('What now, old friend?', '', 44214, 0, 0, 1, 118, 0, 21217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me, my pets! The realm of the mighty Neptulon is ours at last!', 44213, 0, 0, 15, 118, 0, 0, 18878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaaahhh...', '', 44212, 0, 0, 0, 118, 0, 19464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now! Unleash the kraken!', 44211, 0, 0, 15, 118, 0, 0, 18877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gutless bastard! You\'ve killed \'em all! Now I kill you!', '', 44210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die with me, Keeshan! This world has enough heroes!', '', 44209, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Dessstroy them!', 44208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It ssshall profit them nothing, sssave it be a ssspeedy demise...', '', 44207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What hubrisss these fools possessss!', '', 44206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible sir! The current\'s too strong!', '', 44205, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we are to defend the rift, we must do it directly!', '', 44204, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot hold off the naga this way.', '', 44203, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 21201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t helping!', '', 44202, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They fight in vain...', '', 44201, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elementals are clearly outnumbered.', '', 44200, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry I asked...', '', 44199, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the size of those things! What ARE they?', '', 44198, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If he doesn\'t defend his home, he\'ll soon be without one.', '', 44197, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lords of the elemental planes are beings of pure chaos, captain.', '', 44196, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 19518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why does he not protect his own domain?', '', 44195, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Neptulon in all of this, shaman?', '', 44194, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wahoo!', '', 44193, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 21540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commence Fire!', '', 44192, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 21552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Munitions ready!', '', 44191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calibrating fuse...', '', 44190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calculating trajectory...', '', 44189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If they manage to enter the breach, we\'ll never get them out!', '', 44188, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep those naga away from the crater!', '', 44187, 0, 0, 388, 65, 0, 21193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wahoo! This is what I call a target rich environment!', '', 44186, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 21536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, sir!', '', 44185, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 21332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep moving, men! I want a steady stream of shells for these guns!', '', 44184, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 21192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a clear shot here! Get me more ammo!', '', 44183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Th-there\'s no way, sir! The current... it\'s too strong! ', '', 44182, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Set us down next to the crater!', '', 44181, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 21308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we are to defend the rift, we must do it directly!', '', 44180, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We waste our time here just floating about...', '', 44179, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this!', '', 44178, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffer in flames!', '', 44177, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow tired of these games!', '', 44176, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed the master\'s rage! COME AND DIE!', '', 44175, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter. You will die now, a paltry offering to Deathwing as our march upon Stormwind begins.', '', 44174, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you truly believe that the orcs had the presence of mind required to plan an invasion of this magnitude?', '', 44173, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bravo Company, all present and accounted for...', '', 44172, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without aid, they will fail.', '', 44171, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 19541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense desperation in them.', '', 44170, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 19540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They don\'t stand a chance...', '', 44169, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 21304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elementals are grossly outnumbered.', '', 44168, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry I asked...', '', 44167, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twisted creatures bent on the destruction of all living beings.', '', 44166, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 19539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga have enlisted the aid of the Old God\'s minions.', '', 44165, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 19538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the size of those things! What ARE they?', '', 44164, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Unless he wants his home overrun by these serpents, he\'d better show himself...', '', 44163, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one can discern their motives...', '', 44162, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 19537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lords of the elemental planes are beings of pure chaos, Nazgrim.', '', 44160, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 19519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we stuck protecting his domain?', '', 44159, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s the mighty Neptulon, shaman?!', '', 44158, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wahoo!', '', 44157, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commence Fire!', '', 44156, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 21552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Munitions ready!', '', 44155, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calibrating fuse...', '', 44154, 0, 0, 432, 65, 0, 21544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calculating trajectory...', '', 44153, 0, 0, 432, 65, 0, 21543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If they get a foothold in the plane of water, we\'ll never get \'em out!', '', 44152, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 21299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep those naga away from the crater!', '', 44151, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 21298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neptulon\'s revenants must not consider us enemies!', '', 44150, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 19536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use caution when firing those shells...', '', 44149, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 19535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, this is what I call a target rich environment!', '', 44148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, sir!', '', 44147, 0, 0, 113, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard him! Keep that gun stocked with ammo!', '', 44146, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 21297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a clear shot here! Get me more ammo!', '', 44145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After we\'re done here, I think I\'ll go to Ironforge. Get me a few pints of Ironforge\'s finest and some friendly dwarven wenches.', '', 44144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyone hear from my girl? Darcy?', '', 44143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tired of orcs. We need to kill \'em all and let Thrall sort \'em out.', '', 44142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did $n tell you about how we found Danforth, Johnny? I think the orcs may have touched him inappropriately.', '', 44141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like this... Feels too easy.', '', 44140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After we clean this place up, maybe we can start rebuilding it. Maybe they\'ll give it to Bravo Company. We\'ll call it: BRAVO KEEP!', '', 44139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re alright, $n. Not like those no good, money grubbing politicians in Stormwind.', '', 44138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I didn\'t mention it earlier, $n, welcome to Bravo Company.', '', 44137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When this is all over I\'m gonna buy you a drink, $n.', '', 44136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we\'ll have peace again someday. And maybe I\'ll poop gold out my butt.', '', 44135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember a time when there were no orcs. Can you imagine it? No damned orcs!', '', 44134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world\'s gone to hell, $n.', '', 44133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pain excites me!', '', 44132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re nothing!', '', 44131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FEEL THE THUNDER!', '', 44130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda just left us alone.', '', 44129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You brought this on yourself!', '', 44128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WAR IS IN MY BLOOD!', '', 44127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The worgen stares and hesitates!', 'The worgen stares and hesitates!', 44126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Verne has docked. All aboard!', '', 44125, 0, 11196, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Verne will be arriving shortly! Get your gear and form up, boys!', '', 44124, 0, 11196, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope for lasting relief from the shadow that has been cast on our people for so long.', '', 44123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to be punished! Mor\'ghor Slam!', '', 44122, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rghaaaa! Face the fury of Mor\'ghor!', '', 44121, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful out there, $n.  You don\'t want to be on that ship too long... a few more cannonballs and she\'ll be sunk.', '', 44120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not be pulled outside into your trap! Face me here, coward!', '', 44119, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes - I need another wind rider.', 'Yes - I need another wind rider.', 44118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back so soon?', '', 44117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you again, friend.', '', 44116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To our great fortune, you\'ve proven quite honorable and dedicated.', 44115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a difficult thing for us to trust someone so new to our city.  You\'ve come upon us during a somewhat desperate time.', 44114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you, my dear friend, you\'ve done a great thing for us this day.', 44113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, my Lady.', '', 44112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gregory, please take the prisoner back to the sentinels so that we can deal with him properly.', 44111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people have come a long way in those regards, my lady.  I\'m sorry if I gave you any cause to doubt.', '', 44110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m impressed Gregory.  I must admit, I had not expected such restraint.', 44109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be no easy escape for you.  You answer to the temple.', '', 44108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No so fast, betrayer.', '', 44107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take the cultist.  You handle the traitor. ', '', 44106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s finish this.', '', 44105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re just up ahead.  The sound of the water should cover our approach.  Let me know when you\'re ready.', '', 44104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad you made it.', '', 44103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you know how to swim.', '', 44102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no way they could have escaped by land.  Did they...', '', 44101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...where did they go?', '', 44100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s move!', '', 44099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There!  Who is that he\'s meeting with?', '', 44098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, friend.  Quickly!', '', 44097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His trail is still fresh.  We\'re not far behind.', '', 44096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way!  Stay with me.', '', 44095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was wounded.  I can easily pick up his trail.', '', 44094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will hunt this traitor down.  That I promise.', '', 44093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was a massacre.  A planned ambush?  Who do these elementals bend to?', '', 44092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better head straight there, but be cautious.', '', 44091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I promised Malfurion that I would inform him if we made any progress.  I\'ll meet you at the beach as soon as I can.', '', 44090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The route across this western beach is circled.  Do you know your way there?', '', 44089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are routes traced from this Auberdine to several locations.  It almost looks like an evacuation plan.', '', 44088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A map of Darkshore.  I saw this place shortly before I arrived in Rut\'theran Village.', '', 44087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve found something?', '', 44086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too general in use to tell us who is behind this.  Perhaps we\'ll find something inside.', '', 44085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guest rooms.  These were offered to some of my people.', '', 44084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of my ramblings.  The trail leads here.  That entire building is covered in plants with leaves like the one we found.', '', 44083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion strikes me as both wise and honest.  I take him at his word.  I\'d welcome more answers, but it\'s not my place.', '', 44082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He seems to know more than the whispering citizens, and he seems convinced that this traitor is the one last remnant of the cities troubles, Cataclysm aside.', '', 44081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I asked Malfurion of this, and he said that the city recently suffered a great tragedy.  That one of the leaders was taken away and that lives were lost.', '', 44080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear whispers though... whispers of confusion... perhaps even whispers of dissent.', '', 44079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande and Malfurion welcomed us in with open arms.  Almost as if we were long lost family.  It was strange and comforting.', '', 44078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve known nothing but Gilneas for a very long time.  I\'d feared we\'d not find a place we could call home again anytime soon.', '', 44077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trail leads to the northeast.  Follow me if you would.', '', 44076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be able to pick up the trail with this.  Let\'s hope it was the killer that dragged it here.', '', 44075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A very distinct scent.  There doesn\'t appear to be anything like it in the direct area.', '', 44074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sniffs at the leaf briefly.', '', 44073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mud-stained leaf...', '', 44072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you found something?', '', 44071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep a sharp eye out.  There must be a clue here somewhere that can help us track him down.', '', 44070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps he took her unaware.  Perhaps he is that well trusted.', '', 44069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would a sentinel have truly fallen so easy?  I thought these were fierce warriors.', '', 44068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...it looks like there was barely a struggle at all.', '', 44067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will track this traitor down, my lady.  You\'ve no reason to worry.', '', 44066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gregory is one of our new allies from Gilneas.  It is easy to assume that he cannot be involved in this, so we\'ve decided to trust him.', 44065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At your service. ', '', 44064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is Gregory.', 44063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic worms. Prepare to face the Mor\'ghor Slam!', '', 44062, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring that back up to Yancey, by the waterfall.  The ignorant human\'ll have no idea that it\'s not me.', '', 44061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good to see you again, friend.', 44060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me know when you are ready to depart this place.', 44059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you.  Truly.', 44058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think that today, you may have settled some of his worries.  You show nobility and control.  Perhaps more than he thought possible.', 44057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He knows well of your curse and of the terrible things that can come of it.  He may even hold himself to blame for it to some degree.', 44056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malfurion may not say it aloud, but he was greatly concerned for the coming of your people.', 44055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you, my dear worgen, you\'ve done a great thing for us this day.', 44054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, my Lady.', 44053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lilly, please take the prisoner back to the sentinels so that we can deal with him properly.', 44052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s turns away, clearly disturbed.', '', 44051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I cannot find a home amongst my own people, where else am I to turn, \"Shand\'do?\"', '', 44050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In your jealousy, you condemn him and dispatch him to your secret prison.  Just as eagerly as you did your own brother.', '', 44049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope?  Like the hope Fandral had for bringing our people  back to glory?  Back to immortality?', '', 44048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why, Denatharion?  I knew you when you were a boy.  You had hope in your heart.', '', 44047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But... I... yes, my lady.  As you wish.', 44046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, Lilly.  Do not kill him.', 44045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop.  Let me finish him.', 44044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do NOT let him go!', 44043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll take the cultist.  You handle the traitor.', 44042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s finish this.', 44041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re just up ahead.  The sound of the water should cover our approach.  Let me know when you\'re ready.', 44040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glad you made it.', 44039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you know how to swim, worgen.', 44038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no way they could have escaped by land.  Did they...', 44037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...where did they go?', 44036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s move!', 44035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There!  Who is that he\'s meeting with?', 44034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, friend.  Quickly!', 44033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes.  Towards the falls.  I tried to convince him to get his wounds treated, but he just ignored me.', 44032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sentinel!  Did you see a wounded night elf pass by this way?', 44031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right by our guards?  Confident scum...', 44030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here!  A blood stain.  We\'re going the right way.', 44029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a set of fresh tracks following the forest\'s edge back towards town.  It\'s hard to tell if they\'re his though.', 44028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way!  Stay with me.', 44027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was wounded.  I think I can pick up the trail.', 44026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The traitor helped planned this!  He helped to massacre them.', 44025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By Elune!  They were all ambushed... betrayed...', 44024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You better head straight there, but be cautious.', 44023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to stop by  to inform Tyrande and Malfurion of our progress.  I\'ll meet you at the beach as soon as I can.', 44022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The route across the beach is circled.  Let\'s get there and see if there\'s anything to find.', 44021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These could be escape routes I suppose.', 44020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some kind of attack plan?  Auberdine was ravaged during the first throes of the cataclysm.  What value could it have to anyone?', 44019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is a map of Darkshore.  There are paths drawn from Auberdine towards Lor\'danel... and towards several other safe-havens as well.', 44018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These rooms are normally offered to guests of the city.  Really, anyone could have been staying here.', 44017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough of my regrets.  This is the building.  Let\'s check it out.', 44016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a strain, but I shouldn\'t have let it affect me.  I... I should have been better to my sister.\n', 44015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I guess I just feel... I feel a little piece of my life is missing.  Faded.  Like waking from a dream.', 44014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s hard to put into words.  Things should be wonderful.  Malfurion\'s returned.  Teldrassil was finally blessed by the dragon aspects... some of them anyway.', 44013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I get flashes sometimes of these horrific images.  Shadows assaulting us in the night.  Friends turning and attacking each other.', 44012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you ever had that feeling when you just can\'t remember something, but you know it\'s important?  It\'s been like that for all of us since Malfurion came back.', 44011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'d been having a rough spot these past months.  Everyone has I guess.', 44010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Velora was several years my elder.', 44009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The building we\'re looking for is on the Craftsman\'s Terrace.  Let\'s go.', 44008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This only grows in a single area in Darnassus. Perhaps our killer dragged it here on his boot.', 44007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Verdantleaf!  This is quite fortunate.', 44006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s sniffs at the leaf briefly.', 44005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A mud-stained leaf...', 44004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you found something?', 44003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep a sharp eye out.  There must be a clue here somewhere that can help us track him down.', 44002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think he took her that unaware?  Even though she thought she had his trail?', 44001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s so unlike her.  She would have fought tooth and nail if she knew the danger.', 44000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...it looks like there was barely a struggle at all.', 43999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trust that you will, but please, be careful.', 43998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll track this traitor down, priestess.  You\'ve no reason to worry.', 43997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sentinel I told you about was Lilly\'s sister.  She can be trusted.', 43996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Call me Lilly, please.', 43995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is Lillorilen.', 43994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One more thing.  We\'ve arranged for one of our own to accompany you.', 43993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need your help hunting this traitor down.  Are you willing?', '', 43992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is difficult to know who to trust.  You are new here... relatively unknown.  That works in your favor in this case.', 43991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She was found by our patrols this morning.  Murdered within our own city.', 43990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of our best sentinels was on his trail - we assume it\'s a \"he\" - but it appears that she was discovered.', 43989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a traitor within our walls.  Someone who is well connected.', '', 43988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will get straight to the point.  We have something to ask of you.', '', 43987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must admit, we did not bring you here for introductions and pleasantries.', '', 43986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards, leave us.', '', 43985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dead cry for solace. Their anguish echoes on the wind.', 43984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care how low the success rate here is. If we save even one worgen from the madness and savagery of the woods, our struggles are not in vain.', '', 43983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No...', '', 43982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see, brother... we\'re not so different...', '', 43981, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... NO! STOP IT!', '', 43980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aren\'t you feeling it right now?', '', 43979, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely you\'ve felt anger. Anger so foul and vicious that it makes you want to tear someone to shreds...', '', 43978, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stone troggs have no idea of what\'s coming!', '', 43977, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yeah! Tremble at the might of our catapults!', '', 43976, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'d that feel, you stone trogg scum?!', '', 43975, 0, 0, 14, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moving out!', '', 43974, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But why?! How could you?', '', 43973, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The faster we can get to the other side of the front, the faster we can reduce Needlerock Slag to rubble.', '', 43972, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s head out. Just keep those stone troggs off of us.', '', 43971, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to keep moving!', '', 43970, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s get going.', '', 43969, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know why!', '', 43968, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me it\'s not true, brother. Tell me you didn\'t die a murderer!', '', 43967, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother!', '', 43966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all true, brother. Every word. You doubted it?', '', 43965, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tobias...', '', 43964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My ring... Who holds my family ring... Tilloa, is that you?', '', 43963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here they come! Protect the catapult at all costs!', '', 43962, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You took my king, I take your miserable life!', '', 43961, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now who\'s going to get pummelled?!', '', 43960, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Firing at will!', '', 43959, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stone troggs incoming!', '', 43958, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Damn, stone troggs! Over there!', '', 43957, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'m going to need your help!', '', 43956, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out! Here they come!', '', 43955, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Haha! That should be a blast!', 43954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Traitor!  I\'ll die before I surrender me ship to you!', '', 43953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, okay! I got the message!', '', 43952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All cannons!  Open fire on the Crimson Veil!', '', 43951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OUCH!', '', 43950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always nice to get a gift hand delivered by the second-in-command. I\'ll unwrap this right now!', '', 43949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, get into the Ultimate Footbomb Uniform behind you and get down to the docks. Help Thrall kick the Trade Prince\'s butt!', 43948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once your wounded are gathered, you can thank me by leaving.', 43947, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve proven true to your word, Earthmender.  For that, we will spare you our wrath.  ', 43946, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Stonemother.  It was an honor to have...', 43945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da ritual is almost complete!', 43944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Returning has ensured your death.', 43943, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ma\'haat, slaughter these rabble.  I will deal with the fool priestess.', 43942, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should have taken the hint when we destroyed your precipice, cultist.', 43941, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah...', 43940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deathwing shall bring destruction upon your entire order.  And this day, I shall be his blade!', 43939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your tale ends here, shaman. ', 43938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gravely wounded... I cannot hold...', '', 43937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the pillar restored, dis realm is safe.  We must now attend to the wound on the surface.', '', 43935, 0, 10343, 1, 65, 0, 21114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done!  We are finished.', '', 43934, 0, 10343, 1, 65, 0, 21113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank da elements...', '', 43933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop her!  We can still complete da binding!', '', 43932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey\'ve returned!  To arms!', '', 43931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep dese assassins off of me!', '', 43930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have... failed...', '', 43929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are... subsiding.  Renew your efforts, brothers!  We must complete the ritual before they can return!', '', 43928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nooo!  Lorvarius...', '', 43927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twilight assassins are upon us!  Do not let them interrupt the ritual!', '', 43926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve proven more than capable of defeating any enemy.  I would be honored if you stand guard through the ritual, young hero.', '', 43925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather, brothers and sisters!  Let us fulfill our duties and return to Thrall victorious!', '', 43924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final piece of the World Pillar has been recovered!  We have only to bind it together to prevent this realm from collapsing into Azeroth.', '', 43923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAAAHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!', '', 43922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AHHHHHHHHHH!', '', 43921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He won\'t be gettin\' up from that one.', '', 43920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best wishes from the Bravo Company.', '', 43919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Killin\'s as easy as breathin\'.', '', 43918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, master... I have failed you.', '', 43917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your corpses will feed the Blackrock war machine.', '', 43916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Broken Common] Death here for you.', '', 43915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not that easy, hon.  Perhaps another time.', 43914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay close, gorgeous.  I\'m worth chasing.', 43913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do realize there\'s no hope, don\'t you?  Deathwing has already risen.  Your world is doomed.', 43912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come closer, love.  I have a point to make.', 43911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Therazane\'s finally gathered the nerve to challenge us, has she?', 43910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Noooo...', '', 43909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me tink I\'ve had my fill of ya, mon.', '', 43908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay on dem, beasts!  Rip dem from the air!', '', 43907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya need ta be more swift den that!', '', 43906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya handle yaself on da ground.  How about in da skies?', '', 43905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in ova ya head, bud.', '', 43904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agh...', '', 43903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twilight shall fall upon you, even in this deep, dark hole.', '', 43902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathwing will have his way with your Stonemother.', '', 43901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stone Dragons are here, fleshling.  Take wing!', '', 43900, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quite brave for one so small and fragile.', '', 43899, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You make a very tenacious corpse.', '', 43898, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve some sting in you, human.', '', 43897, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this one... standing bravely with earth beneath his feet, thinking to challenge me.', '', 43896, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon you shall be nothing more than a stain to clean off of my foot.', '', 43895, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You built your dwellings upon our very rockface.  Your ignorance shall be your undoing.', '', 43894, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run all you want whelps.', '', 43893, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you find me imposing?  Be honest.  I\'m going for imposing.', '', 43892, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What about you, cultist?  Do you know how to fly?', '', 43891, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Deepholm, cultist.', '', 43889, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $r.  Return to the temple, Gorsik shall meet you there, as promised.', 43888, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cower as the very ground reaches up to swallow you!', 43887, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your trespass shall see no forgiveness.  Deathwing is no longer here to coddle you.', 43886, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The earth has come to claim you, cult!', 43882, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be doin\' exactly that then. Ya have our tanks, Stonemother.', '', 43881, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll leave. We\'ve no desire to stay where we\'re not welcome.', '', 43880, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We came here to seal da rift Deathwing tore into Azeroth. We need the World Pillar to repair da hole on dis side.', '', 43879, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Save your thanks.  We march upon the Twilight Precipice as soon as our forces are gathered. I expect to see you on the battlefield.', 43878, 0, 10382, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seal the rift and leave this place.', 43877, 0, 10382, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do this, and I will send Gorsik to the temple with our piece of the World Pillar.', 43876, 0, 10382, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I propose this: We will march on the Twilight cult and extinguish any utterings of Deathwing\'s name from this realm.  Your Earthen Ring will march with us.', 43875, 0, 10382, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad you\'re at least that perceptive.', 43874, 0, 10382, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what then? Will you leave Deepholm to its denizens?', 43873, 0, 10382, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of this for a piece of the World Pillar?  What exactly, shaman, do you intend to do with it?', 43872, 0, 10382, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Or perhaps a testament to your abilities?', 43871, 0, 10382, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So small.  So soft.  It\'s a wonder you\'ve even lasted this long down here, fleshling.', 43870, 0, 10382, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so the \"champion\" arrives.', 43869, 0, 10382, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not bravery that drives it.  It strode before me like it thought this place its home. It is a fool.  It will surely get itself killed soon enough.', '', 43868, 0, 10401, 0, 65, 0, 21749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know where I stand, Stonemother.', '', 43867, 0, 10401, 0, 65, 0, 21764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This champion also faced the Stone Dragons and their Broodmother with no glimpse of fear or hesitation.  I\'ve seen the most hardy of giants falter where the fleshling did not.', '', 43866, 0, 10401, 0, 65, 0, 21653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve not spoken with the strangers, but I bore witness to their champion treading deep into the Crumbling Depths and returning unscathed.  It is clearly capable.', '', 43865, 0, 10401, 1, 65, 0, 21768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are not the Twilight.  I see no reason to oppose their goals.', '', 43864, 0, 10401, 1, 65, 0, 21880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no love for the intruders, Stonemother, but these fleshlings went well out of their way to cleanse the filth from the Crimson Expanse. ', '', 43863, 0, 10401, 1, 65, 0, 21879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That very well may be.  Even fools have uses though.  I keep you around after all.', 43862, 0, 10401, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What of you Boden?  What do you see in this \"champion?\"', 43861, 0, 10401, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They slaughtered stone troggs, Gorik?  This is supposed to sway me?  It is not much of a feat.', 43860, 0, 10401, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They seek only power, as the Twilight do.  Yet you are confident that they will not turn on us.  Did I raise you to be fools?', 43859, 0, 10401, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are the literal incarnation of corruption.  Their very skin screams it.', 43858, 0, 10401, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You stand here trying to convince me that these beings of flesh should be trusted.', 43857, 0, 10401, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She submits.  Well done, fleshling.', '', 43856, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve strayed too far from the Stonemother\'s gaze, dragon.  It is time that you be put in your place.', '', 43855, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike the crystals when you are ready and we shall face the Broodmother together.', '', 43854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve come to prove yourself, fleshling?  The Crumbling Depths lie northeast.  The stone you seek is within.', '', 43853, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad we had this talk.', 43852, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you betray us, there will be no escape for you.  I will crush your body so slowly that you shall hear every single one of your bones break.', 43851, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you fleshling, consider for a moment that you are entirely surrounded by rock in this place.  The very earth you walk on bends to my will.', 43850, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then you take responsibility for its actions, Stone Lord.  You will be the one answering to me when it shows its true intent.', 43849, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this the one you are wasting your time with, Diamant?', 43848, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take this signet as a testament of my good will.  I pray that my trust is not misplaced.', '', 43847, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The other Stone Lords have already heard my words.', '', 43846, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place the stone upon the ground before me.', '', 43845, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You still have much to prove.  But you brought the stone.  That is an excellent start.', '', 43844, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It stands to reason that it may be here for exactly the reasons it says it is.', '', 43843, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not wasted, Stonemother.  It has been very useful.', '', 43842, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
