('How long must we stand here before our pleas are heard?', 'How long must we stand here before our pleas are heard?', 43753, 7, 10212, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gnolls have never been this aggressive. What\'s going on, Solomon? Tell us!', 'The gnolls have never been this aggressive. What\'s going on, Solomon? Tell us!', 43752, 7, 10212, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better do something quick or you\'ll have a riot on your hands, Solomon!', 'You better do something quick or you\'ll have a riot on your hands, Solomon!', 43751, 7, 10212, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My children were kidnapped while they slept! I WANT ANSWERS, SOLOMON!', 'My children were kidnapped while they slept! I WANT ANSWERS, SOLOMON!', 43750, 7, 10212, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are we paying our taxes for if your guards can\'t even keep gnolls out?', 'What are we paying our taxes for if your guards can\'t even keep gnolls out?', 43749, 7, 10212, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the help that we requested from Stormwind?', 'Where is the help that we requested from Stormwind?', 43748, 7, 10212, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time to wake up, magistrate! These aren\'t ordinary gnoll attacks!', 'It\'s time to wake up, magistrate! These aren\'t ordinary gnoll attacks!', 43747, 7, 10212, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Townspeople are disappearing, Solomon. What are you going to do about it?', 'Townspeople are disappearing, Solomon. What are you going to do about it?', 43746, 7, 10212, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spouse has gone missing! Please help!', 'My spouse has gone missing! Please help!', 43745, 7, 10212, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Support and heal me! Take up this warhammer and be a shaman.', 'Support and heal me! Take up this warhammer and be a shaman.', 43744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, $g sir: ma\'am;.  We attack from the north at your signal.  The Brashtide will wash over Booty Bay!  Aroooo!!!!', 43743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know the battle plan, right?', 'You know the battle plan, right?', 43742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I help you?', 43741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We used to roam the seas... \'til that damned King Greymane shut down the harbors in Gilneas!  If it weren\'t for him, we wouldn\'t be...', '', 43740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about the Brashtide Crew?', 'What can you tell me about the Brashtide Crew?', 43739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'re y\' looking at, $r?', '', 43737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, $g sir: ma\'am;!  We\'ve been biding our time in Gilneas for far too long.  We\'re ready for blood!', '', 43736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long John Copper, is the Brashtide Crew ready for battle?', 'Long John Copper, is the Brashtide Crew ready for battle?', 43735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy there!', '', 43734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$c! Zaela said the Horde would provide us with weapons. What do you have?', '$c! Zaela said the Horde would provide us with weapons. What do you have?', 43733, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it, $c! The revolution has come.', 'This is it, $c! The revolution has come.', 43732, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today Mor\'ghor\'s tyranny will end.', 'Today Mor\'ghor\'s tyranny will end.', 43731, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put me in, coach! I\'m ready to fight!', 'Put me in, coach! I\'m ready to fight!', 43730, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a day of reckoning, $c!', 'It\'s a day of reckoning, $c!', 43729, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I picked the wrong day to stop killin\' fel orcs.', 'Looks like I picked the wrong day to stop killin\' fel orcs.', 43728, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with me! Take up this blade and be a warrior.', 'Fight with me! Take up this blade and be a warrior.', 43727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll fight by your side, $c. You won\'t regret helping us!', '', 43726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has come! It\'s about time we got some real leadership around here.', '', 43725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t give me any armor. Just gimmie a blade and tell me who to kill.', '', 43724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zaela told us the Horde would help! What can I do?', '', 43723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to help overthrow Mor\'ghor?', '', 43722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is the day of reckoning, $c!', '', 43721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peak, I\'m ready to escort the catapult.', 'Peak, I\'m ready to escort the catapult.', 43720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These plans list the details on the upcoming attack!', '', 43719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a bunch of meaningless scribbles.', '', 43718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory for the Dragonmaw!', 'Victory for the Dragonmaw!', 43717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 43716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DRAGONMAW!!', 'DRAGONMAW!!', 43715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll poke out yer deadlights, ye lily-livered eel!', '', 43714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll send ye to feed the fishes, ye flat-shanty trogg!', '', 43713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll send ye down to Neptulon\'s Locker, ye three-gallon pufferfish!', '', 43712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll run ye through, ye cannon-kissin\' cannonface!', '', 43711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mutiny?  I\'ll show ye mutiny, ye cockle-knuckled squiffy!', '', 43710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d never turn sides, ye green-gilled murloc!', '', 43709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draw yer own steel, ye harpy-lovin\' scoundrel!', '', 43708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d never leave the Buccaneers, ye whale-tail skivvy-sniffer!', '', 43707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a mutinous dog!  Draw steel!', 'You\'re a mutinous dog!  Draw steel!', 43706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gangway!', '', 43705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blow me down!', '', 43704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarr!', '', 43703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
