INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Avast!', '', 43701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy!', '', 43700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve got the explosives  in the furnace room.  Just hold them off now!', 43699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 19692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I want two sharpshooters to stay behind and cover the deck.  Everyone else, use the ropes to rappel down.  Let\'s give them hell!', 43698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 19689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Secure the rafters!', 43697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 19688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Attack!', 43696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 19687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You pour grease all over the heavy metal projectiles.  Firallon\'s crew is certainly going to have a hard time loading these.', '', 43695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Grease the cannonballs.>', '<Grease the cannonballs.>', 43694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An enormous crate, filled to the brim with cannonballs.  There is a can of cooking grease sitting innocently nearby.', '', 43693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An enormous crate, filled to the brim with cannonballs.', '', 43692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gunpowder is completely soaked.  Nobody\'s going to be using this to fire cannons anytime soon.', '', 43691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Pour the water onto the gunpowder.>', '<Pour the water onto the gunpowder.>', 43690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A barrel of gunpowder.  There is a pitcher of water sitting nearby.', '', 43689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A barrel of gunpowder.  Highly explosive.', '', 43688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The grog leaks out of the barrel.  A lot of pirates are going to be very unhappy about this.', '', 43687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Nudge the cork.>', '<Nudge the cork.>', 43686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A barrel of grog.  Pirates love this stuff.$b$bThe cork does not seem to fit too tightly in the bunghole.', '', 43685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A barrel of grog.  Pirates love this stuff.', '', 43684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perusing', 'Perusing', 43683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF768EBDI\'ve got the seaforium charges ready. We need to get to the munitions hut and tower.|r|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_BOMB_04.BLP:24|t\n', '', 43682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I need a boat.', 'I... I need a boat.', 43681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy matey!  Hoist anchor, trim the mainsail, batton down the hatches and set to sea!  Today we scuttle the Venture Company\'s blasted contraptions and send \'em all to feed the fishes!  Now hop to, before I put the black spot on ye!', 'Ahoy matey!  Hoist anchor, trim the mainsail, batton down the hatches and set to sea!  Today we scuttle the Venture Company\'s blasted contraptions and send \'em all to feed the fishes!  Now hop to, before I put the black spot on ye!', 43680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, what need ye?', '', 43679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once in a while we\'ll come up against a lone orc that stands between us and victory. Chloroform is often best used in those situations. Just remember to apply chloroform we have to be behind the enemy.', '', 43678, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye-aye, sir.  Heavin\' to and returnin\' back t\' shore.', '', 43677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes a distraction can backfire and cause the orcs to become suspicious. In those instances the orcs will actively search for us. It\'s best to keep a good distance from any orc detecting stealth.', '', 43676, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy!  I see more o\' those goblins over there!', '', 43675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While camouflaged, we are harder to detect when we are BEHIND creatures.', '', 43674, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Belay your attacks!  We\'re movin\' on!', '', 43673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On t\' the next one!', '', 43672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Retreat, says I!', '', 43671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure we always have camouflage up. The orcs in Render\'s Valley will kill us both if we\'re spotted.', '', 43670, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That gold is ours!  Open fire, says I!', '', 43669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One time, Keeshan told me that he could take on five of me at once. Why am I so weak?', '', 43668, 7, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They be on either side of us!  Send \'em down to Neptulon\'s Locker!', '', 43667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready... open fire!', '', 43666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we are!  Fire at will!', '', 43665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll steer, you handle Ol\' Blasty.  An\' don\'t tie yer skivvies in a knot... I\'ll slow down when we get closer!', '', 43664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Messner kills bad guys so fast. I wish I could kill as fast as him. WHY can\'t I shoot fireballs? What does the LIGHT have against fireballs?', '', 43663, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be headin\' up t\' where the goblins say they found black gold.  That gold belongs t\' the Bloodsail!', '', 43662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know, maybe the grass really is greener on the other side. You know? Krakauer and Danforth really kick butt as warriors. Maybe I should drop this paladin thing and try out being a warrior.', '', 43661, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarr, hold on tight, me hearty, fer thar be nary an oarsman so capable as I!', '', 43660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Being a paladin is rough. The Light behaves so erratically. Some days I wake up and it feels like all of my powers have been weakened.', '', 43659, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My heals really don\'t have the \'OOMPH\' that they used to, $n. You know what I\'m saying?', '', 43658, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Abandon the port? Has Mor\'ghor beaten all the sense out of you? This attack is our best opportunity to take our destiny into our own - wait! Here comes $n from the Horde!', 43657, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here to help the Dragonmaw reclaim our freedom?$B$BSpeak with Zaela - she\'s coordinating our resistance!', '', 43656, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes you just need to take out one target. Use chloroform while behind the enemy!|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_SLEEP.BLP:16|t\n', '', 43655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Create a distraction so that you and Jorgensen can slip by unnoticed.|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_ROGUE_BLOODYEYE.BLP:16|t\n\n', '', 43654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re nearing Render\'s Valley. These orcs are tough! Make sure you are camo\'d!|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_PROTECTIONFORMNATURE.BLP:16|t\n', '', 43653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate your Bravo Company Field Kit now.|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_ENGGIZMOS_20.BLP:16|t$BStealth your party using Camouflage.|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_PROTECTIONFORMNATURE.BLP:16|t', '', 43652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be swift, $c. The stone dragons will not give up easily.', '', 43651, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to escort a group of elementals across the open.', 'I am ready to escort a group of elementals across the open.', 43650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beassst will find you tasssty, sssoftsskin!', '', 43649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your have no businesss here, $r!', '', 43648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have successfully planted the seaforium at the Blackrock tower.', '', 43647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have successfully planted the seaforium at the munitions hut.', '', 43646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your interference shall cosst you your life, $r!', '', 43645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me! You stand no chance here alone!\n', '', 43644, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were nearly lost! Do not wander off!\n', '', 43643, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay close! We are too few already!\n', '', 43642, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...but not today!', '', 43641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll die someday, sea-witch...', '', 43640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve stirred up a hornet\'s nest, $n!$B$BI hope you have a plan for finishing this. Krogg\'s warriors are tearing up the dragonmaw, but we\'re taking heavy losses for every inch of ground...', '', 43639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re free! RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!', 'We\'re free! RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!', 43638, 7, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear that?', 'Did you hear that?', 43637, 1, 0, 397, 65, 0, 1107, 1107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that?', 'What\'s that?', 43636, 1, 0, 397, 65, 0, 1107, 1107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s take these ninjas out, boss.  I already see some of \'em up ahead.', '', 43635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should get going back to the Crimson Veil.  See you there.', '', 43634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Miniature bolts of lightning burn across Onyxia\'s skin. Her electrical charge is at critical levels!', 43633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The arcing bolts intensify as Onyxia\'s electrical charge reaches dangerous levels!', 43632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Energy begins to arc across Onyxia\'s body as her electrical charge increases.', 43631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, not me limes, says I!', 'No, not me limes, says I!', 43630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Belay yer lime-stealin\' ways, ye scurvy scallywag!', 'Belay yer lime-stealin\' ways, ye scurvy scallywag!', 43629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead men steal no limes!', 'Dead men steal no limes!', 43628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
