('The excitement of the crowd, the thrill of the fight - you should have seen it!  Ever since those ogres took control of the Dire Maul arena, I\'ve been forced to camp out here.  Griniblix the Spectator - ha!  Spectator of what?  This campfire?  That shrub?  Or how about this odd purple tree?\n\nListen, if you\'re looking for a fight, Skarr was headed towards the Lariss Pavilion, and The Razza was soaring in the direction of the New Thalanaar.  Just be sure to let me in on the betting before the bloodbath begins!', '', 43556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
