('Wait\'ll these orcs get a load of us. Bravo Company BACK IN BUSINESS!', '', 43472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m probably the most important member of this team, being a paladin and all.', '', 43471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I kept hearing the Blackrock orcs talk about the return of Hellscream to the Horde. What\'s that all about? Isn\'t Hellscream dead?', '', 43470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So I heard Thrall left the Horde. That true?', '', 43469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t believe we\'re putting the old team back together. All thanks to you, $n.', '', 43468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, $n. Not all Dragonmaw are your enemies!', 43467, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ever seen Keeshan kill an orc? It\'s a sight to behold, $g man:lady;.', '', 43466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel weak. I mean weaker than normal. Like as if the Light is less powerful this week. Probably just something I ate. Orc food gives me the craps.', '', 43465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I\'ve rescued your equipment for you. I think you\'ve seen all you need to see.', 43464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry, Gorthul. Undo $ghis:her; bonds.', 43463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ever notice how sarcastic the people living in Redridge are? Sometimes I feel like I just want to take a blow torch to that jackass Solomon\'s town hall.', '', 43462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So I hear Varian Wrynn is back. That true? Sorry, I\'m a bit out of the loop.', '', 43461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jorgensen is real dainty, by the way. He\'s a paladin, so be careful what you say around him or you\'re liable to make him cry.', '', 43460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Messner is a master of fire magic. We invite him to all of our barbecues.', '', 43459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They called us the Bravo Company. When things needed killin\', we did the spillin\'... of blood.', '', 43458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, Keeshan lost his wife to Blackrock orcs. He was never the same after that day. Was like the sun just set on his life. Darkness, $g man:lady;. Pure darkness.', '', 43457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember this one time, Keeshan and I were out fishing at the Lakeshire bridge and Keeshan farted. Don\'t think Oslow ever forgave Keeshan for that one...', '', 43456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really missed you, Danforth.', '', 43455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve come to try to help, but it seems that their favor for you does not yet extend to us.', '', 43454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After that Pilgrim\'s Bounty dinner, I took a huge smelly orc.', '', 43453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s an ugly word, you know? It\'s a word I\'d use to describe defecating. For example:', '', 43452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I\'ve always wondered why they call themselves orcs.', '', 43451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Place the food and drink inside the lifeboat.>', '<Place the food and drink inside the lifeboat.>', 43450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You take a moment to silently remember when you used this lifeboat to defeat Negolash.  Those were the good days.', '', 43449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This must be the lifeboat that Captain Hecklebury Smotts spoke about.', '', 43448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This lifeboat appears to be abandoned.  Maybe it belongs to some of the nearby pirates?', '', 43447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s belches.', '', 43446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear you\'ve got some drinks I can buy, Slim.', 'I hear you\'ve got some drinks I can buy, Slim.', 43445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Here\'s to you!  Here\'s to me!  May we never disagree.$b$bBut if we do... BLAST YOU!  Here\'s to me.', '', 43444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Revenge is a dish best served with a butt whompin\'!', '', 43443, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear that crack?!', '', 43442, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toe up...', '', 43441, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to hell!', '', 43440, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had tougher craps.', '', 43439, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAH!', '', 43438, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And just like that, you\'re dead!', '', 43437, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GET SOME!', '', 43436, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t even have my gear on!', '', 43435, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the best you can do?', '', 43434, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just gettin\' warmed up!', '', 43433, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And keep the change you filthy animal!', '', 43432, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You messed with the wrong soldier!', '', 43431, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nowhere to run!', '', 43430, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No good piece of crap!', '', 43429, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to your maker!', '', 43428, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat dirt you filthy mongrel!', '', 43427, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing has always come naturally to my family.  You look like you could use a little help though.  How about running a few errands for a Master Angler?', '', 43426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much senseless loss.', '', 43425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Father Gavin. The world needs more like you and Buin in these dark times.', '', 43424, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have sent to Light\'s Hope Chapel for a grant of gold for the care of the refugees. Carry out your mission, but help as you can.', '', 43423, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not blind to their suffering, Lowan, but our mission here is to learn about what the cataclysm has wrought. Azeroth itself is suffering.', '', 43422, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to report back. Thank you, $c!', '', 43421, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to kill Troggzor the Earthinator!', '', 43420, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t leave these refugees like this, Kelaan. Buin here has sold his weapons and armor to buy food for them. He cannot do it alone.', '', 43419, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me. We have to rescue the king!', '', 43418, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill a few for me, would you?', '', 43417, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened?', '', 43416, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a strange-looking creature. Thank you.', '', 43415, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I can make it back on my own.', '', 43414, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r.', '', 43413, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help you?  Here for some of our famous Lobstrok Thermidor?', '', 43412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, boss.', 43411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Hardwrench Hideaway!$b$bLooking to get away from the hustle and bustle of city life?  You\'ve come to the right place!$b$bWant to witness the marvels of Azeroth\'s famous jungle firsthand?  Look no further!$b$bShopping for some freshly pumped bio-fuel or weapons-grade mineral ores?  Then you\'ve come to the right place, $c!', 43410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zanzil teleports to another location!', '', 43409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... KEN!!', '', 43408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haaadoouuuu....', '', 43407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Payback\'s gonna hurt.', '', 43406, 0, 10100, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You orcs are gonna be sorry when I get out of here.', '', 43405, 0, 10100, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast escaped! By Mekkatorque\'s moustache, it was fast!', '', 43404, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The reports were accurate! The beast is here...', '', 43403, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are approaching the cavern, Captain.', '', 43402, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, number two. We\'ll get another chance. And we\'ll be ready.', '', 43401, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire! Fire! Blow it out of the water!', '', 43400, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steady, number two...', '', 43399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take her in slowly, number two.', '', 43398, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast escaped! By Gallywix\'s gut, it was fast!', '', 43397, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steady, number two...', '', 43396, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The reports were accurate! The beast is here...', '', 43395, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are approaching the cavern, Captain.', '', 43394, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, number two. We\'ll get another chance. And we\'ll be ready.', '', 43393, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire! Fire! Blow it out of the water!', '', 43392, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take her in slowly, number two.', '', 43391, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quick!  Grab onto the ladder!', 43390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And if you\'ll look to your right, you\'ll see... my friend, about to get killed!', 43389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to die!', '', 43388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have slain Jeklik, but you will not leave Zul\'Gurub alive.', '', 43387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hakkar grows impatient.  And so do I.', '', 43386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you.  You\'ve interfered with my plans for the last time.', '', 43385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Jin\'do.', '', 43384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zanzil!  Finish with Venoxis, then we\'ll talk about your failures.', '', 43383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s goin\' on in here?', '', 43382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have left this city to the waves.', '', 43381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choke upon the sands of the Kvaldir!', '', 43380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neptulon will rise and wash your kind from Azeroth.', '', 43379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your race is a disease upon the sea.', '', 43378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought we\'d killed everybody... Mor\'norokk should be pleased with this!', '', 43377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course.  It\'s all yours.', '', 43376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will prepare the enchantment right away then. This may finally shed some light on the means and intentions of the naga.', 43375, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Erunak, take a look at this. This looks like a sufficient focus for the vision magics I was speaking to you about.', 43374, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you.', 43373, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s more to this than we know, $n.  I can guarantee you that much.', 43372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kvaldir never die... this city is ours...', '', 43371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So your bat and your snake need Zanzil\'s help?  Very well.  I\'ll see you inside Zul\'Gurub... old friend.', '', 43370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend?  You were among those who spit and threw stones, Jin\'do.  But let\'s let bygones be bygones, eh?', '', 43369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember what you can do with those elixirs of yours.  Can your elixirs help out an old friend?', '', 43368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, Zanzil, I\'d like to make it your concern.  I\'ve recovered the bodies of High Priestess Jeklik and High Priest Venoxis.', '', 43367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a shame... but not a concern for an old exile like Zanzil.', '', 43366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gurubashi have fallen on hard times.  I live, and Mandokir has returned... but the rest of us are gone.', '', 43365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know well enough about why I\'m here, Zanzil.', '', 43364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings you out to my part of Stranglethorn?  I\'m not accustomed to taking visitors from the esteemed Zul\'Gurub.', '', 43363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jin\'do the Hexxer!  It\'s been a while since I\'ve seen that mask.', '', 43362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kvaldir have returned to take the city back from us, Battlemaiden. They will need you outside.', 43361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chabal, I was hunting Zanzil and I lost track of what I was doing.  Can remind me where to go next?', 'Chabal, I was hunting Zanzil and I lost track of what I was doing.  Can remind me where to go next?', 43360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gurubashi are dead, and Hakkar with them.  Most of my fellow Zandalar have returned to their homeland.$b$bIt falls on me, Maywiki, and the Darkspears of Bambala to watch over Zul\'Gurub now.', '', 43359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They must really like this city. Maybe it\'s the view?', '', 43358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('About as tough as seaweed too.', '', 43357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kind of them to stream in one by one.', '', 43356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the sands with you, wretch!', '', 43355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kvaldir are pouring across the bridge! Battlemaiden, Lady Naz\'jar calls for you!', '', 43354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slavery and death are all that away you.', '', 43353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your return brings you only death.', '', 43352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have accepted your defeat.', '', 43351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools. Weaklings. ', '', 43350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You press on... to your deaths... fools.', '', 43349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your march to your deaths! Azshara shall see you wiped from the seas!', '', 43348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only peace you shall find is in death, Kvaldir!', '', 43347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slaughter them all! Show no mercy, brothers!', '', 43346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome.', 'Welcome.', 43345, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', 'Greetings.', 43344, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome. May I help you find something?', 'Welcome. May I help you find something?', 43343, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c.', 'Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c.', 43342, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings! Please have a look around.', 'Greetings! Please have a look around.', 43341, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.', 'Greetings, $c.', 43340, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome!', 'Welcome!', 43339, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome.', 'Welcome.', 43338, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', 'Greetings.', 43337, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome. May I help you find something?', 'Welcome. May I help you find something?', 43336, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c.', 'Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c.', 43335, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold them back! Keep them away from the temple!', 43334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings! Please have a look around.', 'Greetings! Please have a look around.', 43333, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cut them down, Battlemaiden!', 43332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand fast! The ritual is almost complete.', 43331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.', 'Greetings, $c.', 43330, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome!', 'Welcome!', 43329, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Battlemaiden! You are needed on the battlefield. The Kvaldir have broken through our lines!', 43328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Battlemaiden, I have a task that requires your attention.', 43327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kvaldir have been purged from the city. Now we can begin our preparations.', 43326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nooo!  Zanzil is a failure...', '', 43324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha!  Zanzil is the winner this time!  And look who came to celebrate!', '', 43323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes Zanzil!', '', 43322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t take much more of this...', '', 43321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re back for more, huh?  Too bad, because I\'ve got a stronger potion mixed up this time!  Venoxis will live!', '', 43320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must return to Feathermoon Stronghold!', 'I must return to Feathermoon Stronghold!', 43319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you do whatever it takes to save your kingdom?', '', 43318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the battle at the Ruins of Feathermoon.', 'Take me to the battle at the Ruins of Feathermoon.', 43316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Priest Venoxis is nearly healed!', '', 43315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing just sitting there?!', '', 43314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keeping the bomb warm, obviously. What does it look like I\'m doing?!', '', 43313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call for the others. We will crush Hellscream\'s Horde and hurl their bodies to the sea...', '', 43312, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep the $c alive. $gHe:She; will be our bargaining chip.', '', 43311, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DRAGONMAW!!', '', 43310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is...', '', 43309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring him on!', '', 43308, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was that a THREAT? I knew Hellscream in Outland. A whimpering whelp. He is no Warchief.', '', 43307, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit wasting words, worm. If you want the aid of the Dragonmaw, you should\'ve come on bent knee and with offerings of gold.', '', 43306, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to get out of here!', '', 43305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh... Jin\'do\'s not gonna be happy about this...', '', 43304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I LIVE!', 43303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is madness!', '', 43302, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the Horde has assembled an enormous host! A vast fleet of war machines and hardened veterans. Hellscream would as soon crush you as-', '', 43301, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'re you doin\' here?  Don\' matter, I\'m gonna resurrect Jeklik before you get a chance to interfere!', '', 43300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief, you misunderstand. Garrosh Hellscream will have a beach head on these shores, with or without your help. What we ask -', '', 43299, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most esteemed Warchief -', '', 43298, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'High Priestess Jeklik is nearly healed!', 43297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think these bars can hold me? HAH!', '', 43296, 0, 10099, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s the rest of my crew??!', '', 43295, 0, 10099, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I ever get out of here I\'m gonna crap all over your head, you pig sucking orc.', '', 43294, 0, 10099, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zanzil\'s back!', '', 43293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had enough of this!  Time to take a break...', '', 43292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold it now. Let\'s not rush in.', '', 43291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s not waste time! There\'s undead afoot.', '', 43290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave Ongo\'longo ALONE!', '', 43289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You thought those long arms gave you an advantage, $r? Think again!', '', 43288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this over with. I\'d rather be back home at Aerie Peak than starin\' down these ugly trolls.', '', 43287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya head\'s gonna make a nice bag!', '', 43286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits o\' this land won\'t tolerate this dark magic and vicious sacrifice any longer.$B$BThe Vilebranch have got to go!', '', 43285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 30 seconds.  Prepare yourselves!', '', 43284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 1 minute.', '', 43283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Aerie Peak, home of the Wildhammer Clan.$B$BWith High Thane Falstad off in Ironforge, you\'ll be dealin\' with me.', '', 43282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it! Stay close and let me do the talking. I\'m an expert.', '', 43281, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dragonmaw Warchief is in the largest building up on the hilltop here. I\'m sure he\'ll be reasonable.', '', 43280, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After these negotiations, I am looking forward to a long and prosperous life.', '', 43279, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place the incense at the foot of the statue.', 'Place the incense at the foot of the statue.', 43278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ancient totem is fashioned into the shape of a bat.  It must be the totem that Chabal spoke of.', '', 43277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear a great Dragonmaw medicine man lives here, in the large hut to our right.', '', 43276, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, $n. Soon the Dragonmaw will join the Horde!', '', 43275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, does this red shirt make me look expendable?', '', 43274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sick of sittin\' in this hole. I hope whatever sorry pencil-pusher is holdin\' up Danath\'s return gets a punch in the jimmies.', '', 43273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I misplaced my Negotiator. In fact, he\'s probably dead. Is another available?', 'I misplaced my Negotiator. In fact, he\'s probably dead. Is another available?', 43272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s alive alright, and been living like an outcast in Lakeshire for the past five months. Or hadn\'t you noticed? Now enough chatter. We\'ve got people to save!', '', 43271, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keeshan\'s alive? I thought he died.', '', 43270, 7, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('JOHN J. KEESHAN.', '', 43269, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tortured and kept alive as a urinal for young orc warriors. For FIVE YEARS.', '', 43268, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captured five years ago by a battalion of filthy, pig sucking Blackrocks, five clicks out from the southern DMZ.', '', 43267, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He served 248 consecutive tours of duty across the First, Second and Third Wars.', '', 43266, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What hope, colonel? What could possibly save us from the impending assault?', '', 43265, 7, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is hope, Solomon.', '', 43264, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And right when we finally finished building that damned bridge! What hope is there, $n?', '', 43263, 7, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re finished! I might as well call for an evacuation now and clear out Lakeshire before the orcs march.', '', 43262, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ancient totem is fashioned into the shape of a bat.', '', 43261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Southern Rocketway Terminus! Home of the world famous Secret Lab!', 'Welcome to the Southern Rocketway Terminus! Home of the world famous Secret Lab!', 43260, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Northern Rocketway Terminus! You probably took a wrong turn, but we\'re happy to have you anyway!', 'Welcome to the Northern Rocketway Terminus! You probably took a wrong turn, but we\'re happy to have you anyway!', 43259, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Northern Rocketway Exchange! We at Rocketway Relations are glad you survived that last turn!', 'Welcome to the Northern Rocketway Exchange! We at Rocketway Relations are glad you survived that last turn!', 43258, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Gallywix Rocketway Exchange! Debts to pay or get the heck away.', 'Welcome to the Gallywix Rocketway Exchange! Debts to pay or get the heck away.', 43257, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our warriors are dying. Do you have medical supplies I can take back with me?', 'Our warriors are dying. Do you have medical supplies I can take back with me?', 43256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it you need, outsider? I shouldn\'t be speaking with you...', '', 43255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Dragonmaw have seen so much suffering... our defeat at Grim Batol... the loss of so many great warriors in Outland... and now incursions from Twilight\'s Hammer.$B$BI sometimes wonder if we will ever be great again. But younglings like Zaela, they give this old heap of bones some hope.', '', 43254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad to hear it. I\'ll send Delber any forces I can spare.', 'Glad to hear it. I\'ll send Delber any forces I can spare.', 43253, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Northern Rocketway Terminus, please.', 'Northern Rocketway Terminus, please.', 43252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Northern Rocketway Exchange, please.', 'Northern Rocketway Exchange, please.', 43251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gallywix Rocketway Exchange, please.', 'Gallywix Rocketway Exchange, please.', 43250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Southern Rocketway Terminus, please.', 'Southern Rocketway Terminus, please.', 43249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve also secured air support for the operation and will be ready to deploy soon. If any of your men want to join the assault team, just send them to Delber.', 'We\'ve also secured air support for the operation and will be ready to deploy soon. If any of your men want to join the assault team, just send them to Delber.', 43248, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zombie pirates?!  Kill it!', 'Zombie pirates?!  Kill it!', 43247, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrimmar Rocketway Exchange, please.', 'Orgrimmar Rocketway Exchange, please.', 43246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delber and his men are working overtime, captain. He has devised a means of delivering an assault team to the rear flank of the battle.', 'Delber and his men are working overtime, captain. He has devised a means of delivering an assault team to the rear flank of the battle.', 43245, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast, wet guy!', 'Not so fast, wet guy!', 43244, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t keep up the operation much longer. Delber and his team must launch their attack from Steelgrill\'s Depot as soon as possible!', '', 43243, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It won\'t be long before we\'re out of supplies too, Captain. Between the trolls and the yeti raids, we\'ll be down to half rations within a week.', 43242, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, know that our \"Warchief\" does not speak for us all. There are those among us who hope to see the Dragonmaw great again... and free from corruption.', 43241, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Orgrimmar Rocketway Exchange! You still look to be in one piece.', 'Welcome to the Orgrimmar Rocketway Exchange! You still look to be in one piece.', 43240, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gregor, you coward! Orcs of pure blood are dying off our shores. If you doom them, you doom us all.', 43239, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ... I can\'t give you any of our supplies! Our Warchief... He would...', '', 43238, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, Zaela. I trust you to do the right thing. $C, I can help your fallen warriors...', '', 43237, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most of our steam tanks are out of commission and we\'re losing mountaineers quickly.', '', 43236, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re getting bogged down in the fight against the Frostmane trolls.', '', 43235, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See me if you need a boat to the shore, $n!', '', 43234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where to, buddy?', 'Where to, buddy?', 43233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ANYWHERE BUT THE BRIDGE!', '', 43232, 0, 10063, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOOO!!!', '', 43231, 0, 10063, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO, NO, NO! Please!', '', 43230, 0, 10063, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shiver me timbers!', '', 43229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarr?', '', 43228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well blow me down!  The landlubber scalawag comes bearin\' rum!', '', 43227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BYE, BYE, DADDY!', '', 43226, 0, 10063, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgus think something wrong with $r lemonade...', '', 43225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... Orgus not feel so good...', '', 43224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ornak orders a boat to push off for the fleet.', '', 43223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OK! Me trow in water!', '', 43222, 0, 10063, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gmurgl starts to follow you.', '', 43221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where trow? TROW ON BRIDGE??', '', 43220, 0, 10063, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I get a ride back to the fleet?', 'Can I get a ride back to the fleet?', 43219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ROCK NOT SO HEAVY! PUNY HUMIES!', '', 43218, 0, 10063, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Negotiations aren\'t going well, $n. The Dragonmaw are not yet free orcs.$B$BSomehow, we MUST get them to join the Horde!$B$BLet me know if you need transport back to the fleet.', '', 43217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathwing\'s entry into our world opened a rift between it and Deepholm.$B$BRebuilding the World Pillar is the only way to stabilize the rift.', '', 43216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer the pirate a drink.>', '<Offer the pirate a drink.>', 43215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarr, thar be nary a soul s\'thirsty as me, says I.', '', 43214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer the ogre a drink.>', '<Offer the ogre a drink.>', 43213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$R come to look at Orgus?  Take picture, last longer.', '', 43212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer the murloc a drink.>', '<Offer the murloc a drink.>', 43211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The murloc looks at you with thirsty eyes.>', '', 43210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience... our turn will come.', '', 43209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just teleport me for now. But I can\'t wait for that sweet sweet elevator!', 'Just teleport me for now. But I can\'t wait for that sweet sweet elevator!', 43208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imagine the most amazing elevator you have ever seen... right here. Yea, its sweet isn\'t it? Sadly, its not ready yet.', '', 43207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the time the ritual is complete, Marnal will arrive, and my men will help carve up this grotesque creature.', '', 43206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon, let\'s get you another ale.', '', 43204, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, see? Ol\' Trollplow\'ll be better in no time! Before you know it, you\'ll be bragging about out-gunning me again...', '', 43203, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In fact, I\'ll go see about those gears right now!', '', 43202, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Clay grumbles and sneers.>$B$BDamn kids these days.', '', 43201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes, everything will be fine! Wonderful, in fact. She\'ll be better than ever!', '', 43200, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need you out on the front, $n.$B$BYou\'re going to make the difference. We\'ll crush the stone troggs once and for all.$B$BWe must rescue King Oremantle!', '', 43199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Razzle, tell him everything\'s going to be fine!', '', 43198, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get out there and put those stone troggs back into the ground, $r!', '', 43197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 43196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horzog orders a landing boat to be lowered into the water. ', '', 43195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare they take our king prisoner!$B$BWe will take back Stonehearth and then move through the front to crush the stone troggs in their home!', '', 43194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull yerself togther, Stone! You\'re a steam tank pilot, for Light\'s sake!', '', 43193, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor, poor Trollplow. At least the old gal went out doin\' something she loved.', '', 43192, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
