('With an ample supply of gyromechanic gears, and a team of engineers, your tanks can make a full recovery, but it\'s going to be a long journey.', '', 43191, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, it\'s not good. The battle has taken its toll on both your steam tanks. My salvage teams will secure what\'s left of them as soon as it\'s safe.', '', 43190, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me ashore, Horzog.', 'Send me ashore, Horzog.', 43189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Going ashore, $n?$B$BSay the word and I\'ll lower a boat for you.', '', 43188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll get you out of there, Foreman, just HANG ON!', '', 43187, 0, 10059, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'M PUSHIN\' AS HARD AS I CAN! THING WEIGHS A TON!', '', 43186, 0, 10059, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PUSH HARDER!', '', 43185, 0, 10059, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DAMN ROCK WON\'T BUDGE!', '', 43184, 0, 10059, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HO!', '', 43183, 0, 10059, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
