('', 'Interesting.  I\'d never heard of the Twilight Council until now.', 43180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? What have you done?  No!  Do you have any idea what the Twilight Council will do to me when they find out I\'ve talked!?  I would sooner die!', '', 43179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Happy now?  Pull me up, you vicious little dwarf!', '', 43178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were never in any danger, sweetheart.  My friends down below would\'ve caught you.  You\'re worth too much to us alive!', 43177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... just... wanted... to... build... the... damned... bridge...', '', 43176, 0, 10059, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... kill... me...', '', 43175, 0, 10059, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurts... Hurts so bad...', '', 43174, 0, 10059, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody... please... get... rock... off... me...', '', 43173, 0, 10059, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was delivered to the forgemaster at Deathwing\'s Fall.  I swear... that\'s all I know!', '', 43172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop it, you tiny, angry woman!  I\'ll tell you everything!  What do you want to know?', '', 43171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can start by telling us where the World Pillar fragment is.  My gryphon\'s starting to look a bit tired from hauling you around.', 43170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Doesn\'t say a damn thing about dog-ugly ogres.', 43169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m a daughter of the Wildhammer Clan and a shaman of the Earthen Ring.  My code compels me to honor my ancestors and the elements.', 43168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait!  You can\'t do this!  You people must have a code of honor or something!', '', 43167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All right, sunshine.  Time to spill your guts before I spill \'em for ya!', 43166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
