('That being the fresh piece of land just off the coast of the Eastern Kingdoms.', '', 43130, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21363, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest assured, they\'ll deliver ya safely to yer destination.', '', 43129, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 21362, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And please. Pay no heed to the... uhh... diversity of our crew.', '', 43128, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 21361, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
