('Step aboard, friends! Carefully now...', '', 43126, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 21358, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so I see that you have appealed to Diamant. I have been bidden to abide your passing, fleshling. But that shall be the extent of the welcome you shall receive from me.$B$BDo not forget our first conversation. My trust for you is shallow. You have much to prove.$B$BYou would do best to leave. I grow tired of being wary of where my feet fall.', '', 43125, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Earthwarder began to recover, he became ill content with the quiet. With the peace. It was not long before he turned the stone dragons upon us.$B$BWith Deathwing gone, they are without purpose again. We can remind them of our strength. Bring them back to the Earthmother.', '', 43124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deepholm was a slow, quiet place. Always alive. Steadily moving. Never rushed. In this time, I strived to become one with the earth, and to a large degree, I succeeded.$B$BLater, the Earthwarder returned, injured. He did not upset the balance at first. He\'d stayed here before, and we knew of him. The shift did not truly begin until the Twilight cult joined him.', '', 43123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand your ground, brothers! Make it bleed!', '', 43122, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 21296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meddlesome gnats! You think us defeated so easily?', 43121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 18891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ready for a tussle, $Glad:lass;?', 43120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With Crushcog defeated, Thermaplugg is sure to be quaking in his mechano-tank, and rightly so. You\'re next, Thermaplugg. You\'re next!', '', 43119, 0, 10045, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to be in position to strike against Crushcog when the mountaineers arrive.', '', 43118, 0, 10045, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A messenger reached us from Brewnall Village this morning. The dwarves are sending a squad of mountaineers to help us.', 43117, 0, 10045, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a battle to win!', '', 43116, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And here we are!  Welcome to Kharanos!  Watch your step on the way out.', '', 43115, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the meaning of this!?', '', 43114, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s plenty else going on out here, too.  We\'ve opened up the path to the airport, there\'s rumors of Dark Irons in the east... oh, and I think something weird is going on with that dwarf king, Magni.  Might want to check it out.', '', 43113, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And if you\'ll look to your left, you\'ll see that the gnomes have retaken Gnomeregan.  Hooray for us!', '', 43112, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re going to have a hard time handling this one alone. I sent a message to the dwarven capital of Ironforge asking for their support.', 43111, 0, 10045, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What we do know is that Crushcog is using an advanced mechano-tank prototype and his irradiated gnomes are trying to repair more at the old arsenal.', '', 43110, 0, 10045, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy money! Commission\'s to be dispersed evenly among any and all survivors!\n', '', 43109, 0, 8873, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...where we\'ll commence to assistin\' the Horde in their little skirmish with them Alliance fellers.\n', '', 43108, 0, 8873, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cap\'n Samir is navigatin\' this here ship non-stop to that there ocean over yonder...\n', '', 43107, 0, 8873, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
