('We\'ve got another $r flying in!', 'We\'ve got another $r flying in!', 42960, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming $r!', 'Incoming $r!', 42959, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inbound $r!', 'Inbound $r!', 42958, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t suppose you brought another squad with you, did you? We\'ve got our hands full out here.', '', 42951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... a couple more tweaks should do it, I think...', '', 42950, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise my, uh... what shall I call you? How about \'multi-bot\'? Arise, my multi-bot!', '', 42949, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, it\'s finished.', '', 42948, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to put the finishing touches on my bot.', '', 42947, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, to be back in Stranglethorn.  The screeching raptors, the troll wars, jungle creatures as far as the eye see, just ASKING to be killed...$b$b<Bort sighs.>', '', 42946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi.', '', 42945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranglethorn, $g man: babe;.  That\'s where it\'s AT!', '', 42944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ever been to the jungle, $r?$b$bIt\'s real nice.', '', 42943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shell\'s markings read: \"STORMWIND ROYAL INDUSTRIES\"', '', 42942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to meet with your so-called Earthcaller.', '', 42941, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must fly up to Stonehearth, aid my people against the stone troggs, and free my father.$B$BI will meet you there shortly after speaking with the Earthcaller.$B$BDon\'t let him die, $n, or I will put you in the ground myself!', '', 42940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one that assisted me should be adequate. Have them report to our force commander, Crag Rockcrusher at Stonehearth.', '', 42939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I demand that you send aid to Stonehearth. Help us with our war and to free Stonefather Oremantle.', '', 42938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earthcaller, my father, Stonefather Oremantle, has been taken prisoner by the stone troggs of Needlerock Spire.', '', 42937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would be wise not to waste time. If my father dies, he takes with him the knowledge of where the middle fragment of the World Pillar is hidden. I know that you people want it.', '', 42936, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The war between the Earthen and the stone troggs has raged for time beyond measure. But now in the chaos, the Stonefather, prisoner. They are threatening to kill him if we do not surrender.', '', 42935, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was on my way to the temple when I was jumped. My father must be rescued before the stone troggs kill him.', '', 42934, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hurry and speak with your Earthen Ring friend.', '', 42933, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must drop everything that you\'re doing to help me free my father, our leader the Stonefather.', '', 42932, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only thing that matters is that we rescue my father.', '', 42931, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Captain\'s Log lies nearby.', '', 42930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to this Earthen Ring friend of yours. I have important news for the two of you.', '', 42929, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are going to the Temple of Earth, yes?', '', 42928, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have we here, $n?', 42927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to see a medic!', '', 42926, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, come back! I have readings to take!', '', 42925, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t talk about me like I\'m not here! All I know is I\'m hungry and I need to get out of these hideous, smelly clothes!', '', 42924, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, he\'s a little small, even by gnome standards, but he\'s all there! The real question is, what will he remember?', '', 42923, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Absolutely amazing! We\'ve done it!', '', 42922, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what happened to me?', '', 42921, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The great Rastakhan sends his greetings to you, member of the Horde.', '', 42920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a lot of money out there in that jungle, $r.  Can you see it?$b$bNo, it doesn\'t look like gold or copper.  It looks like raptor hides, and mineral veins, and ancient troll artifacts.$b$bOK, maybe the mineral veins might look like gold or copper.$b$bBut still, you get my point, right?', '', 42919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s give this a try. Goggles, everyone!', '', 42918, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The troll sings to himself and stares into the cauldron.  He appears to be injured.>', '', 42917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cannoneer\'s hands are black with gunpowder.', 42916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brother has spent years working on a cure for leper gnomes. Using his notes, I think I\'ve perfected a process for restoring gnomes who\'ve devolved to sludge.', '', 42915, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The cauldron bubbles.>', '', 42914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe I wasn\'t as safe as I thought I was here in Grom\'gol.$b$bA troll\'s gotta watch his neck wherever he goes.', '', 42913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trolls of Stranglethorn don\'t take too kindly to us Darkspear.  I\'m not afraid of no Bloodscalp or Skullsplitter, but still... Grom\'gol\'s high walls make me feel safe.', '', 42912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in this remote corner of the world, know that Hellscream\'s eyes are upon you.', '', 42911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Grom\'gol, $c.  Before we get off on the wrong foot, I\'ll have you know that I won\'t have slackers in my Base Camp.  I expect a healthy $r like you to pull your own weight around here.', '', 42910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See ya!', 'See ya!', 42909, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, thanks!', 'Yeah, thanks!', 42908, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks so much for the cookies!', 'Thanks so much for the cookies!', 42907, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh...I\'m gonna...urp!', 'Uh oh...I\'m gonna...urp!', 42906, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not belong in the realm of earth!', '', 42905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who are not of the earth must be destroyed!', '', 42904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not belong here!', '', 42903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...where we\'ll commence to assistin\' the Horde in their little skirmish with them Alliance fellers.\n', '', 42902, 0, 8873, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zanzil is creating an army that will wash over all of Stranglethorn!  Bloodscalps, Skullsplitter, Gurubashi and Horde... all will serve Zanzil!', '', 42901, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skullsplitter... is... forever... mon...', '', 42900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stay back!  Da troll is mine!', '', 42899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s skin', '', 42898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blade cuts into the Mosh\'Ogg Bounty, forcing it open!', 'The blade cuts into the Mosh\'Ogg Bounty, forcing it open!', 42897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there something you need?', '', 42896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Learn to light fires from the elder raptor.>', '<Learn to light fires from the elder raptor.>', 42895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you again in Thunder Bluff.', '', 42894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re done here. Mulgore will no longer suffer the hatred of the Grimtotem.', '', 42893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Orgrimmar.', 'Send me to Orgrimmar.', 42892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will devour your souls, insolent mortals!', '', 42891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not belong in this world, foul being!  Suffer the wrath of nature!', '', 42890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve no need to fight you, for it appears I\'ve already won.  You cannot stop our attack on Darkshore and save Hyjal at the same time!', 42889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah... Malfurion Stormrage.  I\'d hoped to keep you occupied for a little longer.  It was my goal to keep you away from Hyjal while my allies attacked.  It would seem I have succeeded.', 42888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be up to you to use the Horn of the Ancients and stop Soggoth\'s return.', '', 42887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s not lying.  Nordrassil is in danger.  I must make haste and prepare for Hyjal\'s defense.', '', 42886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fate has brought you to me!', 'Fate has brought you to me!', 42885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your money or your life!', 'Your money or your life!', 42884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in the wrong place at the wrong time, $g pal:missy;!', 'You\'re in the wrong place at the wrong time, $g pal:missy;!', 42883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one here gets out alive!', 'No one here gets out alive!', 42882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me all your gold!', 'Give me all your gold!', 42881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The grapes were VERY TASTY!', 'The grapes were VERY TASTY!', 42880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blackrock take forest!', 'Blackrock take forest!', 42879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat you!', 'Eat you!', 42878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beg for life!', 'Beg for life!', 42877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orc KILL $r!', 'Orc KILL $r!', 42876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya gonna go on to great ting\'s. Don\'t forget me, mon.', '', 42873, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One last favor from old Zuni.', '', 42872, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin.  It\'s good to see you, brother.', '', 42871, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still, I fear I was lettin\' my temper drive me ta bein\' rash. Thrall devoted himself to makin\' the Horde what it is, so I\'ve no eagerness to be leavin\' it on a whim.  Dis will be needin\' much more thought.', '', 42870, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 20106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tha Darkspear are \'ere because I led dem here.  Orgrimmar be no home as long as it be under Hellscream\'s hand. ', '', 42869, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 20105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, teleport me!', 'Yes, teleport me!', 42867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, ho! Oh ho ho.$B$BYo ho ho, even.$B$BThe flight to Twilight Highlands event is being worked on. In the meantime, I\'l take yeh there, lickety-split.$B$BDo yeh trust me, $c?', '', 42866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 7394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarrrr, yeh don\'t want none of what I be dealin\', $gSonny:missy;.$B$BBegone wit\' yeh!', '', 42865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 7394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF768EBDFive years ago, in the heart of the Deadmines...|r |TInterface\\QuestFrame\\UI-QUESTLOG-BOOKICON.BLP:32|t', '', 42864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to escape?  That is fine, but you must know some things first.$b$bStay away from the trolls.  They will not kill you, but they will trap you and bring you back here.$b$bSpeak with every raptor you see.  Not only can they teach you new abilities, but they will help you remember your progress and make your path out of Zul\'Gurub much easier.$b$bYou already have a Dash ability - use it to get out of tight spots.$b$bOh... and stay out of the water.$b$bGood luck!', '', 42863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get over here, bruddas, quick!', 'Get over here, bruddas, quick!', 42862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone been burnin\' my tiki!', 'Someone been burnin\' my tiki!', 42861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a fire!  Hurry up mon!', 'It\'s a fire!  Hurry up mon!', 42860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Da tiki!  Put it out!', 'Da tiki!  Put it out!', 42859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.$b$bIn return, I will teach you how to distract the trolls up ahead.', '', 42858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A soldier could get into a lot of trouble in a town like this.$B$BA lot of trouble.', '', 42857, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bone_orcskull_01.blp:32|t$b$bPick up Gurubashi Skulls from skullpiles, then drop them in troll paths!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bone_orcskull_01.blp:32|t$b$bPick up Gurubashi Skulls from skullpiles, then drop them in troll paths!', 42856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_fire.blp:32|t$b$bPick up Burning Twigs from braziers, then use Light Fire to burn down Zul\'Gurub Tikis!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_fire.blp:32|t$b$bPick up Burning Twigs from braziers, then use Light Fire to burn down Zul\'Gurub Tikis!', 42855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steal food from sleeping Gurubashi Soldiers!', 'Steal food from sleeping Gurubashi Soldiers!', 42854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_net_01.blp:32|t$b$bUse the Eat Through Net ability to chew through Gurubashi nets!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_net_01.blp:32|t$b$bUse the Eat Through Net ability to chew through Gurubashi nets!', 42853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm\'ka, friend! It is good to see a fellow veteran of the Northrend campaign.$B$BThe Warchief has ordered me to assemble his greatest warriors for an assault on the Twilight Highlands.$B$B<Warlord Krogg looks you up and down.>$B$BWe may need your help. Check in with the Warchief in Orgrimmar and see if he has a use for you yet.', '', 42852, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm\'ka, friend!$B$BThe Warchief has ordered me to assemble his greatest veterans for an assault on the Twilight Highlands.$B$BYou look like one tough $c, but we need soldiers who are a bit more... battle-hardened. Perhaps someday you and I will fight side-by-side. Until then, continue your training!  ', '', 42851, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whenever you get the GUTS to come back here, you better be ready.  \'Cause Jin\'do\'s got a surprise for you...', '', 42850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, Good.  And you... yes, you... the meddling worm inside dat Mind Control spell.  Don\'t think Jin\'do can\'t see you.', '', 42849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got a new cage built up, and we got plenty of ways to... teach her not to escape again.', '', 42848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yeah, Jin\'do.  We gonna take REAL good care of Ohgan\'aka.', '', 42847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bloodlord, you gonna take better care of your possessions?', '', 42846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, Ohgan\'aka.', '', 42845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya see... to summon Hakkar, I need Mandokir.  And Mandokir, he needs you.', '', 42844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re lucky I don\'t kill ya right now... but I got bigger plans for ya.', '', 42843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t NO ONE gonna escape Zul\'Gurub!  Not with Jin\'do in charge!', '', 42842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You tryin\' to escape from Zul\'Gurub?', '', 42841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where you goin\', little one?', '', 42840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaahhh!', 'Aaaaahhh!', 42839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch, mon!  I be trippin\'!', 'Ouch, mon!  I be trippin\'!', 42838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh...', 'Uh oh...', 42837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must... regain... balance... mon...', 'Must... regain... balance... mon...', 42836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who left this here, mon?  Whooaahh...', 'Who left this here, mon?  Whooaahh...', 42835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mekkatorque-Beam!', '', 42834, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mekkatorque-Missiles!', '', 42833, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mekkatorque-Ray!', '', 42832, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cheat.', '', 42831, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dice do not lie!', '', 42830, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mekkatorque-Cannon!', '', 42829, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The AWOL Grunt throws some dice.', '', 42828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me back to Blackrock Caverns!', 'Take me back to Blackrock Caverns!', 42827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in my group and ready to teleport to the Blackrock Caverns!', 'I\'m in my group and ready to teleport to the Blackrock Caverns!', 42826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blackrock Caverns, a level 79-81 dungeon on Blackrock Mountain, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\n\nTo leave the Halls of Stone, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be teleported to Dalaran. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC.', '', 42825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight well! I hope to have you by my side in the highlands.', '', 42824, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
