('I\'d started to think we\'d been left out here. Thanks for the hand!', 'I\'d started to think we\'d been left out here. Thanks for the hand!', 42685, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the relief. It\'s getting hairy out here.', 'Thanks for the relief. It\'s getting hairy out here.', 42684, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the elements... that one... just wouldn\'t die...', 'By the elements... that one... just wouldn\'t die...', 42683, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A chance to catch my breath! Thank you.', 'A chance to catch my breath! Thank you.', 42682, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, get to Stormwind. Tell King Wrynn everything. EVERYTHING! GO NOW!', '', 42681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May da elements protect us.', 42680, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 21029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only an elemental lord could bind so many elementals so quickly. It seems we\'re at war with da Stonemother herself...', 42679, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So it is certain den. Dese elementals were bound from dormant stone only recently.', 42678, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I took no pleasure in their deaths.', 42677, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I had no choice, lieutenant. They recognized me. The only people in the world who even knew I existed, recognized my face from when I was an infant.', 42676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why\'d you have the Furlbrows killed?', '', 42675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just tell me one thing, Vanessa.', '', 42674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you, $n, I will spare your life. You have done much to help our cause, albeit unwittingly, but the next time we meet it will be as enemies. ', 42673, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave nothing but ashes in your wake, brothers! Burn Sentinel Hill to the ground!', 42672, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the help. That one was far tougher for some reason.', 'Thanks for the help. That one was far tougher for some reason.', 42671, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for you, chief?', 'What can I do for you, chief?', 42670, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t the biggest job I\'ve done, not even close. This cataclysm may just be the best thing that ever happened to us!', '', 42669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need a mountain moved, I can do that. I can make \'em for you, too. ', '', 42668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jessup McCree, of McCree\'s Mountain Movers, at your service.', '', 42667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you seek peace, relinquish the World Pillar and leave Deepholm. This is our realm. Your only welcome here shall be found underneath my stone foot.', '', 42666, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Did you mistake me for Diamant, $r? Or perhaps some other whimpering, compliant stone trogg who cares?', '', 42665, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boden the Imposing, I come on behalf of the Earthen Ring. We wish your kind no harm. We seek to repair the rift between our worlds. Why do you attack us?', 'Boden the Imposing, I come on behalf of the Earthen Ring. We wish your kind no harm. We seek to repair the rift between our worlds. Why do you attack us?', 42664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, my dear.', '', 42663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Admiral, your hat.', 42662, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tie them up.', 42661, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'RISE UP BROTHERHOOD! THE DAWNING DAY IS UPON US!', 42660, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hope is a cruel joke, played upon us by a harsh and uncaring world. There is no Hope, there is only Vanessa. Vanessa VanCleef.', 42659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hope? Is that what I was supposed to feel when I saw my father decapitated by your henchmen?', 42658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope! Wha..', '', 42657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You bastards will burn for what you did.', 42656, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like this, $n. Stay alert!', '', 42655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now. Show me your fury. Show me!', '', 42654, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what you\'ve got!', '', 42653, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see some spirit. Strike! Strike! Strike!', '', 42652, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eyes of Hellscream are upon you.', '', 42651, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our wrath will paint the highlands red  - or whatever color our enemies bleed!', '', 42650, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When our fury is unleashed, our enemies will cower!', '', 42649, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We assemble an enormous fleet: land, sea, and air. We are legion!', '', 42648, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our destination is the Twilight Highlands. We strike at the beating heart of our enemy.', '', 42647, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemy, cloaked in shadow, seeks to unmake our world. We will not lose another home.', '', 42646, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We embark soon for distant shores, to hurl ourselves at the enemy homeland.', '', 42645, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes of the Horde! Are you ready to create history?', '', 42644, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My warriors! You have already proven your valor. This is why the Warchief has selected you.', '', 42643, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors. You\'ve fought hard in the frozen wastes. Your courage is to be tested again.', '', 42642, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch Nimboya do what Nimboya does best.', '', 42641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magic\'s done.', '', 42640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw de mojos on de skull!', '', 42639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw de big skull in de pot!', '', 42638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twilight scum!  You did this to us!', 'Twilight scum!  You did this to us!', 42637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone started dropping like flies... everyone who ate the rations.', 'Everyone started dropping like flies... everyone who ate the rations.', 42636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard them praying to their dark gods as everything went black... the Twilight\'s Hammer did this!', 'I heard them praying to their dark gods as everything went black... the Twilight\'s Hammer did this!', 42635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They tricked us into ambushing the Horde gunship... but why?', 'They tricked us into ambushing the Horde gunship... but why?', 42634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They poisoned our supplies... we had cultists onboard all along...', 'They poisoned our supplies... we had cultists onboard all along...', 42633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you still doing here, $c?$B$BShouldn\'t you be in Twilight Highlands laying waste to that wretched cult?', '', 42632, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s motions for you to speak with him again.', '', 42631, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be drinkin\' everyting, mon.', '', 42630, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Then keep it coming.', '', 42629, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twilight\'s Hammer. Bah. Bunch of prancing purple... pussycats. Back to business. Gravy! What am I drinking?', '', 42628, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you have it, $n. All the safe approaches to the Twilight Highlands. Unleash havoc on our foes!', '', 42627, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s scrawls out a depiction of his home port on a torn parchment.', '', 42626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, a map of the coastal approaches.', 'Yes, a map of the coastal approaches.', 42625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the weak hide in shadows, Twilight filth!', '', 42624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another worm driven to the ground.', '', 42623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the bite of the Dragonmaw!', '', 42622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twilight scum.', '', 42621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight without honor and die like vermin!', '', 42620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sense that you are being followed...', '', 42619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 3325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No matter what\'s going on elsewhere, Ironforge hasn\'t forgotten this land, nor any of Khaz Modan.', 42618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, Twilight\'s Hammer is trying to finish me off? Honorless filth!$B$BI will definitely help you, $c. You say you need a map?', '', 42617, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will help, but know that you\'re stepping into a viper\'s nest. Let me draw you a map - wha - behind you!', '', 42616, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dragonmaw can be great again. Help our conquest of the Twilight Highlands - can you give me a map?', 'The Dragonmaw can be great again. Help our conquest of the Twilight Highlands - can you give me a map?', 42615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this, $c? You know my name?$B$BDo you know, then, of my reputation?$B$BI am Flametusk of the Dragonmaw clan. I commanded legions, flew on dragonback, witnessed the sundering of Grim Batol...$B$BCurse the Twilight\'s Hammer, and curse their ogre lapdogs. Look at me now. All talk and cheap liquor.', '', 42614, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this old Dragonmaw to his drink, $c.$B$BI\'ve fought creatures that would curl your spine and I\'ve seen my people all but slaughtered in the swamps of the wetlands and amidst the ruins of Outland.$B$BGet. Lost.', '', 42613, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skills in battle are impressive, $n.', 'Your skills in battle are impressive, $n.', 42612, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems your reputation as a formidable $c is well earned, $n!', 'It seems your reputation as a formidable $c is well earned, $n!', 42611, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue the attack, $n!', 'Continue the attack, $n!', 42610, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight on, $n!', 'Fight on, $n!', 42609, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Don\'t let up, $n!', 'Don\'t let up, $n!', 42608, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep pressing the fight, $n!', 'Keep pressing the fight, $n!', 42607, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elemental rifts have opened up around the city.  We need to shut them down now! Evacuate all non-combat ready citizens.  Make sure they get to safety!', '', 42606, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wind and air elementals threaten to destroy Thunder Bluff.  If you think you are strong enough to go in there, be my guest.  Otherwise, stay out of the city and let us take care of it.', '', 42605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Daddy...', 42604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us return to Sentinel Hill, allies, and inform Gryan of VanCleef\'s demise!', '', 42603, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory for the Alliance! Glory to Stormwind!', '', 42602, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m starting my patrol now!', '', 42601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m stopping my patrol now!', '', 42600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no not de bar! Take it outside, mon!', '', 42599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cover the door - we\'ve got him!', 'Cover the door - we\'ve got him!', 42598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am prepared, Erunak. Let\'s go!', 'I am prepared, Erunak. Let\'s go!', 42597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make your preparations, $n, but do it quickly!', '', 42596, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None may challenge the Brotherhood!', '', 42595, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 5780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here to finish this! Face us, coward!', '', 42594, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nowhere left to hide, VanCleef! The Defias are THROUGH!', '', 42593, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirit Rise is secure! The invaders have been eliminated and the evacuation is complete!', '', 42592, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have secured the Hunter\'s Rise! All invaders have been repelled and the evacuation has been completed!', 42591, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes $gsir:ma\'am;! Right away, $gsir:ma\'am;! ', '', 42590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re on it!', '', 42589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Center Rise has been reclaimed!  The Earthmother be praised!', '', 42588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll get right on this, $gsir:ma\'am;!', '', 42587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place weather breakers around Thunder Bluff to protect the city!$B$BPick up wind breaks in crates around the city$B$Band place them at locations marked with a red arrow |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MARKEDFORDEATH.blp:32|t.', '', 42586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friends of the tribe, our city is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our home!  If you do not wish to battle, then grab weather breakers and line our city to protect it\'s citzens from the elements!', '', 42585, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free! I\'m really free!', '', 42584, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, someone who\'s not a trogg!', '', 42583, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea how happy I am to see you!', '', 42582, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks. Now, let\'s blow up that cave!', '', 42581, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t ever want to smell unwashed trogg again!', '', 42580, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for breaking me out of here!', '', 42579, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s throws his fish at you and attempts to run away in fear!\n', '%s throws his fish at you and attempts to run away in fear!\n', 42578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today, we are reborn! Today, we take a stand as men and women, not nameless, faceless numbers!', 42577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The government of Stormwind, of the ALLIANCE, must be made accountable for what it has done to us!', 42576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time has come, brothers and sisters, to stop this injustice!', 42575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'HIS war, not ours, cost us our livelihood. WE paid for the Alliance\'s victories with our blood and the blood of our loved ones!', 42574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meanwhile, our children die of starvation on these very streets!', 42573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our \"king\" sits atop his throne made of gold and shrugs at our plight!', 42572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brothers. Sisters. We are ABANDONED - the orphaned children of Stormwind.', 42571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gather, brothers and sisters! Come, all, and listen!', 42570, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The rally is about to begin!', 42569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s still good enough to ship. I can fix it with a patch!', '', 42568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s takes off running.', '', 42567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can float. On my toes. I\'m like a butterfly. Wanna see?', '', 42566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always wanted to be... a dancer! Power tools frighten me.\n', '', 42565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ... I never wanted to be an engineer anyways.', '', 42564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little paint and it\'ll be fine!', '', 42563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, look, it\'s okay! It\'s just a tiny little glitch. See?', '', 42562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh. Um. Oops.', '', 42561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nothing left for us but to wait... and hope.', '', 42560, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right. Takes a lickin\' but keeps on kickin\' butt!', '', 42559, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See that? Ironclad!', '', 42558, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready for inspection! ...Be gentle.', '', 42557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This baby is all mine! I call her, \"The Throttler.\"', '', 42556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready for inspection, $gsir:ma\'am;!', '', 42555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ain\'t with us, you\'re against us! DIE!', '', 42554, 0, 9992, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where do you think you\'re goin\'?', '', 42553, 0, 9992, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the end of the line, pal!', '', 42552, 0, 9992, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little early to the party, aren\'t ya?', '', 42551, 0, 9992, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naz\'jar and her honor guard... Fight for your lives!', '', 42550, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 21215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naz\'jar and her honor guard! Fight for your lives!', '', 42549, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nooooo!', '', 42548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhhh!', '', 42547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not relent! He is weakening!', 42546, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To me, my minions! Strike now!', 42545, 0, 0, 15, 118, 0, 0, 18876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye. Tonight.', 42544, 0, 9988, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moonbrook, mistress?', '', 42543, 0, 9988, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Call for the people. I wish to speak to them one last time before the dawning.', 42542, 0, 9988, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Judgment day is soon upon us, Helix.', 42541, 0, 9988, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, mistress.', '', 42540, 0, 9988, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will free the admiral during the dawning.', 42539, 0, 9988, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But mistress, the admiral is sti...', '', 42538, 0, 9988, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
