('Gibberish from a mad wolf. Bah!', '', 42530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dawning comes, Stoutmantle, and with it comes your end.', '', 42529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know anything about this, beast? Who is the admiral? Speak!', '', 42528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The war in Northrend took its toll on us as a people, $n. While we were victorious in the frozen wastes, our own land fell into disarray.\n', '', 42527, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
