('Worse than your bite?', '', 42512, 7, 9983, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But is your bark...', '', 42511, 7, 9983, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, the marshal wasn\'t kidding.', '', 42510, 7, 9983, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I break out of these stocks I\'m going to rip out your heart and devour it whole!', '', 42509, 7, 9983, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We caught this beast slaughtering sheep in the countryside. He is unrepentant and easily agitated. Keep your distance, lieutenant.', '', 42508, 7, 9983, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Might I ask, what\'s with the worgen in the stocks?', '', 42507, 7, 9983, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s good to hear, marshal. While $n has brought the perpetrators to justice, their ringleader is still on the loose. Perhaps with the aid of the Westfall Brigade we will finally be able to solve this case.', '', 42506, 7, 9983, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have our full cooperation, lieutenant. The Furlbrows were good people. Their deaths will not go unpunished.', '', 42505, 7, 9983, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Akil\'darah at the middle terrace.', 'Send me to Akil\'darah at the middle terrace.', 42500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jintha\'alor gonna be ours, mon. The vilebranch be weak, nasty traitors, undeservin\' of the favor of the loa.', '', 42499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akil\'darah, return me to my allies.', 'Akil\'darah, return me to my allies.', 42498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Wind howls past the statue as you stand in front of it.>', '', 42497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I misplaced the enchanted blade that you gave me. Have you seen it?', 'I misplaced the enchanted blade that you gave me. Have you seen it?', 42496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In my youth, my family did not approve of my interest in shamanism. Brash and foolish as I was, I ran away from them and practiced on my own.  Upon returning to my home one day, I found my parents gone. My home destroyed. They never found who did it.\n\nI\'ve spent my life striving to extend my shamanistic visions to see into the past - to find out what happened to my family and who is responsible. I\'ve come a great way. I\'ve learned to focus in on impactful events in the recent past, but I have much further to go if I ever hope to glimpse something that occurred so long ago.', 42495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The trolls here are quite accepting of my kind. After all, they spoke to the dead for centuries before the Forsaken even existed.$B$BIt\'s good for business.', 42494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wit\' practice, ya\'ll find that the dark arts can be much stronga than any weapon.', '', 42493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Voldreka if ya want warlock trainin\'.', 'I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Voldreka if ya want warlock trainin\'.', 42492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps one day I will repay you for this kind act.', 'Perhaps one day I will repay you for this kind act.', 42491, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bless you, friend.', 'Bless you, friend.', 42490, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe... maybe life is worth living.', 'Maybe... maybe life is worth living.', 42489, 7, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d know that smell anywhere! Salma\'s famous stew!', 'I\'d know that smell anywhere! Salma\'s famous stew!', 42488, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Westfall stew? I\'ll never forget this moment!', 'Westfall stew? I\'ll never forget this moment!', 42487, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, kind and gentle stranger.', 'Thank you, kind and gentle stranger.', 42486, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
