('I TOLD YOU TO PAY UP, PAL!', 'I TOLD YOU TO PAY UP, PAL!', 42388, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe I can sell your liver for some gold.', 'Maybe I can sell your liver for some gold.', 42387, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Livin\' like an animal is hard enough without your insults!', 'Livin\' like an animal is hard enough without your insults!', 42386, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t tellin\' you a damn thing!', 'I ain\'t tellin\' you a damn thing!', 42385, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You rich punks are all the same!', 'You rich punks are all the same!', 42384, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw \'em with my own two eyes. Think they\'d been casin\' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there...', 'Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw \'em with my own two eyes. Think they\'d been casin\' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there...', 42383, 7, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who killed the Furlbrows? I\'ll tell you who killed the Furlbrows: KING VARIAN WRYNN, THAT\'S WHO! And he\'s killin\' the rest of us too. One bum at a time. The only thing I can tell you is that I saw some gnolls leavin\' the place a few hours before the law arrived.', 'Who killed the Furlbrows? I\'ll tell you who killed the Furlbrows: KING VARIAN WRYNN, THAT\'S WHO! And he\'s killin\' the rest of us too. One bum at a time. The only thing I can tell you is that I saw some gnolls leavin\' the place a few hours before the law arrived.', 42382, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t see who killed \'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin\' to share a meal or a patch of dirt.', 'I didn\'t see who killed \'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin\' to share a meal or a patch of dirt.', 42381, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don\'t want any trouble, ok? I didn\'t see who murdered \'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin\' your shoes.', 'Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don\'t want any trouble, ok? I didn\'t see who murdered \'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin\' your shoes.', 42380, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Judgment day comes! The brotherhood will be reborn!', 'Judgment day comes! The brotherhood will be reborn!', 42379, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll get nothing out of me!', 'You\'ll get nothing out of me!', 42378, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They died of natural causes...', 'They died of natural causes...', 42377, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got no business here, lout! Beat it!', 'You got no business here, lout! Beat it!', 42376, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only thing I\'ll tell you is to get the hell out of here!', 'The only thing I\'ll tell you is to get the hell out of here!', 42375, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t buy me! DIE!', 'You can\'t buy me! DIE!', 42374, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to give this hobo money?', 'Are you sure you want to give this hobo money?', 42373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 42372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe a couple copper will loosen your tongue. Now tell me, did you see who killed the Furlbrows?', 'Maybe a couple copper will loosen your tongue. Now tell me, did you see who killed the Furlbrows?', 42371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see who killed the Furlbrows?', 'Did you see who killed the Furlbrows?', 42370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna talk? Pay up.', 'You wanna talk? Pay up.', 42369, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh the big hero has arrived. I\'m saved! Yea, right...', 'Oh the big hero has arrived. I\'m saved! Yea, right...', 42368, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get lost.', 'Get lost.', 42367, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t tellin\' you nothin\'!', 'I ain\'t tellin\' you nothin\'!', 42366, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whaddya want?', 'Whaddya want?', 42365, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check $g his:her; pockets!', '', 42364, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MINE!', '', 42363, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does $g he:she; have boots? Get \'em!', '', 42362, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEY! HEY YOU! GET OFF MY PROPERTY!', 'HEY! HEY YOU! GET OFF MY PROPERTY!', 42361, 7, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I miss being robbed by the Defias. At least they\'d leave you a little something to eat from time to time.', 'I miss being robbed by the Defias. At least they\'d leave you a little something to eat from time to time.', 42360, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if it\'s possible to eat rocks? Got plenty of rocks around here. Just imagine it! I\'d be the richest person in the world for making that discovery!', 'I wonder if it\'s possible to eat rocks? Got plenty of rocks around here. Just imagine it! I\'d be the richest person in the world for making that discovery!', 42359, 7, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we\'ll be eating shoe leather for dinner again.', 'Looks like we\'ll be eating shoe leather for dinner again.', 42358, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to me? I used to be the king of Stormwind!', 'What happened to me? I used to be the king of Stormwind!', 42357, 7, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think I\'m gonna make it...', 'I don\'t think I\'m gonna make it...', 42356, 7, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off my land!', 'Get off my land!', 42355, 7, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAHAHAH! Good one, Mr. Penguin! GOOD ONE!', 'HAHAHAH! Good one, Mr. Penguin! GOOD ONE!', 42354, 7, 0, 153, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m starving!', 'I\'m starving!', 42353, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I found us a savory and clean piece of dirt! Tonight we eat like kings, Mr. Penguin! Of course I\'ll share it with you! You\'re my best friend!', 'Looks like I found us a savory and clean piece of dirt! Tonight we eat like kings, Mr. Penguin! Of course I\'ll share it with you! You\'re my best friend!', 42352, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('JACKPOT!', 'JACKPOT!', 42351, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These depths truly are a nightmare.$B$BAlthough, the battle that is about to be joined down in the breach below will make this look like kittens and rainbows.', 42350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish that I was going to fight by your side in the upcoming battle, but Erunak wants me to remain here.$B$BGood luck, $n.', 42349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get the hell out of here. I hope this place burns to the ground.', '', 42348, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dirty, rotten pig-lickers. You\'ll get your come-uppance some day.', '', 42347, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dealing with the first ancient, Nespirah, was hard enough. The one across from us, L\'ghorek, is dying.$B$BI can sense its cries of agony. Something is stealing its life force. But to what end?', 42346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sign here says: \"ABSOLUTELY NO BUMS!\" Now get lost!', 'The sign here says: \"ABSOLUTELY NO BUMS!\" Now get lost!', 42345, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you read, pal? Probably not, huh?', 'Can\'t you read, pal? Probably not, huh?', 42344, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just between you and me, hon, I\'m too short to pull this kind of duty. One more month and I\'m out.$B$BI\'ve already died once. No sense doing it a second time.', 42343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re just trying to get a decent meal and maybe a comfortable night\'s sleep.', '', 42342, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Where do you think you two are going?', 'Where do you think you two are going?', 42341, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHOA THERE, BUDDY!', 'WHOA THERE, BUDDY!', 42340, 7, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You ask me, I think we let the soup and gravy take care of this ready and write.$B$BIt\'s bird lime to kick and prance ourselves out of here before we\'re all brown bread.$B$BCatch my meaning, love?', 42339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final battle against the naga has begun. We will destroy them or gloriously die trying in the Abyssal Breach.', '', 42338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before we join the final battle at the Abyssal Breach, we must stop whatever\'s happening inside of that Ancient across from us. Otherwise, we will fail.$B$BLend Erunak all of your might, $n.', '', 42337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you expect us to do?', 'What do you expect us to do?', 42336, 7, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this equality and justice for all?', 'Is this equality and justice for all?', 42335, 7, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heartless monsters!', 'Heartless monsters!', 42334, 7, 0, 14, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re hungry and cold! Help us!', 'We\'re hungry and cold! Help us!', 42333, 7, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What right do you have keeping us out?', 'What right do you have keeping us out?', 42332, 7, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is horse poop!', 'This is horse poop!', 42331, 7, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down with the king!', 'Down with the king!', 42330, 7, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us in!', 'Let us in!', 42329, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a battle brewing at the Abyssal Breach. I hope that the reinforcements that arrived with the Pincer X2 will be enough.', '', 42328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In spite of our best efforts, the naga have attacked the breach!$B$BThe Plane of Water must be defended!', '', 42327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('L\'ghorek is the name of the Ancient god that sits across the chasm from us. It is being infested by something.$B$BWe must put an end to this or we will certainly all meet our doom!', '', 42326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before we can join the final battle, we must ensure that whatever\'s happening inside of that Ancient across from us is put to an end. Otherwise, we will not stand a chance.$B$BLend Erunak your full assistance, $n.', '', 42325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good call.', '', 42324, 7, 9977, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get out of here before they try and pin this on us.', '', 42323, 7, 9977, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep. That King is good for nothin\'.', '', 42322, 7, 9977, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s happened to us? We\'re in worse shape now than when the Defias ran amok!', '', 42321, 7, 9977, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like the Furlbrow\'s were murdered...', '', 42320, 7, 9977, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final battle against the naga is imminent. We will triumph or die trying in the Abyssal Breach.', '', 42319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the hell happened here?', '', 42318, 7, 9977, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we are to die, let it be with honor against our hated enemies!', '', 42316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t die that easily, sea-witch!', '', 42315, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 21214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your head low, $g buddy:lady;.', '', 42314, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think we can do business.', '', 42313, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lookin\' for somethin\' a little more... exotic?', '', 42312, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whaddya need? Information? I got that too!', '', 42311, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'re you doin\' out here? Slummin\'?', '', 42310, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice stuff. You must be rich.', '', 42309, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you need, I can get...', '', 42308, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need something, $g mack:lady;?', '', 42307, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pssst...', '', 42306, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do enjoy yourssselves!', 42305, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 21270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In my absssence, my ssservantsss will... sssee to your needs. ', 42304, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 21269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You mussst forgive me... I have no time to ssstay and play.', 42303, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 21268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What an unexpected sssurprise.', 42302, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 21267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh, visitorsss!', 42301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have foolishly trespassed upon our waters, Alliance fools. Be whipped by the lash of my storm!', 42300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must make haste! The elementals cannot endure this siege.', '', 42299, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 19523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough!  The Earthen Ring will temporarily stop the invasion.  But be warned, the elementals will return!', 'Enough!  The Earthen Ring will temporarily stop the invasion.  But be warned, the elementals will return!', 42298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough!', '', 42297, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 19522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Evacuate the city!  Clear the streets of Stormwind!', 'Evacuate the city!  Clear the streets of Stormwind!', 42296, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear the streets!', 'Clear the streets!', 42295, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guests of Stormwind please find shelter from the coming storm!', 'Guests of Stormwind please find shelter from the coming storm!', 42294, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens of Stormwind! Begin to evacuate the city!', 'Citizens of Stormwind! Begin to evacuate the city!', 42293, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah!  Get back over here!', '', 42292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on!', '', 42291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Continue helping the Rockpool tadpoles.>', '<Continue helping the Rockpool tadpoles.>', 42290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<These baby Rockpool murlocs look toward the ocean.>', '', 42289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly, $n!  We haven\'t much time before Razelikh makes his return.', 42288, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, $n!  We haven\'t much time before Razelikh makes his return.', '', 42287, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('L\'ghorek Dies!', '', 42286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank the waves, you\'re back! The others have already retreated, we need to get out of here!', 42285, 0, 9743, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More naga! Brace yourselves!', '', 42284, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Park\'s been ruined... we\'ll have to go another way, today. Miserable dragon!', 42283, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This miserable can is nothing compared to the might of <Kraken Name here>!', 42282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naga attacking from the port and starboard! Faceless ones attacking head on...! We\'re heavily  outnumbered, but the ship is holding, sir!', '', 42281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue the bombardment of the ocean floor! Show those Naga the might of the Horde!', '', 42280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin! Status report!', '', 42279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re being besieged by the naga attempting to breech our airlocks! Defend the ship topside!', '', 42278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erunak! We don\'t have time for this...', '', 42277, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome back, $n. That took longer than expected. Learn anything useful?', 42276, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, I can\'t offer you training. You\'ll have to find someone more familiar with your skills.', 42275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kelsey Steelspark of Gnomeregan Covert Operations at your service! If you\'re looking for rogue training, you\'ve come to the right place.', 42274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been spotted! Make ready!', '', 42273, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neptulon\'s minions are growing desperate! We must hurry!', '', 42271, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 19524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our goal is in sight - press forward...', '', 42270, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More delays... Form up, men!', '', 42269, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, worm!', '', 42268, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press forward...', '', 42267, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another brief confrontation with naga here.', '', 42266, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before the day is done, you will all be slaves and corpses!', '', 42265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only wanted to... do something... good...', '', 42264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should consider losing some weight.', '', 42263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take two potions and call me in the morning.', '', 42262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing?  You threaten my work!  The Tainted Scar\'s revival is all thanks to me!', '', 42261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When was your last check up?', '', 42260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say \"Ahhhhh\".', '', 42259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh air! Grom\'s beard, I missed it. We have some ships just in sight to the north, $n - fire the flare in their direction.', '', 42258, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh air! By the light, I missed it. We have some ships just in sight to the north, $n - fire the flare in their direction.', '', 42257, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They attacked while you were gone... the Captain fell fighting them off. The rest retreated to the cave, you should do the same.', '', 42256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
