('You cultists are cowards. You make me sick!', 'You cultists are cowards. You make me sick!', 42120, 7, 924, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t have to sacrifice me. I\'d make a great cultist!', 'You don\'t have to sacrifice me. I\'d make a great cultist!', 42119, 7, 924, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I get out of here, I\'m going to kill every last one of you Twilight\'s Hammer scum!', 'When I get out of here, I\'m going to kill every last one of you Twilight\'s Hammer scum!', 42118, 7, 924, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m too young to die as a sacrifice!', 'I\'m too young to die as a sacrifice!', 42117, 7, 924, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh gods, someone get me out of this cage!', 'Oh gods, someone get me out of this cage!', 42116, 7, 924, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the status on new recruits, Marshal? We desperately need more soldiers. The Blackrock orcs invading our territory must be stopped!', '', 42115, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chart a course east with all possible speed. We\'ll rendezvous with the main fleet.', '', 42114, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 19661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take us out, Mister Gearchum.', '', 42113, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 19660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Move forward! Hold the bridge!', 42111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Budd! Noooo!', 42110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when ya be ready ta leave.', '', 42109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to join you in the vision, Farseer.', 'I am ready to join you in the vision, Farseer.', 42108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tha elements be crying out in rage. It ain\'t no coincidence dat da naga are here. Dey be wantin\' someting.', '', 42107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe you had a turtle prepared for me?', 'I believe you had a turtle prepared for me?', 42104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<L\'ghorek\'s voice booms inside your mind.>$B$BI AM ALMOST... DEAD. YOU MUST HELP... STOP... THE TWILIGHT\'S HAMMER.$B$BTHEY DRAIN... MY ENERGY TO... CREATE... THEIR ASCENDANTS. THEY ARE A... GRAVE THREAT IN... THE IMMINENT WAR... VERSUS... NEPTULON.', '', 42102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tie your lure off and let it loose.', 'Tie your lure off and let it loose.', 42101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A stake has been driven into the rock, and a long braid of rope draped around it.$B$BThis must have some purpose.', '', 42100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now make ready, for soon we\'ll be ashore.', '', 42099, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been paid good coin for non-stop passage, miss. We have no time for delays...', '', 42098, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind shall never fall!', '', 42097, 0, 0, 53, 71, 0, 21190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today Hellscream shall learn the lesson that Thrall failed to teach him...', '', 42096, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellscream has sent his best to take this island. We shall see to it that none return home...', '', 42095, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 21188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every orc you slay today will bring honor to them, and to every soldier who has come before you.', '', 42094, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s where we will do our duty, for our king, for Stormwind and for her people...', '', 42093, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 21186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That island on the horizon is our destination.', '', 42092, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 21185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall in, men!', '', 42091, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 21184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Civilians...', '', 42090, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21183, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww, Budd. Now what\'d ya go an\' do that for?\n', '', 42089, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have naga blood on your hands, then you\'re an ally of mine.$b$bA long time ago, I swore I\'d never be anyone\'s slave again, and I kept that bargain until Idra\'kess captured us.  Now I can barely contain my fury.  All I want is blood... not food, not sleep, not even victory... only blood.', '', 42088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wounds are not healing, $r.  I fear I may die inside this creature\'s gut if we do not act soon.', '', 42087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need your help, $c.  We\'ve fought tooth and nail to get here, but the naga keep coming.', '', 42086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t like the feel of this place, $n.  Naga sorceresses and slavedrivers aside... all I can sense inside this cavern is pain.  The ancient one is trying to cry out, but it cannot speak.', 42085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Sitting here injured and watching my brothers fight is almost too much to bear, but even I understand that I\'m more valuable alive than dead.', '', 42084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why are they doing this?  For pearls?  For war?  This ancient, Nespirah, is far more powerful than the naga understand.  If they\'re able to turn her towards their will... the damage they could cause would be tremendous.', 42083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care if I die inside this husk, $n.  I\'ll pay these naga back for every one of my fellow soldiers they\'ve killed or enslaved!$b$bThe others can worry about escape.  I\'ll worry about doling out punishment to these snakes.', '', 42082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve killed dozens of naga to get this far, but they still keep coming.  What will it take to escape this wretched cavern?', '', 42081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry - if they try to pretend they didn\'t see it, I\'ll swim over there and drag them off of their ships myself.', '', 42080, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! There\'s no way they\'ll miss that, cannon fire or not.', '', 42079, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Furien groans.>', '', 42078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let honor guide you, $n. Do not forget that Hellscream\'s eyes are always upon you.', '', 42077, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 20541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The choice is yours to make.', '', 42076, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 20540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, Krom\'gar\'s army is no more. Your rank no longer has meaning. If you wish to truly help the Horde, your considerable power could be used in Desolace or in the Southern Barrens.', '', 42075, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mountaineer Barleybrew said you could help me get to Loch Modan.', 'Mountaineer Barleybrew said you could help me get to Loch Modan.', 42071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mercy... Chieftain, on this day I learn from you.', '', 42070, 1, 0, 66, 65, 0, 20538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mercy... Your wife and child were murdered. Your kin wiped out. Your home burned to the ground.', '', 42069, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have mercy, Warchief.', '', 42068, 1, 0, 20, 65, 0, 21556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, Warchief! Please! $n was the hero responsible for uncovering this corruption. $g He:She; tried to stop Krom\'gar!', '', 42067, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you, $r!', '', 42066, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 20536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU ARE DISMISSED.', '', 42065, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By my right as Warchief, I hereby relieve you of duty.', '', 42064, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have brought shame to us as a people.', '', 42063, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 20531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overlord Krom\'gar, you have disgraced the Horde.', '', 42062, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 20530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Honor,\" Krom\'gar, \"No matter how dire the battle... never forsake it.\"', '', 42061, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While there, a wise old war hero told me something that I would carry with me forever...', '', 42060, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spent a very long time in Northrend, Krom\'gar. I learned much about the Horde in that time.', '', 42059, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instead, you laid waste to the land. Murdered innocents. Children even...', '', 42058, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sent you into Stonetalon Mountains with an army.  Your orders were to secure this land for the Horde.', '', 42057, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I ask you again: WHAT HAVE YOU DONE!', '', 42056, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Warchief!', '', 42055, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I a murderer, Krom\'gar?', '', 42054, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 20523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief... Sir... I...', '', 42053, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magmaw begins to break free from the single chain binding him!', '', 42052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 8717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was my command to murder innocents, Krom\'gar?', '', 42051, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 20522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My command?', '', 42050, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 20521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief! I... I was carrying out your command!', '', 42049, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll escort you to your new \'accommodations\', Your Excellency.', '', 42048, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you done, Krom\'gar?', '', 42047, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 20520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I go willingly, $c. My purpose in my master\'s plan is fulfilled.', '', 42046, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look upon the world, Cliffwalker, and see the might of the Horde!', 'Look upon the world, Cliffwalker, and see the might of the Horde!', 42045, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20789, 20789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we were in Shadowforge City, I would have you tossed into the Ring of Law for your transgressions, Ambassador. The darkest dungeons of Ironforge will have to do for now.', 42044, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do as you will with me. I am not afraid. That halfbreed runt will never be my emperor! Long live Twilight\'s Hammer!', '', 42043, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a totem to break the elemental prisons!', 'I need a totem to break the elemental prisons!', 42042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are grave times for Azeroth, $n.', 'These are grave times for Azeroth, $n.', 42041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet! Moira\'s in a foul mood and if she hears you, she\'ll have your head...', '', 42040, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad to see that Dark Iron scum is finally getting what he deserves!', '', 42039, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it!  The perfect bio-fuel!  Good work, $n!', '', 42038, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'d you manage to make this one?  It burns like flash powder... far too quick.  Add more hammerhead.', '', 42037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re getting close... but it\'s still a little too smoky.  Don\'t put in any terrapin oil next time.  <cough>  Too much smoke.  Give it another shot!', '', 42036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks pretty good... but it burns too long!  I need to be able to stop the fire instantly.  Cut back on hammerhead oil next time.', '', 42035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re right, far too weak.  Needs more remora.  Try it again!', '', 42034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, this will definitely burn too hot.  Do you want to blow up the ship?  Cut back on remora oil next time.', '', 42033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah!  <cough>  Far too smoky!  <cough>   Looks like you put in too much terrapin oil!  Try again!', '', 42032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have discovered a new type of bio-fuel!  Bring it to Fiasco Sizzlegrin for testing.', 'You have discovered a new type of bio-fuel!  Bring it to Fiasco Sizzlegrin for testing.', 42031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are about to cross a terrible threshold, Krom\'gar. May the Earth Mother have mercy on your soul.', 'You are about to cross a terrible threshold, Krom\'gar. May the Earth Mother have mercy on your soul.', 42030, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21554, 21554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch now, Cliffwalker, as this battle comes to its glorious conclusion.', 'Watch now, Cliffwalker, as this battle comes to its glorious conclusion.', 42029, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 20788, 20788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cult must have someone in the city to coordinate this kind of attack. That only leaves one suspect, Ambassador Slaghammer!', 42028, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have discovered a new type of bio-fuel!  Bring it to Engineer Hexascrub for testing.', 'You have discovered a new type of bio-fuel!  Bring it to Engineer Hexascrub for testing.', 42027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, this is the work of a traitor to both our peoples. Despite my best efforts, some Dark Irons remain in the grip of Twilight\'s Hammer.', 42026, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it!  The perfect bio-fuel!  Good work, $n!', '', 42025, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'d you manage to make this one?  It burns like flash powder... far too quick.  Add more hammerhead.', '', 42024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re getting close... but it\'s still a little too smoky.  Don\'t put in any terrapin oil next time.  <cough>  Too much smoke.  Give it another shot!', '', 42023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Both of you know I would never order such a thing! Why would I set one half my son\'s inheritance against the other?', 42022, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks pretty good... but it burns too long!  I need to be able to stop the fire instantly.  Cut back on hammerhead oil next time.', '', 42021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re right, far too weak.  Needs more remora.  Try it again!', '', 42020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, this will definitely burn too hot.  Do you want to blow up the ship?  Cut back on remora oil next time.', '', 42019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah!  <cough>  Far too smoky!  <cough>   Looks like you put in too much terrapin oil!  Try again!', '', 42018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muradin has a point. If you cannot govern your own people, you have no place at this table.', '', 42017, 7, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, I made a Promising Fuel Sample.  Three parts hammerhead and two parts remora.', 'Here, I made a Promising Fuel Sample.  Three parts hammerhead and two parts remora.', 42016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, I made a Quick-Burning Fuel Sample.  Is this good enough?', 'Here, I made a Quick-Burning Fuel Sample.  Is this good enough?', 42015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, I made a Smoky Fuel Sample.  Pretty, isn\'t it?', 'Here, I made a Smoky Fuel Sample.  Pretty, isn\'t it?', 42014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, I made a Perduring Fuel Sample.  What do you think?', 'Here, I made a Perduring Fuel Sample.  What do you think?', 42013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What cause do the Dark Irons have for taking up arms against Ironforge? Are you unable to control your own people, Moira?', '', 42012, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, I made an Anemic Fuel Sample.  It seems... weak.', 'Here, I made an Anemic Fuel Sample.  It seems... weak.', 42011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, I made an Atomic Fuel Sample.  It seems to be a little too hot.', 'Here, I made an Atomic Fuel Sample.  It seems to be a little too hot.', 42010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, I made a Billowing Fuel Sample.  It\'s really smoky!', 'Here, I made a Billowing Fuel Sample.  It\'s really smoky!', 42009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know Commander Stonebreaker and I will vouch for his loyalty and his honesty. We must take his word.', '', 42008, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is quite an accusation, Moira. It\'s hardly your throne room in the first place.', '', 42007, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not let you and this treasonous Commander Stonebreaker steal my son\'s birthright!', 42006, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How dare you storm into my throne room and attempt to spread this conspiratorial nonsense!', 42005, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to start over.', 'I want to start over.', 42004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mix the samples together!', 'Mix the samples together!', 42003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get started!', 'Let\'s get started!', 42002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can use these beakers and alchemy tools to perform experiments with various types of submarine fuel.', 'You can use these beakers and alchemy tools to perform experiments with various types of submarine fuel.', 42001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hammerhead Oil Sample', 'Hammerhead Oil Sample', 42000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remora Oil Sample', 'Remora Oil Sample', 41999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terrapin Oil Sample', 'Terrapin Oil Sample', 41998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have selected all five of your samples.', 'You have selected all five of your samples.', 41997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have four samples, and only have room to test one more.  Which one will it be?', 'You have four samples, and only have room to test one more.  Which one will it be?', 41996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You now have three samples.  Which sample will you select next?', 'You now have three samples.  Which sample will you select next?', 41995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You now have two samples of oil.  Which sample will you select next?', 'You now have two samples of oil.  Which sample will you select next?', 41994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What type of oil will you select next?', 'What type of oil will you select next?', 41993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Several small samples of oil sit in front of you, along with an empty beaker.  The beaker looks like it can probably fit about five samples inside of it.$b$bWhat kind of oil will you take first?', 'Several small samples of oil sit in front of you, along with an empty beaker.  The beaker looks like it can probably fit about five samples inside of it.$b$bWhat kind of oil will you take first?', 41992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people were held as prisoners, as slaves, in this very camp by the humans. I was locked in these cages; I saw my brothers held in these stocks, hung in these gallows.$B$BI saw Orgrim Doomhammer, leader of us all, stabbed in the back. His blood stained black the earth we stand on.$B$BAnd look at us now. This is our legacy: Hammerfall, where we lost everything, and then took it back with our own hands.', '', 41991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone is using these beakers and alchemy tools to perform experiments with various types of submarine fuel.', 'Someone is using these beakers and alchemy tools to perform experiments with various types of submarine fuel.', 41990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I laugh at you, feeble $n, but I will oblige. Now, let us return to my master, below!', '', 41989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We bring victory...', 'We bring victory...', 41988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, men! Move out!', '', 41987, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 21206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be shy now, we\'re all friends here...', '', 41986, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
