('We\'ve beaten back the elementals, $n.  But they have left behind odd portals.$b$bThe King has gone through the portal, contrary to reason, to see where they lead. The portals have been reported in the Trade district, Cathedral district and Mage district$b$bI must remain here to see to the clean up of the city and the return of the citizens.  Go and help the King!', '', 41939, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Stormwind is under siege by elementals and needs your strength!$b$bWe\'ve evacuated most of the city.  King Wrynn is holding the Trade District while Lady Proudmoore and the Archbishop defend the Mage and Cathedral Districts.$b$bWherever you go, you\'ll be of great help.\n', '', 41938, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve destroyed hundreds of elementals, $n, and now they seem to be gaining strength!  Our guards are holding firm, but I\'m sure they could use your support.  King Varian Wrynn is leading the defense in the Trade district, Lady Jaina Proudmoore is helping defend the Mage district and Archbishop Benedictus is holding firm at the Cathedral of the Light.$b$bNo matter where you go in Stormwind, $n, you will be more than helpful.', '', 41937, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light be with them, brother - and with us, for that matter. We\'re spread pretty thin these days.', '', 41936, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
