('Ya have no idea what it\'s like to be stuck here in Vashj\'ir like this!  Do ya know how many fish have confused me for a piece of seaweed, nibbling on my toes and hiding between pieces of my armor?$b$bThe tickling alone is enough to drive a dwarf mad!', '', 41922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t even remember how many times I\'ve spotted a beautiful mining vein at the bottom of a lake or river, glimmering mockingly at me.  I\'m forced to float orelessly by, mining pick in hand, only to watch some blasted orc or blood elf swim down to the bottom and take it away from me.', '', 41921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
