('On my way.', 'On my way.', 41807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, my lady.', 'Of course, my lady.', 41806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not delay.', 'I will not delay.', 41805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Understood, my lady.', 'Understood, my lady.', 41804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Immediately, my lady.', 'Immediately, my lady.', 41803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By your order.', 'By your order.', 41802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At once, my lady.', 'At once, my lady.', 41801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you say, my lady.', 'As you say, my lady.', 41800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course. I will finish shortly and meet the Mistress at the temple. Thank you, Battlemaiden.', '', 41799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Fathom-Caller. The Mistress awaits.', 'Yes, Fathom-Caller. The Mistress awaits.', 41798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlemaiden, you honor me with your presence. Is it time for the ritual to commence?', '', 41797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see. Thank you for informing me personally, Battlemaiden.', 41796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will find the Mistress of the Tides immediately. Thank you for delivering this message, Battlemaiden.', 41795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For her grace, Lady Naz\'jar.', 41794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do me an honor by delivering this message, Battlemaiden.', 41793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope that you will grace our defense with your trident. The Kvaldir numbers are still increasing.', 41792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Tidehunter will fall.', 41791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In Azshara\'s name.', 41790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will head there immediately Battlemaiden. Thank you.', 41789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Sira\'kess has sent for you. You are needed for the ritual.', 'Lady Sira\'kess has sent for you. You are needed for the ritual.', 41788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, Battlemaiden?', 41787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Mistress of the Tides will need your defense back at the temple. Make your way there immediately.', 41786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fall back for the ritual. Our Lady awaits.', 41785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The priestesses will require your aid soon. The Lady requests your return.', 41784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Lady has sent word for your return to the temple. Do not delay.', 41783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Back to the temple. I will pick up the slack here.', 41782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re relieved, Honor Guard. Return to the temple.', 41781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Lady has requested you back at the temple, Honor Guard.', 41780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return to the temple immediately. The ritual will begin soon.', 41779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to help with Mr. D, kid. Let me in.', 'I\'m ready to help with Mr. D, kid. Let me in.', 41778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'BAD, BAD, ALLIANCE!', 41777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurt \'em some more! MORE!', 41776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'YAY!', 41775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make \'em sorry for hurting you, Mr. D!', 41774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Break their bones!', 41773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get \'em, Mr D!', 41772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be really careful, Mr. D. If you see a big group of gnomes, use your magnetic pull! Once you\'ve got \'em all sucked up, launch \'em to their death! YAY!', 41771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hooray, Mr. D! You\'re back! Do you remember how to shoot all your guns? Why don\'t you take a minute to learn how to fight again! Just in case.', 41770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crucible looks abandoned and powerless.$BPerhaps there is a place nearby where you can attune yourself to the Battlemaiden...', 'The crucible looks abandoned and powerless.$BPerhaps there is a place nearby where you can attune yourself to the Battlemaiden...', 41769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin zombies?! What\'s next... the volcano exploding?', '', 41768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I keep a clean inn with all of this going on? Are you going to take care of this pygmy problem?', '', 41767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Lady watch over you...', '', 41766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening?', 'What is happening?', 41765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is doing this to us?', 'Who is doing this to us?', 41764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me!', 'Help me!', 41763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha ha ha! The heroes have made it to the glorious finale. I take it you are in good spirits? Prepared for the final battle? Then gaze now upon my ultimate creation! RISE, SISTER!', '', 41762, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 20066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These lands are the frontier of the Dark Lady\'s conquest, $n. Look upon them; in time, it shall all be in the grasp of the Forsaken.', 41761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A large humanoid hand print is embedded on the surface of the orb. A soft green glow seems to pulse within.', '', 41760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Angry, want kill gong plz.', '', 41759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellscream\'s eyes are upon us all!', '', 41758, 0, 12302, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody knock that thing off of $n\'s head!', '', 41757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fools stop running around! Face it!', '', 41756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter the Portal.', 'Enter the Portal.', 41755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal shows old, ancient desert ruins.  The wind picks up, there must be a sandstorm brewing inside.  This portal must lead somewhere important, but where?', '', 41754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter the Portal.', 'Enter the Portal.', 41753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking through the portal only nets you an eye full of sand.  A pool of water surrounded by desert ruins is all that you can make out.  Where could this portal lead?', '', 41752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not falter, for Hellscream\'s eyes are upon you all!', '', 41751, 1, 12302, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Under Hellscream\'s watchful guise, live or die, we take Stonetalon.', '', 41750, 1, 12302, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From this day forth, failure is no longer an option.', '', 41749, 1, 12302, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How have the Alliance been able to halt the great Horde war machine?', '', 41748, 1, 12302, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHY THEN, have we failed to take Stonetalon Mountains?', '', 41747, 1, 12302, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the new Horde, and under Warchief Hellscream, we are masters of our own destinies.', '', 41746, 1, 12302, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may walk through the streets of Orgrimmar with pride!', '', 41745, 1, 12302, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ambassador. We have been expecting you.', '', 41744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your loved ones live with shelter over their heads.', '', 41743, 1, 12302, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your families no longer starve.', '', 41742, 1, 12302, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s that rabbit and pork it\'s going on about?', 41741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How has our revered Warchief failed you?', '', 41740, 1, 12302, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m gonna need me a good ol\' tiddlywink after this!', 41739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve gone mum and dad, you have!', 41738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Knock it off of their lump of lead!', 41737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re all fore and aft for putting that on!', 41736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hexascrub, you elekk\'s trunk? You haven\'t got a pot of glue!', 41735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m jumping jack in Gilneas on the spot!', 41734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nutmegs don\'t fail me now!', 41733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Somebody kill it!', 41732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not EVER bring cyclopean demonic octopi into the cove again!', 41731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why did I ever leave Brill?', 41730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I want to go home!', 41729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why am I afraid of this?', 41728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fiasco, you\'re an idiot! Next time just blow something up!', 41727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who puts a \"dead\" sea demon on their head, really?!', 41726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get me out of here!', 41725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am perplexed. Troubled by what I witness...', '', 41724, 1, 12302, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, fishie fishie...', '', 41723, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AHA! A FISH!', '', 41722, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get... back... over... here...', '', 41721, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, Captain Jewels is going to be angry...', '', 41720, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why must you taunt me so?', '', 41719, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hold still, fish!', '', 41718, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their numbers are too many to count. Their defenses look impenetrable.$b$bI saw no weaknesses to exploit, $r.', '', 41717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is there to report of these beasts, Gurrok? How do we defeat them?', 'What is there to report of these beasts, Gurrok? How do we defeat them?', 41716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not know what became of them.$b$bThere was a constant flow of captives. Horde and Alliance, both - all barely alive.$b$bThey must\'ve been hauled away beyond the trench, or they have perished.', '', 41715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see Nazgrim and his troops?', 'Did you see Nazgrim and his troops?', 41714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grunts, ATTENTION!', '', 41713, 1, 12302, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of our warriors broke free and smashed many of the prisons... we were free - at least for a moment.$b$bSome swam up towards the surface... some saw this cave and swam for it.$b$bI\'m the only one that lived....', '', 41712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How were you able to get away?', 'How were you able to get away?', 41711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strange that the naga would go out of their way to keep us alive.$b$bThey create prisons from mystical pearls - cells that allowed us to breathe, but little else..$b$bThey ship the prisoners off... somewhere.$b$bNever see them again....', '', 41710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell us about your captors, Gurrok.', 'Tell us about your captors, Gurrok.', 41709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We had them!$b$bWretched Alliance ships... we could\'ve cut a path to Stormwind and put an end to them!$b$b...But out of nowhere, gigantic tentacles reached up and seized our ship... broke it right in two!$b$bThe survivors... we were captured by naga as soon as we hit the water.', '', 41708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you get down here?', 'How did you get down here?', 41707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Gurrok, of Hellscream\'s Vanguard.', '', 41706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me your name, orc.', 'Tell me your name, orc.', 41705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It makes no sense, but those vermin are going to great lengths to keep our troops alive...', '', 41704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many of us tried to escape the naga.$b$bI am the only one who succeeded...', '', 41703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our warriors... they\'re all captives now.', '', 41702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Further attuning yourself with the Battlemaiden, you have gained a new ability!', 'Further attuning yourself with the Battlemaiden, you have gained a new ability!', 41701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wildhammers have always embraced shamanism, aye, but to find ourselves beneath the sea as part of the Earthen Ring?\n\nIt would\'ve taken more than a few tankards for me to believe that one, a year ago.', '', 41700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then what happened?', 'Then what happened?', 41699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earthwatchers won\'t allow faction squabbling to jeopardize the Earthen Ring\'s work here.\n\nThose who break the peace will be dealt with... harshly.', '', 41698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Tortolla.', 'Tell me about Tortolla.', 41697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the spirit of Aessina.', 'Tell me about the spirit of Aessina.', 41696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What became of her?', 'What became of her?', 41695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You speak in the past tense. What happened to her?', 'You speak in the past tense. What happened to her?', 41694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Aviana.', 'Tell me about Aviana.', 41693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $c!', 41692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, tell me more.', 'Yes, tell me more.', 41691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the wolf ancient, Lo\'Gosh.', 'Tell me about the wolf ancient, Lo\'Gosh.', 41690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to him?', 'What happened to him?', 41689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Goldrinn.', 'Tell me about Goldrinn.', 41688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tortolla never fell. Eventually the greatest Doomguards of the legion surrounded him, but couldn\'t pierce his stony skin and invulnerable shell. Oh, how they raged! Tortolla held his ground and covered a final retreat, before the mortal races regrouped and managed to seal the portal and end the invasion.$B$BIt was said that after the battle, Tortolla was found underneath a mountain of demon corpses. He shook the bodies free and his head emerged from the gore. Then, quietly, slowly... he asked if we had won.$B$B<Hamuul rests a hand on his stomach and bellows a deep, unselfconscious laugh.>', '', 41687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Tortolla! Often misunderstood and always, always underestimated. Creatures who move effortlessly between land and sea look to Tortolla as their patron ancient.$B$BTen thousand years ago the Burning Legion invaded Azeroth, and Tortolla was among the ancients who took to the field of battle alongside Cenarius and the mortal races.$B$BAs the demon hordes crashed against the front lines of the beleaguered defenders, they didn\'t know what to make of Tortolla. At first they tried to ignore him, but his terrible weight and crushing jaws laid waste to hundreds...', '', 41686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We mortal races know so little of Aessina, the spirit of the wilderness who lurks in dense untamed woods. She is the soul of the forest, its beating heart, the source of life energy that breaks down stone, devours ancient ruins, and fills dense thickets with mystery and fear. Aessina is the center of the web of life.$B$BThe night elves have built shrines to her throughout Kalimdor. She is revered, yes... But not understood.$B$BWhat would it be like, do you think, to get even a glimpse of this reclusive, powerful ancient?  ', 41685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aviana perished on the battlefield that day, but the mortal races and the remaining ancients ultimately triumphed. The first druids found her body among the carnage, and bore it up here, to the highest mountain.$B$BShe was laid to rest just outside this shrine, within a circle of sacred stones.$B$BA seed of G\'Hanir was used to plant the World Tree, and it is all that remains of that sacred realm, which otherwise perished with her.', 41684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Choluna\'s face darkens.>$B$BTen thousand years ago demons flooded across Azeroth in the War of the Ancients. Aviana called her children to the skies and fought off the demon hordes from the front lines. Her wrath was inescapable.$B$BHundreds fell before the fury of her talons. But ultimately she was surrounded by Doomguards, their barbed lances piercing her sides...$B$BIt is said that her blood itself attacked the demons, searing their flesh, destroying them even as she herself fell from the sky.', 41683, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fair Aviana, the Mistress of Birds! All winged creatures of Azeroth once owed her allegiance, especially we Druids of the Talon. It\'s by her grace that we were granted the ability to shift forms and take to the skies.$B$BAviana was both beautiful and terrible, like the great birds of prey she counted among her children. She lived in the towering spirit realm of G\'Hanir, the Mother Tree, but appeared on Azeroth in the form of a great winged goddess.', 41682, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten thousand years ago demons first breached this world, just as they had the orc homeworld of Draenor. They flooded across the terrain in legion. The great ancients of Azeroth helped the mortal races to mount a desperate defense.$B$BThe tenacity of Lo\'Gosh in these dark days became the stuff of legend. He feared no demon. He would wade into their ranks, fangs bared and spattered with their vile ichor, his great claws thrashing them by the dozen...$B$BHis stand against the demons inspires us all. We can all learn from his example.', '', 41681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lo\'Gosh is the spirit of the hunter, the animal instinct that kicks in when one smells food or sees one\'s children in jeopardy. He has always been with us, a part of our Horde, in our instincts and in our blood.$B$BHe has appeared in many forms, both on our world and here. On Azeroth, he is seen as a great white wolf, ferocious and cunning. The night elves call him \"Goldrinn.\"$B$BThey tell of a legendary battle ten thousand years ago, where Lo\'Gosh fought off the demon hordes. Do you want to hear about it?', '', 41680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tenacity of the wolf ancient is the stuff of legend.$B$BLearn from his example, $c, and victory is all but certain.', '', 41679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see your wares, Felonius.', 'Let me see your wares, Felonius.', 41678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coming or going?', '', 41677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was during those darkest of days that Goldrinn\'s tenacity in war became legendary. While others quaked at the visage of those demon hordes, their multitudes only spurred the great wolf ancient to ever greater feats of strength. He would wade into their ranks, fangs bared and spattered with their vile ichor, his great claws thrashing them by the dozen...$B$BIt was said he stayed behind to cover the Night Elf retreat from Eldre\'Thalas, the ancient city we know now as Dire Maul.$B$BDid he die? I\'m not certain the spirit of animal ferocity can ever truly die, $n.', '', 41676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the moment the wild creatures first stirred on Azeroth, Goldrinn was there. His is the spirit of the hunter, the animal instinct that kicks in when wild things smell food or feel their children are in jeopardy. He appears as a great white wolf, ferocious and cunning.$B$BHe\'s known across all cultures. The orcs even have their own name for him: \"Lo\'Gosh.\"$B$BTen thousand years ago, when demons first breached Azeroth, Goldrinn stood with the other ancients to mount a desperate defense.', '', 41675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is crazy you idiots!', 41674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is marbles and conkers!', 41673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the... $n?', '', 41672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wake up, Mr. D! You\'ve gotta save the spirits!', 41671, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you there, Mr. D?', 41670, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All good girls listen to their daddies!', 41669, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Durotar!', '', 41668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wake up, Mr. D!', 41667, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah! Orcs... This is gunna take some gettin\' used to...', '', 41666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My rescue plan is brilliant. Infallible. Only a goblin could possibly stop me from succeeding. A goblin with fins. Scary thought.', '', 41665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, friend.\n\nWe have little to offer by way of supplies, but I will assist you however I can.', '', 41664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naga.$B$B<Vilethorn spits on the ground in disgust.>$B$BIt was foolish of them to think they could make an orc labor at their whip. We will make every last one of them regret not killing us when they had the chance.', '', 41663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fiasco, I need to see that merciless corpse again.', 'Fiasco, I need to see that merciless corpse again.', 41662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know about you, but I really miss the unlimited raw materials that were down in the ruins!$B$BI\'m not even sure if I could make a dud grenade out of the little that can be scrounged in this cave!', '', 41661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hexascrub, let me see that merciless one again.', 'Hexascrub, let me see that merciless one again.', 41660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place isn\'t quite as cool as the ruins, and the air in here is a bit humid if I do say so myself, but it does have a comfy, home feel to it.$B$BDon\'t you think?', '', 41659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not so fast!', 41658, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave our lands!', 41657, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Filthy beast!', 41656, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF68228BYOUR SIMPLE MIND CANNOT GRASP WHAT IS TRANSPIRING.|r', '|cFF68228BYOUR SIMPLE MIND CANNOT GRASP WHAT IS TRANSPIRING.|r', 41655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF68228BYOU WILL NOT SURVIVE.|r', '|cFF68228BYOU WILL NOT SURVIVE.|r', 41654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF68228BYOUR WORLD CRUMBLES BEFORE YOU.|r', '|cFF68228BYOUR WORLD CRUMBLES BEFORE YOU.|r', 41653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF68228BI SEE YOU.|r', '|cFF68228BI SEE YOU.|r', 41652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF68228BYOU WILL SERVE ME AND THEN DIE PAINFULLY.|r', '|cFF68228BYOU WILL SERVE ME AND THEN DIE PAINFULLY.|r', 41651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF68228BINSIGNIFICANT MORTALS.|r', '|cFF68228BINSIGNIFICANT MORTALS.|r', 41650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF68228BI COME FROM BELOW.|r', '|cFF68228BI COME FROM BELOW.|r', 41649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF68228BDIE.|r', '|cFF68228BDIE.|r', 41647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re all going to die!', '', 41646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away! Get away!', '', 41645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all your fault! It was supposed to be dead! Now it ate your brains!', '', 41644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mommy!', '', 41643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody kill it!', '', 41642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HELP!', '', 41641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m too young to die! Hell, I\'m too pretty to die!', '', 41640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t eat my head!', '', 41639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken control of Greymane Court!', '', 41638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh gods! It\'s not dead! RUN!', '', 41637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of Greymane Court!', '', 41636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has lost control of Greymane Court!', '', 41635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has lost control of Greymane Court!', '', 41634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken control of the Cathedral Quarter!', '', 41633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
