('The Alliance has lost control of the Cathedral Quarter!', '', 41631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has lost control of the Cathedral Quarter!', '', 41630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken control of Merchant Quarter!', '', 41629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of Merchant Quarter!', '', 41628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has lost control of Merchant Square!', '', 41627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has lost control of Merchant Quarter!', '', 41626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When pushed to the edge, results may become unpredictable...', '', 41625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken control of the Stoneward Prison!', '', 41624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of the Stoneward Prison!', '', 41623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has lost control of the Stoneward Prison!', '', 41622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has lost control of the Stoneward Prison!', '', 41621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t complain about the materials down here. Substitutes for everything. Substitutes for substitutes. Gimme a few days and I\'ll build a aquatic hotrod out of kelp and shells!', '', 41620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not good enough....', '', 41619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me have a look at that shard, would you Captain?  I could feel its power radiating from the other side of the cave.', 41618, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck to you too, $n.', '', 41617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This job is well-suited for you, Duarn.  I must attend to matters outside.', '', 41616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing!', '', 41615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s becomes impaled on the spike, exposing his head!', '', 41614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 8717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grahhhh!!', '', 41613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazgrim! They have me....', '', 41612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall\'s balls! They\'re everywhere...', '', 41611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are... beaten. Escape if you can...', '', 41610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight like the orcs you were born to be! There is no retreat!', '', 41609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand your ground... fight!', '', 41608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 41607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors! Make \'em Bleed!', '', 41606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are we waiting for?  Let\'s go!', 'What are we waiting for?  Let\'s go!', 41605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worry not, Erunak.  The tauren will be safe.', '', 41604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may leave now, friend.  The tauren\'s friend Erunak should be waiting outside with seahorses.  In fact, it looks like he is here now.', '', 41603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My body is already starting to fight the naga infection.  Please, I ask you to get to safety before I unleash my wrath!', '', 41602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('K-k-k-k-kkkah!  I am freed from the naga\'s servitude, and my will is once again my own!', '', 41601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Board the seahorse, friend.  You probably do not want to be near Nespirah when she turns on the naga.', '', 41600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, follow me!', '', 41599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duarn - excellent work.  Do not dally long within Nespirah\'s shell.  You know as well as I do the dangers posed by an angry demigod.', '', 41598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have secured escape for us, $n.  You are to come with me.', '', 41597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s a little unstable, but what\'s progress without failure?', '', 41596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How well does the mortal shell handle extreme temperature change? Must find out! For science!', '', 41595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mix and stir, apply heat...', '', 41594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gasps for air and shivers in the cold.', '%s gasps for air and shivers in the cold.', 41593, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your wits, warriors! There are naga yet to kill!', '', 41592, 0, 11839, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They swarm us, shaman! Make yourself useful!', '', 41591, 0, 11839, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Axes ready! The enemy approaches!', '', 41590, 0, 11839, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Hellscream!', '', 41589, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and Thunder!', '', 41588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He never gave up - Captain Irontree - said he\'d make them pay for every inch of ground they defile. He may still be alive down there!', '', 41587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga! They\'ve followed $n back to the ship!', '', 41586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re upon us! Hurry, $n, my axe thirsts for the blood of these naga!', '', 41585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These orcs and I have served together through many battles.$b$bI do not envy any naga that enters this place.', '', 41584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we find a way to fight our way out of here, Hellscream will know of your deeds, $r.', '', 41583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Morale is growing higher, thanks to your efforts, $c.', '', 41582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you bring us? Treasures from the surface?', '', 41581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We kill them and we take their stuffs...', '', 41580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s it got in its pockets? Hmm?', '', 41579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got shiny?', '', 41578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, sir! Let\'s go Ut.', '', 41577, 1, 9767, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are poorly equipped to do battle here.$b$bPreparations must be made...', '', 41576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In all my days, $r, I\'ve never seen such a thing...', '', 41575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As for the rest of you grunts, suit up! We got some killin\' to do.', '', 41574, 1, 9767, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we\'ve got some of Rockrain\'s soldiers here. Dontrag, Utvoch, we\'re gonna need your expertise over at Krom\'gar Fortress.', '', 41573, 1, 9767, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More fodder for the Horde war machine.', '', 41572, 1, 9767, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a sick, sick orc, Ut.', '', 41571, 1, 9767, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know I can\'t resist tauren women, Donty. They\'re my one weakness...', '', 41570, 1, 9767, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What could an orc as depraved as you enjoy more than killing Alliance, Utvoch?', '', 41569, 1, 9767, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
