('Thank you, $c! Back to the fight!', 'Thank you, $c! Back to the fight!', 41427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re still in this fight? I\'ve got to report to Irontree!', 'We\'re still in this fight? I\'ve got to report to Irontree!', 41426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your feet, soldier. The ancients are with us, and the mountain is healed!', 'On your feet, soldier. The ancients are with us, and the mountain is healed!', 41425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve opened gateways to the Firelands... tell me there\'s still hope!', 'They\'ve opened gateways to the Firelands... tell me there\'s still hope!', 41424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The town... demolished! We couldn\'t stop them.', 'The town... demolished! We couldn\'t stop them.', 41423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twilight\'s Hammer... I heard them screaming and running... are we making a counter-attack?', 'Twilight\'s Hammer... I heard them screaming and running... are we making a counter-attack?', 41422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m burned. Badly.', 'I\'m burned. Badly.', 41421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not from Twilight\'s Hammer. What is happening out there?', 'You\'re not from Twilight\'s Hammer. What is happening out there?', 41420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must ... return to ... Irontree!', 'Must ... return to ... Irontree!', 41419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it all over yet?', 'Is it all over yet?', 41418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha - Where  am I? Are you one of them?', 'Wha - Where  am I? Are you one of them?', 41417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we\'re done here, those Frostmanes will fear us more than the troggs. They\'ll have no choice but to leave.', '', 41416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any supplies?', 'Do you have any supplies?', 41415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I rest here?', 'May I rest here?', 41414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The ancient turns to gaze at you with eyes larger than your entire head. Peering into them is like falling into a deep blue ocean.>', '', 41413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New life from the ashes of old... this is Aessina\'s gift.$B$BWithout you, this miracle never would\'ve happened.', '', 41412, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Catacylsm has created chaos in Dun Morogh. The troggs have come to the surface in numbers we haven\'t seen before, driving our traditional enemies, the Frostmane trolls, ever closer to our settlements.$B$BIronforge has dispatched my mountaineer company to help deal with the problems.', '', 41411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the damage, Razzle?', '', 41410, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The future of Kalimdor looks grim.', '', 41409, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We teeter on the brink of annihilation. Is there no one left to help us?', '', 41408, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh Hellscream, curse the day you were born.', '', 41407, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will become of us? Of Stonetalon?', '', 41406, 7, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune help us.', '', 41405, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You did it! I can\'t believe my eyes... the Inferno is gone... What has Aessina done!?', '', 41404, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There will be no second chances, $r.', 41403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See that it thrives. Drive out those who would do it harm. Do this in my name.', 41402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By your hand, this mountain will bloom again. It is yours to protect and defend.', 41401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now I entrust you with an even greater responsibility.', 41400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My dearest old friend Nordu has bestowed to you a great gift, $r. The gift of life.', 41399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protector of the animals...  Slayer of dragons...  Champion of the ancients...', 41398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who are you, $c, to bear such a burden?', 41397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mathias Shaw himself appointed me to assist the night elves.', 41396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The summoning incantations have been prepared, but we were depending on the Crucible of Nazsharin to draw power for our spell. The artifact must be recovered.', 41395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d not expected the city to be taken so quickly. It seems we\'ll have much time to prepare for the invasion.', '', 41394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The city has been routed. The Azsh\'ir cry your name as a victory call. You\'ve earned much respect this day.', '', 41393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... I bind you to his lair!', 41392, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the power within the amulets of Razelikh...', 41391, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to start the Amulet Ritual, Lynnore.', 'I would like to start the Amulet Ritual, Lynnore.', 41390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time for this! Speak or die!', 'I don\'t have time for this! Speak or die!', 41389, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow bored with your resistance. I\'m going to kill you now and get my answers from one of your other friends.', 'I grow bored with your resistance. I\'m going to kill you now and get my answers from one of your other friends.', 41388, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that we have Freewind Post, all that\'s left is that stupid barge. Gnome and goblins. How sad your people are.', 'Now that we have Freewind Post, all that\'s left is that stupid barge. Gnome and goblins. How sad your people are.', 41387, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me everything, you miserable cow!', 'Tell me everything, you miserable cow!', 41386, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing personal. We\'re just a little tired of being pushed out of our homes. Now it\'s our turn to push back.', 'Nothing personal. We\'re just a little tired of being pushed out of our homes. Now it\'s our turn to push back.', 41385, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When do your people counter-attack? Tell me and I\'ll end your suffering.', 'When do your people counter-attack? Tell me and I\'ll end your suffering.', 41384, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you like pain.', 'I hope you like pain.', 41383, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll talk sooner or later!', 'You\'ll talk sooner or later!', 41382, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well.  Stand back... this may get messy.', 41381, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The blood ritual is complete... and I can now see where Loramus Thalipedes awaits you.', 41380, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t even try, $r.$b$bGet out of here while you can...$b$bThere are too many... certain death...', '', 41379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are there any weaknesses we can exploit? Any holes in the naga defenses?', 'Are there any weaknesses we can exploit? Any holes in the naga defenses?', 41378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No telling...$b$bThey brought new soldiers in every day. Horde and Alliance, both.$b$bSome would get hauled away the same day... others, like me, kept there for a week... maybe more.', '', 41377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see Captain Taylor and his men?', 'Did you see Captain Taylor and his men?', 41376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ack!  Stay back, $r!', '', 41375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another soldier somehow got free and broke a bunch of our pearls... freed us.$b$bSome swam up towards the surface... some saw this cave and swam for it.$b$bI\'m the only one that made it....', '', 41374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahahaha! I\'ve always been with the Grimtotem! You fools are all going to die!', '', 41373, 0, 9715, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you escape, Pollard?', 'How did you escape, Pollard?', 41372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strange... never thought the naga would go out of their way to keep us alive.$b$bThey create these pearly bubbles... one per man... made it so we could breathe.$b$bEvery day they send a bunch of the prisoners off... somewhere.$b$bNever see them again....', '', 41371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about your captors?', 'What can you tell me about your captors?', 41370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We had them in our sights... the Horde ships... then out of nowhere, tentacles reached up and seized our ship... broke it right in two!$b$bThe survivors... we were captured by naga as soon as we hit the water.$b$bThat was nearly a week ago.', '', 41369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you get down here?', 'How did you get down here?', 41368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Private Reginald Pollard, 13th brigade, Stormwind infantry... $gsir:ma\'am;.', '', 41367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Leave them to fend for themselves.>', '<Leave them to fend for themselves.>', 41366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Help the Rockpool tadpoles.>', '<Help the Rockpool tadpoles.>', 41365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<These baby Rockpool murlocs seem to have been abandoned here.  You suspect that they are in trouble, and that Neptool would want you to bring them back to the ocean, where they stand a chance of escaping the naga.>', '', 41364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<These baby murlocs seem to have been abandoned here.>', '', 41363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gobber, I need to look in my pack.', 'Gobber, I need to look in my pack.', 41362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gear all banged up, eh?', '', 41361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your wares, please.', 'Show me your wares, please.', 41360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need to do some shopping?', 41359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your wares, Lyanath.', 'Show me your wares, Lyanath.', 41358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful in the vale, $n. Enemies abound!', 41357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to our home away from home, $c. I wish we had a bit more hospitality to offer.', 41356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t even ask about the raptors. Just don\'t.', '', 41355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just when I thought we\'d gotten a break by getting away from those raptors, things get even worse around here.$B$BNo use bellyaching though. We\'re gonna face this like proper dwarves!', '', 41354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face the fury of the mag\'har!', '', 41353, 0, 9709, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall not suffer the same fate as Vaurajo! Die!', '', 41352, 0, 9709, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers, Vol\'tar has fallen!', '', 41351, 0, 9709, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde General\'s chest drops to the ground.', '', 41350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde cannot win!', 'The Horde cannot win!', 41349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will taste Alliance steel!', 'The Horde will taste Alliance steel!', 41348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde shall tremble before me!', 'The Horde shall tremble before me!', 41347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
(' Such a powerful weapon!', ' Such a powerful weapon!', 41346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this?', 'What\'s this?', 41345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde sends assassins! Kill them all!', '', 41344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grundig is nearby. Look there.', '', 41343, 0, 9708, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We didn\'t bring the war to the Horde, the Horde brought the war to us.', '', 41342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ysera has sent me here to make contact with the wilderness spirit of Aessina.$B$BYet the ancient remains silent.', '', 41341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Red Reaches.', '', 41340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmm, mmmm! Smells delicious, \"Cookie!\" Who could resist such a meal? $n, get this meaty offering to the Grimtotem ambassador immediately!', '', 41339, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory... to Ragnaros...', '', 41338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THE FLAMES SHALL CONSUME YOU! THEY SHALL CONSUME US ALL!', '', 41337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BAM!', '', 41336, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now to mix it all together and add me special spices!', '', 41335, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back, $n! When \"Cookie\" cooks things be gettin\' crazy!', '', 41334, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our town\'s under the blasted ocean, our keep\'s full of Dark Iron traitors, and I\'m laid up with such a wound I can\'t do a single thing about any of it.$B$BSo welcome to Menethil Harbor!', '', 41333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It may not be quite comfy out here, but it\'s still Khaz Modan, so it\'s still our home.', '', 41332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LEAVE...THIS PLACE...', '', 41331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You cannot stop... the end...', '', 41330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khaz Modan will crumble! ALL WILL BE RUINED IN HIS NAME!', '', 41329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hellscream\'s eyes are upon you, brothers!', 41328, 0, 9704, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The assassin with the most kills will be invited to the feast at the Overlord\'s table!', 41327, 0, 9704, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scour the mines! Leave no survivors!', 41326, 0, 9704, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve tried everythin\' short of a righteous beating to get these dwarves up off their lazy duffs.$B$BAre you made of sterner stuff?', 41325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there something I can do at the Sanctuary of Malorne?', 'Is there something I can do at the Sanctuary of Malorne?', 41324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help the Shrine of Aviana?', 'How can I help the Shrine of Aviana?', 41323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening at the Grove of Aessina?', 'What is happening at the Grove of Aessina?', 41322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Shrine of Goldrinn.', 'Tell me about the Shrine of Goldrinn.', 41321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have dispatched Archdruid Hamuul Runetotem to the burned out husk of the Sanctuary of Malorne. He is behind the front lines, on scorched terrain known as the Flamewake. He is looking into how we can undo the damage, and investigating the whereabouts of the turtle ancient Tortolla.$B$BBut before you can help him, you must first ensure that the Shrine of Aessina to the west is secure and the animals are saved from the flames. Otherwise all is lost! Concentrate on matters at the Grove of Aessina first, and they will send you to the Archdruid in good time.', 41320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aviana is the lost guardian of the skies, a bird goddess who perished fighting the demon hordes ten thousand years ago. A shrine is dedicated to her memory just southwest of Nordrassil, within the boughs of a great tree.$B$BThe Druids of the Talon are based within the shrine, and we will need their support. You must aid them. And aid Aviana, should she find her way back into this world...', 41319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aessina is the spirit of nature, my everlasting companion in both this world and the dream beyond. Her shrine in western Hyjal is at the forefront of the Twilight offensive, and may be ablaze this very moment.$B$B$n, we will never restore Mount Hyjal without Aessina\'s help. Save her shrine from the fires, and save the nearby animals threatened by the blaze. We must do this or the entire mountain is lost.', 41318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goldrinn is the wolf ancient, known as \"Lo\'Gosh\" in the Horde tongue. His tenacity is legendary.$B$BA shrine dedicated to him is in a basin west of the World Tree, but its keepers have fallen silent in the wake of the attack. I fear the worst.$B$BBefore we can move on, you must save the shrine, discover the whereabouts of the wolf ancient, and beat back his foes.', 41317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR HELLSCREAM! FOR THE HORDE!', 'FOR HELLSCREAM! FOR THE HORDE!', 41316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ATTACK! Grimtotem must fall! ALL MUST FALL!', 'ATTACK! Grimtotem must fall! ALL MUST FALL!', 41315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will be victorious! Do not relent!', '', 41314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen the future, brothers and sisters, and in it the Horde are no more!', '', 41313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not despair! All is not lost! Not yet!', '', 41312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight on! Magatha commands it!', '', 41311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellscream\'s armies march upon us, brothers and sisters!', '', 41310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ask me what you actually brought me, $c. You\'re better off forgetting this ever happened.', '', 41309, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cursed to roam the earth forever...not even poor Fitzsimmons could escape.', '', 41308, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever since, now and then, people claim he\'s spoken to them and told them to get the eye...', '', 41307, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a year ago, poor old Fitzsimmons passed on, his body ruined by drink.', '', 41306, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eye of Paleth was retrieved and cleansed a long time ago, $c. We thought the curse lifted.', '', 41305, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We lived under the same waves, breathed the same water, and worshipped the same god.  Why, then, would the naga turn against us?', '', 41304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine!  Amulet take, but $r help Rockpool.', '', 41303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know why, but those monsters are going out of their way to keep our men alive...', '', 41302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many of us tried to escape the naga.$b$bI am the only one who succeeded...', '', 41301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our soldiers... they\'re all captives now.', '', 41300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a great concentration of naga just outside of this cavern.$b$bWe were fortunate to reach this place unnoticed.', '', 41299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We appear to be dealing with something far bigger than any in the Earthen Ring had suspected.', '', 41298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
