('Of course.  It\'s all yours.', '', 41153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me have a look at that shard, would you Admiral?  I could feel its power radiating from the other side of the cave.', 41152, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can teach a soldier how to kill, but you can\'t teach him to want to kill.  That is one thing we don\'t have to worry about down here.  Every single one of my boys can\'t wait to take a piece out of those naga for what they did to us, and I can\'t say I feel  much different.$B$BWe need to find a way to make contact with the surface, but before that, I want to make a bit of \"contact\" with these naga.  We have some brothers to avenge.', '', 41151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood magic is shunned by many as a dark and forgotten art.  In that and many other ways, it shares some distinct characteristics with demonic magic.  Here, in the demon-scourged remains of the Black Morass, we believe that our blood studies will flourish.', 41150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to start the Blood Ritual, Lynnore.', 'I would like to start the Blood Ritual, Lynnore.', 41149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the Lower City\'s bazaar.>', '', 41148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is under attack!  Protect him!', '', 41147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trackmaster Zherin is stunned. Steal the Horde\'s Proposal now!', '', 41146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing?!', '', 41145, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect %s until the ritual completes!', '', 41144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the meaning of this?', '', 41143, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kravel Koalbeard is stunned. Steal the Alliance\'s Proposal now!', '', 41142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The resurrection ritual has failed!', '', 41141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used to be a simple ticket redeemer at the racetrack. Well, no more racetrack, so no more job.$B$BI\'m trying my hand at negotiations now. Could you help me get things going here? They have oil!', '', 41140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Psst - over here! Stay out of sight for the moment...', 41139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choluna and Thisalee have both given me their reports. It\'s all very clear to me now...$B$B$n, I believe Aviana may soon return to us, but only if we can stop the black dragon Sethria!', '', 41138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what I\'m doing here. I have no experience as a contract negotiatior.$B$BI used to serve drinks for a living, but Daisy put me out of business. Time for a new career, I guess.', '', 41137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choluna told me of your vision. Very puzzling. Is our beloved ancient to be reborn? If so, where is she now?$B$BWe need to know more! Please help Thisalee gather more information for us, then we will act.', '', 41136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thisalee tells me that the harpies are in league with the dragons? But something doesn\'t add up. We need to know more.$B$BPlease assist Choluna with her work here, and see if we can tie this all together... ', '', 41135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $c! Welcome to the Shrine of Aviana, a haven for all creatures of the sky.$B$BAviana may no longer be with us, but her heart and her ferocity live on in all winged creatures.$B$BSpeak with Choluna down below if you are curious about Aviana\'s story.', '', 41134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready!', 'We are ready!', 41133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That vile beast has been driven off, but my precious waters have been tainted! I must cleanse them at once.$b$bIf you insist on lingering here, prepare to defend yourself.\n', '', 41132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s a $r like you doin\' in a place like this? ...especially at a time like now?$b$bHmmmm?', '', 41131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to help with Mr. P, kid. Let me in.', 'I\'m ready to help with Mr. P, kid. Let me in.', 41130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ice cream!', 41129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time\'s up, Marion.', 41128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for your meddling, $c!', 'Step away from there, $c!', 41127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, this is a little embarrassing....', '', 41126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please return to your places!', 'Please return to your places!', 41125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remain calm!', 'Remain calm!', 41124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get back to work, people!', 'Let\'s get back to work, people!', 41123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get back to work, people!', 'Let\'s get back to work, people!', 41122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save us!', 'Save us!', 41121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It came from below!', 'It came from below!', 41120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me out of here!', 'Get me out of here!', 41119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help us!', 'Help us!', 41118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaahh!!!', 'Aaaahh!!!', 41117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me back at Aviana\'s Shrine, $n!', '', 41116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No you won\'t, Tony. Go away, I\'m busy summoning up a date for later!', 41115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bye, hon. See you later tonight.', '', 41114, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get back. I\'m sure we\'ll cross paths again. Next time, I\'ll get to return the favor.', '', 41113, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, mon. You\'ve been true to your word and I can respect that.', '', 41112, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I LIVE!', '', 41111, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need repairs, Irongoat.', 'I need repairs, Irongoat.', 41110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need some smithin\'?', '', 41109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'BAD, BAD, HORDIE!', 41108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurt \'em some more! MORE!', 41107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'YAY!', 41106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make \'em sorry for hurting you, Mr. P!', 41105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Break their bones, papa!', 41104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get \'em, Mr. P!', 41103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be really careful, Mr. P. If you see a big group of goblins, use your magnetic pull! Once you\'ve got \'em all sucked up, launch \'em to their death! YAY!', 41102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a better person than I, $n. But I suppose the harpies are just pawns here.', 41101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ask Thisalee to release the harpy.>', '<Ask Thisalee to release the harpy.>', 41100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hooray, Mr. P! You\'re back! Do you remember how to shoot all your guns? Why don\'t you take a minute to learn how to fight again! Just in case.', 41099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Order Thisalee to kill the harpy.>', '<Order Thisalee to kill the harpy.>', 41098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s your call, $n. Marion brought this on herself when she attacked our matron\'s sacred shrine.', 41097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolish $r! There is a new order. Aviana is dead. DEAD! And never coming back.$B$BTell that to the druids in the trees.$B$BSethria will soon be the master of the skies, and she has made sure Aviana will never be reborn. The egg is hers.$B$BYou are too late.', 41096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brood of the Earth-Warder... you answer to a black dragon? Give me a name!', 'Brood of the Earth-Warder... you answer to a black dragon? Give me a name!', 41095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She of the skies, but also of darkness. Brood of the Earth-Warder. Invincible!', 41094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who? Who are you giving the eggs to?', 'Who? Who are you giving the eggs to?', 41093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She asked for eggs. Eggs for her fiery hatchery in another realm.$B$BAnd one egg... a special egg... she sought more than any other.', 41092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you stealing eggs?', 'Why are you stealing eggs?', 41091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I better get a cut of those sales! Better yet, I\'ll just fry you up and take all of the profit for myself.', '', 41090, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Johnson, tell your friend to move along. It\'s past time for your demise.', '', 41089, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bored now!', '', 41088, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does anyone hear that voice? Make it stop!', '', 41087, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'d been a better assistant this whole Cataclysm thing could have been avoided!', '', 41086, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Why aren\'t you polymorphed? Enjoy it while it lasts, \"Plucky\"!', '', 41085, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Johnson, are you selling my Ancona chickens again? Nooooooo!', '', 41084, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you hurry it up over there? I don\'t have all day!', '', 41083, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, and I\'ll be taking my Ancona chickens back, thank you!', '', 41082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dance, Johnson, dance!', '', 41081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Don\'t resist... I\'m only trying to change you back into a man.', '', 41080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what I\'m having for dinner tonight and it rhymes with \"Sucky\"!', '', 41079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brutal!', 41078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s more where that came from, Marion!', 41077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, you don\'t waste any time.', 41076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Easy, friend. We still need the info.', 41075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We don\'t need to tell Omnuron about this.', 41074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait, was I supposed to be the good cop?', 41073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What shall it be this time: fire or frost? Hmm?', '', 41072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll pluck you, Johnson!', '', 41071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could have stopped the sea if not for your incessant clucking!', '', 41070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand still you worthless chicken!', '', 41069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Men, attack now!', '', 41068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squash these snakes!', '', 41067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slaughter them all.', '', 41066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack the Sea Witches - stop their spells!', '', 41065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the females! I will handle these \"warriors.\"', '', 41064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack them now, brothers!', '', 41063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Soften her up.>', '<Soften her up.>', 41062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do what you will. My new masters will carve my name into your flesh before they execute you.', 41061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your cities will fall, $r. You\'ll perish in the darkness of the new regime!', 41060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Marion squaks loudly and glares at you.>', 41059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll get nothing from me, $r!', 41058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not sure that\'s strictly necessary.', 41057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gotcha Chickenlips! You\'d best get talky, or I\'ll get stabby.', 41056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear that you sell Ancona chickens?', 'I hear that you sell Ancona chickens?', 41055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got to save me here, $c! He\'s gone mad... mad I telll you! His inability to stop the flooding of Thousand Needles has caused him to go completely bonkers!$B$BHe blames me for everything, including the Cataclysm. He probably thinks that I\'m Deathwing in disguise, or something!$B$BHelp!', '', 41054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeouuwch!!!', 41053, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yikes! That stings!', 41052, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see how all of that dynamite in your pocket likes the KS-L10 Steelspark, Megs!', 41051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother of all winged creatures, hear my prayer and reveal yourself... a vision! What could this mean, $n? I will report this to Omnuron.', 41050, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 25, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take the others to the Firelands Hatchery! Soon we will possess the skies.', 41049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the one. The ancient will be ours.', 41048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sharp!', 41047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ow ow! Ow ow ow..!', 41046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ouch! That burns!!', 41045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to my aid, Drake!', '', 41044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, dearest Gilneas, how I miss thee...', '', 41043, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stonetalon has always had its fill of problems, $n, but never has the land and its people suffered so badly. The Horde will destroy us all if left unchecked.', '', 41042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Vashj is nothing like her mother. It is little wonder she left this city so long ago.', 41041, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Warlord? I will kill him and free you!', 'Where is the Warlord? I will kill him and free you!', 41040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon, the rifts will be large enough for Gahz\'rilla to assault the heathens\' cities directly. She will reduce them to frozen rubble!', 41039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful, $n! Warlord Roktrog is near. He should be back any minute!', 41038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You think you\'re all brave facing me, eh, Steelsparks?! Those pig tails won\'t protect you from THE DOOMSAW!', 41037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('INTERLOPERS! Slay them!', '', 41036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and as devoted servants to our master, you and the Sandfury tribe shall  be justly rewarded!', '', 41035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue your work here, Hydromancer. Soon, this world will be remade...', '', 41034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blessed beast Gahz\'rilla, adored pet of the Old Gods, grows larger and stronger by the day... as does the Cult of Twilight\'s Hammer.', '', 41033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re just the kind of scum that I\'m looking for in my organization. You know, we\'re an independetly run franchise of the Southsea Freebooters. We have pretty good benefits, vacation, and full medical, dental, and vision. Maybe we should talk after you bring me back to life.', '', 41032, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t take me long to build a pirate empire out of almost nothing. Ah, the Barrens. Now those were the days. Hey, did anyone ever find out what happened with Mankrik\'s wife?', '', 41031, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kulratha. Things are going well, I see.', '', 41030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I get back into my body, I\'m going to kill you, mon! Er... no, what I meant to say is that I\'m going to hug you. Yeah, that\'s right, I\'m going to hug you and give you a big reward. Nevermind what I said about the killing.', '', 41029, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to know why women are no-good? Because you think that all they\'re doing is calling upon the spirits of the dead. But then, you catch them doing a little more than talking! I mean, how does that even work with a ghost?', '', 41028, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ajamon took her maiden name again. Despite everything, I kinda miss her, you know?', '', 41027, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say I have a bad reputation as a pirate, but you don\'t see me sailing around indiscrimanately killing people just to make a profit. Oh, wait....', '', 41026, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, mon, I had an itch when I died and now it won\'t go away. Please tell me it doesn\'t last for eternity?! You gotta get me rezzed!!!', '', 41025, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That whole thing with Ajamon\'s sister was a big misunderstanding. I didn\'t do it, I swear! I think it was Seadog Fajardo. The little brat kinda looks like him.', '', 41024, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the weather like? I can\'t tell... it\'s all grey and dark, swirling clouds here.', '', 41023, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t like me following you around? Too bad! Maybe next time you go murdering someone just to get a key, you\'ll think twice!', '', 41022, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got something to eat? I\'m hungry!', '', 41021, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, the attacks on the Speedbarge are just a business misunderstanding. When you get me rezzed, I\'ll consider negotiating a contract with Fizzle and Pozzik.', '', 41020, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This afterlife thing isn\'t all that bad. I can see lots of business opportunities here. Plenty of spirits that are waiting for the right deal to come along.', '', 41019, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry about having to deal with my wife, mon. She\'s crazy, but I still love her, you know?', '', 41018, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, if you\'d just been reasonable about the whole thing, I might have simply sold the key to you. Not that it would have done you any good. Broke off in the lock. Muahahahahahahaha!', '', 41017, 0, 0, 153, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. I doubt much would.', '', 41016, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
