('', 'Well done, $n! Return to Windshear Hold and notify Lord Fallowmere of the Horde\'s intentions. I will venture to the Thal\'darah Overlook and warn our soldiers.', 41009, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
