('Let\'s make sure that it stays that way then.  Back to work, overseer.', '', 40877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I am, sir.', 'I... I am, sir.', 40876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is overseeing these men?', '', 40875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see bandages stacked in the same piles as weapons.  I see food that clearly has been left to expire in the sun, when I CLEARLY provided you with a tent for shade.', '', 40874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir, I... my orcs were working well, so I just... thought I\'d...', 'Sir, I... my orcs were working well, so I just... thought I\'d...', 40873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve walked by here twice now, and both times you\'ve been sitting here by the fire, lazing around while your men work.', '', 40872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last I checked, your title was overseer, not overeater.', '', 40871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BURN IN LIQUID FLAME!', '', 40870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BE BATHED IN FLAME!', '', 40869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OVERSEER!  What\'s going on here?', '', 40868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha!  Excellent!  Maybe I\'ll see to it that you get your names recommended to Garrosh.  Now, back to work!  Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 40867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very much, sir.', 'Very much, sir.', 40866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes sir.', 'Yes sir.', 40865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You orcs ever dream about battle?', '', 40864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyhow, I turned around, took his blade, his life, his head, and his mount.', '', 40863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, back then, I had a lot more hair to protect it.', '', 40862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He tried to sneak up behind me and plant his blade in my skull.  Lucky for me, I can smell a dwarf a mile away... and my skull\'s a lot thicker than most.', '', 40861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, did I ever tell you about the dwarf that tried to kill me in the battle for Grim Batol?', '', 40860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This area is looking good, orcs.  Keep up the good work.', '', 40859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you were, orcs.  Let\'s make Hellscream proud.', '', 40858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let an old orc show you how it\'s done!', '', 40857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing poles... you fish like tuskarr.  Or worse, like humans.', '', 40856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in blazes do you orcs think you\'re doing?', '', 40855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU HAVE ONLY DELAYED THE INEVITABLE, CENARIUS. FROM THE FIRELANDS SHALL MY ARMIES BE REBORN...', '', 40854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BURN THEIR FLESH AND SEAR THEIR BONES!', '', 40853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ASSIST ME, MY CHILDREN!', '', 40852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do these blades look sharp to you?  DO THEY, OVERSEER?', '', 40851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thonk is waiting for you at the top of the tower, $c.', 'Thonk is waiting for you at the top of the tower, $c.', 40850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has recovered and resumes fighting!', '', 40849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has fallen!', '', 40848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has recovered and resumes fighting!', '', 40847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has fallen!', '', 40846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat the fire elementals attacking %s!', '', 40845, 0, 10700, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impurity! Your fragile flesh defiles my work.', '', 40844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A... a blade thrower, sir.', 'A... a blade thrower, sir.', 40843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat the fire elementals attacking %s!', '', 40842, 0, 10699, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrong!  Come with me.', '', 40841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overseer!  Tell me what you see.', '', 40840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this blade thrower.  The pride of the orcs... HAH!', '', 40839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need an overseer over here, NOW!', '', 40838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOUR FAILURE TODAY MORTALS HERALDS THE END OF YOUR WORLD. MY CHILDREN USHER IN A NEW ERA, RULED  BY THE FLAME!', '', 40837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FACE ME, INSECTS. I SHALL CRUSH YOU FIRSTHAND!', '', 40836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You infuriate me, mortal!', '', 40835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aiiieeee!', '', 40834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water! Here!?', '', 40833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How? What is this trickery?', '', 40832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This <glub> is not over yet, mortal...', '', 40831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('It ... burns!', '', 40830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get you, mortal! And your little wolves, too!', '', 40829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s howls in fury as he is doused by water!', '', 40828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could kiss you.  I\'ll spare you the shell-breath though.', 'I could kiss you.  I\'ll spare you the shell-breath though.', 40827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None left behind, eh?  You\'re a stand-up $r.', 'None left behind, eh?  You\'re a stand-up $r.', 40826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many times is that that you\'ve saved me today?  I lost count.', 'How many times is that that you\'ve saved me today?  I lost count.', 40825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to name my firstborn $n.', 'I\'m going to name my firstborn $n.', 40824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t forget this.  Thank you.', 'I won\'t forget this.  Thank you.', 40823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you.  Big time.', 'I owe you.  Big time.', 40822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a life saver, $c.', 'You\'re a life saver, $c.', 40821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yippee! We\'re saved!', 'Yippee! We\'re saved!', 40820, 0, 9567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HOORAY! HOORAY!', 'HOORAY! HOORAY!', 40819, 0, 9567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger! We\'re free!', 'Thank you, stranger! We\'re free!', 40818, 0, 9567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I\'d been left behind for sure.  Thanks for coming back for me!', 'I thought I\'d been left behind for sure.  Thanks for coming back for me!', 40817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang in there, Mack...', '', 40816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, friend. We owe ya one.', '', 40815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PAIN is all that you will find here, $r!', '', 40814, 0, 9567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your aid is required, $n. Help us stop the brutish Horde!', 40813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it up, boys!  We\'ve got work to do!', 'Keep it up, boys!  We\'ve got work to do!', 40812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are making ze night elvez nervouz, Gnombuz!', '', 40811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zis iz ridiculous! Ve vill go vhen ve are rezy!', '', 40810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You vorry too much, Gnombuz. Zettle yourzelf down!', '', 40809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t sign up for this garbage! I coulda been back helping Mekkatorque reclaim Gnomeregan!', '', 40808, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re wastin\' time here, professor! The orcs are slaughtering us!', '', 40807, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on?! We need to act NOW! NOW I SAY!', '', 40806, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t take it, man! I\'m freakin\' out here!', '', 40805, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make for that cave to the west. It\'s safe and dry.', 'Make for that cave to the west. It\'s safe and dry.', 40804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to find a safe place soon.$b$bOl\' Mack\'s not doin\' so well.', '', 40803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Twilight\'s Hammer is more than an organization to me.  It\'s a family.$B$BAs such, I take great care in making sure no unworthy candidates make it past the training phase.', 40802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember this, young ones. Every spell you cast, no matter how minor, cuts both ways. This is why sorcery must never be used frivolously.', 40800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That single moment is all a demon needs to wreak havoc. The Burning Legion has watched us for millennia, always waiting for the smallest rift to slip through, the smallest stirring to whisper from.', 40799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arcane magic twists the boundaries of our world. It weakens the laws of this realm to allow the impossible to happen, if only for a moment.', 40798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Magic is a tool, some would even say a gift. But you should never forget its fundamental nature.', 40797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bullseye!', 'Bullseye!', 40796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 40795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright!', 'Alright!', 40794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see that?', 'Did you see that?', 40793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, pirates, my brothers are going to be very worried about me going missing. Maybe you could let me go? Rizzle has a drinking problem and Fizzle has a problem with his blood pressure!', '', 40792, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Synge, I\'m going to slap you around some, and then some more! Just watch. I\'m going to get out of this cage and then gloat and laugh at you!', '', 40791, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who wants to let an innocent gnome out of a cage? Come on now. How often do you get an offer like that?', '', 40790, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pirate friends, listen. I\'m not with this Synge character. Let me assure you that if you let me out of this cage, I\'ll be the best engineer you\'ve ever had. I mean, really, have you seen the accuracy of your cannons? So close, yet soooooo far away!', '', 40789, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m making a list of all of the things that I can transform you into with my Super Adaptive Transformative Shape Changing Ray, Synge! I hope that you end up as something completely useless to match your pathetic life.', '', 40788, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you, over there! Please, please, please, get me out of this cage!', '', 40787, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls forth creatures from the heart of Deepholm.', '', 40786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls forth creatures from Skywall.', '', 40785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my goodness! Oh my goodness! Someone get me out of here! I have claustro.. claustro... claustro.. er, a fear of being trapped in a cage!', '', 40784, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls forth creatures from elsewhere in the Firelands.', '', 40783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Synge, I can\'t believe you got us into this mess, you stupid goblin!', '', 40782, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would someone please do something about those cannons? I can\'t think straight here!', '', 40781, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, you pirates?! Come on now, stop kidding around. Let me out of here and I\'ll get you all a brand new delivery of rifles just as soon as I can get them from the Speedbarge!', '', 40780, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On behalf of the Bilgewater Cartel, allow me to offer a very generous reward to the first person that gets me free of this cage! Of course, standard contractual stipulations apply, but don\'t worry about the fine print. Just get me out of here!', '', 40779, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s there? Let me out! Let me out before these stinking pirates decide to put me on a spit and make green eggs and ham from me!', '', 40778, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, thank you!', 40777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had a good thing going here. Was going to sell these pirates a bunch of rifles and make a fortune! But no! Wizzle had to tag along and try to sell them his cheap engineering parts. Blew up a few of their cannons and my rifles in the process! We\'re doomed!', '', 40776, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to throttle you as soon as I get out of here, Wizzle!', '', 40775, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone get me out of this cage!!!', '', 40774, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wizzle, you idiot! Everything would have been fine if you\'d just kept your mouth shut!', '', 40773, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready, aim... FIRE!', 'Ready, aim... FIRE!', 40772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me! I\'ll lead you to Smuggler\'s Scar.', 'Follow me! I\'ll lead you to Smuggler\'s Scar.', 40771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, $r.$b$bI don\'t know how much longer I can make it here...', 40770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come inside, $r. I must repay your kindness.', 40769, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I...I\'m running out of breath... I must turn back!', 40768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The odds appear to be against us, but we cannot falter, $n.  We are all that stands between the enemy\'s hordes and Nordrassil.', 40767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It mustn\'t know... it mustn\'t learn... what\'s ours...', '', 40766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We ... crushes it! Must ... make crush. Hurry friends!', '', 40765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come winds, whisper whisper... Blows it, blows it, blows it away!', '', 40764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We burns it, we burns! Bring fire, yes!', '', 40763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must destroys it.', '', 40762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wants to kill us does it?  Wants to know our secrets...', '', 40761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Azsh\'ir Monitor calls for help!', '', 40760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Azsh\'ir Monitor has spotted you!', '', 40759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ciao, babe. Let me know if you\'d like to do lunch sometime. We\'ll work something out now that you\'ve learned some manners.', 40758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You gave it a good shot, kid. But this is goblin turf now. I suggest you get used to it.', 40757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rudimentary analysis suggests... that I am unable to continue.', 40756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Ancient Guardians are coming back.  Cenarius, Aviana, Goldrinn... I can feel their presence.  We must make sure we usher them into this world.  Their timely aid will be indispensable.', 40755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'During my stay in the dream I made a vital discovery. The rift that weakens the boundaries of this world has hastened the return of powerful allies.', 40754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fear for Alysra\'s fate.  Fandral\'s corruption ran deeper than anything I encountered in the nightmare.  Yet we can\'t afford to dwell on this.', 40753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The corruption is everywhere!  You cannot succeed!', '', 40752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No prison will hold me, fool!', '', 40751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hyjal is lost!  Give up!', '', 40750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forces we are up against here go beyond the Twilight\'s Hammer, Ragnaros or even Deathwing.  We must succeed here if our world is going to survive at all.', '', 40749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Thousand Needles or lose your River Boat.', '', 40748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_shield_76.blp:20|t%s equips his |cFFFF0000Shield|r and gains |cFFFF0000|Hspell:74908|h[Personal Phalanx]|h|r!', '', 40747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_dualwield.blp:20|t%s equips his |cFFFF0000Swords|r and gains |cFFFF0000|Hspell:74981|h[Dual Blades]|h|r!', '', 40746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Silver Tide Hollow.', 'Take me to Silver Tide Hollow.', 40745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Smuggler\'s Scar.', 'Take me to Smuggler\'s Scar.', 40744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, everyone move into position! Force him back into the Firelands!', '', 40743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHO DARES TO DEFILE THE HALLS OF LIVING FLAME? I SHALL SEAR YOUR ESSENCE FROM YOUR FLESH!', '', 40742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us begin.  It is only a matter of time before the Firelord becomes aware of our presence and comes to the spire\'s defense.', '', 40741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall call upon the chilling mountain winds to protect us from Ragnaros\' flame. Malfurion and Hamuul will shatter the Firelord\'s defenses, allowing us to force him back.', '', 40740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Leave Vehicle button to quickly get back onto the Speedbarge.', 'Use the Leave Vehicle button to quickly get back onto the Speedbarge.', 40739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
