('At least now we have a fighting chance, thanks to you.', '', 40593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring on the naga! I\'m hungry for battle!', '', 40592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find a pair of draenei conversing with Elissa Dumas - the human mage who minds the magical portals - on the ground floor of The Temple of the Moon.$B$BThey will know how to help you.', 'You will find a pair of draenei conversing with Elissa Dumas - the human mage who minds the magical portals - on the ground floor of The Temple of the Moon.$B$BThey will know how to help you.', 40591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How exhilirating!', '', 40590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How exhilirating!', '', 40589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The red thing\'s connected to the... squiggly thing... the squiggly thing\'s connected to my... wristband...', '', 40588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must get the parts Driz wants. THE REST IS OURS!', '', 40587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am GIANT!', '', 40586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much blood!', '', 40585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meat! MEAT! Hahahahaha!', '', 40584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHGGGGHHH!!', '', 40583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a good thing the captain made it through. He\'ll know how to get us out of this mess.', '', 40582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s just a matter of time before the naga find us here.$b$bWhat will we fight them with?', '', 40581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it\'s my time to die, I\'m going to go down swinging!', '', 40580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are we going to get out of here?', '', 40579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I owe you, $c.$b$bThought I was a gonner.', '', 40578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see the size of that thing!?', '', 40577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r.$b$bYou saved me from certain death.', '', 40576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Southsea Freebooters own this shore!', '', 40575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ll not get around our blockade with scavengin\'!', '', 40574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That be property \'o the Southsea Freebooters now, landlubber!', '', 40573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gosh, Miss Megs, maybe next time you can actually do some work!', 40572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must admit I like what I\'m seeing, Ms. Dreadshredder.', '', 40571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See, Marin? We\'ve got you covered, babe. No sweat.', 40570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tch. Amateurs.', 40569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s actually a load off my plate. Thanks, kid.', '', 40568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There you go, Mister Noggenfogger! You won\'t have to worry about those giants anymore!', 40567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chelsea, baby, that\'s crazy talk! You\'re delirious! Just hold on a while longer...', '', 40566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gus... you gotta... get me one of them gnome medics...', 40565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You scurvy dogs make yourselves useful! KEEP FIRING!', '', 40564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You rats call that cannoneering? You make me sick!', '', 40563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move it! MOVE IT!', '', 40562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If any of you dogs stops for so much as to scratch your nose, I\'ll take off the hand you did it with!', '', 40561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Load those cannons, ye wretches!', '', 40560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to Joust, Buzzard Bait!', '', 40559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wave One:', '', 40558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press Flap to Flap Your Wings!', '', 40557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on, $r!', '', 40556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a bad feeling about this.', '', 40555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss, one of the boys is causing some trouble outside.', 'Boss, one of the boys is causing some trouble outside.', 40554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah?  What\'s the matter?', '', 40553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you want, $r?', '', 40552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the depths with you, beast!', '', 40551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rugfizzle escapes from the outhouse and gestures wildly up at the speedbarge.', '', 40550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The drag master escapes from the outhouse and gestures wildly up at the speedbarge.', '', 40549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, $n, I hate being indebted to anyone. So can you make sure to keep this on the down-low, just between the two of us?$B$BI\'d hate for my creditors to find out.', '', 40548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you a debt that I can never repay, $n. Or, can\'t I?$B$BHmm?', '', 40547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your body lies beaten, battered and broken! Let my curse be your own, fate has spoken!', '', 40546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harken, cur! Tis you I spurn! Now feel... the burn!', '', 40545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smoke and ash. If the heat doesn\'t kill me, I may suffocate.', '', 40544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $n! A little bird told me you would be coming.$B$BThat\'s how Aviana sends messages around.', '', 40543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop, thief!', 'Stop, thief!', 40542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AGH! Enough! You two are driving me INSANE! Start getting some freakin\' work done around here or get the heck out of my town!', '', 40541, 0, 9518, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why you little irradiated...', 40540, 0, 9518, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, oh, I know this one! It\'s better than doing business with failed goblins that had to beg others for help!', 40539, 0, 9518, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is laughable. You know what it\'s like trying to do business with gnomes.', 40538, 0, 9518, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gosh, Mr. Noggenfogger, I know you wouldn\'t want to damage your reputation as a neutral trade entity by forming closer ties to the Horde!', 40537, 0, 9518, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The paperwork\'s ready for you to sign, Marin. My people are just waiting on your decision.', 40536, 0, 9518, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are straying from the events of the past. Turn around immediately.', 'You are straying from the events of the past. Turn around immediately.', 40535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must remain inside Darkwhisper Gorge and its surrounding areas!', '', 40531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never take me alive!', 'You\'ll never take me alive!', 40530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the wise one! Protect Meatface!', 'Protect the wise one! Protect Meatface!', 40529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the pig! Spill its blood!!', 'Kill the pig! Spill its blood!!', 40528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaaaaaaahhh! AAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHH!!', 'Aaaaaaaaaahhh! AAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHH!!', 40527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did we land that has such hideous creatures?!', 'Where did we land that has such hideous creatures?!', 40526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monsters! Monsters come to take our gold!', 'Monsters! Monsters come to take our gold!', 40525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tell ya this guy\'s driving me nuts! Does anyone truly believe that a goblin could help run anything so magnificent as this speedbarge?$B$BAll they know how to do is blow stuff up and half of the time, they take themselves out doing even that!', '', 40524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all I can do to keep this ship from tearing itself apart and I still have to deal with puffed up baffoons like Fizzle here!', '', 40523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mama?', '', 40522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We wouldn\'t be in this mess if it weren\'t for the gnomes!$B$BIt\'s a well-known fact that they were the ones that caused the Cataclysm with all of their world-enlarging devices, and other such nonsense!', '', 40521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure thing, $g pal : gal;!', '', 40520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen my river boat? I can\'t find it anywhere!', 'Have you seen my river boat? I can\'t find it anywhere!', 40519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh yeah, I got a million spares just hanging around.', 40518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jinky, can I get another Speedbarge Diving Helm?', 'Jinky, can I get another Speedbarge Diving Helm?', 40517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ask me, I think my brother should do something about all of these goblins! It\'s said that one of them set off the Cataclysm with a footbomb!$B$BWe need to get rid of all of them before it\'s really too late!', '', 40516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The ancient\'s enormous dark eyes peer at you distrustfully.>', '', 40515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master will not suffer this insult!', '', 40514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal! You overreach.', '', 40513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wretched... bag of ... flesh!', '', 40512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master\'s grasp is not so easily severed...', '', 40511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No - No! This one is ours...', '', 40510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disabling', 'Disabling', 40509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Redeem Battleground Marks for Honor.', 'Redeem Battleground Marks for Honor.', 40508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smooth moves!\n', 'Smooth moves!\n', 40507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unshakable!\n', 'Unshakable!\n', 40506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent!\n', 'Excellent!\n', 40505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good!\n', 'Good!\n', 40504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work!\n', 'Good work!\n', 40503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, come on in out of the sun.$B$BCan I get you a drink? Not like I have anything else to do around here.', 40502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The ancient\'s eyes open slowly, revealing deep pools of pain and fear.>', '', 40501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The ancient\'s eyes are vast and deep.>$B$B<The creature speaks slowly, in a language you do not understand. Chills run up your spine. You\'re overwhelmed with feelings of terror and confusion.>', '', 40500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is angry - run for it!', '', 40499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars in fury!', '', 40498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Break it up! The Brute Squad is coming!', 40497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d appreciate if someone started to take my work seriously. Just because I\'m not wrestling sharks or tying eels in knots doesn\'t mean this isn\'t important.', '', 40496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, so you\'ve left your hole?  The Lady will claim you soon enough.', '', 40495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a poor offerin\' but I be givin\' it in thanks for your help.', 'It is a poor offerin\' but I be givin\' it in thanks for your help.', 40494, 0, 9496, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guide dose who died in dis battle, Bwonsamdi.', 'Guide dose who died in dis battle, Bwonsamdi.', 40493, 0, 9496, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ya for your guidance, spirits.', 'Thank ya for your guidance, spirits.', 40492, 0, 9496, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May de spirits of de dead continue to watch over us.', 'May de spirits of de dead continue to watch over us.', 40491, 0, 9496, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wit\'out your help, ancestors, we would still be fearin\' Zalazane.', 'Wit\'out your help, ancestors, we would still be fearin\' Zalazane.', 40490, 0, 9496, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ya for aidin\' us in our battle.', 'Thank ya for aidin\' us in our battle.', 40489, 0, 9496, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n!', '$n!', 40488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BAR FIGHT!', 'BAR FIGHT!', 40487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n!', '$n!', 40486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are definitely the ones that raided our boats, but I don\'t see any of our missing people. Where did they take them?', '', 40485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand still! Rom\'ogg crack your skulls!', '', 40484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is distracted by the odor of fresh meat.', '', 40483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We require da help of allies on da islands.$B$BZen\'tabra has been watching over da animals of de Islands for some time now.  We\'d need her help and da help of da animal creatures.$B$BBwonsamdi is a powerful loa dat controls de spirits of de dead on da islands.  His blessing is crucial for our attack.$B$BOnce our allies have joined us, Zalazane and his army of mind-controlled trolls will have no chance!  Then, da Echo Isles will be de Darkspears!', '', 40482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'d be gettin\' ready to take back da Echo Isles. Zalazane has been workin\' his voodoo magic for some time, convincing folks dat he be dead and performing ancient dark rituals.$B$BHe knows we\'d be coming, so we have ta make sure we be prepared.', '', 40481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do we do that?', 'How do we do that?', 40480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on here?', 'What\'s going on here?', 40479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF2222Fire Harpoon Gun!|r', '', 40478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With Cho\'gall\'s leadership and unity among our ranks we will crush all our enemies!', '', 40477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without pressure in both realms, %s begins to regenerate.', '', 40476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Echo Isles attack be startin\' soon!$B$BSit back and relax, dis song will be over in anotha $5071W minutes and then we\'d be going.', '', 40475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curses!  Who killed the human!?  This is not good!', '', 40474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where?!  Where is he?', '', 40473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin be waitin for ya.  You should talk wit him now, my arms are gettin\' tired.$B$BDis echo isle attack betta be startin\' soon. ', '', 40472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin told me ta keep hittin\' da drum till he gets back.  If ya be waitin\' for him, he\'d be back soon to take back da Isles.$B$BJust wait here and enjoy da music!', '', 40471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?  I\'ll show that pipsqueak!', '', 40470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fizzle, Pozzik, Jinky... they all think that they saved us. But it was me! I built the ship!$B$BIt should be called, Razzeric\'s Speedbarge!', '', 40469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF2222Bloodthirsty Shark goes into a feeding frenzy!|r', '', 40468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat! The flameward has been destroyed.', '', 40467, 0, 9510, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry! You should talk to Mekkatorque! If we don\'t start the assault soon, we\'re going to be late.$B$BAnd my boss HATES it when we\'re late!', 40466, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_elemental_totem.blp:20|t%s Summons an |cFFFF6F00|Hspell:75218|h[Invocation of Flame]|h|r!', '', 40465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_infectedwound.blp:20|t%s rears back for a |cFF01FFE1Shredding Swipe!|r\n', '', 40464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay! We\'re running a little behind, but the assaut is SCHEDULED to start in $5071W minutes.$B$BI mean, everything looks ready to go, and the Gyrocopters, Mechanotanks and Infantry are all here.$B$BIt looks like Mekkatorque is waiting on a few more things before the assault begins.  Let\'s hope we start on time or I may lose my job!', 40463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s my job to ensure that this whole assault runs like clockwork.$B$BHigh Tinker Mekkatorque is out in the field now, but he\'s scheduled to come back to get some more troops any time now.  $B$BHe\'s never late, so just stick around and he\'ll be here.', 40462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us not forget de help of our allies, of de members of de Horde who came to help us! Now is de time to be celebratin\' dis great victory together!', '', 40461, 0, 9496, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks be to de ancestors! Thanks be to de great Bwonsamdi! We all be makin\' offerings in gratitude!', '', 40460, 0, 9496, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De ancestors watched your actions wit\' pride, my brothers!', '', 40459, 0, 9496, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De bravery and de skill of our warriors be plain for all to see!', '', 40458, 0, 9496, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors of de Darkspear tribe, Vol\'jin, son of Sen\'jin has led us to victory!', '', 40457, 0, 9496, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ya, scout. Tell de builders dey be needed on de isles. De Darkspears be home again!', '', 40456, 0, 9496, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya should be able to send in de builders anytime now. Dere be a lot of work ahead of dem.', 'Ya should be able to send in de builders anytime now. Dere be a lot of work ahead of dem.', 40455, 0, 9496, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De warriors are finishin\' de job of clearin\' up de rest of Zalazane\'s creations.', 'De warriors are finishin\' de job of clearin\' up de rest of Zalazane\'s creations.', 40454, 0, 9496, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fizzle & Pozzik\'s Speedbarge my sweet patootie! I built this thing! Not them, not Razzeric!$B$BIt should be called Jinky\'s Speedbarge!', 40453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disturbin\' prospects. And there be little we can be doin\' about it witout more men.', '', 40452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tha naga and de Twilight Cult be workin\' together, and dis be the focus of dey\'re efforts.', '', 40451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis breach leads to tha plane of water. Tha realm of Neptulon, tha Tidehunter.', '', 40450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Darkspears have a home again! An\' we couldn\'t have done it wit\'out ya helpin\', $n. Now, we celebrate!', '', 40449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zalazane\'s time be runnin\' out. De Echo Isles will belong to de Darkspear Tribe again!', '', 40448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory! The flameward has been defended.', '', 40447, 0, 9510, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the flameward!', '', 40446, 0, 9510, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you call down the Spirit of the Tiger again, Vanira?', 'Would you call down the Spirit of the Tiger again, Vanira?', 40445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin kneels at the skull pile and begins a chant.', '', 40444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disturb the stone and summon Lord Ahune.', 'Disturb the stone and summon Lord Ahune.', 40443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This shard of ice echoes the deep, cracking rumble of invading glaciers.  Its cold turns your thoughts to a lifeless, endless winter.', '', 40442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Tinker Town!', '', 40441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is going to be fascinating!', 'This is going to be fascinating!', 40439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Frostlord... will... destroy you...', '', 40438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How DARE you! You will not stop the coming of Lord Ahune!', '', 40437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to take back the Echo Isles.  Take me to the staging area!', 'I am ready to take back the Echo Isles.  Take me to the staging area!', 40436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get to Razor Hill to recruit on behalf of Vol\'jin.  May I borrow a bat?', 'I need to get to Razor Hill to recruit on behalf of Vol\'jin.  May I borrow a bat?', 40435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apologize.', 'Apologize.', 40434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight.', 'Fight.', 40433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?!  What did ye say?!  How dare ye!  Me beer can stand up to any of that rot they serve at Brewfest!\n\nYou\'ll pay for this insult, $c!', '', 40432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insult Coren Direbrew\'s brew.', 'Insult Coren Direbrew\'s brew.', 40431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ve got some stones, $glad:lass;, comin\' in here unannounced.\n\nWhat do ye want?', '', 40430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue for The Crown Chemical Co. battle.', 'Queue for The Crown Chemical Co. battle.', 40429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone\'s got to stop the Crown Chemical Co. I\'d bet my gold-plated Nether-Rocket they\'re cooking up the next big plague on the chocolate-crazed citizenry\'s coin...\n\nIf only I could find someone to serve their apothecaries with court papers! Then we could put an end to it... and maybe seize all their assets, while we\'re at it!', '', 40428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Queue for The Headless Horseman battle.', 'Queue for The Headless Horseman battle.', 40427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... help...\n\nThe Headless Horseman... must be stopped...\n\nHe has slain so many... and yet rides out for more victims with every rising moon!', '', 40426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue for The Frost Lord Ahune battle.', 'Queue for The Frost Lord Ahune battle.', 40425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Frost Lord, Ahune, must be stopped.\n\nEven now he is taking form, summoned from his elemental prison by the mad cultists of the Twilight\'s Hammer.\n\nIf he\'s allowed to enter our world completely, he\'ll bury us beneath an eternal winter.', 40424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue for the Coren Direbrew battle.', 'Queue for the Coren Direbrew battle.', 40422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m tellin\' you, that Coren Direbrew\'s a madman.\n\nIt\'s not MY fault he didn\'t get invited to compete at Brewfest! But that didn\'t stop him and all his Dark Iron cronies from roughin\' up my employees and drinking all my brew.\n\nSomeone\'s got to put an end to this!', '', 40421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('%s rallies the other combatants with a battle roar!', '', 40420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want, Vol\'jin? I\'m busy planning a war.', '', 40419, 0, 9224, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have sometin\' to show you. It be easier to understand if ya see it yourself.', '', 40418, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run away from the Blazing Trainer!', '', 40417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instructor Devoran sends a contender against your raptor.', 'Instructor Devoran sends a contender against your raptor.', 40416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You!  Your mutt killed my Butcher!  I will crush you!', '', 40415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My raptor can take on ANYTHING and ANYONE!', '', 40414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ya, scout. Keep up da patrols. But for now, a rest is in order. Dismissed.', '', 40413, 0, 9498, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He got a big army, an\' he be plannin\' somethin\' down dere.', 'He got a big army, an\' he be plannin\' somethin\' down dere.', 40412, 0, 9498, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zalazane got most of his hexed trolls hidden under de canopy on de big island.', 'Zalazane got most of his hexed trolls hidden under de canopy on de big island.', 40411, 0, 9498, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An\' most of all, we be showin\' Zalazane dat his time be at an end! Dat he will give back what be rightfully ours!', '', 40410, 0, 9498, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do dem proud! Show dem your bravery and your ferocity! Bring honor to their spirits!', '', 40409, 0, 9498, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De spirits of our ancestors will be watchin\' us and aidin\' us in dis battle.', '', 40408, 0, 9498, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
(' Come, now! Join in de liberation of de Echo Isles! Zalazane will FALL!', '', 40407, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be gatherin\' here, on de shores of Sen\'jin Village, to be takin\' BACK what is ours!', '', 40406, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De battle ahead will be de true test of de warrior\'s skill, de true test of loyalty.', '', 40405, 0, 9498, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors of de Darkspear Tribe, our leader, de great Vol\'jin prepares to reclaim de Echo Isles.', '', 40404, 0, 9498, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rendow, can I get a ride with another Water Traveler?', 'Rendow, can I get a ride with another Water Traveler?', 40403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These Grimtotem beasts will soon be sent to their maker!', 40402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought Runetotem reckless to set up camp right in the middle of this devastation, but I wasn\'t about to let the Archdruid travel here alone.$B$BHe\'s planning something. Something big.', 40401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this devastation, $c! Blood and ash, as far as the eye can see.$B$BBut nature is not so easily put down. With some effort, we may yet coax life from this scorched soil.', '', 40400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Motega, can I get another Water Explorer?', 'Motega, can I get another Water Explorer?', 40399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could the Grimtotem do this to us in our greatest time of need?', '', 40398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not die to save your hide, Twilight dude!', '', 40397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De spirits have blessed us wit\' an answer! De Echo Isles will be ours again!', '', 40396, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya must make amends wit\' Bwonsamdi, de guardian of de dead, if ya hope to defeat Zalazane. It be de only way. Tell de son of Sen\'jin dese things.', '', 40395, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya gave up your home an\' ya gave up de loa of your ancestors when ya left de Echo Isles. Dey will not be pleased dat you been ignorin\' dem.', '', 40394, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De task in front of ya will not be easy, but ya have our blessin\'.', '', 40393, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know dat your plans please us, Darkspears. De son of Sen\'jin walks de right path.', '', 40392, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De ancestors hear ya, witch doctor!', '', 40391, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits! I offer me own body to you! Speak through me! Is de time right for mighty Vol\'jin\'s undertaking?', '', 40390, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our leader, Vol\'jin, son of Sen\'jin, issued de call to all Darkspears: reclaim de Echo Isles for our tribe.', '', 40389, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits, we be gathered here to ask for your guidance.', '', 40388, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkspears, we consult de spirits! Drummers, take your places!', '', 40387, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Grimtotem attacked us by surprise. We\'re barely hanging on here.', 40386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us consult the omens.', 'Let us consult the omens.', 40385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May de spirits guide ya, $c.', '', 40384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, the cataclysm has crumbled the mountains and the South Sea has rushed in to drown Thousand Needles.$B$BWe need your help, now!', '', 40383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Have your cave, little shaman.', '', 40382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re staging a relief effort at New Thalanaar for all of the survivors of Thousand Needles. We need your help now!', '', 40381, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relatively speaking, Feralas has barely been touched by the Cataclysm. Surely you can send some aid to New Thalanaar?', '', 40380, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have lost Thalanaar, but not by much. We were the fortunate ones to be only at the very edge of the flooding. I cannot begin to imagine how many lives were lost. Please send as much help as you can to New Thalanaar.', '', 40379, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is the time to prove your allegiance to the Alliance. Please send whatever aid you can to New Thalanaar.', '', 40378, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Cataclysm has destroyed Thousand Needles. We need your help so that we can save as many lives as possible!', '', 40377, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Test', '', 40376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eastern mountains of Thousand Needles crumbled into the waters and the South Sea poured in. All is lost.', '', 40375, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thousand Needles has been swallowed by the South Sea. Thalanaar is submerged!', '', 40374, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Adeline, can you not ask any of your friends to come help us at New Thalanaar?', '', 40373, 7, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seyala, I need to get to New Thalanaar!', 'Seyala, I need to get to New Thalanaar!', 40372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s sniffs and digs into the scorched soil.', '', 40371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig, dig, dig. Burn, burn, burn. Scour this earth clean!', '', 40370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid pig. This ground is already dead. Move on!', '', 40369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thata girl! Dig it all up - leave no stone unturned.', '', 40368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did you find, pig?', '', 40367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right, dig it up. Leave no living thing behind!', '', 40366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm? You found something, boy?', '', 40365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dyslix, I need to get to New Thalanaar!', 'Dyslix, I need to get to New Thalanaar!', 40364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I expect much of you. Do not fail me. Dismissed!', 40363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dyslix, I need to get to Westreach Summit!', 'Dyslix, I need to get to Westreach Summit!', 40362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Adella, you will strike out far to the east. Our forces must retake the eastern wilds, and observe the Horde unseen. May your judgment be as keen as your marksmanship.', 40361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Silvia, I\'m sending you to the Tower of Estulan to drive out the Gordunni ogres. Your diplomacy and strategy will both be put to the test.', 40360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time for you to show me that leadership. Tambre, you will spearhead the offensive on Sardor Isle. Your ferocity will be needed there.', 40359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s vulnerable to our magic now! Hold him down!', 'He\'s vulnerable to our magic now!  Hold him down!', 40357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your training has progressed well, sisters. It won\'t be long before you lead your own people, with no further need of my teaching.', 40356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Cataclysm has destroyed Thousand Needles, $c. Will you help us in our greatest time of need?', 40355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Cataclysm has destroyed the western mountains of Thousand Needles. The South Sea has rushed in and the canyons are flooded.$B$BPlease, $c, you must come to our aid at New Thalanaar!', 40354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bunnies and fawns? Yes, we have those. Will you now come and help us at New Thalanaar? Wait... why do you want to know?', 40353, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Cataclysm has struck hardest in Thousand Needles. Please, can you lend us your aid?', 40352, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not with the Gordok or Gordunni tribes, right?', 40351, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, we can pay.', 40350, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must send us assistance in our time of need. An attack upon New Thalanaar is imminent!', 40349, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Which one of you is in charge? We need help at New Thalanaar now!', 40348, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need help from you and your goblins. Thousand Needles is destroyed! Thalanaar is underwater!', 40347, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brogg. You don\'t mind me calling you that, right? Wait, which head am I talking to?', 40346, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must remain in the Echo Isles, Darkspear Strand, or Sen\'jin Village.', '', 40345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the Shu\'halo of Thousand Needles fall, the Grimtotem clan will be at your doorstep soon after. The time for action is now, Brogg!', 40344, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fear that if we do not receive reinforcements in Thousand Needles quickly, the Grimtotem will act. We are in no position to defend ourselves for very long.', 40343, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you cannot send any help to Westreach Summit, may we send refugees here?', 40342, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand that the Cataclysm has struck Dustwallow Marsh as well, but Mudsprocket appears relatively safe. Can you not spare any goblins?', 40341, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please. We are staging a relief effort at Westreach Summit. Thousand Needles has been decimated!', 40340, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Cataclysm crumbled the eastern mountains. The South Seas poured in and submerged all of Thousand Needles! Can you aid us in our time of need?', 40339, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thousand Needles lies in ruins under hundreds of feet of water. Can you spare any goblins to assist us?', 40338, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I\'ve lost a tabard.', 'I think I\'ve lost a tabard.', 40337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brogg, I beseech you to send some of your goblins to Westreach Summit now, before it is too late.', 40336, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tiger matriarch appears! Prove yourself in combat!', '', 40335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'O spirit of de tigers, lend $n your power and help us find de answers we seek!', 40334, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re calling it the Cataclysm. What caused this destruction? Why us?', 'They\'re calling it the Cataclysm. What caused this destruction? Why us?', 40333, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chieftain Spirithorn must send help to Freewind Post soon.', 'Chieftain Spirithorn must send help to Freewind Post soon.', 40332, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did the Earth Mother not protect us?', 'Why did the Earth Mother not protect us?', 40331, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Securing this area for the Sentinels will be the final part of our defense of Feralas.', 40330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freewind Post is lost. Thousand Needles is destroyed.', 'Freewind Post is lost. Thousand Needles is destroyed.', 40329, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Earth Mother preserve us.', 'May the Earth Mother preserve us.', 40328, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to go to Thousand Needles and help. Please!', 'You have to go to Thousand Needles and help. Please!', 40327, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waters rushed in and drowned everything!', 'The waters rushed in and drowned everything!', 40326, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all in ruins...', 'It\'s all in ruins...', 40325, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go back to Vol\'jin an\' tell him dis: Zen\'tabra stands ready to help him in de coming battle.', 40324, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now dat it looks like de Darkspear be returnin\' to these isles, maybe de time has come for us to reveal ourselves.', 40323, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'My kind, da druids, we been layin\' low for some time now. We been waitin\' to see when an\' if Vol\'jin might return.', 40322, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t be lookin\' so surprised. Your shaman friend has sharp eyes, or should I say, sharp frogs.', 40321, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat be enough for now!', 40320, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I owe you a favor, darling...someday I\'ll be back to repay it.', 40319, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even after I gifted him with that form, he insisted on keeping me trapped. He even hoarded all the souls just so I couldn\'t have any...so stubborn.', 40318, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve been so nice, $n. I\'ve been trapped here so long thanks to Verinias. That young elf was the first soul I\'ve tasted in ages.', 40317, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help... please, if you can hear me, help...', 40316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I report you to HR!', 'I report you to HR!', 40315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! Dat hurt!', 'Ouch! Dat hurt!', 40314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I doin\' wrong? Don\'t I get a lunch and two breaks a day, mon?', 'What I doin\' wrong? Don\'t I get a lunch and two breaks a day, mon?', 40313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work was bettah in da Undermine!', 'Work was bettah in da Undermine!', 40312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re looking at me...can you see me?$B$BPlease, help...', 40311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was once a priestess, but I\'ve always been a scholar. The chance to learn from the Highborne seemed more valuable than practicing strict ignorance.$B$BWhat\'s more most of the apprentices here are youths who came of age during the third war. They need guidance, wisdom...$B$BI only wish those who used to call me friend understood.', 40310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n scoops up a squirming bear cub.', '', 40309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Szabo. He\'s so hot right now!', 'Szabo. He\'s so hot right now!', 40308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey look, it\'s $n. I bet $g he\'s : she\'s; loaded. I hear that $g he\'s : she\'s; going after the Trade Prince\'s job!', 'Hey look, it\'s $n. I bet $g he\'s : she\'s; loaded. I hear that $g he\'s : she\'s; going after the Trade Prince\'s job!', 40307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, hey! Cease your hostilities! I\'m one of those frequently encountered and completely harmless neutral goblins, not the Horde kind!', '', 40306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, $n!', '', 40305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must fight now, $n!', '', 40304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here!  You must stop them!', '', 40303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We look for the evil ones now, yes?', '', 40302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They hide this way!  Quick!', '', 40301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We find evil ones now!  Follow!', '', 40300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Distilling the juice out of kaja\'mite to make a delicious, carbonated beverage that will give people IDEAS! Hey, wait a minute...', 'Distilling the juice out of kaja\'mite to make a delicious, carbonated beverage that will give people IDEAS! Hey, wait a minute...', 40299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Kaja\'Cola thing\'s got me thinking. Do we really want the competition to have ideas?', '', 40298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did someone say, party?', '', 40297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to punch that Chip right in the kisser! I\'d also like to kiss that Candy right in the kisser, too!', '', 40296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness de power of me voodoo... you ain\'t leavin\' dis island ALIVE!', '', 40295, 1, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Distilling Kaja\'Cola out of kaja\'mite was a stroke of pure genius on your part, $n. The Trade Prince has got to be worried that you\'re going to take his title!', 40294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t it weird how kaja\'mite made us smart thousands of years ago, but it doesn\'t seem to be having any effect on our trolls?', 40293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice day for digging up the last known deposits of kaja\'mite in the world, wouldn\'t you say, $n?', 40292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hiya, $g babe : hon;! What\'s this I hear about you and $g Candy : Chip;?', 40291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gobber mostly grunts. You\'re not even certain that he can talk.>', '', 40290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heya, $g dude : toots;! The word is that you\'re gunning for the Trade Prince\'s job.$B$BThat true?', '', 40289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Shandris is counting on me. I will not fail her.', 40288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from him until the fire dies down!', '', 40287, 0, 9469, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here it comes, fall back!', '', 40286, 0, 9469, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move back!', '', 40285, 0, 9469, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad you are here, friend!$B$BThe fires have driven the wildlife to seek shelter in this grove. They can run no farther. We must protect the survivors!', '', 40284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When does de trainin\' start?', 'When does de trainin\' start?', 40283, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to fight beside Vol\'jin!', 'Ready to fight beside Vol\'jin!', 40282, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to take de fight to Zalazane.', 'Ready to take de fight to Zalazane.', 40281, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reportin\' for duty.', 'Reportin\' for duty.', 40280, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New troll here!', 'New troll here!', 40279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Trade Prince\'s yacht is about to set sail. Everyone, get to the dock! Hand over the keys, boss. I\'m driving. Just let me know when you\'re ready to go.', 40278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This unit has been activated outside normal operating protocols. Downloading new operational parameters. Download complete. Full unit self defense routines are now active. Destruction of foreign units in the system shall now commence.', '', 40277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a second... who\'s working for who here? If I give you the new totem, will you just finish the darn task?!', 'Wait a second... who\'s working for who here? If I give you the new totem, will you just finish the darn task?!', 40276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jeeze... would you like me to have Felice give you a massage while you\'re at it? Here, take it. Go get me my sample!', 'Would you like me to have Felice give you a massage while you\'re at it? Here, take it. Go get me my sample!', 40275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh I\'m sorry... did my totem offend your delicate sensibilities? Fine. Here. Now get to work!', 'Oh I\'m sorry... did my totem offend your delicate sensibilities? Fine. Here. Now get to work!', 40274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it, you\'ve done it! The vault door is opening! Now we can... oh, no!', '', 40273, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One more elemental to go! The door is almost open!', '', 40272, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another one down! Just look at those light beams! They seem to be connecting to the far door!', '', 40271, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One down!', '', 40270, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 40269, 0, 9469, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure thing, $n.', 40268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall back!!!', '', 40267, 0, 9469, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slinky, I need a new mook disguise!', 'Slinky, I need a new mook disguise!', 40266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A lot of work goes into training and caring for our animals, but it\'s all worth it.$B$BI could always use a bit of extra help, though.', 40265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I have a Stoneskin Totem instead?', 'Can I have a Stoneskin Totem instead?', 40264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ssso... assshamed...', '', 40263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move back!  His flames are too intense!', '', 40262, 0, 9469, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Shandris!', 40261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cannot... sstop!', '', 40260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wassste your time with me, sssoftsskin!', '', 40259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better to die than to sssubmit...', '', 40258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naga ssshall never ssserve your kind!', '', 40257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mussst ressissst....', '', 40256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the bleeding edge, baby! Elemental infused technologies. Exploring the depths of Azeroth for lost knowledge and new resources.$B$BRemember the name.', '', 40255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. Stop being greedy.', 'No. Stop being greedy.', 40254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just point me at de enemy!', 'Just point me at de enemy!', 40253, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well you\'re a picky little $r, aren\'t you? Fine. Just go get me that sample.', 'Well you\'re a picky little $r, aren\'t you? Fine. Just go get me that sample.', 40252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anythin\' for Vol\'jin!', 'Anythin\' for Vol\'jin!', 40251, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I have an Earth Elemental Totem instead?', 'Can I have an Earth Elemental Totem instead?', 40250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d be glad to help.', 'I\'d be glad to help.', 40249, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I have a Strength of Earth Totem instead?', 'Can I have a Strength of Earth Totem instead?', 40248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I have a Stoneclaw Totem instead?', 'Can I have a Stoneclaw Totem instead?', 40247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I have an Earthbind Totem instead?', 'Can I have an Earthbind Totem instead?', 40246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And miss out on wearing my awesome custom-made helmet? Not a chance.', '', 40245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sign me up!', 'Sign me up!', 40244, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re with the Earthen Ring, I just figured you\'d have a water breathing spell like the rest of them.', 'You\'re with the Earthen Ring, I just figured you\'d have a water breathing spell like the rest of them.', 40243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s with the hat?', 'What\'s with the hat?', 40242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All I need to prove myself here are my claws!', 40241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mirrors pointing all over the place.', '', 40240, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 20902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_mace_15.blp:20|t%s equips his |cFFFF0000Mace|r and is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:75007|h[Encumbered]|h|r!', '', 40239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know about you, pal, but I can\'t breathe water.', '', 40238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep, destroy the four elementals, then the door will open. I\'m sure of it. Just watch out for the Troggs. Nasty tempered, filthy creatures, even if they have not succumbed to the Curse of Flesh.', '', 40237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got it! I saw a tablet that mentioned this chamber. This is the Vault of Lights! Ok, simple enough. I need you adventurers to take out each of the four elementals to trigger the opening sequence for the far door!', '', 40236, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Four platforms with huge elementals.', '', 40235, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 20901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, let me think a moment.', '', 40234, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 20900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? This isn\'t the control room! There\'s another entire defense mechanism in place, and the blasted Rock Troggs broke into here somehow. Troggs. Why did it have to be Troggs!', '', 40233, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That did the trick! The control room should be right behind this... oh... wow...', '', 40232, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right, let\'s go! Just need to input the final entry sequence into the door mechanism... and...', '', 40231, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sampling interrupted. Sambino products offers its sincere apologies. Please attempt sample extraction again at your soonest convenience.', '', 40230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sampling Successful!', '', 40229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts force %s further out of the physical realm!', '', 40228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts force %s further out of the twilight realm!', '', 40227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is delicious! Are there more hors d\'oeuvres?', 'This is delicious! Are there more hors d\'oeuvres?', 40226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love fireworks!', 'I love fireworks!', 40225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I had someone to dance with.', 'If only I had someone to dance with.', 40224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... I need a bucket!', 'Ugh... I need a bucket!', 40223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could really use a refill on my drink here.', 'I could really use a refill on my drink here.', 40222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vanira told me to speak to you about borrowing a bat.', 'Vanira told me to speak to you about borrowing a bat.', 40221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How kaja\'mite rock made into Kaja\'Cola?', '', 40220, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem trolls wanna fight?', '', 40219, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wants us go bash bad trolls?', '', 40218, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trolls been saying stuff, boss.', '', 40217, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We watch dem trolls real good!', '', 40216, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why we not gets no Kaja\'Cola? We wants to have ideas!', '', 40215, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yous be careful. Trolls bad!', '', 40214, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey deres, boss.', '', 40213, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Sardor Island.', 'Take me to Sardor Island.', 40212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you prepared for war, $r?', '', 40211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cackles in glee.', '%s cackles in glee.', 40210, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 6974, 6974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU!$B$BYou think you can just waltz in here and take my spot? Think again, $g boy : girl;!$B$BI\'ve heard the whispering in the boardroom. The people you\'ve surrounded yourself with at headquarters are all boot-licking sycophants who will do anything to get ahead. I should know... I hired all of them.$B$BYour meteoric rise to power is a fluke, and I\'m fully prepared to knock you down a gear or two! Watch your step, $n. Who knows when you\'re going to need me on your side?', '', 40209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ya need a bat, ya come to da right place. I be handlin\' all de bats for de scouts.', '', 40208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood we shed speaks to us. It says  \"Thank you.\"', 'The blood we shed speaks to us. It says \"Thank you.\"\n', 40207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a palm across your heart and reach forward with your other hand to touch the infinite. Does it feel soft? NO! It feels... immense.  \n', 'Place a palm across your heart and reach forward with your other hand to touch the infinite. Does it feel soft? NO! It feels... immense.  \n', 40206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But always remember that our movement cannot stay pure if some traitors among you still draw breath. You know who I mean.\n', 'But always remember that our movement cannot stay pure if some traitors among you still draw breath. You know who I mean.\n', 40205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We walk the edge of a precipice. Some of us must be pushed over for the rest of us to continue.\n', 'We walk the edge of a precipice. Some of us must be pushed over for the rest of us to continue.', 40204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But a bitter stench blows into our ranks. The answer is to purge! PURGE! Purge until the Twilight\'s Hammer is pure again!\n', 'But a bitter stench blows into our ranks. The answer is to purge! PURGE! Purge until the Twilight\'s Hammer is pure again!\n', 40203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eons ago, the \"Titans\" came and cast down our Masters. But this is NOT their world, and it never was! Judgment comes at last!', 'Eons ago, the \"Titans\" came and cast down our Masters. But this is NOT their world, and it never was! Judgment comes at last!', 40202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not all of you will ascend to glory. Look to your left. Look to your right. THEY will perish in the end times. But YOU will become immortal.', 'Not all of you will ascend to glory. Look to your left. Look to your right. THEY will perish in the end times. But YOU will become immortal.', 40201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d imagined my first adventure into the ocean as more peaceful and enlightening. Becoming one with nature perhaps?$B$BThere is very little natural about this place. The elements all around us scream for vengeance.', 40200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you talking about?', 'What are you talking about?', 40199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh?', 'Huh?', 40198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lie!', 'You lie!', 40197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sit down!', 'Sit down!', 40196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is this guy?', 'Who is this guy?', 40195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('History in the making!', 'History in the making!', 40194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truer words were never spoken!', 'Truer words were never spoken!', 40193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s like I\'m hearing the Old Gods themselves!', 'It\'s like I\'m hearing the Old Gods themselves!', 40192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s how it\'s done!  Yeah!', 'That\'s how it\'s done!  Yeah!', 40191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ndamus, you\'re a born leader!', '$ndamus, you\'re a born leader!', 40190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell it like it is, $g brother:sister;!', 'Tell it like it is, $g brother:sister;!', 40189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This $gguy:girl; gets it!', 'This $gguy:girl; gets it!', 40188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end is nigh!  The end is a new beginning!', 'The end is nigh!  The end is a new beginning!', 40187, 0, 11411, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Immalanath, yasoth nalarub!!!', 'Immalanath, yasoth nalarub!!!', 40186, 0, 11411, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s like... it\'s like the void just touched my mind.', 'It\'s like... it\'s like the void just touched my mind.', 40185, 0, 11411, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
