('Landro\'s Gift Box', 'Landro\'s Gift Box', 40166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I be one of da first to answer Vol\'jin\'s call to arms. Will you be joinin\' us?', 40165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And to those who call for harmony among our ranks... to them I ask: \"Does not ALL strife please our masters?  Does not ALL bloodshed feed their thirst?\"', 'And to those who call for harmony among our ranks... to them I ask: \"Does not ALL strife please our masters?  Does not ALL bloodshed feed their thirst?\"', 40164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look upon the symbol that unites us.  This hammer.  It is the hammer that builds and creates.  But it is also the hammer that bludgeons and destroys!', 'I look upon the symbol that unites us.  This hammer.  It is the hammer that builds and creates.  But it is also the hammer that bludgeons and destroys!', 40163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not think it is luck that brought you here.  Luck had nothing to do with it.  Our MASTERS\' WILL brought us here!', 'Do not think it is luck that brought you here.  Luck had nothing to do with it.  Our MASTERS\' WILL brought us here!', 40162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And some will preach unity!  But does unity prevent a chain from breaking at its weakest link?', 'And some will preach unity!  But does unity prevent a chain from breaking at its weakest link?', 40161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at how far we\'ve come!  Yesterday we lived in the shadows of civilization... hunted like rats!  But today!  Today... HYJAL BURNS!!!', 'Look at how far we\'ve come!  Yesterday we lived in the shadows of civilization... hunted like rats!  But today!  Today... HYJAL BURNS!!!', 40160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And these incidents... these divisive acts of hate against other members of our organization.  They were cowardly and ugly, yes.  But maybe... they were NECESSARY!', 'And these incidents... these divisive acts of hate against other members of our organization.  They were cowardly and ugly, yes.  But maybe... they were NECESSARY!', 40159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, my fellow initiates.  The friend of my enemy\'s enemy... well he is also the enemy of my friend.  And yes... he shall perish too!', 'Yes, my fellow initiates.  The friend of my enemy\'s enemy... well he is also the enemy of my friend.  And yes... he shall perish too!', 40158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And there is no hope!  There is no hope but in the loss of all hope.  That\'s right, brothers and sisters.  Only hopelessness can grant true hope!', 'And there is no hope!  There is no hope but in the loss of all hope.  That\'s right, brothers and sisters.  Only hopelessness can grant true hope!', 40157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you will be rewarded!  If you fall in battle, yours will be a virtuous death!  You will be at HIS side when he rises again!  You will share in HIS glory!', 'And you will be rewarded!  If you fall in battle, yours will be a virtuous death!  You will be at his side when he rises!  You will share in his glory!', 40156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('F\'tagh nah\'hat!  I\'mmathan!  Sha\'lub nahab!  Sha\'lub nahab, my friends!', 'F\'tagh nah\'hat!  I\'mmathan!  Sha\'lub nahab!  Sha\'lub nahab, my friends!', 40155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And sometimes you have to ask yourself: \"Is it worth it?\"  And the answer is plain: \"Pain is not the cost, but the reward!\"', 'And sometimes you have to ask yourself: \"Is it worth it?\"  And the answer is plain: \"Pain is not the cost, but the reward!\"', 40154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be no surrender!  There will be no escape!  There will be no quarter!', 'There will be no surrender!  There will be no escape!  There will be no quarter!', 40153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One by one... our enemies will perish!  One by one... they will be destroyed!', 'One by one... our enemies will perish!  One by one... they will be destroyed!', 40152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is truly a great time for the Twilight\'s Hammer.  The greatest of times.  First, Lord Deathwing\'s arrival.  And now... now great Ragnaros has returned!', 'It is truly a great time for the Twilight\'s Hammer.  The greatest of times.  First, Lord Deathwing\'s arrival.  And now... now great Ragnaros has returned!', 40151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And yes, Cho\'gall might have founded the Twilight\'s Hammer, but who made it what it is today?  Who preached the truth and faced persecution in the orc and human cities?', 'And yes, Cho\'gall might have founded the Twilight\'s Hammer, but who made it what it is today?  Who preached the truth and faced persecution in the orc and human cities?', 40150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember the words of C\'Thun! Remember them well! \"Your friends will betray you!\" And betrayed us they have!', 'Remember the words of C\'Thun! Remember them well! \"Your friends will betray you!\" And betrayed us they have!', 40149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is in this moment, friends, that we should ask ourselves.  What would the Old Gods want us to do?', 'It is in this moment, friends, that we should ask ourselves.  What would the Old Gods want us to do?', 40148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But enough words, comrades!  This is a call to action!  We will not let these \"chosen ones\" take what is ours!  We captured this prisoner and offer him to the Old Gods ourselves!!', 'But enough words, comrades!  This is a call to action!  We will not let these \"chosen ones\" take what is ours!  We captured this prisoner and offer him to the Old Gods ourselves!!', 40147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Mechashark\'s REPAIR!', '', 40146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our defenses are impenetrable! WE are the true sons of Gnomeregan!\n', '', 40145, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 17665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heading to the Wild Overlook.', 'Heading to the Wild Overlook.', 40144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cogspin searches his \"Gigantique\" bag looking for the items.', '', 40143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hinkles rummages through his backpack looking for supplies.', '', 40142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But your time will come soon enough. Yes, mortal. Soon enough...', '', 40141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a reward, I will allow you to live.', '', 40140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, mortal! Your heroism in The Inferno has made my escape possible.', '', 40139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s barks a cruel laugh.', '', 40138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gods of terror, quake and thunder, tear these mortal bonds asunder!', '', 40137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashes from the plane below, scattered by the hand of foe...', '', 40136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dark ashes swirl around %s, who utters an incantation:', '', 40135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hear his voice...', 40134, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Join us! Join us!', 40133, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The strands of life...', 40132, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready! Go, Brann!', 'We\'re ready! Go, Brann!', 40131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The nightmare reigns!', 40130, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great, ye found yer way here!$b$bNo time to waste. Ye ready?', '', 40129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Me fate be entwined wit\' yours now, Vol\'jin, for good or for ill. I be stayin\'.', 40128, 1, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 17625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to return to de village. Time to rebuild our home... de Darkspear\'s home. Will you be stayin\' wit\' us, wise Zen\'Tabra?', '', 40127, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 17592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'ll be good to hear de Darkspear drums once more. You take care now, Son of Sen\'jin.  Bwonsamdi will be waitin\' for ya... on de Other Side...', '', 40126, 1, 0, 273, 65, 0, 17618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fittin\' end for so foul a troll. Bwonsamdi; you have my tanks, and dat of all de Darkspear. We will continue to honor you, as is proper.', '', 40125, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! No... NOOO!', '', 40124, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ZALAZANE. What you tinkin\', takin\' dat which be mine? De Darkspear dead are MY domain, sorcerer... and now you gonna be one of dem!', '', 40123, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 17617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who... who dat be?', '', 40122, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BWAH HAH HAH HAH HAH!', '', 40121, 1, 0, 11, 65, 0, 17616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter! I can\'t be touched. No living ting can make its way trough dis barrier! Da Echo Isles be Zalazane\'s ta rule, shadow hunter! Now, and FOREVER!', '', 40120, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fool! I ain\'t runnin\' away. I lured ya here, ta kill ya wit\' your own precious tribe!', '', 40119, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give up, Zalazane. It be over, now.', '', 40118, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 17590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not for long. Time ta finish dis ting.', '', 40117, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He be just west of here, workin\' at some black magic.', 40116, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 17624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Den find him, wise one. Go!', '', 40115, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 17588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Der ain\'t no escapin\' Zen\'tabra. Not while he on dese islands.', 40114, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t be lettin\' him get away!', '', 40113, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha ha!', '', 40112, 1, 0, 11, 65, 0, 17598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ain\'t doin\' nothin\' of de sort, shadow hunter. De Echo Isles are MINE! ', '', 40111, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be TIME, Hexmaster! De sons and daughters of de Darkspear have returned! We gonna drive you into de sea...', '', 40110, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 17586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\' be underestimatin\' Zalazane... he be a tricky foe, cunnin\' and strong with de voodoo. Are ya ready? MOVE ON!', '', 40109, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. Al\'galar thol, thol al\'thaug: The end is the beginning. ', '', 40108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now GO! Use me boon wisely.', '', 40107, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 17615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of de Darkspear... ARISE! Take up de ancient masks, take up de bloody spears... you be followin\' VOL\'JIN, now!', '', 40106, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey be waitin\' for us, all. We fight now for our old home... we gonna reclaim what be OURS!', '', 40105, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 17584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This symbol, I think I\'ve seen this before... ', '', 40104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the appointed time, they will unleash storm elementals, washing away the city and setting the stage for our master\'s glorious return!', '', 40103, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to de old village, across de water. Take it back. I\'ll help ya den.', '', 40102, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrm.', '', 40101, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not me, Great Spirit. Me TRIBE.', '', 40100, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH!  You got some BIG mojo, Vol\'jin. Maybe you worth helpin\' after all...', '', 40099, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 17612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya tink ya got what it takes ta face ME? Give up, shadow hunter!', '', 40098, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 17611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrmmm. Time ta see how bad ya want dis, shadow hunter. Time ta see if you be WORTHY.', '', 40097, 1, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid us, Bwonsamdi! Help us regain our home! Return de Darkspear to de Isles, and hear your drums again! Drink your ritual offerings once more! Dis, as de Son of Sen\'jin, I swear.', '', 40096, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zalazane...', '', 40095, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were driven away, Great Spirit. Hexmaster Zalazane took de Isles from us...  drove us mad, made us fight one another. De only trolls left in de Echo Isles are his mindless voodoo slaves.', '', 40094, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkspear...  it been a long time since I heard de drums...  since I drank de ritual offerings. I be watchin\' over your dead, Vol\'jin, and for NOTHIN\'. Why have de Darkspear forsaken Bwonsamdi, eh?', '', 40093, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know who ya are, shadow hunter. An\' I know what ya WANT. But what makes you tink I\'m gonna help YOU? Ain\'t a wise ting, callin\' me from de Other Side...', '', 40092, 1, 0, 273, 65, 0, 17607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be Vol\'jin, Son of Sen\'jin, here ta ask your aid, o great Bwonsamdi.', '', 40091, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHO BE STIRRIN\' UP MY BONES? Dem\'s Bwonsamdi\'s charges, and not ta be touched!', '', 40090, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Den we go! First, to Bwonsamdi... if we gonna win dis, we need his mojo on our side.', '', 40089, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...as do de beasts of de Isles.', 40088, 1, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 17622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De elements be walkin\' wit us, too...', 40087, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De time has come! Warrior of de Darkspear, make ready! Da Loa walk wit us! Are ya ready, Vanira, Zen\'tabra?', '', 40086, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, Son of Sen\'jin. Zen\'tabra always keep her word.', 40085, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You came, wise sista! De Darkspear be grateful.', '', 40084, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zalazane\'s time has come! De Darkspear will have a proper home again. Be ready!', '', 40083, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 17575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be gettin\' ready to march to de Isles, an\' FREE dem of Zalazane\'s wicked rule! Join me!', '', 40082, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 17574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sons and daughters of de Darkspear! Friends of de tribe!', '', 40081, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your companions\' efforts force %s further into the twilight realm!', '', 40080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your companions\' efforts force %s further into the physical realm!', '', 40079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Others will come... the age of mortals... has passed.', '', 40078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone should tell the king. A chat with Lo\'gosh would set these cultists straight!', 'Someone should tell the king. A chat with Lo\'gosh would set these cultists straight!', 40077, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A strange mood has come over the city, $c. The people are afraid of something and many have gone missing. We must get to the bottom of it.', '', 40076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be time enough to speak of preparations for battle against Twilight\'s Hammer. Today, we celebrate $n\'s victory!', '', 40075, 0, 10606, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With heroes like $n fighting on our behalf, Stormwind stands ready to face any Twilight\'s Hammer threat!', '', 40074, 0, 10606, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the enemies of Stormwind and the Alliance know, I will not allow them to spread fear and rumors among the people!', '', 40073, 0, 10606, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I am the light and the darkness! Cower, mortals, before the herald of Deathwing!', '', 40072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The orbiting spheres pulse with dark energy!', '', 40071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, dwarf. I shall slay you and carry the tablets to Cho\'Gall.', 'Very well, dwarf. I shall slay you and carry the tablets to Cho\'Gall.', 40070, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
