('If you are interested in our message, I will be holding a gathering. Speak with me if you wish to know more, but beware, for Stormwind is full of people who would silence the truth.', 'If you are interested in our message, I will be holding a gathering. Speak with me if you wish to know more, but beware, for Stormwind is full of people who would silence the truth.', 40054, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
