('Cast off your lives of war and drudgery, be reborn in elements and claim your rightful place in this new world!', 'Cast off your lives of war and drudgery, be reborn in elements and claim your rightful place in this new world!', 40052, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not despair! Turn away from the false Light, and instead embrace the hope and truth I offer you!', 'Do not despair! Turn away from the false Light, and instead embrace the hope and truth I offer you!', 40051, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flames will consume the world. Storms will wash away all hope. The elements will reign at last!', 'Flames will consume the world. Storms will wash away all hope. The elements will reign at last!', 40050, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end of our world nears, my brothers and sisters! Azeroth will be no more!', 'The end of our world nears, my brothers and sisters! Azeroth will be no more!', 40049, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear me, citizens of Stormwind. We have long been in the dark. I beg you to open your eyes as I have!', 'Hear me, citizens of Stormwind. We have long been in the dark. I beg you to open your eyes as I have!', 40048, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should I return, $n? The world is ending and I have a chance to become something more. If their paths lead them to the truth, as mine did, then we will see each other again. If not, I cannot open their eyes.', '', 40047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am on the path to ascension, $n. There is no going back. Tell my family that I wish them well, and I will be here if they decide to join me.', '', 40046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot return. Now that I\'ve learned the truth, my place is here among my new brothers and sisters.', 40045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t go back, not after the horrible fight I had with them. I\'m sorry, $n, I just can\'t.', 40044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your family is worried and wants you to come back to Stormwind.', 'Your family is worried and wants you to come back to Stormwind.', 40043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not the only one who has lost a family member. There are others, many others!', 'I\'m not the only one who has lost a family member. There are others, many others!', 40042, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think he was kidnapped? Will I ever see him again?', 'Do you think he was kidnapped? Will I ever see him again?', 40041, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem like a reasonable man, captain. What would you do if someone in your family went missing?', 'You seem like a reasonable man, captain. What would you do if someone in your family went missing?', 40040, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My husband just disappeared. You have to help me, captain. I\'m no warrior.', 'My husband just disappeared. You have to help me, captain. I\'m no warrior.', 40039, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He would never just disappear like this! It\'s not like him.', 'He would never just disappear like this! It\'s not like him.', 40038, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There has to be someone who can help me!', 'There has to be someone who can help me!', 40037, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to help! He just went to the market and never came back!', 'You have to help! He just went to the market and never came back!', 40036, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He just went missing and I don\'t know what to do!', 'He just went missing and I don\'t know what to do!', 40035, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You normally have to pay to see a show like this.', 'You normally have to pay to see a show like this.', 40034, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like the king got himself a new court jester!', 'Looks like the king got himself a new court jester!', 40033, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This region was an epicenter of the cataclysm.$b$bThe naga activity here is certainly no coincidence. Their intentions must be unveiled!', '', 40032, 0, 9425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lean left!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\misc_arrowleft.blp:32|t', 'Lean left!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\misc_arrowleft.blp:32|t', 40031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
