('<Cough.>$b$bHave I... died?', '', 40023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emits a shrill cry!', '', 40022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assuming there\'s a world left for your legion to conquer. The Twilight\'s Hammer seeks to destroy everything.', 'Assuming there\'s a world left for your legion to conquer. The Twilight\'s Hammer seeks to destroy everything.', 40021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you help us to defeat them?', 'Will you help us to defeat them?', 40020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is your master now, Blackhorn? It\'s not too late to turn to the light...', 'Where is your master now, Blackhorn? It\'s not too late to turn to the light...', 40019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Blackhorn strains against his bonds, for the first time visibly upset.>$B$BRedemption! You act as if there\'s an escape from the Burning Legion. So smug! As though your efforts a decade ago or in Outland have slowed the Legion a single iota! They will come, $r. They will return. And I will be here to welcome them.', '', 40018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Matoclaw believes that you may yet be redeemed. This is your chance to atone for siding with demons.', 'Matoclaw believes that you may yet be redeemed. This is your chance to atone for siding with demons.', 40017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroyed? Yes, that\'s possible. At night I am haunted with visions of this world being torn asunder from within. I feel neither sorrow nor rage. Merely... curiosity.$B$BI served my master in exchange for power, $c. But those you fight... they strive for oblivion. A strange motivation.', '', 40016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be destroyed if the Twilight\'s Hammer brings this mountain down!', 'You\'ll be destroyed if the Twilight\'s Hammer brings this mountain down!', 40015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal? Yes I was once mortal. Weak.$B$BYou see my bonds now? These restraints are nothing compared to being shackled within a mortal coil.$B$BEven now the master\'s gifts stir within me, ready to be unleashed.$B$BNo, $c, my mortal days have passed, and if any flame of my former life still flickers within I would wish it extinguished. You\'ll have to do better than that, $r.', '', 40014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were a mortal once, Blackhorn. One of us.', 'You were a mortal once, Blackhorn. One of us.', 40013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m only here in case someone faints. The new recruits get a little excited and occasionally overexert themselves.\n\n...well, that, and sometimes one of the new mechano-tank prototypes explode. Whoops!', 'I\'m only here in case someone faints. The new recruits get a little excited and occasionally overexert themselves.\n\n...well, that, and sometimes one of the new mechano-tank prototypes explode. Whoops!', 40012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('My help? Have things really grown so dire?$B$B<The distant flames flicker in Blackhorn\'s cruel, dark eyes.>$B$BTell me why I shouldn\'t let your world burn.', '', 40011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Blackhorn. I\'ve been sent to request your aid, if you are willing.', 'Yes, Blackhorn. I\'ve been sent to request your aid, if you are willing.', 40010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes and no. He may be a demon now, but Tyrus Blackhorn was a night elf once. Like many of his brothers he was wooed and transformed by the promises of power the demonic army whispered in his ear.$B$BHe was captured after his master\'s defeat and imprisoned here on the summit, his immortal form bound by sacred energies.$B$BBut perhaps the dimmest flicker of a soul still burns within him... We must at least reach out to know for sure.', 40009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blackhorn is a demon?', 'Blackhorn is a demon?', 40008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A decade ago, a great battle took place here on the summit of Mount Hyjal. Archimonde the Defiler commanded a swarm of demons to march upon the World Tree and claim its power for his own.$B$BHis defeat signaled the end of the Legion\'s invasion of Azeroth... But many of his corrupted supporters remained behind.', 40007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Dire Maul! Let go...so cold...', '', 40006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ch-ch-Cho\'gall gives us...orbs...Twilight\'s Hammer clan makes us strong...', '', 40005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Tyrus Blackhorn?', 'Who is Tyrus Blackhorn?', 40004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C-c-cold...', '', 40003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years of my research have led me here.$b$bI\'m not about to turn back now...', '', 40002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will no longer live there, ogre. Pray you land somewhere safe, for it\'s more than you deserve.', '', 40001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
