('We finds evil one!  Quick!', '', 39944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meep!  $R is good friend.  Follow now!  We find intruder!', '', 39943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meddlesome insects! You are too late. The Ruby Sanctum is lost!', '', 39942, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me. I\'ll make my way back to Orgrimmar once I recover a bit.', '', 39941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blasted titans... Why do they use a different set of mechanisms at each of their installations?', '', 39940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twice the pain and half the fun.', '', 39939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world has enough heroes.', '', 39938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baltharus leaves no survivors!', '', 39937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... didn\'t see that coming....', '', 39936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the entertainment has arrived.', '', 39935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Halion will be pleased.', 39934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As it should be....', 39933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will sssuffer for this intrusion!', 39932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never fall to these cowards! The Horde stands united against all enemies! Lok\'tar Ogar!', '', 39931, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interact with the Mysterious Crystal to gain new abilities and use them to defend Durak Flamespeaker.', '', 39930, 0, 9406, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*BEEP* Attention. Emergency. You now have ten seconds to reach minimum safe distance.', '', 39929, 0, 11832, 0, 65, 0, 17636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Irradiator 3000 activated. Attention. Emergency. You now have ten minutes to reach minimum safe distance.', '', 39928, 0, 11832, 0, 65, 0, 17635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was a good man, $r. We\'d served together through many battles...$b$bThese beasts have a debt to pay!', '', 39927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the crystal\'s powers to defeat the elementals! I won\'t last long...', '', 39926, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn in the master\'s flame!', 39925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal has granted you new abilities! Use them to defeat the summoned elementals.', '', 39924, 0, 9405, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, help me! They\'re going to kill me!', '', 39923, 0, 9321, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shyn, I need to get to Westreach Summit!', 'Shyn, I need to get to Westreach Summit!', 39922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BThe mountains have crumbled and the Cataclysm has caused the seas to rush in and drown Thousand Needles.$B$BWe need your help, now!', '', 39921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m here to study the ways of the muisek spirits, the wild magic. Witch Doctor Uzeri sent me here to start practicing with the lesser creatures of the forest.', 39920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Shu\'halo of Thousand Needles fall, the Grimtotem clan will be at your tent flap soon after. The time for action is now, Chief Spirithorn!', '', 39919, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear that if we do not receive reinforcements in Thousand Needles quickly, the Grimtotem will act. We are in no position to defend ourselves for very long.', '', 39918, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you cannot send any help to Westreach Summit, may the refugees from Freewind Post stay on the edge of Camp Mojache?', '', 39917, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand that the Cataclysm has struck Feralas as well, but Camp Mojache appears relatively safe. Can you not spare any braves?', '', 39916, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please. We are staging a relief effort at Westreach Summit. Thousand Needles has been decimated!', '', 39915, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Cataclysm crumbled the eastern mountains. The South Seas poured in and submerged all of Thousand Needles! Can you aid us in our time of need?', '', 39914, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thousand Needles lies in ruins under hundreds of feet of water. Can you spare any braves to assist us?', '', 39913, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chief Spirithorn, I beseech you to send aid to Westreach Summit now, before it is too late.', '', 39912, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dire Maul! DIRE MAUL!', '', 39909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Now throw yourself off.', '', 39908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twilight\'s Hammer?! Where are they?', '', 39907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cho\'gall!', '', 39906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHO HAS GIVEN YOU POWER?', '', 39905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAAAAAAAAAAAGH!', '', 39904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not gonna talk.', '', 39903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must uncover the truth about these rumors and stop this Twilight\'s Hammer campaign to spread fear among us!', '', 39902, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors of the Horde, we should honor $n for $g his:her; courage in uncovering the Twilight\'s Hammer plot against Orgrimmar!', '', 39901, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talk, ogre. Who\'s giving your clan these trinkets?', '', 39899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone has to report this!', 'Someone has to report this!', 39898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We hold the surface, and when the radiation clears we\'ll assault and recapture Gnomeregan with a force twice this size.', '', 39897, 0, 9381, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curses! We had to fall back. But Thermaplugg\'s lost, and he knows it...he\'s only bought himself time. ', '', 39896, 0, 9381, 1, 65, 0, 17558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whuh-oh! We\'ve got to get out of here! Lapforge, beam us back, quickly!', '', 39895, 0, 11832, 5, 65, 0, 17557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hinkles, hand me that Whirring Bronze Gizmo and some Fresh Spring Water. Cogspin, toss me that Dirty Trogg Cloth and a Handful of Copper Bolts...', '', 39894, 0, 11832, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten minutes? Plenty of time to disarm the device.', '', 39893, 0, 11832, 1, 65, 0, 17556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I\'d love to see that old cog\'s face. I bet he...what? It\'s still on? WELL TURN IT O-', '', 39892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now DIE!', '', 39891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve FAILED, Mekkatorque! I\'ve caught and defeated you before you even set FOOT in my precious city!', '', 39890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TEN MINUTES?! You left the factory setting on? Give me that controller, you idiot!', '', 39889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is... and twenty-six TIMES more powerful than the first! ', '', 39888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...DISINTEGRATE THEM ALL!', '', 39887, 0, 11832, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate the Ultimate Atomic Protection System.', '', 39886, 0, 11832, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! No, no, NO!!! I won\'t allow you into my kingdom, usurper! I WON\'T ALLOW IT! ', '', 39885, 0, 11832, 0, 65, 0, 17570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that? That looks like the radiation bomb that poisoned Gnomeregan...wait! Incoming!', '', 39884, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s too quiet. Where are Thermaplugg\'s defense forces?\n', '', 39883, 0, 11832, 1, 65, 0, 17552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweet baby titans! That\'s got to be the biggest trogg I\'ve ever seen! Keep firing...take it down!', '', 39882, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 17551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frag bombs and suppressing fire...HOLD THE LINE! We won\'t be turned back now!', '', 39880, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My GEARS...that\'s got to be every last trogg in the city! Squads, dig in!', '', 39879, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 17550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate the Expendable Atomic Defense System: DRIVE FORTH THE TROGGS!!!', '', 39878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you\'ll just march into MY city? ', '', 39877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NEVER! Gnomeregan is MINE, Mekkatorque. ', '', 39876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NEVER! Wait...is this thing on? Is it...this button? Testing...testing. Ah! *ahem* ', '', 39875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gnomeregan is within our grasp!', '', 39874, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we capture the underground railway and loading dock, we\'ll use them to make a rapid attack on the heart of the city. ', '', 39873, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand at the brink of victory, my friends. Initiate Phase III: Into the tunnels!', '', 39872, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll shut down the defensive radiation pumps. Squads, commandeer the remaining mechanized suits and move up to the Main Entry.', '', 39871, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve secured the surface! Operation: Gnomeregan is proceeding with 93%% efficiency...well done, everyone!', '', 39870, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 17548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IT\'S A TRAP! That\'s a fully functional irradiator!', '', 39869, 0, 11832, 5, 65, 0, 17554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Multi-Bombers have destroyed Tankbuster Cannons\' shields. Take them down and secure the Surface Command Post!', '', 39868, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 17547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiate Phase II: Capture the Surface Command Post!', '', 39867, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now our Multi-Bombers can obliterate the Thermaplugg\'s shielded Tankbuster Cannons.', '', 39866, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy their rocket launchers and achieve total air superiority!', '', 39865, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiate Phase I: Recapture the enemy airfield! ', '', 39864, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The assault begins in but a moment!', '', 39863, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather now at the staging area!', '', 39862, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather around me as we prepare to reclaim our homeland!', '', 39861, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today is the day we take back our glorious city from that vile traitor Thermaplugg! ', '', 39860, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The airfield is ours, and with it, the skies over Gnomeregan.', '', 39859, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 17546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work. Don\'t let up!', '', 39858, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 17544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s another destroyed. Maintain the assault!', '', 39857, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 17543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s one down. Keep attacking!', '', 39856, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 17542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Targets in sight! Squads, deploy: Destroy all enemy rocket launchers!', '', 39855, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 17541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Operation: Gnomeregan begins NOW!', '', 39854, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 17539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our tactics, our science, our bravery and determination shall prevail.', '', 39853, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end of Thermaplugg\'s reign draws near!', '', 39852, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more shall our people live as refugees, as outcasts, as wretched, irradiated slaves chained to the yoke of a madman\'s war machine!', '', 39851, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens and friends of Gnomeregan!', '', 39850, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather around the altar, brothers and sisters! Revelation awaits!', '', 39849, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another robe.', 'I need another robe.', 39848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to join your movement.', 'I want to join your movement.', 39847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re interrupting work your feeble mind cannot possibly comprehend!', '', 39846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s chuckles softly to himself, carefully logging his progress in his manuscript.', '', 39845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s tinkers with a bizarre array of equipment on his workbench.', '', 39844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s consults his manuscript, grunting.', '', 39843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hastily scrawls a page of notes into his manuscript. ', '', 39842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will hear what you have to say.', 'I will hear what you have to say.', 39841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end of the world nears, $c. There is no need to despair. Hear what I say and what my brethren have to offer.', 'The end of the world nears, $c. There is no need to despair. Hear what I say and what my brethren have to offer.', 39840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BY FIRE BE PURGED!!!!', '', 39839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s something going on in Orgrimmar, and I don\'t like the look of it. These women complain that people have disappered. Others say the world will end. What does it mean?', '', 39838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not the only one who is here to report a disappearance. There are others, many others.', 'I am not the only one who is here to report a disappearance. There are others, many others.', 39837, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think he was kidnapped? Will I ever see him again?', 'Do you think he was kidnapped? Will I ever see him again?', 39836, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a reasonable man, blood guard. Where would you turn if your kin went missing?', 'You are a reasonable man, blood guard. Where would you turn if your kin went missing?', 39835, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My husband has disappeared. Please, blood guard, he is no warrior. You must help me find him.', 'My husband has disappeared. Please, blood guard, he is no warrior. You must help me find him.', 39834, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He would never leave on his own! Where could he have gone?', 'He would never leave on his own! Where could he have gone?', 39833, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There has to be something you can do, blood guard.', 'There has to be something you can do, blood guard.', 39832, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely you can help. He just went out to the market and never came back.', 'Surely you can help. He just went out to the market and never came back.', 39831, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood guard, you have to help me find him. He just went missing!', 'Blood guard, you have to help me find him. He just went missing!', 39830, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will run no longer. Seek me atop the peak to the east.', 39829, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taerar has not fled Feralas. He acts as a conduit to the nightmare through his own form.', 39828, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noooooooooooooooo!', '', 39827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t belong here, outsider. Leave before you get yourself in trouble.', 39826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, you are new. These devices are a part of our master\'s plan to bring about the transformation of the world. They will unleash the fires of judgment and allow us to ascend to immortality. This is the master\'s promise.', 39825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are those devices that everyone is building?', 'What are those devices that everyone is building?', 39824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t recognize you. Are you new here?', 39823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Taerar no longer dwells here, fool. He has bestowed me with enough power to stop you!', '', 39822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heed me, Twilight Lords!  Accept this $r as a humble offering!', 'Heed me, Twilight Lords!  Accept this $r as a humble offering!', 39821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was chosen!  I will prevail!', 'I was chosen!  I will prevail!', 39820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be the one learning the secrets of the Old Gods!  I\'ll show you!', 'I should be the one learning the secrets of the Old Gods!  I\'ll show you!', 39819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We live or die in THEIR service!', 'We live or die in THEIR service!', 39818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I\'ll kill you and take your place, scum!', 'I\'ll kill you and take your place, scum!', 39817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It should be me in your place!  I\'ll show you!', 'It should be me in your place!  I\'ll show you!', 39816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be as you say, my lord.', '', 39815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of all the ancients, Goldrinn is the most magnificent. His fury, his resolve... you would do well to emulate.', '', 39814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then, my brothers and sisters, we shall shed these frail forms and ascend to immortality!', '', 39813, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kristoff grunts.>', '', 39812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, $n. Can I call you $n?$B$BI am hanging from a meathook in the back of an ogre cave.$B$BHow do you THINK my research is progressing, you pompous dirt-sucking ass-$c? C\'mere! C\'mere you son of a swineherd!$B$B<Kristoff flutters back and forth on his chain, trying desperately to kick you in the face.>', '', 39811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So how is your research into the Eye coming along?', 'So how is your research into the Eye coming along?', 39810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... WHAT?$B$BCome over here and say that!$B$B<Kristoff kicks and flails his limbs in a frothing rage, his head twisting around to glare at you.>$B$BSo help me, I will - I am going to - I will knock your brains out! I will fill the empty cavity left behind with my boot! Come here! GET BACK HERE!$B$B<Kristoff strains to grasp your neck, his fingers wriggling inches from your face.>', '', 39809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, no. Would you mind hanging out a little longer? I have some stuff I need to take care of first.', 'Um, no. Would you mind hanging out a little longer? I have some stuff I need to take care of first.', 39808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, let\'s try this again.', 'Okay, let\'s try this again.', 39807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well? Are you going to help me down?', '', 39806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi. Yeah, I know. I got captured again.$B$BI don\'t want to talk about it.$B$BYou ready?', '', 39805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the Twilight Apocrypha? I\'ll be boiled alive - it DOES exist!', '', 39804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He doesn\'t see me, does he?', '', 39803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t get stepped on.', '', 39802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What, more ogres?', '', 39801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill that one! I\'ll stay over here.', '', 39800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one smells particularly bad.', '', 39799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ogre!', '', 39798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 39797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the appointed time, they will unleash fire elementals, consuming the city in flame and setting the stage for our master\'s glorious return!', '', 39796, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one\'s huge. You shouldn\'t have made him angry.', '', 39795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When they are completed, you will hide these devices all over Orgrimmar.', '', 39794, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the instrument the master will use to bring an end to this world and reforge it in his image.', '', 39793, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work on the devices is proceeding as you have directed. We will soon be ready to carry out the next phase of your orders.', '', 39792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swear your allegiance to me (The master wants! He sees and wants and hungers!) and you will be remade in my image. (Wait! INFIDEL! A heathen among us!) An intruder! YOU! Show yourself...', '', 39791, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 22125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us, and embrace the inevitable end. (The Master\'s power calls!) You will be reborn, stronger than flesh! (Strength beyond form! Power in the infinite!)', '', 39790, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 22124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold! The world you see before you has been judged. (Fire, water, earth, air!) All shall perish before the elements! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate!)', '', 39789, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 22123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then all is in order. The master has given us a mission of the utmost importance and he will not suffer failure.', '', 39788, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you are growing in numbers, my brethren. Tell me of your progress in implementing our master\'s plan.', '', 39787, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We made it! I\'ll find my way back on my own. Do me a favor and go tell Royce Duskwhisper where he can stick his stupid Eye of Twilight.', '', 39786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn them to ash, minions!', '', 39785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HALION! I....', '', 39784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s for the best.', '', 39783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You thought you stood a chance?', '', 39782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alexstrasza has chosen capable allies.... A pity that I must END YOU!', '', 39781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been given another chance to serve?  I will not fail again!', 'I\'ve been given another chance to serve?  I will not fail again!', 39780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, let\'s do this! You fight the ogres, and I will... not fight them. Head for the exit!', '', 39779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doesn\'t she realize I wanted her to come with me? I\'m young; I don\'t want to die. We should have many good years ahead of us and this is the only way. Tell her these things. Make her understand.', '', 39778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your wife is concerned for you. She wants you to return to Orgrimmar.', 'Your wife is concerned for you. She wants you to return to Orgrimmar.', 39777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They had their chance to come with me, and instead they mocked my beliefs. They are nothing to me.', '', 39776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Less yap flappin\'. More ogre thwappin\'. Deal?', '', 39775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you always talk so much when there\'s stuff to kill?', '', 39774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ogres.$B$BI hate ogres.', '', 39773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t recommend hanging from a chain like that. But, to be honest, it did great things for my hair.', '', 39772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How long was I hanging back there? It felt like days.', '', 39771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re one unusual $c, $n. I don\'t mean that it a negative way. I\'m just sayin\', you\'re kinda funny.', '', 39770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d lend a hand, but I\'ve got... chain rash. I\'ll just hang back a little.', '', 39769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You smell somethin\'?', '', 39768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your family wants you to return to Orgrimmar.', 'Your family wants you to return to Orgrimmar.', 39767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our world will end soon, but together we will ascend and inherit the power of the elements.', '', 39766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work hard, $c. We have little time to complete our tasks before the prophecies are fulfilled.', '', 39765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It amazes me that in a city full of people, only the small handful here heeded the warnings of the elements.', 39764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One day, I, too, will ascend.', 39763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not leave. Tell my family that I am at peace here and that I wish them well.', 39762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your family has asked about you. They\'re worried.', 'Your family has asked about you. They\'re worried.', 39761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, I cannot return to Orgrimmar. I grieve for my family, but they have made their choices and I have made mine. My future is here, among my chosen brethren.', 39760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should return to Orgrimmar. Your family is worried.', 'You should return to Orgrimmar. Your family is worried.', 39759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c. I imagine you have a lot of questions.$B$BSuffice it to say that Royce Duskwhisper sent me into the middle of an ogre cave for some \"Eye of Twilight\" jib-job, and it hasn\'t gone well.$B$BIf I ever get my hands on that lanky, heartless, mealy-mouthed little night elf...$B$B<Kristoff wriggles helplessly as he dangles in the air, his face reddening.>', '', 39758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy your hollow victory, insects. (The darkness comes...) May it console you as your world rots.', '', 39757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end of the world approaches, but there is time to set things right, $c.', '', 39756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We only want to be left alone. Why is that so difficult to understand?', '', 39755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not be afraid, $c. We embrace all who seek the truth.', 39754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you come here to bother us, outsider?', 39753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill anyone who tells you otherwise. So sayeth the Eye!', 'Kill anyone who tells you otherwise. So sayeth the Eye!', 39752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your work in Hyjal is done - return from whence you came.', 'Your work in Hyjal is done - return from whence you came.', 39751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the Eye of Twilight... Behold your new master!', 'I am the Eye of Twilight... Behold your new master!', 39750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us (Join us!) and be granted strength beyond strength! (Strength! His STRENGTH! His MIGHT!)', '', 39749, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 22128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twilight\'s Hammer is the instrument of this grand destruction, the method of glorious annihilation! (Tear aside the veil! Open your mind to emptiness!) Through us will you find true power.', '', 39748, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 22127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sun of life will set forever, as light gives way to eternal night! (Oblivion looms! It calls!)', '', 39747, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 22126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Mekkatorque!', 'Take me to Mekkatorque!', 39746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot ... control the Eye! Cho\'gall will know. You will be ... punished.', '', 39745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think you\'re doing, $c? Get away from those instruments!', '', 39744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The forces of the Sentinel Army hold back the Horde across all of Kalimdor. While the war continues in Ashenvale and Stonetalon, our forces are also needed here, to protect these remaining wilds and prevent our enemies from gaining further footholds.', 39743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you seek to join us? We have messengers in the city who will tell you what you must do, seeker.', 'Do you seek to join us? We have messengers in the city who will tell you what you must do, seeker.', 39742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have withdrawn from life in the city to await our fates here, where the truth has been revealed to us.', 'We have withdrawn from life in the city to await our fates here, where the truth has been revealed to us.', 39741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave us in peace, stranger. We have done nothing to you.', 'Leave us in peace, stranger. We have done nothing to you.', 39740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for rescuing us, $c.$B$BWe\'ll accompany the next caravan off of this mountain, but... I don\'t think I\'ll ever be the same...', '', 39739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know if it\'s good to have my mind back.$B$BKnowing what I know... Knowing what may happen to our world...$B$B<He shudders and falls silent.>', '', 39738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for your help, $n.\n', 39737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any luck out there? Just trying to hold a conversation with the freed slaves makes my head hurt.$B$BThey straddle the line in discord and rhyme.\n', 39736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did they do to me? I\'ve got to get back to camp...', '', 39735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, you made the voices go away. I\'m outta here!', '', 39734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My ... brain ... hurts!', '', 39733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...What am I saying? Nothing makes sense anymore. I\'ve got to get out of this place!', '', 39732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to me? I\'m leaving!', '', 39731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha - what? Where am I? I\'ve got to get out of here!', '', 39730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Administer the draught.>', '<Administer the draught.>', 39729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must remain in Steelgrill\'s Depot.', 'You must remain in Steelgrill\'s Depot.', 39728, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, the Twilight slaves you and others have been rescuing from Wolf\'s Run are wandering into camp, but they can\'t tell me who they are and they speak in riddles and gibberish.$B$BI thought Twilight\'s Hammer kept the slaves in line the old fashioned way - you know, whips and chains - but it\'s clear that there\'s some brainwashing at work...\n', 39727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...our Autonomy Day!', '', 39726, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
(' We\'re going to live on! We\'re going to survive! Today we celebrate...', '', 39725, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go get him.', '', 39724, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
