('...our INNOVATION!', '', 39722, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('H\'thon, the column of darkness stretching beyond sight. H\'thon marwol qualar: the infinite grasp of night.', '', 39721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 430, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Twilight Servitor gurgles at you, white spittle foaming and bubbling from his mouth.>', '', 39720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are nothing. Tulall par\'okoth. Far\'al, ka\'kar. The void devours.', '', 39719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear broils forth from the heart of the infinite. Don\'t make me look! I\'ve seen more than I can stand!', '', 39718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mar\'kowa tallol ye\'tarin, it knows, it knows.', '', 39717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadow sees. Bo\'al lal arwi C\'toth. The end comes, cloaked in silent fire.', '', 39716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Al\'tha, Al\'tha bormaz. Ni bormaz ta\'thall? It comes, it walks in flames, $r!', '', 39715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thoth\'al amun Ree\'thael vormos! Vormos! Vormos!', '', 39714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
