('Well, that must be why my neighbor shaved his head and donned those robes. Maybe he\'ll let me have his stuff.', 'Well, that must be why my neighbor shaved his head and donned those robes. Maybe he\'ll let me have his stuff.', 39692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
