('Cave is too filthy! Put filth in filth piles marked with flag. ', '', 39675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who talk to Eye last? Is Eye happy? Tell Gar\'gol!', '', 39674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is two-head? What do Eye tell us now?', '', 39673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Captain! Shipwreck off the starboard bow! There appear to be survivors!', 39672, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 20916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are your orders, Eye of Twilight?', '', 39671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak now, Eye of Twilight.', '', 39670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mighty Eye of Twilight, guide your humble servant!', '', 39669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s right, I\'ve seen you here before! How could I forget?$B$BI can teleport you to Stratholme now, if you wish.', 39668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chromie, you and I both know what\'s going to happen in this time stream. We\'ve seen this all before. Can you just skip us ahead to all the real action?', 'Chromie, you and I both know what\'s going to happen in this time stream. We\'ve seen this all before. Can you just skip us ahead to all the real action?', 39667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trigger spell received. Idling.', '', 39666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Starting test.  Casting trigger spell now.', '', 39665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead the Twilight Recruit away from the group and use the Blackjack to knock him out.', 'Lead the Twilight Recruit away from the group and use the Blackjack to knock him out.', 39664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch!  That... that really hurt!', 'Ouch!  That... that really hurt!', 39663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for the trip back down.', 'I\'m ready for the trip back down.', 39662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy money! Commission\'s to be dispersed evenly among any and all survivors!\n', '', 39661, 0, 8873, 0, 65, 0, 21282, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...where we\'ll commence to assistin\' the Alliance in their little skirmish with them Horde fellers.\n', '', 39660, 0, 8873, 0, 65, 0, 21281, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cap\'n Samir is navigatin\' this here ship non-stop to that there ocean over yonder...\n', '', 39659, 0, 8873, 22, 65, 0, 21280, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come aboard, now. Step right up!\n', '', 39658, 0, 8873, 70, 65, 0, 21279, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine.  I\'ll come with you.  This had better be important.', 'Fine.  I\'ll come with you.  This had better be important.', 39657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have something to show me?', 'You have something to show me?', 39656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want something?', 'You want something?', 39655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my Motivate-a-Tron. May I have another?', 'I lost my Motivate-a-Tron. May I have another?', 39654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t askin\' for me alone, Great Spirit, but on behalf of da Darkspear Tribe... on behalf of me PEOPLE.', '', 39653, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh... shiny!', '', 39652, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 21178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Into the wind with the sky and everything...\n', '', 39651, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out on a boat... way far away from the dock...\n', '', 39650, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like it\'s time for the grunts to clean out the Drag and the Cleft of Shadow again.', 'Looks like it\'s time for the grunts to clean out the Drag and the Cleft of Shadow again.', 39649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who would join something like this? If the world is really going to end, do they really think it would bother warning us?', 'Who would join something like this? If the world is really going to end, do they really think it would bother warning us?', 39648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that must be why my neighbor shaved his head and donned those robes. Maybe he\'ll let me have his stuff.', 'Well, that must be why my neighbor shaved his head and donned those robes. Maybe he\'ll let me have his stuff.', 39647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put these cultists on a zeppelin and send them to Stormwind! We don\'t need this kind of thing in Orgrimmar.', 'Put these cultists on a zeppelin and send them to Stormwind! We don\'t need this kind of thing in Orgrimmar.', 39646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doomsday cultists? Well, the orcs have already survived the end of one world, so what\'s another?', 'Doomsday cultists? Well, the orcs have already survived the end of one world, so what\'s another?', 39645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I had a silver for every time I heard the world was going to end, I\'d be richer than a goblin trade prince!', 'If I had a silver for every time I heard the world was going to end, I\'d be richer than a goblin trade prince!', 39644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m saaaailing!', '', 39643, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 21175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy!', '', 39642, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 21174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you\'re just wasting my time!', 'Now you\'re just wasting my time!', 39641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fate subjugates faith, mortal. Your prayers are meaningless here.', '', 39640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Log\'loth og shandai, mortal. Only death is eternal. You will be undone.', '', 39639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, friend.  Let\'s ride through Grim Batol and strike a blow against Deathwing that he won\'t soon forget!', '', 39638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like this is it, boss-$g man : lady;. It\'s been a real honor. I\'m sure we\'ll see each other again real soon.', 39637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have the heart of a giant, $n. It has been an honor!', '', 39636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have other business that must be done in Azshara, so I will join you on your journey, $n.', '', 39635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The song of your life will be sung by the mighty, $n. Until we meet again.', '', 39634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the Earth Mother watch over you, $n. Thank you for your help.', 39633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have an idea... this time let\'s not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.$B$BI\'m just saying.', 'I have an idea... this time let\'s not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.$B$BI\'m just saying.', 39632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know. I think I\'m going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here.', 'I don\'t know. I think I\'m going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here.', 39631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to go when you are, $g sir : ma\'am;!', 'Ready to go when you are, $g sir : ma\'am;!', 39630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s leave dock before the volcano destroys us all!', 'Let\'s leave dock before the volcano destroys us all!', 39629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There\'s a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.$B$BCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there\'s a chance for profit and promotion.', 'I\'d keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There\'s a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.$B$BCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there\'s a chance for profit and promotion.', 39628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I ever thank you, $n?', 'How can I ever thank you, $n?', 39627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are we really finally going to Azshara? Is there a volcano there, too?', 'Are we really finally going to Azshara? Is there a volcano there, too?', 39626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did it! We\'re saved!', 'You did it! We\'re saved!', 39625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not talking to you right now. If I were you, I wouldn\'t count on getting a raise this year, $n.', '', 39624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No one could have done what you did, $n. Why you spared Gallywix is beyond me. You should have had his job.$B$BHere\'s to hoping that setting up our new home in Azshara is uneventful. I\'m looking forward to retiring.', 39623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you have any idea how much time and moolah you\'ve saved us, $n? This could have been a complete disaster and you\'ve single-handedly saved the entire cartel.$B$BToo bad that you and Thrall spared Gallywix. I think that you would make an excellent Trade $g Prince : Princess;!', 39622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew you had it in you, $n! You saved our skins.$B$BNow let\'s get out of here before I have to kill Fizz and Evol.', '', 39621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s deal with that punk, Evol, once and for all. Azshara\'s not big enough for the two of us!', '', 39620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s jump Fizz right before we set sail. I\'ll hit him high and you go low!', '', 39619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please insert coins into ship in order to move away from exploding island.', '', 39618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re Orgrimmar and Azshara bound. Let\'s get this baby out to sea!', '', 39617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did a superb job, $n. Top notch!$B$BNow, of course, you couldn\'t have done it without my tinkering genius, which I\'m sure you\'ll put in your company report, but you really pulled it off, despite the bumbling of my assistant here.', '', 39616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three cheers for $n!!!$B$BI really cannot wait to setup my own little bed and breakfast in Azshara. What do you think it\'s like there?', '', 39615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am NOT going to sweep the ground of a mud pit, I can tell you that!$B$BYou need to deal with that rat, the Trade Prince, that\'s what I think!', '', 39614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just wanted to say thanks, $n.$B$BI\'m sure glad that the doc here was able to shock you back to life or we\'d all be dead by now, or worse!', '', 39613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew you had it in you all along, $n.$B$BNow, do you think there\'ll be a position for me in Azshara? Do they have trolls there?', '', 39612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re all going to DIE in here!!!$B$BI\'m a slave foreman... I wonder if it\'s too late to side with the Trade Prince?', '', 39611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t suppose that there\'s any way that you can get us out of here? No?$B$BAh well, I suppose it won\'t be too painful as the lava slowly pours into this pit.', '', 39610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did it, my $g boy : girl;, you did it!$B$BNow, let\'s get to Azshara so that I can set up my new practice. This has been a long vacation and I have bills to pay!', '', 39609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got the stuff, kid! You got the ball into the endzone and you detonated it for the win!$B$BNow let\'s get out of here. I\'m thinking that the new team might need to be called the $n Explosion!', '', 39608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a mess! How am I going to spin this?$B$BAnd really... goblin zombies?!!', 39607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This right here is what you\'d call bad for business!', '', 39606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s always just enough time for a last minute sale to the $g hero : heroine; of the Bilgewater Cartel, $n.', '', 39605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh goodness, you did it, $n, you really did it!$B$BNow, by my calculations, if we do not get this bucket sailing very very soon, there is the increasing likelihood of one of those giant volcano rocks shooting through the air and smashing the yacht to smithereens.$B$BShall we?', 39604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This does not look good for the future of the cartel. Not one bit.$B$BYou have to pull our fat out of the fire, $n, or we might as well all just walk into that volcano up there.', 39603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a true $g hero : heroine;, $n! The poster-$g boy : girl; for the Bilgewater Cartel.$B$BOur stock is going to skyrocket now and I\'m going to get a raise!', 39602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank... you...', '', 39601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been a long journey to get here, hon. Thank you!$B$BLet\'s get off of this island now.', 39600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re Orgrimmar bound, $g bud : girlie;, and then on to our new home in Azshara. See you there!', '', 39599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um... I\'m gonna need your battleworg again.', 'Um... I\'m gonna need your battleworg again.', 39598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar, $c.', '', 39597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prove yourselves, my ogres! Slay this insect! (Blood for the master! Blood and suffering!)', '', 39596, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 22119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sassy, let\'s set sail for Orgrimmar before the island blows for good!', 'Sassy, let\'s set sail for Orgrimmar before the island blows for good!', 39595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like this is it, boss-$g man : lady;. It\'s been a real honor. I\'m sure we\'ll see each other again real soon.$B$BJust let me know when you\'re ready to head out for Orgrimmar.', 39594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For now we cannot return to Kalimdor. Only Chawg is going back with you.  Another ship is coming to take the rest of us on to our destination.$B$BThe greatest adventure is yet ahead of you, $n. Our paths will cross again, and when they do, the fate of the world will be in your hands!', '', 39593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR DA HORDE!', '', 39592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar, soldier.', '', 39591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to ignore the firm, feathery behinds of the harpies... the creatures are really quite deadly!', '', 39590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be as you say! Long live the Bilgewater Cartel! For the Horde!', '', 39589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will have a new home in Azshara and the Bilgewater Cartel will become a part of the Horde!', '', 39588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will send a representative from amongst your people to the new warchief, Garrosh Hellscream in Orgrimmar.', '', 39587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For now, you will remain the Trade Prince of the Bilgewater Cartel.', '', 39586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall grunts and thinks a moment on what to do with the Trade Prince.', '', 39585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Give up.  This is too scary.>', '<Give up.  This is too scary.>', 39584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Attempt to remove Fizzle\'s Hand, then.>', '<Attempt to remove Fizzle\'s Hand, then.>', 39583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You grab at the orb, but Fizzle\'s hand clutches around it even tighter.  The orb glows slightly.>', '', 39582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Attempt to remove the orb.>', '<Attempt to remove the orb.>', 39581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Fizzle\'s body bobs lifelessly.  His orb is clutched tightly in his right hand.>', '', 39580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Slave Pits or the Gallywix Docks, or forfeit your footbomb uniform!', '', 39579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does our cult serve the Old Gods?', 'Does our cult serve the Old Gods?', 39578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does Cho\'Gall lead the Twilight\'s Hammer?', 'Does Cho\'Gall lead the Twilight\'s Hammer?', 39577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you a $c?', 'Are you a $c?', 39576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do rivers flow upstream?', 'Do rivers flow upstream?', 39575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so money!', '', 39574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like you. Here\'s a raise!', '', 39573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s some of that moolah back that I took from you!', '', 39572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do liars speak the truth?', 'Do liars speak the truth?', 39571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are deserts lush?', 'Are deserts lush?', 39570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are slaves free?', 'Are slaves free?', 39569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
