('Only if Lord Deathwing commands it!', 'Only if Lord Deathwing commands it!', 39555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well that\'s all semantics, really.', 'Well that\'s all semantics, really.', 39554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes and no.  It really depends on how you look at it... I suppose.  Did that answer your question?', 'Yes and no.  It really depends on how you look at it... I suppose.  Did that answer your question?', 39553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... what do you think the answer is?', 'Well... what do you think the answer is?', 39552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
