('Now, dance!', '', 39403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can do this alone, you say? Is this simple foolishness or misplaced confidence I see before me?\n\nNo, I can see it in your eyes. You have to know. You have to prove to yourself that you can do this alone. Very well. I will retreat from the battlefield if you so wish it.', '', 39402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With all due respect, your Highness, we can do this alone.', 'With all due respect, your Highness, we can do this alone.', 39401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The continued sacrifice of the Ashen Verdict and heroes such as yourself bring us all closer to final victory. Now I have come to Icecrown Citadel to lend aid to those who fight against the Scourge. Together we will end the tyranny of the Lich King!', '', 39400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a puny plan.', '', 39399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am gravely disappointed. Again you have made me unleash my dogs of war. ', '', 39398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There has been too much violence. Too much pain. But I have an honorable compromise. Just walk away.', '', 39397, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First you tell us the world is ending, now you tell us not to worry. What ruse is this?', 'First you tell us the world is ending, now you tell us not to worry. What ruse is this?', 39396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me hear that battle roar!', '', 39395, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, recruits, salute!', '', 39394, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should we believe you?', 'Why should we believe you?', 39393, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, you twisted mess of broken gears, let\'s get to work!', '', 39392, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast off your lives of war and drudgery, be reborn in elements and claim your rightful place in this new world!', 'Cast off your lives of war and drudgery, be reborn in elements and claim your rightful place in this new world!', 39391, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe you\'d do this to me!', '', 39390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where the heck did all of these shredders come from?!', 39389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salvaging', 'Salvaging', 39388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone, cheer!', '', 39387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember though, a key factor in winning any battle is positive reinforcement.', '', 39386, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you go into combat, it is important that you know how to intimidate the enemy with a deafening battle roar!', '', 39385, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
(' However, the most important part of battle is how you celebrate a good hard earned victory!', '', 39384, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first thing you need to learn is proper discipline.', '', 39383, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But do not despair, people of Orgrimmar! Join us and learn the truth.', 'But do not despair, people of Orgrimmar! Join us and learn the truth.', 39382, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flames will consume the world. Storms will wash away all hope. The elements will reign at last!', 'Flames will consume the world. Storms will wash away all hope. The elements will reign at last!', 39381, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end of our world nears, my brothers and sisters! Azeroth will be no more!', 'The end of our world nears, my brothers and sisters! Azeroth will be no more!', 39380, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People of Orgrimmar, listen. We have been blind for too long! I ask you to open your eyes to the truth!', 'People of Orgrimmar, listen. We have been blind for too long! I ask you to open your eyes to the truth!', 39379, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Grunt>', '', 39378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t know how long we\'re gonna be able to hold them off, $g bud : lady;. Hope you have a plan!', '', 39377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a game plan, kid!', '', 39376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, shaman. I shall slay you and carry the tablets to Cho\'Gall.', 'Very well, shaman. I shall slay you and carry the tablets to Cho\'Gall.', 39375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you are good enough to learn from us?  You will pay for your insolence!', '', 39374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh will burn, mortal!', '', 39373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your only lesson will be death.', '', 39372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will wish you never came here, worm!', '', 39371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ride the mine cart.', 'Ride the mine cart.', 39370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the worthy will learn the secrets we keep!', '', 39369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yours will be a lesson in pain!', '', 39368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?  Another unworthy pupil?', '', 39366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Coach is here?! He\'ll have a plan.', 39365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold everything - the walls of Northwatch have been breached! We\'re under attack!', 39364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s seawater. It\'s breached the ocean. Do you think the fissure is growing?', 39363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s all this? This jungle wasn\'t here during last week\'s survey. What is happening to the Barrens?', 39362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interesting. Even this far from the epicenter, Azeroth\'s crust is completely torn asunder.', 39361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to fly.', 'I\'m ready to fly.', 39360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The gyros are all spun up. Are you ready to fly my survey?', 39359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much data... so little time...', 39358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did I leave my voltometer? Bah, no matter. The Horde can keep it!', '', 39357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think I can make it to Theramore on foot?', '', 39356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run for your lives! Every gnome for himself!', '', 39355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m taking the next ship back home.', '', 39354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re through the gates! I\'m outta here!', '', 39353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody panic!', '', 39352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Barrens ... will ... devour you, $r.', '', 39351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s explodes in a frothing, feral rage!', '', 39350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You trespass on sacred soil!', '', 39349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relax, friend. You have not passed away... yet. Sadly, these others cannot say the same.', '', 39348, 0, 8873, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These crazy tauren - always trying to blow up my flying machine. This has been going on for years!', '', 39347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re going to pay, $n. They\'re all going to pay.', '', 39346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you been to Bael Modan? What\'s going on over there?', '', 39345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be sure to check in with my son Marley at the digsite. He\'s a good kid - my eyes and ears over at Bael Modan.', '', 39344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the field, $c! You can\'t get a feel for the tactical situation if you\'re hiding in a fortress all day. I always like to get my boots dirty.', '', 39343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mine cart is prepped and ready to go.', '', 39342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill that goblin, quickly!', 39341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? You\'re not supposed to be here. You\'re dead!', '', 39340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] For Gnomeregan!', '', 39339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH]..and we will finish the job!', '', 39338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Give us the tools...', '', 39337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Neither the sudden shock of battle, nor the long-drawn trials of vigilance and exertion will wear us down.', '', 39336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] We shall not weaken or tire.', '', 39335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] We shall not fail or falter.', '', 39334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s appears to be weakening!', 39333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is going on here?', 'What is going on here?', 39332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t fight any longer...', 'I can\'t fight any longer...', 39330, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('H-help me!', 'H-help me!', 39329, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll never see my wife again...', 'I\'ll never see my husband again...', 39328, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody... anybody...', 'Somebody... anybody...', 39327, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Operation: Gnomeregan is divided into a number of phases:$B$BFirst, we must retake the air tower.  This will allow our planes give us air support as we move towards Gnomeregan\'s main entrance.$B$BIn addition, a cache of mechanized Battle Suits was discovered in one of the nearby buildings.  Once we have those suits, our assault on the entrance should be unstoppable.$B$BThen, we go straight for Thermaplugg in the heart of Gnomeregan!', '', 39326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dwarves have kept us safe in their home for some time now, and for that we thank them.  However, the traitorous Thermaplugg\'s occupation of our home must at last come to an end.$B$BGnomeregan has festered beneath the atomic weight of our ill-conceived plan for too long. The detonation of the radiation bombs drove us from our city, but we now possess the technology to take it back!$B$BWe will regain what is ours... and bring Thermaplugg to justice!', '', 39324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your plan?', 'What is your plan?', 39323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break time over!', '', 39322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me overseer, you slave!', '', 39321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me like beat you up!', '', 39320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no mine ore, you get beating!', '', 39319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trade Prince say hurt you!', '', 39318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last it is time for the exiled gnomes to return.$B$BOnce again Gnomeregan will be our home!', '', 39317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me get big bonus for capture you!', '', 39316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no slave! Work or die!', '', 39315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to work!', '', 39314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what are those things on the rooftops?', 'What... what are those things on the rooftops?', 39313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re not a part of your system!', 39312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll help you defend the tablets.', 'I\'ll help you defend the tablets.', 39308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to help me, $c! Twilight\'s Hammer attacked my zeppelin and their men tried to take the tablets and the crystal I was transporting to Orgrimmar.', '', 39307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight well.  I will leave you now.  Lok\'tar ogar!', 'You fight well.  I will leave you now.  Lok\'tar ogar!', 39306, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was an honor to watch you fight, $n.', 'It was an honor to watch you fight, $n.', 39305, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again.  I will return to Razor Hill now.', 'Thank you again.  I will return to Razor Hill now.', 39304, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel much better now.  For the Horde!', 'I feel much better now.  For the Horde!', 39303, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Warchief!  You lead, I will follow.', 'For the Warchief!  You lead, I will follow.', 39302, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You\'ve saved my life, $c.  Protect me for a few more moments while I recover.', 'You\'ve saved my life, $c.  Protect me for a few more moments while I recover.', 39301, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was supposed to die in battle... ah well, another day.  I will follow you until I recover.', 'I was supposed to die in battle... ah well, another day.  I will follow you until I recover.', 39300, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r... I was close to death.  May I stay by your side for a moment?', 'Thank you, $r... I was close to death.  May I stay by your side for a moment?', 39299, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is casting Envenom!  Place your totem down now!', '', 39298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'NOOOOOOO!', 39297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Twilight\'s Hammer fools would tear the very earth apart to get these tablets.', '', 39296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them overpower us!', '', 39295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, I need help!', '', 39294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, you\'ve driven them off. Take the tablets to Earthmender Norsala in the Valley of Strength at once! Tell her that I\'ll be along once I\'ve had some time to recover.', '', 39293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the crystal\'s power to defend me and the tablets. If Twilight\'s Hammer\'s minions break through my shield, they\'ll kill me and take the tablets!', '', 39292, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We discovered this crystal and tablets in a Titan archive. I used the crystal to buy some time, but they\'re still following me!', '', 39291, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The zeppelin from Northrend was attacked by Twilight\'s Hammer! I don\'t know how they found us, but they killed everyone.', '', 39290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I catch a ride to Razor Hill?', 'Can I catch a ride to Razor Hill?', 39289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need something?', '', 39288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been here in this valley since before the dark portal opened, $glad:lass;. I don\'t plan on letting a handful of blood elves traipse in here and plunder these ruins!', '', 39287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pouring', 'Pouring', 39286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s trying to bash me skull in!', '', 39285, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light, that hurts!', '', 39284, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! I can\'t take much more o\' this!', '', 39283, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elementals, I bid you come forth and slay this enemy of Twilight\'s Hammer!', 'Elementals, I bid you come forth and slay this enemy of Twilight\'s Hammer!', 39282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was done for! Thank you!', 'I thought I was done for! Thank you!', 39281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is up crap creek an\' I ain\'t got no shovel.', 'I thought I was cooked like a turkey dinner!', 39280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The roof over the mess hall collapsed. So many - dead!', 'The roof over the mess hall collapsed. So many - dead!', 39279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could they have done this?', 'How could they have done this?', 39278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are still others - search the barracks!', 'There are still others - search the barracks!', 39277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could this have happened?', 'How could this have happened?', 39276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, thank you!', 'Thank you, thank you!', 39275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This whole keep is going to collapse!', 'This whole keep is going to collapse!', 39274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The attacks on these ships, they are clearly not random.$b$bWe must discover the motives of the naga here.', '', 39273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This region is one of the epicenters of the cataclysm that threatens to rend our world.$b$bIf we manage to survive, we must try to discover its cause.', '', 39272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brace yourself, $r.$b$bThe naga could attack again any moment.', '', 39271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, the tablets are ours!', 'At last, the tablets are ours!', 39270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are you not burning your feet?', '', 39269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get down from there this instant!', '', 39268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duokna, what are you doing?', '', 39267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duokna... this is embarrassing.', '', 39266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done it! You\'ve saved the tablets. Hurry and bring them to Ironforge. I\'ll be along once I\'ve had some time to recover.', '', 39265, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impressive!  You learn quickly, my pupil.', 39264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... very impressive.  Alright, you\'ve passed my test.', '', 39263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll help you defend the tablets.', 'I\'ll help you defend the tablets.', 39262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must help me safeguard the Tablets of Earth. Twilight\'s Hammer will not stop until they\'ve taken the tablets.', '', 39261, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That cursed crystal! We will not give up so easily. We will have that tablet for our ascendants. Perhaps not today, but soon!', 'That cursed crystal! We will not give up so easily. We will have that tablet for our ascendants. Perhaps not today, but soon!', 39260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'VE GOT AN IDEA!', 39259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have to rescue everyone and get out of here before the volcano explodes for real!', 39258, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s my assistant.$B$BSure, he\'s not been plagued in the same manner as we have, but he is clearly plagued nonetheless.  He\'s bent the knee to Sylvanas, so he\'s as much one of us as you or I.$b$bAnd just between you and me... to be perfectly honest, I think the Dark Lady thought he was already bending his knee when he entered her chamber!', '', 39257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s the little guy?', 'Who\'s the little guy?', 39256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kelsey sent me to get a boat.', 'Kelsey sent me to get a boat.', 39255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Marley. Let\'s fly!', 'I\'m ready, Marley. Let\'s fly!', 39254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a one-seater plane, but you can always sit up on the fuselage. It\'s perfectly safe.$B$BYou ready?', '', 39253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Rowdy tauren don\'t scare me none.', '', 39252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I can\'t hold it! Mayday! MAYDAY!', '', 39251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...What the? The keep is under attack!', '', 39250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up ahead is Bael\'dun Keep. Isn\'t she a beauty? That stronghold is indestructible!', '', 39249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re all very proud of Bael Modan. It was the first dwarven settlement in Kalimdor.', '', 39248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on tight back there! Seat belts are for chumps.', '', 39247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll use the crystal to shield the tablets. See if it will grant you powers to defend me. If Twilight\'s Hammer\'s minions break through my shield, they\'ll kill me and take the tablets!', '', 39246, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using a crystal Brann sent with the tablets, I managed to protect myself and escape, but one of the attackers followed me!', '', 39245, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our ship from Northrend was attacked by Twilight\'s Hammer! I don\'t know how they got aboard, but they killed everyone.', '', 39244, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just let me know when ya ready, mon.', '', 39243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used to be overcome with frequent, debilitating fits of rage. But since I met Driz, I\'ve been able to live a happy, productive life.$B$BAnd I get to tear things apart with my bare hands.', '', 39242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Echo Isles.', '', 39241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay. We\'re going to move away from the exploding volcano and try to hook up with the orcs for the final assault on the Trade Prince. See you on the other side... I hope.', 39240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard about this Nesingwary guy, out of Stranglethorn Vale, hunting all sorts of beasts for sport.$B$BFor SPORT. What a complete idiot, right? Think of all the profit he\'s letting rot in the field!', '', 39239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 39238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('UNBELIEVABLE! $n is victorious! King Kraw is no more!', '', 39237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve spared no expense for the crowd, folks! We\'re determined to kill $n at any cost, for you, the viewer! Taken all the way from the hidden jungle of Un\'goro Crater, cower in fear at...KING KRAW!', '', 39236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no stopping $n! Sarinexx has been massacred!', '', 39235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the truth of it! Fighting leads to killing, and killing leads to warring. And that was nearly the end of all our customers!$B$BNow, when men get to fighting, it happens here. And it finishes here! For maximum viewing potential!', '', 39234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The faint of heart may wish to shield their eyes! Being brought into the ring now is a horror, captured from the dark tunnels of the Centipaar Hive! I give you the skittering death: SARINEXX!', '', 39233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has done it again! Zumonga dies once more!', '', 39232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ... what is happening to me?', '', 39231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s in here. Let\'s get \'im!', '', 39230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not loiter; we\'ve work to do here.', '', 39229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine it\'s mine I found it. Mine I say! Mine! ', '', 39228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find Marley Twinbraid up top, $gsir:ma\'am;.', '', 39227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This was going to be a walk in the park until that airhead over there came out of nowhere with an army of gnomes.$B$BGallywix will have my head if we let these creepy runts one-up us here.', 39226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have permission to enter the city.', 'You have permission to enter the city.', 39225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are only allowed into the city for an hour.  Be quick with your business.', 'You are only allowed into the city for an hour.  Be quick with your business.', 39224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haven\'t I seen you before?  We\'ll be keeping an eye on you, citizen.', 'Haven\'t I seen you before?  We\'ll be keeping an eye on you, citizen.', 39223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re papers look to be in order.  Proceed.', 'You\'re papers look to be in order.  Proceed.', 39222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve filled out my paperwork to enter the city.', 'I\'ve filled out my paperwork to enter the city.', 39221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Hands off the banner, $gson:missy;.', '', 39220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll let you into the city, this time.', 'We\'ll let you into the city, this time.', 39219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s me job, $c. The General goes out on patrol, and I carry his banner and plant it in the dirt.$B$BImagine a General out and about without his banner. He might as well not wear pants.', '', 39218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please insert coins.', '', 39217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you going in there? I\'m not going back in there!', 39216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Panic!', 'Panic!', 39215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe that Fizz and Evol are at each other\'s throats again. It\'s the pressure. We need you now more than ever, $n.', '', 39214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them make off with any of the artifacts!', 'Don\'t let them make off with any of the artifacts!', 39213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save what you can - every Dwarf for himself!', 'Save what you can - every Dwarf for herself!', 39212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re everywhere!', 'They\'re everywhere!', 39211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab the gear - we gotta clear out!', 'Grab the gear - we gotta clear out!', 39210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn away, $c.$B$BBefore the cataclysm hit, we found something.$B$BWe dug something up that should\'ve stayed buried.$B$BPray to whatever you believe in that the landslide was enough to keep it down...', 'Turn away, $c.$B$BBefore the cataclysm hit, we found something.$B$BWe dug something up that should\'ve stayed buried.$B$BPray to whatever you believe in that the landslide was enough to keep it down...', 39209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Evol Fingers must pay! For the love of profit, $n, help me!', '', 39208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You wanna help me out here with Fizz? He\'s up to no good again!', '', 39207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, $n. You heading in?', '', 39206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This might be the only cool place left on the island... right next to the volcano!', 39205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bastia, let\'s ride!', 'Bastia, let\'s ride!', 39204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall Hall, $n! Here to help kill some misguided dwarves and gnomes?', '', 39203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m alive!', '', 39202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks a ton, pal!', '', 39201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Those bugs took my watch!', '', 39200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What day is it?', '', 39199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can breathe!', '', 39198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ZUMONGA...KILL...', '', 39197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ginormus has fallen! $n looks like $Ghe\'s:she\'s; ready for more!', '', 39196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our next fighter was found in the deepest tombs of Zul\'Farrak! Gorged on cursed blood, raised from death countless times, he now knows only fury and violence! Dare you face the mindless wrath of...ZUMONGA!', '', 39195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Clarice stares over the body, her eyes vacant.>$B$BI rode here from Theramore as soon as the news reached me.$B$BJohn and I had always talked about settling down when the conflict subsided.$B$BI don\'t think the fighting will ever stop. Do you?', 39194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 18, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Bilgewater Cartel will be in business here by the end of the day, mark my words.', 39193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure, it\'s got bugs to work out. But the microtank is a marvel of engineering.$B$Bit uses one quarter the materials of a full-sized siege engine, and it can be mass-produced by anyone! ...with really tiny hands!', 39192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What I\'m cooking up is way ahead of its time, $n.$B$BLook at these blueprints! It\'s like licking the future.', 39191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Battlescar is a dangerous place. All the armor in the world can\'t save a steam tank that\'s swallowed up by the earth.', 39190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Firelord has risen!  We must send word to the others.  Let us hurry!', '', 39189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When me and my Wildhammer Mercenaries were hired on to secure Fort Triumph, I imagined we\'d be fighting the Horde.$B$BBut we\'re set on from all sides! \'Sploding goblins, burrowing bugs, electro-fied lizards... ', '', 39188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can afford no delay. Fort Triumph must be completed and reinforced, or any hope we have for permanent settlement on this continent will be erased.', '', 39187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it too late?  I feel Deathwing\'s presence nearby!', '', 39186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... it can\'t be.  Our forward outpost has been obliterated!', '', 39185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be a hero. Just walk away.', '', 39184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any Ladies and Gentlemen present should LEAVE NOW...for only REAL MEN AND WOMEN will be able to handle the gory spectacle about to unfold! Introducing the first fighter, the warrior of the Wastewander, the Ayatollah of Kaja-Cola...THE GINORMUS!', '', 39183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The blood of the fallen cries out for justice.', 39182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, friend! It feels like it\'s been years since you helped me whip up my first Noggenfogger Elixer.$B$BNow I\'m running the whole city! Those things still sell like crazy.', '', 39181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On behalf of the illustrious and still neutral Steamwheedle Cartel, I hope you enjoy your stay.$B$BRemember, everyone is welcome in Gadgetzan! Everyone except pirates.', '', 39180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should mention I reversed the gearbox to accommodate the smaller form-factor.', 39179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sniff for pheromones to find your way into the hive!', 'Sniff for pheromones to find your way into the hive!', 39178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nonsense! Miniaturization is the future of warfare.', 39177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gordo, do you think you could repair my gear?', 'Gordo, do you think you could repair my gear?', 39176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Johaan say Gordo need a tailor to fix Gordo tummy.', '', 39175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It drafty out here.', '', 39174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gordo like picking flowers.  Pick flowers kind of like killing.', '', 39173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simmer say Gordo got guts, but got no brains.  Why he mean?', '', 39172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmmm... aye. But it\'s a wee bit - uh - wee, innit?', '', 39171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our equipment is really taking a beating out here!', 39170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay... structure? Check. Power? Check. Danger? Double-check. Let\'s fire up my masterpiece!', 39169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n! Now I can begin my final assembly...', 39168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Into the Thunderdrome, $n! There\'s no getting out until someone\'s hit the sand. Let\'s start the show!', '', 39167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE, YOU WRETCHES!', '', 39166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And my soul... my soul belongs to the Scourge!', '', 39165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... I remember.  My family is dead.  And so am I.', '', 39164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mother... father... Thurman... where are you?  Come help me!', '', 39163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You people... what are you doing here?  Why are you in my house?', '', 39162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, am I... home?', '', 39161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on here?', '', 39160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m a little busy at the moment, $c... return when I\'m less preoccupied.', 39159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I had better return to my post.  You can find me downstairs if you need anything.', 39158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Resist the Lich King\'s will, Devlin!  Come to us!', 39157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your mortal remains have been gathered, here in this place where you spent your childhood!', 39156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Devlin Agamand!  Listen to my voice!', 39155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now it is time for us to begin.', 39154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well.  Follow me.', 39153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 39152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do our best here to heal the broken earth. It was difficult enough before we started getting raided at night.', '', 39151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to begin the procedure?', 39150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I help you with something?', 39149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, dwarf. Have it your way. I shall kill you and take the tablets.', 'Very well, dwarf. Have it your way. I shall kill you and take the tablets.', 39148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn over the tablets and I will allow you a quick death.', 'Turn over the tablets and I will allow you a quick death.', 39147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for everything... father.', 39146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then again, why kill myself... when I can kill YOU instead!', 39145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lilian, I...', '', 39144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But wait... I remember now.  You taught me to only kill the undead.  So do you want me to kill myself, daddy?', 39143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, ah...', '', 39142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You raised me to be a killer.  How am I doing, daddy?', 39141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shut up.', 39140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lilian... you\'re... it\'s so nice to see you well.', '', 39139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father!', 39138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are quite right, Trask.', '', 39137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were he still alive to avenge himself, General Hawthorne would have no doubt ordered a retaliatory massacre of biblical proportions.', '', 39136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lesson we\'ve learned here in the Barrens is that nothing short of scorched earth will rout these Horde animals. No quarter!', '', 39135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His body was found strung up from a tree. Those animals... Those filthy animals!', 'His body was found strung up from a tree. Those animals... Those filthy animals!', 39134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They killed him! General Hawthorne - he was ambushed on the road by Horde assassins.', 'They killed him! General Hawthorne - he was ambushed on the road by Horde assassins.', 39133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You\'re alive! Have you heard?', '$n! You\'re alive! Have you heard?', 39132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to purchase a bat ride.', 'I\'d like to purchase a bat ride.', 39131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take that flight to Brill now.', 'I\'ll take that flight to Brill now.', 39130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Going somewhere?', '', 39129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taurajo had a significant civilian population. I wanted to ensure that they could escape the fighting, and many did, finding refuge in the north.$B$BThere are some, even in Alliance High Command, who argued that I let an opportunity slip away. That I should\'ve taken hostages. But I don\'t see the value in those sort of terror-tactics.$B$BHear me out, $n: I want this war to end someday. It won\'t ever stop if we butcher or imprison civilians.$B$BI just pray that there are those on the other side who see things as I do.', '', 39128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did you do that?', 'Why did you do that?', 39127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Hawthorne wrinkles his brow.>$B$BI would prefer not to use the term \'sacked,\' but yes, the attack went off flawlessly. We removed Taurajo from the equation, confiscated its arms, and destroyed its smithing facilities. The assault gave our forces considerable breathing room and knocked the enemy off balance.$B$BNonetheless, during the assault, I instructed my men to leave a gap open in our lines...', '', 39126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We sacked the town?', 'We sacked the town?', 39125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, our assault on the Horde town of Taurajo. I struggled with the implications of the decision.$B$BTaurajo was admittedly what you might call a \'soft target,\' primarily a hunters\' camp. Still, it had been used to recruit, equip, and train Horde infantry for many years.$B$BWhen our scouts reported that Taurajo\'s most dangerous units were out on the hunt, we had to act quickly.', '', 39124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what happened at Taurajo.', 'Tell me what happened at Taurajo.', 39123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You might not think that a Worgen like myself would know how to cook a fine steak.$B$BJust \'cuz I like my meat raw... Still panting from flight... Arterial spray in my face...$B$BWhat were we talking about? Oh yes! I was quite the gourmet back in Gilneas.', '', 39122, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 15, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just between you and me, I worry that the good General here doesn\'t have the stomach to do what needs to be done.$B$BThis is the Horde we\'re dealing with. History shows there can never be peace.$B$BOur goal should be ... annihilation.', '', 39121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! How can I help you, old friend?', '', 39120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me up into the skies, Sassy!', 'Get me up into the skies, Sassy!', 39119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Warchief has promised to help us rescue our people and deal with Gallywix if we help them with the Alliance.$B$BIt sounds like a fair deal to me. The enemy of my friend is my enemy, right?', 39118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re doing incredible work here in the Barrens, $n.$B$BWith the help of heroes like you, we can secure Kalimdor, and in doing so ensure a lasting peace in our homelands.', '', 39117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back into the skies on the Tranquil Coast or be ejected!', '', 39116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any savage can win a war. The true hero aims not merely for victory on the battlefield, but to attain a lasting peace after the final arrow falls.', '', 39115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me sorry! No hurt!', '', 39114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Deathguard Simmer looks at you expectantly.>', '', 39113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it I can do for you?', '', 39112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Working for Jerrod isn\'t all that bad.  He might lose his temper now and again, but he pays well, and he even gives me a boost when I can\'t reach something in the cart.', '', 39111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm-Ka, $n. It is good to see you again.', '', 39110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your friends were all taken prisoner by Trade Prince Gallywix while the volcano was exploding.$B$BWe are going to have to deal with the Alliance quickly if we\'re to rescue them and get off of this island.', '', 39109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kor\'kron could not fight better! For the Horde!', '', 39108, 1, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen what our goblin friend can do. These dwarves are in for a nasty surprise!', '', 39107, 1, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tighten it up a little. We wouldn\'t want them to slip through and miss all of the fun.', '', 39106, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no better day than one filled with the blood of dwarves!', '', 39105, 1, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They spoil the coast with their cowardly mines. Disgusting!', '', 39104, 1, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps they should send their gnomes down here? They could do no worse!', '', 39103, 1, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They eagerly rush to their deaths. What fools!', '', 39102, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you playing with them? It\'s cruel.', '', 39101, 1, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our little friend is here. I weep for the dwarves if the goblin has their weed whacker!', '', 39100, 1, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance sends gnomes and dwarves against us? Is this some kind of joke?!', '', 39099, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight for your ancestors and your true warchief!', '', 39098, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach these cowards the true meaning of war!', '', 39097, 1, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall Hall!', '', 39096, 1, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 39095, 1, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will throw these Alliance curs back into the sea!', '', 39094, 1, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the line!', '', 39093, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sshal tasste your blood, landling.', '', 39092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They sssend you to your death, youngling.', '', 39091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sssea Witch will kill you all.', '', 39090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sshal ssslaughter you, Darksspear runt! ', '', 39089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I expect this operation to proceed without major incident.', 39088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya trainer should be somewhere in the grounds \'ere. I\'ll catch you lata, mon.', '', 39087, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, stop! I give up!', 'Okay, stop! I give up!', 39086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Busted!', '...Busted!', 39085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I yield. I\'ll go quietly.', 'I yield. I\'ll go quietly.', 39084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No way I\'m letting them ship me back to the stockades!', 'No way I\'m letting them ship me back to the stockades!', 39083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It didn\'t have to go down this way, $c.', 'It didn\'t have to go down this way, $c.', 39082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cheese it! It\'s the fuzz!', 'Cheese it! It\'s the fuzz!', 39081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never take me alive, $c!', 'You\'ll never take me alive, $c!', 39080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t goin\' back to the clink, $gman:lady;!', 'I ain\'t goin\' back to the clink, $gman:lady;!', 39079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re under arrest.', 'You\'re under arrest.', 39078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, you aren\'t here to bust us, are you?', 'Whoa, you aren\'t here to bust us, are you?', 39077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $c! This place is pretty picked over but you might still be able to find somethin\' worth your time.', 'Hey, $c! This place is pretty picked over but you might still be able to find somethin\' worth your time.', 39076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All these dead Tauren got on \'em is beads and junk. Did you score anything good? ', 'All these dead Tauren got on \'em is beads and junk. Did you score anything good? ', 39075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up, $c! Take everything you can!', 'Hurry up, $c! Take everything you can!', 39074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want in on this? Smash and grab, baby!', 'You want in on this? Smash and grab, baby!', 39073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $gman:woman;, I\'m just tryin\' to get my slice of the pie.', 'Hey $gman:woman;, I\'m just tryin\' to get my slice of the pie.', 39072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me back to Darkspear Hold if you would, Vanira.', 'Take me back to Darkspear Hold if you would, Vanira.', 39071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I caught up with ya! Let\'s stick together in \'ere, okay?', '', 39070, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try not ta make me look too bad, eh?', '', 39069, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know dis is prolly busy work, but I don\'t mind. Dese baby raptors are cute lil devils.', '', 39068, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You finished with ya trainin\' too? Glad you make it through, mon!', '', 39067, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 21370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait up, mon!', '', 39066, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is wild! Vol\'jin\'s not messin\' around. He\'s going afta tha Sea Witch wit a vengeance.', '', 39065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast! Save some for me, mon!', '', 39064, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to die!', '', 39063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge will destroy you all!  Death will sweep the lands!', '', 39062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a good nap.  Wait, where\'s my elbows and knees?!', 'That was a good nap.  Wait, where\'s my elbows and knees?!', 39061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so dark in here.  I\'m not sure I like being undead.', 'It\'s so dark in here.  I\'m not sure I like being undead.', 39060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aha, I understand now.  Thank you for waking me.', 'Aha, I understand now.  Thank you for waking me.', 39059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Undead?  I will have my vengeance against the Lich King!', 'Undead?  I will have my vengeance against the Lich King!', 39058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I understand.  Off to work!', 'Ah, I understand.  Off to work!', 39057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I see.  Looks like I\'m part of the Horde now.', 'Ah, I see.  Looks like I\'m part of the Horde now.', 39056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...I think I understand what\'s going on.  At least I still have my free will.', '...I think I understand what\'s going on.  At least I still have my free will.', 39055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I see.  Well, I guess I\'m off to work then.', 'Ah, I see.  Well, I guess I\'m off to work then.', 39054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It feels like I\'ve been sleeping for years...', 'It feels like I\'ve been sleeping for years...', 39053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The plague... is it over?', 'The plague... is it over?', 39052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I used to be handsome...', 'I used to be beautiful...', 39051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this place?', 'What is this place?', 39050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light, I\'m alive again...', 'By the Light, I\'m alive again...', 39049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So cold...', 'So cold...', 39048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why... what happened...', 'Why... what happened...', 39047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on?', 'What\'s going on?', 39046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not so fast, little troll!', 39045, 0, 11577, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ZUNI! NOOOO!', 39044, 0, 11577, 5, 65, 0, 0, 21945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get the fires dis time!', '', 39043, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tha Darkspear shall never give in to ya kind, Zar\'jira. We\'re stronga\' than you\'ll eva\' be.', '', 39042, 0, 11577, 1, 65, 0, 20120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your name, $c? $n?$B$BWelcome to the Barrens. You are standing at the vanguard of one of our most important operations on this continent. I would be honored if you were to lend us your strength.', '', 39041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want you to know that I sincerely appreciate your aid, $c. We are not fighting beasts out here, but a foe both cunning and fanatical. We must stick together or hang separately.', '', 39040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yessir, those stormsnouts pack quite a punch.', '', 39039, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come an\' get it!', '', 39038, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we\'re cooking, $n.', '', 39037, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] Exactly.  Let us hope that Baine has less than half the strength of his father...or we are going to need more guards.', '[ph] Exactly.  Let us hope that Baine has less than half the strength of his father...or we are going to need more guards.', 39036, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]I\'ve only heard stories.  Some say it can only be picked up with two hands, but Cairne could wield it easily in one.', '[ph]I\'ve only heard stories.  Some say it can only be picked up with two hands, but Cairne could wield it easily in one.', 39035, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]Do not underestimate members of the Bloodhoof.  Did you ever see that totem that Cairne carried around?', '[ph]Do not underestimate members of the Bloodhoof.  Did you ever see that totem that Cairne carried around?', 39034, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]Baine?  He would be crazy to come here.  We outnumber him at least two to one.  He\'s the one that should be worried.', '[ph]Baine?  He would be crazy to come here.  We outnumber him at least two to one.  He\'s the one that should be worried.', 39033, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] We will not have anything to speak of if the Pretender comes here.', '[ph] We will not have anything to speak of if the Pretender comes here.', 39032, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At ease.', '', 39031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gentlemen, our business is murder. And business is GOOD.', '', 39030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jackson, you\'ve spilled your powder all over the ground. <Sigh>', '', 39029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fast. But not fast enough. We\'ll do it again.', '', 39028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, you will not fire until you see the - whatever color their eyes are.', '', 39027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barkley, we do NOT aim with our eyes closed!', '', 39026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When\'s the last time you cleaned that weapon, Holmberg?', '', 39025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look lively there, Grizwald.', '', 39024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PRESENT!', '', 39023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right shoulder ... ARMS!', '', 39022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaarrrmms ... ABOUT!', '', 39021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were fools to leave the safety of your city. Your return to the ocean has assured your demise.', 39020, 0, 9261, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When I am finished with your tribe, I shall hunt down that orcish cur that saved you from my wrath once before. None will survive.', 39019, 0, 9261, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Troll weaklings, there is no hope. Your death has been foretold by the tides.', 39018, 0, 9261, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tides shall wash away the entire Darkspear Tribe.', 39017, 0, 9261, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thrall is not here to save you this time, Darkspear. Slink away to the shadows, for I shall hunt every last one of you down.', 39016, 0, 9261, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, another Darkspear Warrior sacrificed on my altar. One by one, you shall all perish.', 39015, 0, 9261, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your father was a weakling, Vol\'jin. I shall enjoy sucking the life from you as I did him.', 39014, 0, 9261, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Atennnn ... SHUN!', '', 39013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have returned to finish what I started, Darkspear. These islands shall run with your blood.', 39012, 0, 9261, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]I would not say that so soon.', '[ph]I would not say that so soon.', 39011, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]It appears the Grimtotem clan now has a home to build upon.', '[ph]It appears the Grimtotem clan now has a home to build upon.', 39010, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Save me from the cold!', 39009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cold dark beckons...', 39008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So cold...', 39007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where we go from here is unknown, hero. What we do know is that none of this would have been possible without your aid.$B$BThe Knights of the Ebon Blade salute you.', '', 39006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A day of celebration and of mourning, hero...', '', 39005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They cannot fear...', '', 39004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I stand, the lion before the lambs... and they do not fear.', '', 39003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never been more proud ta be a Darkspear. Vol\'jin leads us ta glory.', '', 39002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gebler, father, why would you...', 39001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, my... wait, be quiet!  I hear the lieutenant approaching.', 39000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The world of the living may have turned its back on me, but I\'m no damned Scourge.  Just go.', 38999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately, you were too dangerous in life, and you\'re far too dangerous in undeath.  I will enjoy killing you, you Scourged witch...', '', 38998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The High Priest sends his regrets.  He had hoped that one day you would be a powerful weapon against our enemies.', '', 38997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What?  NO!  This can\'t be!  Gebler, you know me... we were friends once!', 38996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Priest Voss denounces you as a daughter.  He\'s ordered that you be executed immediately.', '', 38995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gebler, you came!  What did he say?', 38994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come, my little captive... word has come back from your father.', '', 38993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First Kezan and now here. We are toast if we don\'t find a way off of this island soon!', 38992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your father?', 'Your father?', 38991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m NOT undead!  Not for long, anyway.  My father will rescue me, I know it...', 38990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did the Scarlet Crusade put you in a cage?  They usually kill the undead on sight.', 'Why did the Scarlet Crusade put you in a cage?  They usually kill the undead on sight.', 38989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lilian, you\'re one of the Forsaken, like me.  Which brings the question: why did the Scarlet Crusade put you in a cage?  They usually kill the undead on sight.', 'Lilian, you\'re one of the Forsaken, like me.  Which brings the question: why did the Scarlet Crusade put you in a cage?  They usually kill the undead on sight.', 38988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First of all, I don\'t need to be rescued.  Second of all, I\'d never allow myself to be rescued by an abomination like you!', 38987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to rescue you.', 'I\'m here to rescue you.', 38986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you doing here?  Get out of here!', 38985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh!  Get away from me, you fiend!', 38984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father, NO!  Wait... where am I?', 38983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t understand... I CAN\'T be undead!  Not me, not now...', 38982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not hideous, Lilian... you\'re one of us.  Here, look in this mirror, see for yourself.', 'You\'re not hideous, Lilian... you\'re one of us.  Here, look in this mirror, see for yourself.', 38981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away from me, you monster!  Don\'t look at me!  I\'m hideous!', 38980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes.  Do you have a raptor that can take me there?', 'Yes.  Do you have a raptor that can take me there?', 38979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya want to join the attack on the naga?', '', 38978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_creature_cursed_01.blp:12|t %s cast |cFFFF7F00Vile Gas!|r', '', 38977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming! Horde incoming - Look out behind you, $n!', '', 38975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behind you, $n! Look out - incoming!', '', 38974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get in the back seat. We\'re getting out of here. I know where our old friends, the orcs, are!', 38973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins casting Empowered Shock Vortex!', '', 38972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no! Where is everyone? I dropped them off here!', 38971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re coming up on the Town-In-A-Box now...', 38970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you back in town, babe!', 38969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'GENERAL TRIGGER 4 SENT, REMOVE THIS ACTION!', 38968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Geronimo!', 38967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, throw the Life-Rocket packs down to the survivors, and drop the bombs on the pirates. Try not to mix those up, okay?', 38966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Up and away, hon. I\'ll steer, you just keep an eye out.', 38965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People tink raptors wild and vicious, but little else. In truth, they be loyal and cunnin\' in ways ya hardly know.', '', 38964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Corporal\'s a good man, but he\'s got tunnel-vision when it comes to his orders.$B$BSomething unnatural is happening to the land here, $n. This jungle shouldn\'t be here!', 38963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re still cut off from Forward Command, but thanks to your \'negotiations\' with the quilboar, we should be able to re-open the roads with a little elbow grease.', '', 38962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s some good huntin\' to be found here in the Barrens, if you\'ve the stomach for it.', '', 38961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s belches loudly.', '', 38960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, the quilboar are a foul lot.', '', 38959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'YEEEEEEEEEEE HAAAAAAAAAAAA!!!', 38958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was talking about you and Durty Pete.', '', 38957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stinking. Disgusting. Filthy animals!', '', 38956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WE\'RE ON FIRE!', 38955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aren\'t you the least bit curious why the Barrens are suddenly in bloom, seemingly overnight?', 38954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In a word? No.', '', 38953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disgusting! We\'ll have to slash and burn our way to Forward Command.', '', 38952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s slaps a mosquito on his neck.', '', 38951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that your plan, Teegan? Set fire to anything that gets in our way?', 38950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like the way you think, Bridgewater.', '', 38949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep hacking at the overgrowth! If that doesn\'t work, we\'re going to start burning.', '', 38948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you yours, \"Warchief.\"', '', 38947, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 20104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You spoke of communing with Thrall?  Did I miss it?', 'You spoke of communing with Thrall?  Did I miss it?', 38946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya will spend ya reign glancin\' over ya shoulda and fearin\' tha shadows, for when tha time comes and ya blood be slowly drainin\' out, ya will know exactly who fired tha arrow dat pierced ya black heart.\n', '', 38944, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 20103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'OH MY GOSH! BEHIND YOU!!!', 38943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard this one. Tell me another...', 'I\'ve heard this one. Tell me another...', 38942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s not good.', 'That\'s not good.', 38941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A butt?', 'A butt?', 38940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weep SNOT!?', 'Weep SNOT!?', 38939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me another story, Ol\' Durty Pete!', 'Tell me another story, Ol\' Durty Pete!', 38938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sounds serious.', 'That sounds serious.', 38937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let me tell you somethin\' about knotty pine, it\'s got knots, $gson:missy;.$B$BAnd knots is just big holes in trees, which makes for a stupid rowboat and I blamed Whistler but he had his own ideas about my choice of tar (I chose to forget it) so we decided to settle it by drinking.$B$BWhen the grog ran out, that\'s when we had the knife fight. For sport.$B$BAnyways, we never made it to Menethil, and I\'m pretty sure one or both of us drowned.', '', 38936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back in the war - not that one, the udder one - when them orcs rode dragons? Me and Whistler set out to cross from Southshore to Menethil Harbor inna rowboat we\'d built outta knotty pine while soused to our eyeballs on Cherry Grog.$B$BAn\' we got about a third the way by my reckoning, which were mostly far judgin\' by the fact that there were nothing all around us but the sea, when my feet got to start feelin\' wet.', '', 38935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 23, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard me, $glad:lass; - a butt! Not a fitting gift for a lady. But I liked it. So I offered to donate it to me local drinkin\' hole.$B$BThey called it Durty Pete\'s Bottom, and eventually named the pub after it, afore them orcs burned it to toast, and all that\'s left today is me big blackened bottom amidst a heap of rubble.$B$B<Ol\' Durty Pete sheds a single tear.> ', '', 38934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 18, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They didn\'t always call me Ol\' Durty Pete.$B$BOnce, when I were young an\' durty, I thought I\'d impress a sweet buxom lass named Bellie with me chiselin\' styles.$B$BOl\' Bellie! She were somthin\' else. Firm, that one. All big but for the middle, like they was meant to be.$B$BSo I found me a chunk of limestone white like her skin and I set about to chiselin\' and carvin\' and creatin\' what you\'d call a masterpiece, but I got me scale all wrong, see? I ended up with an enormous, what would you call it? Butt.', '', 38933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 23, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ayup, word got around fast and soon the whole of Menethil gathered around to see it through, with bettin\' and fruit vendors and the like, an\' there were some consternation over the rules that had to be ironed out with a big rigamarole, \'til the mayor hisself agreed that weepin\' blood tain\'t count fer nothin\'.$B$BSo Chuck kneels down an\' she gets up on a stool and REARS back with that big \'ol thick leg of hers and - but I\'m digressin\'. Point is, I shoulda taken the deal, \'cuz this gun\'s a bit dodgy.', '', 38932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see this here gun, $gboy:missy;?$B$B<Ol\' Durty Pete casually waves his weapon directly at your face.>$B$BThis here gun\'s seen action on every continent but for Northrend. It\'s saved me life more times than I can count: Seven. One time, \"Big Mackie\" MacDungal - not the wee MacDungal now, but his pappy - offered me his youngest daughter in barter for me gun.$B$BLet me tell you somethin\' about Edie: she and me gun had a lot in common. Wide-mouthed. Buck-toofed. Dangerous from the biz-ness end. Likin\' to go oft half-cocked.$B$BYou heard about the time wee Edie bet Chuck Brandybeard 25 silver she could kick \'im in the head so hard he would weep snot?', '', 38931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know why they call it stout? \'Cuz once it were rolling down the hill it couldnae be bargained wit\', couldnae be reasoned wit\'. It felt no pity, no remorse, no fear.$B$BIt were like a beervalanche, which is a damn fine way to die.$B$BSo that keg explodered soon as it hit the orphanage at the bottom of the hill, and I dove inta the mud puddle wit\' me mouth open, an\'... Come to think of it, I don\'t \'member how this story ends. Wanna see the tattoo?$B$B<Ol\' Durty Pete drops his pants.>', '', 38930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 22, 14, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back in the day \'afore the day, me and me mates didn\'t have much in the way of drinkin\' money, as is we spent our pay on booze an\' that didn\'t leave none left over for more casual drinkin\'.$B$BSo we decide we\'re gonna comm-an-deer one of them epic-sized kegs of ol\' Barkerstout from the loft of Barky\'s Brewpub.$B$BWe chopped the supports out with hatchets and that ol\' boy just up an\' ROLLED on out through the side of the thatch roof like a baby bird leavin\' the nest, but some sort of big round beer bird, that could crush a man.', '', 38929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me a story, Ol\' Durty Pete!', 'Tell me a story, Ol\' Durty Pete!', 38928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ain\'t the first time I been stuck up to me teef in a jungle that up an\' done ambushed me. I been all over the world, $gson:missy;, an\' I\'ll be hog-smacked if this one\'s gonna be the end of me.', '', 38927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] Just stay alert.  Any sign of Bloodhoof and we\'ll have a true fight on our hands.', '[ph] Just stay alert.  Any sign of Bloodhoof and we\'ll have a true fight on our hands.', 38926, 0, 0, 153, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] Not yet.  When I last talked to Tarakor, it should have started already.', '[ph] Not yet.  When I last talked to Tarakor, it should have started already.', 38925, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] Have you heard anything from the attack on Bloodhoof Village?', '[ph] Have you heard anything from the attack on Bloodhoof Village?', 38924, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] I just hope Stormsong was able to take out the Pretender.  With Baine dead, we could take some of these extra guard patrols down.', '[ph] I just hope Stormsong was able to take out the Pretender.  With Baine dead, we could take some of these extra guard patrols down.', 38923, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] Now that we have control, there are going to be some changes around here.', '[ph] Now that we have control, there are going to be some changes around here.\n', 38922, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] Without Cairne, the citizens of Thunder Bluff really didn\'t have much fight in them.', '[ph] Without Cairne, the citizens of Thunder Bluff really didn\'t have much fight in them.', 38921, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]Attacking Thunder Bluff was easier than expected.', '[ph]Attacking Thunder Bluff was easier than expected.', 38920, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]She must have been planning this for a long time.', '[ph]She must have been planning this for a long time.', 38919, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] And to think...no one even saw it coming.', '[ph] And to think...no one even saw it coming.', 38918, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve filled out all the paperwork for the auction house.', 'I\'ve filled out all the paperwork for the auction house.', 38917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can trust our auctioneers.', 'You can trust our auctioneers.', 38916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough\'a dis...Chief Sandscalp can\'t reward me if I\'m dead, yah? Farewell, mon...for good.', '', 38915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold! Sul\'thraze the Lasher be rejoined!', '', 38914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now dat Sang\'thraze is mine again, de only thing ya be findin\' here...is ya own fresh grave.', '', 38913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Joke\'s on you, mon. I found Jang\'thraze long ago. Had both of de halves...\'til some wily one come and steal one away in de night.', '', 38912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell me of the time when the Darkspear left Orgrimmar, Vol\'jin?  I need to see Garrosh\'s actions for myself.', 'Can you tell me of the time when the Darkspear left Orgrimmar, Vol\'jin?  I need to see Garrosh\'s actions for myself.', 38911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see ta it personally dat the Darkspear rise as a power in their own right.', '', 38910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'EeeKKeech - it stings! It crushes! $GHe:She; tricked us, kills $ghim:her;, kill!', 38909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, come on! Get over here!!!', 38908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits at Vol\'jin\'s feet.', '', 38906, 0, 9224, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And when tha time comes dat ya failure is complete and ya \"power\" is meaningless, I will be dere to end ya rule swiftly and silently.', '', 38905, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 20102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what exactly do you think that you are going to do about it?  Your threats are hollow.  Go slink away with the rest of your kind to the slums, I will endure your filth in my throne room no longer.', '', 38904, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 20509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are lucky that I don\'t gut you right here, whelp.  You are foolish to think that you can speak to your Warchief in such ways.', '', 38903, 0, 9224, 5, 65, 0, 20512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have sealed your fate, troll.', '', 38901, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 20510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know exactly what I\'ll be doin\' about it, son of Hellscream.  I\'ll watch and wait as ya people slowly become aware of ya ineptitude.  I\'ll laugh as dey grow ta despise ya as I do.', '', 38900, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 20101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be no Warchief of mine.  Ya not earned my respect and I\'ll not be seein\' tha Horde destroyed by ya foolish thirst for war.', '', 38899, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 20100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere be no question why, Garrosh.  He gave ya tha title because ya be Grom\'s son and because tha people be wantin\' a war hero.', '', 38898, 0, 9224, 5, 65, 0, 20098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t talk back to me, troll.  You know who was left in charge here.  Haven\'t you stopped to ask yourself why Thrall chose me instead of you?', '', 38897, 0, 9224, 25, 65, 0, 20508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You deserve to lose this land, for what your people did to us!  Now back off, or face the wrath of the worgen!', '', 38896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They come... <Snort> Pretty $r, yes? So pretty...', 38895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'New life from clay. Dead earth... reborn.', 38894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eekrala gree-kay. By blood and by thorn...', 38893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have sometin\' to show ya. It be easier to understand if ya see it yourself.', '', 38892, 0, 9224, 1, 65, 0, 20097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you wanna find de fabled swords of de Sandfury, eh?$B$BYa be ready ta kill for Sul\'thraze? Spill de blood across de sands? In search of treasure, of power?$B$BIf ya are...welcome to de desert, mon.', '', 38891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall\'s words be true. Dey always be. The Horde is much more den a few old, stubborn leaders and a handful of heroes from Northrend. The people be cryin\' Garrosh\'s name... at least for now.', '', 38890, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese be dark times, but our people will be stayin\' with tha Horde for tha good of all.  ', '', 38889, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm\'ka, old friend.', '', 38888, 0, 9223, 66, 65, 0, 20147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be strong and proud, youngblood.  Tha Darkspear will be honored ta have you fight beside d\'em.', '', 38887, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand, brotha. I will tink on this and be troublin\' ya no furtha. You have a world to be savin\'.', '', 38885, 0, 9223, 6, 65, 0, 20113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde cries for a hero of old. An orc of true blood that will bow to no human and bear no betrayal. A warrior that will make our people proud again. Garrosh can be that hero.', '', 38884, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For all my supposed wisdom, there have been moments that I\'ve barely been able to hold the Horde together. The Wrath Gate and Undercity displayed that clearly enough.', '', 38883, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must beg ya council, my friend.  I can\'t be standin\' by Garrosh while he be turnin\' our people against each other for tha sake of war.  My respect for you does not extend to dis new Horde... I am tinkin\' of leadin\' my people away.', '', 38882, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin, I chose Garrosh because he has the strength to lead our people in these trying times. ', '', 38881, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall!  I am glad ya be well.  Dere were rumors otherwise.', '', 38880, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed.  Someone did try to kill me, but that is not my greatest concern at this moment.  The world itself calls for my aid.', '', 38879, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve no love for Garrosh, dat much is sure, but leavin\' tha Horde is not a decision I be takin\' lightly.', '', 38878, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere\'s only one with tha answers I seek. Ya can stay and watch if ya like.', '', 38877, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tha Sea Witch is dead, our home is reclaimed, but our future still be uncertain.', '', 38876, 0, 9223, 1, 65, 0, 20108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood...more BLOOD!', '', 38875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hang on, $n! We have to get out of here, NOW!', 38874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve filled out my paperwork for the bank.', 'I\'ve filled out my paperwork for the bank.', 38873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, your money is safe with us.', 'Don\'t worry, your money is safe with us.', 38872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', 'What?', 38871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you trying to use?', 'What are you trying to use?', 38870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you need?', 'What do you need?', 38869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you need papers for?', 'What do you need papers for?', 38868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]To be standing in Thunder Bluff....OUR Thunder Bluff so soon after Cairne died is not luck.', '[ph]To be standing in Thunder Bluff....OUR Thunder Bluff so soon after Cairne died is not luck.', 38867, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] So soon though?  I do not think even she thought this invasion would go as swiftly as it did.', '[ph]Thinking about things?  What do YOU have to think about?', 38866, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]It is still fortunate for us.  Magatha has guided us well.  She knew this day would come.', '[ph]It is still fortunate for us.  Magatha has guided us well.  She knew this day would come.', 38865, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]Caire is dead?  It\'s hard to imagine.', '[ph]Caire is dead?  It\'s hard to imagine.', 38864, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be able to get back to camp on my own.', '', 38863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, thank you! Suffice it to say... Negotiations did proceed as planned.', '', 38862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Untying', 'Untying', 38861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n - help! The ropes ... please...', '', 38860, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]Citizens unwilling to pay will be refused access to the Auction services.', '[ph]Citizens unwilling to pay will be refused access to the Auction services.', 38859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To use the convienent Grimtotem Auctioneering services, you must have the permission of the great Magatha Grimtotem!', 'To use the convienent Grimtotem Auctioneering services, you must have the permission of the great Magatha Grimtotem!', 38858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]All money collected will be used for the betterment of the Horde.', '[ph]All money collected will be used for the betterment of the Horde.', 38857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]For a small fee, you can have an all access pass to either Grimtotem auctioneer.', '[ph]For a small fee, you can have an all access pass to either Grimtotem auctioneer.', 38856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]Attention Citizens of Thunder Bluff!', '[ph]Attention Citizens of Thunder Bluff!', 38855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s is ready to be captured!', '', 38854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]Purchase a permission slip from me and access to your vault will be granted.', '[ph]Purchase a permission slip from me and access to your vault will be granted.', 38853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]Citizens who refuse to pay this fee will not be allowed to use the banking services here on Thunder Bluff.', '[ph]Citizens who refuse to pay this fee will not be allowed to use the banking services here on Thunder Bluff.', 38852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]This fee ensures the use of the bank for a limited amount of time.  ', '[ph]This fee ensures the use of the bank for a limited amount of time.  ', 38851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]Citizens of Thunder Bluff! Our matriarch Magath requires citizens wanting to access their vault to pay a small service fee.  ', '[ph]Citizens of Thunder Bluff! Our superior matriarch Magath requires citizens wanting to access their vault to pay a small service fee.  ', 38850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang in there ol\' buddy!', '', 38849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop shooting you senile idiot! You\'re going to kill somebody!', 38848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay out of the way of Volcanoth\'s breath!', '', 38847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'magonna - git! Git! Horkin\' nit, unfh, DABBIT!', '', 38846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frappin\' cratchet! Sonnova HEY what!?', '', 38845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gol-Crawdad!?', '', 38844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gone, $c.  I have no need of you in my hunt.', 'Be gone, $c.  I have no need of you in my hunt.', 38843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to join the hunt, $n?', 'Have you come to join the hunt, $n?', 38842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this mess. I was told the Barrens would be... barren.$B$BThis jungle appeared overnight and has already swallowed up my camp and choked off the roads!', '', 38841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting. Very ... interesting.', '', 38840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now then, $n. Let\'s see what this what this crazy stick is capable of...', '', 38839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An ancient score is settled today.', 38838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vol\'jin rushed off in eagerness, but I can take us back to safety. Just give me the word when ya ready, mon.', 38837, 0, 11577, 275, 65, 0, 0, 21948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll send some watchers ta get his body so we can offer a proper farewell... I wish I could do more.', 38836, 0, 11577, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m afraid there\'s nothin\' I can do for our brother... her power tore away at his soul.', 38835, 0, 11577, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must be returnin\' ta Darkspear Hold. Please meet me there once Vanira is done with her healin\' of the boy.', '', 38834, 0, 11577, 1, 65, 0, 20123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I been waitin\' a long time for a chance to avenge my father. A great weight has been lifted from my shoulders.', '', 38833, 0, 11577, 1, 65, 0, 20122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DND] Have you filled out the proper paper work and paid the appropriate fees to gain access to the bank?', '[DND] Have you filled out the proper paper work and paid the appropriate fees to gain access to the bank?', 38832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have the proper certification to use the bank.', 'I have the proper certification to use the bank.', 38831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DND] Have you filled out the proper paper work and paid the appropriate fees to gain access to the auction house?', '[DND] Have you filled out the proper paper work and paid the appropriate fees to gain access to the auction house?', 38830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be done. Our ancient enemy is defeated.', '', 38829, 0, 11577, 1, 65, 0, 20121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sea Witch is \'ere, I can sense it. Stay and she\'s sure to come out of her hole soon enough.', '', 38828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The unfortunate soldier you find at the side of the road has been gutted with what appears to have been long knives. Rolling the body over, you notice teeth marks.>$B$B<Could wild animals have done this?> ', '', 38827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take care of her spirits! We be handlin\' Zar\'jira.', 38826, 0, 11577, 5, 65, 0, 0, 21944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s drawing power from the fires! Stamp out the braziers, quickly!', '', 38825, 0, 9218, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The waves shall rise and consume your tribe, Vol\'jin! You should never have returned!', 38824, 0, 11577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is not right - this is not how it was supposed to end!', 38823, 0, 11577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is this?! Release me!', 38822, 0, 11577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were a fool to touch my fires! When Vol\'jin falls, you know who dies next!', 38821, 0, 11577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! I will make your death slow and painful, little trolls.', 38820, 0, 11577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave the fire alone, pesky trolls! Just give up and die.', 38819, 0, 11577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits rise once again!', 'Spirits rise once again!', 38818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh. Ogre like eat bug. Get bug from west.', '', 38817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
