('', '', 38805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The silithid? Those things are disgusting and completely inedible...oh, whatever.', 38804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s sighs.', 38803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WHAT OGRE LIKE. WHAT GOOD FUN FOR GIVE OGRE.', 38802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, ogre. Now that your tribe\'s signed the proper paperwork, what can we do to actually convince all of them to come do work for us?', 38801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
