('Maximillian, I am ready to ride.', 'Maximillian, I am ready to ride.', 38724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so glad that you asked, $n!$B$BNo one ever asks how stuff works. It\'s just here, gimme that, I\'m gonna blow stuff up. Or, don\'t bore me with the details, just let me point and shoot. Or, worse yet, who cares how it works, is it a bigger explosion than last time?$B$BI swear sometimes, I could just scream, you know? It\'s like I\'m always doing all of Hobart\'s work for him, but I never get any of the credit! I have got to be the most underappreciated, overworked, and underpaid tinkers assistant ever!$B$BWait, what did you ask about?', 38723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
