('Izzy, you don\'t happen to know where Yngwie\'s body is, do you?', 'Izzy, you don\'t happen to know where Yngwie\'s body is, do you?', 38598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
