('Great. We\'re not gutless, we\'re incompetent.', '', 38596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been the greatest honor of my life to serve with you, Hummel.', '', 38595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apothecaries! Give your life for the Crown!', '', 38594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time, Frye!  Attack!', '', 38593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baxter! Get in here and help! NOW!', '', 38592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But what does it matter.  It is time for this to end.', '', 38591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invocation of Blood jumps to Prince Taldaram!', '', 38590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invocation of Blood jumps to Prince Valanar!', '', 38589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invocation of Blood jumps to Prince Keleseth!', '', 38588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did they bother to tell you who I am and why I am doing this?', '', 38586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assuming we make it through this, it\'ll take a month to clean the brains off my brasswork.', '', 38585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye aye sir! Immediately, sir!', '', 38584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mister Blaine? Flag down a gryphon for $n if you please.', '', 38583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Godspeed, $c!', '', 38582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain, I need a ride back to Northwatch Hold.', 'Captain, I need a ride back to Northwatch Hold.', 38581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hands topside! Run \'em through!', '', 38580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PR\'PR TA DI, GOBIN!!!', '', 38579, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 3417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t even know how to use this weapon... but I reckon if I stand here looking menacing, the worgen might go somewhere else.', 38577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadows amass and swarm around $n!', 'Shadows amass and swarm around $n!', 38576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not here on vacation, pal. Noggenfogger sent me down here with a mission: Find out how to turn a profit on these silithid, or wipe \'em clean.$B$BIf a $r like you wants to do some favors for the Steamwheedle Cartel, I could use a hand.', '', 38575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Admiral, can I get a ride to the Blackpool?', 'Admiral, can I get a ride to the Blackpool?', 38574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hold fast. If Northwatch falls, there is nothing to our backs but the sea!', '', 38573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The other captives are up in the volcano... they\'re being sacrificed, or worse, zombiefied!', 'The other captives are up in the volcano... they\'re being sacrificed, or worse, zombiefied!', 38572, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They took the others up into the volcano. Some to turn into zombies, some to sacrifice to their turtle god, Volcanoth!', 'They took the others up into the volcano. Some to turn into zombies, some to sacrifice to their turtle god, Volcanoth!', 38571, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really can\'t thank you enough!', 'I really can\'t thank you enough!', 38570, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gotta get out of here before they catch me again!', 'I gotta get out of here before they catch me again!', 38569, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were trying to change me into a zombie!!!', 'They were trying to change me into a zombie!!!', 38568, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I felt my life slipping out of me.', 'I felt my life slipping out of me.', 38567, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was a goner for sure!', 'I thought I was a goner for sure!', 38566, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free! I owe you my life!', 'I\'m free! I owe you my life!', 38565, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The living... here?!', 'The living... here?!', 38564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16925, 16925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly! We\'ll ambush them from behind!', 'Quickly! We\'ll ambush them from behind!', 38563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16924, 16924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... cannot escape us!', 'You... cannot escape us!', 38562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16923, 16923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tay\'kn gobins!', '', 38560, 0, 9192, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('F\'dun ta gobins ta da Beeg Badda!', '', 38558, 0, 9192, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Admiral Aubrey is expecting you upstairs, $gsir:ma\'am;.', '', 38557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meesa na watun ta longa!', '', 38556, 0, 9192, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Echuta, gobin!', '', 38555, 0, 9192, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gobin ookum ta z\'mbee!', '', 38554, 0, 9192, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Killum gobins! Na cayno da BOOM!', '', 38553, 0, 9192, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GOBIN!!!', '', 38552, 0, 9189, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s an opening up ahead. GO NOW!', 38551, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17059, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aaagh! It burns! What sorcery is this!?', 38550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doomed for eternity!', '', 38549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damnation!', '', 38548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The swell of souls will not be abated! You only delay the inevitable.', '', 38547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great news, everyone!', '', 38546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was unexpected!', '', 38545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrm, interesting...', '', 38544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You won\'t impede our escape, fiend! Keep the undead off me while I bring this barrier down.', 38543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I grow tired of these games, Arthas! Your walls can\'t stop me!', 38542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another barrier? Stand strong, champions. I will bring the wall down.', 38541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No wall can hold the Banshee Queen. Keep the undead at bay, heroes. I will tear this barrier down!', 38540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Your barriers can\'t hold us back much longer, monster! I will shatter them all!', 38539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re almost there... Don\'t give up!', 38538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another ice wall! Keep the undead from interrupting my incantations so that I may bring this wall down.', 38537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will destroy this barrier. You must hold the undead back!', 38536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t come in here all dirty like that. You need that nasty flesh scrubbed off first!', '', 38535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not disturb the investigation protocol.', '', 38534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall not contaminate the investigation site.', '', 38533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not interfere.', '', 38532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, you gotta get in there and save our people!', 38531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, $c! Admiral Aubrey is expecting you up above.', '', 38530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our souls will never be freed.', 'Our souls will never be freed.', 38529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is but a brief repose...', 'This is but a brief repose...', 38528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All serve the master in death.', 'All serve the master in death.', 38527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not our final rest.', 'This is not our final rest.', 38526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our torment is eternal.', 'Our torment is eternal.', 38525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The living do not belong here.', 'The living do not belong here.', 38524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you seek death in this place?', 'Why do you seek death in this place?', 38523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once more we fight for our master.', 'Once more we fight for our master.', 38522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why hello there, fellow member of the Alliance!$B$BAs an official representative of Gadgetzan, I\'m here to make sure we poor scattered gnomes can peacefully co-exist with the Steamwheedle goblins here in Gadgetzan! We may even be open to tolerating the presence of their new Horde goblin friends.$B$BI\'m sure we can all come to an agreeable decision with your help!', 38521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in death we serve.', 'Even in death we serve.', 38520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our master commands us.', 'Our master commands us.', 38519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who... goes there...?', '', 38518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... awaken!', '', 38517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, intruders! None shall interfere with the Cult\'s plans!', '', 38516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You thirst for blood!', 'You thirst for blood!', 38515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure everything is ready.  The orcs\' emissary is ready to meet Sylvanas inside the cathedral.', '', 38514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time to join the fray, $n!  With you on our side the scales will surely tip in our favor!', '', 38513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh- where am I...?  What a nightmare I have had....  But this is no time to reflect, I have much information to report!', '', 38512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('', 'Was there truly no way to save him?$b$bI fear I shall always wonder.', 38511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s truly gone, isn\'t he?$b$bI... I can feel it.', 38510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r. I sense some confusion at my presence here. The others harbor suspicion as well, and I cannot blame them, after what my brethren have put them through.$B$BMuch has happened since the events at the Sunwell, little of it good. And so it falls to me to pick up the pieces, and attempt to salvage the pride of my flight. There is much to say, and more to do, but know this: Not all in the Blue Dragonflight blame the mortal races of Azeroth for the troubles that have befallen the world.$B$BSome of us have more sense than that.', '', 38509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the beginning AND the end, mortals. None may enter the master\'s sanctum!', '', 38508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you attacking him for? The dangerous one is over there!', '', 38507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve changed my mind, go get that one instead!', '', 38506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, that one! That one! Get that one!', '', 38505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arms and legs are in short supply! Thanks for your contribution!', '', 38504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could probably use these parts.', '', 38503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our work must not be interrupted! Ick, take care of them!', '', 38502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Professor Putricide cast |cFF00FF00Malleable Goo!|r', '', 38501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast Unstable Experiment!', '', 38500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_herb_evergreenmoss.blp:16|t%s cast |cFF00FF00Malleable Goo!|r', '', 38499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cast |cFFFF7F00Choking Gas Bomb!|r', '', 38498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mortals, you have saved me from a fate worse than death. Left to their devices, the sorcerers of the Lich King would have broken my will eventually, and condemned me to a tortured eternity of unlife. Ahead of you lies one who was not so fortunate: the once-proud consort of Malygos, Sindragosa.$B$BMortally wounded after Neltharion\'s betrayal and left to die alone in the snows of Icecrown, she exists now as a being of pure hatred. And yet, beneath those layers of malevolence still remains the noble spirit of a dragon queen. I believe there is yet hope that Sindragosa\'s soul may find peaceful respite.', 38497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Push them back!', '', 38496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!', '', 38495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time is up, Forsaken scum!', '', 38494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gilneas will prevail!', '', 38493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will attempt to seal the scar, $n. Make sure nothing from the other side makes its way through!', '', 38492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another soul to strengthen the host!', '', 38491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fodder for the engine.', '', 38490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will sever your soul from your body!', '', 38489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vortex of the harvested calls to you!', '', 38488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Devourer awaits...', '', 38487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, a captive audience!', '', 38486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LIAM!!  NO!!!', '', 38485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us take back our city!', 'Let us take back our city!', 38484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time to take back Gilneas City is at hand.', '', 38483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am not authorized to answer that question.  I am, however, permitted to offer you a suggestion:$b$bSeek out Brann Bronzebeard.$b$bHe has already learned much of what there is to know about us, and he is teetering on the verge of another discovery.  Help him, and he may help you uncover the knowledge that you desire.', 38482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When the cataclysm struck Azeroth, it disrupted the cloaking mechanism that kept this terrace hidden.  At that point, it was only a matter of time until the intelligent races discovered me here.$b$bThis was a scenario that, quite honestly, we did not foresee.  It required us to perform some new tests.  And you, $n, are my test subject.', 38481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not exactly.  In fact, many of the creatures here in the crater existed long before my master arrived... but some did not.$b$bNevertheless, we observe them all, without prejudice.', 38480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Simple stimulus-response tests.  Normally my kind does not interfere with the matters of Azeroth, but here in Un\'Goro, we are free to take a more direct approach.  As Un\'Goro is the experimental ground of the Titans, it is our right to do so.$b$bFor example, say Khaz\'goroth wants to know what happens when one of his creations is exposed to a sulfurous hot spring.  He could wait for millennia, observing, and waiting for the creature to accidentally stumble and fall in.  Or, he could place the creature in the water himself.$b$bIn Un\'Goro, we may do so.', 38479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am observing.  It is my charge to watch over Un\'Goro, and I do so from this spot.$b$bI am also performing tests, and recording the results.  These tests allow me to observe that which most interests me.', 38478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am Nablya, apprentice to Khaz\'goroth and envoy to Un\'Goro Crater.  I am known as the Watcher.$b$bI stand here in the place of my master, who has since left Azeroth.  He once stood in this very spot when he shaped many of his creations.', 38477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you Nablya.', 'Thank you Nablya.', 38476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nablya, I must ask... did Khaz\'goroth create me and the rest of my race?', 'Nablya, I must ask... did Khaz\'goroth create me and the rest of my race?', 38475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you telling me all of this?', 'Why are you telling me all of this?', 38474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His creations?  So you\'re saying that all the creatures here in the crater are Khaz\'goroth\'s creations?', 'His creations?  So you\'re saying that all the creatures here in the crater are Khaz\'goroth\'s creations?', 38473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tests?  What kind of tests?', 'Tests?  What kind of tests?', 38472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here?', 'What are you doing here?', 38471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?', 'Who are you?', 38470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, well, what do we have here...? You must know many secrets....', 38469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eep!', '', 38468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Un\'Goro Crater serves a very specific purpose, $n.  It is now time for you to learn that purpose.', 38467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feast, my minions!', '', 38466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hrm, well I\'ve come this far, but now how am I going to get a hold of those samples...?', 38465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BY THE MIGHT OF THE LICH KING!', '', 38464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, did you hear the one about the $r $c?  OK, here goes:$b$bA $r $c walks into a cave and starts fighting gorillas.  The leader of the gorillas says, \"Hey, why are you doing that?!\"  So then the $r $c says, \"A goblin told me to.\"$b$bThe gorilla leader says, \"Do you do everything that goblins tell you to do?\"  And the $r $c says, \"Yes, because I\'m stupid and smelly and I walk on two legs.\"$b$bPretty funny, huh?  Hmm... maybe it needs some work...', '', 38463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Worthless spy, if there were a single morsel of information inside that hollow vessel you call a skull, you would have coughed it up by now. I tire of this exercise. Now perish!', 38462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '', 38461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh....', '', 38460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ack!', '', 38459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arg!', '', 38458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior-Matic NX-01 is online.$B$BInsert coins for further instructional training.', '', 38457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior-Matic NX-01 destroy!', '', 38456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve got the moves, $n. Now use them!$B$BOr are you looking for some new moves?', 38455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve got the moves, $n. Use them!', 38454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These pygmies are cutting into profits!$B$BSeeking enlightenment, $n?', 38453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These pygmies are cutting into profits!', 38452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These little things are a pain in my backside!$B$BSo, you need some training?', '', 38451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These little things are a pain in my backside!', '', 38450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place seems nice enough, I suppose. Needs a little elbow grease.$B$BYou looking for a job, $n?', '', 38449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you help with this please? I don\'t have unlimited mana.$B$BOf course, if you need some training....', '', 38448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you help with this please? I don\'t have unlimited mana.', '', 38447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little help here? Or do you need more training, $n?$B$BI\'m kinda busy at the moment if you hadn\'t noticed.', '', 38446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little help here?', '', 38445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just like old times, eh, $n?$B$BI\'m not too busy here to train you. These guys are creampuffs.', '', 38444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just like old times, eh, $n?', '', 38443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each moment you tarry here, Quel\'Delar drinks in the evil of this place.', '', 38442, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish!', '', 38441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Lady!  Should I order my men to stop the deployment of the Plague?  Or are we to continue as planned?', '', 38440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you transport me to the pylon up above?', 'Could you transport me to the pylon up above?', 38439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flora of Un\'Goro Crater are quite remarkable, to be sure.  Wouldn\'t you agree, $n?', '', 38438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you please resummon the Un\'Goro Examinant?', 'Could you please resummon the Un\'Goro Examinant?', 38437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Challenge and defeat another Bloodpetal in one-on-one combat.', 'Challenge and defeat another Bloodpetal in one-on-one combat.', 38436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want you to pit the Bloodpetal against one another.', 'I want you to pit the Bloodpetal against one another.', 38435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly high up above the jungle canopy.$b$bUse Pterrordash to temporarily increase your flight speed.$b$b|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_dash.blp:32|t', 'Fly high up above the jungle canopy.$b$bUse Pterrordash to temporarily increase your flight speed.$b$b|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_dash.blp:32|t', 38434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want you to test the limits of your wings.', 'I want you to test the limits of your wings.', 38433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with one of each type - Gorilla, Stomper, and Thunderer -$band learn what they have to teach you.', 'Speak with one of each type - Gorilla, Stomper, and Thunderer -$band learn what they have to teach you.', 38432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want you to speak with the local gorillas.', 'I want you to speak with the local gorillas.', 38431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_monsterfang_02.blp:32|t  Use Bite on 5 humanoid targets.$B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bone_02.blp:32|t Use Bony Armor to increase your armor.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_monsterfang_02.blp:32|t  Use Bite on 5 humanoid targets.$B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bone_02.blp:32|t Use Bony Armor to increase your armor.', 38430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want you to test your Bite skill on the people of Marshal\'s Stand.', 'I want you to test your Bite skill on the people of Marshal\'s Stand.', 38429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will deliver my report to our leader, then.  By your leave, my lady.', '', 38428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sound very confident, your Majesty.  I seriously hope you do not plan to use the Plague.  Garrosh has explicitly forbidden it.', '', 38427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears you\'re losing control of Gilneas, Sylvanas.  Garrosh fears he\'s going to have to carry out this invasion himself.', '', 38426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What kind of question is that?  Of course we\'re deploying the Plague as planned!  Let the Gilneans enjoy their small victory.  Not even their bones will remain by tomorrow.', 38425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go with honor, General.', 38424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'d do well to watch your tone, General.  Neither you nor Garrosh have anything to worry about.  We\'ve ceased all production of the Plague, as he ordered.  We\'d never deploy it without his permission.', 38423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can assure Garrosh that this is a minor setback.  Our victory in Gilneas will be absolute.', 38422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go forth, and defeat the Prince of Darkness.', '', 38421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wield this mighty weapon and direct the souls that empower it.', '', 38420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now...', '', 38419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have withstood the torment of the Lich King himself, and now Shadowmourne is yours.', '', 38418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where most would falter, you have overcome.', '', 38417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is complete.', '', 38416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand.  Thank you.', 'I understand.  Thank you.', 38415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SCOURGE! INCOMING!', 'SCOURGE! INCOMING!', 38414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 7274, 7274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lashers to the south will eat small creatures, like frogs and parrots.  We, the gorillas, will eat the lashers.  And dinosaurs will eat gorillas.  All this is honorable and natural.$b$bThe humans and orcs also hunt the gorilla, but they take the skin and leave the body to rot.  This is why we attack the humans and orcs.', '', 38413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Individual strength is important, but tribal strength is more so.  Our tribe is only as strong as its weakest member.', '', 38412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few of our tribe have harnessed the power of thunder.  We use it to defend ourselves against invaders, whether human, orc, or dinosaur.$b$bOur thunder stuns all dinosaurs, you know.', '', 38411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you teach me, Gorilla?', 'What can you teach me, Gorilla?', 38410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you teach me, Stomper?', 'What can you teach me, Stomper?', 38409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you teach me, Thunderer?', 'What can you teach me, Thunderer?', 38408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to observe?  Would you like a coconut?', '', 38407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, outsider, to our home.', '', 38406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nablya, is that you?', '', 38405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?  What do you want with our tribe?', '', 38404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick!  Hide in the water!', '', 38403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear that, $n?  Sylvanas is headed to the cathedral.  Let\'s hurry!', '', 38402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do our best not to be seen, $n.', '', 38401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow Tobias Mistmantle into the Cathedral District.', '', 38400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us go at once.  We will track Sylvanas down.  For Gilneas!', '', 38399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, $n?', '', 38398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to return to The Shaper\'s Terrace.', 'I\'d like to return to The Shaper\'s Terrace.', 38397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go to The Shaper\'s Terrace.', 'I\'m ready to go to The Shaper\'s Terrace.', 38396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My patron requests your presence.', '', 38395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you understand now, $n?', 38394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to return to Marshal\'s Stand, please.', 'I\'d like to return to Marshal\'s Stand, please.', 38393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is nothing here for you.  Now go.', 38392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go ahead. Harvest your specimens.', 'Go ahead. Harvest your specimens.', 38391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is incredible! You\'re covered in potent, virulent, fantastic blight! Please, allow me to harvest these pristine samples. I will remove any lingering infection from your allies as well, and reward you all for your bravery and self-sacrifice in the name of medicine! Let me know if you are ready to proceed.\n\n[Before proceeding, make sure that ALL raid members are nearby in order for them to receive credit for your accomplishment.]', 38390, 0, 9153, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alchemist, I am covered with living blight!', 'Alchemist, I am covered with living blight!', 38389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alchemist, I am covered with living blight!', 'Alchemist, I am covered with living blight!', 38388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like you\'ve had a fun time playing with Festergut, but to harvest a proper specimen I\'m afraid I will need BOTH strains of blight at the same time!', 38387, 0, 9153, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like you\'ve had a fun time playing with Rotface, but to harvest a proper specimen I\'m afraid I will need BOTH strains of blight at the same time!', 38386, 0, 9152, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After countless failures of our agents to secure workable samples of Scourge blight for analysis, I\'ve come up to the front lines myself to oversee the efforts. Like they say, if you want a job done right....', 38385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoah, what\'s that?', 38384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lady, I think I hear Arthas coming. Whatever you\'re going to do, do it quickly.', 'My lady, I think I hear Arthas coming. Whatever you\'re going to do, do it quickly.', 38383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t tempt me! Do you even know what\'s in those things?', '', 38382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, naga leader, come on out from hiding and surrender in the name of $n and the Bilgewater Cartel!', '', 38381, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t want any trouble. Just keep our path clear and everything will be fine. Nobody needs to get hurt. Especially me!', '', 38380, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re planning on having a special naga appreciation sale after your surrender is all wrapped up.  Thirty percent off most goods we have in stock. Red light savings on Kaldorei artifacts today only!', '', 38379, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody make any sudden movements! We\'ll just negotiate your surrender and leave peaceably.', '', 38378, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know you were getting ready to attack us. You brought this on yourselves.', '', 38377, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to surrender to the Bilgewater Cartel!', '', 38376, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got your hatchlings. You better not attack us if you know what\'s good for you!', '', 38375, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You naga keep your distance. We\'re not kidding around here!', '', 38374, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out of our way, or your hatchlings get it!', '', 38373, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We took back our city... we took back...', '', 38372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it, father...', '', 38371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a waste.  That arrow\'s poison was not meant to be wasted on your whelp.  We\'ll meet again, Genn!', 38370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FATHER!!!', '', 38369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see how brave Gilneas gets on without its stubborn leader!', 38368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No way in hell I\'m staying out of this fight.  Let\'s go!', 38367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 19685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough!', 38366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SYLVANAS!!', '', 38365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Block their retreat, Liam!  We\'ve got them right where we want them!', '', 38364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast Slime Spray!', '', 38363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abominations are blocking the way towards the military district!  This won\'t be easy.', '', 38362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us join your father\'s force\'s, Liam.  They\'ll need our help against Sylvanas.', '', 38361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crowley\'s troops are up ahead!  Press on!', '', 38360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, young $n, you will die!', '', 38359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 15140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, dude, this does not look good. I\'m out of here!', '', 38358, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ready to make their leader surrender, $g buddy : lady;? Okay, here we go.', '', 38357, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got these little hellions on a short leash, $n. The naga won\'t attack us while we have their hatchlings.', '', 38356, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cry out in torment... Let your pain overcome your might...', 'Cry out in torment... Let your pain overcome your might...', 38355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He watches your every move...', 'He watches your every move...', 38354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death consumes you...', 'Death consumes you...', 38353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release yourself from the chains of life...', 'Release yourself from the chains of life...', 38352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in... to the cold embrace of death...', 'Give in... to the cold embrace of death...', 38351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King is unstoppable...', 'The Lich King is unstoppable...', 38350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I care nothing for your threats or these naga. Prepare to be removed from existence.', '', 38349, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot escape the Master\'s Wrath...', 'You cannot escape the Master\'s Wrath....', 38348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Master\'s will remains inviolate...', 'The Master\'s will remains inviolate...', 38347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little goblins? I remember when your race was created.', '', 38346, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a sight for sore eyes, Lorna.  Let\'s get those cannons manned!  The rest of you, lure the abominations into the open!', '', 38345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve dug my own grave...', '', 38344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll turn you into a fossil, $r!', '', 38343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense.  Have I hired a blind squire?  There are dragons everywhere.$b$bMy neighbor Spark refers to them as \"dinosaurs\", but I know a dragon when I see one.  They must be slain.', '', 38342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fair question.$b$bOne might check the perimeter of the hot springs.  Or one might look for signal fires up in the cliffs to the west.  Finally, the path to Silithus, far to the north, is often wrought with danger.$b$bThose would be the places I\'d check.', '', 38341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t see any dragons anywhere.', 'I don\'t see any dragons anywhere.', 38340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where would one go about finding damsels?', 'Where would one go about finding damsels?', 38339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHO DARES?!', '', 38338, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 15140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was saved by my last disciple, Muyoh, and a band of adventurers. I considered the entire incident a failure. It wasn\'t until the Cataclysm occured that I realized I\'d been far too successful!$B$BWhen the Barrens was cracked apart, a great font of underground water was breached and flowed up to the surface, full of the energies it was imbued with in the Wailing Caverns. Life immediately sprung from the earth around it, and the animals thrived...and then it continued to grow, uncontrollably, unchecked.$B$BNow I have to answer for my arrogance in thinking I could dictate the flow and shape of nature myself. This overgrowth must be stopped, before it chokes out the natural wildlife entirely.', '', 38337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you escape?', 'How did you escape?', 38336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I came upon what I can only describe as an overwhelming corruption within the Emerald Dream. An unending nightmare that seized me in its claws and tore at my very mind. I could not break free of its grasp; my disciples were unable to wake me.$B$BWhatever this corruption was, it found its way into our world through my body. I did indeed channel its energies into the Wailing Caverns, and its horrible influence twisted the wildlife there into chaotic, deviate forms. Even my disciples were affected; their minds overcome by madness and savagery, they took on the forms of serpents, and called themselves the Druids of the Fang.', '', 38335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened?', 'What happened?', 38334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My plan was to connect these underground waters directly to the Emerald Dream itself. With my faithful disciples, I journeyed deep within the Wailing Caverns, settled into meditation, and entered the Dream. Through my own body, this world was connected to it.$B$BIt was there that everything went wrong.', '', 38333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what did you do?', 'So what did you do?', 38332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While studying the land, I discovered a cave that stretched deep beneath the earth. These waterways carried underground rivers for miles beneath the parched savannah above. I named them the Wailing Caverns, for the howls made by the wind and steam as they coursed through its depths.$B$BThis would be the instrument of revival, I thought. The water had already bubbled to the surface as small, lush oases throughout the Barrens...if it were imbued, enhanced, this growth could spread across the entire land.', '', 38331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How?', 'How?', 38330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you know that the Barrens was once a lush forest? Thousands of years ago, before the first Sundering, it was verdant and thriving, watched over by the Kaldorei. But when the continents were torn apart, and this land became separated as what we call Kalimdor, this valley of nature became a harsh, sun-scorched plain.$B$BWhen I first learned this, I saw it as a great tragedy. I decided I would find a way to regrow the forests once more.', '', 38329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened here?', 'What happened here?', 38328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heya, $n. I\'m sure glad that you\'re here. This is turning into a mess.', '', 38327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We came here to Un\'Goro with one objective in mind: profit.  My associates and I are always looking for business partners, if you\'re interested.', '', 38326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you interested in making some money?', 38325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 38324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squealer take this land! Tauren will burn!', '', 38323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The villagers were thankful to have Emberstone back.  They brought us a little something to help against the Forsaken!', 38322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 19684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the bulk of Undercity\'s forces deployed to Vengeance Landing in Northrend, the Warchief has sent us to reinforce the city\'s defenses.', 'With the bulk of Undercity\'s forces deployed to Vengeance Landing in Northrend, the Warchief has sent us to reinforce the city\'s defenses.', 38321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While Varimathras is, uh... away, I\'ve been assigned to assist Captain Bragor in his duties.', '', 38320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varimathras? No, he hasn\'t reported in for some time. No doubt he\'s off on an errand of importance for his queen.', '', 38319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya were foolish to come \'ere, Sea Witch. Ya escaped our vengeance once, but the Darkspear Tribe will not abide ya trespassin\' again.', '', 38318, 0, 11577, 1, 65, 0, 20119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Vol\'jin.', 'I am ready, Vol\'jin.', 38317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She has returned. Tha revenge of the Darkspear finally comes to pass dis day.$B$BLet me know when ya ready, $n. We\'ll not let her slip away again.', '', 38316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Colossus burrows underground!', '', 38315, 0, 11621, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poison Explosion incoming!  Take cover behind something!', '', 38314, 0, 11621, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, user.  We prepare for escape protocol.  You use mount now, if you have one.', '', 38313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c. We shaman have gathered here at Firestone Point to watch over the land and tend to its wounds.', 38312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My achy bones. Achy knees. Achy face. I shoulda stayed in school I shoulda.', '', 38311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I came over here to see if we could open up trade with these naga. Their reply wasn\'t very nice.', 38310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, $c! Just up ahead you\'ll find Honor\'s Stand, the Alliance\'s only link between Stonetalon and the coast.$B$BThe road\'s a treacherous one, though. I speak from experience.', '', 38309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Honor\'s Stand, $c! We ripped this valley from the claws of the Horde, but keeping this chokepoint open has proven to be another matter entirely.', 38308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad you\'re out here with us, $n. It\'s not easy getting stuff from naga!', '', 38307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For we are all born of you, and shall all return to you.', '', 38306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch over her as she has watched over us; let her look down on us with joy, through the eternal gaze of An\'she and Mu\'sha, until we too join her in death.', '', 38305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May her spirit fly to you swiftly; may the winds carry her gently, and the grass whisper her name.', '', 38304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earth Mother, into your arms we give one of our own. She is Unaya Hawkwind, my mother, and Greatmother to us all; the wisest of our tribe.', '', 38303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is my role to test our young initiates on the ways of the hunt.$B$BAnd that hasn\'t changed. Today, the quilboar are our prey.', 38302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to test our entire raid.', 'I want to test our entire raid.', 38301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR DOLORIA!', '', 38300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DRAGON, I SHALL RUN YOU THROUGH!', '', 38299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DRAGON!', '', 38298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A DRAGON!', '', 38297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, that does smell pretty... Hey! Stop spraying that thing at me!', '', 38296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lady, thank you for coming to our aid. I assure you that we\'ll do whatever we can to help.', '', 38295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are weak Vol\'jin, like your father was weak. Today I will finish what I started long ago - the Darkspear shall be wiped from existence!', 38294, 0, 11577, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, the backup I\'ve been waiting for! I prepared the paperwork that Snagglebolt requested. All that remains is for someone to serve it.', '', 38293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not let our grief weaken us. Our people will stand strong against the invaders.', '', 38292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you really think you could corner me this easily?', '', 38291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On second thought, keep the whole bag. I have to, uh, get going.', '', 38290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Here\'s a little somethin\' extra since I\'ll be away.', '', 38289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the great cut and shave, buddy.', '', 38288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... Don\'t think I don\'t see you. Leave me alone!', '', 38287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those\'ll net me a nice profit when I return from the South Seas.', '', 38286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right, I\'d like to list some of these \'fireworks\'.', '', 38285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear I must now depart you and your ex-phoenix.  Light be with you!', '', 38284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Dire Strait or the Mechashark X-Steam will mysteriously fall apart.', '', 38282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The quilboar will pay!', 'The quilboar will pay!', 38280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can move again!', 'I can move again!', 38279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Earth Mother!', 'Thank the Earth Mother!', 38278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squire!  I understand you are newly trained, but must I tell you not to kill the spirits of the Light?', '', 38277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you staring at? Haven\'t you ever seen a genius before?', '', 38276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go forth, my beautiful angel! Ah, it is so very sad when one\'s children leave the nest, isn\'t it?', '', 38275, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s alive, $n. It\'s alive!', '', 38274, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I accept your blessing.', '', 38273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squire!  Please stand next to me as I request the blessing of this Light-blessed spirit.', '', 38272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, I humbly request that you cease venting your hostility \'pon my good squire.', '', 38271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, I entreat you to stop buffeting my squire with punches and kicks.', '', 38270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, please find it in your heart to forgive my squire, for I see that you are smiting him.', '', 38269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I request that you summon birds to sing pleasant meadow-tunes into my Doloria\'s ears, while she sleeps.', '', 38268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I also ask you to shine your glorious light upon the immaculate face of my lady Doloria.', '', 38267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I also ask you to sprinkle wildflowers around the feet of my beautiful Doloria, where\'er she may walk.', '', 38266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light, grant us the ability to bring Un\'Goro\'s dragons to their demise.', '', 38265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light, give us the courage we need to enter battle with Un\'Goro\'s corrupted dragons.', '', 38264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light, give us the strength we need to defeat the vile broodmother of Un\'Goro.', '', 38263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi mon, it reeks of bad fish in \'ere.', '', 38262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow. Ya even ugly for a naga.', '', 38261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya about to be darkspeared.', '', 38260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya mest with da wrong trolls, fishhead.', '', 38259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go suck on a trident.', '', 38258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I fished ya up, I\'d throw ya back. Waste of good fish meat.', '', 38257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die snakefish!', '', 38256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya momma was bait fish.', '', 38255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maximillian, I am ready for more adventure.', 'Maximillian, I am ready for more adventure.', 38254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This\'ll teach you to mind your own business!', '', 38253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorerot crush puny worgen!!', '', 38251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a few ideas on how to help heal the overgrowth, $c.$B$BUnfortunately, Naralex is so upset, he refuses to take any more chances.', '', 38250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Professor Putricide has removed your mutation!', '', 38249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A foul wind blows from the East, $c.', '', 38248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear it beeping very faintly.  The fossil must be very, very far away.', 'You hear it beeping very faintly.  The fossil must be very, very far away.', 38247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is beeping very faintly.  You are still quite far away.', 'It is beeping very faintly.  You are still quite far away.', 38246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is beeping quietly every 5 seconds or so.', 'It is beeping quietly every 5 seconds or so.', 38245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is beeping regularly, about once every two seconds.', 'It is beeping regularly, about once every two seconds.', 38244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is beeping regularly, about once a second.', 'It is beeping regularly, about once a second.', 38243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is beeping loudly, suggesting that you are only a few paces away.', 'It is beeping loudly, suggesting that you are only a few paces away.', 38242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is now flashing brightly.  You\'re very close!', 'It is now flashing brightly.  You\'re very close!', 38241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is beeping and flashing wildly.  Dig here!', 'It is beeping and flashing wildly.  Dig here!', 38240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the northeast of here.', 'The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the northeast of here.', 38239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the east of here.', 'The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the east of here.', 38238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the southeast of here.', 'The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the southeast of here.', 38237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the south of here.', 'The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the south of here.', 38236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the southwest of here.', 'The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the southwest of here.', 38235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the west of here.', 'The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the west of here.', 38234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the northwest of here.', 'The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the northwest of here.', 38233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From up here you can see the full scope of the cataclysm\'s destruction. It is chilling to see just how fragile our world really is.', '', 38232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the north of here.', 'The Fossil-Finder 3000 indicates that there is a large fossil to the north of here.', 38231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn back, mon. The naga be controlin\' the island to the north. It not safe for ya there.', 'Turn back, mon. The naga be controlin\' the island to the north. It not safe for ya there.', 38230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It won\'t.', 'It won\'t.', 38229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lost?$B$BI am deeply disappointed, $n.$B$BThat ring was one of a kind, crafted out of the remnants of the armor of our fallen heroes and the purified metal from our enemy\'s blades.$B$BLet\'s not allow this to happen again.', '', 38228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appear to have lost my ring.', 'I appear to have lost my ring.', 38227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ormus, what happened to your eyes?', 'Ormus, what happened to your eyes?', 38226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A self-inflicted wound, friend.  I could not bear to look upon a world where I\'d committed so many horrors under the Lich King\'s grasp.$B$BIt was my first step towards redemption, and if my sins are unforgivable, then I will attempt to atone for them for the rest of my life.', '', 38225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was once a paladin, $n.  Now the Light shuns me, for my sins are too great.$B$BI will aid my allies as best I can, but never again will I wield the powers of darkness.', '', 38224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be flung!  To safety!', '', 38223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kalu\'ak Fishing Derby has ended!  If you caught a shark, please bring it to me within the hour.', '', 38222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kalu\'ak Fishing Derby ends in 5 minutes!', '', 38221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only 10 minutes remain before the Kalu\'ak Fishing Derby ends!', '', 38220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has won the Kalu\'ak Fishing Derby!', '', 38219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kalu\'ak Fishing Derby has begun!  The first person to bring a blacktip shark to me in Dalaran will be declared the winner!  Blacktip sharks can be caught anywhere you can catch a pygmy suckerfish.', '', 38218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kalu\'ak Fishing Derby starts in 5 minutes!', '', 38217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kalu\'ak Fishing Derby starts in 10 minutes!', '', 38216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kalu\'ak Fishing Derby starts in 20 minutes!', '', 38215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nevertheless, you are now freed from the mountains\' grip and safe from harm.  Marshal\'s Stand lies to the east, I believe.', '', 38214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before I take my leave, you must be told that it is not by my fault that you lay stretched on the ground, but by the fault of my squire.', '', 38213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, cry not, as you fall not to your death, but into the waiting arms of my squire!  Off you go now!', '', 38212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hup!', '', 38211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maiden!  Fear not, for Maximillian of Northshire has arrived to deliver you from your rocky tomb!', '', 38210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luck is with us today!  A damsel appears before us, stuck in a crag, without hope of escape!  Let us go save her!', '', 38209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save me!  I\'ve dropped my belongings into the hot springs.$b$bMy gowns are in there!', '', 38208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You again...I hope you didn\'t put too much faith in your actions settling my spirit. I\'ve realized there will be no peace without her, not anymore.$B$BI will see their very homes razed. Are you ready to slay more of these disgusting murderers?', '', 38207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Light, may he at last find rest, free from the icy grip of that terrible blade.', 38206, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 17388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps - perhaps he might someday remember what he once was.', 38205, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 17387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sensed a part of him still alive! Trapped... struggling... Oh, Arthas!', 38204, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 17386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew! ', 38203, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 17385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He... he kept it? All this time, he kept it!?', 38202, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 17384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s this!?', 38201, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 17383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scar is sealed! Thank Cenarius...', '', 38200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bael Modan... the dwarves...  ', '', 38199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, squire.  Adventure waits not!', '', 38198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not sure I know what to make of all of this, other than I\'m very insulted, and thank you for returning my purse.  I mean crate!', '', 38197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My squire will retrieve your purse for you.', '', 38196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not a what?  Not available?  Worry not, for my heart belongs only to the lady Doloria, though one as fair as you must command the hearts of many.', '', 38195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?  Yes, that\'s my... crate.  And I\'m not a...', '', 38194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maiden!  Fear not, I seek only to steady the quiver in thine lower lip.  Is that your purse that floats \'pon the water, so agonizingly close yet so perilously far away?', '', 38193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look squire, yon maiden has lost her purse to the sulfurous waters of the Golakka Hot Springs.', '', 38192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see...she\'s using him to manipulate them all..', 38191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This he has spoken to me...go, and KILL!', 38190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go!  Go and take our land! When all belongs to the quilboar, we will be delivered, and Agamaggan will rise again!', 38189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Agamaggan will not rise again without BLOOD! His body demands sacrifice!', 38188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I\'ll adventure alone for a while.', 'I think I\'ll adventure alone for a while.', 38187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have much to ponder.', 38186, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 17382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave me. ', 38185, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 17381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But what now, hero? What of those freed from his grasp, but still shackled to their mortal coils?', 38184, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 17380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May Azeroth never fail to remember the terrible price we paid for our weakness... for our pride.', 38183, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 17379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Squire $n, for adventure awaits us!', '', 38182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, he has been made to pay for the atrocities he imposed upon my people.', 38181, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 17378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I had not dared to trust my senses - too many times has the Lich King made me to be a fool.', 38180, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 17377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, it is done.', 38179, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 17376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, Arthas... my brother.', '', 38178, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I\'da never discovered that accursed blade...', '', 38177, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I\'da been able ta stop yeh that day, how different things mighta been.', '', 38176, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh... Yeh sure put them skills ta use, didn\'t yeh, lad?', '', 38175, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 17425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...forgin\' ya into a weapon meant to withstand the demands of a great destiny.', '', 38174, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...sharpenin\' yer skill with this dull blade...', '', 38173, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How I miss those endless days in Lordaeron...', '', 38172, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, lad...', '', 38171, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shut it down, shut it down! The eggs are bad!!!', '', 38170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', '', 38169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall always be in your debt, friend.', '', 38168, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is this memory of Arthas that I choose to keep in my heart.', '', 38167, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eager to defend his people, no matter the cost.', '', 38166, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recall clearly the gleam of pride in his eye as he stood before me, eager to defeat the enemies of the Light...', '', 38165, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maximillian, I am ready for adventure.', 'Maximillian, I am ready for adventure.', 38164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soul has been wracked with unbearable anxiety, dark thoughts... distancing me from the Light.', '', 38163, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have I struggled to forgive the prince for his terrible transgressions.', '', 38162, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas, hero of Azeroth, you give me a greater gift than you know.', '', 38161, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arthas...', '', 38160, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aid me, friends. Let us call upon the spirits for vision.', 38159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was your sacrifice, my son, that again saved me from eternal peril.', '', 38158, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The one memory, I clung to, Darion... The one thought that kept me from giving in...', '', 38157, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, when events demanded his full attention, he left me.', '', 38156, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Endlessly, he sought to break my will, to force me to serve him, to bind me to his blade...', '', 38155, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King tormented me without end, Darion.', '', 38154, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, I am able to lay my eyes upon you again.', '', 38153, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darion, my son.', '', 38152, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father... For you, I would give my life a thousand times.', '', 38151, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father. I feared for your... your sanity.', '', 38150, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now, and defeat the Prince of Darkness. (DO NOT USE?)', '', 38149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wield this mighty weapon and direct the souls that empower it.', '', 38148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now...', '', 38147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have withstood the torment of the Lich King himself, and now Shadowmourne is yours.\n', '', 38146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where most would falter, you have overcome.\n', '', 38145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is complete.\n\n', '', 38144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father...', '', 38143, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There it goes.  It should only be a moment now....', 38142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This thing is huge! Reverse the polarity on the Poultryizer. We\'ll have to shove it in through the outtake.', 38141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can see through the fog that hangs over this world like a shroud, and grasp where true power lies.', 38140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have found your way here, because you are among the few gifted with true vision in a world cursed with blindness.', 38139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those who oppose him will be destroyed utterly, and those who serve -- who serve wholly, unquestioningly, with utter devotion of mind and soul -- elevated to heights beyond your ken.', 38138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through our Master, all things are possible. His power is without limit, and his will unbending.', 38137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sooner you come to accept your condition as a defect, the sooner you will find yourselves in a position to transcend it.', 38136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a weakness; a crippling flaw....  A joke played by the Creators upon their own creations.', 38135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fix your eyes upon your crude hands: the sinew, the soft meat, the dark blood coursing within.', 38134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arise, and exult in your pure form!', 38133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I release you from the curse of flesh!', 38132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are prepared, Highlord. Let us battle for the fate of Azeroth! For the light of dawn!', 'We are prepared, Highlord. Let us battle for the fate of Azeroth! For the light of dawn!', 38131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take this blessing and show these intruders a taste of the Master\'s power!', 38130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have I waited for this day, hero. Are you and your allies prepared to bring the Lich King to justice? We charge on your command!', '', 38129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This charade has gone on long enough!', 38128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are weak, powerless to resist my will!', 38127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! I see I must take matters into my own hands!', 38126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All part of the Master\'s plan.... Your end is inevitable....', 38125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Embrace the darkness... darkness eternal.', 38124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you yet grasp the futility of your actions?', 38123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is this disturbance? You dare trespass upon this hallowed ground? This shall be your final resting place!', 38122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s Mana Barrier shimmers and fades away!', '%s\'s Mana Barrier shimmers and fades away!', 38121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great news, everyone! The slime is flowing again!', '', 38120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Genius idea, sir. Your brain power never ceases to amaze me!', 38119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise up, champions of the Light!', '', 38118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free at last! It is over, my son. This is the moment of reckoning.', '', 38117, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 17397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid me in destroying these tortured souls! Together we will loosen Frostmourne\'s hold and weaken the Lich King from within!', '', 38116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First, you must escape Frostmourne\'s hold, or be damned as I am; trapped within this cursed blade for all eternity. ', '', 38115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have come to bring Arthas to justice? To see the Lich King destroyed?', '', 38114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King must fall!!', '', 38113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more, Arthas! No more lives will be consumed by your hatred!', '', 38112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LIGHT GRANT ME ONE FINAL BLESSING! GIVE ME THE STRENGTH... TO SHATTER THESE BONDS!', '', 38111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. Champions, attack!', '', 38110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll grant you a swift death, Arthas. More than can be said for the thousands you\'ve tortured and slain.', '', 38109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will stay here and watch over the land as it heals.  Do keep an eye out for any stragglers from here...', '', 38108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As Druids, we are tasked with protecting the balance of nature. My life\'s work has gone against this. In my folly, I have sewn chaos, and this deviant crop must be reaped before it spreads further.', '', 38107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greely, load The Biggest Egg Ever into the Poultryizer. Mechnuggets for everyone!', '', 38106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truly an amazing sword, don\'t you think? That\'s no weapon of dwarven make, no, it\'s far more ancient than that.$B$BThese Sunreaver and Silver Covenant representatives seem intent on getting to the bottom of the mystery. I\'m already working on a report for Brann.', '', 38105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... so very thirsty...', '', 38104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need water... not much time...', '', 38103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The canteen... get the canteen...', '', 38102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water...', '', 38101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slap Ringo before he passes out!', '', 38100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light will abandon you, hero, just as it did me.', '', 38099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your heart -it\'s incessant drumming disgusts me. I will silence it as I did my own.', '', 38098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stumble about in darkness. There is no light here. No mercy! Icecrown has claimed the souls of better heroes than you.', '', 38097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hunger your weapon feels is but a shade of what awaits. You want to see real hunger? Real power? Continue onward, hero. I am waiting.', '', 38096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More souls...  yes, more...  you will find it hard to stop, mortal.', '', 38095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The moment is soon at hand, mortal. You shall toil for eternity in a new Azeroth!', '', 38094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never have I had cause to regret sparing your life, mortal. Always, you find ways to amuse me.', '', 38093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My challenges have strengthened you, champion. You shall serve me well!', '', 38092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me, pretender! Feed MY blade!', '', 38091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at you, child; would-be wielder of souls... you cannot fathom the power that lies at my command!', '', 38090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me your weapon, champion, that I might feed it the soul of its master!', '', 38089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, do it! Create your monstrous new weapon. It too will serve me when your soul is mine.', '', 38088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you too are gathering souls for your own ends. Are we really so different, \'champion\'?', '', 38087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember hero: I, too, once sought a weapon of great power...', '', 38086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon, mortal, you too shall have a blade for a prison.', '', 38085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Crusaders and combatants, a true hero stands before you this day! $n, of the Sunreavers, has restored the ancient blade of Quel\'Delar as a symbol of our resolve to defeat the Lich King!', 38084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take them, mortal, these souls will again be mine soon enough.', '', 38083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AARRRGGHHH!', '', 38082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BAH! You gnats actually hurt me... Perhaps I\'ve toyed with you long enough... Now - taste the VENGEANCE OF THE GRAVE!', '', 38081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible...', '', 38080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rise up, brothers, and destroy our enemies!', 38079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I delight in the irony.', '', 38078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch now as I raise them from the dead to become masters of the Scourge. They will shroud this world in chaos and destruction. Azeroth\'s fall will come at their hands -- and you will be the first to die.', '', 38077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You trained them well, Fordring. You delivered the greatest fighting force this world has ever known... right into my hands - exactly as I intended! You shall be rewarded for your unwitting sacrifice.', '', 38076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it truly righteousness that drives you? I wonder...', '', 38075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No questions remain unanswered. No doubts linger. You ARE Azeroth\'s greatest champions. You overcame every challenge I laid before you. My mightiest servants have fallen before your relentless onslaught... your unbridled fury... ', '', 38074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come then, champions. Feed me your rage!', '', 38073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll keep you alive to witness the end, Fordring. I would not want the Light\'s greatest champion to miss seeing this wretched world remade in my image.', '', 38072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll learn of that first hand. When my work is complete, you will beg for mercy -- and I will deny you. Your anguished cries will be testament to my unbridled power...', '', 38071, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 17350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the Light\'s vaunted justice has finally arrived? Shall I lay down Frostmourne and throw myself at your mercy, Fordring?', '', 38070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But... we were getting along... so... well...', 38069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This ends NOW!', 38068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a pity.', 38067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Really...? Is that all you\'ve got?', 38066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes! Feed, my precious one! You are mine now!', 38065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How... unfortunate.', 38064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here it comes...', 38063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you handle this?', 38062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'SUFFER!', 38061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death is no escape!', 38060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the end, you will all serve me.', '', 38059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Know my hunger!', 38058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The breaking of this one has been taxing. The atrocities I have committed upon his soul... He has resisted for so long, but he will bow down before his king soon.', '', 38057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But that honor is no longer yours. Soon, I will have a new champion. ', '', 38056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You could have been my greatest champion, Fordring: A force of darkness that would wash over this world and deliver it into a new age of strife.', '', 38055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You now stand upon the hallowed ground of the Scourge. The Light won\'t protect you here, paladin. Nothing will protect you...', '', 38054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just a taste...', 38053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'kyr, your master calls!', '', 38052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow down before your lord and master!', '', 38050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('APOCALYPSE!', '', 38049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have made an... unwise... decision.', 38048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch as the world around you collapses!', '', 38047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will freeze you from within until all that remains is an icy husk.', '', 38046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frostmourne feeds on the soul of your fallen ally!', '', 38044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frostmourne, OBEY ME!', '', 38043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frostmourne hungers...', '', 38042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face now your tragic end.', '', 38041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end has come!', '', 38040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Crusaders and combatants, a true hero stands before you this day! $n, of the Silver Covenant, has restored the ancient blade of Quel\'Delar as a symbol of our resolve to defeat the Lich King!', 38039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope wanes...', '', 38038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something stinks, and for once it\'s not my socks.', 'Something stinks, and for once it\'s not my socks.', 38037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the leader of the Sunreavers, it is with great pride that I present $n as the new bearer of Quel\'Delar!', '', 38036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is a great day for all who oppose the Lich King! Brave $n has taken up the ancient blade, Quel\'Delar, in the name of the Silver Covenant!', 38035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Do you know that you are very strong?', '', 38034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, I needed that.', '', 38033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, okay, I\'m going!', '', 38032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You didn\'t have to hit me so HARD!', '', 38031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!  A little help over here!', '', 38030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... maybe if you could lightly slap me on the cheek...', '', 38029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Umm... I think I might need a hand here...', '', 38028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we don\'t slow down soon, I might pass out.', '', 38027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another disguise.', 'I need another disguise.', 38026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you have some packages to move?', 'Don\'t you have some packages to move?', 38025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That crate won\'t deliver itself, friend. Get a move on!', 'That crate won\'t deliver itself, friend. Get a move on!', 38024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lovely Merchant is waiting for that. Hurry it up!', 'The Lovely Merchant is waiting for that. Hurry it up!', 38023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is money, friend. Go go go!', 'Time is money, friend. Go go go!', 38022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No snooping around, friend.$B$BIf you\'re looking to buy Crown holiday goods, you\'ll have to do it at the Lovely Merchant in the city.', 'No snooping around, friend.$B$BIf you\'re looking to buy Crown holiday goods, you\'ll have to do it at the Lovely Merchant in the city.', 38021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stare into the abyss and see your end.', 38020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SUFFERING! ANGUISH! CHAOS! RISE AND FEED!', '', 38019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The swell of souls will not be abated! You only delay the inevitable.', 38018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The swell of souls will not be abated! You only delay the inevitable.', '', 38017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Doomed for eternity!', 38016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doomed for eternity!', '', 38015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damnation!', 38014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damnation!', '', 38013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare look upon the host of souls? I SHALL DEVOUR YOU WHOLE!', '', 38012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delight in the pain!', '', 38011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremble before Taldaram, mortals, for the power of the orb flows through me!', '', 38010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beg for mercy!', '', 38009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worm food.', '', 38008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood will flow.', '', 38007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such wondrous power! The Darkfallen Orb has made me INVINCIBLE!', '', 38006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My queen, they... come.', '', 38005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truth is found in death.', '', 38004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were you ever a threat?', '', 38003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My cup runneth over.', '', 38002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naxxanar was merely a setback! With the power of the orb, Valanar will have his vengeance!', '', 38001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BOW DOWN BEFORE THE SAN\'LAYN!', '', 38000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you see NOW the power of the Darkfallen?', '', 37999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dinner... is served.', '', 37998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolish mortals. You thought us defeated so easily? The San\'layn are the Lich King\'s immortal soldiers! Now you shall face their might combined!', 37997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feast, my minions!', '', 37996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ground runs red with your blood!', '', 37995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have become... DEATH!', '', 37994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... Am... Released...', '', 37993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will find no redemption here!', '', 37992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nothing!', '', 37991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BY THE MIGHT OF THE LICH KING!', '', 37990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should keep you around.', '', 37989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aquanos can hardly keep up!', '', 37988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice. I don\'t want to know what that stain was.', '', 37987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s how it\'s done!', '', 37986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clean and tidy!', '', 37985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Squawky...', 37984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maiden: if your curiosity gnaws at you, then you may know your salvation was delivered by Maximillian of Northshire.', '', 37983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curiously the bird does not become flame and ash.  A phoenix that does not become flame and ash \'pon its slaying is a dire omen indeed.', '', 37982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Doloria!', '', 37981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch as the accursed bird becomes flame and ash as soon as it is slayed.', '', 37980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears that adventure has made itself apparent.  Look, for as yonder maiden treads innocently through the jungle, a hatchling phoenix stalks her as its prey!', '', 37979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s Aether Shield has been shattered by $n!', '%s\'s Aether Shield has been shattered by $n!', 37978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has impaled $n!', '%s has impaled $n!', 37977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This whole place is gonna blow. Get to the exit!', '', 37976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, I\'m ready.', 'Alright, I\'m ready.', 37975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay your sword and loosen your cap.  Before we do battle with our blades, I first have prepared an assault to unleash upon your ears.$b$bAre you prepared?', '', 37974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Maximillian is deep in prayer, oblivious to your presence.>', '', 37973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nature will guide ya when all else fails.', 37972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Trust in ya bow. It\'ll be there for ya when ya need it most.', 37971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woo hoo!', 'Woo hoo!', 37970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Umm... yes, yes she is.  Unquestionably.', 'Umm... yes, yes she is.  Unquestionably.', 37969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wit\' practice, ya\'ll find that magic can be much stronga than any weapon.', '', 37968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m rather glad to hear that.  Congratulations, $n, for you have completed your training.  You may now ride beside me into the fray.', '', 37967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moving on!  As chivalry is the way of the knight, and I am a knight, you must know then that my own intentions are indeed valorous.  It is true, I fight for my Lady Doloria, to proclaim her beauty and majesty across all the lands.  Any who question her beauty are without a doubt the most vile of enemies, and must be brought to justice.$b$bAs I speak, it occurs to me that I am a failure.  We have come quite far in the squiring ceremony, yet I have not yet ascertained whether or not you deserve my charity or my righteous fury.$b$bI must know, now, do you agree that my Lady Doloria is unquestionably the fairest Lady across all of Azeroth?', '', 37966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is ridiculous!  I don\'t have to put up with this!', 'This is ridiculous!  I don\'t have to put up with this!', 37965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha!  Did I not just say, good $n, chivalry and gallantry are the charge of the KNIGHT?  You seek only to be a SQUIRE.  The colossal burden of chivalry is unfit for the squire, for as I mentioned before, the only colossal burden that you are to bear is that of my belongings.', '', 37964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, sir.', 'Yes, sir.', 37963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give you my oath.', 'I give you my oath.', 37962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good.  Secondly, you must know that a knight embraces no tenet more tightly than that of chivalry.  He clings to his generosity as tightly as he clings to his lance.  His valor shines as brightly as his armor.  And while his smallsword may be sharp, his manner among allies is soft and courteous.$b$bNow tell me $n, do you give your oath to hold to the teachings of chivalry and gallantry?', '', 37961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Understandable.', 'Understandable.', 37960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A squire is the right hand of the knight.  As you are already fully aware, hands are especially good at carrying things, and thus your first duty will be to carry my sundries, knickknacks, and other miscellaneous paraphernalia while I dispense justice across the land.  To lug around such etcetera is a job unbefitting of a knight.', '', 37959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In tha chaos of battle, it\'s tha balance of light and shadow that leads us ta victory.', 37958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike swiftly an\' fade away. You\'ll know ya beginin\' ta master ya skills when people know ya deeds, but never heard of you.', '', 37957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Darkspear trolls \'ave age old connections wit\' nature, but only lately \'ave we come ta know the druidic arts. Try ta keep an open mind, $n.', 37956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waste away into nothingness!', '', 37955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh shall decay before your very eyes!', '', 37954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, my lord.', '', 37953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master surveyed his kingdom and found it... Lacking. His judgment was swift and without mercy: DEATH TO ALL!', '', 37952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... Run... Run to meet your destiny... Its bitter, cold embrace, awaits you.', '', 37951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choke on your suffering!', '', 37950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw the same look in his eyes when he died. Terenas could hardly believe it.', '', 37949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is all that you will find here!', '', 37948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, my lord.', '', 37947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear... so exhilarating...', '', 37946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Despair... so delicious...', '', 37945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of Lordaeron, rise to meet your master\'s call!', '', 37944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marwyn, finish them...', '', 37943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The children of Stratholme fought with more ferocity!', '', 37942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sniveling maggot!', '', 37941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t help ya \'ere, mon.', 'We can\'t help ya \'ere, mon.', 37940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Ortezza if ya want hunter trainin\'.', 'I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Ortezza if ya want hunter trainin\'.', 37939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Soratha if ya want mage trainin\'.', 'I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Soratha if ya want mage trainin\'.', 37938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Tunari if ya want priest trainin\'.', 'I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Tunari if ya want priest trainin\'.', 37937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Legati if ya want rogue trainin\'.', 'I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Legati if ya want rogue trainin\'.', 37936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Zen\'Tabra if ya want druid trainin\'.', 'I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Zen\'Tabra if ya want druid trainin\'.', 37935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Nekali if ya want shaman trainin\'.', 'I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Nekali if ya want shaman trainin\'.', 37934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Nortet if ya want warrior trainin\'.', 'I can\'t help ya. Go talk ta Nortet if ya want warrior trainin\'.', 37933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The elements chaotic and wild. Only through learnin\' can we keep in touch wit\' them and keep them controlled.', 37932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Men, women, and children... None were spared the master\'s wrath. Your death will be no different.', '', 37931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care of ya weapons an\' they\'ll take care of ya back.', '', 37930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like the look of this \'Crown Chemical Co.\' one bit.', '', 37929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not bad, $n. Not bad.', 'Not bad, $n. Not bad.', 37928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A single drop of coconut milk leaks out of A-Me 01\'s eye as she takes one long, last look at Wooga.', '', 37927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But most of all... thank you, Wooga, for teach A-Me how to love.', '', 37926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-Me need you tell others.  Tell Rakoo thanks for teach A-Me how to make lightning.  And tell Misko thanks for teach A-Me how to fight dinosaur.', '', 37925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This not easy for A-Me to say... A-Me going home.  It finally time for A-Me to leave.', '', 37924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wooga... you came.  Good.  A-Me need you listen now.', '', 37923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-Me pounds her chest and calls out to a nearby gorilla.', '', 37922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait.  A-Me forget something.  We make quick stop, then return to escape protocol.', '', 37921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good.  Good.  User appear ready.  Now we go.', '', 37920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Input recognized.  Please prepare for journey.', '', 37919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overdrive Mode!  Let\'s do this!', 'Overdrive Mode!  Let\'s do this!', 37918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s try Run Mode.', 'Let\'s try Run Mode.', 37917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I\'ll go with Amble Mode, A-Me.', 'I think I\'ll go with Amble Mode, A-Me.', 37916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-Me have many locomotion speed modes.  A-Me design specification U-2502 state that user may define A-Me locomotion mode to suit user preference.$b$bIn Amble Mode, A-Me move at speed of normal $r.$b$bIn Run Mode, A-Me move at speed of normal horse or wolf.$b$bIn Overdrive Mode, A-Me move at speed of VERY FAST horse or wolf.$b$bWhich mode you prefer?', '', 37915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light will abandon you, hero, just as it did me.', '', 37914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your heart - its incessant drumming disgusts me. I will silence it as I did my own.', '', 37913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stumble about in darkness. There is no light here. No mercy! Icecrown has claimed the souls of better heroes than you.', '', 37912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hunger your weapon feels is but a shade of what awaits. You want to see real hunger? Real power? Continue onward, hero. I am waiting.', '', 37911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More souls... yes, more... you will find it hard to stop, mortal.', '', 37910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The moment is soon at hand, mortal. You shall toil for eternity in a new Azeroth!', '', 37909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never have I had cause to regret sparing your life, mortal. Always, you find ways to amuse me.', '', 37908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My challenges have strengthened you, champion. You shall serve me well!', '', 37907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me, pretender! Feed MY blade!', '', 37906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at you, child; would-be wielder of souls... you cannot fathom the power that lies at my command!', '', 37905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me your weapon, champion, that I might feed it the soul of its master!', '', 37904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, do it! Create your monstrous new weapon. It too will serve me when your soul is mine.', '', 37903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you too are gathering souls for your own ends. Are we really so different, champion?', '', 37902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember hero: I, too, once sought a weapon of great power...', '', 37901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon, mortal, you too shall have a blade for a prison.', '', 37900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take them, mortal, these souls will again be mine soon enough.', '', 37899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $n!', 'Well done, $n!', 37898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR GILNEAS!!!', 'FOR GILNEAS!!!', 37897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19651, 19651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we will... NEVER SURRENDER!!!!!', '', 37896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And if we find ourselves surrounded and disarmed... wounded and without hope... we will lift our heads in defiance and spit in their faces.', '', 37895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quiet, fools. If I had wished to kill you, you\'d already be dead.', 37894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How wrong they are.  We will fight them in the fields until the last trench collapses and the last cannon is silenced.', '', 37893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight them in the alleys, until our knuckles are skinned and bloody and our rapiers lay on the ground shattered.', '', 37892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight them on the streets until the last shot is fired.  And when there\'s no more ammunition, we\'ll crush their skulls with the stones that pave our city.', '', 37891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And if we find ourselves surrounded and disarmed... wounded and overwhelmed... we will lift our heads in defiance and spit in their faces.', '', 37890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re in mid challenge, mon. Be patient.', 'They\'re in mid challenge, mon. Be patient.', 37889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forsaken think we\'re weak.  A broken people.  They think we\'ll roll over like a scared dog.', '', 37888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not welcome here, minion of the Lich King!', 'You are not welcome here, minion of the Lich King!', 37887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get in the pit and show us your stuff, $G boy:girl;.', 'Get in the pit and show us your stuff, $G boy:girl;.', 37886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to face my challenge.', 'I\'m ready to face my challenge.', 37885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ain\'t much of a big challenge, mon, but we gotta know ya can handle the pit before we can take ya in.', 'This ain\'t much of a big challenge, mon, but we gotta know ya can handle the pit before we can take ya in.', 37884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fires Extinguished: $4857W/$4864W', '', 37882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sets his eyes upon you!', '%s sets his eyes upon you!', 37881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you think you would escape with your life?', 'Did you think you would escape with your life?', 37880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t escape from us so easily!', 'You won\'t escape from us so easily!', 37879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My strength is returning. Press on, heroes!', '', 37878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not last much longer.', '', 37877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have opened a portal into the Dream. Your salvation lies within, heroes...', '', 37876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes, lend me your aid. I... I cannot hold them off much longer. You must heal my wounds!', '', 37875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, mortal, seek out Magister Hathorel in Dalaran. He might be able to negotiate with the Silver Covenant for access to the book.', '', 37874, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, mortal, speak with Arcanist Tybalin in Dalaran. He may be able to negotiate with the Sunreavers for access to the book.', '', 37873, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_creature_disease_02.blp:16|tYou have |cFF00FF00Mutated Infection!|r', '', 37872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weezil Slipshadow - master of disguise!', '', 37871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel beside me, friend. I caught a bullet during that last raid.$B$B<Gann grunts in pain as he tries to shift position. His left hand clutches a wound, blood welling between his quivering fingers.>$B$BWhen the dwarves first invaded the Barrens, I contented myself with harassing their diggers and sabotaging their equipment. I should\'ve struck a killing blow when I had the chance.', '', 37870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fires threaten to destroy all of Orgrimmar.  If you think you are strong enough to go in there, be my guest.  Otherwise, stay out of the city and let us take care of it.', 'The fires threaten to destroy all of Orgrimmar.  If you think you are strong enough to go in there, be my guest.  Otherwise, stay out of the city and let us take care of it.', 37869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$BQuick, use the Ice Stones at each corner of the city to open a portal to the elemental plane and summon in those responsible.$B$BActivate each stone at the same time to ensure victory.', '', 37868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are new, stronger elementals attacking, but the fires are out of control!  Eliminate the elementals and get a handle on those fires.', '', 37867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Searing Fire Elementals Killed: $4584W/$4863W', '', 37866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elementals are invading the area.  Prepare to defend Orgrimmar!', '', 37865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Furious Fire Elementals Killed: $4582W/$4862W', '', 37864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes ladies, I\'m single.', '', 37863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It burns so good!', '', 37862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best. Workout. Ever.', '', 37861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So sexy it hurts!', '', 37860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on fire!', '', 37859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burning up the dance floor!', '', 37858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toasty!', '', 37857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woo! Feel the burn!', '', 37856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must ask that you reforge Shadow\'s Edge for me, Highlord Mograine.', 'I must ask that you reforge Shadow\'s Edge for me, Highlord Mograine.', 37855, 0, 8943, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When we were packed into the Town-In-A-Box, they told us we\'d be deployed somewhere in Azshara. Is this Azshara?$B$BI ask you: who prepares a Town-In-A-Box and doesn\'t supply it with enough food to live on?! One measly Poultryizer?!$B$BWe all know how the \"Micro\" Mechachicken worked out.', 37854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My genius cannot be contained within a box!$B$BWait, this isn\'t Azshara?! What is this place? That\'s a dormant volcano!$B$BI have half a mind to go join the Trade Prince! The other half of my mind is considering the possible weaponization of the clucker eggs!', '', 37853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I AM RENEWED! Ysera grant me the favor to lay these foul creatures to rest!', '', 37852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourselves brothers and sisters.  The elements conspire against our city.  Be ready for battle!', 'Prepare yourselves brothers and sisters.  The elements conspire against our city.  Be ready for battle!', 37851, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The heat comes. Prepare to defend against the elemental attack! Lok\'tar ogar!', 'The heat comes. Prepare to defend against the elemental attack! Lok\'tar ogar!', 37850, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cries out with a loud, baying howl!', '%s cries out with a loud, baying howl!', 37849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh Festergut, you were always my favorite -- next to Rotface.  The good news is that you left behind so much gas. I can practically taste it!', '', 37848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terrible news, everyone. Rotface is dead, but great news everyone! He left behind plenty of ooze for me to use! What? I\'m a poet and I didn\'t know it... Astounding!', '', 37847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two oozes, one room. So many delightful possibilities!', '', 37846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tastes like... Cherry! OH! Excuse me!', '', 37845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrm, I don\'t feel a thing. Wha?! Where\'d those come from?', '', 37844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just an ordinary gas cloud, but watch out because that\'s no ordinary gas cloud!', '', 37843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great news, everyone!', '', 37842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad news, everyone... I don\'t think I\'m going to make it...', '', 37841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was unexpected!', '', 37840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrm, interesting...', '', 37839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good news, everyone! I think I\'ve perfected a plague that will destroy all life on Azeroth!', '', 37838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Precious? Noooooooooo!!!', '', 37837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Icky sticky!', '', 37836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SLEEPY TIME!', '', 37835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad news, daddy...', '', 37834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daddy make new toys out of you!', '', 37833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I brokes-ded it...', '', 37832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WEEEEEE!', '', 37831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! You killed Stinky! You Pay!', '', 37830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not feel so good...', '', 37829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fun time over!', '', 37827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da ... Ddy...', '', 37826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead, dead, dead!', '', 37825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daddy, I did it!', '', 37824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fun time?', '', 37823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told Gar\'dul not to build a fortress on top of a Silithid colony.$B$BDid he listen to Crawgol? No!', '', 37822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n. Zuni. Ya\'ll find ya trainer in the trainin\' grounds to the east. Bring pride to the Darkspear.', '', 37821, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lords and ladies, I present $n, bearer of Quel\'Delar.', '', 37820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get our men in position immediately, Tobias.  We cannot let the Scythe fall into the hands of the Forsaken!!', '', 37819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya, mon. Let\'s crack some tiki target skulls!', '', 37818, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well said, my lady. We sin\'dorei will be free and we shall be great again!', 'Well said, my lady. We sin\'dorei will be free and we shall be great again!', 37817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will be the most difficult battle we have ever faced, but our resolve and the power of the Sunwell will sustain us until we have been restored to our greatness.', 37816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a strength that we sin\'dorei all share. It is a strength we will need to free ourselves of the addiction ravaging our people.', 37815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But the Light showed me that I was not lost. It helped me to find the strength to survive in spite of all that had happened and all the evil I had wrought.', 37814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our people had walked a dark path and mine was among the darkest of them all.', 37813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be done!', '', 37812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In that moment, the Light revealed to me the truth of the terrible things I had done.', 37811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darius!  The Dark Rangers have the Scythe!  They got to it before we were able to reach it.', '', 37810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My brothers and sisters, words cannot describe what I felt upon seeing the Sunwell rekindled.', 37809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse your eyes, $r!', '', 37808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to enter the Sunwell.', 'I\'m ready to enter the Sunwell.', 37806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rifles through the fortress supplies, looking for something.', '', 37805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will escort you into the Sunwell when you\'re ready.', 'I will escort you into the Sunwell when you\'re ready.', 37804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only those who have the ranger-general\'s approval may enter the Sunwell Plateau.', 'Only those who have the ranger-general\'s approval may enter the Sunwell Plateau.', 37803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re no orc. You\'re a spy! Alliance spy!', 'You\'re no orc. You\'re a spy! Alliance spy!', 37802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okidoki. Uh. R-ready to work!', '', 37801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Who are you? What clan are you from?', 'What? Who are you? What clan are you from?', 37800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Grok\'thar More\'gar. Bok choy, friend. Um. Zub zub! ', '', 37799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not rest, $n. Not until they are driven back to the sea.', '', 37798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Butcher of Taurajo will pay.', '', 37797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall back!  Retreat into the woods!', '', 37796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep them occupied, my brothers!  Allow $n to retrieve the scythe!', '', 37795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll string his body from the trees and leave him swinging in the wind for the Alliance to discover. Go back and tell Warlord Bloodhilt the news!', '', 37794, 0, 11745, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s ours! The Butcher of Taurajo is dead!', '', 37793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...thank you, Mahka.', '', 37792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '', 37791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my Crown Choclate Sampler.', 'I lost my Crown Choclate Sampler.', 37790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my Crown Cologne Sprayer.', 'I lost my Crown Cologne Sprayer.', 37789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my Crown Perfume Sprayer.', 'I lost my Crown Perfume Sprayer.', 37788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder!', '', 37787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They come! Everyone, get ready...', '', 37786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As will we all.', '', 37785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay close men - it\'s an ambush. To arms!', '', 37784, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, my queen. I will not stand in their way, but I will keep a close watch.', '', 37783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies once turned our strongest weapon against us. What makes you think the prismatic blades will be any different?', '', 37782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Mortal champions have long used these weapons to combat evil. I see no reason to keep the swords from them in this battle.', 37781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Karthog. For the Horde!', 'I am ready, Karthog. For the Horde!', 37780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slow down, friend. You say the General is coming?$B$BNow THERE\'S a trophy for my wall! I\'ll distract the bodyguards, but it will be up to you to kill General Hawthorne himself. Are you ready to strike?', '', 37779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You believe our allies will not be able to control the power of the swords?', '', 37778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Karthog offers you a drink from his waterskin.>$B$BOnce we called this the Gold Road, $c. Today it runs red with blood.$B$BAlliance blood, if I have anything to do with it.', '', 37777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 37776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These blades, Krasus... They were made long ago, when things were... different.', '', 37775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you certain you should be helping these mortals in their quest for the sword?', '', 37774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n may have found the remains of a prismatic blade, Kalecgos. Will you offer your help to our visitor?', '', 37773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid you\'ll have to ask the -- Well, perhaps Kalecgos can help.', '', 37772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
