('%s places a cup against the wall of Desolation Hold and listens in.', '', 37758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swiftclaw isn\'t stopping!  Steer him back to the raptor pens near Darkspear Hold.', 'Swiftclaw isn\'t stopping!  Steer him back to the raptor pens near Darkspear Hold.', 37757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mahka wishes to see me? ...very well. Return to her, I will follow.', '', 37756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mahka wants you to come see her, Mankrik.', 'Mahka wants you to come see her, Mankrik.', 37755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come see me whenever you are weary.', 37754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then...you do not need to bear it alone. Just sit next to me and forget your troubles, if only for a while.', 37753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This hatred has burned in me for years, Mahka. Your words cannot lift it from me so easily.', '', 37752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, Mankrik. Let go. Set down your blade.', 37751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mahka...', '', 37750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Because despite what you think, there may be people in this world who would mourn your passing.', 37749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Because...', 37748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what if it is? Why do you even care?', '', 37747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You seek escape, not glory. It\'s suicide.', 37746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nothing left for me. I seek a warrior\'s death. Is that wrong?', '', 37745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re destroying yourself, Mankrik.', 37744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
