('This should be helpin\' ya!', 'This should be helpin\' ya!', 37735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the spirits for you, brothers and sisters. The Skybreaker has already left. Quickly now, to Orgrim\'s Hammer! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them.', 'Thank the spirits for you, brothers and sisters. The Skybreaker has already left. Quickly now, to Orgrim\'s Hammer! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them.', 37734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17161, 17161, 1, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 39653),
