('Fire up the engines! We got a meetin\' with destiny, lads!', '', 37677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was dreadful, $c. Unceremoniously booted from Orgrimmar, jars of fresh squirming body parts smashed to the ground as I was hauled through the gates.$B$BLike I was some kind of monster!$B$BFortunately I\'ve been able to continue my research here, where there\'s no shortage of fresh corpses.', '', 37676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now - to the business of winning this war!$B$BAcross the scarred terrain to the east, the Alliance hopes to build an overland link between their coastal strongholds. They think to build a fortress here, in the center of the Barrens. In the center of MY Barrens.$B$BIt will not stand.', '', 37675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Belysra\'s Talisman to escape before the Dark Scout shoots you!$B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_jewelry_talisman_10.blp:64|t', 37674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
