('', 'What a pitiful choice of an ally, Crok!', 37654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, Scourgebane. I\'ll show the master which of us is truly worthy of the title of \"Champion\"!', 37653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His spirit is free from the grasp of the Lich King. We must now focus our attention on breaking down the walls that block our passage into the upper reaches. It is only a matter of time now, $n. The siege engineers should have the door down in $4939W days.', '', 37652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
