('Today, I fulfill that promise.', '', 37642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I made a promise to his mother before she died; that I would cross the Dark Portal alone - whether I lived or died, my son would be safe. Untainted...', '', 37641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We named him Dranosh - It means \"Heart of Draenor\" in orcish. I would not let the warlocks take him. My boy would be safe, hidden away by the elders of Garadar.', '', 37640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
