('Are you sure, $n? We must face the Scourge at full strength if we are to succeed. If you do not require more rest, we will begin.', '', 37632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to go, High Overlord. The Lich King must fall!', 'We are ready to go, High Overlord. The Lich King must fall!', 37631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brave soldier of the Horde, I salute you! We would have surely been destroyed by the Alliance gunship had it not been for you and your allies.$B$BTake a moment to rest before we begin our assault upon the upper reaches of the citadel.', '', 37630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance now dominates the Battlescar!', '', 37629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde now dominates the Battlescar!', '', 37628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take down the rifts and use the totems given by the Earthen Ring Defenders to free Trapped Citizens!', '', 37627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place sandbags around Stormwind to ward off flooding!$B$BPick up a sandbag from any sandbag pile located around the city$B$Band place them at a location marked with a red arrow |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MARKEDFORDEATH.blp:32|t.', '', 37626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$BQuick, use the Ice Stones at each corner of the city to open a portal to the elemental plane and summon in those responsible.$B$BActivate each stone at the same time to ensure victory.', '', 37625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elemental rifts have opened up around the city.  We need to shut them down now! Evacuate all non-combat ready citizens.  Make sure they get to safety!', '', 37624, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens and guests of Stormwind.  Our city is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our capital!  If you do not want to answer the call of battle, then grab sandbags and line the streets to prevent flooding!', '', 37623, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Travel quickly! The Sunreavers will not waste any time once they realize that we have the information they seek.', '', 37622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here is the book. You must ensure it gets to Caladis Brightspear in Icecrown before the Sunreavers realize what is happening.', '', 37621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to finally see you, courier. Krasus has entrusted us with one of the few remaining copies of Ancient Dragonforged Blades.', '', 37620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re an odd little guy.', 'You\'re an odd little guy.', 37619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do you interrupt me, $c?', 37618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish girl. You seek that which I killed long ago. He is merely a ghost now. A faint echo in my mind... ', '', 37617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not make the same mistake again, Sylvanas. This time there will be no escape. You will all serve me in death!', '', 37616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Falric. Marwyn. Bring their corpses to my chamber when you are through.', '', 37615, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 17227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you wish to commune with the dead? You shall have your wish.', '', 37614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SILENCE, PALADIN!', '', 37613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uther shakes his head.', '', 37612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Jaina! ARRRRRRGHHHH... He... He is coming. You... You must...', '', 37611, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 16674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not know, Jaina. I suspect that the piece of Arthas that might be left inside the Lich King is all that holds the Scourge from annihilating Azeroth.', '', 37610, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A grand sacrifice by a noble soul...', '', 37609, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is... something else that you should know about the Lich King. Control over the Scourge must never be lost. Even if you were to strike down the Lich King, another would have to take his place. For without the control of its master, the Scourge would run rampant across the world - destroying all living things.', '', 37608, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snap out of it, girl. You must destroy the Lich King at the place where he merged with Ner\'zhul - atop the spire, at the Frozen Throne. It is the only way.', '', 37607, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 16670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, listen to me. You must destroy the Lich King. You cannot reason with him. He will kill you and your allies and raise you all as powerful soldiers of the Scourge.', '', 37606, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, girl. Arthas is not here. Arthas is merely a presence within the Lich King\'s mind. A dwindling presence...', '', 37605, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, you haven\'t much time. The Lich King sees what the sword sees. He will be here shortly. ', '', 37604, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina! Could it truly be you?', '', 37603, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 16666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You won\'t deny me this, Arthas! I must know... I must find out... ', 37602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then maybe there is still hope...', 37601, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who could bear such a burden?', 37600, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 16640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re right, Uther. Forgive me. I... I don\'t know what got a hold of me. We will deliver this information to the King and the knights that battle the Scourge within Icecrown Citadel.', 37599, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me how, Uther? How do I destroy my prince? My...', 37598, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 16638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But Uther, if there\'s any hope of reaching Arthas. I... I must try.', 37597, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arthas is here? Maybe I...', 37596, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 16636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uther! Dear Uther! I... I\'m so sorry.', 37595, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand back! Touch that blade and your soul will be scarred for all eternity! I must attempt to commune with the spirits locked away within Frostmourne. Give me space. Back up, please. ', 37594, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 16634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Frostmourne: the blade that destroyed our kingdom...', 37593, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is that! Up ahead! Could it be? Heroes, at my side!', 37592, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 16632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The chill of this place... I can feel my blood freezing.', 37591, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uther shakes his head.', '', 37590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. ARRRRRRGHHHH... He... He is coming. You... You must...', '', 37589, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 16665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas, the only way to defeat the Lich King is to destroy him at the place where he was created.', '', 37588, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not know, Banshee Queen. I suspect that the piece of Arthas that might be left inside the Lich King is all that holds the Scourge from annihilating Azeroth.', '', 37587, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps, but know this: there must always be a Lich King. Even if you were to strike down Arthas, another would have to take his place, for without the control of the Lich King, the Scourge would wash over this world like locusts, destroying all that they touched.', '', 37586, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot defeat the Lich King. Not here. You would be a fool to try. He will kill those that follow you and raise them as powerful soldiers of the Scourge. But for you, Sylvanas, his reward for you would be worse than the last.', '', 37585, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You haven\'t much time. The Lich King sees what the sword sees. He will be here shortly. ', '', 37584, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, girl. I\'ve heard talk of that cursed blade saving us before. Look around you and see what has been born of Frostmourne.', '', 37583, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 16659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your back, courier. I needn\'t remind you of the value of the book, nor the fact that the Silver Covenant will stop at nothing to take it from us.', '', 37582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s the tome our representative brought from Wyrmrest. Get this to Myralion Sunblaze immediately.', '', 37581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re late, courier. No, I don\'t want any excuses; this errand is far too important.', '', 37580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not escape me that easily, Arthas! I will have my vengeance! ', 37576, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 17057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Frozen Throne...', 37575, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who could bear such a burden?', 37574, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 17055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There must be a way...', 37573, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Lich King is here? Then my destiny shall be fulfilled on this day! ', 37572, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 17053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uther... Uther the Lightbringer. How...', 37571, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I dare not touch it. Stand back! Stand back as I attempt to commune with the blade! Perhaps our salvation lies within...', 37570, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Standing this close to the blade that ended my life... The pain... It is renewed.', 37569, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I don\'t believe it! Frostmourne stands before us - unguarded - just as the gnome claimed. Come, heroes!', 37568, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark Lady, I think I hear Arthas coming. Whatever you\'re going to do, do it quickly.', 'Dark Lady, I think I hear Arthas coming. Whatever you\'re going to do, do it quickly.', 37567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you remove the sword?', 'Can you remove the sword?', 37566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not into any of that creepy stuff you like, Brazie. Just show me the \"legal\" wares.', 'I\'m not into any of that creepy stuff you like, Brazie. Just show me the \"legal\" wares.', 37565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Standing this close to the blade that ended my life... The pain... It is renewed.', 37564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you need, Brazie Getz! Get it?$B$BAnd I\'m not just talkin\' about the \"legal\" stuff, either. WHATEVER YOU NEED, PAL! Anything...', '', 37563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told you what I know, now shove off!', '', 37562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like a Lovely Charm Collector\'s Kit.', 'I\'d like a Lovely Charm Collector\'s Kit.', 37561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good show!', '', 37560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you know about our \"Charitable Charms\" program?$B$BOfficial Crown event mascots like myself are authorized to distribute Lovely Charm Collector\'s Kits.$B$BYou can then use the Lovely Charms you gather to create Lovely Charm Bracelets for friends and loved ones, or turn them in to Lovely Merchants for Love Tokens!$B$BOne popular activity is making bracelets for your favorite leaders to let them know they\'re appreciated and adored...', '', 37559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You expect me to remember all that off the top of my head? Look. They didn\'t pay me enough to put up with this, and the contract only asked for my silence. So I\'m just gonna drop my ledger on the floor here, and you\'re going to take it and leave me alone.$b$bGot it?', '', 37558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where were they delivered?', 'Where were they delivered?', 37557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, I don\'t know, okay? I don\'t know!$b$bI just got paid to make rockets that deliver an airborne chemical payload, and that\'s what I did. Job\'s done, pal. They\'re all made, packaged, and sent off. I got the money and I was TRYING to enjoy myself a little when you started chasing me all over town.  I don\'t have any more of that chemical and I don\'t know what it was.', '', 37556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a chemical inside the rocket. What is it?', 'There\'s a chemical inside the rocket. What is it?', 37555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He looks at the rocket and flashes a nervous grin.>$b$bOkay, yeah, so maybe I made a couple rockets for some guys. So what? The gold was good and I was paid for my work. It\'s not like anyone died. That\'s about as honest as work gets. What\'s it to you?', '', 37554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve brought in the best gnomes we\'ve got to get those doors open, $n! They\'re estimatin\' that it\'s gonna take another $4939W days before that door comes down!', '', 37553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magister Hathorel said you might be able to lend me a certain tabard.', 'Magister Hathorel said you might be able to lend me a certain tabard.', 37552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would you have of me, my lady?', 'What would you have of me, my lady?', 37551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not have much time, hero. What do you need?', 37550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would you have of me, Banshee Queen?', 'What would you have of me, Banshee Queen?', 37549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have no time to waste, $c. Why do you delay here?', 37548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away, yer majesty!', '', 37547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was nothing, your majesty. Just... I\'m proud of my king.', 37546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Muradin, secure the deck and prepare our soldiers for an assault on the upper citadel. I\'ll send out another regiment from Stormwind.\n', '', 37545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s wipes her tears away and smiles at King Varian Wrynn.', 37544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina? Why are you crying?', '', 37543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s cries.', 37542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought he\'d never shut up. At last, Sindragosa silenced that long-winded fool. To the Halls of Reflection, champions! Our objective is near... I can sense it.', 37541, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 17036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take cover behind me! Quickly!', 37540, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 17037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll make a great addition to Silas\' menagerie, Lobos.', '', 37539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rocket Pack Disabled. Move closer to Zafod Boombox to re-activate.', 'Rocket Pack Disabled. Move closer to Zafod Boombox to re-activate.', 37538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rocket Pack Active!', 'Rocket Pack Active!', 37537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware the dangers that lie ahead... and do try to remain in one piece. ', '', 37536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can possibly redeem this unholy place? Thank you.', '', 37535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The loss of our comrades was unpreventable. They lived and died in the service of the Argent Crusade.', '', 37534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done much in this war against the Scourge. May the light embrace you. ', '', 37533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('hmpf', '', 37532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '', 37531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I was not at the Wrath Gate, but the soldiers who survived told me much of what happened. Your son fought with honor. He died a hero\'s death. He deserves a hero\'s burial.', '', 37530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not forget this... kindness. I thank you, Highness', '', 37529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Blood and thunder, my son.', '', 37528, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand down, Muradin. Let a grieving father pass.', '', 37527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I can\'t do it. Get back on yer ship and we\'ll spare yer life. ', '', 37526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behind you lies the body of my only son. Nothing will keep me from him. ', '', 37525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t force me hand, orc. We can\'t let ye pass.', '', 37524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me down below and we\'ll discuss our upcoming counter-attack.', '', 37523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh\'s Horde does not tolerate failure.', '', 37522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Opening', 'Opening', 37521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Naralex.', 'I\'m ready, Naralex.', 37520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it. I can sense that this was once the site of great tragedy; mortal suffering still echoes through it. No doubt this is what the horrors beyond have seized onto.$B$BTo fully seal this intrusion into our world, I must first fully open it. I will need your strength to hold back whatever may attempt to come through.$B$BAre you prepared?', '', 37519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I vow that the Silver Covenant will see Quel\'Delar restored.', '', 37518, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What part of \"Victory or Death\" don\'t you understand!?', '', 37517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yield? You ... YIELD?', '', 37516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, ah - wait! I yield. I yield!', '', 37515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It falls to us to see Quel\'Delar restored for the Sunreavers.', '', 37514, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cries out in death with an echoing roar.', '', 37513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got it this time!', '', 37512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are fools to have come to this place. The icy winds of Northrend will consume your souls!', 37511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die well, fool.', '', 37510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...in eternal unrest!', '', 37509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You both shall suffer as his father does...', '', 37508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you truly expect to fulfill Mograine\'s task unopposed?', '', 37507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So predictable...', '', 37506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers, fall in! Looks like the Horde are comin\' to take another shot!\n', '', 37505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in the... There, in the distance!\n', '', 37504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was Saurfang\'s boy - the Horde commander at the Wrath Gate. Such a tragic end...', '', 37503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gasps for air.', '', 37502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relieved? Over my dead body!', '', 37501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But they\'ve, ah, they\'ve gotten reinforcements! From the Eastern Kingdoms. Whereas I\'ve been, ah, cut off -', '', 37500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hiding? Listen Bloodhilt - I\'ve, ah, reinforced our grip on the Barrens.', '', 37499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So! You DO have a spine!', '', 37498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your excuses sicken me! Consider yourself relieved of command.', '', 37497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cower behind your walls! If it wasn\'t for $n here the Alliance would be marching through Mulgore.', '', 37496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is where you\'re hiding, Gar\'dul.', '', 37495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quel\'Delar will never serve another!', 37494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was I who brought Quel\'Delar here, to return it to its makers. In breaking the weapon, so did I break its power.', 37493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My memories of Thalorien went cold and so did his blade.', 37492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arthas shattered our forces and took the most powerful of us into his service as the San\'layn.', 37491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After the battle, I recovered the sword from the field. I bore it to Northrend in the service of my prince, seeking to avenge our people\'s defeat.', 37490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swore that nothing would stir me to take up this blade again.$B$BI was a fool.', '', 37489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thalorien fell before the gates of the Sunwell, buying time for others to escape.', 37488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But even Thalorien\'s skill and Quel\'Delar\'s magic could not save Silvermoon from the might of the Scourge.', 37487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The king bestowed the blade upon my friend, Thalorien Dawnseeker.', 37486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As Quel\'Serrar was forged by the dragons and given to the kaldorei, its twin, Quel\'Delar, was given to my people.', 37485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quel\'Delar.', 37484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you need, $c?$b$bStormwind is under siege by elementals!  We have evacuated most of the city and our guards are fighting to hold the elementals at bay.$b$bI suggest you head to a safer area.  We do not have the manpower to defend the city and worry about you.', '', 37483, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. I trust you will, ah, defer to my authority on this matter.', '', 37482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t delay, he\'s - ah - he\'s almost here!$B$BMeet me at the top of the northernmost tower.', '', 37481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I could not save them... Damn you, Arthas! DAMN YOU!', 37480, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 16616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroes, to me!', 37479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 16614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Frost Queen is gone. We must keep moving - our objective is near.', 37478, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... Am... Released...', '', 37477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell him yourself. He\'s almost here!', 'Tell him yourself. He\'s almost here!', 37476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, ah, supplies have been tight. I\'ve got, ah, a manpower shortage. Tell Bloodhilt that, ah -', '', 37475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be sure to tell the Taurajo refugees that. Those that lived.', 'I\'ll be sure to tell the Taurajo refugees that. Those that lived.', 37474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warlord Bloodhilt? Garrosh\'s pet?$B$BThere\'s no need for him to be here, as you can see, ah, tell him I have the situation well in hand.', '', 37473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here on behalf of Warlord Bloodhilt, who wants you to know he will be arriving shortly.', 'I\'m here on behalf of Warlord Bloodhilt, who wants you to know he will be arriving shortly.', 37472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarves...', '', 37471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After all these years, can it really be --', '', 37470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The style of this blade and its markings hinted that it might be a dragonforged sword. At last, we will have our answer.', '', 37469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to ride, Warlord!', 'I am ready to ride, Warlord!', 37468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to ride to Desolation Hold as my Vanguard, $n?$B$BGar\'dul may try to give you the runaround. Let him know his judgment is coming.', '', 37467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But can it be? Is this really --', '', 37466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew this was a dragonforged blade when I first laid eyes on it.', '', 37465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a lot of potential, $n. I\'m going to need soldiers like you if we\'re going to regain the initiative here in the Barrens.', '', 37464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make this quick, $c. The Warchief personally sent me to evaluate our progress in the Barrens, and when I get here I find our towns aflame and Alliance dogs running amok.', '', 37463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is Desolation Hold, $c. Here we bide our time until we are ready to strike back against the Alliance.', '', 37462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Charge!!!\n', '', 37461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A lone orc against the might of the Alliance???', '', 37460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are about to get much worse. Come, taste the power that the Lich King has bestowed upon me!', '', 37459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For every Horde soldier that you killed -- for every Alliance dog that fell, the Lich King\'s armies grew. Even now the val\'kyr work to raise your fallen as Scourge.\n', '', 37458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get a move on then! Move ou...', '', 37457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reclaim the sword, $n, and bear it through that portal to Dalaran. Archmage Aethas Sunreaver will be waiting to congratulate you.', '', 37456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This blade has been returned to us for a reason, my lords. Now is the time to rally behind the bearer of Quel\'Delar and avenge the destruction of Silvermoon and the Sunwell.', '', 37455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quel\'Delar is not held in high esteem by the sin\'dorei alone. It holds a place in the heart of all children of Silvermoon.', '', 37454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let Quel\'Delar be a sign that we will never give up, that we will face any enemy without fear.', '', 37453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you found the sword, it was broken and abandoned, much like Silvermoon after Kael\'thas\'s betrayal.', '', 37452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The regent speaks truly, $n. Thalorien\'s sacrifice could not prevent the fall of this very Sunwell.', '', 37451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a hero and an inspiration to the sin\'dorei, $n, a symbol of our endurance in the face of tragedy and treachery.', '', 37450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is indeed Quel\'Delar. I had not thought I\'d live to see the day when Thalorien Dawnseeker\'s legendary sword would be restored to us.', '', 37449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re sure. Let\'s go!', 'We\'re sure. Let\'s go!', 37448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are ye sure, $g lad:lass;? Ye don\'t need another minute or two?', '', 37447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready, Muradin.', 'We\'re ready, Muradin.', 37446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Twas a fierce battle, $n! Take a moment to rest and gather yer forces. Who knows what lies beyond that door?$B$BLet me know when yer ready and we\'ll begin our ascent into the upper reaches of the citadel.', '', 37445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at it, Lor\'themar. It is certainly Quel\'Delar.', '', 37444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master\'s sanctum has been disturbed!', '', 37443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall see.', '', 37442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can that really be Quel\'Delar?', '', 37441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carry the sword back to Dalaran through that portal, $n. You have done what many quel\'dorei have dreamt of for years. Quel\'Delar has been restored at last.', '', 37440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Lord Regent! What have they done to you?', '', 37439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hurls a massive saronite boulder at you!', '', 37438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel the Lich King reaching out...watching us. ', '', 37437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The chill of this place freezes the marrow of my bones. ', '', 37436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the light, the transporter worked!', '', 37435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will have what you have come for, $n. Take the sword and begone. And you, Auric, have a care what you say in this sacred place.', '', 37434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems the captain is correct. Quel\'Delar is not to be ours after all.', '', 37433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards, return to your posts.', '', 37432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call off your men. Lor\'themar\'s own foolishness caused his injuries. Quel\'Delar is not chosen; it chooses its master.', '', 37431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not my doing, Rommath. There is no treachery here.', '', 37430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earwax. It\'s got to be good for SOMETHING.', 'Earwax. It\'s got to be good for SOMETHING.', 37429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('String-less kites!', 'String-less kites!', 37428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Games you can play with your face!', 'Games you can play with your face!', 37427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tether-footbomb!', 'Tether-footbomb!', 37426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Explosive fire extinguishers!  We\'ll fight fire... WITH fire!', 'Explosive fire extinguishers!  We\'ll fight fire... WITH fire!', 37425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Upside-down boats!  They\'ll never capsize!', 'Upside-down boats!  They\'ll never capsize!', 37424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mouse-sized beartraps... no... Bear-sized mousetraps!!', 'Mouse-sized beartraps... no... Bear-sized mousetraps!!', 37423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Handheld one-way mirrors!', 'Handheld one-way mirrors!', 37422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water-proof soap!  For underwater use!', 'Water-proof soap!  For underwater use!', 37421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bagel-holes!', 'Bagel-holes!', 37420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One-sided paper!', 'One-sided paper!', 37419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spoon sharpeners!', 'Spoon sharpeners!', 37418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flerberts. I\'m not sure what they do, but I\'d better lock down the name with a trademark.', 'Flerberts. I\'m not sure what they do, but I\'d better lock down the name with a trademark.', 37417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Recycling! But, for stuff that\'s never been used before.', 'Recycling! But, for stuff that\'s never been used before.', 37416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Houses made of dirt! When you clean them... THEY\'RE GONE.', 'Houses made of dirt! When you clean them...THEY\'RE GONE.', 37415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mom detectors.', 'Mom detectors.', 37414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fake food! Created by grinding up real food and pressing it into shapes of different food. With artificial flavoring!', 'Fake food! Created by grinding up real food and pressing it into shapes of different food. With artificial flavoring!', 37413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worthless mongrel.  I will order our outhouses cleaned with this rag you call a banner.', '', 37412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will come no further, Forsaken scum!  By the war banner of the ancient Greymane clan, I expel you from our ancestral lands!', '', 37411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just in time, $n.  Here come the Forsaken.', '', 37410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Corpse-men take Koroth\'s banner!  Corpse-men get smashed to bitses!!!', '', 37409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy the refreshingly intelligent taste of all new Kaja\'Cola!', '', 37408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaja\'Cola! When your tinkering has to be second to none!', '', 37407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaja\'Cola is a proud sponsor of the Bilgewater Buccaneers!', '', 37406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaja\'Cola! Jinxy the Weasel says, Drink it... or else!', '', 37405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaja\'Cola! It gives you IDEAS!', '', 37404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the Kaja\'Cola Taste Test Challenge!', '', 37403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All new Kaja\'Cola! Now with 100 percent more ideas!', '', 37402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink Kaja\'Cola!', '', 37401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not die as slaves... we\'re Gilneans!', '', 37400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is our land -- they\'re not going to take it away without a fight!', '', 37399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bloody Forsaken!  They\'ll pay for what they\'ve done!', '', 37398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will delay here until more reinforcements arrive, but you must keep moving. Arthas will soon realize that we\'re here.', 37397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Free any Horde slaves that you come across. We will most certainly need their assistance in battling Tyrannus. I will gather reinforcements and join you on the other side of the quarry.', 37395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will have to battle your way through this cesspit on your own.', 37394, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pathetic weaklings.', 37393, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soldiers of the Horde, attack!', 37392, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 17045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our champions have lost much blood in the struggle to activate this Scourge transporter. We must be prepared to return the favor. Follow me, men!', '', 37391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drop your weapon and surrender, traitor.', '', 37390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the meaning of this treachery?', '', 37389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it is. You have my thanks, $n, for restoring Quel\'Delar to its rightful owners.', '', 37388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent work, champions! We shall set up our base camp in these chambers. My magi will get the Scourge transport device working shortly. Step inside when you are ready for your next mission. I will meet you on the other side.', 37387, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Dark Lady watches over you. Make haste!', 37384, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will cut a swath of destruction through this cursed place and find a way to enter the Halls of Reflection. If there is anything of value to be found here, it will be found in the halls.', 37383, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 17041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our scouts have reported that the Lich King has a private chamber, outside of the Frozen Throne, deep within a place called the Halls of Reflection. That is our target, champions. ', 37382, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the attention of the Lich King turned towards the front gate, we\'ll be working our way through the side in search of information that will enable us to defeat him - once and for all.', 37381, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Argent Crusade and the Knights of the Ebon Blade have assaulted the gates of the Icecrown Citadel and are preparing for a massive attack upon the Scourge. Our mission is a bit more subtle, but equally as important.', 37380, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grabbing', 'Grabbing', 37379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make haste, champions! I will prepare the troops to fall in behind you.', 37377, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 16624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your first mission is to destroy the machines of death within this malevolent engine of souls and clear a path for our soldiers. ', 37376, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will carve a path through this wretched place and find a way to enter the Halls of Reflection. I sense powerful magic hidden away within those halls. Magic that could be the key to destroying the Scourge!', 37375, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'King Varian\'s SI:7 agents have gathered information about a private sanctum of the Lich King\'s deep within a place called the Halls of Reflection. ', 37374, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the attention of the Lich King drawn towards the front gate, we will be working our way through the side in search of information that will enable us to defeat the Scourge once and for all.', 37373, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their success hinges upon what we discover within these cursed halls. Although our mission is fraught with peril, we must persevere!', 37372, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our allies within the Argent Crusade and the Knights of the Ebon Blade have broken through the front gate of Icecrown and are attempting to establish a foothold within the citadel. ', 37371, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank the Light for seeing you here safely! We have much work to do if we are to defeat the Lich King and put an end to the Scourge.', 37370, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 16617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent work, champions! We shall set up our base camp in these chambers. My magi will get the Scourge transport device working shortly. Step inside it when you are ready for your next mission. I will meet you on the other side.', 37369, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 16625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s casts |cFFFFFF00Mirrored Soul!|r', '', 37368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a rocket here with your mark on it, Snivel.', 'I have a rocket here with your mark on it, Snivel.', 37367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, pal, I don\'t know who you are or why you\'ve been following me around, but I\'m about to board a ship and I want to be left alone, got it?', '', 37366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stairways... for horizontal surfaces!', 'Stairways... for horizontal surfaces!', 37365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A globe that shows the inside of the planet... on the outside. So you know where to dig!', 'A globe that shows the inside of the planet... on the outside. So you know where to dig!', 37364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Edible beds. So you can have breakfast in bed. Beds... for breakfast!', 'Edible beds. So you can have breakfast in bed. Beds... for breakfast!', 37363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soap on a rope! Attached to a chain. Mounted via a steel cable. To some soap.', 'Soap on a rope! Attached to a chain. Mounted via a steel cable. To some soap.', 37362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoes with wheels on them. And gloves with wheels - for when you fall down.', 'Shoes with wheels on them. And gloves with wheels - for when you fall down.', 37361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invisible condiments. For an unobstructed view of your food.', 'Invisible condiments. For an unobstructed view of your food.', 37360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Giant gnomes. No, wait... tiny giants!', 'Giant gnomes. No, wait... tiny giants!', 37359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A binary number system. It uses only two numbers. 6 and 11.', 'A binary number system. It uses only two numbers. 6 and 11.', 37358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A big convention, see? To show off all of our inventions. We\'ll call it GoblinCon. And we\'ll give away special pets! Except most people will probably sell them for profit on the auction house.', 'A big convention, see? To show off all of our inventions. We\'ll call it GoblinCon. And we\'ll give away special pets! Except most people will probably sell them for profit on the auction house.', 37357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We put a whole town... in a tiny little box!', 'We put a whole town... in a tiny little box!', 37356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What if we were to ORGANIZE crime?', 'What if we were to ORGANIZE crime?', 37355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invisible bunnies!  We\'ll put them all over the place, and they\'ll control everything!', 'Invisible bunnies!  We\'ll put them all over the place, and they\'ll control everything!', 37354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nose-stenders. For smelling things in different rooms.', 'Nose-stenders. For smelling things in different rooms.', 37353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clowns. Except instead of making you laugh, they\'re there for beating.', 'Clowns. Except instead of making you laugh, they\'re there for beating.', 37352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bathrobes with integrated shower-nozzles.', 'Bathrobes with integrated shower-nozzles.', 37351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A spring-loaded plunger with blades attached, for processing food. Or people you disagree with.', 'A spring-loaded plunger with blades attached, for processing food. Or people you disagree with.', 37350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarves. In. Space!', 'Dwarves. In. Space!', 37349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about smiling monkey wallets?', 'How about smiling monkey wallets?', 37348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A truck that delivers ice-cream. With a catapult.', 'A truck that delivers ice-cream. With a catapult.', 37347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('State-sponsored healthcare!', 'State-sponsored healthcare!', 37346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gloves with built-in clappers, for hands-free clapping.', 'Gloves with built-in clappers, for hands-free clapping.', 37345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murder permits!', 'Murder permits!', 37344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed pigs rubber, \'til they bounce. There\'s got to be an application for that.', 'Feed pigs rubber, \'til they bounce. There\'s got to be an application for that.', 37343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Electrical wires used to send messages over great distances... no, impractical. Giant rockets, with speakers attached....', 'Electrical wires used to send messages over great distances... no, impractical. Giant rockets, with speakers attached....', 37342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attach two vehicles to a bigger vehicle, and then have the passengers jump from one vehicle to the other!', 'Attach two vehicles to a bigger vehicle, and then have the passengers jump from one vehicle to the other!', 37341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblins with gills!', 'Goblins with gills!', 37340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thirteen-sided dice!', 'Thirteen-sided dice!', 37339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Half man...half sharkalligator!', 'Half man...half sharkalligator!', 37338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Portable gasoline squirt-guns!', 'Portable gasoline squirt-guns!', 37337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Edible rocket fuel!', 'Edible rocket fuel!', 37336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s like bungie-jumping, right? But without a cord, see? And you start at the bottom. I guess it\'s just sorta like regular jumping. But with guns.', 'It\'s like bungie-jumping, right? But without a cord, see? And you start at the bottom. I guess it\'s just sorta like regular jumping. But with guns.', 37335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So I have this idea for a movie. Three gnomes find a bracelet of power...', 'So I have this idea for a movie. Three gnomes find a bracelet of power...', 37334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about this: Instant water! Just add... oh.', 'How about this: Instant water! Just add... oh.', 37333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Headshoes!', 'Headshoes!', 37332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Motorized gravy-boat. With laser lump vaporizer.', 'Motorized gravy-boat. With laser lump vaporizer.', 37331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chocolate-flavored vanilla!', 'Chocolate-flavored vanilla!', 37330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tauren Paladins!', 'Tauren Paladins!', 37329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shirts with leg-holes. Reversable shirtshorts!', 'Shirts with leg-holes. Reversable shirtshorts!', 37328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leashes... with pre-attached pets.', 'Leashes... with pre-attached pets.', 37327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got it: Squeezeable rocks!', 'I\'ve got it: Squeezeable rocks!', 37326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...wait, it is over? I\'ve been run through ... Ah. Of course. I understand now. I am expected elsewhere.', '', 37325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, stay with the others. Escort them north, away from the fighting. I will stay here with the wyverns and cover your escape. Go!', '', 37324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alliance - they\'ve surrounded the camp! What are they doing here? Why are they attacking Taurajo? Get the children - run! RUN!', 37323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel the embrace now of all living things, the Earthmother\'s eternal peace. Thank you.', '', 37322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This day will stand as a testament not only to your valor, but to the fact that no foe, not even the Lich King himself, can stand when Alliance and Horde set aside their differences and---', '', 37321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brave champions, we owe you our lives, our freedom.... Though it be a tiny gesture in the face of this enormous debt, I pledge that from this day forth, all will know of your deeds, and the blazing path of light you cut through the shadow of this dark citadel. ', '', 37320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ran to wake up the others when the attack hit. Were they able to escape? I tried to fight off the soldiers with a skinning knife...', '', 37319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go get \'em, boss!', 37318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has anyone seen the quilboar they had caged up over here?', 'Has anyone seen the quilboar they had caged up over here?', 37317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unwrap your Awesome Party Ensemble and wear your Cool Shades, Hip New Outfit, and Shiny Bling!', 'Unwrap your Awesome Party Ensemble and wear your Cool Shades, Hip New Outfit, and Shiny Bling!', 37316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s got to be more. Doublecheck the bodies!', 'There\'s got to be more. Doublecheck the bodies!', 37315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, did anyone loot the mailbox yet?', 'Hey, did anyone loot the mailbox yet?', 37314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is wasting. I want this place picked clean before they counter-attack.', 'Time is wasting. I want this place picked clean before they counter-attack.', 37313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most of this stuff is beads and hides. Where\'s all the treasure?', 'Most of this stuff is beads and hides. Where\'s all the treasure?', 37312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have we cleaned out the inn yet? Burn the rest of it when you\'re done!', 'Have we cleaned out the inn yet? Burn the rest of it when you\'re done!', 37311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab anything you think we can fence.', 'Grab anything you think we can fence.', 37310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry it up. The soldiers have already pulled out of here.', 'Hurry it up. The soldiers have already pulled out of here.', 37309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The disease has been cured and you feel normal again!', '', 37308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear the streets!  The skies darken and elementals will soon attack.  Be on your guard!', 'Clear the streets!  The skies darken and elementals will soon attack.  Be on your guard!', 37307, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be on your guard! The weather worsens, and the elementals are soon to follow! Seek shelter!', 'Be on your guard! The weather worsens, and the elementals are soon to follow! Seek shelter!', 37306, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n - please see me. I need your help.', 37305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me out of the city.', 'Take me out of the city.', 37304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is an Emergency Evacuation Portal.', '', 37303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will fall before the might of the Scourge. Crypt raiders, attack!', '', 37302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ghouls, slay this pathetic high elf!', '', 37301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stickybombing', 'Stickybombing', 37300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready. Send me to the gates!', 'I am ready. Send me to the gates!', 37299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder! WHAMS!', '', 37298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n! With Baine and our Horde allies working together, we may yet push the invaders back to the swamp they washed in from.', 37297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The gate\'s meager defenses are prepared, $n. Are you?', 37296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Barrens may be dry, but these plains once teemed with life. We roamed, we hunted, and we lived off the land.$B$BThen the Alliance came... slashing, burning, killing. We call these the Fields of Blood now, $c.$B$BThe refugees have all fled. Those who remain behind remain to fight.', 37295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to return to the front of the quarry. Kill a few extra for me.', 'I\'m going to return to the front of the quarry. Kill a few extra for me.', 37294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to return to help free the rest of the slaves.  Thank you again, hero.', 'I\'m going to return to help free the rest of the slaves.  Thank you again, hero.', 37293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll fight by your side. Offer them no mercy.', 'I\'ll fight by your side. Offer them no mercy.', 37288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If by life or death I can repay you, I will.', 'If by life or death I can repay you, I will.', 37287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you my life.', 'I owe you my life.', 37286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m with you, hero.', 'I\'m with you, hero.', 37285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets his mining pick drag on the ground as she approaches, clearly exhausted.', '%s lets her mining pick drag on the ground as she approaches, clearly exhausted.', 37284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s closes his eyes, savoring freedom for a moment.', '%s closes her eyes, savoring freedom for a moment.', 37283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s raises an empty hand in toast to you.', '%s blows a kiss your way.', 37282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s offers a quick, cynical laugh at his fortune.', '%s offers a quick, cynical laugh at her fortune.', 37281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s stares at you for a moment, clearly finding it hard to believe that you\'re real.', '%s stares at you for a moment, clearly finding it hard to believe that you\'re real.', 37280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s almost collapses as he stumbles towards you.', '%s almost collapses as he stumbles towards you.', 37279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s offers an appreciative smile.', '%s offers an appreciative smile.', 37278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods his thanks.', '%s nods her thanks.', 37277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can hardly believe my eyes. Thank you. Really, thank you.', 'I can hardly believe my eyes. Thank you. Really, thank you.', 37276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will find a way to repay you someday, hero.', 'I will find a way to repay you someday, hero.', 37275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You deserve a mighty man-hug.', 'I could just kiss you!', 37274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is the time for revenge.', 'Now is the time for revenge.', 37273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll join you as soon as I catch my breath, heroes. Thank you.', 'I\'ll join you as soon as I catch my breath, heroes. Thank you.', 37272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so glad you\'re here. I wouldn\'t have made it much longer.', 'I\'m so glad you\'re here. I wouldn\'t have made it much longer.', 37271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Too many of us died in this pit. Far too many.', 'Too many of us died in this pit. Far too many.', 37270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a beautiful sight... you have no idea.', 'You\'re a beautiful sight... you have no idea.', 37269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d lost all track of time in this forsaken place. You\'re a sight for sore eyes, friend.', 'I\'d lost all track of time in this forsaken place. You\'re a sight for sore eyes, friend.', 37268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can barely feel my arms, but I\'ll stand with you once I find some weapons.', 'I can barely feel my arms, but I\'ll stand with you once I find some weapons.', 37267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you kill the Pit Master, spit on his corpse for me, will you?', 'When you kill the Pit Master, spit on his corpse for me, will you?', 37266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, carry out our vengeance on the Scourgelord.', 'Please, carry out our vengeance on the Scourgelord.', 37265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let a single one of them live.', 'Don\'t let a single one of them live.', 37264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you a long night of drinking, my friend.', 'Have my babies.', 37263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I might die in this pit. Thank you!', 'I thought I might die in this pit. Thank you!', 37262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, heroes. I will stay behind and round up the slaves as you free them. If you kill the Forgemaster to the east, we should be able to get ourselves equipped for battle.', '', 37261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s casts |cFF00AACCDeep Freeze|r at $n.', '', 37260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we are, safe and... OH NO! We\'ve been double-crossed!', 37259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'OUT OF THE WAY!', 37258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll have to go around.', 37257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hang on! I\'m putting the pedal to the metal!!!', 37256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This mine and everything in it are now property of Queen Sylvanas.  That includes all you worms -- so get back to work!', '', 37255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consider yourselves lucky to be alive, Gilnean dogs!  Now get to work before we change our minds!', '', 37254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work harder, you maggots!  This ore is not going to mine itself!', '', 37253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A final warning, mortal; Fail, and you shall fall by my hand!\n\n', '', 37252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fail, and your soul shall forever be its slave.\n', '', 37251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bend it to your will, and you shall wield unspeakable power!', '', 37250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold! The binding of sacred and corrupt; the forging of Shadow\'s Edge, a weapon of untold potential!', '', 37249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, it has begun....', '', 37248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m beginning to regret promoting you, $n!', '', 37247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink Kaja\'Cola!', '', 37246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your hard work and dedication. Unpaid overtime is approved for all!', '', 37245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hail the greatest trade prince on Azeroth... me!', '', 37244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that you, $n? What are you doing away from headquarters? Get back to work!', '', 37243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s demotions for everyone if the Sharks beat the Buccaneers!', '', 37242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re all lazy! Get back to work. Especially you, $n!', '', 37241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this I hear about a party? I wasn\'t invited!', '', 37240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forsaken will pay for what they\'ve done!', 'The Forsaken will pay for what they\'ve done!', 37239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s true then?  Even those afflicted by the Curse are fighting the Forsaken!', 'It\'s true then?  Even those afflicted by the Curse are fighting the Forsaken!', 37238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you!', 'Thank you!', 37237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('scatters a handful of grain into the wind.', '', 37236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will follow your lead, heroes. The Scourgelord will die this eve.', '', 37235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha, such an amusing gesture from the rabble. When I have finished with you, my master\'s blade will feast upon your souls. Die.', '', 37234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas, brave, brave adventurers, your meddling has reached its end. Do you hear the clatter of bone and steel coming up the tunnel behind you? That is the sound of your impending demise.', '', 37233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes! We will hold off the undead as long as we can, even to our dying breath. Deal with the Scourgelord!', '', 37232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the safety of Camp Taurajo I once trained young hunters in the ways of the wild.$B$BWe have no such luxury now - skills must be learned in the heat of battle against a foe camped on our very doorstep.', '', 37231, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll gather up the rest of slaves and get them ready to fight. We\'ll catch up with you before you engage Scourgelord Tyrannus.', '', 37230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll make use of these supplies to get everyone ready for a fight.$B$BContinue on. We\'ll meet you ahead.', '', 37229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, Sassy, I\'m ready to go.', 'Okay, Sassy, I\'m ready to go.', 37228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo! I\'m here representing the Crown Chemical Company.$B$BYou looking for a gift? A job? Maybe a little something for yourself? Well, you\'ve come to the right place, friend.$B$BIf I don\'t have what you need, our mascot Kwee or the Lovely Merchant beside me will.', '', 37227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you attacking him for? The dangerous one is over there!', '', 37226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve changed my mind, go get that one instead!', '', 37225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arms and legs are in short supply! Thanks for your contribution!', '', 37224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could probably use these parts.', '', 37223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our work must not be interrupted! Ick, take care of them!', '', 37222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garfrost hope giant underpants clean. Save boss great shame. For later.', '', 37221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one maybe not so good to eat now. Stupid Garfrost! BAD! BAD!', '', 37220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will save for snack. For later.', '', 37219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tiny creatures under feet, you bring Garfrost something good to eat!', '', 37218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grimtotem will never surrender!', '', 37217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat! The defenders couldn\'t hold the hill.', '', 37216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success! The hill is yours!', '', 37215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the hill!', '', 37214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, climb aboard! We mustn\'t tarry here! There\'s no telling when this whole mountainside will collapse.', '', 37213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16722, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get on board, now! This whole mountainside could collapse at any moment.', '', 37212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16733, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s prepares to attack!', '', 37211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bridle your enthusiasm, $r.$b$bYou embark upon a fool\'s errand that will likely be your undoing. Forces that have corrupted the most noble among us will relentlessly assault you.$b$bKnow this; succumb and I shall have no choice but to deliver you from this world.', '', 37210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am eager to begin our work, Highlord Mograine!', 'I am eager to begin our work, Highlord Mograine!', 37209, 0, 8943, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is great potential in the hammer Arthas cast aside when he took up Frostmourne.$b$bIt has helped to bring about events that have shaped this world\'s destiny. It possesses a great capacity for power that few comprehend.$b$bWith ample saronite I can reforge the hammer into an artifact to rival Frostmourne itself.$b$bIt is then that your most dangerous trial begins....', '', 37208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why must I retrieve Light\'s Vengeance?', 'Why must I retrieve Light\'s Vengeance?', 37207, 0, 8943, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can resist Frostmourne\'s call no more...', '', 37206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is only one way to cleanse this sword. Make haste for the Sunwell and immerse the blade in its waters.', '', 37205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have forged this blade from saronite, the very blood of an old god. The power of the Lich King calls to this weapon.', '', 37204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another faulty electrical-gas-flammable bed-fireworks accident?!', '', 37203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you realize what you\'ve done?', '', 37202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt! Do not carry that blade any further!', '', 37201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ages ago the demon lord Kil\'jaeden subjected the shaman, Ner\'zhul, to a seemingly endless torture before sealing his soul in a frozen crystal. It is this prison, forged in the depths of the twisting nether, that we have come to call the Frozen Throne.$b$bIt was not until Arthas smashed the crystal with Frostmourne that he merged with the soul of Ner\'zhul and became the Lich King. This breaking of the throne created the frozen fragments of [shadowfrost] that now lie scattered throughout the citadel.', '', 37200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know how, but the blade has chosen you to be its new wielder. Take it with my blessing, and wield it against the Scourge as I once did.', '', 37199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s Quel\'Delar! You possess the sword!', '', 37198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why has this happened? Why have you come here?', '', 37197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I wasn\'t meant to survive this attack.', '', 37196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King is near, $n. His voice taunts me...$b$bLet us silence him at last!', '', 37195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First, the blade must be fed with the souls of those who serve our enemy. Then, before the blade draws upon their power, I must encase it in Shadowfrost. This will insulate you from the corrupting voices that would otherwise consume you... I hope. ', '', 37194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is Shadowfrost?', 'What is Shadowfrost?', 37193, 0, 8943, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps, $c... perhaps.$b$bBut if you would be the one to attempt its creation, you must learn the ways of the Argent Verdict Forgemasters.$b$bAssociate yourself with them and prove your loyalty and dedication.$b$bWhen this is done, we shall discuss the matter further.', '', 37192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, tell me more of this artifact, Highlord Mograine.', 'Please, tell me more of this artifact, Highlord Mograine.', 37191, 0, 8943, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Capturing', 'Capturing', 37190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps, $c... perhaps.$b$bBut if you would be the one to attempt its creation, you must learn the ways of the Argent Verdict Forgemasters.$b$bAssociate yourself with them and show them your loyalty and dedication.$b$bWhen this is done, we shall discuss the matter further.', 'Perhaps, $c... perhaps.$b$bBut if you would be the one to attempt its creation, you must learn the ways of the Argent Verdict Forgemasters.$b$bAssociate yourself with them and show them your loyalty and dedication.$b$bWhen this is done, we shall discuss the matter further', 37189, 0, 8943, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there is any hope, you must allow me to try!', 'If there is any hope, allow me to try!', 37188, 0, 8943, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have pondered the matter unceasingly.$b$bI believe that a weapon might be fashioned which would rival Frostmourne in power without enslaving  its master.$b$bNevermind it, $r. Even if it were possible, there\'s not time to create such an artifact.$b$bIt is best that you focus your energies on our assault.', '', 37187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me then, Highlord Mograine. What can be done?', 'Tell me then, Highlord Mograine. What can be done?', 37186, 0, 8943, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolishness! Do you know nothing of that accursed blade, $c?$b$bIt would devour all that you are. Whatever remained of your lifeless husk would spend eternity in the enemy\'s service.$b$bIt is that same rationale that bought Arthas his fate, costing Azeroth legions of its best champions.$b$bStill, there may be something....', '', 37185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With Frostmourne, could I defeat the Lich King?', 'With Frostmourne, could I defeat the Lich King?', 37184, 0, 8943, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Alchemist Finklestein, $c. He can set you on the path.$b$bDemonstrate your loyalty and their methods shall be made known to you.', '', 37183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I learn to work Primordial Saronite?', 'How can I learn to work Primordial Saronite?', 37182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashen Verdict is a select group of the most talented craftsmen in the Ebon Blade and Argent Crusade. Its creation symbolizes the unity of our forces as we mount this final assault on the Lich King and his minions.$b$bIt is through the Ashen Verdict\'s efforts that we have discovered how to bend primordial saronite to our will.', '', 37181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the Ashen Verdict?', 'What is the Ashen Verdict?', 37180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready yourself, $c.$b$bThe time has come for the Lich King\'s reign to come to an end.', '', 37179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forgemaster is dead! Get geared up men, we have a Scourgelord to kill.', '', 37178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no escape!', '', 37177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17217, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another dead end.', '', 37176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17219, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Succumb to the chill of the grave.', '', 37175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17218, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death\'s cold embrace awaits.', '', 37174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17221, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not make the same mistake again, Sylvanas. This time there will be no escape. You will all serve me in death!', '', 37173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17213, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your allies have arrived, Jaina, just as you promised. You will all become powerful agents of the Scourge.', '', 37172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17212, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are safe... for now. His strength has increased tenfold since our last battle. It will take a mighty army to destroy the Lich King. An army greater than even the Horde can rouse.', 37171, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 17062, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'BLASTED DEAD END! So this is how it ends. Prepare yourselves, heroes, for today we make our final stand!', 37170, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 17061, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot hold him for long, we must leave at once!', 37169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s... too powerful. Heroes, quickly... come to me! We must leave this place at once! I will do what I can to hold him in place while we flee.', 37168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall kill you myself!', '', 37167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
