('You will fall as your lands and your city have before you. My lord will win a great victory here, and none will remember your name!', '', 37160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen well, Scourge defilers. None of you will reach the Sunwell so long as I stand!', '', 37159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
