('These appear to be the remains of Thalorien Dawnseeker, the last wielder of Quel\'Delar.', '', 37148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember when the Barrens was ... barren. And we liked it!', 'I remember when the Barrens was ... barren. And we liked it!', 37147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
