('I think this jungle wants to eat me!', 'I think this jungle wants to eat me!', 37145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ... me ... out of here!', 'Get ... me ... out of here!', 37144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had enough of this jungle!', 'I\'ve had enough of this jungle!', 37143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew! I\'m never eating asparagus again.', 'Whew! I\'m never eating asparagus again.', 37142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
