('I must break you now.', '', 37132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Snort>? <Gurgle>!', '', 37131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ... survive the boars? <Snort> So many boars! So sad! <Gurgle>', '', 37130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strong enough for THE BOARPOCALYPSE?', '', 37129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, <Snort> you are strong <Gurgle>. But...', '', 37128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 37127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will make example of $r <Snort>! Prepare yourself <Gurgle> soft-for-face.', '', 37126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? <Gurgle> <Snort> The $r has come? To challenge mighty Sabersnout <Snort>?', '', 37125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a savior! I don\'t know what those things wanted from us...', 'You\'re a savior! I don\'t know what those things wanted from us...', 37124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are the refugees still gathering at Camp Una\'fe?', 'Are the refugees still gathering at Camp Una\'fe?', 37123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only understand a few words of the quilboar tongue, but I didn\'t like what I heard.', 'I only understand a few words of the quilboar tongue, but I didn\'t like what I heard.', 37122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
