('Free at last!', 'Free at last!', 37120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you thought you had problems with trolls in Coldridge, wait \'til you get to Kharanos!  That big cataclysm got the trolls all stirred up out here.', '', 37119, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems you Coldridge folks are dreadfully under-informed about the events of the last few days.', '', 37118, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, there you are.  Hello!  I figured that, while you\'re flying to Kharanos, I\'d give you some data about what\'s going on outside of Coldridge Valley.', '', 37117, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will delay here until more reinforcements arrive, but you have to keep moving.$B$BWe won\'t have much time until Arthas realizes we\'re here.', 37116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Static>$bIs this thing on?  Hello?', '', 37115, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There there, little hunter. I\'m here for you.', 37114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sleep now, little one. We\'ll find your parents soon.', 37113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hush, hush. It\'s okay little one.', 37112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They attacked Taurajo while our strongest were on the hunt. By some miracle, there was a gap in the Alliance lines through which myself and some others were able to carry the little ones...$B$B<Tawane trails off, trying not to cry in front of the children.>', 37111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In our native tongue, \"Una\'fe\" can be translated as \"Refuge.\" But the name no longer fits. From the moment we set up this camp, this strange jungle has threatened to engulf it. ', 37110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, feel my master\'s limitless power and despair!', 37109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s prepares to unleash a wave of blistering cold!', 37108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vinny, I just gotta get me a genuine Cataclysm souvenir!', 'Vinny, I just gotta get me a genuine Cataclysm souvenir!', 37107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Volcano rocks! Limited time offer! Papers of authenticity and everything!', '', 37106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must not approach the Frost Queen. Quickly, stop them!', 'You must not approach the Frost Queen. Quickly, stop them!', 37105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17167, 17167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Volcano rocks. Million and one uses. Lava, java, sauna, banana....', '', 37104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Papers to weigh? Doors to stop? Windows to break? bam, Bam, BAM! Volcano rocks.', '', 37103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take home a piece of the Cataclysm! Volcano rocks for sale - hot, Hot, HOT!', '', 37102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your volcano rocks here! ...Great for cats!', '', 37101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Volcano rocks - new low price! You\'re gonna love my rocks.', '', 37100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Volcano rocks for sale! Hot off the mountain! You want \'em, I got \'em!', '', 37099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Volcano rocks! Get your volcano rocks here!', '', 37098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions, destroy these interlopers!', '', 37096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your last waking memory will be of agonizing pain.', '', 37095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrmph, fodder. Not even fit to labor in the quarry. Relish these final moments for soon you will be nothing more than mindless undead.', '', 37094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders have entered the master\'s domain. Signal the alarms!', '', 37093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Free any Alliance slaves that you come across. We will most certainly need their assistance in battling Tyrannus. I will gather reinforcements and join you on the other side of the quarry.', 37091, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will have to make your way across this quarry on your own.', 37090, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do what I must. Please forgive me, noble soldiers.', 37089, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'NO! YOU MONSTER!', 37088, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 16627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroes of the Alliance, attack!', 37087, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 16626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tapping', 'Tapping', 37086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kelsuwa doesn\'t make eye contact with you.>$B$BI escaped amidst the fighting, but not before freeing all the stabled animals.$B$BI couldn\'t keep them with me. They scattered into the smoke...', '', 37083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By dusk, the flames towered into the sky. I lost everything. Everything.$B$BWhy would they burn an inn?', '', 37082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you do, $c?', '', 37081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you can see, we\'ve cleared out the rockslide.  The tremendous loss of life was regrettable, but you can now pass freely through the trogg-infested tunnel.$b$bYou\'re welcome!', '', 37080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d almost given up hope.', 'I\'d almost given up hope.', 37079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My gosh, it\'s full of rocks!', '', 37078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t... let Finklestein use me... for his potions...', '', 37077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You miserable fools never did manage to select a decent bat wing.', '', 37076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THAT was for bringing me spoiled spider ichor!\n', '', 37075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never... could reach... the top shelf...', '', 37074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel like I\'ve been cooped up in here forever.  Is it Brewfest yet?', 'I feel like I\'ve been cooped up in here forever.  Is it Brewfest yet?', 37073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n!  I hear you\'re Ironstock\'s new little whipping $r.  What\'s she got ya doin\' now?', '$n!  I hear you\'re Ironstock\'s new little whipping $r.  What\'s she got ya doin\' now?', 37072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'d think that, after an earthquake of cataclysmic proportions, the LAST place ye\'d want ta be is indoors, wouldn\'t ye?', 'Ye\'d think that, after an earthquake of cataclysmic proportions, the LAST place ye\'d want ta be is indoors, wouldn\'t ye?', 37071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s gettin\' awful crowded in here.  I don\'t do well in confined spaces.', 'It\'s gettin\' awful crowded in here.  I don\'t do well in confined spaces.', 37070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have ye any news from outside?  I hear the trolls have been actin\' up too.', 'Have ye any news from outside?  I hear the trolls have been actin\' up too.', 37069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Might as well make yerself comfortable.  Ironstock\'s not lettin\' anybody out until the troggs die down.', 'Might as well make yerself comfortable.  Ironstock\'s not lettin\' anybody out until the troggs die down.', 37068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are all these troggs coming from?  Were they livin\' underground the whole time?', 'Where are all these troggs coming from?  Were they livin\' underground the whole time?', 37067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When d\'ye think we can leave?  I need ta get back to work.', 'When d\'ye think we can leave?  I need ta get back to work.', 37066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Miserable creatures! Die! ', 37065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_unstableaffliction_2.blp:16|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000Unstable Ooze Explosion!|r', '', 37064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tink I made an angry poo-poo. It gonna blow!', '', 37063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me another shot at kicking the winning goal, coach!', 'Give me another shot at kicking the winning goal, coach!', 37062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 37061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh dear.  Things aren\'t looking good for Felix.', '', 37060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To fight, yes. To die? Likely. But we will give them no ground, $c.$B$BWe are outnumbered. Our armor is patchwork, our weapons scavenged.$B$BBut this is our land! Our tauren allies know every hidden trail, crevice, and pass through these hills. We descend from the high ground where they least expect us, then disappear into the terrain like phantoms. Fear is our weapon, and we will strike at them unceasingly.', '', 37059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your men stayed behind to fight.', 'You and your men stayed behind to fight.', 37058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. We regrouped east of the pass and prepared a counter-attack, but the next day, the skies reddened and the land was cleaved in two, as easily as a child might split open a cactus apple. See how the devastation stretches from horizon to horizon?$B$BOur Alliance foes in their makeshift bunkers were as surprised and disorganized as we were by the disaster. It would\'ve been the perfect time to strike! But Warlord Gar\'dul insisted we pull back to the south to refortify.$B$B<Kilrok spits on the ground.>$B$BNot all of us followed. I stood toe-to-toe with demons in the last war, $n. I\'m not about to turn tail and let the Alliance plant roots on my soil.', '', 37057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of the Light knows no bounds, Saurfang. His soul is under great strain, but he lives - for now.', '', 37056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor\'kron, prepare Orgrim\'s Hammer for its final voyage! Champions, our gunship will find a point to dock on the upper reaches of the citadel. Meet us there!', '', 37055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our mission is now clear: The Lich King will answer for his crimes and we will save Highlord Bolvar Fordragon!', '', 37054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then we must save him! If we rescue Bolvar Fordragon, we may quell the unrest between the Alliance and the Horde.', '', 37053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was before the Cataclysm?', 'This was before the Cataclysm?', 37052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The paladin still lives? Is it possible, Highlord? Could he have survived?', '', 37051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kick the Footbomb between the smokestacks up and behind the opposing goal!', '', 37050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good news, everyone! I\'ve fixed the poison slime pipes!', '', 37049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was a clever ruse, $n. Alliance forces streamed out of Northwatch and marched up the gold road, besieging Crossroads as dusk fell. Then, in the heart of the night, they force-marched southward, leaving their campfires burning behind.$B$BOur meager forces at Honor\'s Stand were caught unawares as the Alliance poured through the pass at dawn\'s first light. Many of our bravest warriors fell before their blades.', '', 37048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 15, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kilrok, how did we lose Honor\'s Stand?', 'Kilrok, how did we lose Honor\'s Stand?', 37047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes, ye must fight yer way to a clear extraction point within Icecrown. We\'ll try an\' rendezvous on the ramparts!', '', 37046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are outnumbered here, our ties to Crossroads and Durotar severed. But one orc is worth 10 Alliance cowards.$B$BWe will bottle them up in this pass and gut them like swine.', '', 37045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions, destroy these interlopers.', '', 37044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare the Skybreaker fer an aerial assault on the citadel!', '', 37043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your last waking memory will be of agonizing pain.', '', 37042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did that dragon do to Mount Kajaro?!!!', 'What did that dragon do to Mount Kajaro?!!!', 37041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrmph, fodder. Not even fit to labor in the quarry. Relish these final moments, for soon you will be nothing more than mindless undead.', '', 37040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders have entered your master\'s domain. Signal the alarms!', '', 37039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light, it must be so!', '', 37038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could it be, Lord Fordring? If Bolvar lives, mayhap there is hope fer peace between the Alliance and the Horde. We must reach the top o\' this cursed place and free the paladin!', '', 37037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the end, you will all serve me.', '', 37036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NEVER! I... I will never... serve... you...', '', 37035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The breaking of this one has been taxing. The atrocities I have committed upon his soul. He has resisted for so long, but he will bow down before his king soon.', '', 37034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But that honor is no longer yours. Soon, I will have a new champion.', '', 37033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You could have been my greatest champion, Fordring: A force of darkness that would wash over this world and deliver it into a new age of strife.', '', 37032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARTHAS! I swore that I would see you dead and the Scourge dismantled! I\'m going to finish what I started at Light\'s Hope!', '', 37031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You now stand upon the hallowed ground of the Scourge. The Light won\'t protect you here, paladin. Nothing will protect you...', '', 37030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our march upon Icecrown Citadel begins now!', '', 37029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, heroes, fear is your greatest enemy in these befouled halls. Steel your heart and your soul will shine brighter than a thousand suns. The enemy will falter at the sight of you. They will fall as the light of righteousness envelops them!', '', 37028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people!\n', '', 37027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, I\'m sure safety is your top priority. Give me a rocket pack.', 'Yeah, I\'m sure safety is your top priority. Give me a rocket pack.', 37026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you\'re just the $c I was looking for! I\'m testing a new rocket-powered flying device, and I need your help!\n\nJust take one of these harnesses and put it on under your armor.  Hit the button on the side, and BOOM, off you go.\n\nDon\'t go trying to steal my work though. Each of these babies is fitted with a Transponster 8000 linked to the one in my hand. If you get too far from me the Transponster will shut down the main rocket and you\'ll be unable to lift off until you return.\n\nNow where did I put those liability forms?', '', 37025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may have once fought beside me, Crok, but now you are nothing more than a traitor. Come, your second death approaches!', 37024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may have once fought beside me, Crok, but now you are nothing more than a traitor. Come, your second death approaches!', 37022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry,  before that Val\'kyr picks us off!', '', 37021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolish Crok. You brought my reinforcements with you. Arise, Argent Champions, and serve the Lich King in death!', 37020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 17019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I AM FROM THE ELEMENTAL PLANE!', '', 37019, 12, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll remain and inform Tirion of our progress. You must press on and bring down Sindragosa. Lok\'tar, champions! ', '', 37018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll draw her attacks. Return our brothers to their graves, then help me bring her down!', '', 37017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her reinforcements will arrive shortly, we must bring her down quickly!', '', 37016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Quickly, push on!', '', 37015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Push forward! ', '', 37014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draw them back to us, and we\'ll assist you. ', '', 37013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trolls are acting strangely, $n.  I don\'t like it.  I don\'t like it one bit.', '', 37012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What d\'ye want, $c?', 37011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take that, ye cave-dwellin\' mongrel!$b$bAhh... how can I help ye, $n?', '', 37010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Ironforge!', '', 37009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat dwarven lead!', '', 37008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back, ye filthy beast!', '', 37007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for a fellow by the name of Milo Geartwinge.  I suppose I\'ll see what I can do about this cave-in.', '', 37006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From these hidden paths we can rain terror down on our enemies below.$B$BThere is not much honor in hit-and-run strikes, but a good warrior knows to keep his foe off-balance.', '', 37005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recommend that you return to Anvilmar, $n... and quickly!  I\'ll send the signal to the Gnomeregan Airmen.', '', 37004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, so you\'re just going to head through this tunnel and whaaaaa....?', '', 37003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years ago, the Grimtotem raided my village. The pain, the anger, the loss - still they weigh on my heart.$B$BAnd now I find myself giving comfort and aid to others who have lost their village to a savage attack.', '', 37002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye aye!', 'Aye aye!', 37001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17159, 17159, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skybreaker infantry, hold position!', 'Skybreaker infantry, hold position!', 37000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These hills and hidden trails are my home. For years I have used them on the hunt.$B$BI never thought I\'d use them to fight a war.', 36999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s an opening up ahead. GO NOW!', 36998, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16645, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, climb aboard! We mustn\'t tarry here! There\'s no telling when this whole mountainside will collapse.', '', 36997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Muradin is waiting aboard the Skybreaker. We\'ll secure the area until you are ready for take off.', 'Captain  Muradin is waiting aboard the Skybreaker. We\'ll secure the area until you are ready for take off.', 36996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks. We were outnumbered until you arrived. ', 'You have my thanks. We were outnumbered until you arrived. ', 36995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17157, 17157, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nowhere to run... You\'re mine now!', '', 36994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17223, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FIRE! FIRE!', '', 36993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16721, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It... It\'s a dead end. We have no choice but to fight. Steel yourselves, heroes, for this is our last stand!', 36992, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16647, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We now know what must be done. I will deliver this news to King Varian and Highlord Fordring.', 36991, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16649, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgive me, heroes. I should have listened to Uther. I... I just had to see for myself. To look into his eyes one last time. I am sorry.', 36990, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16648, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to receive training.', 'I would like to receive training.', 36989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, to be finally free of that cage...', 'Ah, to be finally free of that cage...\n', 36988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse this foul cage...', 'Curse this foul cage...', 36987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lost your Rocket Pack? Have you checked your bags?', '', 36986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw your Footbombs at those Steamwheedle Sharks!', '', 36985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, much better.  I owe ya one.', 'Ahh, much better.  I owe ya one.', 36984, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer a lifesaver!  For Ironforge!', 'Yer a lifesaver!  For Ironforge!', 36983, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks!  I can make it from here.', 'Thanks!  I can make it from here.', 36982, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ought to help!', 'This ought to help!', 36981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17155, 17155, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coach, get me back into the game!', 'Coach, get me back into the game!', 36980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No team\'s ever come back from this far behind!', '', 36979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vengeance...', '', 36978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 36977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank goodness you arrived when you did, heroes. Orgrim\'s Hammer has already left. Quickly now, to the Skybreaker! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them.', '', 36976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17154, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recovered your armor and weapons. Victory or death!', 'I recovered your armor and weapons. Victory or death!', 36975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your jormungar can only move if you\'ve submerged beneath the snow, but it cannot attack while submerged. Once your jormungar emerges, it can use its powerful acid attack to wear through the armor of the Iron Colossus. Be ready to submerge to escape from the Iron Colossus\'s most devastating attacks.', '', 36974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s Joren doin\' out there, anyhow?', 36973, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s keep this fire going, dwarves!', 36972, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t fret, we\'ll be outta here soon.', 36971, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get ta work, boys!', 36970, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No orc should ever flee from battle as I did. Leave me to my disgrace. Would that I would die in this tower, but I dread learning what my ancestors think of my cowardice.', '', 36969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not look at me, $r. I have disgraced the Horde. I am done.', '', 36968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My commander was butchered before my eyes - my brothers dead all around me - I could not fight on. I am so ashamed, $c. I did not avenge them.', '', 36967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We grunts were ordered to charge once more - into a wall of pikes - I could not do it, $c. My weapon slid from my hands and my legs did not move.$B$BI am dishonored.', '', 36966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De spirit come from deep down to talk with Grik\'nir.', 36965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But beneath the earth, child, there always be fire.', 36964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our land be a land of ice an\' snow.', 36963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da spirits be angry with us.', 36962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon enough we take over dis valley.  Soon enough.', 36961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grik\'nir says he gon\' talk to the elemental, get it to fight on our side.', 36960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\' worry, child.  Grik\'nir gonna help us get through this.', 36959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\' know why the spirits be rejectin\' us so.', 36958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What we gon\' do now, you ask?  We wait.', 36957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s can barely maintain its form!', '', 36956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\' wanna die in a fire, mon.', '', 36955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go attack him first, mon.  I don\' attack him quite yet.', '', 36954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First da fire, and now da $r!  You gonna die!', '', 36953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is growing volatile!', '', 36952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No hit me! Tell Peake I been good.', '', 36951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grows more unstable!', '', 36950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am from the elemental plane!', '', 36949, 12, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even dying here beats spending another day collecting reagents for that madman, Finklestein. ', '', 36948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! I expect this $r to be clapped into chains!', '', 36947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough idle banter! Our champions have arrived - support them as we push our way through the hall!', '', 36946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready your arms, my Argent Brothers. The Vrykul will protect the Frost Queen with their lives.', '', 36945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the price they\'re getting on this operation, I\'m hoping for a nice hefty profit sharing check. They better not shortchange us again.', '', 36944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have opened the portal to my retreat. Go and rest. I\'ll need you lively when our studies resume in the morning, you nimble little thing.', '', 36943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you open a portal to your tower for me, Archmage Xylem?', 'Can you open a portal to your tower for me, Archmage Xylem?', 36942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am truly blessed to have so many loyal and dedicated apprentices. My work would be impossible without this influx of test subjects.', '', 36941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooooh... looking sexy!', '', 36940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements are fickle and best left out of untrained hands.  My apologies, but I have no need for yours.', 'The elements are fickle and best left out of untrained hands.  My apologies, but I have no need for yours.', 36939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements favor you.  What will you ask of them?', 'The elements favor you.  What will you ask of them?', 36938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Testing, 1... 2... 3!', '', 36937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most definitely.  Might you mentor me?', 'Most definitely.  Might you mentor me?', 36936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir, I think the explosions and gunfire gave us away. You don\'t have to use hand signals.', '', 36935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think that\'s physically possible, sir.', '', 36934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leading under the influence...', '', 36933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s just rude...', '', 36932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did you just call my mother?', '', 36931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
