('$G Sir.:Ma\'am.;', '', 36924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people.$B$BRemember, hero, fear is your greatest enemy in these befouled halls. Steel your heart and your soul will shine brighter than a thousand suns. The enemy will falter at the sight of you. They will fall as the light of righteousness envelops them!', '', 36923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Found!', 'Found!', 36922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, I have failed...', '', 36921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16922, 0, 1, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 39653),
('My companions are all accounted for, Muradin. Let\'s go!', 'My companions are all accounted for, Muradin. Let\'s go!', 36920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The old wounds still linger, $g lad:lass;. I can feel \'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I\'m gonna give that boy the beatin\' I shoulda given \'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with \'im.$B$BTell me when yer crew is ready and we\'ll lift off for the top o\' the citadel.$B$BArthas won\'t be expectin\' this!', '', 36919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is reclaimed by the earth!', '', 36918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t over, Baine...', '', 36917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is for you.', '', 36916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
