('You got here just in time.  Thanks!', 'You got here just in time.  Thanks!', 36909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve come seeking your death? Happy to oblige.', 36908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
