('WHAT CHANCE HAVE YOU?', '', 36901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It took a coward\'s poison and the fury of Hellscream to bring my father down.', '', 36900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die in shame like your pathetic father.', '', 36899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think so, little wyrm.', '', 36898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have saved Azuregos, $r, but your life ends here.', '', 36897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baine! You\'ve shown yourself! GET HIM!', '', 36896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not worry, young one. I knew that our arrangement was... temporary. I will be fine.$B$BYou though, you do not belong here. It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living.$B$BThis one is on me.', 36895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So have I, Grimtotem.', '', 36894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had enough of this!', '', 36893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek Azuregos? Bane of the Bitter Reaches? Scourge of the Bay of Storms? Lord of all magic in Azshara?$B$BWell, you\'ve found him.$B$B<Azuregos appears to be smiling.>', '', 36892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is all YOUR fault, Sten!', '', 36891, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just give me the \'copter, Friz.', 'Just give me the \'copter, Friz.', 36890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grapplehammer wants me to do WHAT? He\'s finally finished his bomb and he wants ME to fly it across the harbor? No-sir-ee!$B$BHere, I\'ll set one of my \'copters on autopiliot for you. Good luck!$B$BI\'ll be in my shelter.', '', 36889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It takes a few good crashes to really \"season\" a flying machine.$B$BNo goblin in their right mind flies one pristine.', '', 36888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What on earth is going on here?!?!', '', 36887, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot hold him for long, we must leave at once!', 36886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready! Let\'s go!', 'We\'re ready! Let\'s go!', 36885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this supposed to be a counterrecoil recuperating cylinder? I call it CRAP. Build it again!', '', 36884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flink, did you compile the compression data for the hydropneumatic recoil jack yet? Chop chop!', '', 36883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blazcowiz, you\'d better get those recoil cylinders greased. Or I will grease them with your FACE.', '', 36882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? I told you I wanted stepped threads on the interrupted breechblock! We\'re going to have to re-engineer the whole loading mechanism! ', '', 36881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step it up, Horvik. You too, Gleenix! Grapplehammer demands nothing less than perfection here. ', '', 36880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call that a trigger assembly? This is not a toy, people!', '', 36879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah yeah. I\'m on my way. Don\'t get your chain panties in a bunch.', '', 36878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to let him know right away. Meet us at Sable Ridge.', 'I\'m going to let him know right away. Meet us at Sable Ridge.', 36877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah yeah, I\'ll come to his rescue.$B$BDon\'t you fall into his little center-of-the-world hero bit though! He just likes the attention. I swear, he thinks he\'s going to be the next Aspect. It\'s laughable.', '', 36876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll come then?', 'You\'ll come then?', 36875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s going after them? And he sent you to ask me for help? Was there begging? Were there tears?$B$B<Azuregos stares off into the distance as a toothy smile creeps onto his face.>$B$BYou know, if I came to his rescue, there\'s no way he could ever live it down. Maybe he\'d make me one of those little Sunwell girls of my very own.$B$BNo offense, Anara.', '', 36874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But Kalecgos is already out there trying to stop them. He needs your help.', 'But Kalecgos is already out there trying to stop them. He needs your help.', 36873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why bother? It\'s not like they actually have even the slightest clue where I am. They\'re not going to do any harm to the already-found artifacts around here.$B$BAnyway, one of the amusingly convenient things about evil and destruction is that they tend to just evilly destruct each other eventually.', '', 36872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You already know? Why don\'t you go stop them then?', 'You already know? Why don\'t you go stop them then?', 36871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh. That? Thought I hadn\'t noticed the scorched earth and senseless slaughter that usually give them away? I\'m not THAT old.', '', 36870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the... forget it. I\'m here to warn you that the black dragonflight is here hunting you.', 'I\'m the... forget it. I\'m here to warn you that the black dragonflight is here hunting you.', 36869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well get to it then. You\'re the one veering off onto all these unnecessary topics.', '', 36868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s not what I was saying at all.', 'That\'s not what I was saying at all.', 36867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know. I KNOW. We could never be, right? Dragon and Spirit Healer... two different worlds! Not to mention the physiological problems.$B$BBut you\'re wrong. We have a deeper connection than that. Anara and I, we\'re involved.$B$BBesides, I kind of like it here. No adventurers to poke and prod me with no provocation.', '', 36866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, I didn\'t mean to be rude, I just...', 'I\'m sorry, I didn\'t mean to be rude, I just...', 36865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She has a name, you know. Anara. You\'d do well to treat her with the respect she deserves.$B$BHow many times have she and her sisters brought you back from the grip of death itself? You\'re just all kinds of inconsiderate, aren\'t you?', '', 36864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...the spirit healer?\n', '...the spirit healer?\n', 36863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A dragon? Hah! Don\'t be ridiculous.$B$BYou know $r, you\'re awfully rude. She\'s standing right here!', '', 36862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Met someone? I didn\'t know there were any other dragons out here.', 'Met someone? I didn\'t know there were any other dragons out here.', 36861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course you are. Here to save big blue from himself, spending all his time in the spirit world, obsessing over magical artifacts. Kalec doesn\'t understand though, I\'ve turned a new leaf.$B$BI\'ve met someone.', '', 36860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No no no, you don\'t understand. I\'m here to help.', 'No no no, you don\'t understand. I\'m here to help.', 36859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalecgos?! That\'s your good foot forward?$B$BGood luck with that one, buddy.', '', 36858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalec sent me...', 'Kalec sent me...', 36857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Frostmourne lies unguarded? Impossible!', 36856, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 16612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a cruel end. Come, heroes. We must see if the gnome\'s story is true. If we can separate Arthas from Frostmourne, we might have a chance at stopping him.', 36855, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not so naive as to believe your appeal for clemency, but I will listen.', 36854, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
