('Good to see you again, $n.', '', 36850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be sure to keep an eye out for recruitment posters in Gobland. Once we get that operation under way, it would be good to have you on board again.', '', 36849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
