('What you seek is in the master\'s lair, but you must destroy Tyrannus to gain entry. Now, within the Halls of Reflection you will find Frostmourne. It... It holds the truth.', '', 36842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait! Stop! Don\'t kill me, please! I\'ll tell you everything!', '', 36841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... taking so long... my limbs... can\'t go on...', 'Ugh... taking so long... my limbs... can\'t go on...', 36840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That worg of a taskmaster. It\'s only a matter of time before he gets what\'s coming to him.', 'That worg of a taskmaster. It\'s only a matter of time before he gets what\'s coming to him.', 36839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We came here to investigate and were caught like a gnome with his hand on King Mekkatorque\'s throne. ', 'We came here to investigate and were caught like a gnome with his hand on King Mekkatorque\'s throne. ', 36838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does the Lich King need with living servants? Why doesn\'t he just kill us all?', 'What does the Lich King need with living servants? Why doesn\'t he just kill us all?', 36837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m shocked they didn\'t take our clothing with our weapons...', 'I\'m shocked they didn\'t take our clothing with our weapons...', 36836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slaves to our own prince, we\'re treated worse alive than dead. ', 'Slaves to our own prince, we\'re treated worse alive than dead. ', 36835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s hard to believe that I once respected Arthas.', 'It\'s hard to believe that I once respected Arthas.', 36834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The raptor peers at you, growls, and slobbers.>$B$B<It appears Subject Nine left behind an un-augmented clone of herself in order to cover her tracks. Clever girl! You ponder over what exactly you\'ve unleashed onto the cosmos...>', 36833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you renew my Silver Covenant disguise, Magister Hathorel?', 'Would you renew my Silver Covenant disguise, Magister Hathorel?', 36832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THIS IS A TEST', '', 36831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you renew my Sunreaver disguise?', 'Would you renew my Sunreaver disguise?', 36830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll deliver the tome to our contacts in Icecrown, arcanist.', 'I\'ll deliver the tome to our contacts in Icecrown, arcanist.', 36829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you are! I was beginning to think that the Sunreavers had intercepted you. Are you ready to deliver the tome to our representatives in Icecrown?', '', 36828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll... get... back... to... work... I... promise.', 'I\'ll... get... back... to... work... I... promise.', 36827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, no more! I just need to rest for a moment!', 'Please, no more! I just need to rest for a moment!', 36826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never trust the Sunreavers. They are hard at work undermining us in the eyes of our Argent Crusade allies.', '', 36825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to deliver the tome, Magister Hathorel.', 'I\'m ready to deliver the tome, Magister Hathorel.', 36824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, you\'re here. We have to get this tome to Icecrown as quickly as we can.', '', 36823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your business here, $c?', '', 36822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is too powerful. We must leave this place at once! My magic can hold him in place for only a short time. Come quickly, heroes!', 36821, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 16644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pirates are NOT in my contract!', 36820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And to yours, brat.', '', 36819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To your health, windbag.', '', 36818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aquanos, stop sending the clothes so high! You didn\'t have to see the look on Aethas Sunreaver\'s face when he found his pants in the fountain!', '', 36817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Is drink time?', '', 36816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mouth tastes wet!', '', 36815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You make face soaky.', '', 36814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chilly tickles!', '', 36813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My, that\'s quite a load you have there.', '', 36812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pirates?! Nobody said anything about pirates!$B$BDon\'t let them get me, boss. I\'m too young to die!!!', '', 36811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A hand-lettered sign reads:>$B$B          Secret Lab Archives$B     X. Nizzlebex, Lab Director$B$B$B<It appears nobody is home right now. Perhaps you should come back later?>', '', 36810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You didn\'t even make it 20 more feet that time.', '', 36809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m charging you for hazard pay on this one, pal.', '', 36808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s 3 for you, buddy. One more and my fee goes up.', '', 36807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Walk it off.', '', 36806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to work!', '', 36805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not getting out of your debts that easy.', '', 36804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more lying down on the job.', '', 36803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rez incoming!', '', 36802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light is money, friend.', '', 36801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got what you need!', '', 36800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love the smell of salvation in the morning.', '', 36799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Health from above!', '', 36798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got the best heals, anywhere!', '', 36797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have I got a heal for you!', '', 36796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 36795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take my fee out of your paycheck.', '', 36794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your salvation has arrived... and it\'s affordably priced!', '', 36793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to need you to do something else in a moment.', '', 36792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See how easy that was with everyone working together? Just take what you need from the clean laundry here, but don\'t forget to return it when you\'re finished.', '', 36791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tub needs more water!', '', 36790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Add the unmentionables... uh, I mean, the \'delicates\'!', '', 36789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick, add some shirts to the laundry!', '', 36788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toss some pants in to the tub!', '', 36787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They don\'t pay me enough to put up with this kind of unprofitable behavior!', '', 36786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did the two of you ever make it to the executive level?', '', 36785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t wait to learn how to Hex. The two of you are going to be frogs for the rest of your miserable lives!', '', 36784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time, I won\'t miss!', '', 36783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadow and fire, how quaint. Ride the lightning!', '', 36782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You two mooks stow it. The boss is here!', '', 36781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taking all bets on who wins between these two idiots.', '', 36780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would one of you hurry up and finish off the other? Some of us are trying to make some moolah here!', '', 36779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Discretion is the better part of valor, after all.', '', 36778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...perhaps we should seek our fortune somewhere less likely to be fatal.', '', 36777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed.', '', 36776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The two of us against the vast undead sea.', '', 36775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Citadel, correct? Facing the Lich King\'s most powerful minions.', '', 36774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we do succeed here, you realize what comes next.', '', 36773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just as well.', '', 36772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear those lances are rough-hewn, too. I\'m no fan of splinters.', '', 36771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Typical empty boasting. Still, the stables are rather distant and the drinks here are decent enough.', '', 36770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bullheadedness? It is my perseverance that has gotten us this far, dandy. You wouldn\'t last five seconds.', '', 36769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oops.', 'Oops.', 36768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning: shredder is programmed only to function in Azshara.', '', 36767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] What a miserable gnome. That beast would have better off fighting without him.', '', 36766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another shall take his place. You waste your time.', '', 36765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Well done!', '', 36764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, no! That wasn\'t right. Now I\'ll have to go get more detergent so we can start over!', '', 36763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See the piles of laundry and the bucket of water? I\'ll call out what I need next, and you put it in the tub. Ready?', '', 36762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in luck. I\'ve got just what you need in the load I\'m about to wash.', '', 36761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arcanist Tybalin said you might be able to lend me a certain tabard.', 'Arcanist Tybalin said you might be able to lend me a certain tabard.', 36760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you surprised to see me here? Everyone needs clean laundry, and what better way to do it than with your own water elemental?$B$BSimply bring your laundry, pay a nominal fee, and before you know it, everything will be fresh and clean!', '', 36759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boom, baby!', '', 36758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gassed up and good to go.', '', 36757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, form it up! If it moves, shoot it. If it shoots... Move it!', '', 36756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no doubt in my mind you\'d lose. Speed and wit triumphs over brute strength and bullheadedness any day of the week.', '', 36755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You realize, of course, that we would likely have to joust one another should we enter the tournament.', '', 36754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He suggested I do something else with the lance, instead. It\'s not my place to repeat vulgarities.', '', 36753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They refused to train you?', '', 36752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Needless to say, when I walked into the pavilion there was something of an altercation.', '', 36751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had a... situation some time back with one of the individuals now heading up the Sunreavers here. A falling out, if you will.', '', 36750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why aren\'t you competing?', '', 36749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah. That might be a problem.', '', 36748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dislike elekks. Strongly.', '', 36747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What could be holding you back? You\'re hale, hearty... missing an eye perhaps, but that shouldn\'t keep you from competing!', '', 36746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know. I am uncertain this is the proper vehicle to heroism.', '', 36745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now comes our chance at redemption, Jadaar. We could become heroes through this tournament!', '', 36744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget, $n - you can now use the summoning stone to port yourself back to my location in Valormok! ', '', 36743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good. Whatever it is you boys do... Do a lot of it.', '', 36742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $n! Now then, let me assemble the team...', '', 36741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enormous stone shimmers with focused arcane energy.$B$BIf Andorel\'s instructions are to be believed, it should be easy to refocus the stone\'s energies.', '', 36740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Use the stone to teleport back to Valormok.>', '<Use the stone to teleport back to Valormok.>', 36739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enormous stone shimmers with focused arcane energy.', '', 36738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ask me, the night elves lost this area ten thousand years ago. Their expulsion today at our hands is merely a formality.', '', 36737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please! No more. I can\'t handle any more of this!', 'Please! No more. I can\'t handle any more of this!', 36736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17152, 17152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was in that \"bisque?\"', '', 36735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ... clam strips ...', '', 36734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"All you can eat\" he says. *Gulp*', '', 36733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was ... the chowder.', '', 36732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shouldn\'t have had ... the clams ...', '', 36731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Urp!*', '', 36730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The orc before you looks greener than usual.>$B$B$C, the goblins have brought \"all you can eat seafood\" to our shores. It is ... *urp* ... like a cataclysm in my belly.', '', 36729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just wanted to let you know that we\'re all counting on you!', 36728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not much, but it just might keep your green skin intact.', 36727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was wondering when I\'d see you again, $n.', 36726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That one\'s free of charge, $g sir : ma\'am;.', 36725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hope you don\'t mind the extra fortitude, boss-$g man : lady;.', 36724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing wrong with a little drive-by fortitude!', 36723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light be with you... for the very low price of a one silver tithe!', 36722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I really should charge you for that.', 36721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Flameshock.blp:20|t|cFFBC0000 OVERHEAT  |r|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Flameshock.blp:20|t', '', 36720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a frenzy!', '', 36719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way! We\'re about to mount an assault on the Scourgelord\'s location! ', 'This way! We\'re about to mount an assault on the Scourgelord\'s location! ', 36718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 17153, 17153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ... doesn\'t end here ... $r.', '', 36717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve sent you to finish me off? Is this the best your Horde can muster?', '', 36716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirit is displeased and attacks!', '', 36715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rimefang, trap them within the tunnel! BURY THEM ALIVE!', 'Rimefang, trap them within the tunnel! BURY THEM ALIVE!', 36714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16757, 16757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ticker, blow this thing.', '', 36713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s set. Get clear!', '', 36712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Almost done.', '', 36711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On it.', '', 36710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Persistent whelps! You will not reach the entrance of my lord\'s lair! Soldiers, destroy them!', 'Persistent whelps! You will not reach the entrance of my lord\'s lair! Soldiers, destroy them!', 36709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16756, 16756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pursuit shall be in vain, intruders, for the Lich King has placed an army of undead at my command! Behold!', 'Your pursuit shall be in vain, intruders, for the Lich King has placed an army of undead at my command! Behold!', 36708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16755, 16755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
