('I\'ve little more than a cursory knowledge of magical artifacts, and the blue flight has enough troubles of its own.$B$BThere was a book in the library about the blades we forged for our mortal allies, but I\'m afraid I\'ve already loaned it to a representative of the Silver Covenant. You\'re not the first person to come asking after information on those ancient swords, $n.', '', 36705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
