('There are more survivors to tend to. I\'ll see you on the shore.', '', 36549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You made the right choice. We all owe you a great deal, $n. Try not to get yourself killed out here.', '', 36548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all I\'ve got. It\'s up to $g him : her; now. You hear me, $n? Come on, snap out of it! Don\'t go into the Light!', '', 36547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! Clear!', '', 36546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back, I\'m going to resuscitate $g him : her;! I hope these wet jumper cables don\'t kill us all!', '', 36545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s $n! $G He\'s : She\'s; the whole reason we\'re still breathing and not crispy fried critters back on Kezan.', '', 36544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gizmo, what are you doing just sitting there? Don\'t you recognize who that is laying next to you?!', '', 36543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s takes in a deep breath...', '', 36542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do we stop it?', 'How do we stop it?', 36541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that $r doing here!?', 'What is that $r doing here!?', 36540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out - it\'s loose...', 'Look out - it\'s loose...', 36539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough moving around! Hold still while I blow them all up!', '', 36538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly! Poison them all while they\'re still close!', '', 36537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, that one! That one! Get that one!', '', 36536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s surges with uncontrolled arcane energies.', '', 36535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes - auuugh!', 'My eyes - auuugh!', 36534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaiiiiieee!', 'Aaiiiiieee!', 36533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My flesh!', 'My flesh!', 36532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to unleash a toxic poison cloud!', '', 36531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is chasing $n.', '', 36530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is chasing you. Run!', '', 36529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um... Al\'teth ... la c\'tolgar? Or something.', 'Um... Al\'teth ... la c\'tolgar? Or something.', 36528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The \"voice\" of the construct seems to emanate from the air around you, ringing in your ears while the hairs on your arms stand up. The construct speaks to you in a language you can\'t understand, with words that sound like multiple voices talking at once.>', '', 36527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vortex of the harvested calls to you!', '', 36526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soul for you, master.', '', 36525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More souls to power the engine!', '', 36524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night elven mages. Pah!', '', 36523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ruins scattered throughout this area are remnants of the night elven civilization at its former peak. They are a treasure trove of information for those who study the arcane.$B$BAnd it would seem they have attracted the attention of a most unusual group of night elven mages. Yes, you heard me $r - night elves are trying to reclaim their magical heritage! I would find it amusing but for the terrible potential should they discover anything of value here.', '', 36522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaja\'mite... you know, the stuff that legend holds helped the entire goblin race to evolve into the ultimate masters of alchemy and engineering?!$B$BIt\'s the stuff that helped us to overthrow our jungle troll oppressors, to take control of Kezan -- may she rest in peace -- and is the most valuable ore in all of existence!$B$BHey, you don\'t think that it\'s having any effect on those monkeys do you?', '', 36521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Refresh my memory on the whole kaja\'mite thing.', 'Refresh my memory on the whole kaja\'mite thing.', 36520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to borrow your tamed jungle cat to get to the cliffs, Kilag.', 'I need to borrow your tamed jungle cat to get to the cliffs, Kilag.', 36519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to get to the cliffs and Scout Brax, $n.', '', 36518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your Infrared Heat Focals!', '', 36517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll want to look in the Undercity.  In the old Ruins of Lordaeron, south of here, you\'ll find an elevator down. Once you\'re there, ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions.', 'You\'ll want to look in the Undercity.  In the old Ruins of Lordaeron, south of here, you\'ll find an elevator down. Once you\'re there, ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions.', 36516, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GASP, THIS IS A TEST', '', 36515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I uh - I could use a little help here?', '', 36514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Hmmm, once again I\'ve forgotten who I am and what I\'m doing here. Call me back if anything comes up.', '', 36513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let Clubnik know that the priesthood will be sending him a bill. For the Light!', '', 36512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terrific! That went down nice and clean.', '', 36511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, goblin!', 'Die, goblin!', 36510, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cleanse thee with holy fire!', '', 36509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power tools compel you! The power tools compel you!', '', 36508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cast you out! Unclean spirit - Begone!', '', 36507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! We got a live one here!', '', 36506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This calls for an old-fashioned bulldozer exorcism! Give me a hand if she gets uppity, will ya?', '', 36505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, there\'s your problem! You have what we call a ghost in the machine.', '', 36504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise to the Light, $gbrother:sister; $n! Let\'s take a look here...', '', 36503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s makes a heavy snort as he sniffs and nibbles at Sorata\'s clothes.', '', 36502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not anger me!', '', 36501, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I pity the fool!', '', 36500, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence, fool!', '', 36499, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'ll be very tasteful!', '', 36498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howsabout a ... Memorial  Fuel Depot?', '', 36497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure I hear ya.', '', 36496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Clubnik? I hope you die. In a fire.', 36495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you hear that, Clubnik? Those that died defending Lake Mennar are heroes. Their selfless actions may have even saved this entire world! A memorial should be erected.', 36494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First you, $r. Tomorrow: the world!', '', 36493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, fresh sustenance!', '', 36492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your miniscule intellect is no match for my superior claws!', '', 36491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s light this candle!', 36490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell, Azeroth. I leave behind a world steeped in filth and wracked by cataclysm.', 36489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s wounds begin to heal.', '', 36488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sweet, adorable progeny!', 36487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would like to reiterate how pleased I am with the continued development of our working relationship, $n. In the weeks following my stunning cognitive enhancement, my goblin benefactors became apprehensive, perhaps outright distrustful, as my intellect eclipsed theirs.$B$BWhat a shame that my progenitors were unable to prevent this recent cascading series of industrial \'accidents\' that now allows me to operate so unencumbered...', 36486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the stuff! All awake now. Tasty!', '', 36485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s takes a drink of his brew and jitters uncontrollably for a few moments.', '', 36484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Summoned by a fumbling $r? Unbelievable. Desperate or stupid, this will be your final mistake.', '', 36483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior-Matic NX-01 online.$B$BPlease insert coins for training.', '', 36482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior-Matic NX-01 is currently offline.', '', 36481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, $n. I for one am glad to be away from those darned monkeys!$B$BSo, want to hone your skills with a little training?', 36480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, $n. I for one am glad to be away from those damned monkeys!', 36479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sounds like you\'ve had quite the adventure, $n. There must have been plenty of moolah on those Alliance creeps.$B$BWant to purchase some training?', 36478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sounds like you\'ve had quite the adventure, $n. There must have been plenty of moolah on those Alliance creeps.', 36477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good job, $n! Isn\'t this all very exciting? I wonder what the next island will be like?$B$BCan I teach you anything new?', '', 36476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good job, $n! Isn\'t this all very exciting? I wonder what the next island will be like?', '', 36475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw Dampwick ride across on that thing. I\'d rather use a Slow Fall spell, but I don\'t know that one yet.$B$BWant some training, $n?', '', 36474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw Dampwick ride across on that thing. I\'d rather use a Slow Fall spell, but I don\'t know that one yet.', '', 36473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been patient up to this point, but if they don\'t get that rocket sling working soon, I\'m going to shadow bolt someone!$B$BNeed some training, $n?', '', 36472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been patient up to this point, but if they don\'t get that rocket sling working soon, I\'m going to shadow bolt someone!', '', 36471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out of the frying pan and into the fire, eh $n? Need any training?', '', 36470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out of the frying pan and into the fire, eh $n?', '', 36469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, pay no attention to me. I\'m just a messenger. The leader of the Deathstalkers certainly wouldn\'t be stupid enough to stand here on the dais waiting to be gutted. No need for history to repeat itself.', '', 36468, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scourgewar', 'Scourgewar', 36467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spectral Tiger Cub', 'Spectral Tiger Cub', 36466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mini-Mount', 'Mini-Mount', 36465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mini-Mount', 'Mini-Mount', 36464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tuskarr Kite', 'Tuskarr Kite', 36463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mark my words! I\'m gonna get you, $n! I\'ll get you all! Out of my way!', '', 36462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna crush you! I\'m the Trade Prince! Me! I gotta plan that\'s gonna get me off of this island and make me the king of Azshara!', '', 36461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you\'re such a bigshot, saving everyone and making friends with these orc savages?!', '', 36460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brothers and I can reach northern Gilneas by boat in a matter of days.  As soon as we finish the repairs, that is.', '', 36459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up, Up & Away!', 'Up, Up & Away!', 36458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this really a good idea?', '', 36457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I should not be surprised at this cold reception. We have long been in hiding, and the separation from our brethren was necessary.$b$bThat time, however, is done. Whether the residents of this young tree come to accept us or not, the Highborne are returning to light, and we will not turn our backs on what we are.', '', 36456, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the benefit of my improved cognitive capacity, I am able to turn fresh eyes upon the rest of my race. A majority of our energies were spent in the hunt of fresh prey. Why, I wonder, did we not invest that time developing a store of domesticated creatures from which to draw our food supply?$B$BI am naturally inclined to think that humans would make excellent foodstock. They breed quickly, fatten up nicely, and can be trained to do menial chores for the herd until harvest time. Hmmm.', 36455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $r. Please do not alarm yourself. I am indeed speaking to you in your native tongue.$B$BMy own considerable raptor intelligence has been augmented through a series of experiments. You may refer to me as \"Subject Nine,\" an identity recently bestowed to me by my creators, who are otherwise at the moment occupied or deceased. Perhaps you can render me some assistance?', 36454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, $n. I know, it\'s not much, but the trade prince\'s wreck is home for now.', '', 36453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In good time.', 36452, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch yourself, Highborne.', 36451, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Recalling your treachery?', 36450, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take your gaze off the moonwell, exile. The power within is not yours to wield.', 36449, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And we would not see those mistakes repeated. Return to your exile.', 36448, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You show some nerve coming to Teldrassil, Highborne. Your kind are unwelcome here. We have not forgotten the War of the Ancients or the minds behind it.', 36447, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must wait for an audience.', 36446, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Axe too weak. Garfrost make better and CRUSH YOU.', '', 36445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garfrost tired of puny mortals. Now your bones will freeze!', '', 36444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 16917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the blessings of Cenarion rain down upon you as it has this land, $r.', '', 36443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never again shall we allow our differences to divide us.$b$bLong live the children of Cenarion!', '', 36442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand united as sons of Cenarion, thanks to you.$b$bYour deeds here shall live on as long as our clans draw breath, $n!', '', 36441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks over at the moonwell with a sigh.', '', 36440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were the one who challenged me for merely looking. I still await my audience with Tyrande.', '', 36439, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not believe admiration and wistful thoughts are against the societal norm.', '', 36438, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had forgotten.', '', 36437, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough. I have been apart from this for centuries. The well within this temple may be a pale spectre of the Well of Eternity, but it still holds the same... beauty. Purity.', '', 36436, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm yourself, Sentinel. I do not seek to use it. I am merely... remembering.', '', 36435, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will wait, Sentinel... but I will have my audience.', '', 36434, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time may soon come when the kaldorei require the knowledge and skill we have to offer.', '', 36433, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is change on the wind, and we cannot ignore it. I have traveled from the dust and ruin of the past to come to an accord.', '', 36432, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not return until I am heard. There is too much at stake.', '', 36431, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lure of power is great. Mistakes were made.', '', 36430, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must I? I doubt Tyrande has more pressing business.', '', 36429, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sentinel, I would speak with your High Priestess.', '', 36428, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ring the Buzzer>', '<Ring the Buzzer>', 36427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A hand-lettered sign reads:>$B$B          Secret Lab Archives$B     X. Nizzlebex, Lab Director$B$B$BPlease ring buzzer for service.', '', 36426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, $n, it was just you. Please don\'t scare me like that.', '', 36425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('EeeeEEEEEEKK!', '', 36424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to begin my trials.', 'I\'m ready to begin my trials.', 36423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lovely outfit. Dressed for the part!', '', 36422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do not mess with my kitty you son of a mongrel!', 36421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be taking this cat.  It seems to work as the perfect bait.  Prepare to die now, fool!', '', 36420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The land gave way from under our feet...  I thought I was dead.  I owe you one.', 'The land gave way from under our feet...  I thought I was dead.  I owe you one.', 36419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I thought I was a goner.  Thanks.', 'I... I thought I was a goner.  Thanks.', 36418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you... *gasp*   I owe you my life.', 'Thank you... *gasp*   I owe you my life.', 36417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Voctory is ours, $n!', '', 36416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sons of Cenarion, UNITE!', '', 36415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready! I want to join in the battle!', 'I am ready! I want to join in the battle!', 36414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steady yourself, friend...$b$bThese next hours shall determine the fate of our clans.', '', 36413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s casts Meteor Fists!', '', 36412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The enormous giant peers down at your tiny form.>$B$B$n, did you change your hair?', '', 36411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SQUEAK!!', 'SQUEAK!!', 36410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hum - Wha?', '', 36409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to aim for the Forsaken ships.', 'I have to aim for the Forsaken ships.', 36408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Move fast, $n! You\'ll revert to regular-size in just a couple of minutes.', 36407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Shrink me!', 'I\'m ready. Shrink me!', 36406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to be shrunkified? This may sting a little. And burn. The agony and convulsions will pass quickly, however.', 36405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grapplehammer relies on me to get things done. A mind like his needs to be free of distractions.', 36404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always good to see you, friend!', '', 36403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pentigast! Bring the new $r up to speed, would you?', '', 36402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gormungan eyes the laxative with suspicion, then sniffs it. With visible irritation, he begins smooshing and molding the laxative into the shape of a goblin.>$B$BI suspect your little green friends are putting you up to no good. Please explain to them that we giants are not to be toyed with.$B$B<To demonstrate his point, Gormungan twists the head off of his chocolaty goblin statue before handing it back to you.>', '', 36401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, $n, you\'ve saved us again! Thank you for getting rid of those evil humans before they could get us!', 36400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, eat this! It\'s a special chocolate rock.', 'Here, eat this! It\'s a special chocolate rock.', 36399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $g bro : lady;. Rocket ride! Yeah!', '', 36398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hallo again, soft little friend. What\'s that you have there?', '', 36397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew I should have brought my folding chair.', 'I knew I should have brought my folding chair.', 36396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the looks of that thing, I might take my chances swimming with the sharks!', 'By the looks of that thing, I might take my chances swimming with the sharks!', 36395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we rocketing over to an island that has a volcano? Didn\'t we barely survive this scenario on Kezan?', 'Why are we rocketing over to an island that has a volcano? Didn\'t we barely survive this scenario on Kezan?', 36394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That rocket looks unsafe even by our standards!', 'That rocket looks unsafe even by our standards!', 36393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that a volcano over on that other island?', 'Is that a volcano over on that other island?', 36392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is money, friend!', 'Time is money, friend!', 36391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the hold up?', 'What\'s the hold up?', 36390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear this line\'s not moving!', 'I swear this line\'s not moving!', 36389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the battle in Shok\'Thokar or the centaur will abandon you!', '', 36388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for freeing Thrall, $n. He\'s been missed.$B$B<Aggra looks over at the Warchief.>', 36387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We owe you a debt that will be hard to repay, $n.', '', 36386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No worries, everyone. This is just a short pit stop on our way to our new home.', '', 36385, 0, 8784, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want you all to listen good... anyone who\'s not with me can start looking for a new job!', '', 36384, 0, 8784, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You thought to take my place on Kezan, $n? You reach too far! I made you what you were... were being the operative word. You\'re nothing now. Nothing!', '', 36383, 0, 8784, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got my eye on you, $n. Let\'s just say that only one of us will be leaving this island, and that goblin\'s name begins with Trade Prince!', '', 36382, 0, 8784, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help but think that if it weren\'t for the meddling of $n back on Kezan, we\'d all be safe and sound in Azshara by now.', '', 36381, 0, 8784, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never fear, Trade Prince Gallywix is here. We\'ll be on our way to our new home in Azshara before you know it! Despite the bumbling interference of $n.', '', 36380, 0, 8784, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody panic! I\'ll see to it we get off of this deplorable island. You\'ll see... I\'ve got it all planned out!', '', 36379, 0, 8784, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I think we all know who\'s really responsible for the mess we\'re in! Don\'t worry, I\'m going to see to it that $n gets what $g he : she; deserves!', '', 36377, 0, 8784, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marvelous! You bound ahead with more haste than a flame-laden kitten. Quite suitable indeed!', '', 36376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Barely a scratch on you! Way to go!', 36375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The trade prince lowers his voice to barely a whisper.>$B$BDon\'t think for a moment that I\'ve forgotten how much I despise you, $n, rescue or not.$B$BDon\'t worry your $g simple : pretty; head. I\'ll get my revenge soon enough, mark my words!$B$BYou\'ll fare far worse than being my slave. There\'ll be no escape for you this time.', '', 36374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My house!', '', 36373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along, bub.', '', 36372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, $n, I can\'t be seen talking with you. You\'re not exactly at the top of the Trade Prince\'s list these days and I need to think about my future.$B$BYou understand, right, babe? Besides, I\'m with Candy now.', '', 36371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah? Whadya want?', 36370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No offense, babe, but Chip is my boyfriend and I\'m working for the Trade Prince now.$B$BMove along, would ya? You\'re blocking my view.', 36369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zap \'em!', 'Zap \'em!', 36368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snagged one!', 'Takedown!', 36367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got one!', 'Over here!', 36366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me again about Azsharite?', 'Tell me again about Azsharite?', 36365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gormungan emits a good-natured snort.>$B$BHaaarrum! I have never had my personal habits scrutinized so. Your kind never ceases to surprise me. Farewell, friend, and good luck with ... whatever it is you are on about.', '', 36364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('15 to 25 years? Assistant Greely isn\'t going to want to hear that!', '15 to 25 years? Assistant Greely isn\'t going to want to hear that!', 36363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t live our lives as quickly as you do, my mushy friend. A healthy giant eats three square meals a decade, although I am known to indulge in a snack every couple of years. We\'ll go to the bathroom every 15 to 25 years... barring any tummy trouble.', '', 36362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How often do you, uh, \"go?\"', 'How often do you, uh, \"go?\"', 36361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would seem so. You and your friends are welcome to as much as you can find. I suppose it\'s very potent. We don\'t need to go that often.', '', 36360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s ... your droppings!? And the goblins have been running around scooping it up?', 'It\'s ... your droppings!? And the goblins have been running around scooping it up?', 36359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It comes from - harum - what is your word for it? Harrrm. Let us say that my kind does not have bathrooms. Do you understand?', '', 36358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the giants have been dropping the azsharite? But where does it come from?', 'So the giants have been dropping the azsharite? But where does it come from?', 36357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gormungan\'s laugh, deep and long, rumbles the ground and causes distant rockslides.>$B$BOh - hah! Harroooo - Ha harum! Little friend, I am sorry. I suppose my kind does not pick up after ourselves as you do.', '', 36356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those piles of blue-ish crystals we find on the ground.', 'Those piles of blue-ish crystals we find on the ground.', 36355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azsharite? You soft ones come up with new names for everything. What is this \"azsharite?\"', '', 36354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know anything about azsharite?', 'Do you know anything about azsharite?', 36353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha - harrrum! Food? We don\'t eat squishlings, friend, not unless they aggravate us. We eat rocks and stones and earth. Though I sometimes find the crunch of bones makes a delightful seasoning.$B$B<Gormungan lifts up a boulder and, with one enormous hand, smashes the corpses you\'ve given him onto the boulder as one would put icing on a cupcake. He crunches his treat, rumbling happily.>', '', 36352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I brought you something to eat.', 'I brought you something to eat.', 36351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gormungan\'s voice booms deep from within, hurting your ears and reverberating in the very ground beneath your feet.>$B$BHallo, softling.$B$BYour kind dashes about, always running, never stopping. Rest with me a while.', '', 36350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mkay, m\'ne ta oor!', '', 36349, 0, 8829, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taronto bosch!', '', 36348, 0, 8829, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sooie nah mi juju, gobin!', '', 36347, 0, 8829, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eekum Bokum!', '', 36346, 0, 8829, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooga booga!', '', 36345, 0, 8829, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not giving up on you.  I don\'t have a cure for the Curse yet... but there are treatments.  You will have control again.', '', 36344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t be serious!  Did you forget everything that $n did for us?', '', 36343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEPRECATED.', '', 36342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t think so.  Now hand me that potion, Krennan... and double the dosage.', '', 36341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, Godfrey.  Those that stayed in Gilneas City so that we could live.  Were they following protocol?', '', 36340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEPRECATED', '', 36339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEPRECATED', '', 36338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEPRECATED', '', 36337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give it up, Krennan.  It\'s time to put this one down.  It\'s protocol.', '', 36336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can\'t be serious!  Did you forget everything that $n did for us?  $gHe:She; stayed behind... for us!', 36335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How yeh doin\', $glad:lass;?', '', 36334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It really is you, isn\'t it?  I remember those eyes.', 36333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look around you, $c!$b$bIsn\'t it all just beautiful?', 36332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join the others inside the basement next door.  Hurry!', 'Join the others inside the basement next door.  Hurry!', 36331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it, $c? I\'ve got a lot to see to around here now that the demon\'s gone. Someone has to shuffle the paperwork and make sure we don\'t see another lapse like the one with Putress.$b$bLucky me.', '', 36330, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not safe here.  Go to the Allens\' basement.', 'It\'s not safe here.  Go to the Allens\' basement.', 36329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mother\'s in the basement next door.  Get to her now!', 'Your mother\'s in the basement next door.  Get to her now!', 36328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I browse your ancient gem recipes?', 'May I browse your ancient gem recipes?', 36327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you one of the good worgen, $g mister:ma\'am;?  Did you see Cynthia hiding in the sheds outside?', 36326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are scary!  I just want my mommy!', 36325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t hurt me!  I was just looking for my sisters!  I think Ashley\'s inside that house!', '', 36324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been infected with a Paralytic Toxin!', 'You have been infected with a Paralytic Toxin!', 36323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have the proper certification to use the bank.', 'I have the proper certification to use the bank.', 36322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is so nice to see the Undercity returned to the calming wheezes and gas-expulsions of the abominations. The orcs smelled far worse.', '', 36321, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DND] Have you filled out the proper paper work and paid the appropriate fees to gain access to the auction house?', '[DND] Have you filled out the proper paper work and paid the appropriate fees to gain access to the auction house?', 36320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I failed to defend my people in Gilneas City.  It seems the fates have given me a second chance, $n.  I will not fail again!', '', 36319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DND] Have you filled out the proper paper work and paid the appropriate fees to gain access to the bank?', '[DND] Have you filled out the proper paper work and paid the appropriate fees to gain access to the bank?', 36318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DND] I have the proper certification to use the bank.', '[DND] I have the proper certification to use the bank.', 36317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DND] To use my services you must have the proper certification.', '[DND] To use my services you must have the proper certification.', 36316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back here!  I smashes you!', '', 36315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gots bad feeling...', '', 36314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh-oh... this gonna hurts me...', '', 36313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This not be good...', '', 36312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barrel smell like gunpowder...', '', 36311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GAH!!!!  I CAN\'T SEE IN HERE!!!!', '', 36310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This pit stinks and I\'m surrounded by snakes, but I\'m here to do a job.$b$bEver since Putress pulled his stunt at the Wrath Gate, the Warchief doesn\'t trust these people as far as he can throw them. That\'s why we\'re here. The apothecaries can\'t do a thing without me.', '', 36309, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tell you what you need to know, but I don\'t have to like it. We\'re watching you and your kind.', 'I\'ll tell you what you need to know, but I don\'t have to like it. We\'re watching you and your kind.', 36308, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet you rotters thought you were pretty clever at the Wrath Gate, didn\'t you? Playtime\'s over. We\'re here to make sure you don\'t try anything.', 'I bet you rotters thought you were pretty clever at the Wrath Gate, didn\'t you? Playtime\'s over. We\'re here to make sure you don\'t try anything.', 36307, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shut your face, you gibbering idiot!', 'Shut your face, you gibbering idiot!', 36306, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get that rotten nut to shut his trap!', '', 36305, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll see about that.', '', 36304, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will cause you no trouble. We seek only to continue our research in peace.', '', 36303, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I assure you, overseer, the Royal Apothecary Society dearly wishes to make up for the tragic misguidance which ended so many lives.', '', 36302, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you so much as spit without my permission, this place shuts down. Forcefully.', '', 36301, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No abominations protecting you. No secrecy. No plotting in the dark.', '', 36300, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got my eye on you, Faranell.', '', 36299, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it quick, $r.', '', 36298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s wrong, bonebag? Looking for someone else? I\'m all you\'ve got now, so if you want something, make it quick.', 'What\'s wrong, bonebag? Looking for someone else? I\'m all you\'ve got now, so if you want something, make it quick.', 36297, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar. Don\'t try anything suspicious around here. If these undead are going to be part of the Horde, they\'re going to mind themselves under our watch.', 'Lok\'tar. Don\'t try anything suspicious around here. If these undead are going to be part of the Horde, they\'re going to mind themselves under our watch.', 36296, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope you\'re not looking for those abominations. The apothecaries can\'t be trusted, and that means none of their little constructs patrolling the halls. We\'re here to keep things safe.', 'Hope you\'re not looking for those abominations. The apothecaries can\'t be trusted, and that means none of their little constructs patrolling the halls. We\'re here to keep things safe.', 36295, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surprised to see an orc here? Don\'t be.$b$bThe forsaken need watching. If we\'d been paying closer attention from the start, maybe the Wrath Gate wouldn\'t have happened.', 'Surprised to see an orc here? Don\'t be.$b$bThe forsaken need watching. If we\'d been paying closer attention from the start, maybe the Wrath Gate wouldn\'t have happened.', 36294, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The zeppelin towers are just north of the Undercity.', 'The zeppelin towers are just north of the Undercity.', 36293, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t blame you for wanting to get out of here. Go up topside and head north of the ruins. The zeppelins leave from the two towers there.', 'I don\'t blame you for wanting to get out of here. Go up topside and head north of the ruins. The zeppelins leave from the two towers there.', 36292, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see someone wanting to learn something useful. Head to Archibald on the inner ring of the War Quarter.', 'Good to see someone wanting to learn something useful. Head to Archibald on the inner ring of the War Quarter.', 36291, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to learn how to wield weapons, go to Archibald on the inner ring of the War Quarter.', 'If you want to learn how to wield weapons, go to Archibald on the inner ring of the War Quarter.', 36290, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the War Quarter is where you\'ll find the warriors. Head to the outer ring there.', 'In the War Quarter is where you\'ll find the warriors. Head to the outer ring there.', 36289, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warriors are in the War Quarter, practicing on the outer ring.', 'The warriors are in the War Quarter, practicing on the outer ring.', 36288, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find the warlocks in the Magic Quarter\'s main building, but I better not hear of any trouble that comes of this.', 'You\'ll find the warlocks in the Magic Quarter\'s main building, but I better not hear of any trouble that comes of this.', 36287, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have guts asking me about warlocks. Go to the Magic Quarter\'s outer ring and get out of my sight.', 'You have guts asking me about warlocks. Go to the Magic Quarter\'s outer ring and get out of my sight.', 36286, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to the Magic Quarter and head to the inner ring. The tailor\'s there.', 'Go to the Magic Quarter and head to the inner ring. The tailor\'s there.', 36285, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tailor here\'s Josef Gregorian. He\'s in the Magic Quarter on the inner ring.', 'The tailor here\'s Josef Gregorian. He\'s in the Magic Quarter on the inner ring.', 36284, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can talk to Anya Maulray up by the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. I wouldn\'t recommend it, but they\'re your pets.', 'You can talk to Anya Maulray up by the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. I wouldn\'t recommend it, but they\'re your pets.', 36283, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you really trust some undead with your pets, you can talk to Anya Maulray at the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter.', 'If you really trust some undead with your pets, you can talk to Anya Maulray at the inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter.', 36282, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to learn how to skin things, head to the Rogues\' Quarter. The skinner has his place on the inner ring.', 'Us have skinning hook.  We get it from Killian Hagey who teach us how to skin kills.  You have nice skin.  You find him on inner ring of Rogues\' Quarter.', 36281, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skinner here is named Killian Hagey. He works in the Rogues\' Quarter on the inner ring.', 'The skinner here is named Killian Hagey. He works in the Rogues\' Quarter on the inner ring.', 36279, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to the outer ring of the Rogues\' Quarter if you want to find rogues.', 'Go to the outer ring of the Rogues\' Quarter if you want to find rogues.', 36278, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rogues are in the Rogues\' Quarter. Simple as that. Look for them on the outer ring.', 'The rogues are in the Rogues\' Quarter. Simple as that. Look for them on the outer ring.', 36277, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Head to the War Quarter. The priests are there on the outer ring making sure no limb remains unattached for long.', 'Head to the War Quarter. The priests are there on the outer ring making sure no limb remains unattached for long.', 36276, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The priests are located on the outer ring of the War Quarter.', 'The priests are located on the outer ring of the War Quarter.', 36275, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to find a paladin, you\'ll have to go to the Royal Quarter. There\'s some elf there who can teach you.', 'If you want to find a paladin, you\'ll have to go to the Royal Quarter. There\'s some elf there who can teach you.', 36274, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The miner here works in the War Quarter on the inner ring. His name\'s Brom Killian.', 'The miner here works in the War Quarter on the inner ring. His name\'s Brom Killian.', 36273, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to learn to mine, talk to Brom Killian at the inner ring of the War Quarter.', 'If you want to learn to mine, talk to Brom Killian at the inner ring of the War Quarter.', 36272, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mailbox? You want to head to the inn in the center of the city\'s upper ring. It\'s right there.', 'Mailbox? You want to head to the inn in the center of the city\'s upper ring. It\'s right there.', 36271, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mailbox is in the Trade Quarter by that coffin storage closet they call an inn.', 'The mailbox is in the Trade Quarter by that coffin storage closet they call an inn.', 36270, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On the outer ring of the Magic Quarter you\'ll find a large, stepped building. That\'s where the mages hide.', 'On the outer ring of the Magic Quarter you\'ll find a large, stepped building. That\'s where the mages hide.', 36269, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mages? They\'re in the Magic Quarter, in the central building. Thought you\'d be smart enough to figure that out.', 'Mages? They\'re in the Magic Quarter, in the central building. Thought you\'d be smart enough to figure that out.', 36268, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need keys, talk to Walter Soref in the Rogues\' Quarter, but watch yourself.', 'If you need keys, talk to Walter Soref in the Rogues\' Quarter, but watch yourself.', 36267, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arthur Moore is the leatherworker. He tends the trainees over in the Rogues\' Quarter, on the inner ring.', 'Arthur Moore is the leatherworker. He tends the trainees over in the Rogues\' Quarter, on the inner ring.', 36266, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The city\'s leatherworker is in the inner ring of the Rogues\' Quarter.', 'The city\'s leatherworker is in the inner ring of the Rogues\' Quarter.', 36265, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scribe of the city is in the Apothecarium, someone named Margaux Parchley.', 'The scribe of the city is in the Apothecarium, someone named Margaux Parchley.', 36264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Innkeeper Norman keeps a dusty crack in the wall he calls an inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter.', 'Innkeeper Norman keeps a dusty crack in the wall he calls an inn on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter.', 36263, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The inn - if you can call it that - is on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. They don\'t even have beds.', 'The inn - if you can call it that - is on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. They don\'t even have beds.', 36262, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Head to the Apothecarium\'s inner ring. Martha Alliestar is there, and she\'ll instruct you in herbalism.', 'Head to the Apothecarium\'s inner ring. Martha Alliestar is there, and she\'ll instruct you in herbalism.', 36261, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The herbalist around here is Martha Alliestar. She\'s over on the inner ring of the Apothecarium.', 'The herbalist around here is Martha Alliestar. She\'s over on the inner ring of the Apothecarium.', 36260, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guild master handles his business in the Trade Quarter. He\'s up on the eastern platform.', 'The guild master handles his business in the Trade Quarter. He\'s up on the eastern platform.', 36259, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guild master is Christopher Drakul. He\'s on the eastern platform in the Trade Quarter.', 'The guild master is Christopher Drakul. He\'s on the eastern platform in the Trade Quarter.', 36258, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what he\'s trying to catch there, but Armand Cromwell is on the dock in the Magic Quarter.', 'I don\'t know what he\'s trying to catch there, but Armand Cromwell is on the dock in the Magic Quarter.', 36257, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, friend.$b$bEnjoying the glade, I trust?', '', 36253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crazy fisherman is on the dock in the Magic Quarter.', 'The crazy fisherman is on the dock in the Magic Quarter.', 36252, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the walking dead need to mend themselves. Mary Edras handles it here. She\'s in the Rogues\' Quarter, on the inner ring.', 'Even the walking dead need to mend themselves. Mary Edras handles it here. She\'s in the Rogues\' Quarter, on the inner ring.', 36251, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello! Someone who doesn\'t smell like fish. I like.', '', 36250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yup yup! Say hi for me if you find him.', '', 36249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a start. Thanks Ergll.', 'It\'s a start. Thanks Ergll.', 36248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Become an apprentice I suppose. Pretty high turnover really.$B$BI\'ve met maybe a dozen washed up apprentices this last month alone. He leaves them kind of damaged. They keep coming though. I guess there aren\'t many options in the Archmage racket.$B$BI met another one just today. He was heading over to the west, to that big pillar that\'s being built.\n', '', 36247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any idea on how I could get him to answer some questions?', 'Any idea on how I could get him to answer some questions?', 36246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xylem\'s a little bit lacking in the social graces. He talks to his apprentices a bit, but mostly he just talks to himself. Tends to brush everyone else off.$B$BWouldn\'t take me as an apprentice - said I was too slimy. Said that my mind wasn\'t any good to study being all mucked up with magic and all.\n', '', 36245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Xylem? Where can I find this Archmage, Ergll?', 'Archmage Xylem? Where can I find this Archmage, Ergll?', 36244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was always prattling on about finding this or that magic artifact. Said Azshara was full of them, he did. He was a bit obsessive if you ask me.$B$BLast I heard, he was trying to make friends with that Archmage person. Xylem? He said Xylem had found some grand old magic item.\n', '', 36243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really? Weeks? Don\'t you have anything better than that?', 'Really? Weeks? Don\'t you have anything better than that?', 36242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mary Edras is the one you want. She\'s set up at the inner ring of the Rogues\' Quarter.', 'Mary Edras is the one you want. She\'s set up at the inner ring of the Rogues\' Quarter.', 36241, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, if you want to go talk to those engineers on the outer ring of the Rogues\' Quarter, it\'s your hide.', 'Look, if you want to go talk to those engineers on the outer ring of the Rogues\' Quarter, it\'s your hide.', 36240, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The engineer here is called Franklin Lloyd. He tinkers in the Rogues\' Quarter, on the outer ring.', 'The engineer here is called Franklin Lloyd. He tinkers in the Rogues\' Quarter, on the outer ring.', 36239, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to learn enchanting, go find Lavinia Crowe on the inner ring of the Apothecarium.', 'If you want to learn enchanting, go find Lavinia Crowe on the inner ring of the Apothecarium.', 36238, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lavinia Crowe\'s the local enchanter. She\'s set up shop on the inner ring of the Apothecarium.', 'Lavinia Crowe\'s the local enchanter. She\'s set up shop on the inner ring of the Apothecarium.', 36237, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cook around here is in the Trade Quarter. Her name\'s Eunice Burch.', 'The cook around here is in the Trade Quarter. Her name\'s Eunice Burch.', 36236, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eunice Burch cooks what passes for food here over in the Trade Quarter. It\'s your stomach, not mine.', 'Eunice Burch cooks what passes for food here over in the Trade Quarter. It\'s your stomach, not mine.', 36235, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blacksmith here works in the War Quarter, close to where his weapons will be put to use. He\'s there on the inner ring.', 'The blacksmith here works in the War Quarter, close to where his weapons will be put to use. He\'s there on the inner ring.', 36234, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('James Van Brunt runs a decent forge in the War Quarter. He\'s on the inner ring.', 'James Van Brunt runs a decent forge in the War Quarter. He\'s on the inner ring.', 36233, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which battleground calls you?', 'Which battleground calls you?', 36232, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battlemasters are stationed in the Royal Quarter; you\'ll find them around the throne room.', 'The battlemasters are stationed in the Royal Quarter; you\'ll find them around the throne room.', 36231, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bat handler has his roost on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. You can\'t miss the smell.', 'The bat handler has his roost on the upper ring of the Trade Quarter. You can\'t miss the smell.', 36230, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Michael Garrett tends the Undercity\'s bats. He\'s in the upper ring of the Trade Quarter.', 'Michael Garrett tends the Undercity\'s bats. He\'s in the upper ring of the Trade Quarter.', 36229, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naznik\'s the local barber. He set up shop on the top ring of the Trade Quarter.', 'Naznik\'s the local barber. He set up shop on the top ring of the Trade Quarter.', 36228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s right in the center of the city. The hub of the wheel.', 'It\'s right in the center of the city. The hub of the wheel.', 36227, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azuregos! I remember him. Tall, blue, big fangs. Nice sort really, if a little loopy. Haven\'t seen him in weeks.', '', 36226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... where can I find Azuregos, Ergll?', 'So... where can I find Azuregos, Ergll?', 36225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More reliable this way I think.', '', 36224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of that just to wake you up? I\'m sure I have several weapons that could have managed that fine.', 'All of that just to wake you up? I\'m sure I have several weapons that could have managed that fine.', 36223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wakes me up in the mornings. The sun makes me tired. Hard to think.', '', 36222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it then?', 'What is it then?', 36221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So Ergll, is that all that you needed for your memory potion?', 'So Ergll, is that all that you needed for your memory potion?', 36220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bank? It\'s that tower in the middle of the Trade Quarter.', 'The bank? It\'s that tower in the middle of the Trade Quarter.', 36219, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kawphi? Memory potion? Hah! This isn\'t a memory potion.', '', 36218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to access the market here, get to the central ring of the city.', 'If you want to access the market here, get to the central ring of the city.', 36217, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Head to the central ring; you\'ll find auctioneers stationed there.', 'Head to the central ring; you\'ll find auctioneers stationed there.', 36216, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to help the Defilers? Head to the Royal Quarter and speak with Sir Malory Wheeler. He\'s your man.', 'You want to help the Defilers? Head to the Royal Quarter and speak with Sir Malory Wheeler. He\'s your man.', 36215, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want Sir Malory Wheeler. He\'s in the Royal Quarter with the rest of the battlemasters.', 'You want Sir Malory Wheeler. He\'s in the Royal Quarter with the rest of the battlemasters.', 36214, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battlemaster serving Undercity is Grizzle Halfmane - a fierce fighter in his day. He\'s in the Royal Quarter.', 'The battlemaster serving Undercity is Grizzle Halfmane - a fierce fighter in his day. He\'s in the Royal Quarter.', 36213, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grizzle Halfmane in the Royal Quarter is the orc you\'re looking for.', 'Grizzle Halfmane in the Royal Quarter is the orc you\'re looking for.', 36212, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doctor Herbert Halsey is who you want. Just don\'t try anything funny. Any more of that plague nonsense and you\'ll find an axe in uncomfortable places.', 'Doctor Herbert Halsey is who you want. Just don\'t try anything funny. Any more of that plague nonsense and you\'ll find an axe in uncomfortable places.', 36211, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find them in the Apothecarium. Names are Doctor Herbert Halsey and Doctor Marsh. Just watch your back.', 'You\'ll find them in the Apothecarium. Names are Doctor Herbert Halsey and Doctor Marsh. Just watch your back.', 36210, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gilneas will soon belong to the Forsaken!', 'Gilneas will soon belong to the Forsaken!', 36209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There were worgen everywhere.... it should\'ve been me....', '', 36208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to the center of the temple and use the Horn of Elemental Fury!', '', 36207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief, I need another cyclone.', 'Warchief, I need another cyclone.', 36206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar, $n!', '', 36205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m feeling much better already.', '', 36204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sons of Stormwall, descend and destroy those who would prevent me from protecting this world!', '', 36203, 0, 8839, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winds of boundless fury, unleash your tempest upon the Alliance!', '', 36202, 0, 8839, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speed of the storm, heed my call!', '', 36201, 0, 8839, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children of the watery depths, lay waste to those who foul your realm!', '', 36200, 0, 8839, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power of the ocean, heed my call!', '', 36199, 0, 8839, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of the sea, rise and lay waste to my enemies!', '', 36198, 0, 8839, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice to see you again, $n.', 36197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gobber grunts.>$B$BMe banker now!', '', 36196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I put this all on you, but what are you doing to get us off of this island?', 36195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sit with me a while. We can roast crabs over the fire and sing songs.', 36194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I miss Kezan. Will we ever see Bilgewater Port again, $n?', 36193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, $n, we\'re marooned!', 36192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we\'re in a pretty tight jam. Think you can get us out of here?', '', 36191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, look guys, it\'s $n!', '', 36190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who would\'ve thought we\'d wind up here after everything we\'ve been through?', '', 36189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, sit on down. The fire\'s warm and the monkeys don\'t seem to like it.', '', 36188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! What is this about?!', '', 36187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spear is broken! Retreat!', '', 36186, 0, 8745, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Retreat!!', '', 36185, 0, 8745, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Spear of the Kolkar Khan has been broken...', '', 36184, 0, 8745, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A goblin? I must be seeing things. Throm-Ka and thank you, little one.', '', 36182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That seems to have done the trick.', '', 36181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give the orc warchief some smelling salts to rouse him from his drugged stuppor.', 'Give the orc warchief some smelling salts to rouse him from his drugged stuppor.', 36180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A goblin? I must be seeing things. Throm-Ka and thank you, little one!', '', 36179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kolkar clan! Attack!!', '', 36178, 0, 8745, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find the Precious Cargo!', '', 36177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes critical!', '', 36176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You failed to plant the spear! We must make another attempt... soon!', '', 36175, 0, 8745, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry! Before we\'re discovered!', '', 36174, 0, 8745, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
