('Champions, you\'ve defeated the Trial of the Grand Crusader! Only the most battle tested adventurers could ever hope to complete this Trial. I present to you this tribute chest as a well deserved reward! May the contents serve you well in our upcoming campaign against Arthas in the heart of Icecrown Citadel!', '', 36134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry - save the others!', 'Hurry - save the others!', 36133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make a note: Fire bad.', 'Make a note: Fire bad.', 36132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should really try to burst into flames less often.', 'I should really try to burst into flames less often.', 36131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew, thanks! I\'m going to check and see if these results are repeatable.', 'Whew, thanks! I\'m going to check and see if these results are repeatable.', 36130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions, you\'re alive! Not only have you defeated every challenge of the Trial of the Crusader, but also thwarted Arthas\' plans! Your skill and cunning will prove to be a powerful weapon against the Scourge. Well done! Allow one of the Crusade\'s mages to transport you to the surface!', '', 36129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, thank you!', 'Thank you, thank you!', 36128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m leaving for the next rendezvous point in a few seconds.', '', 36127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We protected Gilneas from the Scourge.  We protected Gilneas during the Northgate rebellion.  We will protect Gilneas from whatever this new threat may be.', '', 36126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want the perimeter secured and the gates manned by two guards at all times.  No one gets in, no one gets out.', '', 36125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand ready, guards!  We don\'t know how many intruders we\'re dealing with, but the Headlands are overrun and we\'re cut off from the harbor towns.  Expect to be outnumbered.', '', 36124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My flesh!', 'My flesh!', 36123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
