('We will scout ahead to the Wild Overlook and see you there, Kilag.', '', 36113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin technology is strange and deadly. I approve!', '', 36112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not wait long, Kilag. We will scout ahead.', '', 36111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
