('Keep them back!', '', 36092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire!', '', 36091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the barricades!  Do not give them an inch!', '', 36090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 19709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was simply spendid! Unbelievable! Well done! We already have plans in motion to celebrate your victory. Our preperations will be finished next week, see you then!', '', 36089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We dispatched a force of knights to capture a pair of Arthas\' Scourge lieutenants to serve as the next challenge of the trial. The knights have not returned with their prey yet, so the next phase of the trial is on hold. Check back next week.', '', 36088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delays, delays, and more delays. The Trial of the Crusader has currently been placed on hold, pending the results of an investigation into the actions of Wilfred Fizzlebang. Next week the trial will continue, so be ready to fight the best knights of the Argent Crusade!', '', 36087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies, adventurer. The grand warlock Wilfred Fizzlebang has not arrived on the tournament grounds yet, so the next challenge of the trial is not available. We expect him next week.', '', 36086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Trial of the Grand Crusader is a more difficult version of the Trial of the Crusader. Each encounter is more difficult, and you will not be able to freely attempt the encounters until you win. After 50 unsuccessful attempts, the Trial of the Grand Crusader will end for the week. After successfully completing the Trial of the Grand Crusader, you will receive an additional tribute chest of rewards as compensation. Are you prepared for this trial?', '', 36085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back again when you have achieved success in the Trial of the Crusader.', '', 36084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not completed the Trial of the Crusader.', 'I have not completed the Trial of the Crusader.', 36083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have completed the Trial of the Crusader.', 'I have completed the Trial of the Crusader.', 36082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, champion! Have you gathered your forces in preparation for the challenges of the Trial of the Grand Crusader? Only the most powerful and accomplished of combatants are able to participate in these trials. To participate in these trials, you must have completed the normal Trial of the Crusader.', '', 36080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am prepared to join you in battle, Hydronis!', 'I am prepared to join you in battle, Hydronis!', 36079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rescue Krennan Aranas by using your vehicle\'s ability.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_groupneedmore.blp:64|t', 'Rescue Krennan Aranas by using your vehicle\'s ability.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_groupneedmore.blp:64|t', 36078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, fleshling?', '', 36077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the most superficial glimpse into the secrets I hold would drive you mad, $c.', '', 36076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will gladly share my forbidden knowledge with you in this time of great peril.  The darkness will protect us, $gbrother : sister;.', '', 36075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think that we might have angered them.', '', 36074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Light is with you, $c.  No harm will come to you today.', 36073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even now, in the darkest of times, the teachings of the Light will guide you throught this world.', 36072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I swear this wasn\'t my fault.  Why are you looking at me like that?', 36071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ask me for help and advice... just don\'t ask me for money, okay?', 36070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d have a hard time teaching you.  It takes years of mental preparation to become attuned to the powers of the arcane.', 36069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, I will share my knowledge with you.  Especially if it helps us defeat the worgen.', 36068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek further training.', 'I seek further training.', 36067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
