('Die, orc scum!', 'Die, orc scum!', 36062, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last batch of orcs. They should fall quickly!', 'The last batch of orcs. They should fall quickly!', 36061, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek further training in the old ways of the druids.', 'I seek further training in the old ways of the druids.', 36060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The worgen will pass.  We shall pass.$B$BOnly the earth and her secrets will remain.  Are you willing to learn, $n?', 36059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are not initiated in the old ways.  There is nothing I can teach you, child.', 36058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your efforts here shall not be forgotten, $n! I shall make certain of that.', 36057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My humblest apologies, Champion, but you have run out of opportunities to complete the Trial of the Grand Crusader. As a reminder, you and your fellow adventurers are able to begin the Trial of the Grand Crusader once every week. May the lessons learned this week bring you one step closer to final victory here and against the Scourge!', '', 36056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
