('Help me, please!', 'Help me, please!', 36038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s coming right for me!', 'It\'s coming right for me!', 36037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s plans a Stranglethorn Vale fishing trip.', '%s plans a Stranglethorn Vale fishing trip.', 36036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Justicar Mariel Trueheart has asked us to help administer and defend the tournament now that the coliseum is complete. She wants us to work with those worthless Silver Covenant curs, but they\'re just getting in the way.', 36035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bemoans the loss of his Nethercleft Leg Armor.', '%s bemoans the loss of his Nethercleft Leg Armor.', 36034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tournament\'s seneschal has asked us to shoulder some of the burden of running the competition now that the coliseum is finished. Those who have earned the right to stand as champions and who have proven themselves in our eyes are asked to assist with these duties.', 36033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s daydreams of Lucky Fishing Hats.', '%s daydreams of Lucky Fishing Hats.', 36032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s realizes he needs some Leggings of the Fang.', '%s realizes he needs some Leggings of the Fang.', 36031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortar strike called in. Let \'em have it, Hackel!', '', 36030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just bring them out again, then watch.', 'Just bring them out again, then watch.', 36029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I hope you improve quickly!', '', 36028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'kyr? We\'re ready for them.', 'Val\'kyr? We\'re ready for them.', 36027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better believe it! You\'re going to face two of Arthas\' most powerful Val\'kyr lieutenants!', '', 36026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll just have to improve our own teamwork to match the two of them.', 'We\'ll just have to improve our own teamwork to match the two of them.', 36025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That tough, huh?', 'That tough, huh?', 36024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Val\'kyrs\'  teamwork is rather astounding. I now see why we had such problems capturing the two of them.', '', 36023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Underground...', 'Underground...', 36022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars at the sight of the surviving beasts and fights with renewed vigor!', '', 36021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Er, Dampwick, I need another miner....', 'Er, Dampwick, I need another miner....', 36020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We suffered a lot of casualties when capturing your next challenge!', '', 36019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s good enough for now. I\'ll make my way out on my own. Thanks for the escort, $n.', 'That\'s good enough for now. I\'ll make my way out on my own. Thanks for the escort, $n.', 36018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, why am I doing all of the work here?', 'Hey, why am I doing all of the work here?', 36017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I wouldn\'t give for some explosives right about now.', 'What I wouldn\'t give for some explosives right about now.', 36016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The monkeys already extracted most of the kaja\'mite out of this deposit.', 'The monkeys already extracted most of the kaja\'mite out of this deposit.', 36015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did I ever tell you that I was a mid-level accountant with the company back on Kezan? I worked for you for years. Do you even know my name?', 'Did I ever tell you that I was a mid-level accountant with the company back on Kezan? I worked for you for years. Do you even know my name?', 36014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve hit the jackpot in this place!', 'We\'ve hit the jackpot in this place!', 36013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t get anything else out of this one.', 'I can\'t get anything else out of this one.', 36012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This chunk\'s been picked clean.', 'This chunk\'s been picked clean.', 36011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s move on.', 'Let\'s move on.', 36010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m certain that the kaja\'mite is having the same intelligence-increasing effect on the monkeys that it had on our ancient ancestors.', 'I\'m certain that the kaja\'mite is having the same intelligence-increasing effect on the monkeys that it had on our ancient ancestors.', 36009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These cave paintings are creeping me out. NOT TO MENTION THE MONKEYS TRYING TO KILL ME!', 'These cave paintings are creeping me out. NOT TO MENTION THE MONKEYS TRYING TO KILL ME!', 36008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to mine, you\'re here to fight. Get it straight!', 'I\'m here to mine, you\'re here to fight. Get it straight!', 36007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re not paying me enough for this. Wait! They\'re not paying me at all!', 'They\'re not paying me enough for this. Wait! They\'re not paying me at all!', 36006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I want to go home now.', 'I want to go home now.', 36005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re going to die in here like all the others, aren\'t we?', 'We\'re going to die in here like all the others, aren\'t we?', 36004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I get my mining done if I\'m being attacked?', 'How can I get my mining done if I\'m being attacked?', 36003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought you were going to keep these things off of me?', 'I thought you were going to keep these things off of me?', 36002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return to me now, $c. There is much to do.', 36001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The water itself rises to fight against them here, but why? Many questions and few answers...', 36000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are scouring the entire region. We must discover what it is that they seek!', 35999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A priestess of Azshara! Could she be leading their efforts?', 35998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cataclysm split the land apart here, allowing the naga to stretch inland...', 35997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The number of naga here continue to rise steadily....', 35996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, here we go. You\'re gonna cover me, right?', 'Okay, here we go. You\'re gonna cover me, right?', 35995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The swoop egg is destroyed...', '', 35994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready for anything!', 'We\'re ready for anything!', 35993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t wait to see it! They seem ready for another round now, so prepare yourselves!', '', 35992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be even more amazed after we take them out!', 'You\'ll be even more amazed after we take them out!', 35991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That fight was savage and brutal. I haven\'t seen a grand melee like that in many years! Amazing!', '', 35990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give the signal! We\'re ready to go!', 'Give the signal! We\'re ready to go!', 35989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well then, I\'ll give the signal to Tirion when you are ready to go.', '', 35988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course!', 'Of course!', 35987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That warlock certainly didn\'t summon a Doomguard! Your next challenge will find you fighting knights of the Argent Crusade. Think you\'re up for the challenge?', '', 35986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Training, massages, whatever you need, boss. Just don\'t forget me when you\'re the new Trade $g Prince : Princess;!', 35985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can see me? How can you see me, boss?$B$BI\'m going to have to work on that.', 35984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re... er, I mean the Light, is going to need a lot of gold, now more than ever.$B$BSpeaking of which, do you need any training?', 35983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shipwrecked on an island infested with bomb-throwing monkeys? What\'s next... is there a volcano that\'s going to blow?!', 35982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see such a bright future for you, my $g boy : girl;! What shall I teach you today?', '', 35981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re doing a great job, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n. Keep up the good work.', '', 35980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me give you a moment to get our opponents ready for battle.', 'Let me give you a moment to get our opponents ready for battle.', 35979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a wonderful day for some training in the mystical arts. Wouldn\'t you agree, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n?', 'What a wonderful day for some training in the mystical arts. Wouldn\'t you agree, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n?', 35978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ll excuse me, I\'m afraid I have other business I must attend to.  Please call on me again in the future.', '', 35977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n. I can\'t train you in the ways of magic, but all of this finger-waggling means that I can give a mean neck massage.', 'Hey there, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n. I can\'t train you in the ways of magic, but all of this finger-waggling means that I can give a mean neck massage.', 35976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s my favorite warlock! What dark secret can I whisper in your ear today?', '', 35975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t offer you any training, $n, but I sure could use your help against these damn monkeys!', '', 35974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to be shown this threat you speak of, Korrah.', 'I am ready to be shown this threat you speak of, Korrah.', 35973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The whispering winds have made it known to me that a $r $c would come; that $ghe:she; would assist me where many others have failed.$b$bCould you be the one?', 35972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more! I no like that!', '', 35971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who did that?! Stop it!', '', 35970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave Balboa alone you shiny gnats!', '', 35969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emerges from the ground!', '', 35968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rargh! Not another one!', '', 35967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s just horrible. I think they\'re all dead.$B$BHow will I get the kaja\'mite out of there now?', '', 35966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need you, $n!  There are worgen everywhere!', '', 35965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you and I are going to have a great time. I have so much to teach you about the ways of the hunter.', 'Oh, you and I are going to have a great time. I have so much to teach you about the ways of the hunter.', 35964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n? $G Sir : Ma\'am;, you\'re not a hunter, you\'re a $c.', '$n? $G Sir : Ma\'am;, you\'re not a hunter, you\'re a $c.', 35963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sabotage! I\'m ruined....$b$bWhoever\'s behind this will pay! I promise you that....', '', 35962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 35961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Justicar Mariel Trueheart has entrusted us with the duty of overseeing many of the tournament\'s affairs. Unfortunately, she tasked the Sunreavers with the same duty, which means we must work twice as hard to solve the problems created by those fools!', 35960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Justicar Mariel Trueheart has asked us to see to the needs of the tournament. Those who have earned the right to stand as champions and who have proven themselves in our eyes are asked to assist with these duties.', 35959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$b$bLook around you. Have you stopped to ponder what all of this means?', '', 35958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is trampled!', '$n is trampled!', 35957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon.   Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces!$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon.   Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces!$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 35956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon.   Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces!$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon.   Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces!$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 35955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a Brains shot!', '', 35954, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Marooned! Blasted to bits by the Alliance and stranded on some island in the middle of who-knows-where?!$B$BBusiness as usual, right, $n?', 35953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That had to hurt! Brains!', '', 35952, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somone stop that ghoul!', '', 35950, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s says: Look out! He\'s gonna blow!', '', 35948, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there, $n. So nice of you to rescue me. No hard feelings, right?', '', 35947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not safe out here, $n.  Seek shelter before it\'s too late.', '', 35946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sighs.', '', 35945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You shall pay dearly for your interference!', '', 35944, 0, 8690, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howling Fjord', 'Howling Fjord', 35943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Storm Peaks', 'Storm Peaks', 35942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Icecrown', 'Icecrown', 35941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sholazar Basin', 'Sholazar Basin', 35940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Borean Tundra', 'Borean Tundra', 35939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This tear in the fabric of time and space looks ominous.  Different scenes flash by at terrifying speed.  A very brave person might try to jump through at the right time...', '', 35938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day, $gsir:madam;!  How may I be of assistance?', '', 35936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue for Wintergrasp.', 'Queue for Wintergrasp.', 35935, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress.  When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle.$B$B', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress.  When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle.$B$B', 35934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun!  Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun!  Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!', 35933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello. Would you like to fight the Anub\'arak encounter for the Argent Colosseum raid? \n\nYou will face the version of this encounter that corresponds to the current raid difficulty you have selected. This encounter is a work in progress. Please be sure to report any bugs you experience on the Blizzard forums.\n\nAre you ready to begin the encounter?', '', 35932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muahhaah! You are far too late. The summoning of your doom is nearly complete!', 'Muahhaah! You are far too late. The summoning of your doom is nearly complete!', 35931, 0, 8689, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello. Would you like to fight the Val\'kyr encounter for the Argent Colosseum raid? \n\nYou will face the version of this encounter that corresponds to the current raid difficulty you have selected. This encounter is a work in progress. Please be sure to report any bugs you experience on the Blizzard forums.\n\nAre you ready to begin the encounter?', '', 35930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders of Desolace, come join the Burning Blade or suffer the consequences of defiance!', 'Invaders of Desolace, come join the Burning Blade or suffer the consequences of defiance!', 35929, 0, 8689, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of Azeroth, prepare! The age of the Burning Blade is nigh!', 'All of Azeroth, prepare! The age of the Burning Blade is nigh!', 35928, 0, 8689, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring on any opposition! The Burning Blade shall make a feast of your soul!', 'Bring on any opposition! The Burning Blade shall make a feast of your soul!', 35927, 0, 8689, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the help of the Burning Blade, demons shall rule all of Azeroth!', 'With the help of the Burning Blade, demons shall rule all of Azeroth!', 35926, 0, 8689, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time is nearly here! We shall sweep across this land, sacrificing all who defy us!', 'The time is nearly here! We shall sweep across this land, sacrificing all who defy us!', 35925, 0, 8689, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun.  Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun.  Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!', 35924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear me, invaders of Desolace! The Burning Blade shall use you all as sacrifices!', 'Hear me, invaders of Desolace! The Burning Blade shall use you all as sacrifices!', 35923, 0, 8689, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress.  When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle.$B$B', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress.  When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle.$B$B', 35922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello. Would you like to fight the Faction Champions encounter for the Argent Colosseum raid? \n\nYou will face the version of this encounter that corresponds to the current raid difficulty you have selected. This encounter is a work in progress. Please be sure to report any bugs you experience on the Blizzard forums.\n\nAre you ready to begin the encounter?', '', 35921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next please!', '', 35920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall sail for distant Azshara. There, I will forge a new trade empire. One that will crush the Steamwheedle Cartel! And I shall carve my likeness upon that distant land\'s mountains. All will pay tribute to me!', '', 35919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready my yacht! We ride with the tide and only the most wealthy and fit will be welcome to come with us!', '', 35918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You brutes make sure that my number one executive doesn\'t get anywhere near the villa.', '', 35917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It doesn\'t matter that Mount Kajaro has blown. All that matters is that I stay on top!', '', 35916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see great profit possibility on the horizon. All of Bilgewater Port\'s assets are about to flow to me.', '', 35915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mooks be on the lookout for any looters. Treat them with extreme prejudice!', '', 35914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s back to the Undermine with the lot of you!', '', 35913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TIME IS MONEY, TROLLS!', '', 35912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worthless! You\'re all just worthless! I\'m afraid we\'re going to have dump you all into the Maelstrom!', '', 35911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I have to come in there and show you how it\'s done?!', '', 35910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear you trolls are the worst batch of workers we\'ve ever had!', '', 35909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t make me come in there with my brutes!', '', 35908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Yes, you! Get back to work!', '', 35907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All you slaves better step it up!', '', 35906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arms ready!  Here they come!  HERE THEY COME!!!', '', 35905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will join in the assault upon Icecrown Citadel when the time to strike is upon us.', '', 35904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Merge with the spirit.>', '<Merge with the spirit.>', 35903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The shimmering vision does not acknowledge your presence. She is lost in her own world, reacting to events that played out thousands of years ago.>', 35902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes Archmage. I will hide the stone.', 'Yes Archmage. I will hide the stone.', 35898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kalytha ... it is done. The Sarcen Stone is fully charged and is already diverting energy from the portal. Are you still the incredible swimmer I knew those many years ago? The stone must not be found by either the demons or our \"beloved\" Queen.$B$BSwim to the bottom of the lake, Kalytha, and bury the stone deep under the center arch. Hopefully the demonic invaders will not discover it when they raze the surrounding temple. Go!', 35897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Argent Crusade invites you to test your skills in honorable combat against other heroes of Azeroth at the Argent Tournament.', '', 35896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s all I can do to keep these wards up. Find one of the Archmages, Kalytha! I feel like I\'m about to collapse...', 35895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kalytha! Hurry - Archmage Selwyn wanted to see you, she said it was urgent. Maybe we can win this thing?', 35894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More of these creatures! Where are they coming from? What\'s going on in the capital?', 35893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t maintain this shield much longer. Kalytha - are any of us going to survive this?', 35892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My strength ... is beginning ... to falter. Kalytha, please tell me the Archmages have a backup plan...', 35891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got to keep the arcane wards charged.', 35890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why didn\'t I flee with the others? They\'ve got the academy surrounded. We\'re trapped here.', '', 35889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These creatures ... so many of them. So many dead! Look at Azshara burn. What have the highborne done?', '', 35888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalytha! Archmage Selwyn was looking for you. She should be nearby...', '', 35887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. I suppose these are the consequences of magic. You reap what you sew ... Elune help us all.', '', 35886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I still bleeding? I can\'t ... I can\'t keep this up much longer. Have you seen any of the archmages?', '', 35885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalytha - you\'re still alive! Find some cover, there\'s no end to these ... things!', '', 35884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold them off - just hold them off. The Archmage has a plan.', '', 35883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re being overrun!', '', 35882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re storming the walls!', '', 35881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop them!', '', 35880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More? Where are they all coming from!?', '', 35879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We mustn\'t allow them through!', '', 35878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s on the auction house today?', 'What\'s on the auction house today?', 35877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day, $n.  If you require my services as an auctioneer, I regret to inform you: no.  Only grand master engineers possess the minimum intellectual capacity to interface with my superior functions.$b$bMore importantly, why are you still talking to me?', '', 35876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more play.', 'No more play.', 35875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to test our tanks.', 'I want to test our tanks.', 35874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to test our damage-dealers.', 'I want to test our damage-dealers.', 35873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello. By odd twist of fortune, we have obtained the remains of Kel\'Thuzad\'s feared abomination Patchwerk.  Our researchers are able to reassemble them in various ways to test the mettle of your band of would-be heroes, should you so desire.  \n\nWe can construct a sturdy Patchwerk against which to measure your ability to do damage, a brutal Patchwerk who will deliver rapid and mighty blows to any who would dare stand before him, or a well-rounded Patchwerk who will test your entire fighting force.\n\nWhich would you prefer?', '', 35872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The champions of the world\'s great nations have gathered at the Argent Tournament Grounds in northeastern Icecrown to face all challengers.', '', 35871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You see the world through Kalytha\'s eyes...', 35870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue for Wintergrasp.', 'Queue for Wintergrasp.', 35869, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shudders as piles of green sludge ooze out of the exhaust pipes!', '', 35868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n pops open the engine hatch and mucks around with the machine\'s innards...', '', 35867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I lost control of the mines!$B$BPlease, $g sir : ma\'am;, don\'t fire me!', '', 35866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...and stay dead!', 35865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to put in for hazard pay.', 35864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll never make Sr. Grade at this rate...', 35863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s how it\'s done!', 35862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first challenge requires you to be mounted on an Argent Warhorses.  You will find these mounts along the walls of this coliseum.$b$bPlease, mount the warhorse, speak to me, and then we can proceed.', '', 35861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn ... back ...', '', 35860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These grounds ... are not ... yours ...', '', 35859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave ... this ... place ...', '', 35858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect Nijel\'s Point with your lives!', 'Protect Nijel\'s Point with your lives!', 35857, 0, 8678, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay out of its way! It\'ll burn you alive!', 'Stay out of its way! It\'ll burn you alive!', 35856, 0, 8678, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I - I think there\'s someone INSIDE that thing!', 'I - I think there\'s someone INSIDE that thing!', 35855, 0, 8678, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh-what is that thing!!', 'Wh-what is that thing!!', 35854, 0, 8678, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand your ground, men!', 'Stand your ground, men!', 35853, 0, 8678, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success! You have your Personal Riches!$B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_coin_02.blp:64|t', '', 35852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_Searinglightpriest.blp:36|tYou have Empowered Light!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_Searinglightpriest.blp:36|tYou have Empowered Light!', 35851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Darkritual.blp:36|tYou have Empowered Darkness!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Darkritual.blp:36|tYou have Empowered Darkness!', 35850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I got it!', 35849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we go - keep those things off of me while I work!', 35848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s the survey marker!', 35847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch my back, I need to concentrate on this...', 35846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Yes, you!$b$bGaze upon me and treasure this moment of meeting, for soon the world will come to know and fear the name and stern visage of Wilfred Fizzlebang! Once my magnificent summoning is complete, no one will doubt my ability!', '', 35845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may operate in the shadows of polite society, but out here on the battlefront our powers are properly respected at last.', 'We may operate in the shadows of polite society, but out here on the battlefront our powers are properly respected at last.', 35844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have been tending these worms for some time. I hope they will be fit in time for the ring event of this organization. You must face not one, but two jormungar, after all.', '', 35843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The yeti is a fierce, cunning creature, and this one is one of the strongest of his kind. We keep him asleep through herbs in his food.$b$bDo not think he will be lethargic in the ring, however.', '', 35842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tend these creatures of Gormok as he cannot. I do not fully agree with this slaughter, but at the least he will have his chance to fight.', '', 35841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magnataur are not as stupid as they appear. Keeping Gormok until his time is a difficult task, but he is bound tightly enough that there is no danger.', '', 35840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s do this thing.', 35839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t botch this - I\'m angling for Sr. Grade by the end of the year.', 35838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Surveyor? I hardly know her! Hah HAH!', 35837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I ain\'t \'fraid of no ghost!', 35836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes I do!', 'Yes I do!', 35835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Gumps are letting me help them run their shop! I just love flowers.$B$B<Little Adeline suddenly squints at you, looking very serious.>$B$BDo you like flowers?', 35834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! My servants!', '', 35833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RAAAAGH!', '', 35832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free me!', '', 35831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gormok will be free, runts!', '', 35830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Ware the grounds! Frostwyrms are attacking!', '', 35829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Val\'kyr are attacking! Take cover!', '', 35828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!', 'Attack!', 35827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!', 'Attack!', 35826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your guard!', 'On your guard!', 35825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! Frostwyrms, to the south!', 'Look! Frostwyrms, to the south!', 35824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the innocent!', 'Protect the innocent!', 35823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'kyr! Take cover!', 'Val\'kyr! Take cover!', 35822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that, to the southeast?', 'What\'s that, to the southeast?', 35821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our sisters have been captured! Fall back!', 35820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fools! Did you think our master blind? Did you think we did not know of this intrusion? Our elder sisters come, and there will be no escape from their wrath!', 35819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course I was the one chosen to summon a demon for the competitors. I am Wilfred Fizzlebang, master summoner! Demons quail before the mere thought of being under my will!', '', 35818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It won\'t be long before Fizzlebang is a household word, used to scare children into bed! \"Beware, or Fizzlebang will summon a mighty demon to eat you!\"', '', 35817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon all the world will know the name of Wilfred!', '', 35816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, Wilfred Fizzlebang, have been invited to this quaint tournament to make use of my extensive knowledge of the summoning arts. What better choice?', '', 35815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wind fiercely cuts across this bluff, and most life has long since fled this corner of Icecrown. However, all it takes is a bit of coaxing for it to return, and that is why I walk these grounds. One day these trees will tower over us all.', '', 35814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep him asleep, that\'s it. No need to wake him before it\'s time.', 'Keep him asleep, that\'s it. No need to wake him before it\'s time.', 35813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highlord Tirion Fordring approaches the stage to address those gathered upon the tournament grounds! Make way to the stage area to attend him!', '', 35812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief of the Horde, Thrall, and Overlord Garrosh Hellscream have arrived upon the tournament grounds! Clear the way to the entrance!', '', 35811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His Majesty, King Varian Wrynn, and Lady Jaina Proudmoore have touched down upon the tournament grounds! Make way!', '', 35810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah! This ring will do nicely...', 35809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s sifts through the recovered treasures until something catches her eye.', 35808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The victors will take their rightful place in the assault upon the Citadel. We will stand together in the face of evil, and Arthas WILL fall!', '', 35807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your prowess, your might, and your cunning will be under close watch. These games will determine the best Azeroth has to offer.', '', 35806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Within these walls, you will be tested. Your skill in combat will be matched against the fiercest dangers Northrend has to offer under the watchful eyes of your leaders.', '', 35805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have Touch of |cFF9932CDDarkness.|r  Switch to |cFF9932CDDark|r Essence!', 35804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instead, we require a small, concentrated strike force for the attack to succeed. For that reason, we have created the Argent Tournament.', '', 35803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A massive attack with every able-bodied man would end in needless slaughter. Every soldier lost would rise as the enemy. Azeroth would be left defenseless against the undead threat.', '', 35802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But this is no task to be taken lightly.', '', 35801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the south lies our goal. We will march to the Citadel and cut out the heart of the Scourge where it dwells.', '', 35800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Combatants of the Alliance and Horde! You are welcome under the banner of the Argent Crusade.', '', 35799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have Touch of |cFFFFFFFFLight.|r  Switch to |cFFFFFFFFLight|r Essence!', 35798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now and rest; you\'ve earned it.', '', 35797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My congratulations, champions. Through trials both planned and unexpected, you have triumphed.', '', 35796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fought well.', '', 35795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Horde!', '', 35794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach those cultists a lesson, $n. No one messes with Crusader Kul and gets away with it!', '', 35793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s rescue the rest of those aspirants and get back to camp. I\'m going to need a whole keg of ale after this!', '', 35792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me at those crazy cultists! I\'ll cleave \'em in half!', '', 35791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were seconds from strapping me to one of those altars and sucking my soul out. Let\'s get out of here!', '', 35790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light! I\'ll never do anything this foolish again!', '', 35789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you will follow me, then.', '', 35788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Under my roof, gentlemen, I trust you will behave.', '', 35787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you\'ll see the merit of these events in time, Garrosh. We cannot win against the Scourge if we continue to war against one another.', '', 35786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, Warchief Thrall. Overlord Hellscream.', '', 35785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I like the way you think, $r!$B$BUntil recently, the latent magical energies of the academy grounds attracted the attention of the Blue Dragonflight, and I wasn\'t able to study them. The attention of the dragons is now elsewhere, but a worse threat is in the making - these little green brutes want to level the ruins to make way for a fuel depot! Knowledge lost for ten thousand years is days away from being lost forever. We\'ve got to act fast.', 35784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And we\'re going to dig them up.', 'And we\'re going to dig them up.', 35783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold out? Against a full frontal assault from the legion\'s vanguard? Not likely!$B$BNo, history doesn\'t record what happened next... for there were no survivors. The raging demons left little more than the ruins you see today, and the secrets of the academy lay buried under the soil of Azshara.', 35782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were they able to hold out?', 'Were they able to hold out?', 35781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the time the Burning Legion began its assault, the mages at the Mennar Academy had fallen far from the Queen\'s graces. They would\'ve been a powerful asset in the war to come, but they refused to fall back when the rest of the city fell.$B$BInstead of regrouping outside the city to join in the counter-assault, they stayed behind, erecting magical barriers and turning their once quiet home into a fortress. Refugees streamed to the Mennar Academy in the first terrible days of the invasion, and survivors rallied to mount a defense.', 35780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to the mages?', 'What happened to the mages?', 35779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suffice it to say that the academy was cautious in its application of these newfound powers - what few writings remain indicate that the mages there worried about arcane addiction, a problem my race suffers from to this day.$B$BThis restraint put the mages of Mennar in opposition to Queen Azshara and her highborne lackeys, who sought ever greater power with wild abandon, throwing caution to the wind and delving into ever more dangerous applications of the arts.', 35778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, please go on.', 'No, please go on.', 35777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My concern for the moment is with the ruins that surround Lake Mennar, to our east. Thousands of years ago the Mennar Academy was among the first to study the arcane arts. It was a beautiful terraced structure built in a ring around a tranquil lake, a place of quiet contemplation and focused study. It was there that my ancestors first discovered the potential of the magical energies seeping from the Well of Eternity.$B$BI\'m sorry - is this all too much to take in? I\'ve immersed myself in arcane history for several decades now, I forget that others do not share my passion.', 35776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here?', 'What are you doing here?', 35775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you familiar with the War of the Ancients, $n? That is what we call the period of time 10,000 years ago, when the demons of the Burning Legion first breached the realm of Azeroth and attempted to devour this entire world as they have countless others. The ancient capital of Azshara, a city that once dominated this landscape, was ground zero for the invasion. The ancient wreckage you\'ll find scattered throughout the area stands in broken testament to the egotism of our forebears.', 35774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Timed Out!', '', 35773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no need for bones to best you!', '', 35772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My rotting flesh was just getting in the way!', '', 35771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I must not fail... again...', '', 35770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A waste of flesh.', '', 35769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 35768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This farce ends here!', '', 35767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be at ease.', 35766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take your rest.', 35765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take this time to consider your past deeds.', 35764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the Light give me strength to provide a worthy challenge.', 35763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, good herald. Your words are too kind.', 35762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I yield! I submit. Excellent work. May I run away now?', '', 35761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nay, nay, and I say yet again nay! Not good enough.', '', 35760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! You need more practice.', '', 35759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourselves!', '', 35758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The swarm shall overtake you!', '', 35757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auum na-l ak-k-k-k, isshhh. Rise, minions. Devour...', '', 35756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have failed you, master...', '', 35754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another soul to sate the host.', '', 35753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('F-lakkh shir!', '', 35752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place will serve as your tomb!', '', 35751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh, our guests have arrived, just as the master promised.', '', 35750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The souls of your fallen champions will be mine, Fordring.', '', 35749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The Nerubians built an empire beneath the frozen wastes of Northrend. An empire that you so foolishly built your structures upon. MY EMPIRE.', '', 35748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will have your challenge, Fordring.', '', 35747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the light consume you!', 35746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the dark consume you!', 35745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'CHAOS!', 35744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are finished!', 35743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Scourge cannot be stopped...', 35741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unworthy!', 35740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have been measured and found wanting.', 35739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the name of our dark master. For the Lich King. You. Will. Die.', 35738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IN-FER-NO!', '', 35737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth, sister! Your master calls!', '', 35736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FLESH FROM BONE!', '', 35735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another will take my place. Your world is doomed...', '', 35734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Banished to the Nether!', '', 35733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insignificant gnat!', '', 35732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You face Jaraxxus, Eredar Lord of the Burning Legion!', '', 35731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trifling gnome! Your arrogance will be your undoing!', '', 35730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I\'m in charge here...', '', 35729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-HA! I\'ve done it! Behold the absolute power of Wilfred Fizzlebang, master summoner! You are bound to me, demon!', '', 35728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare for oblivion!', '', 35727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Highlord. Now, challengers, I will begin the ritual of summoning. When I am done a fearsome doomguard will appear!', '', 35726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Trials of the Crusader! Only the most powerful combatants of Azeroth are allowed to undergo these trials. You are among the worthy few.', '', 35725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arthas! You are hopelessly outnumbered! Lay down Frostmourne and I will grant you a just death.', '', 35724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mighty blow has been dealt to the Lich King! You have proven yourselves as able bodied champions of the Argent Crusade. Together we will strike against Icecrown Citadel and destroy what remains of the Scourge! There is no challenge that we cannot face united!', '', 35723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only by working together will you overcome the final challenge. From the depths of Icecrown come two of the Scourge\'s most powerful lieutenants: fearsome val\'kyr, winged harbingers of the Lich King!', '', 35722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A shallow and tragic victory. We are weaker as a whole from the losses suffered today. Who but the Lich King could benefit from such foolishness? Great warriors have lost their lives. And for what? The true threat looms ahead - the Lich King awaits us all in death.', '', 35721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. I will allow it. Fight with honor!', '', 35720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next battle will be against the Argent Crusade\'s most powerful knights! Only by defeating them will you be deemed worthy...', '', 35719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone calm down! Compose yourselves! There is no conspiracy at play here! The warlock acted on his own volition, outside of influences from the Alliance. The tournament must go on!', '', 35718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The loss of Wilfred Fizzlebang, while unfortunate, should be a lesson to those that dare dabble in dark magic. Alas, you are victorious and now must face the next challenge.', '', 35717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, heroes, destroy the demon lord before it can open a portal to its twisted demonic realm!', '', 35716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Warlock Wilfred Fizzlebang will summon forth your next challenge. Stand by for his entry.', '', 35715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tragic... They fought valiantly, but the beasts of Northrend triumphed. Let us observe a moment of silence for our fallen heroes.', '', 35714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The monstrous menagerie has been vanquished!', '', 35713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The air itself freezes with the introduction of our next combatant, Icehowl! Kill or be killed, champions!', '', 35712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steel yourselves, heroes, for the twin terrors, Acidmaw and Dreadscale, enter the arena!', '', 35711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hailing from the deepest, darkest caverns of the Storm Peaks, Gormok the Impaler! Battle on, heroes!', '', 35710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the games begin!', '', 35709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, champions! You have heard the call of the Argent Crusade and you have boldly answered! It is here, in the Crusaders\' Coliseum, that you will face your greatest challenges. Those of you who survive the rigors of the coliseum will join the Argent Crusade on its march to Icecrown Citadel.', '', 35708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen more worthy challenges in the Ring of Blood. You waste our time, paladin.', '', 35707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you still question the might of the Horde, paladin? We will take on all comers!', '', 35706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was just a taste of what the future brings. FOR THE HORDE!', '', 35705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incorrect!', '', 35704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde demands justice! We challenge the Alliance! Allow us to battle in place of your knights, paladin. We will show these dogs what it means to insult the Horde.', '', 35703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Correct!', '', 35702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show them no mercy, Horde champions! LOK\'TAR OGAR! ', '', 35701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your |cFFFF2222Amazing G-Ray!|r$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_20.blp:64|t', '', 35700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treacherous Alliance dogs! You summon a demon lord against warriors of the Horde? Your deaths will be swift!', '', 35699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar!', '', 35698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overpowered...', '', 35697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 35696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finding yourself without a Raging Vortex Gem, you reach into the runestone to acquire another.', 'Finding yourself without a Raging Vortex Gem, you reach into the runestone to acquire another.', 35695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weakling!', '', 35694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your beasts will be no match for my champions, Tirion!', '', 35693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not even the Lich King\'s most powerful minions can stand against the Alliance. All hail our victors!', '', 35692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GLORY TO THE ALLIANCE!', '', 35691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our honor has been besmirched! They make wild claims and false accusations against us. I demand justice! Allow my champions to fight in place of your knights, Tirion. We challenge the Horde!', '', 35690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight for the glory of the Alliance, heroes! Honor your king and your people!', '', 35689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance doesn\'t need the help of a demon lord to deal with Horde filth! Come, pig!', '', 35688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this the best the Horde has to offer?', '', 35687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worthless scrub.', '', 35686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hardly a challenge.', '', 35685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAH!', '', 35684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your kind is not welcome here, $r!', 35683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are treading upon sacred ground!', 35682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do not belong here, $r!', 35681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die, tresspasser!', 35680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the nearby ruins.', 'Tell me about the nearby ruins.', 35679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At long last we have an opportunity to study the ruins that dot this landscape... Provided these moneygrubbers don\'t level the place first.', 35678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may begin!', '', 35677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s spikes pursue $n!', '', 35676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s glares at $n and lets out a bellowing roar!', '', 35675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes crazy-go-nuts!', '%s goes crazy-go-nuts!', 35583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was surprisingly restful.', 'That was surprisingly restful.', 35582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I quit, I QUIT!', 'I quit, I QUIT!', 35581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your |cFFFF2222Infinifold Lockpick!|r$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_swissArmy.blp:64|t', '', 35579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your |cFFFF2222Ear-O-Scope!|r$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Ear_NightElf_02.blp:64|t', '', 35578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your |cFFFF2222Blastcrackers!|r$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bomb_07.blp:64|t', '', 35577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your |cFFFF2222Kaja\'mite Drill!|r$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Weapon_ShortBlade_21.blp:64|t', '', 35576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No job is worth this!', 'No job is worth this!', 35575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give that $gman:woman; a raise!', 'Give that $gman:woman; a raise!', 35574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can still clock in for the time I was petrified, right?', 'I can still clock in for the time I was petrified, right?', 35573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nightmare is over!', 'The nightmare is over!', 35572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m outta here...', 'I\'m outta here...', 35571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free!', 'I\'m free!', 35570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck!', '', 35569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vault will be cracked once the |cFFFF2222Vault Breaking progress bar reaches 100 percent!|r$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_coin_02.blp:64|t$BDoing the wrong thing at the wrong time will reduce the progress of the bar.', '', 35568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use what is called for in your Goblin All-In-1-Der Belt below to crack open the vault!$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_20.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bomb_07.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Ear_NightElf_02.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_EngGizmos_swissArmy.blp:64|t |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Weapon_ShortBlade_21.blp:64|t', '', 35567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are breaking into the vault to retrieve your Personal Riches!', '', 35566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re looking at the most state-of-the-art mining operation in the world. Only rubes would bother to tunnel under a mountain to get at the minerals below. We moved the whole mountain! Now we can just scoop the precious metals right off of the ground.', '', 35565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finding yourself without a Vortex Gem, you reach into the runestone to acquire another.', 'Finding yourself without a Vortex Gem, you reach into the runestone to acquire another.', 35564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This monument hums and crackles with perpetual ancient energies.', '', 35563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, Tirion. I apologize for his outburst.  It will not be repeated.', '', 35562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh, enough!', '', 35561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wise words.', '', 35560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the invitation, Lord Fordring. We look forward to observing these games.', '', 35559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are guests here, Garrosh, and you will conduct yourself honorably.', '', 35558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah.', '', 35557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Words of a fool, you mean. The Horde will destroy the undead without your aid, human, or that of the pompous king.', '', 35556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak for yourself, Thrall.', '', 35555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What honor is there in thrashing about with blunted sticks? This is a waste of time.', '', 35554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pah! That was a show of strength, worthy of a leader. I only regret I did not kill that human before the mage interfered.', '', 35553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh, I expect you to control yourself here. I do not want a repeat of the Violet Citadel.', '', 35552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tear him apart!', '', 35551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
