('', 'No, I\'m the intellectual one, and I am not to be taken lightly.  I could brew a healing potion from dishwater and dandelions, although that\'s not something I\'ll show you!$b$bAnyhow, if you\'d like to make a purchase, please speak with Patricia.', 35404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
