('Do you actually sell anything?', 'Do you actually sell anything?', 35402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to our shop.  We have everything you need... if you need alchemy supplies.', 35401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Szabo already made you an outfit worthy of a trade prince. Move along now, you are scaring all of Szabo\'s customers away.', '', 35400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no warranty on those shades yous bought!', 35399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
