('You already gots the shiniest bling on the island, $g brother : sister;!', '', 35397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello. Would you like to fight the Lord Jaraxxus encounter for the Argent Colosseum raid? \n\nYou will face the version of this encounter that corresponds to the current raid difficulty you have selected. This encounter is a work in progress. Please be sure to report any bugs you experience on the Blizzard forums.\n\nAre you ready to begin the encounter?', '', 35396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
