('Go for the face! Go for the face!', 'Go for the face! Go for the face!', 35385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here yous go. My best pair and I\'m giving them to ya cheap!$B$BYous gonna look sharp in them!', 35384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need some cool shades. What will two stacks of macaroons get me?', 'I need some cool shades. What will two stacks of macaroons get me?', 35383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
