('See to it that I\'m not followed.', 'See to it that I\'m not followed.', 35359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re too late to stop our plan.', 'You\'re too late to stop our plan.', 35358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think you\'re doing?', 'What do you think you\'re doing?', 35357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What up, G? Don\'t look like you gots enough macaroons to afford the class of bling I specialize in.$B$BYou might want to get yoself up to the bank. Dig?', '', 35356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That bling is phat like your momma!', '', 35355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Set me up with the phattest, shiniest bling you got!', 'Set me up with the phattest, shiniest bling you got!', 35354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo! You look like a $g man : woman; of discerning tastes.$B$BWhat can I do you for?', '', 35353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pleasure doing business with you as always, $g Mr. : Ms.; $n.$B$BHave a nice day.', '', 35352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to make a withdrawal. Ten stacks of macaroons!', 'I need to make a withdrawal. Ten stacks of macaroons!', 35351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to First Bank of Kezan, a wholly-owned subsidiary of the Bilgewater Traders & Merchants Bank Of The South Seas.$B$BWhat can I do for you today?', '', 35350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
