('Syntax Error Line 14, Sequence: Flee for Life. Entering passive mode. *Click!*', '', 35339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coming out of the gate is Eressea Dawnsinger, skilled mage and Grand Champion of Silvermoon!\n', '', 35338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Representing the tenacity of the Forsaken, here is the Grand Champion of the Undercity, Deathstalker Visceri!\n', '', 35337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tall in the saddle of his kodo, here is the venerable Runok Wildmane, Grand Champion of Thunder Bluff!\n', '', 35336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Entering the arena is the lean and dangerous Zul\'tore, Grand Champion of Sen\'jin!\n', '', 35335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Presenting the fierce Grand Champion of Orgrimmar, Mokra the Skullcrusher!\n', '', 35334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For years I served in this backwater corner of the world, learning the terrain and biding my time. At last our time has come. The full might of Orgrimmar is now turned to Azshara, our gateway to Ashenvale and dominance over this continent. Welcome to the front lines, $c.', '', 35333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You come to learn how to ride?', '', 35332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin!', '', 35331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will first be facing three of the Grand Champions of the Tournament! These fierce contenders have beaten out all others to reach the pinnacle of skill in the joust.', '', 35330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re worthy fighters, you\'ll see.', 35329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not come here to watch animals tear at each other senselessly, Tirion.', '', 35328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, a fight worth watching.', '', 35327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight well, Horde! Lok\'tar Ogar!', '', 35326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh, enough.', '', 35325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Admirably? Hah! I will enjoy watching your weak little champions fail, human.', '', 35324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course they will.', 35323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no taste for these games, Tirion. Still... I trust they will perform admirably.', '', 35322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, champions. Today, before the eyes of your leaders and peers, you will prove yourselves worthy combatants.', '', 35321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 35320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready for your first challenge, $c?', '', 35319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trampling combatants underfoot, %s goes into a frothing rage!', '', 35318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s crashes into the Coliseum wall and is stunned!', '', 35317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Trade Prince will hear about this, $n!', 'The Trade Prince will hear about this, $n!', 35316, 0, 8606, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a public nuisance, $n!', 'You\'re a public nuisance, $n!', 35315, 0, 8606, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get you, $n!', 'I\'ll get you, $n!', 35314, 0, 8606, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My neck! I\'m gonna sue!', 'My neck! I\'m gonna sue!', 35313, 0, 8606, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch!', 'Ouch!', 35312, 0, 8606, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn how to drive you maniac!', 'Learn how to drive you maniac!', 35311, 0, 8606, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch where you\'re going!', 'Watch where you\'re going!', 35310, 0, 8606, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re gonna hear from my lawyer!', 'You\'re gonna hear from my lawyer!', 35309, 0, 8606, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many champions have fallen to the skills displayed by $n.  We are proud to present this formidable $c.', '', 35308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We offer a mighty champion, a capable $c, an honorable $r.  We present, $n.', '', 35307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One would be hard pressed to find a more steadfast champion than this $c.  Today we present, $n. ', '', 35306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions on the tournament grounds speak highly of this $c.  Today we present, $n.', '', 35305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has risen to the ranks of champion in our tournament.  We are proud to present $ghim:her; to you today.', '', 35304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These earthquakes have just been crazy!', '', 35303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice weather wouldn\'t you say?', '', 35302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been delivering mail for a month now. Are there any executive openings? I have my resume right here.', '', 35301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mines have been at peak efficiency under your leadership, despite the worms and lazy trolls.', '', 35300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I say that it\'s an honor to be your driver?', '', 35299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This won\'t take long.', '', 35298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on!', '', 35297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we go!', '', 35296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so tired. Just let me rest for a moment.', 'I\'m so tired. Just let me rest for a moment.', 35295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t hear the screams anymore. Is this the end?', 'I can\'t hear the screams anymore. Is this the end?', 35294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was awful... I dreamt I was fighting against my friends.', 'It was awful... I dreamt I was fighting against my friends.', 35293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My nightmare, is it finally over?', 'My nightmare, is it finally over?', 35292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last... now I can rest.', 'At last... now I can rest.', 35291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dampwick, I need a ride back to headquarters, pronto!', 'Dampwick, I need a ride back to headquarters, pronto!', 35290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, boss-$g man : lady;. This batch of troll slaves has got to be the worst yet!$B$BLucky for us that the kaja\'mite doesn\'t seem to be making their soft brains any smarter, eh?', '', 35289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has defended the workshop!', '', 35286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sassy, get me another ride down to the Kaja\'mite Mine.', 'Sassy, get me another ride down to the Kaja\'mite Mine.', 35285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you do not yet know this name, we are certain you will after these battles.  We present, $n.', '', 35284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We present to you, $n.  One of the finest $cs we have seen in action.', '', 35283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Words can scarce describe the deeds that this $c has performed on the battlefield.  We are proud to present $n.', '', 35282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the fiercest $cs on the field of battle, we present $n.', '', 35281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken the workshop!', '', 35280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken the workshop!', '', 35279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has assaulted the workshop!', '', 35278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A cunning $c, a proud $r.  We are pleased to present $n to you.', '', 35277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'s my hot, company executive girlfriend today? With the way you run things around here, I think that any day now we\'ll be calling you Trade Princess $n!$B$BI cannot wait! I\'m gonna spend my days at the gym and working on my tan by the pool.', '', 35276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard that some Southsea pirates pulled into dock earlier. Be careful if you go into town!$B$BThey even have women pirates! Hmm, maybe I should go check it out myself? Just to make sure it\'s safe for you out there, baby.', '', 35275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know that I promised you last night, and the night before that, but I\'m taking you out someplace really nice tomorrow night!', '', 35273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like what you\'re wearing!', '', 35272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those other women are just friends, baby.', '', 35271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think of my abs, baby? I just got back from the gym.$B$BI am one fine piece of meat!', '', 35270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweetie, where have you been? You know how worried I get when you don\'t check in with me!', '', 35269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve got a miscievious look in your eye. What have you been up to, babe?$B$BWell?', 35268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can we go on a nice, romantic picnic on top of Mount Kajaro?$B$BMake sure you pickup my favorite champagne!', 35267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful out there. I heard that there are Southsea pirates in the bay.$B$BHmm, maybe I should go check for myself...', 35266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t wait for the day when you rise to the top. Just think, I\'ll be able to call myself Mrs. Trade Prince$B$BNot to mention buy all that stuff I\'ve always wanted!!!', 35265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
