('I adore you! You believe me? Right, baby?', '', 35261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sunreavers are proud to present their representatives in this trial by combat.', '', 35260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Silver Covenant is pleased to present their contenders for this event, Highlord.', '', 35259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now.', 'Now.', 35258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
