('You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience.', 'You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience.', 35224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did you say earlier?', 'What did you say earlier?', 35223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are Synthebrew Goggles?', 'What are Synthebrew Goggles?', 35222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We want everyone to have fun at Brewfest. It would also help if we had some people remember it as well.$b$bThese goggles allow anyone to experience what it\'s like to be drunk, but without the drinking part. Put the goggles on, and it\'s like you\'re drunk! Take them off, and you\'re sober!$b$bAre you interested in a pair?', '', 35221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 300, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like a pair of Synthebrew Goggles.', 'I\'d like a pair of Synthebrew Goggles.', 35220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Alliance hands. Will you join the fight?', 'The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Alliance hands. Will you join the fight?', 35219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Horde hands. Will you join the fight?', 'The Isle of Conquest is laden with valuable resources we cannot allow to fall into Horde hands. Will you join the fight?', 35218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience.', 'You are not yet strong enough to do battle on the Isle of Conquest. Return when you have gained more experience.', 35217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready. This time things will be different.', 'We\'re ready. This time things will be different.', 35216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We want another shot at those beasts!', 'We want another shot at those beasts!', 35215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! Let me know when you are ready for the next attempt.', '', 35214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those beasts are amazing specimens. You should feel no shame at being bested by them.', '', 35213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All I\'m saying is don\'t be caught dead in those outdated fashions!', 35212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I recommend you buy like there was no tomorrow. Who knows how long it will be until you find deals this good again.', 35211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Browse my wares to your hearts content! From the finest in enchantments, to the latest in fashion, you can find it all here.', 35210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come in, come in! One at a time.', 35209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sisters go into a Berserker Rage!', 35208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s giggles.', '%s giggles.', 35207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Away from me, lowborn scum! Perhaps you did not notice my boot in your face the first time!', 35206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was the greatest moment of my life...', '', 35205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s shudders.', 35204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, Illyanna, I love you!', '', 35203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You go ahead and start your travels. I\'ll catch up with you right after I finish tending to my hair. ', 35202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To hold you in my arms would be the fulfillment of my dreams. Come down from there, let us travel far away from here!', '', 35201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then why don\'t you go and do that? My friends and I have better things to do!', 35200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illyanna, why do you spurn me? I would weave a web to catch the sun, if you were to ask me to do so!', '', 35199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. They are even more beautiful without your reflection in them. ', 35198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, Illyanna, your eyes, they are so beautiful.', '', 35197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placing', 'Placing', 35196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
