('$n has |cFFFF0000Legion Flames!|r\n', '', 35194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, patience. We will be with you shortly.', '', 35193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
