('%s creates an |cFF00FF00Infernal Volcano!|r', '', 35191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s creates a Nether Portal!', '', 35190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please show me your documents before proceeding.', '', 35189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods warmly.', '', 35188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However, our new allies, formed from within the Twisting Nether promise new sources of power, and untold mastery of our magic. Keep faith in Lady Azshara, as she keeps her faith in you. ', '', 35187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
