('Blowing open my escape pod. I like your style, $n!', 'Blowing open my escape pod. I like your style, $n!', 35004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, it\'s you! Thanks, $g man : sweetie;!', '$n, it\'s you! Thanks, $g man : sweetie;!', 35003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What, are you crazy?! Trying to blow me to smithereens like that!', 'What, are you crazy?! Trying to blow me to smithereens like that!', 35002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde captured the last flag!', '', 35001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yaaarr!', 'Yar!', 35000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damn you, Fandral! What have you gotten us into with this cursed \"World Tree?\"', 34999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There has to be a way to stop this corruption before it consumes us all.', 34998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the furbolg could be this far gone, what does that say for the rest of Teldrassil?', 34997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should have seen this coming. The corruption has been spreading for quite some time.', 34996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I haven\'t seen any of the sleeping druids. They must have been taken from here already.', 34995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place is infested... we\'ll need to make our way out of here with the relics as quickly as possible.', 34994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It saddens me to see the furbolg all corrupted so readily. These used to be our friends.', 34993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m injured! I need to rest a bit.', 34992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll need to find a place to rest a while. Continue on... don\'t leave without the relics.', 34991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m hurt! Go on without me.', 34990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you. They\'re all throughout the tunnels, we\'ll have to stay on our guard.', 34989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There you are! I thought the furbolgs might have caught you before you could even get here.', 34988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kyra said that you might need some help.', 34987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glad to see that you\'ve arrived. Shall we get to it then?', 34986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re finally here. Take the scenic route?', 34985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need some help finding your way? I know this place like the back of my hand.', 34984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s the gallows for me...', 'It\'s the gallows for me...', 34983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance captured the last flag!', '', 34982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tie game!', '', 34981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whistles at Charlie the dog.', '%s whistles at Charlie the dog.', 34980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gimmie that key, you stupid mutt!', 'Gimmie that key, you stupid mutt!', 34979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...we\'ve got a nice bone for you, puppy.', '...we\'ve got a nice bone for you, puppy.', 34978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mere! Here boy!', 'C\'mere! Here boy!', 34977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forty five seconds until the Arena battle begins!', '', 34976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to cast Twin\'s Pact!', 34975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to cast  |cFFFF0000Twin\'s Pact!|r', 34974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Rear Admiral will hear of this.', '', 34973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Northwatch!', '', 34972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$R, I\'ll have your head.', '', 34971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, filth!', '', 34970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde scum!', '', 34969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to cast |cFF9932CDDark Vortex!|r Switch to |cFF9932CDDark|r Essence!', 34968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to cast |cFFFFFFFFLight Vortex!|r Switch to |cFFFFFFFFLight|r Essence!', 34967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometimes the mist cannot find its way if we are too far. Let\'s venture further and try again.', 34966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sputtervalve you\'re a genius! I\'ll take 30.', '', 34965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that a working samophlange? Throttle it up! MAX POWER!', '', 34964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away, Noz.', '', 34963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No idea. But it\'s doing it perfectly!', '', 34962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s beautiful! ...have we figured out what it does yet?', '', 34961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior-Matic NX-01 is online.$B$BPlease insert coins for training.', '', 34960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior-Matic NX-01 is currently offline.', '', 34959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure, $n, I\'ll train you, $n. Just keep an eye out for those monkeys!', 34958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m surprised that a $c like you could even see me, $n. I\'m stealth on a stick!', 34957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, $n, if you\'re going to be a $g priest : priestess; of the Light, you\'re going to need a lot of gold to keep things running smoothly.$B$BNever be afraid to ask for donations.', 34956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t have to be a priest to tithe. Your coin is just as welcome, $g sir : ma\'am;.', 34955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah good, there $g he : she; is... my future $g master : mistress; of the elements! What kind of training would you like today?', '', 34954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you believe these monkeys, $n?', '', 34953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know about you, $n, but I for one do not intend to be marooned on this island forever!$B$BIf only I\'d stayed at the academy and learned how to use teleport magic....', '', 34952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somehow I doubt that you want training from me, $n. I\'m not sure those fingers can handle a firebolt.', '', 34951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'m glad that you\'re here. Maybe I can teach you a thing or two.$B$BWhat do you think, $g sir : ma\'am;?', '', 34950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? $n, you\'re not a warlock.$B$BThere\'s nothing that I can teach a $c like you, $g sir : ma\'am;.', '', 34949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All I have to do is resequence the oscillating coolant pressure valves...', '', 34948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this samophlange operational!', '', 34947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $n, good to see you. These monkeys are driving me insane!$B$BWhat do you need?', '', 34946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These monkeys are a real pain!', '', 34945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another Gahz\'ridian Detector.', 'I need another Gahz\'ridian Detector.', 34944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Locomotion systems operable. Resuming transport,', '', 34943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Waaaahhh! It\'s raining $r!!', 34942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep, $Ghe:she;\'s a goner.', '', 34941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand still, $n! And hold your breath in case you end up over the ocean...', '', 34940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Stonetalon Mountains, friend! Saurboz is expectin\' ya.', '', 34939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to teleport. I think.', 'I\'m ready to teleport. I think.', 34938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, my Personal People-Porter is ready for testing! I mean, ready for use. I wouldn\'t test unproven hardware on you, would I?', '', 34937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $r. Seeing any profit lately?', '', 34936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Billowing clouds of white smoke... Is that by design?', '', 34935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We just need to knock the centrifugal rotary ball clutch back into alignment. Easy!', '', 34934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, boss. I trust that you\'re enjoying your new promotion?$B$BWe all think that you\'re the one who\'s going to finally be able to replace that stinky ol\' Gallywix and take the title of Trade $g Prince : Princess;. But you didn\'t hear that from me!$B$BWe have a lot to do and very little time. Hope you\'re ready!', 34933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Walk away, fool!  You are no match for me!', '', 34932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bloodhound has spotted a piece of parchment at the end of the trail.', '', 34931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bloodhound has caught the scent.  Follow it!', '', 34930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard the lady, boys... Give \'em some fire!', '', 34929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s mutters angrily to herself.', 34928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nonsense! You\'re overreacting. Have you been watching me this whole time?', 34927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What, this? This is nothing. Just some ... wildlife research.', 34926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve seen the results of your \'research\' before. I\'ll deliver this package to Orgrimmar for study.', '', 34925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should do well to consider where your loyalties lie, $r.', '', 34924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, you should know the Warchief doesn\'t trust the undead. Have you heard what happened at the Wrathgate?', '', 34923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you two conspiring? Hand me that package. ', '', 34922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold it!', '', 34921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This portal leads to the Stair of Destiny in Hellfire Peninsula... that\'s right, Outland.$B$BAre you prepared...?', '', 34920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 397, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fire!!!', 34919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take aim, sisters...', 34918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your remains shall soon join those of them who have come before you.', 34917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look around you, servant of the Horde...', 34916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Systems failing....', '', 34915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will send these to Thunder Bluff to confirm my findings. I may need your assistance again soon, friend.', '', 34914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Approaching Stonetalon. Prepare for heavy resistance!', '', 34913, 0, 8548, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashenvale belongs to the Kaldorei!', '', 34912, 0, 8548, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
