('Ha hah! That was glorious! I would fight by your side any day, $n.', '', 34896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sneak, sneak, sneak. Let me tell you something about Gorgal: Gorgal doesn\'t sneak.', '', 34895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s flees in terror as Kurak falls.', '', 34894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait \'til Shoe hears about THIS.', '', 34893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please $c, don\'t encourage Gorgal. We\'re supposed to observe and report - not raise up a ruckus.', 34892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Perhaps I WANT to be seen? I tire of skulking.', '', 34891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quit your pacing, mon! You\'re gonna be seen.', 34890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop the Bomb!', 34889, 0, 8548, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shoot it! Destroy it!', 34888, 0, 8548, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Ashenvale!', 34887, 0, 8548, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t let it get to Stonetalon!', 34886, 0, 8548, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Destroy the bomb!', 34885, 0, 8548, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death to the Horde!', 34884, 0, 8548, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simply amazing!$B$BYou\'re reading this which means that DAN IS THE MAN!', '', 34883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory!', '', 34882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, there\'s our target. I can smell him from here.', '', 34881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More.... More!', '', 34879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come get some, you horsefaced maggot farms!', '', 34878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah, yes $n! That\'s what I want to hear. Let\'s make some noise!', '', 34877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some help, my little friend?', '', 34876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commencing transport. Destination, Windshear Crag.', '', 34875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
