('Recalculation underway...', '', 34873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('System malfunction detected... recalculating route...', '', 34872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning... danger detected!', '', 34871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calculating route...', '', 34870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a deep breath, $c. The air atop Thunderhead Summit is thin, but free of the choking dust that strangles the land below.', '', 34869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must do everything in our power to stop the same from happening here. We\'ll have to step up our investigations of the oases and stop this phenomenon at the source. We\'ll talk again at Crossroads!', '', 34868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed, the flora is growing unchecked, devouring the land. Similar to our findings from the oases.', '', 34867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But what\'s this? Something else is happening to the land south of the fissure.', '', 34866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merciful Earthmother, look at the scope of the devastation! We\'re lucky the entirety of the Barrens isn\'t crumbling into the sea.', '', 34865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, friend! From here we can survey the land.', '', 34864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tonga\'s eagle calls out, then circles toward the peak.', '', 34863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See?! That wasn\'t hard, was it? You\'ll have no problem fooling stinky old Oso Bramblepaw and his guardians now.', 34862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to play possum.', 34861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Playing possum is super easy, $n.  Just watch....', 34860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon, one known as $n, soon we will have destroyed our captors!', '', 34859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to make a run for Stonetalon!', 'I\'m ready to make a run for Stonetalon!', 34858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A strange light ignites in Ota Wen\'s eyes as he stands up straight, roaring at the heavens.>$B$BYES, WE WILL RISE UP! RISE UP AND DESTROY OUR JAILORS!', '', 34857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, rise up! Tell your fellow furbolg to break out of this cage and to slay the Horde. The power of the rod compels you!', 'Yes, rise up! Tell your fellow furbolg to break out of this cage and to slay the Horde. The power of the rod compels you!', 34856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ota Wen\'s eyes, already dull from his enslavement, glaze over even more at your suggestion. You feel the power of Dartol\'s Rod begin to course through you and reach out to touch the furbolg.>$B$BRise up?', '', 34855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s not important right now. Ota Wen, listen to me. You must rise up against the orcs!', 'That\'s not important right now. Ota Wen, listen to me. You must rise up against the orcs!', 34854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call yourself, $n? That is a strange name for a furbolg.$B$BYou\'re not from Ashenvale.', '', 34853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey mon, how\'d you find me? I gotta find a better hiding spot.', '', 34852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kologarn focuses his eyes on you!', '', 34851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
