('Mnn, <snort> why you cook this meat? Tortusk tells us meat taste best when stolen and raw.', '', 34728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s warily takes the offered food.', '', 34726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
