('<Offer food.>', '<Offer food.>', 34719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kick him in his big fat face.>', '<Kick him in his big fat face.>', 34718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Punch him in the mouth.>', '<Punch him in the mouth.>', 34717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who sent you!?', 'Who sent you!?', 34716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Children, please behave yourselves! No one will want to adopt you if you keep acting like that!', 34715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We tell orphan matron on you!', '', 34714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re warriors, $n. <Snort> Many and proud.', '', 34713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What now, $r? Do your worst.', '', 34712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The quilboar wrinkles his nose at you and snorts.>', '', 34711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The quilboar fixes his beady black eyes on you.>', '', 34710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Togrik, can you wake up the prisoner again?', 'Togrik, can you wake up the prisoner again?', 34709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The quilboar have always scavenged the fringes of our camps for food and supplies, but direct assaults on our farms and homesteads? Something has sent them on a rampage recently.', 34708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sinks to the ground and falls unconscious.', '', 34707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop!', '', 34706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give toy back!', '', 34705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want, go get, big-tongue baby!', '', 34704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BY THE LIGHT!!', 'BY THE LIGHT!!', 34703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legendary Pelt!', 'Legendary Pelt!', 34702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Epic Pelt!', 'Epic Pelt!', 34701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monster Pelt!', 'Monster Pelt!', 34700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ultra-Pelt!', 'Ultra-Pelt!', 34699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pelting Spree!', 'Pelting Spree!', 34698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mega-Pelt!', 'Mega-Pelt!', 34697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Multi-Pelt!', 'Multi-Pelt!', 34696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Double Pelt!', 'Double Pelt!', 34695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some of our huntresses have already made their way to Ban\'ethil Barrow Den. They will find you when you get inside. Go ahead and speak to Citarre to secure a ride there.', 34694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Pound this chump.>', '<Pound this chump.>', 34693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Snort> Is this how cowards fight, $r?', '', 34692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is ensnared!', '', 34691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s breaks out of the net.', '', 34690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe give up and throw book at animals, but try.', '', 34689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not sure how reading helps. Kekek can\'t read anyway, but if Hemet Nesingwary say, Kekek try.', '', 34688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, lad, you can start by readin\' The Green Hills of Stranglethorn. Then, maybe you can join me on one of my safaris. What do you say?', '', 34687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even Frenzyheart know all about you after you come to Sholazar. Maybe you teach Kekek your tricks?', '', 34686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow. At last, Kekek get to meet Hemet Nesingwary!', '', 34685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old.', 'It\'s good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old.', 34684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat axe you bacon-brained porkchops!', '', 34683, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody steals my livestock!', '', 34682, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right, squeal you maggots. I will gut you lengthwise and roast you when we are through!', '', 34681, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will RIP off your HEADS and EAT your filthy faces!', '', 34680, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right! Die, vermin! The Horde will have your heads for this.', '', 34679, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tear your tusks out. You hear me?', '', 34678, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pigs! Scum! I will cleave your fat heads like apples!', '', 34677, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flat-nosed filth! Get off of my land!', '', 34676, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We brought you a gift, Great One. Maybe you see it when you wake up. Maybe you remember we came to see you, oki?', '', 34675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you\'re asleep, Mr. Great One? We understand. Must be hard working being Great One, collecting all the shinies we leave for you.', '', 34674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, hello, Mr. Great One. We are honored to meet you.', '', 34673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow! A real Great One? We don\'t even think Soo-say has met a real Great One!', '', 34672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t go on... I need to retreat and recover.', 34671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you lead me to the exit?', 'Can you lead me to the exit?', 34670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The exit is to the northwest... the mist will lead the way.', 34669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mist will lead the way.', 34668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work! I\'ll unload the goods. You should check in with Kranal Fiss.', '', 34667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! Now Kekek understand. Not want to be crushed by big dragon-lady. Maybe come back sometime when not so crowded. Nice to meet you, dragon-lady.', '', 34666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest assured, Kekek, she is the queen of the dragons. We often take the forms of smaller beings when we work with them.', '', 34665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But why? Dragons big and powerful. Elf-lady weak. Kekek want to see dragon queen\'s real form.', '', 34664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them all and burn their tower!', 'Kill them all and burn their tower!', 34663, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gol\'Kosh!', 'Gol\'Kosh!', 34662, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', 'Lok\'tar ogar!', 34661, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalimdor for the Horde!', 'Kalimdor for the Horde!', 34660, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashenvale is ours!', 'Ashenvale is ours!', 34659, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the elves!', 'Destroy the elves!', 34658, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Warchief Hellscream!', 'For Warchief Hellscream!', 34657, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 34656, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kekek thought we go see dragon queen. This just some elf-lady with funny horns.', '', 34655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oben Rageclaw resides at the double bridges in the western chamber, near the hallway that leads out of the Barrow Den.', 34654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Raven Claw Talisman is located on the ledge in the upper section of the northern chamber.', 34653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Black Feather Quill is located down the ramp in the lower section of the southern chamber.', 34652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Sapphire of Sky is located at the separate room in the lower section of the northern chamber.', 34651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Rune of Nesting is located across the bridge in the upper section of the southern chamber.', 34650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle has begun!', 'The battle has begun!', 34649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The battle will begin in 15 seconds.', 'The battle will begin in 15 seconds.', 34648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle will begin in 60 seconds.', 'The battle will begin in 60 seconds.', 34647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where I can find Oben Rageclaw?', 'Where I can find Oben Rageclaw?', 34646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Raven Claw Talisman?', 'Where is the Raven Claw Talisman?', 34645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Black Feather Quill?', 'Where is the Black Feather Quill?', 34644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Sapphire of Sky?', 'Where is the Sapphire of Sky?', 34643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Rune of Nesting?', 'Where is the Rune of Nesting?', 34642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need some help finding your way? I know this place like the back of my hand.', 34641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late... the relic is being offered to Azshara above us as we speak!', '', 34640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle will begin in 30 seconds.', 'The battle will begin in 30 seconds.', 34639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not allow an inch to our enemy.  If they strike in Darkshore we will fight them back just as if they had attacked Darnassus itself.', '', 34638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune guide us, $c.', '', 34637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... that Kekek very old. Must be elder, leader of Frenzyheart. This good. Kekek have good future as warrior and leader. Kekek very happy you bring him here. Orphan-lady never do that for Kekek.', '', 34636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I was in my dragon form, there wouldn\'t be any room for anyone else, little one.', 34635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oki... How about now?', '', 34634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um... Your Majesty, would you turn into a dragon for us?', '', 34633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How come she doesn\'t look like the other dragons? Could she turn into a big ol\' dragon if she wanted to?', '', 34632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So that\'s the queen of the dragons? Hmm... we thought she\'d be bigger. Yes, we did.', '', 34631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mount up, $n! Do not fail me.', 34630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I\'m ready. Let\'s do this thing!', 'Yes, I\'m ready. Let\'s do this thing!', 34629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, $n - are you ready to roll? It won\'t be easy!', 34628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 50, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m honor-bound to get these supplies to the Crossroads. Pitch in or step aside.', 34627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 50, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Head \'em up! Move \'em out!', 34626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the Caravan Kodo!', '', 34625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better watch out!', '', 34624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good snowball fight!', '', 34623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got you back!', '', 34622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got you good!', '', 34621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look!', '', 34620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now dance together!', '', 34619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can dance too!', '', 34618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wanna see what I can do?', '', 34617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look!', '', 34616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We made a new friend!', '', 34615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Before you make your way into Fel Rock, be sure to speak to Tallonkai Swiftroot at the top of the tree. He has a task he would ask of you as well.', 34614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('During the Day of the Dead, people gather in graveyards to celebrate with and cherish the spirits of those they have lost.$B$BYou can find the festivities in the cemeteries of any major city, where you\'ll be able to cook, dance, don costumes, and more.', 'During the Day of the Dead, people gather in graveyards to celebrate with and cherish the spirits of those they have lost.$B$BYou can find the festivities in the cemeteries of any major city, where you\'ll be able to cook, dance, don costumes, and more.', 34613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you feel it?$B$BThe spirit world draws close during the Day of the Dead. This is why we decorate the graves of our dearly departed with flowers and candles and offerings: To welcome them back, even if only for a time.$B$BSo come! Dance with me! Let us cherish and honor those we have lost in their ghostly presence, so that they might eat and drink and smile and know that they are loved.', 34612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a temporary object, quest will use autolaunch.', '', 34611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! That must be Kekek as a mighty warrior! See? What Kekek tell you?', '', 34610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, back to work!  Your superiors are watching from the outlook above and they do not take kindly to idleness!', '', 34609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your tongue, worm.  You will not refer to Soggoth the Slitherer as \"that thing\" or you\'ll find yourself eating your own heart for dinner.', '', 34608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we blessed by Great Ones! Shrines give magic, make us high-oracle someday? Maybe?', '', 34607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! Is that us? We think it\'s us. A bit older, maybe?', '', 34606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we digging this thing up anyway, boss?', 'Why are we digging this thing up anyway, boss?', 34605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am to bomb Astranaar! Captain Goggath\'s orders.', 'I am to bomb Astranaar! Captain Goggath\'s orders.', 34604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think maybe one day, Kekek lead Frenzyheart home, like bear-men fight to get tree-city back? Kekek want own home, not city with purple men, not jungle with big-tongues.', '', 34603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take with you the blessing of the wind\'s embrace. May it make your descent from Aldrassil more... direct.', '', 34602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not worry.  Like I said, our men are almost done unearthing the Slithering One.  They will make for a suitable -- and even voluntary -- sacrifice.  Soggoth will rise!', '', 34601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not quite.  We shall need a great many offerings of sacrifice before the Herald of the Old Gods roams the land again.', 34600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our men are almost finished unearthing great Soggoth.  Is the ritual ready?', '', 34599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s over Azshara!  You and your naga will return to the bottom of the seas where you belong!', '', 34598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The artifact shatters as Yoth\'al the Devourer gasps his last breath.', '', 34597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who dares oppose Queen Azshara?  You will soon beg for a swift death!', 34596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Moonwell at the base of the tree for rapid health recovery out of combat.', '', 34595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work! Let Orseus know if we need to take another pass. Otherwise, I\'ll meet you in the grove!', 34594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why would anyone want to dig up something so horrific? I\'m convinced those things are behind what\'s happening to the animals here.', 34593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look below - some of those thistle bears haven\'t been consumed yet. We\'re not too late.', 34592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Moonstalkers displaced by the fires patrol this strand, we need to keep them safe!', 34591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold on, the updraft from the fires can be fierce.', 34590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whitetail deer have been repopulating this whole area.', 34589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Raynewood Retreat!', '', 34588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Head outside and destroy the Horde!', '', 34587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to invoke the shade of Shadumbra.', 'I am ready to invoke the shade of Shadumbra.', 34586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orseus, Kathrena sent me to borrow one of your Hippogryphs.', 'Orseus, Kathrena sent me to borrow one of your Hippogryphs.', 34585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been assisting the flight masters to round up the Hippogryphs that fled their post when the land tore itself apart. Even now our birds remain squeamish.', '', 34584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 34583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde is here, $n! Quickly, we must invoke the shade of Shadumbra!', 34582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We thank you, Aroom.  And we thank $n.  We return to Elune... finally.', '', 34581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From the air, you should be able to cast your protective ward on whole groups of animals at once.', 34580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold on tight! I\'ll take care of the flying, you focus on the wildlife below.', 34579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We here! Only, if this is world tree, how come it broke when they tried to put whole world in?', '', 34576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Recover the Laughing Sister\'s corpse.', 'Recover the Laughing Sister\'s corpse.', 34572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hop on!', 34571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must do more than hold the tree, $r. The Horde will never give up.$B$BWe must destroy them!', 34570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may choose to care for an Oracle orphan or a Wolvar orphan, but you will not be able to help both.', 34569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The orphans we have taken in come from war torn Sholazar Basin. You can choose to care for either an orphaned Oracle hatchling or a Frenzyheart pup. Either will be happy to make a new friend, but you will only be able to care for one of them.', 34568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask about the orphans.', 'Ask about the orphans.', 34567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kekek took big-tongue hatchling\'s favorite toy. Maybe it help you get to sleep at night.', '', 34566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caught three chickens for lunch. Bet you couldn\'t catch any.', '', 34565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know what? If Kekek closes his eyes, you can\'t see him.', '', 34564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orcs always point and laugh at Kekek, but he get revenge one day.', '', 34563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kekek take you hunting. You be good bait.', '', 34562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should stay away from walrus-men. They could pup-nap you.', '', 34561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you alone because puppy-men killed your parents too?', '', 34560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we be a $r when we grow up. Think so?', '', 34559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soo-$n, maybe you give us whistle for when we need to call you. Oki?', '', 34558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you think puppy-man hatchlings keep asking if we pity Lafoo? Lafoo talks a lot, but he\'s our friend.', '', 34557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do Great Ones ever run out of bag space for shinies?', '', 34556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can has aged yolk?', '', 34555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Lich King\'s cruel reign has inflicted great suffering on all of Northrend\'s inhabitants, particularly the children. If you are a friend to the Oracles or Frenzyheart Tribe of Sholazar, perhaps you might consider caring for an orphan for a week.', 34554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual of soothing has completed.', '', 34553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A %s emerges from the shell!', '', 34552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual of soothing has begun.  Defend the totem at all costs!', '', 34551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The body of the fallen dryad lies here where she lost her life to the Horde.', 34550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
