('%s is transformed!', '', 34547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This dig here is compromised - the Explorers\' League wants us to grab whatever\'s left of value and clear out. Easily said, not so easily done.', '', 34546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miraculously, the satyr does not die. Instead he is bathed in a warm light.', '', 34545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
