('Let\'s see what this artifact tells us...', '', 34537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did the ancients build their cities next to all these $ns?', '', 34536, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dug up this $n, anyways?', '', 34535, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did this $n come from? Honestly now.', '', 34534, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you make of this, Ferd?', '', 34532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense. See? Here\'s my journal, right here. ', '', 34531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('You big duffer, these ARE the same ruins. You\'re wandering in circles again.', '', 34530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('These ruins I\'ve found are IDENTICAL to the ones I just left! It\'s the find of a lifetime!', '', 34529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the three hammers, will you look at that! More ruins!', '', 34528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, we\'re almost there, whos-yer-face! The camp where I left my notes is just around the corner!', '', 34527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ruins you see here are identical to ones I dug up a few months ago, but they\'re flooded! Curious, eh?', '', 34526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready? Let\'s move!', '', 34525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('Superb! Gather your strength, whats-your-face. We\'ve got a long way to travel.', '', 34524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abandon the dig? Ridiculous! In my long industrious career, I\'ve never abandoned a site. Not intentionally. Misplaced a few, maybe. Who are you again? What are we doing here?', '', 34523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 200, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s quickly finishes the food and glances around for more.', '', 34522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s\'s strong jaws tear into the food.', '', 34521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s catches the food in its mouth and swallows it in one gulp.', '', 34520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s devours the food.', '', 34519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my venomhide hatchling. Have you seen him?', 'I lost my venomhide hatchling. Have you seen him?', 34518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The hatchling looks at you as if trying to determine whether or not you\'re its mother.>', '', 34517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hungrily devours the egg.', '', 34516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish I could tell you more, but until recently nobody believed such creatures existed. Long before the Titans shaped Azeroth into the world we see today, before the natural cycle of life and death as we know it, the Old Ones ruled over the elements and corrupted creation to serve their own malignant ends.$B$BFrom what Onu here tells me, the Titans ultimately defeated the Old Ones. Or, at least, they imprisoned them under the earth. Can something like that ever really die? I wish I knew more, but this is all pre-prehistory for me, and I\'ve been around a while.$B$BI know that there are some that worship the Old Ones, if you can believe that. That\'s like praying for the end of the world. These Old Gods make people crazy!\n', 34515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 6, 0, 800, 800, 39653),
('Who are the Old Ones?', 'Who are the Old Ones?', 34514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your help, $n! These woods may never be safe from the evils that once dwelled here, but I feel better knowing that heroes like you are helping me keep watch.\n', 34513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I appreciate your help defending the wildlife here. Hopefully we\'re not too late.\n', 34512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
