('I am ready to be one with the whirling vortex and defeat Lord Magmathar.', 'I am ready to be one with the whirling vortex and defeat Lord Magmathar.', 34495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our brother has lost his way. He scorches the ground, he vaporizes the water, and devours too much air.$B$BHelp us to bring him back into balance and harmony.', '', 34494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arctanus, I am ready to lead one of your freezing surgers into battle.', 'Arctanus, I am ready to lead one of your freezing surgers into battle.', 34493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see if we can freeze the enemy where they stand, little $r.', '', 34492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The age of the night elves is coming to a close.', 34491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You live on borrowed time. The sea will consume you.', 34490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Queen Azshara will return and your land will be forfeit.', 34489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will suffer no interruptions!', 34488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hum, hrm. A powerful reagent for one so young. You will kill many foes in the name of your Alliance, but it is important to remember that in the great cycle, birth is as powerful as death.$B$B<Onu slowly reaches up to his head and withdraws an inconspicuous acorn. He lowers his arm to you with unhurried calm.>$B$BThis is extremely potent.$B$B...I apologize, I did not wish that to sound like a boast.', '', 34487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient Onu, where may I find a Seed of the Earth?', 'Ancient Onu, where may I find a Seed of the Earth?', 34486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be still, little one, and you can hear this ancient land speak. It cries out in pain.', '', 34485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a creature half-buried in the silt, a hideous collection of limbs and tentacles with no discernable face. You can\'t bring yourself to touch the eerily translucent flesh.$B$BAlthough the beast is dead, the water around the shapeless body appears clean, and the corpse itself curiously shows no sign of decay.', '', 34484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t just stand around, $r...$b$bThere\'s work to be done!', '', 34483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And don\'t worry about the trolls underfoot while you\'re up there. They\'ll be trampled into the ground by the ancients\' strides.', '', 34482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello there! Don\'t you dare step behind those pillars. Let me welcome you properly.', 34481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome! Don\'t be shy... move away from those pillars so that I can see you fully.', 34480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prey! Move away from those pillars so that I can show you the err in your trespass. ', 34479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Company! Stay in sight, love, so that I can welcome you properly.', 34478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Stay right there while I cast this spell! It won\'t hurt much.', '', 34477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t move, little adventurer. I have the death you seek.', '', 34476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you can best Lorenth Thundercall? Stand still, silly gnat, so that I can swat you.', '', 34475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A challenge?! Stand still so that I can blast your corpse all over the ground.', '', 34474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While the elements are doing their best to tear Darkshore asunder, I\'ve been struggling to protect the remaining wildlife.$B$BCan I count on your help, $c?\n', 34473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you do? I\'m Gary, and I assume Gorbold sent you.\n\nIf you\'re here to help, the plan\'s pretty simple. I\'ve rigged up some decoy bots. We prance the little fellows in near the murlocs and activate their countdown. They\'ll pulse light and sound to attract the murlocs, and after several seconds, they\'ll explode, taking the murlocs with them.\n\nIf we get enough of these in there, we should be able to make our way to the ships\' holds again. With less casualties this time hopefully. That part\'s not for you though, just get to blowing those little fish men up!', '', 34472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scorch is extinguished by the water!', '', 34471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Standing in the way of nature is heresy.  Even when nature\'s force is a destructive one.$B$BThe forces that would destroy Darkshore are not natural, however.  I will not let this land be torn asunder.', '', 34470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are many dangers facing us, but we cannot find ourselves neglecting nature, lest it neglect us in our time of need. We\'ve learned this lesson before.', '', 34469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s begins to self destruct!', '', 34468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
