('The Argent Tournament has begun in the northern reaches of Icecrown, $c. If you\'ve yet to find your way there, I can pay your way.$B$BThe more we have participating in the melee, the stronger we\'ll be when we strike against the Lich King.', '', 34426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strange, I don\'t remember any mention of those orbital emplacements last time. I wonder what dolt activated them.', 34425, 0, 8426, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Access to the interior of the complex is currently restricted. Primary and secondary defensive emplacements are active.', '', 34424, 0, 8426, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to represent the Argent Crusade in this tournament.', '', 34423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Security override permitted. Secondary defensive systems activated.$B$BBackup deactivation for secondary systems can be accessed via individual generators located on the concourse.', '', 34422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Confirmed.', 'Confirmed.', 34421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate secondary defensive systems.', 'Activate secondary defensive systems.', 34420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activating secondary defensive systems will result in the extermination of unauthorized life forms via orbital emplacements.$B$BYou are an unauthorized life form. Please confirm.', '', 34419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you wish, $n.', 34418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, $n.', '', 34417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lady.$b$bI was unable to protect her. How can I return to Silvermoon...', '', 34416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A kaldorei assassin leaps from the shadows and attacks $n!', 'A kaldorei assassin leaps from the shadows and attacks $n!', 34415, 0, 8416, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you see a shadowy figure out of the corner of your eye.', 'You think you see a shadowy figure out of the corner of your eye.', 34414, 0, 8416, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear a shuffling noise nearby, but see nothing.', 'You hear a shuffling noise nearby, but see nothing.', 34413, 0, 8416, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a feeling someone is watching you....', 'You have a feeling someone is watching you....', 34412, 0, 8416, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Westspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!', '', 34411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Westspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Alliance!', '', 34410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eastspark siege workshop has been attacked by the Horde!', '', 34409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
