('The Westspark siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!', '', 34405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eastspark siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!', '', 34404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Shatterspear Vale.', '', 34403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A kaldorei assassin evades $n\'s gaze and slips into the shadows.', 'A kaldorei assassin evades $n\'s gaze and slips into the shadows.', 34402, 0, 8416, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ancient Gate of the Keepers unlocks!', '', 34401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here for the confessor\'s sermon? Good luck findin\' a place to sit...', '', 34400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s prepares to unleash a staggering shout!', '', 34399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When this is over, you may want to brush up on your secrecy skills....', '', 34398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You didn\'t need to use the whole sack at once, did you?', '', 34397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may wish to put some more signal powder on the brazier next time. I\'m not sure they could see that from Orgrimmar....', '', 34396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge.', 'You\'ve already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge.', 34395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get to it, $r.$b$bThere\'s little time and much to do.', '', 34394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to our little chapel of the Light. Please, take a seat. Enjoy a respite from the world\'s ills.', 'Welcome to our little chapel of the Light. Please, take a seat. Enjoy a respite from the world\'s ills.', 34392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Detonation imminent.', '', 34391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murloc pests, I have come to steal your treasure! Attempt to stop me! Quickly!', '', 34390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Orgrimmar riders pride themselves on fearless and devastating charges. Such is their skill and ferocity that even when charged themselves they simply charge right back.$B$BTry staying close and Thrusting, and when they attempt to gain range, throw them off-balance with a Shield-Breaker before you Charge. Otherwise, they\'ll meet you head-on every time.', 'The Orgrimmar riders pride themselves on fearless and devastating charges. Such is their skill and ferocity that even when charged themselves they simply charge right back.$B$BTry staying close and Thrusting, and when they attempt to gain range, throw them off-balance with a Shield-Breaker before you Charge. Otherwise, they\'ll meet you head-on every time.', 34389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Undercity riders are a tenacious lot, relying heavily on their defenses and steadfastly trading blows with their opponents, strike for strike.$B$BTrying wearing them down with Charges while maintaining your own Defense... meet them with a defensive advantage so that they will suffer the most with each exchange.', 'The Undercity riders are a tenacious lot, relying heavily on their defenses and steadfastly trading blows with their opponents, strike for strike.$B$BTrying wearing them down with Charges while maintaining your own Defense... meet them with a defensive advantage so that they will suffer the most with each exchange.', 34388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Silvermoon riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.$B$BHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.$B$BClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts.', 'The Silvermoon riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.$B$BHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.$B$BClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts.', 34387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
