('The Thunder Bluff riders are massive and powerful combatants, terrifying at close range.$B$BTry to stay out of their defense-crushing Thrust range, breaking down their defenses with Shield-Breakers before risking a Charge.', 'The Thunder Bluff riders are massive and powerful combatants, terrifying at close range.$B$BTry to stay out of their defense-crushing Thrust range, breaking down their defenses with Shield-Breakers before risking a Charge.', 34386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
