('The Gnomeregan riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.$B$BHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.$B$BClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts.', 'The Gnomeregan riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.$B$BHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.$B$BClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts.', 34380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
