('The Argent Crusade riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.$B$BHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.$B$BClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts.', 'The Argent Crusade riders believe in balance and precision, deftly mixing attack and defense.$B$BHowever, they will often open themselves to Charges by trying to gain range on you.$B$BClose that range with a Charge before they can do the same, and then Shield-Break them as you wheel around for more Thrusts.', 34378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do the Argent Crusade riders fight?', 'How do the Argent Crusade riders fight?', 34377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
