('Tread lightly through these woods, $c. It is as though the trees themselves have eyes and whisper to our foes.', '', 34372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 100, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Astranaar!', '', 34371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the Molten Colossus weakens, a single ominous word rumbles through the air like rolling thunder: \"BURN\"', '', 34370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golganneth, lend me your strength! Grant my mortal allies the power of thunder!', '', 34369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Combat matrix enhanced. Behold wonderous rapidity!', '', 34368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
