('It may seem pointless, but try to find pride in a good fight. The time will come when all this practicing and competition will be put to good use.', 'It may seem pointless, but try to find pride in a good fight. The time will come when all this practicing and competition will be put to good use.', 34292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I\'m beginning to get HELMET HAIR. This is a travesty!', 'And I\'m beginning to get HELMET HAIR. This is a travesty!', 34291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of this posturing, all of this dancing about in rings... it seems pointless. What\'s the use?', 'All of this posturing, all of this dancing about in rings... it seems pointless. What\'s the use?', 34290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This fighting is endless. I\'m not certain how much more of it I can stand.', 'This fighting is endless. I\'m not certain how much more of it I can stand.', 34289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with the Light, orc.', 'Go with the Light, orc.', 34288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Besides... while an axe can be a valuable tool in war, lances have their uses as well.', 'Besides... while an axe can be a valuable tool in war, lances have their uses as well.', 34287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But this is a different sort of honorable combat. Difficult to adapt to, perhaps, but with your prowess I\'m sure you\'ll show everyone the strength in your people.', 'But this is a different sort of honorable combat. Difficult to adapt to, perhaps, but with your prowess I\'m sure you\'ll show everyone the strength in your people.', 34286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand your frustration. Your people are ferocious in battle, and this isn\'t what you\'re used to.', 'I understand your frustration. Your people are ferocious in battle, and this isn\'t what you\'re used to.', 34285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
