('This is not how orcs fight! My duty to the Warchief wars with my personal honor. I hold no faith in your Light, but as you seem an advisor, I would hear your words.', 'This is not how orcs fight! My duty to the Warchief wars with my personal honor. I hold no faith in your Light, but as you seem an advisor, I would hear your words.', 34272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But instead of fighting as my people would, as my people should, I find myself with a long, unwieldy pole, attempting to coax my wolf into charging my opponent without attacking.', 'But instead of fighting as my people would, as my people should, I find myself with a long, unwieldy pole, attempting to coax my wolf into charging my opponent without attacking.', 34271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are my enemies. YOU would be my enemy in battle! Your king has declared war on my kind!', 'These are my enemies. YOU would be my enemy in battle! Your king has declared war on my kind!', 34270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t honorable combat. I long to face my opponents in battle with my axe in hand!', 'This isn\'t honorable combat. I long to face my opponents in battle with my axe in hand!', 34269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Self-destruct sequence initiated.', 34268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know this does not seem like the obvious path to you, but it will bring you closer to the Light. Fight well, brother.', 'I know this does not seem like the obvious path to you, but it will bring you closer to the Light. Fight well, brother.', 34267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will bring the might of all races to the Lich King, and he will be defeated.', 'We will bring the might of all races to the Lich King, and he will be defeated.', 34266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This tournament is helping to form a strong, concerted force, though it may not appear obvious. When we\'re ready, the eyes of the Crusade and all its champions will turn toward Icecrown.', 'This tournament is helping to form a strong, concerted force, though it may not appear obvious. When we\'re ready, the eyes of the Crusade and all its champions will turn toward Icecrown.', 34265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your heart is in the right place, and I know you seek to serve the Light. But these small strikes do little to the great undead host.', 'Your heart is in the right place, and I know you seek to serve the Light. But these small strikes do little to the great undead host.', 34264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I justify jousting while people die without my protection?', 'How can I justify jousting while people die without my protection?', 34263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beyond these reaches, the Scourge continue their work, destroying more and more of what we\'ve built. The fight should be there. I should be there.', 'Beyond these reaches, the Scourge continue their work, destroying more and more of what we\'ve built. The fight should be there. I should be there.', 34262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been ordered here, and here I stay and fight under the banner of Stormwind. But everything I do here is empty.', 'I have been ordered here, and here I stay and fight under the banner of Stormwind. But everything I do here is empty.', 34261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My heart hangs heavier with each passing day, Confessor.', 'My heart hangs heavier with each passing day, Confessor.', 34260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink in moderation, then, my dwarven friend, but you may want to turn in your lance and reins for the time being. Go with the Light.', 'Drink in moderation, then, my dwarven friend, but you may want to turn in your lance and reins for the time being. Go with the Light.', 34259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...I NEED A DRINK!', '...I NEED A DRINK!', 34258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was a powerful feelin\' while I was listenin\' to yer sermon, and it\'s drivin\' me nuts!', 'It was a powerful feelin\' while I was listenin\' to yer sermon, and it\'s drivin\' me nuts!', 34257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been feelin\'... urges.', 'I\'ve been feelin\'... urges.', 34256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lass, I\'ve a confession to make to ya.', 'Lass, I\'ve a confession to make to ya.', 34255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, my. Do you feel remorseful, at least?', 'Oh, my. Do you feel remorseful, at least?', 34254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nah, not really. I just wanted to see the look on your face.', 'Nah, not really. I just wanted to see the look on your face.', 34253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I punched a penguin on my way in here.', 'I punched a penguin on my way in here.', 34252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you lack in size you make up for in ambition and dedication, little one. Go with the Light.', 'What you lack in size you make up for in ambition and dedication, little one. Go with the Light.', 34251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take heart. Size isn\'t what matters, but how you use the skills you have.', 'Take heart. Size isn\'t what matters, but how you use the skills you have.', 34250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and some of those mounts can trample me!', '...and some of those mounts can trample me!', 34249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t accurately assess the mathematics behind the charge of my turbostrider while keeping hold of my lance at the precise angle needed and keeping my shield in the exact location for maximum protection at any given second!', 'I can\'t accurately assess the mathematics behind the charge of my turbostrider while keeping hold of my lance at the precise angle needed and keeping my shield in the exact location for maximum protection at any given second!', 34248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve calculated the probability of my success, and it\'s distressingly low!', 'I\'ve calculated the probability of my success, and it\'s distressingly low!', 34247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know if I can compete! Everyone is so much bigger!', 'I don\'t know if I can compete! Everyone is so much bigger!', 34246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training in Fishing.', 'I seek training in Fishing.', 34245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, why would you go and do something like that? Didn\'t you see the sign that said, \"DO NOT PUSH THIS BUTTON!\"? How will we finish testing with the self-destruct mechanism active?', '', 34244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s good to see you here, $n.', 34243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the tournament, $n.', '', 34242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not hold back! Destroy them!', '', 34241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 34240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you at least put up a fight?', '', 34239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am on a task from Kadrak. I must get to Zoram\'gar right away!', 'I am on a task from Kadrak. I must get to Zoram\'gar right away!', 34238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must remain within the field of battle.', 'You must remain within the field of battle.', 34237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great job with that metal monstrosity. There appears to be only a few more obstacles in our way.$B$BOnce you clear out that clanking robot at the end of the hall, we\'ll be inside Ulduar.$B$BWe also noticed an enormous, fire-breathing protodrake and a molten giant. They aren\'t in our way, though, if you\'d like to just avoid them. ', '', 34236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine. If our allies are going to be the ones getting their hands dirty, we\'ll leave it to them to decide how to proceed.', '', 34235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re hunting an old god, Brann. ', 34234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sneak?! What do you think we are, marmots?', '', 34233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can sneak past them. As long as we can take down that construct in front of the gate, we should be able to get inside.', 34232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What about the plated proto-drake and the fire giant that were spotted nearby? Think your mages can handle those?', '', 34231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kirin Tor can\'t possibly spare any additional resources to take on anything that size. We may not have to though.', 34230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi. So we\'ll have to contend with that thing after all then?', '', 34229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None at all. I suspect it has something to do with that giant mechanical construct that our scouts spotted in front of the gate.', 34228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our friends fought well, Brann, but we\'re not done yet.', 34227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps so, but it\'s only a matter of time until we break back into Ulduar. Any luck finding a way to teleport inside?', '', 34226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a battle! Did you see that, Rhydian?!', '', 34225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re expecting the Shatterspear Leader to show here at any moment. Be patient if you wish to join the attack.', 34224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me know when you are ready to begin the attack.', 34223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready. Begin the attack.', 'I am ready. Begin the attack.', 34222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was folly for them to think us weak amidst recent events. There is no more hope for these trolls  - we will end this today.', 34221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do not act alone in this. Whatever happens to us this day, the night elves will still fall!', '', 34220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve shattered the shield protecting their leader! Quickly, kill him!', 34219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us put an end to this Shatterspear threat for good. Sentinels, attack now!', 34218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast Plasma Blast!', '', 34217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be behind the confessional screen if anyone wishes to speak with me. Any doubts, any worries, any uncertainties I will happily soothe.', 'I\'ll be behind the confessional screen if anyone wishes to speak with me. Any doubts, any worries, any uncertainties I will happily soothe.', 34216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shhhh - Please don\'t give away my position when I\'m out in the field. Mathas needs to know what\'s happening out here.', 34215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I - I don\'t know. There\'s movement in the ruins.', 34214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The catapults remain disabled. I\'ve burned several and trapped the others.', 34213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think on my words, friends. In the darkness that surrounds us all, the Light is needed more than ever.', 'Think on my words, friends. In the darkness that surrounds us all, the Light is needed more than ever.', 34212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acting on these tenets, these virtues, help make the world a place we all can appreciate. A world of honor and justice.', 'Acting on these tenets, these virtues, help make the world a place we all can appreciate. A world of honor and justice.', 34211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By feeling and understanding compassion in enemy and ally alike, you reaffirm your connection with the world.', 'By feeling and understanding compassion in enemy and ally alike, you reaffirm your connection with the world.', 34210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...even if the victim bears another banner.', '...even if the victim bears another banner.', 34209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The challenge is in looking beyond appearances and understanding our similarities. Through this understanding, you can feel compassion for the losses others have suffered...', 'The challenge is in looking beyond appearances and understanding our similarities. Through this understanding, you can feel compassion for the losses others have suffered...', 34208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rivalries abound in this day and age. It is easy to see differences wherever you turn.', 'Rivalries abound in this day and age. It is easy to see differences wherever you turn.', 34207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is one further step on the path of Light: compassion.', 'There is one further step on the path of Light: compassion.', 34206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and in acknowledging those connections, you are closer to the Light.', '...and in acknowledging those connections, you are closer to the Light.', 34205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all you\'ve got for me? I want numbers, locations, intentions - we\'re as good as blind. Get back out in the field!', '', 34204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Respect your opponent on the field, whether he be your brother or your sworn enemy. No matter where your beliefs truly lie, such respect is acknowledging a connection...', 'Respect your opponent on the field, whether he be your brother or your sworn enemy. No matter where your beliefs truly lie, such respect is acknowledging a connection...', 34203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of us gathered here have a concept of honorable combat. Conducting yourself with honor and treating your opponent as you wish to be treated shows respect.', 'All of us gathered here have a concept of honorable combat. Conducting yourself with honor and treating your opponent as you wish to be treated shows respect.', 34202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look across the aisle to those you would call enemy. Despite the hatred that separates you, there are qualities to respect in your opponent. Their prowess should be acknowledged.', 'Look across the aisle to those you would call enemy. Despite the hatred that separates you, there are qualities to respect in your opponent. Their prowess should be acknowledged.', 34201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Respect is the first virtue taught to those joining the path of the Light.', 'Respect is the first virtue taught to those joining the path of the Light.', 34200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There can be no doubt as to your tenacity... but there are other virtues to consider.', 'There can be no doubt as to your tenacity... but there are other virtues to consider.', 34199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will do for the moment. And the tower? What of Althalaxx?', '', 34198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet you persevere, as we all must. In these times, no one is a stranger to the virtue of tenacity. In the face of despair and hatred, we continue to stand true to our beliefs and fight on.', 'Yet you persevere, as we all must. In these times, no one is a stranger to the virtue of tenacity. In the face of despair and hatred, we continue to stand true to our beliefs and fight on.', 34197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many of you have experienced a betrayal of trust.', 'Many of you have experienced a betrayal of trust.', 34196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me, Keynira?', '', 34195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are dark and difficult times for us all. The armies of the Scourge amass to the south. Companions fall on the battlefield and rise to serve our enemy moments later.', 'These are dark and difficult times for us all. The armies of the Scourge amass to the south. Companions fall on the battlefield and rise to serve our enemy moments later.', 34194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today I would like to touch on the three virtues of the Light.', 'Today I would like to touch on the three virtues of the Light.', 34193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you all for attending this sermon. It\'s wonderful to see so many familiar faces!', 'Thank you all for attending this sermon. It\'s wonderful to see so many familiar faces!', 34192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rip it to pieces!', 'Rip it to pieces!', 34191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve moved the replacement vehicles up already so that you can take the thing down this time. Good luck!', 'We\'ve moved the replacement vehicles up already so that you can take the thing down this time. Good luck!', 34190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darned thing just started working! This should take you right up to the end of the concourse, where you last fought the Flame Leviathan.', 'The darned thing just started working! This should take you right up to the end of the concourse, where you last fought the Flame Leviathan.', 34189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your petty quarrels only make me stronger.', '', 34188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, I know... I haven\'t given up yet. Don\'t get your hopes up though, this technology is way beyond me.', 'I know, I know... I haven\'t given up yet. Don\'t get your hopes up though, this technology is way beyond me.', 34187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep at it. If our suspicions are right and this is a transporter, it could prove extremely useful in our assault.', 'Keep at it. If our suspicions are right and this is a transporter, it could prove extremely useful in our assault.', 34186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not fail you, master!', '', 34185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any luck?', 'Any luck?', 34184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a bit. For the life of me, I can\'t figure out how this thing works.', 'Not a bit. For the life of me, I can\'t figure out how this thing works.', 34183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The siege is broken... for now. Follow me to Splintertree.', '', 34182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s quietly slips into the underbrush.', 34181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww, I told you take care of her. I poured my heart and soul into that thing, you know? Take it easy this time around.', 'Aww, I told you take care of her. I poured my heart and soul into that thing, you know? Take it easy this time around.', 34180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got your back... and a hefty supply of vehicles to fix up too apparently.', 'We\'ve got your back... and a hefty supply of vehicles to fix up too apparently.', 34179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, that\'s one big tank! You\'ve got more guts than I do. Good luck to ya!', 'Wow, that\'s one big tank! You\'ve got more guts than I do. Good luck to ya!', 34178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry one bit, we had replacements ready. Can\'t expect to always get it first go, you know.', 'Don\'t worry one bit, we had replacements ready. Can\'t expect to always get it first go, you know.', 34177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That last time was just practice, right? You\'ve got this!', 'That last time was just practice, right? You\'ve got this!', 34176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Replacement siege vehicles brought right to your doorstep in no time flat. Can\'t ask for better service than that!', 'Replacement siege vehicles brought right to your doorstep in no time flat. Can\'t ask for better service than that!', 34175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll get\'m this time. Show no mercy!', 'You\'ll get\'m this time. Show no mercy!', 34174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Getting these replacements up here was no easy feat. Make it worth our while, will ya?', 'Getting these replacements up here was no easy feat. Make it worth our while, will ya?', 34173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone... back to Splintertree at once!', '', 34172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brutusk... NOOOOOO!!', '', 34171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s prepares to unleash Empowering Shadows!', '', 34170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off that horse and fight me man-to-man!', '', 34169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave no stone unturned. I mean that literally, you heaps of decay! Tear this place apart if you have to.', '', 34168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 500, 0, 0, 39653),
('I said, SEARCH the bodies BEFORE you eat them!', '', 34167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 500, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to see every scrap of paper you wretches get your claws on.', '', 34166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 500, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drive them back! Back to Darnassus!', '', 34165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and Thunder!', 'Blood and Thunder!', 34164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh is forfeit!', '', 34163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to activate the Feral Defender!', 34162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it, lads! We got here before Algalon\'s arrival. Maybe we can rig the systems to interfere with his analysis--', '', 34161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make \'em pay, Brutusk!', '', 34160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t forget to check near the bridges southeast of town for a ride up to our forward post.', 34159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be sure to stop by the bridges southeast of town. You should be able to secure a nightsaber to get you down to the ruins.', 34158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay! Let\'s move out. Get into your machines; I\'ll speak to you from here via the radio!', '', 34157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly! Evasive action! Evasive act--', '', 34156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that? Be careful! Something\'s headed your way!', '', 34155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done it! You\'ve broken the defenses of Ulduar. In a few moments, we will be dropping in to...', '', 34154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears you are near a repair station! Drive your vehicle onto the platform, and it should be automatically repaired.', '', 34153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The control unit for the missile generator is on the top floor of the tower. If you can find a way to get up there, you can shut it down yourselves.', '', 34152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the tower of Krolmir. It is said that the power of Thorim has been used only once... and that it turned an entire continent to dust. ', '', 34151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This generator powers Mimiron\'s Gaze. In moments, it can turn earth to ash, stone to magma--we cannot let it reach full power!', '', 34150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re approaching the tower of Freya. It contains the power to turn barren wastelands into jungles teeming with life overnight. ', '', 34149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This tower powers the Hammer of Hodir. It is said to have the power to turn entire armies to ice! ', '', 34148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are four generators powering the defense structures. If you sabotage the generators, the missile attacks will stop!', '', 34147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out! Our air scouts report that the generators for the missile silos are coming online!', '', 34146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The iron dwarves have been seen emerging from the bunkers at the base of the pillars straight ahead of you! Destroy the bunkers, and they\'ll be forced to fall back!', '', 34145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only a flesh wound!', '', 34144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a scratch!', '', 34143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am invincible!', '', 34142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, they come....', '', 34141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OBLIVION!', '', 34140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas, only the esteemed champions of Silvermoon City may purchase what I have to offer.', '', 34139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will squeeze the life from you!', '', 34138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU FAIL!', '', 34137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Samamba tinkin\' joo be at da wrong quartermaster!$B$BWhat she got only for de Sen\'jin champions...', 34136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('KOL-THARISH!', '', 34135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas, only champions of Darnassus may purchase what I have to offer.', '', 34134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None shall pass!', '', 34133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Matron, flee! They are ruthless....', '', 34132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there!$B$BSorry, friend, but only champions of Gnomeregan can buy what I\'ve got.', 34131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('Such a waste....', '', 34130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place will serve as your graveyard.', '', 34129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only champions of the Exodar may purchase what I have to offer.', 34128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only champions of Orgrimmar may purchase what I have to offer.', 34127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freya! They come for you.', '', 34126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BEGONE!', '', 34125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return you whence you came!', '', 34124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals have no place here!', '', 34123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Away with you, $c!$B$BOnly champions of Undercity may purchase what I have to offer.', 34122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Matron, one has fallen!', '', 34121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apologies, $r, but only champions of Thunder Bluff may purchase what I have to offer.', '', 34120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your corpse will nourish the soil.', '', 34119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fertilizer.', '', 34118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open the gates brothers! Let us welcome our visitors in true Horde fashion!', '', 34117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
