('Splintertree...', '', 34112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not far now....', '', 34111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to travel to Lor\'danel.', 'I\'d like to travel to Lor\'danel.', 34110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to travel to the Bashal\'Aran.', 'I\'d like to travel to the Bashal\'Aran.', 34109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to travel to Shatterspear Vale.', 'I\'d like to travel to Shatterspear Vale.', 34108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From your death springs life anew!', 34107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgive me.', 34106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to travel to the Ruins of Mathystra.', 'I\'d like to travel to the Ruins of Mathystra.', 34105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only champions of Stormwind may purchase what I have to offer.', '', 34104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My advice is no good to ye unless ye\'re ridin\' a tournament mount.$B$BEquip a lance and grab a tournament mount outside yer faction\'s pavilion.', '', 34103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad to see that you\'re well.', 34102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A bit cold out, don\'t you think?', 34101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How are you, $c?', 34100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looking for a ride?', 34099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you.', 34098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is there anything that I can help with?', 34097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would you like a ride?', 34096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 34095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar Ogar!!', '', 34094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now there\'s some REAL blood and thunder!!', '', 34093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about the Charge.', 'Tell me more about the Charge.', 34092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about using the Shield-Breaker.', 'Tell me more about using the Shield-Breaker.', 34091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about Defend and Thrust.', 'Tell me more about Defend and Thrust.', 34090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be riding a tournament mount before I can instruct you.$B$BEquip a lance and find a tournament mount outside your faction\'s pavilion.', '', 34089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. The spirit is bound with you and you will carry it with you anytime you are in Darkshore. May you serve nature well.', '', 34088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach them the meaning of blood and thunder!', '', 34087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would appear that I\'ve made a slight miscalculation. I allowed my mind to be corrupted by the fiend in the prison, overriding my primary directive. All systems seem to be functional now. Clear.', '', 34086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s crackles and surges with raw energy!', '', 34085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just in time. Let\'s see this thing off, then.', '', 34084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turtle', 'Turtle', 34083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorilla', 'Gorilla', 34082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crocolisk', 'Crocolisk', 34081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crab', 'Crab', 34080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bear', 'Bear', 34079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, champion. Yogg-Saron\'s defeat echoes through these halls.', 34078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wasp', 'Wasp', 34077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tallstrider', 'Tallstrider', 34076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moth', 'Moth', 34075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hyena', 'Hyena', 34074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, champion. Yogg-Saron\'s defeat echoes through these halls.', '', 34073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aid your companions little one; the battle is joined!', 34072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid your companions little one; the battle is joined!', '', 34071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tenacious Pet', 'Tenacious Pet', 34070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ferocious Pet', 'Ferocious Pet', 34069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cunning Pet', 'Cunning Pet', 34068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sporebat', 'Sporebat', 34067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Powerful acidic content theoretically found inside the being known as Yogg-Saron would account for the liquification of saronite. Submersion in this substance might be sufficient to rebind an alloy of titan origin.', '', 34066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Probability of successful repair by ordinary means available in this world is close to nil. Please hold while theoretical means are analyzed.', '', 34065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'anyr was shattered during the first war between the earthen and the iron dwarves. The weapon\'s remnants were believed lost in the conflict.', '', 34064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Created by the titans themselves, Val\'anyr was given to the first earthen king, Urel Stoneheart. With the hammer he was to create and give life to the rest of his brethren.', '', 34063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Object identified: Val\'anyr, hammer of ancient kings.', '', 34062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fragment analysis underway.', '', 34061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please hold still for a moment.', '', 34060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Preservation of cache is essential to recovering Hodir\'s sigil.', '', 34059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tactical analysis suggests approaching the arena from the front and splitting secondary force through a side passage at the ground level. This will maximize odds of reaching Thorim\'s outlook before mental domination by external presence is complete.', '', 34058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a berserker rage!', '', 34057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold now: terror absolute!', '', 34056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The black blood of Yogg-Saron courses through me! I. AM. UNSTOPPABLE!', '', 34055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, what horrors await....', '', 34054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your destruction will herald a new age of suffering!', '', 34053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your defeat was inevitable.', '', 34052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defiance... a flaw of mortality.', '', 34051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You thought to stand before the legions of death and survive?', '', 34050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To Splintertree!', '', 34049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cries out, \"I will have my vengeance!\"', '', 34048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now... witness the power of a war kodo in the hands of a master!', '', 34047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brutusk is out watering the bushes right now.$b$bStay close though, $n. He should be ready for our ride to Splintertree very soon.', '', 34046, 0, 8174, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will check back with you shortly, Kadrak.', 'I will check back with you shortly, Kadrak.', 34045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathe in the smoke to entice visions of the great animal spirits.', 'Breathe in the smoke to entice visions of the great animal spirits.', 34044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Tempest Minion appears to defend Emalon!', '', 34043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watcher Analysis: Mimiron', 'Watcher Analysis: Mimiron', 34042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watcher Analysis: Thorim', 'Watcher Analysis: Thorim', 34041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to accompany you to Splintertree, Kadrak!', 'I am ready to accompany you to Splintertree, Kadrak!', 34040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watcher Analysis: Hodir', 'Watcher Analysis: Hodir', 34039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watcher Analysis: Freya', 'Watcher Analysis: Freya', 34038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Portals open into %s\'s mind!', '', 34037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strong odor coming from the bowl smells like a mixture of various herbs with burning hair.', '', 34036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Shield-Breaker on a Ranged Target.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t$BThen use Shield-Breaker while the target is defenseless.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t', 'Use Shield-Breaker on a Ranged Target.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t$BThen use Shield-Breaker while the target is defenseless.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t', 34035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Shield-Breaker on a Charge Target.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t$BFollow up with Charge while the target is vulnerable.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_Charger.blp:32|t', 'Use Shield-Breaker on a Charge Target.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t$BFollow up with Charge while the target is vulnerable.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_Charger.blp:32|t', 34034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze upon its magnificence! Bask in its glorious, um, glory! I present you with... V-07-TR-0N!', '', 34033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put up Defend$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldMastery.blp:32|t$BThen use Thrust on a Melee Target.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_65.blp:32|t', 'Put up Defend$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldMastery.blp:32|t$BThen use Thrust on a Melee Target.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_65.blp:32|t', 34032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now try out your skills.', '', 34031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll head back to the Archivum and see if I can jam his signal. I might be able to buy us some time while you take care of him.', '', 34029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is in the universe\'s best interest to re-originate this planet should my analysis find systemic corruption. Do not interfere.', '', 34028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back, mortals. I\'m not here to fight you.', '', 34027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Translocation complete. Commencing planetary analysis of Azeroth.', '', 34026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it, lads! We got here before Algalon\'s arrival... maybe we can rig the systems to interfere with his analysis...', '', 34025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was here visiting relatives when Lordaeron fell, and then... well. I suppose I won\'t ever be returning to Westfall, now.$B$BSometimes I wonder if my family is still alive. More often, though, I wonder why I no longer care.', '', 34024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s heart is severed from his body.', '', 34023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s opens his mouth wide!', '', 34022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now ya be knowin\' everything, mon! Prepare yourself... we attack soon!', '', 34021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have witnessed your magnificent operation, Drakuru. When do we put your plan into effect?', 'I have witnessed your magnificent operation, Drakuru. When do we put your plan into effect??', 34020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With da chieftains out of da way, we be poised to make our assault! Soon, $n....', '', 34019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not worry about my fate, Bronzen. If the signal is not transmitted in time, re-origination will proceed regardless. Save... your world...', '', 34018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know just the place. Will you be all right?', '', 34017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lack the strength to transmit the signal. You must... hurry... find a place of power... close to the skies.', '', 34016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, mortals. Your bravery is admirable, for such flawed creatures.', '', 34015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin uplink: Reply Code: \'Omega.\' Planetary re-origination requested.', '', 34014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve rearranged the reply code - your planet will be spared. I cannot be certain of my own calculations anymore.', '', 34013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps it is your imperfections... that which grants you free will... that allows you to persevere against all cosmically calculated odds. You prevail where the Titan\'s own perfect creations have failed.', '', 34012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Drakkari Chieftains have been captured! What more would you have me do?', 'The Drakkari Chieftains have been captured! What more would you have me do?', 34011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darmuk\'s incompetence be hinderin\' us no more! Patience, mon. Dere soon be more for you to do....', '', 34010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have defeated Darmuk! How else may I serve you?', 'I have defeated Darmuk! How else may I serve you?', 34008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed you have, mon. Our stores of blight crystals be nearly sufficient!', '', 34007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Analysis complete. There is partial corruption in the planet\'s life-support systems as well as complete corruption in most of the planet\'s defense mechanisms.', '', 34006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have whipped the Blight Geists into shape!', 'I have whipped the Blight Geists into shape!', 34005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to Overload!', '', 34004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All in good time, mon. I be havin\' more work for you to do soon....', '', 34003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorebag has shown me the Drakkari Empire. I am eager to help you conquer it!', 'Gorebag has shown me the Drakkari Empire. I am eager to help you conquer it!', 34002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are out of time.', '', 34001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen worlds bathed in the Makers\' flames, their denizens fading without as much as a whimper. Entire planetary systems born and razed in the time that it takes your mortal hearts to beat once. Yet all throughout, my own heart devoid of emotion... of empathy. I. Have. Felt. Nothing. A million-million lives wasted. Had they all held within them your tenacity? Had they all loved life as you do?', '', 34000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware...', '', 33999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See your world through my eyes: A universe so vast as to be immeasurable - incomprehensible even to your greatest minds.', '', 33998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do what I must.', '', 33997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loss of life unavoidable.', '', 33996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your actions are illogical. All possible results for this encounter have been calculated. The Pantheon will receive the Observer\'s message regardless of outcome.', '', 33995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the tools of creation!', '', 33994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes berserk, extinguishing all life!', '', 33993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Freya casts |cFF00FF00Strengthened Iron Roots!|r', 33991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s mutters to himself in Forsaken.', '', 33990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That our lives... our lives are worth living.', '', 33989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cold logic deemed our world not worth saving. Cold logic, however, does not account for the power of free will. It\'s up to each of us to prove this is a world worth saving.', '', 33988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He found a planet whose races had deviated from the titans\' blueprints. A planet where not everything had gone according to plan.', '', 33987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Algalon was sent here to judge the fate of our world.', '', 33986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Algalon the Observer, herald of the titans, has been defeated by our brave comrades in the depths of the titan city of Ulduar.', '', 33985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today our world\'s destruction has been averted in defiance of our very makers!', '', 33984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens of Dalaran! Raise your eyes to the skies and observe!', '', 33983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We received Brann\'s message, and we have begun preparations.', '', 33982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ranged Shield-Breaker attack is simple to learn, but difficult to master. Alone it may seem weak, but in conjunction with Thrusts and Charges the Shield-Breaker makes a successful jouster.$B$BFind a Ranged Target. Take a moment to understand the Shield-Breaker\'s range... how much space you need, and how far you can hurl the lance.$B$BAfter that? Well. Start throwing, and do not stop until you\'ve broken every last layer of Defend and pierced the vulnerable target.$B$BThis tactic will serve you well in actual mounted combat: Break down your opponents\' defenses... and then crush them!', '', 33981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 11, 0, 3, 2, 39653),
('Show me how to train with a Ranged Target.', 'Show me how to train with a Ranged Target.', 33980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well. Another $c, come to learn the ways of the Shield-Breaker...?', '', 33979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s catches a fish!', '', 33978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well then! A mounted Charge is about more than just kickin\' yer mount ta full speed an\' hollerin\' yer lungs out... though that IS the fun part, heh! But the Charge Target will teach ye the finer points.$B$BA good Charge is all about distance and timing. Ye can\'t be TOO close, or ye won\'t get enough speed. But ye can\'t be too far away either or yer mount will tire! As for timin\'...$B$BYe\'ll want ta make sure the Charge Target doesn\'t have a layer o\' Defend up before ye rush in. If it does, use yer Shield Breaker ta make it vulnerable, and THEN Charge in!$B$BSame goes for the real thing: Try ta drop yer opponent defenses before ye Charge!', '', 33977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 5, 0, 2, 2, 39653),
('Show me how to train with a Charge Target.', 'Show me how to train with a Charge Target.', 33976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, how are ye?$B$BCome ta learn the art o\' the Charge, $c?', '', 33975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time for breaks! Get back to work!', '', 33974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to digging! This ore won\'t mine itself!', '', 33973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let a little elf attack get in the way of your work!', '', 33972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to work, dogs! We\'re behind schedule!', '', 33971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durak, I have lost my disguise!', 'Durak, I have lost my disguise!', 33970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you, $n.$b$bI trust everything is going according to plan?', '', 33969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Melee Target trains Aspirants in both mounted attack and defense.$B$BApproach the Melee Target and strike it with a Thrust attack. The force of the blow often spins the target hard enough to injure you or your mount. This is where defense comes into play.$B$BBe certain to have at least one layer of Defend before attacking the target, and continue to stack and refresh Defend throughout the training exercise. Otherwise, you may well find yourself dismounted.$B$BThe same holds true in actual mounted combat: Balance attack and defense, Thrusting at every opportunity and maintaining your layers of Defend as best you can.', '', 33968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 1, 0, 2, 2, 39653),
('Yes, $c? What is it?', '', 33967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Preliminary testing phase complete. Now comes the true test!', '', 33966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it, puny mort-$b$bErr... yes, $r? What can I do for you?', '', 33965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me how to train with a Melee Target.', 'Show me how to train with a Melee Target.', 33964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, $c.$B$BI train Aspirants in the art of mounted close combat.', '', 33963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand still and stare into the light!', '', 33962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cries out for help!', '', 33961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
