('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_MindMastery.blp:24|t|cFFFF8900 100%% Sanity Lost|r', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_MindMastery.blp:24|t|cFFFF8900 100%% Sanity Lost|r', 33955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now it falls to you, champions, to avenge us all. The task before you is great, but I will lend you my aid as I am able. You must prevail.', '', 33954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the hand behind all the evil that has befallen Ulduar, left my kingdom in ruins, corrupted my brother, and slain my wife.', '', 33953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Fiend, you are not my beloved! Begone!', '', 33952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need time to reflect.... I will aid your cause if you should require it. I owe you at least that much. Farewell.', '', 33951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sif... was Sif here? Impossible--she died at my brother\'s hand. A dark nightmare indeed....', '', 33950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel as though I am awakening from a nightmare, but the shadows in this place yet linger.', '', 33949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay your arms! I yield!', '', 33948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
