('It\'s a real honor to be able to aid Brann in exploring ancient Ulduar.', '', 33946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An %s emerges from the dying Crystalsong Oak!', '', 33945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A spirit appears to avenge the Crystalsong Oak!', '', 33944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An %s attacks the treekiller.', '', 33943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As for not endangering the sigils during this process, I can analyze each watcher\'s status and make that information available to you upon completion of calculations.', '', 33942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sufficient use of force would trigger a reset in watcher functions, removing the external influence.', '', 33941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Corruption found. External influence gaining control over watchers. Sigils compromised.', '', 33940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Analyzing watcher status. Please wait.', '', 33939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The four watchers of Ulduar: Freya, Thorim, Hodir, and Mimiron. The sigils are tied to their physical and mental integrity. All four sigils are required for access to the Celestial Planetarium.', '', 33938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Request denied. Access requires manual verification of the four watchers\' sigils.', '', 33937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve dreamed of roaming the halls of the titans for years. I never thought I\'d be pitted against their creations.', '', 33936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to tell us how to... \"un-compromise\" the sigils, aren\'t you?', '', 33935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do we get the sigils from them, then? Just walk up to them and ask them nicely?', '', 33934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Four watchers? Sigils? Could ye be a little less cryptic, confounded machine?', '', 33933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New orders! Unlock the entry to the Celestial Planetarium.', '', 33932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is grounded permanently!', '%s is grounded permanently!', 33931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
