('', 'Hefting', 33914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blast it, lads. Looks like we\'ve got a fight ahead of us.', '', 33913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, what\'s this Algalon going to be looking for with his diagnostics? What are our chances?', '', 33912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear that, lads? It\'s only the end of the world! Well, what are ye waiting for, ye rusty machine? Initiate Reply-code Alpha. All is well! Pints are on me!', '', 33911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Planetary re-origination? Speak plainly, ye blasted machine!', '', 33910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well? Who\'s on the listening side of the signal? What\'s going to happen?', '', 33909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prime Designate? Where have I \'eard that before? By my grandfather\'s beard, Loken is Azeroth\'s Prime Designate. Loken\'s death triggered this!', '', 33908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a second: this doesn\'t look right! Next to this blinking light... what\'s this Algalon signal? ', '', 33907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks just like all the other titan archives me lads have found... only older... and bigger.', '', 33906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll show ye access, ye wretched machine. Here it is again: Norgannon\'s key!', '', 33905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, this is what we call a nice find!', '', 33904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
