('Ninety-nine point nine nine percent.', '', 33902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Algalon diagnostics assess danger of systemic Old God corruption in planetary vital functions.  Calculating chance of Omega Reply-code...', '', 33901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Request denied.  Reply-codes built into Algalon observer entity.  He is both messenger and message.', '', 33900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The decomposition of the planet and its living organisms into base elements: metals, rocks, gases. This is followed by a period of reconstitution of each element into the original planetary blueprint.', '', 33899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Searching... Destruction of Prime Designate is considered the first warning sign of systemic planetary failure. Algalon observer entity\'s arrival is followed by planetary diagnostics resulting in one of two possible reply signals. Reply-code Alpha, signaling \"All is well\" and Reply-code Omega, signaling planetary re-origination.', '', 33898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Affirmative.  Timestamp of Prime Designate Loken\'s destruction coincides with signal activation.', '', 33897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiating query.  The Algalon Failsafe is an automated emergency signal following a Prime Designate\'s demise.', '', 33896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Access to the Archivum granted.  Intrusion protection mechanisms suspended.', '', 33895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Entry denied.  Access level insufficient.', '', 33894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must resume my duties, $c.', '', 33893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, $c, that was... subtle.', '', 33892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_MindMastery.blp:24|t|cFFFF8900 12%% Sanity Lost|r', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_MindMastery.blp:24|t|cFFFF8900 12%% Sanity Lost|r', 33891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To retrieve Mimiron\'s sigil, initiate self-destruct sequence and defeat Mimiron before its completion.', '', 33890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trigger for self-destruct mechanism is codenamed \"Big Red Button\", Mimiron\'s own creation.', '', 33889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watcher Mimiron\'s sigil is linked to a self-destruct mechanism connected to the entirety of the Corridors of Ingenuity.', '', 33888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commencing watcher Mimiron status analysis.', '', 33887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allies present in the field of battle are likely to provide synergies and minimize combat duration.', '', 33886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watcher Hodir\'s temperament and behavior highly unstable. Destruction of cache highly probable during prolonged combat.', '', 33885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hodir\'s sigil appears to be located inside a cache of artifacts.', '', 33884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
