('I have been defeated.  Good fight!', 'I have been defeated.  Good fight!', 33868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you are ready to fight me?', 'Are you sure you are ready to fight me?', 33867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task.  Are you sure you are ready?', 'It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task.  Are you sure you are ready?', 33866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
