('When you are ready to test for the rank of valiant, I will call forth a member of the Argent Crusade.', 'When you are ready to test for the rank of valiant, I will call forth a member of the Argent Crusade.', 33800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
