('Make good use of those tar pools. Your friends should be able to light them on fire if they\'re smart about it.', 'Make good use of those tar pools. Your friends should be able to light them on fire if they\'re smart about it.', 33740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We put together some sweet custom horns for these things. Enjoy!', 'We put together some sweet custom horns for these things. Enjoy!', 33739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s all fixed up and ready to go. Treat her nice!', 'She\'s all fixed up and ready to go. Treat her nice!', 33738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing\'s going to catch you on this baby!', 'Nothing\'s going to catch you on this baby!', 33737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Into riding in style? I like your taste.', 'Into riding in style? I like your taste.', 33736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This thing should wreck that iron army. One better, it won\'t explode in your face... unlike some machines I\'ve seen. Not saying names or anything.', 'This thing should wreck that iron army. One better, it won\'t explode in your face, unlike some machines I\'ve seen. Not saying names or anything, Blastwrench.', 33735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Made to far exceed Brann\'s specifications. You won\'t be disappointed.', 'Made to far exceed Brann\'s specifications. You won\'t be disappointed.', 33734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
