('I call her Betty. She\'s a beauty, eh?', 'I call her Betty. She\'s a beauty, eh?', 33732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Anti-Air Rockets should be perfect for taking down those air transports to get at the extra pyrite.', 'The Anti-Air Rockets should be perfect for taking down those air transports to get at the extra pyrite.', 33731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Roll\'m!', 'Roll\'m!', 33730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We upgraded these with some advanced armor plating - they should be able to take quite a beating now!', 'We upgraded these with some advanced armor plating - they should be able to take quite a beating now!', 33729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These things should bring down those towers in no time!', 'These things should bring down those towers in no time!', 33728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All yours. Make good use of her!', 'All yours. Make good use of her!', 33727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve only got a limited amount of pyrite stocked, use it sparingly.', 'We\'ve only got a limited amount of pyrite stocked, use it sparingly.', 33726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now with new passenger tossing capability! I\'m sure your buds will love ya.', 'Now with new passenger tossing capability! I\'m sure your buds will love ya.', 33725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You treat my baby nice, alright? I don\'t want to find any dents when you\'re done with her.', 'You treat my baby nice, alright? I don\'t want to find any dents when you\'re done with her.', 33724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you like explosions. They\'re my specialty.', 'I hope you like explosions. They\'re my specialty.', 33723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wish I could be going with ya. Blow\'m up good!', 'Wish I could be going with ya. Blow\'m up good!', 33722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget to get some of that extra pyrite if your friends can shoot it down.', 'Don\'t forget to get some of that extra pyrite if your friends can shoot it down.', 33721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like you know a good machine when you see one. Give\'m hell!', 'Looks like you know a good machine when you see one. Give\'m hell!', 33720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That better be the last one that blows up on our watch. They\'re paying top dollar for these things.', '', 33719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No room for mistakes this time! I don\'t want any of these siege engines breaking down on the field. ', '', 33718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Silver Covenant welcomes you to the tournament. The Argent Crusade has asked us to register and train those interested in competing.', '', 33717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s whispers something to Brann.', 33716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s nods.', 33715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like the battle\'s about to get under way, that\'s my cue to leave. We\'ll have to pick this up later.', 33714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yogg-Saron is here? It sounds like we really will have our hands full then.', 33713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Primary defensive emplacements consist of iron constructs and Storm Beacons, which will generate additional constructs as necessary. Secondary systems consist of orbital defense emplacements.', '', 33712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Entity designate: Yogg-Saron. Security has been compromised. Prison operational status unknown. Unable to contact Watchers for notification purposes.', '', 33711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you mentioned an imprisoned entity? What is the nature of this entity and what is its status?', 33710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rhydian, make sure you let Brann and Archmage Pentarus know about those defenses immediately.', 33709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got it. At least we don\'t have to deal with those orbital emplacements.', 33708, 0, 8425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Compromise of complex detected, security override enabled - query permitted.', '', 33707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you detail the nature of these defense systems?', 33706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Access to the interior of the complex is currently restricted. Primary defensive emplacements are active. Secondary systems are currently non-active.', '', 33705, 0, 8425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Frontal defense systems? Is there something I should let Brann know before he has anyone attempt to enter the complex?', 33704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was constructed to serve as a repository for essential information regarding this complex. My primary functions include communicating the status of the frontal defense systems and assessing the status of the entity that this complex was built to imprison.', '', 33703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard a story or two of a Lore Keeper in Uldaman that fit your description. Do you serve a similar purpose?', 33702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid you are not ready to become a valiant.  However I suspect you will be ready soon enough.', 'I\'m afraid you are not ready to become a valiant.  However I suspect you will be ready soon enough.', 33701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would seem that you are not yet ready for the rank of valiant.  Some more training may serve you well.', 'It would seem that you are not yet ready for the rank of valiant.  Some more training may serve you well.', 33700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
