('Impressive skills indeed.  I believe that you are more than ready for the rank of valiant.', 'Impressive skills indeed.  I believe that you are more than ready for the rank of valiant.', 33691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done!  It seems that you are worthy of the valiant rank!', 'Well done!  It seems that you are worthy of the valiant rank!', 33690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are far to slow on the field of battle.  Perhaps you need to further hone your skills.', 'You are far to slow on the field of battle.  Perhaps you need to further hone your skills.', 33689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
