('Mages of the Kirin Tor, on Brann\'s Command, release the shield! Defend this platform and our allies with your lives! For Dalaran!', '', 33677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
