('We\'re here with you Brann, you can trust in your brothers of earth.', '', 33672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pentarus, you heard the $gman:woman;. Have your mages release the shield and let these brave souls through!', '', 33671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will hold until the reinforcements come. As long as men with stout hearts are manning the walls and the throne, Stormwind will hold.', '', 33670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t it beautiful? I call it the magnificent aerial command unit!', '', 33669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
