('', '$n... You have served the Horde well.$b$bHurry now... speak with Kadrak....$b$bSave Splintertree!!', 33654, 0, 8193, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am... finished....', 33653, 0, 8193, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready. Begin the assault!', 'We\'re ready. Begin the assault!', 33652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a good thing you guys showed up! The Iron Dwarves have pushed us back to this location, and we\'re barely managing to hold the line here. \n\nEven worse, they\'ve begun to power up their magical defenses. If we don\'t attack soon, they\'ll be able to annihilate us in the blink of an eye!\n\nWe\'ve managed to rebuild several siege machines, demolishers and motorcycles from the Alliance and Horde expeditions that were here before us. However, all of our pilots died in the last assault.\n\nYou must take the vehicles and storm the gates of Ulduar! \n\nPlease, $n! You\'re our last hope!', '', 33651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These babies can hurl fire like none other. We\'ve even attached a secondary cannon, a grappling hook and added a manual fuel injection system.  If you can obtain liquid pyrite from the mechanognomes, you can use it to hurl high-density explosives, or turbo-boost your movement speed. \n\nLet\'s see those Explorers\' League twirps beat that!', 'These babies can hurl fire like none other. We\'ve even attached a secondary cannon, a grappling hook and added a manual fuel injection system.  If you can obtain liquid pyrite from the mechanognomes, you can use it to hurl high-density explosives, or turbo-boost your movement speed. \n\nLet\'s see those Explorers\' League twirps beat that!', 33650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about demolishers.', 'Tell me about demolishers.', 33649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were in luck to find enough parts to get these babies working again!$BHow can I help you?', '', 33648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saronite barrier protecting General Vezax shimmers and fades away!', '', 33647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
