('Sentinel, I would like to ride one of your nightsabers to Astranaar.', 'Sentinel, I would like to ride one of your nightsabers to Astranaar.', 33552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
