('', 'Greetings, $c.', 33548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate your help in this. We never would have suspected Saean as a sympathizer - we just weren\'t prepared for this.', '', 33547, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
