('NO! Garrosh, I have failed you....', '', 33485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I am released from his grasp... at last.', '', 33484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no blood easier spilt than that of a puny night elf!', '', 33483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no hope for you. Your Darkshore lies in ruins. Astranaar will fall before the end of the day as will this place. Retreat to Darnassus while you still can.', '', 33482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want that one killed! The one right there that doesn\'t look like the others!', '', 33481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time has past, night elves. Ashenvale is ours!', '', 33480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash them! Destroy them! Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 33479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surrender, Maestra, and I will see to it that your deaths are quick!', '', 33478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one, over there. Target them. Do NOT let them get past you!', '', 33477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see you, worm. Are you grunts blind? Kill them!', '', 33476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic weakling. You\'ll die quickly!', '', 33475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you\'re the Alliance\'s so-called champion. With your death this place will easily fall.', '', 33474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $r? I spit on you!', '', 33473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll carve your heart out, maggot!', '', 33472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('General Vezax roars and surges with dark might!', '', 33471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mission complete. Thank you, friend.', '', 33470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood of Gladiators', 'Blood of Gladiators', 33469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foam Sword Rack', 'Foam Sword Rack', 33468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sandbox Tiger', 'Sandbox Tiger', 33467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Epic Purple Shirt', 'Epic Purple Shirt', 33466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast Flame Jets!', '', 33465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the help of its allies the %s regenerates back to life.', '', 33464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s withers into the earth and begins to regenerate.', '', 33463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you, $r vermin! This forest belongs to the Kaldorei...', '', 33462, 0, 8169, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea what you\'re meddling with!', '', 33461, 0, 8169, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell newcomer. May Elune\'s blessing be with you.', 33460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was afforded a brief chance to attack their leader, and he was protected by some kind of magic. Make sure Morra hears of this before leading any kind of attack.', 33459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First, Morra will be interested to know that it sounds like the Warsong clan spurred these trolls out of the mountain to attack us, so I suspect they\'re going to attack in Ashenvale as well.', 33458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for getting me out of there. I should be able to swim back from here, but before I go, one quick thing...', 33457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for the rescue. Let\'s get out of here!', 33456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many times must I have you killed, orc?!', '', 33455, 0, 8169, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cause the earth to quake.', '', 33454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! NO! NO! NO! NO!', '', 33453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s rough out there. I need some replacements, Sentinel Onaeya.', 'It\'s rough out there. I need some replacements, Sentinel Onaeya.', 33452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just let me know when you\'re ready to take a squad out.$B$BI\'m holding some in reserve, so if you need a few more, come back.', 33451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you, $c.$B$BSorry... can\'t talk. We\'re in a bit of a fight here.', 33450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show yourself, elf-coward! Face your death with honor!', '', 33449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to play!', '', 33448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s heart is exposed and leaking energy.', '', 33447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So tired. I will rest for just a moment!', '', 33446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He must fall!', '', 33445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Elendilad conceals himself on the island ahead, cowardly issuing orders to his underlings.', '', 33444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me closely, and prepare for battle!', '', 33443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hurry, now. I sense that my time is short.', '', 33442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and that my mens\' sacrifice had not been avenged.', '', 33441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. I could not rest knowing that my mission had not been completed.', '', 33440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Tabard of Summer Flames.', 'I\'ve lost my Tabard of Summer Flames.', 33439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Tabard of Summer Skies.', 'I\'ve lost my Tabard of Summer Skies.', 33438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It has brought me naught but ill. Mayhap you can find someone who will contain its power.', 33437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, mortal, for freeing me from this curse. I beg you, take this blade.', 33436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The orc\'s lifeless body is no longer responsive....>', '', 33435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mortally wounded orc seems to be unconscious.', '', 33434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come near, $c. I haven\'t got much time....', '', 33433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s ignores $n.', '', 33432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like you anymore!', '', 33431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to fight!', 'I am ready to fight!', 33430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you are ready for mounted combat?', 'Are you sure you are ready for mounted combat?', 33429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Allies of Nature have appeared!', 33427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your gift is a rare kindness, traveler. Please take this blade with my gratitude. Long ago, another traveler left it here, but I have little use for it.', 33426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The lake has been too lonely these past years. The travelers stopped coming and evil came to these waters.', 33425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been so long since a traveler has come here bearing flowers.', 33424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are those winter hyacinths? For me?', 33423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thanks, $c!', 'Many thanks, $c!', 33422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the Alliance!', 'Death to the Alliance!', 33421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 33420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder, $r!', 'Blood and thunder, $r!', 33419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lend us your aid, keeper. Together we will defeat Yogg-Saron.', 'Lend us your aid, keeper. Together we will defeat Yogg-Saron.', 33418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you certain you want my help in the battle against Yogg-Saron?', 33415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron.\n\nI can grant you and your friends the Fury of the Storm, increasing your damage and maximum health. Should you be faced with evil so malevolent that it cannot be destroyed, I can channel all my power into a final Titanic Storm that will destroy even Immortals.', '', 33413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron.\n\nI can grant you and your friends the Speed of Invention, increasing your damage and movement speed. In addition, I can destabilize the matrices of certain Saronite based life-forms, reducing their attack and casting speeds.', '', 33412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for my scouting mission.', 'I\'m ready for my scouting mission.', 33411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c.', 33410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron.\n\nI can grant you and your friends the Resilience of Nature, increasing your damage and increasing healing taken from spells and effects. In addition, I can conjure Sanity Wells that will allow you to recover your Sanity when your grip on reality falters.', 33409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron.\n\nI can grant you and your friends the Fortitude of Frost, increasing your damage and reducing damage taken from enemy attacks. Should one of you be about to fall in battle, I can freeze you in a block of ice, protecting you from all damage for a short time. Know that this ability taxes my power, and I must rest after using it.', '', 33408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you certain you want my help in the battle against Yogg-Saron?', '', 33407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, but I had to check. Okay, let\'s get out of here.', 33406, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s trashed, but it doesn\'t look like there are any bodies.', 33405, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry! We have to check on them!', 33404, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This isn\'t happening. Oh no... my friends!', 33403, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taldan!', 33402, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind Champion\'s Pennant', 'Stormwind Champion\'s Pennant', 33401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What may I do for you, $GSir:Dame;?', '', 33400, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am an archaeologist with the Explorers\' League! I can assure you that King Magni will hear of this outrage!', 33399, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cultists are going to pay! Someone get me out of here!', 33398, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This would never have happened to Ironforge!', 33397, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d be dead if it weren\'t for you.', 33396, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why did I ever let Remtravel convince me to come to Darkshore?!', 33395, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was the last one, right?', 33394, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This has to be said... the Twilight\'s Hammer sucks!', 33393, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How many elementals do they have?!', 33392, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have to get out of here.', 33391, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time for a very short breather.', 33390, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anytime, lass. Anytime.', 33389, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, thank you, Elisa! Thank you!', 33388, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course. Don\'t think anything of it. And I won\'t hear of you trying to pay me back, either!', 33387, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have a favor to ask. Could you reward my friend here? I haven\'t any coin. I can pay you when we get back to Ironforge.', 33386, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know, lass, but you\'re safe now and with friends. I thought you were dead!', 33384, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisa! Oh, it\'s so good to get out of there! Auberdine is completely overrun with cultists and elementals!', 33383, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hollee!', 33382, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll race you!', 33381, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s the refugee camp!', 33380, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go.', 33379, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great! Let\'s get out of here. I don\'t have a weapon, so I\'d really appreciate it if you could... you know... protect me?', 33378, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ohmygosh! I didn\'t think that I was ever going to see anyone ever again!$B$BYou have to get me out of here!', 33377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please! Someone! Anyone! Help me get out of here!', 33376, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Up here on the second floor of the inn! Hurry!', 33375, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Somebody please! Get me out of here before they sacrifice me!', 33374, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Come to the top of the inn! They have me chained up!', 33373, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need some help here! Damsel in distress! <snort>', 33372, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Anybody out there?', 33371, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A |cFF00FFFFLifebinder\'s Gift|r begins to grow!', 33370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impossible!  Lord Thorim, I will bring your foes a frigid death!', 33369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These pathetic mortals are harmless, beneath my station.  Dispose of them!', 33368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now, I must return to the waters of the lake.', 33367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can it really be? Free after all these years?', 33366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My patience has reached its limit!', '', 33365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take it with my gratitude, $c.', 33364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad to help, my lady. I\'m told you were once the guardian of a fabled sword. Do you know where I might find it?', 'Glad to help, my lady. I\'m told you were once the guardian of a fabled sword. Do you know where I might find it?', 33363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought I\'d never be free from that terrible curse. You have my gratitude, stranger.', 33362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see you, land-walker. Come to me... we shall parlay.', 33361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To arms! Invaders approach! Strike them down! Let none survive!', 33360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Cataclysm is only the beginning. Let the two-legs drown in a sea of their own blood!', 33359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Destroy Zoram\'gar Outpost! Destroy the Blackfathom Camp! We march on Maestra\'s Post and by nightfall Astranaar will lie in ruins!', 33358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the might of Zoram rise! Let our enemies be crushed within our coils! Go forth and teach them what it means to face the Wrathtail!', 33357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our great queen beckons us forward. Let us turn the waters red with the blood of our enemies!', 33356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Assemble the schools. We will wash away even the memories of the Alliance and the Horde from Ashenvale!', 33355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare yourselves. We attack at high tide!', 33354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to help!', 'We are ready to help!', 33353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, champions! All of our attempts at bringing her down have failed. We could use a hand in bringing her down with these harpoon guns.', 'Welcome, champions! All of our attempts at bringing her down have failed. We could use a hand in bringing her down with these harpoon guns.', 33351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c. Our position here is a bit exposed given the build up of the Horde\'s forces to the south.$B$BAnything that you can do to help will be greatly appreciated.', 33350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $g sir : my lady;. This is a much better camp than the one that I used to have.$B$BIt\'s good to have company. They\'ve been nice enough to teach me some of their fighting techniques so that I can hold my own against the Horde.', '', 33349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We thank you mortal.  The ocean\'s will is to be free.', '', 33348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides do as Elune commands.', '', 33347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the ocean... return to the tides.', '', 33346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig rats make some surprisingly tasty stew.', '', 33345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here to do my master\'s bidding, no matter what the cost. A little girl\'s life hangs in the balance and what could be more important?', '', 33344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The forest is crawling with Horde, $c. Be mindful of your surroundings!', 33343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me some quest credit, yo.', 'Give me some quest credit, yo.', 33342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you dumb? I\'m a freaking bear. Back off, punk. (Temp text)', '', 33341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meow. I\'m a cat lawl.  Don\'t pick me up or I might scratch you. Have any catnip? (Temp text)', '', 33340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
