('EVEN IN THIS WEAKENED FORM, I WILL DESTROY YOU!!!', '', 33237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After the Plaguelands and the Battle for Light\'s Hope Chapel, I didn\'t think that we would witness anything more horrible.$B$BI was wrong.', 33236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you hear it, $c? The elements cry out that this land is almost dead. The Drakkari are stealing the power of their gods by killing them just to defend themselves against the Scourge.$B$BThey are short-sighted and will be their own undoing in the end.', '', 33235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a fine mess we\'ve gotten ourselves into. We\'re overdue to join up with our forces in Icecrown and now we\'re entangled in this debacle, stuck between the Scourge and the Drakkari.$B$BI told the highlord it was a mistake to come here.$B$BSee what you can do to help out there.', '', 33234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall see. Let us weaken him, my friends!', '', 33233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT IS THIS? YALDA? AHAHAHAHAHA, THERE IS NOTHING THAT YOU OR THESE OTHER SPIRITS CAN DO TO STOP ME!', '', 33232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Aetherion, we will not allow that to happen!', '', 33231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not judge others by their stature, $r, but by their courage and loyalty.', '', 33230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU DARE?! TODAY WILL SEE THE END OF LOR\'DANEL, MALFURION, AND YOU!', '', 33229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU MORTALS ARE MADE OF THE STUFF OF THE ELEMENTS. HOW CAN YOU POSSIBLY HOPE TO PREVAIL? PREPARE TO RETURN TO YOUR TRUER, MORE BASIC NATURES!', '', 33228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THERE IS BUT ONE OUTCOME POSSIBLE. THE CATACLYSM WAS ONLY THE BEGINNING. THE WORLD AS YOU KNOW IT IS AT AN END!', '', 33227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('JOIN THE TWILIGHT\'S HAMMER NOW. THOSE WHO DO NOT BELONG WHEN I FULLY ENTER THE WORLD WILL KNOW ONLY DEATH!', '', 33226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PATIENCE! THE RITUAL TO BRING ME INTO THIS WORLD IS COMPLEX AND MUST NOT BE RUSHED!', '', 33225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MY MASTER COMES, MORTALS! I AM BUT ONE OF A LEGION OF HERALDS. YOUR WORLD IS ABOUT TO UNDERGO A TRANSFORMATION THAT WILL SEE THE END OF YOU!', '', 33224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MALFURION, CAN YOU HEAR ME?! WHEN I HAVE DESTROYED THE CHILDREN OF ELUNE, I WILL COME AND PUT AN END TO YOU!', '', 33223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I SEE YOU, INSECT. RUN WHILE YOU CAN. RUN AND TELL YOUR PATHETIC LOR\'DANEL THAT I AM COMING TO DESTROY IT!', '', 33222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I HAVE ALMOST ARRIVED. TWILIGHT\'S HAMMER, DO NOT RUSH THE SUMMONING OR I WILL DESTROY YOU AS WELL!', '', 33221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gots no time for playin\' with ya. Aetherion just about ready to go!', '', 33220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be messin\' with Tzu-Tzu? It no matter... Aetherion\'s here, mon. We gonna roll on ya refugee camp an\' then bring the hurt to ya Lor\'denal. But first, ya die!', '', 33219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatcha doin\', mon? Don\'tcha know the end o\' the world be nigh? Here, I show you!', '', 33218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you only knew the power that I serve, you would not hesitate to kneel before me and join our ranks. Sadly, your ignorance will prove to be your undoing!', '', 33217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not stop our final ritual to bring Aetherion into the world. Too bad that you won\'t live to see it!', '', 33216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our master will break the world asunder and all that you know will come to an end. This is only a taste of what\'s to come!', '', 33215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lor\'danel must have been desperate to send you. We\'ll deal with them soon enough!', 33214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place was only the beginning. We will crush your refugee camp and then lead our elementals north to destroy Lor\'danel with Aetherion as our vanguard!', 33213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lor\'danel is next, fool. With Aetherion almost completely in this world, it is only a matter of time!', 33212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coax the spirit out of Caylais Moonfeather\'s still corpse.', 'Coax the spirit out of Caylais Moonfeather\'s still corpse.', 33211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Far too powerful for these elementals, Caylais and her hippogryphs must have been struck down by something else.', 33210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coax Taldan\'s corpse to give up its spirit.', 'Coax Taldan\'s corpse to give up its spirit.', 33209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s where Taldan served his last drink.', '', 33208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coax the spirit out of Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze\'s corpse.', 'Coax the spirit out of Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze\'s corpse.', 33207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sentinel\'s body rests here, the apparent victim of the elemental onslaught that has overtaken the town.', 33206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, I know... \"fishing in a sewer?\" But you\'d be surprised by what you can catch down here. I\'ve even heard stories of sharks, if you can believe it.', '', 33205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not fighting, so send me in now!', 'I\'m not fighting, so send me in now!', 33204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you doing out here? You should be inside fighting off the Blue Dragonflight!', 33203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drinks, here! Delicious drinks! From snowplum brandy to Westfall bourbon... get your drinks!', 33202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fine, snowplum brandy sold here! Buy a snifter, and experience its wonders...', 33201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothin\' will warm your belly like a cup of caraway burnwine. Buy it here!', 33200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used to have 1850 spell power, what happaned?', '', 33199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s my bottle?  Have you seen it?', '', 33198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I?  Hic!', '', 33197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thirsty? How about flagon of sweet, warm honeycomb mead? Come on over!', 33196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell.', 'Farewell.', 33195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lift the icepaw bear\'s tail to check if it\'s a male or a female.', 'Lift the icepaw bear\'s tail to check if it\'s a male or a female.', 33194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The icepaw bear lays here tranquilized.', '', 33193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a female.', '', 33192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s an angry male!', '', 33191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lift the frost leopard\'s tail to check if it\'s a male or a female.', 'Lift the frost leopard\'s tail to check if it\'s a male or a female.', 33190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The frost leopard lays here tranquilized.', '', 33189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Artruis is shielded. You must choose your side quickly to break his spell.', '', 33188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thundris Windweaver\'s spirit is coaxed forth.', '', 33187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coax Thundris Windweaver\'s spirit.', 'Coax Thundris Windweaver\'s spirit.', 33186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thundris Windweaver\'s corpse lays sprawled out here, the apparent victim of the Twilight\'s Hammer\'s machinations.', '', 33185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me, stranger.', '', 33184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another shiny, happy person.  Take care, $c!', 'Another shiny, happy person.  Take care, $c!', 33183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shiny!', 'Shiny!', 33182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me shine your shoes, $c.', 'Let me shine your shoes, $c.', 33181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One shoeshine coming up!', 'One shoeshine coming up!', 33180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care of that shine, $c.', 'Take care of that shine, $c.', 33179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a shoeshine, $c?', 'Need a shoeshine, $c?', 33178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many years ago I died tragically while attempting to help with a local murloc problem. However, I was content to stay and watch my family and friends instead of passing on to be with the Goddess.$B$BNow they are all gone, or worse, dead, and I have only one reason to stay.$B$BVengeance.', 33177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning: Golem can only be used in Dun Argol!', '', 33176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On my flight south from Darnassus to seek out Malfurion Stormrage, I came across these injured refugees from the Ruins of Auberdine.$B$BTheir cause is just and I am helping to heal them, but their injuries are numerous, and it will take time.$B$BI trust that you will be willing to lend them your aid as well.', '', 33175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our home was destroyed during the Cataclysm!$B$BAll of the rest of the survivors moved north to build Lor\'danel, but those of us that stayed behind are here for a reason. We WILL retake the Ruins of Auberdine from those Twilight\'s Hammer scum just as soon as we heal up.$B$BI hope that you can help us to deal with them in the meantime.', 33174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not your mule.', '', 33173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mule looks at you expectantly.', '', 33172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That brute has the key. ', 33171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get me out of here, will ya?', 33170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Over here!', 33169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is Vesprystus that you seek.  He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil.', 'It is Vesprystus that you seek.  He watches over the hippogryphs that come and go from the base of Teldrassil.', 33168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TURKEY TRIUMPH!', 'TURKEY TRIUMPH!', 33167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vesprystus\' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination.', 'Vesprystus\' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination.', 33166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turkey Slaughter!', 'Turkey Slaughter!', 33165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turkey Domination!', 'Turkey Domination!', 33164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turkey Hunter!', 'Turkey Hunter!', 33163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this... is what it feels like... to be mortal?\n\n<The question trails off as Mavralyn\'s breathing stops.>', 'So this... is what it feels like... to be mortal?\n\n<The question trails off as Mavralyn\'s breathing stops.>', 33162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The night elf turns to you as you approach and reaches for your hand.>\n\nIt is too late for me. We earned our fate with our pride. Go... others may have made it. Save any that you can.\n\n<Her grip loosens as life slips from her.>', '<The night elf turns to you as you approach and reaches for your hand.>\n\nIt is too late for me. We earned our fate with our pride. Go... others may have made it. Save any that you can.\n\n<Her grip loosens as life slips from her.>', 33161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vicious gashes line Valdaron\'s body. You need not check his pulse to know that he has already passed.>', '<Vicious gashes line Valdaron\'s body. You need not check his pulse to know that he has already passed.>', 33160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Terenthis\' eyes stare unblinking into the distance, betraying the sorrow of his last moments.>', '<Terenthis\' eyes stare unblinking into the distance, betraying the sorrow of his last moments.>', 33159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Grondal reaches futilely towards you as you approach, but his arm collapses as life slips from him.>', '<Grondal reaches futilely towards you as you approach, but his arm collapses as life slips from him.>', 33158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Dalmond\'s body looks almost peaceful, buried only slightly in the sand.>', '<Dalmond\'s body looks almost peaceful, buried only slightly in the sand.>', 33157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you turn Barithras\' limp body over in the water, a brutal injury on his head makes it very apparent why he did not make it.>', '<As you turn Barithras\' limp body over in the water, a brutal injury on his head makes it very apparent why he did not make it.>', 33156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gershala rolls onto his side to look at you as you approach and you see a hopeful smile creep onto his face.>', '<Gershala rolls onto his side to look at you as you approach and you see a hopeful smile creep onto his face.>', 33151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A whisper escapes Shaldyn\'s throat as you approach.>\n\nHelp... please.', '<A whisper escapes Shaldyn\'s throat as you approach.>\n\nHelp... please.', 33150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Volcor\'s body lies motionless.  As you begin to move away, a hand reaches out and grabs your ankle. He\'s alive!>', '<Volcor\'s body lies motionless.  As you begin to move away, a hand reaches out and grabs your ankle. He\'s alive!>', 33149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impertinent whelps, you dare challenge me atop my pedestal? I will crush you myself!', '', 33148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you approach, you hear Cerellean gasp for breath. He looks to stand a chance if rescued soon.>', '<As you approach, you hear Cerellean gasp for breath. He looks to stand a chance if rescued soon.>', 33147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Allyndia\'s body bobs gently in the surf. It appears that she\'s been dead for some time.>', '<Allyndia\'s body bobs gently in the surf. It appears that she\'s been dead for some time.>', 33146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interlopers! You mortals who dare to interfere with my sport will pay.... Wait--you...', '', 33145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That\'s where you\'ll find more... disreputable types.', 'If you are seeking a locksmith, might I suggest the sewers? That\'s where you\'ll find more... disreputable types.', 33144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Him Walter Soref. Work in Rogue District. He make keys.', 'Him Walter Soref. Work in Rogue District. He make keys.', 33143, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be after Benik Boltshear, then. He\'s located in the heart of the Dwarven District by the blacksmiths.', 'You\'ll be after Benik Boltshear, then. He\'s located in the heart of the Dwarven District by the blacksmiths.', 33142, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Locksmith', 'Locksmith', 33141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings $c!  Welcome aboard the Cloudkisser.  Northrend can be a very harsh place.  I hope you have prepared yourself.', 33140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to return to Archdruid Lilliandra. Can you send me back to her?', 'I wish to return to Archdruid Lilliandra. Can you send me back to her?', 33139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the help of our new taunka allies, the Northrend will belong to the Horde.', '', 33138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BWhen the Horde controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.$B$BThe battle currently ensues. Hurry to Wintergrasp to support our forces.', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BWhen the Horde controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.$B$BThe battle currently ensues. Hurry to Wintergrasp to support our forces.', 33137, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BWhen the Alliance controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.$B$BThe battle currently enues. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BWhen the Alliance controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.$B$BThe battle currently enues. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!', 33136, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, friend. Enjoying Noblegarden, I hope? Why not join in the fun?', 'Well met, friend. Enjoying Noblegarden, I hope? Why not join in the fun?', 33135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, friend! Have you come to serve the sons of Azeroth in battle?', '', 33132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab the explosive on the docks and bring down those doors, men!', 'Grab the explosive on the docks and bring down those doors, men!', 33131, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab the explosive on the docks and bring down those doors, men!', 'Grab the explosive on the docks and bring down those doors, men!', 33130, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s senses his destiny!', '', 33129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This entire holiday is nonsensical. Colored eggs and \"life affirmation,\" bah.', 'This entire holiday is nonsensical. Colored eggs and \"life affirmation,\" bah.', 33128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yah, mon, this be the time to be glad of life and spring. Ya collect lots of eggs yet?', 'Yah, mon, this be the time to be glad of life and spring. Ya collect lots of eggs yet?', 33127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is the time in which we pay homage to the birth of life, and the eggs are symbols representing the spring and rebirth. May you enjoy the spring.', 'Now is the time in which we pay homage to the birth of life, and the eggs are symbols representing the spring and rebirth. May you enjoy the spring.', 33126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re celebrating spring during Noblegarden. Affirmation of life and all that.', 'We\'re celebrating spring during Noblegarden. Affirmation of life and all that.', 33125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noblegarden is the time when the druids of Azeroth celebrate the rebirth of life. The eggs are a symbol of fertility and an excellent way to bring everyone into the spirit, don\'t you think?', 'Noblegarden is the time when the druids of Azeroth celebrate the rebirth of life. The eggs are a symbol of fertility and an excellent way to bring everyone into the spirit, don\'t you think?', 33124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noblegarden time! I\'ve already found a lot of eggs. Great weather for the hunt, eh?', 'Noblegarden time! I\'ve already found a lot of eggs. Great weather for the hunt, eh?', 33123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, if people want to run around rooting in the dirt for colored eggs, who am I to judge? I still get a cut of the profits on paint, and I invested in chickens this year.', 'Hey, if people want to run around rooting in the dirt for colored eggs, who am I to judge? I still get a cut of the profits on paint, and I invested in chickens this year.', 33122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The celebration of the natural processes of the world is silly; it\'s going to happen whether we celebrate or not! But it\'s a great excuse for sugar!', 'The celebration of the natural processes of the world is silly; it\'s going to happen whether we celebrate or not! But it\'s a great excuse for sugar!', 33121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Candy! That\'s what I\'m talking about; I just wish I didn\'t have to run around finding it!', 'Candy! That\'s what I\'m talking about; I just wish I didn\'t have to run around finding it!', 33120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come for Noblegarden once again! Time to thank the Light for the rebirth of the world.', 'The time has come for Noblegarden once again! Time to thank the Light for the rebirth of the world.', 33119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Noblegarden. So amusing to watch others throw away their dignity in favor of hunting colored eggs. Still, they do have a curious magical aura to them...', 'Ah, Noblegarden. So amusing to watch others throw away their dignity in favor of hunting colored eggs. Still, they do have a curious magical aura to them...', 33118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seem to have misplaced the Horn of the Peaks.', 'I seem to have misplaced the Horn of the Peaks.', 33117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death... will not stop me.', '', 33116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend da\' siege, $n! Smash dem walls!', '', 33115, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The Glacial Falls be to the east, mon. Bring back da best armor ya be findin\'. Those Alliance won\'t know what hit \'em.', '', 33114, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect our war machines, $n! Fight for the glory of the Alliance!', '', 33113, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory or Death, $n!', '', 33112, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash da\' siege, $n! Murp will know.', '', 33111, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elemental embers burn hotter than Durotar during the fire festival. The Alliance cannot be permitted to claim them!', '', 33110, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slay them all, $n!', '', 33109, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Glacial Falls be to the east, mon. Bring back da best armor ya be findin\'. Those Alliance won\'t know what hit \'em.', '', 33108, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance disgrace this land with their villainous poaching. Don\'t hesitate to claim the herbs from their corpses!', '', 33107, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forest is on the western side of Wintergrasp. Just look for the soul-leeching shades, I\'m sure they\'ll be glad to have some company...', '', 33106, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring us victory, $n, and we shall grant you the honor you deserve! Fight for the Alliance!', '', 33105, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Glacial Falls is a dangerous place, $n. The Horde will be just as happy to claim your armor for their vile hoodoo magics.', 33104, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy their foul machines of war, $n!', '', 33103, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop the Horde from retrieving the embers, $n. We cannot risk them having the advantage when the battle resumes!', '', 33102, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show those animals no mercy, $n!', '', 33101, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be safe, $n. Remember, the Horde are also seeking the dragon bones. It might be easier to kill them than to kill the shades.', '', 33100, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n. The health of our soldiers depends upon your success.', 33099, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar! Have you come to serve the Horde in battle?', '', 33098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will send word that you have discovered the link to the Defias. I was a fool to think them broken with the defeat of Edwin VanCleef, and King Wrynn will want to make an example of all who remain.', 33097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meanwhile, the king managed to escape his captors, and returned to Stormwind to deal with Onyxia.', 33096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your help enabled us to connect the Defias to the mastermind behind the abduction, Onyxia, who was posing as a member of the royal court.', 33095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
