('The main chamber is this way! Let\'s go!', '', 32945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KILL THEM! My work must not be interrupted!', '', 32944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let them pass, minions!', '', 32943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ONWARD!', '', 32942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay alert and on guard. There\'s no telling what horrors await us.', '', 32941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde. By the looks of the struggle, they are here in force - somewhere.', '', 32940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s happened here? There are corpses everywhere... the stench... overwhelming...', 32939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers, fall in! Guard the halls!', '', 32938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your aberrations are no match for the Alliance, Putress! We\'re coming for you!', '', 32937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome.', 'Welcome.', 32936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', 'Greetings.', 32935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Highlord.', 'I\'m ready, Highlord.', 32933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you are.  Are you ready then?  Once we start, there is no turning back.', '', 32932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, $n.  Where are your cultist robes?', '', 32931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to join the battle against the wyrms. Do you have an eagle ready for me, Fjorlin?', 'I am ready to join the battle against the wyrms. Do you have an eagle ready for me, Fjorlin?', 32930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Stormheart sent me to be tested as a frostborn would.  I am ready for my test, Fjorlin.', 'King Stormheart sent me to be tested as a frostborn would.  I am ready for my test, Fjorlin.', 32929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Apothecary Putress unleashes the Engorged Blight Worm!', '', 32928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve finally caught up with you, Arthas.', '', 32927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I tell you, it sure is fun to see you work!  And you sure go through a lot of bombers!', 32926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve been just as busy blowing yourself up as you have blowing up the opposition.  That sounds fun, but be careful or I\'ll stop giving you bombers...', 32925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain in your chest will soon be gone... never to return!', '', 32924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The human blood in your veins is but a detriment.  Rid yourself of all emotion!', '', 32923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I just got order to pull your flight privilege, $n.  Came back later and we\'ll let you back into a bomber.', 32922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not worry, Arthas.  Soon you will not need your heart.', '', 32921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rid yourself of your humanity and you will never bleed again!', '', 32920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been a busy day in the air, eh $n?  Maybe you should take a moment to catch your breath before going back out.', 32919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your heart and your humanity hold you back, Arthas.', '', 32918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve taken a lot of bombers out and don\'t have much to show for it.  Use more caution or your flight priveledges will be revoked...', 32917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your orders have been revoked until further notice.  Cool your jets and try to be more careful out there!', 32916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The queen\'s consort nods in acknowledgment of your presence.>', '', 32915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mulfunction.  Error Code: .- .- .-', '', 32914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I.am.a.robot.', '', 32913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to die!', '', 32912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done. You may now open the focusing iris.', 32911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, we must speak when the queen is done with you.', '', 32910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dolt.', '', 32909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '', 32908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What were we on?  \'D\'?', '', 32907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s holds up a finger.', '', 32906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Craven?! I am most certainly not! Are we not in the middle of a war z... ah.', '', 32905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Craven.', '', 32904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Braggart.', '', 32903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrogant.', '', 32902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AGH!', '', 32901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re right, of course, it\'s a terrible practice.', '', 32900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop agreeing with me!', '', 32899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snake, then, if you prefer.', '', 32898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snake.', '', 32897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A lowly worm, I\'m sure.', '', 32896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are beneath me.', '', 32895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, of course.', '', 32894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merely being in your presence is an affront to my beliefs.', '', 32893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No doubt.', '', 32892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should leave you to rot in this sewer with the filth.', '', 32891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to head further into Storm Peaks.', 'I am ready to head further into Storm Peaks.', 32890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have decades of practice handling blowhards like yourself, and I\'m the only one you know here in this abominably freezing land.', '', 32889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s smirks wryly.', '', 32888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remind me again why I tolerate your company, Asric.', '', 32887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh.. perhaps, after another drink.', '', 32886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps, but with the opportunity to make names for ourselves! Think of the reception you\'d have in Shattrath as the savior of Azeroth, slayer of the Scourge!', '', 32885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Penniless and away from what we know in the middle of the frozen, undead-infested northland.', '', 32884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come off it, Jadaar. That\'s all I\'ve heard out of you for months. No matter what happened, the point is we\'re free agents now! No longer tied to politics or duties, able to roam where we will!', '', 32883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rolls his eyes.', '', 32882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My failure?! MY FAILURE?! It was your incompetence that landed us here, you insufferable prat!', '', 32881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was your doing, not mine, windbag. I found myself unemployed due to my unfortunate association with your failure.', '', 32880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And above it all, I somehow find myself saddled with you, the very man who caused me to lose my job in the first place!', '', 32879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disgusting, I agree.', '', 32878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at us, elf. Look at us. Unemployed, destitute, and drinking swill from an establishment in the sewers named after a carrion bird!', '', 32877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Underbelly Croc stares at you hungrily as he licks his chops.', 'Underbelly Croc stares at you hungrily as he licks his chops.', 32875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise, Sindragosa!  Rise and lead the Frostbrood into war!', '', 32874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, it\'s you, $n! Welcome into our sanctuary. Rest and refresh yourself; you have more than earned it.', '', 32873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are welcome here, friend and ally of the Dragonflights. Take your rest here in our halls.', '', 32872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Ah, fantastic to see you out and about. Busy as always, hm?', '$n! Ah, fantastic to see you out and about. Busy as always, hm?', 32871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, wonderful to see you. Wonderful.', '$n, wonderful to see you. Wonderful.', 32870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You couldn\'t ask for a finer person than $n, I say.', 'You couldn\'t ask for a finer person than $n, I say.', 32869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine example of a $g man:woman;, that $n.', 'A fine example of a $g man:woman;, that $n.', 32868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you\'re an inspiration.', '$n, you\'re an inspiration.', 32867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There goes the finest $c I have the honor of knowing.', 'There goes the finest $c I have the honor of knowing.', 32866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right away, your majesty!', 32865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re integral to our operation here, $n.', 'You\'re integral to our operation here, $n.', 32864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Still fighting the good fight?', '$n! Still fighting the good fight?', 32863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done the Crusade proud, $n!', 'You\'ve done the Crusade proud, $n!', 32862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re relieved to see you whole, $n.', 'We\'re relieved to see you whole, $n.', 32861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is here!', '$n is here!', 32860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('What is this?! Stand your ground! Don\'t give them an inch!', '', 32859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our descent into the depths of depravity begins! Be on guard! Jaina, lend us your strength!', '', 32858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you still breathe, $n.', 'Good to see you still breathe, $n.', 32857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onward, brothers and sisters! Destiny awaits!', '', 32856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avoid becoming plagued, $n. You deserve better.', 'Avoid becoming plagued, $n. You deserve better.', 32855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, your strength is inspiring.', '$n, your strength is inspiring.', 32854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay alive, $n.', 'Stay alive, $n.', 32853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful with yourself, $n. I might actually hesitate for an instant if I saw your undead husk on the field.', 'Be careful with yourself, $n. I might actually hesitate for an instant if I saw your undead husk on the field.', 32852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will guard this place, $n, and hope for your safe return.', 'We will guard this place, $n, and hope for your safe return.', 32851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be safe, $n.', 'Be safe, $n.', 32850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The march upon the Undercity begins now! Be empowered by your King\'s strength! Follow me, heroes! FOR THE GLORY OF THE ALLIANCE!', '', 32849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care and be safe, mortal; you are a valuable ally we do not wish to lose.', 'Take care and be safe, mortal; you are a valuable ally we do not wish to lose.', 32848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hour of redemption is close at hand! Prepare yourselves!', '', 32847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the key to open the Focusing Iris.', 'Use the key to open the Focusing Iris.', 32846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Focusing Iris thrums, holding back an inconceivable amount of restrained power!', '', 32845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon we will march upon this cursed place and cleanse it of its evil!', '', 32844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes of the Alliance, your King calls! Gather behind me at the entrance to the sewers!', '', 32843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are victorious on the Wintergrasp battlefield!  The fortress is ours!  ', '', 32842, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are victorious on the Wintergrasp battlefield!  The fortress is ours!  ', '', 32841, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforcements are needed on the Wintergrasp battlefield!  I have opened a portal for quick travel to the battle at Sunreaver\'s Sanctuary.', '', 32840, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, of course, but please be more careful in the future.', 32839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforcements are needed on the Wintergrasp battlefield!  I have opened a portal for quick travel to the battle at The Silver Enclave.', '', 32838, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final battle will begin soon, $n. Stand at attention!', '', 32837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh great Queen of the Dragons, I have somehow misplaced my Heroic Key to the Focusing Iris. Can you find it for me?', 'Oh great Queen of the Dragons, I have somehow misplaced my Heroic Key to the Focusing Iris. Can you find it for me?', 32836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting for duty, your majesty! Let the assault begin!', 'Reporting for duty, your majesty! Let the assault begin!', 32834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle for control of Wintergrasp will begin in 5 minutes!', '', 32833, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh great Queen of the Dragons, I have somehow misplaced my Key to the Focusing Iris. Can you find it for me?', 'Oh great Queen of the Dragons, I have somehow misplaced my Key to the Focusing Iris. Can you find it for me?', 32832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle for control of Wintergrasp will begin in 15 minutes!', '', 32831, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All this fighting is finally getting to you, $n.  Do not worry, I will not divulge your little secret -- lest the others think you\'re mad.$B$BGet some rest.  It\'ll do you good.', '', 32830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand ready, $n. We attack when all of our forces have arrived!', '', 32829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Koltira... this might sound strange, but I keep seeing some kid\'s ghost.  Matthias Lehner... does the name mean anything to you?', 'Koltira... this might sound strange, but I keep seeing some kid\'s ghost.  Matthias Lehner... does the name mean anything to you?', 32828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take your much deserved rest in the peace of the temple, $n.', 'Take your much deserved rest in the peace of the temple, $n.', 32827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to have you among us, $n.', 'It is an honor to have you among us, $n.', 32826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome $n, dragonfriend.', 'Welcome $n, dragonfriend.', 32825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
