('The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.', 'The Magical Menagerie is located in northeast Dalaran. Pet supplies, exotic mounts, and stables are all available there.', 32668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aimee\'s cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.', 'Aimee\'s cart can usually be found in northern Dalaran, near the Bank of Dalaran.', 32667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The process is finally complete! My work here is done.', '', 32666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies.$B$BIf you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.', 'Red at Glorious Goods in southeast Dalaran can provide most general trade supplies.$B$BIf you need something more specialized, try the Magus Commerce Exchange. Each trade shop there has its own supply vendor.', 32665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('finds the coin face down for tails!', 'finds the coin face down for tails!', 32664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('catches the coin heads up!', 'catches the coin heads up!', 32663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve only Sargeras! You shall join him too someday, mortal...', '', 32662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twisting Nether\'s coldest reaches shall not hide you from my vengeance.', '', 32661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I play all of my records backwards. Except for the ones by Arrowsmite and Sons.', '', 32660, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have delved too far into our magics. I will claim your soul myself!', '', 32659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear your kind squeals like a felhunter when roasted alive over a fire.', '', 32658, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d sooner serve the Dark Lord Alexander than be your pitiful pet.', '', 32657, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jepetto Joybuzz\'s Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.', 'Jepetto Joybuzz\' Wonderworks in western Dalaran carries such items.', 32656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be nothing when compared to the satisfaction I will feel when I crush your skull beneath my heel.', '', 32655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I am ever freed of these chains, I will return one day and slay you myself.', '', 32654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.', 'The Arsenal Absolute in southeast Dalaran carries all manner of melee weapons.', 32653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hunter\'s Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.', 'The Hunter\'s Reach in eastern Dalaran sells guns, bows, ammunition and the like.', 32652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.', 'The Militant Mystic in southern Dalaran should have what you desire.', 32651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.', 'You\'ll find what you are looking for at One More Glass in northern Dalaran.', 32650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance horns? Stay on guard!', '', 32649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall, Sylvanas...', '', 32648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such will be the fate of all enemies of the Horde, Warchief.  Now we must deal with the wretch, Putress.', 32647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark Lady, join me! You have fought hard and spilled much blood for this right. The Royal Quarter belongs to you!', '', 32646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks for saving my existence in this timeline. Now I must report back to my superiors. They must know immediately of what I just experienced.', '', 32645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Undercity belongs to the Horde once more! LOK\'TAR!', '', 32644, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WE ARE VICTORIOUS!', '', 32643, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My time... has run out...', '', 32642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your timeline is no more!', '', 32641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insignificant.', '', 32640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you interfere with our work!', '', 32639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('casually flips his |Hitem:44430|h|cff0070dd[Titanium Seal of Dalaran]|r|h.', 'casually flips her |Hitem:44430|h|cff0070dd[Titanium Seal of Dalaran]|r|h.', 32638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was an accident. I was framed. Don\'t drop me!', 'It was an accident. I was framed. Don\'t drop me!', 32637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got it all wrong. I\'m a subjugator!', 'You\'ve got it all wrong. I\'m a subjugator!', 32636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a sentry!', 'Not a sentry!', 32635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOOO!', 'NOOOOOO!', 32634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, who\'s the joker that threw an orb at me?', 'Okay, who\'s the joker that threw an orb at me?', 32633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel funny all of a sudden.  Er?!', 'I feel funny all of a sudden.  Er?!', 32632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a minute, I didn\'t activate my...?', 'Wait a minute, I didn\'t activate my...?', 32631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?!', 'What?!', 32630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The red dragonflight will take on the burden of mending the devastation wrought on Azeroth. Return home to your people and rest. Tomorrow will bring you new challenges, and you must be ready to face them. Life... goes on.', 32629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This resolution pains me deeply, but the destruction, the monumental loss of life had to end. Regardless of Malygos\' recent transgressions, I will mourn his loss. He was once a guardian, a protector. This day, one of the world\'s mightiest has fallen.', 32628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so ends the Nexus War. ', 32627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did what I had to, brother. You gave me no alternative.', 32626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champions! My children, blessed with my power, shall aid you in your fight!', 32625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not die so quickly this time!', '', 32624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only a fool would mock the appearance of my battle-garb.$B$BThis raiment of well-worn steel is from an ancient place of learning!', '', 32623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('The prisoner sobs desperately, waiting for the end to come.', 'The prisoner sobs desperately, waiting for the end to come.', 32622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King is here.  May the Light guide our blades.', '', 32621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something\'s wrong... I sense a dark presence.', '', 32620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here it comes.  Stand ready.', '', 32619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU HAVE FAILED ME, VARIMATHRAS!', '', 32618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years... wasted...', '', 32617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your heads down and follow my lead.', '', 32616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We lost many to the faceless ones, my lord.  But we succeeded in retrieving the heart from Naz\'anak.', 'We lost many to the faceless ones, my lord.  But we succeeded in retrieving the heart from Naz\'anak.', 32615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot hold... Destabilizing...', '', 32614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not fail! Not again!', '', 32613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such power! Can you not feel it, mortals? Cease this foolishness and join me!', '', 32612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need more time... The Master is near...', '', 32611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too long... Tireless, endless planning... It will not end like this...', '', 32610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They do not die; they do not live. They are outside the cycle.', '', 32609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where one falls, many shall take its place.', '', 32608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('They drink your fear: it is the blood of life.', '', 32607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their shadow will choke the land for eternity.', '', 32606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are the whisper on the shivering wind.', '', 32605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze into the void. It is the perpetuity in which they dwell.', '', 32604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'kafh an\'shel. Yoq\'al shn ky ywaq nuul.', '', 32603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ywaq maq oou; ywaq maq ssaggh. Ywaq ma shg\'fhn.', '', 32602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iilth vwah, uhn\'agth fhssh za.', '', 32601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ywaq puul skshgn: on\'ma yeh\'glu zuq.', '', 32600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uulwi gag erh\'ongg w\'ssh.', '', 32599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ywaq ma phgwa\'cul hnakf.', '', 32598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They who dine on lost souls know only hunger.', '', 32597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shgla\'yos plahf mh\'naus.', '', 32596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only shadows from the past remain.  There\'s nothing left to redeem!', '', 32595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You surely wouldn\'t destroy humanity\'s only chance to redeem its most wayward son.  You\'d sooner die!', '', 32594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I call your bluff.  You\'re a paladin after all.  Your obsession with redemption goes beyond the inane.', '', 32593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sound a little too confident.  Especially considering the way our last encounter ended.', '', 32592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The heart... the last remaining vestige of your humanity.  I had to stop it from being destroyed.  I had to see for myself.  And at last I\'m sure...', '', 32590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That might be, but I don\'t need to stand on holy ground to run that disembodied heart of yours with the Ashbringer.', '', 32589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last time we met, you had the advantage of fighting on holy ground.  You\'ll find that our situation has been... reversed.', '', 32588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t be worryin\' \'bout no Lich Kings. Seen a lotta big-shots come and go, dey always messin\' somethin\' up. It ain\'t long aftah that when a posse rolls on through and sends dem quick on dey way to da history books. Dis one ain\'t no different.', 32587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I always be up for a nice three-finger discount. Stealin\' be all in the wrist... and when that fails ya, then ya stick somethin\' sharp in between the ribs, and that\'s all in the wrist too.$B$BSkilled hands be worth more than a steady paycheck, ya heard?', 32586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must confess... you were not altogether unexpected.  I hope you find your final resting place... to your liking.', '', 32585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?', '', 32584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LET\'S GO! QUICKLY!', '', 32583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uninvited guests!  Did you think you\'d go unnoticed inside my dominion?', '', 32582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When it comes to treasure, never be lookin\' sideways at lootin\' someone else\'s junk. Stolen goods be much sweeter, ya? But free is free, no matta how it got that way!', 32581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to your future -- what little there is left of it...', '', 32580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousand-thousand pardons, Master! I will deal with these intruders myself!', '', 32579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time.  May the Light give us strength.', '', 32578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a lead on Norgannon\'s keystone, which guards access to Ulduar\'s archives, but the Titans divided it into two pieces and secreted them away.$B$BOne of the pieces, the keystone\'s shell, is held within the Inventor\'s Library on the northern coast, south of Ulduar itself. The first thing you\'ll need to do is retrieve the fragments of an access disk from the library\'s guardians.', '', 32577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of help do you require?', 'What kind of help do you require?', 32576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great spirits of the earth, help us in our hour of need!', '', 32575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '', 32574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light for that.', '', 32573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry too much. By the time I went off duty, we hadn\'t found a scrap of befouled grain here.', '', 32572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The soldiers are doing important work. The safety of the people is more important, Mal, if you\'re interested in your customers living to spend another day.', '', 32571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t argue with that.', '', 32570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grudgingly nods.', '', 32569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring down the halls! NOW!', '', 32568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Royal Quarter is just up ahead, Warchief.', 32567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m interested.', 'I\'m interested.', 32566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('COWARD! You think to stop the Warchief of the Horde with pebbles? I will show you the true power of the elements!', '', 32565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We come for you! Prepare yourself!', '', 32564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, hold on just one second.  I see you\'re not riding a flying mount of your own.$B$BYou probably won\'t be of much use to the other goblins here if you can\'t get around.  They\'ve paid me to loan my used mounts to people such as yourself -- at no cost to you.$B$BInterested?', '', 32563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, friend.  Something I can do for ya?', '', 32562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 32561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough, Michael. Business is hurting enough with this scare as it is. We can use every copper.', '', 32560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The door seal is about to collapse! All is lost if the Blue Dragonflight breaks through the door!', 32559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only half of the door seal\'s strength remains! You must fight on!', 32558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Adventurers, the door is beginning to weaken!', 32557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may only fly in Icecrown, Sholazar Basin and the Storm Peaks.', 'You may only fly in Icecrown, Sholazar Basin and the Storm Peaks.', 32556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to open a Twilight Portal!', '', 32554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that all, demon? Have you nothing left to throw at us?', '', 32553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde now controls Wintergrasp Fortress. Use the portal, if you like.$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde now controls Wintergrasp Fortress. Use the portal, if you like.$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 32552, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance now controls Wintergrasp Fortress. Use the portal, if you like.$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance now controls Wintergrasp Fortress. Use the portal, if you like.$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 32551, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BWhen the Horde controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BWhen the Horde controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 32550, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport me to Lake Wintergrasp.', 'Teleport me to Lake Wintergrasp.', 32549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BWhen the Alliance controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BWhen the Alliance controls Wintergrasp Fortress, I will open a portal for those who wish to travel there.$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k.', 32548, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think not. When I\'ve finished beating the arrogance out of you, I\'ll impale your corpse on the spikes as an example to any other \'heroes\'!', '', 32547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you can wrest this rampart from my control?', '', 32546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No hope for you!', '', 32545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The air around you crackles as Khanok the Impassable appears!', '', 32544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the mighty... can fall.', '', 32543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told ya so!', '', 32542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who needs gods when we ARE gods?', '', 32541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a rush!', '', 32540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say hello to my BIG friend!', '', 32539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KILL THEM ALL!', '', 32538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gut them! Impale them!', '', 32537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna see power? I\'m gonna show you power!', '', 32536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t gonna be nothin\' left after this!', '', 32535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna spill your guts, mon!', '', 32534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s makes a strange noise that translates as laughter in your mind.', '', 32533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
