('Did you enjoy my minion\'s terrible creation? Potent, is it not?', '', 32376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my kingdom of darkness!', '', 32375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My men are prepped and ready - just give us the word!', '', 32374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suited up and ready to go, sir!', '', 32373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to work Cultists!', '', 32372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Brann. Let\'s make the keystone.', 'I\'m ready, Brann. Let\'s make the keystone.', 32371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Ymirheim or your jumpbot will fall to pieces!', '', 32370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great water spirit, wash away this corruption!', '', 32369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must answer to the elements, demon!', '', 32368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great wind brother, clear our path!', '', 32367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ONWARD!', '', 32366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, whoa, whoa! Keep it down, $n. Keep it down!$B$B<Blast looks around.>$B$BWe don\'t want those frosty vrykul noticing us, now do we?$B$BWhat do you think of my jumpbot? I based it off of the mechagnome. Pretty slick, huh?', '', 32365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh my gosh! Keep your voice down, $n! What? Are you trying to get us killed?!$B$BOf course I know who you are! Who in the Alliance doesn\'t know the name, $n?!$B$BSay, what do you think of my jumpbot? She\'s based off of the mechagnome design. Sleek and aerodynamic!', 32364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle for the Undercity begins now! Sound the horns of war! Champions of the Horde, be empowered by the might of your Warchief!', '', 32363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of wind, carry to Saurfang the Younger the song of war! May ALL of our fallen brethren be vindicated by this battle!\n', '', 32362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather behind me at the gates of the Undercity! Soon we march upon our fallen city and reclaim it - FOR THE HORDE!', '', 32361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements are with us in force, $n. With their help, we will do all that is in our power to stop Varimathras and Putress! LOK\'TAR OGAR!', '', 32360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Warchief.', 'I am ready, Warchief.', 32359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to begin the assault and win back the Undercity for the Horde, $n?', '', 32358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where did you learn that?', 32357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fight like a beast!', 32356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What the--?!', 32355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', '$n\'s exotic fighting technique throws the Drakerider off-balance.', 32354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for keeping us covered back there! We\'ll hold the gate while we wait for reinforcements.', '', 32353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work! We can only rest a moment.', '', 32352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright boys, let\'s do this!', '', 32351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders! Who trespasses in the Old Kingdom?', '', 32350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On duty. GO. AWAY.', 'On duty. GO. AWAY.', 32348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? I\'m busy here.', 'What? I\'m busy here.', 32347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorta busy.', 'Sorta busy.', 32346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hum of magic energy in the air diminishes...', '', 32345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me a bomber!', 'Give me a bomber!', 32344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The air battle rages close, $n.  Both we and the Horde send bombers into the Bombardment and the Valley of Lost Hope.  Will you enter the fray?', 32343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I call to you great spirits! Grant the Horde your blessing! For on this day our cause is righteous and just!', '', 32342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though we face great conflict, our might combined shall obliterate those who would oppose us! The grave injustices committed against the Horde will be met by an unstoppable force of reckoning!', '', 32341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder, champions of the Horde! We fight on this day for our fallen brothers and sisters! Mourn them not for they all died with honor in their hearts!', '', 32340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEROES OF THE HORDE, YOUR WARCHIEF CALLS!', '', 32339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shouldn\'t have done that!  He\'s not going to like it.', '', 32338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Retrain me in Cloth Scavenging.', 'Retrain me in Cloth Scavenging.', 32337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day to you!', '', 32336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The aura fades away, allowing healing once more!', '', 32335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An aura of necrotic energy blocks all healing!', '', 32334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rushes to attack once more!', '', 32333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s teleports and begins to channel a spell!', '', 32332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s teleports to the balcony above!', '', 32331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll burn it to the ground before giving it to you!', 'We\'ll burn it to the ground before giving it to you!', 32330, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re taking it back!', 'We\'re taking it back!', 32329, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BURN IN HELLFIRE!', 'BURN IN HELLFIRE!', 32328, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s for Saurfang!', 'This one\'s for Saurfang!', 32327, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FIRE IN THE HOLE!', 'FIRE IN THE HOLE!', 32326, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is there anything you can pay me to do?', 32325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The polarity has shifted!', '', 32324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good Morning!', '', 32323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What can I be helping you with?', 32322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s decimates all nearby flesh!', '', 32321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help?', '', 32320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s injects you with a mutagen!', '', 32319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sprays slime across the room!', '', 32318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh... RAAAAAGH! Never thought... I would be free of him....', '', 32317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pestilence upon you!', '', 32316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uunak-hissss tik-k-k-k-k!', '', 32315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your armor is useless against my locusts!', '', 32314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth, my brethren! Feast on their flesh!', '', 32313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auum na-l ak-k-k-k, isshhh.', '', 32312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon the master\'s voice will call to you.', '', 32311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have made your choice.', '', 32310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall experience my torment first hand!', '', 32309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eternal agony awaits you!', '', 32308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The central gate opens!', '', 32307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s teleports into the fray!', '', 32306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spiderlings appear on the web!', 32305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s sprays strands of web everywhere!', 32304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s spins her web into a cocoon!', 32303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to page 2.', 'Take me to page 2.', 32302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TEXT GOES HERE', '', 32301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor\'kron, prepare transport to the Undercity.', '', 32300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell, Warchief. I pray that the next time we meet it will be as allies.', 32299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fear that the rage will consume him, Thrall. I remain hopeful that reason will prevail, but we must prepare for the worst... for war.', 32298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bolvar was like a brother to him. In the King\'s absence, Bolvar kept the Alliance united. He found strength for our people in our darkest hours. He watched over Anduin, raising him as his own. ', 32297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will deliver this information to King Wrynn, Thrall, but...', 32296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will make this right, Jaina. Tell your king all that you have learned here.', '', 32295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we are forced into a conflict, the Lich King will destroy our divided forces in Northrend.', '', 32294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We now prepare to lay siege to the city and bring the perpetrators of this unforgivable crime to justice.', '', 32293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has lost the Undercity.', '', 32292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As the combined Horde and Alliance forces began their assault upon the Wrath Gate, an uprising broke out in the Undercity. Varimathras and hordes of his demonic brethren attacked. Hundreds of my people were slain in the coup. I barely managed to escape with my life.', 32291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Proudmoore, the Warchief speaks the truth. This subterfuge was set in motion by Varimathras and Grand Apothecary Putress. It was not the Horde\'s doing.', 32290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, what happened at the Wrath Gate. It was a betrayal from within...', '', 32289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thrall, what has happened? The King is preparing for war...', 32288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina...', '', 32287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor\'kron, stand down!', '', 32286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arthas\'s weakness is his pride. That weakness only grows as his power does. The Ebon Blade will have its chance to strike at the once-prince - of that I have no doubt.', '', 32285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Weeping Quarry!', '', 32284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be grateful... but I long ago lost the capacity....', '', 32283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dinner time, my pets!', '', 32282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They hunger....', '', 32281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense the living. Be ready.', '', 32280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear footsteps. Be on your guard.', '', 32279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep an eye on that tunnel. We must not let anyone through!', '', 32278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gate must be protected at all costs. Rip them to shreds!', '', 32277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hold the gate. Attack! Tear them limb from limb!', '', 32276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are besieged! Strike out and bring back their corpses!', '', 32275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As Anub\'arak commands!', '', 32274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were foolish to come.', '', 32273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hassh tak heeeek ta!', '', 32272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This kingdom belongs to the Scourge. Only the dead may enter!', '', 32271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Seize control of a Lithe Stalker through the eye.>', '<Seize control of a Lithe Stalker through the eye.>', 32270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am prepared to join the assault, Keritose. Do you have a skeletal gryphon ready for me?', 'I am prepared to join the assault, Keritose. Do you have a skeletal gryphon ready for me?', 32269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can hardly believe the Cult was so careless as to leave these behind.', '', 32268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could we not have seen this coming, to think a Dreadlord could be trusted!', 'How could we not have seen this coming, to think a Dreadlord could be trusted!', 32267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That wretch Putress won\'t get away with this!', 'That wretch Putress won\'t get away with this!', 32266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forward to glory, Orcs!', 'Forward to glory, Orcs!', 32265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare for battle, it looks like the Apothecarium already has their Blight aimed at the entrance!', 'Prepare for battle, it looks like the Apothecarium already has their Blight aimed at the entrance!', 32264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heed your blades, Orcs!', 'Heed your blades, Orcs!', 32263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Travel well, hero of the Alliance!', 'Travel well, hero of the Alliance!', 32262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, $r...$b$bLeave nothing for the Scourge to raise!', 'Please, $r...$b$bLeave nothing for the Scourge to raise!', 32261, 0, 7904, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do it, $c...Then... avenge me!', 'Do it, $c...Then... avenge me!', 32260, 0, 7904, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me on my way... I beg you...', 'Send me on my way... I beg you...', 32259, 0, 7904, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell my family...$b$bMy last thoughts were of them...', 'Tell my family...$b$bMy last thoughts were of them...', 32258, 0, 7904, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t think, $c.$b$bJust... do it....', 'Don\'t think, $c.$b$bJust... do it....', 32257, 0, 7904, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, $r.$b$bRelease me...', 'Please, $r.$b$bRelease me...', 32256, 0, 7904, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DISCOVERY!   $n has discovered a new inscription!', 'DISCOVERY!   $n has discovered a new inscription!', 32255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For too long I tolerated my brother.  It is time to set things right.  It is time to destroy him and his followers.', '', 32254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our way is sacred.  We will choose death before we abandon Thorim and join the likes of the Lich King.', 32253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feeling as restless as I am, Cloudwing? Then let us fly!', 32252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m bored, Cloudwing. Go, go!', 32251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Hit!', 'Alliance Hit!', 32250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s sighs softly and rolls her shoulders.', 32249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde Hit!', 'Horde Hit!', 32248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, Cloudwing. Let\'s do a lap.', 32247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine hit me!', 'Mine hit me!', 32246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s yawns quietly into the palm of her hand.', 32245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s looks around Krasus\' Landing, bored.', 32244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All services and shops are to remain closed until further notice! That is all!', '', 32243, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tragic events have unfolded in Northrend. The Warchief is doing all that he can to keep us safe.', '', 32242, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are on the brink of all out war with the Alliance!', '', 32241, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SILENCE!', '', 32240, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is Thrall allowing this to happen to our city?', 'Why is Thrall allowing this to happen to our city?', 32239, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is an outrage!', 'This is an outrage!', 32238, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When can we reopen our shops? I\'m losing gold here!', 'When can we reopen our shops? I\'m losing gold here!', 32237, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Warchief?', 'Where is the Warchief?', 32236, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We demand answers!', 'We demand answers!', 32235, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is the city under lock down?', 'Why is the city under lock down?', 32234, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are all these Forsaken doing here?\n', 'What are all these Forsaken doing here?', 32233, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
