('The Lich King has given me power beyond your wildest nightmares. Behold!', '', 31962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! That\'s all you\'ve got? I\'m surprised you even made it to the citadel.', '', 31961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have given my all... for the Horde...', 'I have given my all... for the Horde...', 31960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the hand of the Ebon Blade has finally come to claim me. I tremble in fear.', '', 31959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have served honorably.. I shall make your victory known to all the Horde.', 'You have served honorably.. I shall make your victory known to all the Horde.', 31958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will make this as easy as possible for you.  Simply come here and die.  That is all that I ask for your many trespasses.  For your sullying of this exalted place of battle.', '', 31957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hardly a fitting introduction, Spear-Wife.  Now, who is this outsider that I\'ve been hearing so much about?', '', 31956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warriors of Jotunheim, I present to you, Blood Prince Sandoval!', 31955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, brothers, for I have failed you...', '', 31954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Argent Crusade never surrenders!', '', 31953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never take me alive!', '', 31952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From the depths of Icecrown Citadel, one of the Lich King\'s chosen comes to put an end to the existence of $n and $g his : her; friends.', 31951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face your judgment by the Light!', '', 31950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s too late to run now.  Do not leave the ring.  Die bravely, $n!', 31949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ALL HAIL $n, CHAMPION OF VALHALAS!', 31948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time of judgment is nigh. In your heart, you know justice is the only true path.', '', 31947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In defeating him, $g he : she; and $g his : her; fighting companions have proven themselves worthy of battle in this most sacred place of vrykul honor.', 31946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The unthinkable has happened... $n has slain Prince Sandoval!', 31945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must tell my brothers that I live.', '', 31944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have you to thank for my life. I will return to my comrades and spread word of your bravery. Fight the Scourge with all the strength you can muster, and we will be by your side.', '', 31943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had my fill of this place. Let us depart.', '', 31942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light\'s blessing be upon you for aiding me in my time of need, $n.', '', 31941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thane Banahogg the Deathblow has fallen to $n and $g his : her; fighting companions.  $G He : She; has but one challenge ahead of $g him : her;.  Who will it be?', 31940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thane Banahogg returns to Valhalas for the first time in ages to prove that the vrykul are the only beings worthy to fight within its sacred ring.  Will $n prove him wrong?', 31939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look to the southeast and you will see the thane upon the platform near Gjonner the Merciless when he shows himself. Let him come down.  Stay within the ring of Valhalas.', 31938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can hear Sigrid Iceborn approaching from the northwest. She has been informed that she cannot use her proto-drake in battle here. Do not leave the battle ring!', 31937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight me and die you cowards!', '', 31936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH!  You tiny insects are not worthy to do battle within this sacred place!  You do not fight with honor!  You do not even ascend! ', '', 31935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on, friend. Tell me what happened here.', 'Hold on, friend. Tell me what happened here.', 31934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gathering... information... on the Scourge.$b$bAlliance forces appeared...$b$bWe took cover - waited until they attacked the gate... then, we hit them from the rear.$b$bPinched between us... and the Scourge... it was too much for them....$b$b$g Brother:Sister;... it was... glorious.', 'Gathering... information... on the Scourge.$b$bAlliance forces appeared...$b$bWe took cover - waited until they attacked the gate... then, we hit them from the rear.$b$bPinched between us... and the Scourge... it was too much for them....$b$b$g Brother:Sister;... it was... glorious.', 31933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uhnhh.... Don\'t... bother with me.$b$bI am... finished...', 'Uhnhh.... Don\'t... bother with me.$b$bI am... finished....', 31932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The horror known as Carnage is no more.  Could it be that $n is truly worthy of battle in Valhalas?  We shall see.', 31931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From the bowels of the Underhalls comes Carnage.  Brave and foolish $n has accepted the challenge.  $G He : She; and $g his : her; group stand ready to face the monstrosity.', 31930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must unite and focus our attention upon the true threat: THE LICH KING!', '', 31929, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much of our efforts are being wasted by attacking the Horde?', '', 31928, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Judgment day comes, brothers and sisters! Will you be prepared?', '', 31927, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join the Argent Crusade! United, we shall destroy the Lich King!', '', 31926, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you not see that you play right into the Lich King\'s hands? He wants you to kill each other!', '', 31925, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters, we must remain united! The Lich King will never fall to a world divided!', '', 31924, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is madness! Cease this foolish battle!', '', 31923, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must unite and focus our attention upon the true threat: THE LICH KING!', '', 31922, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
