('$n prepares a Small Feast!', '$n prepares a Small Feast!', 31845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n prepares a Fish Feast!', '$n prepares a Fish Feast!', 31844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s prepares a Great Feast!', '%s prepares a Great Feast!', 31843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That... no, keep your filthy money! It won\'t help my family!', 'That... no, keep your filthy money! It won\'t help my family!', 31842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simpletons! You cannot comprehend the forces you have set in motion. The ley line conduit will not be disrupted! Your defeat shall be absolute!', '', 31841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, it\'s not my fault! If... if I give you a refund, maybe you can speak to a healer? I don\'t know what you expect me to do!', 31840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t try to weasel out of this!', 'Don\'t try to weasel out of this!', 31839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It wasn\'t my food!', 31838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wife and children are sick in bed because of the poison you sold me!', 'My husband and children are sick in bed because of the poison you sold me!', 31837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I am done here, I am going to mount your heads upon the walls of Azjol-Nerub!', '', 31836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew that you would come.', 31835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything I have done... has been for Azeroth....', '', 31834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunate, but necessary.', '', 31833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now do you see? Do you?!', '', 31832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only you understood!', '', 31831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much unstable energy... but worth the risk to destroy you!', '', 31830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A taste... just a small taste... of the Spell-Weaver\'s power!', '', 31829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be time for a proper thanks later, but there is still a battle to be fought!', '', 31828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without your help, I would\'ve been doomed to a life of undeath among the Lich King\'s gruesome creations.', '', 31827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light for granting me another chance. And thank you, $n.', '', 31826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
