('<The dusty journal is missing various entries>', '<The dusty journal is missing various entries>', 31445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First, an introduction.  I am Archmage Vargoth, leader of the first Kirin Tor expedition to Draenor.  We have accompanied Alliance forces through the Dark Portal, and now set up base camp - Kirin\'Var Village - in Farahlon, near the ancestral home of the Laughing Skull clan of orcs.  Such a lovely place!', 'First, an introduction.  I am Archmage Vargoth, leader of the first Kirin Tor expedition to Draenor.  We have accompanied Alliance forces through the Dark Portal, and now set up base camp - Kirin\'Var Village - in Farahlon, near the ancestral home of the Laughing Skull clan of orcs.  Such a lovely place!', 31444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
