('It\'s a pleasure to meet you as well, Archdruid. I am on a task from Tirion and time is short. Might I trouble you for a portal to Moonglade?', 'It\'s a pleasure to meet you as well, Archdruid. I am on a task from Tirion and time is short. Might I trouble you for a portal to Moonglade?', 31372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained.', 'Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained.', 31371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?', 'Greetings, mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?', 31370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is always a pleasure to meet heroes such as yourself in this forsaken land. Is there some form of assistance that I can offer you?', 31369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This pathetic siege ends NOW!', '', 31368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reckoning Bomb READY! Purge the evil from this land!', '', 31367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to ride.', 'I\'m ready to ride.', 31366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We serve Thorim, sister.', 31365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Jotunheim immediately. You can feel the Bone Witch\'s spell of possession failing!', '', 31364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such flammable little insects....', '', 31363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lava surrounding %s churns!', '', 31362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remind me how to make Northern Stew.', 'Remind me how to make Northern Stew.', 31361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
