('', 'The Fleshwerks is the heart of the Scourge\'s ghoul, abomination, and flesh giant production. If we can take it out, the Lich King will be greatly weakened.', 31342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
