('Who are you, little one?  To come speak these words to the mighty Thorim...$B$BI should... crush you!$B$BYet, you\'ve delivered me from my stupor.  Your presence here is a sign!$B$BIt was no accident that I mistook you for Sif.  What would she think of me?  I must prepare for battle.$B$BI must avenge her death and liberate the titans\' sacred grounds from my brother\'s madness!', '', 31224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It needn\'t end this way.', 'It needn\'t end this way.', 31223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ulduar... I was sworn to protect Ulduar.$B$BSworn to protect the Terrace of the Makers.$B$BSworn to protect the pacts between the races of frost.$B$BBut I failed!  I let my brother trick me.  I let him turn me against my allies.  He tricked me into blaming Sif\'s death on a dear friend, Arngrim, the king of the frost giants.$B$BAfter I realized what I\'d done... I... gave in to despair.', '', 31222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He did more than that, Thorim.  He controls Ulduar now.', 'He did more than that, Thorim.  He controls Ulduar now.', 31221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For a moment I thought you were my beloved Sif... that strand of hair... but no!  It can\'t be... Sif is dead....$B$BMy... my brother.... killed her!', '', 31220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell me what became of Sif?', 'Can you tell me what became of Sif?', 31219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve hidden from my destiny long enough.  What I must do has never been clearer.$B$BLoken must be destroyed by my hand.', '', 31218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak, $c.', '', 31217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have been found wanting and are judged accordingly. Now rise, Thane Illskar the Damned!', 31216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thane Illskar, you were challenged to honorable combat and failed.', 31215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n! How can I help you today?', 'Hello, $n! How can I help you today?', 31214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pray to your gods for a quick death.', '', 31213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have defeated my champions, $c. I am something else entirely.', '', 31212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brita, create a pincushion of this puny $c!', '', 31211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The thane spits as the first of his champions falls.', '', 31210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bethod\'s Sword?!! Very well, $r, I accept your challenge. But first, you must best my champions. Volgur! Squash this insect!', '', 31209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We discovered these proto-drakes at the Bronze Dragonshrine in the Dragonblight. We knew at once that they were kin - our blood from ages past.$B$BMy apologies, $c. You are probably confused. I am Penumbrius of the bronze dragonflight. I have taken this form out of convenience. It is much easier to communicate and live amongst mortals while in the mortal guise.$B$BHow can I help you?\n', '', 31208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Frostborn Scout appears to have breathed his last breath.>', '', 31207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You receive 7500 honor and 150 arena points.', '', 31206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mountains are rich with history... don\'t forget to stop and take it all in, $c.', '', 31205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pleased to meet you, $c.', '', 31204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, peach - good to have your company!', 31203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, peach - good to have your company!', 31202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, hello!', '', 31201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ravage the living, minions!', '', 31200, 0, 7709, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As %s falls, the altar set into the floor on his balcony begins to glow faintly.', '', 31199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RISE!', '', 31198, 0, 7709, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be your last incursion against the Scourge!', '', 31197, 0, 7709, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bethod was a great warrior, but apparently not great enough. Find me a new champion. We cannot afford this dishonor now!', '', 31196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! That horn is MINE!', '', 31195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call in all of our favors then. See to it that whatever they\'re up to, we know of it before it occurs. Then we shall see who strikes first!', '', 31194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave him chained there. I will deal with him in good time. As for the others... see to it that they do not escape!', '', 31193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them fight. If they fall to one of the lesser races then it was fated and they are worthless.', '', 31192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then you must send a messenger to the Lich King. Ready my forces to attack upon his word.', '', 31191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone called for me...?', 31190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell Hroegar that he will be at the van of my forces when I give the word for them to strike.', '', 31189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thane, I bear untimely news. Your champion, Bethod, has fallen in the ring at Valhalas. As a vargul, he has been exiled to The Underhalls.', '', 31188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Milord, there have been reports of the other thanes preparing their forces for a strike against us. We should move quickly.', '', 31187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord, this draenei was caught along with an entire contingent of death knights from The Shadow Vault. They are Knights of the Ebon Blade!', '', 31186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Ufrang, there are strangers on the ledge petitioning your warriors to honor duels. They are not vrykul.', '', 31185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thane Ufrang the Mighty, I bear ill news. The Shadow Vault over the mountain to the east has fallen.', '', 31184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The horn! Use the horn on it while it\'s weak!', '', 31183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord, Instructor Hroegar conveys that your warriors are ready. They spar on the ledge outside awaiting your orders', '', 31182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never allow you to use the Horn of Elemental Fury against us! Die, weakling!', '', 31181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You will never defeat me!', '', 31180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been chosen!', 'I have been chosen!', 31179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, friend. I\'m afraid we\'ve used all of the parts we can spare at the moment.', 'Sorry, friend. I\'m afraid we\'ve used all of the parts we can spare at the moment.', 31178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bears are beautiful creatures.  Wild, strong and fierce in battle... much like us, sister.', 31177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These mines are a dreadful place.  Fortunately, I don\'t plan on being here long.', 31176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Men -- can\'t live with them, can\'t live without them.  Well, you can... but it\'s just really boring.', 31175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me to my shame, $r.', '', 31174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'LL RISE AGAIN AND WHEN I DO I WILL HAVE MY REVENGE!', '', 31173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lorehammer is silent. This isn\'t from Stormhoof\'s time.', 'The Lorehammer is silent. This isn\'t from Stormhoof\'s time.', 31172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lorehammer is reacting. This must be from Stormhoof\'s time.', 'The Lorehammer is reacting. This must be from Stormhoof\'s time.', 31171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.  I\'ll take part in this competition.', 'Very well.  I\'ll take part in this competition.', 31170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do I care if these she-wolves and the frost giants kill each other every day?$B$BNo, no... I want Thorim to break out of his stupor and rally all his allies to retake Ulduar.$B$BThe world will be torn asunder if he fails to accomplish this!$B$BAnd of course, I\'ll reward you appropriately.', 31169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want me to take part in the Hyldsmeet to end the war?', 'You want me to take part in the Hyldsmeet to end the war?', 31168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thorim lost it.  He lashed out against his most beloved allies, the frost giants.$B$BThat\'s one reason why to this day, this land is torn apart by the war between the Hyldnir and the Sons of Hodir... and why Thorim has exiled himself to the Temple of Storms.', 31167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened then?', 'What happened then?', 31166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You see, Thorim is not like these harpies.  He\'s a worthy being of near godlike stature.$B$BHe served the titans as guardian of Ulduar and the Terrace of the Makers.$B$BThat is until his wife, Sif, was cowardly slain by his brother.', 31165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about this proposal.', 'Tell me about this proposal.', 31164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at them... all they care about is outdoing each other.', 31163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The engine\'s blown!  Fly Zak\'s Flying Machine back to K3!', '', 31162, 0, 7394, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see you at the Temple of Storms.  Looks like I\'m going to have to break her in again.', '', 31161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy there, girl!  Don\'t you recognize your old master?', '', 31160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out below!', '', 31159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets out a bellowing roar as she descends upon the nest.', '', 31158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, they are at fault, but I am powerless to stop them. Will you warn the people of Tunka\'lo, stranger, that their past and their ancestors are in danger?', '', 31157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The disturbances in the tomb, they must be involved. Look around you, $n. Do you see them?', '', 31156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is as though my memories are shrouded in mist. I cannot even recall what became of my brother. Is this how you mean that he is in danger?', '', 31155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know that a terrible enemy pursued him after he won the horn, but I... I don\'t recall... what happened... next.', '', 31154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He sought an artifact... a horn, I think. He left the village on a long journey in search of it.', '', 31153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could he be in danger? All he wanted was to give us power over the elements that made life harsh for us here.', '', 31152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brother, Stormhoof, was a far greater warrior than I. While I trained to be the chieftain of our clan, he prepared for a larger quest.', '', 31151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry to disturb your rest, chieftain, but your brother\'s spirit may be in danger. Would you tell me what you remember of him?', 'I am sorry to disturb your rest, chieftain, but your brother\'s spirit may be in danger. Would you tell me what you remember of him?', 31150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no taunka. Why have you come to the sacred burial grounds of our warriors?', '', 31149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, hello, little $r.', '', 31148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, at last... Time for a little break.', '', 31147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
