('Over here! Down on the ground! Help!', 'Over here! Down on the ground! Help!', 31136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HELP! I\'m wrapped up in webbing and unable to move!', 'HELP! I\'m wrapped up in webbing and unable to move!', 31135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHO DARES?! I AM GOING TO FLAY THE FLESH FROM YOUR BONES EVEN IF I HAVE TO DESTROY NERGELD TO GET TO YOU!', '', 31134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shape wasn\'t mine, of course.  And had you not been so reckless, you would\'ve seen past my illusion.  But you came through for me, and for that... I must thank you!', '', 31133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
