('...farewell brother.', '', 31129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions!  Take my brother and his drake to their new dwellings.  Make sure the beast makes it alive.  I have special plans for the broodmother.', '', 31128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As for your life, mortal.  I will be generous.  After all... why would I destroy my most useful servant?  I waited for you for weeks inside that Hyldnir mine.', '', 31127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH!', '', 31126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I think I saw the Lich King. It was only for a moment, but he was here... And it turned so cold, friend. So, so cold...', 'I... I think I saw the Lich King. It was only for a moment, but he was here... And it turned so cold, friend. So, so cold...', 31125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Had you not come along I would have died for sure!', 'Had you not come along I would have died for sure!', 31124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are hundreds of them! Maybe thousands! They will attack at any moment! I\'m sure of it!', 'There are hundreds of them! Maybe thousands! They will attack at any moment! I\'m sure of it!', 31123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster, hero! We must get back to the Argent Vanguard and warn them of the impending attack!', 'Faster, hero! We must get back to the Argent Vanguard and warn them of the impending attack!', 31122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re planning a huge attack! We need to warn Highlord Fordring!', 'They\'re planning a huge attack! We need to warn Highlord Fordring!', 31121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you jump into Nergeld, the rotting flesh of the construct comes to life.', '', 31120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve come for the doctor\'s plans! You\'ll only find death!', '', 31119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here! I\'m on top of the destroyed plague spreader! Help!', 'Over here! I\'m on top of the destroyed plague spreader! Help!', 31118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
