('Get me out of here, friend!', 'Get me out of here, friend!', 31113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to your little friend, you\'ve left the Temple of Storms, where you were at your strongest.  Instead we fight closer to my master\'s power.', '', 31112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately for you.... this fight is anything but fair!', '', 31111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like you can still best me in a fair fight, little brother.', '', 31110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re too late, puny one.', '', 31109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no time for this!', '', 31108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nergeld is only the first of a new army of vargul-powered flesh giants. You\'ve not known fear until now!', '', 31107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the doctor returns, your pitiful Shadow Vault will be laid to waste.', '', 31106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not let you destroy our hard work! Nergeld will be the end of you all!', '', 31105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll kill you little one and then I will add your body parts to what we\'re creating!', '', 31104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go Brann. Bring me back an epic tale when we meet again. Farewell for now, brothers.', '', 31103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, be safe Muradin. I\'d join you, but I\'m on top of the most amazing discovery the world has yet seen. I can\'t abandon it now.', '', 31102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it then. I have to return to my people, brothers. Come back to me in one piece.', '', 31101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure, Magni. I\'ll see this through, don\'t ya worry.', '', 31100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure Muradin? I just got you back after years of thinking you were dead. I do not want to lose you again.', '', 31099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
