('That\'s in the past, Muradin. Regrets won\'t change anything.', '', 31096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never give you the information you seek!', '', 31095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, I know. I watched him turn... I watched him give up all that was right and I didn\'t lift a hand... I didn\'t even consider it until it was too late.', '', 31094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s not the boy of your memories anymore, Muradin. He\'s become something else entirely.', '', 31093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magni nods.', '', 31092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Arthas.', '', 31091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The doctor entrusted me with the plans to Nergeld, our flesh giant amalgamation made entirely of vargul! It will be the most powerful creation of its kind and a whole legion of them will be created to destroy your pitiful forces!', '', 31090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not much, Magni. I\'ve had nightmares of a human... tall... light hair... death black armor. His name rests on the tip of me tongue, but...', '', 31089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it seems! And you haven\'t lost any muscle yourself. Do you remember anything of what happened, Muradin? Fate has turned ill in your absence.', '', 31088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speaking of which...', '', 31087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so good to see you again, Muradin. And what\'s this I heard about you being a King in your own right now? The Bronzebeards were always destined to greatness.', '', 31086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother! There you are! I can barely believe my eyes... you\'re alive!', '', 31085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look Lagnus, I consider you a capable man, but my patience is wearing thin. I know that Muradin is here, can you point me to him or not?!', '', 31084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not dare...', '', 31083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem eager to join your beloved Sif, brother.', '', 31082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see ya again!$B$BKing Stormheart has informed me that he will be taking his leave for a time... a grim memory brought back to him has left him with a score to settle it seems. He was very insistent that we not join him, so we have respected his wishes as we always do.$B$BI have taken responsibility for our clan in the meantime. You are still welcome with us, of course.', '', 31081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand up and fight me, you worthless traitor!  ', '', 31080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loken!!', '', 31079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('It is time I put an end to my brother\'s madness.', '', 31078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some injuries never heal, noble dwarf. A broken soul cannot be fixed.', '', 31077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the lives he has taken... Such misery and pain inflicted on the innocent. And for what?', '', 31076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no doubt of that, Dalfors, but will we be alive to see it happen?', '', 31075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That he is, Dalfors...', '', 31074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wounds will heal, child.', '', 31073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did they react so fast, Dalfors? Our plan was perfect. I just don\'t understand.', '', 31072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end, Dalfors. I\'m thinking about how close we are to seeing an end to the Scourge.', '', 31071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eversong Woods, Dalfors. I\'m thinking about how beautiful it was before Arthas cut a swathe of death through it...', '', 31070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We lost a lot a good people today, laddy. The Lich King is gonna pay for all the lives he\'s ruined!', '', 31069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to build a shredder.', 'I\'d like to build a shredder.', 31068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to build a bomber.', 'I\'d like to build a bomber.\n', 31067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, friend. Only certified officers of the Horde can authorize the purchase of a vehicle.', 'Sorry, friend. Only certified officers of the Horde can authorize the purchase of a vehicle.', 31066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s on yer mind, lad?', '', 31065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to build a fighter jet.', 'I\'d like to build a fighter jet.', 31064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krolmir... I thank you Jokkum. I hadn\'t dared hope it still existed. It shall soon see glorious battle once again!', '', 31063, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would ask your forgiveness for the suffering I have caused you and your people.', '', 31062, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to build a siege engine.', 'I\'d like to build a siege engine.', 31061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must return to Dun Niffilem. We shall speak again soon, Stormlord.', '', 31060, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We welcome the opportunity to fight by your side, mighty Thorim.', '', 31059, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to build a catapult.', 'I\'d like to build a catapult.', 31058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the great explosion filled the region, my father cast a rune at the great hammer that it might not be had by our enemies. It was his final act...', '', 31057, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $r. How can I help you today?', 'Hello, $r. How can I help you today?', 31056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to build a demolisher.', 'I\'d like to build a demolisher.', 31055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To signify our reforged friendship, I have something which belongs to you...', '', 31054, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The events of that dark day are hereby forgiven by my people.  They shall never again be spoken of.', '', 31053, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never have such humble words come from mighty Thorim. I shall deliver your words to Dun Niffelem.', '', 31052, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The deeds of your $r servant defy $g his:her; stature, Stormlord. $g His:Her; efforts have succeeded in softening the hearts of my people.', '', 31051, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It confirms our suspicions. The threads of time have been severed and rewoven in the wrong pattern. But, how?', '', 31050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lorehammer...', '', 31049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The frostborn have been very good to me. They\'re strong people.', '', 31048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They would rather die than bow before the North Wind. Something is amiss here.', '', 31046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magni! Forgive me, the memories are comin\' back slowly, brother.', '', 31045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The North Wind is the ancient enemy of the taunka, a ruler among the elements, and the very force which bleeds the life from these ancient people.', '', 31044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good te see you though, brother. More than words can say.', '', 31043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I dun know, Brann. I\'ve been \'ere a long time... all I \'ave of me life before this place are flashes and nightmares.', '', 31042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t right at all, $n. In the tale Wind Tamer Barah told me, Stormhoof was a hero, not a villain.', '', 31041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Brann?', '', 31040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muradin clutches his head and reels for a moment as the memories rush back to him.', '', 31039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brother... yes... I do have brothers...', '', 31038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that? You talkin\' to me, lad?', '', 31037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s here in Northrend brother, looking for you. A seer in Wintergarde brought word that you were not dead, and he left Ironforge immediately to come find you.', '', 31036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed! Magni will be so happy to see you too! He\'s gotten nothing but bad news for a long while now, but this changes everything!', '', 31035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe this! You were dead! All accounts said so... what happened, Muradin. How did you get here?', '', 31034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on boy, there\'s no mistak\'n it - it\'s definitely you. Don\'t ya recognize your younger brother?!', '', 31033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By all the gods... it can\'t be... Muradin?!', '', 31032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re coming up on Frosthold. I would be very appreciative if you would introduce me to King Stormheart before you go. I believe we are both very much in his debt.', '', 31031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor Creteus. He was a good keeper... I\'m glad he at least got to see his task to completion, I imagine that\'s all that really mattered to him.', '', 31030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their numbers are unbelievable... I\'m glad to hear King Stormheart came to your aid. I only hear good things of him - I think it\'s high time we meet.', '', 31029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barring stray boulders from those giants, we should be clear... it seems a mess down there though.', '', 31028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re almost out... just a little bit farther.', '', 31027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are more up ahead - keep at it!', '', 31026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re trying to take down the plane! I can\'t pull up any steeper... you need to keep them off of us!', '', 31025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iron dwarves... everywhere.... they\'re making their way down from the top. They certainly are persistent.', '', 31024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t thank you enough for all of your help in putting together the keystone. Great things will come of this, I assure you.', '', 31023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormhoof ambushed the North Wind in the heart of its domain, and nearly succeeded in his plot. But the North Wind survived Stormhoof\'s treachery and executed the taunka as punishment for his invasion.', '', 31022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The chieftain\'s brother, Stormhoof, gathered all his strength and set out to conquer the Storm Peaks from its rightful ruler, the North Wind.', '', 31021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, when the North Wind ruled these peaks alone, a powerful taunka chieftain\'s brother coveted these lands for himself.', '', 31020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s is affected by Widow\'s Embrace!', 31019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thorim! Come, show yourself!', '', 31018, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then you have lost, Highlord.\n', '', 31017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will do this with honor, Darion. We will not sink to the levels of the Scourge to be victorious. To do so would make us no better than the monster that we fight to destroy!', '', 31016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King knows your boundaries, Highlord. He knows that you will not fire on your own men. Do you not understand? He has no boundaries. No rules to abide. \n', '', 31015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soldiers are being used as living shields to stave off artillery fire in the Valley of Echoes, allowing the forces of the Lich King to assault your base without impediment.', '', 31014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The breach you created was sealed with Nerubian webbing almost as quickly as it was opened.', '', 31013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look upon the field, Highlord. The Lich King has halted your advance completely and won the upper hand!', '', 31012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shakes his head.', '', 31011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose your words wisely, death knight. You stand amidst the company of the devoted.', '', 31010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing. There is nothing that you can do while the Light binds you. It controls you wholly, shackling you to the ground with its virtues.', '', 31009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would you have me do, Darion?', '', 31008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot win. Not like this...\n', '', 31007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King is unlike any foe that you have ever faced, Highlord. Though you bested him upon the holy ground of Light\'s Hope Chapel, you tread now upon his domain.\n', '', 31006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are dealing with a being that holds within it the consciousness of the most cunning, intelligent, and ruthless individuals to ever live.', '', 31005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King reacted swiftly to the breach. Faster than I anticipated.', '', 31004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jokkum, son of Arngrim, I have always regretted my actions here. In my grief, I brought great harm to those closest to me.', '', 31003, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The noble deeds of your $r $c servant defy $g his:her; stature, Stormlord. $g His:her; efforts have succeeded in softening the hearts of my people.', '', 31002, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Jokkum, you have summoned me?', '', 31001, 0, 8056, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on, little $r.', '', 31000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My slack-jawed compatriot, the time to act is now! Pull yourself together and lend me a hand!', '', 30999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you think that you would be spared the sight of bloodshed and terror?!', '', 30998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no interest in buying anything that you are here to sell me, friend!', '', 30997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessed Light! They are all dying!', '', 30996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend, wipe the drool off of your chin and come lend me a hand!', '', 30995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in the world are you doing? There are people dying all around you!', '', 30994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t just stand around $g boy:girl;! The Crusade needs your help!', '', 30993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! $C! These men are dying! I need your assistance!', '', 30992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll hold them off as long as we can. Do whatever you need to do quickly!', '', 30991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the watchers, look at him fight. I\'ve never seen a more vicious warrior... I\'m glad to call him my king.', '', 30990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, Creteus is to the west. King Stormheart is holding them off, but they have the advantage of numbers.', '', 30989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Stormheart caught wind of the iron dwarves heading this way and brought all the best warriors he could muster on such short notice.', '', 30988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail! I hate to rush you, but there\'s an army of iron dwarves here to stop whatever you and Creteus are trying to do... we need to get out of here.', '', 30987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This bear\'s flank is frozen solid.... try again.', 'This bear\'s flank is frozen solid.... try again.', 30986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to be shown the fate of Krolmir.', 'I am ready to be shown the fate of Krolmir.', 30985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, little $c.$b$bWhile there is much left for you to do to mend our relations with Thorim, I am compelled to share with you this one secret.$b$bSpeak to me again when you are ready to be shown that which you seek.', '', 30984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not trust you enough to speak of such things.$b$bYou must respect the trials our people have endured, the burdens we have borne...$b$bPerhaps, if you were to bring great honor to Dun Niffelem, I would be inclined to share with you the knowledge of our people.', '', 30983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it please you, King Jokkum, may I know what has become of Krolmir?', 'If it please you, King Jokkum, may I know what has become of Krolmir?', 30982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are permitted to visit our stronghold, little $r.$b$bDo not bring us dishonor!', '', 30981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you and farewell, friend. I must return to the Argent Vanguard.', 'Thank you and farewell, friend. I must return to the Argent Vanguard.', 30980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wisdom of the ages upon you, noble $c.', 'Wisdom of the ages upon you, noble $c.', 30978, 0, 7665, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory and strength to you, $c. I bless you with all the strength left in me. May this nightmare soon end!', 'Glory and strength to you, $c. I bless you with all the strength left in me. May this nightmare soon end!', 30977, 0, 7665, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Might grace you, $c. Let the Scourge feel the fury of a million lost souls!', 'Might grace you, $c. Let the Scourge feel the fury of a million lost souls!', 30976, 0, 7665, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here $G laddy:lass;, I have something I could use a hand with.', '', 30975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are welcome here, as a friend and ally of the earthen.', '', 30974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have killed Valduran, but that will not stop me from completing the colossus.', '', 30973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You didn\'t think that I was going to let you walk in here and take the Heart of the Storm, did you?', '', 30972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Watcher loses its footing under the furious blow.', '', 30970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Watcher reels, reaching to its now useless eyes, and charges blindly.', '', 30969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Giant shudders slightly.', '', 30968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Watcher roars with fury, shaking more rust from its ancient frame.', '', 30967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Giant shudders slightly.', '', 30966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the hammer lands, more rust shakes free from the Iron Watcher\'s frame and its pace quickens.', '', 30965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Creaking echoes off of the nearby structures as the Iron Watcher comes to life.', '', 30964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WotLK - Request Defender', 'WotLK - Request Defender', 30963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WotLK - Stormwind Harbor Captain', 'WotLK - Stormwind Harbor Captain', 30962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the battle begin!', '', 30961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battle for Lake Wintergrasp is about to begin!', '', 30960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want?', '', 30959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I serve you?', '', 30958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Retrain me in Gem Perfection', 'Retrain me in Gem Perfection', 30957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the test put before you this day. Return to us only once The Iron Watcher is dead, and be revered as a warrior of the frostborn.', '', 30956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And as one of the fiercest tests put upon a warrior of the frostborn, we are made to face a creature far larger than ourselves--giants, dragons, jormungar--as a testament to the fact that size will never be our weakness.', '', 30955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How you be doin\' mon?', '', 30954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Stormheart has trained us well... turned us into even more fearsome warriors than we could have boasted during the time of our war with the Frost Giants.', '', 30953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stranger having no name of his own, my father deemed \"Yorg,\" a name reserved for champions of legend. Years later, he now stands before us as Yorg Stormheart, King of the Frostborn.', '', 30952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for you?', '', 30951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The jormungar collapsed instantly, its head barely still attached to its convulsing body.  My father turned to the dwarf in awe and raised a fist in praise...', '', 30950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dwarf barreled forward with a sound like rolling thunder and hurled a shining metal hammer, lightning coursing over its surface, directly into the jormungar\'s throat.', '', 30949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father thought they were all doomed... but behind him, a furious roar rumbled across the snow, and he turned to see the mountain dwarf growing in size, his skin taking on a stone-like texture, and his hands sizzling with lightning.', '', 30948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not long later, out of nowhere, the snow burst before them and a jormungar the size of Veranus herself came down upon their party... one of them was swallowed whole before they even had time to react.', '', 30947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dwarf seemed lost, having no memory of where he came from, or even of his own name. Not being the kind to leave a dwarven cousin to die in the snow, my father\'s party took him in and continued back towards Frosthold.', '', 30946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They crossed a trail of blood-soaked snow and followed it to find a dwarf wandering and speaking in a dialect they couldn\'t make out... and not a dwarf of our kind mind you, but a mountain dwarf - something our kind had never seen before.', '', 30945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years back, my father and several other frostborn were returning from a trek across Dragonblight. There was a heavy blizzard... far worse than we\'ve ever seen since.', '', 30944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you\'re new to our kind, so I\'ll catch you up a bit while we\'re on our way over.', '', 30943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Stormheart is putting you to the test, eh?  He must see something in you to begin with or I doubt he\'d put you through such a sacred ritual.', '', 30942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Broken Temple siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!', '', 30941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sunken Ring siege workshop has been captured by the Horde!', '', 30940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Broken Temple siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!', '', 30939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sunken Ring siege workshop has been captured by the Alliance!', '', 30938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Stormheart sent me to be tested as a frostborn would.  I am ready for my test, Fjorlin.', 'King Stormheart sent me to be tested as a frostborn would.  I am ready for my test, Fjorlin.', 30937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where there are frostborn, there are eagles. They\'ve been our allies for longer than I\'ve walked the land... and I\'m not exactly young anymore, $G laddy:lass;.', '', 30936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to work alongside Grand Apothecary Putress. His work has saved the world from the Lich King\'s plague and has given new hope to our cause.', 'It is an honor to work alongside Grand Apothecary Putress. His work has saved the world from the Lich King\'s plague and has given new hope to our cause.', 30935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a landmark discovery! The Royal Apothecary Society has spent years working to break the secrets of the Lich King\'s plague, and I\'ve finally done it!$B$BDespite this turning point in history, there is still so much to discover. I have more experiments to conduct... test subjects to acquire...$B$BAt least I don\'t have to worry about Scourge necropoli. The Alliance is dealing with that problem. This leaves me plenty of time to delve into the secrets of the plague and uncover what I can.', '', 30934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Putress looks you over in a very unsettling fashion.>$B$BAren\'t you a remarkable specimen....$B$BHave you considered making a sacrifice for the greater good?', '', 30933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know who I am?! I\'m a very important person! You\'re supposed to be protecting me from the Scourge, not dilly-dallying with pointless conversation!$B$BI\'m no fighter, but you are. So get out there!', '', 30932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everything I am, I owe to Arthas. I savor the moment when I can repay him for this torment.$B$BI have longed for the time when the Forsaken could take the fight against the Scourge to Northrend, but we need the rest of the Horde\'s support. Our numbers are not great unless bolstered by the other races in our alliance.$B$BArthas\'s latest attack on the Horde will hopefully convince Thrall to declare war on Icecrown. He\'ll have my support when that happens.', 30931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can feel Thrall\'s anger at Arthas, but it pales before my own. Were he as furious as any one of the Forsaken, the Horde\'s armies would unleash their rage upon Northrend and eradicate all Scourge from that cursed, frozen wasteland.$B$BBut I do not lead the Horde, and cannot give the command for war. Thrall wishes to weigh his options, despite this being a time of action. Still, our time will come... very soon.', 30930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d choose your next words carefully if you value your life.$B$BSilence? How wise. Now destroy the Scourge!', 30929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We face an enemy we cannot kill through traditional means. The Lich King\'s plague is a force that no healer within our ranks has been able to deter. The Forsaken and their alchemists are the only hope we have, much to my disgust.$B$BIf we live through this, I promise you that the Horde will go to Northrend and bring the Lich King and his armies to their knees!', '', 30928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand Garrosh\'s desires. The urge for battle is strong within every orc, especially against a foe that has killed our people. But, the warchief has proven time and again that strategy is as important as strength in a battle.$B$BWe will set out when the time is right. We are no longer a band of mindless, demon-manipulated savages. This is the new Horde.', '', 30927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! Why are you not fighting? Kill these Scourge horrors before they do more damage to Orgrimmar!', '', 30926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never believed Thrall until I saw it with my own eyes. Orcs... free of demonic corruption! Proud and honorable warriors making their place on this unbroken planet.$B$BEager am I to prove myself to Thrall and the Horde. My father never had to deal with this undead menace you call the Lich King, but by all descriptions he represents a dire threat to the Horde.$B$BI will implore Thrall to let me lead his finest warriors into Northrend and destroy the Lich King! But this plague takes precedent.', '', 30925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My arms grow restless, anxiously waiting to drive my axes into the skull of the Lich King. Thrall would have us wait and let the Scourge continue to grow in strength. I will not have this!$B$BIf we are to end the threat of the Lich King, we must sail to Northrend and give him the full might of the Horde! Our forces are ready and willing to exact revenge for the deaths wrought by the plague and invasion.$B$BThe time to strike is now!', '', 30924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A true warrior does not stop in a battle to talk with his allies! Send these monstrosities back to their graves!', '', 30923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Since the founding of Orgrimmar, many trials have tested the Horde, but we have risen up and beaten back any who\'d seek to destroy us!$B$BBut this... this is something that even my power cannot defeat. It pains me deeply to watch my people suffer from this plague. I must rely on the Forsaken for their assistance.$B$BThe Lich King will hear the approaching war drums of the Horde, but not yet. First, we must help our people before exacting our revenge on the Scourge.', '', 30922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was only a matter of time before we would have to deal with the Lich King. He represents a threat to all of Azeroth, not just the humans.$B$BBut, the decision to go to war is one that must not be made lightly. We would be fools to rush into Northrend. The Lich King has surely anticipated such an action.$B$BOur options must be weighed carefully. Our armies are mightier than ever, but a tactically unsound decision could ruin us.$B$BIf only Garrosh understood....', '', 30921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde needs you! Beat back the Lich King\'s forces!', '', 30920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once, I had a home in the lush woods of Quel\'Thalas. Once, I had a family, a husband... children. Once, I was alive and one with the world. The Lich King took all of that away from me in the blink of an eye.$B$BThough I have not the power to strike at him directly, I will pay him back threefold!', 30919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t live to speak of this!', '', 30918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, friend of the frost!', '', 30917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Found me, did ya? Now ya gotta die!', '', 30916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The frostworg howls, exposing its prey!', '', 30915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The worg growls as it closes in on its prey.', '', 30914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clearly on to something, the worg bares its fangs and follows the scent.', '', 30913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After a moment\'s pause, the worg resumes the hunt.', '', 30912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The worg hesitates for a moment, then changes direction.', '', 30911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without hesitation, the ethereal worg sets off into the valley.', '', 30910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The worg sprints off in search of enemies.', '', 30909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?$B$BGo away... I\'m exhausted from working so hard on the Harbor Road. It\'s time to drink some dwarven ale, have a good cry, and take a nap.', '', 30908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Helm of Hodir!', 'The Helm of Hodir!', 30907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sons of Hodir! I humbly present to you....', 'Sons of Hodir! I humbly present to you....', 30906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill!', 'Kill!', 30905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s my damned helmet? Well, at least they left my sword here. Idiots.', 'Where\'s my damned helmet? Well, at least they left my sword here. Idiots.', 30904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time for revenge!', 'It\'s time for revenge!', 30903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent. Let\'s kill some vrykul!', 'Excellent. Let\'s kill some vrykul!', 30902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $c. I owe you.', 'Thank you, $c. I owe you.', 30901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can fight by your side for a few minutes before I need to return to The Shadow Vault.', 'I can fight by your side for a few minutes before I need to return to The Shadow Vault.', 30900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks. How can I help?', 'Thanks. How can I help?', 30899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this.', 'Let\'s do this.', 30898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had it all, once. Fame, fortune, a full set of the very best gladiator\'s gear... and then I threw it all away.$B$BOnce the Cartel caught me rigging fights... trading wins... it was all over.$B$BNow I\'ve got nothing but these rags and a bad liver.', '', 30897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 18, 0, 0, 4, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re so eager to fight, I\'ll oblige you. But know that nothing you do here can prevent the completion of the iron colossus!', '', 30896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How predictable! But then, who would expect a rock to think like anything other than one?', '', 30895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am your doom, Valduran!', '', 30894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more will your minions assail the creatures of stone and their allies.', '', 30893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormforged dwarves pour out of the broken corpse!', '', 30892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, the tyranny of the stormforged is at its end!', '', 30891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dun worry about me $G lad:lass;. I\'ve thought for a long time that age would claim me... I\'m glad I was wrong. Dun let these iron dwarves find what they\'re looking for.', '', 30890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you get me out of this cage, we\'re going to make them wish they were never awakened!', 'When you get me out of this cage, we\'re going to make them wish they were never awakened!', 30889, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were you sent by Baron Sliver to get me out of this cage? Finally. Hurry up!', 'Were you sent by Baron Sliver to get me out of this cage? Finally. Hurry up!', 30888, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me out and we\'ll fight side-by-side. The slaughter will be glorious!', 'Let me out and we\'ll fight side-by-side. The slaughter will be glorious!', 30887, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m over here in this cage. You can\'t miss it!', 'I\'m over here in this cage. You can\'t miss it!', 30886, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good thing I don\'t really feel the cold.', 'Good thing I don\'t really feel the cold.', 30885, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you could bust me out of this cage?', 'Think you could bust me out of this cage?', 30884, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It gets the key. It comes here. It opens the lock.', 'It gets the key. It comes here. It opens the lock.', 30883, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you! There are keys on the vrykul. Kill them, get a key and come over here to let me out of this damned cage!', 'Hey you! There are keys on the vrykul. Kill them, get a key and come over here to let me out of this damned cage!', 30882, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m heading back now. I\'ll let the baron know that you liberated me.', 'I\'m heading back now. I\'ll let the baron know that you liberated me.', 30881, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to go. Don\'t let them capture you or they\'ll put you in the stew!', 'Time to go. Don\'t let them capture you or they\'ll put you in the stew!', 30880, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to go. You stay and kill more of these ugly mongrels.', 'I have to go. You stay and kill more of these ugly mongrels.', 30879, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d love to stay and kill vrykul with you all day, but I\'m sure the baron will be wondering where I am.', 'I\'d love to stay and kill vrykul with you all day, but I\'m sure the baron will be wondering where I am.', 30878, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s enough for me. I\'m heading back now.', 'That\'s enough for me. I\'m heading back now.', 30877, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see you back at The Shadow Vault.', 'I will see you back at The Shadow Vault.', 30876, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve tarried too long here. I must get back to The Shadow Vault. Farewell.', 'I\'ve tarried too long here. I must get back to The Shadow Vault. Farewell.', 30875, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks. I\'m going back to The Shadow Vault now.', 'You have my thanks. I\'m going back to The Shadow Vault now.', 30874, 0, 7659, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
