('You\'ve been cut off, $n.  No more ale for you.', 'You\'ve been cut off, $n.  No more ale for you.', 30869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more ale for you $n.', 'No more ale for you $n.', 30868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But one thing is for certain: this plate\'s size, thickness, and bolt holes point to a use as armor for a colossal structure.', '', 30867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found this strange armor plate. Can you tell me more about it?', 'I found this strange armor plate. Can you tell me more about it?', 30866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. This is the workshop of Keeper Mimir.', '', 30865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
