('I have bad news for you Onu\'zun: I\'m gonna have to cut short your dreams!', 'I have bad news for you Onu\'zun: I\'m gonna have to cut short your dreams!', 30858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onu\'zun here to challenge the vrykul and work himself up in the ranks.$B$BThen when Onu\'zun fight in Valhalas and win, Onu\'zun gonna be workin\' for the Lich King!', '', 30857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
