('Onu\'zun go now. You\'ll miss me.', '', 30853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onu\'zun is defeated by the ugliest person ever!', '', 30852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saronite in this sample is nearly pure. Ores like this do not occur naturally on the surface of Azeroth.', '', 30851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
