('', 'I no longer train Death Knights, having grown weary of cretinous Initiates and their constant questions.$B$BNow begone.', 30846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the strongest of us - show\'m how it\'s done, my king!', '', 30845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to be in the thick of it again.', '', 30844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The training you gave us is paying off, sire!', '', 30843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll learn to fear the Stormriders this day!', '', 30842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll keep\'m busy, sir!', '', 30841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haven\'t seen a battle like this since the Frost Giants!', '', 30840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hail King Stormheart!', '', 30839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s an honor to share the battlefiend with you, my liege.', '', 30838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fjorn\'s Anvil now stands prominently in Dun Niffelem as a symbol of their victory over Fjorn and his armies.$b$bYou can\'t help but smile, knowing that your actions have had such a lasting impact on the world.', '', 30837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Popcorn!  Peanuts!  Ale!', 'Popcorn!  Peanuts!  Ale!', 30836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anguish Ale!  Cold Anguish Ale here!', 'Anguish Ale!  Cold Anguish Ale here!', 30835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peanuts!  Get your peanuts here!', 'Peanuts!  Get your peanuts here!', 30834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Popcorn!  Get your popcorn!', 'Popcorn!  Get your popcorn!', 30833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snacks!  Get your snacks here!', 'Snacks!  Get your snacks here!', 30832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your snacks here!', 'Get your snacks here!', 30831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snacks!', 'Snacks!', 30830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snacks for sale!', 'Snacks for sale!', 30829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WHEE!!!', 30828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who\'s the bigshot now, huh?!', 30827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'YOU\'RE NO FUN!', 30826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Sorry, Tinky, but I can\'t afford you as a distraction while I\'m doing what needs to be done here.', 'Sorry, Tinky, but I can\'t afford you as a distraction while I\'m doing what needs to be done here.', 30825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, I recognize you! I guess I have you to thanks for me being here. That teleport accident was the best thing that ever happened to me.$B$BIf you find yourself back in Borean Tundra, let my goody two-shoes nerd of a duplicate know that I\'ve moved up in the world quite a bit!', 30824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you here to prove yourself to the Lich King as well?$B$BIt\'s kind of archaic, don\'t you think? Having to fight and survive?', 30823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grrrrrrrr! I\'ll kneecap ya!', 30822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fight well, little one. I am bested for now. We will meet again I assure you. When we do I will be better prepared!', 30821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, $n!  Don\'t let me down!', 'Come on, $n!  Don\'t let me down!', 30820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull it together, $n!', 'Pull it together, $n!', 30819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rip \'em apart, $n!', 'Rip \'em apart, $n!', 30818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do it, $n!', 'Do it, $n!', 30817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n!', '$n!', 30816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t show \'em any mercy $n!', 'Don\'t show \'em any mercy $n!', 30815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on $n!  You can do it!', 'Come on $n!  You can do it!', 30814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on $n!  I\'ve got good money riding on you!', 'Come on $n!  I\'ve got good money riding on you!', 30813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no!  $n is looking hurt!', 'Oh no!  $n is looking hurt!', 30812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not worthy of Thorim!', 30811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not defeat me!', 30810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck...  You\'ll need it!', 30809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the best win!', 30808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not afraid of anything -- bring it on!', 30807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skip the warmup, sister... or are you too scared to face someone your own size?', 'Skip the warmup, sister... or are you too scared to face someone your own size?', 30806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This puny green pup was of no use at the mines.  No matter, he\'ll make for suitable warmup for battle.', 30805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for you?', '', 30804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, thank you!  Time to get away from these crazy blue women!', '', 30803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get them!', '', 30802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is just a warning, wench.  You strike one of us again and we\'ll kill you in your sleep.', '', 30801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d be careful if I were you, Hyldnir.  We\'re not afraid to lose a few men if it means smashing your pretty blue faces in.', '', 30800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not looking to cause trouble, but if things don\'t change around here, you\'re going to have an insurrection on your hands.', '', 30799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have revenge... some day.', '', 30798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You treat us worse than animals!', '', 30797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back... to work...', '', 30796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d rather die fighting than live like a slave!', '', 30795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough!  I will teach you some manners, wench!', '', 30794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you!  You will not treat me like a beast!', '', 30793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This likeness of the Horn of Hodir stands in memorial of King Arngrim and all others lost in the battle of Thunderfall.', '', 30792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to spin, encased in a magical shield!', '', 30791, 0, 7614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These are sacred halls! Your intrusion will be met with death!', 30789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be an honor, Dark Lady.', '', 30788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent... most excellent.', 30787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, Thrall. The time has come to kill Arthas. You can take my grand apothecary with you. His knowledge will be invaluable against whatever the Scourge will throw at you.', 30786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marshal our forces. Contact our goblin shipwrights. The Horde prepares for war!', '', 30785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whisker! Where are you?! Assist me!', '', 30784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, Warchief? What say you now? Will you send me to Northrend?', '', 30780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! So, son of Durotan, what--', '', 30779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your duties as warchief can wait. For now... we fight!', '', 30778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saurfang...', '', 30777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will finish this another time... son of Grom.', '', 30776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GYAH!', '', 30775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s finish this quickly.', '', 30774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inside!', '', 30773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You challenge me, boy? I don\'t have time for this....', '', 30772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Storm Peaks.', '', 30771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the baddest of the bad, the coolest of the cool! To my side, my elements, let us freeze and rule!', '', 30770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring a gust so strong, it can knock down trees! Minions, assist me, they shall not do as they please!', '', 30769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To burn my kingdom, you can\'t use fire! Come my servants, I am not ready to retire!', '', 30768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the king of dirt, there is none higher! To my aid, minions - assist your sire!', '', 30767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does not compute. Unit malfunctioning. Directive: shut down.', '', 30766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New directive: assist in the defeat of the iron dwarves.', '', 30765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New directive: leave mine and return to Inventor\'s Library.', '', 30764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r. I will join your struggle against the stormforged.', '', 30763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free again? Keeper Mimir\'s work awaits.', '', 30762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s explodes into a pool of plague!', '', 30761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not a laborer. I\'m here to free you from servitude in the mines.', 'I\'m not a laborer. I\'m here to free you from servitude in the mines.', 30760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go back to work before the overseer sees us.', '', 30759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This unit is busy. Please inquire later.', '', 30758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast Poison Nova!', '', 30757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the champion now, buddy! Do you think you have what it takes to defend your title?', '', 30756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PUPS OF ORGRIMMAR!  HEAR ME, BRASH UPSTARTS OF THE HORDE!  TREMBLE, AND KNOW YOUR DOOM,  FOR THE LICH KING\'S GAZE IS FIXED UPON YOU!', '', 30755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like you could make us some money. How about a spin inside the Amphitheater of Anguish, pal?', '', 30754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard that vrykul women cannot fight at all. If you wish to prove me wrong, you can try.', 'I\'ve heard that vrykul women cannot fight at all. If you wish to prove me wrong, you can try.', 30753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not bother me, pest. I am studying the inept fighting of these so-called combatants.$B$BI will best them all, and then I will be elevated to serve the Lich King.', 30752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course you lost. What did you expect?', 30751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taste my steel, little $g boy : girl;!', 30750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight me now, vrykul, or be labeled a coward!', '', 30749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not possessed of infinite patience! I came here to prove myself, and that is exactly what I intend to do!', '', 30748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you not face me? Are you afraid of Efrem the Faithful?', '', 30747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare to touch ME?! You won\'t keep me from proving myself to the Lich King!', '', 30746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, vrykul dogs. I will fight you!', '', 30745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Efrem the Faithful wins again. Of course!', '', 30744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, wait... I surrender! Please, no more! I\'ll leave!', '', 30743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you to a duel, Scarlet scum!', 'I challenge you to a duel, Scarlet scum!', 30742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are YOU doing here?$B$BJust make sure that you stay out of my way. I didn\'t leave the Scarlet Onslaught to be distracted by the likes of you!', '', 30741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something stirs in the pool of mojo...', '', 30740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you command, Warchief!', '', 30739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Warchief?', '', 30738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief! Scourge forces are attacking Orgrimmar!', '', 30737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief, it is clear that Northrend represents the gravest threat to our people, and that we must act against it. But this foe is unlike any other. Caution must be advised.', '', 30736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this is a trap, it is one I will not blindly walk into! Do not make the same mistakes as your father, Garrosh!', '', 30735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will send scouts to assess the situation. I will also convene with the Lady Proudmoore and see what plans the Alliance has.', '', 30734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soul burns for revenge, but the elements tell me to think clearly. The Lich King is a ruthless opponent... one who must be handled carefully.', '', 30733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What say you, Saurfang?', '', 30732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you refuse? Is the son of Durotan a coward?', '', 30731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After all that he did for YOU and YOUR people? MAK\'GORA!', '', 30730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gragh! I cannot take this! While you talk and deliberate, our enemies grow stronger! Were it my choice, I would have put all our available forces onto that frozen rock and conquered it for the Horde!', '', 30729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall... Warchief... your armies await your command. Let me lead them to Northrend to remove this undead menace!', '', 30728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grows increasingly crazed!', '', 30727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes Berserk!', '%s goes Berserk!', 30726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once a match starts there\'s two ways out: WIN OR DIE! Fleeing is not an option!', '', 30725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can take care of myself, $n.', '', 30724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us fight the irons together!', '', 30723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me fight by your side.', '', 30722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was certain I was going to die out here.', '', 30721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I thought I was doomed.', '', 30720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there\'s nothing else that you can do, kill these things!', '', 30719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is impaled!', '', 30718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gathers its mojo and surges forward!', '', 30717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I DON\'T BELIEVE IT! WE HAVE A NEW CHAMPION OF ANGUISH!!! Vladof the Butcher has been defeated by a ragtag crew of nobodies! Incredible finish!', '', 30716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hailing from the distant mountains of Alterac, one of the fiercest competitors this arena has ever seen: KORRAK THE BLOODRAGER!!!', '', 30715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The champion of the Winterax trolls has challenged you, $n! I hope you\'re ready!', '', 30714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My answer? Here\'s my answer, little messenger!', '', 30713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By order of Duke Lankral, Commander of the Knights of the Ebon Blade, Vanquisher of the Scourge and Conqueror of The Shadow Vault, you are ordered to stand down. What is your answer?', 'By order of Duke Lankral, Commander of the Knights of the Ebon Blade, Vanquisher of the Scourge and Conqueror of The Shadow Vault, you are ordered to stand down. What is your answer?', 30712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?!', '', 30711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vladof dismounts!', '', 30710, 0, 7614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Useless mongrel! I\'ll kill \'em myself!', '', 30709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, my precious, we will tear them apart! For the one true king!', '', 30708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the Savage Ledge of Icecrown, Vladof the Butcher and his mammoth, Enormos! There ain\'t gonna be a thing left of our challengers, folks! Prepare for a downpour of blood, guts and tears!', '', 30707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No graveyard here for you to play wicked games on Korrak! DIE!', '', 30706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Korrak has come, weaklings! Snowfall belongs to Winterax! Erm, Korrak mean to say amphitheater belong to Winterax!', '', 30705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, land-dwellers, face the fury of tusk and whisker!', '', 30704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This battle must be seen to be believed! Once a mild-mannered tuskarr fisherman, our next fighter turned to the life of a soulless mercenary when his entire family was wiped out by a vicious pack of lion seals and ill-tempered penguins! Now he\'s just in it for the gold! Ladies and gentlemen, ORINOKO TUSKBREAKER!!', '', 30703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Al\'Akir grant my enemies a cold, swift death!', '', 30702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Neptulon! Strength of storm and sea, crush my enemies!', '', 30701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, brothers of the earth! Watch as Erathius destroys the mortals!', '', 30700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coward!', '', 30699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you feel that folks? The air is crackling with energy! That can only mean one thing...', '', 30698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Drakkari, one of the so-called Scarlet Onslaught, a gnome, a Hyldnir shield-maiden, and now you? Is this a joke?', '', 30697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A quick trip to the underworld for you, and a laugh for me. Sounds like a fair trade!', '', 30696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you seek death, you have found it!', '', 30695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will not get me any closer to proving myself at Valhalas to kill you, but it should be entertaining!', '', 30694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come then, $r $c, I do not have all day!', '', 30693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Thorim\'s beard, this should be good sport!', '', 30692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your race has no honor. But come anyway... you\'ll die like all the others!', '', 30691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you can challenge me, little $r?', '', 30690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll melt the flesh off your bones!', '', 30689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stinkbeard comin\' for you, little ones!', '', 30688, 0, 7612, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And with AUTHORITY, $n dominates the magnataur lord! Stinkbeard\'s clan is gonna miss him back home in the Dragonblight!', '', 30687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle is about to begin! Am I reading this card right? It... It\'s the nefarious magnataur lord, STINKBEARD! Yes, folks, STINKBEARD! $n doesn\'t stand a chance!', '', 30686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to make your stand, $n! Get in the Amphitheater and stand ready! Remember, you and your opponent must stay in the arena at all times or you will be disqualified!', '', 30685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has defeated Yg... Yggg-really big worm!', '', 30684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emerges!', '', 30683, 0, 7613, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we are once again, ladies and gentlemen. The epic struggle between life and death in the Amphitheater of Anguish! For this round we have $n versus the hulking jormungar, Yg... Yggd? Yggdoze? Who comes up with these names?! $n versus big worm!', '', 30682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The grand Amphitheater of Anguish awaits, $n. Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. WIN OR DIE!', '', 30681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avert your eyes, ladies and gentlemen! It\'s a bloodbath!', '', 30680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OUTTA NOWHERE -- WHAMO! DEAD!', '', 30679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OOOF! That one\'s gonna require the \"scraper.\"', '', 30678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call in the clowns! It\'s turned into a circus in there!', '', 30677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All that\'s left of the challenger is a red stain on the floor!', '', 30676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They went down like a sack of orc skulls!', '', 30675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The challenger has been defeated!', '', 30674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is our home!', '', 30673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re under the ground. They\'re under the ground!', '', 30672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight back the enemy!', '', 30671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the Temple with your life!', '', 30670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, Battle-Sister.$B$BFeast, sleep, so that you may fight with all your strength!', 30669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death Knights... get over here!', '', 30668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met, Battle-Sister. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions.', 30667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met, Battle-Sister. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.', 30666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this, sister.', 'Let\'s do this, sister.', 30665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You think you have what it takes?', 30664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t look so tough.', 30663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You challenge?', 30662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will tear you limb from limb.', 30661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ebon Blade is indebted to you for your help in taking The Shadow Vault. We are lucky to have you.$B$BWhile the Alliance and the Horde fight each other, doing the Lich King\'s job for him, we will stay focused on the task at hand.$B$BWhere the Argent Crusade might falter and think twice about how best to crush the enemy, we will have no such moral difficulties.$B$BYou shall be our instrument of vengeance, $n.', '', 30660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you freed him, did you? No matter, his death and reconstruction will only be slightly delayed.', '', 30659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrym... Av... Avenge me...', '', 30658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THRYM CRUSH!', '', 30657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MASTER! NO!', '', 30656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re in over our heads, $r! Watch your back!', '', 30655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ulduar\'s archives may hold the knowledge we need to stop Loken from using the city\'s resources against us. The problem is that the key to those archives was divided and hidden.$B$BI think I\'ve found out where one of the pieces is, in the Inventor\'s Library, which sits on the northern edge of the mountains northeast of you. The first thing you\'ll need to do is retrieve the fragments of an access disk from the library\'s guardians.', '', 30654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gymer is about to die! Find a storm cloud!', '', 30653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gymer needs storm cloud badly!', '', 30652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have reached Rank 2: First Lieutenant', 'You have reached Rank 2: First Lieutenant', 30651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have reached Rank 1: Corporal', 'You have reached Rank 1: Corporal', 30650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have reached Rank 1: Recruit', 'You have reached Rank 1: Recruit', 30649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready I will place you atop my head and we will march into the heart of the Scourge in Zul\'Drak. You must direct me to smash and destroy our enemies!', '', 30648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must strike at Jotunheim continuously. Never give them a chance to catch their breath, never a chance to sleep, and never accept surrender!$B$BTirion Fordring with all the might of Ashbringer and the Argent Crusade behind him cannot hope to accomplish what you are doing!$B$BNow, be quick about your business, $n. There is too much occurring for idle chit-chat.', '', 30647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to bring the venom sac to Ricket... and then... you know... collapse. Thank you for helping me!', 'I\'m going to bring the venom sac to Ricket... and then... you know... collapse. Thank you for helping me!', 30646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you\'re ready. I\'d prefer sooner than later... what with the slowly dying from poison and all.', 'Let me know when you\'re ready. I\'d prefer sooner than later... what with the slowly dying from poison and all.', 30645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready - lets get you out of here.', 'I\'m ready - lets get you out of here.', 30644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poison... my insides are churning...', 'Poison... my insides are churning...', 30643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You complain much, like a shield-maiden!', '', 30642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll wish you\'d never been awakened, boy.', '', 30641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll sleep in the underworld tonight!', '', 30640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Getting tired? Hahahahaha!', '', 30639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The runes foretold victory for me today!', '', 30638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will feast in the halls of Ymirheim tonight and you will pour my mead, cur.', '', 30637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hela take you!', '', 30636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re weak, old woman!', '', 30635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a few more questions, Gymer.', 'I have a few more questions, Gymer.', 30634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ymirjar battle lord, Algar the Chosen, rouses his Vargul armies at the Reliquary of Pain, northeast of this cage.$B$BPrince Navarius is across the Dead Fields, east of here, near the great steps leading up to the second level of Zul\'Drak.$B$BThrym\'s location is currently unknown, which is curious considering his size.$B$BAll must be dealt with!', '', 30633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boktar thinks this crash an unfortunate event, but I believe we\'re intended to learn something from it.', '', 30632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak to the commander at your post, $g lad:lass;, and persuade him to abandon Vor\'takh\'s foolish plan.', '', 30631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we spend our time and strength fighting with each other, Loken will use Ulduar\'s resources to destroy both Horde and Alliance.', '', 30630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loken and his iron dwarf minions have ousted the Earthen from Ulduar and taken over the city.', '', 30629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve seen the journal, then you know what I\'ve been discovering. The titans\' own creations are at war with each other!', '', 30628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That wouldn\'t be Scout Vor\'takh, would it? Even I know of his reputation for ruthlessness. He means to abduct me, then?', '', 30627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks for dispatching the iron dwarves. But why would the Horde have an interest in me?', '', 30626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you get my communicator from the Explorers\' League?', '', 30625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I can understand you now! Well, now that we can talk to each other, you have some explaining to do!', '', 30624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A scout found the remains of your journal in Thor Modan. We\'ve been looking for you ever since.', 'A scout found the remains of your journal in Thor Modan. We\'ve been looking for you ever since.', 30623, 1, 7605, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Explorers\' League sent men, I didn\'t see any trace of them. I found your note buried in a camp overrun by iron dwarves.', 'If the Explorers\' League sent men, I didn\'t see any trace of them. I found your note buried in a camp overrun by iron dwarves.', 30622, 1, 7605, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you understand me? We should be able to understand each other now.', 'Do you understand me? We should be able to understand each other now.', 30621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', '', 30620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imagine all the wisdom and knowledge locked away within Ulduar. The very secrets of life could be held there!', '', 30619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Brann looks at you expectantly.>', '', 30618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Gymer. Let\'s go!', 'I\'m ready, Gymer. Let\'s go!', 30617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gymer, what do I need to know? I\'ve never ridden on a giant.', 'Gymer, what do I need to know? I\'ve never ridden on a giant.', 30616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gymer, where are Algar, Navarius and Thrym?', 'Gymer, where are Algar, Navarius and Thrym?', 30615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acknowledged, Branbronzan. Session terminated.', '', 30614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Designation: Old Gods. Old Gods rendered all systems, including earthen, defenseless in order to facilitate assimilation. This matrix destabilization has been termed \"the Curse of Flesh\". Effects of destabilization increased over time.', '', 30613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accessing... In the early stages of it\'s development cycle, Azeroth suffered infection by parasitic necrophotic symbiotes.', '', 30612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accessing prehistoric data... retrieved. In the beginning the earthen were created to--', '', 30611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to what I have to tell you about our enemy before we start. You don\'t want to be unprepared while we\'re out smashing Scourge in the field.', '', 30610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With my freedom comes the vengeance of storm!', '', 30609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Essentially that is correct.', 30608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unknown. Data suggests that impetus for global combat originated with prime designate Loken, who neutralized all remaining Aesir and Vanir, affecting termination of conflict. Prime designate Loken then initiated stasis of several seed races, including earthen, giants and vrykul, at designated holding facilities.', 30607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Additional background is relevant to your query: following global combat between Aesir and Vanir--', 30606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Designations: Aesir and Vanir. Or in the common nomenclature, storm and earth giants. Sentinel Loken designated supreme. Dragon Aspects appointed to monitor evolution on Azeroth.', 30605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Correct. Creators neutralized parasitic threat and contained it within the host. Forge of Wills and other systems were instituted to create new earthen. Safeguards were implemented, and protectors were appointed.', 30604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Accessing... Creators arrived to extirpate symbiotic infection. Assessment revealed that Old God infestation had grown malignant. Excising parasites would result in loss of host--', 30603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burning', 'Burning', 30602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge don\'t stand a chance!', '', 30601, 0, 7603, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WOW! I... I\'ve never seen anything like him! Give \'em hell, $n!', '', 30600, 0, 7603, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FREE!!! Soon you will feel the wrath of the storm king!', '', 30599, 0, 7602, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste Gymer\'s size 600!', '', 30598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tiny creatures, I trample you!', '', 30597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll wipe you off of my boots later!', '', 30596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you under foot!', '', 30595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be welcome amongst us, $c.', 30594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delicious morsels have come to visit! Shall I use your bombs to cook you?', '', 30593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IT IS THE WRATH OF THE STORM KING!', '', 30592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THE LIGHTNING COURSES THROUGH ME!', '', 30591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAARRRRRRGGGGGGHHHHHHH!! SUCH POWER!', '', 30590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO ESCAPE FOR THE WICKED!', '', 30589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LET THE STORM\'S FURY CONSUME YOU!', '', 30588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LIGHTNING GUIDE MY FURY!', '', 30587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('STORMS GRANT ME POWER!', '', 30586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hefting', 30585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll use the forge to make batches o\' earthen to stand guard... But our greatest challenge still remains: find and stop Loken!', '', 30584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, now... that\'s a lot to digest. I\'m gonna need some time to take all this in. Thank ye.', '', 30583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This \"Loken\" sounds like a nasty character. Glad we don\'t have to worry about the likes o\' him anymore. So... if I\'m understandin\' ye right, the original earthen eventually woke up from this stasis, and by that time the destabili-whatever had turned \'em into proper dwarves. Or at least... dwarf ancestors.', '', 30582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold everything! The Aesir and Vanir went to war? Why?', '', 30581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aesir and Vanir... Okay, so the Forge o\' Wills started makin\' new earthen... but what happened to the old ones?', '', 30580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What protectors?', '', 30579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If they killed the Old Gods, Azeroth would\'ve been destroyed...', '', 30578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Gods, huh? So they zapped the earthen with this Curse of Flesh... and then what?', '', 30577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you trying to make me look bad? That\'s the only thing that you\'re good for today!', '', 30576, 0, 7652, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop trying to hit him and HIT HIM already!', '', 30575, 0, 7652, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the best of the best get a shot in Valhalas to go to Ymirheim. Everyone else dies... or worse!', '', 30574, 0, 7652, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will practice until your lungs are bursting and your arms are aching, and then we\'ll really start!', '', 30573, 0, 7652, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well hello, ladies. What do you think this is... Skorn?', '', 30572, 0, 7652, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
