('I\'ve half a mind to cut you both down where you stand! The other half isn\'t arguing!', '', 30571, 0, 7652, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dead grandmater, rest her soul, could beat you... even now!', '', 30570, 0, 7652, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
