('Your death is in vain, tiny mortal.', '', 30414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Onslaught will wash over the Lich King\'s forces!', '', 30413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anakh kyree!', '', 30412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunate. The best was yet to come.', '', 30411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How disappointing for you.', '', 30410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gave in too soon!', '', 30409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impostor must be dealt with. The Inventor\'s Disk must be recovered.', '', 30408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Inventor\'s Disk has fallen into the hands of an unauthorized user.  Activating defense protocol.', '', 30407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Identity verification failed. User is not Keeper Mimir.', '', 30406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Standby to verify identity as Keeper Mimir.', '', 30405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Norgannon\'s shell accounted for and secure. It will be available for transfer once user\'s identity has been verified.', '', 30404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Verifying status of Norgannon\'s shell.', '', 30403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use of the Inventor\'s Disk detected. Emergency protocol gamma activated.', '', 30402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This mean war!', '', 30401, 0, 7577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARRRROOOOOGGGGAAAA!!!', '', 30400, 0, 7577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Revenge for Rageclaw!', '', 30399, 0, 7577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I poop on you, trollses!', '', 30398, 0, 7577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more mister nice wolvar!', '', 30397, 0, 7577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rageclaw free! Troll die now!', '', 30396, 0, 7577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See to your arms! We must protect the harbor, or the Alliance\'s assault on Northrend will be halted before it can even begin!', '', 30395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARGH!  THIS SMALL VICTORY WILL AVAIL YOU NOTHING!  COME!  COME TO NORTHREND.  MY MINIONS ARE WAITING, AND THEY ARE HUNGRY....', '', 30394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOOLS OF STORMWIND!  HEAR ME, NAIVE CHILDREN OF THE ALLIANCE!  TREMBLE AND KNOW YOUR DOOM, FOR THE LICH KING\'S GAZE IS FIXED UPON YOU!', '', 30393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard the Horde is amassing its own army to head to Northrend. HOPEFULLY your Alliance and the Horde can focus their aggression on the real threat. You know, instead of each other?$B$BSomehow I think that\'s unlikely to happen, if my experience here is any indication. Your people have been SO welcoming to me.$B$B<Valeera mutters angrily to herself.>', 30392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is no time for talk! If those boats are destroyed, then the Alliance will keep fighting the Scourge in their home instead of the Lich King\'s! So make yourself useful and kill some undead!', 30391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see that look in your eyes. Don\'t think I\'m ignorant to the feelings of your people. I\'m just as uncomfortable having to suffer the distrusting glares of guard and citizen alike.$B$BI only stick around because of my obligation to Varian. He treats me as an equal... the way the Alliance should have treated my people.$B$BNow, if you\'re done gawking, the Scourge is making a mess of things in Stormwind. Why don\'t you go do something about it?', 30390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t seen such a buildup of forces since the Third War! Varian is dead set on addressing the Scourge threat directly. That\'s just like him....$B$BAre you heading to Northrend? I have never been there, but I hear it is both a beautiful and treacherous land. Sadly, urgent matters at home require my attention, so I will not be able to join Highlord Fordragon and his army on their journey.', '', 30389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s transforms into a Mammoth!', '', 30388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save your words! If the Scourge succeeds here, then the Alliance\'s hopes of striking back at the Lich King are dashed!', '', 30387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has gone through some dramatic changes since I last walked among its citizens in the time of the Third War. Some good and some...$B$B<Broll glances forlornly at Valeera.>$B$B...that could have been regrettably avoided.$B$BWith all the focus on the Burning Legion and their attacks on Azeroth, the Scourge has grown into a formidable force. The Legion\'s corruption and Scourge\'s defilement of the land are one and the same: an aberration of the natural order that must end.', '', 30386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to transform!', '', 30385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our efforts in Lordaeron have been all for naught. Despite numerous setbacks, the Scourge remain unfazed. We must cut them off at the source.$B$BThe time draws near to sail for Northrend. I don\'t know what awaits us; only that our enemies are numerous and are eager for our slaughter.$B$BBut we cannot pursue any other path in good conscience. Azeroth depends on our vigilance.', '', 30384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blast it, this isn\'t the time for talk! Scourge forces are pressing down upon our war ships. Take up your weapon of choice and protect those boats! If they are destroyed, our war effort will be set back months!', '', 30383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No sooner does King Wrynn return to us that another king makes his presence known.  For five years, we have had the luxury of the Scourge keeping to their conquered lands while brave heroes dealt with threats both near and far.', '', 30382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This latest affront by the Lich King must be dealt with. Stormwind is doing what we can, but it will require the effort of everyone to overcome. Only after the threat at home has passed can we begin to deal with the Scourge threat abroad.$B$BThe traitor prince Arthas tests us from his seat of power in Northrend. Rest assured that the Alliance will not sit on its haunches. Preparations are already underway... for war.$B$BDefeating the Lich King and his armies will be a long and challenging ordeal. Death itself must be conquered. Many lives will be lost, but the future of Azeroth depends on our victory.$B$BI only hope that you\'ll be able to join the battle in Northrend and contribute your skill and strength to the cause.', '', 30381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See to your arms! We must protect the harbor, or the Alliance\'s assault on Northrend will be halted before it can even begin!', '', 30380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too long have I been gone, fighting my way across Azeroth to rediscover my past and reclaim my throne. With all the challenges that have tested the Alliance in my absence, it warms my heart to see heroes such as yourself defending our coalition.', '', 30379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Implementing new security protocols ...', '', 30378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attempting to restore lost data ...', '', 30377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Verifying encryption key ...', '', 30376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defragmenting swap file ...', '', 30375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Running a level three diagnostic ...', '', 30374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assessing database integrity ...', '', 30373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello there! Care to buy some fishing supplies, or perhaps take a lesson or two?', 30372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TROLL MAKE ME ANGRY!', '', 30371, 0, 7577, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousssand fangsss gonna rend your flesh!', '', 30370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minionsss of the scale, heed my call!', '', 30369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The frosthound has located the thief\'s hiding place. Confront him!', '', 30368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s has tracked the scent to its source.', '', 30367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s sniffs the ground to pickup the trail.', '', 30366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been seen! Use the net and ice slick to keep the dwarves away!', '', 30365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to show you my true power! [PH]', '', 30364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Tabard of the Protector.', 'I\'ve lost my Tabard of the Protector.', 30363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Tabard of the Achiever.', 'I\'ve lost my Tabard of the Achiever.', 30362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.', 'Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions.', 30361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Purple Trophy Tabard of the Illidari.', 'I\'ve lost my Purple Trophy Tabard of the Illidari.', 30360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Green Trophy Tabard of the Illidari.', 'I\'ve lost my Green Trophy Tabard of the Illidari.', 30359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Tabard of the Hand.', 'I\'ve lost my Tabard of the Hand.', 30358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Tabard of the Argent Dawn.', 'I\'ve lost my Tabard of the Argent Dawn.', 30357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Blood Knight Tabard.', 'I\'ve lost my Blood Knight Tabard.', 30356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Battle Tabard of the Defilers.', 'I\'ve lost my Battle Tabard of the Defilers.', 30355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Arathor Battle Tabard.', 'I\'ve lost my Arathor Battle Tabard.', 30354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking for a tabard?', 'Looking for a tabard?', 30353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Der be no stoppin\' us!', '', 30352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Der ain\'t notin anybody can do about it!', '', 30351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noting can save you, beasties! Dis be Scourge land now!', '', 30350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da little beasties\' homes light up nice!', '', 30349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis whole place gonna belong to da Scourge!', '', 30348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat be da will o\' Drakuru!', '', 30347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BURN, BABY, BURN!', '', 30346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What be happening?$B$BYou here to eat, mon? Or maybe to learn cooking from the best, eh?', '', 30345, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s throws a bomb.', 'The %s throws a bomb.', 30344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trolls is shameful. Trolls is killers!', '', 30343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you smell so bad now? You smelled much less bad before!', '', 30342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hurted the chief\'s lion seal! WHY YOU HURT LION SEAL??!', '', 30341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You leave den the hard way!', '', 30340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You kill our pups! We kill you back!', '', 30339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rageclaw and troll friends no more!', '', 30338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you hurt Rageclaw? You crazy?', '', 30337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go now, bad troll!', '', 30336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acquiring', '', 30335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a portal to the Warsong Gulch battleground.', '', 30334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience.', 'You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience.', 30333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a portal to the Eye of the Storm battleground.', '', 30332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a portal to the Alterac Valley battleground.', '', 30331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a portal to the Arathi Basin battleground.', '', 30330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s daydreams about princes and far off places.', 30329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s whistles while she works.', 30328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My life and spirit has been filled with memories of the insufferable Horde. Times of sorrow, desperation, and sacrifice have come to pass. The rage of battle could never leave my heart!', 30327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stand before a master of the Arcane. One would be unwise to challenge me. Many corpses have been left ablaze in my wake.', '', 30326, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s up to you to find him before the irons do!', '', 30325, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are some rather cryptic instructions in this note. Brann must\'ve had some kind of backup plan, but he can\'t keep evading capture forever...', '', 30324, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re not going to give up until they find him. We can\'t allow that to happen, $n, and Brann knows it.', '', 30323, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s those blasted iron dwarves again! Somehow, they found him before we did.', '', 30322, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
