('I\'ve lost my key to Karazhan.', 'I\'ve lost my key to Karazhan.', 30321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost The Eye of Haramad.', 'I\'ve lost The Eye of Haramad.', 30320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Shadowforge Key.', 'I\'ve lost my Shadowforge Key.', 30319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my key to Searing Gorge.', 'I\'ve lost my key to Searing Gorge.', 30318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my key to The Shattered Halls.', 'I\'ve lost my key to The Shattered Halls.', 30317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
