('Hey $c, if you\'ve lost a key I might be able to help you out.', 'Hey $c, if you\'ve lost a key I might be able to help you out.', 30314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 30313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pansy.', '', 30312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was close! You scared me.', '', 30311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow!', '', 30310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no... no!', '', 30309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want to die!', '', 30308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my...', '', 30307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh!', '', 30306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... that\'s okay. It still kind of hurts from last time.', '', 30305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... good point. How about right there? That looks clear... kind of.', '', 30304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It really doesn\'t look like it, Bailey.', '', 30303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We wait for the next adventurer to come through and we tell him that\'s the way to go... then after they set off the mines, we just walk in and grab the tools!', '', 30302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a path right there... only a few mines at the end in between us and the tools.', '', 30301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no - this might work!', '', 30300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got an idea, Bailey...', '', 30299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, no! Not short... it\'s just... well... maybe I could toss you across most of it?', '', 30298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... I was just thinking... you\'re a bit smaller, so you\'re less likely to set off any of those mines.', '', 30297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it, lad! It looks totally safe. Go for it, I\'ll be right behind ya!', '', 30296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'d the goblin leave his tools there then?', '', 30295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s got to be a way in somewhere.', '', 30294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cause I\'m just going to watch and laugh as they toss you in.', '', 30293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better hope they don\'t survive it, lad.', '', 30292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it to yourself.', '', 30291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toss me?! Okay, that\'s it punk.', '', 30290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That right? Well why don\'t you go prance your merry little self over and grab them, eh?', '', 30289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s strange... for a moment there, I could have swore you called me short.', '', 30288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know, Bailey... it\'s not so bad. We could throw a rock at the tools from here.', '', 30287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This doesn\'t look pretty, lad.', '', 30286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Icefang shows great courage for entering the battlefield unarmored.$b$bPerhaps her example could instill some courage in you, $n.', 30285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge are breaching the northern wall!', 'The Scourge are breaching the northern wall!', 30284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge are breaching the western wall!', 'The Scourge are breaching the western wall!', 30283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AHAHAHAHAHA! Incompetence at its finest!', '', 30282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you find me? Did Landgren tell?', '', 30281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
