('You messed with the wrong goblin.', 'You messed with the wrong goblin.', 30132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bombs are great!', 'Bombs are great!', 30131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love blowing things up!', 'I love blowing things up!', 30130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaah, it\'s beautiful!', 'Aaaah, it\'s beautiful!', 30129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaaboooom!', 'Kaaboooom!', 30128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this...', 'Let\'s do this...', 30127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring it on, hot stuff!', 'Bring it on, hot stuff!', 30126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Hyldsmeet is sacred.  Whoever earns victory is assured a lifetime next to Thorim.', 30125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nasty little...A-ak, kaw! Kill! Yes, kill you!', '', 30124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s gazes longingly at the flying machine... or is it McGoyver she\'s watching?', 30123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s sighs wistfully at McGoyver... or is it the flying machine?', 30122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s flutters her lashes at the ignorant McGoyver.', 30121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, sir!', 'Yes, sir!', 30120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... we\'re undertakers, sir.', '', 30119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here for civilian work, sir.', '', 30118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s quite a tale, lord-commander.', 'That\'s quite a tale, lord-commander.', 30117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you go, mon. Your very own bone gryphon Now let\'s talk about you takin\' it out to fight the Onslaught!', '', 30116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Onslaught Harbor or lose your Bone Gryphon!', '', 30115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Icecrown or lose the Onslaught Gryphon!', '', 30114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The apothecaries toil day and night on a cure for the Lich King\'s plague.  Without them, both the Horde and the Alliance would be lost.', 'The apothecaries toil day and night on a cure for the Lich King\'s plague.  Without them, both the Horde and the Alliance would be lost.', 30113, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The souls of the undead are cursed and tortured.  If I am infected, promise you\'ll burn me before I turn..', 'The souls of the undead are cursed and tortured.  If I am infected, promise you\'ll burn me before I turn.', 30112, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what there is to hunt in Northrend.  Fierce beasts, I wager.', 'I wonder what there is to hunt in Northrend.  Fierce beasts, I wager.', 30111, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh is eager to take the fight to the north, though Thrall urgres caution...', 'Garrosh is eager to take the fight to the north, though Thrall urgres caution...', 30110, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So troll, have you given thought to my suggestion?  Whatever you decide, I\'m sure it\'ll make Ironhide happy.', '', 30109, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got an idea troll.  How about you tell me about Drak\'Tharon, then I let old Ironhide have a snack?', '', 30108, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drakkari Warrior, huh?  We\'ll see how much of a warrior you are when you fight Ironhide.', '', 30107, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is running out troll.  Whenever you feel like talking about Drak\'Tharon, let me know.', '', 30106, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet you miss your neighbor.  I\'ll see if you can\'t join him soon enough.', '', 30105, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What about you?  Are you ready to be Ironhide\'s next chew toy, or are you ready to talk?  I\'ll let you think about it for a while.', '', 30104, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One empty cage.  One troll lost to the pit.  Do any of you other trolls need more convincing?', '', 30103, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rumors drift like leaves on the wind.  They say that Highborne live to the north!', 'Rumors drift like leaves on the wind.  They say that Highborne live to the north!', 30102, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha!  I almost miss old Jum\'ja.  He was tough.  But Ironhide seemed to chew through him easy enough.', '', 30101, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can smell a market up north... time to pack up the goods and put on my heavy coat!', 'I can smell a market up north... time to pack up the goods and put on my heavy coat!', 30100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can smell a market up north... time to pack up the goods and put on a heavy coat!', 'I can smell a market up north... time to pack up the goods and put on a heavy coat!', 30099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard that the king is found!  He\'s returning to Stormwind!', 'I heard that the king is found!  He\'s returning to Stormwind!', 30098, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The unique magnetic fields of the polar regions pose millions of research possibilities!', 'The unique magnetic fields of the polar regions pose millions of research possibilities!', 30097, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The continent of Northrend is filled with history!  We must dig deep through the frozen ice and find our ancestors.', 'The continent of Northrend is filled with history!  We must dig deep through the frozen ice and find our ancestors.', 30096, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we serve the Light, then we must go north and face the darkness residing there.', 'If we serve the Light, then we must go north and face the darkness residing there.', 30095, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Consider all of the suffering that the Scarlets have caused over the years. The torture, the zealotry, the murder.$B$BI won\'t allow that to continue. Will you?', 30094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the blood elves go to Northrend, then vengeance shall be ours at last!  The Lich King will regret his march on our beloved Silvermoon City!', 'If the blood elves go to Northrend, then vengeance shall be ours at last!  The Lich King will regret his march on our beloved Silvermoon City!', 30093, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the Tauren have cousins in Northrend.  I hope they\'re good hunters... I hope they hunt undead.', 'I heard the Tauren have cousins in Northrend.  I hope they\'re good hunters... I hope they hunt undead.', 30092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stormwind Harbor is really bustling.  I wonder where the new boats will sail...', 'The Stormwind Harbor is really bustling.  I wonder where the new boats will sail...', 30091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The chill creeping from the north gives my bones a fierce ache.', 'The chill creeping from the north gives my bones a fierce ache.', 30090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rumors say that giant men live in Northrend.  They have beards made of daggers and can put out fires with their dead, cold gaze.', 'Rumors say that giant men live in Northrend.  They have beards made of daggers and can put out fires with their dead, cold gaze.', 30089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard that the Lich King  is stirring up north, in the Frozen Wastes.  He built a fortress, Icecrown, and plans our doom.', 'I heard that the Lich King  is stirring up north, in the Frozen Wastes.  He built a fortress, Icecrown, and plans our doom.', 30088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to summon!', '', 30087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s Protective Bubble shatters!', '', 30086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, $n!  Don\'t let me down!', 'Come on, $n!  Don\'t let me down!', 30085, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull it together, $n!', 'Pull it together, $n!', 30084, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rip \'em apart, $n!', 'Rip \'em apart, $n!', 30083, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do it, $n!', 'Do it, $n!', 30082, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n!', '$n!', 30081, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t show \'em any mercy $n!', 'Don\'t show \'em any mercy $n!', 30080, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on $n!  You can do it!', 'Come on $n!  You can do it!', 30079, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on $n!  I\'ve got good money riding on you!', 'Come on $n!  I\'ve got good money riding on you!', 30078, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no!  $n is looking hurt!', 'Oh no!  $n is looking hurt!', 30077, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, I just need a little.  A finger or an ear will do...', '', 30076, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Living flesh eases the pain...', '', 30075, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, I just need a little.  A finger or an ear will do...', '', 30074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Living flesh eases the pain...', '', 30073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is fire in my eyes!  My mind!', '', 30072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and souls for my King!', '', 30070, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and souls for my King!', '', 30069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My King knows of you.  He wants to see you...', '', 30068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... I\'ve seen you in Shattrath...', '', 30067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Please!  $n!  Destroy me!', '', 30066, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show mercy, $n!  Give me peace!', '', 30065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the torture end!', '', 30064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please!  $n!  Destroy me!', '', 30063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...killed loved ones... eaten them...', '', 30062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have done such vile things...', '', 30061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please!  $n!  Destroy me!', '', 30060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope sweetens the soul, and yours will be a fine dessert for the Lich King!', '', 30059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cling to your hope, mortal!', '', 30058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I?  So dark...', '', 30057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me your brain!', '', 30056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must feed...', '', 30055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My king!  I cannot hear your voice!  Do not leave me!', '', 30054, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must feed...', '', 30053, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me your brain!', '', 30052, 36, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My king!  I cannot hear your voice!  Do not leave me!', '', 30051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The lord-commander flashes a rictus grin, looking you up and down discerningly.>$B$BThat\'s what I wanted to hear.', '', 30050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 2000, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s finish this!', 'Let\'s finish this!', 30049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll start in just a moment.$B$BI just want to be very clear -- we\'re not here to soften them up. We\'re not here to make a dent. We\'re here to put an end to the disease that calls itself the Scarlet Onslaught.$B$BIf you don\'t want any part of that, if you don\'t have the stomach, fly away now. I want someone with us who is going to be here every day until the job\'s done.$B$BAre you that $g man : woman;, $n?', '', 30048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s fine. When do I start?', 'That\'s fine. When do I start?', 30047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I said, we lost track of him, but this is something that I\'m sure you will be able to figure out for me. My suspicion is that he\'s down there somewhere, but my spies that have returned haven\'t been able to place him anywhere on the island.$B$BThe Forsaken at Venomspite did a good job of sabotaging New Hearthglen, but the Onslaught forces that are present down there are the battle-hardened remnant from that place. Unfortunately, they picked up better equipment along the way, as well as gryphons taken from fools somewhere.$B$BWhat I\'m trying to say is that this isn\'t going to be a stroll in the countryside, $n, even for you.', '', 30046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did the grand admiral go?', 'Where did the grand admiral go?', 30045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Corpse go boom!', '', 30044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So hungry! Must feed!', '', 30043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me gonna carve you and eat you!', '', 30042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mo\' guts! Mo\' blood! Mo\' food!', '', 30041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The lord-commander fixes you with a stare before going on.>$B$BI was getting to that. Indeed, when High General Abbendis landed her forces on Northrend, she changed their name to the Scarlet Onslaught.$B$BIt was not long before Admiral Barean Westwind presented himself to her at New Hearthglen in the Dragonblight. From all accounts, she wasn\'t expecting him. Nor was she expecting that he would undermine her authority and take the reins of command away from her.$B$BLikely you were involved with her demise, but no matter. Once she was dead, the admiral made a mysterious exit and we lost track of him.', '', 30040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2000, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord-Commander, would you repeat what you said before?', 'Lord-Commander, would you repeat what you said before?', 30039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought that they now called themselves the Scarlet Onslaught?', 'I thought that they now called themselves the Scarlet Onslaught?', 30038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the Lich King fleeing in fear of Fordring armed with the Ashbringer, we were able to easily wrest Ebon Hold from the remaining Scourge forces.$B$BThat didn\'t settle things between us and the Scarlet Crusade, however.$B$BAs the Forsaken have learned the hard way, the Scarlets cannot seem to differentiate between us and the Scourge.$B$BWe think on our own, we have our own motivations, we have almost all of the qualities of the living, and yet to them, we are no different than the mindless slaves of the Lich King.$B$BMistakenly they think we will roll over and play dead.', '', 30037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just give up and die already!', '', 30036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You nod slightly but do not complete the motion as the lord-commander narrows his eyes before he continues.>', '<You nod slightly but do not complete the motion as the lord-commander narrows his eyes before he continues.>', 30035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, but if I were you, I would pay attention and not just blindly nod my head at what I heard.$B$BIt begins, as all good stories do, with betrayal. Oh, it\'s not that we were betrayed... not at all. The Lich King raised us death knights above all others.$B$BRather, it was we who betrayed him with the help of Highlord Darion Mograine.$B$BIn the final fight at Light\'s Hope Chapel in the Plaguelands, with the simpletons moments away from annihilation, Tirion Fordring helped Mograine break the Lich King\'s hold upon him and all of the rest of us that were present.', '', 30034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord-Commander, I would hear your tale.', 'Lord-Commander, I would hear your tale.', 30033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, the Lich King will fall to our might. We will have our final revenge.$B$BBut first, we will see to it that the plague known as the Scarlet Onslaught comes to an end once and for all!', '', 30032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Git up, you!', '', 30031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light\'s Hope Chapel remains a bastion in the Plaguelands.  Argent Dawn\'s foothold there is key to securing the area.', 'Light\'s Hope Chapel remains a bastion in the Plaguelands.  Argent Dawn\'s foothold there is key to securing the area.', 30030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Argent Dawn\'s agents scored a decisive victory in the deserts of Tanaris.', 'The Argent Dawn\'s agents scored a decisive victory in the deserts of Tanaris.', 30029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last attack in the Eastern Plaguelands yielded a large harvest of dead, from both sides.', 'The last attack in the Eastern Plaguelands yielded a large harvest of dead, from both sides.', 30028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freshly killed zombies are arriving via meat wagon, though their numbers are dwindling.', 'Freshly killed zombies are arriving via meat wagon, though their numbers are dwindling.', 30027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind is still beset -- a necropolis looms at its walls and random Scourge outbreaks have been reported.', 'Stormwind is still beset -- a necropolis looms at its walls and random Scourge outbreaks have been reported.', 30026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By order of the grand admiral, stay away from the southern side of the island upon pain of death. Spread the word.', 'By order of the grand admiral, stay away from the southern side of the island upon pain of death. Spread the word.', 30025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land is freezing, but I am warm, blanketed in the glow of the Holy Light. Do not be disheartened.', 'This land is freezing, but I am warm, blanketed in the glow of the Holy Light. Do not be disheartened.', 30024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Admiral Westwind has a plan... a vision. We must remain faithful and steadfast in its execution for the sake of the world.', 'Grand Admiral Westwind has a plan... a vision. We must remain faithful and steadfast in its execution for the sake of the world.', 30023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not question what the Holy Light has put before you. Only those that sacrifice all will be delivered into its presence.', 'Do not question what the Holy Light has put before you. Only those that sacrifice all will be delivered into its presence.', 30022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are villains amongst us - remain vigilant. The Ebon Blade seeks to prevent us from destroying their true master, the Lich King.', 'There are villains amongst us - remain vigilant. The Ebon Blade seeks to prevent us from destroying their true master, the Lich King.', 30021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not waver. Soon we shall sit within the hallowed presence of the Light.', 'Do not waver. Soon we shall sit within the hallowed presence of the Light.', 30020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept this blessing in the name of the Holy Light.', 'Accept this blessing in the name of the Holy Light.', 30019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maintain your faith. The grand admiral will deliver us to victory over the Lich King.', 'Maintain your faith. The grand admiral will deliver us to victory over the Lich King.', 30018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Arena battle ends in 60 seconds.', '', 30017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There.  I found you...', '', 30016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, there you are...', '', 30014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you...', '', 30013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings...', '', 30012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
