('Because you\'ve managed to replenish some of our supplies I can get back to cooking.  Now, what can I do for you?', '', 29863, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our storehouses have been depleted.  I have nothing to sell until we can get more supplies.', '', 29862, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your end.', '', 29861, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s chows down ravenously.', '%s chows down ravenously.', 29860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hurries over.', '%s hurries over.', 29859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why, thank you. I do pride myself on knowing when a little bit of grease beats spending hours of sorcerous study for the same effect.', 'Why, thank you. I do pride myself on knowing when a little bit of grease beats spending hours of sorcerous study for the same effect.', 29858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are such a devious one! Whatever shall we do with you?', 'You are such a devious one! Whatever shall we do with you?', 29857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s places a stick of dynamite upon the ground.', '%s places a stick of dynamite upon the ground.', 29856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, eat this, our enemies shall be delighted.', 'Here, eat this, our enemies shall be delighted.', 29855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ghoul! Come here still for a moment!', 'Ghoul! Come here still for a moment!', 29854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here you are, $n.$b$bNow please, return your focus to the task at hand....', '', 29853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s moves up the tunnel!', '', 29852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So too do the Knights of the Ebon Blade. Although our kind has no place in your world, we will fight to bring an end to the Lich King. This I vow!', '', 29851, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Argent Crusade comes for you, Arthas!\n', '', 29850, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will take the fight to Arthas, and we will tear down the walls of Icecrown!', '', 29849, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Argent Dawn and the Order of the Silver Hand will come together as one! We will succeed where so many before us have failed!\n', '', 29848, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I make a promise to you now, brothers and sisters: the Lich King will be defeated! On this day, I call for a union.', '', 29847, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King must answer for what he has done, and must not be allowed to cause further destruction in our world.', '', 29846, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And while such things can never be forgotten, we must remain vigilant in our cause!\n', '', 29845, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A good start. Return, disciple.', '', 29844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have all been witness to a terrible tragedy. The blood of good men has been shed upon this soil! Honorable knights, slain defending their lives -- our lives!', '', 29843, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have learned well. Continue on your path, disciple.', '', 29842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have more learning ahead of you disciple. Return to your studies.', '', 29841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done.', '', 29840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your retention was poor.', '', 29839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is the reward for your weakness.', '', 29838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such is the price of failure.', '', 29837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be frightened child... welcome the cold embrace of death...', '', 29836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise, Darion, and listen...\n', '', 29835, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s switches to Defensive Stance!', '', 29834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s switches to Berserker Stance!', '', 29833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s switches to Battle Stance!', '', 29832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my ensorcelled choker!', 'I\'ve lost my ensorcelled choker!', 29831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mages fear our kind... with reason. Play upon this fear, disciples.', 29830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The power you absorb from spells with your shell can be used to counter with your other attacks.', 29829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your spells will not be as potent as mine, but you will still find anti-magic shells to be entirely invaluable against a large number of magical attacks.', 29828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When next we meet, it won\'t be on holy ground, paladin.', '', 29827, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... is not over!', '', 29826, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible...', '', 29825, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That day is not today...', '', 29824, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s prepares to shatter his Brittle Golems!', '', 29823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master?', '', 29822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me... bad?', '', 29821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It hurts...', '', 29820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unfortunate.', 29819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm...', 29818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At times, their corpses can prove more useful than the ghouls were themselves.', 29817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I often find the trouble with ghouls is that they outlive their usefulness too quickly. Let us let death and decay reclaim these.', 29816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry... me gone... so long... master.', '', 29815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me come back... master. Me... loyal servant.', '', 29814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Me... back... master...', '', 29813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally... home...', '', 29812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are unfit to serve the Lich King even in undeath. Work hard and I may yet release you forever from this world. Fail me, and you will fuel the fires with your flesh.', '', 29811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you perhaps confused, mortal? The metal end is for stabbing, not pricking! Sharpen it again!', '', 29810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen forks stronger than this. Forge it again!', '', 29809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this is the qualilty one can expect in a weapon of the Argent Dawn, then it is only a matter of time before they fall.', '', 29808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call this a weapon? Keep this up, knave and I\'ll see that you\'re brought back as one of them. Maybe then you will learn how to put your back into it.', '', 29807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The quality of this workmanship is pathetic. Not even fit for a Ghoul to wield.', '', 29806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cackles maniacally.', '', 29805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?', '', 29804, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARTHAS!!!!', '', 29803, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s collapses.', '', 29802, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tirion!', '', 29801, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This lack of knowledge is just one more weakness among many. There is little hope against the power of death itself.', 29800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some healers lack the knowledge to counter the diseases that we master.', 29799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disciples... you will find with time that many healing spells fall victim to the degeneration of our strikes.', 29798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strange, I did not think there were any of those left in the shadow realm. Beware disciples, this one is a bit dangerous.', 29797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skeletal mages. A perfect opportunity to display the utility of some of our powers.', 29796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skeletons. Simple play things, but there are lessons to be learned even here.', 29795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Moving on...', 29794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are many lessons left to learn, let us move onto our next subject...', 29793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What beast lies in store for us...', 29792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us coldly greet another inhabitant of the shadow realm...', 29791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dearest shadow realm, grace us with the presence of one of your many denizens.', 29790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember... always...\n', '', 29789, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('APOCALYPSE!', '', 29788, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ATTACK!!', '', 29787, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gasps for air.', '', 29786, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How simple it was to draw the great Tirion Fordring out of hiding. You\'ve left yourself exposed, paladin. Nothing will save you.', '', 29785, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were right, Fordring. I did send them in to die. Their lives are meaningless, but yours...', '', 29784, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a damned monster, Arthas!', '', 29783, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic...', '', 29782, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... betrayed me. You betrayed us all, monster! Face the might of Mograine!', '', 29781, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is mine now...', '', 29780, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Touching...', '', 29779, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not forget...', '', 29778, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My son, there will come a day when you will command the Ashbringer and, with it, mete out justice across this land. I have no doubt that when that day finally comes, you will bring pride to our people and that Lordaeron will be a better place because of you. But, my son, that day is not today.\n', '', 29777, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I die, Father, I would rather it be on my feet, standing in defiance against the undead legions! If I die, let me die with you!', '', 29776, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darion Mograine, you are barely of age to hold a sword, let alone battle the undead hordes of Lordaeron! I could not bear losing you. Even the thought...\n', '', 29775, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father, I wish to join you in the war against the undead. I want to fight! I can sit idle no longer!', '', 29774, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing could have kept me away from here, Darion. Not from my home and family.', '', 29773, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cries.', '', 29772, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hugs his father.', '', 29771, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been gone a long time, Father. I thought...', '', 29770, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father, you have returned!', '', 29769, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh... what... is...', '', 29768, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father!', '', 29767, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow your heads!', 'Bow your heads!', 29766, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow your heads!', 'Bow your heads!', 29765, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... It can\'t be...', 'I... It can\'t be...', 29764, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashbringer!', 'Ashbringer!', 29763, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My son! My dear, beautiful boy!', '', 29762, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save your breath, old man. It might be the last you ever draw.', '', 29761, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand down, death knights. We have lost. The Light... this place... no hope...', '', 29760, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s kneels in defeat before Tirion Fordring.', '', 29759, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s flees.', '', 29758, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You\'ve led us into a trap! I won\'t die here, Mograine!', '', 29757, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring them before the chapel!', '', 29756, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('D... Dying...', '', 29755, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is overwhelming... cannot fight...', '', 29754, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t... focus...', '', 29753, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What should we do, Highlord?', '', 29752, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is decimating our armies!', '', 29751, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are being consumed by the Light!', '', 29750, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening? What is this?', '', 29749, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My powers are fading, Highlord!', '', 29747, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you are feeling right now is the anguish of a thousand lost souls! Souls that you and your master brought here! The Light will tear you apart, Darion!', '', 29746, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your master knows what lies beneath the chapel. That is why he dares not show his face! He\'s sent you and your death knights to meet their doom, Darion.', '', 29745, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you learned nothing, boy? You have become all that your father fought against! Like that coward, Arthas, you allowed yourself to be consumed by the darkness, the hate... feeding upon the misery of those you tortured and killed!', '', 29744, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot win, Darion!', '', 29743, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions, come to my aid!', '', 29742, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashbringer defies me...', '', 29741, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power... wanes...', '', 29740, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening to me?', '', 29739, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I cannot... The blade fights me...', '', 29738, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will do as I command! I am in control here!', '', 29737, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OBEY ME, BLADE!', '', 29736, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?! My... I cannot strike...', '', 29735, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare no one!', '', 29734, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Argent Dawn is finished!', '', 29733, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much longer will your forces hold out?', '', 29732, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Life is meaningless without suffering!', '', 29731, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life is forfeit!', '', 29730, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge will destroy this place!', '', 29729, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stand no chance!', '', 29728, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel before the Highlord!', '', 29727, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise, minions! Destroy them!', '', 29726, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s falls unconscious.', '%s falls unconscious.', 29725, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scourge armies approach!', '', 29724, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand fast, brothers and sisters! The Light will prevail!', '', 29723, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies turn red with the blood of the fallen! The Lich King watches over us, minions! Leave only ashes and misery in your destructive wake!', 'The skies turn red with the blood of the fallen! The Lich King watches over us, minions! Leave only ashes and misery in your destructive wake!', 29722, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light be cleansed!', 'By the Light be cleansed!', 29721, 0, 7436, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the purging begin!', 'Let the purging begin!', 29720, 0, 7474, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!', 'You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!', 29719, 0, 7474, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will present your head to Abbendis myself!', 'I will present your head to Abbendis myself!', 29718, 0, 7474, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Crusade will be victorious!', 'The Crusade will be victorious!', 29717, 0, 7474, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scourge filth! DIE!', 'Scourge filth! DIE!', 29716, 0, 7474, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
