('Let the purging begin!', 'Let the purging begin!', 29714, 0, 7436, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!', 'You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!', 29713, 0, 7436, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will present your head to Abbendis myself!', 'I will present your head to Abbendis myself!', 29712, 0, 7436, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Crusade will be victorious!', 'The Crusade will be victorious!', 29711, 0, 7436, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scourge filth! DIE!', 'Scourge filth! DIE!', 29710, 0, 7436, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shur\'nab... shur\'nab... Yogg-Saron!', '', 29709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick!  Use the ashes on Ursoc\'s corpse.  We must purge its corruption!', '', 29708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, nevermind. I\'m sure no one would be foolish enough to lay a hand on Kel\'thuzard precious pet.', '', 29707, 7, 7259, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s pounds on the display a few times.', '', 29706, 7, 7259, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mr. Bigglesworth. The last living creature in Naxxramas, this cat is said to be the last thread connecting Kel\'thuzad to his mortal life. It is said that any who dare to harm a hair on his head doom themselves to... wait a second, what is he doing on there?!', '', 29705, 7, 7259, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wha... where am I?', 29704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here is where I sacrificied everything to free my father. Now I come to destroy it...', '', 29703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ghouls? We have quite enough of those already.', 29702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A druid! How curious... I wonder how it got in there.', 29701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RISE!', 'RISE!', 29700, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of the Scourge, death knights of Acherus, minions of the darkness: hear the call of the Highlord!', 'Soldiers of the Scourge, death knights of Acherus, minions of the darkness: hear the call of the Highlord!', 29699, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('EVENT STEP 005 YELL! RAWR!', 'EVENT STEP 005 YELL! RAWR!', 29698, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death knights of Acherus, the death march begins!', 'Death knights of Acherus, the death march begins!', 29697, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sky weeps at the glorious devastation of these lands! Soon, Azeroth\'s futile tears will rain down upon us!', 'The sky weeps at the glorious devastation of these lands! Soon, Azeroth\'s futile tears will rain down upon us!', 29696, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us see what atrocity we can pull from the shadow realm this time...', 29695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of the Scourge, stand ready! Prepare to unleash your fury upon the Argent Dawn!', '', 29694, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death knights of Acherus, hear your master\'s call! The siege of Light\'s Hope is underway! We rally at the mill!\n', '', 29693, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father once told me that life is meaningless... That it is in death that we are truly tested. I sense that the siege of Light\'s Hope will give meaning to his words. We strike soon, $n. Stand ready.', '', 29692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Highlord. Let the siege of Light\'s Hope begin!', 'I am ready, Highlord. Let the siege of Light\'s Hope begin!', 29691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here is where I sacrificed everything to free my father. Now I come to destroy it...', '', 29690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your first test awaits you. Destroy our uninvited guests.', '', 29689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your sacrifice is a testament to your obedience.  Indeed you are worthy of this charge. Arise, and forever be known as Svala Sorrowgrave!', '', 29688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will be happy to slaughter them in your name! Come, enemies of the Scourge! I will show you the might of the Lich King!', 29687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sensation is... beyond my imagining. I am yours to command, my king.', 29686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll never forget what you did for Thassarian.  I will always be in your debt.', 29685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My liege! I have done as you asked, and now beseech you for your blessing!', 29684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nooo! I did not come this far... to...', 29683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any last words?', 29682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yor-guul mak!', 29681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your end is inevitable.', 29680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go now to my master!', 29679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your death approaches....', 29678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another soul for my master!', 29677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your will is done, my king!', 29676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were a fool to challenge the power of the Lich King!', 29675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frozen solid, ripe for the slaughter. Let loose a howling blast and shatter them into pieces, disciple.', '', 29674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not overwhelmed just yet disciple... let the hungering cold of death halt this onslaught.', '', 29673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will vanquish your soul!', 29672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time for your challenge disciple. Use my teachings well.', '', 29671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prove that you understand my teachings, disciple.', '', 29670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have stood and listened long enough. Step forth.', '', 29669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let the ice in your blood slow your step. Prove your prowess, disciple.', '', 29668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time for your learning to be put to the test. Step forth.', '', 29667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let it consider its next spell so freely, disciple... freeze its mind.', '', 29666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Its spells would be less threatening if its incantations were slowed by your icy touch...', '', 29665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step forth disciple. Show me what you have learned.', '', 29664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GO!', '', 29663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay. Fight again. No more stupid.', '', 29662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guard bellies or bellies get opened up! You hitting higher body, not watching lower.', '', 29661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster. Fight faster! Both of you slow like bigtongue. Maybe I dump you in water, make you slimy like bigtongues too, make them take you in.', '', 29660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ajark, you standing like rock. Rakat move more. You move or you get hurt by wasp sting or bristlepine tusk, you see. Move more!', '', 29659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rakat, you stupid. You lose your nose if you keep sticking it where claws go. You lose nose, you can\'t smell. You can\'t smell, you hunt bad, you useless.', '', 29658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for listening. You listen to son of Zart, best scrapper Frenzyheart ever see!', '', 29657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like music to my ears. Scream for me, human.', '', 29656, 0, 7487, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
