('Now we\'re gettin\' someplace!', '', 29628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Where in the-- don\'t just stand around lads; kill somebody!', '', 29627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just like hunters, pets also have specializations. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can\'t take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy\'s attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas.$b$bEach pet comes with a default specialization.', 'Just like hunters, pets also have specializations. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can\'t take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy\'s attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas.$b$bEach pet comes with a default specialization.', 29626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I train my pet?', 'How do I train my pet?', 29625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
