('The zeppelin to Orgrimmar has just arrived! All aboard for Durotar!', 'The zeppelin to Orgrimmar has just arrived! All aboard for Durotar!', 29551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
