('See... you... soon.', '', 29529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skarvald, you incompetent slug! Return and make yourself useful!', '', 29528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By all means, don\'t assess the situation, you halfwit! Just jump into the fray!', '', 29527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
