('Not sure who told you I had some ale left, but keep it quiet will ya? There ain\'t no way I have enough for the whole camp.', '', 29501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was sent to get some of your famous hard ale. Have any to spare?', 'I was sent to get some of your famous hard ale. Have any to spare?', 29500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
