('Listen ta me, $g brudda:sista;. You must fight against da Lich King\'s control. He be a monster dat want ta see dis world - our world - be ruined. Don\'t let he use you ta accomplish he goals. You be a hero once and you be a hero again! Fight it, mon! Fight he control!', 'Listen ta me, $g brudda:sista;. You must fight against da Lich King\'s control. He be a monster dat want ta see dis world - our world - be ruined. Don\'t let he use you ta accomplish he goals. You be a hero once and you be a hero again! Fight it, mon! Fight he control!', 29409, 0, 7465, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
