('There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Teldrassil, our beloved home. This world is worth saving.', 'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Teldrassil, our beloved home. This world is worth saving.', 29330, 0, 7459, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!', 'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!', 29329, 0, 7459, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the kaldorei once! This isn\'t you!', 'You must remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the kaldorei once! This isn\'t you!', 29328, 0, 7459, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fear we haven\'t seen the last of Arugal...', 29327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t remember me? When you were a child your mother would leave you in my care while she served at the Temple of the Moon. I held you in my arms and fed you honey and sheep\'s milk to calm you until she would return. You were my little angel. Blasted Scourge... What have they done to you, $n?', 'You don\'t remember me? When you were a child your mother would leave you in my care while she served at the Temple of the Moon. I held you in my arms and fed you honey and sheep\'s milk to calm you until she would return. You were my little angel. Blasted Scourge... What have they done to you, $n?', 29326, 0, 7459, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?', '$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?', 29325, 0, 7459, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n?', '$n?', 29324, 0, 7459, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to stand for...', 'I\'d like to stand for...', 29323, 0, 7459, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to finish the job, have you?', 'Come to finish the job, have you?', 29322, 0, 7459, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Worgen everywhere!  Don\'t give up yet, I\'m right behind you!', 29321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on in there? What\'s taking so long, $n?', '', 29320, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s dies from her injuries.', '%s dies from her injuries.', 29319, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!', 'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!', 29318, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Elwynn. This world is worth saving.', 'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Elwynn. This world is worth saving.', 29317, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!', 'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!', 29316, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the hills and valleys of Elwynn, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the Alliance once! This isn\'t you.', 'Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the hills and valleys of Elwynn, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the Alliance once! This isn\'t you.', 29315, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They\'ve tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a human!', 'You don\'t remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They\'ve tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a human!', 29314, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?', '$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?', 29313, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n?', '$n?', 29312, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to stand for...', 'I\'d like to stand for...', 29311, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to finish the job, have you?', 'Come to finish the job, have you?', 29310, 0, 7458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on in there? What\'s taking so long, $n?', '', 29309, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The Gate of the Blue Sapphire was destroyed!', '', 29308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 34116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gate of the Green Emerald was destroyed!', '', 29307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 34117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gate of the Red Sun was destroyed!', '', 29306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 34119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gate of the Purple Amethyst was destroyed!', '', 29305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 34118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gate of the Yellow Moon was destroyed!', '', 29304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 34120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s dies from his injuries.', '', 29303, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!', '', 29302, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Mulgore. This world is worth saving.', '', 29301, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gate of the Yellow Moon is under attack!', '', 29300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gate of the Purple Amethyst is under attack!', '', 29299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gate of the Red Sun is under attack!', '', 29298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gate of the Green Emerald is under attack!', '', 29297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gate of the Blue Sapphire is under attack!', '', 29296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!', '', 29295, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the rolling plains of Mulgore, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the tauren once! This isn\'t you.', '', 29294, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me now, $n. I must be speakin\' wit ya.', '', 29293, 0, 7392, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Lich King be sharin\' his power wit dem who serve him well, mon.', '', 29292, 0, 7392, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh yeah, mon! Dere be great glory ta be had here!', '', 29291, 0, 7392, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They\'ve tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a tauren!', '', 29290, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'d recognize those horns anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?', '', 29289, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n?', '', 29288, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll look me in the eyes when...', '', 29287, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to finish the job, have you?', '', 29286, 0, 7457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sobs.', '%s sobs.', 29285, 0, 7455, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cries softly.', '%s cries softly.', 29284, 0, 7455, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whimpers.', '%s whimpers.', 29283, 0, 7455, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s groans.', '%s groans.', 29282, 0, 7455, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Study dis place well, mon. Ya gonna be helpin\' me conquer it!', '', 29281, 0, 7392, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That certainly wasn\'t the reaction I wanted.', 'That was not the reaction I was hoping for.', 29280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep, shoulda tried the red one!', 'Yep, shoulda gone with the red one!', 29279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mental note, don\'t mix the blue one with the green one.', 'Mental note, don\'t touch the blue one.', 29278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well that didn\'t work.', 'Well that didn\'t work.', 29277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. Once again you have saved us all. I will see you back at Zim\'Torga.', 29276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! I will not be defeated!', '', 29275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I THINK NOT. YOU WILL DROP YOUR IMMUNITY, CEASE YOUR RITUAL NOW AND RELEASE THEM!', 29274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, kitten. I see no need to delay your inevitable demise. I look forward to dealing with you just as soon as I finish off this fool!', '', 29273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'YOU KEEP YOUR FILTHY DRAKKARI HANDS OFF OF THEM!', 29272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? HAR\'KOA?!', '', 29271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember this day, $n, for it is the day that you will be thoroughly owned.', 'Remember this day, $n, for it is the day that you will be thoroughly owned.', 29270, 0, 7540, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'PROPHET!', 29269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King will see his true champion on this day!', 'The Lich King will see his true champion on this day!', 29268, 0, 7540, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t stand a chance, $n.', 'You don\'t stand a chance, $n.', 29267, 0, 7540, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going down!', 'You\'re going down!', 29266, 0, 7540, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No potions!', 'No potions!', 29265, 0, 7540, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here come the tears...', 'Here come the tears...', 29264, 0, 7540, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to tear your heart out, cupcake!', 'Don\'t make me laugh.', 29263, 0, 7540, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have challenged death itself!', 'You have challenged death itself!', 29262, 0, 7540, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1...', '1...', 29261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '2...', 29260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('3...', '3...', 29259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The duel will begin in...', 'The duel will begin in...', 29258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The prophet begins to cast a ritual of annihilation.', '', 29257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve meddled in affairs that were none of your business. You are nothing but a foreign invader. Prepare to die!', '', 29256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you, death knight!', 'I challenge you, death knight!', 29255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you challenging me, $g brother:sister;?', 'Are you challenging me, $g brother:sister;?', 29254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How sad that only now do you grasp the truth - I wield the power of a god. You are a mere mortal. You cannot hope to defeat me!', '', 29253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! Nothing can stop us now!', '', 29252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t worry me, $g boy : girl;. Just the opposite - I look forward to killing you. Nothing will stand between me and Zim\'Torga now!', '', 29251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? I recognize you from when I killed Akali. You must be this $n that everyone is dreading.', '', 29250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rejek and $n will teach the enemies of the Frenzyheart to fear us!', '', 29249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rejek feel strong! Rejek crush big-tongue skulls between his hands!', '', 29248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still warm, just the way Rejek likes it.', '', 29247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scarlet Crusade will serve a new master - in death...', '', 29246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has earned the achievement $a!', '%s has earned the achievement $a!', 29245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This isn\'t quite what I signed up for, but hey... at least it\'s warm here.', 29244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Koltira, let\'s get out of here!', 'Koltira, let\'s get out of here!', 29243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Koltira groans.>', '', 29242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your High Inquisitor is nothing more than a pile of meat, Crusaders! There are none beyond the grasp of the Scourge!', '', 29241, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll draw their fire, you make your escape behind me.', '', 29240, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The death of the High Inquisitor of New Avalon will not go unnoticed. You need to get out of here at once! Go, before more of them show up. I\'ll be fine on my own.', '', 29239, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks over in the direction of the witch doctor and is thoughtful.', 29238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, not Akali too!', 29237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And yet we see only doom in your future. It is your destiny that you do this, $n, but we fear that the prophet is too powerful for you and your friends. Still, you must try.', '', 29236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gusty essence of deceased Quetz\'lun\'s wardens must be gathered to draw him near. To Har\'koa must both of these rarities be delivered.', '', 29235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The unblemished heart of the guardian must be secured to show defiance and strength. Jealous Zim\'Rhuk keeps those who harbor it.', '', 29234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once more we hear your call, Khufu. We have wisdom for you and $n. You face great peril and must act swiftly or you all and Har\'koa will die.', '', 29233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lafoo digs up some bugs from the dirt.', '', 29232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re done for, death knight!', '', 29231, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s collapses to the ground.', '', 29230, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is going to be a humbling defeat.', '', 29229, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t keep this damned barrier up forever. Kill faster!', '', 29228, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let them wear you down! Focus!', '', 29227, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death grip! Use your powers, death knight! Pull them in!', '', 29226, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay in the anti-magic field! Make them come to you!', '', 29225, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand your ground! Use my anti-magic barrier to dampen their spells!', '', 29224, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s remains fall to the ground.', '', 29223, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have come seeking deliverance? I have come to deliver!', '', 29222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LIGHT PURGE YOU!', '', 29221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come out and play.', '', 29220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coward!', '', 29219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dark Scourge magic won\'t protect you from the Light!', '', 29218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a faint light emanating from deep within the orb and a blue mist swirls across its surface.', '', 29217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems that I\'ll need to deal with you myself. The High Inquisitor comes for you, Scourge!', '', 29216, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Crusade will purge your kind from this world!', '', 29215, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scourge filth! By the Light be cleansed!', '', 29214, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh heh, stupid ogre.  Like I\'m going backta work.', 'Heh heh, stupid ogre.  Like I\'m going backta work.', 29213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require water breathing, Garren.', 'I require water breathing, Garren.', 29212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
(' Okay, okay! Ya didn\'t hafta hit me! ', ' Okay, okay! Ya didn\'t hafta hit me! ', 29211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The High Inquisitor comes! Be ready, death knight! Do not let him draw you out of the protective bounds of my anti-magic field! Kill him and take his head!', '', 29210, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for you, $r?', '', 29209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t keep this barrier up much longer... Where is that coward?', '', 29208, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are more coming. Defend yourself! Don\'t fall out of the anti-magic field! They\'ll tear you apart without its protection!', '', 29207, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you stand round for, you go back work!', '', 29206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maintaining this barrier will require all of my concentration. Kill them all!', '', 29205, 0, 7451, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
