('The horns of war have sounded! We haven\'t much time! Quicken your pace!', 'The horns of war have sounded! We haven\'t much time! Quicken your pace!', 28615, 0, 7391, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got another pile ready to go! Outta my way!', '', 28614, 0, 7391, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on it!', '', 28613, 0, 7391, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t keep this pace up, sir! If the Scourge don\'t get me, exhaustion will!', '', 28612, 0, 7391, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m workin\' as fast as I can, cap\'n!', '', 28611, 0, 7391, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Double your efforts! Get this wood piled up and ready for shipment to New Avalon!', 'Double your efforts! Get this wood piled up and ready for shipment to New Avalon!', 28610, 0, 7391, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster, brother! I don\'t know how much longer we can hold these Scourge monsters back!', 'Faster, brother! I don\'t know how much longer we can hold these Scourge monsters back!', 28609, 0, 7391, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Western Zeppelin Tower', 'Western Zeppelin Tower', 28608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eastern Zeppelin Tower', 'Eastern Zeppelin Tower', 28607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are two zeppelin towers outside Orgrimmar. The eastern tower serves Tirisfal Glades and Stranglethorn Vale, while the western tower serves Northrend and Thunder Bluff.', 'There are two zeppelin towers outside Orgrimmar. The eastern tower serves Tirisfal Glades and Stranglethorn Vale, while the western tower serves Northrend and Thunder Bluff.', 28606, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bonesunder begins to cast Crack Bone!', '', 28605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls forth an army of frozen corpses.', '', 28604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light bless you, my child.', 'Light bless you, my child.', 28603, 0, 7391, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light be cleansed!', 'By the Light be cleansed!', 28602, 0, 7504, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the purging begin!', 'Let the purging begin!', 28601, 0, 7504, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!', 'You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!', 28600, 0, 7504, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will present your head to Abbendis myself!', 'I will present your head to Abbendis myself!', 28599, 0, 7504, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Crusade will be victorious!', 'The Crusade will be victorious!', 28598, 0, 7504, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scourge filth! DIE!', 'Scourge filth! DIE!', 28597, 0, 7504, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could really use a papaya.', 'I could really use a papaya.', 28596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a spare bunch of bananas?', 'Have a spare bunch of bananas?', 28595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you spare an orange?', 'Can you spare an orange?', 28594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad I could help!', 'Glad I could help!', 28593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! Watch where you\'re tugging!', 'Ouch! Watch where you\'re tugging!', 28592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loken?! That\'s downright bothersome... We might\'ve neutralized the iron dwarves, but I\'d lay odds there\'s another machine somewhere else churnin\' out a whole mess o\' these iron vrykul!', '', 28591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like you had the same idea I did. Hunting for fruit, are you?', 'Looks like you had the same idea I did. Hunting for fruit, are you?', 28590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This outpost is a cog-free zone. Persons employing cogs in the construction of mechanical devices will be subject to unrelenting mockery.', '', 28589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you hiding under that fold of flesh?', 'What are you hiding under that fold of flesh?', 28588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not fail.', 'I will not fail.', 28587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can trust me.  I am no friend of the Lich King\'s.', 'You can trust me.  I am no friend of the Lich King\'s.', 28586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It borders on sacrilege that these secrets be revealed to a mortal such as yourself, but I have little choice.$B$BEver since Freya, daughter of the titans, left me here I\'ve had but one task and I cannot fail.  Life must be protected at any cost.$B$BThere is a waygate that links this place with another very much like this one.  It is there that the weapon we seek can be found.', 28585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The titans did not create life overnight.  The process was gradual and required a great deal of experimentation and iteration.$B$BIt is for that reason that highly protected places such as Sholazar Basin exist.$B$BTo ensure the safety of their experimentation sites, the titans created a defense mechanism.  Its destructive force is unparalleled however, and I will reveal no more unless you swear your fealty to my cause.', 28584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to stop the Scourge as much as you do.  How can I help?', 'I want to stop the Scourge as much as you do.  How can I help?', 28583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But none of you could possibly have anything to worry about, right?', '', 28582, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crowd gasps.', 'The crowd gasps.', 28581, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The pure of heart will be allowed to remain in New Avalon. Those that the inquisitors find bereft of the holy Light will be turned away.', 28580, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where do you expect us to stay? New Avalon cannot hold all of us!', 'Where do you expect us to stay? New Avalon cannot hold all of us!', 28579, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are sending crusaders to reclaim what is rightfully ours! Any Scourge that stand in our way will be turned to ashes.', 28578, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stables and mill are left abandoned! What will happen to our horses?', 'The stables and mill are left abandoned! What will happen to our horses?', 28577, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Havenshire is lost!', 'Havenshire is lost!', 28576, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'SILENCE! The Light has not abandoned us! The Light is stronger than ever among the pure!', 28575, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light has abandoned us!', 'The Light has abandoned us!', 28574, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nor my husband and brothers!', 'Nor my husband and brothers!', 28572, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t see the Light step in to save my wife and children!', 'I didn\'t see the Light step in to save my wife and children!', 28571, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does the Light say to you now, Abbendis!', 'What does the Light say to you now, Abbendis!', 28570, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Scourge are a blemish upon these pristine lands.  By the might of my creators, I will crush every last one of their decrepit bones under my heel.', 28569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We fight! We push them back, just as we have always done!', 28568, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are we to do? We\'ve lost everything!', 'What are we to do? We\'ve lost everything!', 28567, 0, 7443, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re building another road down into Stormwind Harbor as soon as this wall has been removed... but this mad dwarf brought enough powder to level the entire quarter!$B$BI don\'t know what Master Alexston was thinking when he hired her... she\'s foul-mouthed, mean, and stubborn as an ox!', '', 28566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re tryin\' ta blow this wall so Wick\'s men can work on the new Harbor gatehouse and road beyond, but the clueless sod is cryin\' about me using too much powder!$B$BTch. I\'ve been sappin\' since he was in diapers. This goes on much longer, I\'ll kick him into the canal and finish the whole blasted job meself!', 28565, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Awww... look at da purty lil\' gool.$b$bJump, lil\' gool! Jump!$b$bHa, ha, ha.... Attsa guud lil\' gool.', '', 28564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Justice will be done.', '', 28563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s move through here as quickly as possible. If the undead don\'t kill us, the fires might.', '', 28562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU TRY DA\' BEST, NOW TRY DA\' REST!  OGRE BREW!!', '', 28561, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEY YOU!  DRINK OGRE BREWS!  MAKE YOU BIG AND STRONG!', '', 28560, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU WANT DRINK?!  WE GOT DRINK!', '', 28559, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Care to try Grimbooze Thunderbrew\'s new jungle punch?', 'Care to try Grimbooze Thunderbrew\'s new jungle punch?', 28558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, there\'s the kick I\'ve come to expect from Grimbooze\'s drinks! I like it!', '', 28557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, so far, it tastes like something my wife would drink...', '', 28556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde bridge is under attack!', '', 28555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m always up for something of Grimbooze\'s.', '', 28554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
