('The Alliance bridge is under attack!', '', 28553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scourge Disguise Failing! Find a safe place!', 'Scourge Disguise Failing! Find a safe place!', 28552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
