('Hahaha, I\'m playin\' possum, mon. You gonna die!', '', 28545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not simply lay here and allow you to slay me! You will have to earn your right to draw another breath if you want to kill me, mortal!', '', 28544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IT\'S GHOULS!!!! GHOULS!!!!', 'IT\'S GHOULS!!!! GHOULS!!!!', 28543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
