('SCOURGE! RUN AWAY! RUN AWAY!', 'SCOURGE! RUN AWAY! RUN AWAY!', 28541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HELP! HELP!', 'HELP! HELP!', 28540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy $r intruder. DIE!', 'Filthy $r intruder. DIE!', 28539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please hurry, $n. I am in a great deal of pain and time is running out.', '', 28538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rhunok, I need to be reimbued with your mojo.', 'Rhunok, I need to be reimbued with your mojo.', 28537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The structure above begins to hum with energy.', '', 28536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'ll do. Never know what it\'ll need next...', '', 28535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good job! Keep your eyes open, now.', '', 28534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nicely handled! Stay on your toes!', '', 28533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to start the distillation, uh, Tipsy.', 'I\'m ready to start the distillation, uh, Tipsy.', 28532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Drakkari are keeping my body close to death up in the altar building. They cannot see my spirit though.$B$BWe must work together to prevent them from getting my power.', '', 28531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You performed well this day. Anything that Mal\'Ganis has left behind is yours. Take it as your reward. I must now begin plans for an expedition to Northrend.', '', 28530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll hunt you to the ends of the earth if I have to! Do you hear me? To the ends of the earth!', '', 28529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your journey has just begun, young prince. Gather your forces and meet me in the arctic land of Northrend. It is there that we shall settle the score between us. It is there that your true destiny will unfold.', '', 28528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stefan told me you would demonstrate the purpose of this item.', 'Stefan told me you would demonstrate the purpose of this item.', 28527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Bloodrose eyes you curiously.>$b$bI cannot help but wonder what makes you worthy of such attention.$b$bNo offense....', 28526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Move along. Nothing to see here.', 28525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! Be ready for anything!', '', 28524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s no good! I\'m shutting it down...', '', 28523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('spirit of competition test', 'spirit of competition test', 28522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it! Come get the cask.', '', 28521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re going to finish this right now, Mal\'Ganis. Just you... and me.', '', 28520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
