('Everything is set up and ready to go.', '', 28513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It....it be beautiful!', '', 28512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For me? Really, mon?', '', 28511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to dress as a pirate.', 'I\'d like to dress as a pirate.', 28510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh... disgusting!', 28509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to battle the dreadlord, sire.', 'I\'m ready to battle the dreadlord, sire.', 28508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eye of Acherus launches towards its destination.', '', 28507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to face Mal\'Ganis with me?', '', 28506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here, troll... a gift!', 28505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TAUREN CHIEFTAINS! Playing LIVE, in the WORLD\'S END TAVERN! Be there, at the top of the hour! Banished from Shattrath? SNEAK BACK IN!', '', 28504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lighting', 'Lighting', 28503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who? The Tauren Chieftains! What? A live performance! Where? The World\'s End Tavern! When? The top of the hour! BE THERE!', '', 28502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goregek hung... er, sorry. Goregek sorry.', '', 28501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goregek not mean to let chickens get away! Help!', '', 28500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goregek maybe stumbled into chicken hut again...', '', 28499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oops... not again.', '', 28498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is not yet your time, champion. Rise! Rise and fight once more!', 28497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to rock? Then head over to the World\'s End Tavern! The Tauren Chieftains start their show at the top of the hour.', '', 28496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful! No let it scratch you like last time.', '', 28495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gekgek finally trap dumb cat. You Gekgek\'s now!', '', 28494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No let it get away! We got it this time.', '', 28493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dumb! Don\'t shoot at it! Gekgek want trophy in one piece!', '', 28492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scourge! Do not let it escape!', 'Scourge! Do not let it escape!', 28491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Tis the work of the Scourge!', '\'Tis the work of the Scourge!', 28490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone foul demon!', 'Begone foul demon!', 28489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death stalks us! Destroy it!', 'Death stalks us! Destroy it!', 28488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dumb slave thing keep fighitng... Goregek going to not get butt kicked more now.', '', 28487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow. No slave thing, really... ow!', '', 28486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slave thing, you so full of fail.', '', 28485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you get hurt bad, remember rest and get strong again. Dajik show you how right now...', '', 28484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dajik going to rest for a bit... hurt all over.', '', 28483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You still have lot of learning... most important, protect Dajik!', '', 28482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
