('Mistcaller really good at controlling weather with shrine. They know just which crystals to use! Really good!', '', 28330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mistwhisper kind of boring. Yeah, boring... little bit.', '', 28329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mistwhisper not always like us. They say we \"damage their calm.\"', '', 28328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Misty. Very misty. Seem sort of misty to you? Maybe not so much.', '', 28327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! That was close! Quick, quick, stand under metal pole thing! That keep us safe, yeah?', '', 28326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dumb puppy-men messed up the shrine! Boo! Make it stop!', '', 28325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow! Lightning everywhere! We need to learn to make this on the puppy-men!', '', 28324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow! Hahah... er, that no good.', '', 28323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poof!', '', 28322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah... no.', '', 28321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope! No more me. This place all yours. Bye!', '', 28320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! Why you come here? Silly, silly! No come here!', '', 28319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bet you not seen a puppy riding a dragon before? Hah! And not again I think.', '', 28318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach you to steal our treasures! Our treasures are... ours, okay?!', '', 28317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think we scared of dragon thing? Not so much!', '', 28316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tartek no match for you! You got the skills. Yeah!', '', 28315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soo-holu going to get you! Silly puppy-men. Hahah!', '', 28314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pow! Bam! Take that puppy-men!', '', 28313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big yeti beast can\'t catch us! We way too fast.', '', 28312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s run circles around silly puppy-men! Weee!', '', 28311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can never have too many shiny crystals! Nope!', '', 28310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are fast digger! Really fast! See... all done! That was fast, huh?', '', 28309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shiny things! Shiny things! Not as shiny as my crystal, but still shiny!', '', 28308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More treasures! Treasures of all kinds! Yay treasures!', '', 28307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have pie? Someone gave us pie year ago. Really yummy.', '', 28306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh! Who he? He friend of yours? Maybe we be friends too?', '', 28305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puppy-men have so much hair! Looks ichy.', '', 28304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That weird. Someone took our bugs. You have maybe?', '', 28303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Be nice puppy-man. We nice, so you be nice too.', '', 28302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It stinky around here. Why so stinky.', '', 28301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for being nice.', '', 28300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sleep time yet?', '', 28299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got a lot of shinies. Lucky.', '', 28298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great Ones left big kitty protector thing. Not for us I think, but it good friend... keeps mean puppy-men away sometimes.', '', 28297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puppy-men attack this place a lot. It scares off all the bugs... that why we don\'t come much.', '', 28296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Floaty sparks! Think they maybe give me one?', '', 28295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi.', '', 28294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One day maybe you can be Soo-dryskin. Like?', '', 28293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soo-say really nice to us.  We like Soo-say.', '', 28292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crunchy bugs so delicious. Want?', '', 28291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big comfy tree. Good home.', '', 28290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never met Great Ones. Nope, just met their shrines.', '', 28289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh! I hate you puppy-face! So mean!', '', 28288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead things not seem very happy.', '', 28287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got funny looking eyeballs.', '', 28286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It nice that it not snow here. Snow no good.', '', 28285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh hi. Who you? Want be friends?', '', 28284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh! It all safe now?', '', 28283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think... maybe it dead.', '', 28282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That look like it hurt. No hit us like that, okay?', '', 28281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food for bugs!', '', 28280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hiss... hiss... dead. All dead.', '', 28279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You strong! Yay... you keep us safe!', '', 28278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No come back this time!', '', 28277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more eat hatchlings, scary snake thing!', '', 28276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We really not like it here. Maybe come find us when you done.', '', 28275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All bugs gone. Badness here... we not be with badness.', '', 28274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Voices... voices everywhere and not alive! No stay.', '', 28273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. No good here. No no no.', '', 28272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No bugs here... where all bugs go?', '', 28271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we maybe, please go now? Little scary.', '', 28270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many puppy-men here. Think they want be friends now maybe?', '', 28269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful of big scary beast thing! It try to eat us!', '', 28268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe more shiny bugs! We like bugs!', '', 28267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig, dig, dig...', '', 28266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treasure for Lafoo! Treasure for shrine!', '', 28265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh! Shinies!', '', 28261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that I am at my full power I can perform Martyr.  You can use it to protect other drakes, but I will take lots of damage, so make sure you\'re using Evasive Maneuvers too!', '', 28260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that I am at my full power I can perform Dream Funnel.  You can use it to heal other drakes, but it drains my health, so make sure you\'re using Leeching Poison too!', '', 28259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that I am at my full power I can perform Temporal Rift.  You can use it to make enemies take extra damage and to get Shock Charges.  Save up Shock Charges and then Shock Lance for huge damage!', '', 28258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m badly injured!  I can\'t take much more of this!', '', 28257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Shock Lance to damage enemies.  If we get in trouble, Stop Time to freeze all enemies in place, then hit them with Shock Lance for massive damage!', '', 28256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Leeching Poison to damage enemies and keep me healed.  Touch the Nightmare is very powerful, but it hurts me, so only use it when I have a lot of health!', '', 28255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Searing Wrath to damage enemies and Evasive Maneuvers if I start taking damage.  Remember I need to build up Evasive Charges by taking damage to perform Evasive Maneuvers!', '', 28254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require repairs and supplies, Corvus.', 'I require repairs and supplies, Corvus.', 28253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it that you need from Corvus?', '', 28252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the camp, $c.', '', 28251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe I not be the only one big-tongues fear much longer. You scary when in the fight.', '', 28250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feels good to hunt with a not dumb hunter. You good at this.', '', 28249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big-tongues here worship shrine, like at other places, but this shrine sometimes have a guardian. Careful if it shows up.', '', 28248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battle here been going on for a while... these spark big-tongues have a lot more fight than the other ones.', '', 28247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vekjik likes finding big-tongues that wander too far to throw in the basin. He help me trap some of the dumb ones. You should watch him sometime... it pretty funny actually.', '', 28246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always wonder where all the water go... doesn\'t make sense.', '', 28245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big-tongues don\'t usually come down here anymore... I had a big fight and killed lots.', '', 28244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not sure if you notice, but there rumbling sometimes from the water in the big hole. I think there something down there.', '', 28243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flame! Death! Destruction! The black fire rages within my heart! I must... release it! Hahah!', '', 28242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more play?', '', 28241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Leave some for Zepik too.', '', 28240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good one! It not even see it coming.', '', 28239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ever fought big dragon or god or anything? Zepik like hearing stories.', '', 28238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dajik forget what he doing, where he at... sometime even forget his own name. Make him not so good teacher sometimes.', '', 28237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goregek think he the boss of everyone, but he eat too much and hunt too little.', '', 28236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You pretty good! Natural at hunt, like me.', '', 28235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You chickens are tougher than I thought! I\'ll have to improvise!', '', 28234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goregek never \"stumble\" into chicken hut... Goregek always have to feed his dumb belly. Always one chicken missing when we catch them all.', '', 28233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think they learn to keep Goregek away from chickens.', '', 28232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May not be great hunt, but this still fun after so many time.', '', 28231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful of big mistcaller guy... Zepik fought him once and barely got away. He lot stronger than rest of big-tongues here.', '', 28230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mist big-tongues are smart with their shrine thing sometimes... cover whole area with mist and it get hard to find any.', '', 28229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think one reason I like hunting big-tongues so much... they not as dumb as the other hunts. They give a real fight.', '', 28228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That lake near here actually full of sea things. Not sure how it all get here... maybe in floods?', '', 28227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to do this more often! This so funny... lightning hitting big-tongues everywhere!', '', 28226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zap!', '', 28225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BOOM! That so good! More! More!', '', 28224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahah! You see that? Lightning bolt hit him right in the head!', '', 28223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad plan to come here... many more adventures to be had before I risk this place. Be safe... I meet you later.', '', 28222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought about tricking big-tongues to come here, but it too dangerous for me. You have good luck and I meet you back at hill.', '', 28221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many Frenzyheart lost at broken pillar. Today is not Zepik\'s day to be lost too.', '', 28220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My kind not welcome at broken pillar. I going back to hill - find me when you done.', '', 28219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman Jakjek is quiet for a Frenzyheart, but still very strong. He probably the only reason Kartak not turned on more of us.', '', 28218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever met Tartek? He one of our best fighters... leads in the northwest. I hear he captured one of the dragon things. No lie, I a little jealous.', '', 28217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not mentioned much, but Kartak ate dozen Frenzyheart before became \"friend.\"', '', 28216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something about sound of battle make this place more relaxing than main hill.', '', 28215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I teach myself a lot of my big-tongue hunt here. Lot to kill.', '', 28214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to stay away from Kartak. He only a friend of Frenzyheart so long as we keep his belly full... and he\'s got a big belly.', '', 28213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see what you doing... maybe if we treat it nice it will lead us back to more big-tongues.', '', 28212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not so happy about traveling with big-tongues.', '', 28211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Normally I kill these things. You know that, yeah?', '', 28210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I step on its tail, it was an accident.', '', 28209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you planning something secret involving that big-tongue ending up dead.', '', 28208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorlocs are the bad-guys, just so you know.', '', 28207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elder Harkek pretty good Frenzyheart. He help me a lot when I was littler and not liking Dajik.', '', 28206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not live here always... I traveled lot of world on my own not long ago. I like all the stories of beasts and dragons and gods and stuff.', '', 28205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not in a big hurry. We can rest here a while if want.', '', 28204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should go let chickens out again and say Goregek did it. Never get old.', '', 28203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring back good meat and the camp treat you like high-shaman for a day. Good deal.', '', 28202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dajik tried to show me ways of hunt, but I do better when I do things my way.', '', 28201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sparky ones are more squishy! Get them first!', '', 28200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some furless things been making friends with big-tongues... seem pretty dumb to Dajik.', '', 28199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dajik been seeing a lot more furless things like you. Frenzyheart not like giving up land, so you things better be careful.', '', 28198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big-tongues like crystals for shrine things a lot. They not like when we smash them.', '', 28197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zepik does great big-tongue hunt. Dajik tired to teach him when he was little, but he not very teachable.', '', 28196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for more smart Dajik tip! Messing up big-tongue shrine is fun, but make sure lot of big-tongues not watching first.', '', 28195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something big make pillars and crystals and everything. Frenzyheart not care much cause it not here anymore.', '', 28194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wasps like blue crystals. Dajik not sure why.', '', 28193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes big-tongues try to come get crystals. Not now because they not like it when we kill them.', '', 28192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for more smart Dajik tip! Crystals work little too good for back scratch. No try.', '', 28191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In case you wonder, wasp sting not feel so good. No need to try.', '', 28190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seem like there more wasps every time Dajik come back. Why they not run out?', '', 28189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We came for something, yes? Can\'t remember.', '', 28188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drone things not as tough as they look. Wasp things a bit nastier.', '', 28187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was going draw picture of best attack plan... but you have my chalk.', '', 28186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for more smart Dajik tip! Try not to catch stinger with face. Not work so much.', '', 28185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What we doing here again? Dajik can\'t remember.', '', 28184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dajik not think he seen you eat anything. You eat sometimes, yeah?', '', 28183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That look painful.', '', 28182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see face? Looked so scared, \"Ah, big thing going to smash me!\" Hah.', '', 28181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dajik train pups that kill stuff faster than you. You got lot more learning left.', '', 28180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get the stuff off of body! Dajik hate it when he go skin something and there stuff in the way. So annoying.', '', 28179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do okay enough with that one. Just okay.', '', 28178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for more smart Dajik tip! Make sure thing dead before reach in mouth for loots.', '', 28177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s just eat bristlepine instead, okay? All done with chasing.', '', 28176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All this running make Dajik not hungry for chicken anymore.', '', 28175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! Dajik has idea! Make chicken sounds and maybe they come to you!', '', 28174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There reason Frenzyheart not chase back chickens. Look kind of dumb to lose to chicken.', '', 28173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you not notice, chicken move kind of fast.', '', 28172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for more smart Dajik tip! If Goregek let chickens out again, make Goregek get chickens back again.', '', 28171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead thing there already learn lesson of broken pillar. Leave this lesson for dumb, dead things. Going home now.', '', 28170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Broken pillar not safe place. Dajik go now, you need go too.', '', 28169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You all done with learning! Yup! All done! Dajik leave you and evil red pillar thing now.', '', 28168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for more smart Dajik tip! Lot of dead things mean lot of chance of being dead thing. Dajik leaving now.', '', 28167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not see these very much. That fine though, it not very pretty.', '', 28166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Usually it just run away in sand. Not do so good at run away this time.', '', 28165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dajik\'s last learner eaten by sand-thing. We do better this time though!', '', 28164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not sure how thing got here. Not matter if dead though.', '', 28163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Stab few more time just in case! Stab good!', '', 28162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! You killed queen thing! What have you... wait, nevermind. Sorry, that okay.', '', 28161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This not first queen slain by Frenzyheart. Seem like there always more.', '', 28160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Maybe you learn a little after all!', '', 28159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet you wonder where we get tall bird things for roast. Too bad, it secret.', '', 28158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You not very fast learner. Just saying.', '', 28157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This not Frenzyheart Hill, where we again?', '', 28156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe it just Dajik, but it seem like this fight been going for a while, yeah?', '', 28155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kartak like taste of big-tongues. If Kartak hungry though, he not mind taste of Frenzyheart, so make sure Kartak not hungry.', '', 28154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for more smart Dajik tip! No try to ride Kartak.', '', 28153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think it like you. Maybe we can bring it back to hill and ask it nice, \"Step in cooking pot, big-tongue.\" Yes?', '', 28152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww, you two going be friends? Maybe find nice place in swamp and have very own medium-tongues? So sweet... stop being dumb now.', '', 28151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know they funny looking, but less starting, more killing.', '', 28150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, all done playing. Time to kill it.', '', 28149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poke it in the eye, big-tongues hate that.', '', 28148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you still learning, but big-tongues are bad. Frenzyheart good, big-tongues bad, okay?', '', 28147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out for pups. Frenzyheart vicious when little.', '', 28146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lot of strong Frenzyheart here. Dajik taught most of them. First time I teach something like you though. You not a Frenzyheart, you know.', '', 28145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I placed most of the spikes. Good amount of pointiness I think. You like?', '', 28144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure you not forget anything. I forgot stuff once.', '', 28143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay a while and listen.', '', 28142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frenzyheart came here not long ago for new home... big-tongue homes pretty nice, so we maybe take those too. They ugly anyway.', '', 28141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh... where are we? This not right. I not tell you find hardknuckles, did I?', '', 28140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you here to poke more softknuckles, Dajik going to poke you too. That a bad Goregek habit.', '', 28139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you keep killing hardknuckles, you grow up to be like Goregek. You want be like Goregek?', '', 28138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hardknuckles boring. Why we here again?', '', 28137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome Friend.  Keep your head down and hold on tight!', '', 28136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The full power of your drakes has been unlocked.  Use their power to defeat Eregos!', '', 28135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, and accept my gift.', '', 28134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your army....', '', 28133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, Chad... of course I will!', 28132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your betrayal of the Drakkari Empire has borne me a new army.', '', 28131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done well, Drakuru.', '', 28130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you accept my ring?', '', 28129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miss Boulian... will you...', '', 28128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With da help of these mortals, dis region been cleansed of all who oppose us.', '', 28127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the Zandalari and their puppets! Nothing can stop us now!', '', 28126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, my mission be complete.', '', 28125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them! Kill them all and take back Zim\'Torga!', '', 28124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! You\'ll not get my treasure!', '', 28123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You test my patience, you now see the true might of the Blue.', '', 28122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m all kinds of busted up... might not... make it.', '', 28121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be still, friend, and behold da truth of things!', '', 28120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Revelation!', '', 28119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For your efforts, you be gettin\' da greatest of rewards....', '', 28118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Killing me will only strengthen the resolve of my brethren. Do your worst!', 'Killing me will only strengthen the resolve of my brethren. Do your worst!', 28116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not too late, brothers and sisters. Repent! Repent and you may be saved.', 'It\'s not too late, brothers and sisters. Repent! Repent and you may be saved.', 28115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Argent Dawn will fight until the end!', 'The Argent Dawn will fight until the end!', 28114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you not yet realized why we remain defiant?', 'Have you not yet realized why we remain defiant?', 28113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Light forgive you for the evil that you do.', 'May the Light forgive you for the evil that you do.', 28112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will find me and they will free me... Your pathetic cages cannot hold me for long!', 'They will find me and they will free me... Your pathetic cages cannot hold me for long!', 28111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will fall before the might of the Scarlet Crusade!', 'All will fall before the might of the Scarlet Crusade!', 28110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been branded as enemies of the Crusade, heathens!', 'You have been branded as enemies of the Crusade, heathens!', 28109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop the Scarlet Crusade!', 'You cannot stop the Scarlet Crusade!', 28108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light purge you from this world!', 'Light purge you from this world!', 28107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heathens! The day of reckoning comes!', 'Heathens! The day of reckoning comes!', 28106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. Away with you, worm.', 28105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can leave my sight, squire, before I slay you. Again.', 28104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, you sniveling wretch. Now begone.', 28103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away from me, Edwards, lest I behead you.', 28102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, M-mistress...', '', 28101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('M-mistress... did you n-need more corpse dust, p-perhaps...?', '', 28100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('M-mistress... does your axe n-need sharpening...?', '', 28099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('M-mistress... might I b-brush your mighty steed...?', '', 28098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('M-mistress... may I p-polish your armor...?', '', 28097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An emerald drake at full power can perform dream funnel, which transfers the drake\'s own life energy to a friendly target, healing it.  Leeching poison can be used to restore health lost when using this ability.', 28096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An amber drake at full power can perform temporal rift, which creates a bubble of compressed time around an enemy.  Spells that pass through the bubble deal double damage and can generate shock charges on the target.', '', 28095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Ruby Drake at full power can perform Martyr, which shields friendly targets by redirecting all hostile magic to the Ruby Drake for a short time.  Evasive Maneuvers can still be performed during Martyr.', '', 28094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Emerald drakes excel at healing themselves while poisoning their enemies.\n\nUsing leeching poison, they can steal health from their enemies.  Repeated applications of this poison can increase the effect.\n\nWith touch the nightmare, emerald drakes can reach into the Dream, converting a portion of their life energy into a highly damaging attack that leaves the target weakened, reducing its damage for a short time.', 28093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amber drakes excel at dealing damage by manipulating time to their advantage.\n\nUsing shock lance, they can disrupt the flow of time around an enemy target, instantly damaging it.  The power of this effect is dramatically increased by shock charges on the target.\n\nWhen threatened, an amber drake can briefly stop the flow of time for its enemies.  This time disruption stores a large amount of shock energy on affected targets in the form of shock charges.', '', 28092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ruby drakes excel at mitigating damage and protecting their allies.\n\nUsing searing wrath, they can breathe streams of liquid fire that jump from target to target, dealing increasing damage with each jump.\n\nWhenever a ruby drake is damaged by an enemy attack, it gains an evasive charge.  These charges can be used to perform a series of evasive maneuvers, allowing the drake to dodge incoming attacks and spells for a time.', '', 28091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the ultimate ability of the emerald drake?', 'What is the ultimate ability of the emerald drake?', 28090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the ultimate ability of the amber drake?', 'What is the ultimate ability of the amber drake?', 28089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the ultimate ability of the Ruby Drake?', 'What is the ultimate ability of the Ruby Drake?', 28088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What abilities do emerald drakes have?', 'What abilities do emerald drakes have?', 28087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What abilities do amber drakes have?', 'What abilities do amber drakes have?', 28086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What abilities do ruby drakes have?', 'What abilities do ruby drakes have?', 28085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The green flight is in your debt.', 28084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bronze flight is in your debt.', '', 28083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have wrested control of the Oculus from the forces of Malygos.  The red flight is in your debt.', '', 28082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your greatest challenge lies ahead.  Ley-Guardian Eregos is a Blue dragon of immense power. You will find him flying above the uppermost ring. \n\nThe full power of your drakes has been unlocked.  Use their power to defeat Eregos!', '', 28081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring.  He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances!  Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures.  Seek him out above.\n\nI can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the red flight.  Speak to Eternos or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the bronze or the green.', '', 28080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring.  He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances!  Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures.  Seek him out above.', '', 28079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bigger they are, the harder they fall.', '', 28078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat lead!', '', 28077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How d\'you like that one, eh?', '', 28076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take that, beastie!', '', 28075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, beastie. Come to Hemet!', '', 28074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks like a good perch. Mark the target and signal me when you\'ve sighted the broodmother and are ready to attack.', '', 28073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahunae\'s axe will be the end of the Drakkari.$B$BYou be takin\' care of any that get past my axe!', '', 28072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run away dumb softknuckle! We gonna poke you more!', '', 28071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww! So scared!', '', 28070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run away softknuckle! Goregek gonna get you!', '', 28069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squeal! Squeal! So good!', '', 28068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No worry chicken. Goregek not going to put you in fire. Goregek nice wolvar.', '', 28067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slave thing! Go get chicken for Goregek!', '', 28066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorgek gonna catch chicken good!', '', 28065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chicken! So delicious!', '', 28064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go kill more stuff while Goregek eat.', '', 28063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wait, slave thing. Goregek eating.', '', 28062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goregek hungry.', '', 28061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for food!', '', 28060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Revenge is Goregek\'s! Teach dumb hardknuckle to knockdown Goregek from behind.', '', 28059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That how it done, slave thing. Maybe you figure out how someday.', '', 28058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Goregek the greatest hunter ever! Goregek get biggest hardknuckle!', '', 28057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of way silly slave thing! Goregek\'s kill!', '', 28056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is as strong as I can make you. Fight well, my earthen friend.', 28055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Drakkari must not be allowed to break through the defenses.', 28054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lure it into the trap!', '', 28053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are honored by your sacrifice.', 28052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From the earth you arose. To the earth you shall return.', 28051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zim\'Torga must be defended lest the Drakkari foolishly steal her power as well.', 28050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
