('IF WAR IS WHAT YOU WANT, WAR IS WHAT YOU SHALL GET, FRUIT VENDOR!  WE WILL SEE WHO SELLS MORE OF YOUR APPLES!', 'IF WAR IS WHAT YOU WANT, WAR IS WHAT YOU SHALL GET, FRUIT VENDOR!  WE WILL SEE WHO SELLS MORE OF YOUR APPLES!', 27711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
