('The fruit vendor has refused to accept my challenge and remove his cart.  Their ogre protector just sits and does nothing... What could his plan be?', 'The fruit vendor has refused to accept my challenge and remove his cart.  Their ogre protector just sits and does nothing... What could his plan be?', 27704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
