('I won\'t allow it, Mal\'Ganis! Better that these people die by my hand than serve as your slaves in death!', '', 27577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tabard of the Arcane', 'Tabard of the Arcane', 27576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you can see, your people are now mine. I will now turn this city household by household, until the flame of life has been snuffed out... forever.', '', 27575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, this is the beginning. I\'ve been waiting for you, young prince. I am Mal\'Ganis.', '', 27574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My precious magmawyrms... perhaps not all is lost... perhaps there is something left to raise.', '', 27573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Entering Phase 4 <PH>', '', 27572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the cultists seems to have stumbled onto my blade and died... can I have a new disguise? I promise that I will be more careful this time.', 'One of the cultists seems to have stumbled onto my blade and died... can I have a new disguise? I promise that I will be more careful this time.', 27571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('East Pass! Now!', '', 27570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are more at the east pass!', '', 27569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up to the eastern pass! Move!', '', 27568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Head back up to the east pass! They\'re pushing hard!', '', 27567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re backing off here... get to the east pass! Quickly!', '', 27566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On the move back up to the eastern pass!', '', 27565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('South! Now!', '', 27564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are more to the south!', '', 27563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the south! Move!', '', 27562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re pushing in the south!', '', 27561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re backing off here... get to the south pass! Quickly!', '', 27560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On the move to the southern pass!', '', 27559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The keep is ablaze! Bombardiers, where in the Nether are you?!', 'The keep is ablaze! Bombardiers, where in the Nether are you?!', 27558, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look lively! Keep firing!', 'Look lively! Keep firing!', 27557, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn it...', 'Damn it...', 27556, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s attacking the keep! Bring her down!', 'She\'s attacking the keep! Bring her down!', 27555, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drake incoming! OPEN FIRE!', 'Drake incoming! OPEN FIRE!', 27554, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was just the beginning.', '', 27553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, no...', 'Oh, no...', 27552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast Magic Pull!', '', 27550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? This can\'t be!', 'What? This can\'t be!', 27549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can only help you with a clean death.', '', 27548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prince Arthas, may the light be praised! Many people in the town have begun to fall seriously ill, can you help us?', 'Prince Arthas, may the light be praised! Many people in the town have begun to fall seriously ill, can you help us?', 27547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take a ride to my first post, please.', 'I\'ll take a ride to my first post, please.', 27546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You challenge Don Carlos? Guerrero! GO!', '', 27545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAH! How do you like THAT?!', '', 27543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die like a dog!', '', 27541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Im... possible...', '', 27540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush anything that stands in your path!  For the Lich King!', '', 27539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing can stop the Scourge!  Nothing!', '', 27538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onward, you maggots!  This land is the Lich King\'s now!', '', 27537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the well! HURRY!', 'To the well! HURRY!', 27536, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone looks ready. Remember, these people are all infected with the plague and will die soon. We must purge Stratholme to protect the remainder of Lordaeron from the Scourge. Let\'s go.', '', 27535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire! Must be the damned drakes again. Come on!', 'Fire! Must be the damned drakes again. Come on!', 27534, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sigh>... Do you think we could move out, $c?$b$bI\'m losing fluid fast!', '', 27533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOOOOOooooooo.........!', '', 27532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm, more mojo.', '', 27531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, $g brother : sister;. I\'m leaking here....', '', 27530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry, $r.$b$bTime is running out for me.', 27529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am in your debt, friend. Thank you for my life.', 27528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ohhh, I... cannot go on....', 27527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ohhh, the pain is... overwhelming....', 27526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t mind me. I\'m just an old man, waiting on an old... friend.', '', 27525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, my Prince. We are ready.', 'Yes, my Prince. We are ready.', 27524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sigh>... Well, I suppose it could be worse.', '', 27523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sigh>...$b$bA little help here, perhaps?', '', 27522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. Were it not for your aid I would be no more.', '', 27521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sigh>... This is the end of me.', '', 27520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('BOOM!$b$bThat\'s the last thing I remember...', '', 27519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to do whatever must be done to protect Lordaeron?', '', 27518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All officers should check in with me when their squads are ready. We\'ll enter Stratholme on my order.', '', 27517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cheers!', 'Cheers!', 27516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wouldn\'t do this on any other day, but... I\'m thirsty and I hate drinking alone.$B$BBottoms up!', '', 27515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will destroy the Argent Crusade! I will crush the Scourge!', '', 27514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you, insect! Come closer.', '', 27513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the power of the wild gods burning in our veins, none, not even the Lich King, can stand in our way!', '', 27512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish them and then we will move south to kill their brethren!', '', 27511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill these invaders who dare to defile our altar!', '', 27510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They dare attack us? The fools! Do they not know we are now all-powerful?!', '', 27509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mojo of Sseratus is ours. Now all will be crushed under the might of the Drakkari!', '', 27508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink deep my brothers!', '', 27507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s chews on nearby vegetation.', '', 27506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks for a nearby corpse to cannibalize.', '', 27505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will add your watery innards to my own.', '', 27504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The depths consume you!', '', 27503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to drown!', '', 27502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare summon me?!', '', 27501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll cleanse this place! Arthas beware!', 'We\'ll cleanse this place! Arthas beware!', 27500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Argent Crusade! The Scourge shall fail!', 'For the Argent Crusade! The Scourge shall fail!', 27499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can win this war!', 'We can win this war!', 27498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re right! We can do this!', 'You\'re right! We can do this!', 27497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re right! What was I thinking? Bring on the Scourge!', 'You\'re right! What was I thinking? Bring on the Scourge!', 27496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another!', 'Another!', 27495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another drink!', 'Another drink!', 27494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s taste more!', 'Let\'s taste more!', 27493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now where was I?  I yeah...  So I said to her, \"But I need you!  I need you!\"... and she just laughed and slithered away!  It\'s the honest truth, $n.  Naga can be so cruel!', '', 27492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 7, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s sing a song!$B$BBrew, brawl,$BBrew, brawl!$BA Dark Iron\'s life for me!$B$BHah hah!  $n, I like you!', '', 27491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 7, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes $gsir:ma\'am;, this is quite a drink!  Quite a drink indeed!', '', 27490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 7, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s shaping up!  But it needs more kick.  Yep, you guessed it... Let\'s wash yesterday\'s socks in the cauldron... Mmmh, delicious!', '', 27489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 7, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not bad, not bad... But it\'s missing spice!  How about adding scorpid venom?  Yes!  That\'ll fix it right up!', '', 27488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 7, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is good stuff!  But I think it\'s a little flat.  Let\'s round it out with a few squishy basilisk eyeballs...', '', 27487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 7, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out there and make those Scourge wish they were never reborn!', 'Get out there and make those Scourge wish they were never reborn!', 27486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is a fine mess.', 27485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of here while you can, $c!$b$bThere\'s no way we can win....', 'Get out of here while you can, $c!$b$bThere\'s no way we can win....', 27484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re doooomed!!', 'We\'re doooomed!!', 27483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to die here... I just know it.', 'I\'m going to die here... I just know it.', 27482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every time I close my eyes I see the scourge surrounding me!$b$bI gotta get outta here....', 'Every time I close my eyes I see the scourge surrounding me!$b$bI gotta get outta here....', 27481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sob> My uncle served in the Argent Dawn.$b$bHow was he able to face these foul things?', '<sob> My uncle served in the Argent Dawn.$b$bHow was he able to face these foul things?', 27480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t been able to eat or sleep since I got here.$b$bI\'m just not cut out for the Crusade....', 'I haven\'t been able to eat or sleep since I got here.$b$bI\'m just not cut out for the Crusade....', 27479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gotta help me get outta here, $r!$b$bI don\'t wanna become like them!', 'You gotta help me get outta here, $r!$b$bI don\'t wanna become like them!', 27478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t take it anymore....$b$bThey kill you, then eat you! And that\'s if you\'re lucky!', 'I can\'t take it anymore....$b$bThey kill you, then eat you! And that\'s if you\'re lucky!', 27477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truly, the horrors here surpass those we\'ve endured in the Plaguelands.$b$bThe Scourge are more powerful now than ever before.', '', 27476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take their heads! For the Horde!', '', 27475, 1, 7296, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ALLIANCE FILTH! DIE! DIE!', '', 27474, 1, 7296, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('INTRUDERS! KILL THEM!', '', 27473, 1, 7296, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think we lost \'em! That was a close one! Welp, as promised, Amberpine Lodge in one piece! Keep your feet on the ground, friend!', 'I think we lost \'em! That was a close one! Welp, as promised, Amberpine Lodge in one piece! Keep your feet on the ground, friend!', 27472, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahoy! It\'s Pirates\' Day, ye know... and \'til the sun rises on the morrow, Booty Bay is MINE.', 27471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is good stuff!  But it\'s a little weak.  I think I\'ll add a little more garlic breath to it...', '', 27469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 7, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is getting good!  It really warms the stomach!  And $n, I have to say, you\'re a sharp dressing $gfellow:lass;!', '', 27468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 7, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  Don\'t mind DeMeza and her crew... we let the hellion run riot one day a year, Pirates\' Day, and then she leaves us in peace to go plunder the South Seas again.$B$BNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?', '', 27467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take position here, and I will lead a small force inside Stratholme to begin the culling. We must contain and purge the infected for the sake of all of Lordaeron!', '', 27466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I help you taste?', 'May I help you taste?', 27464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s to you, Dread Captain! Make me a pirate for the day.', 'Here\'s to you, Dread Captain! Make me a pirate for the day.', 27463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t bother me, $c!  I have two whole cauldrons of bubbling brew here and I must ensure they taste just right!$B$BIf they don\'t, then Master Coren Direbrew will flay and boil me!', '', 27462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... I\'m feeling groggy...', '', 27461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye\'ve got some stones comin\' up here, $glad:lass;. It\'s Pirates\' Day, ye know... and \'til the sun rises on the morrow, Booty Bay is MINE.$B$BSo! What do ye say? Raise a drink ta me and me crew, and join the celebration?', 27460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 397, 0, 0, 4, 0, 39653),
('SQUAWK! Avast, ye scurvy dogs! Avast!', '', 27459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SQUAWK! Shiver me timbers! Shiver!', '', 27458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SQUAWK! Walk the plank! Walk!', '', 27457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SQUAWK! Keelhaul the lad! Keelhaul!', '', 27456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hapana simply grunts and waves you away towards the Dread Captain DeMeza.$B$BBeneath the fur of one massive arm can be seen a tattoo of the word \"MAGATHA\" in an arrow-pierced heart.', '', 27455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tomorrow, the baron gets his town back... but for today - Pirates\' Day - it belongs to the Dread Captain DeMeza and her crew. Yarrr!$B$BAnd remember: lookin\' the part\'s only HALF the celebration. Talk like a pirate, $glad:lass;!', '', 27454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 15, 396, 0, 3, 2, 39653),
('Ahoy, me hearty!$B$BToday\'s OUR day, ye know... PIRATES\' DAY!$B$BOl\' Chumbucket and I came up with the idea, and once the Dread Captain heard of it... well, here we are!', '', 27453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 5, 396, 0, 3, 2, 39653),
('These Drakkari are just bad news. We need to leave and head to Justice Keep!', 'These Drakkari are just bad news. We need to leave and head to Justice Keep!', 27452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder where we\'re headed to. And who\'s going to deal with these guys?', 'I wonder where we\'re headed to. And who\'s going to deal with these guys?', 27451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t stay out here too long.', 'Don\'t stay out here too long.', 27450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful here, $c. These trolls killed their own snake god!', 'Careful here, $c. These trolls killed their own snake god!', 27449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your back. These Drakkari are a nasty lot.', 'Watch your back. These Drakkari are a nasty lot.', 27448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you around.', 'See you around.', 27447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right. I\'d better get back to the sergeant then.', 'Right. I\'d better get back to the sergeant then.', 27446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, $c.', 'Thanks, $c.', 27445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh-oh. We\'ve got company! HOLD ON TIGHT! I\'m gonna try and lose \'em!', 'Uh-oh. We\'ve got company! HOLD ON TIGHT! I\'m gonna try and lose \'em!', 27444, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in the name of Bronzebeard is goin\' on here? Look at this place! I think...', 'What in the name of Bronzebeard is goin\' on here? Look at this place! I think...', 27443, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna do a quick fly by Conquest Hold to see what those filthy, no good, Horde are up to. Keep your eyes peeled for their wind riders. Not that they\'d ever catch me!', 'We\'re gonna do a quick fly by Conquest Hold to see what those filthy, no good, Horde are up to. Keep your eyes peeled for their wind riders. Not that they\'d ever catch me!', 27442, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
