('', 'Mr. Floppy and I went for a walk, but then we got lost and I was really scared, cause there were these wolves, you know, and they chased us, but then I saw this tower and Mr. Floppy and I hid here and the wolves finally went away after a while and it was terrible and now we don\'t know how to get back home.', 27347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
