('Keep your head low and be on the lookout for frostwyrms! YAAAW!', 'Keep your head low and be on the lookout for frostwyrms! YAAAW!', 26923, 7, 7210, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang on to your hat, pal! We\'re in for a bumpy ride.', 'Hang on to your hat, pal! We\'re in for a bumpy ride', 26922, 7, 7210, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thorson\'s Post - coming right up!', 'Thorson\'s Post - coming right up!', 26921, 7, 7210, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not think for a second that your past accomplishments entitle you to anything, $n.  They don\'t.$B$BIf you want my respect you\'re going to have to earn it.  This means following my orders without question and fulfilling them... without exceptions.', 26920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s what I said!  Badmoon!  Sasha... don\'t ever leave me again!  First they took papa, then they took you... I don\'t want to be alone with them!', 26919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sister!  The mean men were going to take me to Badmoon Isle.  They wanted to turn me into one of them.', 26918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry, sister... no one can hurt you now.', 26917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Badmoon?  You mean Bloodmoon?', 26916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anya!!  You\'re all right!', 26915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You won\'t eat me, will you?', 26914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just issued Kill Credit to $n!', '', 26913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
