('The High Commander said to speak with you to get a ride to Thorson\'s Post.', 'The High Commander said to speak with you to get a ride to Thorson\'s Post.', 26911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
