('Self-destruct sequence initiated.', '', 26909, 0, 7209, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take us into battle, $n!', '', 26908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll hold them a few more moments!  Get into the shrine while you can!', '', 26907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t hold them for long!  Get inside disrupt their necromancers!', '', 26906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll hold them here for a moment.  Get into the shrine and stop those necromancers!', '', 26905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall back!  Incoming Emberwyrm!', '', 26904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming!  Get back down the pass!', '', 26903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
