('Very well, let\'s go!', '', 26897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to get into the fight. Are you ready?', 'We need to get into the fight. Are you ready?', 26896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r.$B$BI have been expecting you.', '', 26895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I see the camp! We\'re almost home, Mr. Floppy! Let\'s go!', 26894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a big meanie attacking Mr. Floppy! Help!', 26893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s gonna eat Mr. Floppy! You gotta help Mr. Floppy! You just gotta!', 26892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for helping me to get back to the camp. Go tell Walter that I\'m safe now!', 26891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is one last thing.  I need to know where Arugal is.', 26890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where is Anya?', 26889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing you can do can compare to what Arugal can do to us!  I will tear you apart myself!', '', 26888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, Tatjana... ', '', 26887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The brat\'s held prisoner in the wolf den on the other side of the mountain.  She was to be taken to Arugal.  Are we free to go now?', '', 26886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop!  Do not shoot!  Do not hurt Tatjana!', '', 26885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Surprise, you scum!  You\'re going to tell me where my sister is or I\'ll put a bucketful of truesilver bullets through your wife\'s heart.', 26884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A lot you know...$b$bSome say they\'re just observing, some think they\'re altering our sea-life, and then others think they\'re here to take over Azeroth!$b$bOnce I take one down with my rocket propelled warheads I\'ll get the answers. You can believe that!', '', 26883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He will live so long as he proves useful. I\'d be careful if I was you, dwarf.', '', 26882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does that satisfy you, Tormak?', '', 26881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will if you wish to keep your head attached to your shoulders.', '', 26880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light, Brann\'s alive? I\'d never help you capture him!', '', 26879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember the dwarven journal that was discovered? Well, this dwarf could be exactly what we need to track down Brann Bronzebeard and capture him.', '', 26878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s just ice. Why all the fuss?', 'It\'s just ice. Why all the fuss?', 26877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be fooled, $r. They\'re very elusive. One moment they\'re there, the next they\'re gone - virtually inexplicable!$b$bBetween you and me, I actually held a piece of one in my hand once! Sadly, before I could conduct any measurements it was gone! Just disappeared....', '', 26876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay your blade, Chieftain. He may yet have value to us.', '', 26875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a minute here! You promised to spare me if I helped you. I held up my end o\' the bargain!', '', 26874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t just let you return to your companions and we can\'t take you with us...', '', 26873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All this equipment just to examine ice?', 'All this equipment just to examine ice?', 26872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll admit, dwarf, I was pleasantly surprised to see your plan succeed.', '', 26871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wha-??$b$bWell, I refer to them as undefined floating obstructions. And where I\'m from, most deny their existence entirely.$b$bBut I know better! I\'ve even seen \'em up close! My recent years have been spent building this vessel to locate, track, document, and if needs be, eradicate them!', '', 26870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mean the iceberg?', 'You mean the iceberg?', 26869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $c, did you see that? Out there, lingering near the water\'s surface....$b$bYou saw it too didn\'t ya?', '', 26868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... he shall suit our needs perfectly.  Have him sent to Solstice Village when you\'re ready.  Arthas will not be pleased if we fall behind schedule.', '', 26867, 0, 7203, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
