('There is no hope.  You will fail.', 'There is no hope.  You will fail.', 26840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every warrior that falls is one more for our mighty army.  There is no victory against us.', 'Every warrior that falls is one more for our mighty army.  There is no victory against us.', 26839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your struggle is meaningless.  You will all fall before the endless Scourge!', 'Your struggle is meaningless.  You will all fall before the endless Scourge!', 26838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
