('You will find no peace in death, wyrms!', 'You will find no peace in death, wyrms!', 26835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s you and I have a chat about some things, Godfrey.', '', 26834, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Halford with the information that the good mayor was kind enough to submit, $n. I will finish here and squeeze whatever else this wretch might know about Thel\'zan. Now, I will show Godfrey the rarely seen \"option three.\"', '', 26833, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop Thel\'zan! He bears the dark gift, bestowed upon him by the Lich King himself!', '', 26832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How? Humans truly are stupid, yes? Thel\'zan the Duskbringer! Thel\'zan the Lich! He who is born of human flesh and bone, sacrificed all for power, protected by the Lich King!', '', 26831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You let us worry about how we kill the monster, Godfrey.', '', 26830, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? There is a mausoleum beneath the old village? What fools we are to not have noticed! We will find and strike down your master now, Godfrey. We will end this nightmare.', '', 26829, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Humans... Beneath the earth of Wintergarde Village you built a mausoleum! Why do you think Naxxramas attacked that spot? Thel\'zan hides deep in your own crypt and sends a thousand-thousand corpses at you! Perish you will...', '', 26828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOO!!! I tell you! I tell you everything!', '', 26827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RUBBISH! Godfrey do you take me for a fool? Do not spew your Scourge propaganda at a man of the Light, heathen! Speak now or I will have the peasants craft a holy water bath and dip you into it like a dog with fleas!', '', 26826, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It tells of the coming apocalypse. How this world will burn and be reborn from death.', '', 26825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought you would see the Light, Godfrey... Now speak quickly, fiend. What does it say?', '', 26824, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never felt hurt like this!', '', 26823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more LIGHT! NO MORE! I BEG YOU!', '', 26822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tell you anything you want!', '', 26821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it stop! MAKE IT STOP!', '', 26820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain is unbearable!', '', 26819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IT BURNSSSSS!', '', 26818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of the Lich King pales in comparison to the glory of the Light!', '', 26817, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
