('LET THE LIGHT IN, GODFREY GOODARD!', '', 26814, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the power of Light compel you!', '', 26813, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LIGHT TAKE YOU, BEAST!', '', 26812, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the sermon begin.', '', 26811, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I say a prayer for you now, lost soul. May the Light take you gracefully.', '', 26810, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then it is option two.', '', 26809, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The book is your salvation, yes... but nothing will you know! NOTHING I SAY! NOTHING! ', '', 26808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you do to me that Kel\'Thuzad has not? That the Lich King will not?', '', 26807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell you nothing, preacher.', '', 26806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hisses!', '', 26805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can do this in one of two ways, Godfrey. First, I will simply ask you to tell me what the unholy markings etched upon the pages of this tome mean. What say you?', '', 26804, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. I have your attention, then, Godfrey?', '', 26803, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s growls.', '', 26802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GODFREY! Hear me, fiend! Hear me, for I am the Light, here to deliver you from evil!', '', 26801, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back, $n, the beast might lash out and harm you.', '', 26800, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s says a prayer for the lost soul.', '', 26799, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen Alexstrasza has placed me in charge of the defense of Wyrmrest Temple.$B$BAs you know, Malygos had his forces destroy a nearby ley line anchor. The forces of the dragonflight then redirected that power to the Azure Dragonshrine.$B$BThe blue dragons are using that power to strengthen themselves; so much so that they dare attack the temple itself! They\'re starting to win.$B$BAre you here to help us, $r?', '', 26798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed, I heard they were recovered from the brink of death by a seasoned veteran of the Horde.', '', 26797, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These kodo are in amazing condition.', '', 26796, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steward, please allow me to ride one of the drakes to the queen\'s chamber at the top of the temple.', 'Steward, please allow me to ride one of the drakes to the queen\'s chamber at the top of the temple.', 26795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall not pass, mon!', '', 26794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop da Scourge!', '', 26793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be ready to strike back soon!', '', 26792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be ready to strike back soon!', '', 26791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Scourge think they can be takin our land? They not know who they dealin wit!', '', 26790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Emporer say we need be holdin dis position mon!', '', 26789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We hold dis place wid our lives mon!', '', 26788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da scourge don\'t know who they be messin with!', '', 26787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me totem fix ya up good bruddahs.', '', 26786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heal ya up bruddas.  You be ready for anothuh battle soon.', '', 26785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you still doing here? Go back to town!', '', 26784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But give what aid you can to the southern peoples, for they are the champions of Silap Inua.', '', 26783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must fight those who would threaten our flesh, who would kill our children; we must look to our own.', '', 26782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You made it $g lad:lass;! I thought you were a goner for sure!', '', 26781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give you this story.', '', 26780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dead rise from our very own crypt!', '', 26779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They threaten not only the ways of the tusked people, but the existence of all who live.', '', 26778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blue-scaled ones have great power. They work to control Silap Inua and take it from the wide ranging peoples of the world.', '', 26777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The threat to Silap Inua is known as those who would cage it. They will be called the blue-scaled ones.', '', 26776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This power is harnessed by all thinking peoples to heal or harm. It is the power of life. It is the power of souls living and dead.', '', 26775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tusked people call it Silap Inua.', '', 26774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a power flowing through all things that live. It carries many names.', '', 26773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bows his head a moment to gather his thoughts.', '', 26772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You haven\'t heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club?  It\'s a bunch of really cute guys that want to celebrate Brewfest all year long!  They tried to bring Brewfest back in the past, but it never lasted very long.$b$bOnce you join the club you get mailed a different brew every month!  If you like that brew, you can talk to the vendors in Ironforge to get more brew.$b$bI think you are cute enough to join the club.  You give me a few prize tokens and I\'ll give you the forms.  Then maybe we can celebrate Brewfest together, all year round!', 'You haven\'t heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club?  It\'s a bunch of really cute guys that want to celebrate Brewfest all year long!  They tried to bring Brewfest back in the past, but it never lasted very long.$b$bOnce you join the club you get mailed a different brew every month!  If you like that brew, you can talk to the vendors in Ironforge to get more brew.$b$bI think you are cute enough to join the club.  You give me a few prize tokens and I\'ll give you the forms.  Then maybe we can celebrate Brewfest together, all year round!', 26771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 24, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the \"Brew of the Month\" club?', 'What\'s the \"Brew of the Month\" club?', 26770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 24, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But there is another threat to the tusked people.', '', 26769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thel\'zan cannot stop me! For the Alliance! For Lord Fordragon!', 'Thel\'zan cannot stop me! For the Alliance! For Lord Fordragon!', 26768, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What could this tome be hiding?', 'What could this tome be hiding?', 26767, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are hunters, too. We are fighters. We can fight for the sea and the land.', '', 26766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thel\'zan\'s enchantment is broken! I am safe!', 'Thel\'zan\'s enchantment is broken! I am safe!', 26765, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The curse is lifted!', 'The curse is lifted!', 26764, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some seek to take the land from us. The finned hunters squat upon the plains and devour the antlered ones themselves.', '', 26763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You haven\'t heard of the \"Brew of the Month\" club? Those gals love to party. If they had their way, Brewfest would never end! Sometimes last year, it felt like it didn\'t.$b$bBut now they\'ve figured, the best way to keep the Brewfest spirit going would be to allow people to join their club.$b$bFor a small fee, just a few tokens, you can join! You get brew mailed to you every month and a chance to buy that same brew if you like it. It\'s cutting edge stuff and a way to make sure that Brewfest\'s spirit is never really gone.', '', 26762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brew of the Month Club?', 'Brew of the Month Club?', 26761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some seek to take the sea from us. The giant raiders have invaded our sacred place on the shore.', '', 26760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sea and the land has given us life.', '', 26759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have lived on the bounty of the sea. We have grown fat on the meat of the antlered ones.', '', 26758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through sunsets beyond counting, the tusked people have dwelled here in the land of ice.', '', 26757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thel\'zan will have you...', '', 26756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tide has brought me a story. Listen, and be enlightened.', '', 26755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only ruin awaits...', '', 26754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us...', '', 26753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks at the gathered crowd and nods his head ponderously.', '', 26752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give... me... book...', '', 26751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tome not yours...', '', 26750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of the frozen wastes, rise and hear the call of your master! Do not let $n escape with the tome!', '', 26749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where do you think you\'re going with that, mortal? Put the tome down and I might spare you an eternity of anguish.', '', 26748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive. The master said that you and your people would be a nuisance. No matter, your end draws near. Soon the combined might of Naxxramas will come down upon this place and shatter your meager existence.', '', 26747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things seem to be going well.', 'Things seem to be going well.', 26746, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s raises his talons menacingly!', '', 26745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With enough tokens you can join the \"Brew of the Month\" club.  Being in the Brew of the Month club is like having Brewfest all year round!$b$bEvery month you will receive mail with a new brew to try out.  If you like that brew, you can go to the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar\'s Valley of Spirits and buy more from the vendors there.  ', '', 26744, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will heal your wounds as best as I can. [PH]', '', 26743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it easy, let the light heal you. [PH]', '', 26742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest easy mon. [PH]', '', 26741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fight for the glory of the Horde!', 26740, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill those Alliance dogs before they can regroup!', 26739, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show the enemy no mercy! This port will be ours!', 26738, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show no mercy!', '', 26737, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let those dirty orcs take the harbor!', '', 26736, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring the fight to the enemy, men!', '', 26735, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brew of the Month Club', 'Brew of the Month Club', 26734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With enough tokens you can join the \"Brew of the Month\" club.  Being in the Brew of the Month club is like having Brewfest all year round!$b$bEvery month you will receive mail with a new brew to try out.  If you like that brew, you can go to the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge and buy more from the vendors there.  ', '', 26733, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare me, Muradin. You weren\'t there to see what Mal\'Ganis did to my homeland.\n', '', 26732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lied to your men and betrayed the mercenaries who fought for you. What\'s happening to you, Arthas? Is vengeance all that\'s important to you?\n', '', 26731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you.  I... I should get going now.', 26730, 0, 7197, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your soul be torn asunder by the very thing you hate most, young prince.', '', 26729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was all lies...', '', 26728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But why?', '', 26727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our lives were worth far more than your blood feud...', '', 26726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gave us your word, betrayer!', '', 26725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our prince has forsaken us! All is lost!', '', 26724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lying wretch, Arthas! You doomed us all!', '', 26723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOOOO!!!!', '', 26722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look alive, lads! Today might be the day we leave this cursed land! O\' sweet Ironforge, how I missed ya!\n', '', 26721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this now? Perhaps Prince Arthas returns to us today!\n', '', 26720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop!  Put that knife away.  You don\'t have to do... whatever they sent you to do.  You\'re not like them yet!', 26719, 0, 7196, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burned down to their frames! No one goes home until our job here is done!\n', '', 26718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t that a bit much, lad?\n', '', 26717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uther had my troops recalled? Damn it! If my warriors abandon me, I\'ll never defeat Mal\'Ganis. The ships must be burned before the men reach the shore!\n', '', 26716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, milord, your father had our troops recalled at Lord Uther\'s request.\n', '', 26715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain, why are the guards not at their posts?', '', 26714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To hell with the undead! We\'ll cut our way through the woods, men!\n', '', 26713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s correct. My men report that the roads from here to the shore are held by the undead. You\'ll need to find an alternate route back to your ships.\n', '', 26712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re to just pick up and leave?', '', 26711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By royal edict, you men are to return to Lordaeron immediately. Lord Uther has convinced the king to recall this expedition.\n', '', 26710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I apologize, emissary, but the prince is away on an errand. What brings you to this desolate place?\n', '', 26709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brother, Synipus has lots of them. You should head up north to Blue Sky Logging Grounds and talk to him.', '', 26708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why, up the river of course!$b$bHaha! Up the river... Okay, okay, you can find him working on shredders up at Blue Sky Logging Ground.$b$bOh, and you can tell him that if he sends me any more half-finished shredders he WILL be up a river!', '', 26707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 153, 396, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I get a Refurbished Shredder Key?', 'Where can I get a Refurbished Shredder Key?', 26706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s great bein\' a member of da \"Brew of the Month\" club.', 'It\'s great bein\' a member of da \"Brew of the Month\" club.', 26705, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, before all the hostilities broke out here we were fixing them up to harvest the local trees.$b$bLately, though, they\'ve been forced into service against the Horde. Turns out they make for a pretty fine fighting machine. If you\'ve got a key, you\'d be silly not to use it!', '', 26704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 396, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would I want to ride a shredder?', 'Why would I want to ride a shredder?', 26703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I find this brother of yours?', 'Where can I find this brother of yours?', 26702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A good brew, is a strong brew.', 'A good brew, is a strong brew.', 26701, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why, the refurbished shredder key, silly!$b$bIf you haven\'t already gotten one today you can talk to my brother, Synipus.', '', 26700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Key? What key?', 'Key? What key?', 26699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy, $r!$b$bIf you\'re lookin\' for a shredder to ride, you\'ll need to head on up into the hills.$b$bThis one\'s out of commission.', '', 26698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 70, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get to Wintergarde Keep fast!', 'I need to get to Wintergarde Keep fast!', 26697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo Ding-Dong.  Ding-Dong man.  Ding-dong.  Yo!', 'Yo Ding-Dong.  Ding-Dong.  Ding-dong yo!', 26696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have for me?', 'What do you have for me?', 26695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there friend!  I see you\'ve got some Brewfest tokens.  As it happens, I still have some Brewfest items for sale.', 'Hey there friend!  I see you\'ve got some Brewfest tokens.  As it happens, I still have some Brewfest items for sale.', 26694, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to buy this month\'s brew.', 'I\'d like to buy this month\'s brew.', 26693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A good club can make all the difference in the world.', 'A good club can make all the difference in the world.', 26692, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huntin time!', '', 26691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Saurfang is here, Sagai! Saurfang! The brother of Broxigar himself, here to aid our efforts!', 26690, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I send ya to today?', '', 26689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yah. Hellscream, he be a fierce one, but too eager to prove himself, I be thinkin\'. It be good Saurfang be here, for sure.', '', 26688, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A skunk, rabbit, and a fawn travelling together.  Now that\'s something you don\'t see every day.  No matter, I\'ll be dining on venison tonight!', '', 26687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOO! Mother! We\'ll avenge you!', '', 26686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without your help, I surely would have died....', '', 26685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d nearly given up. You\'ve given me new life!', '', 26684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r!', '', 26683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bless you, friend. I nearly expired....', '', 26682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure everything will work out, footman.', 'I\'m sure everything will work out, footman.', 26681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
