('Take Ducal\'s horse, he\'s one of them now!', '', 26540, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t even know, do you?  The trappers?  They\'re not human... we have to get out of here!  Come, quick!', '', 26539, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help mon! There\'s too many of dem!', '', 26538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Backup! We need backup!', '', 26537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s flees back to its den....', 26536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I saw them take him over by the north side of the abbey, near the archery targets.', 'I think I saw them take him over by the north side of the abbey, near the archery targets.', 26535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell me where they have Chancellor Amai caged?', 'Can you tell me where they have Chancellor Amai caged?', 26534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think they have her down near the gallows.', 'I think they have her down near the gallows.', 26533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any idea where they\'re keeping Deathguard Schneider?', 'Any idea where they\'re keeping Deathguard Schneider?', 26532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every two years the Spirits of Competition grow especially fervent... and now is that time! Both Alliance and Horde wear this tabard into the Battlegrounds to honor the spirits, seeking to defeat all enemies and earn their favor.', 'Every two years the Spirits of Competition grow especially fervent... and now is that time! Both Alliance and Horde wear this tabard into the Battlegrounds to honor the spirits, seeking to defeat all enemies and earn their favor.', 26531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need only face your rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. Win or lose, if you stay for the duration of the battle, you will be mailed a Competitor\'s Tabard.', 'You need only face your rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. Win or lose, if you stay for the duration of the battle, you will be mailed a Competitor\'s Tabard.', 26530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think he\'s on the south side of the abbey.', 'I think he\'s on the south side of the abbey.', 26529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must defeat your rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. With every victory, there is a chance that a Gold Medallion will be mailed to you.', 'You must defeat your rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. With every victory, there is a chance that a Gold Medallion will be mailed to you.', 26528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see where they took Sanitation Engineer Burke?', 'Did you see where they took Sanitation Engineer Burke?', 26527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think they put him in a cage over near the lumbermill.', 'I think they put him in a cage over near the lumbermill.', 26526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Senior Scrivener Barriga being held?', 'Where is Senior Scrivener Barriga being held?', 26525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here, take this horse over to your stable.  Tell Ronald, \"Hello.\"', 26524, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s a fine one for you.  Take good care of him.', 26523, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All these folks are keeping me busy.  Take this horse over to your stables.', 26522, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re such a sweet lad.  Here, take this horse over to your stable.', 26521, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Amberpine Lodge, $c.', '', 26520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krenna must doubt my abilities. While our elite warriors march out to face the Alliance and their trapper allies, or wreak havoc among the trolls, I\'ve been assigned to mop up those pesky Dragonflayer vrykul.$B$BPerhaps if we combine our efforts, we can both prove ourselves in the conqueror\'s sight.', '', 26519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are quickly learning the price of death in this frigid wasteland, $n. The Lich King\'s power extends across every inch of Northrend, permeating into the earth itself! He turns our own fallen people against us.$B$BFrom the sky, risen gryphon riders rain down their vengeful stormhammers as the walking dead assail us on the ground.\n', 26518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go forth my little pet, kill these mongrels and feast on their flesh! [PH]', '', 26517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go my warrior! Slay the living! [PH]', '', 26516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must kill these intruders! [PH]', '', 26515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise and fight! Kill the living! [PH]', '', 26514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Competitor\'s Souvenir.', 'I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Competitor\'s Souvenir.', 26513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know of the Spirits of Competition, yes?$B$BEvery two years they draw close to the mortal realm. During such times, members of both the Alliance and Horde wear Competitor\'s Tabards into the Battlegrounds to honor the spirits, seeking to defeat one another and earn their favor.$B$BI stockpile souvenirs from such turbulent times. If you\'ve learned the proper word, I might be convinced to part with one...', 'You know of the Spirits of Competition, yes?$B$BEvery two years they draw close to the mortal realm. During such times, members of both the Alliance and Horde wear Competitor\'s Tabards into the Battlegrounds to honor the spirits, seeking to defeat one another and earn their favor.$B$BI stockpile souvenirs from such turbulent times. If you\'ve learned the proper word, I might be convinced to part with one...', 26512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must defeat our rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. With every victory, there is a chance that a Gold Medallion will be mailed to you.', 'You must defeat our rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. With every victory, there is a chance that a Gold Medallion will be mailed to you.', 26511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need only face our rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. Win or lose, if you stay for the duration of the battle, you will be mailed a Competitor\'s Tabard.', 'You need only face our rivals in any of the Battlegrounds. Win or lose, if you stay for the duration of the battle, you will be mailed a Competitor\'s Tabard.', 26510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I gain the favor of a Spirit of Competition?', 'How can I gain the favor of a Spirit of Competition?', 26509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I earn a Competitor\'s Tabard?', 'How do I earn a Competitor\'s Tabard?', 26508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OWWWWWWWW!', '', 26507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You won\'t get... anything else... out of me!', '', 26506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THIS IS TORTURE!', '', 26505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I beg you... no more.', '', 26504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every two years the Spirits of Competition grow especially fervent... and now is that time! We wear this tabard into the Battlegrounds to honor them, seeking to defeat our enemies and earn their favor.', 'Every two years the Spirits of Competition grow especially fervent... and now is that time! We wear this tabard into the Battlegrounds to honor them, seeking to defeat our enemies and earn their favor.', 26503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you going to be doing this for much longer?', 'Are you going to be doing this for much longer?', 26502, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They all... begged... for their... lives!', '', 26501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you try to be a little quieter?', 'Could you try to be a little quieter?', 26500, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just... end it.', '', 26499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... stop. I\'ll do... anything....', '', 26498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You aren\'t going to let me sleep are you?', 'You aren\'t going to let me sleep are you?', 26497, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I TOLD YOU... I don\'t know... anything... else!', '', 26496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to do something to keep myself busy.', 'I need to do something to keep myself busy.', 26495, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just don\'t want to let anyone down.', 'I just don\'t want to let anyone down.', 26494, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just nervous.  Sorry.', 'I\'m just nervous.  Sorry.', 26493, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm....', 'Hmm....', 26492, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My arm is getting sore.', 'My arm is getting sore.', 26491, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I\'m starting to get the hang of this.', 'I think I\'m starting to get the hang of this.', 26490, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t easy.', 'This isn\'t easy.', 26489, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is harder than it looks.', 'This is harder than it looks.', 26488, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did that seem okay?', 'Did that seem okay?', 26487, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take you to some other horses.  You probably miss being around other horses.  They can be your friend too.', '', 26486, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AHHHHHHHHH! Please... we know... that you... have a spy... disguised as... one of us! There... that\'s all that I know. Please... mercy... STOP!', '', 26484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know... that you don\'t... know why we\'re immune... to your so-called blight. Grand Admiral Westwind somehow gave the high abbot that prayer. I beg you... no more... please?!', '', 26483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OW...NO! We know that you\'ve been stealing our armor and weapons and horses!', '', 26482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... WAIT! What is it that you want to know?! I know you\'re the $c named $n.', '', 26481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow! I\'ll tell you NOTHING, filthy $r!', '', 26480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'d be best friends.  I bet me and Anduin would also be best friends, too.  Friends are important.  ', '', 26479, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I were king, I\'d have a horse like you.  I\'d make sure you didn\'t get lost, and I bet you\'d make sure I never got lost.', '', 26478, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People used to come up to me because they thought I was the king.  I guess we look alike...', '', 26477, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His son, Anduin Wrynn, was the king for a while.  He\'s about my age too.  Can you imagine if I were the king?', '', 26476, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See this statue, boy?  This is the king of Stormwind, Varian Wrynn.', '', 26475, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be so quick to escape! I have a parting gift....', '', 26474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please enjoy their company, the Lich King sends his regards!', '', 26473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to play?', '', 26472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Annihilate them.', '', 26471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good of you to come, champion! The beast almost had me!', 'Good of you to come, champion! The beast almost had me!', 26470, 7, 7168, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! A hero has come!', 'Finally! A hero has come!', 26469, 7, 7168, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll never forget you, friend.', 'I\'ll never forget you, friend.', 26468, 7, 7168, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, kind soul.', 'Thank you, kind soul.', 26467, 7, 7168, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise my warriors and fight for your new liege!', '', 26464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes? What is it?', '', 26463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unchain and control Flamebringer.', 'Unchain and control Flamebringer.', 26462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thane Torvald Eriksson\'s temperamental proto-drake is chained up here.', '', 26461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c.$B$BHow may I help you?', 26460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just arrived in Venomspite. How could I have possibly wronged you?', '', 26459, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the meaning of this?! Stop! I\'ll double whatever they\'re paying you!', '', 26458, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the line! Legion, focus fire at the gates!', '', 26457, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforce the gate! Do not let the Scourge through!', '', 26456, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion, to the front lines!', '', 26455, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I beg you! Please don\'t kill me!', '', 26454, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can someone let me out of here? I need to get back to Venomspite and finish my shift.', '', 26453, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'d be so kind, please let me out of here!', '', 26452, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, over here!', 26451, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t possibly mean to.... I\'ll write you up for this, $c!', '', 26450, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you mean my time has come?! I\'ll kill you where you stand!', 26449, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, chancellor, I wouldn\'t say that I\'m here to \'rescue\' you, per se.', 'No, chancellor, I wouldn\'t say that I\'m here to \'rescue\' you, per se.', 26448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what happened. I had just arrived at Venomspite and then all of a sudden I woke up in this cage!$B$BAre you here to rescue me?', '', 26447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their defenses are down! The time is now, minions! ATTACK!', '', 26446, 0, 7235, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('End this mortal affront to the Lich King!', '', 26445, 0, 7235, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack now, my minions! Your master commands it!', '', 26444, 0, 7235, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Afraid not. Your days as a sanitation engineer are coming to an end.', 'Afraid not. Your days as a sanitation engineer are coming to an end.', 26443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $g buddy : ma\'am;. I\'ve seen you around.$B$BMind getting me out of here?', '', 26442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not today, senior scrivener!', 'Not today, senior scrivener!', 26441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh good, you\'re here to rescue me. Now let me out of here!', '', 26440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid not, Schneider. Your time has come!', 'I\'m afraid not, Schneider. Your time has come!', 26439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Think you could get me out of here, $c?', 26438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know their kind as old gods.  Beware Yogg-Saron, the beast with a thousand maws.  His evil extends beyond Vordrassil\'s roots.', '', 26437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you all.  The druids of old were wise to tear down Vordrassil, for its roots seep deep into the dwelling of an ancient evil. ', '', 26436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me how to make those carrots!', 'Tell me how to make those carrots!', 26435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It sure is bright out here... and flat.', '', 26434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way, boy.  I\'ll take you to our nice stables in the back.', '', 26433, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go boy.', '', 26432, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon boy, let\'s get you away from all this noise.', '', 26431, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet with all these new people here, Celidh, you\'ve got to have some pets you want me to move to the stables.', '', 26430, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure is busy here Celidh.  Do you have any pets you want me to move to the stables?', '', 26429, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Celidh!  Do you have any pets you want me to take over to the stable?', '', 26428, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ursoc, brother of Ursol and guardian of the furbolg tribes... show yourself!', '', 26427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy cretin. Your kind doesn\'t deserve to live. Have at thee!', '', 26426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, a worthy offering!', '', 26425, 0, 7145, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s clears a jam from his rifle.', '%s clears a jam from his rifle.', 26424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light take you!', 'Light take you!', 26423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooooh! I think that one\'s head exploded!', 'Ooooh! I think that one\'s head exploded!', 26422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were once people... Now? Undead monsters with an appetite for flesh!', 'They were once people... Now? Undead monsters with an appetite for flesh!', 26421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Light have mercy on your soul, fiend.', 'May the Light have mercy on your soul, fiend.', 26420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with the Light, friend.', 'Go with the Light, friend.', 26419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My beautiful mill. You! You\'ll die for this!', '', 26418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Kodian.  I\'ll do what I can.', 'Thank you, Kodian.  I\'ll do what I can.', 26417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A furbolg named Tur Ragepaw.  Not one of ours.$B$BThis one came from the southern lands.  He was of the Timbermaw tribe.$B$BHe wanted to see Ursoc.  He seemed to think that Vordrassil\'s taint could be purified and used to save my father.$B$BIt is foolish to entertain such hopes.  You will agree when you see the darkness that has afflicted him like I have.', '', 26416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who was this stranger?', 'Who was this stranger?', 26415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Kodian, daughter of Ursoc.  I watch over this once sacred shrine.$B$BI\'ve not seen a stranger come here in a long time.', '', 26414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Son of Ursoc.  I\'ll see what can be done.', 'Thank you, Son of Ursoc.  I\'ll see what can be done.', 26413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sapling they grew bore a fruit.  At first it seemed to work.  Ursoc did come back and I was filled with joy for a brief moment.$B$BAs he recovered, it was clear that he wasn\'t the same.  Neither were the furbolg.$B$BWhatever evil caused the ancient druids to tear down Vordrassil manifested itself in the new tree and turned them all into monsters filled with bloodlust.$B$BThe thing that now walks the Grizzly Hills is not my father and it must be put to rest.', '', 26412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened then?', 'What happened then?', 26411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your voice down, $c. I\'m in disguise and spying for Venomspite.', 26410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t understand.  If I wanted to I could fight my way out of this cave.$B$BIt\'s my father, Ursoc.  He has returned from the dead... but he\'s not the same.$B$BHe gave his life during the War of the Ancients thousands of years ago.  For centuries, the furbolg who worshipped him tried to devise a way to resurrect him.$B$BFinally they decided they were to attempt to regrow the failed world tree, Vordrassil, and use its magic to bring back my father.', '', 26409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
