('Calm down. I want to you ask you about the iron dwarves and Loken.', 'Calm down. I want to you ask you about the iron dwarves and Loken.', 26262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Limpy Joe, it\'s you. It\'s really you!', '', 26261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will ravage the living... I mean the Scourge, of course.\n', '', 26260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I humbly offer myself to the will of the light.', 'I humbly offer myself to the will of the light.', 26259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All rewards to be paid by High Executor Wroth upon verification.$B$BSerious-minded individuals inquire within.$B$BNO SOLICITORS!', '', 26258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stink.  Take a shower.', 'You stink.  Take a shower.', 26257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense the taint of this land in you, footman.  Report to the Bishop before the start of your next shift.', 'I sense the taint of this land in you, footman.  Report to the Bishop before the start of your next shift.', 26256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard whisperings of intruders.  Be wary.', 'I\'ve heard whisperings of intruders.  Be wary.', 26254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think about it, prospector, but make up your mind swiftly. We must act soon.', '', 26253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you agree to help us against our mutual enemy, you will come to no harm here.', '', 26252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are among the Taunka of Camp Oneqwah, dwarf.', '', 26251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remain vigilant, soldier. This terrible war will be over soon.', '', 26250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes peeled for any suspicious activity, soldier. I\'ve spotted a few troublemakers mulling about.', '', 26249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('When all this is over, I\'m going to recommend you for an Alliance Mark of Honor.', '', 26248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re doing a good job, soldier. Prince Arthas would be proud! Keep it up!', '', 26247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At ease, lad. The Prince will be back soon and we\'ll be on our way back to Lordaeron.', '', 26246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention!', '', 26245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you wanna go home, peasant? These things aren\'t gonna rebuild themselves!', '', 26244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re gonna have to hammer harder than that, fella! Get a move on!', '', 26243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That better be finished by the time Prince Arthas returns!', '', 26242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look alive, peasant! We\'ve got to get these structures back up!', '', 26241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where... where am I?', '', 26240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see if this works.', '', 26239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ringing', 'Ringing', 26238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My S.T.O.U.T. is more than just a target for throwing steins, it\'s a valuable training asset.  If you can hit S.T.O.U.T. you can probably hit anything!$b$bJust try not to hit me.', '', 26237, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to your duties, overseer. Be certain to impress upon your workers the urgency of their tasks.', '', 26236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the stone giants interfere with our work at Ulduar, I will hold you and your thane responsible. Mortals must not be allowed to come to the aid of the giants.', '', 26235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell your rune-smiths to continue converting what stone giants you can. Those that will not submit must be destroyed.', '', 26234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destiny will not wait. Your craftsmen must increase their production of the war golems before the stone giant leader and his army reach Ulduar.', '', 26233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re late, overseer.', '', 26232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You... half-idiot... what got into you?  Pulling off something like that on her?  Did you think she wouldn\'t notice?', 26231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My liege!  Allow me to go instead.', 26230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen you so eager to cause harm to someone, sister.  Such a pleasant development... very well, go!', 26229, 0, 7217, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At once, my lady!', '', 26228, 0, 7217, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That spineless troll has failed me for the last time.  Anthis!  Break his legs!', 26227, 0, 7217, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 9:00pm. Break time for me! I\'ll see you all in 4 hours. Unless one of you kills me in my sleep (please).', '', 26226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 7:00pm. Another productive day at Venomspite comes to a close as night falls upon us.', '', 26225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 5:00pm. To those that may have been keeping score, I did - in fact - soil myself.', '', 26224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 3:00pm. I think I soiled myself.', '', 26223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 1:00pm. We\'re right in the middle of the lunch time rush! Your poisons, plagues, and noxious gases are delivered in 60 seconds or your order is free!', '', 26222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 11:00am. I want to take this opportunity to welcome all you new murderous, twisted Horde to Venomspite! So welcome, on behalf of me and my brother, Brote.', '', 26221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 9:00am. It looks like another beautiful day in Dragonblight!', '', 26220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 7:00am. Good morning to all you early risers!', '', 26219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 5:00am. End me!', '', 26218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 3:00am. Time for bed!', '', 26217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 1:00am. If I ever break free, I will tear this town apart!!!', '', 26216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna jump this time, Brote. I swear it!', '', 26215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it lunch time?', '', 26214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it my turn?', '', 26213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh! What be happenin\' to me, mon?', '', 26212, 0, 7145, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 6:00pm. Please kill my brother!', '', 26211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 4:00pm. That\'s HAPPY HOUR at Middleton\'s Apothecarium! Come on inside and get poisoned or gased or both for a mere 35 silver!', '', 26210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 2:00pm. I want to take this opportunity to let you all know that Middleton\'s got a 2 for 1 sale going on right now! Buy 1 canister of his world famous poisonous biological agents and get the second free!', '', 26209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 12:00pm. Noon for those of you that can\'t count. That\'s right, I\'m looking at you, orcs.', '', 26208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 10:00am. It\'s looking like there\'s gonna be more of the green poisonous cloud of death in today\'s weather forecast.', '', 26207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 8:00am. I\'m sure you\'re all getting back from your morning jogs by now.', '', 26206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 6:00am *yawn*. Rise and shine.', '', 26205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 4:00am. Don\'t you people ever sleep?', '', 26204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 2:00am. Coincidentally, a perfect time to kill me and end my misery.', '', 26203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the bell\'s toll it will be 12:00am. Midnight to all you scary Forsaken! OOoooo...', '', 26202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I ever get out of here, I will CRUSH every clock I come in contact with...', '', 26201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I ever get out of here, I will CRUSH every clock I come in contact with...', '', 26200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has it really been an hour?', '', 26199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not this nonsense again...', '', 26198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope one of us dies. I hope that one is you, Skrotee.', '', 26197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pray Skrotee... Find religion... Because if we ever get out of here, you will be wishing you were back in here!', '', 26196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you know what pisses me off more than anything, Skrotee? No, not that we\'ve been made into a living cuckoo clock for the amusement of the Forsaken. And not that we have to endure being spat upon and mocked every waking minute of our time here... What pisses me off the most is being made to wear these damned short-shorts...', '', 26195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of all the hair-brained, idiotic, BRAINLESS ideas... \"Yea, Brote, it\'ll be great... the Forsaken will rain gold coins down on our heads!\"', '', 26194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is all your fault, you know...', '', 26193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings!  Do you need something?', '', 26192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These irons are crazy! They keep talking about serving their \'master Loken\' but from what I can tell, only a few receive orders from him.', 26191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank goodness! I was worried they were going to press me into service in their war against the stone giants!', '', 26190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for rescuing me, but the others are still held on the tiers above!', '', 26189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah!  My slaves brought back a real meal this time!', '', 26188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah!  So be it.  Blow the horn of a magnataur leader at the ring of torches south of the Blue Dragonshrine.  Make peace with your gods... Grom\'thar will come.  ', 'Hah!  So be it.  Blow the horn of a magnataur leader at the ring of torches south of the Blue Dragonshrine.  Make peace with your gods... Grom\'thar will come.  ', 26187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 60, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek their leader... little thing, you wage war against the clans of Grom\'thar the Thunderbringer himself.  Don\'t be so eager to rush to your death.', 'You seek their leader... little thing, you wage war against the clans of Grom\'thar the Thunderbringer himself.  Don\'t be so eager to rush to your death.', 26186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through the valleys and peaks of Mount Hyjal, across the shifting sands of Silithus, against the Legion\'s dread armies - we have fought. We are the nameless, faceless, sons and daughters of the Alliance. By the Light and by the might of the Alliance, the first strike belongs to us and the last strike is all that our enemies see.$B$BWe are 7th Legion.\n', '', 26185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come in by the fire and rest, $r. I hope you don\'t mind the smell of fish.', 'Come in by the fire and rest, $r. I hope you don\'t mind the smell of fish.', 26184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re everywhere!', '', 26183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh!!!', '', 26182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big guy will save us!', '', 26181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t wanna die!', '', 26180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run away!', '', 26179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh. Nothing against you, pup, but you might want to find somewhere else to bed down for the night. Wouldn\'t want that tender skin of yours to get bruised.', '', 26178, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Might not be snowy out there, but the nights here can freeze your nose right off. The bunks are in the back - just don\'t make a nuisance of yourself.', '', 26177, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Preserve? Why? There\'s no truth in it. No no no... only in the taking! I see that now!', 26176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you think you be doin? Get away from me!', '', 26175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. Now these beasts shall feel the fury of the Sunwell!', 'Thank you, friend. Now these beasts shall feel the fury of the Sunwell!', 26174, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will protect you, friend!', 'I will protect you, friend!', 26173, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, buddy! Let\'s see if I can\'t get this hunk o\' junk movin\' faster!', '', 26172, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gains fuel.', '', 26171, 0, 7141, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s recovers from the EMP and restores Iron Thane Furyhammer\'s shield.', '', 26170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The EMP disrupts Iron Thane Furyhammer\'s shield!', '', 26169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have food, if you are hungry, and you may make use of my tent, should you require rest.', 'I have food, if you are hungry, and you may make use of my tent, should you require rest.', 26168, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xink\'s Shredder security features activated.  Returning to base.', '', 26167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xink\'s Shredder ready and available for woodland destruction.', '', 26166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scourge aberrations... They\'ll get what\'s coming to them soon enough.', '', 26165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey dere. You need anythin\', you let me know.', '', 26164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You only delay the inevitable! The dread citadel rises in the east as the armies of the dead march from the heart of Icecrown!', '', 26163, 0, 7264, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah!  My slaves brought back a real meal this time!', '', 26162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Resist it, me bruddas! Dun be turning to der side!', '', 26161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Drakkari Empire won\'t stand for dis mon!', '', 26160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No mon, we dun want to be part of da Scourge!', '', 26159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Warsong Hold.', 'Take me to Warsong Hold.', 26158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Amber Ledge.', 'Take me to Amber Ledge.', 26157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like passage to the Transitus Shield.', 'I\'d like passage to the Transitus Shield.', 26156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you disturb me?', '', 26155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Energy collection complete.', '', 26154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiating energy collection.', '', 26153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('casually tosses his |Hitem:36862|h|cFFFFFFFF[Worn Troll Dice]|r|h.', 'casually tosses her |Hitem:36862|h|cFFFFFFFF[Worn Troll Dice]|r|h.', 26152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, I can be restin\'...', '', 26151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s mah mummy?', '', 26150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could sleep forever, mon....', '', 26149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free at last, mon.', '', 26148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('rubs his |Hitem:36863|h|cFFFFFFFF[Decahedral Dwarven Dice]|r|h between his hands and rolls.', 'rubs her |Hitem:36863|h|cFFFFFFFF[Decahedral Dwarven Dice]|r|h between her hands and rolls.', 26147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrrrrroooom!', '', 26146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $r.  I\'m sorry that you had to see our sacred land for the first time in such a state.', 26145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no thrill like the thrill of a dragon hunt.', '', 26144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You not a real mon til you killed a dragon... mon.', '', 26143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR THE HORDE!', '', 26142, 1, 7119, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Horde, High Chief. Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 26141, 1, 7119, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For my Taunka brothers and sisters! FOR THE HORDE!\n', '', 26140, 1, 7119, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From this moment until the end of days I live and die - For the Horde!\n', '', 26139, 1, 7119, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief\'s desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief\'s command!', '', 26138, 1, 7119, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde! For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.', '', 26137, 1, 7119, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather, brothers and sisters.', '', 26136, 1, 7119, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like a ride up to the bottom of Warsong Hold.', 'I\'d like a ride up to the bottom of Warsong Hold.', 26135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heya. They weren\'t sure this elevator would be workin\' in time, so they called me and my brother in. You need a ride down?', '', 26134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like a ride up to the top of Warsong Hold.', 'I\'d like a ride up to the top of Warsong Hold.', 26133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo. They weren\'t sure this elevator would be workin\' in time, so they called me and my brother in. You need a ride up?', '', 26132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will walk together, $n.', '', 26131, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reads from the scroll as the other Taunka gather around him.', '', 26130, 1, 7119, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is you who honor me, High Chief. Please read from this scroll. It is the oath of allegiance.', 'It is you who honor me, High Chief. Please read from this scroll. It is the oath of allegiance.', 26129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be an honor to battle alongside of you as a brother of the Horde, $n. I accept your offer.', '', 26128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings High Chief. Would you do me the honor of accepting my invitation to join the Horde as an official member and leader of the Taunka?', 'Greetings High Chief. Would you do me the honor of accepting my invitation to join the Horde as an official member and leader of the Taunka?', 26127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for rescuing me, $n. I will never forget your courage and determination.', '', 26126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warm-up sequence initiated.', '', 26125, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can sleep in the barracks, if you\'d like. Just don\'t wake my men, or I\'ll throw you out in the snow myself.', '', 26124, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll see how the Drakkari holds up against the might of the Scourge!', '', 26123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zombie! Slay him!', '', 26122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish Troll, you will join our ranks. Zombie! Attack!', '', 26121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must return to the world of shadows, Koltira. Send me back.', 'I must return to the world of shadows, Koltira. Send me back.', 26120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? You want to train under me, $c? You better be ready to work.', '', 26119, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have crossed into the world of the dead in search of answers. You wish to save your ally and have risked life and limb to be here. Allow me to help.', '', 26118, 0, 7136, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the Horde... meddling, as always. I suppose a welcome is in order. So welcome, insects. Welcome to my world.\n', '', 26117, 0, 7136, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And remember this, mortal: for now, I give you the choice. I allow you to pick your allegiance, but in the end, you will be mine - one way or another.\n', '', 26116, 0, 7136, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mograine\'s sacrifice was for nothing. You will let Koltira know, won\'t you?\n', '', 26115, 0, 7136, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The boy believed that he was free, but free will has a price. The demons I kept at bay are now loosed upon him and all death knights that attempt to flee... \n', '', 26114, 0, 7136, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t you dare talk about my father, monster.  He was twice the man you\'ll ever be.', 26113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d rather be dead than be one of you!  You think you\'re still human?  You\'re... animals!', 26112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m old enough to shoot beasts like you right between the eyes... at twice this distance.', 26110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your father was weak, Sasha... he didn\'t have the guts to do what had to be done.', '', 26109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll all end up serving the Lich King, kid.  Better this way than becoming a rotten corpse.', '', 26108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How old are you, lass?', '', 26107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t get away with this, you know?  You\'re just a kid.', '', 26106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have made a grave misssstake...', '', 26105, 0, 7136, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relent! This ssssoul iss not worth sssaving...', '', 26104, 0, 7136, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill ussss all... More will come for him...', '', 26103, 0, 7136, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The boy believed he could essssscape... Neither of you shall make it out alive.', '', 26102, 0, 7136, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me be, fool!', '', 26101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, please, I would like to return to the ground level of the temple.', 'Yes, please, I would like to return to the ground level of the temple.', 26100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would you like to head back down, $c?$B$BI can see to it that one of these drakes sees you safely to where you need to go.', 26099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you summon me without an offering!', '', 26098, 0, 7135, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Wyrmrest Temple, traveler.$B$BHere the dragonflights confer in peace with one another amidst the bones of their honored ancestors.$B$BAt least, we were peaceful until the Blue Dragonflight launched a surprise attack upon the temple itself.$B$BEnter with our blessing, but know that we will brook no aggression within our walls.', '', 26096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tell your story, friends!  I\'ll tell everyone about how the Hollowstone miners never gave in!', '', 26095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t let your families see you like this!  Us miners have to look after each other!', '', 26094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dimitri!  Anton!  Don\'t you recognize me?  Do not worry, I will put your souls to rest!', '', 26093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare to defy the sons of iron?', '', 26092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You\'ll never get away with this!', '', 26091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for this!', '', 26090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think you\'re doing?', '', 26089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back here with me guts, $r!', '', 26088, 0, 7133, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat me liver you be squeezin, mon!', '', 26087, 0, 7133, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why ya wanna mess wit me innards, mon?', '', 26086, 0, 7133, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You take my heart, now I take yours!', '', 26085, 0, 7133, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull the console\'s levers.', 'Pull the console\'s levers.', 26084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This console stands before steaming rubble.  The sounds of an engine can be heard below.', 'This console stands before steaming rubble.  The sounds of an engine can be heard below.', 26083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With enough money, I could take over the world...', '', 26082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $r.  You are welcome to share this canyon with us as refuge from the dragons.  Beware the goblin runt though... his kind cannot be trusted.', '', 26081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive, aren\'t they? These giants would be the perfect fodd... er, allies.  This one is their leader, but he continues to refuse to speak with me.', '', 26080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('About time!  Get that lumber and get moving.  The horde won\'t be up there fighting forever, there\'s money to be made!', '', 26079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Talk to Narf.  Lets take care of those bird-brains once and for all.', 26078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Fizzcrank Airstrip.', 'Take me to Fizzcrank Airstrip.', 26077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Valiance Keep.', 'Take me to Valiance Keep.', 26076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Star\'s Rest.', 'Take me to Star\'s Rest.', 26075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Fordragon Hold.', 'Take me to Fordragon Hold.', 26074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Wintergarde Keep.', 'Take me to Wintergarde Keep.', 26073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Westfall Brigade Encampment.', 'Take me to the Westfall Brigade Encampment.', 26072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Agmar\'s Hammer.', 'Take me to Agmar\'s Hammer.', 26071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Wyrmrest Temple.', 'Take me to Wyrmrest Temple.', 26070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Amberpine Lodge.', 'Take me to Amberpine Lodge.', 26069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Expire? Me? Heh, not hardly, kid. That was just a scratch.', '', 26068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harrison Jones? Didn\'t you expire back in Zul\'aman?', 'Harrison Jones? Didn\'t you expire back in Zul\'aman?', 26067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See ya \'round, kid!', '', 26066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, kid. I can handle this thing. You just watch my back!', '', 26065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have another task for you, should you be willing, little one.', '', 26064, 0, 7131, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Venomspite.', 'Take me to Venomspite.', 26063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t offer you anything outside Howling Fjord. The bats still don\'t know their way abroad. Where do you want to go?', 'I can\'t offer you anything outside Howling Fjord. The bats still don\'t know their way abroad. Where do you want to go?', 26062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us speak a moment, $r.', '', 26061, 0, 7130, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 26060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My charge at Agmar\'s Hammer extends far beyond the care of the animals at the stables.', '', 26059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Conquest Hold.', 'Take me to Conquest Hold.', 26058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re free to go, miss.', '', 26057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you!', 26056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Camp Oneqwah.', 'Take me to Camp Oneqwah.', 26055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Apothecary Camp.', 'Take me to the Apothecary Camp.', 26054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just as well, I\'ve had enough of this place.', '', 26053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Runebreaker fails to free the Runed Giant, weakening it and causing it to attack!', '', 26052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was doomed. Thank you for freeing me.', '', 26051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never thought I\'d be free from that terrible spell!', '', 26050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my gratitude.', '', 26049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, small one.', '', 26048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ya worry, mon. Just leave it to Rokhan. She be comin\'.', '', 26047, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get that frostwyrm on the ground and I\'ll finish her.', 'Get that frostwyrm on the ground and I\'ll finish her.', 26046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mon, da west wastes of dis place be full o\' baddies. Stay away from dis here area if ya want to live!', '', 26045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have dealings with the doctor over there, be cautious. Whatever they\'re up to, it\'s unnatural.', '', 26044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to feassst!', '', 26043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s is angered by your request and attacks!', '', 26042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breaking off a piece of its bark, the %s hands it to you before departing.', '', 26041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s gives you its thanks.', '', 26039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ssssupper comess early?', '', 26038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww, not a snake!', '', 26037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this?', '', 26036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m keeping an eye on the forsaken idiots down there. You can never be too cautious around them!', '', 26035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde is about honor and war. I am certain that there is nothing honorable about what these apothecaries are doing.', '', 26034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ask me, and you DID, I think we should kill all of the apothecaries before it\'s too late!', '', 26033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mark my words, these forsaken fools will be the death of us all!', '', 26032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do your part in keeping the Scourge at bay, soldier! Report all suspicious activity and kill first, ask questions later!', '', 26031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Odd. That usually does it.', '', 26030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to put an end to all this!', '', 26029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their ceremonial chamber, where I was to be sacrificed...', '', 26028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, kid. Stay behind me and you\'ll be fine.', '', 26027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This transgression against the Blue Dragonflight has been noted. I will take extra pleasure in separating the life energy from your body!', 26026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deal with this interruption, Keldonus. After you are through, bring me the head of the one they call $n. I will decorate my chambers with $g his:her; skull.', 26025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ley line beneath this night elf temple is now flowing into the Azure Dragonshrine. Our brothers should have all the power they need to crush our enemies.', '', 26024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chug and chuck!  Chug and chuck!', 'Chug and chuck!  Chug and chuck!', 26023, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live only to serve the master, my lady.', '', 26022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done well, Keldonus. Lord Malygos will be quite pleased with your progress.', 26021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lady, the surge needle is fully operational.', '', 26020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $c, for seeing to it that I received the letter from my brother.$B$BRest assured, his death will not have been in vain. The blue dragonflight will pay for this.$B$BI\'ll see to it personally!', 'Thank you, $c, for seeing to it that I received the letter from my brother.$B$BRest assured, his death will not have been in vain. The blue dragonflight will pay for this.$B$BI\'ll see to it personally!', 26019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the -- ?', 'What the -- ?', 26018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits on the ground near the Alliance Envoy.', '%s spits on the ground near the Alliance Envoy.', 26017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are damned.  If I were you, I\'d leave before it was too late.  You\'ll be lucky if you make it back alive.', 'We are damned.  If I were you, I\'d leave before it was too late.  You\'ll be lucky if you make it back alive.', 26016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you ask for our help?  Where were you when we needed you?  Do you\'ve any idea what we\'ve been through?', 'Now you ask for our help?  Where were you when we needed you?  Do you\'ve any idea what we\'ve been through?', 26015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a bad feeling about this.  If something happens to me, head back to Amberpine lodge and report to Lieutenant Dumont.', 'I\'ve got a bad feeling about this.  If something happens to me, head back to Amberpine lodge and report to Lieutenant Dumont.', 26014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awww man not again.', 'Awww man not again.', 26013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s comin right for us!', 'It\'s comin right for us!', 26012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!', 'RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!', 26011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! Impossible! RUNNN!', 'What?! Impossible! RUNNN!', 26010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'d better get outta here unless you want to find yourself in one of these cages....', '', 26009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'d best head back, $n.  These simpletons don\'t know what a grave mistake they\'re making.', 'We\'d best head back, $n.  These simpletons don\'t know what a grave mistake they\'re making.', 26008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find it in your interest to aid the Alliance war effort.  We are in need of scouts and trackers, as well as provisions for our troops.  Payment, in gold, will be delivered immediately from the king\'s treasury.', 'You will find it in your interest to aid the Alliance war effort.  We are in need of scouts and trackers, as well as provisions for our troops.  Payment, in gold, will be delivered immediately from the king\'s treasury.', 26007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail!  By order of King Varian Wrynn, I\'ve been given the authority to extend an offer to the people of Silverbrook.', 'Hail!  By order of King Varian Wrynn, I\'ve been given the authority to extend an offer to the people of Silverbrook.', 26006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bodies hanging from the gate... something\'s very wrong here.', 'The bodies hanging from the gate... something\'s very wrong here.', 26005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it up ahead.', 'That\'s it up ahead.', 26004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re taking a shortcut.  Be on the lookout for worgs.', 'We\'re taking a shortcut.  Be on the lookout for worgs.', 26003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silverbrook is due northwest of here.  A small community of hunters and trappers.  They know the lay of the land -- it would be good to have them on our side.', 'Silverbrook is due northwest of here.  A small community of hunters and trappers.  They know the lay of the land -- it would be good to have them on our side.', 26002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready to ride, $n.  If the military can\'t be bothered to send me an escort, I suppose you\'ll have to do.', 'Get ready to ride, $n.  If the military can\'t be bothered to send me an escort, I suppose you\'ll have to do.', 26001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $c, for seeing to it that I received the letter from my daughter.$B$BRest assured, her death will not have been in vain. The blue dragonflight will pay in spades.$B$BI\'ll see to it personally!', '', 26000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anub\'et\'kan is defeated! Take a fragment of his husk as proof of your victory!', '', 25999, 0, 7121, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not Haloke!', 25998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not let you win!', '', 25997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for that!', '', 25996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Warning! Vehicle has left the operation area. Power-down imminent.', '', 25995, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Deino, mah sistah. Ta\'zinni die now.', '', 25994, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya shouldn\'a taken the boat north, mon!', '', 25993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s flies away.', '', 25992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be cautious, but return quickly. We cannot afford to be blind.', '', 25991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello! I have your rations right here.', 25990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A package changes hands between Pahu and the Longrunner, who packs it away safely.', 'A package changes hands between Pahu and the Longrunner, who packs it away safely.', 25989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, Pahu.', 'Hello, Pahu.', 25988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life is forfeit, ally of stone!', '', 25987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a fool to fight Kurun\'s hopeless battle!', '', 25986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for your interference!', '', 25985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the glory of Loken!', '', 25984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one will keep us from our destiny!', '', 25983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enemy grows stronger! Aid me!', '', 25982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children of iron, lend me your blades!', '', 25981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will destroy you, puny creature!', '', 25980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush the small one!', '', 25979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike now!', '', 25978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grunts and nods.', '', 25977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then we cut our way through the Nerubians.', '', 25976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. We\'ve known this much for some time. We need to get closer and see how deeply they go.', 25975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There they are. Taima, are we close enough to see everything for the report?', '', 25974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will return swiftly with our report.', 25973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get outa here! Good riddance!', 'Get outa here! Good riddance!', 25972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OWNED!', 'OWNED!', 25971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We go to scout out the sinkholes to the west, Chieftain.', '', 25970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why am I so good? ', 'Why am I so good?', 25969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YaY! WE WON!', 'YaY! WE WON!', 25968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iron masters, aid me in this battle!', '', 25967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there!  Fizzcrank\'s pilots are the best of the best.  We stay that way through constant training.  That includes parachute training.  You never know when you will need to use your chute, but you do know that one day you\'ll have to use it.$b$bSo what we have here is a teleporter to the top of this spire.  Once you get up there, the only way for a real soldier to get back down is with a parachute.  We\'ve got another trooper stationed up top ready with the parachutes.$b$bIf you feel like trying it out, $c, I\'ll clear you for teleporter use.  Then just step onto the teleporter.', 'Hello there!  Fizzcrank\'s pilots are the best of the best.  We stay that way through constant training.  That includes parachute training.  You never know when you will need to use your chute, but you do know that one day you\'ll have to use it.$b$bSo what we have here is a teleporter to the top of this spire.  Once you get up there, the only way for a real soldier to get back down is with a parachute.  We\'ve got another trooper stationed up top ready with the parachutes.$b$bIf you feel like trying it out, $c, I\'ll clear you for teleporter use.  Then just step onto the teleporter.', 25966, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARRGGH!! It cannot be! How...', '', 25965, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent mortal! You will be consumed!', '', 25964, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I will force you down! Wind grant me flight!', '', 25963, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come down and face me, insect!', '', 25962, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hulking Jormungar falters for a moment, opening its mouth wide.', '', 25961, 0, 7117, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 25960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your freedom will be short lived, Icemist!', '', 25959, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR ICEMIST! FOR THE TAUNKA!', '', 25958, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rebirth comes, my brothers... Rise... Rise and fight once more.', '', 25957, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will face the full fury of the ancestors for what you have done, monster!', '', 25956, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have they done to my people...', '', 25955, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... am... FREE!', '', 25954, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new day dawns, my children! Soon the undead legions of Azjol-Nerub will rise and take over this world!', '', 25953, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in, Taunka! Your will cannot hold out against the Scourge!', '', 25952, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave no survivors!', '', 25951, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tear this pitiful village apart!', '', 25950, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Undercity', 'Undercity', 25949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thunder Bluff', 'Thunder Bluff', 25948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind', 'Stormwind', 25947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silvermoon City', 'Silvermoon City', 25946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrimmar', 'Orgrimmar', 25945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ironforge', 'Ironforge', 25944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Exodar', 'The Exodar', 25943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darnassus', 'Darnassus', 25942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bind Here', 'Bind Here', 25941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking for an Arena Battlemaster? You can find them on the road between towns, or in the capitals.$B$BYou can bind here, at me. I can also teleport you to one of the capitals.', 'Looking for an Arena Battlemaster? You can find them on the road between towns, or in the capitals.$B$BYou can bind here, at me. I can also teleport you to one of the capitals.', 25940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will rise again, more powerful... much... more...', '', 25939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your victory is meaningless.', '', 25938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gladly die for the master...', '', 25937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anub\'et\'kan will... end you.', '', 25936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, daddy....', 25935, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep them away from the focus!', 25934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sails of the windmill grow taut against the sudden wind.', '', 25933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A chilly gust encircles the taunka mill, carrying with it soft, resentful mutterings in Kalimag.', '', 25932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wind immediately surrounding the mill picks up rapidly, causing the timbers to groan.', '', 25931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('North wind! You will do as I command!', '', 25930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bend the wind to the task of keeping the mill turning, spirit!', '', 25929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are bound to me, spirit! Your task is to keep the mill running - do not falter!', '', 25928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirit, you will submit to my will.', '', 25927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'NO!  My machine... my bombs!  THAT\'S IT!  Those Harpies are going DOWN!', 25926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who to test the bomb on?  The Harpies?  Ha ha... wait... what\'s that?', 25925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The control components are working perfectly this time!', 25924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll show you!  Give me that practice parachute!', 'I\'ll show you!  Give me that practice parachute!', 25923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are not welcome in our home.  Leave and go find some other land to pillage!', 25922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for this insult, $c!', '', 25921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will crush Arthas! The Scourge cannot stand up to the might of the Horde!', '', 25920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies, ambassador. My orders were quite clear.', 'My apologies, ambassador. My orders were quite clear.', 25919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It won\'t be long now.', 'It won\'t be long now.', 25918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master will be with you momentarily.', 'The master will be with you momentarily.', 25917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My orders are that you must wait here.', 'My orders are that you must wait here.', 25916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goramosh is busy with a ritual right now.', 'Goramosh is busy with a ritual right now.', 25915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll have to be patient.', 'You\'ll have to be patient.', 25914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.', 'No.', 25913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot.', 'I cannot.', 25912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us see what this journal reveals.', 25911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got a survivor inbound!', '', 25910, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming survivor!', '', 25909, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We just lost a plane!', '', 25908, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bomber went down!  The pilot\'s out safe though!', '', 25907, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magmoth Crusher\'s moving off!', '', 25906, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magmoth Crusher is on the move!', '', 25905, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you can translate those plates, we can find and capture Brann.', 25904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brann doesn\'t record the translations, but it says he committed them to memory before fleeing the battle.', 25903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He managed to explore the ruins before the battle began, discovering three runic plates inscribed with prophecies.', 25902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scout Vor\'takh\'s hunch was correct. Brann Bronzebeard visited Thor Modan recently and this journal records his findings.', 25901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome!  If you need a place to rest, I can solve that problem.', 'Welcome!  If you need a place to rest, I can solve that problem.', 25900, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Anub\'ar have destroyed the %s!', '', 25899, 0, 7115, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The feast has arrived! DIE!', '', 25898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anub\'arak may have uses for your carcass...', '', 25897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine meal you will make...', '', 25896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anub\'ar fear nothing, mortal...', '', 25895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hearty beatings will be dispensed in the name of the Horde!', 'Hearty beatings will be dispensed in the name of the Horde!', 25894, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show yourselves so that I may crack your insectoid skeletons with my bare hands!', 'Show yourselves so that I may crack your insectoid skeletons with my bare hands!', 25893, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this place or I will thrash you soundly!', 'Leave this place or I will thrash you soundly!', 25892, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come! Come face your doom!', 'Come! Come face your doom!', 25891, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you all! For the Horde!', 'I will crush you all! For the Horde!', 25890, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you that dare challenge the Horde? Then come...', 'Do you that dare challenge the Horde? Then come...', 25889, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, cowards! FACE THE HORDE!', 'Come, cowards! FACE THE HORDE!', 25888, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If he\'s in the area, we must find him. First, though, we\'ll need a way to decipher this journal.', '', 25887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think about how valuable a member of the dwarven royal family would be as a hostage.', '', 25886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you mean?', 25885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Brann Bronzebeard.\' The brother of Ironforge\'s king? You may have spoken too soon, Paluna.', '', 25884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This journal is written in dwarven. I can\'t read this scrawl, but I can make out one thing.', '', 25883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm...', '', 25882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me take a look at that.', '', 25881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The language is unfamiliar and for all we know, it\'s just some soldier\'s journal.', 25880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is an intriguing find, $n, but I don\'t know what to make of it.', 25879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry now, $n. I\'ll be waitin\' for ya, mon.', '', 25878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be waitin\' for ya, mon.', '', 25877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remove the Eye of the Prophets from the idol\'s face.', 'Remove the Eye of the Prophets from the idol\'s face.', 25876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where the Eye of the Prophets rested for millennia, only an empty niche remains.', '', 25875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You feel a strange presence as you stand before this ancient idol.', '', 25874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s money to be made!  Just like pops always said - no better time for raking in the cash than a time of war. ', '', 25873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I can make a new war machine, I know I can get a pretty penny for it over at the Wrath Gate.  $B$BSome of our previous iterations haven\'t been entirely... stable, but my flying machine should do the trick if I can just develop an effective bomb system for it.', 25872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh?  What?!  Go away.', '', 25871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 36, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now swim back with the knowledge I have granted you. Do what you can for them, $r.', 25870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell the mystic that his people are to stand and fight alongside the Horde and Alliance against the forces of Malygos and the Lich King.', 25869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Simply put, you must tell the tuskarr that they cannot run. If they do so, their spirits will be destroyed by the evil rising within Northrend.', 25868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $n. Your display of respect is duly noted. Now, I have information for you that you must convey to the Kalu\'ak.', 25867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, $n, you have failed to act. The prophecy is not yours to learn. Do not call upon me again until you have found your backbone!', 25866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though you are compelled, the choice, and the last step before you leap, are yours. You have twenty more seconds to decide.', 25865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will lay a mild compulsion upon you. Jump into the depths before me so that you put yourself into my element and thereby display your submission.', 25864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense uncertainty in you, and I do not trust it whether you are with them, or not. If you wish my augury for the Kalu\'ak, you will have to prove yourself first.', 25863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anveena\'s sacrifice has given us all a new hope for the future.', '', 25862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Betrayers! The day of reckoning comes and with it comes your end! See then if your Lich King saves you from the ancient one\'s judgment! Now you die!', '', 25861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have made a fatal mistake, mortal... There isss no essscape...', '', 25860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ruuun!', '', 25859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Scourge be everywhere!', '', 25858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drak\'Tharon be lost, mon!', '', 25857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outta my way, mon!', '', 25856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every troll for himself, mon!', '', 25855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Little $n, why do you call me forth? Are you working with the trolls of this land? Have you come to kill me and take my power as your own?', 25854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Scourge be everywhere, mon!', '', 25853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run for yer life, mon!', '', 25852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve taken the harbor!  The enemy has been driven away.  Sun\'s Reach is ours!', '', 25851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not worry, Leryssa.  I will come back to you when I am done.  Nothing in the world will stop me from coming home to the only family that I have left.', '', 25850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know that look in your eye... I\'m not going to be able to talk you out of this.  If you die on me again...', 25849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t leave me again!  You want to fight for your country, but they don\'t even want you!  They sent you here to die!', 25848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh!  My head won\'t stop spinning...', '', 25847, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You might be right, sister.  My obligations to my land and King have been fulfilled.  But there is something that I still owe to myself.', '', 25846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot return home with you just yet, Leryssa.  I am not quite done with the Scourge.', '', 25845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leryssa... you... you\'re all right!', '', 25844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought... I thought you were... dead.', 25843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thassarian!  You\'re alive!', 25842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what happened to me?', '', 25841, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this, Thassarian.  It\'s now or never.', 'Let\'s do this, Thassarian.  It\'s now or never.', 25840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is where the cultists\' orders are coming from.  Their leader is bound to show up soon.$B$BLet\'s not miss this opportunity.', '', 25839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All I ever wished for was to serve my king once again.  For humanity, against a common enemy.$B$BInstead, I find that our numbers have been infiltrated by cultist scum.... and all signs point to Naxxanar as the origin of this rot.', '', 25838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lurid could get used... to working with you.', '', 25837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This not... end well for you!', '', 25836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You Arthas lapdog?  You die!', '', 25835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about time!  Lurid was getting bored.', '', 25834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to kill!', '', 25833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the town hall, everyone!  We\'ve brought you weapons!  Arm yourselves and beat the Scourge back!', '', 25832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never succumb to your tortures! NEVER!', '', 25831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will break these bonds that hold me and send you all back to the hell from whence you came!', '', 25830, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pray to whatever gods you believe in that I am never freed!', '', 25829, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release me, fiends!', '', 25828, 0, 7118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The worst is behind us. Soon we will put an end to the Lich King\'s reign.', 25827, 1, 7030, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will retake Icemist. The Anub\'ar will be expelled from our city.', 25826, 1, 7030, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will make a fine warrior of the Horde.', 25825, 1, 7030, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am proud of you, child.', 25824, 1, 7030, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pssst... Over here, by the mailbox. Come quickly and make sure you aren\'t followed.', '', 25823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike now heroes, while he is weakened! Vanquish the Deceiver!', '', 25822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need some more of your fine grog, Mack.', 'I need some more of your fine grog, Mack.', 25821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'day mate! Sit an\' have yerself a sip, won\'t yeh?', '', 25820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back, $n. If you\'re out of your body for too long, you run the risk of not being able to return. We have much to discuss.', '', 25819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elder Mana\'loa, the statue there, sees you. This is a good sign!', '', 25818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... no! My people are all dead spirits or deranged!', '', 25817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $c!  I hope you aren\'t afraid of heights!$b$bI\'ve got a practice parachute for you.  These chutes are for quick landings.  If you want to gently soar to the ground, use a mount.  If you want action and an adrenaline rush, you fall.  At the last possible moment you use your chute.  That\'s how these were made.  Quick action!  Are you ready for some quick action?$b$bThe chute only lasts a few seconds.  So you\'ll need to time it just right.  I\'m not sure you can handle it, $c.  I\'d like to see you prove me wrong.', 'Welcome, $c!  I hope you aren\'t afraid of heights!$b$bI\'ve got a practice parachute for you.  These chutes are for quick landings.  If you want to gently soar to the ground, use a mount.  If you want action and an adrenaline rush, you fall.  At the last possible moment you use your chute.  That\'s how these were made.  Quick action!  Are you ready for some quick action?$b$bThe chute only lasts a few seconds.  So you\'ll need to time it just right.  I\'m not sure you can handle it, $c.  I\'d like to see you prove me wrong.', 25816, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s happened to the lake bed? Strange power is pouring out of it.', '', 25815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear me for the teleporter, I\'m ready to go!', 'Clear me for the teleporter, I\'m ready to go!', 25814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re coming up on the village now. Keep your eyes peeled.', '', 25813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wanted DEAD for treason and other treacherous acts against the Horde!$B$BAll bounties paid by Captain Gort.', '', 25812, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve successfully freed your spirit! You can serve as my eyes. Together we\'ll get to the bottom of this.', '', 25811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mr. Floppy, you\'re ok! Thank you so much for saving Mr. Floppy!', 25810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t go toward the light, Mr. Floppy!', 25809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, Mr. Floppy, this is hopeless!', 25808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, Mr. Floppy! No!', 25807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, no! Look, it\'s another wolf, and it\'s a biiiiiiig one!', 25806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get out of here before more wolves find us!', 25805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s going for Mr. Floppy!', 25804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Um... I think one of those wolves is back...', 25803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready, Mr. Floppy? Stay close to me and watch out for those wolves!', 25802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strange activity has been reported at Frostmourne Cave. Scout it out!', '', 25801, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aerial recon of New Hearthglen! Observe Scarlet Crusade activity!', '', 25800, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Supply drop at the Wrathgate! Ride with caution!', '', 25799, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take this message to Lord Hellscream at once!', '', 25798, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Air raid on Icemist! Let the Anub\'ar feel the power of our air strikes!', '', 25797, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 25796, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on the way, sir!', 'I\'m on the way, sir!', 25795, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away, sir!', 'Right away, sir!', 25794, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir, yes, sir!', 'Sir, yes, sir!', 25793, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orders, sir?', 'Orders, sir?', 25792, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the front lines! The Kor\'kron Vanguard needs air support!', '', 25791, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be shy, elfy. Don\'t you feel dis burnin\' love formin\' between us?', '', 25790, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis troll tink you got a crush on he! Come on over!', '', 25789, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got a man! Now take a hike!', 25788, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get lost, creep!', 25787, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never!', 25786, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ewwww!', 25785, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not if you were the last troll on Azeroth!', 25784, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grumbles.', '', 25783, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lookie what Zebu\'tan got for you! Roses for da rose!', '', 25782, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey pretty lady, Zebu\'tan got two rugs over here! Why don\'t you come on over and keep he warm, eh?', '', 25781, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Vengeance Landing.', 'I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Vengeance Landing.', 25780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo. Looking for a ride to Vengeance Landing? The Wild Wench flies back and forth, day and night.', '', 25779, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t make me jump off of this crate! I will beat your head in, orc.', '', 25778, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overlord Agmar demands more of us! We must not disappoint!', '', 25777, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will happily replace you all with goblins! Do not fail me!', '', 25776, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster! Faster! These armaments must be delivered to the Kor\'kron Vanguard TODAY!', '', 25775, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Durotar.', 'I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Durotar.', 25774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heading home, $c? The Mighty Wind will get you there, if home\'s in Kalimdor. She flies straight from here to Durotar.', '', 25773, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Vengeance Landing.', 'I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Vengeance Landing.', 25772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Northrend awaits, $r. The majestic Cloudkisser will take you straight across the sea to Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord.', 25771, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Warsong Hold.', 'I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Warsong Hold.', 25770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, how ya doin\'? Lookin\' for a ride ta Warsong Hold? The Wild Wench will get ya there lickety-split. She\'s the fastest zeppelin in Northrend!', 25769, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Warsong Hold.', 'I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Warsong Hold.', 25768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there. If you wanna get to Northrend, then The Mighty Wind is the way to go. She\'ll fly you straight to Warsong Hold in the Borean Tundra.', '', 25767, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades.', 'I\'d like to take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades.', 25766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo. Lookin\' to get back to the Old World? Fly to Tirisfal Glades in style on the Cloudkisser.', '', 25765, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the great sea turtle to Moa\'ki Harbor.', 'I\'d like to take the great sea turtle to Moa\'ki Harbor.', 25764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our blessed great sea turtle, Green Island, travels from here to Moa\'ki Harbor in Dragonblight.', '', 25763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the ship to Stormwind Harbor.', 'I\'d like to take the ship to Stormwind Harbor.', 25762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there! Miss the Eastern Kingdoms, huh? Well, the Kraken sails back to Stormwind if you\'re really itching to return. I know I\'d enjoy the warmer weather!', '', 25761, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the ship to Valiance Keep.', 'I\'d like to take the ship to Valiance Keep.', 25760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re looking to get to Valiance Keep, you can hop onto the cargo ship that runs between here and Borean Tundra. They don\'t mind taking on the occasional passenger or two.', 25759, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the ship to Valgarde.', 'I\'d like to take the ship to Valgarde.', 25758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking to travel to Northrend, the icebreaker Northspear sails from here to Valgarde in the Howling Fjord.', '', 25757, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the ship to Valiance Keep.', 'I\'d like to take the ship to Valiance Keep.', 25756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eager to get to Northrend, are you? The steam-powered Kraken sails from here to Valiance Keep in Borean Tundra.', 25755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the great sea turtle to Kamagua.', 'I\'d like to take the great sea turtle to Kamagua.', 25754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the great sea turtle to Unu\'pe.', 'I\'d like to take the great sea turtle to Unu\'pe.', 25753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moa\'ki Harbor is blessed with two great sea turtles: Walker of Waves and Green Island. They swim between Unu\'pe and Kamagua.', '', 25752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the ship to Westguard Keep.', 'I\'d like to take the ship to Westguard Keep.', 25751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A ship runs between here and Westguard Keep, sometimes ferrying troops and the occasional passenger but most often carrying much-needed supplies.', '', 25750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the ship to Menethil Harbor.', 'I\'d like to take the ship to Menethil Harbor.', 25749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The steam-powered Alliance icebreaker Northspear sails from here to Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands, across the sea in the Eastern Kingdoms.', '', 25748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take the great sea turtle to Moa\'ki Harbor.', 'I\'d like to take the great sea turtle to Moa\'ki Harbor.', 25747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The great sea turtle Walker of Waves travels from this dock to Moa\'ki Harbor in Dragonblight.', '', 25746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('LUNCH!', '', 25745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never understood why some pirates bury their treasure.  Me... I like to keep it within arm\'s reach.', '', 25744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you really want to bribe Olga?', 'Do you really want to bribe Olga?', 25743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my totemic beacon - may I have another?', 'I\'ve lost my totemic beacon - may I have another?', 25742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elemental spirits are restless...', '', 25741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you discovered something?', '', 25740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it you need?', '', 25739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ummm... the frog says you\'re a traitor, \"matey.\"', 'Ummm... the frog says you\'re a traitor, \"matey.\"', 25738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ye be lookin\' at, matey?', '', 25737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your surge needle appears to have worked perfectly.  Surely Goramosh now has time to speak further of the proposed accord?', '', 25736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes, I am given to understand that the ley line has already been diverted. I will wait no longer... summon Goramosh this instant!', '', 25735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ku into me carver, ye ugly croaker!  Ku and show me who dares cross me brethren!', '', 25734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s croaks eagerly while directing its gaze to the docked ship.', '', 25733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is entranced by the sun\'s reflection on Zeh\'gehn\'s knife.', '', 25732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you sell any of this stuff?', 'Do you sell any of this stuff?', 25731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel the power SURGING within me!', '', 25730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing will stand in the way of vengeance!', 'Nothing will stand in the way of vengeance!', 25729, 1, 7030, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have come to kill or be killed!', 'I have come to kill or be killed!', 25728, 1, 7030, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amidst the tragedy and chaos, this place stands defiantly against the Scourge! It is good to be Horde.', 'Amidst the tragedy and chaos, this place stands defiantly against the Scourge! It is good to be Horde.', 25727, 1, 7030, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am taunka of the Horde and I have come to drive the Scourge from this world!', 'I am taunka of the Horde and I have come to drive the Scourge from this world!', 25726, 1, 7030, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah.  I was merely jesting...', '', 25725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s blinks...', '', 25724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU WILL ALL PERISH IN FLAMES!', '', 25723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KNEEL, LITTLE MORTAL!  KNEEL BEFORE THE MIGHT OF THE HERALD OF RAGNAROS!', '', 25722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now!  Finally!  Our plans can take effect!', '', 25721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bellows with laughter!', '', 25720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has everything a growing scorchling needs!', '', 25719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So good!  So packed with energy!', '', 25718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s devours the incense.  It\'s ravenous!', '', 25717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
