('For the Horde!\n\nArm yourself from the crates that surround us and report to Agmar\'s Hammer, east of here. Your first trial as a member of the Horde is to survive the journey.\n\nLok\'tar ogar!', 'For the Horde!\n\nArm yourself from the crates that surround us and report to Agmar\'s Hammer, east of here. Your first trial as a member of the Horde is to survive the journey.\n\nLok\'tar ogar!', 25655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.$B$BI give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief\'s desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief\'s command.$B$BFrom this moment until the end of days I live and die - FOR THE HORDE!', 'Lok\'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.$B$BI give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief\'s desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief\'s command.$B$BFrom this moment until the end of days I live and die - FOR THE HORDE!', 25654, 1, 7241, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then repeat after me: \"Lok\'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.\n\nI give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief\'s desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief\'s command.\n\nFrom this moment until the end of days I live and die - For the Horde!\"\n', 'Then repeat after me: \"Lok\'tar ogar! Victory or death - it is these words that bind me to the Horde. For they are the most sacred and fundamental of truths to any warrior of the Horde.\n\nI give my flesh and blood freely to the Warchief. I am the instrument of my Warchief\'s desire. I am a weapon of my Warchief\'s command.\n\nFrom this moment until the end of days I live and die - For the Horde!\"', 25653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To avenge my people, to drive out the blight that has engulfed our land - I will take your oath. I will pledge all that I have and all that I am to the Horde.', 'To avenge my people, to drive out the blight that has engulfed our land - I will take your oath. I will pledge all that I have and all that I am to the Horde.', 25652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
