('Arthas... I spit on Arthas.', 'Arthas... I spit on Arthas.', 25579, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If given the chance, we should join the Horde. The Scourge would crumble beneath our collective strength.', 'If given the chance, we should join the Horde. The Scourge would crumble beneath our collective strength.', 25578, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mate was slain while I was made to watch. Only vengeance remains in my heart.', 'My mate was slain while I was made to watch. Only vengeance remains in my heart.', 25577, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe this is it... the end of days is finally upon us.', 'Maybe this is it... the end of days is finally upon us.', 25576, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the Horde can save us now.', 'Only the Horde can save us now.', 25575, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The one that they call Hellscream might be our only hope.', 'The one that they call Hellscream might be our only hope.', 25574, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge are a fearless machine set to bring about the end of all life on this world.', 'The Scourge are a fearless machine set to bring about the end of all life on this world.', 25573, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are a people without a home to call our own now.', 'We are a people without a home to call our own now.', 25572, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Lich King burn in hellfire for what he has called down upon this land.', 'May the Lich King burn in hellfire for what he has called down upon this land.', 25571, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family was slaughtered without mercy. Even the young.', 'My family was slaughtered without mercy. Even the young.', 25570, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nothing left for us here.', 'There is nothing left for us here.', 25569, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to buy from you.', 'I wish to buy from you.', 25568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to our camp, $c. You\'re free to rest here if you\'d like.', 'Welcome to our camp, $c. You\'re free to rest here if you\'d like.', 25567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoying the festival, $c?$b$bWhile the Flame Keepers tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I\'m also, of course, documenting this year\'s festivities. Things are going well thus far, don\'t you think?$b$bYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We\'re taking care of ours, but I\'m certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy\'s cities...', 'Enjoying the festival, $c?$b$bWhile the Flame Keepers tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I\'m also, of course, documenting this year\'s festivities. Things are going well thus far, don\'t you think?$b$bYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We\'re taking care of ours, but I\'m certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy\'s cities...', 25566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anveena is no mere mortal, $r. Those who recognize her true nature stop at nothing to possess her.$b$bShe once rescued me, and now I intend to return the favor. ', '', 25565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would Kil\'jaeden want with a mortal woman?', 'What would Kil\'jaeden want with a mortal woman?', 25564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Madrigosa accompanied me on this journey, but we have become separated in the Sunwell.$b$bMay fate keep her safe.\n', '', 25563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not alone here?', 'You\'re not alone here?', 25562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A friend and I have come to rescue a young human woman from the clutches of the Legionlord, Kil\'jaeden and his vile minions.$b$bWe\'ve discovered that Kael\'thas is trying to summon Kil\'jaeden from the depths of the Sunwell itself.$b$bFor the sake of this world - this cannot come to pass! I am committed to seeing that it does not.\n', '', 25561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings you to the Sunwell?', 'What brings you to the Sunwell?', 25560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... no oats here, either.', '', 25559, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... maybe over there.', '', 25558, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, where do they keep those oats?', '', 25557, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that, girl? You\'re hungry already? Don\'t worry, I\'ll get the oats.', '', 25556, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oblivion!', '', 25555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destruction!', '', 25554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chaos!', '', 25553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enemy is among you!', '', 25552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who can you trust!', '', 25551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anakh Kyree!', '', 25550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another step toward destruction!', '', 25549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drain the girl! Drain her power until there is nothing but a vacant shell!', '', 25548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fail me and suffer for eternity!', '', 25547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have waited long enough!', '', 25546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay on task, do not waste time!', '', 25545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All my plans have led to this!', '', 25544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another orb is ready! Make haste!', '', 25543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have empowered another orb! Use it quickly!', '', 25542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not alone! The blue dragonflight shall help you vanquish the Deceiver!', '', 25541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve cleared the way to Kil\'jaeden! Can you transport me close to the Sunwell?', 'We\'ve cleared the way to Kil\'jaeden! Can you transport me close to the Sunwell?', 25540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess have been defeated, can you teleport me to the Witch\'s Sanctum.', 'Now that Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess have been defeated, can you teleport me to the Witch\'s Sanctum.', 25539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With Kalecgos freed, can you provide a teleport up to Apex Point?', 'With Kalecgos freed, can you provide a teleport up to Apex Point?', 25538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of the barriers blocking you from reaching the Sunwell have been destroyed. Enter the Sunwell and stop Kil\'jaeden from entering this world!', '', 25537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agamath, the First Gate and Rohendor, the Second Gate are now destroyed. Only Archonisus, the Third Gate remains.', '', 25536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All three barriers are fully operational. Consult with Archmage Ne\'thul in Sun\'s Reach Harbor to aid the effort in unlocking the gates.', '', 25535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agamath, the First Gate has been breached. Two of Kil\'jaeden\'s most powerful lieutenants, Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess, are now vulnerable to attack.', '', 25534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the current state of the Sunwell\'s Gates?', 'What is the current state of the Sunwell\'s Gates?', 25533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Selana has instructed me to assist you with your efforts here on the Sunwell Plateau.', '', 25532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take advantage of their deactivated Sunblade Protectors. If one of their Sunblade Scouts spot you, I\'m sure the elf will try to reactivate a nearby Sunblade Protector. Kill him quickly to prevent this. With the blood elves eliminated, as long as you do not trigger the Protector\'s proximity sensors you should be able to move past them without a fight. That will save you both time and resources.', 25531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your insight is appreciated.', 'Your insight is appreciated.', 25530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know, but I\'m glad they did. The respite has allowed Anchorite Elbadon to save many of the men and women under my command. I\'ve sent a few of my stealthiest scouts forward, and they\'ve reported back something interesting. Nearly all of the Sunblade Protectors are powered down! Kil\'jaeden\'s forces appear to be conserving their energy, and seem content to merely contain us with one active Protector. If you and your companions want to force your way inside, allow me to suggest a plan of attack.', 25529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did they stop?', 'Why did they stop?', 25528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kil\'jaeden\'s defenders here on the Sunwell Plateau are much stronger than anything we faced outside on the Island. The Legion have even twisted our Arcane Guardian technology with fel energy to create something much more sinister. Just one of those Sunblade Protectors decimated my troops, and I ordered a swift retreat. I expected my squad to be pushed completely off the plateau, but the enemy surprised me by calling off the pursuit.', 25527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What went wrong?', 'What went wrong?', 25526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shattered Sun Offensive has made great progress in the outer areas of the Isle of Quel\'Danas. Kil\'jaeden\'s forces are being pushed back, and in the chaos I was able to lead a small scouting force here inside the Sunwell Plateau. My troops proceeded through Parhelion Plaza, spotted a group of Sunblade blood elves, and we then engaged the enemy. That fight quickly turned into a disaster.', 25525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me a situation report, Captain.', 'Give me a situation report, Captain.', 25524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad you are here, $c. The military situation in the Sunwell Plateau is rather grim.', 25523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... fade.', 25522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time is a luxury you no longer possess!', 25521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ee-nok Kryul!', 25520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadows engulf.', 25519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Der\'ek... manul.', 25518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your luck has run its course!', 25517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sacrolash!', 25516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Edir harach!', 25515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fires consume.', 25514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fire to the aid of shadow!', 25513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Misery...confusion...mistrust. These are the hallmarks.', 25512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Depravity...hatred...chaos. These are the pillars.', 25511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have toyed with you long enough!', '', 25510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haven\'t you heard? I always win!', '', 25509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Piteous mortal!', '', 25508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will watch you bleed!', '', 25507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your misery is my delight!', '', 25506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m never on the... losing... side!', '', 25505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be no reprieve! My work here is nearly finished!', '', 25504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of the world hangs in the balance!', '', 25503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kil\'jaeden must be destroyed!', '', 25502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My awakening is complete! You shall all perish!', '', 25501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were warned!', '', 25500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the name of Kil\'jaeden!', '', 25499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pain has only begun!', '', 25498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will purge you!', '', 25497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggh!! No longer will I be a slave to Malygos! Challenge me and you will be destroyed!', '', 25496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do not fear you, child of iron!', '', 25494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loken will never triumph!', '', 25493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your masters will never conquer the stone!', '', 25492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Hurry, $n! Flee! Live to finish what we\'ve begun here....', 25491, 0, 7567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tyranny of iron is at an end!', '', 25490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never!', 25489, 0, 7567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! You\'ve bested my consort... and now YOU shall take her place!', '', 25488, 0, 7567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush the children of stone, my iron brethren!', '', 25487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the thane! For Loken!', '', 25486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keristrasza! You\'ve bested my consort... and now YOU shall take her place!', '', 25485, 0, 7567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To battle, my children! Show the enemy no mercy!', '', 25484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Constructs, defend the capital at all costs!', '', 25483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders! Do not let them into the Sanctum!', '', 25482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come with me. It is not safe here.', 25481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saragosa! What has become of you?', '', 25480, 0, 7567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, $n. Let us see the fruits of our efforts.', 25479, 0, 7567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...what remains of her!', 25478, 0, 7567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, Lord of Magic, and recover your precious consort....', 25477, 0, 7567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your precious consort has failed you. You shall be the next to fall!', 25476, 0, 7567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'MALYGOS!!', 25475, 0, 7567, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay close to me, $n. I could not bear for any harm to come to you.', 25474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, $g dearest: dear; $n. The time is not quite right. Fire the flare again soon and we shall begin....', 'Patience, $g dearest: dear; $n. The time is not quite right. Fire the flare again soon and we shall begin....', 25473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell, Raelorasz.', 25472, 0, 8043, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s smiles', 25471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare them well, Raelorasz. Malygos\' power is like nothing they\'ve seen. We will likely only delay his plans with this diversion.', 25469, 0, 8043, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, my lady. Until we meet again...', '', 25468, 0, 8043, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malygos - in the open? I hadn\'t dared hope for an opportunity such as this. I\'ll assemble our brethren at once!', '', 25467, 0, 8043, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fate, it seems, has been more than kind. A blow has been dealt to Malygos. When he learns of it, I am confident he will leave the safety of the Nexus.', 25466, 0, 8043, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fate has been kind to return you to us.', '', 25465, 0, 8043, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keristrasza! I wish that circumstances allowed for a more fitting welcome. Fate has been kind to return you to us.', '', 25464, 0, 8043, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Raelorasz, it is good to see you again.', 25463, 0, 8043, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malygos the Spellweaver, the Lord of Magic, Master of the Blue Dragonflight. He is the blue dragon aspect, one of the most ancient creatures on Azeroth.$b$bHe is said to be recovering from a madness which has lasted for millennia, but his recent actions lead me to believe that he is still far from sane.$b$bHis solution to our dilemma is to search out and destroy every magic-wielding mortal on Azeroth.$b$bAs the guardians of life, this has forced the red dragonflight to take action.$b$bDragon now fights against dragon, and the fate of our frail world lies in the balance.', '', 25462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must succceed! Azeroth\'s fate lies in the balance....', '', 25461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re making progress, $r, but far too slowly.', '', 25460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Malygos?', 'Who is Malygos?', 25459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In a word, magic.$b$bIrresponsible mortals with their brief lifespans think nothing of the lasting effects of their actions.$b$bArcane energies have been tapped too liberally, disrupting the world\'s balance. If this is allowed to continue, Azeroth will soon be annihilated.$b$bOn this, both sides agree. But before a council could even be appointed, Malygos put his own plan into action.$b$bWe had no choice but to confront him.', '', 25458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh....$b$bWhere am I?', 25457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them!  Kill them all!', '', 25456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These tuskarr have seen nothing!  Show them what we\'re capable of!', '', 25455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight on, Kvaldir!  We\'ll burn Kaskala to the ground!', '', 25454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My strength is returning, slowly....$b$bI hope to be able to show you the glory of my true form soon.', 25453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When our duty here is behind us, I shall find a way to repay you for my rescue.', 25452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show no mercy!  Kill every last one of the tuskarr!', '', 25451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you hadn\'t rescued me from that prison I surely would have succumbed by now.$b$bI have not forgotten....', 25450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In times such as these, dear friends are invaluable.$b$bBe safe, $n. As safe as one can be in a place like this....', 25449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must hurry, $n. Malygos\' ruinous plans will soon be irreversible.', 25448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trust you\'re taking every precaution....$b$bThis is a dangerous place and I couldn\'t forgive myself if something were to happen to you.', 25447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! I\'ve been wondering how you were. What\'s kept you?', 25446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Festival Loremaster asked me to speak with you.', 'The Festival Loremaster asked me to speak with you.', 25445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
