('Can I get you anything?  My selection is a little limited, but that\'s to be expected... all things considered.', '', 25308, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready. Let us continue.', 'I am ready. Let us continue.', 25307, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me a moment to catch my breath.', 'Give me a moment to catch my breath.', 25306, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I don\'t think I can make it...', 'I... I don\'t think I can make it...', 25305, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cries.', '%s cries.', 25304, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was raised on this land... taught to hunt on this very tundra.', 'I was raised on this land... taught to hunt on this very tundra.', 25303, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t fight it...', 'Don\'t fight it...', 25302, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is the only salvation...', 'Death is the only salvation...', 25301, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us.', 'Join us.', 25300, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', 'Look out!', 25299, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is how it ends? A pity...', 'So this is how it ends? A pity...', 25298, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it really over? Is this the end of the taunka?', 'Is it really over? Is this the end of the taunka?', 25297, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will become of us?', 'What will become of us?', 25296, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s places a hand on the ground.', '%s places a hand on the ground.', 25295, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop!', 'Stop!', 25294, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but my services are only of use to warriors.', 'Sorry, but my services are only of use to warriors.', 25293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but my services are only of use to warlocks.', 'Sorry, but my services are only of use to warlocks.', 25292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but my services are only of use to shamans.', 'Sorry, but my services are only of use to shamans.', 25291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but my services are only of use to rogues.', 'Sorry, but my services are only of use to rogues.', 25290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but my services are only of use to priests.', 'Sorry, but my services are only of use to priests.', 25289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but my services are only of use to paladins.', 'Sorry, but my services are only of use to paladins.', 25288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but my services are only of use to mages.', 'Sorry, but my services are only of use to mages.', 25287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but my services are only of use to hunters.', 'Sorry, but my services are only of use to hunters.', 25286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Confirm Unlearn Talents', 'Confirm Unlearn Talents', 25285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can erase all your talents so that you may choose new ones.$b$bThis becomes more expensive each time you do it.', 'I can erase all your talents so that you may choose new ones.$b$bThis becomes more expensive each time you do it.', 25284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('is steamed!', '', 25283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unlearn Talents', 'Unlearn Talents', 25282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Training', 'Training', 25281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I help you, $c?', 'How may I help you, $c?', 25280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but my services are only of use to druids.', 'Sorry, but my services are only of use to druids.', 25278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but my services are only of use to hunters.', 'Sorry, but my services are only of use to hunters.', 25277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re miners, farmers and craftsmen - not soldiers.  But we\'ll defend our land with our bare fists if we must.', '', 25276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cheers at you.', '%s cheers at you.', 25275, 1, 6978, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s $n! Bow your heads!', 'It\'s $n! Bow your heads!', 25274, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There walks a hero!', 'There walks a hero!', 25273, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With your strength and determination, we cannot fail!', 'With your strength and determination, we cannot fail!', 25272, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm-Ka, hero!', 'Throm-Ka, hero!', 25271, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', 'Lok\'tar ogar!', 25270, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to serve along your side, $g sir:ma\'am;.', 'It is an honor to serve along your side, $g sir:ma\'am;.', 25269, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, champion.', 'Welcome back, champion.', 25268, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$g Sir:Ma\'am;, my life for the Horde!', '$g Sir:Ma\'am;, my life for the Horde!', 25267, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fastest wolf is ready to take you to Taunka\'le Village, champion. Let me know when you are ready.', '', 25266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to leave, Durkot.', 'I am ready to leave, Durkot.', 25265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arthas was once a human prince.  The army he led into Northrend suffered a horrible fate.$B$BMy brother, Thassarian, was a part of that army.', 25264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am forever in your debt. Once we have triumphed over Kil\'jaeden, this entire world will be in your debt as well.', '', 25263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stable', 'Stable', 25262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Madrigosa deserved a far better fate. You did what had to be done, but this battle is far from over!', '', 25261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pet Loyalty', 'Pet Loyalty', 25260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can stable your pets and maximize their loyalty.', 'I can stable your pets and maximize their loyalty.', 25259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('5,000 Gold', '5,000 Gold', 25258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need gold? Here\'s 5,000 coins worth.', 'Need gold? Here\'s 5,000 coins worth.', 25257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 25256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draenei', 'Draenei', 25255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood Elf', 'Blood Elf', 25254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tauren', 'Tauren', 25253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Undead', 'Undead', 25252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night Elf', 'Night Elf', 25251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarf & Gnome', 'Dwarf & Gnome', 25250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orc & Troll', 'Orc & Troll', 25249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Human', 'Human', 25248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can teleport you to another race\'s zone.', 'I can teleport you to another race\'s zone.', 25247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t know who you\'re messing with, $c!  Death beckons!', '', 25246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally!  This charade is over... Arthas give me strength!', '', 25245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose this is it, then?  I won\'t go down quietly!', '', 25244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well...', '', 25243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How long have you worked for the Cult of the Damned?', 'How long have you worked for the Cult of the Damned?', 25242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My shift\'s almost over.  Can\'t wait to catch some shut-eye, know what I mean?', '', 25241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just another day workin\' the kitchen.  Sure gets dull after a while.', '', 25240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I have reason to believe you\'re involved in cultist activity.', 'I have reason to believe you\'re involved in cultist activity.', 25239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s howls in compliance.', '', 25238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know about the Cult of the Damned?', 'What do you know about the Cult of the Damned?', 25237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way, $g sir:ma\'am;.', '', 25236, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of us get to avoid military duty.  A good fisherman\'s always handy... even generals need to eat.', '', 25235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Archonisus Gate is no more! The way to the Sunwell is clear!', 25234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Rohendor Gate has been shattered! Move forward, champions!', 25233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Agamath Gate has been breached!', 25232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark forces are at work in this land, $n.  Keep your eyes open and your courage strong.', '', 25231, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arthas thinks a few of his undead bugs are going to send us running back to the Eastern Kingdoms... he\'s got another thing coming.', '', 25230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malygos, my lord... I did my... best.', 25229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak! I grow weary of asking! ', 25228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will tell me where they are!', 25227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where is Anveena, demon? What has become of Kalec?', 25226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was fun, but I still await a true challenge!', '', 25225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you!', '', 25224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bagh! Your magic is weak!', '', 25223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny lizard! Death is the only answer you\'ll find here!', '', 25222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold, friends! There is information to be had before this devil meets his fate!', 25221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come try your luck!', '', 25220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge are everywhere!  This is... a nightmare!', '', 25219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lay your hand on the stone.', 'Lay your hand on the stone.', 25218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stone radiates a bitter cold, chilling the air around it and the platform on which it sits. Deep within its facets, a blue light pulses, waiting.', 'The stone radiates a bitter cold, chilling the air around it and the platform on which it sits. Deep within its facets, a blue light pulses, waiting.', 25217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. I am Durkot Wolfbrother, protector of the pack.', '', 25216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a noise from behind you!', '', 25215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Summon Ahune, the Frost Lord.', 'Summon Ahune, the Frost Lord.', 25214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This shard of ice echoes the deep, cracking rumble of invading glaciers.  Its cold turns your thoughts to a lifeless, endless winter.', '', 25213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll be damned if these blasted Scourge are going to drive us away!  Us settlers gave everything up to start new lives in Northrend.$B$BYou\'d better believe we\'re going to fight tooth and nail.', 25212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is dire news indeed!', 25211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taking Readings', '', 25210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s quite insane! Someone must put a stop to his madness before it\'s too late for everyone!', 'He\'s quite insane! Someone must put a stop to his madness before it\'s too late for everyone!', 25209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He claims that all creations of the Titans fall prey to what he calls, \'The Curse of Flesh\'. He says that the original gnomes were once mechagnomes.', 'He claims that all creations of the Titans fall prey to what he calls, \'The Curse of Flesh\'. He says that the original gnomes were once mechagnomes.', 25208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In return, he \'de-cursed\' us, saying that we were being \'fixed\' by returning us to the state of being mechanical constructs.', 'In return, he \'de-cursed\' us, saying that we were being \'fixed\' by returning us to the state of being mechanical constructs.', 25207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unit is now operational and attacking targets.', '', 25206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving us. We accidentally uncovered the pieces of Gearmaster Mechazod and reassembled him.', 'Thank you for saving us. We accidentally uncovered the pieces of Gearmaster Mechazod and reassembled him.', 25205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, $n, let us release their souls and hear what they have to say.', 25204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy presence detected.', '', 25203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemies spotted! Attack while I try to activate a Protector!', 'Enemies spotted! Attack while I try to activate a Protector!', 25202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Local proximity threat detected. Exiting energy conservation mode.', '', 25201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unit entering energy conservation mode.', '', 25200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggghh! The powers of the Sunwell... turn... against me! What have you done? What have you done???', '', 25199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The nightmare is over! The spell is broken! Goodbye Kalec, my love!', 25198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kalec... Kalec?', 25197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I\'m... lost. I cannot find my way back.', 25196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I serve only the master now.', 25195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goodbye Anveena, my love. Few will remember your name, yet this day you changed the course of destiny. What was once corrupt, is now pure. Heroes, do not let her sacrifice be in vain.', '', 25194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes Anveena! Let fate embrace you now!', '', 25193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anveena I love you! Focus on my voice! Come back for me now! Only you can cleanse the Sunwell!', '', 25192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must let go! You must become what you were always meant to be! The time is now Anveena!', '', 25191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anveena, you must awaken! This world needs you!', '', 25190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This orb will create a portal that will return you to the Temple City of En\'kilah.', '', 25189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This orb will create a portal to Upper Naxxanar.', '', 25188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It takes brass ball-bearings to craft siege engines for the Horde. Now get with the program or hit the bricks!', '', 25187, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are the new tools. These are the Gadgetzan Power tools. And to you, they\'re gold. And you don\'t get \'em. Because to give them to you is just like throwin\' them into a scrap heap. They\'re for crafters. Crafters only!', '', 25186, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the orb.', 'Use the orb.', 25185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using this orb will create a portal leading to Naxxanar.', '', 25184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see this kodo? DO YOU SEE THIS KODO? This kodo cost more than that toolbox you call a house. You see, pal, that\'s who I am. And you\'re nothin\'.', '', 25183, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re such a hero, you\'ve got so much gold - why you coming down here and wasting your time on a bunch of losers?', 'You\'re such a hero, you\'ve got so much gold - why you coming down here and wasting your time on a bunch of losers?', 25182, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast with string ID in spell...', '', 25181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast with string ID on Action...', '', 25180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-B-C. A-always, B-be, C-crafting. Always be crafting. Always be crafting!', '', 25179, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gnome lover, that\'s my name! You know why, buddy? \'Cause you rode into this shop on a broken down unicycle and I flew in here on a 5,000 gold piece, top of the line, armored wyvern. THAT\'S my name!', '', 25178, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, what\'s your name?', 'Say, what\'s your name?', 25177, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tools are weak? You\'re weak! I\'ve been in this business fifty years.\n', '', 25176, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tools are weak!', '', 25175, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re laughin\' now? You got tools! Thrall paid good money for those tools. Get out your blueprints and read them! If you can\'t build siege engines with the tools you\'re given, you can\'t build nothin\', you are nothin\', hit the bricks pal and take the first zeppelin out of here \'cause you are going out!', '', 25174, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Third prize is YOU\'RE FIRED! You get the picture?', '', 25173, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Second prize is some fused wiring.', '', 25172, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you all know, first prize is a Turbo-Charged Flying Machine. Anyone want to see second prize?', '', 25171, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... Have I got your attention now? Good, \'cause we\'re adding a little something to this month\'s crafting contest.', '', 25170, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You certainly don\'t pal, \'cause the good news is YOU\'RE FIRED! The bad news is you\'ve got - you\'ve all got - just one week to regain your jobs, starting tonight. Starting with tonight\'s build.', '', 25169, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
