('He calls himself the Fur Baron - I call him a sucker! I get a brand new set of winter socks made of rat fur for merely killing and skinning fifty caribou fawns?', 'He calls himself the Fur Baron - I call him a sucker! I get a brand new set of winter socks made of rat fur for merely killing and skinning fifty caribou fawns?', 25118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
