('No way! Rhino head helmet for the low, low price of thirty rhino heads? I\'ll take two at those prices!', 'No way! Rhino head helmet for the low, low price of thirty rhino heads? I\'ll take two at those prices!', 25116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So let me get this straight: I give Lane fifteen mammoth trunks and he gives me a set of daggers that I can use as steak knives? How does he do it? How does he make such amazing deals??', 'So let me get this straight: I give Lane fifteen mammoth trunks and he gives me a set of daggers that I can use as steak knives? How does he do it? How does he make such amazing deals??', 25115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
