('A friend and I have come to rescue a young human woman from the clutches of the Legionlord, Kil\'jaeden and his vile minions.$b$bWe\'ve discovered that Kael\'thas is trying to summon Kil\'jaeden from the depths of the Sunwell itself.$b$bFor the sake of this world - this cannot come to pass! I am committed to seeing that it does not.', '', 25095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
