('I\'d like to return to the mainland.', 'I\'d like to return to the mainland.', 25032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the last one that I need for the set of Nesingwary steak knives!', 'This is the last one that I need for the set of Nesingwary steak knives!', 25031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid beasts!', 'Stupid beasts!', 25030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a miracle! The beast skinned itself!', 'It\'s a miracle! The beast skinned itself!', 25029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is your cause righteous and your heart true? If so, you are welcome here - among the druids for the ethical and humane treatment of animals. So long as you do not veer down the dark path of depravity and harm the animals that have allowed us to coexist within their world, D.E.H.T.A. will consider you an ally.\n', '', 25028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. It saddens me that it has come to this. I look upon all of you as if you were my children. I will slay you if I must!', '', 25027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, I can see it in your eyes, hear it in your pulse rate. You would destroy me despite my offer of immortality!', '', 25026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that I have been reassembled, we can return to a time of perfection... the time of the Titans!', '', 25025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were looking for me, child? Why do you come to kill me, $n? I only wish to help.', '', 25024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give it up, little beast!', 'Give it up, little beast!', 25023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now THIS is a sport!', 'Now THIS is a sport!', 25022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horns, antlers, hooves, tails, fur, hide, skin, WHATEVER!', 'Horns, antlers, hooves, tails, fur, hide, skin, WHATEVER!', 25021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s gonna be veal tonight!', 'It\'s gonna be veal tonight!', 25020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KILL KILL KILL!!!!!!!', 'KILL KILL KILL!!!!!!!', 25019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just fifty more hooves and I\'ll have the new gun!', 'Just fifty more hooves and I\'ll have the new gun!', 25018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure ol\' Hemet can do something with your bones!', 'I\'m sure ol\' Hemet can do something with your bones!', 25017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what Nesingwary will give me for your hide!', 'I wonder what Nesingwary will give me for your hide!', 25016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your meddling is at an end. Mechazod will relieve your curse once I am done with you.', '', 25015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the herald of Mechazod. You will be decursed!', '', 25014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ED-210 online!', '', 25013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twonky!', '', 25012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve treated peasants, nobles, merchants\' sons and beggars.  Allow me to share one piece of wisdom with you - we\'re all the same when staring death in the face.', '', 25011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sworn by tuskarr law to avenge my kin... these murderers burned Pal\'ea to the ground.', '', 25010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting for duty, $g sir : ma\'am;!', '', 25009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maintenance initiated.', '', 25008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come be perfect with us, $g brother : sister;.', '', 25007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be decursed!', '', 25006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, the Borean Tundra. Tomorrow, the world!', '', 25005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gearmaster has plans for your weak flesh.', '', 25004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can decurse you, we have the technology.', '', 25003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flesh is weak. We will make you better, stronger... faster.', '', 25002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are cursed and we are the cure.', '', 25001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are Mechagnome... resistance is futile.', '', 25000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful around these parts, $r. The natives are ruthless.', 24999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feebleminded tinkerer, do you really think your pathetic creation can stop me?', '', 24998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Status: Life-giving substance collection completed.', '', 24997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We mustn\'t tarry here... stay close - I\'ll take us somewhere safe.', 24996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thank you, friend of Dalaran.', 24995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And remember, $n, the bloodspore powder can be used to weaken all magnataur in Gammoth.', '', 24994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time to waste!', '', 24993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How positively awful! You were totally incapacitated? Weak? Hot flashes?', 24992, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The commander needs to be told: Mechazod\'s planning an attack! We\'re doomed!', 'The commander needs to be told: Mechazod\'s planning an attack! We\'re doomed!', 24991, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel funny. I don\'t think you reintegrated me right....', 'I feel funny. I don\'t think you reintegrated me right....', 24990, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t go out there. The pools are crawling with robots and mechagnomes!', 'Don\'t go out there. The pools are crawling with robots and mechagnomes!', 24989, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I\'m flesh and blood again. That\'s all that matters!', 'I\'m flesh and blood again. That\'s all that matters!', 24988, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I said, NO transmatter! At least I\'m not a mechagnome anymore.', 'I said, NO transmatter! At least I\'m not a mechagnome anymore.', 24987, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have vital information for Fizzcrank. Out of the way!', 'I have vital information for Fizzcrank. Out of the way!', 24986, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the worst contraption anyone ever devised!', 'This is the worst contraption anyone ever devised!', 24985, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I survived and I\'m flesh again!', 'I survived and I\'m flesh again!', 24984, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sathrovarr drives Kalecgos into a crazed rage!', '', 24983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gathering', 'Gathering', 24982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been detected. You will be assimilated or eliminated.', '', 24981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention all units, $r inside the perimeter.', '', 24980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate counter-measures. Repel intruder.', '', 24979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning: $r incursion detected!', '', 24978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to not lose this one, $n. It is important that we at least try and keep up appearances with the Alliance.', '', 24977, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am embarassed to say it, Nork, but my deserter has gone missing.', 'I am embarassed to say it, Nork, but my deserter has gone missing.', 24976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The actions of these deserters shames us all. A shame so powerful that it must be witnessed to be understood. It is why Ug\'thor is here... The boy must learn.', '', 24975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He called it the Curse of the Flesh. Mechazod is deranged!', 'He called it the Curse of the Flesh. Mechazod is deranged!', 24974, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was horrible! They\'ve all been changed!', 'It was horrible! They\'ve all been changed!', 24973, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mechazod is insane! You have to stop him before it\'s too late!', 'Mechazod is insane! You have to stop him before it\'s too late!', 24972, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I? Who are you? What\'s that strange feeling?', 'Where am I? Who are you? What\'s that strange feeling?', 24971, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... but... I was perfect!', 'But... but... I was perfect!', 24970, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no, not the transmatter... it\'ll probably malfunction!', 'Oh no, not the transmatter... it\'ll probably malfunction!', 24969, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you so much! I thought I\'d never wake up from that nightmare!', 'Thank you so much! I thought I\'d never wake up from that nightmare!', 24968, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m flesh and blood again! Thank you, $c!', 'I\'m flesh and blood again! Thank you, $c!', 24967, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r. I will take this miserable cur from you now.', '', 24966, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone is dead... Everyone and everything...', 24965, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So cold...', 24964, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the power of the horn, I bind you to its wielder\'s will!', 24963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wouldn\'t use it just yet, but you feel free to test it out yourself.', '', 24962, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep, I think I finally have it. Just a twist of this dial, and... oops.', '', 24961, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re being soooooo helpful... NOT!', '', 24960, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, it\'s not my fault that Tinky took off. This thing\'s her baby... I\'ve just watched her keep it going on spit and glue.', '', 24959, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I look like a transmatter-tech to you?! At least we have incoming... sort of.', '', 24958, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jinkies, Jinky, I\'m tryin\' the best I know!', '', 24957, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish elemental slave! You and your master will pay for your meddling!', '', 24956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you don\'t get that thing fully operational, we\'re toast for sure!', 24955, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This transmatter\'s the key to our survival. If we don\'t get it fully operational, we\'re goners for sure!', 24954, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you even know what you\'re doing?!', 24953, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mordle get the outgoing on the transmatter fixed now!', 24952, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir, I need another flying machine...', 'Sir, I need another flying machine...', 24951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now it\'s time to brag about how utterly awesome I am.', 'I wonder if that cute pilot with the pink hair is still around...', 24949, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was a good day to fly!', 'It was a good day to fly!', 24948, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to head in for a nice cup of Jinky\'s Magmatically Hot Chocolate!', 'Time to head in and see if I can\'t get a bit of Mordle\'s Mysterious Mead...', 24946, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, nothing like a job well done!', 'Ahh, nothing like a job well done!', 24945, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll blast those gnomish wannabes back to the scrap heap!', 'I\'ll blast those gnomish wannabes back to the scrap heap!', 24944, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? You\'re sending me back there?!', 'What? You\'re sending me back there?!', 24942, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harumph! Alright, off I go!', 'Harumph! Alright, off I go!', 24941, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t understand a word that you\'re saying. Just follow me.', 'I can\'t understand a word that you\'re saying. Just follow me.', 24940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you going to take me back to Valiance Keep?', 'Are you going to take me back to Valiance Keep?', 24939, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 20, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll make no mention of me. Either of you!', '', 24938, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell...', '', 24937, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '', 24935, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should return to Warsong Hold now, friend. Hellscream will surely want to hear of what just happened here... of Saurfang...', '', 24934, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I can\'t believe it... Saurfang... I... I am honored... honored to have fought along side you, sir.', '', 24933, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahune will soon resurface.', 'Ahune will soon resurface.', 24932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahune Retreats.  His defenses diminish.', 'Ahune Retreats.  His defenses diminish.', 24931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earthen Ring\'s Assault Begins.', 'The Earthen Ring\'s Assault Begins.', 24930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RISE!', '', 24929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You? A lone orc? Against me and...', '', 24928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fool who is about to end you, necrolord. There will be nothing left of you for the Lich King to reanimate!', '', 24927, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then you are a fool.', '', 24926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Threat imminent! Beginning evasive action!', '', 24925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight you with every fiber of our being - until we are nothing more than dust and debris. We will fight until the end.', '', 24924, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning! Danger! Danger!', '', 24923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder detected! Must notify defender bots!', '', 24922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this now?', '', 24921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world that you seek to destroy is our home.', '', 24920, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were never alone, $n.', '', 24919, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll rip your shriveled heart out with my bare hands before any harm comes to $n, necromancer.', '', 24918, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take $g him:her; away and prepare $g him:her; for reanimation.', '', 24917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world is coming to an end. Let. It. Burn.', '', 24916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King cannot be stopped. Accept it.', '', 24915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why won\'t you just let go? Why do you fight the inevitable?', '', 24914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never understood your type. The hero...', '', 24913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 24912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this it? Is this all the mighty Horde could muster?', '', 24911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go...', '', 24910, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it, $n. The start of the end of the world. And you\'re here to see it off...', '', 24909, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And that\'s where we find ourselves now, $n.$B$BWe can\'t possibly deal with all of this by ourselves, and quite frankly, I feel a little out of my depth. Jinky knows what needs to be done. You should go see her now.$B$BI just hope you\'ll be able to get us out of this mess with our bodies intact.', '', 24908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It didn\'t look like much of a \"cure\" to me, and I wasn\'t about to stand around listening to some crazy robot while he was butchering my people!$B$BWe did what any sane gnome would do... we ran! Well, actually, most of us parachuted off the side of the platform, but you get the picture.$B$BNot many of us managed to make it back here, and we\'re still spread thin from having to deal with everything else too, like the magnataur to the north and the Scourge to the east. To make things worse, the Horde just setup shop to the northwest!', '', 24907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The station\'s mechanics had put him back together, bringing him back to \"life\".$B$BAnd now, by way of thanks, he was going to return the favor by curing all of us of what he called the \"Curse of the Flesh\".$B$BAccording to Mechazod, it\'s a condition that eventually befalls all of the creations of the Titans! In other words, we all supposedly start out as robots of some kind, and, over thousands of years, slowly turn into fleshy beings!$B$BPreposterous, I know.', '', 24906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He called himself Gearmaster Mechazod. When we arrived he was busy transforming the survivors into mechanical beings!$B$BHe greeted us warmly and explained that he was one of the first gnomes ever to be created by something he called \"The Grand Architect\", a Titan keeper from within the halls of fabled Ulduar.$B$BApparently, he was the blockage that my team had accidentally sucked up from where he\'d malfunctioned thousands of years ago. It was just our luck that we\'d built the pumping station right above him.', '', 24905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I was saying, what we saw out there defied explanation.$B$BMy people were nowhere to be found, but in their place was a veritable army of robots and androids going about their business!$B$BThe droids all looked like gnomes and they said that they\'d been expecting us. In fact, in their own strange way, they acted like they knew us. We were surrounded and quickly taken to the top of the pumping station.$B$BThat\'s where we saw their leader and what he was doing to the surviving gnomes!', '', 24904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After a couple of days of silence, I sent a scouting party out to the platform. They never returned.$B$BI sent another group the next day with the same results, and lost a couple of flying machines out on aerial recon.$B$BAt that point I sent someone south to find help, and we hunkered down to prepare for the worst. We turned all of our attention to making armor, weapons and robots so that we could head out there in full force.$B$BWhen we did a few days ago, we couldn\'t believe our eyes!', '', 24903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind you, this part I learned later because I wasn\'t out there at the time.$B$BWhen they ratcheted up the suction on the pump, up came pieces of a robot that looked like a gnome! Of course the fools worked night and day to put it back together without telling us.$B$BThis is when we lost communication with the pumping station.', '', 24902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, back up. What was that last thing you said?', 'Wait, back up. What was that last thing you said?', 24901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyway, we needed to pump up lots of sand and oil for the machinery. The nearby pools proved to be perfect for that.$B$BSome of the sand even proved to have magical properties... can you say possibilities!? But that\'s a different tale.$B$BSo, we drained most of the water out and built the pumping station smack dab in the middle. Everything was going swimmingly until one day the main suction pipe got clogged.', '', 24900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on.', 'Go on.', 24899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine then, have a seat. This might take a while.$B$BWhen we first came to this frozen hell, General Arlos, down in Valiance Keep, gave my group of flying daredevils and me a special task: to establish a forward airbase for Alliance operations.$B$BThis airstrip is the result. Let me tell you, it wasn\'t easy, what with all the nasty beasts and the ground rock-hard from being frozen! But we managed, and we did it quickly too!', '', 24898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
