('A dishonorable scheme.', '', 24801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ancestors knew a way to confound an enemy\'s senses. We could use this knowledge to discover the Scourge\'s weakness or strike at their commanders. Without their leaders, the Scourge would fall before our warriors.', 24800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
