('Mootoo thanks you, $n.', '', 24753, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alrighty then, $n, here we go: one illusory-enhanced, Warsong orc disguise, complete with Smell-A-Vision!', 24752, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daughter! You have returned!', '', 24751, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s hugs Elder Mootoo.', 24750, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'FATHER! Father, I\'m saved!', 24749, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see a break in the mist up ahead. We\'re getting closer!', 24748, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can feel my father\'s aura. He\'s definitely this way... come on, $n.', 24747, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for doing this, $r. I... I think I know how to get back to my father. Please don\'t let the bad things hurt me.', 24746, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, all right... but you didn\'t get these from me!', '', 24745, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lads know the drill.  No alcohol to servicemen on duty.  You want the general to kill me himself?', '', 24744, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have slain the sea-witches and our god shall slay their queen!', 'We have slain the sea-witches and our god shall slay their queen!', 24743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to Azshara and her lies!', 'Death to Azshara and her lies!', 24742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Smash the pitiful naga statue.', 'Yes! Smash the pitiful naga statue.', 24741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I\'ve told you all that I know. Your continued abuse is senseless!', '', 24740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright! I am beaten. Your precious archmage is held in a prison, elevated and sealed. Even if you manage to reach her, Salrand herself holds the key. Your mission is folly!', '', 24739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! I beg you, please stop. Please....', '', 24738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aahhhh! Release me! I am of no use to you. I swear it!', '', 24737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aargh! Do your worst, $c! I\'ll tell you NOTHING!', '', 24736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic fool! A servant of Malygos would sooner die than aid an enemy....', '', 24735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Helmsman comes for you!', '', 24734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take their clothing.', 'Take their clothing.', 24733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Freezing mist engulfs the jetty.', '', 24732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back!  This is real fire I\'m handling here, and it can really burn you!', '', 24731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to purchase torches.', 'I wish to purchase torches.', 24730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence unbalances the land. You must be removed!', '', 24729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not welcome here. Die!', '', 24728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frozen and destroyed. This is all your fleshy corpse is good for.', '', 24727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think to take my primal essence? Come, let us see if you are hard as stone and ice!', '', 24726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bor\'s Anvil is engulfed in tuskarr fire!', '', 24725, 0, 6843, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bor\'s Hammer is engulfed in tuskarr fire!', '', 24724, 0, 6843, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kur Drakkar is engulfed in tuskarr fire!', '', 24723, 0, 6843, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Serpent\'s Maw is engulfed in tuskarr fire!', '', 24722, 0, 6843, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... Are you...$B$B<Mootoo shivers.>$B$BAre you here to save me?', 24721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Since landing here I have seen horrors that had previously only haunted my darkest nightmares, but nothing could have prepared me for what lies beyond the mist.$B$B<Mootoo nods.>$B$BThrough that fog, not more than a few yards from us, stand the bloodthirsty creatures known as Kvaldir. None have returned from the fog and few that were originally at the landing when the mist rolled in have escaped. The area has since been condemned by Hellscream. Enter at your own risk...', '', 24720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Become ashes in the mist!', '', 24719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The subjugation of these people has only just begun... so much time for fun and games.', '', 24718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn, land dweller! BURN!', '', 24717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you see here on this coast is not a result of the Scourge. In fact, we believe that the Scourge also fear the mist - which might be why they do not come here.$B$BYou see, the mist is alive, friend. Inside those airy tendrils lies death...$B$BShould you step within its grasp, you will vanish. The mist will take you!$B$BWe have never seen anyone return alive from the mist.', '', 24716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we go, bunky. One Crafty\'s Ultra-Advanced Proto-Typical Shortening Blaster at your service!', 24715, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How am I supposed to get anything done with Fizzcrank breathing down my neck and me without all of my stuff?!', 24714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Both Garrosh\'s Landing and Pal\'ea were wiped out by the mist. We\'re the only ones crazy enough to stay here, buddy!', '', 24713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for a five-minute break. Haha, just kidding! What do you think this is, the Alliance?!', '', 24712, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you grunts no pride? You will have this outpost ready for the reinforcements from Warsong Hold or your worthless corpses will fill the graveyard!', '', 24711, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear that if you do not work faster I\'m going to feed you to my worg!', '', 24710, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the most pathetic bunch of peons I\'ve ever seen! Where\'s my booterang?', '', 24709, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You peons are falling behind. Half rations until you pick up the pace!', '', 24708, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work faster! We must push into Sholazar Basin before the Alliance!', '', 24707, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This outpost is not ready! What would happen if Malygos and the blue dragonflight decided to strike?', '', 24706, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You peons work harder or I will come over there and beat you!', '', 24705, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wanna go home... Take off this uniform and leave the Horde!', '', 24704, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you heard anything from Warsong? We gonna be gettin\' some supplies soon?', '', 24703, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t fix somethin\' as complicated as a tank without the proper equipment, buddy!', '', 24702, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I supposed to do without tools, Gorge!', '', 24701, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I look forward to further training when you are ready.', 24700, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farseer, you live!', '', 24699, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s smiles and sits down for a well-deserved rest.', '', 24698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farseer, it is good to see that you still live.', '', 24697, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel... different.', '', 24696, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the lifegiver!', '', 24695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s can now be captured.', '', 24694, 0, 6835, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am dishonored. I should have died with the farseer at Magmoth.', '', 24693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, I have something to ask of you.', '', 24692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect lifegiver!', '', 24691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No touch spores!', '', 24690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No hurt the lifegiver!', '', 24689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, I must rest. Thank you for all that you have done.', '', 24688, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been returned to the living.', '', 24687, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farseer! I\'m so glad to see you again!', 24686, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Garrosh\'s Landing, Yanni.', 'Send me to Garrosh\'s Landing, Yanni.', 24685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve lost a good many of our wind riders on scouting missions to the west. The Scourge is ruthless in their assault against any would-be spies.$B$BFortunately, I\'ve come up with a solution that only risks the life of the rider. It\'s seen a 30% survival rate to those being ferried across the Plains of Nasam. That\'s a 30% improvement over when we were using wind riders!', '', 24684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no... they\'ve shackled his spirit!', 24683, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your corpse will feed my fish.', '', 24682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will not be pleasant!', '', 24681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare come into my pool?!', '', 24680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you under the weight of my waves!', '', 24679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no escape from my rise!', '', 24678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be consumed!', '', 24677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will turn your bones to ash!', '', 24676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares?!', '', 24675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather, soldiers! Gather and take your trophies from the carapace of the enemy!', '', 24674, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the forces of the Lich King gaze upon the carcass of this wretch and know that the Horde will not relent!', '', 24673, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take great pleasure in tearing the forces of the Horde apart... limb from limb and piece by piece...', '', 24672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, remove yourself from my presence. You would be wise not to come within sight of me again.', '', 24671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... submit. As long as Simmer agrees to stop boiling my pool, I agree to an armistice.', '', 24670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WAIT... NO MORE!', '', 24669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow bored with you. Begone!', '', 24668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell Imperean that I will consider a cessation of hostilities. But first, Churn must stop his watery intrusions upon my rise!', '', 24667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('STOP!', '', 24666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... Let the rage consume you!', '', 24665, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Hellscream! For the Horde!', '', 24664, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave no survivors! Let Arthas sort \'em out...', '', 24663, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the inner sanctum at all costs!', '', 24662, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only you can save me from Kaganishu, $n.', '', 24661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nerub\'ar have been punished for their transgression!', '', 24660, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marksmen, lock and load!', '', 24659, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KAGANISHU!', '', 24658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marksmen! Front and center! Scourge attack incoming!', '', 24657, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be ready for \'em... You did a good job in warning us.', '', 24656, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Settle down, soldier!', '', 24655, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! There!', 'There! There!', 24654, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain... Nerub\'ar flyers! Hundreds of \'em! Coming... Coming from the south! Over our defenses!', 'Captain... Nerub\'ar flyers! Hundreds of \'em! Coming... Coming from the south! Over our defenses!', 24653, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kada nu batteka, oht!', '', 24652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grr... na su ka Magmoth!', '', 24651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Etu Magmothregar, cha!', '', 24650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaganishu!', '', 24649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[In Broken Common] Hear boy, cowards? Boy die! Boy die for freedom!', '', 24648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right, Ug. Victory or death!', '', 24647, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 24646, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar, popo!', '', 24645, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s puffs out his chest and stands on his tip-toes.', '', 24644, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I don\'t understand, popo.', '', 24643, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s scratches his head.', '', 24642, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ug\'thor, they are afraid to die.', '', 24641, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have given up and surrendered - willingly - to us.', '', 24640, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are here because they do not wish to defend their homes... their families...', '', 24639, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But popo, what are they afraid of? Why are they here?', '', 24638, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, blood of my blood, they are soldiers of the Alliance. Our sworn enemies.', '', 24637, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shakes his head.', '', 24636, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are they cowardly pigs, popo?', '', 24635, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those are cowards.', '', 24634, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those...', '', 24633, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, popo. They look kind of like the pigs. Are they pigs?', '', 24632, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at \'em, Ug. You know what those are?', '', 24631, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why it keep telling me to put da lotion in da basket? Me no like da lotion!', '', 24630, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mister Mortuus gonna be so mad! Me go home now.', '', 24629, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tanks, buddy!', '', 24628, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HOORAY! ME FREE!', '', 24627, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh? Where me at? Dis don\'t look good! Me run now!', '', 24626, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vengeance shall be mine! For Quel\'thalas! For the sin\'dorei!', 'Vengeance shall be mine! For Quel\'thalas! For the sin\'dorei!', 24625, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the fury of the Sunwell, I am released!', 'By the fury of the Sunwell, I am released!', 24624, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will battle together to rid this quarry of the Scourge!', 'We will battle together to rid this quarry of the Scourge!', 24623, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rescued! You have my thanks and my aid, friend.', 'Rescued! You have my thanks and my aid, friend.', 24622, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancestors be with you, hero. Farewell!', 'Ancestors be with you, hero. Farewell!', 24621, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits watch over you, friend. I must make my return to Warsong Hold.', 'Spirits watch over you, friend. I must make my return to Warsong Hold.', 24620, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who disturbs my meditation?!', 'Who disturbs my meditation?!', 24619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until we meet again, hero. Duty calls!', 'Until we meet again, hero. Duty calls!', 24618, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, friend. I must return to Warsong Hold.', 'Farewell, friend. I must return to Warsong Hold.', 24617, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must return to Warsong Hold, hero. May you swim in the blood of our enemies and feast upon their sorrow!', 'I must return to Warsong Hold, hero. May you swim in the blood of our enemies and feast upon their sorrow!', 24616, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must return to Warsong Hold. Battle hard, hero!', 'I must return to Warsong Hold. Battle hard, hero!', 24615, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My axe is yours, hero! Together we will destroy these insects!', 'My axe is yours, hero! Together we will destroy these insects!', 24614, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do your people great honor, $r. Thank you again for helping me deal with Steeljaw\'s spirit.$B$BDespite this grievous misunderstanding, I\'m sure in time our peoples will come to be friends.', '', 24613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It pains me to see my ancestors disturbed from their graves.$B$BWe must strike down the cursed spirit of your Force-Commander Steeljaw, the one who foolishly led his caravan through these sacred grounds.', '', 24612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not stop until this place is once again at peace.', '', 24611, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is what happens when southerners come to our lands.', '', 24610, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a Proudhoof, I will not fail!', '', 24609, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The defilement of this sacred resting place comes to an end now!', '', 24608, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the grave with you!', '', 24607, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing shall stop us!', '', 24606, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I go to join my ancestors here.', '', 24605, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I die before my task is complete.', '', 24604, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The burial site must be restored.', '', 24603, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honor my ancestors.', '', 24602, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the ancestors always aid you, $c, as you have aided me.', '', 24601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The people of Kaskala are in your debt, $c.', '', 24600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $c. May the winds and seas always deliver you safely.', '', 24599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not allow Kaskala to forget what has happened here.', '', 24598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my gratitude, $c. I thought I\'d never be free.', '', 24597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for freeing me! May the tides always favor you.', '', 24596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1...', '', 24595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '', 24594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('3...', '', 24593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('4...', '', 24592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Detonation in 5...', '', 24591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s armed.', '', 24590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reading', 'Reading', 24589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yes, it is almost time for the master\'s dinner...', 'Ah, yes, it is almost time for the master\'s dinner...', 24588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall be needing more blood for the master soon...', 'We shall be needing more blood for the master soon...', 24587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the meaning of this?! I have not yet finished my feast!', 'What is the meaning of this?! I have not yet finished my feast!', 24586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroying', 'Destroying', 24585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we shall need more...', 'Perhaps we shall need more...', 24584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one looks a little fragile... well, no matter...', 'This one looks a little fragile... well, no matter...', 24583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blood Prince should be very pleased with these...', 'The Blood Prince should be very pleased with these...', 24582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes, very good...', 'Yes, yes, very good...', 24581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The element of air here is restless. Beware... they will not let you pass unharmed.', '', 24580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am dishonored. I should have died with the farseer at Magmoth.$B$BLeave me to my thoughts.', '', 24579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m freed! Thank you.', '', 24575, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free my soul if you can, cur!', '', 24567, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fought well. Now go north to your orc outpost and inform Overlord Bor\'gorok of our success!', '', 24566, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s the dog\'s banner and there\'s his corpse. What\'s that? He\'s upon us!', '', 24565, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Regain your strength. The place where Steeljaw was felled is just ahead.', '', 24564, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An ambush. Return them to their rest!', '', 24563, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WE STRIKE!', '', 24562, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is going to join us on our assault. Let us bring peace to my ancestors!', '', 24561, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your overlord promised me help. Where is this important person he intends to send?', '', 24560, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we move, we\'ll move fast. Be prepared to put to rest anything that gets in our way.', '', 24559, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not a good start to relations between my people and your Horde.', '', 24558, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits of the taunka will not rest until Steeljaw is dealt with.', '', 24557, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is worth all of our lives to eliminate the spirit of your fallen commander.', '', 24556, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do what you must to quell the restless spirits, Ragefist.', '', 24555, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Steeljaw is now haunting this place... I can feel it.', '', 24554, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was your commander thinking? Taking your caravan through our sacred burial grounds!', '', 24553, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lords, be on your guard! The Horde plan to breach our defenses and stop the ceremony!', '', 24552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twilight Cult seeks to undo everything we fight to preserve. It is our sworn duty to prevent this calamity from coming to pass, $r.', 'The Twilight Cult seeks to undo everything we fight to preserve. It is our sworn duty to prevent this calamity from coming to pass, $r.', 24551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw\'s caravan workers.', 'Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw\'s caravan workers.', 24550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw\'s caravan guards.', 'Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw\'s caravan guards.', 24549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s takes a deep breath.', '%s takes a deep breath.', 24548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits speak all around us. Are you listening, $r?', 24547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r. Without your help I would have become one of them!', 'Thank you, $r. Without your help I would have become one of them!', 24546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve saved me, $c. Thank you!', 'You\'ve saved me, $c. Thank you!', 24545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r. I shall not forget your kindness.', 'Thank you, $r. I shall not forget your kindness.', 24544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avenge me....', 'Avenge me....', 24543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avenge me....', 'Avenge me....', 24542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s... too late for me....', 'It\'s... too late for me....', 24541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have to clean up this mess, but I\'ll do it without complaint.$B$BYou\'ll help if you have any Horde pride at all!', 24540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to get this outpost ready for the push into Sholazar Basin.$B$BDon\'t just stand there, $c. Go out and represent the Horde with honor and spilled blood!', '', 24538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear has always been our greatest weapon. Entire wars have been won and lost upon the shifting shoulders of trepidation and doubt. So how, then, does one fight an enemy that knows no fear?$B$B<Saurfang shakes his head.>$B$BWe do not just fight the Scourge in Northrend, we fight to gain control of our senses before they tear us apart...\n', '', 24537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love the firework show at the end of Midsummer Firefestival.', 'I love the firework show at the end of Midsummer Firefestival.', 24536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Midsummer Fire Festival is a great time to celebrate the summer!', 'Midsummer Fire Festival is a great time to celebrate the summer!', 24535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde fires will never be extinguished!', 'The Horde fires will never be extinguished!', 24534, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to see the Alliance try to steal our flame.', 'I\'d like to see the Alliance try to steal our flame.', 24533, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance fires burn strong and true!', 'The Alliance fires burn strong and true!', 24532, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde have tried to steal our flames.  I hope we return the favor.', 'The Horde have tried to steal our flames.  I hope we return the favor.', 24531, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stamp out the Alliance bonfire!', 'Stamp out the Alliance bonfire!', 24530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve reached an Alliance bonfire! Desecrate this bonfire and stamp it out!', '', 24529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Midsummer Fire Festival has something for everyone to enjoy!', 'The Midsummer Fire Festival has something for everyone to enjoy!', 24528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance bonfire.', 'Alliance bonfire.', 24527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stamp out the Horde bonfire!', 'Stamp out the Horde bonfire!', 24526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cel\'s got what you need, friend.', '', 24525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve reached a Horde bonfire! Desecrate this bonfire and stamp it out!', '', 24524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde bonfire.', 'Horde bonfire.', 24523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes sir!', 'Yes sir!', 24522, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, solja! Lift off time!', '', 24521, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits.', '', 24520, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t eat pork...', '', 24519, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How have you managed to survive for so long, Saurfang? Not fallen victim to your own memories?', '', 24518, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s returns to his post.', '', 24517, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t let you take us down that dark path again, young Hellscream. I\'ll kill you myself before that day comes...', '', 24516, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not speaking solely of the children of our enemies...', '', 24515, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks grimly at Garrosh.', '', 24514, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shakes his head.', '', 24513, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But surely you cannot think that those children were born into innocence? They would have grown up and taken arms against us!', '', 24512, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever been to Jaggedswine Farm? When the swine are of age for the slaughter... It\'s that sound. The sound of the swine being killed... It resonates the loudest. Those are hard times for us older veterans.', '', 24511, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think it was the sounds of the draenei children that unnerved most of them... You never forget...', '', 24510, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '', 24509, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our minds were finally free, yes... Free to relive all of the unthinkable acts that we had performed under the Legions\' influence.', '', 24508, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winter after the curse was lifted, hundreds of veteran orcs like me were lost to despair.', '', 24507, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s pauses.', '', 24506, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His act could not erase the horrors we committed. ', '', 24505, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And while Grom died a glorious death - freeing us all from the blood curse - he could not wipe away the terrible memory of our past.', '', 24504, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I drove my weapons into the bodies and minds of my enemies.', '', 24503, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I drank of the same blood your father did, Garrosh. Mannoroth\'s cursed venom pumped through my veins as well.', '', 24502, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not speak to me of consequences, old one. ', '', 24501, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You rush headlong into all-out war without a thought of the consequences.', '', 24500, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interested in learning about inscription?', 'Interested in learning about inscription?', 24499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your father\'s blood runs strong in you, Hellscream. Impatient as always... Impatient and reckless.', '', 24498, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the prodigal son has spoken!', '', 24497, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And just for good measure...', '', 24496, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There... Now we now have a shipping lane.', '', 24495, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Propose? I will show you what I propose!', '', 24494, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Siege engines, ammunition, heavy armor... How do you propose to shatter the walls of Icecrown without those?', '', 24493, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shipping lanes... supplies... You bore me to death! We need nothing more than the warrior spirit of the Horde, Saurfang! Now that we are firmly entrenched in this frozen wasteland, nothing shall stop us!', '', 24492, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grunts.', '', 24491, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything our zeppelins cannot haul must be brought in by ship and travel the length of Northrend to reach us.', '', 24490, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our only viable port for resupply is held by the Forsaken on the other side of this blasted continent!', '', 24489, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance holds the only secure shipping lane in this region, and even that is at risk of being lost to those dreaded mists.', '', 24488, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge descends like locust from the north.', '', 24487, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are surrounded... Our enemies press in from all sides, young Hellscream.', '', 24486, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When he was given to us by \'Prince\' Kael\'thas, we believed his power would help us lead our people into a new age.', 24485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I pledge the blades of my Blood Knights to the defeat of Kil\'jaeden and the restoration of Silvermoon.\n', 24484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was the worst beer I\'ve ever had.', '', 24483, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess that\'s it then.  Off we go.', '', 24482, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle for the Sunwell is but the first step on your new path, Lady Liadrin. Shattrath is open to you and all who follow you.', '', 24481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shattered Sun Offensive will surely benefit from the addition of your knights, Lady Liadrin.', '', 24480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll surely make an exception for us, eh?  We might not come back.', '', 24479, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barkeep!  Bring out your strongest ale.  We\'re off to the front.', '', 24478, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will fight beside you, A\'dal.', 24477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, why not?', '', 24476, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One last drink before we head to the front?', '', 24475, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see it clearly now. I renounce my loyalties to House Sunstrider and its false prince.', 24474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'At darkest hour, redemption comes, in knightly lady sworn to blood.\'', '', 24473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Broken, then betrayed by one, standing there bestride the sun.\'', '', 24472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('\'Led astray into the night, armed with sword of broken Light.\'', '', 24471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Silvery moon, washed in blood,\'', '', 24470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It wasn\'t I who foretold it, but Velen of the Draenei:', '', 24469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I don\'t understand. You -- and M\'uru -- knew all along that this would occur?', 24468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('M\'uru accepted his role in this long ago, knowing full well what would happen to him. Will you accept your own?', '', 24467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Both our peoples have suffered greatly at the hands of Kael\'thas and his agents, Lady Liadrin. Your people were not the authors of their own fate, but they will die if they do not change.', '', 24466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve come to realize our path was a false one. We were betrayed by the man we called our prince. In his lust for power, he sent the felblood to attack us, and to spirit M\'uru away to the Sunwell.', 24465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for allowing me to speak, A\'dal. I know many of your allies despise me and my knights for our treatment of M\'uru.', 24464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are welcome in Shattrath, Lady Liadrin. We have long awaited your arrival.', '', 24463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, general. The Light embraces all who enter Shattrath in good faith.', '', 24462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you suffer the presence of this despicable Lady Liadrin? She and her followers distort the Light and make a mockery of all we stand for!', '', 24461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not one of mine. King Mrgl-Mrgl must have sent you to talk terms of surrender. Come closer so that I might see you better.', '', 24460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ride the dragonhawk to Sun\'s Reach.>', '<Ride the dragonhawk to Sun\'s Reach.>', 24459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The razing of Orgrimmar was not just an attack against orcs, it was an affront to the Horde. An assault against our very existence!$B$BThe Lich King sought to sow the seeds of fear.$B$BThis...$B$B<Garrosh points to the fortified walls that surround him.>$B$BThis is the result of Arthas\'s campaign.$B$BThe Horde fears nothing...\n', '', 24458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 15, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You not $g da-da : ma-ma;!', '', 24457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eww... $r!', '', 24456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No go with stranger!', '', 24455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Close!', '', 24454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
