('', 'These look good.  Nice work.', 24442, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice work so far.  The recruits keep on coming and they\'re all going to need new blades.  Keep it up!', 24441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oi!  Who\'s been using up all the tin?  Don\'t think just because I\'m a lass I won\'t kick yer behind for wasting materials!', 24440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
