('Not to worry, $n, one of the gatherers found the outfit where you accidentally dropped it.$B$BHere, take it, but please be more careful. I\'d hate for you to have to fight your way to Claximus and kill more of the Winterfin murlocs unnecessarily along the way.', '', 24381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
