('I recently came here to observe the Winterfin murlocs. Disguised as one of them, I kept my distance and took notes on their day-to-day life.$B$BHowever, not long after I arrived, that all changed.$B$BAn earthquake in Coldarra caused a landslide, which exposed the nearby caverns. Out came a strange makrura who stole away with the Winterfins\' tadpoles. When the murlocs went into the caverns to rescue their young, they re-emerged, glowing and under the makrura\'s influence.$B$BNow the unaffected have retreated to here, and I have reluctantly assumed their leadership.', '', 24379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
