('Living in these caverns and following that mad lobstrok, Clacker, is unnatural! Let me free!', '', 24317, 0, 6811, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t hold me against my will! You\'ve all been brainwashed!', '', 24316, 0, 6811, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only there were someone nearby who would help me escape.', '', 24315, 0, 6811, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you, stranger, come here!', '', 24314, 0, 6811, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for rescuing me, $r. Please tell the king that I am back.', '', 24313, 0, 6811, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 36, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is far enough. I can make it on my own from here.', '', 24312, 0, 6811, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then we leave!', '', 24311, 0, 6811, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we will fight our way out of here. Are you ready?', '', 24310, 0, 6811, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Easy boy.  $n is here to help, $ghe:she;\'s not with the demons.', 24309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ahlurglgr looks surprised to be able to understand you.>', '', 24308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmrrglglglg? Glbmr brmmrggl glmrrbmrgl.$B$BGrglgrlbrr mrgl!!!', '', 24307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Schweitzer here is an old friend of mine... a valuable thing, that. Friendship, I mean. I thought I\'d forgotten the feeling until we met again in Shattrath City.\n\nHe\'s not in Tirisfal so much these days, so I thought I\'d take the Orb of Translocation here to give my hellos.', '', 24306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in charge of the workers that support the Tauren Chieftains.\n\nYou know: packing, driving, and unpacking the wagons, building and taking down the stage, setting up the pyrotechnics, all that sort of thing.', '', 24305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Sun\'s Reach is ours.  Kael\'s dogs are on the run... it is time to put them out of their misery!', '', 24304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kael\'s lackeys are about to be taught a lesson in humility.  We will crush the Dawnblade army and take Sun\'s Reach Harbor from them.$B$BWe are $3238w percent done with our goal.', '', 24303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not fight the enemy unprepared, $n.  I can provide you with very powerful items... provided you have proven yourself to us.', 24302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d give nearly anything for a chance to go up there and speak with them...', 'I\'d give nearly anything for a chance to go up there and speak with them...', 24301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder how much longer they\'ll be in Silvermoon City. I hope they play here!', 'I wonder how much longer they\'ll be in Silvermoon City. I hope they play here!', 24300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tauren Chieftains must be the best-known minstrels in all of Azeroth!', 'The Tauren Chieftains must be the best-known minstrels in all of Azeroth!', 24299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you manage to see their show in Terokkar Forest? It was amazing!', 'Did you manage to see their show in Terokkar Forest? It was amazing!', 24298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tauren Chieftains are staying in Silvermoon while I arrange their next tour. They often lounge on the balcony above me when they\'re not practicing. Feel free to wave... they love the attention.\n\nWe\'re not currently hiring for the show or the crew, but you can always check back later. Who knows what will arise?', '', 24297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Cold feet, I assume. Probably better this way - nothing but death in there for the likes of you....', '', 24296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('According to my calculations, if enough of us bang the gong at once the seal on these doors will break and we can enter.', '', 24295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suit yourself. At least three of you must assist me if we\'re to get inside. Follow me....', '', 24294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come in out of the ash and muck. Dry yourself a spell.', '', 24293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 24292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my calculations are correct, banging on this gong will bring down that door. It\'s crazy, I know, but to be totally honest with you, I think it\'s an idea that might be ahead of its time!', '', 24291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The flight from Grom\'gol to Undercity is beautiful, though uneventful.  Though that is no excuse to fall asleep on the job.', 24290, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time to talk right now.', 'I don\'t have time to talk right now.', 24289, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need something fixed? Use the Vend-O-Tron.', 'You need something fixed? Use the Vend-O-Tron.', 24288, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m busy right now.', 'I\'m busy right now.', 24287, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me sleep just five more minutes, mon...', '', 24286, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please allow me a few seconds of rest.', '', 24285, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The captain\'s great!  We get time to relax when we dock.  Those are the times I look forward to the most.', '', 24284, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relaxation is the key to being an efficient crew.  Let the crew relax, and they\'ll perform better.', '', 24283, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome aboard $c.  Take a load off and enjoy the trip.  Aboard \"The Purple Princess\" we want you to relax.  We have vending machines down below if there\'s anything you might need while aboard.', 24282, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 4, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is your job so hard that you don\'t even have the energy to stand at the ready when we dock?  I gave you this post as a favor to your family.  Don\'t make me regret that decision.', 24281, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watcher, we have docked.  On your feet!', 24280, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s clears her throat loudly.', 24279, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you really want to get past those doors you\'ll lend me the strength of at least three people! Follow me!', '', 24278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NAP\'S OVER!! WE ARE HEADING OUT!', '', 24277, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WAKE UP!!  WE ARE SHOVING OFF!', '', 24276, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HELP ME!  WE ARE LEAVING!', '', 24275, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go ahead, I can handle this part.', '', 24274, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to work my magic!', '', 24273, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to get this show on the road!', '', 24272, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s go time!', '', 24271, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, give me a second to get my bearings...', '', 24270, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to take a short nap.  Do you think you can handle the ship while she\'s not moving?', '', 24269, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t the memorial beautiful?  It is important to remember moments in our history when great sacrifices are made, lest we forget the price of all wars - even ones that are won.', 24268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m gathering funds to build a monument in honor of those who\'ve died in the war.  It is important to not forget the sacrifices we\'ve made to achieve victory.$B$BWe are $3275w percent done with this goal.', 24267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it, $n.  With Sun\'s Reach under our control we are but mere moments away from absolute victory.', '', 24266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve almost consolidated our control over Sun\'s Reach.  If we manage to keep the harbor from getting any reinforcements we will certainly succeed.$B$BWe are $3238w percent done with our goal.', '', 24264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s transforms into a bear!', '', 24263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I run the tightest airship in Azeroth. She used to be fitted with twin light cannons and enough bombs to flatten a city, you know... her mere shadow was enough to rout armies.$b$bWhat? Of course it\'s true!', '', 24262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 4, 0, 39653),
('Not right now, $gpal:sugar;... I got things to do. See ya around.', '', 24261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('We protect this airship on its way from Orgrimmar to Grom\'gol base camp in Stranglethorn Vale.', 'We protect this airship on its way from Orgrimmar to Grom\'gol base camp in Stranglethorn Vale.', 24260, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need something fixed? Use the Vend-O-Tron D-Luxe.', 'You need something fixed? Use the Vend-O-Tron D-Luxe.', 24259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On duty. GO. AWAY.', 'On duty. GO. AWAY.', 24258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? I\'m busy here.', 'What? I\'m busy here.', 24257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorta busy.', 'Sorta busy.', 24256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Iron Eagle.\" Hmph. It\'s a passenger ship, not a warbird! But hey, a job\'s a job, and I\'ll humor Captain \"Bombast\" so long as the prince is paying.$b$bIn any case, welcome aboard.', 24255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re safe!  But we weren\'t going fast enough!  All I want to feel is the wind in my eyes!', '', 24254, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe how lucky we got on that trip!  I really am the greatest sky-captain in all the realms!', '', 24253, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another successful trip!  Come on boys let\'s buzz the tower!', '', 24252, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickfix!!  We\'ve got our self a situation down here!!', '', 24251, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archonisus is no more. Alas, we are... we are too late...$B$BKil\'jaeden is unleashed! The heroes of the world are now our only hope.', '', 24250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rohendor has been obliterated.  Only the gateway, Archonisus, remains.$B$BOur mages are $3257w percent through the defenses of the final gate, Archonisus.', '', 24249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first gate, Agamath, has been dismantled! The second gate of Rohendor now blocks our passage.$B$BOur mages are $3255w percent through the defenses of the second gate, Rohendor.', 'The first gate, Agamath, has been dismantled! The second gate of Rohendor now blocks our passage.$B$BOur mages are $3255w percent through the defenses of the second gate, Rohendor.', 24248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should Kil\'jaeden rise up through the Sunwell our world will be thrown into a war the likes of which has not been seen for 10,000 years!\n', '', 24247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sir, if you could at least get my gender correct...', 24246, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You almost got my name right that time, sir.', 24245, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Close sir...', 24244, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the way, my name is Coppernut, sir!', 24243, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mister Fairweather, slow ahead if you please!', 24242, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sir, my name is... Oh, never mind...', 24241, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mister Coppertop... Punch it!', '', 24240, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mister Copperpot, you may take us out.', '', 24239, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take us out nice and fast Mister Copperpants.', '', 24238, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Full speed ahead Mister Copperbolt!', '', 24237, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare to dock!', 24236, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it!  We survived another trip with our ship intact!  But that\'s no reason to slack off!  Push her hard until we dock!', '', 24235, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rohendor, the Second Gate has been brought down, but the last of the Sunwell Plateau\'s magical barriers, Archonisus, resists us, $n.$B$BMaintain your efforts to assist at the Sunwell in any way that you can.', '', 24234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agamath, the First Gate is breached and two of Kil\'jaeden\'s lieutenants, Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess, must be destroyed.$B$BGather your friends, $c, and see to it! Rohendor, the Second Gate is our next target.', '', 24233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are trying to bring Agamath, the First Gate down. Please, $c, go to the Isle of Quel\'Danas and help in any way that you can!', '', 24232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know about the magical gates at the Sunwell Plateau being brought down?', 'What do you know about the magical gates at the Sunwell Plateau being brought down?', 24231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The alchemy lab is not quite yet ready, $n. Mar\'nah says that she is $3223w percent done with its assembly, however.$B$BIf you would like to help her with that, you will find her inside the inn at the Sun\'s Reach Harbor.', '', 24230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nasuun, do you know how long until we have an alchemy lab at the Sun\'s Reach Harbor?', 'Nasuun, do you know how long until we have an alchemy lab at the Sun\'s Reach Harbor?', 24229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, unfortunately we have not yet taken the harbor. However, reports indicate that we are $3238w percent of the way towards doing so.$B$B$n, if you want to help out, look for Magister Ilastar and Vindicator Kaalan at the Sun\'s Reach Armory on the Isle of Quel\'Danas.', '', 24228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exarch, have we taken the Sun\'s Reach Harbor yet?', 'Exarch, have we taken the Sun\'s Reach Harbor yet?', 24227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have something else to ask you about.', 'I have something else to ask you about.', 24226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last I heard from Hauthaa, she indicated that we are $3228w percent of the way there.$B$BI cannot express how vital it is to our efforts that we get them created. Our men and women are going to need better armor and weapons, and the anvil and forge are the key to that.$B$BYou will find the smith behind the Sun\'s Reach Armory, $n.', '', 24225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How close are we to the completion of the anvil and forge at the Sun\'s Reach Armory?', 'How close are we to the completion of the anvil and forge at the Sun\'s Reach Armory?', 24224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad that you ask. Our efforts to take the armory are at $3233w percent of our projections.$B$BI know that Battlemage Arynna and Harbinger Inuuro need your help. Seek them inside the Sun\'s Reach Sanctum on the Isle of Quel\'Danas.', '', 24223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What news of the fight to take the Sun\'s Reach Armory?', 'What news of the fight to take the Sun\'s Reach Armory?', 24222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m awaiting orders on your specific assignments. In the meantime, stay here and be ready to move at a moment\'s notice!', '', 24221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors will be deployed to hold key positions, while you marksmen will be assigned to keep the enemy fliers at bay.', '', 24220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Let me assure you people that if he\'s successful, this world will suffer far worse than Outland ever did! So, let\'s make sure that doesn\'t come to pass.', '', 24219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, we thought he was dead too, but that\'s not the case. He\'s trying to use the Sunwell to bring the master of the Burning Legion, Kil\'Jaeden, into this world.', '', 24218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The current situation looks like this: we\'re holding what we can while those with more experience and better equipment are moving against Prince Kael\'thas.', '', 24217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Sunwell. Despite the mild temperatures and scenic vistas, you\'re not on vacation, ladies and gentlemen!', '', 24216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If none of you ladies have any questions, you can get further instructions and assignments from your squad leaders. That\'s it. Good luck!', '', 24215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here as support for the so-called \'adventurers\' that the brass has called in. We\'ll help them hold the key points on the island, and keep the heat off so that they can do their jobs.', '', 24214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that that\'s out of the way, welcome to the Isle of Quel\'Danas. The Sunwell\'s on the plateau to the south, and Prince Kael\'thas is holed up in the Magisters\' Terrace to the east.', '', 24213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First though, you sin\'dorei listen up. I run a tight ship... this isn\'t going to be like what you\'re used to with the Scryers. Pull your weight, or get back on the boat!', '', 24212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve stood with some of you draenei before at Skettis, and others in Shadowmoon Valley. But now we\'re on Azeroth, and the situation looks grim.', '', 24211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, quiet down. We have a lot to do and very little time to do it in, people.', '', 24210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good. Fall into formation with the rest of your squadron. There is work to be done.', '', 24209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, sir!', 'Yes, sir!', 24208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir, we\'ve just flown in from the south. What are your orders?', 'Sir, we\'ve just flown in from the south. What are your orders?', 24207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this pathetic magic? How about you come back with twenty-four of your best friends and try again, $r!', '', 24206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grraaarrr! You think to make an icicle out of me? Come down, then I will add real fire to your life.', '', 24205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I prefer my meals a bit colder!', 'I prefer my meals a bit colder!', 24204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come down! I tear your wings from your shoulders and feed you to the dirt. Then YOU be the maggot, dragon!', '', 24203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silver Pig', 'Silver Pig', 24202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golden Pig', 'Golden Pig', 24201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all I have to say for now. Stay focused, boys and girls.', '', 24200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Needless to say, a lot of us won\'t be going home. But if you remember your training and keep your wits about you, you\'ll greatly increase your chances.', '', 24199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our job is to clear out as much of his fodder as we can, while supporting the specialists that the powers-that-be are having brought in.', '', 24198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up on the plateau, he and his demon friends are trying to reignite the Sunwell and open a rift to bring their head-honcho, Kil\'Jaeden, back into the world.', '', 24197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Isle of Quel\'Danas has been overrun by the forces of Prince Kael\'thas Sunstrider. Intel had him pegged as deceased. Intel was wrong.', '', 24196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello to you new recruits. I\'m Drill Sergeant Bahduum. For the next few days, you\'re going to receive orientation.', '', 24195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ATTENTION!', '', 24194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big talk from a blue birdie! How about you come down and see if you can pluck this maggot from the dirt!', '', 24193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear Pit Lords are born from maggots, Brutallus!', 'I hear Pit Lords are born from maggots, Brutallus!', 24192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beat or be beaten! This is the way of the Legion!', '', 24191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beat or be beaten! This is the way of the Legion!', '', 24190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No horror here can compare with what you\'ll face when I\'m through with you!', '', 24189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn their bodies, shred their skins, crush their creaking carapaces!', '', 24188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harder, maggots! We must keep the sunwell clear for the master\'s return!', '', 24187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash them! Grind the bones into the dirt!', '', 24186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush these stinking husks!', '', 24185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eye on the demons.  We\'re not concerned with killing Scourge today.', 'Keep your eye on the demons.  We\'re not concerned with killing Scourge today.', 24184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be quick with those charges.  Some of those demons are going to take more than one direct hit to bring down.', 'Be quick with those charges.  Some of those demons are going to take more than one direct hit to bring down.', 24183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall into formation!  We\'re approaching the Dead Scar.', 'Fall into formation!  We\'re approaching the Dead Scar.', 24182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silver Pig', 'Silver Pig', 24181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golden Pig', 'Golden Pig', 24180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something I can help you with? Looking for a pet pig, perhaps?', '', 24179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s showtime!  Blast them hard, blast them fast!', 'It\'s showtime!  Blast them hard, blast them fast!', 24178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move up and hit them from above.  Let\'s try to get $n some cover.', 'Move up and hit them from above.  Let\'s try to get $n some cover.', 24177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got your back, $n!', 'We\'ve got your back, $n!', 24176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shattered Sun scum!  Fire at will!', '', 24175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let that dragonhawk through!  Open fire!', '', 24174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dragonhawk incoming from the west!  Shoot that $c down!', '', 24173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used to be known as Iolol until a secret vote was passed around town that resulted in me having to change my name. It was either change it or go the way of Corki. You would have done the same. What do you think of my new name? Huge improvement, right?$B$BBy the way, check the bulletin board if you\'re looking for work.', '', 24172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for purifying the armaments yourself, $n. I have much to do and very little time to do it in.', 24171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your work here is invaluable to the Offensive.', 24170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Along with the naga\'s ore, the cleansed metal that you provide will form a nigh-invulnerable alloy.', 24169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your form is excellent. Are you a blacksmith by chance?', 24168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n!', 24167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At this rate, our men and women will be the finest equipped in no time.', 24166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can use all of the cleansed metal that you can provide.', 24165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work, $n.', 24164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t blame me for our mishaps... I can\'t even see where I\'m going!$b$bThough maybe that means you can blame me...$b$bNo!  Wait!  I can dock this ship just fine... It\'s gotta be the orders the captain issues!  Maybe he likes pushing us to our limits and testing out our survival and repair skills.', '', 24163, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ask...', '', 24162, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you like excitement, our captain\'s the best!  I love this job!', 24161, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Grumbles> I still don\'t know how we managed to snake through Thousand Needles without a scratch, only to crash and burn in the Shimmering Flats!', '', 24160, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve managed to squeeze through Thunder Bluff twice now!  ', '', 24159, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never thought I\'d get to see Teldrassil... I certainly never thought we\'d crash into Teldrassil.', '', 24158, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am impressed that pine tree branches don\'t seem to damage our ship much.$b$bNot that it excuses the three times we\'ve crashed into some forest.', '', 24157, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Grumbles> I wish I could say we\'ve managed to avoid crash landing into lakes.  I wish I could say we\'ve only crashed into a lake once... but we\'ve managed to crash into four separate lakes, including Lordamere Lake!', '', 24156, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Grumbles>  You\'d think it would be hard to crash a zeppelin into the ocean.  You\'d think it\'d be even harder to do it four separate times!', '', 24155, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Grumbles>  I guess those mountains came out of nowhere...  All five times!', '', 24154, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome aboard the Thundercaller!$b$bDon\'t pay attention to the people that complain about explosions or the like.  I mean really, everyone makes mistakes.  We should cut people some slack.$b$bLook, I\'d understand if a captain managed to crash his ship 22 or 23 times... But anything less than that isn\'t worth mentioning.', '', 24153, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('I need to intercept the Dawnblade reinforcements.', 'I need to intercept the Dawnblade reinforcements.', 24152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve taken the harbor, and this ship is a nice bonus. Too bad she\'s not yet sea-worthy.$B$BIn the meantime, I\'ve been instructed to oversee the disruption of the naga on the Greengill Coast.$B$BThink you can help me out?', 24151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $n.$b$bNow that I\'ve finished creating my anvil I can begin outfitting our troops. It\'s an important step, but there\'s still much to be done.$b$bMore importantly for you, there are new things that I can create, which you may be interested in.', 24150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $r.$b$bLet\'s get busy! No sense waiting around for supplies that may never arrive.$b$bI need my anvil in order to outfit our troops properly. Right now It\'s $3228w percent complete.$b$bAnd when the anvil is completed, there will be many more powerful items that I will be able to smith for you.', 24149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('Urrrk... if that grubbing galley chief over there offers you his special, do yourself a favor and dump it in the ocean. It might kill a few makruras instead of your will to live.', '', 24148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paper Airplane', 'Paper Airplane', 24147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rocket Chicken', 'Rocket Chicken', 24146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kite', 'Kite', 24145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s becomes enraged!', '', 24144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a killing frenzy!', '', 24143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks!  I\'ll try it right now.', 'Thanks!  I\'ll try it right now.', 24142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s... great.  What about these flying machines?', 'That\'s... great.  What about these flying machines?', 24141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As often as I can.  It\'s great exercise and it keeps me informed on what they\'re up to--which, from my experience, is always no good.', '', 24140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you often squeeze gnomes?', 'Do you often squeeze gnomes?', 24139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flying machines?', 'Flying machines?', 24138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s amazing what you can learn from a gnome if you squeeze them hard enough: clever little tricks about getting out of a bind, making delicious cookies, and even how to make a flying machine.', '', 24137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome aboard the Maiden\'s Fancy. It should be smooth sailing all the way to port.', '', 24136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, I\'ve little time for speaking to anyone other than the wisps and the captain to report my findings.  Forgive me.', 24135, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgive me, $r, I must focus on my job.', 24134, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune has blessed us many times over with all the discoveries we have made.  But we must remain vigilant, $c.', 'Elune has blessed us many times over with all the discoveries we have made.  But we must remain vigilant, $c.', 24133, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step aboard Elune\'s Blessing, $r.  Though Elune\'s blessed us with the discovery of our new friends, we\'ve also had our share of hardships at sea.$b$bHowever, recovering souls lost at sea or lost in a new world is truly a blessing from Elune.', '', 24132, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('On behalf of the crew of the Moonspray, I welcome you $c.  I hope you take advantage of our provisions before parting with us.', '', 24131, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('Welcome aboard the Feathermoon Ferry.  We travel between Feathermoon Stronghold and the Forgotten Coast looking for those lost at sea.  The sea can be a dangerous place if you are not prepared.$b$bIf you need to get prepared, please speak to our provisioners.  They are more than happy to help you.', '', 24130, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('What\'s a Steamwheedle ship without an engineer, eh? Torquespindle can help you with anything you need. He\'s handy with repairing things quickly, too, if that\'s what you\'re after.', '', 24129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If your stomach\'s rumbling, talk to Galley Chief Steelbelly, but just between you and me? You might want to wait. He\'s got that name for a reason.', '', 24128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, that\'s her you\'re standing on. A beaut, isn\'t she? The Baron set me up as the captain a while back. She\'s not mine originally, so I didn\'t name her; if you want my opinion, kid, I think the sailor who named her spent a little too much time at sea and not enough time in port, if you catch my meaning.', '', 24127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Maiden\'s Fancy', 'The Maiden\'s Fancy', 24126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, kid. You\'re aboard the Maiden\'s Fancy. The name\'s Captain Wrenchnozzle, and you\'ve got the privilege of sailing on the pride of the Blackwater Raiders. The Bloodsail don\'t come near us, not with my sharp crew and the large amount of gunpowder in the hold. Insurance, you know.$b$bIf you\'ve got questions, kid, I\'ll answer \'em.', '', 24125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('Examining', 'Examining', 24124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dawnblade forces have been driven from the Sun\'s Reach Harbor!  The day is ours!', '', 24123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $n, try to leave some of the glory for us, would ya?', 'Hey, $n, try to leave some of the glory for us, would ya?', 24122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who needs sentries? $n is here!', 'Who needs sentries? $n is here!', 24121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a coincidence... we were just talking about you, $n!', 'What a coincidence... we were just talking about you, $n!', 24120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you have no idea what a relief it is to see you!', '$n, you have no idea what a relief it is to see you!', 24119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve sworn to do our very best to protect the passengers of The Bravery. The sea lane between Rut\'theran Village and Stormwind Harbor must remain safe.', 24118, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t even want to think about what\'ll happen here if $n ever decides not to come back.', 'I don\'t even want to think about what\'ll happen here if $n ever decides not to come back.', 24117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, one of these days I want to buy you a drink.', '$n, one of these days I want to buy you a drink.', 24116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lay waste to the demons on the Dead Scar lately, $n?', 'Lay waste to the demons on the Dead Scar lately, $n?', 24115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This greyin\' seadog may be the oldest of the crew, but he\'s also the toughest of the lot! Eh? Eh? Arms like an ogre!', '', 24114, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('No matter what, your efforts will always be exalted here, $n!', 'No matter what, your efforts will always be exalted here, $n!', 24113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guarantee that without $n, this whole offensive would have been a failure.', 'I guarantee that without $n, this whole offensive would have been a failure.', 24112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s our $g hero : heroine; right there! How are you doing, $n?', 'There\'s our $g hero : heroine; right there! How are you doing, $n?', 24111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, $n.', 'Welcome back, $n.', 24110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unlucky name fer a sailor, innit?', 24109, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snap to attention, $n, one of our finest, is here!', 'Snap to attention, $n, one of our finest, is here!', 24108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many wretched do you think $n has put out of their misery?', 'How many wretched do you think $n has put out of their misery?', 24107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I were one of those Dawnblade blood elves, I\'d be swimming away from the island now that $n is here.', 'If I were one of those Dawnblade blood elves, I\'d be swimming away from the island now that $n is here.', 24106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m almost jealous of our Mr. Wavesinger. Why, he may well be prettier than me!', 24105, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('$n has kept the demons at bay countless times.', '$n has kept the demons at bay countless times.', 24104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s an honor to serve with you, $n.', 'It\'s an honor to serve with you, $n.', 24103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three cheers for $n!', 'Three cheers for $n!', 24102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to The Bravery, $gsir:madame;. Now if you\'ll excuse me...', 24101, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, thank you again for helping us. We couldn\'t have achieved any of this without you.', '$n, thank you again for helping us. We couldn\'t have achieved any of this without you.', 24100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it weren\'t for $n, we\'d all be long dead.', 'If it weren\'t for $n, we\'d all be long dead.', 24099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shattered Sun Offensive is lucky to have $n on our side.', 'The Shattered Sun Offensive is lucky to have $n on our side.', 24098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but we\'ll have to speak some other time. Farewell.', '', 24097, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bravery\'s crew will do its best to make your journey as swift and pleasant as possible.', '', 24096, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Its only a matter of time before that dog, Akama, betrays the Betrayer as well...', '', 24095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, maybe it was more like a hundred...', '', 24094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twenty? Impossible, it couldn\'t have been less than fourty.', '', 24093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had heard that a score of them broke into the Eye and slew him.', '', 24092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forces of the Aldor and Scryers stormed the citadel shortly after Akama and his foul brethren slew Al\'ar. Its a good thing we left Illidan as soon as we did.', '', 24091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... the Black Temple is under siege?', '', 24090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G Milord : Milady;, $n, we are fortunate to have you here with us.', '$G Milord : Milady;, $n, we are fortunate to have you here with us.', 24089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dawnblade, demons and naga beware, $n is back.', 'Dawnblade, demons and naga beware, $n is back.', 24088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone look, it\'s $n!', 'Everyone look, it\'s $n!', 24087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, it\'s very good to see you again!', '$n, it\'s very good to see you again!', 24086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arming the wards at the sanctum will help us secure it faster.  We don\'t want any Wretched getting in our way when we unleash a full scale attack on the Legion and Kael.$B$BWe are $3244w percent done with our goal.', '', 24085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our efforts have paid off.  We\'ve captured the Sun\'s Reach Sanctum, $n.  Go there and see if there\'s anyone you can assist.', '', 24084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve captured the armory, $n.  Let\'s not rest on our laurels, however.  The Legion sure will not.', 24083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My orders are to create a distraction at the Dead Scar so our forces can take the Sun\'s Reach Armory.  It might not be as glamorous as killing demons face to face, but if it wins us this battle then I\'m all for it.$B$BWe are $3233w percent done with our goal.', 24082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have gained control of the armory, but our work on the island is not yet finished.', '', 24081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Capturing the Sun\'s Reach Sanctum was the first step in our battle plan.  Our orders are to take control of the armory next.$B$BWe are $3233w percent done with our goal.', '', 24080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve taken the Sanctum at Sun\'s Reach!  Send word back to Shattrath, we make our move now!', '', 24079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sun\'s Reach Armory is ours!  We\'ve pushed the demons back to Dawning Square!', '', 24078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to your posts!  The battle is not yet over!', '', 24077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fear death?  Far worse awaits you, should you fail!  Slay the mortals!', '', 24076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coilskar Key', 'Coilskar Key', 24075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kil\'jaeden\'s patience wears thin!  Destroy the naaru\'s lackeys once and for all!', '', 24074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want to end up like one of the Wretched? No?! Then put your hearts into it this time!', '', 24073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is no vacation - our hearts, our souls, the final escape from the addictions that bind us lie here on Quel\'Danas. ', '', 24072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dawnblade will defend this land for all of the Sin\'dorei. There is no turning back!', '', 24071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again!', '', 24070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kael\'thas will not tolerate any further failures!', '', 24069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your shoulders into it! We must defend the Sunwell with our lives if needed!', '', 24068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Train harder! We are all that remains of the loyal defenders of Kael\'thas!', '', 24067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods in agreement.', '', 24066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I hope once they\'re done he\'ll send them right back through that portal...', '', 24065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Kael\'thas insisted upon it.', '', 24064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do we need them anyways?', '', 24063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... not to mention that those blasted abyssals patrol all over the flowerbeds.', '', 24062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! When was the last time you saw a doomguard take a bath?', '', 24061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I utterly cannot stand the presence of these demons!', '', 24060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speaking of action, I\'ve been ordered to undertake an air strike.', 'Speaking of action, I\'ve been ordered to undertake an air strike.', 24059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t get to see much action in my line of work.  Serving this close to the front lines in a combat zone is a nice change of pace.', '', 24058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings of the naaru upon you, my friend.', '', 24057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gasps.', '', 24056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His... return.', '', 24055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepares? Prepares for what?', '', 24054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, but we will follow him to the end. Its our duty to hold this sanctuary while he prepares.', '', 24053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That look in his eyes now... it scares me.', '', 24052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was beaten and left for dead. If Priestess Delrissa hadn\'t arrived when she did, who knows what might have happened!', '', 24051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. He hasn\'t been the same since the attack on Tempest Keep.', '', 24050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... did you see how Kael\'thas looked?', '', 24049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The booty be ours!', '', 24048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take that, landlubber!', '', 24047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rum and wenches for all!', '', 24046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thar she blows!', '', 24045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of gnomish spirits!', '', 24044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot keep our wards!', '', 24043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will retake these wards!', '', 24042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The energy; I can feel it!', '', 24041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... much... power.', '', 24040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal wards... I must feed!', '', 24039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not stop me!', '', 24038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power... it will be mine!', '', 24037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hunger!', '', 24036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid I cannot speak with you at the moment.', 'I\'m afraid I cannot speak with you at the moment.', 24035, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The seas are a dangerous place, $c.  We must be alert.', 'The seas are a dangerous place, $c.  We must be alert.', 24034, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wisps and I watch the seas for any lost souls.', 'The wisps and I watch the seas for any lost souls.', 24033, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorlof\'s booty falls to the floor.', '', 24032, 0, 6797, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many have been lost to the seas.  I, and the wisps, are charged with looking for those souls.  ', 'Many have been lost to the seas.  I, and the wisps, are charged with looking for those souls.', 24031, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me $c, but I must concentrate on my job.', 'Forgive me $c, but I must concentrate on my job.', 24030, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It may\'ave won in life, but it won\'t be winnin\' in the afterlife! FIRE!', '', 24029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire! Fire for the booty, me hearties!', '', 24028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aim for the keester!', '', 24027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must make sure not to lose any more souls to the seas.', 'We must make sure not to lose any more souls to the seas.', 24026, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy! Ye be lookin\' to book passage board the Sister Mercy, matey? Ye\'ve come to the right place...', '', 24025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We succeeded in taking the Sanctum.  We can continue to convert sentries and use them as guards at other tactical locations.', 24024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen the damaged sentries that wander the island?  A few modifications to the crystals that control their behavior will allow us to gain control of them and use them to secure tactical locations.$B$BThe Sun\'s Reach Sanctum will be ours in no time.  We are $3244w percent done with this goal.', 24023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the gateway that Kael\'s armies used to retreat to the Sunwell.  Some of his lapdogs remain here; the Legion has rewarded them in a most... unusual way.', 24022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly! Use the flames and support the ground troops. Its ancient magic should cleanse Terokk\'s shield.', 'Quickly! Use the flames and support the ground troops. Its ancient magic should cleanse Terokk\'s shield.', 24021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kwa! You cannot kill me, I am immortal!', '', 24020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good day to you, $c.$b$bThere\'s much to be done to assist in the effort here. Sadly, there\'s very little I can do for you until I get all of my supplies.$b$bI\'ve now got $3223w percent of the razorthorn roots I need to get started. Any assistance you provide will be well worth the effort, I assure you.', 24019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $r.$b$bMy shop is finally open. I hope you like what you see!', 24018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s becomes energized with arcane power.', '', 24017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deployment successful.  Trespassers will be neutralized.', '', 24016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commence location defense.', '', 24015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Objective acquired.  Initiating security routines.', '', 24014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for Zul\'Aman, Jebediah. Teleport me!', 'I\'m ready for Zul\'Aman, Jebediah. Teleport me!', 24013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re currently focus testing Zul\'Aman, a 10 player raid dungeon in the Ghostlands. You must be at least level 68 to enter.', '', 24012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have for me?', 'What do you have for me?', 24011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The noble Flaskasaur nods at you in approval.>', 24010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal pulses faintly.  Its protective energy has grown weak but is not entirely depleted.', '', 24009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Core overload detected. System malfunction detected...', 'Core overload detected. Recharging...', 24008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise and serve your eternal master!', '', 24007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not meant for you! Get away from here!', 'It is not meant for you! Get away from here!', 24006, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine! You shall not take this place!', 'Mine! You shall not take this place!', 24005, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away, this place is ours!', 'Get away, this place is ours!', 24004, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rift\'s power is ours!', 'The rift\'s power is ours!', 24003, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s releases its energy, engulfing its surroundings in flames!', '', 24002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s becomes unstable with brimming energy!', '', 24001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorlof been tricked! Aarrrrggghhh...', '', 24000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are tiny men!? Just puny flag!', '', 23999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MORE PIRATES FOR SORLOF TO SMASH!', '', 23998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire! Fire, ya yella sea dogs!', '', 23997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... no... NO!!!!!', 'No... no... NO!!!!!', 23996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power... is gone!', 'My power... is gone!', 23995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you done?!', 'What have you done?!', 23994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s unleashes a Spectral Blast!', '', 23993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone from my sight!', '', 23992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This portal is not like the others that lead back to Azeroth. To maintain it, we must acquire more mana cells.$B$BIt is either that or risk losing our access to the Isle of Quel\'Danas and the Sunwell.', '', 23990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we are to be successful in the creation of a portal to the Isle of Quel\'Danas, and the Sunwell which rests upon it, we must acquire an energy source powerful enough to ignite the portal.$B$BWe are $3269w percent completed with our efforts. Will you assist us, $c?', '', 23989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More... more... MORE!!!', 'More... more... MORE!!!', 23988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will soon be stronger than any elf!  I will serve at Kil\'jaeden\'s side!', 'I will soon be stronger than any elf!  I will serve at Kil\'jaeden\'s side!', 23987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life force is my nourishment, demon... Kil\'jaeden\'s gift to us!', 'Your life force is my nourishment, demon... Kil\'jaeden\'s gift to us!', 23986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel energy... courses through my veins!', 'Fel energy... courses through my veins!', 23985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unparalleled power... I... crave... more!', 'Unparalleled power... I... crave... more!', 23984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry! There is not much of me left!', '', 23983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agghh!! Help me before I lose my mind!', '', 23982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need... your help! Cannot... resist him much longer!', '', 23981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HOW DARE YOU! ABDUL WILL PUT YOUR HEAD ON A PIKE!', '', 23980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARE YOU CHALLENGING ME? I HAVE THE STRENGTH OF TEN MEN!', '', 23979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ABDUL IS STRONG LIKE BULL!', '', 23978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Its power courses through me! I AM A GOD!', '', 23977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fury of the Vrykul will consume you!', '', 23976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time for chit-chat, Lou. Take me to Scalawag Point.', 'I don\'t have time for chit-chat, Lou. Take me to Scalawag Point.', 23975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lucked out. Not many tauren get to be cabin boy on a frigate like this! Grezzix even lets me man these incredible battle canoes.', '', 23974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The anguish of ten-thousand years awaits any foolish enough to don the Ancient Armor of the Kvaldir. Beware the mist and fog, mortals; for with them comes your end.\n', '', 23973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Frozen Heart of Isuldof will consume this land until it is returned. Woe unto those that hold the heart as the curse of frozen blood besets them...\n', '', 23972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Staff of Storm\'s Fury pilfered. A curse upon this land! The storms will never cease!\n', '', 23971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From sundered ground the sacrament was stolen. The Shield of Aesirites is lost. Unrest will be eternal.', '', 23970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dead rise and seek vengeance on any that dare pass through their domain. Turn back!\n', '', 23969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Ah, yes, that... the name. Well... as they say, a good name, like good will, is got by many actions and lost by one. No need to go into the hows or whys; suffice to say, that is how I am named by some.', '', 23968, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mr. Combs, the ship\'s engineer and quartermaster, can furnish you with whatever supplies you might require. He is a fair tinker, too, if your gear is in need of repair.', '', 23967, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should you desire sustenance, Galley Chief Grace can tend to your needs.', '', 23966, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, that\'s her name, and a fine ship she is.$b$bThere\'s much to learn from such vessels, you know. A great poet once said: Ships that pass in the night, and speak each other in passing, only a signal shown, and a distant voice in the darkness; So on the ocean of life, we pass and speak one another, only a look and a voice, then darkness again and a silence.', '', 23965, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Stash?\"', '\"Stash?\"', 23964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goods & Gear', 'Goods & Gear', 23963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food & Drink', 'Food & Drink', 23962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lady Mehley', 'The Lady Mehley', 23961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the majestic Lady Mehley. I am Captain Torgoley.$b$bIf you\'ve questions about the ship, feel free to ask; otherwise, please, enjoy the journey, as I always do... After all, to quote a favorite scribe of mine: My experience of ships is that on them one makes an interesting discovery about the world. One finds one can do without it completely.', '', 23960, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('The Lady Mehley is in Theramore enough that we\'ve been assigned to guard her passengers.', 'The Lady Mehley is in Theramore enough that we\'ve been assigned to guard her passengers.', 23959, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must keep my eyes on ship and crew, good $gsir:madame;. You must forgive my not pausing to speak with you.', '', 23958, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There aren\'t many of us left, $n.  The return of our old enemy is a cause for great concern.', '', 23957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torgoley works us hard, but he\'s a good captain, aye.', '', 23956, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine day fer sailin\', innit?', '', 23955, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t ya see I\'m workin\' here, $glad:lass;? Off with ya, afore Kowalski sees me jawin.\'', 23954, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve little time for talk, sorry.', '', 23953, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Times are changing, $n.  War has arrived.$B$BWill our people rise to the occasion and aid our allies... or will we linger in the sidelines?', '', 23952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye aye, Mr. Kowalski.', '', 23951, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swabbin\' decks cured my rickets!', '', 23950, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lady Mehley is the best ship EVER!', '', 23949, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swab the decks!', '', 23948, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cap\'n Stash is the BEST!', '', 23947, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, all. Please bring us safely to our next port.', '', 23946, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Mr. Kowalski! You may return to your post to oversee docking!', '', 23945, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Stash! We\'ll be arriving shortly, sir!', '', 23944, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring us into port, please, Mr. Mehran.', '', 23943, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Mr. Henders.', '', 23942, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Land ho, Mr. Kowalski! Port is in sight, sir!', '', 23941, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mind is gradually opened as you focus on the orb before you....', '', 23940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not yet attuned to the scrying orb.', '', 23939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow the orb to take you where it will....', 'Allow the orb to take you where it will....', 23938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you peer into the orb, you feel a familiar force tugging at your mind.', '', 23937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be still, mortals, and hearken to my words.', '', 23936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
