('Brewfest is the perfect holiday!  But it\'s got one catch, Dark Iron dwarf attacks.  They happen nearly every half-hour!$b$bThe attackers target the kegs that dispense the FREE brew!  And it\'s really good brew that the brewmasters are giving out!$b$bLook, if you\'re around when the Dark Iron dwarves show up, lend a hand and protect the FREE brew.', '', 23839, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something\'s got those Dark Iron Dwarves riled up.  They show up almost every half-hour, break all the kegs, and leave!$b$bSo you\'re probably asking, \"Why should I care?\"$b$bI\'ll tell you...  Because the kegs they break stop us from giving out free brew!  You heard me right, free brew!$b$bSo if you are around when those dwarves show up, take a minute and help protect the kegs.', '', 23838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
