('Here\'s a gold, buy yourself something nice.', 'Here\'s a gold, buy yourself something nice.', 23829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re going to pull off a stunt on Jack in front of his boys?$B$BThat takes a good amount of... stupidity.  Well, it\'s going to cost you.  I\'m not going to risk my life for anything less than a gold.  And you best wait til I\'m out of the way before you make a move.', 23828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
