('May Tayutka repay you and your village.', '', 23793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Akiaruk.  We\'d heard of your kindness even in Iskaal.', '', 23792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You aid us in our time of need.  May the oceans provide you a plentiful catch.', '', 23791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We lost everything, brother.  We thank Kamagua for giving us shelter.', '', 23790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Feed the grub to the rock falcon.>', '<Feed the grub to the rock falcon.>', 23789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The falcon squawks hungrily for a grub.>', '', 23788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The creature pecks at your hand.>', '', 23787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shut your trap, you feathered idiot!  These pirates will cut you open and wear you for a hat!', '', 23786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Sqwaaak!*  Shut up, stupid bird!  You\'ll get us all killed!  *Cawwwww!*', '', 23785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Caw!*  Talk like a pirate!  Yarrr! *Sqwaaaaak!*', '', 23784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Squawk!*  Ahoy!  Look at me pirate disguise!  Yarrrr!  *Sqwak!*', '', 23783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tell ya, the only proper way to hunt is when yer good an\' goggled!', '', 23782, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vexallus overloads!', '', 23781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[NODE 5] DEPARTING - PLEASE NOTE THAT NODE 5 HAS NO ARRIVAL EVENT.', '', 23780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[NODE 4] DEPARTING', '', 23779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[NODE 4] ARRIVING', '', 23778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[NODE 3] DEPARTING', '', 23777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[NODE 3] ARRIVING', '', 23776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[NODE 2] DEPARTING', '', 23775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[NODE 2] ARRIVING', '', 23774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[NODE 1] DEPARTING', '', 23773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[NODE 1] ARRIVING', '', 23772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep!', 'Yep!', 23771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wanna take a ride?', '', 23770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would love to read it to you!\n\nDo not stand at my grave and weep,\nI am not there, I do not sleep.\n\nI am in a thousand winds that blow,\nacross Northrend\'s bright and shining snow.\n\nI am the gentle showers of rain,\non Westfall\'s fields of golden grain.\n\nI am in the morning hush,\nof Stranglethorn\'s jungle, green and lush.\n\nI am in the drums loud and grand,\nthe thunderous hooves across Nagrand.\n\nI am the stars warmly gleaming,\nover Darnassus softly dreaming.\n\nI am in the birds that sing,\nI am in each lovely thing.\n\nDo not stand at my grave and cry,\nI am not there. I do not die.\n ', 23769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you read me Alicia\'s poem again?', 'Can you read me Alicia\'s poem again?', 23768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, Light of Elune be with you.', 23767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey hey, don\'t forget to grab yourself some Brewfest souvenirs! We got everything from traditional holiday garb to mini-kegs of tasty brew. Just talk to Blix Fixwidget, but make sure you got plenty of Brewfest Prize Tokens on hand... it\'s the only way to buy them! You can earn prize tokens by helping out around the Brewfest Grounds.', '', 23766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone loves those crazy Brewfest racing rams. Want to know more? Talk to Driz Tumblequick down by the ram stable. Have a blast and earn some Brewfest Prize Tokens while you\'re at it!', '', 23765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewfest is all about the beer and the eats, and it don\'t get any better than what we\'re serving up. Think I\'m lying? Just check out all the tasty brews, sausages, pretzels, and cheeses we got. You\'ll see: Best chow around, and it don\'t get any cheaper!', '', 23764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, welcome to Brewfest! There\'s a mess of ways to keep yourself entertained in there, so you got any questions, you let me know. Otherwise, go buy some beer and a pretzel!', '', 23763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ram racing is one of the great traditions of Brewfest. Speak to Pol Amberstill down by the ram stable if you want to learn more. It\'s a right hoot AND can be a great way to earn Brewfest Prize Tokens!', '', 23762, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BY FIRE BE PURGED! Hey what\'s up?', '', 23761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next to the beer and sausage, the most popular part of Brewfest is the souvenirs! From traditional holiday garb to mini-kegs of tasty brew, all sorts of Brewfest-themed items are available from Belbi Quikswitch. Just be sure to have plenty of Brewfest Prize Tokens on hand, as it\'s the only way to buy them! You can earn prize tokens by helping out around the Brewfest Grounds.', '', 23760, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewfest is all about enjoying the very best food and drink in the lands, and that\'s no exaggeration! Just take a gander at the many invigorating hand-crafted beers and holiday sausages, pretzels, and cheeses available. You\'ll find nothing better, and for so little coin!', '', 23759, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r. I am Hidalgo, master of the hunt and world class falconer. This killing machine that you see perched atop my shoulder is Excelsior.$B$BYou might be thinking to yourself, \"What does a falconer even do?\" Well I\'ll tell you what we do - we hunt! Falconry is the art of using a bird of prey to hunt and catch game. Perhaps you are interested in learning to hunt with a trained raptor? Hidalgo can teach you such things!', '', 23758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ram Racing', 'Ram Racing', 23757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tokens & Souvenirs', 'Tokens & Souvenirs', 23756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food & Drink', 'Food & Drink', 23755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, friend, to the Brewfest Grounds! There\'s much to enjoy here while we celebrate the spirit of friendly competition between rival breweries. If you have any questions, let me know!', '', 23754, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to channel from the nearby Fel Crystal. Destroy it!', '', 23753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vexallus discharges pure energy!', '', 23752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s listens impatiently...', '', 23751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods silently...', '', 23750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sighs...', '', 23749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... did I tell you about the time that I explored the far reaches of Dire Maul?', '', 23748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... the city was burned, a scorched ruin of what it once was. The armies of the undead rose where the people had once lived.', '', 23747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... the burning sands of Silithus scorched my face as we battled wave after wave of Silithid.', '', 23746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... not to forget that time I ventured deep within the forests of Zul\'Aman.', '', 23745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('..with a mighty blow, I slew a Murloc, freeing the orb from his cold, slimy hands!', '', 23744, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, deep within the pockets of a Troll was the beautiful gem, which I sold for a handsome price!', '', 23743, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, I crafted this breastplate with my own hands, toiling for hours upon the forge.', '', 23742, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found a mighty axe there, freshly forged upon the fire.', '', 23741, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was when I slew the Orc with a great slash and took away these spaulders.', '', 23740, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... and have I told you about the time when I ventured deep into the heart of Blackrock Mountain?', '', 23739, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, Becca, just leave them in the garden next to the bush. Watch out for wolves!', 23738, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm... well, just be careful, he might be sweet on you. I don\'t trust that sister of his either...', 23737, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s replants the herbs nearby.', 23736, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', ' I am sure a noble soldier of the Alliance has better things on his mind. Oh! Elenna found some herbs so I\'m going to go pick them up.', 23735, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That William is so funny. His face always turns bright red.', 23734, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d better ask before I go herbing this time. I don\'t want to get attacked by another wolf.', 23733, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nah, I can handle it. Thanks.', 23732, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, thank you! I\'ll be sure to go get them soon.', 23731, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi, William, what\'s up?', 23730, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, but I\'m not very hungry right now.', '', 23729, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My brother simply must try these.', 23728, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, these apples are utterly delicious!', 23727, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s turns slightly red and walks away.', '', 23726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! If you uh, need any help, just come pick me up... I mean, come get me and I\'ll help!', '', 23725, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi, uh, Becanna, I mean... uh, Elenna found some herbs! Can you go pick them up?', '', 23723, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Odd, she\'s usually here...', '', 23722, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s takes a deep breath.', '', 23721, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, I\'ll tell her.', '', 23720, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Why do you want me to do it?', '', 23719, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, just do it.', 23718, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('%s grumbles something under his breath.', '', 23717, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Settle down, will ya! No need to be gettin\' all riled up over nothin\'! Remember what happened last time? Now sit down!', '', 23716, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it! That\'s it! I\'ve had just \'bout enough of ya, brother! Ya had to bring in our pappy, didn\'t ya! Stand up and fight! I don\'t wanna belt ya while yer sittin\' and then hear ya cryin\' \'bout it later!', '', 23715, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because they\'re made of iron ya big dummy! Ya ain\'t got none of da senses pappy left me with - that\'s for darn sure!', '', 23714, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unlikely, eh!? Pray tell why you be thinkin\' that, brother, when I know it be true in me bones!', '', 23713, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'William, I saw a fresh growth of herbs out on the ridge. Go ask Becanna to pick them up.', 23712, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s highly unlikely, brother.', '', 23711, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twas those iron cousins of ours! For certain!', '', 23710, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, Goodie, lets go scout the area.', 23709, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dun think nothin\', Wad! I know who\'d do such a heinous thing!', '', 23708, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who do ya think dun it, Needlemeyer?', '', 23707, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozzer, old boy!  Here comes daddy!', '', 23706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarrrrrrr!  Ye\'ll never get me spyglass, bilgesucker!', '', 23705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damn shame what they did to that rug.', 23704, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s shakes her head.', 23703, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t just come and do this to a dwarf\'s rug! You just don\'t do things like that!', '', 23702, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey hey, it\'s another $c! Welcome to my annual Brewfest celebration... now go feast and drink some!', '', 23701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s up, friend? Welcome to the Brewfest Grounds! Now go buy some drinks!', '', 23700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s BLOWIN\' my mind!', '', 23699, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, and welcome to Brewfest. Come in and have a drink or three!', '', 23698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who or what would do something like this, man?!', '', 23697, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you really think that by facing me, you have any hope of saving your friends?', '', 23696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish child, you will not stop what I have set in motion! Now, meet your doom!', '', 23694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, good $c! Welcome to Ironforge\'s annual Brewfest celebration!', '', 23693, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, friend! Welcome to the Brewfest Grounds!', '', 23692, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ho there, and welcome to Brewfest!', '', 23691, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse that frog!  Yes, I joined the Southsea crew - you want to make something of it, mate?  I\'ll cut you down here and now!', '', 23690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarrrr!', '', 23689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um...', '', 23688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick, $n!  Put on your disguise!', '', 23687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Official Explorers\' League business, McGoyver. Take me to the Explorers\' League Outpost!', 'Official Explorers\' League business, McGoyver. Take me to the Explorers\' League Outpost!', 23686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarp? Yar wannar fly? Narp... No-no-no-norp gonnarp ha-hap-hap-happen!', '', 23685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 399, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy, umm.... \"matey!\"  This is the $g fellow : gal; I was telling you about, \"me bucko!\"  $g He : She;\'s a real \"terror of the seas!\"', '', 23684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So eager to be rescued, but no one came now did they?', '', 23683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more chatter for you.', '', 23682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scalawag Point is just ahead.  I\'m just gonna lie down for a spell, if ye don\'t mind.  Me head is killin\' me.', 'Scalawag Point is just ahead.  I\'m just gonna lie down for a spell, if ye don\'t mind.  Me head is killin\' me.', 23681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your sacrifice will fuel our efforts.', '', 23680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How disappointing; no resistance.', '', 23679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plucked ripe off the vine.', '', 23678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Lich King!', '', 23677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly away little soul.', '', 23676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahahahahaha!', '', 23675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure they\'re quite wonderful.  If you don\'t mind I have some drinking to get back to.  You coming, $n?', 'I\'m sure they\'re quite wonderful.  If you don\'t mind I have some drinking to get back to.  You coming, $n?', 23674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this yer friend, Grezzix?  $g He : She; doesn\'t look very... piratey.', 'Is this yer friend, Grezzix?  $g He : She; doesn\'t look very... piratey.', 23673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yohoho!', 'Yohoho!', 23672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I \'eard Terry fenced one of \'em pictures for a thousand gold.  Maybe I can get in some of that artwork dealin\' too!', 'I \'eard Terry fenced one of \'em pictures for a thousand gold.  Maybe I can get in some of that artwork dealin\' too!', 23671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kiss the gunner\'s daughter?  Why I haven\'t ever met the lass...', 'Kiss the gunner\'s daughter?  Why I haven\'t ever met the lass...', 23670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s always room for one more.', '', 23669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have so many wonders to show you.', '', 23668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life for the Lich King!', '', 23667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, little one. Come to play?', '', 23666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...so he says \"Of course I\'m not seeing double!  I\'ve only got one eye!\"', '...so he says \"Of course I\'m not seeing double!  I\'ve only got one eye!\"', 23665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More ingredients to fuel our rituals here.', '', 23664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You too will serve the Lich King.', '', 23663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So eager to die are we?', '', 23662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent, another sacrificial lamb.', '', 23661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...that scurvy dog had two peg legs, a hook for a left hand, two glass eyes and a wooden nose!', '...that scurvy dog had two peg legs, a hook for a left hand, two glass eyes and a wooden nose!', 23660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab a seat and \'ave a drink, mate!  Grab me one while yer at it!', 'Grab a seat and \'ave a drink, mate!  Grab me one while yer at it!', 23659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
