('Would you really drink brew from an orc or an ogre?  For a better choice check out T\'chali\'s Voodoo Brewery at Brewfest!', 'Would you really drink brew from an orc or an ogre?  For a better choice check out T\'chali\'s Voodoo Brewery at Brewfest!', 23524, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join with your brothers and sisters at Drohn\'s Distillery and drink for the horde!', 'Join with your brothers and sisters at Drohn\'s Distillery and drink for the horde!', 23523, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you think an orc can hit hard, check out their brew, it hits even harder!  See for yourself at Drohn\'s Distillery, only at Brewfest!', 'If you think an orc can hit hard, check out their brew, it hits even harder!  See for yourself at Drohn\'s Distillery, only at Brewfest!', 23522, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Celebrate Brewfest with orcs that know what a good drink really is!  Check out Drohn\'s Distillery at Brewfest!', 'Celebrate Brewfest with orcs that know what a good drink really is!  Check out Drohn\'s Distillery at Brewfest!', 23521, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drohn\'s Distillery knows how to party hard!  Check them out at Brewfest!', 'Drohn\'s Distillery knows how to party hard!  Check them out at Brewfest!', 23520, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'chali\'s Voodoo Brewery has the best brew you can find!  They were voted \"Best Brew\" by the Goblin Brew Weekly!', 'T\'chali\'s Voodoo Brewery has the best brew you can find!  They were voted \"Best Brew\" by the Goblin Brew Weekly!', 23519, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you wanna live life to the fullest, you gotta try T\'chali\'s Voodoo Brew!', 'If you wanna live life to the fullest, you gotta try T\'chali\'s Voodoo Brew!', 23518, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you!  T\'chali\'s Voodoo Brewers have got a brew that won\'t kill you!  But they\'ve also got a brew that might...', 'Hey you!  T\'chali\'s Voodoo Brewers have got a brew that won\'t kill you!  But they\'ve also got a brew that might...', 23517, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We drink for the Horde!  Do you drink for the Horde?  Come show us at Drohn\'s Distillery!', 'We drink for the Horde!  Do you drink for the Horde?  Come show us at Drohn\'s Distillery!', 23516, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drohn\'s Distillery has the best brew money can buy!  They were voted \"Outstanding Brew\" by Monthly Goblin Brew!', 'Drohn\'s Distillery has the best brew money can buy!  They were voted \"Outstanding Brew\" by Monthly Goblin Brew!', 23515, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drohn\'s brew is the stuff legends are made of!  Come taste the legend!', 'Drohn\'s brew is the stuff legends are made of!  Come taste the legend!', 23514, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you, the tall one...  Want to put some hair on your chest?  Drohn\'s Distillery can help you out!', 'Hey you, the tall one...  Want to put some hair on your chest?  Drohn\'s Distillery can help you out!', 23513, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey mon, you ready to try da best brew in all da realms?', '', 23512, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t find a better brew in Azeroth.', '', 23511, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm....', 'Hmm....', 23510, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t going to end well.', 'This isn\'t going to end well.', 23509, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Normal dogs won\'t come anywhere near me nowadays.  I was devastated when I found out... I used to love the beasts.$B$BPlaguehounds make for a fine substitute, however.  They\'re not quite as... easy on the eyes.  But then again, neither am I!', '', 23508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, we\'re not busy right now. We could start building a coffin for you...', 'You know, we\'re not busy right now. We could start building a coffin for you...', 23507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give \'im hell for us!', 'Give \'im hell for us!', 23506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to face Shatterhorn? You\'re brave, I\'ll give you that.', 'You\'re going to face Shatterhorn? You\'re brave, I\'ll give you that.', 23505, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we don\'t expand the mine, there\'s no way we\'ll get all the ore we need. Captain Adams\'ll have our hides!', 'If we don\'t expand the mine, there\'s no way we\'ll get all the ore we need. Captain Adams\'ll have our hides!', 23504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t the foreman say he was going to bring some guards? Where are they?', 'Didn\'t the foreman say he was going to bring some guards? Where are they?', 23503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoah!  Walk by again girl!', '', 23502, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, hey!  Nice build you got there honey!', '', 23501, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey tough stuff! Hey, $c! Do you like money?  I\'m loaded!  How about you come over here and check out my gold coins?', '', 23500, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo! Big lady! You think you\'re big enough to handle me?', '', 23499, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Sweet cheeks, over here!', '', 23498, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, hey sweet thing!  Looking good!', '', 23497, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s with your crazy goggles?', 'What\'s with your crazy goggles?', 23496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear you\'re looking for Keg Protector marks.  What are those?', 'I hear you\'re looking for Keg Protector marks.  What are those?', 23495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got Keg Protector marks to redeem...', 'I\'ve got Keg Protector marks to redeem...', 23494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw you across the way and was hoping you were going to stop by. So what can I do for you sweetie?', '', 23493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for all sorts of things honey!  But those marks you are talking about, the Keg Protector marks?  Those show me that you know how to handle yourself in a fight.$b$bEvery time you take down a Dark Iron dwarf, you get a mark.  For every mark you have, I\'ll give you a prize ticket.$b$bIt pains me to give these tickets away, but it also means I get to see you again, and see you leave again...', 'I\'m looking for all sorts of things honey!  But those marks you are talking about, the Keg Protector marks?  Those show me that you know how to handle yourself in a fight.$b$bEvery time you take down a Dark Iron dwarf, you get a mark.  For every mark you have, I\'ll give you a prize ticket.$b$bIt pains me to give these tickets away, but it also means I get to see you again, and see you leave again...', 23492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 24, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey friend, what I\'ve got here is a breakthrough, the likes of which have never been seen! And it\'s for sale, for cheap!$b$bYou see, I got tired of spending money in taverns looking for the perfect person. So I made these goggles and now EVERYONE looks like pure perfection. I mean you CAN\'T go wrong with these puppies!$b$bSo, you wanna try these out, help pad my pockets a bit? Since you look soo good, I\'ll even give you a discount!', '', 23491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it boys!  Now back to the Grim Guzzler and we\'ll drink to the $3151W that were injuredl!', '', 23490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RETREAT!!  We\'ve taken a beating and had $3151W casualties!  We can\'t keep taking these losses!  FALL BACK!!', '', 23489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We built this place with our bare hands! Blood and tears, my friend.$B$BBelieve me when I tell you this: We have no plans on ever giving up our hold on Valgarde.', '', 23488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t show you anything else, kid. Go find Zebig in Thrallmar - that\'s in Hellfire Peninsula. He can teach you more than I can!', '', 23487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t show you anything else, kid. Go find Lebowski in Honor Hold - that\'s in Hellfire Peninsula. He can teach you more than I can!', '', 23486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mojo leaps into $n\'s pocket!', '', 23485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feelin\' a little froggy, are ya?', '', 23484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your lily pad or mine?', '', 23483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, $n, I know of a little swamp not too far from here....', '', 23482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s just never enough Mojo to go around...', '', 23481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I promise not to give you warts...', '', 23480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This won\'t take long, did it?', '', 23479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s what I call froggy-style!', '', 23478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought you\'d never ask!', '', 23477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall end your life and bind you to his service!', 'I shall end your life and bind you to his service!', 23476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cold darkness awaits your soul!', 'The cold darkness awaits your soul!', 23475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your spirit shall find no rest in these lands!', 'Your spirit shall find no rest in these lands!', 23474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take great pleasure in slaughtering you, $c!', 'I will take great pleasure in slaughtering you, $c!', 23473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall see if you are a worthy opponent!', 'We shall see if you are a worthy opponent!', 23472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll send your soul to the afterlife little one!', 'I\'ll send your soul to the afterlife little one!', 23471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life ends now invader!', 'Your life ends now invader!', 23470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you feel the magic?  Thunderbrew brewmasters are on the loose!  Check them out at Brewfest!', 'Can you feel the magic?  Thunderbrew brewmasters are on the loose!  Check them out at Brewfest!', 23469, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes you want to party hard, Thunderbrew\'s got ya covered!  Check them out at Brewfest!', 'Sometimes you want to party hard, Thunderbrew\'s got ya covered!  Check them out at Brewfest!', 23468, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewfest has called down the thunder!  Thunderbrew, that is!', 'Brewfest has called down the thunder!  Thunderbrew, that is!', 23467, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Barleybrew will treat you right!  Check out the Barleybrews at Brewfest!', 'Barleybrew will treat you right!  Check out the Barleybrews at Brewfest!', 23466, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barleybrew brew!  Won\'t fill you up, won\'t kill you...  The Thunderbrews can\'t say the same.', 'Barleybrew brew!  Won\'t fill you up, won\'t kill you...  The Thunderbrews can\'t say the same.', 23465, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check out the 3-B entertainment! Brewfest\'s Barleybrew Brewmasters!', 'Check out the 3-B entertainment! Brewfest\'s Barleybrew Brewmasters!', 23464, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to purchase a Brewfest riding ram.', 'I\'d like to purchase a Brewfest riding ram.', 23463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you earn enough Brewfest prize tickets, the ticket redeemer in the Brewfest camp can give you an \"Honorary Brewer\" hand stamp.$b$bThat stamp will allow me to sell you a Brewfest riding ram. But they don\'t come cheap, mind you!', 'If you earn enough Brewfest prize tickets, the ticket redeemer in the Brewfest camp can give you an \"Honorary Brewer\" hand stamp.$b$bThat stamp will allow me to sell you a Brewfest riding ram. But they don\'t come cheap, mind you!', 23462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there a way to purchase one?', 'Is there a way to purchase one?', 23461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I presume you come with good news?', 'I presume you come with good news?', 23460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are going as planned, Lord Falconcrest. I assure you, it is only a matter of time.', 'Things are going as planned, Lord Falconcrest. I assure you, it is only a matter of time.', 23459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odd, I would have thought you\'d have found something useful on those Scourge that might help us deal with the scourging crystals.$B$BIf I may strongly suggest, and I do, $c, go back down to the beach and continue to slaughter them until you do find something of use to me.', 23458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been saving this just for you, big boy!', '', 23457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes? What is it?$B$BTime waits for no one!', 23456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This end have I reached before.  What new adventure lies in store?', '', 23455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, that\'s strange, $c. I would have thought you\'d have found something connected with those scourging crystals.$B$BWe really should find a way to bring down their shields and destroy them. You think you could go back out there and kill some more Scourge until you find something?', '', 23454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ram racing is easier than it seems, but it takes skill to master. Just use the reins, eat apples if you can and avoid exhausting your ram.\n\n', 'Ram racing is easier than it seems, but it takes skill to master. Just use the reins, eat apples if you can and avoid exhausting your ram.', 23453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keeping your ram in a canter or gallop for too long will exhaust him. If you want your ram to recover a bit, let him walk or trot. If there are apple bushels around, take him there to recover.\n\n', 'Keeping your ram in a canter or gallop for too long will exhaust him. If you want your ram to recover a bit, let him walk or trot. If there are apple bushels around, take him there to recover.', 23452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you start loosening the reins on the ram, you\'ll see his speed change. He starts off walking. Ease up on the reins a bit more and he\'ll start to trot. Give him more slack on the reins while he\'s trotting and he\'ll go into a canter. Give him even more slack while he\'s in a canter and you will send him into a gallop.\n\n', 'Once you start loosening the reins on the ram, you\'ll see his speed change. He starts off walking. Ease up on the reins a bit more and he\'ll start to trot. Give him more slack on the reins while he\'s trotting and he\'ll go into a canter. Give him even more slack while he\'s in a canter and you will send him into a gallop.', 23451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you get a ram, you also get the reins. These aren\'t your grandma\'s reins though, you\'ve gotta use them!$b$bJust loosen up on the reins a few times to build up some speed.  Keep on loosening up and GIDDYUP!  You\'ll be flying!$b$bBut the faster he goes the quicker he\'ll get tired. So you have to be careful.\n', 'When you get a ram, you also get the reins. These aren\'t your grandma\'s reins though, you\'ve gotta use them!$b$bJust loosen up on the reins a few times to build up some speed.  Keep on loosening up and GIDDYUP!  You\'ll be flying!$b$bBut the faster he goes the quicker he\'ll get tired. So you have to be careful.\n', 23450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you take one of these tasks, we\'ll lend you a ram. It\'s a loan, so it won\'t last forever. The ram may seem slow, but just ease up on the reins a bit and he\'ll pick up the pace.$b$bOur rams love apples. We\'ve put a few bushels of apples out along the way, so make sure to stop by. Eating apples will make your ram forget about how tired he\'s been getting.', 'When you take one of these tasks, we\'ll lend you a ram. It\'s a loan, so it won\'t last forever. The ram may seem slow, but just ease up on the reins a bit and he\'ll pick up the pace.$b$bOur rams love apples. We\'ve put a few bushels of apples out along the way, so make sure to stop by. Eating apples will make your ram forget about how tired he\'s been getting.', 23449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That all sounds very complicated...', 'That all sounds very complicated...', 23448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I tire my ram out?', 'Can I tire my ram out?', 23447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s with the different speeds?', 'What\'s with the different speeds?', 23446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I make my ram go faster?', 'How do I make my ram go faster?', 23445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I get a free mount?', 'Do I get a free mount?', 23444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there!  Are you interested in learning some more about racing rams and ram racing?', 'Hey there!  Are you interested in learning some more about racing rams and ram racing?', 23443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have another question.', 'I have another question.', 23442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your voice down, $c. We wouldn\'t want them to hear us.', '', 23441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s with your crazy goggles?', 'What\'s with your crazy goggles?', 23440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 24, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear you\'re looking for Keg Protector marks.  What are those?', 'I hear you\'re looking for Keg Protector marks.  What are those?', 23439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t she a beauty? Want to take her for a spin?', '', 23438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you want to know what I\'m looking for?  I like that... I\'m looking for someone strong and courageous.  Brains are one thing, but you\'ve gotta be able to back it up with some muscle.$b$bWhenever those pesky Dark Iron dwarves attack, you can attack them by throwing a mug at them.  Just down it and throw.  Simple.$b$bFor every dwarf you down, you\'ll be marked.  Talk to me and I\'ll give you a prize ticket for every mark you have.', 'So you want to know what I\'m looking for?  I like that... I\'m looking for someone strong and courageous.  Brains are one thing, but you\'ve gotta be able to back it up with some muscle.$b$bWhenever those pesky Dark Iron dwarves attack, you can attack them by throwing a mug at them.  Just down it and throw.  Simple.$b$bFor every dwarf you down, you\'ll be marked.  Talk to me and I\'ll give you a prize ticket for every mark you have.', 23437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 24, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, good looking!  What can I do to help you out?', 23436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 24, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s and Investigator Asric glare at each other silently, their eyes narrowed.', '', 23435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pompous, uptight windbag.', '', 23434, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incompetent, sniveling dandy.', '', 23433, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course. My methods are questionable. It was my methodology, I\'ll note, that exposed that \"Griftah\" as a fraud in the first place! You had only to keep the peace, and you failed in that simple task!', '', 23432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Had we been fully handling the investigation, I assure you, the evidence would have remained safe. Instead, we used your highly questionable methods...', '', 23431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My services were rendered. The protection of the city is not my jurisdiction. I believe that\'s why they call you \"peacekeepers?\"', '', 23430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must have taken leave of my senses, allowing a Scryer to aid in such a delicate operation...', '', 23429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never want to see this nasty pond again. Thank you, $n. I\'ll never forget you!', 23428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank goodness you came along when you did. Please, take one of these troll boxes to remember me by.', 23427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was just terrible. I was all slimy, and I kept licking my eyes!', 23426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! Back to my beautiful self? How lovely! I thought I would be a frog forever.', 23425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may want to consider leaving this place. I think being transformed into a frog is one of the better things that can happen to one here.', '', 23424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
