('Why isn\'t there beer-flavored candy?!', 'Why isn\'t there beer-flavored candy?!', 23290, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth has many strange traditions. This one, I like.', 'Azeroth has many strange traditions. This one, I like.', 23289, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This time of year is quite important to our Forsaken allies.', 'This time of year is quite important to our Forsaken allies.', 23288, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know... why DO we celebrate this holiday?', 'You know... why DO we celebrate this holiday?', 23287, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should go trick or treating later.', 'We should go trick or treating later.', 23286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I\'ve eaten too much candy...', 'I think I\'ve eaten too much candy...', 23285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Happy Hallow\'s End!', 'Happy Hallow\'s End!', 23284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barrels like these are unique in this region. Short, round....', '', 23283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strange... these mosaics don\'t resemble any known troll traditions.', '', 23282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashes and charred bones, most unsettling. I must take a sample.', '', 23281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? A broken tooth. Likely from a giant cat of some sort. Odd....', '', 23280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One can learn volumes about a culture by studying its refuse.', '', 23279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trash packaged, stacked and neatly set aside. Such order in contrast with extreme barbarity... remarkable.', '', 23278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh. Matted clumps of hair, molted feathers, bits of bone, partially burnt material - clothing perhaps?', '', 23277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes, I\'m quite certain this represents a melding of entities. Fascinating.', '', 23276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This statuary is a significant departure from previous troll effigies.', '', 23275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting use of materials here. Rich color, strong lines, deep symbolism.... striking.', '', 23274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puzzling. They\'re clearly harnessing great power from their sacrifices. But for what?', '', 23273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These fires have been burning steadily for years. Unusual dedication for trolls.', '', 23272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. The significance of this bird eludes me.', '', 23271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mummified trolls... hastily embalmed by the looks of them.', '', 23270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LOOK AT ME, I\'M RANDOMIZING! HERE IT COMES (IN 5 SECONDS)!', '', 23268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You blame the peacekeepers for your failure? You were entrusted with a simple task. The troll was obviously a fraud!', '', 23267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought it was secure! If your peacekeepers had the clout to control the thieves of this city, this wouldn\'t have happened!', '', 23266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could you have lost the evidence?!', '', 23265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('During Hallow\'s End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity.', 'During Hallow\'s End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity.', 23264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow\'s End instead of a real one, but it\'s their holiday.', 'I don\'t know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow\'s End instead of a real one, but it\'s their holiday.', 23263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them.', 'I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them.', 23262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?', 'The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?', 23261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities.', 'To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities.', 23260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Hallow\'s End is over we\'ll smash all these pumpkins. That\'ll be the greatest day I\'ve ever known!', 'When Hallow\'s End is over we\'ll smash all these pumpkins. That\'ll be the greatest day I\'ve ever known!', 23259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All this free candy is just bad business, I tell you. Or... maybe it\'s just a loss leader... they get you in the inn, and then gouge you on the meat. It\'s brilliant!', 'All this free candy is just bad business, I tell you. Or... maybe it\'s just a loss leader... they get you in the inn, and then gouge you on the meat. It\'s brilliant!', 23258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!', 'Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!', 23257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!', 'We\'re celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!', 23256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know.', 'I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know.', 23255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker.', 'Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker.', 23254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da spirits gonna feast today! Begin da ceremonies, sacrifice da prisoners... make room for our new guests!', '', 23253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More intruders! Sound da alarm!', '', 23252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahaha, ya see this? Griftah\'s BACK! Back in my stall, back with my old wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!$b$bWant to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin\'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!', '', 23251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks toward the summoning stones and sighs.', '', 23250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s stares off to the Northeast!', '', 23249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There we go, the Rune of Command... hopefully. Not nearly as vicious as its Iron Dwarf cousin, but functional.', '', 23248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m omitting the runes for \"north\" and \"west\" because I\'m not sure how they impact the giant. I\'m also including a rune to limit how long you can control it.', '', 23247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m only going to carve the runes I think will give you command over a giant.', '', 23246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you still need some help shipping kegs from Kharanos?', 'Do you still need some help shipping kegs from Kharanos?', 23245, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there! Just because I can race rams better than anyone else, doesn\'t mean I won\'t pitch in and help out the brewers. You can join me if you like.$b$bBut wait, there\'s more!$b$bHelping out with Brewfest means you get a chance to ride some of the fastest rams in the realms!', '', 23244, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Regardless, stay out of my way, and don\'t bother calling for me when you get yourself into trouble....', '', 23243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In fact, it would be best if you just stay here. You\'d only get in my way....', '', 23242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve researched this site extensively and I won\'t allow any dim-witted treasure hunters to swoop in and steal what belongs in a museum. I\'ll lead this charge.', '', 23241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m aware of the dangers of this place. Now move out of the way, I won\'t ask again.', 'I\'m aware of the dangers of this place. Now move out of the way, I won\'t ask again.', 23240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me guess, another group of Budd\'s riff-raff?$b$bAway with you, $r, before you get hurt - or worse.', '', 23239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the concern, but we intend to explore Zul\'Aman.', 'Thanks for the concern, but we intend to explore Zul\'Aman.', 23238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should do it. The gate\'s primary locking mechanism has been nullified.', '', 23237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All you be doin\' is wastin\' me time!', '', 23236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be da predator! You da prey...', '', 23235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya got nothin\'!', '', 23234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop your cryin\'!', '', 23233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t... kill... me spirit!', '', 23232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seemingly unphased by the nearby plague tank on fire, %s appears inspired.', '', 23231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shakes his head before continuing on with his research.', '', 23230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking around, %s frowns at what he considers the overreactions of his compatriots.', '', 23229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The plaguebringer sighs at the interruption.', '', 23228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh, a little fire. Everyone panic!', '', 23227, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! It could very well be an increase in temperature that perfects the plague!', '', 23226, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ignore that... we have work to do!', '', 23225, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fools! I knew they\'d try this, which is why I fire-proofed the plague tanks. Muahahahahaha!', '', 23224, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the toads? Unbelievable!', '', 23223, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, let\'s all run around like chickens with their heads cut off.', '', 23222, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance idiots! Don\'t they realize their efforts are futile?', '', 23221, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People, really, there\'s nothing to worry about!', '', 23220, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mebbe I should write a book... \'Harkor\'s Guide to Zul\'Aman\'. Yeah, I like the sound a\' that.', '', 23219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be days like today that make ye grateful fer the kindness of strangers - brings a tear to me eye.... Heh, nuthin a good pint won\'t fix.', '', 23218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This\'ll make fer a great a story to tell the grandkids, that\'s fer sure... if I be livin\' long enough to have any, that is.', '', 23217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That rescue came just in time. Ya shoulda seen what them brutes did to their prisoners....', '', 23216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I oughtta shuffle on down and poke around fer treasure while I\'m here - after all, what\'re the odds of a dwarf like me gettin\' pinched twice?', '', 23215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Quite an adventure, this. The boys back home won\'t believe a word of it....', '', 23214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if I\'ll ever be the same after this. Heh, nuthin\' a pint won\'t cure I\'ll wager.', '', 23213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya know, without so many of them burly trolls wanderin\' about this place can be downright pleasant.', '', 23212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde team is running out of reinforcements!', 'The Horde team is running out of reinforcements!', 23211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance team is running out of reinforcements!', 'The Alliance team is running out of reinforcements!', 23210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just lemme know if there be anything I can help ya with, mon.', '', 23209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya saved me, mon! I thought they be drownin\' me for sure.', '', 23208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s my bag! At last I\'ve found it and now it\'s my gift to you and I truly hope you like it because I want you to all remember this wonderful moment for as long as you live and I hope that when you think of it you\'ll smile inside because I know I\'ll never forget it in a million years and I can\'t wait to tell momma all about it when I get back home.... Do you like my earrings?', 23207, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nope, not in that one either - well, it must be around here somewhere, by the way, did I mention how wonderful it is to be out of that stinky cage? It was almost impossible to run around in there but I did anyway but sometimes I got going so fast that I ended up walking on the walls of the  cage so finally I stopped trying and just turned around in circles....', 23206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, sweety. We love you, too.', 23205, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s sighs at all of the cooking she still has to do today.', 23204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are those dock workers on break again?! I need those supplies!', 23203, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need more shoveltusk!', 23202, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Grumble> Pretty dress indeed! <Grumble>', 23201, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lissan! I bet that girl is daydreaming at the well again!', 23200, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You just can\'t get good help these days!', 23199, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lissan! Lissan White! Where is that girl?', 23198, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bartender hums a tune while working.', '', 23197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I love you too, snookums!', 23196, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love you, pooky!', '', 23195, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peppy, I swear you could drink a dwarf under the table.', '', 23194, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s that talking? I can barely see the top of your head. Are you sure that you\'re old enough to be drinking?', '', 23193, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh huh.', '', 23192, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think you\'ve had just about enough.', '', 23191, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s a pretty dressh, Celeste. You\'re sho pretty. I love you guys ...hic!', 23190, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should... you should send thish shtuff over to Petrov for his bombs!', 23189, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can whip up better than thish, Jashon.', 23188, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You done cleaning that mug yet ...hic?', 23187, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, bartender, another round!', 23186, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm, maybe it\'s this one - oh by the way, did I ever tell you about the time Fudgerick Two-toots snuck up on me while I was casting a fireball? We call him two-toots because, well, nevermind that, it was just terrible timing, and momma was soo mad - my eyebrows are just now growing back....', 23185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Weeee! I\'m alive, I\'m alive, I\'m alive! Oh, I hope it\'s not too forward of me to tell you that I think I love you all and I hope I can find my bag because you certainly deserve a little something extra, you know, for the effort and all that you must have went through to save me...', 23184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mebbe me fall... but da Amani empire... never going to die.', '', 23183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lot more going to fall like you.', '', 23182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Amani di chuka!', '', 23181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is why dey call me INVINCIBLE!', '', 23180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire kill you just as quick!', '', 23179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya don\' have to look to da sky to see da dragonhawk!', '', 23178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me introduce you to me new bruddas: fang and claw!', '', 23177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere be no hidin\' from da eagle!', '', 23176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got me some new tricks... like me brudda bear....', '', 23175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Zandalari give us strength. Nobody push around de Amani no more!', '', 23174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... be waitin\' on da udda side....', '', 23173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Amani gonna rule again!', '', 23172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now whatchoo got to say?', '', 23171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You had your chance; now it be too late!', '', 23170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make way for da Nalorakk!', '', 23169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call on da beast, you gonna get more dan you bargain for!', '', 23168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring da pain!', '', 23167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be dead soon enough!', '', 23166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Zul\'Aman!', 'Take me to Zul\'Aman!', 23165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna go to Zul\'Aman, mon? I be takin\' you der.', '', 23164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now! Do the bidding of your masters!', '', 23163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go!', 'I\'m ready to go!', 23162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can get you started on your journey to Northrend. Let me know when you are ready and I will teleport you to your starting point.', '', 23161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sure you all must be in a big hurry and probably have some more big dangerous monsters to kill but if you would just take a moment and come help me out of this cage before rushing off it would make me so happy and excited that I would barely be able to contain myself so if you get a moment I\'ll just be over here... waiting... patiently....', 23160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('', 'So... as much as I hate to complain after being saved from a horrible death I just thought you should know that I\'m still over here stuck in one of these messy cages and it would really be great if you could come on over and let me out so I could help you celebrate your amazing victory over that big crazy scary troll-cat... thing.', 23159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('', 'Ahem... so, I most certainly don\'t blame you for taking your time and catching your breath and congratulating yourselves for such heroism after such a long and hard-fought battle with that horrible monster just so long as when you\'re finished you don\'t forget about me over here because even though I\'m small I think I can still find some way to repay you for your amazing bravery....', 23158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('Of course.', '', 23157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wowee! It was amazing how you beat that big bad troll into the ground like that and it\'s too bad I can\'t reach the handle of this cage or I would have jumped in and blown him to bits to get him back for killing all of the other poor prisoners and scaring me so badly and I feel bad for asking you for any more help but could you maybe come over and let me out of here?', 23156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 1, 1, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('Of course. I found it on the corpse of a dwarf nearby.', '', 23155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s safe, little gnome. You can come out now.', 'It\'s safe, little gnome. You can come out now.', 23154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh hooray - you killed the bad troll just in time to save me from being helplessly slaughtered and having my innocent little soul enslaved and used to add power to their wicked scheme to take over Azeroth and seeing how you have risked your lives to free me from certain death I must repay your kindness regardless of who you are or where you may have come from so help me out of here and I will do my best to find some way to reward you....$b$b<Ashli takes a deep breath.>$b$bI hope you like candy....', 23153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shall we prepare it for you, my lord?', 23152, 0, 6616, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now watch, val\'kyr. Observe as I apply pressure. Can you see that it is not yet ripe? Watch as it pops and falls lifeless to the floor.', '', 23151, 0, 6616, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
