('Do you feel it, mortal? Death seeps through me, enveloping all that I touch. With just a snap of my finger your soul will languish in damnation for all eternity.', '', 23149, 0, 6616, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
