('The Headless Horseman lives in the Scarlet Monastery with all the other creepy ghosts and humans.', 'The Headless Horseman lives in the Scarlet Monastery with all the other creepy ghosts and humans.', 23023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say the barrel and buckets are for fighting fires.  Are you a fire fighter?', 'They say the barrel and buckets are for fighting fires.  Are you a fire fighter?', 23022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like to play in the water barrel but I\'m told it\'s not for children.', 'I like to play in the water barrel, but I\'m told it\'s not for children.', 23021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen the Headless Horseman?  If he comes here then I\'ll fight him and steal his pumpkin!', 'Have you seen the Headless Horseman?  If he comes here then I\'ll fight him and steal his pumpkin!', 23020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More souls for the Lich King! Come, little ones! Come!', '', 23019, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Firjus fears nothing! Release the combatants!', '', 23018, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We plaguebringers tend to be slightly more practical than the average apothecary.  After all, we deal with the logistics of deploying the plague.$B$BThat doesn\'t mean our theoretical background isn\'t rock solid.  We just prefer... hands on tasks.', '', 23017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ancient cipher falls to the ground.', '', 23016, 0, 6597, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nalorakk is dead, you\'re free to go.', 'Nalorakk is dead, you\'re free to go.', 23015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pleaase! Someone save poor ol\' Tanzar.', '', 23014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could be pickin\' this lock in my sleep, mon. Just come an\' say when it be safe to get away.', '', 23013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello out there. Anybody be hearin\' Tanzar?', '', 23012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You kill the trollbear, mon? It be safe for Tanzar to come out now?', '', 23011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey mon! Don\'t ya be forgettin\' about Tanzar over here.', '', 23010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one speaks of my mother in that manner!', '', 23009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Crude Vrykul] Bjorns mottar haelgond sygar!', '[Crude Vrykul] Bjorns mottar haelgond sygar!', 23008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear me, Arthas? The Argent Crusade comes for you! Your kingdom shall crumble beneath the weight of justice! By the Light!', '', 23007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s picks up the Ashbringer.', '', 23006, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you are right, Irulon. The price of our freedom will undoubtedly cost thousands more of their lives.', '', 23005, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It should have been me that carried the blade to Northrend. The burden was mine to bear.\n', '', 23004, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grimaces.', '', 23003, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The path of freedom has always been beset with tragedy, sire. We could not risk losing you. The Crusade could not have survived such a blow.', '', 23002, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their passing weighs heavily upon my soul.', '', 23001, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The boy\'s death and, in fact, the deaths of all of the knights involved in the redemption of the blade could have been avoided.', '', 23000, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s removes his disguise.', '', 22999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Fordring, you mustn\'t reveal yourself!', '', 22998, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will be enough, Irulon.', '', 22997, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be shy, now. Help yerselves. If it weren\'t fer yer help, them basterds\'d be shrinkin\' me head right about now.', '', 22996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A\'course it only be fair that I reward yeh fer me rescue. Now where\'d them savages put me satchel?', '', 22995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, freedom!', '', 22994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their defenses are down!  Attack!', 'Their defenses are down!  Attack!', 22993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feknut, please! I\'m sure that Petrov will be sending you more help soon.', 22992, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feknut please quiet down. You\'re giving me a headache.', 22991, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, you could think about doing the work yourself. That way you could get back to the keep more quickly.', 22990, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feknut! Enough!', 22989, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, and we all wish that you\'d stayed back at the keep.', 22988, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feknut, please stop. I\'m worried about Jaren and you\'re not helping.', 22987, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everything\'s going to be fine, Feknut. You\'ll see.', 22986, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh Feknut, hush!', 22985, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place was supposed to be safe! Instead we\'re in the middle of hungry worgs and the High Tinker only knows what!', '', 22984, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be down there working on the flying machines, not in charge of guano collection!', '', 22983, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Petrov promised me more help would be coming. What\'s taking so long?!', '', 22982, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is as far north as I go! Those spiders are huge!', '', 22981, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we get back, I\'m gonna kill Petrov!', '', 22980, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no way I\'m going into the Rivenwood; the place is haunted!', '', 22979, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That guano\'s not going to collect itself!', '', 22978, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s the help that I was promised?', '', 22977, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'d I ever let Petrov talk me into coming out here with these incompetent dwarves?!', '', 22976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good... More flesh for the harvest...', '', 22975, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Firjus was unworthy! Test your battle prowess against a true soldier of the Lich King!', '', 22974, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release the prisoners! Firjus will destroy them all!', '', 22973, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ring will overflow with the blood of the interlopers! Oluf has come!', '', 22972, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akil\'zon, the invaders approach!', '', 22971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t go leavin\' the job half done, now. Come an\' tell me if it be safe to make my escape!', '', 22970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yoohoo. Over here... the trapped dwarf. Come on, lemme have a word with yeh.', '', 22969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So.... How\'s about one \'a ya stroll on up \'ere an\' help me out, eh?', '', 22968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hallooo.... You just gunna sit down there an\' pat yerselves on the back? What kinda rescuers are ya?', '', 22967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pssst! Up \'ere, in the cage. Come and lemme get a look at yeh.', '', 22966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The coast is clear. You\'re free!', 'The coast is clear. You\'re free!', 22965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Spirit, come back to me!', '', 22964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fight wit\' untamed spirit....', '', 22963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Not a word to Grick about this! Do you hear me?', '', 22962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s absolutely nothing out of the ordinary about it.', '', 22961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beer! Mere beer!', '', 22960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s just...', '', 22959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a minute...', '', 22958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We battle for the glory of Ymiron! We die in the name of the Lich King!', '', 22957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May you die in the Lich King\'s favor!', '', 22956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand and be judged!', '', 22955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink in their misery, brother!', '', 22954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me! I am ready to die!', '', 22953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you a life debt, stranger.', 'I owe you a life debt, stranger.', 22952, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They took us one by one. I\'m sure there are other survivors.', 'They took us one by one. I\'m sure there are other survivors.', 22951, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strange ghosts walk the land. Be careful!', 'Strange ghosts walk the land. Be careful!', 22950, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should never have traveled through the Rivenwood. Everyone knows this!', 'We should never have traveled through the Rivenwood. Everyone knows this!', 22949, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved me from certain death. I owe you.', 'You saved me from certain death. I owe you.', 22948, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings of the spirits of the land and air upon you.', 'Blessings of the spirits of the land and air upon you.', 22947, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must return. Good hunting to you.', 'I must return. Good hunting to you.', 22946, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger.', 'Thank you, stranger.', 22945, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your wits about you, $r, we\'re surrounded by the walking dead here.', '', 22944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hungry? Can sleep here, too.', '', 22943, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thunderbrew, finest brewery in all the realms.  Check them out at Brewfest!', 'Thunderbrew, finest brewery in all the realms.  Check them out at Brewfest!', 22942, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barleybrew, finest brewery in Azeroth!  Check them out at Brewfest!', 'Barleybrew, finest brewery in Azeroth!  Check them out at Brewfest!', 22941, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be lookin\' forward to it. Guess I\'ll get to preserving this meat, then. A good quartermaster won\'t turn down a reliable supply of rations.', '', 22940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe after everything dies down, you and I can make a deal with some of the surplus. I\'m sure the troops will give your people plenty of business as they head into the Grizzly Hills.', '', 22939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Much as I\'d like to do business with you, Jethan, all this stuff is the property of the Alliance expeditionary forces.', '', 22938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, Gil, you give my offer any more thought? I\'ll have plenty of skins and preserved meat to trade for those heavy yeti furs or down your men are working with.', '', 22937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been in the military my whole life.  I\'ve fought in many wars, under many banners - but they\'ve always been other people\'s battles.$B$BNot this time.  Every Forsaken soldier you see here has come for one reason alone.  Arthas must be killed.', '', 22936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A %s appears to defend its dinner.', '', 22935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, stop trying to hit me and hit me already!', 'Come on, stop trying to hit me and hit me already!', 22934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Practice or not, you\'re going to spit teeth!', 'Practice or not, you\'re going to spit teeth!', 22933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your sparring is feeble!', 'Your sparring is feeble!', 22932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure you don\'t need a break, old woman?', 'Sure you don\'t need a break, old woman?', 22931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the little ones come, I won\'t hold back like I am with you.', 'When the little ones come, I won\'t hold back like I am with you.', 22930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You practice as if you\'re still asleep.', 'You practice as if you\'re still asleep.', 22929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I train better against a target dummy.', 'I train better against a target dummy.', 22928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You spar like a girl!', 'You spar like a girl!', 22927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Camp Winterhoof.', 'Take me to Camp Winterhoof.', 22926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t offer you anything outside Howling Fjord. The bats still don\'t know their way abroad. Where do you want to go?', 'I can\'t offer you anything outside Howling Fjord. The bats still don\'t know their way abroad. Where do you want to go?', 22925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to New Agamand.', 'Take me to New Agamand.', 22924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Vengeance Landing.', 'Take me to Vengeance Landing.', 22923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For your safety, I can only allow you short flights to other places in the fjord. What is your desired destination?', 'For your safety, I can only allow you short flights to other places in the fjord. What is your desired destination?', 22922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end is near, brothers!  This plague eats us from within!', '', 22921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gods have abandoned us!', '', 22920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our magic... useless against this sickness!', '', 22919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s smells the meat, awakens from his slumber, and roars in anger!', '', 22918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My charge ends as your charge begins, Irulon. Farewell and may the Light guide you.', '', 22917, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s places the sacred artifact next to Lord Irulon Trueblade.', '', 22916, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will return you to the hell that bore you!', '', 22915, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the cold dark with you!', '', 22914, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face the blinding judgment of the Light, fiend!', '', 22913, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, hero. The Light will guide and protect us.', '', 22912, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All four prisoners saved! You are teh uber!', '', 22911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps it was a mistake to travel so close to the Rivenwood and Gjalerbron to get here.', '', 22910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is up! You have failed.... Any remaining prisoners are now SMOKED.', '', 22909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Irena sobs gently.', 22908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love you, my precious Irena.', '', 22907, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s just as beautiful as ever! Please, $n, tell her for me!', '', 22906, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go then.', '', 22905, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, are you certain you are ready to leave? Take a moment.', '', 22904, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope. Didn\'t hear a thing...', 'Nope. Didn\'t hear a thing...', 22903, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Away... go...', '', 22902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad light... hurt...', '', 22901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light... light so bright...', '', 22900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARGHHHH...', '', 22899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BURNS! IT BURNS!', '', 22898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear something, Jones? I almost thought I heard something, right there...', 'You hear something, Jones? I almost thought I heard something, right there...', 22897, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Closer... come closer...', '', 22896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOOD! EAT YOU!', '', 22895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FEED ME...', '', 22894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... Hungry...', '', 22893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BRAINNNS!', '', 22892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you deaf?! I\'ll be there when Captain Adams is flogging you for holding up the Alliance\'s advance!', '', 22891, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s keeping my boys from expanding the mine. The Alliance needs that ore!', '', 22890, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s Y-E-T-I. Yeti! You know, the giant, shaggy things with the bloody horns?', '', 22889, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do know about the giant YETI in the mine, don\'t you?', '', 22888, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s a guy gotta do to get some help around here?', '', 22887, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!$B$BIf you\'d like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer in the Terrace of Light in Shattrath City. She\'ll aim you at a target in a small pond outside the city walls!', 22886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrykuls is bigger and stronger than us.  But we is better looking!', '', 22885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorth is confused sometimes.  Gorth is good at killing people so Gorth is made sergeant.  But now Gorth never gets to kill nothing!', '', 22884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
