('Removing', 'Removing', 22741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I clear? Do you understand what I\'m sayin\'? I don\'t wanna have to send any more coffins or letters home.', '', 22740, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So when you\'re feeling that tinglin\' sensation at the base of your spine and you\'re \'bout ready to wet your pants, embrace it. Let it enrage you. That fear is the only thing that\'s gonna keep you breathin\'.', '', 22739, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look across this base and all I see is fear... Are you gonna be scared when the Lich King\'s armies are sittin\' pretty in Stormwind? Ironforge? NO! You\'re not. And do you know why? Because you\'ll be dead, that\'s why.', '', 22738, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s clears his throat.', '', 22737, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood is mine!', '', 22736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast.', '', 22734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Fort Wildervar.', 'Take me to Fort Wildervar.', 22733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Westguard Keep.', 'Take me to Westguard Keep.', 22732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Valgarde Port.', 'Take me to Valgarde Port.', 22731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our gryphons are still learning the lay of the land, $c, so I can only offer you short flights to other places in the fjord. Where do you want to go?', 'Our gryphons are still learning the lay of the land, $c, so I can only offer you short flights to other places in the fjord. Where do you want to go?', 22730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aranal, ledel! Their fate shall be yours!', '', 22729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There be one mon!', '', 22728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at ya mon! You be out here all day tryin\' to find em!', '', 22727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coo Yah! There ya be!', '', 22726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where ya be mon? Ya dang kitty\'s are sneaky!', '', 22725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, kitty kitty.....', '', 22724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The choice is yours, Anselm.  Return to the Lich King\'s army and fight alongside them or remain loyal to your so-called queen and suffer their wrath as they drive you from their homelands!', '', 22723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the Vrykul!   A race that has perfected war and destruction to the point of an art form.  Already they\'ve cast their lot with the Lich King!  Their dwellings surround you and their numbers are easily five times yours.', '', 22722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, know demise!', 'Now, know demise!', 22721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You felt death once...', 'You felt death once...', 22720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heard he sent Ragnaros back to the elemental planes by himself...', 'Heard he sent Ragnaros back to the elemental planes by himself...', 22719, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heard he\'s Thrall\'s right hand orc. Hangs up dragon heads in his spare time.', 'Heard he\'s Thrall\'s right hand orc. Hangs up dragon heads in his spare time.', 22718, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m no orc lover but yea, wish he were here right now. He\'d dismantle these things!', 'I\'m no orc lover but yea, wish he were here right now. He\'d dismantle these things!', 22717, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reminds me of the time I was stationed at Cenarion Hold during the second war of the shifting sands... Remember that orc? Saurfang? Damndest thing I ever did see.', 'Reminds me of the time I was stationed at Cenarion Hold during the second war of the shifting sands... Remember that orc? Saurfang? Damndest thing I ever did see.', 22716, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They want you to stop asking questions! Shut up and fight!', 'They want you to stop asking questions! Shut up and fight!', 22715, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the 64,000 gold piece question, isn\'t it? ', 'That\'s the 64,000 gold piece question, isn\'t it? ', 22714, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Us dead? I dunno... Just a guess.', 'Us dead? I dunno... Just a guess.', 22713, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Idiot...', 'Idiot...', 22712, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Total shot in the dark here but I\'d guess they\'re coming from that gigantic evil castle. I could be wrong.', 'Total shot in the dark here but I\'d guess they\'re coming from that gigantic evil castle. I could be wrong.', 22711, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does it really matter?', 'Does it really matter?', 22710, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me stop fighting for my life and ask them - oh wait... Who cares! Just kill!', 'Let me stop fighting for my life and ask them - oh wait... Who cares! Just kill!', 22709, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re definitely not gnomes.', 'They\'re definitely not gnomes.', 22708, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know, but they\'re big and they\'re pissed!', 'I don\'t know, but they\'re big and they\'re pissed!', 22707, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is madness!', 'This is madness!', 22706, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do they want?!', 'What do they want?!', 22705, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are they coming from?!', 'Where are they coming from?!', 22704, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are these things?!', 'What are these things?!', 22703, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for Ymiron!', 'My life for Ymiron!', 22702, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffer, insect!', 'Suffer, insect!', 22701, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YAAARRRGH!', 'YAAARRRGH!', 22700, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your end draws closer!', 'Your end draws closer!', 22699, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beg for your life...', 'Beg for your life...', 22698, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Ymiron!', 'For Ymiron!', 22697, 0, 6614, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time is nigh...', 'Your time is nigh...', 22696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horseman rise...', 'Horseman rise...', 22695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For ages, I was lost.  Now, finally, I see how dark my soul had become...', '', 22694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G Sir : Ma\'am;! I\'m here to assist and defend you.$B$BYour orders?', '', 22693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let those monsters through the gate! Stand firm, soldiers!', 'Don\'t let those monsters through the gate! Stand firm, soldiers!', 22692, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invader incoming!', 'Invader incoming!', 22691, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoot it between the eyes! Those beasts are vulnerable there!', 'Shoot it between the eyes! Those beasts are vulnerable there!', 22690, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FIRE! FIRE!', 'FIRE! FIRE!', 22689, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s coming right for us!', 'It\'s coming right for us!', 22688, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send these scumbags back to hell!  Fire at will!', '', 22687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that all you\'ve come to say?', '', 22686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, my child, come here, I have something to ask of you.', '', 22685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet, did you hear that?!', '', 22684, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes even I wish that I didn\'t know. But then I realize it\'s for the best.', '', 22683, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re safe here, my brothers and sisters, while the rest of the world will perish.', '', 22682, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there, stop slacking!', '', 22681, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their coming will herald the end of the world!', '', 22680, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill anyone who tries to interfere!', '', 22679, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know some of the truth. Now we must uncover the rest!', '', 22678, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work faster, people!', '', 22677, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run!  It\'s the Dark Iron dwarves!', 'Run!  It\'s the Dark Iron dwarves!', 22676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you value your beer, run for it!', 'If you value your beer, run for it!', 22675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone has to save the beer!', 'Someone has to save the beer!', 22674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re after the beer!', 'They\'re after the beer!', 22673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark Iron dwarves!!!', 'Dark Iron dwarves!!!', 22672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arthas is prepared to offer you power beyond your imagination.  The puny army you lead here would pale in comparison to the phalanxes at your command if you returned to the Scourge\'s embrace.', '', 22671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, spirits.', '', 22670, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... he has learned of your victory over Stormwind\'s North Fleet and thinks you have potential.  Potential to see reason and abandon Sylvanas\' childish rebellion.', '', 22669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s falls into a trance.', '', 22668, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s inhales the wispy smoke tendrils emanating from the burner.', '', 22666, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, but it is you who intrudes on our master\'s territory.  He could wipe you out in an instant for that transgression alone!  Arthas does not have much love or patience for his escaped slaves.', '', 22665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water grant me serenity...', '', 22664, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What fool dares to enter her majesty\'s dominion unannounced?', '', 22663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archers at the ready!  Hold your fire!', '', 22662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire grant me vision...', '', 22661, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DEBUG] SHRINK AND EXTINGUISH', '', 22660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DEBUG] GROW AND EXPLODE', '', 22659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DEBUG] SPLIT', '', 22658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Walk in the Light, my child.', '', 22657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defend our cannons at all costs!', 22656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kick these Alliance mongrels off our ships!', 22655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to gut the lookouts that scouted these reefs!  We walked right into their blasted trap!', 22654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t let them take the Windrunner you worthless mutts!  Stand your ground!', 22653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank goodness for you!', 'Thank goodness for you!', 22652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my life!', 'You saved my life!', 22651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vrykul are evil and must be destroyed!', 'The vrykul are evil and must be destroyed!', 22650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thanks to you, hero!', 'My thanks to you, hero!', 22649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to put a stop to this madness before it\'s too late!', 'You have to put a stop to this madness before it\'s too late!', 22648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avenge my friends who have already been sacrificed!', 'Avenge my friends who have already been sacrificed!', 22647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.  I will not forget this!', 'Thank you.  I will not forget this!', 22646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, thank you, thank you!', 'Oh, thank you, thank you!', 22645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the end.', 'This is the end.', 22644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there no hero to rescue me?', 'Is there no hero to rescue me?', 22643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re performing unholy rites down in the catacombs, and I\'m about to be the sacrifice!', 'They\'re performing unholy rites down in the catacombs, and I\'m about to be the sacrifice!', 22642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want to be sacrificed!', 'I don\'t want to be sacrificed!', 22641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want to be taken down into the catacombs!', 'I don\'t want to be taken down into the catacombs!', 22640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I saw a key on one of those vrykul.', 'I think I saw a key on one of those vrykul.', 22639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The key... you have to find the key!', 'The key... you have to find the key!', 22638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, let me out of here!', 'Please, let me out of here!', 22637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not stop my work here!  My husband-king will awaken!', 22636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come in out of the cold and rest your weary bones a while. Our hospitality is yours.', 'Come in out of the cold and rest your weary bones a while. Our hospitality is yours.', 22635, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We defeated the sea monster!', '', 22634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it! We\'ve defeated Tethyr!', 'We did it! We\'ve defeated Tethyr!', 22633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kraz should never have come to this cursed place... should have known not to trust the human. A blind fool I was, $c, as are you if you follow his counsel.$b$bMy son, lost for two moons, was last seen with the human, Budd. He told me I could find him behind the walls of Zul\'Aman....$b$bI followed his people here, and was captured with the rest. Without your help, I was doomed to die.$b$bThank you, stranger.', '', 22632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to you, orc?', 'What happened to you, orc?', 22631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freedom! Kraz life was over.$b$bI thank you, $c.', '', 22630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorth no care if he die!  Gorth get put back together!', '', 22629, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no match for Gorth!', '', 22628, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some things Gorth has to do himself!', '', 22627, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let vrykul come through!  Kill all!', '', 22626, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill vrykul scum!  For Sylvanas!', '', 22625, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold positions!  Keep vrykul men back!', '', 22624, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush them!  Crush their faces!', '', 22623, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give me your souls that I might slay the enemy!', 22622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nevermind me, $r. $b$bKraz as good as dead. Leave now, $r, before bad trolls get you too.', '', 22621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is the Headless Horseman?', 'Who is the Headless Horseman?', 22620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Headless Horseman, once a knight of the Silver Hand and a hero among his fellow paladins, is cursed.  Driven insane within the Scarlet Monastery, he believes that he is alive and we are dead.$B$BNow, his fervor no longer serves the Light.  With the coming of Hallow\'s End, he spreads gloom and fire across the villages of Azeroth.', 22619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is those two cannons along the wall that are slowing us down.  Without their protection our forces would be able to rush their fortification without taking any losses.$B$BIt\'s either take out those cannons or wait until they run out of ammunition.  Anselm\'s choice, I suppose.', 22618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Executor Anselm requests your report.', 'High Executor Anselm requests your report.', 22617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the will of Sylvanas, our enemies will fall.', 22616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will be a matter of hours before the Alliance in the Derelict Strand are crushed.  They are surrounded and outnumbered.', 22615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The stranded Alliance sailors know they\'re going to die, yet they fight us tooth and nail.$B$BImpressive and pathetic at the same time.', 22614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wanted to practice my spells on the bunnies outside my home to make my magic stronger so I could go and kill all the bad guys in Gnomeregan and let all the gnomes go back home but momma said I was too young to go on adventures but then I met Mister Budd and he told me that you\'re only as young as you feel and that I could come here with his friends and I would get all the practice I needed but then we got caught and put in the cages...$b$b<Ashli takes a deep breath.>$b$bAre you a real $r?\n', 22613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 275, 6, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('How\'d a perky little gnome like you get caught up in a mess like this?', 'How\'d a perky little gnome like you get caught up in a mess like this?', 22612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ohh, thank you soo much for getting me out of that cage because I was in there for soo long and it smelled like minced mutton that had been sitting out in the sun for a week and I don\'t like mutton to begin with because when I was little, well littler, I was actually turned into a sheep for a minute and so I know what it feels like to be a sheep and I don\'t want someone eating me, especially an overgrown troll dressed up like a kitty....$b$b<Ashli takes a deep breath.>$b$bHow\'s my hair?\n', 22611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 4, 11, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('A sad tale, that one - a wee bit embarrassin\' too.$b$bMy people be know fer havin\' a taste fer the ale, ya know. And I be no exception. Seems I been given more than me share of the thirst.$b$bSo I run inta ol\' Budd ya see, an\' he offers me all the grog I can swallow fer joinin\' his crew - a move I\'ve come to regret.$b$bOne night, after drinkin\' enough grog to drop a Kodo, I was lured into followin\' Budd\'s band o\' misfits into Zul\'Aman.$b$bThat be the last I recall before findin\' meself in that cage.', '', 22610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, how does a dwarf like you end up in a place like this?', 'So, how does a dwarf like you end up in a place like this?', 22609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well then, I spose I be owin\' ya my thanks, $r.$b$bTruth is, I thought I\'d swallowed me last tankard \'til ye showed up.', '', 22608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, stranger, I\'d love to sit and chat, but me head\'s poundin\' somethin\' fierce.$b$bHow \'bout ye git these good fer nothin\' trolls to stop makin\' such a racket. Then we\'ll get to talkin\', eh?', '', 22607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig the wheels out, we don\'t have much time!', '', 22606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curses!  We might as well dismantle these for parts!  They\'re useless to us.', '', 22605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse this frozen land!  We\'ll never move these meatwagons to the front!', '', 22604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are $3094W activated dwarves!', '', 22603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RETREAT!!  We\'ve already lost $3096W and we can\'t afford to lose any more!!', '', 22602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it boys!  Now back to the Grim Guzzler and we\'ll drink to the $3096W that were injuredl!', '', 22601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spectral Tiger Mount', 'Spectral Tiger Mount', 22600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing Chair', 'Fishing Chair', 22599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin Gumbo Kettle', 'Goblin Gumbo Kettle', 22598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi $c, I\'m Ashli, and I need you to help me \'cause I\'m trapped in this cage \'cause Budd sent me in here with some yucky trolls and stinky orcs and silly humans and a drunk dwarf and we got caught by super-bad trolls and they dragged us off and they put me in here with the big troll-cat who\'s really really mean and kills all the people in the cages and I think he\'s gunna kill me too really soon but I can\'t get out by myself so...$b$b<Ashli takes a deep breath.>$b$bCan you kill that thing?\n', 22597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never call Brackenwall Village my home. To do so is to give up hope of reclaiming our rightful lands.', '', 22596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does it look like?  The ground is frozen like a rock!$B$BThe wheels on these meatwagons were built to go over mud at best.  We\'re going to need an abomination and some chains to salvage them.', '', 22595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Executor Anselm wants a report on the situation.', 'High Executor Anselm wants a report on the situation.', 22594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ground... is frozen.  We\'re sitting ducks here; these meatwagons aren\'t going anywhere.', '', 22593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m inclined to say they made ogres too big! I can see I\'m not going to convince you to move now, but don\'t think this is permanent!', '', 22592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But this the only building that fit Brogg! Goblins make buildings too small!', '', 22591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, we said you can stay here, but this building is our headquarters! All of our manuals and blueprints are stored here!', '', 22590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You said Brogg could stay here! You promised Brogg you\'d help regain Stonemaul clan mound!', '', 22589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought we talked about this, Brogg. You can\'t stay in this building. Sure, it can house you, but there\'s no room for anyone else!', '', 22588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harken, cur!  Tis you I spurn!  Now feel... the burn!', '', 22587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skill has grown immense, $c. In order to further your instruction, you must journey to Outland itself. Kalaen will train you in Thrallmar, within Hellfire Peninsula. If you prefer, you can speak to the rather prudish Hamanar on Aldor Rise within Shattrath City, though I wouldn\'t advise it.', 22586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skill impresses me greatly, $n! It is time for you to head to Outland to learn more. If you head to Hellfire Peninsula, Tatiana will take you on as a student in Honor Hold. Or, if you prefer working with the Aldor, Hamanar can instruct you in Shattrath City, on Aldor Rise.', 22585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have reached the limits of my knowledge, but there is more yet to learn. Across the sea, in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind City, a great tailor dwells. His name is Georgio Bolero, and he will train you now, I think. Go and speak with him.', '', 22584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tsk. Respect your elders. It is Kayaart who should train you.', '', 22583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gnomes! Gnomes are marvelous people. Wonderful! And they hold such knowledge of the engineering arts! You must travel to Ironforge, to Tinkertown, and speak with Springspindle Fizzlegear.', '', 22582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For simple schematics of your skill level, speak with Ghermas, if you would.', '', 22581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People of Outland, are you ready to rock?! The Tauren Chieftain concert now begins!', '', 22580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The more powerful enchantments are beyond even me, $n. Your path should lead you through Elwynn Forest to the Tower of Azora, where your next tutor spends her days. Her name is Kitta Firewind.', '', 22579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in five minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!', '', 22578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in fifteen minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!', '', 22577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in thirty minutes!  Come celebrate the opening of the Darkmoon Faire in Terokkar, just south of Shattrath City!', '', 22576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am busy, $c. Your time would be better spent discussing matters with Kudrii.', '', 22575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tauren Chieftains play on this stage at the top of every hour. Show some energy: Cheer the minstrels on to capture some of the event\'s intensity!', '', 22574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may ask yourself, \"What is next?\" I have the answer. To learn more of our art, you must travel across the sea to an awe-inspiring place known as Ironforge. The forge there is one of the largest in the land! Bengus Deepforge, found in the Great Forge, can instruct you further.', 22573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, not now. Speak with Edrem. He can show you what you need to know.', 22572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever wished to see the boughs of Teldrassil, $n? You should, for there is an elf there who can teach you more. Seek out Ainethil in Darnassus on the Craftsmen\'s Terrace.', '', 22571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deriz is the one you should speak with if you wish to learn the basics of alchemy.', '', 22570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time for you to move on. Telonis, a night elf located within the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in Darnassus, is the next step in your training.', '', 22569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must walk before you can run. Speak with Feruul for training, and attend well to his lessons.', '', 22568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You seek to uncover mysteries I myself have yet to unlock, $c. Please, discuss these matters with Nahogg instead.', 22567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You flatter me, but it is my colleague Refik who deserves your attention now, not I.', 22566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time for you to expand your knowledge with another teacher; Ockil has unlocked many fascinating wonders of the engineer, and will lead you on your path to discovery, yes?', 22565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time learning at my side draws to a close, friend. Akham will gladly instruct you further.', '', 22564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miall is the next step in your training, friend $c. You\'ve grown beyond what I can teach you.', '', 22563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...to create a fund for the purchase of hair gel? I like my hair the way it is, thanks!', '...to establish a fund for the purchase of hair gel? I like my hair the way it is, thanks!', 22562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...to establish the chicken as the official symbol of Theramore?! These guys are nuts!', '...to establish the chicken as the official symbol of Theramore?! These guys are nuts!', 22561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve reached the limits of my skill. Farii was my instructor, and I\'m sure she\'ll instruct you as well.', '', 22560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...the deserters seek a Theramore where citizens will be free to juggle at all hours of the day? What is this nonsense?', '...the deserters seek a Theramore where citizens will be free to juggle at all hours of the day? What is this nonsense?', 22559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen a lot of things in my time, but the change that came over the Explorers\' League in the Whisper Gulch takes the cake.$B$BI\'m just glad that I got out of there with my skin intact!', '', 22558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In all of my days I never thought to see such a magnificent new frontier.$B$BIf only it weren\'t tainted by evil and knowledge which is best left hidden.', '', 22557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...as a deserter, you\'ll enjoy activities like tethered swimming and dog grooming? How ridiculous!', '...as a deserter, you\'ll enjoy activities like tethered swimming and dog grooming? How ridiculous!', 22556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...receive 50 percent off deserter undergarments? What is this garbage?', '...receive 50 percent off deserter undergarments? What is this garbage?', 22555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of these mouths to feed, and who has to do it? Me!$B$BAll the cooking, and the cleaning, and everything else!', 22554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I advise the captain on matters that he chooses to share with me, but I have a feeling that he\'d rather hear from you.', '', 22553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shouldn\'t have left so many behind at Valgarde. Admiral Keller, that insufferable egomaniac!$B$BHow am I to fulfill my orders with so few? I need enough men to stay here at the keep and still properly garrison Fort Wildervar when it\'s ready!$B$BAt least we have a hope of dealing with our problems now that you\'re here.', '', 22552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WAAAHH! This was all $n\'s idea! Some of my best friends are forest trolls....', '', 22551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It wasn\'t me! $n did it, I swear!', '', 22550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('You look like an intelligent person. Why don\'t you read one of these leaflets and give it some thought?', 'You look like an intelligent person. Why don\'t you read one of these leaflets and give it some thought?', 22549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Theramore, $c. Looking for something?', 'Welcome to Theramore, $c. Looking for something?', 22548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SOMEONE TRY THIS SUPER BREW!!', 'SOMEONE TRY THIS SUPER BREW!!', 22547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event in all of Outland!', 'The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event in all of Outland!', 22546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll take good care of your pets, don\'t you worry!', 22545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the worlds!  We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end!  Don\'t forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate!  All it takes is five or more and you\'re on your way to the most wondrous prizes in all of Outland.  Everybody is a winner!', '', 22544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone enjoying themselves so far?  That\'s great!  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest show in all of Outland!  Make sure that you speak with Yebb and his friends here while you\'re taking in Neblegear\'s Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre.', '', 22543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings friends, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!$B$BPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Ride the rides and see the sights!  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!', '', 22542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome one and all to the greatest show on all of Azeroth... the Darkmoon Faire!  Adventure and excitement await, don\'t be shy!  Mysteries and prizes for both the young and the old are here for the taking.  And be sure to speak with the professor about any Darkmoon Cards that you have come across during your travels!', '', 22541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show in Outland!$B$BPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!', '', 22540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back to the greatest show in Outland, my friend!  It is truly a delight to see you once again.$B$BPlease, step right up and once more take in all we have to offer.  Be sure to check around, as we are always adding new and exciting things to the Darkmoon Faire!  Amaze at wonders old and new that we have uncovered!  We continue to spare no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!', '', 22539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is he gone?  Hooray!', 'Is he gone?  Hooray!', 22538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my mom was alive, she would put out the fires!', 'If my mom was alive, she would put out the fires!', 22537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my dad was alive, he would put out the fires!', 'If my dad was alive, he would put out the fires!', 22536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Matron!  Is the Headless Horseman going to eat us?', 'Matron!  Is the Headless Horseman going to eat us?', 22535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go back to the orphanage!', 'I want to go back to the orphanage!', 22534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s happening?', 'What\'s happening?', 22533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hallow\'s End is a scary holiday, but I like it!', 'Hallow\'s End is a scary holiday, but I like it!', 22532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Headless Horseman had been driven away, for now.  We may breath easy for a time, but must remain ever vigilant.', 22531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Headless Horseman is attacking!  Quickly, aid your Horde brethren in the village\'s defense!', 22530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Headless Horseman has set fire to the village!  We must protect the children!', 22529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Headless Horseman\'s mind is plagued with dementia!  During Hallow\'s End, he might attack this village at any moment.', 22528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are eight types of Darkmoon Cards; Beasts, Blessings, Elementals, Furies, Lunacy, Portals, Storms and Warlords, with eight cards, Ace to Eight in each suit. If you collect all eight of one suit then you can turn them into a deck that you can give to our Professor Thaddeus Paleo in exchange for a powerful trinket.', 22527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lucc is the one to speak to now, $n, to further your skill.', '', 22526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The peace of Ogri\'la shall be restored!', '', 22525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you send me to Theramore? I have an urgent message for Lady Jaina from King Wrynn.', 'Can you send me to Theramore? I have an urgent message for Lady Jaina from King Wrynn.', 22524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pleased to meet you, $c.', '', 22523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to travel to Stormwind.', 'I\'m ready to travel to Stormwind.', 22522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Defias are little more than a band of thugs. We should be busy combatting Stormwind\'s real enemies instead of chasing baseless speculation!', 22521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t be such a fool, Bolvar!', 22520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lynalis can help you more than I, $c. Speak with her to learn more.', '', 22519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Convey my thanks to Lady Jaina and let her know that we will pursue the Defias and their backers until our liege is safely returned!', '', 22518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With their newfound patronage and apparent role in the king\'s disappearance, I see no choice but to plan a renewed offensive against the Defias.', '', 22517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Jaina would not send a messenger with such haste if she did not believe her information reliable.', '', 22516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m afraid you\'re at the limits of my knowledge. Camberon is more skilled in alchemy than I. Please speak with him if you\'re interested in advancing.', 22515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve surpassed my own knowledge, but Bemarrin over there can teach you far more.', '', 22514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is there a pattern or two I can show you today?', 22513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
