('Intruder! You were sent to destroy us!', 'Intruder! You were sent to destroy us!', 22506, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'ll all be over soon. Soon you will be in the embrace of That Which Must Not Be Named!', 'It\'ll all be over soon. Soon you will be in the embrace of That Which Must Not Be Named!', 22505, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
