('The end is nigh! That Which Must Not Be Named is almost free!', 'The end is nigh! That Which Must Not Be Named is almost free!', 22499, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re safe; IT will never reach us here!', 'We\'re safe; IT will never reach us here!', 22498, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When one studies and digs, one reveals the truth.', 'When one studies and digs, one reveals the truth.', 22497, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want to know anymore. Make me forget!', 'AI don\'t want to know anymore. Make me forget!', 22496, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha! I must find the secrets!', 'Ahahaha! I must find the secrets!', 22495, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re in your debt, friend.  Speak to Lysander at Vengeance Landing; he will arrange a suitable reward for you.', '', 22494, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t shoot!  Apothecary coming through!', '', 22493, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s high-tail it out of here.', '', 22492, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'ll teach you to mess with an apothecary, you motherless Alliance dogs!', '', 22491, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re almost done!', '', 22490, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yes... watch it burn!', '', 22489, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Adams sent me out here to investigate what\'s happening at Halgrind. This is as close as I\'ve been able to get, however; the abandoned Vrykul tower affords me some amount of cover from prying eyes.$B$BThe Forsaken are up to no good over there. I can feel it!', '', 22488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have limited supplies in this camp.  It would be a real shame if something were to happen to them.', '', 22487, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, let us leave... but not before we leave our Alliance hosts something to remember us by!', '', 22486, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You couldn\'t have come at a better time!  Let\'s get out of here.', '', 22485, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What you need are schematics far beyond my own meager offerings. Danwe here can show you some true technological delights!', 22484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire!', '', 22483, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have the Repaired Diving Gear anymore. Do you have a spare?', 'I don\'t have the Repaired Diving Gear anymore. Do you have a spare?', 22482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light the Defias don\'t know the first thing about diving!', '', 22481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here to relieve me? I\'m certain it\'s almost time. Well, if you want to relieve me anyway, let me know. I could use a drink or three.', '', 22480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lieutenant Aden always volunteers for gate duty. That\'s fine by me.$B$BI\'ve got a post that allows me a good view of my guards AND the daughters of the tradesmen at the same time.', '', 22479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t much time to talk unless it\'s urgent, citizen. The gates of Theramore are my greatest responsibility.', '', 22478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be seein\' ya, little man Budd. Sooner than later I\'ll be bettin\'.', '', 22477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then, forever on, yer soul be my plaything....', '', 22476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But be knowin\' this, little man - no matter where ya be hidin\', when me pyres grow dim, I\'ll be feedin\' them with yer bones!', '', 22475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So long as yer fools be fillin\' my cages with sacrifices I\'d be a fool to kill ya.', '', 22474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be the worm my captives be cursin\'? I expected more!', '', 22473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, dis be Budd?', '', 22472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? No, no, there must be some misunderstanding. I can explaaaiiin....', '', 22471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will go with you. Just spare my men. They\'re good lads who\'ve only made a mistake...', '', 22470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I surrender! Stay your blade!', '', 22469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy, boy!  Don\'t ruin the dummy now!', '', 22468, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it!  Bite the sword arm!', '', 22467, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get him, Fiend!', '', 22466, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have to eat, Celeste?', 'What do you have to eat, Celeste?', 22465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time for some rest, sweety, or just something to eat and some relaxation?$B$BWell, if anyone deserves it, it\'s you!', 22464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All o\' this shootin\' at Skorn and other places o\'er the horizon, and what do ya think it\'s gotten me?$B$BCannonball recovery duty!$B$BNot exactly what I signed up fer, ya know?', '', 22463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All cannons, ready.', 'All cannons, ready.', 22461, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Aye, aye, sir!', '', 22460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have top men and women on it even as we speak, sir!', '', 22459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir!', '', 22458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.  Carry on Mr. Ely.', 'Very well.  Carry on Mr. Ely.', 22457, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are my recovered cannonballs?', 'Where are my recovered cannonballs?', 22456, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mr. Ely!', 'Mr. Ely!', 22455, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right cannon, ready.', 'Right cannon, ready.', 22454, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Center cannon, ready.', 'Center cannon, ready.', 22453, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire!', 'Fire!', 22452, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Range.', 'Range.', 22451, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s the flare. Left cannon, ready!', 'There\'s the flare. Left cannon, ready!', 22450, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FIRE AT WILL!', '', 22449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to fire upon my command! Ready, aim...', '', 22448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marksmen, form up and take your positions!', '', 22447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Verse 6', '[DNT] Verse 6', 22446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And when the brew\'s all missin\'\nTa Shadowforge we\'ll hop,\nA bitter toast ta Ragnaros...\n... but bring him not a drop!', 'And when the brew\'s all missin\'\nTa Shadowforge we\'ll hop,\nA bitter toast ta Ragnaros...\n... but bring him not a drop!', 22445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll drink yer stout and lager,\nDrain all the pints and kegs!\nWe\'ll drink and brawl and brawl and drink,\n\'til we can\'t feel our legs!', 'We\'ll drink yer stout and lager,\nDrain all the pints and kegs!\nWe\'ll drink and brawl and brawl and drink,\n\'til we can\'t feel our legs!', 22444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So lift a mug to Coren,\nAnd Hurley Blackbreath too!\nThis drink is weak, without much kick,\nBut oi!  At least it\'s brew!', 'So lift a mug to Coren,\nAnd Hurley Blackbreath too!\nThis drink is weak, without much kick,\nBut oi!  At least it\'s brew!', 22443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeh will not try our bitter, \nYeh will not serve our ale!\nBut have Brewfest without our lot?\nJust try it, and ye\'ll fail!\n', 'Yeh will not try our bitter, \nYeh will not serve our ale!\nBut have Brewfest without our lot?\nJust try it, and ye\'ll fail!\n', 22442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, we\'re from Blackrock Mountain,\nWe\'ve come ta drink yer brew!\nDark Iron dwarves, they do not lie,\nAnd so yeh know it\'s true!', 'Oh, we\'re from Blackrock Mountain,\nWe\'ve come ta drink yer brew!\nDark Iron dwarves, they do not lie,\nAnd so yeh know it\'s true!', 22441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Theramore, $c.', 22440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A %s senses a potential meal!', '', 22439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! There\'s no telling what those brutes would\'ve done to me.', 'Thank you! There\'s no telling what those brutes would\'ve done to me.', 22438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Lion Seal has become alerted to your presence and begins bellowing a warning!', '', 22437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The situation out here is worse than I thought! The zeppelin is little better than a heap of twisted metal and burning fuel!', 22436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s absorbs the essence of the dragonhawk spirit!', '', 22435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s absorbs the essence of the lynx spirit!', '', 22433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s absorbs the essence of the eagle spirit!', '', 22432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you wish to advance further in the fine art of tailoring, please speak with my employer, Keelen. He can show you more than I ever will.', 22431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve reached the limits of my enchantments. Sedana can instruct you further.', '', 22430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is little else I can teach you, $c. Please, speak with my colleague Kalinda if you wish to know more of the craft.', '', 22429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the rate this is going, we\'re not going to finish on time.', 'At the rate this is going, we\'re not going to finish on time.', 22428, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out for that beam!', 'Look out for that beam!', 22427, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! A little to the left... there, you have it.', 'No! A little to the left... there, you have it.', 22426, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster!', 'Faster!', 22425, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you even know what you\'re doing?', 'Do you even know what you\'re doing?', 22424, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break time\'s over, ladies.', 'Break time\'s over, ladies.', 22423, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s work smarter, people. The captain wants this done by the end of the week!', 'Let\'s work smarter, people. The captain wants this done by the end of the week!', 22422, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch it there.', 'Watch it there.', 22421, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break time.', 'Break time.', 22420, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks weak enough to capture!', '', 22419, 0, 11587, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you wake ghost? Where other Stonemauls?!', '', 22418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You leave Stonemaul lands now!', '', 22417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me crush puny friend of dragons!', '', 22416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get over here, you idiot!', '', 22415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go go go!', 'Go go go!', 22414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never catch me!', 'You\'ll never catch me!', 22413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m out of here!', 'I\'m out of here!', 22412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick! Run!', 'Quick! Run!', 22411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s absorbs the essence of the bear spirit!', '', 22410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Royal Apothecary Society welcomes you to Northrend, $c.  Now, what is it that you will do to aid us in Sylvanas\' service?', '', 22407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were making progress with our plague in Undercity.  All of a sudden our strains keep failing!', '', 22406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The plague samples they\'ve sent us would not even hurt a rat!', '', 22405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot work under these conditions!  We need a viable strain!', '', 22404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last ten strains from Undercity... all of them worthless!', '', 22403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As my most recent gift to the lowly inhabitants of Azeroth, the evil Zul\'jin is no more!', '', 22400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('NO!', 'NO!', 22399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not on your life!', 'Not on your life!', 22398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No way!', 'No way!', 22397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn straight!', 'Damn straight!', 22396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You said it!', 'You said it!', 22395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right!', 'Right!', 22394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah!', 'Yeah!', 22393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You might wanna stand back. Fish guttin\' is a dirty job.', '', 22392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash their kegs! DRAIN BREWFEST DRY!', '', 22391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody try to keep de Amani Empire down. Now we got friends. We wit de Zandalari now. We part of something bigger. You can\'t stop us all. De whole world gonna drown in blood!!', '', 22390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DAMN RIGHT! We\'ll show \'em why you don\'t cross the Dark Iron dwarves!', '', 22389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are we going to hide in our mountain and let those swill-peddlers have their little shindig without us?!', '', 22388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perish the thought!$b$bI\'m simply trying to rid the world of a horrible menace, and that type of thing rarely comes without a price, as I\'m sure you know.$b$bThink of it like this, $n. You\'ll be offering ordinary folks the chance to become heroes! A rare opportunity indeed!$b$bYou just send them my way and I\'ll handle the rest....', '', 22387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('Are you suggesting I provide you with people for Zul\'jin\'s sacrifices?', 'Are you suggesting I provide you with people for Zul\'jin\'s sacrifices?', 22386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down the free brew and pelt the Guzzlers with your mug!', 'Down the free brew and pelt the Guzzlers with your mug!', 22385, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed! They were given every advantage I could muster. I simply can\'t imagine what went wrong.$b$bHere, $c, take one. I\'ve made a couple of modifications - little refinements really. Now there\'s no excuse for failure!', '', 22384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('You supplied the crew with disguises?', 'You supplied the crew with disguises?', 22383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep them split from their main force!', 22382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cover fire, now!', 22381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep firing!  Cut off their reinforcements!', 22380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think Drazzit\'s going to have any luck finding anyone to kill this raptor. I mean, he\'s already raised the reward twice...', 22379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This board is used by the Steamwheedle representatives at Mudsprocket to post bounties and job notices.', '', 22378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve sent muscle to get revenge! Scatter!', '', 22377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is an insult! An affront! They deny us participation in time-honored dwarven traditions!', '', 22376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For years beyond counting these woods have burned. They are fueled by an ancient magic and are the mating grounds for the brood mother and her proto-drake consorts.$B$BBut now a long-forgotten evil has reawakened and seeks once again to enslave the offspring of the brood mother for their own purposes.$B$BThese vrykul have caused a disturbance that is extending the boundary of the clutch, and threatens your people.', '', 22375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hallow\'s End is a scary holiday, but I like it!', 'Hallow\'s End is a scary holiday, but I like it!', 22374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s gone?  Hooray!', 'He\'s gone?  Hooray!', 22373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All who venture here belong to me, including you!', '', 22371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land was mine long before your wretched kind set foot here.', '', 22370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, $c, it\'s clear that you and your friends know your way around Azeroth. Surely you\'ve come across certain folks who hunger for fame and fortune. $b$bSend me anyone who might be willing to enter Zul\'Aman and I\'ll make it worth your while.', '', 22369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('Finlay, let me see what you have for sale.', 'Finlay, let me see what you have for sale.', 22368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Day and night all I do is sit here and make ammo and restring crossbows.$B$BI suppose you want me to do something for you too?', '', 22367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is too late for Jarl... its hold is too strong...', 'It is too late for Jarl... its hold is too strong...', 22366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is too late for us, living one. Take yourself and your friend away from here before you both are... claimed...', 'It is too late for us, living one. Take yourself and your friend away from here before you both are... claimed...', 22365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness will consume all... all the living...', 'The darkness will consume all... all the living...', 22364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why have you come here, outsider? You will only find pain! Our fate will be yours...', 'Why have you come here, outsider? You will only find pain! Our fate will be yours...', 22363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness... the corruption... they came too quickly for anyone to know...', 'The darkness... the corruption... they came too quickly for anyone to know...', 22362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The manor... someone else... will soon be consumed...', 'The manor... someone else... will soon be consumed...', 22361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was... terrible... the demon...', 'It was... terrible... the demon...', 22360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away, whoever you are! Witch Hill is mine... mine!', 'Go away, whoever you are! Witch Hill is mine... mine!', 22359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
