('I came out here to visit you, Jarl! And I find you living in an empty cabin in the middle of nowhere, babbling about frogs? You\'re hopeless!', '', 22354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing. Wanna help me whip up some frog leg stew?', '', 22353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jarl, you haven\'t been yourself ever since I arrived. What\'s going on?', '', 22352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unless it\'s something I can eat, I don\'t want it.', '', 22351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jarl?', '', 22350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
