('I brought you a housewarming gift, Jarl.', '', 22348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my mom were alive, she would put out the fires!', 'If my mom were alive, she would put out the fires!', 22347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my dad were alive, he would put out the fires!', 'If my dad were alive, he would put out the fires!', 22346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Matron!  Is that bad man going to eat us?', 'Matron!  Is that bad man going to eat us?', 22345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go back to the orphanage!', 'I want to go back to the orphanage!', 22344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, $n. I didn\'t become the renowned Budd Nedreck by being hasty.$b$bFinal preparations are being made and soon the treasures and secrets of Zul\'Aman shall be mine! $b$b<Budd pauses and looks at you for a moment, then chuckles.>$b$b...ours I mean, of course.', '', 22343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('Listen, $n, you should know by now that when fortune comes knocking, you open the door and ask questions later. Chances like this don\'t come around every day! Are you in or not?$b$b<Budd doesn\'t wait for a reply.>$b$bOf course you are! Now, there\'s work to be done, and so far I\'ve seen a lot of talking and no action. I suggest you show me something before I find a replacement.$b$bThere are thousands who would kill for an opportunity like this, I assure you!', '', 22342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('So, when does this excavation of Zul\'Aman begin?', 'So, when does this excavation of Zul\'Aman begin?', 22341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RETREAT!!!!', '', 22340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disturbing', 'Disturbing', 22339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blazing flames are safely extinguished.', '', 22338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The zeppelin\'s leaving for a tour around the bay in less than one minute!  Oh, and if anyone feels like setting me free, I\'m on the dock.', '', 22337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My zeppelin has docked. Despite my being held captive, and the sorry state that she\'s in, she\'ll be departing the dock again in two minutes.', '', 22336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a prisoner!$B$BThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That\'s nothing new!$B$BNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don\'t have the parts to keep her going like this! I\'m barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!$B$BIf you\'re determined to help them out, she\'s due to arrive back in port in less than $3078w minutes.$B$BIt\'s a crime I tell you!', '', 22335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a prisoner!$B$BThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That\'s nothing new!$B$BNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don\'t have the parts to keep her going like this! I\'m barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!$B$BIf you\'re determined to help them out, she\'s due to arrive back in port in less than a minute.$B$BIt\'s a crime I tell you!', '', 22334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a prisoner!$B$BThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That\'s nothing new!$B$BNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don\'t have the parts to keep her going like this! I\'m barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!$B$BI won\'t be held responsible for what happens to you, but you might as well get on board before she leaves.$B$BIt\'s a crime I tell you!', '', 22333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a prisoner!$B$BThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That\'s nothing new!$B$BNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don\'t have the parts to keep her going like this! I\'m barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!$B$BIt\'s a crime I tell you!', '', 22332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi there! We\'re being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?!$B$BOur stolen zeppelin\'s almost here... I think I hear her now.  Make sure you\'re onboard when she leaves!', '', 22331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi there! We\'re being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?!$B$BOur stolen zeppelin\'s less than $3078w minutes away.  Make sure you\'re onboard when she leaves!', '', 22330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi there! We\'re being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?!$B$BOur stolen zeppelin\'s here; hop on board before she sets sail!', '', 22329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi there! We\'re being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay!$B$BDo you think you can help us out?', '', 22328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, $n, you should know by now that when fortune comes knocking, you open the door and ask questions later. Chances like this don\'t come along every day!$b$bNow, are you in or not, $c?$b$b<Budd doesn\'t wait for a reply>$b$bOf course you are! Now, there\'s work to be done, and so far I\'ve seen a lot of talking and no action. I suggest you show me something before I find a replacement.$b$bThere are thousands who would kill for an opportunity like this, I assure you!', '', 22327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('Gee, Budd, is there anyone alive who can back up these claims of yours?', 'Gee, Budd, is there anyone alive who can back up these claims of yours?', 22326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, them - a sad tale, that one.$b$bThey have disappeared behind the walls of Zul\'Aman. I haven\'t heard from them in days.$b$bI\'ve seen it a hundred times; that overeager itch for fame and fortune. I tried to hold them back, told them they weren\'t prepared, but in the end they chose to face their peril....', '', 22325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('How about this latest crew - what became of them?', 'How about this latest crew - what became of them?', 22324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, well, that all depends on which partners you mean. Many have come and gone over the years - always someone eager to ride the coat-tails of the legend that is Budd Nedreck!$b$bYou can rest assured that most of them have become wealthy and retired. That\'s simply not the path I\'ve chosen. You see, I\'ve always felt that I\'ve been called to reveal the world\'s great mysteries. Alas, if I don\'t do it, who could?\n', '', 22323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('What became of your previous \'partners\'?', 'What became of your previous \'partners\'?', 22322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, don\'t tell me... $n, right?$b$bWhat can I do for you?\n', '', 22321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('I wish we had a priest or a druid out here. I can\'t continue my studies until I\'ve recovered from my injuries.', '', 22320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need to speak with Apprentice Garion, you\'ll find him inside the cottage with Tabetha. At least there, he can\'t steal all the reagents.', '', 22319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did someone say, \"Free Brew\"?', 'Did someone say, \"Free Brew\"?', 22318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not a party without some crashers!', 'It\'s not a party without some crashers!', 22317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink it all boys!', 'Drink it all boys!', 22316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn, mutants, BURN!', '', 22315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire!', '', 22314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a silly question! Clearly, $n, I\'ve overestimated you.$b$bIt should be apparent to you that someone needs to stay focused on the big picture here. Being the only one remotely qualified, alas, that burden falls to me.$b$bIn truth, I envy you, $c. I would much rather be the one to enter Zul\'Aman and cleanse it of those savages. You should consider yourself lucky....\n\n', '', 22313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re as accomplished as you claim, why don\'t you investigate Zul\'Aman yourself?', 'If you\'re as accomplished as you claim, why don\'t you investigate Zul\'Aman yourself?', 22312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, now, $n, just relax and take a deep breath. You really need to learn to trust me.$b$bYour lack of experience in these situations is causing you to panic, and panic always exaggerates the truth. So you see, there really is no crisis.$b$bNow that we\'ve settled that, I must ask that you stop being so negative. It\'s not good for the crew\'s morale....', '', 22311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('The party you sent to Zul\'Aman is being slaughtered! You must do something!', 'The party you sent to Zul\'Aman is being slaughtered! You must do something!', 22310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Budd rolls his eyes as he sees you draw near>$b$bAhh, yes, the soon-to-be-famous $n!$b$bTo what do I owe the pleasure of your company?', '', 22309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('I require some components, Sorely.', 'I require some components, Sorely.', 22308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dealin\' wit\' *hic* poison and alco... *hic* booze ish dangeroush...', '', 22307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That man be nuthin\' but a fool!$b$bFame, fortune? Phooey! This place be nuthin\' but a deathtrap, mon!$b$bI seen all kinds a\' trolls in my day, but these, they be different - sneaky, strong, tricky.$b$bSeemed to me like they knew we was comin\'....\n', '', 22306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares, Hazel.', 'I wish to browse your wares, Hazel.', 22305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This inn was built before the savages from the north awoke. Thank the Light for that, at least!$B$BWill you be staying long?', 22304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut the chatter, kid. I need to stable my pet.', 'Cut the chatter, kid. I need to stable my pet.', 22303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I grow up I want to be a stable man!', '', 22302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok mon, a deal be a deal....$b$bIt was night when we all snuck in to Zul\'Aman fer a look around.$b$bAll was quiet, til we be hearin\' a rustlin\' sound, like the wind through the trees. Before we know it, we be surrounded by these savages and their pets! Next day, I be wakin\' up here, stuck in a cage.$b$bDay an\' night, one by one, prisoners be gettin\' killed. Every time one be dyin\', that bear-troll be lookin\' stronger.$b$bThat be all I know \'bout this place, mon. And I don\'t wanna be knowin\' any more!', '', 22301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 1, 0, 500, 1000, 39653),
('I need some booze, Coot.', 'I need some booze, Coot.', 22300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lemme give you some advice: Never trust a gnome.', '', 22299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I know you?', '', 22298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, you look familiar. Have we met?', '', 22297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to purchase reagents, Yazmina.', 'I wish to purchase reagents, Yazmina.', 22296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never experienced cold like this, $r. Even in the absence of ice and snow, the frozen wastes of Northrend are extremely taxing.', 22295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell us about Budd?', 'What can you tell us about Budd?', 22294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re welcome.... Now tell us what\'s going on in here!', 'You\'re welcome.... Now tell us what\'s going on in here!', 22293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hooray! Tanzar be free, mon!$b$bWhat luck! All that an\' not even a chipped tusk.$b$bCharmed, mon. That\'s what I be. No sense denyin\' it.', '', 22292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Murloc costume.', 'I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Murloc costume.', 22291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brogg is glad Mudsprocket goblins have let him stay here, but sometimes thinks he hears them laughing at him.', '', 22290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, mon!$b$bI tell ya all I be knowin\', but first ya gotta be savin\' me from these savages and their killer bears.$b$bDeal?', '', 22289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about this place?', 'What can you tell me about this place?', 22288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, mon! I be doomed!$b$bI see what they be doin\' to prisoners, an\' I be too young to die!$b$bYa gotta do somethin\', and soon!', '', 22287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pathetic challenge has not gone unnoticed. I shall enjoy toying with you before you die.', '', 22286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful mortal, Onyxia answers to no one!', '', 22285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter code to receive Netherwhelp pet.', 'Enter code to receive Netherwhelp pet.', 22284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there. I\'m watching these whelps until their owners come along with the proper secret passwords.', 22283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
