('', 'Good question. You\'d hafta ask my brother Turgore that one.$b$bMaybe you can get an answer out of that lazy, no good... oohh. Don\'t get me started.\n\n', 22280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 388, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Then what are you doing here?', 'Then what are you doing here?', 22279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nuthin\' good!$b$bI\'m on to that one. He lures fools in with promises of wealth, keeps \'em drunk, an\' then uses \'em to do his dirty work - which ends up gettin\' em killed often as not.\n', 22278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 396, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about this Budd fellow?', 'What can you tell me about this Budd fellow?', 22277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
