('Try as I might, I can\'t seem to drink you pretty!', '', 22256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, Marge, I\'ve actually been looking for a way to tell you this....', '', 22255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Say, Brend, why is it that you never make eyes at me?', 22254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Useless orc! Just you wait, one day I\'ll drop somethin in yer grog that you\'ll NEVER wake up from....', 22253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
