('', 'James? James... No, you\'re not James, but I know who you are...', 22244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With all due respect, sir, stick it!', 22243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have got to be the most incompetent officer I have ever met!', 22242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remind me once again why it is that I don\'t just leave?', 22241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would you please shut up?!', 22240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Idiot.', 22239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh huh.  Whatever you say.', 22238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohh, that. See, there\'s been nuthin\' but orc grog around camp lately.$b$bOrc grog doesn\'t seem to agree with me, if ya know what I mean....', '', 22237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<hic>Lissen here, $r. Spend a day or two wrestlin\' with wild trolls and then tell me how you smell!', '', 22236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sniff\'s himself, and winces>$b$bThat there be the smell of adventure, $c!', '', 22235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew! What\'s that smell?', 'Whew! What\'s that smell?', 22234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed. Budd\'s scraped together rif-raf from all over creation.$b$bSeems when there\'s free booze to be had, there be plenty of folk willin\' to set aside their differences.', '', 22233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, ya never know who\'s gunna join next, or who be dyin\' next for that matter.$b$bMy advice? Don\'t be gettin\' too attached to anyone.', '', 22232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Budd\'s crew, ye mean? Aye, he be no respecter of persons. He\'ll take on anyone who can work a shovel.$b$b\'cept them undead. Budd hates \'em. Scared of \'em, likely as not.\n', '', 22231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting crew you\'ve got here....', 'Interesting crew you\'ve got here....', 22230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beats me, kid. I\'m new to the crew.$b$bI\'ve had my fill of troll-killin\' and grog drinkin, I can tell ya that. Only thing left to see is the treasure Budd keeps promisin\'....\n', '', 22229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If yer here to partake in the big spoils, ya best be gettin\' in line!$b$bMy share be long overdue....\n', '', 22228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sumthin\' I can do fer ya, $c?\n', '', 22227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can a guy like me be doin\' for a $r like you at a time like this?\n', '', 22226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is this Budd fellow?', 'Who is this Budd fellow?', 22225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Budd\'s crew, ye mean?$b$bAye, he be no respecter of persons. He\'ll take on anyone who can work a shovel$b$b...\'cept them undead. Budd hates \'em. Personally, I think he\'s scared of \'em.\n', '', 22224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm, p\'rhaps I\'ll rest these old bones for a bit.', '', 22223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooohh. Somethin\'s not agreein\' with the tummy today...', '', 22222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whooo! Like daddy used to say, just makin room fer more! Heh.', '', 22221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<cough> Ugh...', '', 22220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never drink before 5 o\'clock, momma used to say. Well, momma, it\'s bound to be 5 o\'clock somewhere!', '', 22219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm, nuthin a little lubrication won\'t fix!', '', 22218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrmph. I never liked her anyway....', '', 22217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, my precious Ameenah! How wonderful to see you again.', '', 22216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well now, what vision of loveliness is this?', '', 22215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go jump in the lake, won\'t ya Mack? I smelled ya before I saw ya....', 22214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There be nuthin\' here to drink, Mack. Away with ya!', 22213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beat it, Mack! Else I\'ll have Budd cook ya fer my hounds....', 22212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer wearin down, princess. I can sense it!', '', 22211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now why would ya wanna go an\' break poor Mack\'s heart? When I return, I\'ll pray ye\'ve changed yer way of thinkin\'....', '', 22210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you say, princess. But yer simply postponing the inevitable....', '', 22209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There shall be no prison for you this time!', 22208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not now, Mack. I be in no mood for your drunken pawing. Off with ya!', 22207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, don\'t mind if I do!', '', 22206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Playing hard to get today, I see.... Very well, perhaps I\'ll find you in a better mood later.', '', 22205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Well, helllooo there, pretty thing...', '', 22204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that the deserters have taken over Lost Point, North Point Tower is the most distant of Theramore\'s outposts.', '', 22203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maeshtro! Cue da mushic!', '', 22202, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re shayin\' you wan... you wan... *hic* you wan\' me to dansh on dis bar? *hic*', '', 22201, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That hit the shpot! Gimmie anudder one, Coot! *hic*', '', 22200, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the zeppelin to Grom\'gol right now?', 'Where is the zeppelin to Grom\'gol right now?', 22199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be on your guard. We are Theramore\'s first line of defense against its many enemies in the marsh.', '', 22198, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright... I give up... sniff...', '', 22197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, and good night!', '', 22196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THE POWER OF THE HORDE!', '', 22195, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a little something I like to call...', '', 22194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People of Azeroth and Outland... ARE YOU READY TO ROCK?!', '', 22193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh. Tell me that wasn\'t a cockroach...', '', 22192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in all the worlds did I do to deserve this job?', '', 22191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If they think I\'m about to root around in a troll\'s wardrobe, they are SORELY mistaken.', '', 22190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I get home, I\'m going to have a hot bath to scour away the grime. Perhaps two. Or five.', '', 22189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told A\'dal that playing host to a mass of flea-bitten refugees would only end in trouble, but would he listen? No, no, what would a Scryer know about such things? Bah.', '', 22188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who in the world would believe these little bits of rock and string possessed any power whatsoever? No energy worth drawing at all.', '', 22187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This troll was positively filthy.', '', 22186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the zeppelin to Orgrimmar right now?', 'Where is the zeppelin to Orgrimmar right now?', 22185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brother Krixx thinks he has it bad working in Orgrimmar. Nothing compares to the stench of this place. At least the boss had the decency to give me hazard pay!\n\nWhat? Do you want to see where the zeppelin is? Good thing I\'ve got my zeppelin tracker right here!', 'My brother Krixx thinks he has it bad working in Orgrimmar. Nothing compares to the stench of this place. At least the boss had the decency to give me hazard pay!\n\nWhat? Do you want to see where the zeppelin is? Good thing I\'ve got my zeppelin tracker right here!', 22184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry $n, but you\'ve already learned all I know about cooking.  Of course, you never know when our cooks will whip up something new, so don\'t be shy and be sure to visit again some time.', 22183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d love to learn more.', 'I\'d love to learn more.', 22182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, me a cook?  I suppose that\'s true.  A barmaid\'s got to work in the kitchens from time to time, and I\'ve learned a few recipes over the years.  Nothing too special, but they\'re hearty enough to fill Grok\'s substantial belly.', 22181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear you\'re quite the cook.', 'I hear you\'re quite the cook.', 22180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like a drink.', 'I\'d like a drink.', 22179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'ll it be, sweety?', 22178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s happening?', 'What\'s happening?', 22177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Jaina told me to speak to you about using a gryphon to survey Alcaz Island.', 'Lady Jaina told me to speak to you about using a gryphon to survey Alcaz Island.', 22176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What an impressive display of alluring prospects!', 22175, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yoooohoo, you well-proportioned charmer, you!', 22174, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sweetie! Are you interested in a woman able to hold intelligent discourse and look attractive while doing so?', 22173, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You! The cute one! Would you like to go over to my place and look over my tool collection?', 22172, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yoohoo! Over here, sweet stuff!', 22171, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooo, walk by again, cutie! Your posterior muscles are very finely toned!', 22170, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand that many individuals seek romance in taverns and festivals like this one, but alcohol dulls the senses and makes calculating the difficulties of daily life all fuzzy!$b$bBut I\'ve found a solution! Through many trials and tribulations, I\'ve engineered an extraordinary device! With these goggles on, ANYONE looks attractive!$b$bMmm... including you, cutie! Tell you what. I\'ll give you a discount!', 'I understand that many individuals seek romance in taverns and festivals like this one, but alcohol dulls the senses and makes calculating the difficulties of daily life all fuzzy!$b$bBut I\'ve found a solution! Through many trials and tribulations, I\'ve engineered an extraordinary device! With these goggles on, ANYONE looks attractive!$b$bMmm... including you, cutie! Tell you what. I\'ll give you a discount!', 22169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 24, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I miss my dog so much!', '', 22168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you help me find my dog?', '', 22167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is that dog?', '', 22166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WOOP! WOOP! Unauthorized retrieval of valuables detected. Activating security system.', '', 22165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met, $c. I\'m learning the art of gryphon handling from Baldruc over there. One day, I hope to run my own stable of gryphons.', 22164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one expects the Dark Iron dwarves!', 'No one expects the Dark Iron dwarves!', 22163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey... what\'s this? A pair of manacles and not just any. These are enchanted. This cargo, it wasn\'t a thing... it was a person!', '', 22162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More ugly jewelry... letters home... I\'m beginning to give up hope!', '', 22161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... old coins... ugly jewelry...', '', 22160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, well, listen here, $c. I\'m older than I look and wise beyond my years. You\'d do well not to question me so much.\n\nLook, you don\'t need to take my word for it. Read the postings on any local bulletin board for yourself. I\'m everywhere!$b$bJust do yourself a favor and ignore the ones with \'WANTED\' in the title. Simple misunderstandings, I assure you.', '', 22159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 274, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('Really? That\'s quite a claim....', 'Really? That\'s quite a claim....', 22158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope, can\'t say I\'ve heard of you.', 'Nope, can\'t say I\'ve heard of you.', 22157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told. I know, I know... he\'s a gnoll.  But he\'s a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!$B$BAnd we are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!', 22156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be losin\' me patience! Go on: make dem wish dey was never born!', '', 22155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh come now, don\'t be ridiculous! I\'m the one and only Budd Nedreck!$b$bI\'ve been all over this land, from the top of Mount Hyjal to the depths of the Sunken Temple. In fact, I was the first to call it the Sunken Temple!$b$bYes, that was me. Don\'t give it a second thought.\n\n', '', 22154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 274, 0, 500, 1000, 39653),
('Uhh, who are you?', 'Uhh, who are you?', 22153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can only assume that you know who I am. And yet you insist on disturbing me?$b$bWhat could you possibly want that requires my attention?', '', 22152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ride now! Ride out dere and bring me back some heads!', '', 22151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait! I want some coffee!', 'Wait! I want some coffee!', 22150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see that I\'ve got places to go and people to see! Step aside, peasant!', '', 22149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 397, 0, 0, 1, 0, 39653),
('Wake up, orc, I\'m parched! Sell me something to drink....', 'Wake up, orc, I\'m parched! Sell me something to drink....', 22148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm? Uhg... gah, rhmmrugh...', '', 22147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards, go already! Who you more afraid of, dem... or me?', '', 22146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mua-ha-ha!', '', 22145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get da move on, guards! It be killin\' time!', '', 22144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoah! You really want buy from us?', '', 22143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Thunderbrews take pride knowing that we are the best brewhouse in all the realms.', '', 22142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t find a better brew in Azeroth.', '', 22141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU TRY DA\' BEST, NOW TRY DA\' REST! OGRE BREW!', '', 22140, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEY YOU! DRINK OGRE BREWS! MAKE YOU BIG AND STRONG!', '', 22139, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU WANT DRINK?! WE GOT DRINK!', '', 22138, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look like you could use a cold one. Thunderbrew\'s got ya covered!', 22137, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'THUNDER! THUNDER! THUNDER! THUNDERBREW, HO!', 22136, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thunderbrew, finest brewery in all the realms.', 22135, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Barleybrews have always been leaders in brewery innovation.  Check out our newest creation, Barleybrew Clear!', 22134, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come try our Barleybrew Dark!', 22133, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Barleybrew, finest brewery in Azeroth!', 22132, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should you venture outside the gates, $c, be alert; a garishly-dressed troll may attempt to approach you. Leave him to his exile where he rightly belongs.', '', 22131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep a wary eye out, $r; there are unsavory characters afoot.', '', 22130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let it never be said that we do not listen to the concerns of the people. This \"Griftah\" individual has made false claims, and we mean to set things right.', '', 22129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep back from this stall, please; there is a delicate investigation underway.', '', 22128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no need to worry - the swindler who peddled his \"wares\" here has been exiled from our fair city.', '', 22127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This stall is under official investigation. Please keep your distance.', '', 22126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing to see here. Move along.', '', 22125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The merchant known as Griftah has been exiled from this city for his fraudulent activities. We plan to go over these little knick-knacks he sells extremely carefully. Please, leave his stall undisturbed and let us do our work.', '', 22124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, I know what ya be thinkin\'. Ol\' Griftah\'s in a spot of trouble. This be nothin\'. I still got a lotta my stock on me, so c\'mere and check out what I got.', '', 22123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe they be chasin\' me outta the city. Innit supposed to be a refuge? Ol\' Griftah be a refugee! Not my fault I be an ENTERPRISIN\' refugee...', '', 22122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, wait, $c! Ya been by the market lately? My stall\'s okay, yeah? Still there?', '', 22121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, okay, I know what ya be thinkin\'. This be a stick. But it be no ORDINARY stick, no! What ya be seein\' here, $c, be a stick of incredible rarity and extraordinary value, shaped by the very powers that wrought the world! Ya wanna own this fantastic piece of Draenor, touched by magnificent power, I know ya do. I be practically givin\' em away!', '', 22120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin\' nothin\' on the tried and true mystical methods of... the... uh... the newly relocated Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!', '', 22119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check this out, $r! Ya know what $G ya:yer sweetheart; be needin\'? One of these flowers. Lilacs, right outta the mystical forest of Terokkar! Rare! So rare! Ya don\'t see any of \'em around me, do ya? A pretty flower for a pretty lady, right? Right?', '', 22118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
