('Yak, yak! Let\'s get to the drinking!', 'Yak, yak! Let\'s get to the drinking!', 21996, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MORE POUR, LESS BORE!', 'MORE POUR, LESS BORE!', 21995, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speed it up, Tinker!', 'Speed it up, Tinker!', 21994, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... okay, I\'ll just wait for zero then...', 'Oh... okay, I\'ll just wait for zero then...', 21993, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right, right... So let\'s start the countdown from ten, ready?  TEN!', 'Right, right... So let\'s start the countdown from ten, ready?  TEN!', 21992, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... uh...  I guess the Keg Tapper 74205 will have to wait... but that\'s okay, I\'ve got some designs for the Keg Tapper 75633...', 'Well... uh...  I guess the Keg Tapper 74205 will have to wait... but that\'s okay, I\'ve got some designs for the Keg Tapper 75633...', 21991, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So I had my top men and women start working on a machine to do this exact task!  We\'ve calculated down to the second how best to dist-', 'So I had my top men and women start working on a machine to do this exact task!  We\'ve calculated down to the second how best to dist-', 21990, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can understand that. But the King did allow for a change, letting a gnome tap the keg.  So I got a chance to work on a new type of problem; How to efficiently and quickly open the keg and distribute its contents such that all participants will receive equal parts quickly and efficiently.', 'I can understand that. But the King did allow for a change, letting a gnome tap the keg.  So I got a chance to work on a new type of problem; How to efficiently and quickly open the keg and distribute its contents such that all participants will receive equal parts quickly and efficiently.', 21989, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When King Magni approached me about these festivities I was excited.  I began explaining how with a little help from the gnomes, we could really make this a blast to remember.  Sadly, King Magni wanted to keep it simple.  He wanted to honor the past.', 'When King Magni approached me about these festivities I was excited.  I began explaining how with a little help from the gnomes, we could really make this a blast to remember.  Sadly, King Magni wanted to keep it simple.  He wanted to honor the past.', 21988, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lashes out, opening a large gash on $n!\n', '', 21987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh...', 'Uh oh...', 21986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good times! <hic!>', 'Good times! <hic!>', 21985, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'sh great to finally drink with friendsh... Normally I\'d jusht sit at home and drink alone.', 'It\'sh great to finally drink with friendsh... Normally I\'d jusht sit at home and drink alone.', 21984, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Anyone shee that cute blond dwarf?  I shwear they were jusht here...', 'Hey! Anyone shee that cute blond dwarf?  I shwear they were jusht here...', 21983, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The besht part about drinking is pretending to be drunk... I\'m jusht pretending guys.', 'The besht part about drinking is pretending to be drunk... I\'m jusht pretending guys.', 21982, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s all the fuss about here?', 'What\'s all the fuss about here?', 21981, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You guys have gotta try thish...', 'You guys have gotta try thish...', 21980, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey fellas!  How\'s it going?', 'Hey fellas!  How\'s it going?', 21979, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'ll leave a mark...  I\'ll just rest here for a bit.', 'That\'ll leave a mark...  I\'ll just rest here for a bit.', 21978, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you\'ll shee shome real fancy riding!', 'Now you\'ll shee shome real fancy riding!', 21977, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Lishten up!  I\'ve got... I have something important to talk about!  Shee... Wait... What wash I shaying?  Something aboutsh boats and floating... Yeah! Sho don\'t float on a boat... Thank you...', 'Hey! Lishten up!  I\'ve got... I have something important to talk about!  Shee... Wait... What wash I shaying?  Something aboutsh boats and floating... Yeah! Sho don\'t float on a boat... Thank you...', 21976, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal foci?  Of course we\'ll explain it seeing as you only have half the brain power to figure it out.$B$BA depleted crystal focus can be combined with ten apexis shards in a simple process, which creates a charged crystal focus.  These charged foci have some healing properties, but more important is their use with a possessed demon.$B$BYou see, the charged focus can be used to enable a possessed demon to exhibit special powers.  If you have a darkrune, Gahk will speak to you about that.', '', 21975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal foci?  Of course we\'ll explain it seeing as you only have half the brain power to figure it out.$B$BA depleted crystal focus can be combined with ten apexis shards in a simple process, which creates a charged crystal focus.  These charged foci have some healing properties, but more important is their use with a possessed demon.$B$BYou see, the charged focus can be used to enable a possessed demon to exhibit special powers.  After a time, Gahk will have a mission for you to do just that.', '', 21974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kronk, tell me about the charged crystal foci.', 'Kronk, tell me about the charged crystal foci.', 21973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go!', 'Let\'s go!', 21972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get out of here!', '', 21971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewfest is a non-stop party.  Setting up for it, though, is non-stop work!', 'Brewfest is a non-stop party.  Setting up for it, though, is non-stop work!', 21970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
