('Well, if it isn\'t our resident $g flyboy : flygirl;, $n.  How\'s it going, ace?', 'Well, if it isn\'t our resident $g flyboy : flygirl;, $n.  How\'s it going, ace?', 21898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
