('Well one thing\'s for sure, $n\'s not a nugget any more!', 'Well one thing\'s for sure, $n\'s not a nugget any more!', 21896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh, the skies aren\'t so friendly with $n flying them!', 'Heh, the skies aren\'t so friendly with $n flying them!', 21895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
