('Buzz the landing pad lately, $n?', 'Buzz the landing pad lately, $n?', 21889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good hunting up there, $n!', 'Good hunting up there, $n!', 21888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough!  I will take care of these fools myself!', '', 21887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
