('', 'For Quel\'Thalas! For the Sunwell!', 21717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No second chances!', 21716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Destiny... awaits.', 21715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Skyguard shall pay for your temerity, $n!', '', 21714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As it should be.', 21713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My work is done.', 21712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flee or die!', 21711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tire of interruptions from the insignificant.  Your time has come, $n!', '', 21710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forsaken brew such intriguing and strong concoctions, don\'t you think? It comes from an inability to poison oneself with failures, I believe. Luckily for you, Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Undercity has already done the necessary research; all that remains is for you to visit him.', 'The Forsaken brew such intriguing and strong concoctions, don\'t you think? It comes from an inability to poison oneself with failures, I believe. Luckily for you, Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Undercity has already done the necessary research; all that remains is for you to visit him.', 21709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to kill me? You first!', '', 21707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you by your stench, little $n.  Here, in my perch, is where your bones shall finally rest.', '', 21706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anar\'alah belore!', '', 21705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not cut out for this.', '', 21704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You got... lucky.', '', 21703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death is at hand, $n.  Savor these last moments.', '', 21702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A glorious kill!', '', 21701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please. Show Razia your weak little concoctions if you must. Return to me when you can handle more... potent fare.', 'Please. Show Razia your weak little concoctions if you must. Return to me when you can handle more... potent fare.', 21700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valiant effort.', '', 21699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to test me?', '', 21698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eager to die, are we?', '', 21697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from my clutch!!!', '', 21696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard tell of a truly skilled smith across the sea named Saru Steelfury. The smithy in Orgrimmar is where you should head if you wish to ply your trade, $c. Best of luck.', '', 21695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May whatever god you believe in have mercy on you.  For I will show you none.', '', 21694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t you go hone your skills with Mirvedon first? He\'ll gladly show you the basics.', '', 21693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will make your death a quick one, $n.', '', 21692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, come. If you\'ve properly prepared your leather for once, I\'ll show you how to fashion serviceable items.', 'Come, come. If you\'ve properly prepared your leather for once, I\'ll show you how to fashion serviceable items.', 21691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What better teacher for working leather than one who lives encased in it daily and could make a fine pelt herself if she were to meet an unfortunate end? Una in Thunder Bluff can show you more than I, if you can stand the stench.', 'What better teacher for working leather than one who lives encased in it daily and could make a fine pelt herself if she were to meet an unfortunate end? Una in Thunder Bluff can show you more than I, if you can stand the stench.', 21690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I shall consume your flesh, so too shall the Burning Legion consume your people!', '', 21689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am older than you can fathom.  Show some respect!', '', 21688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your laughable stitching is best observed by Talmar there; come back when you understand how to properly cure a hide, perhaps. Your work smells foul.', 'Your laughable stitching is best observed by Talmar there; come back when you understand how to properly cure a hide, perhaps. Your work smells foul.', 21687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What mysteries of the trade can I help you uncover today?', 21686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dragonmaw must be stopped...', '', 21685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you seek to advance your training beyond what I have to show you, you\'ll need to sully those fine clothes. Hgarth has unlocked a number of mysteries in our profession, and lurks in the hills behind Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains.', 21684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t cry, $n.  It will all soon be over.  I promise not to spit upon your corpse.', '', 21683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You haven\'t yet mastered the simplest of enchantments. Please, trouble Dolothos instead.', 21682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $c and $g his : her; friends... how quaint.  This shouldn\'t take long.', '', 21681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many fools, so little time!', '', 21680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think that you\'re $g man : woman; enough to take the depleted item from me?', '', 21679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, allow me to give you some advice: tuck tail now and fly back down to the safety of the valleys below.', '', 21678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You activated the accelerator with only this motley assemblage to back you up?', '', 21677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have other matters to attend to for the master.  Let\'s make this quick so that I can get back to them.', '', 21676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know what you\'re playing with, $n?  Here, allow me to educate you and your friends.', '', 21675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bash\'ir sends his regrets that he could not make it, but he sent me along to salve your disappointment.', '', 21674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master is busy, but I have time to come out and play!', '', 21673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And wheresoever did you find the module to activate that controller?  No matter, you won\'t be doing that again.', '', 21672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I\'ll be able to sell your hide on the market.  Then again, it\'s likely worthless.', '', 21671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were expecting one of my harbingers?', '', 21670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look forward to teaching you the error of your ways.', '', 21669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave off. I don\'t have anything for the likes of you.', 'Leave off. I don\'t have anything for the likes of you.', 21668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hammer of justice shall now find you guilty!', '', 21667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to face the wrath of the light!', '', 21666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be judged by the Light!', '', 21665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We... are... lost.', '', 21664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory to the Scryers! The Dragonmaw have been defeated!', '', 21663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting your skill in Mooncloth Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Mooncloth Tailoring to create!$b$bAre you absolutely sure?\n', 'Forgetting your skill in Mooncloth Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Mooncloth Tailoring to create!$b$bAre you absolutely sure?\n', 21662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting your skill in Shadoweave Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Shadoweave Tailoring to create!$b$bAre you absolutely sure?\n', 'Forgetting your skill in Shadoweave Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Shadoweave Tailoring to create!$b$bAre you absolutely sure?\n', 21661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting your skill in Spellfire Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Spellfire Tailoring to create!$b$bAre you absolutely sure?', 'Forgetting your skill in Spellfire Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Spellfire Tailoring to create!$b$bAre you absolutely sure?\n', 21660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn Mooncloth Tailoring.', 'I wish to unlearn Mooncloth Tailoring.', 21659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn Shadoweave Tailoring.', 'I wish to unlearn Shadoweave Tailoring.', 21658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s feeds on the freshly-killed warp chaser.', '', 21657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BURN IT DOWN!', '', 21656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KILL THEM ALL!', '', 21655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s next?', 'Who\'s next?', 21654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LET\'S ROCK!', 'LET\'S ROCK!', 21653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you want some of this?', 'Oh, you want some of this?', 21652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come and get it!', 'Come and get it!', 21651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on!', 'Come on!', 21650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go!', 'Let\'s go!', 21649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heads up!', 'Heads up!', 21648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love when they do that.', 'I love when they do that.', 21647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think the rumors about the Infinite Dragonflight are true?  I\'ve sensed it... the familiarity.', 21646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is a dangerous train of thought.  If something was truly amiss, Soridormi would be the first to know.', '', 21645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can we say, $n?  $G Dude : Dudette;, anything that we have in the store is yours to purchase!$B$BRight on!', '', 21644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re like something of a revered figure around here, $g man : kitten;.  Seems like everyone\'s talking about you.  That\'s cool.$B$BLet\'s see if there\'s something in stock that you\'re interested in.  We have a lot of nice stuff.', '', 21643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chu\'a\'lor\'s been saying good things about you, $n.  If you want, we have a couple of special ogre brews for sale.$B$BThey\'re really tasty!', '', 21642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, remember, $n, we\'ll make this stuff available for you to buy as you do good deeds.  It\'s like a karma thing, or something.$B$BSo, help out where you can, including with our Skyguard friends just to the north.$B$BAwesome... thanks!', '', 21641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peace, child, your time has not yet come. Remain here and witness that which is to unfold.', '', 21640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who calls me to this world?  The stars are not yet aligned... my powers fail me!  You will pay for this!', '', 21639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, I\'m sure that I can find a Skyguard out there that can make use o\' the cloak.$B$BThere\'s yer apexis crystal.  I hope it makes ya happier than that cloak did.', '', 21638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I\'m sure.  I want to exchange my Deathwing Brood Cloak for an Apexis Crystal.', 'Yes, I\'m sure.  I want to exchange my Deathwing Brood Cloak for an Apexis Crystal.', 21637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are ya sure, $g laddy : lassie;?  Once I trade ya, I ain\'t gonna trade it back.', '', 21636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sounds fine to me.', 'That sounds fine to me.', 21635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Call forth Terokk.>', '<Call forth Terokk.>', 21634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand tall, soldiers. Show them no quarter!', '', 21633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defenders, show these mongrels the fury of a Scryer!', '', 21632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Overlord Mor\'ghor salutes.>', '', 21631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye don\'t?  But ya worked so hard ta get it!  Well, $g lad : lass;, if ya want, I\'ll take it off o\' yer hands fer a fair price.$B$BHow does an exchange of yer cloak fer an apexis crystal sound ta ye?', '', 21630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sky Commander Keller, I don\'t like my Deathwing Brood Cloak.', 'Sky Commander Keller, I don\'t like my Deathwing Brood Cloak.', 21629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jho\'nass, let me see what you have to offer.', 'Jho\'nass, let me see what you have to offer.', 21628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am an envoy of Balthas. He has sent me to collect a flawless arcane essence.', 'I am an envoy of Balthas. He has sent me to collect a flawless arcane essence.', 21627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it that you want?', '', 21626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look man, I only need to know one thing, where they are.', 'Look man, I only need to know one thing, where they are.', 21625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skyguard Rangers, MOUNT UP!!', '', 21624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are about to find out!', '', 21623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyone have any questions?', '', 21622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are Skyguard!  This is what we are trained to do.  We do not retreat, we do not surrender.  We will see our mission through even if it means death! We will secure that information or we will die on the field of battle.', '', 21621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But don\'t underestimate our enemies.  We are invading them.  We are taking the fight to them.  We have them backed into a corner and they will strike back.', '', 21620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rangers, listen up! We stand ready to take the pain directly to the heathen Bash\'ir devils.  Our mission is simple. Hold the area long enough to get accurate readings on their new technology.  ', '', 21619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You having a good time here with us in Ogri\'la?$B$BWe have a lot of stuff that our ogres are making, day and night.  We save the best to sell to our coolest guests like you!$B$BSo, as you\'re out there doing your thing, and making the mountains a safer place, stop by from time to time to see what we have.$B$BGood luck out there, $g man : chicky;.', '', 21618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall add another year to your enslavement for your failure!', '', 21617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incompetent fools!  Why must we suffer your stupidity?', '', 21616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you done you fools?', '', 21615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('About time you showed up!  That forge has been busted for almost an hour!', '', 21614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get over there and realign The Crystal Forge.', '', 21613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are humbled by your selflessness, $n.  If in the past we\'ve seemed a bit conceited, realize that it is by your example that we were able to change our attitudes.$B$BWe thank you, and hope that you\'ll continue to assist us in our struggle against the forge camps.', '', 21612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been making quite a name for yourself around here, $r.  Good for you.$B$BWe trust that you won\'t let that go to your single head, and that you\'ll still help out by banishing demons?', '', 21611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are here to help.', '', 21610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello friend! What can we do for you?', '', 21609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honored $G brother:sister;, how may we help?', '', 21608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Since the sparrowhawks have proven such a success in hunting down the raven stones, Watcher Elaira has trained another one to relay my voice at a great distance. He can help us communicate as you investigate the bird spirits revealed in the tablet!', 21607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will regret this, mortal! Reth\'hedron will return... I will have my vengeance!', '', 21606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How might we be of assistance?', '', 21605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can we get for you, our exalted $G brother:sister;?', '', 21604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 16, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Us sure see yous here all da time!$B$BChu\'a\'lor say little $r our $g hero : heroine;!$B$B$n like one of us ogres now.  Only, Gahk confused because $n need to be bigger for dat!', '', 21603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gahk like little, $r $n.  Yous kill da big demon; make all da little demons scared!$B$B<Gahk\'s heads both grin at you.>', '', 21602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Us starting ta like little $n!  Yous bashem da demons real good!', '', 21601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot thank you enough for everything you\'ve done to protect our family, $n.$B$BAnd, you do realize that we were joking before when we offered to sell you one of our sons?  No, really... although we do feel a couple more headaches coming on.$B$BJunior, be still, will you?!', '', 21600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 6, 15, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have steel that needs shaping?', '', 21599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here in Ogri\'la we have time to contemplate the riddle of steel. But enough of that, how can we help?', '', 21598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s amazing how much you\'ve helped us out.  We dare say that if it weren\'t for you, we\'d already have been overrun by the demons, or fried to a crisp by the Black Dragonflight!$B$BOn a side note, we did mention that we\'d sell you one of our sons, cheap, right?  No, not interested?', '', 21597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is steel compared to the hand that shapes it?', '', 21596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s an honor to have a $r such as yourself aiding us ogres.  You\'re keeping our hope of a better future alive.$B$BNow if we could just get rid of these headaches.  Are you sure you don\'t want one of our sons?', '', 21595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are few things you can trust in life. Steel, you can trust.', '', 21594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('First you became $g king : queen; of the ogres below, and now you have exalted yourself amongst us of Ogri\'la.$B$BThis is unheard of for a $r, and yet, there you stand as living proof.  I thank you, $n, and we all owe you a debt that we will never truly be able to repay!', '', 21593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your name is beginning to be revered around here.$B$B<Chu\'a\'lor\'s left eye pierces you with its stony gaze.>$B$BKeep up the good work, $n!', '', 21592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steel isn\'t strong, exalted one, flesh is stronger. Steel gains its strength from the one who wields it. But enough of that... How can we help you exalted one?', '', 21591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Chu\'a\'lor\'s left head says,>$B$BWe find your zeal to help us most appealing...$B$B<His right head concludes,>$B$B... and we want you to know that we greatly appreciate your efforts!', '', 21590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The relics are truly a great mystery.  Perhaps by studying them regularly, you will gain a finer appreciation of their capabilities.', '', 21589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you don\'t think I\'m a stalker, or anything like that, $n.$B$BI mean, I know that you\'re real famous within the Skyguard now, and well... I\'m sure that you wouldn\'t want to hang out with a lowly peon like me.$B$BBut, if you ever want to get together to just hang out, or even wrangle some more rays, drop by anytime!  I\'ll be here.$B$BI miss you...', 21588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 18, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, you\'ve been around a lot, but we seem to keep missing each other for getting together after work.$B$BIs it me?$B$B<Khatie purposely cheers up.>$B$BAnyway, I just wanted to say that I... we really appreciate everything that you\'ve been doing for the Skyguard!', 21587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, $n, it\'s such an honor to work with you!$B$BWhen you\'re not busy wrangling, maybe we could $g go out some place for dinner? : get together for a girl\'s night?;$B$BOh, did I mention that we can now get you to our base in the Skethyl Mountains real quick?  If you want, speak with Skyguard Handler Irena about that.', 21586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 24, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you looking for?', '', 21585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend! It\'s been too long.  What can we get for you?', '', 21584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, $c!$B$B<Khatie looks at you slyly.>$B$BAnytime you want to wrangle us up some more aether rays, you make sure to come and see me!', 21583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honored $G brother:sister;, how can we help?', '', 21582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are happy to provide you with supplies.', '', 21581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, I admit it, you\'ve proven yourself and then some, $n.$B$BIf I was hard on you before it was because I saw the spark of a true Skyguard within you.  I dare say that you\'re the finest ace that we have!$B$BAnytime that you want to help out, I\'ll be more than proud to hand you another set of bombs.', 21580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can we be of service, exalted one?', '', 21579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 16, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your name seems to be on everyone\'s lips around the outpost.  Don\'t let it get to your head; I know that you can do better!$B$BI\'ll be watching you, rookie.', 21578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see that you\'ve been putting in your time around here, $c.$B$BPut in more; the demons aren\'t gone yet, rookie.', 21577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I say, $n?  Yer the finest o\' the Sha\'tari Skyguard!$B$BJust don\'t be lettin\' that go ta yer head.  I can still teach ya a thing or two, $g lad : lass;!$B$B<Sky Commander Keller grins at you and winks.>', '', 21576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink or be gone!', '', 21575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer gettin\' ta be something of a revered figure \'round here, $g boy : girl;!  If\'n I didn\'t know better, I\'d say ye were gunnin\' fer me job!!!$B$BAll the same, if ye keep up the way ye have been, ye\'ll deserve it!', '', 21574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the spirit, $g laddy : lassie;!  Yer making all of us proud with all o\' the work ye be doing!$B$BAnd ya know, if ya want a quick trip ta our other base in the Skethyl Mountains, go down an talk ta Skyguard Handler Irena.  She\'ll set ya up nicely.', '', 21573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 71, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ya have something better ta do, $g lad : lass; than jaw with me?$B$BNow get out there and prove yer mettle!', '', 21572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our drinks should quench even the mightiest of thirsts.', '', 21571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings $G brother:sister;, how can we help?', '', 21570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting your knowledge is an expensive endeavor.  Are you willing to pay the cost?', 'Forgetting your knowledge is an expensive endeavor.  Are you willing to pay the cost?', 21569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone\'s gotta drink. What can we get for you?', '', 21568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn Spellfire Tailoring.', 'I wish to unlearn Spellfire Tailoring.', 21566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll let you in on our secret diet: Cocktails and dreams. We can help you with one.', '', 21565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting your skill in Spellfire Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Spellfire Tailoring to create!', 'Forgetting your skill in Spellfire Tailoring is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Spellfire Tailoring to create!', 21564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This door is all that stands between us and the Betrayer.  Stand aside, friends.', '', 21563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be reasonable! You cannot hope to stop the Burning Legion! Let us discuss this in a civilized manner. I can offer you power beyond your wildest dreams!', '', 21562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flee now while you still have your life!', '', 21561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will break you in two! Relent, fool!', '', 21560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are making me angry, mortal!', '', 21559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop us!', '', 21558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
