('What do you hope to accomplish from this, insect?', '', 21556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary, friends. The Betrayer meditates in the court just beyond.', '', 21555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you for your aid, brothers.  Our people will be redeemed!', '', 21554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Absolutely!  Send me to the Skyguard Outpost.', 'Absolutely!  Send me to the Skyguard Outpost.', 21553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day to you.  When you\'ve risen a bit more in the ranks of the Sha\'tari Skyguard, I will be able offer you a direct flight to the Skyguard Outpost, our base atop the Blade\'s Edge Mountains.', '', 21552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $g sir : ma\'am;!  If you want, I have a nether ray waiting to take you to the Skyguard Outpost atop the Blade\'s Edge Mountains.$B$BJust let me know.', '', 21551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I\'d love a ride to Blackwind Landing.', 'Yes, I\'d love a ride to Blackwind Landing.', 21550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $n.  Need to quickly get to Blackwind Landing, our base in the Skethyl Mountains?  I\'ve got a pretty little nether ray ready.$B$BYou want to go now?  You just say the word, $g big guy : bunny;!', 21549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot do this alone...', '', 21548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, comrade.  If you get yourself in good with the Skyguard, I can offer you a direct flight to our base, Blackwind Landing, in the Skethyl Mountains.$B$BDo you like my beautiful nether ray?  It is lovely.', 21547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
