('We do not know. We believe that the Black Dragonflight is involved as are some independent third parties. That is why you are here, $r. You will unravel this mystery from the inside and bring redemption to Netherwing.$B$BAnd now... I can only assume she asked you to bring back my hand.', '', 21463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are these bidders?', 'Who are these bidders?', 21462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dragonmaw are corrupt. They are strip-mining this island of all natural resources and using those resources to supply Illidan\'s armies out of the Black Temple. They take much for themselves, however, and sell whatever they have hidden away to the highest bidder.', '', 21461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue please.', 'Continue please.', 21460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who speaks of me? What are you talking about, broken?', 'Who speaks of me? What are you talking about, broken?', 21459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Netherwing. They speak to us. They offered us peace and protection. Something the broken have never truly felt. We accepted their offer and assisted Toranaku in rousing the creatures of this mine - at great personal cost to us. Many of my brothers gave their lives for this offensive. We were attempting to make the mine uninhabitable, forcing the Dragonmaw to relocate and ultimately move off of this island.', '', 21458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overseer?$B$BYou are no more an overseer than I am the king of Stormwind. Yes... You are the one they speak of.', '', 21457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 396, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you question an overseer of the Dragonmaw!', 'How dare you question an overseer of the Dragonmaw!', 21456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here for you, overseer.', 'I am here for you, overseer.', 21455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They sent you to kill me, eh? So predictable... Creatures ruled by terror are all the same.$B$BBut you... You are not one of them...', '', 21454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Murkblood overseer grunts.>', '', 21453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'We must re-establish our stranglehold on these mines!', 21452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cowers in fear as it realizies what the ogre has in mind.', '', 21451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s makes a gesture of dismissal and heads for the launch pad.', '', 21450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, sir. An ogre, sir. But give us a chance, sir! We\'ve been preparing for this since the first time the Skyguard flew over Ogri\'la, sir!', '', 21449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look here, lad. I admire your dedication, but I\'m not sure how to tell you this... You\'re an ogre, son.', '', 21448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, sir! Cadet Torkus Jr. reporting for duty, sir!', '', 21447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out, Skyguard. Here comes Torkus Jr.!', '', 21446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that the flasks are ready, we can show the Skyguard our moves!', '', 21445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defensive Stance! Shield yourself against their blows and strike back!', '', 21444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Berserker Stance! Attack them recklessly!', '', 21443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ack, ye\'ve been busy now haven\'t ye?!  I canna thank ye enough for bombing them demons and resupplying us with mounts.$B$BYer making our job all the more easier.  Keep up the good work, $g laddy : lassie;!', '', 21442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battle Stance! Prepare for an offensive rush!', '', 21441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find plenty to do here, $n.', '', 21440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy sighted!  Fall into formation and prepare for bombing maneuvers!', 'Enemy sighted!  Fall into formation and prepare for bombing maneuvers!', 21439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abort mission!  Our ground forces have been defeated.', 'Abort mission!  Our ground forces have been defeated.', 21438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They did it!  Enemy down!  Return to base!', 'They did it!  Enemy down!  Return to base!', 21437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you shall witness the meaning of true power!', '', 21436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been a long while since I fought a worthy adversary...', '', 21435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am an ally of the Cenarion Expedition, Mortog. Show me your wares.', 'I am an ally of the Cenarion Expedition, Mortog. Show me your wares.', 21434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Cenarion Expedition rescued me from certain death inside the mines. I owe them my life! I offer up my services of repair and reagent sales to those that are allies of the Cenarion Expedition.', '', 21433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I weep for you, $n. You really have no idea what you\'ve gotten yourself into...', '', 21432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I am undone... The new top orc is $n!', '', 21431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare a funeral pyre! $n has challenged Skyshatter!', '', 21430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MULVERICK!', '', 21429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you place the apexis shards into the nest surrounding the dragon egg, they begin to hum.  A few moments later a crack appears in the rugged shell, and a black dragon whelpling emerges, squalling for its father.>', '', 21428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s screams out for its father.', '', 21427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the best I\'ve ever seen. I can\'t believe I\'m saying this but you might have a chance against Skyshatter. And hey, if that doesn\'t go so well you can be my wing man...', '', 21426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in for a rough ride, $n. I hope you\'ve already made funeral arrangements.', '', 21425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for that... It was humbling to be served in such a manner.', '', 21424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m taking this back to the old school. I\'ll be the Alliance and you be Frostwolf Village. BOMBS AWAY!', '', 21423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You put up a hell of a fight, newbie. Hell of a fight...', '', 21422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this over with...', '', 21421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s screams out for its mother.', '', 21420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did well. Certainly a surprise to Trope... Report back to Ja\'y.', '', 21419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trope will show you how to fly like a Dragonmaw... You will show Trope how to die like a scrub.', '', 21418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Angela coos to the felhunter again before turning her attention to you.>$B$BJir\'see\'s always been smaller than all the other felhunters, but that\'s never bothered him. And Outland\'s going to change all that, right Jir\'see?$B$BMomma\'s little angel is going to grow up to be a big, fierce felhunter, yes he is!', 21417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you place the apexis shards into the nest surrounding the dragon egg, they begin to hum.  A few moments later a crack appears in the rugged shell, and a black dragon whelpling emerges, squalling for its mother.>', '', 21416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place 35 Apexis Shards near the dragon egg to crack it open.', 'Place 35 Apexis Shards near the dragon egg to crack it open.', 21415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The egg appears resilient as an egg of the Black Dragonflight rightfully should.  Perhaps if you were to place a great many apexis shards next to it, their vibrations would cause it to crack open?$B$BToo bad that you don\'t appear to have the thirty-five apexis shards necessary to do the job.', '', 21414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The egg appears resilient as an egg of the Black Dragonflight rightfully should.  Perhaps if you were to place a great many apexis shards next to it, their vibrations would cause it to crack open?', '', 21413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to hurt me?  I have nothing to do with the war, $r.$B$BI\'m just a sickly scholar, please leave me alone!', '', 21412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look it\'s the Skyguard!!', 'Look it\'s the Skyguard!!', 21411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t. You\'re not strong enough to participate in ranking matches yet. Still, you can find an Arena Battlemaster and get in some practice rounds. It\'s never too soon to start training.', 'You don\'t. You\'re not strong enough to participate in ranking matches yet. Still, you can find an Arena Battlemaster and get in some practice rounds. It\'s never too soon to start training.', 21410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t wait to join the Skyguard. We just need to take a few more magical flasks, right?', 'We can\'t wait to join the Skyguard. We just need to take a few more magical flasks, right?', 21409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Skyguard need our help! We need to get more magical flasks.', 'The Skyguard need our help! We need to get more magical flasks.', 21408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have we taken enough magical flasks to join the Skyguard yet?', 'Have we taken enough magical flasks to join the Skyguard yet?', 21407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When are we going to get some more magical flasks?', 'When are we going to get some more magical flasks?', 21406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On behalf of all of Ogri\'la, we give you thanks for your efforts, $n.$B$B<Chu\'a\'lor\'s left head nods while his right head smiles at you.>$B$BAnd do not forget that by helping us here you are also helping to protect our brethren down below whom you have become like a $g king : queen; to.', '', 21405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Ogri\'la, $c.$B$BThe ogres here have managed to gain a great mental acuity through the magical emanations of the surrounding crystals.  Though we do not fully understand how they work, we have come to appreciate our new home and only want to live in peace.$B$BUnfortunate then that the demons and ethereals, and especially the Black Dragonflight, will not leave us to that peace.', '', 21404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n smash warp-gate good, but da demons make it strong again.$B$B$n bring Gahk another darkrune and Gahk make special crystalforged darkrune for $n!', '', 21403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gahk now smart!  Us know how ta make da darkrune into da crystalforged darkrune!', '', 21402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gahk new at Ogri\'la like little $r.  It like heaven da other ogres below always talk about.  But, Gahk\'s heads hurt from crystal making Gahk smarter.$B$B<Both of Gahk\'s heads nod to each other.>$B$BUs learning ta make da crystalforged darkrune.  When us learn dat, we smash da demon\'s warp-gate!', '', 21401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Opening', 'Opening', 21400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the beast.  These flasks make the imbiber more agile, stronger and heartier.$B$BIt appears, however, that you do not have the ten shards necessary to purchase even a single flask.', '', 21399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bash\'ir crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the sorcerer.  These flasks make the imbiber more intelligent, heartier, and increase the effectiveness of their damaging and healing magics.$B$BIt appears, however, that you do not have the requisite ten shards to purchase even a single flask.', '', 21398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We wish that we could create more than one darkrune in a day, but that would be a waste of time.  It\'s simply not physically possible.  Besides, we can\'t even reliably create them at that rate.$B$BAnd trust us, if there were anyone else here smart enough to help, they\'d be conscripted and we\'d have as many darkrunes as needed.', '', 21397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a relative newcomer to Ogri\'la, you don\'t have enough exposure to the crystals here to reap their full benefits.  Besides, you only have one head.$B$BWe, on the other hand, have been here a very long time.  So, as you can imagine, we\'re fairly well-versed in a great many things.$B$BOf late, we\'ve taken a keen interest in the demons of the forge camps.  More specifically, we\'ve devised a way to rid us of them for good.$B$BAt least, that\'s the theory.', '', 21396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The boy\'s too stupid still to say it -- not enough crystal exposure yet -- but, he\'s thankful for what you did in getting him those flasks.$B$BNow, only nine more sons to go.  Gah!$B$B<Both of Torkus\'s heads sigh.>$B$BWant to take one of them off of our hands?  We\'ll sell him to you cheap.', '', 21395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any sons, $c?$B$BLet us tell you something, we think we were much happier before we came to Ogri\'la and the crystals made us more aware.  Before, we would have just bashed them over the head to get them to shut up.  Now all they do is bother us about the Sha\'tari Skyguard.$B$BIgnorance is bliss!', '', 21394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We hope you\'ll be able to ease our headaches.  You try having ten sons, all of them wanting to do something they weren\'t meant for!$B$BStill, as a father, we do what we must.', '', 21393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you place your apexis shards within the hollow of the Bash\'ir crystalforge and pull the lever, the device literally disintegrates them.  A few moments later your flasks appear at your feet.>', '', 21392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Purchase 5 Unstable Flasks of the Sorcerer for the cost of 50 Apexis Shards', 'Purchase 5 Unstable Flasks of the Sorcerer for the cost of 50 Apexis Shards', 21391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you place your apexis shards within the hollow of the Bash\'ir crystalforge and pull the lever, the device literally disintegrates them.  A few moments later your flask appears at your feet.>', '', 21390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Bash\'ir crystalforge to make another purchase.', 'Use the Bash\'ir crystalforge to make another purchase.', 21389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Purchase 1 Unstable Flask of the Sorcerer for the cost of 10 Apexis Shards', 'Purchase 1 Unstable Flask of the Sorcerer for the cost of 10 Apexis Shards', 21388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bash\'ir crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the sorcerer.  These flasks make the imbiber more intelligent, heartier, and increase the effectiveness of their damaging and healing magics.$B$BMake your choice, below.', '', 21387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you place your apexis shards into the fel crystalforge and pull the lever, the device makes an unworldly sound as it grinds them into dust.  A few moments later your flasks pop out of its \'mouth\'.>', '', 21386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Purchase 5 Unstable Flasks of the Beast for the cost of 50 Apexis Shards', 'Purchase 5 Unstable Flasks of the Beast for the cost of 50 Apexis Shards', 21385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the fel crystalforge to make another purchase.', 'Use the fel crystalforge to make another purchase.', 21384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you place your apexis shards into the fel crystalforge and pull the lever, the device makes an unworldly sound as it grinds them into dust.  A few moments later your flask pops out of its \'mouth\'.>', '', 21383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Purchase 1 Unstable Flask of the Beast for the cost of 10 Apexis Shards', 'Purchase 1 Unstable Flask of the Beast for the cost of 10 Apexis Shards', 21382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel crystalforge can be used to transform your apexis shards into unstable flasks of the beast.  These flasks make the imbiber more agile, stronger and heartier.$B$BMake your choice, below.', '', 21381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place 35 Apexis Shards into the prism.', 'Place 35 Apexis Shards into the prism.', 21380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burning eyes within the prism fill your mind with a sense of dread...', '', 21379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you summon me, $n?', '', 21378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Woo hoo!  More rays for training!', 21377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice job!  She looks like she\'s in fine condition.  Thank you!', 21376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We never have enough of these rays for the Skyguard.  You\'re keeping us afloat... literally!', 21375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t he so cute?!  Thanks for bringing him right to me!!!', 21374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, isn\'t she a beauty!  Can\'t wait to get her properly trained and back up in the air!', 21373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you soooooo much for bringing it back.  I think you\'re going to be my best wrangler ever!', 21372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a peach!  I\'ll make sure that the ray is properly cared for.', 21371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow!  Thanks for bringing it all the way back here.  You didn\'t have to do that.', 21370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woo hoo! Go Skyguard!', 'Woo hoo! Go Skyguard!', 21369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Skyguard are here! The Skyguard are here!', 'The Skyguard are here! The Skyguard are here!', 21368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal prison begins to shatter!', '', 21367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s appears ready to be wrangled.', '', 21366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rushes away to attack $n!', '%s rushes away to attack $n!', 21365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls for an ally to assist him!', '%s calls for an ally to assist her!', 21364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, you won... I guess.', '', 21363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may be old but I can still take on a young whippersnapper like you, $n. Try not to fall behind...', '', 21362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s approaches and waits quietly.', '', 21361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Debug Error: Out of Range', '', 21360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh?  What?  I\'m a little busy here, friend!$B$BOf course, if you\'re here to help, I\'ve got all the time in the world.', 21359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, ye like me eyepatch now do ya?  Well, just make sure that ya don\'t have ta be wearing one yerself now $g boyo : girly;.', '', 21358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop toying with my emotions!', 21357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you don\'t start throwing some real punches, you\'ll be cleaning the drake stalls for a year!', 'If you don\'t start throwing some real punches, you\'ll be cleaning the drake stalls for a year!', 21356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call that an offense? I\'ve seen more offensive tallstriders!', 'You call that an offense? I\'ve seen more offensive tallstriders!', 21355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen female Gnomes hit harder than you!', 'I\'ve seen female Gnomes hit harder than you!', 21354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop your slacking and fight like a true fel orc!', 'Stop your slacking and fight like a true fel orc!', 21353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s becomes increasingly enraged as he sees his allies fall in battle!', '%s becomes increasingly enraged as he sees his allies fall in battle!', 21352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take of my life\'s essence, master!', '', 21351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail our leader!  Hail Akama!', '', 21350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try and keep up, grunt.', '', 21349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail Akama!', '', 21348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
