('', 'You\'ve sufficiently advanced in the field to be beyond my ability to teach. I hear there\'s a skilled engineer named Roxxik in the stinking pit of a city they call Orgrimmar who might be able to train you.', 21323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skill is notable, $c, and I believe the time has come for you to vacate the premises. If you wish to expand your horizons, visit Josef Gregorian in the Undercity.', '', 21322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
