('Welcome to Keelen\'s Trustworthy Tailoring. I think you\'ll find my shop will suit your needs. If you wish to train with me, you need only ask; I\'ll be more than happy to teach you.', '', 21278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
