('$G King : Queen; $n, me die now.', '', 21035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me honored... $g king : queen; kill me.', '', 21034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me go to... Ogri\'la.', '', 21033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agh... me am...dead.', '', 21032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are brothers.  And we will stand united against those who oppose our peace.', 'We are brothers.  And we will stand united against those who oppose our peace.', 21031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must have wondered how it is that I can speak so clearly for an ogre.  It\'s a side effect of the crystals that grow on the terrace surrounding Ogri\'la.  The ogres there gifted me with this staff, and its crystal has in turn gifted me mentally.$B$BIt is through your continued actions, at Ogri\'la above, that I hope to one day be able to bring this boon to all of my ogre brethren.  You have my thanks, my $g king : queen;, for all that you have done and will do.', '', 21030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not listen to Mog\'dorg\'s lies!  Ogri\'la is a myth!  We make our own heaven here with the blood of any that would divide and subjugate us!', '', 21029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come.  Strike down every creature that stands in the way of the clans!', '', 21028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not bow to Mog\'dorg\'s puppet!  He would replace our gronn overlords with a liege of lesser stock.  Why should we replace one master with another?', '', 21027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mountains are for ogres.  Not for gronn, not for humans or orcs!', '', 21026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mog\'dorg is a fool to think that one of the smaller races will be our savior.', '', 21025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ogre clans will not be subjugated.  Not by the gronn, and not by a puny $r like you!', '', 21024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware the Dragonmaw Skybreakers and ascendants as they are not fooled by our magic! Always keep your distance from those entities!\n', '', 21023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fool no one, $r. Even the magic of the Netherwing cannot hide you from the all-seeing gaze of the Skybreakers!', '', 21022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you gonna help?', 21021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('INVADERS! Let the mark of the Dragonmaw guide your anger! Slay $n!', '', 21020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Supremus punches the ground in anger!', '', 21019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ground begins to crack open!', '', 21018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your spells... ke-kaw... are weak magics... easy to turn against you...', '', 21017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your powers... ak-ak... turn against you...', '', 21016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your magics shall be your undoing... ak-a-ak...', '', 21015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, $r. Were you lucky enough to have attended that recent special event?$B$BIf so, you may have learned a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return.', 'Hail, $r. Were you lucky enough to have attended that recent special event?$B$BIf so, you may have learned a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return.', 21014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Golden Pig pet.', 'I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Golden Pig pet.', 21013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... cast your precious little spells, ak-a-ak!', '', 21012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done much for our cause, $n, but you may go no further until you have mastered flight. Only the most stalwart riders are able to assist the Netherwing.', '', 21011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G Brother:Sister;, you are now considered bound by blood to the Netherwing. All of Netherwing will be behind you now! The time to strike at the heart of our enemies is now, friend! We must reclaim our lost heritage.', '', 21010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, that\'s it.  These will do nicely.', '', 21009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am beginning to suspect you are worthless.  Do not disappoint me further.', '', 21008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find what I am looking for and you may have a treat.', '', 21007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That grouping looks promising.', '', 21006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve found nothing?  Very well.  Over there next.', '', 21005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check those crystals over there!', '', 21004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to join your forces in battle, Xi\'ri.', 'I am ready to join your forces in battle, Xi\'ri.', 21003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The light surrounding Xi\'ri pulses blue.  The naaru welcomes you as an ally in the field of battle.>', '', 21002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you gonna do when Rulk-a-mania runs wild on you, brother????!', '', 21001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear that? You hear that chantin\', brother? They\'re cheerin\' for the Rulkster!', '', 21000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you compete with these pythons? Ooooooh yaaaaa, brother!', '', 20999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 23, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OH YEA! You want a taste of these guns, maggot? Step on in!', '', 20998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 23, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have for sale, Rumpus?', 'What do you have for sale, Rumpus?', 20997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes those damnable blood elves stop by and require some inane reagent or poison. I must keep my stock of such items full at all times lest Lord Illidan get word of the Dragonmaw not cooperating...$B$B<Rumpus swallows hard.>$B$BWe don\'t want that...', 'Sometimes those damnable blood elves stop by and require some inane reagent or poison. I must keep my stock of such items full at all times lest Lord Illidan get word of the Dragonmaw not cooperating...$B$B<Rumpus swallows hard.>$B$BWe don\'t want that...', 20996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me want Gug fix armor. Maybe me buy someting.', 'Me want Gug fix armor. Maybe me buy someting.', 20995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have for sale?', 'What do you have for sale?', 20994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no make dis your home. Maybe you want eat someting?', '', 20993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wut you want? Smell funny for fel orc...', '', 20992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awaken, my children and assist your master!', '', 20991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was neat!', 20990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey stupid! Why you banging wall? Wall go up not down! Stupid orc! Up! Up!', '', 20989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why dis wall no go down? Wut doing?', '', 20988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the summon, little one. My group left for the dungeon without me!', 'Thank you for the summon, little one. My group left for the dungeon without me!', 20987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why dis wall no stay up? Me keep banging but no good!', '', 20986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in jewelcrafting.  Interested?', 'I can instruct you in jewelcrafting.  Interested?', 20985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boy, I could really use one of those gryphons right about now...', 'Boy, I could really use one of those gryphons right about now...', 20984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next person who asks me for a potion is getting a knuckle sandwich. I quit alchemy!', 'The next person who asks me for a potion is getting a knuckle sandwich. I quit alchemy!', 20983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there a mage around here? I\'m supposed to be bringing the food and water...', 'Is there a mage around here? I\'m supposed to be bringing the food and water...', 20982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Symbols of Divinity? Check. Candles? Check. Arcane powder, uh... arcane powder? Oh, no! This is the last time I offer to pick up reagents for anyone. Is there a vendor around here?', 'Symbols of Divinity? Check. Candles? Check. Arcane powder, uh... arcane powder? Oh, no! This is the last time I offer to pick up reagents for anyone. Is there a vendor around here?', 20981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s returns to stone.', '', 20980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instruct me further in the use of the naaru\'s power.', 'Instruct me further in the use of the naaru\'s power.', 20979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ambassador Dawnsinger and I represent the Court of the Sun here in Orgrimmar.$B$BThe ambassador handles civil matters, while I advise Thrall on military campaigns and the unique, err... advantages conferred by the Blood Knights.', '', 20978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scary!', 20977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scary!', 20976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek Avaros Dawnglaive. You will find him at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor. I will mark the location for you on your map.', 'You seek Avaros Dawnglaive. You will find him at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor. I will mark the location for you on your map.', 20975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paladin', 'Paladin', 20974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman', 'Shaman', 20973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well now, you can find Farseer Javad in the area of The Great Forge, just a bit to the North on the East side.', 'Well now, you can find Farseer Javad in the area of The Great Forge, just a bit to the North on the East side.', 20972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is yours my Lord!', '', 20971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require your life essence to maintain my existence in this realm.', '', 20970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Essence-Infused Moonstone. Can you replace it?', 'I\'ve lost my Essence-Infused Moonstone. Can you replace it?', 20969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to me when you are better prepared.', '', 20968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You better wake up real quick, rookie.  This isn\'t our cushy backyard outside of Skettis; this is the Blade\'s Edge Mountains!  One false move and it\'s crash and burn!', 20967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me live to serve.', '', 20966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G Him : Her; so tiny!  How $g him : her; rule?', '', 20965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shh... quiet, it da new $g king : queen;.', '', 20964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mercy!', '', 20963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G Him : Her; look too pretty to be da ruler.', '', 20962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel dogs!', '', 20961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G King : Queen; $n.', '', 20960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da $g king : queen;!', '', 20959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('crystal man', '', 20958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now all Sons of Gruul dead!  Now new $g king : queen; lead all ogres to Ogri\'la!', '', 20957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you look at me like dat?  You not gonna kiss me, right!?', '', 20956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G King : Queen; not angry with me?', '', 20955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If $G King : Queen; $n dance, me dance!', '', 20954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis drink good!', '', 20953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me life for $n!', '', 20952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You kill gronn!  Now you fight things from sky?', '', 20951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
