('%s brushes up against $n and farts like only an ogre can.', '', 20926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s cowers at the sight of his angered $g king : queen;.', '', 20925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shh! Keep your voice down. The babes are sleeping.', 20923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Taste the full fury of High Warlord Naj\'entus!', '', 20922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You try my patience, shore-dwellers!', '', 20921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we call forth the arcane acolyte.', '', 20920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire, show yourself!', '', 20919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth, acolyte of earth!', '', 20918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself! The acolyte of water is soon to come...', '', 20917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done!  Let\'s continue.', '', 20916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The process is arduous. We must first summon forth acolytes of the elements. You must then destroy these acolytes so that my minions can make preparations.', '', 20915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s places a fetish at the ritual pile.', '', 20914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So my blood was not a sufficient payment, eh? Fine, let us recover your arcane essence. After this, I owe Balthas nothing.', '', 20913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
