('Prepare yourselves!', '', 20905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, my prince! I have... failed.', '', 20904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready to face Illidan.', 'We\'re ready to face Illidan.', 20903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary, friends. The Betrayer meditates in the court just beyond.', '', 20902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Morthis! Thank Elune! I was worried I\'d never see you again.', '', 20901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Among these crystals we have seen a new path, a path of peace.', 'Among these crystals we have seen a new path, a path of peace.', 20900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was clear that our paths were set.  We were our own greatest enemies, and we were determined to destroy ourselves.', 'It was clear that our paths were set.  We were our own greatest enemies, and we were determined to destroy ourselves.', 20899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet soon we turned on each other.  Brother fought brother to decide who was the mightiest.', 'Yet soon we turned on each other.  Brother fought brother to decide who was the mightiest.', 20898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fought long and hard.  We had proven again and again that we ogres were a force to be reckoned with.', 'We fought long and hard.  We had proven again and again that we ogres were a force to be reckoned with.', 20897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though mighty, we only knew of violence...', 'Though mighty, we only knew of violence...', 20896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
