('', 'Fine beasts, aren\'t they? The wyverns we raise here are trained to handle the fiercest and strangest weather conditions Draenor has to offer. You\'ll find them dependable and hardy.', 20763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
