('', '%s greets the sparrowhawk that helped locate the raven stones.', 20759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tablet has the confirmation we need, just as I thought. Now, we have to use this information to draw out and defeat this Anzu before he can do any more damage to the Emerald Dream!', 20758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s something else here, too. After a description of a bloody battle and the downfall of the raven, there\'s a prophecy. Anzu will haunt the dreams of his enemies, twisting them to effect a return to this world...', 20757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s all here... how the raven\'s followers captured and subdued the spirits of rivals, trapping them forever within stone statues! The tablet even mentions the raven god\'s name -- Anzu. I\'d thought it was lost to history!', 20756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear me brothers and sisters-in-arms! The time of our enemies is at an end! We must strike at the fel orcs that remain! Exterminate them like the vermin that they are! Carry with you the favor of the Sons of Lothar!\n', '', 20755, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The feast of corruption is no more! Magtheridon has fallen to the battle prowess of $n and $g his:her; allies! Witness the might of the Alliance! A pit lord commander is destroyed!\n', '', 20754, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is it! This is really it -- the Book of the Raven!', 20753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would\'ve taken years to find the Book of the Raven without you, young sparrowhawk. Return to your home in Nagrand with our gratitude.', 20752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will hear the call when you are needed. Fly east, to Skettis, and wait there for $n\'s signal.', 20751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must carry on with or without Maiev.  Inside!  Quickly!', '', 20750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s attention shifts to a crack along the temple\'s southern wall.', '', 20749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our plans are in danger already.  It appears Maiev\'s decided to do things her own way.', '', 20748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s slips into the shadows discreetly as Akama\'s attention shifts towards Vagath\'s last words.', 20747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akama has no master.  Not anymore.', '', 20746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve sealed your fate, Akama.  The Master will learn of your betrayal!', '', 20745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slay all who see us!  Word must not get back to Illidan.', '', 20744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve waited for this moment for years.  Illidan and his lapdogs will be destroyed!', 20743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is the time, Maiev!  Unleash your wrath!', '', 20742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A miserable defense from Light-swollen fools. Xi\'ri, I will consume you myself!', '', 20741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to train you to help $n with a very important task. After that, I promise you\'ll be free to return home.', 20740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cautiously approaches Watcher Elaira.', '', 20739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come closer, young one. There\'s nothing to fear from me or $n.', 20738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s falls silent and a quiet tension falls over the nearby Sha\'tar forces as Xi\'ri makes his decision.', '', 20737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent, it\'s party time!', 'Excellent, it\'s party time!', 20736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After the firework show, they\'ll put out goblets so we can raise a toast!', 'After the firework show, they\'ll put out goblets so we can raise a toast!', 20735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The drink in the kegs is divine.  Drink up, $c!', 'The drink in the kegs is divine.  Drink up, $c!', 20734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Starting at 6PM, the city will have a fireworks extravaganza every hour on the hour.', 'Starting at 6PM, the city will have a fireworks extravaganza every hour on the hour.', 20733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy the festivities!', 'Enjoy the festivities!', 20732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After the fireworks, goblets will be put out. We will then toast our comrades!', 'After the fireworks, goblets will be put out. We will then toast our comrades!', 20731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help yourself to a drink friend.  Just make sure to stay away from the ledge while you drink.', 'Help yourself to a drink friend.  Just make sure to stay away from the ledge while you drink.', 20730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure you stick around for the next firework show!  Starting at 6PM, they\'re every hour on the hour!', 'Make sure you stick around for the next firework show!  Starting at 6PM, they\'re every hour on the hour!', 20729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can kiss me if you like, just be quick about it.', 'You can kiss me if you like, just be quick about it.', 20728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weak, little bugs!  Your souls aren\'t worth eating...', '', 20727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh!  I will shred your soul and grind it to dust!', '', 20726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A kiss would be most appreciated.', 'A kiss would be most appreciated.', 20725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast the frost trap.', 'Cast the frost trap.', 20724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hand over the Southfury moonstone and I\'ll let you go.', 'Hand over the Southfury moonstone and I\'ll let you go.', 20723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t hurt me!', 20722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See? I\'ve got the Southfury moonstone and there\'s not a thing you can do about it. So long!', 20721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All right, you win! I surrender! Just don\'t hurt me!', 20720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful wretches. You dared to assault Illidan\'s temple? Very well, I shall make it your death bed!', '', 20719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!', '', 20718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hoo-rah!', '', 20717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hut!', '', 20716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You, there! Hand over that moonstone and nobody gets hurt!', 20715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack three!', '', 20714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack two!', '', 20713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack one!', '', 20712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons ready!', '', 20711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s raises his hammer menacingly...', '', 20710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s takes the Southfury moonstone and escapes into the river. Follow her!', 20708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At ease soldiers!', '', 20706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes Sir!', '', 20705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention!', '', 20704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s summons watery globules!', '', 20703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sees a bug!', '', 20702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sends his enemies to their watery graves!', '', 20701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The violent earthquake has alerted nearby Murlocs!', '', 20700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your gryphons, Brunn.', 'Show me your gryphons, Brunn.', 20699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think when you think Wildhammer, eh? Gryphon riders, if you\'ve any sense! Shadowmoon is no Aerie Peak, but we\'ve still got fine stock for you, aye, fine stock. Take a look at my beauties and see if one of \'em catches your eye!', '', 20698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya may know a thing or two about handlin\' animals, but have ya ever taken ta the skies? We Wildhammers know how ta ride the wind with the best of \'em. Fer a small fee, if ya\'ve got the mettle, I\'ll train ya good and proper.', 20697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Onward, Scryers!  Show Illidan\'s lackeys the temper of our steel!', 20696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('%s begins to channel a spell of immense purity.', '', 20695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have lost the Eye of Haramad and require a replacement, Ameer.', 'I have lost the Eye of Haramad and require a replacement, Ameer.', 20694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins channelling the powers of the Light.', '', 20693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s senses danger and flees.', '', 20692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'O\'ros says that he wants to talk with you.', 20691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heh, I got a little too close.  Don\'t worry, I\'m fine.', 20690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks at you for a moment, then motions for you to follow.', '', 20689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Does a naaru turn off the Light when it wants to sleep?', 20688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How do you drink and eat so much, and not get fat?', 20687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the Burning Legion is such a problem, why not just throw water on them?  Then they\'ll just be a Legion.', 20686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If a horse gets horseshoes, will I get draenei shoes?', 20685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I hold my breath, what color would I turn?', 20684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are we there yet?', 20683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Boys have cooties and girls have beauty!', 20682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I bet ice cream would taste better if it were socketed!', 20681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I bet Illidan is a nice guy underneath.  He just needs a mama, too.', 20680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Does this dress make me look fat?', 20679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would a tauren paladin be a holy cow?', 20678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I need a bath.  *sniff*  I think you need one, too!', 20677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s locates a buried raven stone.', '', 20676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s surveys the ground for buried raven stones.', '', 20675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to break apart!', '', 20674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do my eyes deceive me? Is that really you, Brother Rokkaram, after all this time?$B$BIf you are looking for Sai\'kkal, he walks among the crystals in the western part of the Vortex Pinnacle. He seems preoccupied with what he calls a brutish, primitive presence there, although nothing seems amiss.', '', 20673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve a message for your master, scum!', 'I\'ve a message for your master, scum!', 20672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic worm... your master\'s days are over!', 'Pathetic worm... your master\'s days are over!', 20671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come closer, demon!  Death awaits!', 'Come closer, demon!  Death awaits!', 20670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan\'s lapdogs!  Destroy them all!', 'Illidan\'s lapdogs!  Destroy them all!', 20669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your end is at hand, Illidari!', 'Your end is at hand, Illidari!', 20668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Xi\'ri!  For the Sha\'tar!', 'For Xi\'ri!  For the Sha\'tar!', 20667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enemies of the Light must be defeated!', 'The enemies of the Light must be defeated!', 20666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enemy is upon us!  Stand your ground!', 'The enemy is upon us!  Stand your ground!', 20665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grok get angry if puny ones not go to Blade\'s Edge and talk to Mog\'dorg!', '', 20664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The answer is still no, Grok.  You can\'t go up.', 'I thought that I told you not to come around here.  Move on!', 20663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along, Grok, you can\'t go up.', 'Aw, sweety, you know that I can\'t let you go up there.  Rules are rules.', 20662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will somebody please help this ogre so that he won\'t come back?', '', 20661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards, if the ogre doesn\'t leave, escort him out.', '', 20660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grok, you\'ve been told before, stay out!', '', 20659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ogre, leave!', '', 20658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has no one helped you yet, ogre?', '', 20657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grok, take it outside.', '', 20656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not again, Grok.  You\'ve been told before to stay away!', '', 20655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ogre, please leave.  You are disturbing our clientele!', '', 20654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The smell of these mutant orcs disgusts me.', '', 20653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has there been contact from the Citadel?', '', 20652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon, our time will come!', '', 20651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not fail The Betrayer.', '', 20650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking around for help, %s sighs.', '', 20649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grok need help!  Why no one help?', '', 20648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with me, $n, for we have much to prepare...', '', 20647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear that Colonel Jules may only be saved through a dangerous ritual... an exorcism.', '', 20646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sons of Gruul must be defeated if we are to shake off our shackles and live as free ogres once more!$B$BWe must work quietly, yet quickly, if our underground resistance is to have a chance of success.', '', 20645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek a $g hero : heroine; of the utmost skill.  $G He : She; will gather others to save the Bloodmaul clan, and all of the ogres of these mountains from the tyranny of our gronn oppressors.$B$BReturn to me when you have learned all that you can.  But, $c, keep quiet about this until that time lest the gronn get wind of our underground movement.', '', 20644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go see Mog\'dorg?', '', 20643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grok look for help.  Little $r go to the mountains and help the Bloodmaul!', '', 20642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The true believers have lived in shame since the day our treacherous cousins in Skettis stole the book from us, shattered its tablet, and buried the fragments in their wretched city!$B$BPray that the raven will choose you to restore it, my son. Be faithful and remember always the prophecy, \"From the dreams of his enemies shall the raven spring forth into the world.\"', '', 20641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, elder. Tell me more of the book.', 'Yes, elder. Tell me more of the book.', 20640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me for questioning you, my son. My sight isn\'t what it once was, but the raven has blessed me with a long life.$B$BSoon, it will be time for you to take my place. I have taught you all I know. My only regret is that I didn\'t prove worthy enough to recover our sacred Book of the Raven.', '', 20639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... yes, it\'s me...', 'Yes... yes, it\'s me...', 20638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The arakkoa ghost reaches out toward you as though to try to identify you. You get the impression that it cannot see you clearly.>$B$BRokkaram, is that you?', '', 20637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Evergrove, $c. Timeon and I have been studying the arakkoa of Blade\'s Edge for some time now, and we\'ve found some alarming differences between them and their cousins in Terokkar.', 20636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come and I will show you how to ride the finest beasts you have ever seen. You... do have enough gold to cover the cost, I trust?', 'Come and I will show you how to ride the finest beasts you have ever seen. You... do have enough gold to cover the cost, I trust?', 20635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know this, $r. Within Shaffar\'s chambers at the end of these tombs rests a creature of unimaginable power. It is held in check by the power of the stasis chamber. You must return to Ameer before you venture further if you wish to destroy it!', '', 20634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I am free! Ethereum were planning on torturing me until I gave in to their requests. I fear that, had you not come along, I would have surely given in to their torment.', '', 20633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Violet Signet and seek a replacement.', 'I\'ve lost my Violet Signet and seek a replacement.', 20632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary of the Ethereum that surround us on all sides.', '', 20631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send your Ashtongue into Tempest Keep and slay his most prized possession, the phoenix known as Al\'ar.  I must know that you\'re not on his side.  Do not think of betraying me, Broken.  We both know who owns your soul!', '', 20630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not sense lies in your voice, Akama.  That Kael\'thas would betray me does not come as a big surprise - I\'m not as oblivious as some would think. That one of your own was involved with him puts your loyalties into question.', '', 20629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You disappoint me, Akama.  I wanted to question the treacherous worm myself!  I\'m beginning to question your allegiance, Broken.', '', 20628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you haven\'t come to train, step back and leave me to my work.', 20627, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t see why you want to learn something else... but I suppose I can point you in the right direction. What training are you after, specifically?', 20626, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ileda of da blood elves, in Farstrider Square of Silvermoon, train her students in both one and two-handed swords. Archibald, da Undercity\'s weapon master, also train you, mon. He in da War Quarter.', 'Ileda of da blood elves, in Farstrider Square of Silvermoon, train her students in both one and two-handed swords. Archibald, da Undercity\'s weapon master, also train you, mon. He in da War Quarter.', 20625, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Forsaken weapon master Archibald know his way \'round da polearm. He train others in da War Quarter of da Undercity. Ileda, da blood elf weapon master in Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, show you da right techniques too, mon.', 'Da Forsaken weapon master Archibald know his way \'round da polearm. He train others in da War Quarter of da Undercity. Ileda, da blood elf weapon master in Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, show you da right techniques too, mon.', 20624, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maces, they taught by Ansekhwa, found on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.', 'Maces, they taught by Ansekhwa, found on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.', 20623, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our gunnery instructor, he Ansekhwa, da tauren weapon master on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.', 'Our gunnery instructor, he Ansekhwa, da tauren weapon master on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.', 20622, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archibald da master of da crossbow. He da weapon master of da Undercity, located in da War Quarter.', 'Archibald is da master of da crossbow. He da weapon master of da Undercity, located in da War Quarter.', 20621, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sayoc and Hanashi, Orgrimmar\'s weapon masters, are true artisans of the thrown weapon. They train willing students in the Valley of Honor. For pure finesse in the art, however, Ileda of Silvermoon\'s Farstrider Square cannot be beaten.', 'Sayoc and Hanashi, Orgrimmar\'s weapon masters, are true artisans of the thrown weapon. They train willing students in the Valley of Honor. For pure finesse in the art, however, Ileda of Silvermoon\'s Farstrider Square cannot be beaten.', 20620, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ileda of the blood elves, found within Farstrider Square of Silvermoon, trains her students in both one and two-handed swords. Archibald, Undercity\'s weapon master, can also train you; he is in the War Quarter.', 'Ileda of the blood elves, found within Farstrider Square of Silvermoon, trains her students in both one and two-handed swords. Archibald, Undercity\'s weapon master, can also train you; he is in the War Quarter.', 20619, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hanashi here knows staves. If you want a sturdier instructor, go to Thunder Bluff. Ansekhwa will teach you on the lower central rise there.', '', 20618, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Staves are taught by Hanashi, the troll weapon master in Orgrimmar\'s Valley of Honor, and Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master who trains on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.', 'Staves are taught by Hanashi, the troll weapon master in Orgrimmar\'s Valley of Honor, and Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master who trains on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.', 20617, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forsaken weapon master Archibald knows his way around the polearm. He trains others in the War Quarter of the Undercity. Ileda, the blood elf weapon master within Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, can show you the proper techniques also.', 'The Forsaken weapon master Archibald knows his way around the polearm. He trains others in the War Quarter of the Undercity. Ileda, the blood elf weapon master within Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, can show you the proper techniques also.', 20616, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maces are taught by Ansekhwa, found on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.', 'Maces are taught by Ansekhwa, found on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.', 20615, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our gunnery instructor is Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.', 'Our gunnery instructor is Ansekhwa, the tauren weapon master on the lower central rise of Thunder Bluff.', 20614, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to punch things, yah? Talk to Sayoc right here. He teach you.', 'You want to punch things, yah? Talk to Sayoc right here. He teach you.', 20613, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fist weapons are taught by Sayoc, the orc weapon master in Orgrimmar. He spends his days in the Valley of Honor.', 'Fist weapons are taught by Sayoc, the orc weapon master in Orgrimmar. He spends his days in the Valley of Honor.', 20612, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sayoc, da ugly orc here, teach you daggers. You want teaching in other places, you talk to Ileda in da Farstrider Square of Silvermoon or Archibald in the War Quarter of Undercity, hokay?', 'Sayoc, da ugly orc here, teach you daggers. You want teaching in other places, you talk to Ileda in da Farstrider Square of Silvermoon or Archibald in the War Quarter of Undercity, hokay?', 20611, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dagger instruction can be sought from three weapon masters: Archibald in the War Quarter of the Undercity, Sayoc within the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar, and Ileda in Silvermoon\'s Farstrider Square.', 'Dagger instruction can be sought from three weapon masters: Archibald in the War Quarter of the Undercity, Sayoc within the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar, and Ileda in Silvermoon\'s Farstrider Square.', 20610, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archibald is the master of the crossbow. He\'s the weapon master of the Undercity, located in the War Quarter.', 'Archibald is the master of the crossbow. He\'s the weapon master of the Undercity, located in the War Quarter.', 20609, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weapon masters in the Valley of Honor within Orgrimmar, Sayoc and Hanashi, can teach you how to shoot a bow. Ileda, the weapon master of Silvermoon found in Farstrider Square, is also an expert.', 'The weapon masters in the Valley of Honor within Orgrimmar, Sayoc and Hanashi, can teach you how to shoot a bow. Ileda, the weapon master of Silvermoon found in Farstrider Square, is also an expert.', 20608, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Both Hanashi and Sayoc can train you in the use of one and two-handed axes. They can be found in the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar.', 'Both Hanashi and Sayoc can train you in the use of one and two-handed axes. They can be found in the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar.', 20606, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How adorable!', 20605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t remember ever being this small.', 20604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What big eyes you have!', 20603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm... this one smells kinda funny.', 20602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lurosa, I am entrusting the Relics of Aviana to $n, who will take them to Morthis Whisperwing. I must return completely to the Emerald Dream now. Do not let $n fail!', '', 20601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aww...', 20600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are so tiny.', 20599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Awww.... Hello little baby!', 20598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sooooo cute!!!', 20597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
