('There are two masters of the sword: Handiir and Woo Ping. The former can be found in the Trader\'s Tier of the Exodar, and the latter in Weller\'s Arsenal within Stormwind.', 'There are two masters of the sword: Handiir and Woo Ping. The former can be found in the Trader\'s Tier of the Exodar, and the latter in Weller\'s Arsenal within Stormwind.', 20578, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Staves are taught by both Woo Ping, the master found at Weller\'s Arsenal in Stormwind, and Ilyenia Moonfire, who trains the night elves on the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus.', 'Staves are taught by both Woo Ping, the master found at Weller\'s Arsenal in Stormwind, and Ilyenia Moonfire, who trains the night elves on the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus.', 20577, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woo Ping is the master of polearms. He trains his students at Weller\'s Arsenal in Stormwind.', 'Woo Ping is the master of polearms. He trains his students at Weller\'s Arsenal in Stormwind.', 20576, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maces are a specialty of Buliwyf\'s! He\'s around this shop somewhere, grousing. If his training techniques aren\'t your style, I hear the draenei weapon master in the Exodar, Handiir, knows his way around the weapon too! He\'s up on the Trader\'s Tier there.', 'Maces are a specialty of Buliwyf\'s! He\'s around this shop somewhere, grousing. If his training techniques aren\'t your style, I hear the draenei weapon master in the Exodar, Handiir, knows his way around the weapon too! He\'s up on the Trader\'s Tier there.', 20575, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Both Handiir and Buliwyf can show you how to swing a mace properly, no matter the size. You can find Buliwyf within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge. Handiir spends his days in the Exodar, training draenei on the Trader\'s Tier.', 'Both Handiir and Buliwyf can show you how to swing a mace properly, no matter the size. You can find Buliwyf within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge. Handiir spends his days in the Exodar, training draenei on the Trader\'s Tier.', 20574, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus, can show ye how to use a bow.', 'Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus, can show ye how to use a bow.', 20573, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My plucky companion Bixi Wobblebonk here can train ye in crossbows. If ye\'re looking for other trainers, though, ye might want to try Ilyenia Moonfire on the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus, or maybe the draenei weapon master, Handiir, in the Trader\'s Tier within the Exodar.', '', 20572, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pal Buliwyf here can show you how to use fist weapons... or, if you prefer, Ilyenia Moonfire - she\'s the night elf weapon master on the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus - can show you, too!', 'My pal Buliwyf here can show you how to use fist weapons... or, if you prefer, Ilyenia Moonfire - she\'s the night elf weapon master on the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus - can show you, too!', 20571, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no finer expert I know on axes than Buliwyf here! One hand, two hands... he\'s a master of it all!', 'There\'s no finer expert I know on axes than Buliwyf here! One hand, two hands... he\'s a master of it all!', 20570, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dwarven weapon master Buliwyf can train you in both one and two-handed axes. He\'s found in the Timberline Arms in Ironforge.', 'The dwarven weapon master Buliwyf can train you in both one and two-handed axes. He\'s found in the Timberline Arms in Ironforge.', 20569, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Emerald Dream will never be yours!', '', 20568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone from this place!', '', 20567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hands the Relics of Aviana to Dreamwarden Lurosa.', '', 20566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish druid! Dividing your essence has weakened you, opening the door for my master to dominate the Emerald Dream. Your spirit and your body will die here!', '', 20565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve recovered the second relic. Take a moment to rest, and then we\'ll continue to the last reliquary.', '', 20564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the first relic, but there are still two more. Follow me, $n.', '', 20563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A %s erupts into the waking world from the Emerald Dream!', '', 20562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to miss you so much, $n!  Promise that you\'ll come to see me.', 20561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will guide you to the location of the relics, but you must guard my spirit well. As the guardian of the relics, only I can break the seals on the reliquaries.', '', 20560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A shadowy, sinister presence has invaded the Emerald Dream. Its power is poised to spill over into our world, $n. We must oppose it! That\'s why I cannot accompany you in person.', '', 20559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please reset the chess board, we would like to play again.', 'Please reset the chess board, we would like to play again.', 20558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to miss you so much, $n!  Promise that you\'ll come to see me.', 20557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here at the behest of Nexus-Prince Haramad. Strange things are afoot at the Stormspire.', '', 20556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buliwyf here will happily teach you everything there is to know about guns!', 'Buliwyf here will happily teach you everything there is to know about guns!', 20555, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The man to talk to about gunnery is Buliwyf, found in the Timberline Arms within Ironforge.', 'The man to talk to about gunnery is Buliwyf, found in the Timberline Arms within Ironforge.', 20554, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Concentrating a moment, Dornaa summons forth the elemental forces.', 20553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master on the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus, or Buliwyf, the dwarf weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, can train you in the use of fist weapons.', 'Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master on the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus, or Buliwyf, the dwarf weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge, can train you in the use of fist weapons.', 20552, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bixi Wobblebonk in this very shop can train ye in daggers. If ye\'re still looking abroad, anyone else - Woo Ping in Stormwind, Handiir in the Exodar, and Ilyenia Moonfire in Darnassus - can show ye a thing or two. Me, I was never one fer knife fights.', 'Bixi Wobblebonk in this very shop can train ye in daggers. If ye\'re still looking abroad, anyone else - Woo Ping in Stormwind, Handiir in the Exodar, and Ilyenia Moonfire in Darnassus - can show ye a thing or two. Me, I was never one fer knife fights.', 20551, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did it, I did it!!!', 20550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing, Dornaa.  Truly amazing!', '', 20549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try.', '', 20548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You mean, I can do it here, too?', 20547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus, can train you in the use of bows.', 'Ilyenia Moonfire, the night elf weapon master who resides at the Warrior\'s Terrace in Darnassus, can train you in the use of bows.', 20546, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed I am, child.  And do you remember what you showed me in those dreams?', '', 20545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those fools! What have they done! What horrors do they hold? And for what purpose? I will need your help again, hero. Help us. Help your people.', '', 20544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re the man from my dream!', 20543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander... I am not long for this world... Taken to a holding pen... hundreds... thousands... beings from other worlds... Imprisoned... Imprisoned by Ethereum. Many of them our allies. Must... Must save the others... It... It\'s not too late...', '', 20542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crossbow can be learned from Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller\'s Arsenal in Stormwind, Handiir, the draenei weapon master found in the Trader\'s Tier within the Exodar, or Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge.', 'The crossbow can be learned from Woo Ping, the human weapon master at Weller\'s Arsenal in Stormwind, Handiir, the draenei weapon master found in the Trader\'s Tier within the Exodar, or Bixi Wobblebonk, the gnome weapon master within the Timberline Arms in Ironforge.', 20541, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s uses the Ethereum prison key on the salvaged Ethereum prison.', '', 20540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back, $n. This may be an Ethereum trap.', '', 20539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You -- you\'re not one of them! Let\'s get out of sight before they find us! Hurry!', '', 20538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I beg you, $r, be swift. They will not stop pursuing me! I cannot escape from them, even here!', '', 20537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attempt to wake Clintar.', 'Attempt to wake Clintar.', 20536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The druid appears to be deep in sleep, oblivious to his surroundings.>', '', 20535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must return to my rest... they must not find me here... the Emerald Dream...', '', 20534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grows sleepy.', '', 20533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re following me, $r! Quickly, tell me why you\'re here before we\'re discovered! If they catch up to me, it will mean my death and yours!', '', 20532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The conflicts in Outland are deadlier than any I have seen.  And their most tragic victims are the children that are left behind.$B$BNow, with the threat against Shattrath from the arakkoa of Skettis, there will be even more orphans to take care of.  These children often live without the hope of a bright future.', 20531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good to see you again, $C $n.  Salandria has been asking about you.', 20530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good to see you again, $C $n.  Dornaa has been asking about you.', 20529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow, he\'s a big one!  Um... what\'s going on?  Save me!', 20528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dornaa\'s jaw nearly hits the ground at the sight of Zaladormu.', 20527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s links with it\'s master, creating a spirit bond.', '%s links with it\'s master, creating a spirit bond.', 20526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gets to his feet, beginning to recognize his surroundings.', '', 20525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing in Ysera\'s realm, interloper? Leave us, I say! Your kind are not welcome here!', '', 20524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s snaps up to a kneeling position, but seems as though he\'s somewhere else.', '', 20523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go in peace, child.', '', 20522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This girl has done nothing, and will not be held accountable for what she might do, or fail to do, in the future.', '', 20521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WAIT!', '', 20520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please transport me to the Guardian\'s Library.', 'Please transport me to the Guardian\'s Library.', 20519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aran has been defeated? Yes... I can sense his grip has loosened - if only just a little. But just enough to allow me to do my job as the doorman! Would you like me transport you to the Guardian\'s Library, $n?', '', 20518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s combines the herbs with the moonwell water to create the Ward of Waking.', '', 20517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are few left in the world who can prepare the Ward of Waking, $n. We are fortunate that I am among them.', '', 20516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay, I like!  Um... what\'s going on?  Save me!', 20515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Salandria\'s jaw nearly hits the ground at the sight of Zaladormu.', 20514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The potion is finished. I can only hope Clintar forgives us for interrupting his sojourn in the Emerald Dream.', '', 20513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s kneels, filling the vial with water from the moonwell.', '', 20512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here, $r?', '', 20511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dornaa stands and gapes in awe at the immense Dark Portal.', 20510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As if in a daze, Salandria moves toward whatever it is she is sensing.', 20509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow, what a rush!', 20508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you\'re done visiting this exotic city, perhaps you would be interested in celebrating with us. The Lunar Festival is underway in Moonglade; the other cities have transport to the festivities. Come and join the other revelers!', 'When you\'re done visiting this exotic city, perhaps you would be interested in celebrating with us. The Lunar Festival is underway in Moonglade; the other cities have transport to the festivities. Come and join the other revelers!', 20507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, wow, is that a naaru they\'re channeling from?  I feel funny....', 20506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s just ahead!', 20505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, let\'s go check it out!', 20504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you feel that?', 20503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan is looking for me.  I am not safe here... none of us are.', '', 20502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you, Akama.  You honor me by allowing me this moment, surrounded by my brothers.  Farewell, friend.  Guide our people well.', '', 20501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My decision is final.  I will not be dissuaded.  I have devoted my life to our plan.  To jeopardize it now would betray all who have died for the cause long before me.', '', 20500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan will find me and when he does... he will pry the Ashtongue secret from me - such is the power of the Betrayer!  No... there is only one way.  My usefulness to the cause has come to an end. I must venture into the spirit world!', '', 20499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akama, my friend!  Have you been informed?  I was found out by Vashj\'s followers.  Our secret is in peril!', '', 20498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be done, my lord!', '', 20497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, sire!  You have misjudged my actions... I do have knowledge of someone close to you who plans to betray you.  It is that dog, Kael\'thas!  He has allied with Kil\'jaeden and intends to replace you as Lord of Outland!', '', 20496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master!  We\'ve found the traitor who escaped Vashj!  His body lies in front of me... lifeless!', '', 20495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, dear friend. We shall meet you in the next world when our duties in this one are fulfilled.', '', 20494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears your mind is set then.  We will guide you to the spirit world with as much kindness as we can.', '', 20493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot... be serious, Olum.  Your sacrifice has already been too great.', '', 20492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan will become suspicious... that much is for certain.  We will deal with it as we always do.', '', 20491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Olum... old friend.  It is good to see that you are safe.', '', 20490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tee hee, your mind-talk tickles.  Thank you, O\'ros!  I promise to be good!!', 20489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dornaa walks slowly and turns in reverence as a blessing is bestowed upon her by O\'ros.', 20487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ow!  Hot!!', 20486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah, it\'s true!  I\'m gonna go have a closer look at the fire one!', 20485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you soon, big brother!', 20484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, sir.', '', 20483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to your studies, boy!', '', 20482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salandria?  Salandria!!!', '', 20481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde Flag was returned to its base by $n!', '', 20480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dornaa!!!', '', 20479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Salandria and Hch\'uu begin to catch up on all that has happened to them this past year.', 20478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope that Jheel will be able to come back to the orphanage soon.', 20477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dornaa gives her brother a big hug, and the two children begin to talk.', 20476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jheel!!!', 20475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks again for bringing my sister to visit me, $G Mr. : Miss; $n!', '', 20474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gezhe has been really nice letting me come here to apprentice and learn all of this fun stuff, $g mister : ma\'am;.$B$B<Jheel hangs his head.>$B$BBut, I hate being away from my sister.', '', 20473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazan descends from the sky.', '', 20472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Morthis glances skyward.>$B$BIn a way, I envy the freedom Rook and Corvax enjoy. To be free of earthbound responsibilities is a great blessing indeed.$B$BThe future will see me on wing once more, but first there\'s a task I must complete.', '', 20471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is the Twisting Nether shaped like a pretzel?  And just what is a Nether?  The orphan matron said I shouldn\'t ask people about their nethers.', 20470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Light!', 20469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Salandria stands and gapes in awe at the immense Dark Portal.', 20467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoa, no way!', 20466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the demons fell, where did they fall from?', 20465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this where all of the adventurers come from?  Help me.', 20464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh wow!', 20463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why isn\'t the Outland called Draenor anymore?', 20462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for bringing me here to see my friend, Hch\'uu!', 20461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga came close to breaking my will... but the secret is still safe, thanks to you.', '', 20460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am free!  But the secret... is now in peril.  Akama must be warned!', '', 20459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dornaa begins to examine the stone edifice, and then touches it.', 20458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hch\'uu!!!', 20457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are we there yet?', 20456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $g sir : ma\'am;!  It was so great to get to speak with Salandria again!', '', 20455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m lonely.  I wish that there were more kids my age around here.  Sometimes I miss being at the orphanage in Shattrath City.', '', 20454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children\'s Week is not yet over... may I have another Draenei Orphan Whistle?', 'Children\'s Week is not yet over... may I have another Draenei Orphan Whistle?', 20453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children\'s Week is not yet over... may I have another Blood Elf Orphan Whistle?', 'Children\'s Week is not yet over... may I have another Blood Elf Orphan Whistle?', 20452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The conflicts in Outland are deadlier than any I have seen.  And their most tragic victims are the children that are left behind.$B$BNow, with the threat against Shattrath from the arakkoa of Skettis, there will be even more orphans to take care of.  These children often live without the hope of a bright future.$B$BBut you have the power to do something about that.  It\'s Children\'s Week, $c, and I implore you to volunteer to bring joy and wonder into a child\'s life.', 20451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give us a kissss...', 20450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death! Only death awaits!', 20449, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Deceiver! For Kil\'jaeden!', '', 20448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only flesh and blood...', '', 20447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In Outland, lunch open prison for you! What a world! Time to eat!', '', 20446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WUT! DA KING IS BACK, BABY!', '', 20445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousand and one ways that all spell out your demise!', '', 20444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gateway of your oblivion has been opened! The blood tide rises.', '', 20443, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FREE! FREE TO DEVOUR ALL THAT STAND IN THE WAY OF LORD ILLIDAN!', '', 20442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Look into my eyes... Find your death within...', '', 20441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$R save me! Thank you! My people thank you too!', '', 20440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessed Light! Free of my confines at last... Thank you, hero. A\'dal will be told of your heroics.', 'Blessed Light! Free of my confines at last... Thank you, hero. A\'dal will be told of your heroics.', 20439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? Where am I? How... How did I... Cursed ethereals! I was on an escort mission out of Shattrath when we were ambushed! I must return to the city at once! Your name will be recorded as a friend of the Lower City, $n.', '', 20438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Keepers of Time thank you for your assistance. The Timeless One shall be pleased with this outcome...', 20437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tell the tale of your heroics to Haramad myself! All Consortium will know your name, $n. Thank you, my friend.', '', 20436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last I am released! Thank you, gentle $r. I must return to the expedition at once! They will know of your deeds. This I vow.', 'At last I am released! Thank you, gentle $r. I must return to the expedition at once! They will know of your deeds. This I vow.', 20435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not have enough reputation with or have not pledged allegiance to The Scryers.', 'You do not have enough reputation with or have not pledged allegiance to The Scryers.', 20434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not have enough reputation with or have not pledged allegiance to The Aldor.', 'You do not have enough reputation with or have not pledged allegiance to The Aldor.', 20433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of your efforts have been in vain, for the draining of the World Tree has already begun!  Soon the heart of your world will beat no more!', '', 20432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen many dangers in these wastes.  Who knows what creatures yet lurk in the dust to ambush the unwary?', '', 20431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The halls of Karazhan shake, as the curse binding the doors of the Gamesman\'s Hall is lifted.', '', 20430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to speak to me, $r?', '', 20429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The chime of A\'dal\'s voice echoes reassuringly through your mind.>$B$BWorry not, child.  Look in your pack and you will find it once more.', '', 20428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A\'dal, I am ashamed to say that I have somehow misplaced the key to the Arcatraz.', 'A\'dal, I am ashamed to say that I have somehow misplaced the key to the Arcatraz.', 20427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('facing $n.', '', 20426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that you have bested me, test your skills against each other!  Take control of either king to begin play.', '', 20425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry.  Shatter Point is as sturdy as they come!  But just in case, be ready to jump on a gryphon if the base starts to break apart...', '', 20424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gone! In the Name of the Light, the Goodness, and the All that is Just!', '', 20423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gone... from this creature of Light! \n', '', 20422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cast you out! Unclean Spirit!', '', 20421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Debug Error: Couldn\'t find a target!', '', 20420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back!  I cast you back... corrupter of faith!  Author of pain!  Do not return, or suffer the same fate as you did here today!', '', 20419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is lost, Anchorite!  Abandon what hope remains.', '', 20418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tear your soul into morsels and slow roast them over demon fire!', '', 20417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is fruitless, draenei!  You and your little helper cannot wrest control of this pathetic human.  He is mine!', '', 20416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see your ancestors, Anchorite!  They writhe and scream in the darkness... they are with us!', '', 20415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah!  Cease the incantations, Anchorite!  Cease, or I will show you such pain that your pathetic people have never imagined!', '', 20414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not succeed, mortal!  This shell will lie decrepit, blistered and bleeding before I am done with it.  And its spirit will be long cast into darkness.', '', 20413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!  Not yet!  This soul is ours!', '', 20412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give us time... Let the man die... I am no one... I am no one... Fear the anchorite... Fear the anchorite... Barada... Barada.', '', 20411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... will... leave... this... man!', '', 20410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot deceive me, demon!  Your strength wanes just as my faith bolsters!', '', 20409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is my guide... it is my sustenance!', '', 20408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... must not...falter!', '', 20407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the name of the Light! It is Light that commands you! It is Light that flung you to the depths of darkness! ', '', 20406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of Light compels you!  Back to your pit!', '', 20405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back, foul beings of darkness!  You have no power here!', '', 20404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be cleansed with Light, human!  Let not the demonic corruption overwhelm you.', '', 20403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep away. The fool is mine.', '', 20402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself.  Do not allow the ritual to be interrupted or we may lose our patient...', '', 20401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time.  The rite of exorcism will now commence...', '', 20400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gone, $c!  Leave us be, or we will enter you next and show you true despair!', '', 20398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, thank you!  The pit of blackness inside of me has been lifted!  I can see again... and I see the face of my savior!', '', 20397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Anchorite.  Let us begin the exorcism.', 'I am ready, Anchorite.  Let us begin the exorcism.', 20396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release the hounds!', '', 20395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not about to train you until you\'re exalted in the eyes of the draenei.', 'I\'m not about to train you until you\'re exalted in the eyes of the draenei.', 20394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not about to train you until you prove yourself a friend to the draenei of the Exodar.', 'I\'m not about to train you until you prove yourself a friend to the draenei of the Exodar.', 20393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The construct gestures to the eastern portion of the Tier.>', '', 20392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lisrythe may be a bit... intimidating at first, but she stocks what you\'re looking for. She sells her wares in the eastern portion of Scryer\'s Tier.', 'Lisrythe may be a bit... intimidating at first, but she stocks what you\'re looking for. She sells her wares outside the large library on Scryer\'s Tier.', 20391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scryer Gem Merchant', 'Scryer Gem Merchant', 20390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inessera is a sharp woman who carries various gems as well as jewelcrafting supplies. You can find her shop in the northern part of Aldor Rise.', 'Inessera is a sharp woman who carries various gems as well as jewelcrafting supplies. You can find her shop in the northern part of Aldor Rise.', 20389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aldor Gem Merchant', 'Aldor Gem Merchant', 20388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are two gem merchants in residence: one works closely with the Scryers, and the other is loyal to the Aldor. Whom do you seek?', 'There are two gem merchants in residence: one works closely with the Scryers, and the other is loyal to the Aldor. Whom do you seek?', 20386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gem Merchant', 'Gem Merchant', 20385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our resident alchemist Lorokeem brought his equipment with him, in fact. It may be slightly different from what you\'re used to - he is an arakkoa, after all - but it should serve your needs. He roosts in the northwest portion of the lower city.', 'Our resident alchemist Lorokeem brought his equipment with him, in fact. It may be slightly different from what you\'re used to - he is an arakkoa, after all - but it should serve your needs. He roosts in the northwest portion of the lower city.', 20384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alchemy Lab', 'Alchemy Lab', 20383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear the sound of beating wings from high up in the canyon as Rexxar approaches.', 'You hear the sound of beating wings from high up in the canyon as Rexxar approaches.', 20382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares place this affront upon the altar of Goc?', '', 20381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins emanating immense power.', '', 20380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
