('I dunno. It can\'t possibly beat the time he tried to convince us that we\'re all actually a figment of some being\'s imagination and that they only use us for their own personal amusement. That went over well during dinner with the family.', 'I dunno. It can\'t possibly beat the time he tried to convince us that we\'re all actually a figment of some being\'s imagination and that they only use us for their own personal amusement. That went over well during dinner with the family.', 20343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
