('I used to amuse myself by accepting challenges from anyone who would offer them, but I\'ve long since grown tired of such easy victories.$B$BFor now, I\'m taking some time to get my reagent business off the ground and write a book about my experiences in Twilight\'s Hammer.', '', 20341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
