('', 'Never leave home without ample supplies of flash powder, especially when working with others. I guarantee someone will run out every time.$B$BWhen the choice comes down to handing out materials or letting the poor sap die, I help... most of the time.', 20296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
