('', 'My early classes are always filled with bright-eyed young lads. Few make it past the first test, though.$B$BI\'ve given up on shouting, \'when I yell vanish, you need to vanish.\' They never listen. Now, the test simply kills the inept.', 20294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Swords, claws, daggers, of course -- I\'ve trained rogues in the use of them all. Now maces, I won\'t touch maces and I won\'t instruct any rogue who gets it in his head to wield one.$B$BThere\'s nothing stealthy about a mace. You\'re in for a noisy kill and a long cleanup if you go that route.', 20293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve trained as an alchemist once again.  I wish to specialize in transmutations.', 'I\'ve trained as an alchemist once again.  I wish to specialize in transmutations.', 20292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The trick to using evasion is realizing that the best fifteen seconds of your life are often the last.', 20291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
