('', 'Long ago the Shadow Council tried to perform a dark ritual inside Auchindoun.  Their failure created the waste you see around you.  The bones and the spirits of the fallen Draenei now haunt this land.  I was sent to cleanse the tombs of my ancestors, but with so many dangers I must remain here to protect the refugees.', 20253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I came to this land to cleanse troubled spirits, but after the attack I fear that my mission has failed.  So many have been taken by the wastes.  Please, you must help them.', '', 20252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death\'s Door is a portal that opens upon the world that the Burning Legion uses to breed their fel hounds and other canine-like terrors.  Any time that you see one of those creatures, that is where it came from, and it passes through here, first.$B$BLately, we became aware that the Burning Legion have ramped up their summoning of these creatures through the portal.$B$BYou must shut down Death\'s Door before it becomes an inexorable tide, and all is lost!', 'Death\'s Door is a portal that opens upon the world that the Burning Legion uses to breed their fel hounds and other canine-like terrors.  Any time that you see one of those creatures, that is where it came from, and it passes through here, first.$B$BLately, we became aware that the Burning Legion have ramped up their summoning of these creatures through the portal.$B$BYou must shut down Death\'s Door before it becomes an inexorable tide, and all is lost!', 20251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('These refugees have suffered greatly and they will no doubt suffer more.  You have already helped them and for that I thank you.  If you have done all you can for now then I would beg a small favor.  ', '', 20249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
