('*WARNING!* You can only select one tailoring specialization.', '*WARNING!* You can only select one tailoring specialization.', 20246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These wastes are scarred by terrible magic.  We must do what we can to heal this great wound.', '', 20245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They fear my words. They make an example out of me. A mockery of the one true god, Neptulon.$B$B<Skar\'this spits.>$B$BRetribution comesss, mortal. The glorious hand of the Tidehunter will one day sweep through the non-believers like a scythe against a new harvest.', '', 20244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These Tears of the Goddess have been blessed by Elune, and their power will help you combat Archimonde\'s vile magics. Use their power well.', 20243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would be grateful for any aid you can provide, Priestess.', 'I would be grateful for any aid you can provide, Priestess.', 20242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to become a spellfire tailoring specialist. Can you teach me?', 'I wish to become a spellfire tailoring specialist. Can you teach me?', 20241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to be a mooncloth tailoring specialist. Can you teach me?', 'I wish to be a mooncloth tailoring specialist. Can you teach me?', 20240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... are the disease... not I...', '', 20239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... released.', '', 20238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to become a shadoweave tailoring expert. Can you teach me?', 'I wish to become a shadoweave tailoring expert. Can you teach me?', 20237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had no choice.', '', 20236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have forced me to this....', '', 20235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no better than they!', '', 20234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will purge you from this place!', '', 20233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what you have for sale.', 'Show me what you have for sale.', 20232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot allow you to interfere!', '', 20231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A\'dal, I have lost the key to Tempest Keep and require a replacement.', 'A\'dal, I have lost the key to Tempest Keep and require a replacement.', 20230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, $c, but my wares are best suited to those who know which end of the needle the thread goes through.$B$BI can assure you, tailoring is about far more than monogramming handkerchiefs.', '', 20229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re seeking patterns or knowledge about shadoweave tailoring, I\'d be happy to help you.', '', 20228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re not a tailor, I don\'t think any of my patterns will interest you, but you\'re welcome to browse!', 20227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pleased to meet you! I\'m Gidge, the resident spellfire tailoring expert here in Shattrath. Not that there\'s any competition, but if you\'re interested in learning to be a spellfire tailor and haven\'t settled on a specialization, I can help.', 20226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what you have for sale.', 'Show me what you have for sale.', 20225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m afraid there is little I can teach you, $c. You\'re free to browse my wares, of course, but you will not find them of use to you.', 20224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $n. My expertise is in the art of working with primal mooncloth. Tailors interested in becoming mooncloth specialists often ask me to teach them our ways.', 20223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a druid stealthing around in his cat-form.  I thought that we had hunters in here.  Deal with it!', 20222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone tell those fools to stay back.  They\'re getting slaughtered when they go over there alone!', 20221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, are we going to attack, or are we just going to mill about all day?', 20220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You there!  What do you think you\'re doing?!', 20219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Has anyone seen the overseer?', 20218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maxnar is going to have my hide if we don\'t get this assault underway soon!', 20217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t let them through!  Look, over there!', 20216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a good thing I was able to make duplicates of the Felsworn Gas Mask.', '', 20215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a bunch of rabble!', 20214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not work so good for not birdies!', '', 20213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic of the wand appears to take hold on %s, but then it fades.', '', 20212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s eyes glaze over as the effects of the wand take over his mind.', '', 20211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may want to take cover. ', 20210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know that the wyrmcultists are massing on the other side of the tunnel.  We\'ll make our stand here.', '', 20209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not come this far to be stopped! The future I have planned will not be jeopardized! Now you will taste true power!!', '', 20208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For... Quel\'...Thalas!', '', 20207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was child\'s play.', '', 20206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gambled. And lost.', '', 20205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not prevail!', '', 20204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow to my will!', '', 20203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Obey me!', '', 20202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anar\'anel belore!', '', 20201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the power of the sun!', '', 20200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Having trouble staying grounded?', '', 20199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see how you fare when your world is turned upside down.', '', 20198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Energy. Power. My people are addicted to it... a dependence made manifest after the Sunwell was destroyed. Welcome to the future. A pity you are too late to stop it. No one can stop me now! Selama ashal\'anore!', '', 20195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Has he found the one, yet?', 20194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell him that our Cenarion friends have been most helpful.', 20193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What does the baron want?', 20192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ask him how he wants to proceed, then come right back!', 20191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right.  We, uh, need to... examine... those blackwhelps.', 20190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deal with them?  How am I supposed to deal with them?', 20189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell him that they have refused his \'offer\'.', 20188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Below is the aptly named Deathforge. If left to their own devices, the Shadow Council would supply the Legion with an endless stream of infernals.', '', 20187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there, cutey!  Do me a favor... ask the Baron what he wants me to do about you know what.', 20186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Deathforge is run by the Shadow Council, under the watchful eye of the Legion.', '', 20185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Damn you!  Damn all of you bleeding fel orcs!  May your souls rot in the belly of whatever Dark Power that fuels you!', '', 20184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s faces the Bleeding Hollow fort of Zeth\'Gor...', '', 20183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This insignia is from Sergeant Rantack, once my superior.  You\'d never find a tougher soldier than old Rantack...', '', 20182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yes... Private Guarding.  He always was quick to laugh... until a Bleeding Hollow Raid tore out his throat!', '', 20181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one was from Corporal Stonewell... he died protecting a field hospital...', '', 20180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, this was from Private Denning.  I remember when he fell...', '', 20179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s inspects the talisman $n gave him...', '', 20178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.  Inform her that I\'m still searching for the prophesied one that is to assist me in the battle.  There are very few promising candidates.', '', 20177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell her that I don\'t want to be connected with it at this time.  The Cenarion Expedition should be more than happy to rid themselves of them.', '', 20176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, little one.  What news do you bring?', '', 20175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must I tell her every little thing to do?  I have larger issues of my own to deal with here.', '', 20174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, but make certain she knows that the blackwhelps are to be captured first.', '', 20173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not sanction their actions.  Tell her to deal with it.', '', 20172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If they will not bend the knee, then she is to see to it that they are destroyed!', '', 20171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell her to use the druids for that!', '', 20170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auchindoun is home to my ancestor\'s spirits.  We might not look it, but all Broken were once draenei... our spirits are all the same.', '', 20169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wyvern drops a black drake corpse on the ground.', '', 20168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The search for my people.  Our struggle against the Alliance.  The war with the ogres and their gronn masters.$B$BAll of these things weigh heavy upon my shoulders, $c.$B$BEven I can use some help from time to time.', '', 20167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Incompetent fools!  Auchindoun should\'ve been ours... look at yourselves scrambling like rats!', 20166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not escape us so easily!', 'You will not escape us so easily!', 20165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll go nowhere, fool!', 'You\'ll go nowhere, fool!', 20164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can find my way from here.  My friend Mekeda will reward you for your kind actions.', '', 20163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware!  More cultists come!', '', 20162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us leave this place.  I\'ve had enough of these madmen!', '', 20161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak, filthy refugee!  What was your caravan doing in the Bone Wastes?', 'Speak, filthy refugee!  What was your caravan doing in the Bone Wastes?', 20160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not powerful enough to undergo the trial of the naaru. Return to me when you are stronger.', '', 20159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re free, Millhouse. Get out of here!', 'You\'re free, Millhouse. Get out of here!', 20158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s points to the sky above.', '', 20157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares slay one of my Kargath\'s commanders?  You will pay for this... in flesh!', '', 20156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have saved us from a fate far worse than death, $n.  You have the eternal gratitude of the Mok\'Nathal ancestors.', 'You have saved us from a fate far worse than death, $n.  You have the eternal gratitude of the Mok\'Nathal ancestors.', 20155, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for allowing me to visit, $n.  You have a very colorful soul, but it\'s a little brighter than I prefer... or I might have stayed longer!', '', 20154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell, mortal. We are forever indebted to you.\n', 20153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In time, we will again require the assistance of the mortals. Across this world our birthright is shattered. It will be the mortal races that help us regain our rightful place on Draenor. Watch over them, Mordenaku...', 20152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mordenaku... Your allies have saved us and destroyed the wretch, Zuluhed. Forever they will be a friend to the Netherwing.', 20151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.  If I might be so bold, may I remind you that -- while I attune myself to the magics of Hellfire Citadel -- there will undoubtedly be Hellfire wardens biting at my proverbial heels!$B$BSo, do be an upstanding member of your Horde and play the part of the hero... and protect me!', '', 20150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Felsworn Gas Mask was destroyed, do you have another one?', 'The Felsworn Gas Mask was destroyed, do you have another one?', 20149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It feels good to walk about and stretch all four limbs. Is there something I can help you with, $c?', '', 20148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Extinguishing', 'Extinguishing', 20147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m too weak to fight with you.  Please find my friends.', 'I\'m too weak to fight with you.  Please find my friends.', 20146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thanks, stranger.', 'My thanks, stranger.', 20145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m hurt, but I can still run.  Thank you, stranger.', 'I\'m hurt, but I can still run.  Thank you, stranger.', 20144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise the naaru, I\'m saved.  I will try to make it clear on my own.', 'Praise the naaru, I\'m saved.  I will try to make it clear on my own.', 20143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mother!', '', 20142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are spotted by the %s!', '', 20141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s casts a spell to draw magical attacks away from his allies.', '', 20140, 0, 7201, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you again, friend.', '', 20139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breaking', 'Breaking', 20138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ATTACK WITH THE FULL FORCE OF NETHERWING, MY CHILDREN! ATTACK!', '', 20137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s flies up through the trees, free of Terokk\'s corruption.', '', 20136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in blacksmithing.  Interested?', 'I can instruct you in blacksmithing.  Interested?', 20135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in leatherworking.  Interested?', 'I can instruct you in leatherworking.  Interested?', 20134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in tailoring.  Interested?', 'I can instruct you in tailoring.  Interested?', 20133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in enchanting.  Interested?', 'I can instruct you in enchanting.  Interested?', 20132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in engineering.  Interested?', 'I can instruct you in engineering.  Interested?', 20131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in alchemy.  Interested?', 'I can instruct you in alchemy.  Interested?', 20130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy them! Destroy them all!', '', 20129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed, the time has come to end this charade.', '', 20128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortals. Did you think that I would not strike you down for your transgressions?', '', 20127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Illidan, bless me with the power of the flight!', '', 20126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No taste good. Bad.', '', 20125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me am so thirsty!', '', 20124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die.', '', 20123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unworthy.', '', 20122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more.', '', 20121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beg for life.', '', 20120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay.', '', 20119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No escape.', '', 20118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scurry.', '', 20117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come.... and die.', '', 20116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gross!', 'Gross!', 20115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think those weird bird guys were going to eat us.  Gross!', 'I think those weird bird guys were going to eat us.  Gross!', 20114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, alright, but you know these things don\'t grow on trees.$B$B<The spiritcaller thinks about that a moment.>$B$BOh, wait a minute....', '', 20113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spiritcaller, I need more totems to save the spirits of the nether drakes.', 'Spiritcaller, I need more totems to save the spirits of the nether drakes.', 20112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yay!  We love you!  You saved us!', 'Yay!  We love you!  You saved us!', 20111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woot!', 'Woot!', 20110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yay!  We\'re free!', 'Yay!  We\'re free!', 20109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathforge Mine: Detonating!', '', 20108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '', 20107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathforge Mine will detonate in 3 seconds!', '', 20106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('4...', '', 20105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
