INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('There are mysteries in this place that we, the orcs, are desperate to uncover.  Mysteries of our past, mysteries of our future, and mysteries that offer glimpses inside us.$B$BIt is my hope to pierce these mysteries... will you walk that path with me?', '', 19933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Where am I? This isn\'t right at all! Look at you! Look at this place! It isn\'t on my list! There\'s going to be so much paperwork...$b$b<The goblin writes frantically in a small notebook.>$b$bLook, if you\'ve got nothing better to do than stand there and stare, why don\'t you go visit my cousin, Kwee Q. Peddlefeet, in one of the major cities? Says here he\'s taking care of Orgrimmar, Stormwind, Thunder Bluff, Ironforge, the Undercity, and Darnassus. Go on, get outta here!', 'What? Where am I? This isn\'t right at all! Look at you! Look at this place! It isn\'t on my list! There\'s going to be so much paperwork...$b$b<The goblin writes frantically in a small notebook.>$b$bLook, if you\'ve got nothing better to do than stand there and stare, why don\'t you go visit my cousin, Kwee Q. Peddlefeet, in one of the major cities? Says here he\'s taking care of Orgrimmar, Stormwind, Thunder Bluff, Ironforge, the Undercity, and Darnassus. Go on, get outta here!', 19932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lunar Festival is in full swing on Azeroth! Return there and honor your elders in this wonderful celebration! The main festivities can be found in Moonglade, but we\'ve provided easy transportation from Stormwind, Ironforge, Darnassus, Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar, and the Undercity. We hope to see you there!', 'The Lunar Festival is in full swing on Azeroth! Return there and honor your elders in this wonderful celebration! The main festivities can be found in Moonglade, but we\'ve provided easy transportation from Stormwind, Ironforge, Darnassus, Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar, and the Undercity. We hope to see you there!', 19931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy these Aldor dogs!', '', 19930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, Scryer scum!', '', 19929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are there very many of them, up there?', 'Are there very many of them, up there?', 19928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you found them?', 'Have you found them?', 19927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are there Wyrmcult ahead?', 'Are there Wyrmcult ahead?', 19926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you see? Anything?', 'What do you see? Anything?', 19925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emits a low, quiet growl, looking back over its shoulder.', '%s emits a low, quiet growl, looking back over its shoulder.', 19924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I realize you have only recently joined us, and thus may be unaware of our traditions. In Moonglade, a tremendous celebration is taking place. This is a time of year when we honor our elders, and you are certainly invited! Travel to one of our cities if you wish to join in!', 'I realize you have only recently joined us, and thus may be unaware of our traditions. In Moonglade, a tremendous celebration is taking place. This is a time of year when we honor our elders, and you are certainly invited! Travel to one of our cities if you wish to join in!', 19923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon all our enemies will beg for mercy or be shatterd bones under our feet!', '', 19922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master desires your full obedience and you will comply!', '', 19921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How has the Wyrmcult gained so many followers? Where are they coming from?!', 'How has the Wyrmcult gained so many followers? Where are they coming from?!', 19920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never forget whom you serve.  Illidan will rule this land and beyond.', '', 19919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Betrayer hasn\'t been the most predictable of foes, Exarch.  I have no fear however, with the Light on our side we shall defeat his forces today, tomorrow, or whenever he chooses to attack.', '', 19918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What manner of thing would ever serve those sinister Wyrmcult wretches?', 'What manner of thing would ever serve those sinister Wyrmcult wretches?', 19917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why hasn\'t Illidan made his move?  All this waiting is making our forces uneasy.', 19916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light be with you, Harbinger.', 19915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to my lair, whelp!  Come to me and pay for your insolence!', '', 19914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you take my eye!  I will crush your soul and feed it to my blind and whimpering imps!', '', 19913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are to wait here. They sent others ahead to check the tunnel interior.', 'We are to wait here. They sent others ahead to check the tunnel interior.', 19912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan speaks the truth! We should return at once to tell our brothers of the news! Retreat back through the portal!', '', 19911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 19910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orcs of the Horde! This portal is the gateway to your new destiny! Azeroth lies before you, ripe for the taking!', '', 19909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the void, no one can hear you scream!', '', 19908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let my darkness engulf you!', '', 19907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall send your soul into the infinite void!', '', 19906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wyrmcult must be using another path. We are still finding them in Ruuan Weald.', 'The Wyrmcult must be using another path. We are still finding them in Ruuan Weald.', 19905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, $n.  All friends of the Light are welcome at the Altar of Sha\'tar.', '', 19904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I crave your death!', '', 19903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once I\'ve hacked off your limbs, I may hang your body from our battlements.', '', 19902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fight against Kael\'thas and Illidan continues on all fronts.  Defeat is not an option.', 19901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love to bathe in the blood of my enemies!', '', 19900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Obey his commands and be honored among the Burning Legion.  Falter and you will be consumed!', '', 19899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are but extensions of Doom Lord Kazzak\'s will!  Be strong!  Be vigilant!  Let nothing stand in the way of the Burning Legion!', '', 19898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be ready my brothers!  We shall make our way thru the Dark Portal and all of Azeroth shall fall!', '', 19896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doom Lord Kazzak will soon unleash our full might on these pitiful Orcs and Humans!', '', 19895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me angered. Raaah!', '', 19894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me mad. You get smash in face!', '', 19893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid puny thing.  Me smash!', '', 19892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I have had enough of you filthy warm bloods!', '', 19891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The information you seek... I cannot give you that freely.  You will have to prove that your enemies are the same as mine.', '', 19890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be proud, your brain will be put to good use in one of my abominations.', '', 19889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is very kind of you to donate your organs!', '', 19888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent!  Fresh parts!', '', 19887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I decree that you are an enemy of the Ogre clans.  Punishment is death!', '', 19886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not allow you to kill anymore of my kind!  Prepare to die!', '', 19885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My message of unity is meant for the Ogre clans, not for you, $R!', '', 19884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only the leaders of the clans would listen.  Unity is the only answer.  All other paths lead to our destruction.', '', 19883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will we never learn to work together?  Or will we simply kill each other off and be forgotten in time.', '', 19882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should be uniting the Ogre clans, not fighting each other.', '', 19881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cries out in withdrawal, opening gates to the nether.', '', 19880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why must I be surrounded by incompetence?  Oh well, perhaps some of my underling may eventually grow a brain.', '', 19879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything is going according to schedule.  Prince Kael\'thas should be pleased.', '', 19878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a nether-fed rage!', '', 19877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power levels seem adequate.  No sign of the anomlies like we saw at Manaforge Ultris.', '', 19876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unauthorized personnel identified!  Punishment protocol activated.', '', 19875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perimeter breached!  Destroy $R!', '', 19874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder detected!  Neutralizing threat immediately!', '', 19873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hellfire Peninsula - Mordiba default', 19872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re willing to give up an Ata\'mal crystal... just to see your plan against Illidan through?  You intrigue me, Broken.  Perhaps I\'ll play along... for now, at least.', 19871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, $n.  You must take the Heart of Fury somewhere safe... you must take it to A\'dal!', '', 19870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have battled many beasts, dragon. I will help you.', 'I have battled many beasts, dragon. I will help you.', 19869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Neltharaku nods.>$B$BKarynaku... She is held prisoner atop Dragonmaw Fortress. I have made many attempts to free her. All have failed... You have battled these beasts before, have you not?\n', '', 19868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mate?', 'Your mate?', 19867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... We are powerless. Illidan found and delivered unto the Dragonmaw their leader - Zuluhed. This orc was the one responsible for the capture and incarceration of Alexstrasza. How could we fight against such power? He captured an Aspect!$B$BAnd just as easily, he took my mate.', '', 19866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you are dragons! How could orcs do this to you?', 'But you are dragons! How could orcs do this to you?', 19865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the eastern reaches of the Netherwing Fields lies Dragonmaw Fortress. It is there that the cruel Dragonmaw orc clan tortures the drakes that they capture in an attempt to bend them to their will. Many have given up hope, choosing instead to do the bidding of Dragonmaw. The others... They refuse to land for fear of Dragonmaw war parties capturing them and taking them back to the fortress.', '', 19864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am listening, dragon.', 'I am listening, dragon.', 19863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, mortal.', '', 19862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fairweather and I are up here representing Sylvanaar\'s interests.$B$BThe druids have been more than accommodating, but allowing the Horde to travel through here gives me the willies.', '', 19861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But that is not part of the vision I was granted... that is not... how my people will be freed.', '', 19860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With this crystal\'s powers, my Deathsworn and I... we\'d be unstoppable!  We could destroy Illidan!  We could... replace him as lords of Outland!', '', 19859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Heart of Fury... I witnessed its power long ago, when Velen wielded it.  I feel the same power coursing through it right now!', '', 19858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Porkchops!', '', 19857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Piggy!!!', '', 19856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spinebreaker Post is a great place to be stationed!  The Bleeding Hollow aberrations are so close you can smell their foul blood!  What better place to gather vengeance from a clan that has forsaken its brethren and made a pact with demons?', 19855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your overconfidence will be your undoing! Guards, lend me your strength!', '', 19854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit isn\'t selling the arena team charters you\'ll need to participate in ranking matches yet.\n\nStill, you can find an Arena Battlemaster and get in some practice rounds. It\'s never too soon to start training.', 'The Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit isn\'t selling the arena team charters you\'ll need to participate in ranking matches yet.\n\nStill, you can find an Arena Battlemaster and get in some practice rounds. It\'s never too soon to start training.', 19853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I form an arena team?', 'How do I form an arena team?', 19852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, another $c looking to be a gladiator, eh? Good!\n\nI sell the arena team charters you\'ll need to participate in ranking Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit matches.', 'Ah, another $c looking to be a gladiator, eh? Good!\n\nI sell the arena team charters you\'ll need to participate in ranking Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit matches.', 19850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, mortal.', '', 19849, 11, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hungrily eats the flayer carcass.\n', '', 19848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sound the alarm!', 'Sound the alarm!', 19847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where piggy go?!', '', 19846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Piggy stop!', '', 19845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm, other white meat!', '', 19844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be Grulloc\'s friend!', '', 19843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me hungry!', '', 19842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grulloc having lots of fun!', '', 19841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you all... die in pain!', '', 19840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna cook ya, an\' then I\'m gonna eat ya!', '', 19839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doom upon you... wretched mortals!', '', 19838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The black dragonflight will conquer all!', '', 19837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dragonflight will... devour you.', '', 19836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic, inferior mortals!', '', 19835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S-s-o-o... cold.', '', 19834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall be consumed by flame!', '', 19833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are... nothing!', '', 19832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare imprison me? You will die!', '', 19831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s retrieves the Heart of Fury.', '', 19830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be hearing from my lawyer!', '', 19829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heal me! For the love of all that\'s holy, heal me! I\'m dying!!', '', 19828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ice, ice baby.', '', 19827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna light you up, sweet cheeks!', '', 19826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You guys feel free to jump in anytime.', '', 19825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t even break a sweat on that one!', '', 19824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to defend yourself, cretin!', '', 19823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no idea what goes on here, but I will gladly join your fight against this impudent imbecile!', '', 19822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We span the universe, as countless as the stars!', '', 19821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master... I\'ve failed you...', '', 19820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will show you horrors undreamed of.', '', 19819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flee in terror.', '', 19818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your will is no longer your own.', '', 19817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will do my bidding, weakling.', '', 19816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am merely one of... infinite multitudes.', '', 19815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The chaos I have sown here is but a taste....', '', 19814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fate is written.', '', 19813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s picks up the flayer carcass.', '', 19812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Read the tome of divinity I have given you, $n.  When you have learned from the book, speak with me again.', 19811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just one good shot...', '', 19810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They can\'t keep this up! Their wings will eventually give...', '', 19809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, it is completed.', '', 19808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must... free... my children...', 19807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ranked arena matches start in $4262d. Would-be champions are already busy honing their skills and acquiring the best gear they can. Are you going to be ready?', 'Ranked arena matches start in $4262d. Would-be champions are already busy honing their skills and acquiring the best gear they can. Are you going to be ready?', 19806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My loathing of interruptions is overshadowed only by my hatred of Gruul the Dragonkiller and his seven sons!', '', 19805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, let me see what you\'ve got.', 'Very well, let me see what you\'ve got.', 19804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there.  Taking a break, overseer?  We don\'t get to see you around here much anymore since you were reassigned to Ruuan Weald.$B$BTake a look at what I have to offer.  It may not have changed much since last we spoke, but I\'ve got plenty.$B$BAnd don\'t be such a stranger!', '', 19803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Yo! Have you heard about the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit?\n\nYou can find Arena Organizers selling the arena team charters in Gadgetzan and outside the arenas in Nagrand and the Blade\'s Edge Mountains.', 'Yo! Have you heard about the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit?\n\nYou can find Arena Organizers selling the arena team charters in Gadgetzan and outside the arenas in Nagrand and the Blade\'s Edge Mountains.', 19802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you have defeated the Crimson Sigil. You now seek to challenge my rule? Not even Arthas could defeat me, yet you dare to even harbor such thoughts? Then I say to you, come! Come $n! The Black Temple awaits...', '', 19801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torloth, your master calls!', '', 19800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run while you still can. The highlords come soon...', '', 19799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no challenge for the Crimson Sigil. Mind breakers, end this nonsense!', '', 19798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What manner of fool dares stand before Illidan Stormrage? Soldiers, destroy these insects!', '', 19797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, get to the middle of the platform! Illidan\'s fury is soon to be unleashed!', '', 19796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
