('You will do nothing to dishonor me before Val\'zareq.  Is that clear?', 'You will do nothing to dishonor me before Val\'zareq.  Is that clear?', 19702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Straighten up!  I will not have soldiers in my unit looking so undisciplined before Val\'zareq.', 'Straighten up!  I will not have soldiers in my unit looking so undisciplined before Val\'zareq.', 19701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using', 'Using', 19700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Karazhan wasn\'t always quite as... ominous.  The darkening of Karazhan only came with Medivh\'s death.  Or what we believe was Medivh\'s death.', 19699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemies approach! Call for me when you are at a safe location.', 'Enemies approach! Call for me when you are at a safe location.', 19698, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... I did not think so...', 19697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then you become enemies of my lord, Illidan. Enemies of Illidan are destroyed. Are your giants able to withstand an attack from the forces of Eclipse Point?', 19696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And... if we do not?', '', 19695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins channelling power into Dimensius.', '', 19694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lend us the strength of the giants of Shadowmoon, Corok. The master is a just ruler. He will be sure to take care of those that assisted in subduing the dissidents of this world.', 19693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the spirit!$B$BI\'m glad that we had this little meeting.  I feel much better about the attack now.  With leaders like you on the front, how can we lose?$B$BAlright, you have your marching orders.  Now get back to the Ruuan Weald and make it happen!', '', 19692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Absolutely!', 'Absolutely!', 19691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re putting the final preparations together even as we speak.  The rest will depend upon how quickly you can organize your forces at Ruuan Weald.$B$BDo you think that you can handle that and get it done quickly?', '', 19690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Impressive.  When do we attack?', 'Impressive.  When do we attack?', 19689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You could at least try to sound a little bit convincing.$B$BLook, Nuaar, I wasn\'t going to tell you this, but I might as well because it\'s going to involve you, too.  Maxnar is planning an all-out attack on the druids at Ruuan Weald.  And he intends to wipe them out.$B$BIt\'s bad enough that we\'ve been fighting with the Boulder\'mok ogres, so we can\'t afford another front to deal with.  I\'ve arranged for a temporary truce with the arakkoa.$B$BWell, what do you think?', '', 19688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('Um, no... no, I don\'t want that at all.', 'Um, no... no, I don\'t want that at all.', 19687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want excuses, I demand results!$B$BYou think what we\'re doing here is a joke?  If we don\'t do this right, then not only will the so-called do-gooders come calling, but we\'ll be found unworthy for elevation within the ranks of the Blackwing.$B$BIs that what you want?', '', 19686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Oh, it\'s not my fault, I can assure you.', 'Oh, it\'s not my fault, I can assure you.', 19685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right, the meeting.  Let\'s get down to it then.$B$BThe fact is that the lumber and livestock being gathered from the Ruuan Weald, which you\'re responsible for, has slowed to a trickle.$B$BWe need those resources, but you\'ve allowed the druids of the Cenarion Expedition to get in the way!', '', 19684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m fine, thank you.  You asked for me?', 'I\'m fine, thank you.  You asked for me?', 19683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone, overseer!  We\'ve already spoken.$B$BStop dragging your feet and execute your orders at Ruuan Weald!', '', 19682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Nuaar, are you feeling well?  You don\'t look like yourself today.', '', 19681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Searching', 'Searching', 19680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did not wish to lower myself by engaging your kind, but you leave me little choice...', 19679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am here at the behest of my master, Baron Sablemane, to help the Cenarion Expedition with its wyrmcult problems.$B$BI\'m something of an expert on these things.', 19678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I detect a charge in your paranarbulatric region!  You must have used the Zephyrium Capacitorium lately -- you can\'t use it again until the charge wears off...', '', 19677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Collecting', 'Collecting', 19676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak quickly, $n. We haven\'t much time!', 'Speak quickly, $n. We haven\'t much time!', 19675, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can handle it from here.  Roughriders you are dismissed.', '', 19674, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FIRE UP THE DEF GUNS!', '', 19673, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GET THOSE GUNS ONLINE!!', '', 19672, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Singing Ridge.', 'Take me to Singing Ridge.', 19671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Raven\'s Wood.', 'Take me to Raven\'s Wood.', 19670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Ruuan.', 'Take me to Ruuan.', 19669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Razaan\'s Landing!', 'Send me to Razaan\'s Landing!', 19668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for my test flight!', 'I\'m ready for my test flight!', 19667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve rigged a few control consoles down the slope. Get to one quickly and take control of the fel reaver! You\'ll only have a limited amount of time.', '', 19666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha, you\'re back?  You don\'t seriously expect me to change my mind do you?$B$BGet lost.', '', 19665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve come to the Ruuan Weald to see if we can reestablish the balance of nature to these mountains.$B$BThe interference of the arakkoa and the wyrmcult is making this a difficult task, however.$B$BLuckily, there are those like you and Samia that are willing to lend us a hand.', '', 19664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Negotiations?  NEGOTIATIONS!$B$BAllow me to make our stance perfectly clear.  We are a free people, able to do whatever we want and come and go as we please.  The Cenarion Expedition does not own this mountain range.$B$BThere will be no negotiations!  Now, go back to the druids and tell them that we will continue to do as we please.', '', 19663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 25, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Overseer, I am here to negotiate on behalf of the Cenarion Expedition.', 'Overseer, I am here to negotiate on behalf of the Cenarion Expedition.', 19662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blade\'s Edge Mountains are a place of great opportunity.  How unfortunate that some deem themselves above all others on matters that pertain to taking advantage of such opportunities.$B$BWho do the Cenarion Expedition think they are to tell us what we can and cannot do here?', '', 19661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last time someone went out to try to collect the bounty on Netherock, all we got back was a compressed layer of foolhardy adventurer!', 'Last time someone went out to try to collect the bounty on Netherock, all we got back was a compressed layer of foolhardy adventurer!', 19660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Netherock?!  That thing\'ll squish you flat with one step of its massive foot!  No thanks!', 'Netherock?!  That thing\'ll squish you flat with one step of its massive foot!  No thanks!', 19659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c - I\'m a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Exodar.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Exodar for your duty and service.\n', 'Greetings, $c - I\'m a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of the Exodar.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from the Exodar for your duty and service.', 19658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c - I\'m a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Silvermoon City.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Silvermoon City for your duty and service.', 'Greetings, $c - I\'m a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Silvermoon City.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Silvermoon City for your duty and service.\n', 19657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A grand master jewelcrafter, Hamanar, may be found in northern Aldor Rise.', 'A grand master jewelcrafter, Hamanar, may be found in northern Aldor Rise.', 19656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find the enchanting trainer, Zurii, in southern Aldor Rise.', 'You will find the enchanting trainer, Zurii, in southern Aldor Rise.', 19655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find the Stable Master near the caregiver center.', 'You will find the Stable Master near the caregiver center.', 19654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find a mailbox near the caregiver center.', 'You will find a mailbox near the caregiver center.', 19653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find a caregiver center in the southern portion of Aldor Rise.', 'You will find a caregiver center in the southern portion of Aldor Rise.', 19652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Aldor Rise. You seek guidance?', 'Welcome to Aldor Rise. You seek guidance?', 19651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the lower city\'s open marketplace.>', '', 19650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards Aldor Rise.>', '', 19648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the northeastern section of the lower city.>', '', 19647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the Seer\'s Library.>', '', 19646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am more powerful than ever!', '', 19645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More knowledge, more power!', '', 19644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on, kill them! I\'ll be the better for it!', '', 19643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures down towards the lower city\'s open market, in the southeast.>', '', 19642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures down towards the lower city, where a great forge may be found.>', '', 19641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures to the northwest portion of the lower city, where Shattrath\'s arakkoa dwell.>', '', 19640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place below the Tier, a stairwell southeast of the city\'s center.>', '', 19638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards a place below the Tier, a stairwell northeast of the city\'s center.>', '', 19637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to die!', '', 19636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, execute the instructions!', 'Now, execute the instructions!', 19635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your failures are tiring me.  If you cannot do as instructed we will have no use for you.', 'Your failures are tiring me.  If you cannot do as instructed we will have no use for you.', 19634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you keep failing these simple tasks, you will be put down.', 'If you keep failing these simple tasks, you will be put down.', 19633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid drake!  When will you learn to follow directions?', 'Stupid drake!  When will you learn to follow directions?', 19632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good!  Soon you will be ready for a rider.', 'Good!  Soon you will be ready for a rider.', 19631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are coming along nicely.', 'You are coming along nicely.', 19630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent!  You are almost ready my pet.', 'Excellent!  You are almost ready my pet.', 19629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you read is something that you don\'t think you\'re quite ready for.$B$BYou should check back later.', '', 19628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The details of the posting call for the execution of an enormous wolf.  She apparently keeps her den to the south of the Jagged Ridge, near the Horde stronghold.', '', 19627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You honor our memory.', '', 19626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been watching you and Rexxar.  You must aid him to secure the future of the Horde here in these mountains.  Only when you have forced the ogres into submission and slain their master, Gruul the Dragonkiller, will your people be safe.', '', 19625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By recovering the artifacts of our clan, by taking up the fight against our ancient enemy, the Bladespire ogres, and their gronn masters, by returning the Thunderspike to my hand, you have secured the blessing of the Thunderlord clan.', '', 19624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you above all have earned the right for the Horde to inhabit our ancestral home.', '', 19623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Facing $n.', '', 19622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins intensely dodging incoming attacks!', '%s begins intensely dodging incoming attacks!', 19621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever advice I can give to aid in your fight against the ogres, you shall have it!', '', 19620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, alright then, there you go, First Officer $n.  Just try to be more careful with your helmet in the future.$B$BThose things don\'t grow on trees, you know!', '', 19619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chief, I\'ve somehow misplaced my X-52 Rocket Helmet!!!!', 'Chief, I\'ve somehow misplaced my X-52 Rocket Helmet!!!!', 19618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To pass beyond my Hall, you must defeat me in a game of skill!  Control your king when you are ready to begin...', '', 19617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"It is too soon for you to control me, for you have recently left the game.\"', '', 19616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... you must take this from me, $n!  I feel its dark power swaying my will already!  Use it to destroy Varedis.', '', 19615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This book would give me unlimited power over my enemies... I would become... unstoppable!', '', 19614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really wish I could help ya, but I can\'t! Kurdran\'s given me direct orders. Now move along!', '', 19613, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t get it! Are ya blind? Can ya not see the demons bangin\' on our door? Who am I gonna send out to talk to your shaman friends? Point \'em out!', '', 19612, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, if I\'ve told ya once, I\'ve told ya a hundred times: WE CANNOT HELP YOU!', '', 19611, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pray to your gods, shaman. Perhaps they will come to your aid. The Horde, however, cannot...', '', 19610, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you not have eyes? Did you not see the demons on our very doorstep? I do not have the soldiers to spare!', '', 19609, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it that you want from me, shaman?', '', 19608, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better, much better.', '', 19607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaghh, the poison...', '', 19606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n, for saving us from a fate worse than death.  You have our eternal gratitude.', 'Thank you, $n, for saving us from a fate worse than death.  You have our eternal gratitude.', 19605, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anti-demon magics flare to life and imbue the weapon.', '', 19604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Into this blade, I imbue the power to strike down the strongest of demons! No demon shall stand before the wielder of this weapon!', '', 19603, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reads several pages of the Lexicon Demonica before beginning his work.', '', 19602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian silently waits for you to further elaborate.>', '', 19600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who disturbs my slumber?  That spear... I still carry the scar!', '', 19599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel my wrath, $r scum!  You will not get away with this!', 19598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all have our demons....', '', 19597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, my banishment ends!', '', 19596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gone, trifling elf.  I am in control now!', '', 19595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 19594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine rock!  Crack stone!  Faster!  Faster!', '', 19593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work harder!', '', 19592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find our mana loom in the merchant\'s bazaar within the Lower City.', 'You can find our mana loom in the merchant\'s bazaar within the Lower City.', 19591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keelen\'s tailoring shop in the northwest corner of the Bazaar has a loom like you describe.', 'Keelen\'s tailoring shop in the northwest corner of the Bazaar has a loom like you describe.', 19590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mana Loom', 'Mana Loom', 19589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mumman has set up her humble shop near the main entrance of the city, just past the inn. A fine cook, that one.', 'Mumman has set up her humble shop near the main entrance of the city, just past the inn. A fine cook, that one.', 19588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will tear you to pieces, demon!', 19587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can take a man away from the Sons of Lothar, but you can\'t take the Sons out of him.$B$B<The smith shrugs.>$B$BIt\'s hard to explain, but I don\'t feel like I\'m meant to be at Honor Hold right now, is all.$B$BPerhaps I\'m meant to be part of something larger.', '', 19586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The metal has lost its magic. I could make a weapon from it, but it would be no different from a mundane blade.', '', 19585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, this isn\'t right. What\'s happened here?', '', 19584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare intrude in my sanctum?  I promise you a world of pain!', '', 19583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The metal\'s magical properties are gone! It can still be worked, but not by conventional smithing methods.', '', 19582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This doesn\'t look right...', '', 19581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will soon pray for a switft death!', '', 19580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
