('', 'I wish I had more time to teach all who came before me, but alas that is not the way of things. Until you have learned all that Padaar has to teach, I cannot help you.', 19435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Creation of Jewelry and Gems is what I live for. Can I share my passion with you?', 'Creation of Jewelry and Gems is what I live for. Can I share my passion with you?', 19434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My knowledge of Jewelcrafting I will share with you.', 19433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Until you have mastered the Apprentice level of Jewelcrafting we shall not speak again.', 19432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you wish to know of Jewelcrafting?', '', 19431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Testing...', '', 19430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you wish to further your skills, seek Telia\'s shop in Silvermoon.  It is on the south end of the Royal Exchange.', 19429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I continue my Jewelcrafting Training?', 'Where can I continue my Jewelcrafting Training?', 19428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Prospecting is the primary method of finding gems!   You simply use the prospecting ability (which is found in the professions tab of your spellbook) on a stack of five ore to extract the gems from it.   Any type of non-precious ore will do!    \n\nBetter quality ores will provide more valuable gems so you will find higher quality gems in iron ore than in copper ore.', 'Prospecting is the primary method of finding gems!   You simply use the prospecting ability (which is found in the professions tab of your spellbook) on a stack of five ore to extract the gems from it.   Any type of non-precious ore will do!    \n\nBetter quality ores will provide more valuable gems so you will find higher quality gems in iron ore than in copper ore.', 19427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I use Prospecting?', 'How do I use Prospecting?', 19426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you interested in learning the intricacies of Jewelcrafting?', 19425, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Toshley\'s Station inn.  What can I do for you?', '', 19424, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooh, this shall be fun! [PH]', 19423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have some uninvited guests.... [PH]', '', 19422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! Assemble yourselves!', '', 19421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hunger! Feed me the power of this forge, my children!', '', 19420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squawk!  Who dare slay my Worshippers and summon me , High Priest A, forth! [PH]', '', 19419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, proceed to the translocator.  Forge Camp Wrath awaits your arrival!', '', 19418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our ally has arrived!  Clear the way to the materialization chamber!', '', 19417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make ready the chambers, another ally will soon join our ranks!', '', 19416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a furious rage.', '', 19415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s detonates in a rage upon seeing its master die.', '', 19414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wit a reward like dis, how could they refuse, mon?', '', 19413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, that\'ll do it! They\'ll come runnin\' once they see the reward we\'ve put up!', '', 19412, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All rewards for services rendered to be dispensed by Warcaller Beersnout.$B$BPost no bills.', '', 19411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All rewards for services rendered to be dispensed by Warcaller Sardon Truslice.$B$BPost no bills.', '', 19410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Curse you, Akama!  I am not a pawn in your game... my will is my own.  When I unleash my wrath upon Illidan it will have nothing to do with your foolish scheme!', 19409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In due time, Maiev.  I\'ve spent years preparing to make my move - I can\'t afford to put my plans in peril by tipping my hand too soon.', '', 19408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we truly desire the same thing, Akama, then release me!  If Illidan is to die, it shall be by my hand!', 19407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To many of my people I am known as a traitor... as Illidan\'s lapdog.  It is best that they continue to think that for now.', '', 19406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive my harsh methods, but the Betrayer cannot learn of the truth.  My secret must be kept at all costs!', '', 19405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'d do well not to toy with me, Akama.  Illidan has given me specific orders to keep a close watch on the Warden.  If I find out you\'re hiding anything from me, I will crush you with my own hands!', '', 19404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mere nuisance, I assure you!  Tell the Master his prisoner will not escape while Akama and his Deathsworn watch over her.', '', 19403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have no fear, $r.  Just play along.', '', 19402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals, here?  What is the meaning of this, pathetic Broken!', '', 19401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Search the corpse for Kagrosh\'s pack.', 'Search the corpse for Kagrosh\'s pack.', 19400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The orc\'s corpse has been casually tossed aside so as not to litter the walkway.', '', 19399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What $r dare harm those of my flock?', '', 19398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop us!', '', 19397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not know what manner of ruse you\'re attempting, Broken wretch, but I want no part in this!', 19396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Release me immediately or face my wrath!', 19395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This cell won\'t hold me for long.  I will have Illidan\'s head one way or another.', 19394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be ready to advance on the enemy.  We will soon launch an all out assault on the Betrayer.', '', 19393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Void energy gathers at the base of the %s!', 'Void energy gathers at the base of the %s!', 19392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of fire grant us wisdom!', '', 19391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a scientist who studies both time and sound, so I\'m not quite certain how I\'m supposed to think, or find the time to get any work done around here, with all of this racket?!$B$BWhy can\'t these fools go blow themselves up somewhere else?$B$BAh well, at least I look good.  Say, $g boy : lovely;, have I seen you around here before?', '', 19390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating.', '', 19389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ever do that again, I will break your neck.', '', 19388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guardians! To me!', '', 19387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want me to get into trouble?  I have a lot of work to do here, and old man Wheeler there isn\'t cutting me any slack.', '', 19386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, if you can manage to get even one of those fixed, I\'ll let you take a ten minute break.  How\'s that sound?  Pretty good, huh?', '', 19385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control Warchief Blackhand', 'Control Warchief Blackhand', 19384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Warchief Blackhand towers over the field.>', '', 19383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just knew that I shouldn\'t have fired Beebo!', '', 19382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much am I paying you?  You call that working?', '', 19381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chubis, after you\'re done there, make sure that you put another coat of wax on the Wheeler mobile.  I want to take mama out for a spin tonight.', '', 19380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I was your age I could have had all of those shredders fixed before breakfast and still had time for all of my other chores.  In the Winterspring snow, no less.  And it\'s uphill both ways there!', '', 19379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chubis Chubisimo!  Get those things fixed... we haven\'t got all day!', '', 19378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control Orc Warlock', 'Control Orc Warlock', 19377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Behind the warlock\'s eyes smolders a deep malevolence.>', '', 19376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control Orc Wolf', 'Control Orc Wolf', 19375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The orc wolf\'s frozen, snarling mouth shivers your bones.>', '', 19374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They most often turn deadly, and we\'re understaffed as it is.', '', 19373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian stands motionless, waiting for you to elaborate on which Battlemasters you mean.>', '', 19372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures across the Tier, towards the inn and the stablemaster outside it.>', '', 19371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place across the Tier, towards the inn and nearby mailbox.>', '', 19370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look sharp troops! Varedis is known for conducting surprise inspections.', '', 19369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place east of the city\'s center.>', '', 19368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control Orc Necrolyte', 'Control Orc Necrolyte', 19367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Dark magic ripples from the necrolyte.>', '', 19366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t get any ideas or I\'ll see that you join them!', '', 19365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures across the Tier, towards the inn.>', '', 19364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures to a place southeast of the city\'s center.>', '', 19363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the easternmost portion of the lower city.>', '', 19362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian seems to face you, but says nothing.>', '', 19361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hurt you for that.', '', 19360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that? Oh you try and use birdy magic? I crush you!', '', 19359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, okay! Me dancing!', '', 19358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see those bones at your feet? Those are guards who tried to desert their post.', '', 19357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be diligent! One word from me and  you\'ll be fed to the warlocks\' demons.', '', 19356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consider it done, sir.', 'Consider it done, sir.', 19355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It shall be so, sir.', 'It shall be so, sir.', 19354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish.', 'As you wish.', 19353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By your command!', 'By your command!', 19352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Understood, sir.', 'Understood, sir.', 19351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you say, sir.', 'As you say, sir.', 19350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder how far this would launch that white cat...', 'I wonder how far this would launch that white cat...', 19349, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What, exactly, are we ever going to fire these at?', 'What, exactly, are we ever going to fire these at?', 19348, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do we even have ammunition for these?', 'Do we even have ammunition for these?', 19347, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re never going to fire one of these, are we?', 'We\'re never going to fire one of these, are we?', 19346, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There have been reports of intruders. You are to notify me at once if you see anything unusual!', '', 19345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are proceeding as planned.', '', 19344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give these to the heroes that made this possible.', '', 19343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Torn-heart men give their weapons to Earthmender Torlok.', '', 19342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We leave, then, Torlok. I have only one request...', '', 19341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, mortals... The earthmender knows what fire feels...', '', 19340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... Well enough for the elements that are here, but the cipher is known to another... The spirits of fire are in turmoil... If this force is not stopped, the world where these mortals came from will cease.', '', 19339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is now as it should be, shaman. You have done well.', '', 19338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are redeemed! Then we have won?', '', 19337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear what you hear, brother. Look behind you...', '', 19336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s falls unconscious.', '', 19335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What say the elements, Torlok? I hear only silence.', '', 19334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must speak with the shaman of the Earthen Ring. Come...', '', 19333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could... Could it be over? Is he destroyed?', '', 19332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nearly ready!  You will soon be called to destroy our enemies and conquer this land!', '', 19331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nearly ready!  You will soon be called to destroy our enemies and conquer this land!', '', 19329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not worthy to be called Burning Legion!  Try harder worm!', '', 19328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep working!  You must be ready to join the front lines!', '', 19327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reclaim Flanis\'s pack.', 'Reclaim Flanis\'s pack.', 19326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dwarf appears to have been discovered and slain in the midst of a spy mission. The Deathforge\'s attendants have left the corpse in the open, perhaps as a warning to other would-be interlopers.', '', 19325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of the nearby arokkoa face east and whistle a long, low note of devotion. [PH]', '', 19324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control Summoned Daemon', 'Control Summoned Daemon', 19323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The summoned daemon twitches, fighting against Medivh\'s rules of play.  He wants your soul!>', '', 19322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s focuses on $n!', '%s focuses on $n!', 19321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control Orc Grunt', 'Control Orc Grunt', 19320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The grunt\'s mouth waters, anticipating bloodshed.>', '', 19319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cansis. You are a chicken.', '', 19318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting... Let me try something.', '', 19317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s partially phases himself out of reality.', '', 19316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cansis, hold still. I\'m going to try to use this crystal.', '', 19315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glory to the naaru, $n.  The Light will soon triumph over its enemies.', 19314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, yeah... welcome to my station.$B$BSo, what do you think?  Pretty nifty what we\'ve done here, wouldn\'t you say?$B$BMakes me glad to be rid of those stuffy elves at Sylvanaar anyway.$B$BMake yourself useful around here; there\'re plenty of experiments and whatnot to help out with.', '', 19313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I AM FLUENT IN OVER TWO LANGUAGES: DWARVISH, GNOMISH AND THE VERY COMMON TONGUE OF HUMANS.  BUT I HAVE NO IDEA WHAT YOU ARE SAYING!$B$BSPEAK UP; I CANNOT HEAR YOU OVER THE GRINDING OF MY GEARS!', '', 19312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WARNING!  WARNING!  AWAY HOSTILE BEINGS!  DO NOT HEAD UP THE RIDGE TO TOSHLEY\'S STATION!', '', 19311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight when you are ready.', '', 19310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will set the elements free of your grasp by force!', '', 19309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little creature made of flesh, your wish is granted! Death comes for you!', '', 19308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Oronok. Let us destroy Cyrukh and free the elements!', 'I am ready, Oronok. Let us destroy Cyrukh and free the elements!', 19307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight when you are ready, $n.', '', 19306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have come to help battle the dirge of Karabor!', '', 19305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not fight alone, $n! Together, we will banish this spawn of hellfire!', '', 19304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A flaming vortex takes shape.', '', 19303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those that dare play with fire will be incinerated!', '', 19302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cyrukh comes for you!', '', 19301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, mortals, face the lord of fire!', '', 19300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will suffer eternally!', '', 19299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cyrukh has awoken!', '', 19298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control King Llane', 'Control King Llane', 19297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Llane\'s true wisdom and strength burn bright, even in this likeness of the king.>', '', 19296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control Human Conjurer', 'Control Human Conjurer', 19295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The conjurer stands fierce, its gaze distant.>', '', 19294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control Human Cleric', 'Control Human Cleric', 19293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The cleric stares at you through the corner of its eye.>', '', 19292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies will darken and all will go quiet. Only then will you know the sweet serenity of death...', '', 19291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world is at an end.', '', 19290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forced to land like a dog. No matter. Soon, all of these wonderous beasts will be under the control of the master.', '', 19289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control Human Charger.', 'Control Human Charger.', 19288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The charger stands proud, eager for battle.>', '', 19287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The water elemental is ready to surge.>', '', 19286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control Conjured Water Elemental.', 'Control Conjured Water Elemental.', 19285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready to seek a new specialization, seek Narain Soothfancy.   He can be found in Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.', 'When you are ready to seek a new specialization, seek Narain Soothfancy.   He can be found in Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.', 19284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you so far from Toshley\'s Station?\n', 'Why are you so far from Toshley\'s Station?\n', 19283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the help of Engineer Lapforge from Gadgetzan i have built a powerful gnomish transporter here at Toshley\'s Station!  I would be happy to help any gnomish engineer with enough skill to build their own personal transport beacon.', '', 19282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crate? I didn\'t send you a crate, Jovaan. Don\'t you have more important things to worry about? Go see to them!', '', 19281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s in the crate?', '', 19280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It shall be as you say, warbringer. One last question, if I may...', '', 19279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could really use a heart. Say, can I have yours?', '', 19278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now what should I do with you? I simply can\'t make up my mind.', '', 19277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not afraid a\' you! Do you wanna\' fight? Huh, do ya\'? C\'mon! I\'ll fight ya\' with both paws behind my back!', '', 19276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warbringer, that will require the use of all the hold\'s infernals. It may leave us vulnerable to a counterattack.', '', 19275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything is in readiness, warbringer.', '', 19274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s moves in behind you with his axe at the ready.', '', 19273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, good of you to come around, Ruusk. Thank you and farewell.', 'Ah, good of you to come around, Ruusk. Thank you and farewell.', 19272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait. Where are you going? You needed a transfer, correct? Let\'s just get it done and over with, ok? Zuluhed at Dragonmaw? It will be done. Please let Lord Illidan know that his orders were carried out with the full cooperation of the Eclipsion.$B$BI will dispatch Ruul the Darkener to personally deliver the fragment!$B$BYou heard me right - Ruul...\n', '', 19271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I need to go into all the gory details? I think we are both well aware of what Lord Illidan does with those that would oppose his word. Now, I must be going! Farewell, Ruusk! Forever...\n', 'Do I need to go into all the gory details? I think we are both well aware of what Lord Illidan does with those that would oppose his word. Now, I must be going! Farewell, Ruusk! Forever...\n', 19270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ruusk swallows hard.>$B$BI... What do you mean?', '', 19269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. I will return to the Black Temple and notify Lord Illidan of your unwillingness to carry out his wishes. I suggest you make arrangements with your subordinates and let them know that you will be leaving this world soon.', 'Very well. I will return to the Black Temple and notify Lord Illidan of your unwillingness to carry out his wishes. I suggest you make arrangements with your subordinates and let them know that you will be leaving this world soon.', 19268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to me, peon. We have a process for the delivery and safekeeping of the cipher fragment. The envoy delivers the missive, which is sealed by Lord Illidan. No missive, no transfer.', '', 19267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you did not hear me, Ruusk. I am giving you an order from Illidan himself!', 'Perhaps you did not hear me, Ruusk. I am giving you an order from Illidan himself!', 19266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh? Of course you have papers documenting this request.', '', 19265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s hand begins to glow with Arcane energy!', '', 19264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Belore...', 19263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cipher fragment is to be moved. Have it delivered to Zuluhed.', 'The cipher fragment is to be moved. Have it delivered to Zuluhed.', 19262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m listening.', '', 19261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring word from Lord Illidan.', 'I bring word from Lord Illidan.', 19260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You boys need some help?', 'You boys need some help?', 19259, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need something destroyed?', 'Need something destroyed?', 19258, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally.', 'Finally.', 19257, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m all over it.', 'I\'m all over it.', 19256, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody call for an exterminator?', 'Somebody call for an exterminator?', 19255, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look alive, we\'ve got company!', '', 19254, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do try and be more careful, $n.', '', 19253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another disguise, Borak. I lost the last one.', 'I need another disguise, Borak. I lost the last one.', 19252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares interrupt the Grand Commander?', '', 19251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The armor and weapons crafters Kradu Grimblade and Zula Slagfury may be found working at a great forge in the lower city.', 'The armor and weapons crafters Kradu Grimblade and Zula Slagfury may be found working at a great forge in the lower city.', 19250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blacksmithing', 'Blacksmithing', 19249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The grand master leatherworker Darmari may be found in the lower city\'s open marketplace.', 'The grand master leatherworker Darmari may be found in the lower city\'s open marketplace.', 19248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seymour, the principal skinner in Shattrath and grand master of the trade, may be found in the lower city\'s open marketplace.', 'Seymour, the principal skinner in Shattrath and grand master of the trade, may be found in the lower city\'s open marketplace.', 19247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The draenei grand master jewelcrafter, Hamanar, may be found among his people on the Aldor Rise.', 'The draenei grand master jewelcrafter, Hamanar, may be found among his people on the Aldor Rise.', 19246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mildred Fletcher may be found within the infirmary in the northeastern section of the lower city.', 'Mildred Fletcher may be found within the infirmary in the northeastern section of the lower city.', 19245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sighing, %s kneels down and picks up the amulet.', 19244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Enchanter Bardolan may be found in the Seer\'s Library on Scryer\'s Tier. A grand master of the art, he is surrounded by his students: masters, artisans, experts, and journeymen.', 'High Enchanter Bardolan may be found in the Seer\'s Library on Scryer\'s Tier. A grand master of the art, he is surrounded by his students: masters, artisans, experts, and journeymen.', 19243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
