('Jack Trapper can be found cooking in the lower city\'s open market, in the southeast.', 'Jack Trapper can be found cooking in the lower city\'s open market, in the southeast.', 19240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
