('What sort of trainer were you looking for?', 'What sort of trainer were you looking for?', 19231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde battlemasters can usually be found on a stairwell southeast of the city\'s center.', 'The Horde battlemasters can usually be found on a stairwell southeast of the city\'s center.', 19230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance battlemasters can usually be found on a stairwell northeast of the city\'s center.', 'The Alliance battlemasters can usually be found on a stairwell northeast of the city\'s center.', 19229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde Battlemasters', 'Horde Battlemasters', 19228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Battlemasters', 'Alliance Battlemasters', 19227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shattrath\'s battlemasters often congregate on the stairwells between the upper and lower city. The Alliance battlemasters gather in one place, the Horde in another, with the arena battlemasters between and across from them.', 'Shattrath\'s battlemasters often congregate on the stairwells between the upper and lower city. The Alliance battlemasters gather in one place, the Horde in another, with the arena battlemasters between and across from them.', 19226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scryers Stable', 'Scryers Stable', 19225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aldor Stable', 'Aldor Stable', 19224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are stable masters just outside both the draenei and blood elf inns on Aldor Rise and Scryer\'s Tier.', 'There are stable masters just outside both the draenei and blood elf inns on Aldor Rise and Scryer\'s Tier.', 19223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find mailboxes within or just outside the Aldor and Scryers banks and inns.', 'You will find mailboxes within or just outside the Aldor and Scryers banks and inns.', 19222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shattrath\'s flight master is Nutral. You will find him east of the city\'s center.', 'Shattrath\'s flight master is Nutral. You will find him east of the city\'s center.', 19221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scryers inn is located above Shattrath city, on Scryer\'s Tier. The lift to there is southwest of the city center.', 'The Scryers inn is located above Shattrath city, on Scryer\'s Tier. The lift to there is southwest of the city center.', 19220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Aldor inn is located high above Shattrath city, on Aldor Rise. The lift to there is northwest of the city center.', 'The Aldor inn is located high above Shattrath city, on Aldor Rise. The lift to there is northwest of the city center.', 19219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scryers Inn', 'Scryers Inn', 19218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aldor Inn', 'Aldor Inn', 19217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shattrath\'s inns are full of wounded refugees. Still, there is room among the draenei Aldor and blood elf Scryers on Aldor Rise and Scryer\'s Tier.', 'Shattrath\'s inns are full of wounded refugees. Still, there is room among the draenei Aldor and blood elf Scryers on Aldor Rise and Scryer\'s Tier.', 19216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scryers bank is located southeast of the city\'s center.', 'The Scryers bank is located southeast of the city\'s center.', 19215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Aldor bank is located northwest of the the city\'s center.', 'The Aldor bank is located northwest of the the city\'s center.', 19214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scryers Bank', 'Scryers Bank', 19213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aldor Bank', 'Aldor Bank', 19212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are two banks in Shattrath, both along the rim of the central city hub. One is run by the draenei Aldor, the other by the blood elf Scryers.', 'There are two banks in Shattrath, both along the rim of the central city hub. One is run by the draenei Aldor, the other by the blood elf Scryers.', 19211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Profession Trainer', 'Profession Trainer', 19210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlemaster', 'Battlemaster', 19209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stable Master', 'Stable Master', 19208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls for the aid of a nearby male!', '', 19207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a small songbook that I thought you might like to have.  It contains the lyrics to a song known as the Lament of the Highborne; the one that Lady Sylvanas glamoured from the air.', '', 19206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it that you have for me, ambassador?', 'What is it that you have for me, ambassador?', 19205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mailbox', 'Mailbox', 19204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flight Master', 'Flight Master', 19203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inn', 'Inn', 19202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bank', 'Bank', 19201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That could have gone better, $n.  Come, I have something for you.', '', 19200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s looks down at the discarded necklace.  In her sadness, the lady incants a glamour, which beckons forth Highborne spirits.  The chamber resonates with their ancient song about the Sin\'dorei...', 19197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas, sometimes one must take matters into one\'s own hands. Balamore shanal!', '', 19195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
(' I think that we should teach a lesson to both the Horde and the Alliance.  One that they will not soon forget!', '', 19194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s pulls a throwing knife from his boot!', '%s pulls a throwing knife from his boot!', 19193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your house in order!  I will return to finish this conversation later.', '', 19192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am returning to Tempest Keep.  See to it that I do not have reason to return!', '', 19191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See to it, Ardonis!', '', 19190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, my lord.', '', 19189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve had too many setbacks along the way: Hellfire Citadel, Fallen Sky Ridge, Firewing Point...  Prince Kael\'thas will tolerate no further delays.  I will tolerate nothing other than complete success!', '', 19188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duro will be reinforced!  Ultris was a complete disaster.  I will NOT have that mistake repeated!', '', 19187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord!', '', 19186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed, it is not a request.', '', 19185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, damn it all! Clever trap. Too bad you\'ll never live to tell the tale...', '', 19184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have it. Do not lose it again!', '', 19183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Borak, I need another bundle of bloodthistle.', 'Borak, I need another bundle of bloodthistle.', 19182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time to strike is at hand. Terminate Icarius.', '', 19181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hide! Hide before they see you! Back up!', '', 19180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s puts the bundle of bloodthistle in his robe.', '', 19179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their loss is most definitely my gain...', '', 19178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, sweet, sweet bloodthistle... Probably left behind by one of those filthy addicts at Eclipse Point.', '', 19177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, my lord.', '', 19176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zarath, I am perfectly capable of making it up this road to Eclipse Point. If we do not deliver the missive, Lord Illidan will have both of our heads! You are dismissed!', '', 19175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord, surely you do not expect me to leave you unattended. Lord Illidan would have my head if anything were to happen to you.', '', 19174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Zarath you must return to the Black Temple at once! I... I seem to have misplaced Lord Illidan\'s orders. Quickly!', '', 19173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it, my lord?', '', 19172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt!', '', 19171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe I may recognize them.  Deal with this quickly, Sharth.  Then take the mana bomb and destroy their town!', '', 19170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See? That\'s all it takes. It \'twasn\'t so bad.', '', 19169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THREE!', '', 19168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reflects the spell back at its caster. ', '', 19167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to channel from the nearby distiller...', '', 19166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See to it that you do, Sharth, or I will personally see to your slow torture and death.', '', 19165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can assure you that we will not fail, my master.  I am personally overseeing every aspect of the construction, and I hold the final codes, myself.  Within a day\'s time, I will have the bomb detonated on those nearby pests.', '', 19164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need not tell you what will happen should the mana bomb down in the courtyard fail to be used on its target soon?  Since moving into the forest, they\'ve become increasingly annoying to our operations: here, at Tuurem and to the south at the Bonechewer Ruins.', '', 19163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the time being, yes.  However, allow my presence to be a motivator.  Prince Kael\'thas was displeased with the failure of the crystal experiment on Fallen Sky Ridge.  This is one of the reasons for why we chose the Cenarion druids as the testing grounds for the bomb.', '', 19162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are satisfied?', '', 19160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All goes exceedingly well, my lord.  Testing of the smaller prototype at the Cenarion Thicket was a complete success.  The second bomb is being ritually fueled in the courtyard below even as we speak.  And, I\'ve sent a courier to Tuurem to bring the rest of the parts to us here.', '', 19159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good, $n, you are under the spell\'s influence. I must analyze it quickly, then we can talk.', 19158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise, young Voldoun.  Do not worry yourself with pleasantries.  I come at the behest of our master, Prince Kael\'thas.  He bids me to check on the progress of the mana bomb.', '', 19157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My master, we are honored by your presence.  How may I serve thee?', '', 19156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know right away if you find something important.', '', 19155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig! Dig for the glory of the master!', '', 19154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep up the good work.  Do well and you will be rewarded by the master.', '', 19153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', '', 19152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about that. I\'ve increased production at the Deathforge. You\'ll have all the infernals you need to carry out your orders. Don\'t fail, Jovaan.', '', 19151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doom Lord Kazzak will be pleased. You are to increase the pace of your attacks. Destroy the orcish and dwarven strongholds with all haste.', '', 19150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is crazy! I could spend years here investigating all this technology!', '', 19149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be able to get out here now. Thanks!', '', 19148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for getting me out of there. I owe you one!', '', 19147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s bad? Who\'s bad? That\'s right: we bad!', '', 19146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m feeling playful.  Bring me another Infernal!', 19145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bring me another plaything to launch!', 19144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LET\'S ROCK!!', '', 19143, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hostile\'s on the move!', '', 19142, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('INCOMING!!', '', 19141, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s our back up?  I want them here now!', '', 19140, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back up is on the way.  Keep up the fight!', '', 19139, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep an eye out boys.  It\'s too quiet out there.', '', 19138, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay frosty boys!', '', 19137, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope the Ultrasafe Transporter never lets you down!   I just know it won\'t but I would recommend carrying a parachute cloak just in case!', '', 19136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am happy to talk with another qualified Goblin Engineer!   So many Goblin Engineers learn how to make the Dimension Ripper and then we never hear from them again.  Puzzling.', '', 19135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the help of my brother Zap in Everlook I have constructed a Dimensional Imploder right here in Area 52.   Who needs a rocket when you have instant transportation via Goblin Engineering!   Are you a skilled enough Goblin Engineer to learn how to build your own Imploder beacon?\n', '', 19134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you have built the device, you simply activate the device to be transported to Toshley\'s Station!    A few people have reported being transformed into chickens, but I am sure they were exaggerating!\n\nIf possible I would try and not use the device on a day when someone else has, but it will probably work out alright even if you do!', '', 19133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot believe they made me move my transporter out of town!   Most of the gnomes affected by the accident regained some sort of humanoid form within a few weeks and it should have been an honor to be a participant in such a grand gnomish experiment!\n\nBesides, we needed the eggs!\n', '', 19132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our imprisonment was intolerable. The sooner we can leave this accursed place, the better.', '', 19131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our time is finally at hand. The naaru and their allies will learn the true meaning of suffering.', '', 19130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My portal creation spells do not appear to work here. The damned naaru constructed this place well.', '', 19129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My work here is complete!', '', 19128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Default.', 19127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You haven\'t signed your waiver!  Come back after you\'ve signed away all claims of liability toward me or Tally.', '', 19126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you talked to my clone--I mean... my twin?', '', 19125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toshley\'s Station is the best!  The solitude and supply of strange, Outland power sources is an ideal setting for extreme experiments!', '', 19124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have the spell. You can analyze it.', 'I have the spell. You can analyze it.', 19123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Default.', 19122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaalllriiiight!! Who ordered up an extra large can of whoop-ass?', '', 19121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And of course I\'ll need some mana. You guys are gonna love this; just wait....', '', 19120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fantastic! Next, some protective spells. Yeah, now we\'re cookin\'!', '', 19119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mana gem...', '', 19118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just need to get some things ready first. You guys go ahead and get started. I need to summon up some water....', '', 19117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Lowly\"? I don\'t care who you are, friend: no one refers to the mighty Millhouse Manastorm as \"lowly\"!', '', 19116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shatters into shards.', '', 19115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, O great one. I am your humble servant.', '', 19114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bear witness to the agent of your demise!', '', 19113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a small matter to control the mind of the weak... for I bear allegiance to powers untouched by time, unmoved by fate. No force on this world or beyond harbors the strength to bend our knee... not even the mighty Legion! ', '', 19112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One final cell remains. Yes, O great one, right away!', '', 19111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anarchy! Bedlam! Oh, you are so wise! Yes, I see it now, of course!', '', 19110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? A lowly gnome? I will do better, oh great one.', '', 19109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where in Bonzo\'s Brass Buttons am I? And who are-- yaaghh, that\'s one mother of a headache!', '', 19108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold, yet another terrifying creature of incomprehensible power!', '', 19107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes... another! Your will is mine!', '', 19106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s weapons glow with unnatural fire.', '', 19105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naaru kept some of the most dangerous beings in existence here in these cells. Let me introduce you to another....', '', 19104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew the prince would be angry, but I... I have not been myself. I had to let them out! The great one speaks to me, you see. Wait--outsiders. Kael\'thas did not send you! Good... I\'ll just tell the prince you released the prisoners!', '', 19103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a complete and total barf-o-rama! RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!', '', 19102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok then, back to business.', '', 19101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
