('The footlockers of Kil\'sorrow Fortress in Nagrand would provide a considerable challenge to even a rogue of your notable skill.', 'The footlockers of Kil\'sorrow Fortress in Nagrand would provide a considerable challenge to even a rogue of your notable skill.', 19087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
