('The feralfen that dwell in Zangarmarsh have wicker baskets with clever locks on them.  Surely they would challenge even your skill.', 'The feralfen that dwell in Zangarmarsh have wicker baskets with clever locks on them.  Surely they would challenge even your skill.', 19084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
