('', 'Drink up, boys!', 19064, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Learning to read is a thirsty business. A toast, eh?', 19063, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think everyone deserves a drink. If Thadok\'s sharing...', 19062, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah! It\'s about time! No more fearing that each day would be our last...', 19061, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I underestimated you. It would be unfair to make you fight all four advisors at once, but... fair treatment was never shown to my people. I\'m just returning the favor.', '', 19060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
