('Attention stance!  Ready Begin.', 'Attention stance!  Ready Begin.', 19057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s looks on in disbelief.', 'The %s looks on in disbelief.', 19056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
