('As you see, I have many weapons in my arsenal....', '', 19053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Nuainn Stormwing shakes his head.>$B$BWith the Legion on one side and Illidan\'s minions on the other, it\'s going to take everything we\'ve got to defend the stronghold, and defend it we will! Every true Wildhammer would sooner die than surrender our home.', '', 19052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knowing there isn\'t enough time, the %s doesn\'t even try to run.', 'Knowing there isn\'t enough time, the %s doesn\'t even try to run.', 19051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
