('Bird spell not working. Me is free!', '', 19030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ogres, they bury me here up to my neck and then forget to come back.$B$BYah, mon, funny.  Laugh it up.  Disembodied ghost head here.$B$BOf course, if you want to help me out, I might be able to make it worth your while.$B$BBut no, keep laughing.', '', 19029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
