('', 'Ah, I see...', 19023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n.  Now, to perform the test...', 19022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to stable my pet, Gedrah.', 'I wish to stable my pet, Gedrah.', 19021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To care for these fearless beasts, who stand between my clanmates and death, is an honor.', '', 19020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve done my time in the trenches, and spent many years training the pups. It\'s good to be home. No matter what has become of it, this is my home.', '', 19019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, $n. The spirit hunter is ready.', '', 19018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require the aid of another spirit hunter, Ar\'tor.', 'I require the aid of another spirit hunter, Ar\'tor.', 19017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master will know of this incursion. You will be hunted for all eternity!', '', 19016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be destroyed!', '', 19015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Cipher of Damnation belongs to us now!', '', 19014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Petulent fool! You will never have the Cipher!', '', 19013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! Destroy him! The Cipher must be recovered!', '', 19012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting your Armorsmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Armorsmithing to create!', 'Forgetting your Armorsmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Armorsmithing to create!', 19011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn Armorsmithing!', 'I wish to unlearn Armorsmithing!', 19010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must forget your weapon type specialty before i can help you.   Go to Everlook in Winterspring and seek help there!', 'You must forget your weapon type specialty before i can help you.   Go to Everlook in Winterspring and seek help there!', 19009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting your Weaponsmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Weaponsmithing to create!', 'Forgetting your Weaponsmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Weaponsmithing to create!', 19008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn Weaponsmithing!', 'I wish to unlearn Weaponsmithing!', 19007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see how your nerves hold up against the Darkener, Thaladred!', '', 19006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, you have proven worthy to test your skills against my master engineer, Telonicus.', '', 19005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Capernian will see to it that your stay here is a short one.', '', 19004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have persevered against some of my best advisors... but none can withstand the might of the Blood Hammer. Behold, Lord Sanguinar!', '', 19003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are meaningless!  Only absolute victory for the Legion matters!', '', 19002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can stand against the Burning Legion!  This world is ours!', '', 19001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will conquer all, for we are the Burning Legion!  Our enemies shall be consumed in flame and crushed beneath our might!', '', 18999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rushes to the aid of a nearby doe!', '', 18998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must be prepared for the next assualt!  The Betrayer will be destroyed!', '', 18997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sky shall fall with the Legions glory!', '', 18996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to launch the next wave of Infernals!', '', 18995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are proceeding well!  Soon we grind The Betrayers bones beneath our feet!', '', 18994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I have died... I was in so much pain... engulfed in darkness... Can you see me, $r?', '', 18993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s strikes out in desperate fury.', '', 18992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting your Hammersmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Hammersmithing to create!', 'Forgetting your Hammersmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Hammersmithing to create!', 18991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn Hammersmithing!', 'I wish to unlearn Hammersmithing!', 18990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi, $n.  I\'m here!', '', 18989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting your Axesmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Axesmithing to create!', 'Forgetting your Axesmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require Axesmithing to create!', 18987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn Axesmithing!', 'I wish to unlearn Axesmithing!', 18986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Infernals are almost ready for the next assualt on The Betrayers Black Citadel!', '', 18985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you really want to unlearn your blacksmithing specialty and lose all associated recipes?', 'Do you really want to unlearn your blacksmithing specialty and lose all associated recipes?', 18984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting your swordsmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require swordsmithing to create!', 'Forgetting your swordsmithing skill is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require swordsmithing to create!', 18983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn Swordsmithing!', 'I wish to unlearn Swordsmithing!', 18982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s skin partially deflects the spell.', '', 18981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny $r cannot lift spear.  Gor lift spear!', '', 18980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah!  The Thunderspike is mine.  Die!', '', 18979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... died.$B$BWhy am I still here? Is there no great hunting ground that I ascend to?$B$BNo... I must first complete my task. Before I can leave this world, the second part of the Cipher of Damnation must be recovered.', 'I... died.$B$BWhy am I still here? Is there no great hunting ground that I ascend to?$B$BNo... I must first complete my task. Before I can leave this world, the second part of the Cipher of Damnation must be recovered.', 18978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn dragonscale leatherworking!', 'I wish to unlearn dragonscale leatherworking!', 18977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting dragonscale leatherworking is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require dragonscale leatherworking as well!', 'Forgetting dragonscale leatherworking is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require dragonscale leatherworking as well!', 18976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn tribal leatherworking!', 'I wish to unlearn tribal leatherworking!', 18975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting tribal leatherworking is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require tribal leatherworking as well!', 'Forgetting tribal leatherworking is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require tribal leatherworking as well!', 18974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am pleased that you\'ve decided to take up our cause.  As a reward I will infuse a ring with the remnants of the Well of Eternity you brought me.$B$BI offer you four different paths in which to unlock their power.  Choose wisely, $n.  The sands of time flow easily in one direction and not the other.', 18973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assist me slaves!', '', 18972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ar\'tor\'s lifeless body remains suspended in mid-air by demonic magic. They take from him, even in death...', '', 18971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I came to this place because of my study into the backward culture that used to be the Thunderlord clan.$B$BThey were weak and succumbed to the lure of power that came with being transformed into fel orcs through Mannoroth\'s blood.$B$BI have read all of their texts.  I am particularly interested in the recovery of an artifact, a drum, an arrow and a tablet that were lost when we crushed the Bladespire ogres and pushed them back down into their hold.', 18970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Do you really want to unlearn your leatherworking specialty and lose all associated recipes?', 'Do you really want to unlearn your leatherworking specialty and lose all associated recipes?', 18969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Shattrath City, seat of the Sha\'tar in Outland. You seek guidance?', 'Welcome to Shattrath City, seat of the Sha\'tar in Outland. You seek guidance?', 18968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('COILSSSKARRR!', '', 18967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m listening...', '', 18966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not beat the Coilsssskaarrr commander anymore, orc! I will tell you! The cipherrr... It is hidden in one of the chests at Coilssskarrr Point... The naga there hold the keysss...', '', 18965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s regains consciousness.', '', 18964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GET UP YOU ROTTEN PIECE OF TRASH! GET UP BEFORE I END YOU!', '', 18963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits on the Coilskar naga.', '', 18962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yesss... Yesss... Ssset me freee...', '', 18961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DO I HONESTLY LOOK THAT STUPID TO YOU, NAGA? NOW YOU FEEL PAIN!', '', 18960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel so stupid. Maybe I should unchain you and set you free?', '', 18959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... Of course not. What was I thinking? Why would you have a third of the Cipher of Damnation?', '', 18958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga do nottt... have thissss... cipherrr...', '', 18957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whhaaat... are you sssspeaking of, ssssoft-sskin?', '', 18956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Cipher of Damnation? I know a third of it is in this village.', '', 18955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m through asking nicely, fish-man.', '', 18954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah!  Your meat will taste sweet slow roasting over my fire!!', '', 18953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You!  I see you!  One of you, kill them!', '', 18952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get up there.  March on Bladespire Hold.  I want to adorn my tower with Gorr\'Dim\'s head!', '', 18951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will crush the Bladespire clan.  Then we will have Gruul the Dragonkiller\'s favor!', '', 18950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want these Alliance and Horde pigs dead!', '', 18949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let any of them escape, you dogs!', '', 18948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will find your boys and the cipher, Oronok.', 'I will find your boys and the cipher, Oronok.', 18947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I said, the cipher was found by Illidan when he took over the Black Temple. He divided the tome into three parts and charged their care to his minions.$B$BMy boys... My boys are grown now. When I got word of what Illidan had done with the cipher, I sent my boys to recover the pieces.$B$BYou must find my boys, $n. You must find them and recover the Cipher of Damnation.', '', 18946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what of the cipher now? And your boys?', 'So what of the cipher now? And your boys?', 18945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A wave of sickness rushed through me. After the ritual was over, I ran home to my children. I gathered what belongings I could carry in my arms and left with my boys. We ran to the hills and hid. There really was no other option...$B$BNot a day goes by that I don\'t think of the cut. It has taken 20 years to reconnect with the elements. It has taken 20 years for the elements to even begin to heal.', '', 18944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue, please.', 'Continue, please.', 18943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never forget that day, $r. Never. Even though I had long since abandoned shamanism in favor of shadow magic, I felt the cut. A sense of loss so profound... I could not explain it to you with mere words.$B$BWhen the tie to the elements was severed, all orcs on Draenor changed. If there was ever any doubt in the power of the shadows, it was washed away with the cresting of the molten lava over the shattered earth.\n', '', 18942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet what? What is it, Oronok?', 'Yet what? What is it, Oronok?', 18941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you stand at the Altar of Damnation and see the spirits of the damned, kneeling in prayer, what you do not see is me, standing next to Gul\'dan.$B$B<Oronok nods.>$B$BI told you that I was a lot of things, did I not? One of those \'things\' was a lieutenant of Gul\'dan.$B$BI have done many terrible things in my life. I have slaughtered man, woman, and child alike. Danced in the blood of innocent draenei... yet...$B$B<Oronok chokes on his words.>', '', 18940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you know all of this?', 'How do you know all of this?', 18939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Cipher of Damnation was kept in Gul\'dan\'s private quarters inside Karabor for twenty years. Ah, that\'s right, you have no idea what Karabor is, do you?$B$BThe Black Temple...$B$BAye, now home to Illidan Stormrage.$B$BWhen Illidan took control of the Black Temple, he discovered the cipher. He recognized that the damage to this world had already been done but thought it wise to keep the cipher secure for later use.', '', 18938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I find the cipher?', 'How do I find the cipher?', 18937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. The words you seek have a name, $n. They are known as the Cipher of Damnation: The words uttered by Gul\'dan himself to shatter this land. The very spell that severed the last remaining tie the orcs had with the elements of Draenor.$B$B<Oronok nods.>$B$BAye, it is the cipher that you must reconstruct and ultimately the words of the cipher that you must call.', '', 18936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to hear your story, Oronok.\n', 'I am ready to hear your story, Oronok.\n', 18935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to hear the story of the Cipher of Damnation, $n?', '', 18934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, please.\n$b\nI cannot teach a $r to ride a hawkstrider.', '', 18933, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be exalted with the blood elves before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.', '', 18932, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be friendly with the blood elves before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.', '', 18931, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve the gold, I can teach you how to ride a hawkstrider.', '', 18930, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to release his power in desperation!', '', 18929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you really want to unlearn your leatherworking specialty and lose all associated recipes?', 'Do you really want to unlearn your leatherworking specialty and lose all associated recipes?', 18928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, $r. Your bulk would only crush one of these noble creatures.\n$b\nNow, away with you!', 18927, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 25, 0, 1, 2, 0, 39653),
('These orcs must really be eager to stake their claim in Outland! If I told you how much they were paying for my allegiance, you\'d kill me out of jealousy!', '', 18926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll be purchasing no hawkstrider here until you\'ve proven your worth and dedication to our people.$b\n\nDo not return until you are considered exalted among the blood elves. Away with you!', 18925, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 25, 0, 1, 2, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll be purchasing no hawkstrider here until you\'ve proven yourself at least friendly to our people.', 18924, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgetting elemental leatherworking is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require elemental leatherworking as well!', 'Forgetting elemental leatherworking is not something to do lightly.  If you choose to abandon it you will forget all recipes that require elemental leatherworking as well!', 18923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Psst, $r, up here near the entrance.  I\'m in the cage.  Hurry!', 18922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please leave the cage door closed.  Thanks.', 18921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'No.  Don\'t open the cage.  One of them might notice!', 18920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, the ogres are so stupid that they forgot to lock my cage.  But that\'s exactly how I like it, so please don\'t open it again.', 18919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi.  Thanks for the help.  But please don\'t open the cage.', 18918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn elemental leatherworking!', 'I wish to unlearn elemental leatherworking!', 18917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am told that the dust and heat of Hellfire Peninsula is quite irritating... I would not know, but I will trust my esteemed, and still living, allies.', '', 18916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, don\'t open the cage!  Okay?$B$BThese ogres have got me right where I want them.', 18915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whitereach Post is something of an unintended stop for me, to put it mildly. My clients are counting on me to deliver my wares and I\'m starting to wonder if I\'m going to make it in time with all the delays involved.', '', 18914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s throws a mushroom spore at $n.', '', 18913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s attempts to split in two.', '', 18912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FASTER!!!!', '', 18911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You filthy little beings need to work faster!', '', 18910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s on your mind, sir?', 'What\'s on your mind, sir?', 18909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall see to it, sir.', 'I shall see to it, sir.', 18908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away, sir.', 'Right away, sir.', 18907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yessir.', 'Yessir.', 18906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You speak the truth.', 'You speak the truth.', 18905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s as if you were reading my mind.', 'It\'s as if you were reading my mind.', 18904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I couldn\'t agree more.', 'I couldn\'t agree more.', 18903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thoughts exactly.', 'My thoughts exactly.', 18902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t take your eyes off of these filthy Broken. I don\'t trust them.', '', 18901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep regulating the main valve to ensure steady flow.', '', 18900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure these Broken are thoroughly cleaned before touching the water.', '', 18899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
