('', 'Not... my best... day.', 18476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You could use a makeover.', 18475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think a change is in order....', 18474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s what I\'m talkin\' about!', '', 18473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take that, ya freakish git!', '', 18472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For... Khaz... Modan!', '', 18471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carry on the fight!', '', 18470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blow \'em away!', '', 18469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m itchin\' to shoot somethin\'!', '', 18468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Justice is served!', '', 18467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Light!', '', 18466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light receive me!', '', 18465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good will... prevail.', '', 18464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rout these demons!', '', 18463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Lordaeron! For victory!', '', 18462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One less demon to contend with!', '', 18461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the void with you!', '', 18460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... can\'t....', '', 18459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agghh!', '', 18458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back, hold them back!', '', 18457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let these monsters taste cold steel!', '', 18456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the lucky one.', 'You\'re the lucky one.', 18455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I obey.', 'I obey.', 18454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it really... over?', 'Is it really... over?', 18453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... released?', 'I am... released?', 18452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let this torment end!!', 'Let this torment end!!', 18451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lambs for the slaughter!', '', 18450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One less enemy of the master!', '', 18449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pleasure... to serve the master.', '', 18448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life... to the master.', '', 18447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will... ultimately fail.', '', 18446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise, my soldiers, and march for me!', '', 18445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elen-ak shaktha!', '', 18444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to enter oblivion, meddlers. You have unleashed a god!', '', 18443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like my work here is done. Report back to the holo-image of Ameer over at the transponder.', '', 18442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the conduit! Stop the intruders!', '', 18441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to find a new line of work.', '', 18440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m under attack! I repeat, I am under attack!', '', 18439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep these things off me!', '', 18438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Done! Back up! Back up!', '', 18437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, keep me protected while I plant this disruptor. This shouldn\'t take very long.', '', 18436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look there, fleshling! Salhadaar\'s conduits! He\'s keeping well fed....', '', 18435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With this much void waste and run-off, a toxic void horror can\'t be too far behind.', '', 18434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the second sun of K\'aresh, look at this place! I can only imagine what Salhadaar is planning. Come on, let\'s keep going.', '', 18433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this... Just keep me covered and I\'ll deliver the package.', '', 18432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What could you be selling?', 'What could you be selling?', 18431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, such an odd place to find potential customers!', '', 18430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence here is interfering with very important work. Please leave at once. Where was I, again?', '', 18429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This tower is complete and utter madness. This isn\'t a library, it\'s a huge haystack of books and I don\'t think the needle even exists! Now, what was I doing?', 18428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s here... somewhere... I know it. Somewhere in this library is the knowledge I\'m looking for...', '', 18427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This party is pointless. Those foolish nobles will never get to see Medivh. Can\'t they see this? I should have just stayed in Darkshire with my family instead of wasting my time here.', '', 18426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Splendid! Wonderful! Such an excellent performance from a relative unknown! Do you have an agent, perhaps?', '', 18425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings! Behold one of the finest musical instruments in all of Lordaeron. It\'s a true honor to perform for the Master and all his guests. Take a seat in the audience, I hear a show is starting soon.', '', 18424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time for idle chitchat. I have men and women to train, and a tower to watch.', '', 18423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yeah, I\'ve never seen them personally, but sometimes I hear them in the distance. Keep a watchful eye out for them if you venture inside.', '', 18422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big ones?', 'Big ones?', 18421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help you with what situation?', 'Help you with what situation?', 18420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The damn spiders, the endlessly screeching bats, and those blasted demon beasts have all taken residence in the Servant\'s Quarters. It\'s not safe to walk around anymore, especially when the big ones come out of hiding.', '', 18419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Midnight is Attumen the Huntsman\'s personal mount. I\'ve never seen a faster, stronger, or more mean spirited horse. And her rider is even more temperamental! Everyone keeps their distance from her, lest they get a hoof upside the head from Midnight or a beating from Attumen.', '', 18418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Midnight?', 'Who is Midnight?', 18417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('From here in the Gatehouse, you may travel in one of three directions. The stairs behind me lead to the Grand Ball Room, where guests are currently being entertained. I\'m sure you can smell the nearby Stables, and the entrance to Servant\'s Quarters lies next to the Gatehouse door.', '', 18416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All inquiries regarding Medivh should be directed to Moroes, the Tower Steward. I myself know very little about the Master\'s business. I believe several nobles are currently having an audience with Moroes in the Banquet Hall, if you wish to inquire further.', '', 18415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the tower of Karazhan and residence of my master, Medivh. As a humble doorman, there is little else I can explain to you.', '', 18414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you navigate the tower?', 'How do you navigate the tower?', 18413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Medivh?', 'Where is Medivh?', 18412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this place?', 'What is this place?', 18411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not fail.', 'We will not fail.', 18410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... master.', '', 18409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you waiting for?  Finish them, young one.  Let your hatred burn!', '', 18408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slay these dogs, Kaylaan!  Earn your place in the Burning Legion!', '', 18407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, please!  This is sickening; I\'m going to have to kill you all myself.', '', 18406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light grant me strength!', '', 18405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!  What have I done?', '', 18404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 18403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You foolish old hag... Why would I do that when I can have you both?', '', 18402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I offer myself in exchange.  You will have Ishanah, the High Priestess of the Aldor, as your prisoner if you release Kaylaan from your dark grasp.', 18401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Light wants its lost son back, Socrethar.', 18400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teacher...', '', 18399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are wrong, Adyen.  My mind has never been clearer.', '', 18398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Socrethar is clouding your mind, Kaylaan!  You do not mean these words!  I remember training you when you were but a youngling.  Your will was strong even then!', '', 18397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once the hatred in my heart became focused, everything became clear to me.  Shattrath must be destroyed and the naaru with it.', '', 18396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I turned that hate on the Illidari and the Burning Legion... but they weren\'t the ones who betrayed us.  We were the naaru\'s chosen!  We lived and died for them!', '', 18395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My heart has been filled with hate since our sworn enemies were allowed into our city.  I knew the one known as Voren\'thal before he was called a Seer.  It was by his hand that my brother was slain.', '', 18394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How... how could you?!', '', 18393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, let us settle this.  Before we begin, however, there\'s somebody I\'d like you to meet.', '', 18392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may be few, Socrethar, but our faith is strong.  Something you will never understand.  Now that custom has been served, prepare to meet your end.', '', 18391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not make me laugh.  Is this the mighty Aldor army that\'s come to defeat me?', '', 18390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here for you, lost brother.  It is custom to offer you a chance to repent before you are destroyed.  We offer you this chance, as the naaru\'s law commands.', '', 18389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve saved me, fleshling! Ameer will hear of this noble act.', '', 18388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kael\'thas and the Legion... just what we needed!', '', 18387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not die on me, vindicator!', '', 18386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light!  Do not fail me!', '', 18385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has captured the flag!', '', 18384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 8213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear the rock flayer has been sucking down unstable energy since its capture.', '', 18383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you defeat that which has no life?', '', 18382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The netherlisk will be a challenge but the gladiator will pull through!', '', 18381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no way some Protectorate prisoner is going to defeat our gladiator!', '', 18380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My money\'s on the fleshfiend. That creature is terrifying!', '', 18379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring out the gladiator!', '', 18378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah!  Your ritual has failed, fool!', '', 18377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children, come to me!', 'Children, come to me!', 18376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has captured the flag!', '', 18375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 8173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HIT ME!', '', 18374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your help was invaluable, my friend.$B$BI can assure you that the Cenarion Expedition will do everything in its power to counter any future tainted crystals dropped from the heavens by Illidan.', 18373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will meet again soon.', '', 18372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow bored with your attempt to heal the land and quell the energies summoning and driving the colossi mad.  Goliathon, King of the Colossi, Prince Kael\'thas and I demand that you defend the crystal!', '', 18371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you like what we\'ve done here?  Perhaps we will drop these crystals from the sky all over Outland.', '', 18370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And just what do you think you are doing?  You dare to interfere with my master\'s experiment?', '', 18369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is exhausted.', '', 18368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cowards! You\'ll never draw me into the shadows!', '', 18367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s discards his weapons and reaches for a polearm!', '', 18366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paladin? Have you been partaking of the Apothecary\'s concoctions or some such thing? I have heard a rumor that some elven contingent is visiting the Dark Lady within the Undercity. Perhaps one of them might know.', 'Paladin? Have you been partaking of the Apothecary\'s concoctions or some such thing? I have heard a rumor that some elven contingent is visiting the Dark Lady within the Undercity. Perhaps one of them might know.', 18365, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flag has been reset.', '', 18364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 8192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Us no like paladins. Elf lady come to city, stay in Royal Quarter. Her paladin. You talk, learn paladin things.', 'Us no like paladins. Elf lady come to city, stay in Royal Quarter. Her paladin. You talk, learn paladin things.', 18363, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paladin', 'Paladin', 18362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flag has been dropped!', '', 18361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Mulric Boldrock at the Training Hall in Old Town. He and Remaari are the resident shaman trainers in Stormwind.', 'Speak with Mulric Boldrock at the Training Hall in Old Town. He and Remaari are the resident shaman trainers in Stormwind.', 18360, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has taken the flag!', '', 18359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve freed me!  The winds speak to my people once again and grant us their strength.  I thank you, stranger.', '', 18358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free!  The spirit of water returns to my people.  It will bring us the wisdom we need to survive in this harsh land.  I am in your debt, $n.', '', 18357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am free!  I will ask the spirit of fire to return to us so that my people may have the courage to fight their masters!  I thank you, $r.', '', 18356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These chains that bind me prevent me from bringing the spirit of fire to my people, $n.  Souls without fire are souls that cannot rebel against their masters.', '', 18355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winds do not speak to our tribe anymore, $n.  My people are lost without elders to bring the spirits to them.', '', 18354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Walk free, elder.  Bring the spirits back to your tribe.', 'Walk free, elder.  Bring the spirits back to your tribe.', 18353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirit of water has left us.  Our tribe is doomed.', '', 18352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Broken worm!  Did he come clean to you!?  Did he tell you he\'s the one that sold out his tribe to my master?', '', 18351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 18350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Broken worm gave you that staff, didn\'t he?  Did he also tell you he\'s the one that sold out his tribe?  No matter, you will both pay for this!', '', 18349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run away while you still can!', '', 18348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic. Is that the best you can do?', '', 18347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will serve as a message to all that would dare set foot upon Ethereum territory!', '', 18346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your battle prowess is nothing compared to mine!', '', 18345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste pure energy!', '', 18344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Salhadaar! For the Nexus-King!', '', 18343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you will know fear!', '', 18342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re weak! COME ON!', '', 18341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want what?! I\'ve heard something about one of those odd draenei creatures in the Valley of Heroes. Maybe she knows; I don\'t.', 'You want what?! I\'ve heard something about one of those odd draenei creatures in the Valley of Heroes. Maybe she knows; I don\'t.', 18340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking for a lapidary? Our jewelcrafters are in the Exodar, using the materials they have uncovered to work wonders. Speak with Farii when you arrive.', 'Looking for a lapidary? Our jewelcrafters are in the Exodar, using the materials they have uncovered to work wonders. Speak with Farii when you arrive.', 18339, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jewelcrafting', 'Jewelcrafting', 18338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have no tailors here in Azure Watch. You might try the encampment on the beach, however - they seem to have a number of tradesmen from across the sea.', 'We have no tailors here in Azure Watch. You might try the encampment on the beach, however - they seem to have a number of tradesmen from across the sea.', 18337, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Travel to Stillpine Hold, my friend. The furbolgs there have been very helpful, and they might have just the expertise you need.', 'Travel to Stillpine Hold, my friend. The furbolgs there have been very helpful, and they might have just the expertise you need.', 18336, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dulvi is the woman you want. She trains new prospects in the middle of the Watch.', 'Dulvi is the woman you want. She trains new prospects in the middle of the Watch.', 18335, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our new allies, the Stillpine furbolgs, have expressed interest in taking what hides we find. They live to the north; I would seek knowledge from them.', 'Our new allies, the Stillpine furbolgs, have expressed interest in taking what hides we find. They live to the north; I would seek knowledge from them.', 18334, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heur has studied the local flora since our landing. He will be able to guide you. You can find him working with Daedal on the western edge of Azure Watch.', 'Heur has studied the local flora since our landing. He will be able to guide you. You can find him working with Daedal on the western edge of Azure Watch.', 18333, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An aspiring angler... well, Diktynna lives on the shore of Ammen Ford, using her net and pole to keep us all supplied. I am certain she could use the help.', 'An aspiring angler... well, Diktynna lives on the shore of Ammen Ford, using her net and pole to keep us all supplied. I am certain she could use the help.', 18332, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fateema is our anchorite, and she has been invaluable in tending crash victims. She practices her trade on the western side of the Watch.', 'Fateema is our anchorite, and she has been invaluable in tending crash victims. She practices her trade on the western side of the Watch.', 18331, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The local artificer, Daelo, can teach you the basics of engineering. Perhaps you can help our technician fix that malfunctioning communications device!', 'The local artificer, Daelo, can teach you the basics of engineering. Perhaps you can help our technician fix that malfunctioning communications device!', 18330, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enchanters spend their days in the Exodar, working away at any number of projects. Nahogg will start your training.', 'Our enchanters spend their days in the Exodar, working away at any number of projects. Nahogg will start your training.', 18329, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We had no cooks to spare, but it is a bit odd... there are some delectable scents on the south wind. Follow your nose, eh?', 'We had no cooks to spare, but it is a bit odd... there are some delectable scents on the south wind. Follow your nose, eh?', 18328, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have no smithy set up in Azure Watch. However, I\'ve seen a few young blacksmiths coming from that odd encampment on the south coast. Perhaps you should investigate.', 'We have no smithy set up in Azure Watch. However, I\'ve seen a few young blacksmiths coming from that odd encampment on the south coast. Perhaps you should investigate.', 18327, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daedal knows his way around the art of brewing potions. He works closely with Fateema in western Azure Watch.', 'Daedal knows his way around the art of brewing potions. He works closely with Fateema in western Azure Watch.', 18326, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s stops playing dead and charges forward!', '', 18325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are a number of skilled tradesmen scattered around Azuremyst. Which one are you looking for?', 'There are a number of skilled tradesmen scattered around Azuremyst. Which one are you looking for?', 18324, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ruada trains young fighters in the eastern portion of Azure Watch. If training in the practical art of warfare is what you\'re looking for, she will help you.', 'Ruada trains young fighters in the eastern portion of Azure Watch. If training in the practical art of warfare is what you\'re looking for, she will help you.', 18323, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re one of the shaman? Hm. I suppose you are free to choose your own path... whatever that path may be. Tuluun has an isolated, small camp in the northwest of Azure Watch.', 'You\'re one of the shaman? Hm. I suppose you are free to choose your own path... whatever that path may be. Tuluun has an isolated, small camp in the northwest of Azure Watch.', 18322, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman', 'Shaman', 18321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In Chellan\'s small but serviceable inn, you can find the priest Guvan.', 'In Chellan\'s small but serviceable inn, you can find the priest Guvan.', 18320, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The good Tullas is a noble woman, and a stalwart defender of the Light. Her lessons are taught in the inn proper.', 'The good Tullas is a noble woman, and a stalwart defender of the Light. Her lessons are taught in the inn proper.', 18319, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This reflection of me is exceptionally weak. Don\'t let these brutes lay a finger on my precious image.', '', 18318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For mastery over the arcane, you need look no further than Semid. He teaches on the eastern side of Azure Watch along with Ruada.', 'For mastery over the arcane, you need look no further than Semid. He teaches on the eastern side of Azure Watch along with Ruada.', 18317, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate flesh beasts...', '', 18316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a bad shot. For a fleshling...', '', 18315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did I forget to mention that I\'m injured?', '', 18314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a waste of my time. Where\'s the action?', '', 18313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn its back to me! I need a clean shot!', '', 18312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Doomguard are utterly devoted to their Pit Lord masters and revel in the destruction of worlds.', 'The Doomguard are utterly devoted to their Pit Lord masters and revel in the destruction of worlds.', 18311, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arconus is close. I can feel him. Take the northwest passage. He should be just up and around the corner. Be ready to battle!', '', 18310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acteon is our resident tracker, and a good one he is, too - the skins he wears are testament to his skill. His camp is in the southeast of Azure Watch.', 'Acteon is our resident tracker, and a good one he is, too - the skins he wears are testament to his skill. His camp is in the southeast of Azure Watch.', 18309, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are fearless and unwaveringly loyal to their master\'s godlike will.', 'They are fearless and unwaveringly loyal to their master\'s godlike will.', 18308, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? You wish to donate cloth to Silvermoon?$B$BYou\'re merely after a Hawkstrider, aren\'t you? Very well, very well... do the city this service, and I will see to it that your reputation here rises.', '', 18307, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Druid? No one here follows that path... but I believe I heard of someone matching that description near the Exodar. Shalannius, I think?', 'Druid? No one here follows that path... but I believe I heard of someone matching that description near the Exodar. Shalannius, I think?', 18306, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are as cruel as they are powerful - and revel in the destruction of all that exists.', 'They are as cruel as they are powerful - and revel in the destruction of all that exists.', 18305, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the wrong way. Arconus is at the other end of the mine. You\'re not chickening out, are you, fleshling? I won\'t follow a coward.', '', 18304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet they fell to the lure of Sargeras\' evil - and now they have become our most stalwart enemies.', 'Yet they fell to the lure of Sargeras\' evil - and now they have become our most stalwart enemies.', 18303, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, seeking training, are you? There are several instructors who are camped in Azure Watch... what are you after?', 'Ah, seeking training, are you? There are several instructors who are camped in Azure Watch... what are you after?', 18302, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh stop! You\'re going to make me turn red and then someone is going to mistake me for Ethereum and kill me.', '', 18301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Esbina will be happy to take care of your animal companion, my friend. She waits outside the inn within Azure Watch.', 'Esbina will be happy to take care of your animal companion, my friend. She waits outside the inn within Azure Watch.', 18300, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at that handsome grouping of chaotic energies!', '', 18299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our humble inn is located in the north of Azure Watch; Chellan will take good care of you.', 'Our humble inn is located in the north of Azure Watch; Chellan will take good care of you.', 18298, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Funaam is our guild registrar. His office has been set up within the Exodar. Just follow the road; you\'ll find it in no time.', 'Funaam is our guild registrar. His office has been set up within the Exodar. Just follow the road; you\'ll find it in no time.', 18297, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Exodar\'s once-vast supply of textiles has dwindled dangerously low. Your reputation with the draenei here would increase were you to assist us by donating cloth.', '', 18296, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hippogryphs are well-tended near the Exodar proper. You should journey there if you wish to fly to Blood Watch.', 'The hippogryphs are well-tended near the Exodar proper. You should journey there if you wish to fly to Blood Watch.', 18295, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, there\'s something that I need you to do.', 18294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Up here on the hill, $n.', 18293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hippogryph Master', 'Hippogryph Master', 18292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The evil emanating from the crystal shard has lured one of the colossi.  Put it down quick!', 18291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be sure to visit Vixton Pinchwhistle in Netherstorm\'s Area 52. As the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit\'s official Arena Vendor, he has all sorts of incredible items for sale to those with enough Arena Points.', 18290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have an idea.  Let\'s plant this shard in the ground and see what happens.', 18289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Alliance has lost control of a Spirit Tower!|r', '', 18288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
