('|cffffff00The Alliance has taken control of a Spirit Tower!|r', '', 18285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have misplaced Archmage Vargoth\'s Staff.', 'I have misplaced Archmage Vargoth\'s Staff.', 18284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Hey you! $R! Over here!', '', 18283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t follow the tracers back out, too many flesh beasts in the way. Send someone in... Follow the tracers... Ya-six, out.', '', 18282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Araxes! Send help! I\'m pinned down in the mines. I... I\'m not sure where I am exactly but I had the presence of mind to drop tracers on the ground behind me.', '', 18281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm.', '', 18280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I haven\'t seen me brothers in ages.', 18279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I miss me home, sometimes. Or maybe I just miss fightin\' for it.', 18278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t say much, do yeh?', 18277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odd city, ain\'t it?', 18276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seeking storage? You\'ll want to head to the safety of the Exodar, then... the bankers will be more than happy to help you.', 'Seeking storage? You\'ll want to head to the safety of the Exodar, then... the bankers will be more than happy to help you.', 18275, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isle can be strange, can it not? Is there something I can do for you?', 'This isle can be strange, can it not? Is there something I can do for you?', 18274, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Light cannot guide you, my friend, perhaps I can be of assistance. What is it you need?', 'If the Light cannot guide you, my friend, perhaps I can be of assistance. What is it you need?', 18273, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
