('Ameer, over and out.', '', 18270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Copy that, Araxes. Backup is on the way. Hold your position. I repeat, hold your position.', '', 18269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
