('Your resistance is insignificant.', '', 18257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope this damned thing works. *Araxes pounds on the portable transponder.*', '', 18256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
