('Let fire rain from above!', '', 18235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pestilence upon you!', '', 18234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The swarm is eager to feed.', '', 18233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweet dreams.', '', 18232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look tired....', '', 18231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are defenders of a doomed world! Flee here, and perhaps you will prolong your pathetic lives!', '', 18230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The clock... is still... ticking.', '', 18229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory to the Legion!', '', 18228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world is ours now!', '', 18227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All life must perish!', '', 18226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be much colder in your grave.', '', 18225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Succumb to the icy chill... of death.', '', 18224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashes to ashes, dust to dust!', '', 18223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crumble and rot!', '', 18222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s final conquest has begun! Once again the subjugation of this world is within our grasp. Let none survive!', '', 18221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have won this battle, but not... the... war.', '', 18220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yikes.  That was close!  And they\'re getting closer to me and the nether-rocket every time!  Someone needs to deal with Dr. Boom!', '', 18219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dr. Boom\'s Bots are attacking!  Stop them!', '', 18218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares.', 'I wish to browse your wares.', 18217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The apprentice occasionally looks over his shoulder, apparently responding to sounds that you can\'t hear.>$B$BGood day, $n. Pardon me if I seem distracted, but I\'m in the middle of a job for Farmer Natin. I want to have all of his horses shoed by the time he returns from the town hall. What can I help you with?', '', 18216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muahahahaha!  Go my minions... destroy the rocket-chief and his nether-rocket!  Annihilate Area 52!  Kneel!  Kneel before Dr. Boom!!!', '', 18215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a grumpy old man!', '', 18214, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon - you sound like a grumpy old man.', '', 18213, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not him I\'m worried about. It\'s these new rookies around here - and those creepy purple elves they brought with \'em. They ain\'t even proved themselves yet.\n', '', 18212, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel the same. But there\'s still a job to do out here. It\'ll all be for naught if this evil finds its way back to Azeroth - back to our homes. We just have to hold on a while longer. Trust Danath - he\'s never let us down before.', '', 18211, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twenty years we\'ve been stranded in this hell-hole. It\'s all I can do not to run screaming through that blasted Portal. I want to see my loved ones again! I want them to know I\'m still alive.\n', '', 18210, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('True. True. Light help him if that monster ever gets free!', 'True. True. Light help him if that monster ever gets free!', 18209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Win or lose, the Lieutenant must be crazy to keep a pet orc like that. Those ones can\'t be trusted. Animals, they are.\n', 'Win or lose, the Lieutenant must be crazy to keep a pet orc like that. Those ones can\'t be trusted. Animals, they are.\n', 18208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, I seen \'im fight. He\'s an orc - big as they come. Lost a week\'s wages bettin\' against that one. Won\'t make that mistake again!', 'Aye, I seen \'im fight. He\'s an orc - big as they come. Lost a week\'s wages bettin\' against that one. Won\'t make that mistake again!', 18207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So have you heard about Lieutenant Blackmoore\'s new gladiator? Some say he\'s unbeatable.', 'So have you heard about Lieutenant Blackmoore\'s new gladiator? Some say he\'s unbeatable.', 18206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, that\'s true. Uther - now there\'s a real hero for the people.', 'Aye, that\'s true. Uther - now there\'s a real hero for the people.', 18205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not so sure. I\'ve heard that he\'s being trained as a paladin. Terenas hopes the Silver Hand can teach him some discipline. If anyone can set Arthas straight, it\'d be old Uther.', 'I\'m not so sure. I\'ve heard that he\'s being trained as a paladin. Terenas hopes the Silver Hand can teach him some discipline. If anyone can set Arthas straight, it\'d be old Uther.', 18204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prince Arthas? Please. Spends all his time chasing after Proudmoore\'s daughter, from what I hear. Boy\'s got more on his mind than affairs of state, I tell ya.\n', 'Prince Arthas? Please. Spends all his time chasing after Proudmoore\'s daughter, from what I hear. Boy\'s got more on his mind than affairs of state, I tell ya.\n', 18203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He hasn\'t been the same since the War. It\'s like he aged and became an old man overnight. That son of his, though - he\'ll make a fine king one day. \n', 'He hasn\'t been the same since the War. It\'s like he aged and became an old man overnight. That son of his, though - he\'ll make a fine king one day. \n', 18202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These damned taxes are breaking my back. King Terenas must be losing his grip if he thinks all this reconstruction will boost the economy.', 'These damned taxes are breaking my back. King Terenas must be losing his grip if he thinks all this reconstruction will boost the economy.', 18201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to the Abyssal Shelf!', 'Send me to the Abyssal Shelf!', 18200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re feeling queasy, speak with Pestle.  He might have something for motion sickness.', '', 18199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on a bombing mission for Forward Commander Kingston.  I need a gryphon destroyer!', 'I\'m on a bombing mission for Forward Commander Kingston.  I need a gryphon destroyer!', 18198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... Me not feel so guud.', '', 18197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle has begun!', '', 18196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 30 seconds!', '', 18195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 1 minute!', '', 18194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 2 minutes!', '', 18193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo. I\'m Vixton Pinchwhistle, official Arena Vendor for the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit. If you\'ve got the rep, I\'ve got the goods that\'ll make your mouth water.', '', 18192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protectorate transmission complete.', '', 18191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hostiles detected. Ending transmission.', '', 18190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I understand now. Can I help with any of this? The Ethereum and void creatures are a threat to our survival as well.', 'I think I understand now. Can I help with any of this? The Ethereum and void creatures are a threat to our survival as well.', 18189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We feel that the Ethereum are as great a threat to our existence as Dimensius. Both must be stopped...', '', 18188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what is your purpose?', 'So what is your purpose?', 18187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ethereum have grown dark... twisted. Vengeance has become their only recourse and any that would stand in their way or not join their cause are considered enemies. Many saw that the Ethereum were plummeting into madness and left. Several of the Nexus-Princes of the Ethereum council abandoned the Ethereum to form other groups and factions with different goals. The Consortium are one such example of an off-shoot group. The Protectorate another... ', '', 18186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t understand. What do you mean, Ameer?', 'I don\'t understand. What do you mean, Ameer?', 18185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ethereum were the ruling class of ethereal on my homeworld of K\'aresh. Tragically, we were forced to evacuate K\'aresh shortly before the void lord, Dimensius, unleashed his void armies upon the world and utterly decimated all that stood in his way. For this act, the Ethereum vowed vengeance. They have been tracking Dimensius ever since...$B$BThe Protectorate, however, were not a reaction to Dimensius. We were a reaction to Ethereum.', '', 18184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are Ethereum?', 'What are Ethereum?', 18183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh...', '', 18182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bessy, you\'re home. Thank the Light!', '', 18181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moooooooooo!', '', 18180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mooooo...', '', 18179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know about ethereals, fleshling?$B$BYou undoubtedly view us all in the same light, oblivious to the conflicts and struggles between the differing factions.$B$BPerhaps it is time for an introduction. I am Commander Ameer of the Protectorate - also your only hope of resolving the infestation of both void creature and Ethereum in this area.\n', '', 18178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to you, we\'ll be able to proceed with our plans for the Ruins of Farahlon.', '', 18177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion everywhere... they must be dealt with!', '', 18176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The work that you did for me at the Ruins of Farahlon has got me back on schedule.  I\'m assembling my team to head out there now.$B$BThank you, $n.', '', 18175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for someone to help me with a task that is long overdue.$B$BYou look capable.', '', 18174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wut\'s dis?', '', 18173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm. Me thirsty!', '', 18172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bloodmaul Brew? Me favorite!', '', 18171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohh, look! Bloodmaul Brew! Mmmm...', '', 18170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Area trigger works.', '', 18169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Muradin\'s beard, $c. This land is on the brink of annihilation. I cannot imagine anyone survived here since the end of the second war.', 'By Muradin\'s beard, $c. This land is on the brink of annihilation. I cannot imagine anyone survived here since the end of the second war.', 18168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will do as ordered.  Manaforge Duro has come under heavy attack by mana creatures and the situation is out of control.  Failure to comply will not be tolerated!', '', 18167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You cannot be serious!  We are severely understaffed and can barely keep this manaforge functional!', '', 18166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need you to send reinforcements to Manaforge Duro, Ardonis.  This is not a request, it\'s an order.', '', 18165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lightwarden\'s job is twofold.  Protect the priesthood at all costs first and foremost.  Destroy the enemies of the Light wherever they may hide second.', '', 18164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s crushes a vial of green gas.', '', 18163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not shut my manaforge down, scum!', '', 18162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. What better way to symbolize the bond of friendship and brotherhood between Tarren Mill and Southshore by erecting this tower at the halfway point between both towns. Brilliant!', '', 18161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at it, Jon. It\'s glorious!', '', 18160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More grog?', 18159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll come back later.', 18158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'ll it be?', 18157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emergency shutdown will complete in one minute.', '', 18156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning!  %s emergency shutdown process initiated by $n.  Shutdown will complete in two minutes.', '', 18155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to shine your shoes! Only one copper for the service!', '', 18154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will work for food...', '', 18153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Psst... Spare a copper for some grog?', '', 18152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, $g sir:madam;, I have three hungry children! Did I say three? TEN HUNGRY CHILDREN!', '', 18151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got any food?', '', 18150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare a copper? You won\'t need it soon. The end of days nears...', '', 18149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare a silver, friend?', '', 18148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes sir!', 'Yes sir!', 18147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Understood.', 'Understood.', 18146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not fail the master.', 'We must not fail the master.', 18145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAAAaaaarrrrgh!!!!! SHUT IT!', '', 18144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOW, everybody in this bar is gonna keep the noise to a minimum or ol\' Jessen is gonna bust out his rollin\' pin and cleaver and go orc on all of ya! IS EVERYONE CLEAR?!!!', '', 18143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m speakin\' to you too, mister fancy britches Mograine! SHUT YER YAP!', '', 18142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('EVERYBODY LISTEN UP!', '', 18141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is madness! I\'ve had enough! ENOUGH!', '', 18140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show us truth! Show us the one who shall betray!', '', 18139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooooh, YAH! Gaze upon my rippling musculature. Bask in the glow of my physique.', '', 18138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! Yes, you, peasant $g boy:girl;. Come quickly, I must tell you something... I must tell you about my greatness, lest such things are lost in the void!', '', 18137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hands off the cloak! Yes, yes, I know that you want one too. Everybody wants one of my cloaks. Believe me, person of low moral and social standing, one day I will make my fortune from the sale of my cloaks. Everyone from here to Ironforge will know the name of Bartolo Ginsetti. The Ginsetti label will be coveted by all!', '', 18136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 5, 15, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Zixil will be a household name! I\'ll corner the market!', '', 18135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe I can sell these things to other goblins? I\'ll be rich! Rich I say!', '', 18134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a few more swings and it\'ll be ready...', '', 18133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I get this hunk of junk up and running, I\'ll be able to walk the roads without fear of being jumped by bandits!', '', 18132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop this immediately!', 'Stop this immediately!', 18131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashbringer...', 'The Ashbringer...', 18130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen it... From this blessed crystal we will forge a weapon. This weapon will hold inside it a piece of each of us... And when it is used against undead, it shall cast them down. And in its wake, it will leave only ashes...', '', 18129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us never again speak of this day. Our enemies are many. They need not know we hold such artifacts.', '', 18128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s puts the crystal back inside the chest.', '', 18127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hand! It is healed!', '', 18126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... It... It is beautiful. What I felt when I touched it... The Light coursed through me and I through it... It healed my spirit.', '', 18125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reaches out to touch the light crystal.', '', 18124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must know... I will know...', '', 18123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BY THE LIGHT! Could it be? Could this be it?', '', 18122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is... Is it getting lighter? Its coloration... It is changing.', '', 18121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you approach the console the access crystal you have with you begins to hum softly and pulse with light.$B$BA rush of information flows into your mind and all of a sudden you\'re aware of the manaforge\'s energy production levels, its stability and its output to different pipelines.  The console awaits your command.', '', 18120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Begin emergency shutdown.>', '<Begin emergency shutdown.>', 18119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible!', '', 18118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It consumed the Light!', '', 18117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow bored of guarding Ambassador Sunsorrow, $n. Care to spar a bit? Perhaps one of us will learn something.', 'I grow bored of guarding Ambassador Sunsorrow, $n. Care to spar a bit? Perhaps one of us will learn something.', 18116, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While the focus of the Sha\'tar remains on Shadowmoon Valley and Illidan, we cannot ignore the threat that Kael\'thas Sunstrider presents.', 18115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me, $c. I must attend to my duties with Ambassador Sunsorrow, dull as they are.', 'Leave me, $c. I must attend to my duties with Ambassador Sunsorrow, dull as they are.', 18114, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shock then silence overtakes the crowd.', '', 18113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense, Mograine! It must be destroyed!', '', 18112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world. So far they refuse to listen, but perhaps you would be willing?', 'Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world. So far they refuse to listen, but perhaps you would be willing?', 18111, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you imagine what the material manifestation of the Light could do against the undead?', '', 18110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And if that answer is no, then could it be possible that because this artifact exists, its polar opposite must also exist?', '', 18109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me ask you this, brothers and sisters: Can good exist without evil? Can there be light without dark?', '', 18108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, old friend, it is very relevant.', '', 18107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shakes his head.', '', 18106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world... but no one will listen.', 'Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world... but no one will listen.', 18105, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not see how this evil artifact is relevant to the undead. We must destroy it!', '', 18104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I surmise that this object is the living embodiment of shadows... darkness... It is a manifestation. It is a void.', '', 18103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s removes the gauntlet from his right arm and shows everyone his mangled hand.', '', 18102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not get too close. I laid a hand upon it once... Only once and never again. The memories of that day still linger.', '', 18101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wrested it free from the remains of an orc lieutenant - a dark caster... It is from their homeworld.', '', 18100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have had this object in my possession for 10 years. Since Blackrock Spire...', '', 18099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Light! What is it?', 18098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s unlocks the chest.', '', 18097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And there is this...', '', 18096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Propose? I propose that we prepare. That we prepare our loved ones, family and friends for the possibility of an undead holocaust.', '', 18095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you propose, Mograine?', '', 18094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, I\'ve battled them as well. We are ill-prepared as a kingdom to withstand such an assault.', '', 18093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '', 18092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stand at the ready. I have faced undead before. They are ruthless killing machines, devoid of any emotion or compassion.', '', 18091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gasps can be heard throughout the room.', '', 18090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have heard that Northrend is lost...', '', 18089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dead rise... Undead, from the frozen northlands. Whole cities have gone missing. I...', '', 18088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear things... Things that should not be.', '', 18087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lowers his voice to a whisper.', '', 18086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters, I have called you here today to discuss the fate of Lordaeron.', '', 18085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your voices down. There are strangers about...', '', 18084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be alright, Ed. Me booty be locked away good in that thar chest. No fool will ever have Cap\'n Sanders\'s treasure! Let\'s go get another drink. The spirits be runnin\' low.', '', 18083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
