('Day in, day out, all we do is toil in this mine.  The blood elf male was not built for such manual labor.', '', 18010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for old Smithers to take a break...', '', 18009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve been to Zangarmarsh, you might\'ve run into a fellow named Daniels. You know -- wears a strange helmet, only answers to \"the Specialist.\"$B$BOf course, I taught him everything he knows.$B$BDon\'t let the fine clothing fool you. I\'m still a rogue at heart. Daniels and I spent a lot of time in the trenches together, but that was before I retired. As far as I know, he\'s still out there, giving \'em hell.', '', 18008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come.  Let\'s put down these crude instruments and walk away from all of this.  It isn\'t why we came to Outland.', '', 18007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They had no right to demote me to these menial tasks!', '', 18006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
