('Kael\'thas lied to us.  The Outland is no paradise.', '', 18004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a blood elf.  I do not do physical labor.', '', 18003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were duped.  This is definitely not the promised land!', '', 18002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should just leave.  Is this what we came to Outland for?', '', 18001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t come all this way from Silvermoon City to toil my life away in a mine!', '', 18000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
