('I hate this place and everyone in it! Smithers do this! Smithers do that! Oh so I\'m a farmer now, eh? So I\'m gonna have to harvest stuff, eh? I hope one day this whole place becomes one big graveyard and all the loud-mouths are buried right damned here!', '', 17996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
