('Well, he comes back to the king all pretendin\' to be nice, draws his sword, and runs the king through, elbow to ... well you know... kills him on the spot.', '', 17987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
