('Success!', '', 17939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tedon, go ahead and try the neutralizing agent on the mutated creature.', 17938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Shatter Point!', 'Send me to Shatter Point!', 17937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Honor Point!', 'Send me to Honor Point!', 17936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Shatter Point!', 'Send me to Shatter Point!', 17935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, to put the neutralizing agent on it...', '', 17934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heading to Outland? Visit Vixton Pinchwhistle in Netherstorm\'s Area 52. As the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit\'s official Arena Vendor, he has all sorts of incredible items for sale to those with enough Arena Points.', 17933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naaru\'s emergency shutdown will disable the manaforge permanently!  It must be aborted!', 'The naaru\'s emergency shutdown will disable the manaforge permanently!  It must be aborted!', 17932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop the emergency shutdown!  Kael will have our heads if he hears about this!', 'Stop the emergency shutdown!  Kael will have our heads if he hears about this!', 17931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What of Grommash? What of Hellscream?\n', 17930, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see that you hold the Doomhammer. Have all of our greatest heroes fallen, grandson?\n', 17929, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have dreamed of this moment all my life, Greatmother. \'Till now, all I\'ve had were Orgrim\'s stories about my parents and their adventures on Draenor. He was my greatest teacher and dearest friend. He died a hero... They all died as heroes - and for all of them, a song of honor remains.\n', '', 17928, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go\'el. You are Go\'el, son of Durotan - rightful chieftain of the Frostwolves. This day, grandson - you are the great joy of my heart.\n', 17927, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s wipes a tear away.', 17926, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like it\'s time to let you out of this cage.', '', 17925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s shakes the dirt loose from the shell.', 17924, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s holds a sea shell up to her ear.', 17923, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s picks up a sea shell.', 17922, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jane will love this one!', 17921, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oooh! Look, a shiny one!', 17920, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you really hear the ocean from one of these shells?', 17919, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I can see the Sunwell from here!', 17918, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pssst!  I have something that might interest you, $n.  It fell off a pack mule in Nagrand!', '', 17917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The best selection of smuggled goods is available right here, $n.  Great for the whole family!  Avoid goblin taxation and naaru prohibition - the Consortium is here to fill your every shopping need!', '', 17916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The latest blueprints, patterns and schematics are available right here.  These instructions are so simple to follow they practically craft themselves!', '', 17915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course none of my goods are stolen.  But if someone asks, you didn\'t get them from me!', '', 17914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the Mechanar at all costs!', '', 17913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the neutralizing agent mixes into the waters of the lake, the water that was irradiated by the crystal seems to clear.', '', 17912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire!', '', 17911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aim!', '', 17910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to purchase one of these creatures.', 'I wish to purchase one of these creatures.', 17909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am sure that, with our help, Botanist Taerix will be able to find solutions to our problems.', 17908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hawkstriders are noble creatures.  Make sure to always treat yours well; there are fewer things more dangerous than an angry hawkstrider.', 17907, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shatter Point is a great place for a Wildhammer dwarf.  I\'ve never had so much time in the air!', 'Shatter Point is a great place for a Wildhammer dwarf.  I\'ve never had so much time in the air!', 17906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brothers in Stormwind told me not to join the military... I\'m glad I didn\'t listen to them!', '', 17905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With some help, I believe Taerix may be close to a breakthrough.', '', 17904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('more', 'more', 17903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aided by the Alliance, my forces will hold the line here, but I need you to deliver my report to General Krakork in Thrallmar. With his help, we\'ll be able to drive these demons back into the abyss that spawned them! Speak to Vlagga Freyfeather who stands on the platform behind us. She\'ll speed you on your way.', '', 17902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Expedition made it safely through the Portal and set up a new base called Thrallmar. Yet as you can see, the Burning Legion moved in and cut us off from our brothers. Clearly, the demons hope to retake the Dark Portal and prevent us from gathering reinforcements from Azeroth.', '', 17901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emergency shutdown complete.', '', 17900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm\'ka, $c. You must be new. You look fresh and unspoiled by the horrors of this land.$B$B<Sergeant Shatterskull spits into the dust.>$B$BThat\'ll change.', '', 17899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has risked much to venture into Outland - resources, manpower - even the tactical defense of our lands is at stake. Despite all else, Thrall believes in the promise of this ravaged land. There is a strange light in his eyes these days - as if he senses some stirring revelation the rest of us do not.$B$BStill, he is my warchief and my blood-brother. I would follow him through the gates of the abyss itself.', '', 17898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Keep Listening>', '<Keep Listening>', 17897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once our warchief heard that the Dark Portal had been reopened, he immediately gathered his advisors to plan this daring expedition. Though a few of his councilors have their doubts, Thrall holds out the hope that we might discover new insights into the history of our people. He believes that somewhere amidst the wreckage of this world, the true tale of the orcish people lies hidden.$B$BI must admit that in my darkest moments... I fear that that tale should remain untold.', '', 17896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more of our mission here, Nazgrel.', 'Tell me more of our mission here, Nazgrel.', 17895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... deserve this....', '', 17894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should not have come....', '', 17893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It had to be done....', '', 17892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm\'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It\'s nothing like the stories I\'ve been told. It\'s hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.', 'Throm\'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It\'s nothing like the stories I\'ve been told. It\'s hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place.', 17891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t make me kill you!', '', 17890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You brought this on yourselves!', '', 17889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The work must continue!', '', 17888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told you only to summon me if that stupid elf returned! What\'s this? No matter, you won\'t detain me long.', 17887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Manaforge shutdown aborted.  Resuming manaforge activity.', '', 17886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emergency shutdown will complete in ten seconds.', '', 17885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emergency shutdown will complete in thirty seconds.', '', 17884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning!  %s emergency shutdown process has begun.  Shutdown will complete in one minute.', '', 17883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. Proceed with caution...', '', 17882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require a chrono-beacon, Sa\'at.', 'I require a chrono-beacon, Sa\'at.', 17881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, welcome back, hero. You have returned to protect the Guardian once more? Do not forget to take a chrono-beacon with you!', '', 17880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sa\'at, I have lost the chrono-beacon and require another!', 'Sa\'at, I have lost the chrono-beacon and require another!', 17879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, adventurer. Heed my warnings before venturing into the Black Morass.', '', 17878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A simple practical joke.', '', 17877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember how you\'re always telling us to chill?', '', 17876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh man, he got you good!', '', 17875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me outta here! Guys... guys?', '', 17874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give my life... gladly.', '', 17873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death is for the greater cause...', '', 17872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve with pride.', '', 17871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, a worthy sacrifice!', '', 17870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be a fine example for the others!', '', 17869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll make an offering of your blood!', '', 17868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to my aid! Heed your master now!', '', 17867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not... grow... overconfident, mortal.', '', 17866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the part I enjoy most...', '', 17865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you fear death?', '', 17864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, something to relieve the tedium!', '', 17863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will break you!', '', 17861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic mortals! You will pay dearly.', '', 17860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid me, you fools, before it\'s too late!', '', 17859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get it away from me!', '', 17858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A skunk! Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeew! Don\'t touch me!', '', 17857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for watching, everyone! If you\'d be so kind as to bring your non-irradiated currency to tomorrow\'s performance, I\'d appreciate it.', '', 17856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall transform my familiar, Sagan, into something truly wondrous!', '', 17855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall breathe fire!', '', 17854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was the best trick ever! Ok, boys, let\'s go get a drink.', '', 17853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show us a trick, Ravandwyr!', '', 17852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another long day in the trenches over with at last! Maybe the magic show will take away some of the afterglow...', '', 17851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And, for my next trick...', '', 17850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sighs audibly and glances at Sagan.', '', 17849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, another show already? Very well then...', '', 17848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm, me wanna bash!', '', 17847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh, guud stuff!', '', 17846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buuuurrp...', '', 17845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmm, Bloodmaul Brew!', '', 17844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raaaah!', '', 17843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh, dat feel guud!', '', 17842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After this mobility test, we\'ll only have the final weapons check to complete.', 'After this mobility test, we\'ll only have the final weapons check to complete.', 17841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be glad when final testing of this unit is complete.', 'I\'ll be glad when final testing of this unit is complete.', 17840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golem movement appears to be within the specifications.', 'Golem movement appears to be within the specifications.', 17839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has assaulted the Mage Tower!', '', 17838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has assaulted the Mage Tower!', '', 17837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
