('You recovered an ata\'mal crystal?  Impressive, $n!', '', 17830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken control of the Fel Reaver Ruins!', '', 17829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
