('The Alliance has taken control of the Draenei Ruins!', '', 17827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has defended the Draenei Ruins!', '', 17826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken control of the Mage Tower!', '', 17825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of the Mage Tower!', '', 17824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken control of the Blood Elf Tower!', '', 17823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This unit is ready to serve.', '', 17822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This unit is currently performing within normal parameters.', '', 17821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This unit is currently at ninety five percent operational efficiency.', '', 17820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of the Blood Elf Tower!', '', 17819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golem. Command. Operational status report.', 'Golem. Command. Operational status report.', 17818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their black iron constructs have sown death across a thousand worlds.', 'Their black iron constructs have sown death across a thousand worlds.', 17817, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muttering under his breath, %s goes back to work.', '', 17816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mischievous by nature, they are fond of employing their own hastily-constructed technologies.', 'Mischievous by nature, they are fond of employing their own hastily-constructed technologies.', 17815, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! Do not go any further, mortal. You are ill-prepared to face the forces of the Infinite Dragonflight. Come, let me help you.', '', 17814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They utilize terror and subterfuge - often turning brother against brother as whole worlds fall before their dark influence.', 'They utilize terror and subterfuge - often turning brother against brother as whole worlds fall before their dark influence.', 17813, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are the driving heart of the Burning Crusade.', 'They are the driving heart of the Burning Crusade.', 17812, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They revel in causing anguish and pain - and their murderous interrogations are the stuff of nightmares.', 'They revel in causing anguish and pain - and their murderous interrogations are the stuff of nightmares.', 17811, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their skill in battle should never be underestimated.', 'Their skill in battle should never be underestimated.', 17810, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it quick, $c - we\'ve got a war to fight here, or hadn\'t you noticed?', '', 17809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm\'ka, $gbrother:sister;! Welcome to Outland. The Horde needs all the strength it can muster in this broken world. I promise you, if it\'s glorious battle you\'ve come seeking, you\'ll have your fill of it here.', '', 17808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Thrallmar!', 'Send me to Thrallmar!', 17807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you\'ve recently arrived from Azeroth, eh? You\'d best steel yourself, $c - there are perils in this land unlike anything the Horde has faced before. I am Nazgrel - right hand to our mighty warchief, Thrall. He honored me with the task of safeguarding this brave expedition and - by all the spirits - I shall!', '', 17806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch!  That\'s not right.', '', 17805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It moved!  I swear, I saw it move!', '', 17804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yeah, it\'s real funny isn\'t it?', '', 17803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?!  You don\'t think I can do it?  I\'ll show you...once I get my parts, that is.', '', 17802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you start with me!', '', 17801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dealer Dunar, I wish to browse your wares.', 'Dealer Dunar, I wish to browse your wares.', 17800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is something that you wish to buy?  There is something that you wish to sell?$B$BThis is why we are here, my friend.$B$BPlease, tell me your pleasure.', '', 17799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get you working yet, you bucket of junk.', '', 17798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That definitely ended our business relationship with Kael\'thas.  Please stay here.  I will return shortly and there is something that I want you to do.', '', 17797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards!  Hold on, I will be right there!', '', 17796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Stormspire, $c.$B$BPlease do not be put off by my being present through this imaging device.  I have many enemies that would like to see me dead, so it is only a precaution.$B$BI assure you that you are perfectly safe here.', '', 17795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT!  This is outrageous!  You will pay for this Haramad!  You and your assistant here!', '', 17794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I think not.  The selflessness that I have just been witness to has cleared my mind.  My dealings with your master are at an end.  You may return and let him know that I have decided to turn the ata\'mal crystal over to the naaru.', '', 17793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ata\'mal crystal is mine!', '', 17791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never get the ata\'mal crystal from me!', '', 17790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will use the power of the ata\'mal crystal to crush you!', '', 17788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed, Nexus-Prince Haramad, you do have much to think on.  Such as turning over that ata\'mal crystal to my master, Prince Kael\'thas.', '', 17787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s strength fades.', '', 17786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grows in size upon seeing $n!', '', 17785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? You must forgive me, but I was not expecting company. As you can see, we are somewhat preoccupied right now. But no matter. As I am a gracious host, I will tend to you... personally.', '', 17784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have such fascinating things to show you.', '', 17783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve longed for a good adventure!', '', 17782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An epic battle, how exciting!', '', 17781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have not been properly introduced.', '', 17780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been... entertaining.', '', 17779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now we part company.', '', 17778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must bid you... farewell.', '', 17777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the Void... once more.', '', 17776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More... I must have more.', '', 17775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... I am... empowered.', '', 17774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not... resist.', '', 17773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... full of life.', '', 17772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will feed... on your soul.', '', 17771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ra-ak! Trinkets, yes. Pretty trinkets! Ak! Power, great power. Ra-kaw! Power in trinkets! Ak-caw!', '', 17769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ak-a-ra-k! No escape for -- caw -- you!', '', 17768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ikiss cut you, pretty -- ak-a-ak -- slice you, yes!', '', 17767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let those fiends breath through!  Our wounded are here behind me!', 'Don\'t let those fiends breath through!  Our wounded are here behind me!', 17766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm, you make war on Ikiss? Aa-ak!', '', 17765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmmmm...', '', 17764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You die -- ka! Stay away from trinkets!', '', 17763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ikiss will not -- rak, rak -- die...', '', 17762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m as ready as I\'ll ever be.', 'I\'m as ready as I\'ll ever be.', 17761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve arranged for your flight to Manaforge Coruu.  Are you ready, $n?  You will be dropped off behind enemy lines so make sure you bring everything you need.', 17760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m a little busy negotiating a bribe right now.  You might want to come back later.', 17759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you think I\'ll betray my friend that easily, think again!  Face me, you scoundrel!', '', 17758, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magistrix Carinda has sent me to ask you about Arelion\'s secret.  Who was he seeing?', 'Magistrix Carinda has sent me to ask you about Arelion\'s secret.  Who was he seeing?', 17757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it you want?  I\'m not one for small talk.', '', 17756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare my life!  I will tell you about Arelion\'s secret.', '', 17755, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wind Trader Marid, I\'ve returned with more information on the nether drakes. I\'m prepared to be your business partner, and for an extra sum, I\'ll take care of that troublesome elf and her human friend.', 'Wind Trader Marid, I\'ve returned with more information on the nether drakes. I\'m prepared to be your business partner, and for an extra sum, I\'ll take care of that troublesome elf and her human friend.', 17754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready to fly to Durnholde, let me know and I shall take you.', '', 17753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no need to contact that conniving ethereal. Come, we have much to discuss.', 17752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attempt to contact Tyri and Jorad.', 'Attempt to contact Tyri and Jorad.', 17751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forest sings with the seeds of change, but it also cries out in pain.$B$BOur new friends, the draenei, are here to help us, like you. We must put an end to the destruction of my brother and sister trees before all is lost and Ashenvale is no more.', '', 17750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'BOAR\'S DUNG! Why must I stay here to guide others to Alterac Valley, when I could be fighting there myself? You! Have you come to fight the Alliance?', 17749, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are ye doin\' here?! Get yer chatty self ta Alterac Vallery, where ye\'re needed!', '', 17748, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met, $c. Even now, the Horde attacks Warsong Gulch. Will you fight alongside the Alliance there?', 17747, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The entrance to Warsong Gulch stands before you. Will you fight the wretched Alliance there?', '', 17746, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go, $n, into Arathi Basin! Slay, SLAY, as you\'ve never slain before!', 17745, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see a friend of the Aldor around these remote parts.  I fear I cannot stand for much more of these elves\' insolent chatter.', '', 17744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin has been overrun by The Defilers.  Will you help us, $n?', '', 17743, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please take me to the master\'s lair.', 'Please take me to the master\'s lair.', 17742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you again, $n. Would you like me to take you to the master\'s lair?', '', 17741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware, mortal, beyond this hall lies dangers unheard of in your world. Tread carefully...', '', 17740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm... no more life. No more pain. A-ak!', '', 17739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmm... be free. Caw!', '', 17738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, fleeting life is, rak-a-kak!', '', 17737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice pets have weapons. No so -- ra-ak -- nice.', '', 17736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice pets, yes... raa-a-ak!', '', 17735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm... time to make my move!', '', 17734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have pets -- ca-caw! -- of my own!', '', 17733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For her Excellency... for... Vashj!', '', 17730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squirm, surface filth!', '', 17729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ba\'anthalso-dorei!', '', 17728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I despise all of your kind!', '', 17727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your head will roll!', '', 17726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not nearly over...', '', 17725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You deem yourselves worthy simply because you bested my guards? Our work here will not be compromised!', '', 17724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mommy.', '', 17723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have fun dyin\', cupcake!', '', 17722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I own you!', '', 17721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You just got served, punk!', '', 17720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m bringin\' the pain!', '', 17719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll come over there!', '', 17718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat hot metal, scumbag!', '', 17717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in for a world o\' hurt!', '', 17716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not fail the master.', 'We must not fail the master.', 17715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you wish there was some water around here?', 'Don\'t you wish there was some water around here?', 17714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary of intruders.', 'Be wary of intruders.', 17713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beg all you want, I am keeping the crystal for myself.  All of Outland will soon fall beneath my step!', '', 17712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay alert!', 'Stay alert!', 17711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.', '', 17710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They all wanted it for themselves, but I slew them as easily as I will slay you when I pay you a visit later.', '', 17709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think not, Socrethar.  With the power of the crystal, you will be serving me soon.  If I allow you to live, that is.', '', 17708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can talk until you\'re blue in the face, I\'m not delivering the ata\'mal crystal to you.', '', 17707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WITH THE CRYSTAL, I AM A GOD!', '', 17706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing that you say will convince me to give up such power!', '', 17705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our matron will be... the end of you.', 17704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not give it to you, Socrethar!', '', 17703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For my lady and master!', 17702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the depths of oblivion with you!', 17701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Culuthas, when I find you, I am going to make certain that you suffer for all eternity!', '', 17699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will drown in blood!', 17698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet your doom, surface dwellers!', 17697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The depths will consume you!', 17696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know where you\'ve gone to.  But I can assure you that wherever that is, I will find you and the crystal, Culuthas!', '', 17695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you using the crystal to hide?  Is that it?  You should know that you cannot possibly mask such power!', '', 17694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show yourself, Culuthas.  All may be forgiven if you just bring the crystal to me.', '', 17693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can sense you, \'adventurer\', even through this magical image.  You think you will retrieve the ata\'mal crystal when Culuthas shows himself, but you are mistaken!', '', 17692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot hide from me, Culuthas!  I will hunt you down no matter where you go!', '', 17691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Culuthas where have you gone?!', '', 17690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that?  Did you hear something?  Culuthas, there are servants of the Consortium nearby.  Bring me the crystal immediately!', '', 17689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Culuthas, deliver the crystal to me now!', '', 17688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are these things that you have summoned to serve you?!  Just who do you think you are!', '', 17687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you destroy my demons!', '', 17686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away from... Me!', '', 17685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is pointless to resist.', '', 17684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what I can make of you!', '', 17683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not make me come there and destroy you!', '', 17682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anger...hate... These are tools I can use.', '', 17681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I can find a use for you...', '', 17680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My work must not be interrupted!', '', 17679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return the crystal to me or face annihilation!', '', 17678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea how to control the ata\'mal crystal.  It will consume you!', '', 17677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Culuthas, you will return the crystal to me at once!', '', 17676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fools! He\'ll kill us all!', '', 17675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ignorant whelps!', '', 17674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mustn\'t let him loose!', '', 17673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good...luck. You\'ll need it.', '', 17672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your friends will soon be joining you!', '', 17671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just as you deserve!', '', 17670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This timeway collapsed and reformed. The result was Stratholme of yore. What could possibly be happening inside?', 17669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me, please.', 17668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are only two truths to be found here: First, that time is chaotic, always in flux, and completely malleable and second, perception does not dictate reality.', 17667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our time is at an end, $n. I would wish you luck, if such a thing existed.\n', 17666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All we know of this timeway is that it leads to Mount Hyjal. The Infinite Dragonflight have gone to great lengths to prevent our involvement. We know next to nothing, mortal. Soridormi is currently attempting to break through the timeway\'s defenses but has thus far been unsuccessful. You might be our only hope of breaking through and resolving the conflict.\n', 17665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have very little information on this timeway. Sa\'at has been dispatched and is currently inside. The data we have gathered from his correspondence is that the Infinite Dragonflight are once again attempting to alter time. Could it be that the opening of the Dark Portal is being targeted for sabotage? Let us hope not...\n', 17664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This timeway is in great disarray! We have agents inside right now attempting to restore order. What little information I have indicates that Thrall\'s freedom is in jeopardy. A malevolent organization known as the Infinite Dragonflight is trying to prevent his escape. I fear without outside assistance, all will be lost.\n', 17663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The timeways are currently ranked in order from least catastrophic to most catastrophic. Note that they are all classified as catastrophic, meaning that any single one of these timeways collapsing would mean that your world would end. We only classify them in such a way so that the heroes and adventurers that are sent here know which timeway best suits their abilities.\n', 17662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These tunnels that you see are called timeways. They are infinite in number. The ones that currently exist in your reality are what the master has deemed as \'trouble spots.\'  These trouble spots may differ completely in theme but they always share a cause. That is, their existence is a result of the same temporal disturbance. Remember that should you venture inside one...\n', 17661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For normal maintenance of time, the Keepers of Time are sufficient caretakers. We are able to deal with most ordinary disturbances. I speak of little things, such as rogue mages changing something in the past to elevate their status or wealth in the present.\n', 17660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'As custodians of time, we watch over and care for Nozdormu\'s realm. The master is away at the moment, which means that attempts are being made to dramatically alter time. The master never meddles in the affairs of mortals but instead corrects the alterations made to time by others. He is reactionary in this regard.\n', 17659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is strange, I know... Most mortals cannot actually comprehend what they see here, as often, what they see is not anchored within their own perception of reality.\n', 17658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not know if the Caverns of Time have always been accessible to mortals. Truly, it is impossible to tell as the Timeless One is in perpetual motion, changing our timeways as he sees fit. What you see now may very well not exist tomorrow. You may wake up yesterday and have no memory of this place.\n', 17657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n. I will guide you through the cavern. Please try and keep up.', 17656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to test me? You are hardly up to the task.', '', 17655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This exercise bores me.', '', 17654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What insolence! What arrogance! To believe you could defeat me on my own doorstep!', '', 17653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins a massive heal!', '', 17652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
