('There are only 3 kinds of people in this world: competitors, customers, and employees. Competitors are to be crushed ruthlessly, customers indulged, and employees strictly supervised.$B$BIndependent contractors are a myth.They want to be paid better than employees, but treated like customers. Never trust one who calls himself by that title.', '', 17629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have to sell, Tuluman?', 'What do you have to sell, Tuluman?', 17628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
