('The ground of this place is still warm from freshly shed blood.  Ah, I would have given my own eye to be here when the demons tore through that portal and clashed with Azeroth\'s heroes!  What a battle it was!$B$BBut now, even more fierce fighting rages on the other side!', '', 17626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
