('Dealer Hazzin, what do you have to offer?', 'Dealer Hazzin, what do you have to offer?', 17592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All things for sale, my friend!  Large and small, whatever you need, Hazzin will provide.$B$BIf you value your life, do not approach Manaforge Ultris without a resupply.  Hazzin is the last chance that you have.', '', 17591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('This ethereal teleport pad is covered in brightly colored buttons and switches, but seems to have fallen into disuse.', '', 17590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We only have to work crunch time for a few more weeks.  At least thats what they tell us...', '', 17588, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
