('Powerful and deliberate, these winged aberrations are renowned across the cosmos for their brutality.', 'Powerful and deliberate, these winged aberrations are renowned across the cosmos for their brutality.', 17370, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
