('I will be with the Lightning Sons should you require my services.', '', 17112, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall, you should go alone. Perhaps this old shaman can teach those farseers a thing or two.', '', 17111, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
