('', 'Drek\'Thar, forever loyal to our people. Spirits bless you, old friend. This is your home too, please make yourself comfortable.', 17104, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come closer, grandson. Sit by your Greatmother.', 17103, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greatmother...', '', 17102, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have been expecting you, young one. Come closer - my eyes are not as sharp as they once were.\n', 17101, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you, Garrosh. We have much to discuss when I return from my visit with the Greatmother.', '', 17100, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s points towards the hospice.', '', 17099, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are honored by your presence, son of Durotan. The Greatmother awaits you at the hospice.', '', 17098, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where?  Where are the Shards!  You cannot hide them from us!', '', 17097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry that I did not come sooner, young Hellscream. There is so much that I have to tell you about your father, but first you must tell me where I may find the Greatmother.', '', 17096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are several prominent bills tacked up on the board here.$B$BHowever, the fine-print indicates that you\'re not quite ready for either of the tasks at hand.  You should definitely check back later!', '', 17095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are two prominent bills tacked up on the board here; one from Papa Wheeler and one from Rocket-Chief Fuselage.$B$BPapa\'s looks like it\'s a wanted ad for a machine part.  The rocket-chief\'s has something to do with a bounty on the head of an immense mountain giant!$B$BThe details for both are provided in very small goblin handwriting, which is, of course, barely legible.', '', 17094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For years I was convinced we were doing the right thing in Silvermoon - working to reach Outland so we could be reunited with Kael.$B$BHad I known what Kael\'thas had in store for us, I would\'ve stayed right in Falconwing Square.', '', 17093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The memories rush back, Thrall.', '', 17092, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '', 17091, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my Crude Explosives. Do you have any left?', 'I lost my Crude Explosives. Do you have any left?', 17090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have some left over.', 'I have some left over.', 17089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Radiation?!$B$BNo, you don\'t need to worry about that!  Sheesh, the things that people believe these days.$B$BSo, what do you think of our operations down here?  State of the art, baby!  You better believe it.', '', 17088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Impertinent fool! You are no match for the servants of Prince Kael\'thas!', '', 17087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s expresses its approval.', '', 17086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares.', 'I wish to browse your wares.', 17085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone called?', '', 17084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you the correspondent from the Gadgetzan Times? If you just follow me, I\'ll show you my experimental apparatus...$B$B<You tell the magus that you\'re not the reporter she\'s expecting.>$B$BOh, you\'re not? Well then, if you need reagents, find what you need and don\'t tarry. I\'m expecting someone.', 17083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks...', '', 17082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pleasure!', '', 17081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellscream! Blessed ancestors! He is the mirrored reflection of Grom, Drek\'Thar.', '', 17080, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a pulse!', '', 17079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
