('Right... let me in there!', '', 17074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never thought it would turn out to be mana oil! There\'s going to be plenty of demand for that, minus Grek, of course!', 17073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh!  Someone needs to get those fires out so I can get in there and save that goblin!', '', 17072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a doctor!  What seems to be the problem?', '', 17071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This oil no good for Grek! What Grek look like to you, some weakling in robes?', '', 17070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grek try!', '', 17069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grek, will you try out this new weapon oil Rakoria made?', 'Grek, will you try out this new weapon oil Rakoria made?', 17068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yikes!  Someone call the fire marshal!  Medic!!!  Is there a doctor in the house?', '', 17067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have done it! Thrall would be proud.', '', 17066, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ok, I\'m ok!  Ah well, back to the drawing board on that rocket fuel!', '', 17064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh!', '', 17063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woot!  Here we go!', '', 17062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... this nether radiation could prove to be quite deadly.  But it could be even deadlier to  just ignore it.  I\'ll need some more readings to confirm this.', '', 17061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This data will be quite useful for Project Blue Book. Er, I mean, this will be great for my new look.  See if you can gather any more data.', '', 17060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
