('May our bond with you never be broken again, spirit.', '', 17055, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boots, what do you have back there that goes down smooth?', 'Boots, what do you have back there that goes down smooth?', 17054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive... Most impressive.', '', 17053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incredible!', '', 17052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s howls in response to Malukaz\'s call.', '', 17051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating.', '', 17050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my...', '', 17049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s your pleasure?  Pull up a seat and knock one back.$B$BI\'m Boots, lead mixologist for B.O.O.M. and bartender extraordinaire!$B$BIf it\'s got kick, Ol\' Boots can give it to ya.', '', 17048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('But we have returned, spirit! We have returned to honor you again. Favor us with your presence once more.', '', 17047, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, you were a companion to my people. We gave ourselves to evil and you were forgotten.', '', 17046, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well hand it over and let\'s see what you\'ve got!', '', 17045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wolf spirit of the forest, hear me!', '', 17044, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be the judge of that.', '', 17043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me a moment to look over these findings.', '', 17042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what you\'ve got.', '', 17041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see what you\'ve found.', '', 17040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s dons his wolf-fur vestments.', '', 17039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should take a look at these readings, they are unlike anything we\'ve seen before.', '', 17038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think my gadget is broken, it did manage to pick up some unusual readings.', '', 17037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My quad-corder has detected some anomolous readings from the nether anomolies.', '', 17036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have another reading from the nether.', '', 17035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a preliminary report about the gravimetric disruptions.', '', 17034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve taken some strange readings from nether ribbons.', '', 17033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to die. Finally home, my spirit can be freed from this mortal shell.', '', 17032, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The old memories stir. They rush back to me as if propelled by the noble spirits of the air...', '', 17031, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were best friends, you know. Durotan and Orgrim once ventured into the Terokkar forest, where they were almost killed by an ogre. If it were not for the draenei that saved them... It makes me sad to look back upon those days. Such terrible things we did to the draenei...', '', 17030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And on this very soil that we now touch, our greatest heroes once hunted.', '', 17029, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe it was on this very land that a young Durotan, barely into adolescence, killed his first talbuk. Ah, I can still remember him recanting that tale for us at the springtime festival.', '', 17028, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder, does Oshu\'gun still stand... Oh the stories I could tell of the time before the darkness... So many wonderous memories...', '', 17027, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is amazing. How could it have remained in this state, untouched by the world\'s destruction?', '', 17026, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look around you, younglings. This is Draenor!', '', 17025, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... It seems that the syncotron unit we\'ve been using has had no noticeable effect on the gravimetric or gravitronic distortions in this sector.', '', 17024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My gadget can\'t get an accurate reading with all the quatum nether fluctuations.', '', 17023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting... it seems the nethertron emissions are on the rise using the gobo-sin curve scale.  Yet the energon particles are cubed...  ', '', 17022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m picking up trace amounts of chroniton particles.  Hmm, if we use a reverse phase inducer, while inverting our own chronosphere, we might be able to eliminate the particles. Of course, that means we need to build a chronosphere...', '', 17021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... the readings on the gravimeteric distortions seem to have stabalized.  We did it!', '', 17020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hippogryph Master', 'Hippogryph Master', 17019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I stand before you only a boy in search of lost memories.', '', 17018, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is I who is unworthy.', '', 17017, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You honor me, $g brother:sister;.', '', 17016, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand proud, $g brother:sister;!', '', 17015, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re back!  Were you able to get all of the machines?', 17014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am unworthy, son of Durotan. We are all unworthy...', 'I am unworthy, son of Durotan. We are all unworthy...', 17013, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Son of Durotan... Grandson of Garad and Geyah... Bow your heads for a Warchief is among us...', 'Son of Durotan... Grandson of Garad and Geyah... Bow your heads for a Warchief is among us...\n', 17012, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the first time, I feel safe. I do not know you, stranger, but I know that I would lay down my life for you if only you asked.', 'For the first time, I feel safe. I do not know you, stranger, but I know that I would lay down my life for you if only you asked.', 17011, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He carries the Doomhammer!', 'He carries the Doomhammer!', 17010, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have never felt such strength radiate from an orc. Is he... mortal...', 'I have never felt such strength radiate from an orc. Is he... mortal...', 17009, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has he come to lead us?', 'Has he come to lead us?', 17008, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could it really be? The son of Durotan?', 'Could it really be? The son of Durotan?', 17007, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are the rumors true? Does he truly carry the Greatmother\'s bloodline?', 'Are the rumors true? Does he truly carry the Greatmother\'s bloodline?', 17006, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is he? He looks so familiar.', 'Who is he? He looks so familiar.', 17005, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A tradesman, perhaps? You need look no further than I for supplies. My prices are quite fair, friend. These items were difficult to acquire, but what does the source matter, eh? You\'ll have what you need.', '', 17004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful in there and come back in one piece!', 17003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The creatures of this place are strong, wayfarer. You\'ll need ample ammunition if you hope to survive. You\'re in luck - I am well-stocked with fine arrows, bullets, and throwing weapons. The price is reasonable, considering circumstances.', '', 17002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, another powerful traveler. The nether can be dangerous; you\'ll want the most potent spells at your disposal. I carry the finest reagents, common and exotic. Come, buy - you won\'t be sorry!', '', 17001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm...', 17000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. That did the trick.', 16999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
