('Peon! Unpack the food and medical supplies!', '', 16707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get the arms and armor shipments unpacked!', '', 16706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heft those barrels!', '', 16705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move those crates, peon!', '', 16704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok narash!', 'Lok narash!', 16703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world is OURS!', 'This world is OURS!', 16702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar Illadari!\n', 'Lok\'tar Illadari!\n', 16701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood is our power! ', 'The blood is our power! ', 16700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gakarah ma!', 'Gakarah ma!', 16699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Kargath!  For Victory!', 'For Kargath!  For Victory!', 16698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the true Horde!', 'We are the true Horde!', 16697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The master will... not be... pleased.', '', 16696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall will remain a slave. Taretha will die. You have failed.', '', 16695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are... irrelevant.', '', 16694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot fight fate!', '', 16693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Struggle as much as you like...', '', 16692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast!', '', 16691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me not know. The overseer, me hope!', '', 16690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What we fire from this thing, anyway?', '', 16689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry it up! Work, WORK!', '', 16688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want those catapults built YESTERDAY!', '', 16687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your backs into it, you lazy peons!', '', 16686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work, you filthy swine!', '', 16685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WORK FASTER!', '', 16684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twelve steps is more like it!', '', 16683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the blood elves think they\'re just one step away from ruling the world...', '', 16682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I own a dog, but I\'m not giving him a sword.', '', 16681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How desperate do you have to be for allies that you recruit your livestock?', '', 16680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just so you guys don\'t feel left out, all I said was how attractive the blood elves are.  It loses something in the translation.', '', 16679, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it just me, or is the Horde about the ugliest enemy we could find?', '', 16678, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards... guards!', '', 16677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you really think you would leave here alive?', '', 16676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall will never be free!', '', 16675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what Blackmoore sees in you. For my money you\'re just another ignorant savage!', '', 16674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a slave! That\'s all you\'ll ever be!', '', 16673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who am I kiddin\'? If you trade with goblins you\'d better have iron plating in your coinpurse.', '', 16672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Used to be you couldn\'t trust a goblin...', '', 16671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The other day I saw one walking down the street shouting, \"Once you go gnome, you never go home!\"', '', 16670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gnomes used to be a nice respectful people...', '', 16669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She made the back cover too!', '', 16668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Hey! Hey! It\'s Raliq the drunk... His momma\'s so fat she didn\'t just make the front cover of Ogre Today...', '', 16667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They don\'t know where to store the leftovers!', '', 16666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look who\'s here, it\'s Raliq the drunk... His momma\'s so fat dragons won\'t eat her...', '', 16665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall... must not... go free.', '', 16664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not interfere!', '', 16663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more meddling for you!', '', 16662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, it\'s Raliq the drunk... His momma\'s so fat, when she flies to Blade\'s Edge they charge her by the pound!', '', 16661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run, you blasted cowards!', '', 16660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to bleed!', '', 16659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no take candle!', '', 16658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many kobolds does it take to change a lantern wick?', '', 16657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw a murloc swim by my window.', '', 16656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goldshire\'s inn advertises a lakeside view...', '', 16655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s a beaut\', isn\'t she? Sky\'ree... the faithful gryphon of our commander. Kurdran himself, he holds his audiences in th\' stronghold. I care fer our Sky\'ree here when he\'s busy. Gorgeous creature, she is; as strong and fierce as they come. She\'d die fer Kurdran, she would. A more loyal soul ye\'ve ne\'er seen.\n\n\'Tis an honor to care fer her, it is.', '', 16654, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('to scale!!', '', 16653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That town\'s so small, I asked a kid to draw me a map. He drew it on the back of a Defias wanted poster...', '', 16652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last week I was in Goldshire. Have you been there?', '', 16651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what you\'re up to, and I mean to put an end to it, permanently!', '', 16650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just flew in from Ironforge and, Boy!, are my mount\'s wings tired!', '', 16649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a good looking crowd. The dwarven women even shaved.', '', 16648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The surface of the %s begins to bubble.', '', 16647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to grow stronger.', '', 16646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough messing around! There\'s a war going on here!', '', 16645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are only to use the staggered formation just before atta-', '', 16644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? You\'ve shifted into an incorrect formation!', '', 16643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we can\'t teach you to shoot, you\'ll have a career in the cantina to fall back on.', '', 16642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again, very nice strutting ladies.', '', 16641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In fact, let\'s see some more of that fancy walkin\'... Move it!', '', 16640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be marching all day if I see any more of that!', '', 16639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, that was cute...', '', 16638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Carefully now, we don\'t need any more mista-', '', 16637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get into formation and get those guns sighted in!', '', 16636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let\'s give shootin\' another try...', '', 16635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was some pretty fancy prancin\' ladies!', '', 16634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With each passing moment, I see the people of Azeroth prove again the reasons we have come.  It is with solemn pride that I fight with you, and if I die this day, then I die among friends.', '', 16633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight on!  Fight on!  And know that blood shed this day mingles with the blood of heroes.  Even in death, our spirits will know the victory of saving your kin and your world.  Do not succumb to despair, friends, for the demons against whom we face will surely take pleasure in it.', '', 16632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes!  Hold your feet firm!  Lend aid to your cohorts and together our banded strength will overcome these demons!  Cling fiercely to hope and grip tightly your weapons, and trust that the Light will pierce this darkness and shine through to morrow\'s dawn!', '', 16631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength!  My new brothers and sisters!  Beat back these devils for the sake of your world.  Hold here, and your friends and allies will come and weigh their swords with you!', '', 16630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons, our old foes from eons passed, once again show their beastly visage.  But do not falter, for fear is one of their many weapons.  And a weapon most deadly it is.', '', 16629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strength, the wisdom, the unending endurance of the peoples of Azeroth inspires those beyond your reckoning.  On this day, this day of blood and terror, I see that yours is a world of heroes!', '', 16628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons should be in no doubt that we are their nemesis and, though they wish our destruction, it is we who will bring about their ruin.  Kazzak and his forces will be diminished and defeated by this coalition.  And to do this, we must throw at them our bodies and hearts, for they seek no less than the obliteration of this world.', '', 16627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall take up this grim task in high spirits, and be sure that our cause will not be suffered to fail.  Welcome the aid of your brethren, and of your once heated foes - let us all go forward together with our united strength, and know victory this day!', '', 16626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of Azeroth, you now fight against the vile Burning Crusade.  And the hopes and prayers of all Light-loving people march with you.  In the company of our brave allies and brothers-in-arms you will hold your ground and break this demonic charge.  You will stem the destructive tyranny that rages across so many worlds.', '', 16625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though your sinews tire and your blood flows from cuts and wounds to this sodden ground, you fight for the spirits of your world.  No evil force can stand against us!', '', 16624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight on, and let our ancestors see the bravery and strength we hold!  Today our hunt is for them, and for our world!', '', 16623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it is our fate to die this day, then we will not go easy!  Mark me, these demons will fall like wheat!', '', 16622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These fiends will fail!  For Azeroth!', '', 16621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once again, we will show this Burning Legion that our world is not for the taking!', '', 16620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defenders of the Argent Dawn!  We are with you!', '', 16619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike true, brothers and sisters!  Today our quarry is demons!', '', 16618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits sing to us!  They sing the song of battle!', '', 16617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hunters, to me! Let us show these demons what it is to fight and die in Azeroth!', '', 16616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to the Abyssal Shelf!', 'Send me to the Abyssal Shelf!', 16615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any spare copper?', 'Any spare copper?', 16614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please don\'t ignore us...', 'Please don\'t ignore us...', 16613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $G man:lady;? Got some money?  I got five kids to feed!', 'Hey, $G man:lady;? Got some money?  I got five kids to feed!', 16612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare a copper, $G sir:madam;?', 'Spare a copper, $G sir:madam;?', 16611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall in for some marching practice! Let\'s see if we can manage to walk without suffering any casualties...', '', 16610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clearly, this group is not ready for weapons exercises.', '', 16609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You DO know that marksmen are issued blanks for practice drills, right?', '', 16608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldier...', '', 16607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...at least we know my rifle is sighted properly.', '', 16606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uhh, whoops...', '', 16605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the heavy bomb master. Send me up!', 'I\'m the heavy bomb master. Send me up!', 16604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you absolutely, positively must kill NOW, the heavy bomb is the way to go. Heavy bombs have a much larger radius and cause much more damage. The downside is that you can carry far fewer heavy bombs than you can light bombs and you must wait longer between uses.\n', '', 16603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 275, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about heavy bombs.', 'Tell me about heavy bombs.', 16602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about something else.', 'Tell me about something else.', 16601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carpet bombing is for me. I\'m ready to fly!', 'Carpet bombing is for me. I\'m ready to fly!', 16600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carpet bombing refers to dropping a very large number of bombs on an area, essentially carpetting the region with bombs.$B$BBombers often use several light bombs on a region and then use heavy bombs to clean up whatever might still be standing.', '', 16599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about light bombs and carpet bombing.', 'Tell me about light bombs and carpet bombing.', 16598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along unless you\'ve got business with the fleet.', '', 16597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright now, let\'s get those rifles sighted in...', '', 16596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A soothing light fills you as you approach the naaru.  Slow musical chimes echo within your mind and, though a word is not uttered, you feel an assurance of safety.  You are welcome in Shattrath City.>', '', 16595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hungarfen roars in pain. ', 'Hungarfen roars in pain. ', 16594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...THAT WAS GREAT!', '', 16593, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Er... \'Moke?', '', 16592, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DO IT, YE COWARD!', '', 16591, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m... not sure that\'s a good idea, \'Moke. Ye might get hurt...', '', 16590, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nae, that\'s fer wimps. Hit me with yer hammer!', '', 16589, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What, with me fists?', '', 16588, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s blinks, a perplexed expression crossing his face.', '', 16587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bron! \'Ey, Bron! Hit me!', '', 16586, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The comedian impersonates an orc.', '', 16584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The comedian impersonates a human female.', '', 16583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The comedian impersonates a blood elf.', '', 16582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The comedian impersonates a gnome.', '', 16581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The comedian impersonates a tauren.', '', 16580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them throw another one of these overgrown tin cans at us! We\'ll show them what the Alliance is made of!', '', 16579, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, soldiers! We weren\'t about to let the filthy animals of the Horde show us up!', '', 16578, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna melt this hunk of junk down and make weapons with the ingots! Let\'s see how the Legion likes a taste of fel reaver served up Alliance style!', '', 16577, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tear it down, soldiers! We\'re shippin\' this thing back to Stormwind!', '', 16576, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WE\'RE UNDER ATTACK! RUN FOR COVER!', '', 16575, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('INFERNALS! CLEAR THE COURTYARD!', '', 16574, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('INFERNAL RAIN ON THE RISE! TAKE COVER!', '', 16573, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worthless!  You are completely worthless!', '', 16572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At this rate you will not survive.', '', 16571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harder! Faster! Stronger!', '', 16570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until then, your presence at your post will keep them on their toes.', '', 16569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In time, you may learn to see through their deceptions.', '', 16568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They mask their intentions with meaningless movements to confuse us.', '', 16567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is exactly as I expected, soldier. They know we watch them closely.', '', 16566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, out with it, neophyte...', '', 16565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you command, sir.', '', 16564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies, sir. I wish I had more to report.', '', 16563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
