('And those in Azeroth now a-bed shall think themselves accursed they were not here,  And hold their valor cheap whiles any speaks that fought with us upon this dark day.', '', 16553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We few, we happy few, we band of brothers and sisters.  For those today that shed their blood with me, Shall be my kin; be they never so vile, This day shall gentle their conditions.', '', 16552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This day we fight!! By all that you hold dear in these good lands, I bid you stand, heroes of Azeroth!', '', 16551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your ground! Hold your ground! Sons of the Alliance!  Of the Horde! My brothers and sisters!  I see in your eyes the same fear that would wither my own heart. A day may come when our courage fails, when we forsake our friends and break our fellowships... but it is not this day.', '', 16550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone fights.  No one quits.', '', 16549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Fight and you may die. Run and you will live, but for how long?  The devils are upon us!  And those not here, dying in their villages weeks from now, would they be willing to trade all the days from this day to that, for one chance to come here and stop these horrors from invading our world?\n', '', 16548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time for us as kingdoms and as individuals to set aside our long-standing feuds and unite. The tides of an unwinnable war are upon us, and we must seek refuge on higher ground, lest we be swept away by the flood of darkness.', '', 16547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us therefore brace ourselves to our duty, and so bear ourselves, that if the Humans of Azeroth last for a thousand years, men will still say, \'This was their finest hour.', '', 16546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
