('Slay these intruders, filthy Dreghood!  I promise you neverending pain if you disobey me!', '', 16439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare interfere with the Master\'s endeavors?  You will pay, foolish mortal!', '', 16438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quake, mortals!  Quake and kneel before your destroyer!', '', 16437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All clear.  Looks like the colossi attack has been repelled.', '', 16436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wardens, defend the east entrance!', '', 16435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms!  The colossi attack!', 'To arms!  The colossi attack!', 16434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for fun!', '', 16433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impudent whelps, you only delay the inevitable. Where one has fallen, ten shall rise. Such is the will of Kazzak...', '', 16432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on a bombing mission for Forward Commander To\'arch.  I need a wyvern destroyer!', 'I\'m on a bombing mission for Forward Commander To\'arch.  I need a wyvern destroyer!', 16431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re ever captured by the Legion, tell them \"Xar il romath da tidesbi.\" They will kill you instantly for insulting their god, saving you intolerable torture or worse...', '', 16430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, I have failed...', '', 16429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes the straightforward approach to a problem is the best.', '', 16428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must discover what\'s behind the mystery of the giant crystal that fell from the heavens on Fallen Sky Ridge.', 16427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was THAT?', '', 16426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not stop!  I promise you a thousand deaths if you even think about putting down that pick!', '', 16425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig faster, wretch!  Do not force me to show you the true meaning of pain!', '', 16424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope I have a chance to visit with Greatfather Winter before Winter Veil is over.', 'I hope I have a chance to visit with Greatfather Winter before Winter Veil is over.', 16423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greatfather Winter will leave presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I can\'t wait to get mine!', 'Greatfather Winter will leave presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I can\'t wait to get mine!', 16422, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster, scum!  The Master won\'t be pleased if we don\'t find the Ata\'mal crystal he\'s after.', '', 16421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Warchief! For the Horde!', '', 16420, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send more, demons! We will destroy them as we have this one!', '', 16419, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We war so that our little ones may live to see a better tomorrow! And for them, we destroy the Burning Legion!', '', 16418, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them see what we have done to their fel reaver!', '', 16417, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look upon what you have accomplished, soldiers! Even the Legion\'s most fearsome machines are no match for the Horde!', '', 16416, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome. Will you take your rest here, or perhaps a meal?', 16414, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is welcome news indeed. I shall pass along your gratitude to our commanders back on Azeroth.', '', 16413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You give me too much credit, good sir. I regret we cannot be of more assistance in such perilous times.', '', 16412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dismissed.', '', 16411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fighting remains fierce and costly, but your assistance has proven invaluable.', '', 16410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the intelligence you\'ve provided on the enemy and their tactics we\'ve gained a significant edge in the field.', '', 16409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On the contrary, my friend.', '', 16408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Word from the front lines is that your recruits outperform all others in battle.', '', 16407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re doing a fine job, Harbinger.', '', 16406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By your leave, Lord Torvos. I must prepare the next troops for your review.', '', 16405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The techniques he has suggested have been most effective in preparing the troops.', '', 16404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you sir, though I cannot accept your praise without acknowledging the assistance of our guest, Emissary Mordin.', '', 16403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars!', '', 16402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Training complete, sir. Our next batch of recruits are due shortly.', '', 16401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find a way to get me out of here, $c!', '', 16400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find a way to get me out of here, $c.', 16399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warbringers hear my call! Strike down at our enemies!', '', 16398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arzule will have this land in the name of our master!', '', 16397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow to the might of the Doom Lord! You stand no chance!', '', 16396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('INCOMING! Do not let them through! Focus fire! NOW, NOW, NOW!', '', 16395, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get used to it, girls. We\'re out here for the rest of our miserable lives as far as I\'m concerned. Welcome to Hellfire Peninsula, your new home.', '', 16394, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many more of you grunts do I need to send back to mommy and daddy in a body bag before you grow a brain and realize that runnin\' head first into a Legion kill squad is suicide? And don\'t nod your thick skulls at me as if you know what I\'m talkin\' about!', '', 16393, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yea, we got problems. I think that\'s crystal clear. The question is, what are we gonna do about it?', '', 16392, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief\'s put a price on Arazzius\'s head! As of right now, that no-good piece of demon refuse is enemy number one.', '', 16391, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not gonna lie to you, soldiers. We\'re getting our butts kicked out there! Now which one of you is orc enough to do something about it?', '', 16390, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow!  The laughs don\'t drop very often here, do they?', '', 16389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I knew it was going to be like this, I\'d have worn my Greater Boots of Laughter.', '', 16388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on!  These jokes are epic!', '', 16387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I get a buff? I\'m dying up here.', '', 16386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apparently my reputation with you people is hostile.', '', 16385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Perry Gatner! What an act!  The cantina is open all night long, so please, stay and enjoy yourselves!', '', 16384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you all for coming tonight.  Now put your hands together to welcome Shattrath\'s best, Perry Gatner!', '', 16383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey all!  So how long until the jokes spawn?', '', 16382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that the show\'s done, can someone run me through Scarlet Monastery?', '', 16381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are ready to laugh, head over to the World\'s End Tavern!', 'If you are ready to laugh, head over to the World\'s End Tavern!', 16380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To eat!!', '', 16379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never met a tauren I didn\'t like...', '', 16378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check out the comedy stylings of Perry Gatner in just a few minutes!', 'Check out the comedy stylings of Perry Gatner in just a few minutes!', 16377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I wish they\'d go away!', '', 16376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard that gnomes can grant wishes...', '', 16375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love blood elf women.  Especially when they say stuff like this...', '', 16374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A stick!', '', 16373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you call a broken boomerang?', '', 16372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then we met!', '', 16371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wife and I were happy for 23 years...', '', 16370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to get a new fence!!', '', 16369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What time is it when an elekk sits on your fence?', '', 16368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time for slumber! Join the fight!', '', 16367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your feet!', '', 16366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get up!', '', 16365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sleep on your own time!', '', 16364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up, we\'re under attack!', '', 16363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join the fight! Agrama-ka!', '', 16362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next warrior, step up! ', '', 16361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s my support?', '', 16360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall in! Mok-thora ka!', '', 16359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next warrior, now!', '', 16358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Replacement, quickly!', '', 16357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fighter down!', '', 16356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must halt their advance! Take your positions!', '', 16355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gakarah ma!', '', 16354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the line! They must not get through!', '', 16353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-Narash! Defensive positions!', '', 16352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One last impersonation.  It\'s tough, but let\'s see if you can guess who it is...', '', 16351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show them no quarter! Form up!', '', 16350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready! This shouldn\'t take long...', '', 16349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, it\'s time to take these comedic muscles elsewhere. Have a good night all!', '', 16348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Form up! Let\'s make quick work of them!', '', 16347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Line up and crush these fools!', '', 16346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you everyone!  And keep clapping, there is a fly in here and one of you are bound to get it!  Good night!', '', 16345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You guys have been a great audience!  Have a good night!', '', 16344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it over already?  You\'ve been great folks.  Walk safely and have a good night.', '', 16343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! Don\'t forget to tip your waiters! Good night folks.', '', 16341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then gnomes are even worse!  They are always saying stuff like...', '', 16340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the deal with women?  I mean they are always like...', '', 16339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The comedian clears his throat.', '', 16338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impersonation time!!  I call this, \"The Silly Tauren.\"', '', 16337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because they are planted in the spring!', '', 16336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tauren says, \"That\'s a load of bull.\"', '', 16335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s too bad they don\'t stay cute.  There must be some rite of passage in the Barrens called, \"Climb ugly tree and fall out.\"', '', 16334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s a good one, why do watermelons have water in them? ', '', 16333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this gnome tells a tauren that he\'s been to Molten Core.', '', 16332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever noticed that all those cute, orc kids look the same?', '', 16331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools.', '', 16330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to laugh!', '', 16329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey folks, go easy on me... it\'s my first time.', '', 16328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for coming out to see me!  I hope you are ready for a good time, because I am.', '', 16327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa!  Is all that applause for me?  Thanks for coming out!', '', 16326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! Thank you! Thanks for that warm welcome.', '', 16325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya look tired, $c. I be havin\' somethin\' for ya. These amulets, they can help ya leap obstacles and swim through the rivers like ya be born to it. They energize the food ya be eatin\', makin\' yer wounds close before yer eyes!', '', 16324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mere, $r. Ya don\'t want to be riskin\' yerself in a dungeon, do ya? Filthy work, and for what? Some worthless trinket? Nah, what ya need be one of my amulets. Guaranteed to work!', '', 16323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin\' nothin\' on the tried and true mystical methods of ol\' Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!', '', 16322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dangerous out there, innit? Know what ya need? Protection. I can help ya defy death itself! Ya wear this madstone \'round yer neck, see, and then ya be able to come back if ya find yerself in the spirit world! Just a quick jaunt to yer corpse and up ya come, fresh and new!', '', 16321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya look lovesick. Special someone be gettin\' ya down, eh? No worries, no worries. Ya get this medallion from me, ya wear it when ya see \'em, and they be all over ya, $G man:sweetheart;!', '', 16320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look over here, $c! I got somethin\' for ya. Just what ya need. It\'s soap, right... and it\'s on a rope! No offense, $G man:honey;, but yer a little ripe, know what I\'m sayin\'?', '', 16319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Hey, $r! I be havin\' just the thing for ya. Ya ever see a tikbalang? Frightenin\' creatures. Prone to stealin\' ya away. What ya need is one of my tikbalang wards. Guaranteed to ward away all tikbalangs!', '', 16318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll... take a look.', 'I\'ll... take a look.', 16317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, ya couldn\'t resist, could ya? Want to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin\'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!', '', 16316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is someone calling for me?', 16315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is that poor orc yelling about? Someone should see what is going on.', 16314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fruit?  Did somebody say they wanted fruit?', 16313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh? Did someone say something?', 16312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go forth my brothers, and may your light pierce the darkness! The Deceiver must be brought to justice!', '', 16311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, with my blessing, you arise as true sons of the Light!', '', 16310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A moment ago, you knelt as recruits...', '', 16309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last my noble brothers and sisters, our time is at hand!', '', 16308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could have sworn I had more apples.  Grok!', 16307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For countless years, and across the faces of many worlds, draenei have yearned to better embrace the Light and put an end to the darkness. So too have our Scryer brethren held such ambition.', '', 16306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conflict and strife have been our constant companions for as long as any of us can remember.', '', 16305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you all well know, the path of our people has not been an enviable one. Blood elf and draenei alike have been tested.', '', 16303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness in your souls draws you ever closer...', '', 16302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has now come for you to face our enemies on the field of battle. As I speak our brothers and sisters fight to fend off the forces of Kil\'jaeden on the isle of Quel\'Danas.', '', 16301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve not seen a more well-trained group of soldiers in all my years.', '', 16300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been observing your training, my young brothers and sisters.', '', 16299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HA!  I CRUSHED AN APPLE, FRUIT VENDOR!  THIS WILL NOT BE THE LAST!!', 'HA!  I CRUSHED AN APPLE, FRUIT VENDOR!  THIS WILL NOT BE THE LAST!!', 16298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does this fruit vendor not value his life? YOU ARE RUNNING OUT OF TIME FRUIT VENDOR!!', 'Does this fruit vendor not value his life? YOU ARE RUNNING OUT OF TIME FRUIT VENDOR!!', 16297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 53, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
