('They say that the Alliance has found new allies. They will be hard pressed to recover from losing us.', 'They say that the Alliance has found new allies. They will be hard pressed to recover from losing us.', 16188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
