('I have heard rumors that our old friends, the elves, have allied themselves with the Horde. I always said our trust in them was foolish.', 'I have heard rumors that our old friends, the elves, have allied themselves with the Horde. I always said our trust in them was foolish.', 16175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to Ironforge\'s Mystic Ward and speak with the night elf druids there. They can transport you to Moonglade to join in the Lunar Festival celebration.', 'Go to Ironforge\'s Mystic Ward and speak with the night elf druids there. They can transport you to Moonglade to join in the Lunar Festival celebration.', 16174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winter Veil has always been a human thing. To see the goblins and orcs take it up is rather strange.', 'Winter Veil has always been a human thing. To see the goblins and orcs take it up is rather strange.', 16173, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The festival of the moon was ever more important to the kaldorei. The great festival of the druids is surely in full swing.', 'The festival of the moon was ever more important to the kaldorei. The great festival of the druids is surely in full swing.', 16171, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greatfather Winter is only a wyvern\'s ride away to Orgrimmar.', 'Greatfather Winter is only a wyvern\'s ride away to Orgrimmar.', 16170, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tauren Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01', 'Tauren Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01', 16169, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lunar Festival holds special meaning for the tauren. We seek out the wisdom of our elders across the world.', 'The Lunar Festival holds special meaning for the tauren. We seek out the wisdom of our elders across the world.', 16168, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winter Veil just isn\'t the same now, but going through the motions still makes me feel something.', 'Winter Veil just isn\'t the same now, but going through the motions still makes me feel something.', 16167, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Undead Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01', 'Undead Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01', 16166, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Undead Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Lunar Festival) 01', 'Undead Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Lunar Festival) 01', 16165, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though we do not truly understand the traditions of Winter Veil, we have taken to them.', 'Though we do not truly understand the traditions of Winter Veil, we have taken to them.', 16164, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Dark Portal opens again, we could go home to Draenor.', 'If the Dark Portal opens again, we could go home to Draenor.', 16163, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my understanding that the people of the Alliance celebrate this Winter Veil in Ironforge.', 'It is my understanding that the people of the Alliance celebrate this Winter Veil in Ironforge.', 16161, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It feels like everyone wants to kiss me under the mistletoe.', 'It feels like everyone wants to kiss me under the mistletoe.', 16158, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night Elf Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01', 'Night Elf Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01', 16157, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lunar Festival holds special meaning for the night elves. We seek out the wisdom of our elders across the world.', 'The Lunar Festival holds special meaning for the night elves. We seek out the wisdom of our elders across the world.', 16156, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ironforge rarely looks as splendid as it does during the feast of Winter Veil.', 'Ironforge rarely looks as splendid as it does during the feast of Winter Veil.', 16155, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarf Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01', 'Dwarf Gossip NPC - Periodic Talk (Expansion Prologue) 01', 16154, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lunar Festival is a special time for us. We seek out our ancient elders, the Earthen, and pay homage to them.', 'The Lunar Festival is a special time for us. We seek out our ancient elders, the Earthen, and pay homage to them.', 16153, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lunar Festival celebration being held by the druids is taking place in Moonglade. If that\'s too far for you to travel, they are offering transportation just outside Stormwind.', 'The Lunar Festival celebration being held by the druids is taking place in Moonglade. If that\'s too far for you to travel, they are offering transportation just outside Stormwind.', 16151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cracks open, filling the nest with yolk.', '', 16150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets loose a terrifying shriek.', '', 16149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, get over here.', '', 16148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Psst, $n, get over here.', '', 16147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have marks to redeem!', 'I have marks to redeem!', 16146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything for you, $n!', '', 16145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wazat, I have done something foolish and have lost my key as a result of this action. Could I trouble you for a spare?', 'Wazat, I have done something foolish and have lost my key as a result of this action. Could I trouble you for a spare?', 16144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again, $n! Just a few more adjustments and the trajectory of the jump will be perfect!', '', 16143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am the quartermaster, here. Did you need provisions?', 16142, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is regrettable that, among our many enemies in Hellfire Peninsula, the orcs of Hellfire Citadel stand among them.$B$BBut... who better to challenge and hone the Horde... than orcs?', 16141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('', 'For years, Honor Hold has stood against the horrors of Hellfire Peninsula.  Now, now that the portal has reopened and aid streams in from Azeroth, perhaps this bloody stalemate will end.', 16140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh sweet, delicious, spotted eggs - you will be mine... ', '', 16139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I could get this blasted machine working!', '', 16138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They look so delicious...', '', 16137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s driving me crazy. I cannot reach those damned eggs!', '', 16136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have for sale?', 'What do you have for sale?', 16135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have for sale?', 'What do you have for sale?', 16134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I carry odds and ends, but mostly just odds.', 16133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you lost? Most of the town\'s vendors are situated near the center of town.', 16132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to stable my pet.', 'I wish to stable my pet.', 16131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you need to stable your pet?', 16130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have for sale?', 'What do you have for sale?', 16129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sell wares that crafters need. Just the basics, nothing fancy.', '', 16128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares.', 'I wish to browse your wares.', 16127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you looking for reagents or poison supplies? If so, you\'ve come to the right place!', '', 16126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares.', 'I wish to browse your wares.', 16125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will take a sharp blade and reinforced armor to bring tranquility back to Nagrand. Shall I repair your equipment so that you may mete justice?', '', 16124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me again what you know!', 'Tell me again what you know!', 16123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have just the thing you need to cast your spell.', '', 16122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take your time, look the weapons over.  I also repair weapons and armor if you need such services.', 16121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Alliance has taken control of The Bone Wastes!|r', '', 16120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Horde has taken control of The Bone Wastes!|r', '', 16119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand... there is more to discuss.', '', 16118, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take a look around and let me know if there\'s anything that you\'re interested in.', 16116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rocks are here when we first enter this world, and they will remain long after we pass.', '', 16115, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('If you have the money, I have what you need.', '', 16114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are stoic, the spirits of the earth. Through them, the shaman learns to endure the hardships of life.', '', 16113, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The earth spirits are very much present in this chamber, my child. After all, we are underground, are we not?', '', 16112, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s chuckles softly.', '%s chuckles softly.', 16111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What about the earth spirits?', 'What about the earth spirits?', 16110, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like anything that you see, $c?', 16109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand, my children... that\'s enough for now.', '', 16108, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods to himself and clears his throat.', '%s nods to himself and clears his throat.', 16107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s enough to drive a man to drink.\n\n', 'It\'s enough to drive a man to drink.\n\n', 16106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hic... What a calim... a culamu... uhh calamit... Err, what a disaster!\n\n', 'Hic... What a calim... a culamu... uhh calamit... Err, what a disaster!\n\n', 16105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Both students close their eyes, straining to hear the voices.', 'Both students close their eyes, straining to hear the voices.', 16104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luckily, I managed to salvage a few bottles.\n', 'Luckily, I managed to salvage a few bottles.\n', 16103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foul deeds, these.\n', 'Foul deeds, these.\n', 16102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All muscle and no brain, that\'s what peons are! They\'re great when you can motivate them, but they have to be \'kick\' started, if you know what I mean.', '', 16101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have known better than to have given Silanna that tome of cantrips.\n', 'I should have known better than to have given Silanna that tome of cantrips.\n', 16100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah! Every time I load something into the wagon, it reappears here within moments!\n', 'Gah! Every time I load something into the wagon, it reappears here within moments!\n', 16099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cakes, pastries, even bread - anything but cheese!\n', 'Cakes, pastries, even bread - anything but cheese!', 16098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why couldn\'t mother have chosen something else to dedicate herself to?\n', 'Why couldn\'t mother have chosen something else to dedicate herself to?', 16097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hours would pass so much more sweetly.\n', 'The hours would pass so much more sweetly.\n', 16096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All day, surrounded by the stench of bad feet.\n', 'All day, surrounded by the stench of bad feet.\n', 16095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh what a dreadful job!\n', 'Ooh what a dreadful job!\n', 16094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I had some wine to go with my cheese...\n', 'If only I had some wine to go with my cheese...\n', 16093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once they\'re dealt with we can dedicate more resources to the war effort.\n', 'Once they\'re dealt with we can dedicate more resources to the war effort.\n', 16092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something must be done about these Wretched...\n', 'Something must be done about these Wretched...\n', 16091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They call you a monster. But they\'re the monsters, not you. Farewell, Thrall.', 16090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goodbye, Taretha. I will never forget your kindness.', '', 16089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her fate is regrettably unavoidable.', '', 16088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That spell should wipe their memories of us and what just happened. All they should remember now is what reality would be like without the attempted temporal interference. Well done. Thrall will journey on to find his destiny, and Taretha...', '', 16087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe I can explain everything to you two if you give me a moment of your time.', '', 16086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thrall, I\'ve never met these people before in my life.', 16085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then who are these people?', '', 16084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad you\'re safe, Taretha. None of this would have been possible without your friends. They made all of this happen.', '', 16083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m free! Thank you all!', 16082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Close your eyes, my children, and listen to the water within these halls.', '', 16081, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The water spirits are perhaps the most outspoken. They are generous and understanding. Indeed, if you are having trouble hearing the voices, it is with water that you should begin.', '', 16080, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The water here is peaceful, is it not? Listening to the trickle from the ceiling can aid you in finding its true voice...', '', 16079, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is enough for now. Come.', '', 16078, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is extended to the spirits themselves. They are often quick to anger; it is important that you learn to listen without falling prey to their tempers.', '', 16077, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strength of fire lies in change. Its strength is considerable, but ever-shifting... unpredictable.', '', 16076, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Focus upon that warmth as I speak...', '', 16075, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The students nod slowly, eyes rapt on their teacher.', 'The students nod slowly, eyes rapt on their teacher.', 16074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you feel the warmth here, my children?', '', 16073, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, welcome, to the recently appropriated and callously renamed Steamwheedle Stadium!', '', 16072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is the greatest hero the arakkoa have ever known.$B$BIt is said that in ancient times, he built the city of Skettis with his own claws. He was our greatest champion and defender, but he left us when we turned away from the veneration of Rukhmar.$B$BWe came to worship a new master, one who promised us untold power and status in the cosmos.$B$BThere are some who say that Terokk and Rukhmar are one, and he withdrew his presence from us when we turned away from him.', '', 16071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is this Terokk you keep mentioning?', 'Who is this Terokk you keep mentioning?', 16070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I find the relics of Terokk?', 'Where can I find the relics of Terokk?', 16069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are the Sethekk?', 'Who are the Sethekk?', 16068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Talon King Ikiss?', 'Who is Talon King Ikiss?', 16067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Talon King\' Ikiss is one of the leaders of the Sethekk, along with my brother, Darkweaver Syth.$B$BIt was they who led the exodus of the Sethekk from Skettis to the ruins of Auchindoun. In the beginning, Ikiss was a charismatic leader, but he has descended into madness.$B$BNow, he openly proclaims that he is Terokk reborn! He truly expects the arakkoa to bend knee to him as their ruler. Can you believe his arrogance?', '', 16066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I was last in the halls, Talon King Ikiss carried Terokk\'s Quill with him, as a sign of his authority.$B$BMy brother, Darkweaver Syth, wore Terokk\'s Mask during our rituals.$B$BAs for the Saga of Terokk, there\'s no way of knowing exactly where it is, but they usually kept it at the center of one of their rune circles in the great vaulted halls.', '', 16065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sethekk believe themselves to be the true and most loyal followers of the master of all arakkoa. Do not ask about the master, $r, for his mysteries are for the feathered people alone.$B$BThe Sethekk interpreted the destruction of Auchindoun to be the arrival of our master on this planet. They set out for the ruins, taking with them the relics of our greatest hero, Terokk.$B$BThey still seek the master in the temple\'s ruins, but I came to see through their lies. I am no longer one of them.', '', 16064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ring of Trials was once of place of great glory and honor. But then, the Steamwheedle Cartel came, with their wagons of gold and quill pens sharper than any orc axe...', '', 16063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your blood will coat the walls of Kil\'sorrow!', 16062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come. There is more to study than the secrets on the wind.', '', 16061, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s smiles to himself as he watches the students fidget in their concentration.', '%s smiles to himself as he watches the students fidget in their concentration.', 16060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just don\'t ask me where I got it...\n', 'Just don\'t ask me where I got it...\n', 16059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Having trouble dealing with the Wretched? I\'ve got just what you need.\n', 'Having trouble dealing with the Wretched? I\'ve got just what you need.\n', 16058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are flighty, these spirits, and easily distracted... but they will share their secrets with those who know how to listen.', '', 16057, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! Hurry, though, we don\'t want to be caught!', '', 16056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits of the air can be found even here, underground. They dislike being surrounded, constricted by the earth... their precious freedom is limited here.', '', 16055, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll have you out of there in just a moment.', 'I\'ll have you out of there in just a moment.', 16054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now\'s our chance! Let me out of this cage!', '', 16053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, $r, get me out of here! Unlocking the cage will surely attract my brother\'s attention. Kill Darkweaver Syth!', '', 16052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Isfar sighs.>$B$BA couple of treehouses don\'t make a home, but it was vast improvement over the Sethekk Halls.$B$BComfortable as it was in Shattrath, I can\'t bring myself to return to my true home in Skettis without my sister. She\'s still trapped in the Sethekk Halls, held prisoner by our older brother.', '', 16051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, teacher.', '', 16050, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for freeing me, $n! I\'m going to make my way to Shattrath!', '', 16049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah!  This place is not yet worthy of my infliction!', '', 16048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fate is sealed, Azeroth!  I will find the Aspect Shards, and then you will not stand against our might!', '', 16047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth has cowered too long under our shadow!  Now, feel the power of the Burning Crusade and despair!', '', 16046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cower, little worms!  Your feeble heroes are nothing!  Your saviors will be our first feast!', '', 16045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
