('', 'Thank you for helping Thrall escape, friends. Now I only hope you can help me as well. I awoke this morning to find myself trapped in this magical prison. A strange wizard told me that I would have to stay here for a while.', 15987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s here, stop him!', 'He\'s here, stop him!', 15986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, many apologies young master. You must be at least this high to utilize a teleportation spell.$B$B<Maltrake makes an approximation of height with his right hand, hovering it at about knee length.>$B$BCome back when you\'ve grown up.', '', 15985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
