('What is it that you want, $r?', '', 15939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve just arrived here and already we\'ve buried too many of our friends and comrades.', 15938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, don\'t say anything to me. I don\'t want to get into any more trouble with them.', 'Please, don\'t say anything to me. I don\'t want to get into any more trouble with them.', 15937, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Train me in the trade of mining.', 'Train me in the trade of mining.', 15936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In my years as a member of Explorers\' League, I\'ve been all over Azeroth, but I\'ve never seen anythin\' quite like Bloodmyst. ', '', 15935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to see you again, $n. You have High Chief Stillpine\'s deepest gratitude for rescuing his daughter from the clutches of the Bristlelimb.', '', 15934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you greet Ambassador Frasaboo in the furbolg language, he smiles.>$B$BYou must be the one spoken of in the prophecy. It is a great honor to meet you.$B$BI am Ambassador Frasaboo, High Chief Stillpine\'s representative in Blood Watch.', '', 15933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t look so surprised to see me here, $r. The coming of the draenei and their alliance with my people was foretold by Kurz the Revelator.', '', 15932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your goods.', 'I wish to browse your goods.', 15931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will repay the betrayal of the Alliance! We shall never forget, and never forgive!', 15930, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nature lives at peace with magic. With both, there is no limit to our future.', 15929, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those who would speak out against magic are enemies of progress. ', 15928, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will pay back the Alliance for their betrayal a thousandfold. We will never forgive and never forget.', 15927, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magisters are wise and will plot a prosperous course for our future.', '', 15926, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you say our lives are not better now? How can you deny the betterment of our lives?', '', 15925, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lor\'themar has remade Silvermoon into something we may truly be proud of.', '', 15924, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you not see how magic has made our city great?', '', 15923, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should take care of that. Summon me if you have further need of my services.', '', 15922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our new allies will bring us back to our former glory. These bonds will be true, and we will not be betrayed again!', '', 15921, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The magisters will guide us back to glory.', 15920, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lor\'themar must hear us! We will not be silenced!', '', 15919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lend us your voices! Now is the time we must act to save our people.', '', 15918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we speak as one, we cannot be ignored!', 15917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Tarren Mill lies just west of here. Since time is of the essence...', '', 15916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tarren Mill.', 'Tarren Mill.', 15915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do no such thing. I simply cannot leave Taretha in danger while I run off into the mountains. I am no coward. Now, where is she?', '', 15914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The situation is rather complicated, Thrall. It would be best for you to head into the mountains now, before more of Blackmoore\'s men show up. We\'ll make sure Taretha is safe.', 'The situation is rather complicated, Thrall. It would be best for you to head into the mountains now, before more of Blackmoore\'s men show up. We\'ll make sure Taretha is safe.', 15913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you mean by this? Is Taretha in danger?', '', 15912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taretha cannot see you, Thrall.', 'Taretha cannot see you, Thrall.', 15911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you friends, I owe my freedom to you. Where is Taretha? I hoped to see her one last time and thank her before leaving into the mountains.', '', 15910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall! You didn\'t really think you would escape, did you?  You and your allies shall answer to Blackmoore... after I\'ve had my fun.', '', 15909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A rider approaches.', '', 15908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all sssuffer!', '', 15907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ssslay them!', '', 15906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This does not concern you. Be on your way.', 'This does not concern you. Be on your way.', 15905, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nothing to see here. Move along.', 'There is nothing to see here. Move along.', 15904, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zzz... I\'m so... beautiful... zzz...', 'Zzz... I\'m so... beautiful... zzz...\n', 15903, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zzz... all lies... doomed, all of us... zzz...', 'Zzz... all lies... doomed, all of us... zzz...', 15902, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zzz... wine... so good... zzz...', 'Zzz... wine... so good... zzz...', 15901, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zzz...', 'Zzz...', 15900, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?  What is it?', '', 15899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gruesome visage of a leering orc stares back at you from this poster.  His raiments are obviously of a warlock nature.', '', 15898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?  You already killed him!$B$BI was hoping to study Quagmirran, perhaps interact with him.  But now all that I\'ll be studying is his corpse.$B$B<sigh>$B$BPlease let me out of this cage.  I\'ll take a look at him and then make my own way out of here.', '', 15897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Intrudersss with the prisssoner!  Kill them!!!', '', 15896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders, you dangle upon the precipice of oblivion! The Burning Legion comes and with it comes your end.\n', '', 15895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go.', '', 15894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As long as we\'re going with a new plan, I may as well pick up a weapon and some armor.', '', 15893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s enough out of him.', '', 15892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the meaning of this? GUARDS!', '', 15891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do NOT let the spy escape!', 'Do NOT let the spy escape!', 15890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Notices of bounties and job openings are posted here.', '', 15889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The high elf spy is escaping.  Get her!', 'The high elf spy is escaping.  Get her!', 15888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok, I think I can make it on my own from here.  Thank you so much for breaking me out of there!', 15887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t these guys ever give up?', 15886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh oh, bad elves!', 15885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, let\'s do this!', 15884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You sure you\'re ready?  Take a moment.', 15883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok, let\'s get out of here!', 15882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t leave me in here!  Cause if you do, I will find you...', 15881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you get a chance do you think you could let me out of here?', 15880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<cough> <cough> Damsel in distress over here!', 15879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello?  Help?', 15878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi!  I know that you\'re with the Horde, and I\'m with the Alliance, but do you think we could put that behind us this once?  I\'d really like some help getting out of here.', 15877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi!  Do you think you might help me to get out of here?', 15876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We control access to the Exodar\'s storage facilities. Are there goods you wish to store or remove?', 'We control access to the Exodar\'s storage facilities. Are there goods you wish to store or remove?', 15875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Exodar\'s vaults are vast and well-protected. Your goods will come to no harm here.', 'The Exodar\'s vaults are vast and well-protected. Your goods will come to no harm here.', 15874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Bank of Silvermoon, $g sir : ma\'am;. Would you care to access the depository?', 'Welcome to the Bank of Silvermoon, $g sir : ma\'am;. Would you care to access the depository?', 15873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings. How may we of the Royal Exchange Bank assist you today?', 'Greetings. How may we of the Royal Exchange Bank assist you today?', 15872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, $t citizen : citizen;, what matter of import do you have to bring to my attention?', '', 15871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to improve your weapon skills?  Our weapon master is located on the highest level of the Trader\'s Tier, on the Warriors\' Terrace.', 'You wish to improve your weapon skills?  Our weapon master is located on the highest level of the Trader\'s Tier, on the Warriors\' Terrace.', 15870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for choosing the Bank of Silvermoon. What may I do for you today?', 'Thank you for choosing the Bank of Silvermoon. What may I do for you today?', 15869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Royal Exchange Bank, $g sir : ma\'am;. How may I help you?', 'Welcome to the Royal Exchange Bank, $g sir : ma\'am;. How may I help you?', 15868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking to be a great warrior?  War does not make one great.  Still, you will find our great warrior trainers on the Warriors\' Terrace, overlooking the rest of the Trader\'s Tier.', 'Looking to be a great warrior?  War does not make one great.  Still, you will find our great warrior trainers on the Warriors\' Terrace, overlooking the rest of the Trader\'s Tier.', 15867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting.  The wanted poster calls for the extermination of the local moth population.  Something about royal teromoths.', '', 15866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The information on this wanted poster indicates that you don\'t yet qualify for the task at hand.$B$BYou should definitely check back later, though.', '', 15865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, we wore one piece jumpsuits. Thanks to our innovative tailors, we no longer wear such impractical outfits. You can find these fashion lifesavers in the Trader\'s Tier.', 'Long ago, we wore one piece jumpsuits. Thanks to our innovative tailors, we no longer wear such impractical outfits. You can find these fashion lifesavers in the Trader\'s Tier.', 15864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find Arthaid, our stable master, outside of the Caregiver Center. He is located on the upper level of the central hub, near the Exodar\'s main entrance.', 'You can find Arthaid, our stable master, outside of the Caregiver Center. He is located on the upper level of the central hub, near the Exodar\'s main entrance.', 15863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find the Exodar\'s skinning trainers in the Trader\'s Tier with the leatherworkers.  May the Light bless you.', 'You will find the Exodar\'s skinning trainers in the Trader\'s Tier with the leatherworkers.  May the Light bless you.', 15862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find a number of shaman trainers in the Crystal Hall. Perhaps you should visit Farseer Nobundo there, and show the Broken some pity. Light be with you.', 'You will find a number of shaman trainers in the Crystal Hall. Perhaps you should visit Farseer Nobundo there, and show the Broken some pity. Light be with you.', 15861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Which profession trainer are you looking for?', 'Which profession trainer are you looking for?', 15860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our priest trainers can be found within the Order of Light\'s chamber, at the entrance to the Seat of the Naaru. Light be with you.', 'Our priest trainers can be found within the Order of Light\'s chamber, at the entrance to the Seat of the Naaru. Light be with you.', 15859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Exodar\'s paladin trainers are found in the luminous Chapel of Light in the Seat of the Naaru.', 'The Exodar\'s paladin trainers are found in the luminous Chapel of Light in the Seat of the Naaru.', 15858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find our mining trainers towards the back of the Trader\'s Tier.', 'You will find our mining trainers towards the back of the Trader\'s Tier.', 15857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings of the Naaru. What can I help you find?', 'Blessings of the Naaru. What can I help you find?', 15856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find our mages in the Vault of Lights.  Go with the Light.', 'You will find our mages in the Vault of Lights.  Go with the Light.', 15855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find the Exodar\'s leatherworkers in the Trader\'s Tier.  May the Light bless you.', 'You will find the Exodar\'s leatherworkers in the Trader\'s Tier.  May the Light bless you.', 15854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, aye, sir.  Right away!', '', 15853, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lieutenant, I want you to make that your top priority.  Notify anyone that you think can help.', '', 15852, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we\'re to help with that in any way we\'ll need more people.  Call some of the scouts in to help with that.', '', 15851, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time for this, lieutenant.  Make sure that you handle it.', '', 15850, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s troubling news indeed.  See to it that it\'s taken care of immediately!', '', 15849, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farii trains those interested in jewel crafting. You can find her in the Crystal Hall near the cavern there.', 'Farii trains those interested in jewel crafting. You can find her in the Crystal Hall near the cavern there.', 15848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?', 'Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?', 15847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Caregiver Center is located above the central Vault of Light, near the Exodar\'s main entrance.', 'Our Caregiver Center is located above the central Vault of Light, near the Exodar\'s main entrance.', 15846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek the hunters?  You will find them on the second level of the Trader\'s Tier, in the Hunters\' Sanctum.', 'You seek the hunters?  You will find them on the second level of the Trader\'s Tier, in the Hunters\' Sanctum.', 15845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have reports from a scout in the field that one of the Cenarion druids has been taken captive up at Firewing Point.', '', 15844, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('One of our scouts is reporting that a shadowy group has moved into the ruins of Grangol\'var Village.  Oops, this report is over a week old.', '', 15843, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('That group that recently arrived from Honor Hold -- they\'re mercs!  They\'re starting to stir up trouble.  Maybe I should have a talk with them?', '', 15842, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('You will find our herbalist, Cemmorhan, against the back wall of the Vault of Lights.', 'You will find our herbalist, Cemmorhan, against the back wall of the Vault of Lights.', 15841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of our merchants has gone missing!', '', 15840, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad news.  We\'ve been hit again.  They\'re gone, but the front sentry tower is on fire.', '', 15839, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('As you say, sir.  It would appear that someone failed to mention to me that the druids at the Cenarion Thicket have been wiped out!', '', 15838, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Yes, lieutenant?  Report.', '', 15837, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What else could possibly go wrong?', '', 15836, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it now, Gravel?', '', 15835, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At ease, lieutenant.  Go on.', '', 15834, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cap\'n, sir, we have a slight problem.', '', 15833, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did this get missed?!', '', 15832, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I picked a bad day to stop drinking.', '', 15831, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is not even remotely imaginable!', '', 15830, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?  What\'s this?!', '', 15829, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find Funaam, the guild master, near the Trader\'s Tier entrance.', 'You will find Funaam, the guild master, near the Trader\'s Tier entrance.', 15828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rifling through the stacks of books and scrolls on the table, %s begins to examine one in particular with interest.', '', 15827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find Erett the fishing trainer in the Crystal Hall near the Light Blessed Waters.', 'You can find Erett the fishing trainer in the Crystal Hall near the Light Blessed Waters.', 15826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you stop--', 'Will you stop--', 15825, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop!', 'Stop!', 15824, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light! It is a blessing to have one who cares about the well-being of others. At a time like this we need all the help we can get. Nus can train you in the ways of first aid. She is near the crystal cave in the Crystal Hall. Light be with you.', 'By the Light! It is a blessing to have one who cares about the well-being of others. At a time like this we need all the help we can get. Nus can train you in the ways of first aid. She is near the crystal cave in the Crystal Hall. Light be with you.', 15823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you are willing to help repair the mighty Exodar?  I heard it will take years before the Exodar is fully functional once more.  You have two hours.  Just kidding.  Our engineers are located on the lower levels of the Trader\'s Tier.  Go with the Light.', 'So, you are willing to help repair the mighty Exodar?  I heard it will take years before the Exodar is fully functional once more.  You have two hours.  Just kidding.  Our engineers are located on the lower levels of the Trader\'s Tier.  Go with the Light.', 15822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enchanters are located in the Crystal Hall opposite the jewel crafters.  Light be with you.', 'Our enchanters are located in the Crystal Hall opposite the jewel crafters.  Light be with you.', 15821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Druid?  Ah... Shalannius, you seek Shalannius.  You shall find this night elf outside of the Exodar, near Valaar\'s Berth.', 'Druid?  Ah... Shalannius, you seek Shalannius.  You shall find this night elf outside of the Exodar, near Valaar\'s Berth.', 15820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What trainer do you seek?', 'What trainer do you seek?', 15819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miall is our chief blacksmith on the Exodar. She can be found on the lower level of the Trader\'s Tier.  Go with the Light.', 'Miall is our chief blacksmith on the Exodar. She can be found on the lower level of the Trader\'s Tier.  Go with the Light.', 15818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find our battlemasters in the Vault of the Lights.  There is also one \"Miglik Blotstrom\" staying with Caregiver Breel, who claims to represent an arena fighting circuit on this world.', 'You will find our battlemasters in the Vault of the Lights.  There is also one \"Miglik Blotstrom\" staying with Caregiver Breel, who claims to represent an arena fighting circuit on this world.', 15817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stephanos is our Hippogryph master.  He resides in the Exodar\'s central hub.  May the Light bless you on your travels.', 'Stephanos is our Hippogryph master.  He resides in the Exodar\'s central hub.  May the Light bless you on your travels.', 15816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find our bank in the Exodar\'s central hub.  Go with the Light.', 'You will find our bank in the Exodar\'s central hub.  Go with the Light.', 15815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though the acquisition of wealth is no longer a driving force in our lives, we understand that money makes the world go \'round. You will find our auction house in the Seat of the Naaru.', 'Though the acquisition of wealth is no longer a driving force in our lives, we understand that money makes the world go \'round. You will find our auction house in the Seat of the Naaru.', 15814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find our alchemist trainers in the Vault of Lights. Go with the Light.', 'You will find our alchemist trainers in the Vault of Lights. Go with the Light.', 15813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hear Bertelm\'s been collecting fur for his latest creation. He told you it\'s going to be a cloak, right?$B$BIt isn\'t. That\'s just the cover he\'s using to keep his wolf fur hatband a secret. He wouldn\'t put all that work into collecting the fur just to soil it in battle!', 15812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darn, and I kind of liked you.', 'Darn, and I kind of liked you.', 15811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?  Isn\'t that the new guy?', 'What?  Isn\'t that the new guy?', 15810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought we were going to be best friends!', 'I thought we were going to be best friends!', 15809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, yeah... get \'em!', 'Um, yeah... get \'em!', 15808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Special lunch?  How about a special death!', 'Special lunch?  How about a special death!', 15807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can forget about those drinks later!', 'You can forget about those drinks later!', 15806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re off the leather ball team!', 'You\'re off the leather ball team!', 15805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could you do this?  I confided in you!', 'How could you do this?  I confided in you!', 15804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who do you think you are that you can walk in here and address me?  I\'m the leader of the Shadow Council in this village.  Get out of my sight!$B$BIf I see you again, I\'ll be the last person that you ever see.  Understand?$B$BPerhaps you\'d like to be buried in the labyrinth of Auchindoun, or sacrificed to Murmur?', '', 15803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('<He leans in closer.>$B$BJust between you and me, I\'m thinking about \'mustering\' out one of these nights.  You know what I mean?', '<She leans in closer.>$B$BJust between you and me, I\'m thinking about \'mustering\' out one of these nights.  You know what I mean?', 15802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('I hope this place pans out as a forward base for Shadow Council operations.  I know it sounds weird, but I kind of miss the Shadow Labyrinth.', 'I hope this place pans out as a forward base for Shadow Council operations.  I know it sounds weird, but I kind of miss the Shadow Labyrinth.', 15801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interested in joining up for the leather ball league?  We play Monday through Wednesday, mostly. $B$BYou\'re welcome to join us after this shift.  We\'re going to toss it around.', 'Interested in joining up for the leather ball league?  We play Monday through Wednesday, mostly. $B$BYou\'re welcome to join us after this shift.  We\'re going to toss it around.', 15800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re interested, a couple of us are going into Shattrath for drinks later.', 'If you\'re interested, a couple of us are going into Shattrath for drinks later.', 15799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, you must be the new recruit!  Good to meet you!$B$BAny word from the Shadow Labyrinth in Auchindoun on whether we\'ve regained control of Murmur yet?', 'Hey there, you must be the new recruit!  Good to meet you!$B$BAny word from the Shadow Labyrinth in Auchindoun on whether we\'ve regained control of Murmur yet?', 15798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('I joined up because they said they\'d pay my way into the academy.  My uncle says that I can go next season!', 'I joined up because they said they\'d pay my way into the academy.  My uncle says that I can go next season!', 15797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('They don\'t pay us enough for this.  But this ruined village sure beats skulking around inside of Auchindoun.', 'They don\'t pay us enough for this.  But this ruined village sure beats skulking around inside of Auchindoun.', 15796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear that they lost total control of Murmur in the Shadow Labyrinth?!', 'Did you hear that they lost total control of Murmur in the Shadow Labyrinth?!', 15795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must have made a misstep somewhere to be assigned here.', 15794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve a duty out here, $g boy : girl;, to see to it that we don\'t let anyone surprise us.$B$BThat means proactive action!', '', 15793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scout Neftis, I need another disguise.', 'Scout Neftis, I need another disguise.', 15792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to figure out what this shadowy group is doing here at Grangol\'var Village!', 15791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Again, I thank you, $n.  Without your aid we would never have been able to deal with the Shadow Council here at Grangol\'var Village.', 15790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, thank you for dealing with the mystery of the Shadow Council at Grangol\'var Village.', '', 15789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Private Weeks, I need another disguise.', 'Private Weeks, I need another disguise.', 15788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to figure out what this shadowy group is up to no matter what!', '', 15787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You!  You don\'t belong here!', '', 15786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are more of the incendiary devices, $n. Be careful with these, they can cause a great deal of disruption to time if used improperly.', '', 15785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a pack of incendiary bombs.', 'I need a pack of incendiary bombs.', 15784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is precious, never waste it.', '', 15783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there anything I can do for you, Greatmother?', 'Is there anything I can do for you, Greatmother?', 15782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The duty of a clan mother is to listen. To listen to the wind and the water and the fire and the earth. To gather information for her clan in the way others gather furs to stay warm. It is the spirits that I commune with... In my dreams, Mother Kashur speaks to me like the spirits that spoke to her once... When I pass, I will speak to Drakia and Celestine in this manner.$B$B<Greatmother Geyah smiles.>', 15781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this duty?', 'What is this duty?', 15780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Greatmother Geyah smiles.>$B$BI am old. It is my time. When I pass, my spirit will move on to the spirit realm. It is there that I will stand with my ancestors. It is there that we will watch over our people.$B$BWhen Garad was alive Mother Kashur\'s duty was the same as my duty now.', 15779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Left? How can you choose to leave?', 'Left? How can you choose to leave?', 15778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish I knew, dear. He will not listen to you nor will he listen to me. In truth, it is why I am still here. It is why I have not left with Mother Kashur. He must find his heart. Our people will not survive through the winter without leadership.', 15777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can be done? I have tried many different things. I have done my best to help the people of Nagrand. Each time I have approached Garrosh, he has dismissed me.', 'What can be done? I have tried many different things. I have done my best to help the people of Nagrand. Each time I have approached Garrosh, he has dismissed me.', 15776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Greatmother Geyah laughs weakly.>$B$BOf course not, dear. But it\'s not me that has to believe...$B$BGarrosh can lead the Mag\'har. He is strong and wise. All of the spirits approve of him. He just needs to believe in himself. He fears so much... He fears so deeply that if he lets himself go, his rage will consume him and all that would be near him.', 15775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you believe that?', 'Do you believe that?', 15774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They have grown up here. We kept them safe from harm. We did the best that we could in nursing them back to health. Many perished but many, many more grew strong. Like Garrosh...$B$B<Greatmother Geyah sighs.>$B$BHe has lost his heart, you know. He tells me that I am his balance. That without me, the blood lust that consumed his father and ultimately cursed our people would take him over.', 15773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You raised all of the orcs here, Greatmother?', 'You raised all of the orcs here, Greatmother?', 15772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, dear. I am Geyah, matron of the Mag\'har.$B$B<Greatmother Geyah coughs.>$B$BIf you are here, it would be safe to assume that the portal has opened. Most of the orcs here were too young or too sick to remember the Dark Portal.$B$B<Greatmother Geyah points to the orcs around her.>$B$BMany of them were orphans or would soon become orphans. Aye, Blackhand would have it no other way. Keep the sick from the healthy. Only the strong would survive... Or so they say.', 15771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, Greatmother. Garrosh told me that you wanted to speak with me.', 'Hello, Greatmother. Garrosh told me that you wanted to speak with me.', 15770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, young $r.', 15769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I was just giving our leader here a progress report on how everything is proceeding according to plan.  It should only be a few more weeks and we\'ll have this place back in shape.$B$BWe may want the Shadow Council to only staff the village with orcs, however.  That way we can make an ancestral claim and work undercover.$B$BWait a minute.  Do I know you?  What\'s your name?', 'Well, I was just giving our leader here a progress report on how everything is proceeding according to plan.  It should only be a few more weeks and we\'ll have this place back in shape.$B$BWe may want the Shadow Council to only staff the village with orcs, however.  That way we can make an ancestral claim and work undercover.$B$BWait a minute.  Do I know you?  What\'s your name?', 15768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('Advisor, what\'s the latest news?', 'Advisor, what\'s the latest news?', 15767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what is it exactly that you think I can do for you?  Can\'t you see that I\'m very busy here discussing matters of import with our illustrious leader?$B$BBe quick about your business or I\'ll have you beaten, dog!', 'And what is it exactly that you think I can do for you?  Can\'t you see that I\'m very busy here discussing matters of import with our illustrious leader?$B$BBe quick about your business or I\'ll have you beaten, dog!', 15766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 25, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not one of us!  Guards!$B$BOh please, don\'t hurt me!  Not the face!  Not the face!', 'You\'re not one of us!  Guards!$B$BOh please, don\'t hurt me!  Not the face!  Not the face!', 15765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Practicing!  Soon I\'ll be good enough to join the other summoners and take my turn inside the Shadow Labyrinth at Auchindoun.$B$BI hope that I\'ll get the chance to summon something big!  Maybe something as big as Murmur, though I wouldn\'t lose control of him!', 'Practicing!  Soon I\'ll be good enough to join the other summoners and take my turn inside the Shadow Labyrinth at Auchindoun.$B$BI hope that I\'ll get the chance to summon something big!  Maybe something as big as Murmur, though I wouldn\'t lose control of him!', 15764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing there?', 'What are you doing there?', 15763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?  Darn it all, now I\'ll have to start over from scratch!', 'Yes?  Darn it all, now I\'ll have to start over from scratch!', 15762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?  Who are you?$B$B<The initiate holds his hands up.>$B$BLook, how about I just go back to my practice and you ignore me?', 'What?  Who are you?$B$B<The initiate holds her hands up.>$B$BLook, how about I just go back to my practice and you ignore me?', 15761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I know you?  Look, I don\'t want any trouble.  I just fix things around here.', 'Do I know you?  Look, I don\'t want any trouble.  I just fix things around here.', 15760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s it look like I\'m doing?  I\'m fixing the place up - all on my own I might add - so that we can move in!$B$BDo I know you?', 'What\'s it look like I\'m doing?  I\'m fixing the place up - all on my own I might add - so that we can move in!$B$BDo I know you?', 15759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s it look like I\'m doing?  I\'m fixing the place up - all on my own I might add - so that we can move in!$B$BWith a base of operations out here in the forest, it\'ll be easier to keep track of what Shattrath, Allerian, Stonebreaker and the Cenarion druids are all up to.  Our base in Auchindoun is just too inconvenient for that.$B$BWait a minute, do I know you?', 'What\'s it look like I\'m doing?  I\'m fixing the place up - all on my own I might add - so that we can move in!$B$BWith a base of operations out here in the forest, it\'ll be easier to keep track of what Shattrath, Allerian, Stonebreaker and the Cenarion druids are all up to.  Our base in Auchindoun is just too inconvenient for that.$B$BWait a minute, do I know you?', 15758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Why are you fixing all of this up?', 'Why are you fixing all of this up?', 15757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand on the brink of destruction. We must reconsider this rash course of action.', '', 15756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, what do you want?  Can\'t you see I\'m busy here?  The Shadow Council isn\'t paying me by the hour!', 'Yeah, what do you want?  Can\'t you see I\'m busy here?  The Shadow Council isn\'t paying me by the hour!', 15755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have not struggled so hard to survive, only to bring about the true destruction.', 15754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, not savagery! Conscience. The excesses of our people will destroy us, and all that we have struggled to build.', '', 15753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You would have us live like the savages!', 15752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Idealistic blather. Go back to your forests!', '', 15751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The magisters are the traitors! They have sealed our doom.', 15750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call us traitors?', '', 15749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But at what cost? You\'ve all been blinded. We have all been blinded. ', '', 15748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at the wonders of this city! This is magic.', 15747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are we to live without magic?', '', 15745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A great blight lies across our land! It grows every day. Our need for magic weakens us, and will bring us to destruction, just as it has before!', '', 15744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood? And these orcs, these fair weather friends? They will aid us?', 15743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Arena battle has begun!', '', 15742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thirty seconds until the Arena battle begins!', '', 15741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One minute until the Arena battle begins!', '', 15740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fifteen seconds until the Arena battle begins!', '', 15739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood will be true. We can trust in none but our own!', '', 15738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there, fetch water quickly! Get these flames out before they spread to the rest of the keep! Hurry, damn you!', '', 15737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Poor Bertelm...', 15736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Poor Bertelm...', 15735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh, no... no, that won\'t be necessary. I\'ll, uh, send a soldier by to collect the, uh, headgear later on. I really must be going now...', '', 15734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to turn red.', '', 15733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why, yes, Bertelm, I\'ve finished your hat. I used the largest, puffiest, most magnificent feather I could find. Perhaps you\'d like me to measure you for a new pair of hose while you\'re -', 15732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day, Ros\'eleth. Is my, err, um... uh, my \'headgear\' finished?', '', 15731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s glances around somewhat nervously.', '', 15730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may be working together, but that only increases the need for discretion. Once again, be mindful of your words and actions.$B$BI can guarantee we\'re far from the only ones out here.', '', 15729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kaide hisses at you.>$B$BBe quiet, or you\'ll bring the orcs and the Alliance down on us, you clumsy oaf!$B$BThat\'s right, nod your head, and when we\'re done speaking, you\'ll walk away and forget you found me here.', '', 15728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen the way Ros\'eleth winks at me whenever I go to pick up a garment or hat? When things settle down around here, I\'m going to take her for a nice walk in the woods.$B$BFor once, I miss all those fancy taverns in Stormwind.', '', 15727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When I first arrived, I\'d hoped to meet the town\'s namesake.$B$B<Ros\'eleth glances around.>$B$BMost young high elves outgrow the \'I wanna be a Farstrider\' phase by the time they\'re taken as apprentices. Then, it\'s onto the \'I\'m going to be a magister\' stage.$B$BI don\'t think I ever quite outgrew the Farstrider phase, to be honest. No one dreams of growing up to be a seamstress, but we can\'t have the Farstriders running around naked, as my mother used to say.', 15726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When I first arrived, I\'d hoped to meet the town\'s namesake.$B$B<Ros\'eleth glances around.>$B$BMost young high elves outgrow the \'I wanna be a Farstrider\' phase by the time they come of age for their first apprenticeship. Then, it\'s onto the \'I\'m going to be a magister\' stage.$B$BNo one dreams of growing up to be a seamstress, but we can\'t have the Farstriders going around naked, as my mother used to say.', 15725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The opening of the Dark Portal brought news of my people\'s fate. In a way, my exile shielded me from sharing in their downfall, but to see the Farstriders throw their lot in with Kael\'thas...$B$BI never imagined my one-time brethren capable of such a thing.$B$BThe homecoming I once dreamt of will never happen. This forest is the only home I have left.', 15724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until I traveled through Nagrand and came to the forest, I feared that too much of our original culture was lost. I\'m thankful to see that I was wrong.$B$BThere is so much to be done here!', '', 15723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malukaz chatters incessantly about the historical importance of this forest, but I don\'t have the luxury of indulging in history until our present problems are settled.$B$BI\'m not saying his work here isn\'t important, but someone has to see to the defenses and logistics of running the hold.', '', 15722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a whole vast forest out there, $c. Let the shaman play with the spirits and the warriors toy with their swords. Terokkar is where I\'ll make my fortune.', 15721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been watching the Aldor working on the walls. They\'re gonna rebuild the whole city, you know.$B$BThey work much faster than old Foreman Oslow did back home in Lakeshire. He kept losing his tools in the lake, or the gnolls would take his supplies.$B$BI should ask the Aldor to send him some help. They\'d have that bridge fixed faster\'n anything.', '', 15720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s faints.', '', 15719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bonelashers, I hate them all!$B$BIf it weren\'t for the loss of my eye, and the fainting spells that I get sometimes, I\'d be out there shooting them down all the time!', '', 15718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, don\'t feel bad.  I get that a lot.$B$B<Taela looks both amused and annoyed.>$B$BI\'m a HIGH elf, not a blood elf.  Don\'t worry, I\'m not going to suck all of the magic out of you.', 15717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This wanted poster is adorned with an assortment of notices and rewards for all manner of dangerous activities.  However, you see nothing in particular that you feel you\'re cut out for yet.$B$BPerhaps you should check again at a later time?', '', 15716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One note stands out from the other various pieces of parchment that are tacked onto this wanted poster.  It\'s a call to slay the bonelashers of the Bone Wastes.', '', 15715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re expecting some kind of official welcome, you\'re going to be disappointed, $c. We don\'t stand on tradition, here. What works is what goes.', '', 15714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anchorite, I need another Extract of the Afterlife.', 'Anchorite, I need another Extract of the Afterlife.', 15713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am forever indebted to you for putting to rest the spirits of my ancestors.', 15712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am grateful for your assistance and sacrifice in this matter, $n.', 15711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cannot control... It draws me in... The void grows...', 'Cannot control... It draws me in... The void grows...', 15710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will become of us when it falls?', 'What will become of us when it falls?', 15709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on. This way.', 15708, 7, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is dying. It is dying. It is dying.', 'It is dying. It is dying. It is dying.', 15707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cease your crying! STOP!', 'Cease your crying! STOP!', 15706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain is unbearable.', 'The pain is unbearable.', 15705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits call... I am consumed.', 'The spirits call... I am consumed.', 15704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening to me?', 'What is happening to me?', 15703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is just horrible.$B$BI care not for our own discomforts here, but we must do something to ease the pain of the dead in the Bone Wastes!', '', 15702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember everything...', 'I remember everything...', 15701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] If only there was a leather soft enough to appeal to Marshal Zyx.', '', 15700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] I have a dream... a dream of a day when horses run faster, men grow stronger and time itself stands still.', '', 15699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish it, but not too quickly! I want to see a slow death!', 'Finish it, but not too quickly! I want to see a slow death!', 15698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes! I want more!', 'Yes, yes! I want more!', 15697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want blood!', 'I want blood!', 15696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off with his head!', 'Off with his head!', 15695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, what a fight!', 'Wow, what a fight!', 15694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready! The brawl is about to begin!\n', 'Get ready! The brawl is about to begin!\n', 15693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody help!  Our young are in peril!', '', 15692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bog lords are attacking!  Help us!', '', 15691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Southshore is such a peaceful town.... I\'d like to live here someday.', '', 15690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary, $c. The forest is full of hidden dangers and potential enemies.', '', 15689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve got him in one of their tree-settlements. Veil... Veil Shalas! Rokag must know about this immediately! Go speak with him.', '', 15688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dugar is alive! I can make out an arakkoa pacing back and forth in front of him, asking him the same questions over and over. There is another, too, a human...', '', 15687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, let\'s see what we can find out...', '', 15686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Allerian Stronghold, $c.', '', 15685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve got him in one of their tree-settlements. Veil... Veil Shalas! Thander must know about this immediately! Go speak with him.', '', 15684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deirom is alive! I can make out an arakkoa pacing back and forth in front of him, asking him the same questions over and over. There is another, too, an orc...', '', 15683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see... something. It\'s very faint, though.', '', 15682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, let\'s see what we can find out...', '', 15681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You speak of her as friend? You are a fool. This \"Dark Lady\" is not Sylvanas.', 15680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ranger-General of Silvermoon will be a loyal ally!', '', 15679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fool! The prince\'s minions were the very Forsaken we have now allied ourselves with, and now he has betrayed us!', '', 15678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The humans abandoned us in our darkest hour! Their prince himself led the assault on our lands.', 15677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When have the dwarves ever been our friends?', '', 15676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, you\'re wrong! We were the ones betrayed!', '', 15675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you not see what is happening? Open your eyes. It is laid bare for all to see. What is this new alliance? Why have we betrayed our allies of old, only to take up with the enemies of all that live?', 15674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My brothers and sisters. Listen to me. We must speak of the survival of our people. We have narrowly survived one calamity, but I fear the next shall destroy us.', 15673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better not say that too loudly!', '', 15672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could be worse, your wife coulda ran off to Stormwind with some cheese merchant!', '', 15671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you say now, but at least you\'ve got a warm dinner waiting for ya...', '', 15670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, an no squealing youngster to upset the peace of a man and his fish...', '', 15669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear you! I can\'t get a moments peace without Sarah complaining about the chores!', '', 15668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing like peace an quiet... unlike home!', '', 15667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing like a warm day and no ol\' lady to yell at ya...', '', 15666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light that Bertha\'s not here...', '', 15665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember that time we caught the red-finned murloc down in Elwynn?', '', 15664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You guys have any extra bait?', '', 15663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got one!', '', 15662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahah, don\'t get your hope up too high...', '', 15661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything could happen...', '', 15660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe...', '', 15659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I better not pull up another of Reggy\'s boots again...', '', 15658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet I\'ll catch a big one this time...', '', 15657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think we\'ll see ol\' sooty today?', '', 15656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did you say?', '', 15655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, real fishermen take on the fiercest rains!', '', 15654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hush up, your yapping will scare the fish away!', '', 15653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, if only every day was just like today....', '', 15652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just wish the fish would bite more than the bugs...', '', 15651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed! Nothing like the warm air and a cool pond...', '', 15650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing like a good evening to fish!', '', 15649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Couldn\'t ask for a nicer day!', '', 15648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine fishing weather!', '', 15647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back in my day, we fought demons! Real ones!', '', 15646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shattrath is more than a staging ground for war against the Burning Legion and Illidan.  It serves as a sanctuary to those seeking to escape the violence surrounding us.$B$BWe would be hypocrites if we turned the refugees away.$B$BIf your question refers to the Scryers, then I will respond that while I may not like them or their leader\'s wild claims of visions of redemption, it is not for us to question the wisdom of the naaru.$B$BThese are difficult times, $n.  We need allies where we can find them.', 15645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t Shattrath a draenei city?  Why do you allow others here?', 'Isn\'t Shattrath a draenei city?  Why do you allow others here?', 15644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Born from light\" would be a close translation for Sha\'tar.  It is the name we gave to the naaru who reclaimed Shattrath City from the agents of Illidan.', 15643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are the Sha\'tar?', 'Who are the Sha\'tar?', 15642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $n.  We are the Aldor, priests of the Light and servants of the Sha\'tar.$B$BYou are welcome to stay with us for as long as you need.', 15641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are going the wrong way, $n. My elekk will not go into hostile territory.', '', 15640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drink this, Zahlia.  It is not as potent as I\'d hoped, but perhaps it will help.', 15639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t cry mommy.  I\'m right here, see?', '', 15638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought I\'d never see my son\'s face again.  Come here, Seth!  Let mom take a look at you!', 15637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I can see...', 15636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coming, momma!', '', 15635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t go too far away Seth.  You know mommy doesn\'t like it when she can\'t hear you.', 15634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When is daddy coming back, mom?', '', 15633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll keep you safe, mommy!', '', 15632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s shakes her head at all of the commotion.', 15631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nay, its still broken. No luck at all, I suppose.', '', 15630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, its still broken. Can\'t afford to buy a new one though.', '', 15629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grumbles to himself while he works.', '', 15628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, go ahead and take one, there\'s plenty for all!', '', 15627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bessy whinneys happily.', '', 15626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any luck, Samuel?', '', 15625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good girl, Bessy!', '', 15624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright Bessy, let\'s get \'cha out for a walk here. Hut, hut!', '', 15623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Young Blanchy stomps her foot jealously.', '', 15622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww, Blanchy, don\'t worry, my brother in Westfall will take good care of you. I hear he\'s got a beautiful farm with lots of space for you to roam.', '', 15621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, there, Blanchy, you can\'t be having any apples today. Tomorrow, we\'ll be taking you down to Southshore, where you\'ll take a boat way across the seas.', '', 15620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, now, Blanchy. Don\'t be jealous, you\'ll be going on a big adventure of your own, soon.', '', 15619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s feeds Bessy the bright red apple.', '', 15618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, Bessy, enjoy this apple while I get you ready. ', '', 15617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, Bessy will enjoy this little snack.', '', 15616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I\'m sorry to hear that. I\'ll be by again later if you want a hand.', '', 15615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such an old wagon, no wonder it broke down on you, Samuel. ', '', 15614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That wagon break down on you again, Samuel?', '', 15613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Samuel, is that old wagon still breaking down on you? ', '', 15612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, Benjamin!', '', 15611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grabs an apple from the tree.', '', 15610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Benjamin, my old friend, think you could spare an apple for Bessy today?', '', 15609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hullo there, Benjamin! Mind if I snack an apple for Old Bessy?', '', 15608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day, Benjamin! Would you mind if I took an apple for Bessy?', '', 15606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bessy is a hungry girl today, isn\'t she? Let me go get you an apple.', '', 15605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor Bessy, cooped up in this barn on such a hot day. Let me get a snack for you!', '', 15604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why hullo there, Bessy. Its your turn for a walk today, isn\'t it?', '', 15603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cat watches the broom intently.', '', 15602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you believe it?  This ethereal does not have a single basilisk eye on him!$B$BAnd his leader has the gall to call himself \"the Smuggler Prince!\"', 15601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My job is to care for these poor souls.  I accept the help of any willing to lend a hand, be they Aldor or Scryer.$B$BWe are so understaffed, I wouldn\'t turn an ogre away if they knew how to apply a tourniquet.  The politics of the city are of little matter to me. ', 15600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My head is clear and cloudy at the same time... Crystal Lining...Silver Clouds...', '', 15599, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The things I\'ve seen... so beautiful...  if only I were a poet...', '', 15598, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... I\'m so not ready to leave...', '', 15597, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel so funky...', '', 15596, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, show me a real fight!', '', 15595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to fight us all at once? This should be amusing!\n', '', 15594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outsiders? Maybe you can beat some sense into that dolt!', '', 15593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Alliance has taken control of Twin Spire Ruins!|r', '', 15591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Horde has taken control of Twin Spire Ruins!|r', '', 15590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me the trouble. Now it\'s my turn to have some fun!\n', '', 15589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How nice of you to decorate my floor with blood.', '', 15588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that I\'m free of training those miserable wretches, I\'ll entertain myself with you!', '', 15587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Took you long enough to finish them off!', '', 15586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He cried when his worg died. Well, no one cries for him now!', '', 15585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, what a waste... next!', '', 15584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His death was even more miserable than the first!', '', 15583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was going to kill him anyway!', '', 15582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the brown skinned orcs take longer to die. What a waste... next!', '', 15581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one died so quickly! Perhaps his brothers can put up more of a fight!', '', 15580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One pitiful wretch down. Go on, take another one! ', '', 15579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh yes, the first kill of the morning. Continue!', '', 15578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want another? Go ahead! His blood will look better on the floor than in his face. ', '', 15577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one\'s skin may be red, but his belly is yellow!', '', 15576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, beat him mercilessly! His skull is as thick as an ogre\'s!\n', '', 15575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful! That one might call for his mommy when you hit him. Hahaha!', '', 15574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t waste your time on that one, he\'s weak!', '', 15573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want him? Very well, take him!', '', 15572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders? Go ahead, kill that one, it saves me the effort!', '', 15570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can have that one, I no longer need him!', '', 15569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again, $n, for helping me to uncover what happened here at the thicket.', '', 15568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raliq teach you lesson now!', '', 15567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I choose the third option: KILLING YOU!', '', 15566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('F\'woooroonn! Coosh\'coosh pay nothing! Die!', '', 15565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He wants his \"golds.\" Pay up or die... again...', 'He wants his \"golds.\" Pay up or die... again...', 15564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you serious? He already killed me! What more could he want?', '', 15563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Floon makes a series of strange clicking and clucking sounds.>', '', 15562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fshhhhhhsssfhhhhh?', '', 15561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been sent by Sal\'salabim to collect a debt that you owe. Pay up or I\'m going to have to hurt you.', 'I have been sent by Sal\'salabim to collect a debt that you owe. Pay up or I\'m going to have to hurt you.', 15560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WUT YOU WANT!?', '', 15559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Firewing blood elves... for some reason they want to stop us.$B$B<Warden Treelos visibly struggles to keep his wits about him for a few more seconds.>$B$BThey... they sent one of the Broken as ... as an emissary....  But he had a bomb!$B$BThey died, they all died!  They tried to run away!  The lucky ones didn\'t even know.$B$BI must have been at the edge of the blast.  It was horr...IT\'S WATCHING US AGAIN!$B$B<Treelos becomes despondent and looks straight through you as if you\'re not there.>', '', 15558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 18, 5, 0, 1000, 1000, 39653),
('I don\'t have time for this!  Warden, what happened?!', 'I don\'t have time for this!  Warden, what happened?!', 15557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that?  Zangarmarsh?  Why would I want to go there?$B$B<Treelos looks thoughtful.>$B$BYes, Zangarmarsh... we... the druids there are getting close to figuring out why the water level is dropping.  It\'s destroying everything!$B$B<You can see the insanity creep back in behind the warden\'s eyes.>$B$BDestroyed us all!  Bright light!  BOOM!!', '', 15556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 5, 0, 1000, 1000, 39653),
('Keep it together man!  What about Zangarmarsh?', 'Keep it together man!  What about Zangarmarsh?', 15555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Warden Treelos looks at you funny and then pauses a moment, clearly struggling.>$B$BZangarmarsh... too close to truth.$B$B<His face goes crazy again.>$B$BIs he still watching!?', '', 15554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 1000, 1000, 0, 39653),
('Treelos, I know that the truth is somewhere inside you.  Tell me what it is.', 'Treelos, I know that the truth is somewhere inside you.  Tell me what it is.', 15553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Altruis sent me. He said that you could help me.', 'Altruis sent me. He said that you could help me.', 15552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
