('No more nice ogre! You hurt Mogor!!', '', 15483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has defeated the hero of the Warmaul, Mogor! All hail $n!', '', 15482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the first time in the Ring of Blood\'s history, Mogor has chosen to exercise his right of battle! On this wartorn ground, $n will face Mogor, hero of the Warmaul!', '', 15481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
