('', 'Amazing! Anatheron\'s defeat at your hands has delayed Archimonde from his objective, and brought us that much closer to victory. My forces cannot stay here, however. My troops and I are exhausted, and now is the time for retreat. If your strength has not waned, head east to Thrall\'s encampment. That is where we make another stand. Be well.', 15415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in alchemy.  Interested?', 'I can instruct you in alchemy.  Interested?', 15414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in herbalism.  Interested?', 'I can instruct you in herbalism.  Interested?', 15413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anoint my head with a healing balm.  Do you like my crown of thorns?', '', 15412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in mining.  Interested?', 'I can instruct you in mining.  Interested?', 15411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, what a sacred place is here overthrown!', '', 15410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dinner guests should show more respect!', '', 15409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did everyone go?', '', 15408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My vicious teromoths will avenge me!', '', 15407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are FOUR lights!', '', 15406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did you do this to us?', '', 15405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 18, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?  What do you want here?', '', 15404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too close to the truth, too close to the truth!', '', 15403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blinding white light, and then silence!', '', 15402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Roar!', '', 15401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meow.', '', 15400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t... control... form.', '', 15399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They broke us all.', '', 15398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop looking at me!', '', 15397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BOOM!', '', 15395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then let Archimonde do his worst.', 15394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready for whatever Archimonde might send our way, Lady Proudmoore.', 'We are ready for whatever Archimonde might send our way, Lady Proudmoore.', 15393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, adventurer. Rage Winterchill\'s death has earned us all a small pause in the enemy\'s advance. Use this short time wisely. Tend to your wounded and prepare your defenses, as soon Archimonde will send even deadlier forces at us. My meager force of reserve units will reinforce you when battle is joined again.', 15392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on, get out of here!  Save yourself!', '', 15391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits watch over you, $r!', 'Spirits watch over you, $r!', 15390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thanks, hero!', 'Many thanks, hero!', 15389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the ogres!', 'Death to the ogres!', 15388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r! Your service to the Mag\'har will not be forgotten.', 'Thank you, $r! Your service to the Mag\'har will not be forgotten.', 15387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My children will be made orphans!', 'My children will be made orphans!', 15386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ogres have the keys! Kill the ogres and get me out of here!', 'The ogres have the keys! Kill the ogres and get me out of here!', 15385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One day, a hero will rise and lift the orcs up to their former glory.', 'One day, a hero will rise and lift the orcs up to their former glory.', 15384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m done for!', 'I\'m done for!', 15383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Help! They\'re going to eat me!', 'Help! Help! They\'re going to eat me!', 15382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must search for survivors. If anyone is still alive, we must at least try and get them back...', '', 15381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have no respect for the dead, $r. The ogres must be taught a lesson.', '', 15380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you would rather test yourselves against a more formidable opponent?!', '', 15379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares attack the steed of the Huntsman?', '', 15378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[PH] Players! Go Stop Archimonde at the tree, we will hold the Undead off here!', 15377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You treat my hat well now, $n.  You won\'t find a finer one anywhere in this world or another.', '', 15376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check the bulletin board if you\'re looking for work, $r.', '', 15375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should get Telaar the assistance it needs!', '', 15374, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New posting going up! Adventurers and heroes, gather round the bulletin board!', '', 15373, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the best reward we\'re going to be able to offer. Hopefully someone accepts the mission.', '', 15372, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn those ogres. Damn them to the Nether. Won\'t someone save us from these savages! This is the fifth kidnapping in as many days.', '', 15371, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Registrants are required to speak with Warden Moi\'bff Jill before posting any task.$B$BThose found making unapproved postings will be prosecuted.$B$BPost no bills.', '', 15370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Registrants are required to speak with Warden Bullrok before posting any task.$B$BThose found making unapproved postings will be prosecuted.$B$BPost no bills.', '', 15369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] This is a test boss emote to see how the text is displayed.', '', 15368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But don\'t take it from me; see for yourself what tragedy lies ahead when the paths of star crossed lovers meet! And now... on with the show!', '', 15367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But beware, for not all love stories end happily, as you may find out. Sometimes, love pricks like a thorn!', '', 15366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tonight... we explore a tale of forbidden love!', '', 15365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will she survive? Will she prevail? Only time will tell. And now... on with the show!', '', 15364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But she is pursued... by a wicked, malevolent crone!', '', 15363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tonight we plumb the depths of the human soul as we join a lost, lonely girl trying desperately--with the help of her loyal companions--to find her way home!', '', 15362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But don\'t let me pull the wool over your eyes! See for yourself what lies beneath those covers! And now... on with the show!', '', 15361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take for instance this quiet elderly woman waiting for a visit from her granddaughter... surely there is nothing to fear from this sweet, gray-haired old lady!', '', 15360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tonight, things are not what they seem... for tonight your eyes may not be trusted!', '', 15359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last mont, me won da dead orc sound champi... champichi... me won da dead orc sound contest.', '', 15358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For shure it be good.', '', 15357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dead orc sound ok. Mine better.', '', 15356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dead orc sound is da best!', '', 15355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You make dat sound pretty good. Sound like da orc dieded.', '', 15354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll not be tortured again!', '', 15353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s all of dem! Dese Warmaul be so mad! Hooray!', '', 15352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You so smart. Let\'s do dis now before more come.', '', 15351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me wanted to make it belive... Me wanted to make it real. Dey tink for shure it Shadow Council now!', '', 15350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shut up, stupid! Why you yell?', '', 15349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I killeded anoder Warmaul ogre! I am Shadow Council! Come get me!', '', 15348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadow Council come for you Warmaul! We is mad at you!', '', 15347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rawr! Me is Shadow Council magishun! Me come for Warmaul terri... tettritor... Me come for Warmaul land!', '', 15346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last the nightmare is over...', '', 15345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You face not Malchezaar alone, but the legions I command!', '', 15344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All realities, all dimensions are open to me!', '', 15343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you hope to stand against such overwhelming power?', '', 15342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simple fools! Time is the fire in which you\'ll burn!', '', 15341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You rang?', '', 15340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, where was I? Oh, yes...', '', 15339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Curator is equipped for gallery protection.', '', 15338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gallery rules will be strictly enforced.', '', 15337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not a guest.', '', 15336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not touch the displays.', '', 15335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Midnight!', '', 15334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another trophy to add to my collection!', '', 15333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will all be over soon!', 15332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No overgrown bug\'s gonna chase me out of Zangarmarsh! I\'ll show \'em what the Explorers\' League is made of...', '', 15331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 23, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will stage a series of events that will lead the Kil\'sorrow orcs of Kil\'sorrow Fortress to believe that the Warmaul ogres have attacked their base and then another series of events to make the Warmaul ogres believe the Kil\'sorrow orcs are attacking their base.$B$BDo this and you solve both of our problems.$B$BThe Boulderfist will have their territory back and your people will be free from attack from Boulderfist, Warmaul and Shadow Council.', '', 15330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do I need to do?', 'What do I need to do?', 15329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lantresor glares at you as if he were looking through you.>$B$BPerhaps there is another way... I will agree to your leader\'s demands, only if you do exactly as I ask.$B$BWith your assistance, we may be able to help each other out greatly.\n', '', 15328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight you until the end, then, Lantresor. We will not stand idly by as you pillage our towns and kill our people.', 'We will fight you until the end, then, Lantresor. We will not stand idly by as you pillage our towns and kill our people.', 15327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lantresor laughs heartily.>$B$BDo you know where you are, fool? This is ogre land. Before orc, before draenei, there was ogre. Yet, you wish to start a war that you will inevitably lose? Boulderfist will crush you. And if Boulderfist does not destroy you, Warmaul will...$B$BBut I think your leaders already know this...', '', 15326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 153, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people ask that you pull back your Boulderfist ogres and cease all attacks on our territories. In return, we will also pull back our forces.', 'My people ask that you pull back your Boulderfist ogres and cease all attacks on our territories. In return, we will also pull back our forces.', 15325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what do your people want of Lantresor, $r?', '', 15324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies. I did not mean to offend. I am here on behalf of my people.\n', 'My apologies. I did not mean to offend. I am here on behalf of my people.\n', 15323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bite your tongue, $r. I have seen things in my lifetime that you have only heard about in legends. I have killed man, woman, and child without remorse. Under the banner of two Warchiefs of the Horde I have served... And now, I rule Boulderfist.', '', 15322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have heard of your kind, but I never thought to see the day when I would meet a half-breed.', 'I have heard of your kind, but I never thought to see the day when I would meet a half-breed.', 15321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draenei... And because of this, I am neither. Not orc, not draenei. My own kind are a rare breed. Most having been killed decades ago... I live because of my strength of will.', '', 15320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And the other half?', 'And the other half?', 15319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An orc...$B$B<Lantresor scoffs.>$B$BI am a blademaster of half-orc descent. ', '', 15318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should I know? You look like an orc to me.', 'Should I know? You look like an orc to me.', 15317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then you are a fool. Do you not know what I am?', '', 15316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have killed many of your ogres, Lantresor. I have no fear.\n', 'I have killed many of your ogres, Lantresor. I have no fear.\n', 15315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who so boldly stands before Lantresor of the Blade? Do you not know death by sight, $g boy:girl;?', '', 15314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods at Lady Jaina Proudmoore.', '', 15313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have played our part, and done well at that. It is up to the others now.', '', 15312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Thrall, it is time to go!', '', 15311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins channelling a massive teleport spell. ', 15310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have won valuable time. Now we must pull back.', 15309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the last time I get caught! I promise! Bye!', '', 15308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what smells worse: Your feet or a dung-filled cheese and fish fillet.', '', 15307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I get some food, please??? This is outrageous!', '', 15306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey fatso, is there any reason why you insist on living in a dung filled hole in the wall?', '', 15305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Congratulations. It smells worse in here than in the ruins.', '', 15304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 15303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Learning about new plant species is extremely important for our expedition.  Not just the medicinal or edible ones either.$B$BPlants provide the foundation for many other forms of life to exist.  Understanding them allows us to better understand nature as a whole.', 15302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me no can take it no more!', '', 15301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me lose appetite. Corki is poop.', '', 15300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me don\'t even want to eat him no more.', '', 15299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shut up!', '', 15298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, $r! I\'m sure my dad will reward you greatly! Bye!', '', 15297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fatheads are in trouble if I ever get out of here!', '', 15296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want my daddy!', '', 15295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat me already! I can\'t take being locked up in this cage around you stinky, fat slobs.', '', 15294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey fatso, how do you go to the bathroom with all that fat!?', '', 15293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey fathead, how about some food!?', '', 15292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me out of here, $r!', '', 15291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lump shrugs.>$B$BYou bring da war to da Boulderfist. We put it in da stew.\n', '', 15290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This means war, Lump! War I say!', 'This means war, Lump! War I say!', 15289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat not true. Me just want to nibble. I don\'t eat all. Ok, maybe I eat da little ones.$B$BDey so delicious!\n', '', 15288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you think you can just eat anything you want? You\'re obviously trying to eat the Broken of Telaar.', 'And you think you can just eat anything you want? You\'re obviously trying to eat the Broken of Telaar.', 15287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boulderfist hungry! Need food! Warmaul ogre tribe kick Boulderfist out of mound to north. Many more Boulderfist to feed now.', '', 15286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are Boulderfist out this far? You know that this is Kurenai territory.', 'Why are Boulderfist out this far? You know that this is Kurenai territory.', 15285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OK! Lump tell you anything you want!', '', 15284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need answers, ogre!', 'I need answers, ogre!', 15283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OK, OK! Lump give up!', '', 15282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you mean to Lump? Lump hungry, dat\'s all.', '', 15281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s drops a conspicuous document.', '', 15280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You taste good with maybe a little salt and pepper.', '', 15279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In Nagrand, food hunt ogre!', '', 15278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TESTING. IS THIS THING WORKING????', 'TESTING. IS THIS THING WORKING????', 15277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tailor Keelen is always seeking more curious students to teach his delicate craft. His shop is somewhat difficult to uncover at first, but it\'s just north of the auction house in the Bazaar. You\'ll find him on the lower level of the building.', 'The tailor Keelen is always seeking more curious students to teach his delicate craft. His shop is somewhat difficult to uncover at first, but it\'s just north of the auction house in the Bazaar. You\'ll find him on the lower level of the building.', 15276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tailoring', 'Tailoring', 15275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
