('', 'I will do my best to take care of the children, Greatmother.', 15144, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greatmother, Garrosh has lost his heart. We are lost without you.', 15143, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greatmother, is there anything I can do?', 15142, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you\'re just in time. The rituals are about to begin!', '', 15141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey!  Didn\'t I give you a bundle of skins before?$B$BEither way, I\'m glad to be saved from the ruthless clutches of that evil Gankly Rottenfist!', 15140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greatmother, please drink this water.', 15139, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am SO glad that evil Gankly Rottenfist got his just desserts!', 15138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life is yours, oh great one...', '', 15137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess I\'m not a failure after all!', '', 15136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them make... a mattress outta\' me.', '', 15135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spawns a poison cloud!', '', 15134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You didn\'t have to go and do that!', '', 15133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Closer! Come closer... and burn!', '', 15132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go ahead and take forty winks.', '', 15131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares interrupt--What is this; what have you done? You\'ll ruin everything!', '', 15130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to arm the Proximity Bomb!', '', 15129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Madness has brought you here to me. I shall be your undoing!', '', 15127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are but a plaything. Unfit even to amuse.', '', 15126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your greed, your foolishness has brought you to this end.', '', 15125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely you did not think you could win.', '', 15124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I refuse to concede defeat! I am a prince of the Eredar! I... am...', '', 15123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t wanna play anymore!', 'I don\'t wanna play anymore!', 15122, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I miss my mommy.', 'I miss my mommy.', 15121, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we stop running now?', 'Can we stop running now?', 15120, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t go close to the lake! It\'s haunted!', 'Don\'t go close to the lake! It\'s haunted!', 15119, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OGRE! You\'re the ogre! HA-HA!', 'OGRE! You\'re the ogre! HA-HA!', 15118, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duck!', 'Duck!', 15117, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of the way!', 'Get out of the way!', 15116, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them!', '', 15115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tag! You\'re it!', 'Tag! You\'re it!', 15114, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am SO glad that evil Gankly Rottenfist got his just desserts!  I have lots of skins if you want some to give to Harold.', 15113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... sure thing, Gankly.  Just...<cough>... wait right there.  <Cough>  Guys?', '', 15112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be taking those skins, tiny.', '', 15111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are my skins, Harold.  Now give me the reward!', '', 15110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rifles through Kristen\'s stuff and grabs her bundle of skins.', '', 15109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will the pain ever end?', '', 15108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You over there!  Help me find a way out of this wretched cage!', '', 15107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you just leave me here?', '', 15106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ack!  Somebody help me!', 15104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me!  Please help me!', '', 15103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi, Harold.  I have your skins!', 15102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve nothing for the likes of you, Cailan. For the last time, get out of this shop.', 15101, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely you\'ve got something to spare, Zalle. You know I\'m good for it. Something, anything!', '', 15100, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We wouldn\'t have crashed if Hemet could learn how to avoid shooting through the ailerons when he\'s trying to bag game on the ground!$B$BNo worries though, I\'ll have her fixed up quick enough.', 15099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, I run!', '', 15098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give up! Please don\'t kill me!', '', 15097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know who we are, stranger? We are Mag\'har - brown orcs, as I have heard your kind call us. The Mag\'har are survivors: Survivors of a fallen dynasty; Survivors of the Red Pox; Survivors of a shattered world...$B$BI am Jorin, son of Kilrogg; last of the lineage of Deadeye: Warchief of the Bleeding Hollow Clan.', '', 15096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh good, I was beginning to worry.', '', 15095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Hemet?  Fitz?', '', 15094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um... guys?', '', 15093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gezhe is here to get a job done.  I\'m here to make sure no one bothers him while he does it.', '', 15092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s smiles and sheathes his rifle.', '', 15091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on?!', '', 15090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out, Fitz, they\'re coming right for us!', '', 15089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh, those stags don\'t look pleased with us!', '', 15088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Consortium has been planning this operation for months!  We were to dig Oshu\'gun, the largest known diamond in the universe.$B$BMinutes before we were to begin, Nexus-Prince Haramaad sends word that we\'re to hold off until a political matter is resolved in Netherstorm.  I\'ve transformed our operation into a clearing house for smuggled gems in the meantime, but this is slowly eating into our profits.', '', 15087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I\'ve gone and made a mess...', '', 15086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time... never enough time.', '', 15085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is for the best.', 15084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impure thoughts lead to profane actions.', 15083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah ah ah...', 15082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death comes. Will your conscience be clear?', 15081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cast out your corrupt thoughts.', 15080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your behavior will not be tolerated.', 15079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thou smilest... upon the stroke that... murders me.', '', 15078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thou detestable maw, thou womb of death; I enforce thy rotten jaws to open!', '', 15077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How well my comfort is revived by this!', '', 15076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wilt thou provoke me? Then have at thee, boy!', '', 15075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'O happy dagger! This is thy sheath; there rust, and let me die!', 15074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, gentle night; and give me back my Romulo!', 15073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Romulo, I come! Oh... this do I drink to thee!', 15072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Parting is such sweet sorrow.', 15071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What devil art thou, that dost torment me thus?', 15070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tito! Oh Tito, no!', 15069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh at last, at last I can go home!', 15068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh Tito, we simply must find a way home! The old wizard could be our only hope! Strawman, Roar, Tinhead, will you - wait... oh golly, look we have visitors!', 15067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t let them hurt us Tito! Oh, you won\'t, will you?', 15066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, ok. Me dance now.', '', 15065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear Unkor, dummy? Dance!', '', 15064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oops. Grondo sorry.', '', 15063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not you, moron! The other imbecile.', 'Not you, moron! The other imbecile.', 15062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow tired of waiting. Dance for me, imbecile.', '', 15061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Failure to comply will result in offensive action.', '', 15060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your request cannot be processed.', '', 15059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not be so harsh on the child, Alturus.  Remember that Cedric himself assigned him to you.', 15058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curator is no longer operation-a-l.', '', 15057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S-sorry, sir.', '', 15056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Menagerie is for guests only.', '', 15055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ought to give your head a good shake!  I\'ve a feeling the ley-lines are clouding up your brain.  No, Darius, what we need is a large depository of mineral-heavy water.  Even faint arcane signals will accumulate in sulphur and lime.', '', 15054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S-sir... have you tried giving the crystal a good shake?  It\'s possible that the ley-lines are clouding up the reading.', '', 15053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How could you? What a cruel, cruel world...', 15052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fixed you, didn\'t I?', 15051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Woe to each and every one of you, my pretties!', 15050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, stranger. Your heroics will be remembered by my people. Now, hurry to Telaar!', '', 15049, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up ahead is the road to Telaar. We will split up when we reach the fork as they will surely send more Murkblood after us. Hopefully one of us makes it back to Telaar alive.', '', 15048, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are surrounded!', '', 15047, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must leave before more are alerted.', '', 15046, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, yeah, I\'m feeling better, but I kind of like it down here.', '', 15045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s an ambush! Defend yourself!', '', 15044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None shall defeat the Fel Horde!', '', 15043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 15042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy the taste of fel iron?', '', 15041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Please?\" You have so much to learn... master.', 15040, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s arches a brow at Keyanomir, a wry smirk playing about her lips.', 15039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you please go back inside?', '', 15038, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what\'s wrong with that? A woman enjoys turning heads now and again.', 15037, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no... it\'s just that... well... we\'re attracting looks.', '', 15036, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tch. One might think you\'re ashamed to be seen with me, master.', 15035, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mighty hunter, $n returns.  Tell me the tale of stalking your latest prey.', '', 15034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told you to wait for me elsewhere, not follow me like a puppy...', '', 15033, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hangs his head and sighs.', '', 15032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know I love it when you beg... but no.', 15031, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on... please?', '', 15030, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may have summoned me, my little warlock, but that does not give you leave to rename me like some child\'s pet.', 15029, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m your master... you\'re supposed to do what I say!', '', 15028, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nimrida.', 15027, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s Sayena.', '', 15026, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My name is Nimrida, boy.', 15025, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your new name is Sayena.', '', 15024, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hemet is the greatest hunter that I know.  We chanced upon each other in the hills of Winterspring back on Azeroth many moons ago.  He and I were stalking the same quarry: the great cat known as Rak\'shiri.$B$BRather than fight each other over our prey, we made a wager out of it; whoever collected the frostsaber\'s skin would get to demand something of the other.  To my eternal shame, this is how I earned the nickname, Fitz.$B$BDo I look like a Fitz?', '', 15023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How terribly clumsy of me.', '', 15022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm, unannounced visitors. Preparations must be made...', '', 15021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00Halaa is defenseless!|r', '', 15020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Horde has taken control of Halaa!|r', '', 15019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Alliance has taken control of Halaa!|r', '', 15018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00All the guards have been defeated!|r', '', 15017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything that we have, we have fought for tooth and tentacle... Retaking Telaar from the orcs and then the ogres was no easy task.', '', 15016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When I catch you, I\'m going to disenchant your components, so help me...', 15015, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You stay out of the regent lord\'s way! I mean it!', 15014, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Argh. They told me those crystals would work properly!', 15013, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get back here, you little...', 15012, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The magister\'s going to kill me...', 15011, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, no, no! Come back here!', 15010, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FROST SHOCK!', '', 15009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Totem of the earth, halt their advances!', '', 15008, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sons of Lightning will have their vengeance!', '', 15007, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ride the lightning, filth!', '', 15006, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wounds be gone!', '', 15005, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits grant me the strength to heal!', '', 15004, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where do you think you\'re going? Kill them all!', '', 15003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them escape! Kill the strong one first!', '', 15002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is best that we split up now, in case they send more after us. Hopefully one of us will make it back to Garrosh. Farewell, stranger.', '', 15001, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More of them coming! Watch out!', '', 15000, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 14999, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s places the Murkblood idols atop the Lightning stone and invokes the spirits.', '', 14998, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits are greatly agitated. We must find the cause of this disturbance.', '', 14997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark times loom ahead, stranger...', '', 14996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They died. All of them...$B$BAs the Murkbloods cut through us, something took hold of me that I cannot understand. Tell me, have you ever felt a rage so great that the whole of your being burns? A heat that wilts the living? A heat that incinerates the blood in your veins? That is what I felt.$B$B<Saurfang\'s eyes glow red for a brief moment.>$B$BI was the last one left alive. 30 of them surrounded me... Murkbloods... I remember nothing beyond that vision. I blacked out and awoke some time later.', '', 14995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Notices of reward for the naga leaders of the Darkcrest and Bloodscale tribes are listed here.', '', 14994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Notices of reward for the naga leaders of the Darkcrest and Bloodscale tribes are listed here.  They both sound extremely dangerous, perhaps you should check again later.', '', 14993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to work, dog!', '', 14992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, it cannot be! Nooo!', '', 14991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last it is here! Mourn and lament the passing of all you have ever known, and all that would have been! Hach min corai!', '', 14990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No breaks until it\'s all chopped down!', '', 14989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe a lightning bolt will give you the incentive to work faster?', '', 14988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I need to come over there and show you how it\'s done?', '', 14987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster or Boss Grog\'ak will have your head!', '', 14986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chop faster!', '', 14985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your backs into it!', '', 14984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garadar is in shambles, stranger. Since the Greatmother took ill, Garrosh has gone into a deep depression. He is most certainly not his father\'s boy.$B$B<Kurkush sighs.>\n', '', 14983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c.  I am what is referred to as one of the Broken.  Like the Lost Ones, though not as badly as they, we were afflicted with fel energies that transformed us from our original draenei forms.', '', 14982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reavij has all the subtlety of a kodo! What\'s funny is that he doesn\'t think he\'s being obvious. I see the way he stares at me when he thinks no one\'s looking.$B$BHe creeps me out. I really wish Shadow Hunter Denjai hadn\'t sent him with us. Setting up Swamprat Post was the perfect opportunity to get away from him.', 14981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ever meet Witch Doctor Tor\'gash, tell him his concoctions and charms don\'t work! I did exactly as he told me to and still Magasha has eyes only for Zurai.$B$BDon\'t believe a thing that sham witch doctor tells you!', '', 14980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to buy from you.', 'I wish to buy from you.', 14979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once the totem of Kar\'dash is ours, we will raze your cities and rebuild them as our own.', 'Once the totem of Kar\'dash is ours, we will raze your cities and rebuild them as our own.', 14978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you die from the torture, we will go out and kidnap another of your kind. One of you is bound to crack under the pain and give us the information we need.', '', 14977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadow Hunter Denjai sent me here with a small contingent of builders and warriors to establish this outpost. We\'ve barely finished building it and he\'s already asking for reports!$B$BIf you need supplies, I can offer a few things, but we\'re still waiting for our first shipment.', '', 14976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me where the totem of Kar\'dash is hidden and the beatings will stop.', '', 14975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treacherous whelp! I will beat you within an inch of your miserable life!', '', 14974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Telredor has seen more change in the last 20 years than it did in prior centuries. I cannot complain, $n, for the world has changed far more in that time.$B$BThe Light has brought me friends and companions I could not have met as a cloistered priest. Learn what you can of the past in your time here. It will help you to understand where your journey is leading you.', '', 14973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen so many different kinds of mushrooms in one place. Given enough time, I\'m sure I could find a use for all of them.', '', 14972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to buy from you.', 'I wish to buy from you.', 14971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exercise caution during your stay. Some close-minded individuals may still cling to old alliances long since dissolved...', '', 14970, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis place be too bright fa my tastes.', '', 14969, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Telredor, $c. If you need anything, don\'t hesitate to ask.', '', 14968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to buy from you.', 'I would like to buy from you.', 14967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The view from the top of Telredor is magnificent, isn\'t it?', 14966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the wonders of our fair city.', '', 14965, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for making the journey here. I hope you will find Silvermoon to your liking.', '', 14964, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such marvelous sights. I regret being unable to see it when I was younger.', 14963, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Telredor was once a secluded retreat for draenei priests and pilgrims. The resident priests seldom received visitors.$B$BWhen the orcs started to attack draenei settlements, refugees began to arrive in larger numbers. Anchorite Ahuurn and the others transformed Telredor from a shrine into a safe haven. Many draenei, myself included, owe our survival to his efforts.', '', 14962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me some pointers on my fishing technique.', 'Give me some pointers on my fishing technique.', 14961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to purchase fishing supplies.', 'I wish to purchase fishing supplies.', 14960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t forget to take some time out to fish while you\'re in Zangarmarsh. You never know when you\'ll see water again.', 14959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to purchase tradeskill supplies.', 'I wish to purchase tradeskill supplies.', 14958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first time I saw mushrooms taller than trees, I wasn\'t so sure I could call this place home. After a while you just stop noticing.', '', 14957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There I was tumbling in a patch of prickly undergrowth with a talbuk stag, hand-to-hand, only my sharp knife...<cough>... and keen hunter\'s intellect to save me.$B$BAll of a sudden I\'m jumped by a pair of fierce windroc hunters that came at me from the skies!  Their cowardly attack...<cough>... didn\'t help them any though.$B$BAnd while I have their beaks as trophies, I received an infected scratch out of the ordeal.  Kind of nasty, and I\'m in a lot of pain, but I\'m sure it\'ll heal up in a day or two.', '', 14956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve bagged them all: Bach\'lor, Banthar, Gutripper, and even the mighty Tusker!  You\'re truly the finest big game hunter that I know!', '', 14955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve proven yourself a very capable game hunter, $n.  But there\'s still one beastie that haunts your dreams... Tusker!', '', 14954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are no more available rides! There should be one available very soon... <PH>', '', 14953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'TugofWar Buffbot, Horde Greeting', 14952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'TugofWar Buffbot, Horde Winner', 14951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TugofWar Buffbot, Give me a Reward', 'TugofWar Buffbot, Give me a Reward', 14950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'TugofWar Buffbot, Alliance Winner', 14949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'TugofWar Buffbot, Alliance', 14948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tor\'gash believes he can see the future in the entrails of birds, or by tossing the knucklebones of his ancestors. Really, all you need to do is ask the spirits. But don\'t try telling him that, $n. He\'s very stubborn.', 14947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now don\'t you be thinkin\' about tryin\' to make off with me baby murlocs! I got the eyes of a hawk and ears like... ears like... like somethin\' with mighty powerful ears!', '', 14946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Zabra\'jin, $c. I am Shadow Hunter Denjai, overseer of this outpost and commander of the Darkspear forces in Zangarmarsh.', '', 14945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This spot is perfect! Let me set up...', '', 14944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me fly!', 'Let me fly!', 14943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GLHF! <PH>', '', 14942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This sign contains various announcements and notices of rewards.', '', 14941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thick red slash has been drawn across the words WANTED: Deathclaw.  \"This bounty has been claimed by the heroic $n, who has overcome the fearsome beast,\" declares more writing in the same red ink.', '', 14940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naaru are wise beyond our understanding.  I\'ve learned more from A\'dal in the last five months than all the years I spent in the libraries of Dalaran.', '', 14939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bounties for notorious criminals and vicious animals are posted here. It would be much too dangerous for you to pursue the bounty posted here right now, but check the board again as you gain strength.', '', 14938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Alvareux once wrote a treatise exploring a fascinating theory.  He proposed the existence of an exact copy of Karazhan in a world other than our own and that both somehow shared the same space.$B$BHe went mad soon after.  A real pity.', '', 14937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Karazhan is more than a mere building, $n.  If you traced the ley-lines traversing Azeroth you would find that they all converge right about there.$B$B<Alturus points at an invisible spot below the tower.>$B$BFascinating, isn\'t it?', '', 14936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be fooled by the ruins surrounding us, $c.  Dalaran is as powerful as ever.', '', 14935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.  You seek to push yourself to the limits of your hunting prowess?  Look no further.$B$BHemet Nesingwary has assembled the finest expedition the remnant of this world has ever known.  Join us on safari if you dare.', '', 14934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have to ask, you don\'t know me anywhere near well enough to be using that appellation.', '', 14933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Specialist, eh? Just what kind of specialist are you, anyway?', 'Specialist, eh? Just what kind of specialist are you, anyway?', 14932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are some who call me \'Tim,\' but to my friends, I am \'the specialist.\'', '', 14931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me browse your reagents and poison supplies.', 'Let me browse your reagents and poison supplies.', 14930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m no happier about being your babysitter than you are about being watched. Just remember... it could have been worse.', 14929, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ja start...', '', 14928, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should be used to those looks, Tatai. Do you remember the reason you were drafted into this job?', 14927, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your chin up. Perhaps with time, our people will see you as the ally you are, rather than the enemy you appear to be.', '', 14926, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares.', 'I wish to browse your wares.', 14925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Memories of this temple shroud my mind like a thick haze, yet I cannot assemble them into a coherent story. This place meant something to me once. Until I can restore that memory, I will feel as though a part of me is missing.$B$BPerhaps the draenei can help me recover what I\'ve lost.', '', 14924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your wares, Maktu.', 'Show me your wares, Maktu.', 14923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid your ancestry is the cause, troll. Decades of fighting with your green-skinned brethren have hardened their hearts against your kind.', '', 14922, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maktu doesn\'t recognize you, $r, but he is pleased to meet you. If ever you need to buy or repair armor, look no further than Maktu.', '', 14921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Orebor Harborage, friend. You have nothing to fear here. We are Broken, but we are not your enemies.$B$BI am Ikuti of the Kurenai, a group of Broken who desire to reestablish ties with our draenei brothers and their newfound allies.', '', 14920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be gettin\' tired\'a dis. Dese elves, dey be treatin\' me like I stole somet\'in\'.', '', 14919, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s an ethereal beauty about this place... but for all the trees and plant life, it\'s still so... unnatural.', 14918, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought we were going to speak with the regent lord. I\'m beginning to question whether or not he exists at all at this point.', 14917, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you say, ambassador. We can wait.', 14916, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is becoming tiresome.', 14915, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s smirks triumphantly.', 14914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ja be keepin\' away from me.', '', 14913, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Troll, if you can\'t keep a civil tongue in your head, I\'ll be happy to remove it for you.', 14912, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just what I be t\'inkin\'. More delays.', '', 14911, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll accept that answer for the time being, Kelemar, but my patience is not exactly boundless.', 14910, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In due course. There is no rush, after all - our hospitality is extended to you indefinitely. Even the troll.', '', 14909, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is unable to see you just yet, but do not trouble yourselves over it. I\'m certain he will find a way to fit you into his busy schedule.', '', 14908, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The regent lord is a very busy man. I\'m sure you understand.', '', 14907, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t suppose Lor\'themar Theron is available for an audience yet?', 14906, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your choice of decor is intriguing, Kelemar. Tell me - why the arcane frippery?', 14905, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why be all dese t\'ings floatin\' an\' movin\' by demselves?', '', 14904, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know. It still seems like such a waste.', 14903, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blasted scrying crystal!  I\'m not getting anything over here.', '', 14902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to perform an arcane scrying.', '', 14901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An understandable expenditure, as I see it. Show everyone, enemies and allies alike, that you\'re not afraid to use your power.', 14900, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, well... luckily for us all, the troll will not be in a position of power within our fair city anytime soon.', '', 14899, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tatai, please. We\'re guests here.', 14898, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! If I ever be in charge\'a dis place, da first t\'ing I be doin\' is stoppin\' alla dat. Ja be markin\' my words.', '', 14897, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s taps a finger on her chin, lost in thought.', 14896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not simply a beautification measure, but also a morale booster. It demonstrates to our people that we have a great deal of power at our fingertips, and with it... we can do nearly anything.', '', 14895, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think about it carefully, my friends. If we can afford to spend our magic on simple aesthetic enhancements, clearly we hold a vast reservoir of power at our beck and call.', '', 14894, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This must be somewhat different from the environment to which you\'re accustomed. It is a visible demonstration of the power we hold, nothing more. We\'re mindful of our resources.', '', 14893, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems that a great deal of your power is used for... and I hope you\'ll pardon the term... frivolous things. Isn\'t that, well, wasteful?', 14892, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This city is very... expansive, but it seems to be lacking something. I can\'t put my finger on what...', 14891, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My condolences. These past years have been hard on us all.', 14890, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not the only victims of the Scourge. Our lady Sylvanas sympathizes with your plight.', 14889, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grumbles under his breath.', '', 14888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, no one asked you, Tatai.', 14887, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be a big waste, if ja be askin\' me.', '', 14886, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If your people are as strong as you purport, I\'m sure you\'ll find your stride again.', 14885, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We lost many of our kin in the war... so yes, the city is not perhaps as lively as it once was. We will endure, however.', '', 14884, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is merely part of what Silvermoon once was. Much of the city was lost after Arthas swept through our lands.', '', 14883, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis place be huge. Why ja be needin\' all dis space?', '', 14882, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My work here is done.', '', 14881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Be sure they understand.$B$BNow, I would appreciate it if you would leave my temple in peace.', '', 14880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tell them. Farewell, elder.', 'I will tell them. Farewell, elder.', 14879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion presses us hard, but our defenses hold. Every moment we keep Archimonde away from the World Tree brings us closer to victory.', '', 14878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then let the Legion do their worst!', '', 14877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So we\'re to trust people who would insult us with this deception? Do the draenei think so little of us that they must resort to trickery to get our attention?$B$BWe\'re aware of their desire to \'redeem\' us, but my people want none of their redemption. We are capable of standing on our own and we will pursue our destiny as a proud and separate people. Carry this message to your allies.', '', 14876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am with you, Thrall.', 'I am with you, Thrall.', 14875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not mean to deceive you, elder. The draenei of Telredor thought to approach you in a way that would be familiar to you.', 'I did not mean to deceive you, elder. The draenei of Telredor thought to approach you in a way that would be familiar to you.', 14874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treat with the draenei, the people who turned their backs on us while we suffered? I think not.$B$BA true spirit does not speak thus! Reveal yourself, impostor. Who sent you?', '', 14873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, elder. It is time for your people to end their hostility toward the draenei and their allies.', 'Greetings, elder. It is time for your people to end their hostility toward the draenei and their allies.', 14872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I humbly welcome you to our temple, spirit.', '', 14871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell us, Ambassador Kelemar... how do the blood elves plan to aid us, exactly?', 14870, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Proudmoore\'s forces have bled to delay Archimonde and his Burning Legion, and now this grim task falls to us. Are you ready to stand with me against the onslaught?', '', 14869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What help be ja givin\' de Horde, anyway?', '', 14868, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranger, make haste and contact Lady Jaina Proudmoore. Her small Alliance force is bravely attempting to blunt the Burning Legion\'s initial assault and delay the approach of Archimonde.', '', 14867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dela Runetotem\'s brow furrows, but she remains silent.', 14866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHO DARES CALL GUROK FROM THE UNDERNEATH?', '', 14865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Truly an advantageous alliance.', 14864, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sighs in resignation and falls silent.', '', 14863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tatai!', 14862, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'ink ja be contributin\' less glarin\' in dis troll\'s direction?', '', 14861, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suppose we\'ll see the measure of your dedication in due time.', 14860, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I realize we have had somewhat differing loyalties in the past, but put your suspicions aside. Our considerable power has been pledged to your leaders in good faith.', '', 14859, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely you see the advantage in our relationship. The powers we command are immense. With our aid, your enemies could well be decimated.', '', 14858, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people are strong. We bring you a mastery over arcane magics that you have previously lacked - ah, no offense intended, of course.', '', 14857, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me!', 'Follow me!', 14856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the place<PH>', '', 14855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remind me, ambassador... what precisely will your people be contributing to our efforts?', 14854, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s hisses loudly and prepares to attack.', '', 14853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n!  I remember your hunting prowess all too well.  You might have gotten off to a shaky start in Stranglethorn, but you stuck in there and became one o\' the finest when you bagged old Bangalash.$B$BBut listen, $g lad : lass;, the prey out here in the Outland is the real deal.  And I\'ve the scars to prove it!', '', 14852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen $g lad : lass;. I left the expedition in the capable hands of me son, Junior. When you\'ve stalked the finest game in all of Azeroth you start to itch for something more.$B$BAnd have you seen the size of the beasties here?!$B$BI\'m here hunting the most dangerous prey you\'ll ever lay your eyes on. I mean to bag myself Tusker and take her heart as my trophy!', '', 14851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hemet Nesingwary, what are you doing here in the Outland?', 'Hemet Nesingwary, what are you doing here in the Outland?', 14850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep a sharp eye, $c.  You never know when some beastie is stalking you instead of the other way around.', '', 14849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father\'s off to more exotic locations in search of bigger prey.  Don\'t worry though, we\'re still on the hunt here!', '', 14848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolsss, you will not ssssuccceed in ssstealing the ark!', 14847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00Broken Hill has been taken by the Horde!|r', '', 14846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00Broken Hill has been taken by the Alliance!|r', '', 14845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('|cffffff00The Stadium has been taken by the Horde!|r', '', 14844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Stadium has been taken by the Alliance!|r', '', 14843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Overlook has been taken by the Horde!|r', '', 14842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Overlook has been taken by the Alliance!|r', '', 14841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still, the Blood Knights will endure through this loss. We have no other choice... we must find another source.', 'Still, the Blood Knights will endure through this loss. We have no other choice... we must find another source.', 14840, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is... it true, what I\'ve heard?  That it was the Sun King himself?', 'Is... it true, what I\'ve heard?  That it was the Sun King himself?', 14839, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Liadrin is bound to find a way. She must.', 'Lady Liadrin is bound to find a way. She must.', 14838, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ssssurely the overseer can stop him!', '', 14837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat him in the name of Lady Vashj!', '', 14836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Use the mana shield!', '', 14835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yessss! Defeat him, Overseer!', '', 14834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s gone. I can\'t believe it\'s gone. Who would have thought we\'d be betrayed like this?', 'It\'s gone. I can\'t believe it\'s gone. Who would have thought we\'d be betrayed like this?', 14833, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those things eat fish! Watch out!', 'Those things eat fish! Watch out!', 14832, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Matters are so uncertain now that the chamber below is empty...', 'Matters are so uncertain now that the chamber below is empty...', 14831, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out for the acid spray, Overseer Tidewrath!', 'Watch out for the acid spray, Overseer Tidewrath!', 14830, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go! Go! You can take him!', 'Go! Go! You can take him!', 14829, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out!', 'Watch out!', 14828, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does that thing eat?', 'What does that thing eat?', 14827, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It must have broken the walls of the tank!', 'It must have broken the walls of the tank!', 14826, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s monstrous!', 'He\'s monstrous!', 14825, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look how big that thing is!', 'Look how big that thing is!', 14824, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They simply fear what they cannot begin to understand.', 'They simply fear what they cannot begin to understand.', 14823, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jealous, that\'s what they are. They\'re afraid to dedicate themselves to true power.', 'Jealous, that\'s what they are. They\'re afraid to dedicate themselves to true power.', 14822, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what you mean... they whisper about us when they think we can\'t hear them. They\'ll get theirs.', 'I know what you mean... they whisper about us when they think we can\'t hear them. They\'ll get theirs.', 14821, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who do they think they are?', 'Who do they think they are?', 14820, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m quickly tiring of the haughty attitude I receive from those grubby bowslingers outside.', 'I\'m quickly tiring of the haughty attitude I receive from those grubby bowslingers outside.', 14819, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rangers certainly have a high opinion of themselves.', 'The rangers certainly have a high opinion of themselves.', 14818, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overseer Tidewrath, watch out!', '', 14817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It ssspoilss our water!', '', 14816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our neighbors are positively laughable. Have you seen the way they turn up their noses at us?', 'Our neighbors are positively laughable. Have you seen the way they turn up their noses at us?', 14815, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Vashj will not be pleasssed to hear of thisss...', '', 14814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did sssuch a thing grow in this wasteland?', '', 14813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the seas... look at the sssize of that thing!', '', 14812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s inclines his head slightly to the pair of guardians in greeting.', '%s inclines her head slightly to the pair of guardians in greeting.', 14811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s surveys the small ranger practice ground with a condescending smirk.', '%s surveys the small ranger practice ground with a condescending smirk.', 14810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s glances from guard to guard.', '%s glances from guard to guard.', 14809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s arches a sculpted brow at the guards, a disapproving scowl on his face.', '%s arches a sculpted brow at the guards, a disapproving scowl on her face.', 14808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to the Sun K-- ah... Silvermoon!', 'Glory to the Sun K-- ah... Silvermoon!', 14807, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Straight and true, that\'s the way.', 'Straight and true, that\'s the way.', 14806, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a beautiful shot!', 'What a beautiful shot!', 14805, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Bullseye!', 'Hah! Bullseye!', 14804, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha!  You have failed!  Now I will pry my ark from your dead hands!', '', 14803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The earth rumbles as Gordawg\'s movements come to a halt.>$B$BSpeak.', '', 14802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I had my way, I\'d show those puffed-up paladins a thing or two.', 'If I had my way, I\'d show those puffed-up paladins a thing or two.', 14801, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With M\'uru gone, perhaps those haughty Blood Knights will see sense.', 'With M\'uru gone, perhaps those haughty Blood Knights will see sense.', 14800, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll see the light, I hope.', 'They\'ll see the light, I hope.', 14799, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there no sanctity left in this world?', 'Is there no sanctity left in this world?', 14798, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agh... a chill ran up my spine.', 'Agh... a chill ran up my spine.', 14797, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve recently heard word of a creature of immense power being summoned near the Vector Coil. Fear not, should anything threaten the town, we will give our lives to protect it.', 14796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Defenders are here to protect Blood Watch from the Sunhawk threat. ', 14795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Defenders of Blood Watch protect this outpost from any threat. ', 14794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the Light is no match for the indomitable will of our people.', 'Even the Light is no match for the indomitable will of our people.', 14793, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your power strengthens us all.', 'Your power strengthens us all.', 14792, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our lives are yours, Blood Knight.', 'Our lives are yours, Blood Knight.', 14791, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to you our young ones will be safe, $n.  Go to Sporeggar and meet my people.  They\'ve all heard great things about you.', '', 14790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bog lords are devouring the spore sacs!  They\'ve got to be stopped!', '', 14789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I welcome you to Sporeggar, $r.  We don\'t normally see many of your kind around here, but you\'ve proven your worth to us.  Make yourself at home.', '', 14788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maintain order within these walls.', '', 14787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what to think of your kind yet, $r.  Some of you can be violent and kill sporelings on sight.$B$BYou seem friendly... though maybe a little bit funny looking, I suppose.', '', 14786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not disturb the serenity of the city. Peace must be upheld.', '', 14785, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remain strong. Kael\'thas will - error - Lor\'themar will lead you to power and glory!', '', 14784, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Obey the laws of Silvermoon. Failure to do so will result in termination.', '', 14783, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Happiness is mandatory, citizen.', '', 14782, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve always liked sorting and organizing things.  I guess I take after my mother.', 14781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This book contains information on the plant species of Outland.  Most of the plants detailed are native to Zangarmarsh.$B$BYou feel confident that you can use the charts and diagrams in the book to identify various plant species.', '', 14780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This book contains information on the plant species of Outland.  Most of the plants detailed are native to Zangarmarsh.$B$BThe charts and diagrams are a bit beyond your understanding.  Perhaps the author could give you some pointers.', '', 14779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn! Burn! Burn!', '', 14778, 12, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the winds guide you, $n.', 14777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, my $g brother : sister;. How can I guide you today?', 'Greetings, my $g brother : sister;. How can I guide you today?', 14776, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land has been ravaged by the crash. While you may not follow our philosophies, $c, I urge you to do whatever you can to aid in the healing process.', 'This land has been ravaged by the crash. While you may not follow our philosophies, $c, I urge you to do whatever you can to aid in the healing process.', 14775, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek further instruction, $n?', 'You seek further instruction, $n?', 14774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.', 'Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.', 14773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What assistance can I offer in your studies?', 'What assistance can I offer in your studies?', 14772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You clearly lack the capacity to grasp the intricacies of the arcane, $c. Off with you.', 'You clearly lack the capacity to grasp the intricacies of the arcane, $c. Off with you.', 14771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?', 'Ah, a fellow ranger. What do you need?', 14770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?', 'It\'s a pleasure to see someone sane around here. How can I help you?', 14769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have little to discuss, $c. Perhaps you should seek other, more like-minded individuals.', 'We have little to discuss, $c. Perhaps you should seek other, more like-minded individuals.', 14768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?', 'Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?', 14767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears you took a wrong turn, $c.', 'It appears you took a wrong turn, $c.', 14766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere.', 'I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere.', 14765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to perisssh at my handsss!', '', 14764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I apologize, $c. I mistook you for someone with a spine. Begone; our secrets are not for untrained ears.', 'I apologize, $c. I mistook you for someone with a spine. Begone; our secrets are not for untrained ears.', 14763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The creature approachessss! Arm yourssselvesss!', '', 14762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Untrag of the Earthen Ring. Try not to upset the elements while you remain at the Throne of the Elements.', '', 14761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can my people fight when the elements are in such turmoil? Do they not see that without the support of the elements, the world simply cannot be.', 14760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earthen Ring seeks to preserve the strength and majesty of the elements.', '', 14759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits are restless, $r. Be mindful of your surroundings while in Nagrand lest you be consumed by their fury.', '', 14758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n.', 14757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grins malevolently.', '', 14756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We end this now!', '', 14755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the light! What have they done to you?', '', 14754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re not the younglings we once were, Man\'ari! By the light, we shall end your suffering!', '', 14753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death comes, Boros!', '', 14752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our might will be focused. We will not allow the desecration to continue.', '', 14751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your brethren seek to harm my children. Those that call themselves Windyreed subvert the land. A marsh this will not become...', '', 14750, 12, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient spirit, you honor the Earthen Ring. What troubles you so?', '', 14749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waters calm as Watoosun materializes.', '', 14748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Having successfully defended the Alonsus Chapel, %s\'s spirit returns to its rest.', 'Having successfully defended the Alonsus Chapel, %s\'s spirit returns to its rest.', 14747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Northpass tower needs our aid!  Once again, let us charge and do proud our liege!', '', 14746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please cast a high priority BUFF spell on all nearby targets.', 'Please cast a high priority BUFF spell on all nearby targets.', 14745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please cast a high priority DEBUFF spell on all nearby targets.', 'Please cast a high priority DEBUFF spell on all nearby targets.', 14744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the light protect you. Now, go!', '', 14743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sir! We have reports of a Man\'ari abomination being summoned to the west. I am deploying the Defenders to intercept along the path to Blood Watch. ', 14742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me your mark, mighty ancient.', 'Grant me your mark, mighty ancient.', 14741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature is a powerful force, $r.  Those who seek to subdue never succeed in doing so permanently.', '', 14740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me your mark, wise ancient.', 'Grant me your mark, wise ancient.', 14739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature favors those willing to learn its secrets, $n.', '', 14738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You honor us with your presence, $n.', 'You honor us with your presence, $n.', 14737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, $n!', 'Welcome back, $n!', 14736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have thwarted us for now, but we shall return...', '', 14735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! more! I shall soon be unleashed!', '', 14734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More! Spill more of their blood! I am near!', '', 14733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes.. spill more of their blood! It draws me nearer to this place!', '', 14732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t escape us, druid!', '', 14731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the headquarters of the Blood Knights, the defenders of Quel\'Thalas, the faithful servants of Silvermoon, and the true masters of the Light.', '', 14730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can see my fellow druids from here.  Thank you, $n.  I\'m sure Ysiel will reward you for your actions!', 14729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re almost to the refuge!  Let\'s go.', 14728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out, $n!  Enemies ahead!', 14727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s keep moving.  We\'re not safe here!', 14726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like we won\'t get away so easily.  Get ready!', 14725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is the way clear?  Let\'s get out while we can, $n.', 14724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Defenders.', 'Tell me about the Defenders.', 14723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We serve the light unquestioningly. Perhaps you might be a bit more curious about our purpose?', 14722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I help you? ', 14721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, are you here to learn about the conflict in Bloodmyst?', 14720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[In broken Common] Stillpine be ready! Many thanks!', '', 14719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am the leader of the Blood Watch defenses. What can I help you with?', 14718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not be stopped by such pitiful defenses. ', '', 14717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More of you stand in my way? Kill them, Sunhawks!', '', 14716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a pitiful defense. Is this the best you can do?', '', 14715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What we saw explains what happened in the Dead Mire.  There was a lake here once.  If we don\'t stop the naga, all of the marsh will soon look like this!', 14714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There!  Those pipes all appear to be connected to that structure.  It can\'t possibly fit all the water they\'ve been stealing.  Where are they keeping it?', 14713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga are even pumping the water out of their own lake!  What purpose could that possibly serve?', 14712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Kael!', 'For Kael!', 14711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us slay them!', 'Let us slay them!', 14710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Sunhawks!', 'For the Sunhawks!', 14709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish!', 'As you wish!', 14708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By your order, master!', 'By your order, master!', 14707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s just like the structure you described at Umbrafen Lake.  Does this mean the naga are pumping water out of all the lakes in Zangarmarsh?', 14706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars in pain. ', '%s roars in pain. ', 14705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must continue to hold on for as long as we can! Fight on!', 14704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] The British are coming! Clear the roads!', '[PH] The British are coming! Clear the roads!', 14703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is too big, though.  If the naga aren\'t stopped, our expedition won\'t even matter.  Word must be sent back to the Archdruids of the Circle.', 14702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told myself I wouldn\'t burden the Cenarion Circle with our expedition\'s problems, $n.  Our military strength is minimal, however.  We\'re scholars and explorers, first and foremost.', 14701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t like the idea of asking Azeroth for help, but we have little choice.', 14700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $R. Now prepare yourselves. Archimonde is on the march, and we must hold off the inevitable for as long as we can.', 14699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My companions and I are with you, Lady Proudmoore.', 'My companions and I are with you, Lady Proudmoore.', 14698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have no idea who you are, but your presence is most welcome. Archimonde and his Scourge army could attack at any time, $C. Will you stand with us against this evil?', 14697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ysiel expected some enemy opposition to her foray into Outland.  That\'s why us wardens were brought along.$B$BWe never expected our opposition to come in the strength or numbers that the naga have shown.', '', 14696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot afford to let our guard down, $c. This world is crawling with agents and allies of the Burning Legion. If you come across anything strange, don\'t hestitate to show me.', 14695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Cowards and fools! Return to my platform if you dare to face me!', '', 14694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I can sense it - you\'ve won the day! I believe I can safely transport you to Stratholme now, provided you\'ve paid my colleague there a visit first. Just step into the circle and be patient...', '', 14693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It does my soul good to see the walls of Stormwind standing strong and tall.$b$bIf you\'re looking to go to Stratholme, I\'m afraid I\'m unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you\'re victorious there.', '', 14692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hail $n, savior of Azuremyst and Bloodmyst. Hero of the Hand of Argus, champion of the draenei people!', '', 14691, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is all for you, $n. You did this. You saved all of these people and thousands more.$B$BYou have risen above the strife and tragedy of this world and in doing so, elevated all of us with you.$B$BYou have done so much - more than many could do in ten lifetimes - yet your life has just begun. If only we had a thousand heroes like you.$B$BBut listen well, $n. Your destiny lies in the Outland. I have seen it in visions, a prophecy yet untold.$B$BFind our people, $n. Find them and bring them home...', '', 14690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The draenei champion walks among us. This is a celebration for the savior of Azuremyst and Bloodmyst!', '', 14689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my daughter, $n, and for that, I am forever indebted to you, $n. Thank you so much.', '', 14688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wanted to thank you once more for what you did for me. You gave me the courage to take back my home from the beasts of the forest. In doing so, I found Magwin!', '', 14687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would have traveled across the Great Sea to see you, friend. We will never forget what you did for us.', '', 14686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have traveled far to celebrate the hero of the draenei people.', '', 14685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a glorious day for the draenei! Thank you for all that you have done, $n.', '', 14684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again, $n. I brought a friend with me. She really wanted to see you.$B$B<Kessel laughs.>', '', 14683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have come to support the draenei champion!', '', 14682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wouldn\'t have missed this for the world, $n.$B$B<Exarch Menelaous hugs you.>$B$BWe are proud of you.', '', 14681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are here to support our hero!', '', 14680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s hugs you.', 14679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You probably don\'t remember me, but you saved my life. I have only recently become healthy enough to walk on my own.$B$BI wanted to thank you for what you did for me and apologize for what I may have said... Thank you, $n. May Elune always watch over you.', 14678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am here to give thanks to the one that saved my life.', 14677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are here to celebrate your victory and to welcome our newfound allies!', '', 14676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve come a long way, $n. A long way indeed... But I knew you were destined for great things.  We all knew. All hail $n!$B$BAnd thanks again for taking care of our gnome problem...', '', 14675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 71, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A glorious victory!', '', 14674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[In broken Common] Stillpine thank hero. Many thank!', '', 14673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Promised One, do you remember us? Do you recall the prophecy of Kurz? This moment was pre-ordained. You have done what you were put on this world to do.$B$B<High Chief Stillpine bows before you.>$B$BDraenei will always be welcome among my people.', '', 14672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[In broken Common] It is time celebrate we do.', '', 14671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naturalist, please grant me your boon.', 'Naturalist, please grant me your boon.', 14670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that the rude interruption is over, as I was saying, Quagmirran is nearby!$B$BAs promised, I can fortify you with a magical boon that should aid you in your fight with him.', '', 14669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Hey!  Over here!  Yeah, over here... I\'m in this cage!!!', '', 14668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am patiently awaiting orders, $c.', 14667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Petulant children, pray to your gods for you are about to meet them!', 14666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to Blood Watch. I\'ll see you there...', '', 14665, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I can\'t believe it\'s over. You did it! You\'ve destroyed the blood elves and their leader!', '', 14664, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holy mother of O\'ros!', '', 14663, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take cover and be ready for the fight of your life, $n!', '', 14662, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve almost got it! Just a little more time...', '', 14661, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cover me, we have to do this quickly. Once I blow the support on this side, it will disrupt the energy beams and she\'ll break out! I doubt very much that she\'ll be happy to see us.', '', 14660, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessed Light! She\'s siphoning energy right out of the Vector Coil!', '', 14659, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be ready for anything, $n.', '', 14658, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in the Nether is that?!?!', '', 14657, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t get too excited, hero, that was the easy part. The challenge lies ahead! Let\'s go.', '', 14656, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1...', '', 14655, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '', 14654, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('3...', '', 14653, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'ll do it! Quickly, take cover!', '', 14652, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It won\'t be much longer, $n. Just keep them off me while I work.', '', 14651, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cover me!', '', 14650, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There it is! Do you see where the large red crystal is jutting out from the Vector Coil? That\'s where I need to plant the first set of explosives.', '', 14649, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no turning back now, $n. Stay close and watch my back.', '', 14648, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come to destroy the Vector Coil!', '', 14647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fhwoor do good!', '', 14646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s places the Ark of Ssslith on the ground.', '', 14645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha, squishy naga!', '', 14644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh...', '', 14643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lifts the Ark of Ssslith with ease.', '', 14642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We go!', '', 14641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take moment... get ready.', '', 14640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fhwoor go now, $n.  Get ark, come back.', '', 14639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Test', '', 14638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treacherous whelp! Sironas will destroy you and your people!', 'Treacherous whelp! Sironas will destroy you and your people!', 14637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did and you believed me. Thank you for the information, blood elf. You have helped us more than you could know.', 'I did and you believed me. Thank you for the information, blood elf. You have helped us more than you could know.', 14636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Numerous? It has two weak points: The base of the structure on the west side and the base of the structure on the east side. Hey, wait a minute. How would you know anything about the Vector Coil? Didn\'t you say that you were captured before you even materialized?', 'Numerous? It has two weak points: The base of the structure on the west side and the base of the structure on the east side. Hey, wait a minute. How would you know anything about the Vector Coil? Didn\'t you say that you were captured before you even materialized?', 14635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vector Coil is massive. I hope we have more than one abomination guarding the numerous weak points.', 'The Vector Coil is massive. I hope we have more than one abomination guarding the numerous weak points.', 14634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Obviously. How else could she infiltrate their ranks and pass as a draenei? She had been living among them for a very long time. ', 'Obviously. How else could she infiltrate their ranks and pass as a draenei? She had been living among them for a very long time. ', 14633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sironas is an eredar... I mean, yes, obviously.', 'Sironas is an eredar... I mean, yes, obviously.', 14632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sironas claims that certain eredar possess the ability to transform others of their race into man\'ari. Draenei were supposedly once eredar and Sironas is a powerful eredar.$B$B<The agent laughs.>$B$BCan you believe it? These pathetic creatures were once all-powerful demons. What kind of fool rejects such power?\n', 'Sironas claims that certain eredar possess the ability to transform others of their race into man\'ari: Savage demonic beings. Draenei were supposedly once eredar and Sironas is a powerful eredar.$B$B<The agent laughs.>$B$BCan you believe it? These pathetic creatures were once all-powerful demons. What kind of fool rejects such power?\n', 14631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incredible. How did Sironas accomplish such a thing?', 'Incredible. How did Sironas accomplish such a thing?', 14630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was Sironas\' idea... The abomination is actually one of their own. He is a high ranking member of the draenei military order: Triumvirate or some such nonsense.$B$BWhatever that thing is, it\'s massive, powerful, and full of rage. Any attacks against the Vector Coil will most certainly result in failure as long as that abomination is around.', 'It was Sironas\' idea... The abomination is actually one of their own. He is a high ranking member of the draenei military order: Triumvirate or some such nonsense.$B$BWhatever that thing is, it\'s massive, powerful, and full of rage. Any attacks against the Vector Coil will most certainly result in failure as long as that abomination is around.', 14629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, Sironas. I had nearly forgotten that Sironas was here. I served under Sironas back on Outland. I hadn\'t heard of this abomination, though; those damnable draenei captured me before I even fully materialized on this world.', 'Ah yes, Sironas. I had nearly forgotten that Sironas was here. I served under Sironas back on Outland. I hadn\'t heard of this abomination, though; those damnable draenei captured me before I even fully materialized on this world.', 14628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The captured Sunhawk agent smirks.>$B$BDon\'t worry, new blood, there are many more portal controllers and many more suitable locations for portals. I am certain that Sironas will have a new gate up very soon. These blue skinned dogs are not long for this world. Sironas and the abomination will clean up whatever the Sunhawk forces leave behind.', '<The captured Sunhawk agent smirks.>$B$BDon\'t worry, new blood, there are many more portal controllers and many more suitable locations for portals. I am certain that Sironas will have a new gate up very soon. These blue skinned dogs are not long for this world. Sironas and the abomination will clean up whatever the Sunhawk forces leave behind.', 14627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a prisoner, what does it look like? The draenei filth captured me as I exited the sun gate. They killed our portal controllers and destroyed the gate. The Sun King will be most displeased with this turn of events.', 'I\'m a prisoner, what does it look like? The draenei filth captured me as I exited the sun gate. They killed our portal controllers and destroyed the gate. The Sun King will be most displeased with this turn of events.', 14626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The captured Sunhawk agent eyes you suspiciously.>$B$BI\'ve never seen you before. Who are you?', '<The captured Sunhawk agent eyes you suspiciously.>$B$BI\'ve never seen you before. Who are you?', 14625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need the illusion cast upon me again, Admetius.', 'I need the illusion cast upon me again, Admetius.', 14624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope this day finds you well.  Can I offer you something?', 'Hope this day finds you well.  Can I offer you something?', 14623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be thankful that I am locked inside this cage, $r.', 'Be thankful that I am locked inside this cage, $r.', 14622, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I can sense it - you\'ve won the day! I believe I can safely transport you to Stratholme now, provided you\'ve paid my colleague there a visit first. Just step into the circle and be patient...', '', 14621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unpleasant place, this \"Undercity\". Not at all like the Lordaeron of old. How I miss it...$b$bIf you\'re looking to go to Stratholme, I\'m afraid I\'m unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you\'re victorious there.', '', 14620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The druids protect me from the naga and evil Lost Ones.  In exchange, I teach them about the plants and animals of the marsh.', '', 14619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Psst!  Hey, $c, over here to your left.  Come here!', '', 14618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vindicator Aesom salutes you.>$B$BHave you spoken with Admetius? I believe he was inquiring as to your whereabouts.', '', 14617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Banish <PH>', '', 14616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait and see what happens!', 14615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Starting Event <PH>', '', 14614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s uproots the rest of the mushroom tree and makes off with it.', '', 14613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s takes a piece of the mushroom tree and holds it to its \'nose\'.  Seemingly satisfied, it eats it!', '', 14612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, thank you, $n!  You\'ve made it possible to save both the sporelings from the bog lords, and the bog lords from our wrath.', 14611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh Buddy, you big baby!  Look, it\'s working.  It\'s really working!!  Now all I need to do is grow more of these mushrooms here and the bog lords will likely leave the sporelings alone!', 14610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok, let\'s see about using those mushrooms you brought back to grow the bog lords a new food supply.', 14609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, let\'s go see if this plan will work.  Come along, Buddy!', 14608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, $n.', 14607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have run out of extinguishing mixture. May I have another vial?', 'I have run out of extinguishing mixture. May I have another vial?', 14606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All things in nature exists in an interconnected web; an ecology.  If we\'re careful not to disturb it, and simply observe, we may be fortunate to piece together the complex relationship between the diverse organisms around us.$B$BOnce we have that understanding, we can take the appropriate actions to ensure the wellbeing of all creatures.  Interfere without that knowledge, and we\'ll surely cause destruction.$B$BI am here to observe the complex interactions between the sporelings and the bog lords.', 14605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('', 'May the Light bend to your will in all endeavors.', 14604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watcher Leesa\'oh, why are you out here?', 'Watcher Leesa\'oh, why are you out here?', 14603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tune \'em up good, boys!', '', 14602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sironas will have our skulls if these are allowed to grow!', 'Sironas will have our skulls if these are allowed to grow!', 14601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the vermin!', 'Destroy the vermin!', 14600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy void beast! DIE!', 'Filthy void beast! DIE!', 14599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them before they grow!', 'Kill them before they grow!', 14598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How embarrassing to be taken as a pet by a hunter!$B$BI owe you my life.  Now that you\'ve freed me from Musel\'ek, I\'ll be able to find my way out.', '', 14597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Encounter Complete!', '', 14596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! Do you know what you\'ve done? This is sacred ground!', '', 14595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Do not waste my time.  What is it you want?', 'Do not waste my time.  What is it you want?', 14594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damn those blood elves and their reckless magic!', 14593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the only apparent surviving \'Broken\', it is both my duty and honor to carry on the shamanistic teachings of Farseer Nobundo.', 'As the only apparent surviving \'Broken\', it is both my duty and honor to carry on the shamanistic teachings of Farseer Nobundo.', 14592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank goodness for you!  Claw and I were investigating this place when we were jumped by Swamplord Musel\'ek.$B$BUnfortunately, Claw was caught in bear form at the time, and is now the swamplord\'s pet.$B$BI\'m afraid you\'ll have to fight Claw in order to save him.', '', 14591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Is it really wrong of me to seek my petty revenge?', '', 14590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not the face... Not the face!!!', '', 14589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can go around you, or through you.  Your choice!', '', 14588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no other way, blasphemer. Prepare to meet your fate.', '', 14587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing will stop me from fulfilling my destiny!', '', 14586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like to think myself a reasonable fellow in an unreasonable situation.', '', 14585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... HAVE HAD ENOUGH... OF... YOU!', '', 14584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Naturalist Bite growls.> You took my worldly possessions, but you will NEVER take my soul!', '', 14583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy animals!  Cage me will you?!', '', 14582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('False paladin, show yourself! Prepare to taste the wrath of the Light\'s true servants!', '', 14581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you have done is abominable! Atone for your crimes against the Light!', '', 14580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh mighty Quagmirran, we beseech thee to welcome us into your presence!', '', 14578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb the sanctity of the Alonsus Chapel?', '', 14577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.  Onward to fame and glory!', '', 14576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh!  It would appear that all of the noise you\'ve been making has attracted some unwanted attention!', '', 14575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, Bite, I\'ll let you out.', 'Alright, Bite, I\'ll let you out.', 14574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sun gate must be stabilized. Focus your energies!', 'The sun gate must be stabilized. Focus your energies!', 14573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The protective tendrils of arcane energy have been lifted. The sun gate is vulnerable!', '', 14572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I almost made it!$B$BI came in here to prove the existence of Quagmirran, that most mythical of fungal giants.  I got my wish, sort of.$B$BYou must let me free!  In return I will grant you a boon to help you to deal with Quagmirran.', '', 14571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Here lie the remains of Weeder Greenthumb, one of Watcher Jhang\'s druid companions.  By all appearances he was killed quick and clean while trying to make his escape from the Slave Pens.', '', 14570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will act when we know what we need, old friend.  The druids have proven wise and capable of making their own decisions.', '', 14569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'d do well not to be reckless.  There\'s still much to learn about this land and about the enemy.', '', 14568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.  When that decision is made, I will be ready.  Let us hope it won\'t be too late.', '', 14567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prudence should not mean granting our enemy unnecessary advantages.', '', 14566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wind speaks of our enemies\' movements, Ashyen.  The naga will attack again.', '', 14565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a matter of fact, I did. I was going to frame it and show it to the guys in Ironforge for a laugh, but you\'re welcome to it.', '', 14564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Aesom, third of the Triumvirate.', '', 14563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my Weathered Treasure Map. Do you have a spare copy of it?', 'I lost my Weathered Treasure Map. Do you have a spare copy of it?', 14562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You only delay the inevitable...', 'You only delay the inevitable...', 14561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sunstrider shall be victorious!', 'Sunstrider shall be victorious!', 14560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My comrades will... will... arrrrgghhh...', 'My comrades will... will... arrrrgghhh...', 14559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, master.', 'Forgive me, master.', 14558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... have... failed...', 'I... have... failed...', 14557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like the phoenix, I shall be reborn.', 'Like the phoenix, I shall be reborn.', 14556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic, really. Is that the best you can do?', 'Pathetic, really. Is that the best you can do?', 14555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hit like a child.', 'You hit like a child.', 14554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never know such discipline.', 'You will never know such discipline.', 14553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the portal!', 'Protect the portal!', 14552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Count yourself blessed that I fear the wrath of Kael\'thas more than death, else I would break from this channel and disintigrate you.', 'Count yourself blessed that I fear the wrath of Kael\'thas more than death, else I would break from this channel and disintigrate you.', 14551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must concentrate! Guards! Guards! Aid me!', 'I must concentrate! Guards! Guards! Aid me!', 14550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fhwoor like little sporelings.  They save Fhwoor.  Not eat them.$B$BFhwoor hate naga.  Fhwoor smash!', '', 14549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If only I hadn\'t twisted my ankle coming into this place, I\'d be in there with my friends.  Hmmm, now that I think about it, maybe it\'s better that I\'m out here?', 14548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Filthy fungal giants!  What did we ever do to them?', '', 14547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, you happen to see that arch in the lake to the west?  I wonder where that goes?  I should go divin\' over there.', '', 14546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you believe this place?  \'Course, it\'s a mite stuffy up here if you ask me.', 14545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With new enemies on our doorsteps, we must not allow our ancient enemies to take advantage of our situation!', '', 14544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their day will come, $n.$B$BAnd when it does, I will be there.', '', 14543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If our enemies would see that we only wish to live in harmony with them, maybe we wouldn\'t have to attack them for our own survival?', '', 14542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find their source of power and tear it down. Tear all of it down.', '', 14541, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits on the corpse of Matis.', '', 14540, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathe your last breath, heathen.', '', 14539, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grins wickedly.', '', 14538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draenei dog! Did you know that the one you call Saruan wept like a babe as I beat him? A feeling of euphoria coursed through me, knowing that I had a member of high rank in my grasp. Were it not for Sironas\' plans for him, I would have tortured him to death... As I do to all draenei that I capture. Alas, I am certain that you will see him again soon...\n', '', 14537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move!', 'Move!', 14536, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take him away.', '', 14535, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light has no choice. It does as it is commanded. Just as the naaru you hold at the core of your vessel will do when we capture and enslave it... Do my words surprise you, blue blood? Yes, we know... We know everything.', '', 14534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You blaspheme! The Light would never allow such an aberration!', '', 14533, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek to martyr me before my order - so be it. Strike me down, another will rise in my place and the suffering of the Light - of the conquered - will continue uninterrupted.', '', 14532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Blood Knight, mongrel. I do not serve the Light, the Light serves me. If mercy is to be granted, it will be by me.', '', 14531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 14530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light?', '', 14529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s glares at Velen.', '', 14528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Light have mercy on your soul. Take him back to his cell.', '', 14527, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits at the image of Velen.', '', 14526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are to be executed at light\'s dawning. Have you anything to say for yourself?', '', 14525, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Matis, blood elf lieutenant of the Sunhawks, you have been found guilty of genocide against the draenei people.', '', 14524, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Velen urged me to take a leadership role amongst the Broken. But more importantly, he asked me to teach shamanism to all; Broken and draenei alike. I accepted.$B$BWe knew then that given the prejudices of some that this would be a difficult proposition at best. There are those that despise the Broken because we are a frightening reminder of the past. And there are others who believe the way of the shaman to be a blasphemy against the Light.$B$BIn any case, that is my tale.', '', 14523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('You heard the Prophet. Move, filth.', 'You heard the Prophet. Move, filth.', 14522, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, go on.', 'Please, go on.', 14521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, you win! <PH>', 'Sorry, you win! <PH>', 14520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring forth the blood elf.', '', 14519, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I returned to my people and was greeted with smiling faces and outstretched arms, mostly from the Broken. The prejudices against us from many draenei had continued in my absence. But it was as if they knew that I was coming, and I soon found out why.$B$BVelen, the prophet and leader of all of the draenei, had seen my return in one of his visions and was there to greet me as well. He asked to speak with me in private and as I related my story to him, he nodded and smiled, for this too he had foreseen.', '', 14518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('What did you do then?', 'What did you do then?', 14517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It taught me the path of shamanism, which in a way is just another facet of the Light. Joining the wind was the water of the oasis, the fire from my camp and the earth upon which I sat. All had something to say.$B$BOver the next few years they taught me what it was to call upon and be one with the elements of the world. And they told me that the worlds of all of the stars in the sky, even this one, are made up of these elements.$B$BBut the day came when I felt that I had learned enough to leave.', '', 14516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('What was that?', 'What was that?', 14515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It spoke to me of secrets and power, and also of truths. The Light had not forsaken the Broken! The fel energies that the orcs had wielded long ago against the draenei had infused us, causing a break in our ability to be heard by, or perhaps to hear, the Light. The same that had been responsible for the degradation of our bodies.$B$BBut our spirits were not broken, and the air offered to me another path, through which I might deliver my people.\n', '', 14514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('What did it say to you?', 'What did it say to you?', 14513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There was something strange about that wind; it didn\'t stop. For weeks it blew across the land, waxing and waning, but never ceasing. And all the time the voice continued, though I could not understand it, nor did I know where it was coming from.$B$BMy time in solitude had taught me how to calm myself and look inward. This I did in order to keep my sanity. And that is when I began to understand the voice. It was coming from the wind itself and it had much to say!', '', 14512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('Nobundo, please continue.', 'Nobundo, please continue.', 14511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had been fortunate to find an oasis and made the decision to stay there until I received an answer. So there I sat, moving only when absolutely necessary, living off of the creatures that would come near the pool. Such was my pride.$B$BAs I said, decades passed without an answer. But I can remember a particularly beautiful sunset one evening. A warm zephyr blew across the land and I was sure that I heard a voice, but no one was around.$B$BAs you can imagine, I thought that I was finally losing my mind.', '', 14510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('Yes, please, if you do not mind.', 'Yes, please, if you do not mind.', 14509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel energies also had the side-effect on the Broken and the Lost Ones of cutting us off from the Light. At the time I did not know exactly why, but as a vindicator I insisted on finding out. I decided to make a pilgrimage to do just that.$B$BAnd so it was that after the war came to its fateful end, I journeyed into the desert of the fragmented planet, beseeching the Light to return to us. But decades passed, and the Light never answered my prayers.$B$BIs this something that you wish to hear more of?', '', 14508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('Yes, please continue.', 'Yes, please continue.', 14507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My story? It is kind of you to ask. Very well.$B$BLong ago on the planet Draenor - the remains of which are now known as the Outland - all of the draenei lived in peace. But then the Burning Legion came, and they corrupted the orcs with their fel magics.$B$BWith no other option we fought to survive, but exposure to these fel energies had horrible effects upon some of us, over time transforming us into the Broken like me, or worse, the seemingly mindless Lost Ones.$B$BShall I go on?', '', 14506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 500, 500, 39653),
('Tell me of your past, Farseer.', 'Tell me of your past, Farseer.', 14505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin your search to the north, $n. Our scouts have spotted the Warp Piston near the shoreline.', '', 14504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where should I begin my search for the portal?', 'Where should I begin my search for the portal?', 14503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s snorts.', '', 14502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sneers.', '', 14501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s smirks.', '', 14500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s giggles.', '', 14499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
