('Show $n the meaning of pain, Sunstriker!', '', 14463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show this upstart how a real Blood Knight fights, Swiftblade!', '', 14462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
