('Champion Lightrend, make me proud!', '', 14460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the trial begin! Bloodwrath, attack!', '', 14459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onward! The wilds of Bloodmyst await!', 'Onward! The wilds of Bloodmyst await!', 14458, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters, tonight we hunt! A blood elf known as Matis must be brought to justice! The first to find him gets one week\'s vacation aboard the Exodar!', 'Brothers and sisters, tonight we hunt! A blood elf known as Matis must be brought to justice! The first to find him gets one week\'s vacation aboard the Exodar!', 14457, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls forth their brethren.', '%s calls forth their brethren.', 14456, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be done, my lord.', 'It will be done, my lord.', 14455, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want all of your trackers out in search of the criminal, Matis the Cruel. I have given trusted agents of the Hand flare guns. Should you or one of your trackers see the flare, it means that an agent has found Matis and needs assistance. And remember, tracker, Matis is to be brought back to me alive.', '', 14454, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am at your service, my lord.', 'I am at your service, my lord.', 14453, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast another spell on me that uses the exact same implicit target but has a different effect -- like death touch.', 'Cast another spell on me that uses the exact same implicit target but has a different effect -- like death touch.', 14452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You complete me.', 'You complete me.', 14451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi, $n. Click the option below to complete quest 9711 -- Matis the Cruel.$B$BNote that nothing happens even though I am attempting to cast a spell.', '', 14450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will regret this, maggot.', '', 14449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the death!', '', 14448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never take me alive!', '', 14447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got you now, $n!', 'We\'ve got you now, $n!', 14446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Kuros. I will bring him to Blood Watch.', 'Return to Kuros. I will bring him to Blood Watch.', 14445, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s falls unconscious.', '', 14444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back, $n. There are going to be a lot of sparks.', '', 14443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Cenarion druids are the protectors of the balance of nature.  The main point being the balance.  When called for, we shouldn\'t wait too long before taking decisive action.  Don\'t let anyone tell you otherwise, especially those of us who only want to observe!', '', 14442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('There, $n. It is done.', '', 14441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay no attention to their kind, $n. The sacrifices made by your order are lost on them. They will never understand the price you pay for the power you wield in their defense.', '', 14440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s face twists in revulsion as he realizes what Bemarrin is doing. He turns his back and walks away.', '', 14439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s arranges the materials on the anvil.', '', 14438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, pay no mind to Buddy.  He won\'t hurt you, he just likes to scratch now and then.$B$BHe\'s just a big, loveable kitty.$B$BAren\'t you Buddy?  Yes, you are, you cute, little thing.  You\'re mommy\'s little baby, that\'s what you are!', 14437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training as a Blacksmith.', 'I seek training as a Blacksmith.', 14436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day, $c. If you wish to learn the smith\'s art, you\'ve come to the right place.', '', 14435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('sqwaks in the innkeeper\'s direction and makes its way back towards Sunstrider Isle.', '', 14434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, $n!  Remain within Dawning Street and you will reach the Inner Elf Gate!', 14433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That the Sironas entity had plans for Saruan... $B$B<The writing stops abruptly and a long line scrolls off the page. This draenei died while making the entry.>\n', '', 14432, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wanted to scream but only a low gasp escaped my lips. I was promptly beaten for this act of rebellion. As I lay on the ground, I could see Matis pacing in front of Saruan\'s body. He seemed visibly concerned. He stated that Sironas or Sirona or some such entity would have his flesh flayed from his bones if Saruan had perished in the beatings. \n', '', 14431, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After what seemed an eternity, the Vindicator lost consciousness. The torture was too much, even for him. The cruel one - Matis as I found out he was called - attempted to wake Saruan by splashing contagion laced water across his ravaged body. But Saruan did not wake.\n', '', 14430, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Turn to the next page.>', '<Turn to the next page.>', 14429, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I watched as they beat him without mercy. Their ruthless lieutenant acted as if such cruelty was an act of normalcy. Through the savage beatings, I could feel myself breaking.$B$BAs I watched Vindicator Saruan take their blows, I began to weep. Not out of fear... I wept out of sadness. To see a draenei of the Triumvirate treated in such a manner. If only I could have broken free of my bonds. If only...\n', '', 14428, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. I am Kuros, second of the Triumvirate of the Hand.', '', 14422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, you lose! <PH>', 'Sorry, you lose! <PH>', 14421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s picks up medical supplies.', '%s picks up medical supplies.', 14420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A %s spots medical supplies.', 'A %s spots medical supplies.', 14419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have served one of three with honor, $n. Our time is at an end. Kuros will call for you when he is ready.', '', 14418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c.  It is good you\'ve decided to visit us.', 14417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes master, anything you say.', '', 14416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too soon! You are slacking off too soon!', '', 14415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is terrible..... my arms grow tired from beating on you lazy peons!', '', 14414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?! Didn\'t mommy and daddy teach you anything?!', '', 14413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up with it already! The longer you take, the more of a hurtin\' I\'m putting on you!', '', 14412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune\'s grace upon you.  How can I serve?', 14411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A search of the corpse\'s clothing and equipment reveals the insignia you need, undamaged by the battle and foul environment.', '', 14410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can help you establish a guild.', '', 14409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Search the corpse for an insignia.', 'Search the corpse for an insignia.', 14408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examining the corpse, you conclude that this must be Blood Knight Dawnstar, the leader of the failed assault on Deatholme.', '', 14407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent fool! You thought to steal Zelemar\'s blood? You shall pay with your own!', '', 14406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up! Now get up and back to work!', '', 14405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to work you!', '', 14404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We happily drink in your blue blood, draenei. Nothing gives us more pleasure than to wound you just to see the blood flow.', 'We happily drink in your blue blood, draenei. Nothing gives us more pleasure than to wound you just to see the blood flow.', 14403, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '%s laughs.', 14402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits on Interrogator Elysia.', '%s spits on Interrogator Elysia.', 14401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare speak to me, blue skinned mongrel? I would sooner die than tell you anything.', 'You dare speak to me, blue skinned mongrel? I would sooner die than tell you anything.', 14400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If these two don\'t start talking soon, I\'m going to get violent with my words.', 14399, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aren\'t you hungry? Thirsty? I can arrange for food and drink -- all you need to do is tell me what I want to know.', 14398, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are our men, scoundrel? I want answers!', 14397, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will tell me everything I need to know, scum.', 14396, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s howls in rage.', '', 14395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 14394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you learn about the ore? Not even the Baron knew...$B$BTake the cursed things. They\'ve brought me nothing but misfortune anyway. I hid them in the stables just off the courtyard.$B$B<A low growl begins to emanate from the back of Landen\'s throat.>', '', 14393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to me, human. I care nothing for your plight, but you have something I require. Tell me where to find the bloodforged ingots.', 'Listen to me, human. I care nothing for your plight, but you have something I require. Tell me where to find the bloodforged ingots.', 14392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away from me, $r! There\'s no telling when the sickness will take me again.$B$BJust leave me alone before it happens again.', '', 14391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, champion. The tale of your deeds will be told throughout the ages. Perhaps one day, a statue of you will stand amongst the heroes of Stormwind.', '', 14390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The signal has been sent. He should be arriving shortly.', '', 14389, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let Marshal Windsor know that I am ready.', 'Let Marshal Windsor know that I am ready.', 14388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You made it! Outstanding! Marshal Windsor has been expecting you. Would you like me to signal him now?', '', 14387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marshal Windsor has been expecting you, $n. Unfortunately, he is currently indisposed. He should be returning shortly.', '', 14386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, citizen. I ask that you move along if you have nothing to ask of me.', '', 14385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s sighs disgustedly as he turns back to his work.', 'The %s sighs disgustedly as he turns back to his work.', 14384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I be expected to get any work done with that thing spreading its heresy?', 'How can I be expected to get any work done with that thing spreading its heresy?', 14383, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do not need your kind here.', 'We do not need your kind here.', 14382, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turning to face Tuluun, the %s sneers contemptuously.', 'Turning to face Tuluun, the %s sneers contemptuously.', 14381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wiping his brow, the %s sighs.', 'Wiping her brow, the %s sighs.', 14380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This sign contains various announcements and notices of rewards for performing dangerous sounding tasks.  Nothing particularly catches your eye; perhaps you should check again at a later time.', '', 14379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Students are a bit like sheep.  They\'re useful and even likeable when you guide and pay close attention to them.$B$BYou leave them alone for a minute and they end up falling down a cliff or drowning in a shallow river.', '', 14378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was the last to die. As I felt my spirit leaving my mortal shell, I swore a blood oath.$B$B<Prince Toreth shakes his head.>$B$BA pact was made between this land and I: My blood for this world. I became the sole keeper of the history of my people.$B$BI cannot rest until I am secure in knowing that the story of the dragon riders of Loreth\'Aran is not lost in the passages of time.\n', '', 14377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So why are you still here?', 'So why are you still here?', 14376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathwing\'s brood... Ysera\'s benevolence raised the ire of Deathwing - patron of the black dragonflight. They attacked us in our sleep! Many died on the initial surge but the greens rose to protect us.$B$B<Prince Toreth points around the island.>$B$BThe bones are all that remain of the once great dragons. None were spared.', '', 14375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until what?', 'Until what?', 14374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you not heard of Ysera? Guardian of nature? Aspect of the Dream? She is the matron of all green dragons! Aye, it was Ysera herself that gifted my kingdom with her brood. We stood shoulder to shoulder with the noble creatures and they allowed us to ride them into battle against our enemies. All was well for many centuries... until...', '', 14373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is Ysera and how were you blessed?', 'What is Ysera and how were you blessed?', 14372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you blind as well as insane?$B$BI am a ghost - a cruel reminder of a civilization that has long since ceased to exist - anchored to a land that I failed to protect.$B$BLong ago - ten-thousand years past - I was flesh and bone, just like you. I was prince of this land and a dragon rider, blessed by Ysera of the Dream.', '', 14371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you suffer?', 'Why do you suffer?', 14370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you mad? Look around you, mortal. Do you not see that you stand upon sundered earth? Leave this place lest you suffer as my people and I have...', '', 14369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t get me wrong, $n. I very much appreciate the resurrection, but I think this is the last time I\'ll perform this particular duty. Maybe a goblet or two of wine will help with this headache.', '', 14368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is... Silvermoon? My head... Next time Bloodvalor needs a volunteer, I\'ll point him in a different direction. Paragon of Blood Knight virtue, indeed!', '', 14367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares defile the statue of our beloved?', '', 14366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend yourself, youngling! We\'ll see if there\'s a Blood Knight in you, yet.', '', 14365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits of this place are focused against your kind, $r. Perhaps if you win this tower in the flesh, I will be able to aid you.', 14364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I\'m coming for you, Exarch!', '', 14363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shh! Be very quiet; I\'m observing murlocs.$B$BLiving in an oversized turtle shell is a sacrifice I\'m willing to make for science. After all, if the murlocs see me here, they\'ll react to my presence and contaminate my data!$B$BAs the first gnomish member of the Explorers\' League, I\'m boldly going places no dwarf has gone before!', '', 14362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to rust!', '', 14361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to travel by hippogryph.', 'I wish to travel by hippogryph.', 14360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need to travel to the Exodar, I have just the hippogryph for you!', '', 14359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I desire to travel by hippogryph.', 'I desire to travel by hippogryph.', 14358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day, $c. Are you in need of a reliable hippogryph?', '', 14357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, kill them all!', '', 14356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This siege has gone dormant for far too long, let us destroy the Draenei and their pitiful city!', '', 14355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, followers of Kael, let us destroy our enemies! Let us show them that there is no escape from the Eredun!', '', 14354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh.... Yes, the blood of the exiles fills me with power! Beware, Bloodmyst!', '', 14353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, sit and make yourself comfortable.', 'Please, sit and make yourself comfortable.', 14352, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I am one of the \'Broken\'.  I trust that this does not bother you?  Broken or draenei, we must endure the ridicule that some in our society may throw at us.  A better understanding and communication with the elements of this world is all that matters.', 'Yes, I am one of the \'Broken\'.  I trust that this does not bother you?  Broken or draenei, we must endure the ridicule that some in our society may throw at us.  A better understanding and communication with the elements of this world is all that matters.', 14351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will satisfy our master.', 'Your death will satisfy our master.', 14350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew Cornelius wouldn\'t leave us behind!', 'I knew Cornelius wouldn\'t leave us behind!', 14349, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the forehead signet of Velen, I am saved!', 'By the forehead signet of Velen, I am saved!', 14348, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woot! Thanks!', 'Woot! Thanks!', 14347, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re free! We\'re free!', 'We\'re free! We\'re free!', 14346, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare strike an agent of the Hand?', '', 14345, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be the laziest messenger known to draenei.', '', 14344, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must be the laziest messenger known to draenei.', 14343, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s going on over there at your delivery service? How are we expected to function when our mail is never here on time?', 14342, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hermesius come quick! I have an urgent delivery that must be taken to the human admiral of the Alliance expedition.', 14341, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hermesius, has my package from the Exodar arrived yet? It\'s been over a week.', 14340, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey Hermesius, do I have any new mail?', 14339, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Otherwise, get off my back! One of these days you won\'t have old Hermesius to push around anymore. That much I can promise...', '', 14338, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IF YOU THINK THIS IS SO EASY, GRAB A BAG AND GET TO WORK!', '', 14337, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on over there at your delivery service? How are we expected to function when our mail is never here on time?', '', 14336, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hermesius come quick! I have an urgent delivery that must be taken to the human admiral of the Alliance expedition.', '', 14335, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hermesius, has my package from the Exodar arrived yet? It\'s been over a week.', '', 14334, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Hey Hermesius, do I have any new mail?', '', 14333, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He thinks he\'s so damned important. Always pushing me around... I\'ll show him. I\'ll show all of them!', '', 14332, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of these days I\'m going to bust out the crystalline doomhammer and go positively orc on this town. Then they\'ll be sorry...', '', 14331, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to be re-assigned. This job is pushing me over the edge...', '', 14330, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How am I expected to deliver all of these messages?', '', 14329, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you people ever check the mail?', '', 14328, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did they send you to find me? Well I\'m not going back without my men.', '', 14327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What it means to be a Hand of Argus... We are agents of the Light. We serve without question. We die without question.', '', 14326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 22, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I deliver the mail to and from Azuremyst, $c. If you need a message delivered, it\'ll more than likely be routed through me first.', '', 14325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Achelus, chief expeditionary officer of Blood Watch.', '', 14324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me, $n! My father will be delighted!', '', 14323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face the wrath of Bristlelimb!', '', 14322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The metal was salvageable.  I should be able to reforge the weapon as a sword or a dagger.', '', 14321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll do what I can.  No promises, though.  This weapon has been completely shattered.', '', 14320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holding his nose, %s scoops up the dung and places it in his bucket.', '', 14319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All those years of research... and for nothing! Perhaps they were right, perhaps this is something we must learn to live with.', 14318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Kessel, lord of the elekk, disciple of the Hand of Argus. Are you the new recruit?', '', 14317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He should not have angered me.  I must go... recover my strength now...', '', 14316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 77688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going back inside.  Let me know if anything else comes up.', 14315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the warning, $n. We will prepare our defenses.', '', 14314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Promised One, we thank you for the warning. The Stillpine tribe will be prepared.', '', 14313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the warning, $n! We shall prepare!', '', 14312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready!', '', 14311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archers, form ranks! On my mark!', '', 14310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders have breached the defenses!', '', 14309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast a spell of great power, weaving his own essence into the magic.', '', 14308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms! The prisoner is escaping!', 'To arms! The prisoner is escaping!', 14306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should res right now.', 'I should res right now.', 14305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c.$B$BOld man Kessel over there, he\'s a clever one. I\'d be real careful in my dealings with him if I were you.$B$BHe offered me work \'caring for the elekk\' and being the fool I was, I took it to mean feeding, training, and the like. Things became real clear when he handed me the shovel...', '', 14304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The others look at this landscape and see only death, corruption, and adversity. None of those things are in short supply, true, but that view ignores the opportunities presented by our environment.$B$BI will not stand by and watch these opportunities go ignored, $c. With your help, we can demonstrate to the others here at Blood Watch just how to make use of the environment and its creatures.', '', 14303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everything that has happened since the crash is little more than a blur. It seems like a lifetime ago that I was aboard the Exodar.$B$BNow, my reality is restricted to this island with its mutant creatures and endless sea of blood elf agents. Soon, it will be as if I\'ve never known anything different...', 14302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you only learn one thing during your time in Bloodmyst, $c, I hope that it is vigilance. This island claims the unwary first, then begins to wear down even the most guarded of warriors.$B$BEverywhere you turn, a foe stands ready to take your life. ', '', 14301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You leave me no alternative.  I will stop you by force if you won\'t listen to reason!', '', 14300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 77691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not know what you speak of, dragon... but  I will not be bullied by this display of insolence.  I\'ll leave Karazhan when it suits me!', '', 14299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 77689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A dark power seeks to use you, Medivh!  If you stay, dire days will follow.  You must hurry, we don\'t have much time!', '', 14298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 77690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare challenge me at my own dwelling?  Your arrogance is astounding, even for a dragon!', '', 14297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 77687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dabbling in the arcane has gone too far, Medivh.  You\'ve attracted the attention of powers beyond your understanding.  You must leave Karazhan at once!', '', 14296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 77692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got my attention, dragon.  You\'ll find I\'m not as easily scared as the villagers below.', '', 14295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 77686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you done, wizard?  This cannot be!  I\'m burning from... within!', '', 14294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 77693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood mushrooms are more common than the other fungi varieties and can be found mostly anywhere in the woods around Bloodmyst. Keep your search south of the road dividing Bloodmyst if you value your life.', '', 14293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jessera, could you direct me towards the blood mushrooms?', 'Jessera, could you direct me towards the blood mushrooms?', 14292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel cone derives its name from fel magic corruption. Seek the fel cone fungus at the Nazzivian satyr camp - to the west.', '', 14291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jessera, could you direct me towards the fel cone fungus?', 'Jessera, could you direct me towards the fel cone fungus?', 14290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the name suggests, it can be found near ruins. Loreth\'Aran holds the answer.$B$BActually, the name doesn\'t really suggest that -- I was just trying to be clever in naming the fungi.', '', 14289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Blood Watch, $c. In my travels, I have amassed a wide variety of tools, artifacts, and knowledge from the various peoples we\'ve encountered.$B$BShould you find yourself in need of this knowledge, you have only to ask.', '', 14288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jessera, could you direct me towards the ruinous polyspore?', 'Jessera, could you direct me towards the ruinous polyspore?', 14287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look in the waters that divide this island, but be warned: the stinkhorn striker makes its home in the waters of the river.', '', 14286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a look at this passage...', '', 14285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jessera, could you direct me towards the aquatic stinkhorn?', 'Jessera, could you direct me towards the aquatic stinkhorn?', 14284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, no matter. Mister Clementine\'s... err, \'contribution\' notwithstanding, this seems to be the journal of a man named Nolkai. The entries toward the end describe a brutal battle.', '', 14283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the process of translating this, I believe I\'ve learned more about the drunken exploits of a certain \'Andrew Clementine\' than about the journal\'s author.', '', 14282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, let\'s see...', '', 14281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does gotcher mean?', 'What does gotcher mean?', 14280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draenei filth will not last on this world...', 'Draenei filth will not last on this world...', 14279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will smite them all in the name of Sunstrider!', 'I will smite them all in the name of Sunstrider!', 14278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sironas stirs, master? Does she toil?', 'Sironas stirs, master? Does she toil?', 14277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sire, any news from the king?', 'Sire, any news from the king?', 14276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Touch not the horse, filth!', '', 14275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare impede official Sunhawk communications?', 'You dare impede official Sunhawk communications?', 14274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out of my way!', '', 14273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is none of your concern, maggot.', '', 14272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have new orders, maggots.', '', 14271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be done, my lady.', '', 14270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I could get back to the mushroom thicket. I have not seen such a mature cluster in my lifetime!', '', 14269, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On Argus, Mac\'Aree was the most sacred of our cities.$B$BWould you believe me if I told you that the walkways were lined with precious minerals? That the rivers glittered even in complete darkness?$B$BI long for those days... How long has it been? A thousand years? Ten-thousand?', '', 14268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to make use of the stables.', 'I wish to make use of the stables.', 14267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need me to take care of your animal companions?', '', 14266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls for assistance.', '', 14265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let her know... my last thought was of her...', '', 14264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... you\'re not Morae, but I sense that you have met. When you see her, tell her that I survived the crash, only to be done in by the infiltrators.', '', 14263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Morae... Is that you?', '', 14262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Thrallmar, $n!  As you continue to aid us in our cause, I will grant you access to more of our supplies.', '', 14261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Admetius, leader of Blood Watch.', '', 14260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come intruders....', '', 14259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what I\'ve earned the right to purchase.', 'Show me what I\'ve earned the right to purchase.', 14258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n.  As you rise in rank among the forces of Honor Hold, I will give you access to some of the different goods we keep in stock.', 14257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got fresh meat, fish and mushrooms.  And plenty to drink!', '', 14256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come for some blacksmithing supplies, have ya?', 14255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars in pain and attacks its assailant.', '', 14254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, but be quick with your browsing.', '', 14253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you any cooking supplies?', 'Have you any cooking supplies?', 14252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sigh> I suppose, if I must.', '', 14251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master chef, can you train me in the culinary arts?', 'Master chef, can you train me in the culinary arts?', 14250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Entering Phase 2 <PH>', '', 14249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is YOU who are wrong!  I will deal with you two after I have slain this meddlesome shaman!', '', 14248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrong!  It is YOU that will die, Tel\'athion the Impure!', '', 14247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shrugs.', '%s shrugs.', 14246, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrm. Nothing comes to mind.', 'Hrm. Nothing comes to mind.', 14245, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weren\'t we supposed to do something?', 'Weren\'t we supposed to do something?', 14244, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will go about our business now. Good day.', 'We will go about our business now. Good day.', 14243, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %ss nod their heads in unison.', 'The %ss nod their heads in unison.', 14242, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can go about your business.', '', 14241, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are not the elekk we\'re looking for.', 'These are not the elekk we\'re looking for.', 14240, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense. These are not the elekk you\'re looking for.', '', 14239, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got orders from the harbinger to pick up some elekk for the base.', 'We\'ve got orders from the harbinger to pick up some elekk for the base.', 14238, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am. What is it that I can do for you?', 'I am. What is it that I can do for you?', 14237, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You Kessel?', 'You Kessel?', 14236, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bursts forth from the ground and attacks!', '', 14235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done a great thing, $n.  You are welcome here at any time.', '', 14234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we will deal with this corruption of the water.', '', 14233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, young shaman.  Make yourself at home within my reef.', '', 14232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is consumed by its own magic!', '', 14231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What...', '', 14230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares wield magic in my presence?', 'Who dares wield magic in my presence?', 14229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well it\'s about time. Kessel isn\'t gonna be too happy about any of this...', '', 14227, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did it give you much trouble? My poor little baby, $r are such nasty company.', '', 14226, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wonderful! You made it!', '', 14225, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please tell Guvan that I\'ll be fine, thanks to you.', 14224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank the Light, $n, my leg is completely healed!', 14223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
