('Then let those towers be their tombs! Lay waste to them!\n', '', 14204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear my words, Korfang!', '', 14203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
