('Raiders, join ranks! On Korfang\'s signal, charge forth and crush these cowardly dogs! Forward!\n', '', 14200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar! For victory!', '', 14199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
