('Two enemy factions. Both deserve to drown in blood. Who will taste death this day?\n', '', 14195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drive them out! We take none alive! ', '', 14194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-Narash! Prepare to strike down the outsiders! Warriors, rally!\n', '', 14193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph.', 'The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph.', 14192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your faith guides me to victory.', '', 14191, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can sense your desire for power, $c.', 'I can sense your desire for power, $c.', 14190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Eralan appears to be chewing on some deathweed.>$b$bIf you\'re looking to make a love potion, you\'ve got the wrong place.  Blinding, crippling, and killing is my business and hopefully yours.', 14189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in need of your skill as a blacksmith, Koren.', 'I\'m in need of your skill as a blacksmith, Koren.', 14188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know about the Violet Eye then?  Maybe I\'ll have time for you later.$B$BI have to get back to my work.', '', 14187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the size of your head! That should fetch me twice as much of a bounty!', 'Look at the size of your head! That should fetch me twice as much of a bounty!', 14186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once served Medivh... or pretended to.  I helped the Violet Eye keep a close eye on the Master.$B$BBut now all I can think of is... making horseshoes.  Over and over.', '', 14185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid I\'m rather busy fixing horseshoes at the moment.  Would you mind coming back at another time?', '', 14184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Silvermoon! For Sunstrider!', 'For Silvermoon! For Sunstrider!', 14183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will make a fitting tribute to the King!', 'Your death will make a fitting tribute to the King!', 14182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your money or your life! Actually, just your life will do...', 'Your money or your life! Actually, just your life will do...', 14181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to meet your maker, $n!', 'Time to meet your maker, $n!', 14180, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what that little purple creature at the village is... It\'s certainly beautiful.', 'I wonder what that little purple creature at the village is... It\'s certainly beautiful.', 14179, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These stags are nothing like talbuks.', 'These stags are nothing like talbuks.', 14178, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrm, azure snapdragons? Where do they come up with these names? Daedal has gone mad!', 'Hrm, azure snapdragons? Where do they come up with these names? Daedal has gone mad!', 14177, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where in the nether are these damnable lashers??', 'Where in the nether are these damnable lashers??', 14176, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m supposed to be hunting infected nightstalkers... This should be easy.', 'I\'m supposed to be hunting infected nightstalkers... This should be easy.', 14175, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
