('I\'ll nail it!', 'I\'ll nail it!', 14120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The romantic plays are really tough, but you\'ll do better this time. You have TALENT. Ready?', '', 14119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome ladies and gentlemen, to this evening\'s presentation!', '', 14118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rough audience, but you\'ll win them over. Ready for another shot?', '', 14117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The brazier fires upon the helpless orc! [PH]', '', 14116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last I will have my revenge!', '', 14115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is taking so long?', '', 14114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s inspects the contents of the crates.', 14113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uther Lightbringer brought only darkness to Quel\'Thalas.  Let us see if we can bring some darkness to his tomb!', '', 14112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did I let myself get stationed here?', '', 14111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I run now!', '', 14110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s stares at you in sheer wonderment.', '', 14109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Putting the bottles away, %s sighs.', '', 14108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought not!', 14107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have something to say to my face?', 14106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her methods are cowardly.  She reminds me of the Forsaken apothecaries.', '', 14105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph, no doubt she believes herself to be the new mistress of Stonard.  Perhaps we should offer to help her succubi tidy up her messes?', '', 14104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at her down there!  Just who does she think she is?', 14103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Must you follow me everywhere? <sigh>', 14102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need some fresh air, not that there\'s any to be had in this swamp!  I\'m going out for a bit.  Tidy up a bit while I\'m gone, would you?', 14101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you hungry?  I\'m hungry.  I just can\'t stand the thought of cured ham steak from Thultash again.  If only we could get some of that succulent roasted quail!', 14099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, would you please stop checking your nails and spanking yourself, for one moment?  Really, no one cares!', 14098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Avuun dares to oppose me?!  I will crush him!  When I am done with the draenei, they\'ll wish that they were Lost Ones!', 14097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot wait to see the results of this latest batch!', 14096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These orcs are fools!  So much power nearby just waiting to be taken, and all they do is sit on their hands and watch while others plunder the riches!', 14095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hahaha!  That fool will never find out what I\'m up to!  Or, if he does, it\'ll be too late for the draenei!', 14094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s over, Spark. The admiral knows it was you who betrayed the Alliance. Now you\'re either going to cooperate with me and tell me everything that you know or we\'re going to engage in some fisticuff.', 'It\'s over, Spark. The admiral knows it was you who betrayed the Alliance. Now you\'re either going to cooperate with me and tell me everything that you know or we\'re going to engage in some fisticuff.', 14093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see that I\'m busy?', '', 14092, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE!', '', 14091, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, I cut you!', '', 14090, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magtoor, I have faith that there is a way to bring the Lost Ones back from the brink.  By studying them, I will find a way to cure the fel energies that have consumed them.  And in so doing, I will be able to reverse the damage to the Broken as well.', '', 14089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anchorite, we are honored that you are here, but I am curious as to what you truly believe you can accomplish?', '', 14088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, Avuun.  One of the merchants that I trade with in Stonard has heard her raving about some horrible disease she\'s trying to perfect.  They say it\'s for use against the draenei!', '', 14087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s examines the shell.', '', 14086, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must find a way to put an end to the evil that Cersei Dusksinger is committing against our lost brothers and sisters!', '', 14085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s holds the shell up to his ear.', '', 14084, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s places the shell in his pack.', '', 14083, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes Master, all goes along as planned.', '', 14082, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have no choice.  If we fail to honor the presence of the Horde, then surely they will crush us from nearby Stonard!  I\'m afraid that not even you and your friends would be able to stop them.', '', 14081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s ironic, I hate the ocean but I love the beach.', '', 14080, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
