('', 'With a good portion of their demons slain, the Legion will think twice about attacking our lumber camp again.  However, I still sense demonic evil stirring.', 13797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
