('', 'Sentinels be on the alert!  I heard something over there...', 13794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 25, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('What have you done to my life\'s work?!  DIE!!!', '', 13793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
