('Is this the end?', 'Is this the end?', 13789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does it frighten you to know that there are those that would serve the Legion with such devotion as to remain unwavering citizens of your pointless civilizations until called upon?', '', 13787, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your kind mean nothing to me, fool. The Master\'s will is all that matters. These ... These draenei will be hunted down and slain -- as will all things on this world. You will cease.', '', 13786, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 13785, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are demons to kill, $c.  Do you have the backbone to do what needs to be done?', 13784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it was you, Spark! How could you? You were a trusted envoy of Mekkatorque!', '', 13783, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, sir. It won\'t happen again...', '', 13782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Bloodmyst scouts have located our contact. The fool, Velen, will soon leave himself open and defenseless -- long enough for us to strike! Now get out of my sight before I vaporize you...', '', 13781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relax? Do you know what Kael\'thas does to those that fail him, Geezle? Eternal suffering and pain... Do NOT screw this up, fool.', '', 13780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relax, Spark! I have it all under control. We\'ll strip mine the Exodar right out from under \'em - making both you and I very, very rich in the process.', '', 13779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Master has gone to great lengths to secure information about the whereabouts of the Exodar. You could have blown the entire operation, including the cover of our spy on the inside.', '', 13778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the big idea? You nearly blew my cover, idiot! I told you to put the compass and navigation maps somewhere safe - not out in the open for any fool to discover.', '', 13777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the big idea, Spark? Why\'d you call for this meeting?', '', 13776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s picks up the naga flag.', '', 13775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not welcome here!', 'You are not welcome here!', 13774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder!', 'Intruder!', 13773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a $r, right?  I am heartened to see you here!  We can use all of the help that we can get.', '', 13772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With you and your people as allies, we have decided to stay on this island and rebuild. Elune bless you, hero.$B$BWhile the sadness still comes and goes, I think we will survive.\n', '', 13771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help me!', 13770, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While you\'ve dealt the demonic evil from the south a serious blow, I still sense trouble from that region.', '', 13769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s devours the fabric and hisses angrily!', '', 13768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 36, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that the demons have been dealt with, we can proceed with the establishment of a new base here. ', '', 13767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you feel the evil all around us, $c? By the Hand, it must be cleansed!$B$BThe demons destroyed our homeworld, Argus. I will NOT countenance their presence here on our new home, Azeroth!', '', 13766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('capture point Progress2', '', 13765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('capture point Progress1', '', 13764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('capture point Win2', '', 13763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('capture point Win1', '', 13762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('capture point Contested2', '', 13761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('capture point Contested1', '', 13760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to hear the voices of others here in Forest Song again. I\'d begun to feel as though I might be the last of the kaldorei ever to set eyes on these lands before their descent into corruption.', '', 13759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s Takes a Deep Beath', '', 13758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s good to see a new face out here. We\'re barely hanging on and our enemies are plentiful.$B$BWe\'re surrounded by those who seek to destroy us: the satyr to the north, the orcs in the lumber camp here to the east, and the demons of Felfire Hill.$B$BWe\'re going to retake this place if it kills us. It looks like it just might!', 13757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. Before the night elves invited the draenei to join them here, this glade was all but forgotten.$B$BThe kaldorei are deeply tied to these lands, and we draenei are honored that they have asked us to share in the task of revitalizing Forest Song.', '', 13750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daughter!', '', 13749, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can thank $n for getting me back here safely, father.', 13748, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s hugs her father.', 13747, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father! Father! You\'re alive!', 13746, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My poor family. Everything has been destroyed.', 13745, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our house is this way, through the thicket.', 13744, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have much in common, night elf. I can\'t help but feel that perhaps it was fate that brought us together. Let me help you, Cowlen. Let my people help. We will right the wrongs. This I vow.', 'We have much in common, night elf. I can\'t help but feel that perhaps it was fate that brought us together. Let me help you, Cowlen. Let my people help. We will right the wrongs. This I vow.', 13743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion? Demons? They hunt you? My people have also been hunted by Legion: Targeted by their dark masters for damnation.$B$B<Cowlen wipes the tears away.>$B$BIt is the reason that I moved my family here oh-so-many years ago.', '', 13742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear that my people are somewhat responsible for this destruction. We are refugees, displaced from our homes by the Burning Legion. This tragedy is a result of our latest evacuation. Our vessel crashed - this debris is a part of that vessel.', 'I fear that my people are somewhat responsible for this destruction. We are refugees, displaced from our homes by the Burning Legion. This tragedy is a result of our latest evacuation. Our vessel crashed - this debris is a part of that vessel.', 13741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If not the gods, who? How? What could cause such strife?', '', 13740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not come to kill you, night elf. And the gods did not do this...', 'I have not come to kill you, night elf. And the gods did not do this...', 13739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What could I have done to give the gods cause to lash out at me with such ferocity? All that I cherished is gone - dead or destroyed. My family taken from me by the brutes of the forest. My home razed. My ship sunk.$B$BI am a broken man, stranded on a broken island.$B$BPerhaps you are here to finish the job? Make it quick, I will not resist. Take my life, stranger; I am too cowardly to do it myself. My hand shivers... the blade will not strike true.', '', 13738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 20, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Cowlen sobs.>', '', 13737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a look at me, scum!  This is what a real orc looks like!', '', 13736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t stop the inevitable, fel orc.  Hellfire Citadel will soon fall.', '', 13735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spit on you, Kargath.  The true Horde will crush you!', '', 13734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s finish this... I\'ve waited long enough.', '', 13733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do your worst, demonspawn!', 13732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring it on, you son of a mangy ogre!', '', 13731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Adamant Ironheart of the great city of Ironforge. As you could probably guess by looking at my uniform, I was once part of the Ironforge elite guard. Yep, I was Magni\'s right hand man! At least until I retired. Now I dabble in archaeology. It\'s a hobby really; plus I figured it would be a great way to see the world!', '', 13730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you lookin\' at?', '', 13729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slay the last prisoner.  Maybe our intruders will reconsider their foolish actions now!', '', 13728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like we have a ranking officer among our captives... how amusing.  Execute this green-skinned dog at once!', '', 13727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like we have a ranking officer among our captives... how amusing.  Execute the Alliance wench!', '', 13726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Execute one of the prisoners at once!  Slay the tauren first... keep his head as a trophy.', '', 13725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Execute one of the prisoners at once!  Slay the dwarf first... he talks far too much for his own good.', '', 13724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The excecutioner has arrived!  Ready the prisoners!', '', 13723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall\'s false Horde dares to intrude this far into my fortress?  Bring out the Thrallmar prisoners and call for the executioner!  They\'ll pay with their lives for this trespass!', '', 13722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance dares to intrude this far into my fortress?  Bring out the Honor Hold prisoners and call for the executioner!  They\'ll pay with their lives for this trespass!', '', 13721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good to see you again, $n. Perhaps once things have settled down, I can talk to you about the priceless treasure that we have lost...', 13720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Adamant. I think I know just the person for the job.', 13719, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got to do something about this!', '', 13718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And it looks like he\'s got reinforcements comin\' from Nazjatar!', '', 13717, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, you aren\'t going to like what I have to tell you, young missy. This tablet is a naga communication. Their leader, Warlord Sriss\'tiz, has ordered his naga to take the rest of the island by force.', '', 13716, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naga warlord! Oh dear...', '', 13715, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s slowly reads the tablet, mouthing the words in their native tongue.', '', 13714, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let me take a look at that tablet.', '', 13713, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course! Anything for you, darling!', '', 13712, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Adamant, could you please take a look at this tablet and try to decipher the runes?', 13711, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been a great help thus far, $n. You would do well to help out the others at the encampment.$B$BAnd don\'t worry about those goblins, I\'m taking care of everything.', '', 13710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step around here, stranger.', '', 13709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $r. Your noble actions are acknowledged. May Elune protect you.', 13708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am a night elf, stranger. While you may know nothing of my kind, we know much of you and your progenitors. You may not call yourself eredar but, in appearance, you share many similarities.$B$BYou have helped my allies, and for that I am thankful; but for the time being, you walk a tenuous path. Perhaps in time, you will be able to dissolve the doubts and fears that I hold in my heart.', 13707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Priestess Il\'dinare eyes you suspiciously.>', 13706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate you so much, Cookie.', '', 13705, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be chicken...', '', 13704, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. Not really...', '', 13703, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow! Really?', '', 13702, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And fer dessert we be havin\' cheesecake, flown in fresh from Stormwind on the wings o\' angels...', '', 13701, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like it be succulent pork ribs basted with its own delectable juices and a side o\' Captain Sander\'s Secret Sauce - fer dippin\'.\n', '', 13700, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarr, Admiral. Let me think about it... Arrr... It be comin\' into focus.', '', 13699, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, Cookie! What\'s for dinner tonight? And don\'t say chicken!', '', 13698, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ghostlands will not be won back by military force alone, $n.  That\'s where we magisters come in.$B$BOur guile and knowledge of the arcane are unmatched.', '', 13697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there!  Keep a close watch on these ramparts, intruders could approach at any time!', '', 13695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks over at Temper as if reluctant to speak.', '', 13694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, shaman.  I am reborn and will burn brighter than ever before!', '', 13693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhanaa!  Gah, I have to get this thing fixed!', '', 13692, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s breaks free!', '', 13691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is nearly free of his bonds!', '', 13690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s bonds begin to weaken!', '', 13689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can barely hear you... <static> aking up!', 13688, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Zhanaa, it\'s me!  Your signal is weak.', '', 13687, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dyvuun, is that you?', 13686, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I pity you, Forsaken.  Your soul is devoid of light.', '', 13685, 35, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... looks like I\'m going to need a new test subject.', '', 13684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink this, you blue brute!  Disobey me and I promise you a slow, painful death!', '', 13683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But where could I ever find a suitable test subject?', '', 13682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...a potent concoction!', '', 13678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insects! Let me show you my strength up close!', '', 13677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I shall land and crush you myself!', '', 13676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
