('Blue Tabard', 'Blue Tabard', 13669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s cries awaken the undead. ', '', 13668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n.  It looks like they\'re going to get along just fine.', 13666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s coughs and begins to wheeze.', '', 13665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot hide from me, mortal!', '', 13664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you need something, $c?  Perhaps I can assist you.', 13663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blessing is always welcome, $n.', '', 13662, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing can stop me now!', '', 13661, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the blessing, $n.', '', 13660, 10, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You won\'t keep me from getting to Falcon Watch!', 13659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, brother.', '', 13658, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Red Tabard', 'Red Tabard', 13657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah - oddities and rarities. We specialize in Azeroth\'s more unique items for the discerning adventurer.$B$BSince you\'re speaking with me, you must already have an idea of what you\'re looking for. So, $n, which item are you interested in?', '', 13656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What promotions do you have?', 'What promotions do you have?', 13655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $n. I am Landro Longshot - manager of the Black Flame. Perhaps you\'ve not heard of the Black Flame until now. That doesn\'t surprise me; we work to keep things that way. We prefer to avoid... factional entanglements.$B$BThe Black Flame specializes in providing the finest services and entertainment money can buy, whether they happen to be hard to find items, gladiatorial combat, or lucrative games of chance.$B$BAre you here seeking something specific?', '', 13654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will take a while, but these Broken Ones will learn the ways of the Light!', '', 13653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ikan tries and tries.  I think these Dreghood are much like the Lost Ones, you know... lost.', '', 13652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It looks like help has finally arrived!  The Omenai welcome you to our remnant camp, $n.', 13651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light be with you, $c.', '', 13650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What fools! I shall bring a quick end to your suffering!', '', 13649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More mortals have come seeking the mysteries of Karazhan?', '', 13648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An ancient being awakens in the distance...', '', 13647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me browse your wares, Calypso.', 'Let me browse your wares, Calypso.', 13646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to become a blacksmith.', 'I want to become a blacksmith.', 13645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need something?', 13644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me browse your wares, Cookie.', 'Let me browse your wares, Cookie.', 13643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach me how to cook, Cookie.', 'Teach me how to cook, Cookie.', 13642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avast ye, matey. Cookie is me name, cooking is me game. The McWeaksauce bloodline be a long line of cooks and tradesmen that work to please the more delicate senses o\' man and woman.', '', 13641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can only hope that he will see the Light and instead turn his energies to restoring once-beautiful Quel\'Thalas.', '', 13640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you want?$B$BIt\'s a bit rude to walk up to strangers for no reason, don\'t you think?', 13639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
