('|cffffff00Crown Guard Tower has been taken by the Alliance!|r', '', 13632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00Eastwall Tower has been taken by the Alliance!|r', '', 13631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00Northpass Tower has been taken by the Alliance!|r', '', 13630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00The Plaguewood Tower has been taken by the Alliance!|r', '', 13629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day to you, $c.$B$BI\'m waiting to hear from one of the High Thane\'s advisors about an audience. It was a struggle just to get the opportunity to present my credentials.$B$BI\'ve heard the Wildhammer described as \'wary of outsiders,\' but that\'s proven to be quite an understatement.  Hopefully, things will improve once I\'ve had the opportunity to meet with Featherbeard, whom I\'m told favors closer ties with the Alliance.', '', 13628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to him.  Return to Mehlar and tell him that I forgive him and that I understand why he believes what he does.', '', 13627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I see it now in your mind.  This is the work of one of my former students... Mehlar Dawnblade.  It is sad to know that his heart has turned so dark.', '', 13626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you do this?  Did I somehow wrong you in life?', '', 13625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you my friend for making this possible.  This is a day that I shall never forget!  I think I will stay a while.  Please return to High Priestess MacDonnell at the camp.  I know that she\'ll be keenly interested to know of what has transpired here.', '', 13624, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, rise my friend.  Keep the Blessing as a symbol of the strength of the Light and how heroes long gone might once again rise in each of us to inspire.', '', 13623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for coming here in remembrance of me.  Your efforts in recovering that symbol, while unnecessary, are certainly touching to an old man\'s heart.', '', 13622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be welcome, friends!', '', 13621, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello there!  Oh my, a draenei!', 13620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land truly needs to be cleansed by the Light!  Let us continue on to the tomb.  It isn\'t far now.', '', 13619, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are beset upon again!  Defend yourself!', '', 13618, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It must be the purity of the Mark of the Lightbringer that is drawing forth the Scourge to us.  We must proceed with caution lest we be overwhelmed!', '', 13617, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware!  We are attacked!', '', 13616, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, let us continue.', '', 13615, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This area is known to be full of foul Scourge.  You may want to take a moment to prepare any defenses at your disposal.', '', 13614, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shall we begin, my friend?', '', 13613, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello.  What brings you to Chillwind Camp today?', '', 13612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light you will leave this tomb!', '', 13611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Viera Sunwhisper scurries away, attempting to flee from Twinkle.', 13610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sighs.', '', 13609, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Man\'ari... But how... We are not eredar! She must know! If there are others like her, we must find them and explain...', 13608, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh dear...', 13607, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s gasps.', 13606, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s falls back into a coma.', 13605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'BY THE LIGHT OF ELUNE! Eredar! Cursed demons, what have you done to me? I have not come alone, we will fight you as we have in the past! I...', 13604, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whe... Where am I? What... What is this place?', 13603, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s sits up.', 13602, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s groans.', 13601, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up little creature. Wake up from your slumber... You are safe now.', '', 13600, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This should do it...', '', 13599, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There may still be a solution. Come here, $n. I will explain what I need.', '', 13598, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It appears that the ointment is ineffective. Such a pity...', 13597, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now to apply the ointment to her wounds.', 13596, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twinkle looks at Viera Sunwhisper with very hungry eyes.', '', 13595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please allow me to browse your wares, Daedal.', 'Please allow me to browse your wares, Daedal.', 13594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to train as an alchemist, Daedal.', 'I wish to train as an alchemist, Daedal.', 13593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An alchemist is able to work miracles with ordinary herbs, converting them into stable potions that range in effect from healing to breathing underwater and everything in between.', '', 13592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What... is happening... to me?  Get this cat away from me!', 13591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t wait to try this wine!', 13590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok, let\'s go.  I know just the perfect spot!', 13589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you find something fun to chase around, Twinkle?  I bet you did!', 13588, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s just you and me, Twinkle.  Daddy\'s not going to be coming home.', 13587, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re such a good friend, Twinkle.  You\'d never leave me, would you?', 13586, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 13585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot ride a mount in that form.', 'You cannot ride a mount in that form.', 13584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shrieks in pain and points at his master.', '', 13582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have much to do! Why can they not leave me to my work?', '', 13580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares, Daelo.', 'I wish to browse your wares, Daelo.', 13579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to learn about engineering, Daelo.', 'I wish to learn about engineering, Daelo.', 13578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. I have been sent here from the Exodar to oversee the construction of Azure Watch.', '', 13577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the foul teat of Kil\'Jaeden\'s rotted torso, the entire backside is blown out! How can someone be expected to live in here? I\'ve seen enough!', '', 13576, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrm, this looks much better. Let\'s have a look on the inside.', '', 13575, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t be held responsible for the catastrophe that will surely result from the haphazard maintenance of this building.\n', '', 13574, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This structure violates at least 8 different ordinances!', '', 13573, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This won\'t do at all! We have to secure the foundation or the entire structure will crumble!', '', 13572, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This won\'t work at all! The buildings will surely collapse if we do not shore up the support beams.', '', 13571, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, useless! There must be another way...', '', 13570, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve wasted enough of my time... let these games be finished!', '', 13569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m very busy right now, young $c. Please excuse me.', 'I\'m very busy right now, young $c. Please excuse me.', 13568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I WILL have my revenge!', '', 13567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to learn all that you have to teach me about first aid, Fateema.', 'I wish to learn all that you have to teach me about first aid, Fateema.', 13566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you have not yet learned how to make use of bandages, I will be happy to show you the basics of creation and application. The difference between life and death can often come down to properly bandaging wounds.', 13565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Crown Guard Tower.', 'Take me to Crown Guard Tower.', 13564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Take me to Eastwall Tower.', 'Take me to Eastwall Tower.', 13563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Northpass Tower.', 'Take me to Northpass Tower.', 13562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be alarmed... while my gryphons may not be entirely alive, they will still carry you faithfully to your destination. Tell me... which tower do you seek?', 'Don\'t be alarmed... while my gryphons may not be entirely alive, they will still carry you faithfully to your destination. Tell me... which tower do you seek?', 13561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who challenges Naias? Puny $r, you are little better than those mindless trolls I have played against each other like so many pieces on a game board!', '', 13560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare summon me?!', '', 13559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look around you, shaman.  Can you see the balance of the elements in the earth, the air, the water and the fire that has touched them all?', '', 13558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence here can only mean trouble, $g son : daughter; of the Horde.  Go in peace.', '', 13557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And why would I speak with you, $r?', '', 13556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a good day to be alive and one with the elements.', '', 13555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r.', '', 13554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If he\'s anything like his father, allying with the Mag\'har will mark the dawn of a new age for the Horde.', '', 13553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have the understanding to continue, shaman?  Do you know why you are here?', '', 13552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your work here is complete, shaman.  Return to your people.', '', 13551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the draenei and tell them to send me one of their shaman.', '', 13550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to your people and tell them to send one of your shaman to me.', '', 13549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit running around, $n!', '', 13548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 7, 7, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('Of course I\'ve got a job for you! We\'re always looking for $cs. Hopefully you\'ll fare better than the draenei we had to send back to the Exodar -- for burial.$B$B<Acteon laughs.>$B$BI\'m joking! You should have seen the look on your face. They got sent back to the Exodar for treatment of minor wounds. Nothin\' that they won\'t recover from...', '', 13547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I haven\'t got anymore work for you, $n. I do want you to know that the red snapper we shared was something special that I\'ll never forget...', 13546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t that adorable! How did you make it out of the Vale? Maybe you should get back there before someone sends a search party after you.', 13545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At once, sir!  For the Horde!', '', 13544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With all due respect, Warchief.  Our enemies would take advantage of your sudden absence if we don\'t prepare properly.', '', 13543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall!  My lord... are you all right?', '', 13542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are right, Eitrigg.  The timing is unfavorable.  Make sure our best ambassadors are sent as envoys to Hellscream.', '', 13541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be fine, Eitrigg.  We must begin preparations... I need to go to Outland at once!', '', 13540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...uncorrupted!', '', 13539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unnoticed for years...', '', 13538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people have survived in Outland...', '', 13537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come down from there!', '', 13536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did you get that? Did HE send you?', '', 13532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you? What do you want? Stay away from me!', '', 13530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, no more! My son... he\'s gone mad!', '', 13529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torment me no more!', '', 13527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want this nightmare to be over!', '', 13526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even death won\'t prevent me from uncovering the secrets of my son!', '', 13525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the cold dark with you!', '', 13523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll freeze you all!', '', 13522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was among the greatest of the Kirin Tor. You shall not defeat me idling about!', '', 13521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn, you hellish fiends!', '', 13520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll show you: this beaten dog still has some teeth!', '', 13519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not some simple jester! I am Nielas Aran!', '', 13518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes my son is quite powerful... but I have powers of my own!', '', 13517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, nothing like a good drink!', '', 13516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins channelling his mana into a powerful arcane spell.', '', 13515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely you wouldn\'t deny an old man a replenishing drink? No, no, I thought not.', '', 13514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not finished yet! No, I have a few more tricks up my sleeve...', '', 13513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, kind spirit.  What has brought you to us?', 13512, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, this can\'t be! This tonic... it was supposed to reverse my addiction, not hasten my descent into the ranks of the Wretched!', 13511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel... lightheaded... What\'s... happening to me?', 13510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve endured much hardship to complete my research and with your help, $n, I\'ve finally done it. Here\'s to a brighter future!', 13509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s removes the reagents from the crate and mixes portions of each in a flask.', 13508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 13507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once more, thank you for your assistance with the cursed Lost Ones.  Without your help I would never have been able to continue my research.', '', 13506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are welcome among us, $c.  At least for the time being.', '', 13505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.  I am Anchorite Avuun of the draenei.  I am here studying the Lost Ones of the Fallow Sanctuary in the hope of being able to find a cure for their condition.', '', 13504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength to the Clans, $c!  What brings you here?', '', 13503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the spirits guide you, $r.', 13502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, most excellent!  That was great fun, was it not?  Little by little I\'ve been cursing more of those disgusting Lost Ones.  Soon enough I\'ll be ready to try it on the draenei!', 13501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I can make it to Brackenwall on my own. They\'ve got the cargo at the top of the tower. Be careful!', 13500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Balandar sent me to get you out of here and reclaim his cargo. He\'s waiting for you in Brackenwall Village.', 'Balandar sent me to get you out of here and reclaim his cargo. He\'s waiting for you in Brackenwall Village.', 13499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did Balandar Brightstar send you to rescue me?', 13498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get word to Balandar Brightstar. He\'ll know what to do.', 13497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze upon the Exodar, young $r. It is hard to imagine that we survived such a catastrophe.$B$B<Menelaous sighs.>$B$BThe Prophet states that it is here that our fate will finally be known. Ten lifetimes spent fleeing from the madness of the Burning Legion... here we finally make a stand.$B$BNo more running... I am ready to die.', '', 13496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is going to be such fun!  Don\'t you think, my dear?', 13495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a hunter in need of training, Acteon.', 'I am a hunter in need of training, Acteon.', 13494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am far too busy to be wasting time on idle chatter. If you are looking for work as a huntsman, speak with Diktynna at the river\'s edge -- to the east. No doubt she\'s behind on her duties...', '', 13493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your petty magics are no challenge to the might of the Scourge!', '', 13492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Transport me to the Molten Core, Lothos.', 'Transport me to the Molten Core, Lothos.', 13491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons are merely a convenience for a warrior of my skill!', '', 13490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is my fervent hope that we will be able to bring the Light to those places in Ashenvale where it has been forsaken.', 13489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings,  I am Vindicator Palanaar, a traveling paladin of the Light.  I am here to be of assistance to the night elves.', 13488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this city not beautiful, $c?  It warms my heart that we have found such good friends in these night elves.', 13487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail to thee, $c.', 13486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
