('And you would be?', 'And you would be?', 13349, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, I don\'t speak with the help.', 'Sorry, I don\'t speak with the help.', 13348, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you believe the nerve of that Elisara Sunstriker?  Thinking that she can catch the eye of Lord Saltheril?  And did you see what she\'s wearing?  So last season.  It\'s sad, really.', 'Can you believe the nerve of that Elisara Sunstriker?  Thinking that she can catch the eye of Lord Saltheril?  And did you see what she\'s wearing?  So last season.  It\'s sad, really.', 13347, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 6, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('I heard a rumor that we\'re all going to go watch the battle with the Scourge at the border tonight.  How delightfully wicked!', 'I heard a rumor that we\'re all going to go watch the battle with the Scourge at the border tonight.  How delightfully wicked!', 13346, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... I think this year\'s Suntouched Special isn\'t so special after all.  Wouldn\'t you agree, $n?', 'Hmm... I think this year\'s Suntouched Special isn\'t so special after all.  Wouldn\'t you agree, $n?', 13345, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('You should try the springpaw appetizers, they\'re to die for!', 'You should try the springpaw appetizers, they\'re to die for!', 13344, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This party is just the best!  Don\'t you agree?', 'This party is just the best!  Don\'t you agree?', 13343, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Word travels fast in this circle.  Thanks for restocking the supplies!', 'Word travels fast in this circle.  Thanks for restocking the supplies!', 13342, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey everyone, it\'s $n!', 'Hey everyone, it\'s $n!', 13341, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi, $n!  Enjoying the party?', 'Hi, $n!  Enjoying the party?', 13340, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... do I know you?', 'Oh... do I know you?', 13339, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m quite sure there was a reason I came here....', 'I\'m quite sure there was a reason I came here....', 13338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps later we should join the dance.', 'Perhaps later we should join the dance.', 13337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This all seems so familiar, like I\'ve been here before.', 'This all seems so familiar, like I\'ve been here before.', 13336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s much easier to talk up here without all that music.', 'It\'s much easier to talk up here without all that music.', 13335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard last night\'s performance was spectacular!', 'I heard last night\'s performance was spectacular!', 13334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I had tickets for tonight\'s show!', 'I wish I had tickets for tonight\'s show!', 13333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well then, have it your way. When we turn others away, you will be responsible for their suffering. Think about that.', '', 13332, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Sunwell, you\'ve a thick skull! You\'ll not bully me into leaving, Taleris. Now, begone from my sight!', 13331, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll do no such thing. We simply haven\'t the room to keep you here. Now, kindly be on your way.', '', 13330, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not going on alone, Taleris, and that\'s final. I\'m going to wait here for the next group of pilgrims and set out with them when they depart.', 13329, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve had enough time to recover from your wounds, Gal\'ressa. The time has come for you to return to the road.', '', 13328, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you want, Taleris?', 13327, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s rubs the sleep from her eyes.', 13326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up, Gal\'ressa.', '', 13325, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An unstable source.... but its warmth beckons me!', '', 13324, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... this will do nicely.', '', 13323, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, Commander. I will be staying at the inn, should you require my services.', '', 13322, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I\'m beginning to regret undertaking this pilgrimage. I anticipated that the road would be rough and I\'m no stranger to travel, but I wasn\'t prepared for the rigors of Outland.$B$BOn top of everything else, that Taleris seems to want to push me out of here before I\'ve regained my strength completely.', 13321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care of him, Sid. He may be the only link I have to my father and mother. He needs to sober up...', '', 13320, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '', 13319, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh brother... Listen, he\'s gonna be here crying like a baby for another five hours. If you\'re really the son of Turalyon, go speak with Trollbane. He\'s in the keep - top floor.', '', 13318, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, Sid. Fill my tankard. Make the memories fade...', '', 13317, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to sob.', '%s begins to sob.', 13316, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And... the battle we lost. I... I\'m sorry, Arator. It was my fault...', '', 13315, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s clears his throat.', '', 13314, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light! So this is why you look familiar. Is this fate? Destiny perhaps? Arator, your father and I were the best of friends. It is I who kept him in good health... Oh the battles we fought... And...', '', 13313, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s face turns white. Sobriety seems to have set in rather quickly.', '', 13312, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Arator, son of Turalyon and Alleria. So yes, Father, I am \"shome\" kind of elf: half-elf to be precise.', '', 13311, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shay, what\'sh your deal anwaysh? Are you shome kind of elf or shomethin? You looksh shorta familiar.', '', 13310, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Farstrider Retreat.  We are rangers sworn to defend our people from enemies both near and far.', 13309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Walk always in the Light, $n.', 13308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, sir!', 'Yes, sir!', 13307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.', '', 13306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Welcome to Falcon Watch, $c. I see to the needs of the pilgrims and help them in continuing their long journey. If you haven\'t yet undertaken the pilgrimage, I can provide you with the information you will need.', '', 13305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t time for idle chatter, $c. I must see to the pilgrims and ensure they are prepared for the long journey ahead.', '', 13304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I bid you welcome, $c.', 13303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You had better straighten up, or you\'ll answer to me!', '', 13302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You block like a little girl! Put your shoulder into it!', '', 13301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of pathetic strike was that? Shape up at once!', '', 13300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Practice as if your life depends on it, because it does!', '', 13299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep the drinks coming; it\'s going to be a long night!', 'Keep the drinks coming; it\'s going to be a long night!', 13298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away!', 'Right away!', 13297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without delay!', 'Without delay!', 13296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish.', 'As you wish.', 13295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe I\'ll try the merlot this time.', 'I believe I\'ll try the merlot this time.', 13294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More food! More wine!', 'More food! More wine!', 13293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Falcon Watch, at last! Now, where\'s my... Oh no! My pack, it\'s missing! Where has - ', 13292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another drink!', 'Another drink!', 13291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Allow me a moment to rest. The journey taxes what little strength I have.', 13290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for agreeing to help. Now, let\'s get out of here, $n!', 13289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps just one more dance. Then I really must be leaving! I have to get back to... to...', 'Perhaps just one more dance. Then I really must be leaving! I have to get back to... to...', 13287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This all seems so strange.', 'This all seems so strange.', 13286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the life of me I don\'t know why I\'m here, but I\'m having the best time!', 'For the life of me I don\'t know why I\'m here, but I\'m having the best time!', 13284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel as though there\'s a task I have yet to complete....', 'I feel as though there\'s a task I have yet to complete....', 13283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so strange: I can\'t remember how I came to be here.', 'It\'s so strange: I can\'t remember how I came to be here.', 13282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This music never gets old, does it?', 'This music never gets old, does it?', 13281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to weaken as its energy bleeds away.', '', 13280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, sir.', '', 13279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waiter, another bottle, and be quick!', 'Waiter, another bottle, and be quick!', 13278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR THE HORDE!', '', 13277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR THE HORDE!', '', 13276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR THE HORDE!', 'FOR THE HORDE!', 13275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the moment of destiny! On the other side, a new beginning awaits. A new enemy to slaughter. You can feel it, can you not? The bloodlust rising? Follow Blackhand! Listen to his orders and you will rule this new world as is your right! It is your world on the other side of the portal. Take it!', '', 13274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is true! All is as you promised us!', '', 13273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are our scouts! They have already gone through the Dark Portal. They return to you with news of the new world.', '', 13272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan, what have you done to us!', '', 13271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO!!!', '', 13270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood is a pure offering to those who give us these vast powers.  And the blood of an innocent is purer still.  With the life fluid of our enemies, we will open the portal and step into a glorious new world - a new page in the history of the Horde!', '', 13269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gestures to the draenei captive.', '', 13268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even now, our ally is working to open the portal on his side. And now, we will begin.', '', 13267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But at the same time, there is no choice. We need food, water. We must go through this portal.', '', 13266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods in agreement.', '', 13265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can they still feel this way? Can they not see this new land will suffer as ours has if we continue on this path?', 13264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s shakes her head in disbelief.', 13263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gestures for silence.', '', 13262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will destroy them. Their blood-red blood-will flow freely upon our swords. As we have destroyed the Draenei, so now we will destroy the humans!\n', '', 13261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best of all, we will continue to exalt in the glory of bloodshed. A race called \'humans\', the enemy of our ally, will try to stop us from taking their lands.', '', 13260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Far, far away, in a land called Azeroth, I have an ally. He offers us his land. It is green and lush, filled with pure water and fat creatures to hunt.', '', 13259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s points to the monolothic structure known as the Dark Portal.', '', 13258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, I will reveal to you the visions I have had.', '', 13257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have all seen this portal being built, admired the craftsmanship and how it stands as a monument to the glory of the Horde.', '', 13256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over there! They\'re following us!', 13255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail!  You look familiar... have we met before?$B$BWell if we have met, then... surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a gift!', 'Hail!  You look familiar... have we met before?$B$BWell if we have met, then... surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a gift!', 13254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Zergling pet.', 'I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Zergling pet.', 13253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I hearing things?', '', 13252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who goes there?', '', 13251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All quiet.', '', 13250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today is a glorious day for the Horde!', '', 13249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you are right.', '', 13248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I saw some killing children in battle. The bloodlust was upon them - I could not condone it but I could see how it could happen, but surely they will not make a ritual sacrifice out of this defenseless captive.', 13247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll check on that right away.', '', 13246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No sooner said than done, sir.', '', 13245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gladly.', '', 13244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waiter, where is my hasenpfeffer?', 'Waiter, where is my hasenpfeffer?', 13243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waiter, more wine!', 'Waiter, more wine!', 13242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waiter, another ale!', 'Waiter, another ale!', 13241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never been so happy! I wish this night would never end!', 'I\'ve never been so happy! I wish this night would never end!', 13240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, life is good.', 'Ahh, life is good.', 13239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did I live before this? I used to know. At least I thought I did....', 'Where did I live before this? I used to know. At least I thought I did....', 13238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does anyone else remember how we got here? Is it just me...?', 'Does anyone else remember how we got here? Is it just me...?', 13237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That joke kills me!', 'That joke kills me!', 13236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so then he says \"I was talking to the chicken!\"', 'And so then he says \"I was talking to the chicken!\"', 13235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A feast fit for royalty!', 'A feast fit for royalty!', 13234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every dish is more delicious than the last!', 'Every dish is more delicious than the last!', 13233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s points to the draenei captive.', 13232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are they going to do with it?', 13231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear the worst.', '', 13230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m positively stuffed; I can\'t eat another bite! Well, perhaps just one more...', 'I\'m positively stuffed; I can\'t eat another bite! Well, perhaps just one more...\n', 13229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard something of your exploits, $n.  I know that while you\'re here in Forsaken lands that you\'ll comport yourself with dignity and as a true hero of the sin\'dorei!', '', 13228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whispers something to their compatriot.', '%s whispers something to their compatriot.', 13227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why has this gathering been called?', 'Why has this gathering been called?', 13226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are we doing here?', 'What are we doing here?', 13225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel! Kneel fools!', 'Kneel! Kneel fools!', 13224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whispers something unintelligible.', '%s whispers something unintelligible.', 13223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That joke... I swear I laugh every time!', 'That joke... I swear I laugh every time!', 13222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He appeared from thin air!', 'He appeared from thin air!', 13221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gasps.', '%s gasps.', 13220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What exactly is going on upstairs, anyway?', 'What exactly is going on upstairs, anyway?', 13219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is Gul\'dan!', 'It is Gul\'dan!', 13218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another meal, another triumph!', 'Another meal, another triumph!', 13217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Appreciated.', '', 13216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All this fuss just for me?\n', '', 13215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', '', 13214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where has he gone?', '', 13212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a shame for this food to go to waste. Oh, well.', '', 13211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At your service, sir, as always.', '', 13210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
