('', 'That\'s my little Jir\'see! We\'ll make you into one of those netherhounds yet!', 13179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This constant, annoying resistance is futile, you maggots! There will be nothing in the end but death!', '', 13178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you truly believe you can win against the armies of the Lich King? No army of the living, no power you could possibly bring to bear can destroy my ranks!', '', 13177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The toils of the living never cease to amaze. Your numbers are limited, and with every battle they dwindle further. You will not live to see the end!', '', 13176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fools! Keep fighting, if that is your wish! With every battle, more of you fall, and the ranks of my undead swell!', '', 13175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you the master is daunted by your games? We will never fall to you!', '', 13174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you truly believe you\'re making progress? You can never defeat my Scourge!', '', 13173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve reclaimed a few paltry territories. Pathetic. In short order they will again be mine!', '', 13172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Open wide, Jir\'see.', 13171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may succeed on the field of battle briefly... but you cannot hope to win against my Scourge!', '', 13170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you truly believe you are doing well? Hah! My forces are limitless!', '', 13169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what you know, Larenis.', 'Show me what you know, Larenis.', 13168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Few bouts are won by sheer strength.  It is cunning, reflexes and knowledge of your weapon that wins the day in the end.', 'Few bouts are won by sheer strength.  It is cunning, reflexes and knowledge of your weapon that wins the day in the end.', 13167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shimmers and disappears!', '', 13166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may think you have won, worms, but against the might of the Lich King there is no victory for the living! You have not seen the last of me!', '', 13165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare disrupt my works here?! Take this time to prepare yourselves... when I return, there will be nothing but death and destruction in my wake!', '', 13164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, the frail members of the living have some teeth after all. Take this place, then, for the time being. I will return, twice as strong, and your paltry forces will fall!', '', 13163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadow of the Scourge yet remains on this land, fools! You will never prevail!', '', 13162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no victory for you here! What little ground you\'ve gained will be swallowed by my army in due course!', '', 13161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy your small victory while you can, mortals. It will not stop my eventual triumph over this land!', '', 13160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you\'ve conquered a small spot of land. A minor setback! I will reign here!', '', 13159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Could night elf saboteurs be behind this?  I doubt it.  With the load we\'ve been putting on the West Sanctum it was only a matter of time until something went wrong.', 13158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools!  You seek to abjure my father\'s presence?  Death awaits you, mortals!', '', 13157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. I see that you are already flagged as having completed the quest to gain entry to Naxxramas. Be sure to speak with Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light\'s Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands to acquire the quest, \"Echoes of War.\" You must first complete that quest to be able to access the quests for your Tier 3 armor set.$B$BI am able to teleport you directly to Naxxramas or you may use the portal found in Plaguewood, to the west.', '', 13156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sighs in regret.', '', 13155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require a teleport to Naxxramas.', 'I require a teleport to Naxxramas.', 13154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require flagging.', 'I require flagging.', 13153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shakes his head in dismay.', '', 13152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. I am Johnny McWeaksauce. I am used as a tool by developers to carry out specific functions for the purpose of testing. For this test period, I am set to do two specific things:$B$B(1) Flag you as having done the Naxxramas attunement quest so that you are able to accept the next quest, \"Echoes of War\" from Commander Eligor Dawnbringer. You must first complete that quest to be able to access the quests for your Tier 3 armor set.$B$B(2) Teleport you to Naxxramas.$B$BWhat is it that you require?', '', 13151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!!! A curse upon you, interlopers! The armies of the Lich King will hunt you down. You will not escape your fate...', '', 13150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrallmar needs you, $c. The warchief needs you. Stand ready to do your duty.', '', 13149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met, $c. Your arrival in Thrallmar could not have occurred at a better time. The warchief is depending on us, since he cannot be here himself.', 13148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look lost, $c. Don\'t make me put you to work on the walls with the other peons.', '', 13147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is sad to see what has happened to this land.  The Cenarion Expedition will do what it can to understand and heal the damage that has been done.', '', 13146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The extent of the corruption in Outland is truly astonishing, $c. The Cenarion Circle hopes to understand how these creatures have managed to survive. Studying this broken, tortured land and its inhabitants may yet teach us how to heal ailing parts of our own world.', 13145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t suppose you\'ve come bearing news about the mines, have you?', '', 13144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n. My fellow Sons of Lothar and I have been stuck on this miserable world for close to twenty years now. We held on as best we could, but it still amazes me that the threats we face today are just the shadows of our past failures.$B$BPerhaps you will help us atone for them?  \n', 13143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
