('Conserve your anger. Harness your rage. You will all have outlets for your frustrations soon enough.', '', 13059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough prattling. Let them come. We shall grind their bones to dust.', '', 13058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow to the might of the Scourge!', '', 13057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master\'s will is done.', '', 13056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find no peace in death.', '', 13055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... am... released... perhaps it\'s not too late to- No! I need... more... time...', '', 13054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be still!', '', 13053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None shall pass!', '', 13052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek death?', '', 13051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hungry worms will feast on your rotting flesh.', '', 13050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The end is upon you.', '', 13049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon the world will tremble.', '', 13048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see endless suffering. I see torment. I see rage. I see everything...', '', 13047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The races of the world will perish. It is only a matter of time.', '', 13046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Close your eyes. Sleep.', '', 13045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s takes his last breath.', '', 13044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... are next.', '', 13043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you...', '', 13042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are mine now.', '', 13041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna\' enjoy killin\' these slack-jawed daffodils!', '', 13040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard about enough a\' yer snivelin\'! Shut yer flytrap before I shut it for ye\'!', '', 13039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms, ye roustabouts! We\'ve got company!', '', 13038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like my meat extra crispy!', '', 13037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time, bring more friends!', '', 13036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a bloody waste this is!', '', 13035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon an\' fight ye wee ninny!', '', 13034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now there is only one way out- to walk the lonely path of the damned.', '', 13033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have fought hard to invade the realm of the harvester.', '', 13032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brazenly you have disregarded powers beyond your understanding.', '', 13031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolishly you have sought your own demise.', '', 13030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolishly you have sought your own demise. Brazenly you have disregarded powers beyond your understanding. You have fought hard to invade the realm of the harvester. Now there is only one way out- to walk the lonely path of the damned.', '', 13029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have waited long enough. Now you face the harvester of souls.', '', 13028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is the only escape!', '', 13027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... am... undone.', '', 13026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feugen make master happy.', '', 13025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... more... Feugen.', '', 13024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed you to master!', '', 13023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cackles maniacally.\n', '', 13022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dark void awaits you!', '', 13021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will freeze the blood in your veins!', '', 13020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agghhhh! Do... not... rejoice! Your victory is a hollow one, for I shall return with powers beyond your imagining!', '', 13019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be no escape!', '', 13018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul is bound to me, now!', '', 13017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The first kill goes to me! Anyone care to wager?', 13016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do hope they stay alive long enough for me to... introduce myself.', 13015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, Zeliek, do not drive them out. Not before we\'ve had our fun!', 13014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your life is mine!', 13013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who\'s next?', 13012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Touche...', 13011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defend yourself!', 13010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Closer now. Tasty morsels. I\'ve been too long without food, without blood to drink.', '', 13009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which one shall I eat first? So difficult to choose. They all smell so delicious...', '', 13008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where to go? What to do? So many choices that all end in pain, end in death.', '', 13007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear little hearts beating. Yes... beating faster now... soon the beating will stop.', '', 13006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh... it will all be over soon.', '', 13005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh... welcome to my parlor.', '', 13004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, run! It makes the blood pump faster!', '', 13003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no way out.', '', 13002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rushes to the aid of Stalagg!', '', 13001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a little taste...', '', 13000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions, servants, soldiers of the cold dark! Obey the call of Kel\'Thuzad!', '', 12999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, I require aid!', '', 12998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end is upon you!', '', 12997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scream your dying breath!', '', 12996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pray for mercy!', '', 12995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Warriors of the frozen wastes, rise up! I command you to fight, kill and die for your master! Let none survive!', '', 12994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, heroes... By the will of the Lich King, you shall be destroyed.', '', 12993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you command, master!', '', 12992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, master. The time of their ultimate demise draws close.... What is this?', '', 12991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your forces are nearly marshaled to strike back against your enemies, my liege.', '', 12990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders... here?! DESTROY them, Kel\'Thuzad! Naxxramas must not fall!', '', 12989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon we will eradicate the Alliance and Horde. Then the rest of Azeroth will fall before the might of my army.', '', 12988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea what horrors lie ahead. You have seen nothing! The frozen heart of Naxxramas awaits you!', '', 12987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow tired of these games. Proceed, and I will banish your souls to oblivion!', '', 12986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! You think yourselves triumphant? You have only taken one step closer to the abyss!', '', 12985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares violate the sanctity of my domain? Be warned: all who trespass here are doomed!', '', 12984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There, $n, I think I\'ve figured it out!', 12983, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The undead are approaching.  Attack!', 12863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The enemy approaches from the south.  Ready your weapons!', 12862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slay them!  Don\'t let the Scourge scum defile our city!', 12861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoying the festival, $c?$b$bWhile the Flame Wardens tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I\'m also, of course, documenting this year\'s festivities. Things are going well thus far, don\'t you think?$b$bYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We\'re taking care of ours, but I\'m certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy\'s cities...', 'Enjoying the festival, $c?$b$bWhile the Flame Wardens tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I\'m also, of course, documenting this year\'s festivities. Things are going well thus far, don\'t you think?$b$bYou know, $n, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We\'re taking care of ours, but I\'m certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy\'s cities...', 12860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Run while you still can!', 12859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kneel before me, worm!', 12858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot hide from me!', 12857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slay them in the master\'s name!', 12856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pathetic wretch!', 12855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have failed!', 12854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The master will avenge me!!', 12853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your old lives, your mortal desires mean nothing... you are acolytes of the master now, and you will serve the cause without question! The greatest glory is to die in the master\'s service!', 12852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please teleport me to the final chamber.', 'Please teleport me to the final chamber.', 12851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With Ouro slain the way is clear to the final chamber. I am able to transport you there, if you desire.', 12850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport me to the lair of the Twin Emperors, please.', 'Teleport me to the lair of the Twin Emperors, please.', 12849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the Emperors slain, the magical protection blocking teleportation within the temple has been greatly weakened. If you desire, I am able to translocate you to the Emperors\' lair.', 12848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My job consists of one task and one task only: ensuring that the West Sanctum runs smoothly.$B$BYou\'ll have to excuse my temper but, as you can see, the situation here is a bit out of hand.', 12847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is great news!  Your efforts have indeed saved us, $n!', 12846, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the seven Ata\'mal crystals!  Others have survived the crash!  Zhanaa, is that you?  It is so good to see you again!', '', 12845, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them all!', '', 12844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Fairbreeze Village.  Silvermoon\'s all but given up on us, but we refuse to leave.  This is our home.', 12842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think I\'m being cruel to this worm?$B$BThey\'ve killed two of my men this month!  We\'re too kind to this Wretched scum.', '', 12840, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your bones will be devoured!', 'Your bones will be devoured!', 12839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Spinebreaker!', 'For Spinebreaker!', 12838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the interlopers!', 'Death to the interlopers!', 12837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the Warchief at all costs!', 'Protect the Warchief at all costs!', 12836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please!  I must feed on something soon... A mana crystal.... a shard... anything!  The pain is unbearable!', '', 12835, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not getting anything until you speak, scum!', '', 12834, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell us!  Where does your leader hide?', '', 12833, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I might just have to go hunting for that Wretched beast now that there\'s a bounty on his head.', '', 12832, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'iCoke - Description (S.H.E. giftbox)', 12831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the iCoke gift box promotion.', 'Tell me about the iCoke gift box promotion.', 12830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Marketing - iCoke Redemption Greeting (S.H.E. giftbox)', 12829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will rue the day that you killed my crew! Rue it, I say!', '', 12828, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I to do?  My precious mine...', '', 12827, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait \'til Nazgrel hears about this! It\'ll be my head! My head I say!', '', 12826, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead!  They are all dead! At least I don\'t have to pay wages.', '', 12825, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Serve the public trust!', '', 12824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uphold the law!', '', 12823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the innocent!', '', 12822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ONWARD!', 'ONWARD!', 12821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need this message delivered to Watch Commander Netherwane at Nethergarde Keep. There\'s a commendation in it for you if you make it... Your horse is waiting at the stables. Dismissed!', '', 12820, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir, yes sir! Private will do their best to not die, sir!', 'Sir, yes sir! Private will do their best to not die, sir!', 12819, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At ease, Private. I have a mission for you. The last messenger I sent to Nethergarde didn\'t make it. We found his entrails scattered about the bone road a few hours ago. We suspect it may have been Legion or fel orc, maybe even Horde...', '', 12818, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SIR! YES, SIR! Reporting for duty, sir!', 'SIR! YES, SIR! Reporting for duty, sir!', 12817, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldier! Front and center!', '', 12816, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As long as he remains unfound, I will search. I know that he lives. And I know that I must find him. I am thankful for what you have done, Commander. As my father called upon you, a brother in arms, know that you may call upon me. I am at your service, my Lord.', '', 12815, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am afraid that I do not, Arator. I have not seen or heard from your father in 15 years. We had long since presumed him dead. But know this: I did all that was in my power to try and find him. From the bounds of Hellfire to the ravages of Nagrand, we searched... All for naught. If I could give my own life to bring Turalyon back, I would do so a thousand times over. I... I am sorry.', '', 12814, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks at Arator grimly.', '', 12813, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, Commander; but I am little no more. I have come to find my father. Have you any news as to his whereabouts? I know that he still lives. I have seen it in my dreams...', '', 12812, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I live and breathe! \"Little\" Arator? Is that you?', '', 12811, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holiday - Scourge Invasion, mystic - how long, Tier 2', '', 12810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holiday - Scourge Invasion, mystic - how long, Tier 1', '', 12809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holiday - Scourge Invasion, mystic - how long, Tier 0', '', 12808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How long will the invasion last?', 'How long will the invasion last?', 12807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A gloom shrouds our lands, young $c.  Will you take up arms to face this flying death?', '', 12806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was only an infant when my father was deployed to this wasteland. All that I have ever known of him is what others have told me.$B$BDo your dreams change, $n? Mine do not. I have one dream: A crimson skyline envelops me as Legion, numbering beyond comprehension, battle in the distance. I kneel before the body of a man, presumably my father, and weep. As he is gasping for air, his body wholly crushed, he whispers something. Despite every effort, I am unable to hear what he is trying to tell me.', '', 12805, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to fly to Thunder Bluff.', 'I\'d like to fly to Thunder Bluff.', 12804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '%s nods.', 12803, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just leave \'em in the cellar.', '', 12802, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bless yer heart, soldier! Just put \'em in the back room.', '', 12801, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Craziest thing - No matter how many bottles I take from the stockpile, the quantity on hand never decreases. It\'s like I\'m stuck in some endless loop of actions...', 'Craziest thing - No matter how many bottles I take from the stockpile, the quantity on hand never decreases. It\'s like I\'m stuck in some endless loop of actions...', 12800, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got another shipment for you, Sid.', 'Got another shipment for you, Sid.', 12799, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where do you want these bottles?', 'Where do you want these bottles?', 12798, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Befriending the Sunstriders has paid off; I get to conduct research with subjects I can only find in Outland and they get... my charming personality and rugged good looks.', '', 12797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I really don\'t think our situation is so bad.  I am certain it will all be rectified soon and the Sunwell\'s power will be restored.  It just can\'t possibly be as bad as everyone is making it out to be.', 12796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grunts in pain as he applies a splint to his injured leg.', '', 12795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t... worry... about me...', '', 12794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dragonhawks, if raised properly, are really quite tame.  Don\'t you think that is fascinating?  To be so friendly and companionable if raised right and so vicious and deadly in the wild...I just love them so much.', 12793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My husband\'s been missing for days.  We went on this pilgrimage together; we were supposed to finish it together.$B$BAll this worry has gotten me tapping into mana crystals more often than I really should.', 12792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outland just oozes with magical energy, it\'s in the very air.  Can you feel it, $n?  I can\'t think of a place better suited to our race.  Soon the sin\'dorei shall have a new land to call our own!', '', 12791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I see your wares?', 'May I see your wares?', 12790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gone filthy creature!  Why anyone would tolerate your filth is beyond me.', '', 12789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I serve?', 'How may I serve?', 12788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do we ally with filthy stinking trolls?  The only good troll is a dead troll.', '', 12787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does anyone need supplies to hunt down the trolls?  Any troll will do.', '', 12786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not think enough attention is being paid to those trolls.  They could swarm in here anytime.', '', 12785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was born here, $r. This is my world - all that I know... As a boy, my mother and father would regale me with tales of your world and the splendor it held. How I longed to leave this place.$B$BAlas, fate is a cruel mistress. My mother and father have long since passed, buried in this very graveyard. I remain to uphold their honor and the honor of my family - the Sons of Lothar.', '', 12784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There exist in Outland demonic presences much more powerful than anything we\'d ever seen in the old world.$B$BGreat power shall come to those who do not shy away from it, but learn to harness and master its strength.', '', 12783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s to hoping not all of Outland is as barren as this region.  This is quite a change from the green grasslands and forests of Eversong.', 12782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bristles with energy!', '', 12781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bursts, showering the area with arcane residue!', '', 12780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope yer not here for our ale.  We\'re not sharing and that\'s final!$B$BIt\'s not our fault no one had the good sense to bring beer to Outland but us.', '', 12779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mirren and I are two of the very best hunters on either side of the Dark Portal.  Stick around, you might learn a thing or two.', '', 12778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, what are you still doing here?  Have you spoken with Proenitus down at the crash site yet?', '', 12777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate the company, $n.', '', 12776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again for replenishing our healing crystals.  I hear that you\'re helping out all over the place.  Keep up the good work!', '', 12775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you alive and well, $n!', '', 12774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None will question your actions, $c.  You did what had to be done.', 12773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for taking care of the lake, the lashers and the owlkin, $c.', 12772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How are we ever going to get out of here?', 12771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for delivering that list!  My leg is almost recovered enough that I\'ll be able to walk back to the crash site.', '', 12770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I wouldn\'t give for a healing crystal right about now!', '', 12769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you start with me, Sid! Have it sent to my quarters in the tower instead! Your inn has become a zoo!', '', 12768, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll not take me alive, scum!', 12767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 36, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Comin\' right up, yer highness! Is there anythin\' else you\'ll be needin\'? Perhaps yer hat cleaned or yer nails trimmed?', '', 12766, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sid! Ale, NOW!', '', 12765, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mailbox? Well is that not the salt on the wounds! Twenty years cut-off from the world and now a mailbox! WONDERFUL!', '', 12764, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I take my leave now, Commander. Good day!', '', 12763, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never! I\'ll never abide by their will! I\'d sooner be dead.', '', 12762, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To trust an orc? Even if it is the progeny of Durotan himself! This is madness!', '', 12761, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twenty years lost! Twenty! I won\'t stand for this! No, no, no... ', 'Twenty years lost! Twenty! I won\'t stand for this! No, no, no... ', 12760, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And have you heard? Have you heard the preposterous claims? Alliance and Horde supporting peace? Why the very thought of such things makes my blood boil!', 'And have you heard? Have you heard the preposterous claims? Alliance and Horde supporting peace? Why the very thought of such things makes my blood boil!', 12759, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a good mind to tear that portal down myself! This is outrageous!', '', 12758, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What manner of fool opens the very thing we were sent to close?', '', 12757, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though we\'ve arrived at the promised land, $n, much work remains to be done.  Our people won\'t reach Kael\'thas if we lunge desperately across Outland.$B$BSafe routes must be found, resources must be secured and our enemies must be avoided or destroyed.', '', 12756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is precisely why I have called for you old friend. We have much to discuss.', '', 12755, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What now, Danath? Can you not see that I am inundated with work as is?', '', 12754, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Judging by your signal, we put you... ust southeast of the larger part of the island we crashed onto.  Cross the Crystalbrook River to ge... kshhhhk zzzt. Sorry, there\'s a lot of stat...', '', 12753, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And who do we have here?  No doubt th... crzzzk ...ade this communication possible?  I give you greetings fro... psshzzzk... Azure Watch.', '', 12752, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to make Honor Hold my home, Sid.', 'I wish to make Honor Hold my home, Sid.', 12751, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to take a look at your wares, Sid.', 'I would like to take a look at your wares, Sid.', 12750, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sid\'s the name. It\'s nice to see some new faces around here. What can I do you for?', '', 12749, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So help me, I\'m gonna count to ten and if yer not outta there by the time I reach 10, I\'m comin\' in!', 'So help me, I\'m gonna count to ten and if yer not outta there by the time I reach 10, I\'m comin\' in!', 12748, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OY! You in there, this is official Honor Hold business yer holdin\' up!', 'OY! You in there, this is official Honor Hold business yer holdin\' up!', 12747, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do ya want me to call a medic? Maybe a priest? It\'s been over an hour, mate!', 'Do ya want me to call a medic? Maybe a priest? It\'s been over an hour, mate!', 12746, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s goin\' on in there?? For the love of the LIGHT, hurry it up!', 'What\'s goin\' on in there?? For the love of the LIGHT, hurry it up!', 12745, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OY! Wait in line, would ya? Outland food doesn\'t agree with me at all.', 'OY! Wait in line, would ya? Outland food doesn\'t agree with me at all.', 12744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s skin hardens!', '', 12743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s done it!  Hopefully Rommath will send reinforcements soon.', '', 12742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another batch of Scourge has been destroyed!', '', 12741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose you want something for what you did, is that it? Reminding me of my life? Pfagh. Take what I have and leave me alone.', 'I suppose you want something for what you did, is that it? Reminding me of my life? Pfagh. Take what I have and leave me alone.', 12740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, you\'re the one who found the letter. Thank you for the... news, I suppose, about my family. You\'re welcome to what food and drink I can offer.', 12739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
