('I no longer have my Zandalar Illusionist\'s Wraps and require a new pair.', 'I no longer have my Zandalar Illusionist\'s Wraps and require a new pair.', 12679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
