('I\'d like you better if you would apply some perfume.', 'I\'d like you better if you would apply some perfume.', 11806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like you\'ve had your heart broken. Come back when you\'re not so sad.', 'You look like you\'ve had your heart broken. Come back when you\'re not so sad.', 11805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
