('I\'d talk to you if you smelled better. Cologne would be nice.', 'I\'d talk to you if you smelled better. Cologne would be nice.', 11795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
