('It seems like love is drifting on the wind. I hope that I won\'t be left out.', '', 11754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you have lived as long as I, it becomes easy to forget about love for years. It is always good to be reminded.', '', 11753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you have lived as long as I, it becomes easy to forget about love for years. It is always good to be reminded.', 'When you have lived as long as I, it becomes easy to forget about love for years. It is always good to be reminded.', 11752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you have lived as long as I, it becomes easy to forget about love for years. It is always good to be reminded.', 11751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You work with machines for so long, sometimes you forget about real hearts.', '', 11750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You work with machines for so long, sometimes you forget about real hearts.', 'You work with machines for so long, sometimes you forget about real hearts.', 11749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You work with machines for so long, sometimes you forget about real hearts.', 11748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what\'s come over me. My heart feels as hot as new steel.', '', 11747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know what\'s come over me. My heart feels as hot as new steel.', 11746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been so wrapped up in this war, some of us forgot to make time for love.', '', 11745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like you\'ve already found love. You can give me a love token, but I\'m not giving you anything nice. I\'m waiting for someone special.', '', 11744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like you\'ve already found love. You can give me a love token, but I\'m not giving you anything nice. I\'m waiting for someone special.', 'It looks like you\'ve already found love. You can give me a love token, but I\'m not giving you anything nice. I\'m waiting for someone special.', 11743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive my Panda Cub pet.', 'I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive my Panda Cub pet.', 11742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift of one of the panda cubs that I take care of.$B$BJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready.', 'Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift of one of the panda cubs that I take care of.$B$BJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready.', 11741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like you\'ve already found love. You can give me a love token, but I\'m not giving you anything nice. I\'m waiting for someone special.', '', 11740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It looks like you\'ve already found love. You can give me a love token, but I\'m not giving you anything nice. I\'m waiting for someone special.', 11739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like you\'ve already found love. You can give me a love token, but I\'m not giving you anything nice. I\'m waiting for someone special.', 'It looks like you\'ve already found love. You can give me a love token, but I\'m not giving you anything nice. I\'m waiting for someone special.', 11738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve been so wrapped up in this war, some of us forgot to make time for love.', 11737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been so wrapped up in this war, some of us forgot to make time for love.', '', 11736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What manner of trick is this, $r?  If you seek to ambush me, I warn you I will not go down quietly!  ', '', 11735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.  Let\'s see what you have to show me, $n.', '', 11734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why... yes, of course.  I\'ve something to show you right inside this building, Mr. Anvilward.', 'Why... yes, of course.  I\'ve something to show you right inside this building, Mr. Anvilward.', 11733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you must be the $glad : lass; assigned to show me around the Eversong Woods.  Took your sweet time getting here, didn\'t you?$B$BVery well, off we go.  Let us not waste one more minute.', '', 11732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a moment of your time, sir.', 'I need a moment of your time, sir.', 11731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you looking at, $glad : lass;?  Never seen a dwarf before, then?$B$BYou\'d best be on yer way if you don\'t want any trouble.', '', 11730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $gmister:miss;.  You look like a $C with discerning tastes in wine.  I have a favor to ask, and I think I can make you an offer you can\'t refuse...forget about it!', '', 11729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was quite a fight.  Let us catch our breath for a bit.', 11728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not belong here!  Ancients, rise against these intruders!', '', 11727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ordered a few shipments of new perfumes and colognes from the city. After I get them unpacked, check back and I\'ll have them for sale.', 'I ordered a few shipments of new perfumes and colognes from the city. After I get them unpacked, check back and I\'ll have them for sale.', 11726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are those crates for?', 'What are those crates for?', 11725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been so wrapped up in this war, some of us forgot to make time for love.', 'We\'ve been so wrapped up in this war, some of us forgot to make time for love.', 11724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, I\'d like to give you this token of my love.', 'Here, I\'d like to give you this token of my love.', 11723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Generic Text2!', 'Generic Text2', 11722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Attack!  Don\'t let them reach the gates!', 11721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The walls have been breached!', '', 11720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s been a pleasure, Mr. Anvilward.  I must say your enthusiastic interest in our operations is most... unexpected.', '', 11718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These arcane sanctums of yours are quite... interesting Mr. Caidanis.  I appreciate the information you have given me today.', '', 11717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mess, that\'s what this is!  All of these creatures sprung up out of nowhere, and are running around out of control!  And where\'ve the Magister, and his apprentices, run off to?  Leaving me here all alone without as much as a, \"Hello there Wyllithen, would you like to come with?\"$B$BThe nerve!', '', 11716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A man can only live with himself and his shame for so long, $c, before he must take action to undo the mistakes he\'s made.', '', 11715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope that Loralthalis is alright, $c. Maybe I should go up to Duskwither Spire myself? Maybe I should have done that in the first place?', '', 11714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good riddance... now none shall be able to repeat my mistakes!', '', 11713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 11711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The feast of souls begins now...', '', 11710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, little ones.\n', '', 11709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh so much pain...', '', 11708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be pain...', '', 11707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are your manners, brother. Let us properly welcome our guests.', '', 11706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('such easy pray.', '', 11705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals are...', '', 11704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('and Bone.', '', 11703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only flesh and bone. Mortals are such easy prey...', '', 11702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wretched are a constant thorn in my side, $n.  When they\'re not being a danger to themselves by tapping unstable arcane sources to satisfy their cravings, they\'re cooking up half-brained schemes against our respectable society.', '', 11701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('The massive floating eyeball in the center of the chamber turns its gaze upon you. You stand before a god.', '', 11700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $c. These are troubling times indeed if this is what is to become of our beloved Quel\'Thalas.', 11698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 18, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s all a mess, $c, and it\'s all my fault! I was warned to get out of dock while there was still time, but did I listen? No.$B$BWhat am I going to do now? Those sickly blood elves, the Wretched, have made off with my magical goods, and ate them I think. I\'m pretty sure that means they can\'t be retrieved. And the Grimscale murlocs pirated away the rest of my goods in the dead of night! Furthermore, to kick an honest merchant when she\'s down, my crew abandoned ship!$B$BI think I\'m going to cry.', 11697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 18, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Long have we toiled to see our land returned to its former glory, $c. Ever shall we remain vigilant against those who have invaded and defiled Quel\'thalas. We will not rest until they are driven from our sight.$B$BLet none exist who stand in the way of the sin\'dorei!', '', 11696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is frozen solid!', '', 11695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a berserker rage!', '', 11694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a rage!', '%s goes into a rage!', 11693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shares his powers with his brethren.', '%s shares his powers with his brethren.', 11692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to purchase another Elune\'s Candle.', 'I wish to purchase another Elune\'s Candle.', 11691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Omen sleeps in the depths of Lake Elune\'ara, but may be summoned at the southeast banks near the Stormrage Barrow Dens.  There, you will find special cluster launchers...$B$BUse your rockets in the launchers and Omen\'s minions will come.  Fire more rockets, nearly three dozen, or fire Elune\'s candles at his minions, and soon he will awaken.', '', 11690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I summon Omen?', 'How can I summon Omen?', 11689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your elders bless you, $n, and bring you luck in the coming year.', 'May your elders bless you, $n, and bring you luck in the coming year.', 11688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is the last night of the Lunar Festival.  May fortune be with you!', 'It is the last night of the Lunar Festival.  May fortune be with you!', 11687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They put these lanterns out to commemorate the closing of the Lunar Festival.', 'They put these lanterns out to commemorate the closing of the Lunar Festival.', 11686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re going to show fireworks all night long.  From 6PM until dawn, the sky will blaze over Elune\'ara!', 'They\'re going to show fireworks all night long.  From 6PM until dawn, the sky will blaze over Elune\'ara!', 11685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This moonlight will take you to Thunder Bluff.  Use it when you want to leave the festival.', 'This moonlight will take you to Thunder Bluff.  Use it when you want to leave the festival.', 11684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know how these fireworks work, but they sure are pretty!', 'I don\'t know how these fireworks work, but they sure are pretty!', 11683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love the Lunar Festival!  It\'s a great place to let your hooves kick up dust!', 'I love the Lunar Festival!  It\'s a great place to let your hooves kick up dust!', 11682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This beam of moonlight leads to the Undercity.  Retire when ready.', 'This beam of moonlight leads to the Undercity.  Retire when ready.', 11681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to be careful lighting fireworks when you can\'t feel your fingers...', 'You have to be careful lighting fireworks when you can\'t feel your fingers...', 11680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nothing like a little Lunar celebration to warm your bones!', 'There\'s nothing like a little Lunar celebration to warm your bones!', 11679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This moon beam will send you to Orgrimmar.  Use your invitation when you want to go.', 'This moon beam will send you to Orgrimmar.  Use your invitation when you want to go.', 11678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see?  That last firework almost caught that dwarf\'s shirt on fire!  Hah!', 'Did you see?  That last firework almost caught that dwarf\'s shirt on fire!  Hah!', 11677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I didnt know better, I\'d say this party was organized by orcs!', 'If I didnt know better, I\'d say this party was organized by orcs!', 11676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This beam of greater moonlight will send you to Darnassus.', 'This beam of greater moonlight will send you to Darnassus.', 11675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say these fireworks use the power of the moon!', 'They say these fireworks use the power of the moon!', 11674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lunar celebration this year is quite magnificent!', 'The lunar celebration this year is quite magnificent!', 11673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This moonlight will send you to Ironforge.  But who\'d want to leave this party?', 'This moonlight will send you to Ironforge.  But who\'d want to leave this party?', 11672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These fireworks sure make a nice BOOM, don\'t you think?', 'These fireworks sure make a nice BOOM, don\'t you think?', 11670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The people in Nighthaven sure know how to party!', 'The people in Nighthaven sure know how to party!', 11669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t try to teleport to one of your enemies\' cities.  It won\'t work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain...', 'Don\'t try to teleport to one of your enemies\' cities.  It won\'t work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain...', 11668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This beam of moonlight leads to Stormwind.  Use your invitation when you\'re ready.', 'This beam of moonlight leads to Stormwind.  Use your invitation when you\'re ready.', 11667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try these fireworks launchers.  They\'re a blast!', 'Try these fireworks launchers.  They\'re a blast!', 11666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They know how to throw a party here in Moonglade.  Who would have thought so?', 'They know how to throw a party here in Moonglade.  Who would have thought so?', 11665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our steady progress in our fight against the Qiraji can be attributed to the diverse help we received from nearly every corner of Kalimdor.$B$BYou need more than just soldiers to fight a war, $n.  Many of the war\'s unsung heroes are the traders and craftsmen that keep our forces supplied with the resources they need.', 11664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This war\'s not over, it\'s only just begun!  We have brave men and women fighting our enemy inside Ahn\'Qiraj day and night, $n.  It won\'t be long before the Qiraji city falls.', '', 11663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As deadly as the silithid seem, they are but tame creatures compared to their Qiraji overlords.', '', 11662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, like many others, came to aid my fellow druids when the war started.$B$BNow that the Gates of Ahn\'Qiraj are open, I\'ve realized that much work still remains to be done.  I\'ve decided to stay in Silithus and do my best to help the cause, $n.  ', '', 11661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run if you want cowards!  It will do you no good!', '', 11660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I, like my brother, honor those who honor their ancestors.  It brings me great joy to share my crafting secrets to disciples of the Lunar Festival!', 11659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Great job collecting resources for the war,\" they said, \"Have a promotion,\" they said.  What they really meant is \"You\'re stationed outside a bughive in Silithus with a bunch of sweaty dwarves, Carnes!\"$B$BThanks for the promotion, Captain!', '', 11658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul\'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale.', 'You\'ll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul\'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale.', 11657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Elder Starglade?', 'Where is Elder Starglade?', 11656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands.', 'I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands.', 11654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Where is Elder Meadowrun?', 'Where is Elder Meadowrun?', 11653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand together with the Alliance, $r. An evil, so old that the world has forgotten it, seeks to engulf us all; first on Kalimdor and then the rest of Azeroth. It is driven by a hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.$B$BWe are all that stand in the way of C\'Thun\'s armies. We will strike first and bring down the forces of Ahn\'Qiraj. Let all of Azeroth quake at the combined might of the Horde and Alliance.$B$BThe war effort needs you!', '', 11652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle is won! Watch as they flee to the safety of their precious temple. Soon all will be razed... Their leaders destroyed!', '', 11651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re on orders from on high to destroy Rajaxx. Terminate with extreme prejudice if you want to get technical.', '', 11650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Might of Kalimdor is victorious! The last of the Qiraji forces are defeated, retreating back to the ancient city-fortress of Ahn\'Qiraj. The Qiraji Resonating Crystals littering Kalimdor vanish as quickly as they appeared, leaving behind nothing but sundered earth.', 'The Might of Kalimdor is victorious! The last of the Qiraji forces are defeated, retreating back to the ancient city-fortress of Ahn\'Qiraj. The Qiraji Resonating Crystals littering Kalimdor vanish as quickly as they appeared, leaving behind nothing but sundered earth.', 11649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
