('Would any of you deny yourselves such a death? Such an honor?\n', '', 11631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To die today, on this field of battle, is to die an orcish death. To die today is to die for our little ones. Our old ones. Our ... loved ones.\n', '', 11630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We defend. We stand. We show that as one. United. We destroy. Their god will fall.\n', '', 11629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And for our gods?\n', '', 11628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waiting to crush the life from our little ones. To slay all in their path. This they do for their god.\n', '', 11627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In those years - where strife filled the land as Legion and Scourge sacked our homes, killed our families - these insects dwelled beneath us. Beneath our homes - waiting.\n', '', 11626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of you have not fought in battles. Peace has been with us for many years. Many years we sat idle but many years we battled.\n', '', 11625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An orc - a true orc warrior - wishes for one thing: To die in the glory of battle against a hated enemy.\n', '', 11624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
