('I\'ll wait.', 'I\'ll wait.', 11413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you seek, $c?', '', 11412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only those who have proven themselves to not be hostile toward the Timbermaw may pass through the Hold without fear of being attacked.  Have you made an effort to earn our trust, outsider?', '', 11411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The journal of Jandice Barov is filled with rantings and ravings about the undead. Towards the end of the book is what appears to be a tailoring pattern for the creation of a felcloth bag. This bag is used by warlocks to store soul shards. You already know how to create this bag.', 11410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets out a battlecry!', '', 11409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s loosens her grasp on the journal she had been clutching.', 11408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Copy the pattern into my journal.>', '<Copy the pattern into my journal.>', 11407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The journal of Jandice Barov is filled with rantings and ravings about the undead. Towards the end of the book is what appears to be a tailoring pattern for the creation of a felcloth bag. This bag is used by warlocks to store soul shards. Do you wish to copy the pattern into your own journal?', 11406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The journal of Jandice Barov is filled with rantings and ravings about the undead. Towards the end of the book is what appears to be a tailoring pattern for the creation of a bag of some sort. Your understanding of tailoring is insufficient to decipher the pattern.', 11405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only thing Metzen is going to be doing this Winter Veil is roasting on a spit!', 'The only thing Metzen is going to be doing this Winter Veil is roasting on a spit!\n', 11404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a rescue attempt!  Slay them all!', 'It\'s a rescue attempt!  Slay them all!\n', 11403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Humbug!  Die!', 'Humbug!  Die!\n', 11402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me give you my regards for Greatfather Winter, scum...', 'Let me give you my regards for Greatfather Winter, scum...\n', 11401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a rescue attempt!  Let no one escape!', 'It\'s a rescue attempt!  Let no one escape!\n', 11400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These land lubbers are here for the reindeer!  Give \'em the shank!', 'These land lubbers are here for the reindeer!  Give \'em the shank!\n', 11399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No scallywag $c is taking our Winter Veil plunder!  Get \'em!', 'No scallywag $c is taking our Winter Veil plunder!  Get \'em!\n', 11398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ll be feasting on me blade this Winter Veil!  Yeargh!', 'Ye\'ll be feasting on me blade this Winter Veil!  Yeargh!', 11397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tag on this present reads: \"For ages 10 and up.\"', '', 11396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tag on this present reads: \"For ages 20 and up.\"', '', 11395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait!  It appears our lookout has spotted something.', 11394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that the war is in full swing, we\'ve had no shortage of able-bodied combatants from the Horde and Alliance.$B$BIf only we could keep them off of each other\'s throats...', '', 11393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All will know of what has transpired here in this accursed temple, hero. It will be written about in history books - the tales told as legend from Azeroth to the far reaches of the Nether itself!', 11392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our freedom would have meant nothing if C\'Thun had survived. You are truly a champion of prophecy.', '', 11391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world is indebted to you and your allies, $n.', '', 11390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, citizen.', '', 11389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your present from the pile.', 'Get your present from the pile.', 11388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tag on this present reads: \"For ages 40 and up.\"', '', 11387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a pile of wrapped gifts here.', '', 11386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. I am Leoren, stable master of Cenarion Hold.', '', 11385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, $c. I trust you are here to inquire on the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Horde and Alliance to prepare for the impending war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn\'Qiraj. In Orgrimmar\'s Valley of Spirits, we are collecting a vast number of goods to create war materiel, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about helping out?', 11384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, $c. I trust you are here to inquire on the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Horde and Alliance to prepare for the impending war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn\'Qiraj. In Orgrimmar\'s Valley of Spirits, we are collecting a vast number of goods to create war materiel, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about helping out?', 11383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, $c. I trust you are here to inquire on the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Horde and Alliance to prepare for the impending war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn\'Qiraj. In Orgrimmar\'s Valley of Spirits, we are collecting a vast number of goods to create war materiel, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about helping out?', '', 11382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met, $c. I hope you are here to inquire on the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Alliance and Horde to prepare for the upcoming war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn\'Qiraj. In the Military Ward of Ironforge, we are collecting all manner of goods to create our war materiel from, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about pitching in?', 11381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met, $c. I hope you are here to inquire on the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Alliance and Horde to prepare for the upcoming war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn\'Qiraj. In the Military Ward of Ironforge, we are collecting all manner of goods to create our war materiel from, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about pitching in?', 11380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, $c. I hope you are here to inquire on the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort. We are going to need a great deal of assistance.$B$BThe war effort is a united effort between the Alliance and Horde to prepare for the upcoming war against the Silithid and their masters in Ahn\'Qiraj. In the Military Ward of Ironforge, we are collecting all manner of goods to create our war materiel from, and these gathering tasks are what we need your help with.$B$BCan I convince you to speak with our commander about pitching in?', '', 11379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food, now there\'s a subject that I can sink my fangs into! I am told that we have $2095w of $2096w lean wolf steaks, $2102w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail, and $2105w of $2106w baked salmon on ice and stored away.', '', 11378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bandages? Why, do you intend to survive long enough to need them? Har! Very well, $r, I will tell you. Of the $2080w wool bandaged needed, we have collected $2079w. Also to date, we have taken in $2085w out of $2086w mageweave bandages, and $2089w of $2090w runecloth bandages asked for.', '', 11377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me a moment; there are a lot of numbers to remember here. It looks like we have $2066w of $2067w heavy leather skins collected. As well, we have $2070w out of $2071w thick leather, and $2073w of $2074w rugged leather stockpiled.', '', 11376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just received word on that. We currently have $2021w out of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom, and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotus herbs requested.', '', 11375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of the $1998w copper bars that we\'ll need, we have $2018w. The number for tin bar collections sits at $2005w out of $2006w needed. And, there have been $2008w of $2009w mithril bars smelted for the cause.', '', 11374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, the Horde has gathered all that it needs for the Ahn\'Qiraj War! Now we wait for the puny Alliance to catch up. When they do, we\'ll begin transporting everything to Silithus. It should not be long after the buildup there is completed that the war will begin!', '', 11373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time for war is almost upon us, $c! Both the Horde and the Alliance have finished with their preparations. All of our war materiel is being shipped to Silithus as we speak. I\'d expect it all to arrive within $2113w days. When all is assembled there, the one who has completed the arduous task of reassembling the Scepter of the Shifting Sands will bang it against the Scarab Gong and open the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj. Then battle shall be joined as has not been seen in ages!$B$BLok\'tar Ogar!', '', 11372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time for war is almost upon us, $c! Both the Horde and the Alliance have finished with their preparations. All of our war materiel is being shipped to Silithus as we speak. I\'d expect the last of it to arrive within a day. When all is assembled there, the one who has completed the arduous task of reassembling the Scepter of the Shifting Sands will bang it against the Scarab Gong and open the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj. Then battle shall be joined as has not been seen in ages!$B$BLok\'tar Ogar!', '', 11371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm\'ka, Horde $C, stand proud! I am Warlord Gorchuk, commander of the Horde\'s war effort. There are trying times ahead of us, but we shall prevail, as always.$B$BIf you have questions, you should ask them.', '', 11370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On the cooked goods front it would appear that we\'ve managed to collect and store away $2092w rainbow fin albacore, out of $2093w requested. Additionally, right now we have in $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail in cold storage.', '', 11369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Collection of bandages is proceeding according to schedule. As far as linen bandages are concerned, we\'ve gathered $2076w of $2077w. Silk bandages have been tallied at $2082w out of $2083w, and we have $2088w out of $2090w runecloth bandages needed.', '', 11368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I received an update on that just a moment ago. It looks like out of $2061w light leather needed, we have $2060w. As for the others, the report indicated that we\'ve gathered $2063w of $2064w medium leather, and $2069w out of our $2071w thick leather quota.', '', 11367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbs, herbs, hmmm, let me see here. Ah yes, here it is. To date we have accumulated $2047w out of $2048w stranglekelp, $2053w out of $2055w purple lotuses, and $2057w out of $2058w arthas\' tears needed.', '', 11366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good question, $c. Last I was informed; we have managed to collect $1997w copper bars out of $1998w needed. Additionally, I am told that we have $2002w iron bars out of $2003w, and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars requested.', '', 11365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you heard the good news, $c? The Alliance has completed all of its war effort collections! Now we simply await the Horde to finish theirs. When they do, we\'ll begin shipping all of the war materiel over to Silithus, and it shouldn\'t be long after that until the Ahn\'Qiraj War begins.', '', 11364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it, $g lad : lass;! The Alliance and the Horde have completed gathering everything that we think we\'ll need for the Ahn\'Qiraj War. Right now the final goods are being taken over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus and all of it will arrive within $2113w days. After that, some brave $g hero : heroine; is going to need to ring the Scarab Gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to open the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj. When those gates open, the war begins!', '', 11363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it, $g lad : lass;! The Alliance and the Horde have completed gathering everything that we think we\'ll need for the Ahn\'Qiraj War. Right now the final goods are being taken over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus and the last of it will arrive within a day. After that, some brave $g hero : heroine; is going to need to ring the Scarab Gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to open the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj. When those gates open, the war begins!', '', 11362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. I am Field Marshal Snowfall, commander of the war effort here. We\'ve a hard road to plow ahead of us, $g lad : lass;, so if you can help out, please do so. And feel free to ask questions.', '', 11361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, friend!', 'Well met, friend!', 11360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After the firework show, they\'ll put out goblets so we can raise a toast!', 'After the firework show, they\'ll put out goblets so we can raise a toast!', 11359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what they put in those kegs, but it goes down like honey!', 'I don\'t know what they put in those kegs, but it goes down like honey!', 11358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be sure to stick around for the next firework show!  Starting at 6PM, they\'re every hour on the hour!', 'Be sure to stick around for the next firework show!  Starting at 6PM, they\'re every hour on the hour!', 11357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look alive, lads!  The enemy has been sighted!  Form ranks immediately!', 11356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of Kalimdor! Heroes of Silithus! One among you has dealt a vicious blow to our mortal enemies! $n and $g his:her; allies have relieved the Ruins of Ahn\'Qiraj of its merciless leader! Ossirian the Unscarred, scourge of Silithus, has finally been destroyed and his armies wholly dismantled!', '', 11355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bear witness to a miracle that stands before me! In one thousand years of captivity, I have not seen a single LIVING specimen - other than those foul Qiraji and silithid - enter these chambers.', '', 11354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroes of the Brood? C\'Thun must be banished! We can assist you, mortal!', 11353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even if you somehow managed to free us without defeating C\'Thun, we would focus all of our powers to see the beast banished back to the hell from whence it came - AT ANY COST.', '', 11352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Metzen\'s eyes light up with reindeer joy.', '', 11351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re free, Metzen. The bad greench can\'t hurt you anymore.', 'You\'re free, Metzen. The bad greench can\'t hurt you anymore.', 11350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Around this reindeer\'s neck is a tag with the Smokywood Pastures logo on it and a name - \"Metzen\".$B$BMetzen looks at you with sad, forlorn eyes.  It is almost as if the reindeer has been immobilized by some unseen force.', '', 11349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anachronos, I have lost the signet ring. Could you supply me with a replacement?', 'Anachronos, I have lost the signet ring. Could you supply me with a replacement?', 11348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks ready to shatter!', '', 11347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to crack!', '', 11346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is freezing up!', '', 11345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to slow!', '', 11343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A Horde Commendation Signet is awarded to a $g hero : heroine; who goes above and beyond the call of duty to the Horde.  Various Commendation Officers for the factions of the Horde are located in all of the major cities; speak with the one with whom you\'d like to raise your reputation, and give them the number of signets they ask for!$B$BBy the way, during the war effort here, if you\'d rather receive a material reward for your signets instead of reputation, seek out Warlord Gorchuk.', 11342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Horde Commendation Signet is awarded to a $g hero : heroine; who goes above and beyond the call of duty to the Horde.  Various Commendation Officers for the factions of the Horde are located in all of the major cities; speak with the one with whom you\'d like to raise your reputation, and give them the number of signets they ask for!$B$BBy the way, during the war effort here, if you\'d rather receive a material reward for your signets instead of reputation, seek out Warlord Gorchuk.', '', 11341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is a Horde Commendation Signet?', 'What is a Horde Commendation Signet?', 11340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Alliance Commendation Signet is awarded to a $g hero : heroine; who goes above and beyond the call of duty to the Alliance.  Various Commendation Officers for the factions of the Alliance are located in all of the major cities; speak with the one with whom you\'d like to raise your reputation, and give them the number of signets they ask for!$B$BBy the way, during the war effort here, if you\'d rather receive a material reward for your signets in lieu of reputation, seek out Field Marshal Snowfall.', '', 11339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are united in cause, $r. An ancient evil threatens to extinguish all life on Kalimdor and consume the world with its depravity... Its hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.$B$BWe are the first and the last lines of defense against the armies of C\'Thun. If we do not rise up and strike at our enemy, our enemy will surely destroy us.$B$BThe war effort needs you!', '', 11338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An Alliance Commendation Signet is awarded to a $g hero : heroine; who goes above and beyond the call of duty to the Alliance.  Various Commendation Officers for the factions of the Alliance are located in all of the major cities; speak with the one with whom you\'d like to raise your reputation, and give them the number of signets they ask for!$B$BBy the way, during the war effort here, if you\'d rather receive a material reward for your signets in lieu of reputation, seek out Field Marshal Snowfall.', 11337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is an Alliance Commendation Signet?', 'What is an Alliance Commendation Signet?', 11336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This line is mostly filler...', 11335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready!', 'I\'m ready!', 11334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.$B$BIt is you who must lead your armies into the cursed fortress city of Ahn\'Qiraj and mete justice to its inhabitants.$B$BVenture to Silithus and present the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to Jonathan the Revelator.\n', '', 11333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.$B$BIt must be you who uses the scepter. It must be you who heralds in the next age of your people. $B$BYou must wait for the armies of the Horde and the Alliance to arrive in Silithus before you may ring the Scarab Gong. The time for war is close at hand.\n', '', 11332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Anachronos. Please grant me the Scepter of the Shifting Sands.', 'I am ready, Anachronos. Please grant me the Scepter of the Shifting Sands.', 11331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $n.$B$BIt must be you who uses the scepter. It must be you who heralds in the next age of your people.$B$BWhen you are prepared to ring the Scarab Gong and once more open the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj, I will grant you the Scepter. You have only to ask.\n', '', 11330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us leave Nighthaven, hero. Seek me out at the grove.', '', 11329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s nods.', 11328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And heroes... I hold that which you seek. May it once more see the evil dissolved. Remulos, see to it that our champion receives the shard of the Green Flight.', '', 11327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lady, I am unworthy of your prayer. Truly, you are an angel of light. Please, assist me in returning to the barrow den so that I may return to the Dream. I, like Malfurion, also have a love awaiting me... I must return to her... to protect her...', '', 11326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to retrieve your report.', 'I\'m here to retrieve your report.', 11325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... Malfurion, Cenarius, Ysera... they still fight. They need me. I must return to the Dream at once.', '', 11324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For so long, I was lost... The Nightmare\'s corruption had consumed me... And now, you... all of you... you have saved me. Released me from its grasp.', '', 11323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon we shall rid Azeroth of the silithids\' abominable presence.  Their potential for destruction is much greater than what you\'ve seen firsthand, $n.  Greater, darker powers are behind their activities.', '', 11322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t get me wrong, I\'d rather not be in a tunnel filled with silithid day in and day out, but if hiding here and watching these creatures\' movements is going to help us win the war then I\'ll do it for as long as it takes.', '', 11321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Praise be to Elune... Eranikus is redeemed.', 11320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s falls to one knee.', 11319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It takes a bit of practice to be this close to the silithid and go unnoticed.  I don\'t recommend trying it if you can avoid it.  ', '', 11318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tend to the injuries of the wounded, sisters!', 11317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I feel... I feel the touch of Elune upon my being once more... She smiles upon me... Yes... I...', '', 11316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHY? Why did this happen to ... to me? Where were you Tyrande? Where were you when I fell from the grace of Elune?', '', 11315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IT BURNS! THE PAIN... SEARING...', '', 11314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, is wholly consumed by the Light of Elune. Tranquility sets in over the Moonglade.', 'Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, is wholly consumed by the Light of Elune. Tranquility sets in over the Moonglade.', 11313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The grasp of the Old Gods is unmoving. He is consumed by their dark thoughts... I... I cannot... cannot channel much longer... Elune aid me...', 11312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will be forgiven, Eranikus. Elune will always love you. Break free of the bonds that command you!', 11311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seek absolution, Eranikus. All will be forgiven...\n', 11310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune, hear my prayers. Grant us serenity! Watch over our fallen...', 11309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let it be known that $n - Alliance $C - has earned the undying respect of Ironforge and the Alliance as a whole.  $GHe : She; has engaged in great diplomacy with Timbermaw Hold and performed valiant actions for them on our behalf.   $GHe : She; has gone above and beyond the call of duty.  Three cheers for $n - a true hero of the Alliance!', '', 11308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let it be known that $n - Horde $C - has earned the undying respect of the Warchief.   $GHe : She; has engaged in great diplomacy with Timbermaw Hold and performed valiant actions for them on our behalf.   $GHe : She; has gone above and beyond the call of duty.  Three cheers for $n - a true hero of the Horde!', '', 11307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remulos, look how easy they fall before me? You can stop this, fool. Turn the druid over to me and it will all be over...', '', 11306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeated my minions? Then face me, mortals!', '', 11305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is your savior? How long can you hold out against my attacks? ', '', 11304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be done, Eranikus. Be well, ancient one.', '', 11303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will battle these fiends, together! Nighthaven\'s Defenders are also among us. They will fight to the death if asked. Now, quickly, we must drive these aberrations back to the Nightmare. Destroy them all!', '', 11302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, champion, protect our people.', '', 11301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, $n! We must find protective cover!', '', 11300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise, servants of the Nightmare! Rise and destroy this world! Let there be no survivors...', '', 11299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars furiously.', '', 11298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My redemption? You are bold, little one. My redemption comes by the will of my god.', '', 11297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets loose a sinister laugh.', '', 11296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is the predictable one, beast? Surely you did not think that we would summon you on top of Malfurion? Your redemption comes, Eranikus. You will be cleansed of this madness - this corruption.\n', '', 11295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are certainly not your father, insect. Should it interest me, I would crush you with but a swipe of my claws. Turn Shan\'do Stormrage over to me and your pitiful life will be spared along with the lives of your people.', '', 11294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fiend! Face the might of Cenarius!', '', 11293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend Nighthaven, hero...', '', 11292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He will stop at nothing to get to Malfurion\'s physical manifestation. That must not happen... We must keep the beast occupied long enough for Tyrande to arrive.', '', 11291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rift will be opened there, above Lake Elun\'ara. Prepare yourself, $n. Eranikus\'s entry into our world will be wrought with chaos and strife.\n', '', 11290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s drinks in the suffering of the fallen.', '', 11289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 11288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merok!  Shai!  To my side!', '', 11287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enemy is upon us, stand ready!', '', 11286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Remulos.', 'I am ready, Remulos.', 11285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will call forth Eranikus when I am given the word.', '', 11284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To Nighthaven! Keep your army close, champion.', '', 11283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will locate the origin of the Nightmare through the fragments you collected, $n. From there we will pull Eranikus through a rift in the Dream. Steel yourself, $c. We are inviting the embodiment of the Nightmare into our world.', '', 11282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eranikus is here! Seek shelter! Safety!', 11281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Steel yourselves! Summoning a being this powerful is seldom done with positive results.', 11280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me.', 11279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, $n. I will use the Nightmare object to conjure forth Eranikus.', 11278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, has entered our world.', 'Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, has entered our world.', 11277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The silithid are no match for the sons and daughters of Orgrimmar.  Soon all that will be left of them are their crushed limbs and wings under our feet, $n.', '', 11276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re just in time, $c.  Do you feel the ground shaking beneath you?$B$BSomething approaches from the hive.  Take a place near the grunts, $n.  I\'m counting on you!', '', 11275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting for duty, sir.', 'Reporting for duty, sir.', 11274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We serve Thrall with great pride.  We\'ll travel as far as is needed to vanquish the enemy.', '', 11273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A chill is in the air.', 'A chill is in the air.', 11272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, $n. See what the Nightmare brings...', '', 11271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s squeezes the last bit of life out of $n and swallows their soul.', '', 11270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare cannot be stopped!', '', 11269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your meddling in demonic affairs ends NOW, mortal!  Face the great corruptor - Xandivious!', '', 11268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking for this: [Red Scepter Shard]? Come and get it...', '', 11267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will pull the shard from his sundered corpse.', 'I will pull the shard from his sundered corpse.', 11266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Recover the scepter shard, $n. Nefarius must not be allowed to destr... destroy the shard.', '', 11265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While it is true that the Alliance has completed all of their war effort tasks, don\'t let that discourage you, $r. Time is of the essence, but we would much rather that you help in the Horde\'s collections carefully and thoroughly. That seems better to me than making a mistake that could cost someone their life once this war truly begins. Wouldn\'t you agree, $c?', '', 11264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right, um, $g lad : lass;, all of the war materiel is being transported to Silithus and the last of it should get there within $2113w days. After that, we\'ll all just have to wait and see who puts forth a $g hero : heroine; to reconstitute the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais. Only when that occurs will the war begin to open the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj.', '', 11263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right, um, $g lad : lass;, all of the war materiel is being transported to Silithus and the last of it should get there within a day. After that, we\'ll all just have to wait and see who puts forth a $g hero : heroine; to reconstitute the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais. Only when that occurs will the war begin to open the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj.', '', 11262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of the Horde\'s war effort tasks are completed, young $c. Now we need but wait for the Alliance to also finish theirs and all will be ready for the Ahn\'Qiraj War. Except perhaps for the gathering and reunification of the pieces to the Scepter of the Shifting Sands?', '', 11261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you heard that all of the Horde and Alliance collections have been completed, then you heard right, $c. All of the goods for the war that we gathered and prepared are in the process of being sent to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, with less than $2113w days until the last of it arrives there. After that I suppose we\'ll just have to wait and see who assembles that scepter to ring the gong with, which will open the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj and herald the war.', '', 11260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you heard that all of the Horde and Alliance collections have been completed, then you heard right, $c. All of the goods for the war that we gathered and prepared are in the process of being sent to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, with less than a day until the last of it arrives there. After that I suppose we\'ll just have to wait and see who assembles that scepter to ring the gong with, which will open the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj and herald the war.', '', 11259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to relax, the Alliance be way behind us mon. We all done with our collectin\' here, and the final polishes be goin\' on things as we speak. When they get done over in their Ironforge, then we be thinkin\' \'bout movin\' all this stuff to Silithus. \'Til then, sit tight and maybe do some fishin\'.', '', 11258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like there be only $2113w more days left to fish until all this here war materiel is shipped over to the Silithus desert mon. Then they\'s gonna be getting\' it all ready, and someone is gonna have to ring that gong down south of Cenarion Hold there to open them gates and be startin\' the war.', '', 11257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like there be only one more day left to fish until all this here war materiel is shipped over to the Silithus desert mon. Then they\'s gonna be getting\' it all ready, and someone is gonna have to ring that gong down south of Cenarion Hold there to open them gates and be startin\' the war.', '', 11256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it, $c? The Horde is done with all collections, and final preparations are being made while the Alliance tries to catch up in their efforts. Is there anything else that you need?', 11255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, yes, all of the Horde\'s and Alliance\'s war materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should be there within $2113w days. Do you know what happens then, $c? We hurry up and wait. Hopefully someone is gathering the pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, because in order to open the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj it needs to be rung against the gong on the Scarab Dais.', 11254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, yes, all of the Horde\'s and Alliance\'s war materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should be there within a day. Do you know what happens then, $c? We hurry up and wait. Hopefully someone is gathering the pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, because in order to open the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj it needs to be rung against the gong on the Scarab Dais.', 11253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While I live to serve the Earth Mother and the Horde, I cannot help but feel a little nervous now that we\'ve collected everything that we need. At least we have a little time until the Alliance finishes their gathering efforts. After that it will all be shipped to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the war will likely follow not long after.', 11252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of the preparations are complete now, $c. We await the last of the materiel to be sent to Silithus, which should be in less than $2113w day\'s time. Then once the organization there is done with, someone will have to come forward and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. That is when the Ahn\'Qiraj War will begin. May the Earth Mother watch over all of us then.', 11251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of the preparations are complete now, $c. We await the last of the materiel to be sent to Silithus, which should be in less than a day\'s time. Then once the organization there is done with, someone will have to come forward and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. That is when the Ahn\'Qiraj War will begin. May the Earth Mother watch over all of us then.', 11250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it now, $c, I haven\'t got all day? The Horde has completed its collections and now waits only on the Alliance to organize themselves and do the same. Perhaps you should be out there looking for the pieces to the Scepter of the Shifting Sands so that you can ring the gong at the Scarab Dais, opening the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj and thereby starting the war?', 11249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, you heard true, $c, all of our collections are complete and the last of the war materiel should arrive in Silithus within $2113w days. I am told that once all is assembled there, and our troops readied, someone from within the ranks of you heroes is going to ring the gong outside of Ahn\'Qiraj, already having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to do so with. I hope that we don\'t have to wait too long for that to happen.', 11248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, you heard true, $c, all of our collections are complete and the last of the war materiel should arrive in Silithus within a day. I am told that once all is assembled there, and our troops readied, someone from within the ranks of you heroes is going to ring the gong outside of Ahn\'Qiraj, already having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to do so with. I hope that we don\'t have to wait too long for that to happen.', 11247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We of the Horde have done all that we can to prepare for the upcoming war at Ahn\'Qiraj. Now we wait, $c, for the Alliance to do the same. Once they are done we will all transport our war materiel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus.', '', 11246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All has been gathered and is being sent to Silithus, $c. It should get there within $2113w days. I can only hope that after the gong is rung, and the gates opened, that our efforts here will make an impact and save many lives.', '', 11245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All has been gathered and is being sent to Silithus, $c. The last of it should get there within a day. I can only hope that after the gong is rung, and the gates opened, that our efforts here will make an impact and save many lives.', '', 11244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well now, it would appear that we have some time on our hands. The Horde has completed its gathering tasks, and all is being prepared for final shipment to Silithus. We\'re only waiting on the Alliance to finish with theirs. You should go ask that silly, little ambassador of theirs how far along they are.', '', 11243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of our collections are completed, $c. That which we have assembled is in the process of being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the rest of it should take no more than $2113w days to arrive. The Ahn\'Qiraj War can then start once that is done and someone brave and foolish rings the gong right outside of the gates down there.', '', 11242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of our collections are completed, $c. That which we have assembled is in the process of being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the last of it should take no more than a day to arrive. The Ahn\'Qiraj War can then start once that is done and someone brave and foolish rings the gong right outside of the gates down there.', '', 11241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde stands ready now that we have finished with all of our resource gathering. We only wait for the sluggish Alliance to finish with theirs, and then on to glorious battle!', 11240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throm\'ka, $c. All of the war materiel is in final preparation and being sent to Silithus. It should arrive over the course of the next $2113w days. With the equipment readied, and our forces arrayed, all we will be waiting for is someone to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, which should open the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj and start the war.$B$BLok\'tar Ogar!', 11239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throm\'ka, $c. All of the war materiel is in final preparation and being sent to Silithus. The last of it should arrive in less than a day. With the equipment readied, and our forces arrayed, all we will be waiting for is someone to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, which should open the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj and start the war.$B$BLok\'tar Ogar!', 11238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heya, $c, don\'t you know? The Horde is done with all of its collecting. We\'re just finishing up final preparations while we wait for the Alliance to finish their gathering. Then it will be time to ship everything over to Silithus for the war.', 11237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of the collecting is done and the finished goods are being shipped over to Silithus as they\'re being completed. Looks like less than $2113w days until all of it is over there. After that we just need to get someone to ring that gong and open the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj. Then the real fun begins.', 11236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of the collecting is done and the finished goods are being shipped over to Silithus as they\'re being completed. Looks like less than a day until all of it is over there. After that we just need to get someone to ring that gong and open the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj. Then the real fun begins.', 11235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are dutiful to inquire, $c, but all Horde collections have been completed. We now wait for the Alliance hegemony to finish theirs, and then all will be transported to Silithus in the vicinity of Cenarion Hold.', 11234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The end draws nigh! Even as we speak our supplies are being shipped to Silithus and should arrive within $2113w days. Once there I am sure that all we be assembled in quick order, and then we\'ll be awaiting the ringing of the gong at the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj to start the war. I look forward to analyzing whether our preparatory efforts will make a difference.', 11233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The end draws nigh! Even as we speak the last of our supplies are being shipped to Silithus and should arrive within a day. Once there I am sure that all we be assembled in quick order, and then we\'ll be awaiting the ringing of the gong at the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj to start the war. I look forward to analyzing whether our preparatory efforts will make a difference.', 11232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s laughter can once more be heard through the halls of Blackwing.', '', 11231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s laughter echoes through the halls of Blackwing.', '', 11230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it is my fate to fall, then my dying breath shall take you with me!', '', 11229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha, you be pullin\' me leg mon. Pele\'keiki know that you know we Horde already be havin\' all the war stuff we be needin\'. Now we just waitin\' on that Alliance to get all theirs and we startin\' up the war.', '', 11228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa now, $c, Pele\'keiki thinkin\' that you not knowin\' all that stuff be on its way to Silithus. Pele\'keiki told the last of it be getting\' there in less than $2113w days, and after that some misguided fool gonna ring the gong outside the Ahn\'Qiraj gates to open \'em up and be startin\' the war.', '', 11227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa now, $c, Pele\'keiki thinkin\' that you not knowin\' all that stuff be on its way to Silithus. Pele\'keiki told the last of it be getting\' there in less than a day, and after that some misguided fool gonna ring the gong outside the Ahn\'Qiraj gates to open \'em up and be startin\' the war.', '', 11226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde\'s gathering efforts are completed, $c. Now we bide our time with extra preparations while the Alliance finishes their war collections.', 11225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is true, young $r, we and the Alliance have gathered and prepared all that we will need for this upcoming conflict at Ahn\'Qiraj. Even now these things are being sent to Cenarion Hold, and they should all arrive within $2113w days. After all is in place, some person will need to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais to open the gates and start the war.', 11224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is true, young $r, we and the Alliance have gathered and prepared all that we will need for this upcoming conflict at Ahn\'Qiraj. Even now these things are being sent to Cenarion Hold, and the last of them should arrive within a day. After all is in place, some person will need to ring the gong on the Scarab Dais to open the gates and start the war.', 11223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not only am I havin\' all the mithril bars I be needin\', but all the Horde collections are done now mon. It\'s lookin\' like we just waitin\' on the Alliance and then we be goin\' to war!', 11222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now the war, it be comin\' soon. All that be left is the sendin\' of all these goods and weapons to the Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and that is gonna be done within $2113w days. Then some brave soul is gonna have to be ringin\' the gong near those Ahn\'Qiraj gates to open \'em and start the war.', 11221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now the war, it be comin\' soon. All that be left is the sendin\' of all these goods and weapons to the Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and that is gonna be done within a day. Then some brave soul is gonna have to be ringin\' the gong near those Ahn\'Qiraj gates to open \'em and start the war.', 11220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scepter shard is no more! Your beloved Kalimdor shall soon be a desolate wasteland. I will, of course, turn the Eastern Kingdoms into an ashen, lifeless void...', '', 11219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the protective layer is nearly gone. Do you hear that, heroes? That... That is the sound of inevitability. Of your hopes and dreams being crushed under the weight of my being.', '', 11218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not even my father could have planned such tragedy... such chaos. You will never make it! Time is running out!\n', '', 11217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would it not be glorious if you somehow managed to defeat me but not before I could destroy the only hope Kalimdor may have? I am giddy with anticipation. Soon... Soon it will be dust.', '', 11216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? A chip in the shard? Finally, a weakness exposed... It won\'t be long now.', '', 11215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder, heroes, what will you do when I manage to destroy this shard? Will the world be beyond salvation?', '', 11214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ours is the path of glory, $r! The puny Alliance is still trying to scrape together their war supplies, while we have gathered all of ours and stand ready to send them to Silithus.', '', 11213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If someone has put together the magic scepter of the sands then the war with the bugs will be soon. I relish it, $c! The last of our war goods are on their way to Silithus and should be there within $2113w days. Go and bring honor to the Horde!', '', 11212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If someone has put together the magic scepter of the sands then the war with the bugs will be soon. I relish it, $c! The last of our war goods are on their way to Silithus and should be there within a day. Go and bring honor to the Horde!', '', 11211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our work is done. Now we wait on the Alliance to finish theirs before shipping everything over to Silithus.', '', 11210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard that the preparations are being shipped over to Silithus and should all arrive in under $2113w days. I don\'t want to see one of those bugs burrowing through into my mine, so I hope that someone is taking the time to assemble that Scepter of the Shifting Sands so the gong can be rung, the gates opened and the war finally begun.', '', 11209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard that the last of the preparations are being shipped over to Silithus and should arrive in under a day. I don\'t want to see one of those bugs burrowing through into my mine, so I hope that someone is taking the time to assemble that Scepter of the Shifting Sands so the gong can be rung, the gates opened and the war finally begun.', '', 11208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!  For the Horde!', '', 11207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s acknowledges your obeisance and then waves dismissively at you.', '', 11206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As expected, the Horde has completed all of their preparations well in advance of you and your so-called Alliance. You are all holding us up as we cannot take final measures to begin the war until you finish your promised responsibilities.$B$BNow go and pull your weight, $r.', '', 11205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unexpected that you are all capable of such organization. Both the Alliance and the Horde have completed their preparations for the Ahn\'Qiraj War. Even as we speak the materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should all arrive within $2113w days. Then it is up to the one who is going to reassemble the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to beat on the gong at the Scarab Dais and open the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj. That is when the war will truly begin!', '', 11204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unexpected that you are all capable of such organization. Both the Alliance and the Horde have completed their preparations for the Ahn\'Qiraj War. Even as we speak the materiel is being shipped over to Silithus and should all arrive within a day. Then it is up to the one who is going to reassemble the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to beat on the gong at the Scarab Dais and open the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj. That is when the war will truly begin!', '', 11203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of us, working collectively, have accomplished a great task. Now an even greater one confronts us. We only await the completion of the Horde\'s gathering efforts and then we shall all confront the Silithid and their masters together.', 11202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $r. The war materiel is gradually being sent on its way and should be at Cenarion Hold within $2113w day\'s time. We can only hope that once it is there that someone, having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, will step forward to ring the gong and open the gates.', 11201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $r. The war materiel is on its way and should be at Cenarion Hold within a day\'s time. We can only hope that once it is there that someone, having assembled the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, will step forward to ring the gong and open the gates.', 11200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, $c. I\'ve talked with everyone around here, and it seems like we have all of the stuff that the Alliance wants for the war. That mean orc ambassador said that the Horde is still gathering though, which means we have some time before we need to ship all of this stuff over to Silithus.', 11199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of the food and war materiel we gathered is on its way to Silithus. It should be there in less than $2113w days. Someone told me that once it\'s all assembled over near Cenarion Hold, someone\'s going to have to go ring the gong at the Scarab Dais to open the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj and start the war.', 11198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of the food and war materiel we gathered is on its way to Silithus. It should be there in less than a day. Someone told me that once it\'s all assembled over near Cenarion Hold, someone\'s going to have to go ring the gong at the Scarab Dais to open the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj and start the war.', 11197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will bring him back into this world, champion. ', '', 11196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Understand this, Eranikus wants nothing more than to be brought to Azeroth from the Dream. Once he is out, he will stop at nothing to destroy my physical manifestation. This, however, is the only way in which you could recover the scepter shard.', '', 11195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you really surprised? Is it hard to believe that the power of an Old God could reach even inside the Dream? It is true - Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream, wages a battle against us all. The Nightmare follows in his wake of destruction.', '', 11194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be steadfast, champion. I know why it is that you are here and I know what it is that you seek. Eranikus will not give up the shard freely. He has been twisted... twisted by the same force that you seek to destroy.', '', 11193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bows.', '', 11192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The walls of the chamber tremble. Something is happening...', 'The walls of the chamber tremble. Something is happening...', 11191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The buzz around here is that we\'ve collected everything that we need. Now it all comes down to the Horde gathering up their stuff. Once they have we can all ship our goods over to Silithus and the war can begin.', '', 11190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of the fish and everything else is on its way to Silithus, and should be there in less than $2113w days. After that someone\'s going to have to ring that gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to start the war.', '', 11189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of the fish and everything else is on its way to Silithus, and should be there in less than a day. After that someone\'s going to have to ring that gong with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to start the war.', '', 11188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has completed its gathering tasks, $c. Now, while we pack and prepare everything, we await the Horde\'s collections to be completed. Then we shall all transport our war materiel to Silithus.', '', 11187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is gathered, $c. All is being transported for final preparation to Silithus and should arrive within $2113w days. All of our combined forces await the $g hero : heroine; that will complete the reunification of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, ring the gong and begin the Ahn\'Qiraj War.', '', 11186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is gathered, $c. All is being transported for final preparation to Silithus and should arrive within a day. All of our combined forces await the $g hero : heroine; that will complete the reunification of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, ring the gong and begin the Ahn\'Qiraj War.', '', 11185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The generals tell us that we\'ve collected everything that we need for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War. Now we\'re just waiting for the Horde to finish their stockpiling and the transport of the war materiel can begin.', 11184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like the last of the goods we\'ve collected are shipping out to Silithus over the next $2113w days. And once that\'s done, someone will have to come along and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, outside of Ahn\'Qiraj, to open the gates. That\'s when our bandages will come in handy.', 11183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like the last of the goods we\'ve collected is going to be shipped out to Silithus sometime in the next day. And once that\'s done, someone will have to come along and ring the gong on the Scarab Dais, outside of Ahn\'Qiraj, to open the gates. That\'s when our bandages will come in handy.', 11182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take pride, $c, in the fact that the Alliance has completed all of the gathering tasks set before it. The finished products are stored and preserved, and our tradeskill professionals are hard at work molding those raw materials into war materiel that will be shipped to Silithus as soon as the Horde finishes their collections.', 11181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even as we speak, $c, all of the war materiel is being transported over to Silithus. By the looks of things, all of it should arrive in less than $2113w days. After that, a $g hero : heroine; will need to come along and ring the gong at the Scarab Dais. Then the war will begin in earnest.', 11180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even as we speak, $c, all of the war materiel is being transported over to Silithus. By the looks of things, the last of it should arrive in less than a day. After that, a $g hero : heroine; will need to come along and ring the gong at the Scarab Dais. Then the war will begin in earnest.', 11179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Narain, if you have enough materials, I could use another arcanite buoy.', 'Narain, if you have enough materials, I could use another arcanite buoy.', 11178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Narain, I need another special kit.', 'Narain, I need another special kit.', 11177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 11176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $c! I\'ve went around and asked, and it looks like all of us here have collected everything that the Alliance needs to prepare for the Ahn\'Qiraj War. Now we just need to encourage the Horde to do the same and then we\'ll be able to ship it all over to Cenarion Hold in Silithus.', 11175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, $c! Looks like the Horde collected the last of their stuff, and now theirs and ours is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. I\'m told it\'ll be there in less than $2113w days, and then someone can ring that big gong near the Ahn\'Qiraj gates to start the war.', 11174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, $c! Looks like the Horde collected the last of their stuff, and now theirs and ours is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. I\'m told it\'ll be there in less than a day, and then someone can ring that big gong near the Ahn\'Qiraj gates to start the war.', 11173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-ten-hut! All Ahn\'Qiraj war materiel accounted for and in the process of being transported to Cenarion Hold $g sir : ma\'am;! I am told that the last of it should arrive in less than a day. Once that is done, and someone rings that gong over there to open the gates, I guarantee that we\'ll give those bugs one heck of a fight!', '', 11172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-ten-hut! All Ahn\'Qiraj war materiel accounted for and in the process of being transported to Cenarion Hold $g sir : ma\'am;! I am told that the last of it should arrive in less than $2113w days. Once that is done, and someone rings that gong over there to open the gates, I guarantee that we\'ll give those bugs one heck of a fight!', '', 11171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes $g sir : ma\'am;! I\'ve been ordered to report that the Alliance has collected all war materiel necessary. It has been relayed to me that we are simply waiting on the Horde to finish their part and then everything will be shipped to Silithus. Thank you $g sir : ma\'am;!', '', 11170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As I understand it dear, everything has been gathered and the final materiel is being assembled and shipped off to Cenarion Hold. The last of it should arrive in less than a day. Once our equipment and forces are all there, the bearer of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands can ring the gong near Ahn\'Qiraj to open the gates. Then the war will begin.', 11169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you reporting for duty, $c? All of the war materiel for both the Horde and the Alliance is completed and being shipped to Silithus as we speak. It should all arrive in less than a day. I hope that someone has found the different pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and put them all together.', 11168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is completed, young $c. Even as we speak, both the Horde and the Alliance are in the process of transporting all final goods for the war into Silithus near Cenarion Hold, which should be complete in less than a day. After that, the gong near the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj can be rung, and the war will begin.', '', 11167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it, everything\'s been collected by both sides. Now it\'s all being transported over to Silithus and should be there in less than a day. Once that\'s done and someone rings the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war is on!', '', 11166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $c. From what I\'ve been told, everything\'s been collected, and all of the materiel for the war is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. It should all be there in less than a day. Once that\'s done, and the gong has been rung with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war will really begin.', 11165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woo hoo, here we go! Everyone\'s collected everything, and it\'s all being airlifted via zeppelin to Silithus as we speak. The last of it should be there in less than a day. Once it\'s all over there, and the scepter has been assembled, the war against those dirty insects can begin. As they say, \'Ship It!\'', '', 11164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all over \'cept for the crying now. All of the war materiel is being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and the last of it will be there in less than a day. Shouldn\'t be much longer until the scepter is assembled and the war finally begins.', '', 11163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As I understand it dear, everything has been gathered and the final materiel is being assembled and shipped off to Cenarion Hold. The last of it should arrive in less than $2113w days. Once our equipment and forces are all there, the bearer of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands can ring the gong near Ahn\'Qiraj to open the gates. Then the war will begin.', 11162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well now, $g lad : lass;, it looks like the Alliance has already gathered up all that we need for our part of the war. I know that the blacksmiths, engineers and everyone else is busy with the final preparations, and as soon as the Horde assembles all of their goods, it will all be sent to Silithus for the war.', 11161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast returns from whence it came. The wrath of Neptulon has subsided.', '', 11160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A being of great power has awoken.', '', 11159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you reporting for duty, $c? All of the war materiel for both the Horde and the Alliance is completed and being shipped to Silithus as we speak. It should all arrive in less than $2113w days. I hope that someone has found the different pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and put them all together.', 11158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, $c. As you may know, we\'ve completed all collections necessary for the Alliance\'s role in the upcoming war. Now it\'s up to the Horde to finish with theirs and we\'ll ship out to Silithus.', 11157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is completed, young $c. Even as we speak, both the Horde and the Alliance are in the process of transporting all final goods for the war into Silithus near Cenarion Hold, which should be complete in less than $2113w days. After that, the gong near the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj can be rung, and the war will begin.', '', 11156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of the material necessary for the Alliance\'s contribution to the war effort has been satisfied, $c. We await the Horde\'s labors to be finalized and then shall move on to transporting the war materiel to Silithus.', '', 11155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  I hope your stay in my town is enjoyable and uneventful - emphasis on the latter.  We\'ve got plenty of drink if you\'re thirsty, and plenty of bouncers if you\'re antsy.$B$BNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?', '', 11154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it, everything\'s been collected by both sides. Now it\'s all being transported over to Silithus and should be there in less than $2113w days. Once that\'s done and someone rings the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war is on!', '', 11153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, looks like we\'ve gathered up everything that the Alliance is going to need; now we\'re just waiting on the Horde. I think soon I\'m going to see if there\'s any Tigule & Foror\'s ice cream nearby.', '', 11152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Hello, $c. From what I\'ve been told, everything\'s been collected, and all of the materiel for the war is being shipped over to Silithus as we speak. It should all be there in less than $2113w days. Once that\'s done, and the gong has been rung with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war will really begin.', 11151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would appear dear that the Alliance has managed to collect everything needed for the war effort. Now all that we\'re waiting on are those poor Horde creatures to finish with theirs.', 11150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woo hoo, here we go! Everyone\'s collected everything, and it\'s all being airlifted via zeppelin to Silithus as we speak. The last of it should be there in less than $2113w days. Once it\'s all over there, and the scepter has been assembled, the war against those dirty insects can begin. As they say, \'Ship It!\'	', '', 11149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well, what do you know, sparky, we did it. Everything\'s collected and ready to go. We\'re just waiting on those Horde yahoos now, and once they get their act together it\'s off to the races at Ahn\'Qiraj!', '', 11148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all over \'cept for the crying now. All of the war materiel is being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and will be there in less than $2113w days. Shouldn\'t be much longer until the scepter is assembled and the war finally begins.', '', 11147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha, $g boyo : girlie;! The Alliance has gathered everything that we\'re needin\' to get this here war started! Maybe the Horde will catch up soon?', '', 11146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages.', 'The stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages.', 11145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That reminds me, I\'m going to need to find something to eat soon. As to what the Alliance has been cooking up, I\'m told that $2092w out of $2093w rainbow fin albacore have been packed away. As well, $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail have been prepared and are currently in cold storage awaiting transport to Cenarion Hold in Silithus.', '', 11144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many cooked goods have the Alliance collected so far?', 'How many cooked goods have the Alliance collected so far?', 11143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bandages you say? Yes, well, if memory serves from the last time I was told, it would appear that the Alliance has created $2076w of $2077w linen bandages, $2082w of $2083w silk bandages and $2088w of $2090w runecloth bandages.', '', 11142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many bandages have the Alliance collected so far?', 'How many bandages have the Alliance collected so far?', 11141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Funny you should ask... I just received an update on that. Thus far, the Alliance has gathered $2060w of $2061w light leather, $2063w out of $2064w medium leather and $2069w of $2071w thick leather skins.', '', 11140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many leather skins have the Alliance collected so far?', 'How many leather skins have the Alliance collected so far?', 11139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see, let me see. I had those numbers here somewhere. Ah yes, here they are! To date, the Alliance has collected $2047w stranglekelp, out of $2048w needed. It also says here that we have $2053w of $2055w purple lotus and $2057w out of $2058w arthas\' tears needed.', '', 11138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many herbs have the Alliance collected so far?', 'How many herbs have the Alliance collected so far?', 11137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A very good question, $c. When last I had heard, the Alliance had managed to smelt $1997w out of $1998w copper bars, $2002w out of $2003w iron bars and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars needed for the war effort.', '', 11136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many metal bars have the Alliance collected so far?', 'How many metal bars have the Alliance collected so far?', 11135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This line is mostly filler...', '', 11134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r $c. I am Commander Stronghammer, the ambassador representing the Alliance here. If you have any questions concerning the status of Alliance collections for the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort, $g lad : lass;, don\'t hesitate to ask.', '', 11133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to ask you about something else.', 'I want to ask you about something else.', 11132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to know about ration collections? Very well. Last I was told, the Horde had prepared $2095w out of $2096w lean wolf steaks. We\'ve also packed away $2102w of $2103w spotted yellowtail and $2105w out of $2106w baked salmon needed.', '', 11131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many cooked goods have the Horde collected so far?', 'How many cooked goods have the Horde collected so far?', 11130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde is stockpiling a great many bandages. So far $2079w out of $2080w wool bandages have been collected. $2085w out of $2086w mageweave bandages have been created. And $2089w out of $2090w runecloth bandages have been gathered.', '', 11129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many bandages have the Horde collected so far?', 'How many bandages have the Horde collected so far?', 11128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leather skins? Yes, I just received some information on that. It would appear that of $2067w heavy leather needed, the Horde has collected $2066w. Also, $2070w out of $2071w thick leather and $2073w out of $2074w rugged leather have been gathered.', '', 11127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many leather skins have the Horde collected so far?', 'How many leather skins have the Horde collected so far?', 11126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last I heard the Horde had accumulated $2021w of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotuses.', '', 11125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many herbs have the Horde collected so far?', 'How many herbs have the Horde collected so far?', 11124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many metal bars you say? As of my last update on the situation, here is what I know. The Horde has collected $2018w copper bars out of $1998w needed, $2005w tin bars out of $2006w and of $2009w mithril bars sought, $2008w have been gathered.', '', 11123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many metal bars have the Horde collected so far?', 'How many metal bars have the Horde collected so far?', 11122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This line is mostly filler...', '', 11121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort?', 'What is the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort?', 11120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar, $r. I am General Zog, ambassador of the Horde. I am here to keep you apprised of the progress that the mighty Horde is making in their efforts toward the Ahn\'Qiraj War. What is it that you want to know?', '', 11119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s yawns.', '', 11118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Evil makes me so sleepy...', '', 11117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It... It\'s foggy, $n. I can\'t see anything! Wait... Wait a minute. I see... I see Doctor Weavil\'s hideout. It... YES! I believe he is holding a chapter of the book!$B$BLet me see if I can zoom this thing out to get a better vantage point.$B$B<Narain appears to be going cross-eyed.>$B$BAlcaz Island! That devious son-of-a-goblin is on Alcaz Island!', '', 11116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 23, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is devoured!', '%s is devoured!', 11115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take this book for the good of Azeroth!>', '<Take this book for the good of Azeroth!>', 11114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your quest to learn Draconic is futile, mortal. And why would you ever want to learn to speak in the ancient tongue? Baffling really...', '', 11113, 11, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dogs of the Cenarion Circle.  Slay them all!', 11112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In days long past, we lived for the hunt.  We hunted for glory, for honor...$B$BIs it so different now?', 'In days long past, we lived for the hunt.  We hunted for glory, for honor...$B$BIs it so different now?', 11111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KILL!', '', 11110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see right through your disguise, $r. Number Two! Number Two kill!', '', 11109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... You thought you could fool me, did you? The greatest criminal mastermind Azeroth has ever known???', '', 11108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s eyes you suspiciously.', '', 11107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No hello for your old friend, Narain? Who were you expecting???', '', 11106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake.', '', 11105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guilds of the Horde have pulled together and accomplished this task already $c. We have all of the singed corestones necessary for our war materiel. Make yourself useful by asking the other collectors here if they need your aid.', '', 11104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not have time to waste, $c; there is a war at Ahn\'Qiraj to prepare for. If you are going to help, we are collecting singed corestones from the Molten Core. I need to gather a total of $2110w, and currently have $2109w.', '', 11103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good of you to ask, $c, but we already have all of the baked salmon that we\'ll need for the war. Perhaps you would be kind enough to check with the other collectors here; they are sure to have something that they could use your help with.', '', 11102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. It is good to see you interested in helping with the war effort. The collectors here are organizing the gathering of various stockpiles of goods so that we will be prepared when the time comes.$B$BI am in charge of obtaining $2106w baked salmon to store away for those involved in the fighting at Ahn\'Qiraj. The last time that I counted, we had collected $2105w.', '', 11101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heya, $c! Lookin\' like we got all the spotted yellowtail that we be needin\' for that war. Maybe you going to some of the other collectors \'round here and askin\' them if they be needin\' your help?', '', 11100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ja mon, I be collectin\' up the fishy-fishy for the Horde. They gettin\' ready for big war in the desert at Ahn\'Qiraj, and askin\' me to get them $2103w of the spotted yellowtail. But right now we only be havin\' $2102w. You here to help?', '', 11099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like we have as many lean wolf steaks as the Horde wants. They told me to pack up what we have here and ready it to be shipped it out to Cenarion Hold in Silithus. But it looks like some of the others here might still be collecting whatever it is that they\'re in charge of. Go bug one of them.', 11098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grrr, what do you want, $r? Oh, you must be here about the lean wolf steaks for the impending Ahn\'Qiraj War. Yes, you heard right, I\'m collecting them, what about it? Do you have a fresh stack for me? I only need $2096w, and it looks like we have $2095w right now.', 11097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is very kind of you to ask after our needs, $c. It would appear though that we have collected all of the runecloth bandages we feel we\'ll need of the war. May I ask that you inquire around with some of the other collectors and lend them your aid if needed? Ancestors watch over you.', 11096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Earth Mother provides, but at times, a $c needs a little extra help to survive. Thus, I am collecting all of the runecloth bandages that we can in preparation for the looming war at Ahn\'Qiraj. As of now we have gathered $2089w on our way to collecting a total of $2090w.', 11095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall take my secrets to the grave with me!', '', 11094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How unfortunate; it would appear that we have collected all of the mageweave bandages necessary. Perhaps you can go sell them on the auction house? But before you go, be a good $g boy : girl; and check with the other collectors present. They may have an errand to send you off on.', 11093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $c, good of you to show up. Allow me to be succinct; we are gathering supplies for the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort. We wouldn\'t want to have more casualties than necessary, now would we? I have the responsibility of coordinating the collection of $2086w mageweave bandages. To date we have garnered $2085w. Care to assist?', 11092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you for your inquiry, but I already have all of the wool bandages necessary for the war effort. I suggest that you ask around though; there are many here that could probably still use your aid.', '', 11091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $c, good to see you. We need assistance here with gathering supplies in preparation for the impending war at Ahn\'Qiraj. I\'ve been asked to put together a great many first aid field kits, and the primary component I need is wool bandages. I already have some, $2079w to be exact, but I need to collect $2080w.', '', 11090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lovely song, isn\'t it?', 11089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That would be wonderful! Thank you, Meridith.', 'That would be wonderful! Thank you, Meridith.', 11088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s so lovely to see you again, $n! I really can\'t thank you enough for delivering that message to my dear little gnome.$B$BWould you like to hear a song? It will make traveling in the rough seas much easier!', 11087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I find the ocean floor to be very peaceful.', 11086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a pity, and here I\'ll wager that you sharpened your knife special in anticipation of slicing a few skins for me. Alas, we\'ve already gathered all of the rugged leather necessary, $c. Do make yourself useful though, and check with the others here to see if they have any other collection tasks to send you on.', '', 11085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c. I trust that you bring good tidings concerning the Ahn\'Qiraj War preparations. I myself have been placed in charge of all accumulation of rugged leather for the Horde; a task to which I feel uniquely qualified. Never underestimate the utility of a sharpened knife.$B$BAs to the rugged leather, we currently have $2073w out of $2074w needed.', '', 11084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you have more thick leather, I\'m sorry but you\'ve come too late. We have all that we need, but before you go would you check with the others here? There\'s likely someone that still needs your help with their own collecting.', 11083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lok\'tar, $c, I have important information! There\'s a war coming at Ahn\'Qiraj and we need to get ready for it. I\'m here collecting all of the thick leather that I can get my hands on. Right now we have $2070w, but the Warchief has tasked me with the gathering of $2071w. As you can see, I\'m a little short.', 11082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An unspeakable horror dwells here, mortal.  C\'Thun and his worshippers are not just an affront to nature, their existence presages destruction for Azeroth as we know it.$B$BMerithra sacrificed herself a thousand years ago along with Caelestrasz and Arygos because they knew this as well.  We\'re here because of our oath to return for them, but we\'re also here because C\'Thun must be stopped!', 11081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, that\'s sweet of you mon, but we already got all the heavy leather that we need. And here I\'m sure that your knife is still sharp. Maybe you can put it to use helping the others with their collections, no?  Have a good one!', 11080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re here to help with the heavy leather for the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort, are you, $c? Good, good. As you can see I\'ve collected $2066w, but we\'re going to need $2067w in total. That\'s a lot of skinning my friend, so I hope that your knife is sharp. The leather will go to all sorts of uses for making our war materiel and ensuring our success.', 11079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re filled to capacity on purple lotus, $c. Go ask one of the others if they need your help, and leave me to my studies. There is no time to waste!', 11078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, there you are. I was told to expect help, so please listen closely. The situation is this: I\'ve been tasked with gathering $2055w purple lotus in preparation for the coming war in Ahn\'Qiraj. To date we have $2054w.$B$BActually going into the field and collecting the flowers will be up to you and those like you. I am needed here to see that they are properly maintained and to find new, creative applications for their use against the silithid and whatever else awaits us there.', 11077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pele\'keiki know, it seem impossible even to him, but we be havin\' all that firebloom the Horde be wantin\' for the war. If you not be feelin\' too lazy, Pele\'keiki think you be helpin\' out the others here. They sure to have many things they be wantin\' you to get for them.', '', 11076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hehehe, how you doin\' mon. You gonna help Pele\'keiki great deal he be thinkin\'. We be needin\' a bombastic amount of the firebloom herb to be preparin\' right for the Ahn\'Qiraj War. The Horde, they say, \'Pele\'keiki, you get us $2051w of the fire petals right quick\'.$B$BPele\'keiki tell you now, he only have $2050w firebloom, but you gonna add to that real soon, right mon?', '', 11075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sets eyes on $n!', '', 11074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require rogue training.', 'I require rogue training.', 11073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require priest training.', 'I require priest training.', 11072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.', 'I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.', 11071, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you seek training?', 'Do you seek training?', 11069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your path does not match mine.  You must seek training elsewhere, $c.', 'Your path does not match mine.  You must seek training elsewhere, $c.', 11068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not worth my time, $n!', '', 11067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Narain Soothfancy, at your service! Retired engineer and master soothsayer! I can tell your future before it even happens!$B$BIf you\'re here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there...$B$B<Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">', '', 11066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t tell me! Shhh! You are here about the Ashbringer?!? Yes... Yes... No! My bad.$B$BWhat can I help you with, $r?$B$BIf you\'re here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there...$B$B<Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">', '', 11065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Narain holds an unopened envelope to his forehead.>$B$BWhat is... Mmmm... Velvet!$B$BAm I right?$B$BIf you\'re here to try and relearn a tradeskill, use the book over there...$B$B<Narain points to \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\">', '', 11064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shouldn\'t you be saving the world?', '', 11063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousand years ago, when the War of the Shifting Sands ended, three of our kin sacrificed themselves and held the Qiraji inside these halls while Anachronos and Staghelm sealed Ahn\'Qiraj shut.$B$BEach of us vowed to look for Merithra, Arygos and Caelestrasz should the Scarab Wall ever fall.$B$BAnd fall it did... and so we came.', '', 11062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 500, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Step carefully mortal.  You tread where mightier beings have met their fate.', 11061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I SAID GOOD DAY!', '', 11060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But...', 'But...', 11059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take this ledger to an old acquaintance of mine in Tanaris. His name is Narain Soothfancy - terrible, terrible, psychic but an amazing engineer! He should be able to make sense of it all.$B$BNo need to thank me, $n. It\'s the least I could do.$B$BGood day!', '', 11058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FINE! And how, dare I ask, am I supposed to acquire an arcanite buoy?', 'FINE! And how, dare I ask, am I supposed to acquire an arcanite buoy?', 11057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I did not know better I would think that you were mocking me, mortal; but yes, that is mostly correct. You may remain fully clothed.', '', 11056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('General Rajaxx has been owned. Chalk up another victory for Andorov.', '', 11055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, let me get this straight. You put the scepter shard entrusted to your Flight by Anachronos on a minnow of your own making and now you expect me to build an... an arcanite buoy or something... to force your minnow out of hiding? AND potentially incur the wrath of an Elemental Lord? Did I miss anything? Perhaps I am to do this without any clothes on, during a solar eclipse, on a leap year?\n', 'Ok, let me get this straight. You put the scepter shard entrusted to your Flight by Anachronos on a minnow of your own making and now you expect me to build an... an arcanite buoy or something... to force your minnow out of hiding? AND potentially incur the wrath of an Elemental Lord? Did I miss anything? Perhaps I am to do this without any clothes on, during a solar eclipse, on a leap year?\n', 11054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right then... You have to build an arcanite buoy and place it in the ocean. My minnow will be attracted to the magical emanations. When he gets near the buoy - BLAMO! It will explode in a glorious pulse of arcane energy, revealing the minnow\'s true form. Also, you may or may not incur the wrath of Neptulon. A 50/50 chance I would say.', '', 11053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come again.', 'Come again.', 11052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two words: Arcanite buoy.', '', 11051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m all ears.', 'I\'m all ears.', 11050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Genius is often misunderstood, $r. Now, about the scepter shard... If you want that shard and do not wish to spend the next ten thousand years searching for it, you are going to have to listen very carefully.', '', 11049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re insane.', 'You\'re insane.', 11048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Correct. You\'ve been listening! This minnow is really quite a terrible creature of my own creation. When I am relaxing I like to think of the unlucky fishermen who have run into this minnow and been devoured whole. I bet they were quite surprised!$B$B<Azuregos laughs.>', '', 11047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You put the piece on a minnow and placed the minnow somewhere in the waters of the sea between here and the Eastern Kingdoms? And this minnow has special powers?', 'You put the piece on a minnow and placed the minnow somewhere in the waters of the sea between here and the Eastern Kingdoms? And this minnow has special powers?', 11046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Genius, I know... It will never be found; but, in case it is found, I gave the minnow some special powers.', '', 11045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '...', 11044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exactly!', '', 11043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A minnow? The oceans are filled with minnows! There could be a hundred million minnows out there!', 'A minnow? The oceans are filled with minnows! There could be a hundred million minnows out there!', 11042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not just any fish, mortal. This fish was a minnow. A very special minnow.', '', 11041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fish? You gave a piece of what could be the key to saving all life on Kalimdor to a fish?', 'Fish? You gave a piece of what could be the key to saving all life on Kalimdor to a fish?', 11040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I was saying, I held onto that scepter shard for a good five-hundred years and it was nothing but trouble. It attracted all kinds of attention - the wrong kind of attention. I want to be left alone to my studies not babysit some would be hero\'s ticket to glory. So... I gave it to the fish.', '', 11039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Bronzbeard\'s... um, beard! What are you talking about?', 'By Bronzbeard\'s... um, beard! What are you talking about?', 11038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are going to love this story, $r. See, here is the thing. As soon as Malygos charged me with protecting the scepter shard, I knew I was in for an eternity of headache and pain.$B$BAll I want to do is study these magic rich shorelines and take in what artifacts might remain from the Sundering. You know, there was once a thriving Highborne civilization here! You don\'t have to tell me that there is going to be some solid magical items around here, $r. I can smell it!', '', 11037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright. Where?', 'Alright. Where?', 11036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course I do not have the shard. That would be asinine. I walk amongst savages in this cursed land! I cannot take five steps without some crazed orc or human trying to thrust a sharp stick into my hide. At any given time you could very well be speaking to my ghostly spirit.$B$BAnyhow... I hid it.$B$BGo on... ask me where.', '', 11035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you know? I mean, yes... Yes I am looking for that shard. Do you have it?', 'How did you know? I mean, yes... Yes I am looking for that shard. Do you have it?', 11034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek the scepter shard charged to the protection of the Blue Flight?$B$B<Azuregos appears to be smiling.>', '', 11033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill first, ask questions later... Incoming!', '', 11032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run, little ones. Run and tell your masters that Eranikus has come to raze their world.', '', 11031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful, predictable mortals... You know not what you have done! The Master\'s will fulfilled. The Moonglade shall be destroyed and Malfurion along with it!', '', 11030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end rapidly approaches! Surrender yourselves to Eranikus and be spared eternal suffering!', '', 11029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, Rajaxx, when I said I\'d kill you last?', '', 11028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world shall suffer an unmerciful end. The Nightmare comes for you!', '', 11027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s find out.', 'Let\'s find out.', 11026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Andorov looks at you grimly.>$B$BIf it bleeds, we can kill it.', '', 11025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is more to magic than just arcane gesticulations... but I am speaking to someone who already knows this, yes?$B$BYou\'ve come to me to learn, and learn you will... just so long as you pay attention and do as I say.  The secrets of the demons do not cater to fools, and neither do I.', 'There is more to magic than just arcane gesticulations... but I am speaking to someone who already knows this, yes?$B$BYou\'ve come to me to learn, and learn you will... just so long as you pay attention and do as I say.  The secrets of the demons do not cater to fools, and neither do I.', 11023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My watch is eternal, mortal.', '', 11022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s counterattacks with retaliation.', '', 11018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You challenge the charge of the Blue Dragonflight? DIE, vermin.', '', 11017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a treasure hunter in search of powerful artifacts. Give them to me and you will not be harmed.', 'I am a treasure hunter in search of powerful artifacts. Give them to me and you will not be harmed.', 11016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek to harm me, $r?', '', 11015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good that you wish to help, $c. Unfortunately I have collected up all of the peacebloom that we feel we\'ll need for the war effort. Maybe you could ask around; I\'m sure that there are likely to be others here that still need your aid in gathering other things.', 11014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, young $c. Are you here to bring me a batch of peacebloom? We are collecting them to make potions and elixirs for the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort. Though tragic that we are forced into this war, the results will be even more terrible if we do not prepare properly.$B$BThe Horde has tasked me with the collection of $2020w peacebloom, and so far we\'ve managed to put together $2021w. If you have it within your ability, please gather up all that you can and return them to me here.', 11013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They come now. Try not to get yourself killed, young blood.', '', 11012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yah, I know, it be lookin\' like we already have all of the mithril bars we be needin\' for the war. But ya know, there still be plenty of folk \'round here that can probably be usin\' your help right about now.  Thanks mon.', 11011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey mon, you be here ta bring me mithril bars no doubt. There be big trouble brewin\' in the Silithus desert at Ahn\'Qiraj. We and the Alliance goin\' all out this time to stop them bugs, and that be why you seein\' everyone here.$B$BThe Horde be askin\' me to collect $2009w for the war effort, but I only have $2008w. So ya gonna help me out, or what?', 11010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill $n!', '', 11009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is stunned by Elune\'s Candle!', '', 11008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Captain is busy at the moment.  He\'s studying maps we recently acquired of the underground silithid hives.  Stay with us if you\'d like to help, he\'ll come out any moment now.', 11007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to aid the Captain.', 'I\'m here to aid the Captain.', 11006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, $c.  The Ironforge Brigade is stationed here to keep an eye on Hive\'Zora.  The Cenarion Circle druids have been monitoring silithid movement and they\'re anticipating something major in this area.', 11005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A golden placard along the side of the shrine reads:$B$B\"Here stands the Shrine of Dath\'Remar, a fitting tribute to the most noble of elves.  Let all who gaze on this monument remember his sacrifices to bring us to this land.  All who prosper in Quel\'Thalas do so thanks to him.\"', '', 11004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Falconwing Square Inn. May I prepare a meal for you, or ready a room?', 11003, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more tin bars! Even my arms hurt from stacking them. We have all that we need, so go ask one of the others if they need you to collect anything.', '', 11002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm\'ka, $c. You are here to help me with tin bars? They tell me that I will need $2006w so that they can make weapons and armor for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War, but I only have $2005w right now. You are going to bring me more!', '', 11001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, it is good to see you again.$B$BRemember to stay focused on your learning.  You represent our future, and should you falter our future will be dark indeed.', '', 11000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have not spoken to Magistrix Erona at the Sunspire, I recommend you do so immediately.  There are pressing matters to attend to, and she - as do we all - need your help!', '', 10999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('According to the latest count we have all of the copper bars we\'re going to need for the war. If I were you I\'d check with some of the other collectors here to see if they need your help.', '', 10998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need a great number of copper bars, $c. The upcoming war at Ahn\'Qiraj is going to use up a lot of metal for weapons, armor and whatnot. I\'m told that the Horde alone needs to collect $1998w copper bars. As of now we have $2018w.', '', 10997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to the combined efforts of the Alliance\'s adventuring guilds, we have been able to gather all of the singed corestones we think that we\'ll need. However, you might want to check around with the other collectors here to see if they still need help in gathering up vital resources.', '', 10996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c. I\'m sure that I don\'t need to inform you of the gravity of our situation here. We need to gather many goods, and in most cases assemble them into materiel, to be transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus. This is no small effort.$B$BRecently in the Molten Core we discovered something called a singed corestone. Our blacksmiths and engineers tell us that they can put them to good use, so I\'m supervising their accumulation here. As of now, out of $2110w needed, we\'ve managed to collect $2108w.', '', 10995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not push it citizen!', '', 10994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off with you, $n!', '', 10993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along, $C!', '', 10992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your inquiry, $c, but we have all of the spotted yellowtail necessary. There are others here though that may still be gathering materiel for the upcoming war. Seek them out, and may the goddess shine upon you.', 10991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Proper sustenance will keep a soldier alive long after the wounds of the battlefield should have finished $g him : her; off, $c. If we\'re to persevere in the Ahn\'Qiraj War to come, we\'ll need all of the provisions that we can carry. I\'m gathering up spotted yellowtail fish at this location before it is to be shipped out.$B$BAs of now we have $2101w, but we need to collect a total of $2103w if we\'re going to be able to feed everyone.', 10990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like you\'re too late, $c. We have all of the roast raptor that we need; killed, cooked and salted. Anyway, it looks like some of the others around here could use some help. You should go check with them. I\'m going to see if they\'ll let me go home now.', 10989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hi, $c. I guess the Alliance asked me to come here and keep track of all of this cooked meat that people are gathering because of the impending doom at Ahn\'Qiraj. Doesn\'t that sound like fun?$B$BAnyway, I suppose you\'d like to know how much we have. Last time I counted it we were at $2098w out of a total $2099w roast raptor needed.', 10988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must feed... prepare to die!', '', 10987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take heart! Your friends will not long mourn your passing! ', '', 10986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish whelp! I will consume your energies - and then your SOUL!', '', 10985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, looks like we have all of the cooked albacore that we can properly salt and store for the upcoming war at Ahn\'Qiraj. Thanks for asking though, $c. If you have a mind to, check around with the other collectors. I\'d bet there\'s someone else here that could use your help with gathering up whatever it is that they need.', '', 10984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm, mmm, mmm. Can you smell that?! That\'s good eatin\' right there, $c. Rainbow Fin Albacore hits the spot every time. Slicky Gastronome here, ace connoisseur of all things edible, especially fish. With the Ahn\'Qiraj War looming, the Alliance thought it wise to bring in an expert for the war effort, so here I am, large and in charge.$B$BLooks like we\'re going to need $2093w of the fish, and we\'ve got a pile that currently comes to $2092w.', '', 10983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand ready!', '', 10982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas $n, I am much too busy to talk.  As I mentioned, I need time to think on the situation at hand.$B$BI wish you luck in your travels.  Good day.', '', 10981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, through the efforts of many we have managed to gather up all of the runecloth bandages that the Alliance feels it needs for the upcoming conflict. Were I you, I would ask some of the others here to see if they still have collection tasks that need fulfilling.', '', 10980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, even our hardiest warriors and scouts will need use of the healing arts in the war to come at Ahn\'Qiraj. And when there is no magical healing available, they must rely upon our efforts here.$B$BTo date I have collected $2088w runecloth bandages, out of $2090w needed. If you are willing, we should speak further on how you can do your part.', '', 10979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s very kind of you to ask, but it would appear that we\'ve collected all of the silk bandages that we\'ll need. You could ask around though and see if anyone else needs help with their collections.', 10978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, how are you feeling today, $c? Well, I hope. You may be wondering what is going on here. There\'s a war at Ahn\'Qiraj that is being planned and prepared for. We and the Horde are preparing as best we can for it.$B$BTo that end, the Alliance has asked me to supervise the collection of silk bandages here. To date we\'ve managed to put together $2082w out of $2083w needed. Are you thinking about helping out?', 10977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain!  Lieutenant Stouthammer requests your presence!  The enemy is approaching, sir!', '', 10976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Ma\'am!', '', 10975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soldier, call Captain Blackanvil at once!', 10974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something big\'s coming out from the hive, ma\'am.  Headed straight for us.', '', 10973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gaze into the crystalline tear.>', '<Gaze into the crystalline tear.>', 10972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great sorrow eminates from this crystal.', '', 10971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Footmen, make a line!', '', 10970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should\'ve grabbed a bigger sword.', '', 10969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like it\'s going to be one of those days.', '', 10968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, lads!  Things are about to get quite ugly.', '', 10967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This better be important!', '', 10964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for the inquiry, $c, but as you can see, I already have all of the linen bandages that the Alliance feels is necessary in preparation for the war at Ahn\'Qiraj. Don\'t let that stop you from helping out with the other collections going on here though.', 10963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $c. I am collecting linen bandages here for the Ahn\'Qiraj war effort; an effort that will put us all to the test, but strengthen us for the war to come. I can assure you that any bandages that you choose to donate will be put to good use in helping to save the lives of our soldiers when the time comes. I am in need of $2077w, and to this point have managed to collect $2076w. Will you assist us?', 10962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open fire!', '', 10961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow! Looks like we already gathered all of the thick leather they think we\'ll need. That sure went by fast. You know, there are probably others around here that could use your help though if ya want to give \'em a hand.', 10960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there, $c! With the Ahn\'Qiraj War drawing near, our preparations here are in full swing. I\'m in charge of thick leather collections. It\'s a fine day for gathering thick leather, don\'t ya think? I got my stacks here and it looks like we\'ve got $2069w right now. Our magic number is $2071w. Want to help out?', 10959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, um, yes $g sir : ma\'am;. It would appear that we have collected all of the medium leather that the Alliance feels is necessary for the war. I\'m told that there may be others here though that still need your assistance with their collection efforts.', '', 10958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G Sir : Ma\'am;, yes $g sir : ma\'am;! Private Porter reporting for duty and ready to assist you with your medium leather collection needs. The Ahn\'Qiraj War is coming and we need to be as prepared as we can be.$B$BAs you can see we have collected exactly $2063w pieces of medium leather, and I have been tasked with gathering a total of $2064w.', '', 10957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re sweet for asking, $c, but we have all of the light leather that we need. May be that one of the others in charge of collecting around here is in need of your assistance though?', 10956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your actions shame us all, $c. I hurt inside as I beat you senseless.', 'Your actions shame us all, $c. It pains me to beat you senseless!', 10955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Believe me when I tell you this: You\'re gonna wish you weren\'t born, sissy!', 'Believe me when I tell you this: You\'re gonna wish you weren\'t born, sissy!', 10954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As if we don\'t have enough problems, you go and create more!', 'As if we don\'t have enough problems, you go and create more!', 10953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get a rope!', 'Get a rope!', 10952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please tell me that you didn\'t just do what I think you just did. Please tell me that I\'m not going to have to hurt you... ', 'Please tell me that you didn\'t just do what I think you just did. Please tell me that I\'m not going to have to hurt you... ', 10951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste blade, mongrel!', 'Taste blade, mongrel!', 10950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t take kindly to miscreants, $r.', 'We don\'t take kindly to miscreants, $r.', 10949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare spill blood on neutral ground? OUT! OUT, I SAY!', 'You dare spill blood on neutral ground? OUT! OUT, I SAY!', 10948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Ahn\'Qiraj War is on the horizon, $c, and in preparation the Alliance has asked my family to gather up a good deal of light leather for the war effort. Out of $2061w needed, we currently have $2060w. You look the type that might be able to help out.', 10947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I get reports of your exploits against the Abyssal Council all the time, $n.  You\'re doing great things out there!$B$BKeep it up, and we\'ll make it worth the effort!', '', 10946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I guess that\'s that. We have all of the Arthas\' Tears necessary. You might try asking around. One of these others is sure to have something that they still need collected for the war effort.', 10945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re preparing for war, $c. We\'ve taken all that we\'re going to from the Silithid and their masters in Ahn\'Qiraj. To get ready for it we\'re collecting all sorts of material. I\'m in charge of gathering Arthas\' Tears. Not sure what we need them for though. If you ask me I don\'t want anything to do with that madman, even if it is just a flower named after him.$B$BStill, I\'m my father\'s daughter, and a soldier, so I do what I\'m told. Currently we have $2057w and need to collect a grand total of $2058w.', 10944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is with satisfaction that I relay to you we have collected all of the purple lotus that we feel we need. Thank you for your contribution to the effort, $c. If you are so inclined, there are most likely several still here that are collecting other resources for the struggle.', '', 10943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, young $c. In preparation for the war at Ahn\'Qiraj against the Silithid, the Alliance has asked me to head up their collection of purple lotus. This flower has many uses that I am aware of, and thus, I have agreed to help them attain $2055w. To date we have collected $2053w.', '', 10942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not that I\'m quite sure that you could ever possibly in a gazillion years have enough stranglekelp, what with all the ice cream one needs, but we seem to have enough. Or that\'s what I\'m told anyway. It looks like some of the others here might need help with whatever it is that they\'re collecting. Understandable really when you consider that theirs just couldn\'t possibly be as fun as collecting stranglekelp.', '', 10941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s true, even stranglekelp can be quite useful in building up what we need for the upcoming war at Ahn\'Qiraj! It has so many uses, like making ice cream for hot days under the Silithus sun, as a salve for the effects of some icky plants, breathing underwater, hardening the skin, making you quick, regaining magic power; so many things I can\'t think of them all! Did I mention making ice cream?$B$BAnywhoodles, I\'ve got about $2047w here, and I need a total of $2048w!', '', 10940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for checking in with me, $c. We now have all of the thorium bars that we\'ll need, but you may want to ask some of the others here that are in charge of different collection efforts.', 10939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$C, please listen to what I have to say. The Alliance and Horde are preparing for a war with the Silithid and their masters in Ahn\'Qiraj. Any assistance that you can lend will be greatly appreciated. As you can see, I am collecting thorium bars here for the war effort. We need to gather $2012w in total, and currently we have $2011w.', 10938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to everyone\'s efforts we now have all the iron bars that we need. Check with one of the others to see if there\'s something else you should be out there collecting for the war effort. Me, I\'m going to see if I can get out of here a little early to play some cards.', '', 10937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen up, flapjack, we\'re in for the fight of our lives with the bugs in Ahn\'Qiraj and we need to get prepared for it. I\'m collecting iron bars here.  Currently, the Alliance only has $2002w iron bars, but we\'re projected to need a total of $2003w for the war effort.', '', 10936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now you know all that there is to know, mortal... ', '', 10935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s kneels down to pick up the fragments of the shattered scepter.', '', 10934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shakes his head in disappointment.', '', 10933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My son\'s soul will find no comfort in this hollow victory, dragon. I will have him back. Though it takes a millennia, I WILL have my son back!  ', '', 10932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Staghelm, where are you going? You would shatter our bond for the sake of pride?\n', '', 10931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sands of time will halt, but only for a moment! I will now conjure the barrier.', '', 10930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hurls the Scepter of the Shifting Sands into the barrier, shattering it.', '', 10929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want nothing to do with Silithus, the Qiraji and least of all, any damned dragons!', '', 10928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After the savagery that my people have witnessed and felt, you expect me to accept another burden, dragon? Surely you are mad.', '', 10927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hands the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to Fandral Staghelm.', '', 10926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before I leave this place, I make one final offering to you, Lord Staghelm. Should a time arise in which you must gain entry to this accursed fortress, use the Scepter of the Shifting Sands on the sacred gong. The magic holding the barrier together will dissipate and the horrors of Ahn\'Qiraj will be unleashed upon the world once more.', '', 10925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is but one duty that remains...', '', 10924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It... It is over, Lord Staghelm. We are victorious. Albeit the cost for this victory was great.', '', 10923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s falls to one knee - exhausted.', '', 10922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient ones guide my hand... Wake from your slumber! WAKE AND SEAL THIS CURSED PLACE!', '', 10921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FINISH THE SPELL, STAGHELM! I CANNOT HOLD THE GLYPHS OF WARDING IN PLACE MUCH LONGER! CALL FORTH THE ROOTS!', '', 10920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not all Tauren despise your kind, $r. Alas, I am forbidden to offer you my services.', 'Not all Tauren despise your kind, $r. Alas, I am forbidden to offer you my services.', 10919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r. Wonderful day to be alive, is it not?', 'Greetings, $r. Wonderful day to be alive, is it not?', 10918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay close...', '', 10917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done, dragon. Lead the way.', '', 10916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOW, STAGHELM! WE GO NOW! Prepare your magic!', '', 10915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, Fandral, remember these words: Let not your grief guide your faith. These thoughts you hold... dark places you go, night elf. Absolution cannot be had through misguided vengeance.', '', 10914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods knowingly.', '', 10913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s glances at her compatriots.', 10912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is a way...', 10911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My forces cannot overcome the Qiraji defenses. We will not be able to get close enough to place your precious barrier, dragon.', '', 10910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must act quickly or all shall be lost!', '', 10909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will push them back, Anachronos. This I vow. Uphold your end of this task. Let not your hands falter as you seal our fates behind the barrier.', 10908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not forget the sacrifices made on this day, night elf. We have all suffered immensely at the hands of these beasts.', '', 10907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The translocator hums, awaiting your command.', '', 10906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up!', '', 10905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anachronos, this diversion will give you and the young druid time enough to seal the gate. Do not falter. Now, let us see how they deal with chaotic magic.', '', 10904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Succumb to the endless dream, little ones. Let it consume you!', 10903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alexstrasza grant me the resolve to drive our enemies back!', '', 10902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them feel the wrath of the Blue Flight! May Malygos protect me!', '', 10901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Touch the unstable rift crystal.>', '<Touch the unstable rift crystal.>', 10900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see large cavernous tunnels and corridors reflected inside the crystal. You recognize the area as the Molten Core.', '', 10899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krathok, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to instead learn the ways of the armorsmith. Will you train me?', 'Krathok, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to instead learn the ways of the armorsmith. Will you train me?', 10898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krathok, I was once an armorsmith and wish to instead learn the ways of the weaponsmith. Will you train me?', 'Krathok, I was once an armorsmith and wish to instead learn the ways of the weaponsmith. Will you train me?', 10897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Myolor, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to instead learn the way of the armorsmith. Will you teach me?', 'Myolor, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to instead learn the way of the armorsmith. Will you teach me?', 10896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Myolor, I was once an armorsmith and wish to instead learn the way of the weaponsmith. Will you teach me?', 'Myolor, I was once an armorsmith and wish to instead learn the way of the weaponsmith. Will you teach me?', 10895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('%s will be armed in 3 seconds!', '', 10894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fury is released!', '', 10893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, I need more copper bars! There\'s a war brewing at the Gates of Ahn\'Qiraj and we need supplies! The Alliance has collected $1997w and we need $1998w copper bars in total. If I don\'t get those copper bars, it\'s going to be my head on a platter!', '', 10892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have all the copper bars that we need. Thank you for your assistance, $c. You might wanna help out with the other materials being collected here.', '', 10891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the resources have been gathered.  Yippee!', '', 10890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, $n - it is good to see you again.  I trust your affairs go well.', 10889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, puny mortals. Come and face your end. The secrets of Ahn\'Qiraj will die with Roman\'khan!', '', 10888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children of Madness - I release you upon this world!', '', 10887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peace is but a fleeting dream! Let the NIGHTMARE reign!', '', 10886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope is a DISEASE of the soul! This land shall wither and die!', '', 10885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste your world\'s corruption!', '', 10884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can sense the SHADOW on your hearts. There can be no rest for the wicked!', '', 10883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your wicked souls shall feed my power!', '', 10882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth, ye Dreamers - and claim your vengeance!', '', 10881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strands of LIFE have been severed! The Dreamers must be avenged!', '', 10880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us return to the grove, mortal.', '', 10879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remulos, I am being drawn back... Tyrande... send her my love... Tell her I am safe. Tell her... Tell her I will return... Farewell...', '', 10878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, old friend... Farewell...', '', 10877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cenarius fights at my side. Illidan sits atop his throne in the Outland - brooding. I am afraid that the loss to Arthas proved to be his breaking point. Madness has embraced him, Remulos. He replays the events in his mind a thousand times per day, but in his mind, he is the victor and Arthas is utterly defeated. He is too far gone, old friend. I fear that the time may soon come that our bond is tested and it will not be as it was at the Well in Zin-Azshari. ', '', 10876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a leatherworker by trade, aren\'t you?  It\'s that faint smell of cured hides, I\'d recognize it anywhere.$B$BMy father used to talk about a famous artisan who lived in Southwind Village centuries ago.  It\'s a shame the place is in ruins now.', 10875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been gone too long, Malfurion. Peace between the children of Azeroth is tenuous at best. What of my father? Of your brother? Have you any news?\n', '', 10874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, Remulos. Prepare the mortal races.', '', 10873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sensed as much, Malfurion. Dark days loom ahead.', '', 10872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear for the worst, old friend. Within the Dream we fight a new foe, born of an ancient evil. Ysera\'s noble brood has fallen victim to the old whisperings. It seems as if the Nightmare has broken through the realm and seeks a new host on Azeroth.', '', 10871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was shrouded in nightmares, Malfurion. What is happening in the Dream? What could cause such atrocities?', '', 10870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remulos, old friend. It is good to see you once more. I knew that the message would find its way to you - one way or another.', '', 10869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion!', '', 10868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand near me, $n. I will protect you should anything go wrong.', '', 10867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, $n. The lake is just around the bend.', '', 10866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think it\'s strong enough.', '', 10865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s surveys the ground and nods approvingly.', '', 10864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('War is upon us, $n.  It\'s time for every member of the Horde to answer the call and join the fight against the cowardly Alliance.', '', 10863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The war against the Horde has reached full tilt, $n.  This is a time of great need for the Alliance and it\'s necessary that all of us do our part to help.', '', 10862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Wickerman Festival now begins!  Power to the Forsaken!', 10861, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The burning of the Wickerman will begin in five minutes!  Come to the festival - located just west of the Undercity - and celebrate Hallow\'s End and our liberation from the Scourge!', 10860, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The burning of the Wickerman will begin in fifteen minutes!  Come to the festival - located just west of the Undercity - and celebrate Hallow\'s End and our liberation from the Scourge!', 10859, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re back already!  What can I do for you now?', '', 10858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave at once, stranger!  I have no business with you.', '', 10857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Wickerman festivities will begin in ten minutes!  Join us in the Ruins of Lordaeron courtyard to celebrate Hallow\'s End and our liberation from the Scourge!', 10856, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some call me... Impsy?', '', 10855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the time is right, my lady. All will be clear when the time is right. The master stirs even now. Look to the skies for the Brood of Nozdormu have returned.', '', 10854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shifts uncomfortably.', '', 10853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hrm, curious... This ends abruptly. In Tanaris the Qiraji document facing a bronze dragon. There is much missing from this... More information must be found! Surely they are planning to invade Kalimdor once more!\n', 10852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating, this coincides with theories of Un\'Goro being the home of the Titans when they inhabited Kalimdor. Perhaps Aman\'thul himself watched over \'The God Lands.\'\n', 'Fascinating, this coincides with theories of Un\'Goro being the home of the Titans when they inhabited Kalimdor. Perhaps Aman\'thul himself watched over \'The God Lands.\'\n', 10851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The night elf army was pushed back through Un\'Goro, to the borders of the Tanaris desert. Something in Un\'Goro prevented the Qiraji from being able to take the land. I do not quite understand this word but I believe it to mean \'God Lands.\' It is stated that they could not \'take the God Lands.\' \n', 10850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Poor man, this explains so much.', 10849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The war continued but the will of the great leader was sapped. The whole of Silithus was soon engulfed by the silithid and their Qiraji hosts.', 10848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Valstann, eager to please his father, convinced Fandral to allow him to take a small battalion to the defense of Southwind. Surely with the tide of battle turning their way, no harm could come to his beloved child. The trap was missed. Valstann was captured by the hiding Qiraji and Southwind Village obliterated. Rajaxx himself would take the captive Valstann to the front lines of the battle where - in front of Staghelm and the night elf forces - he would brutally execute the young night elf.\n', 10847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Qiraji forces were commanded to fall back and hide the bulk of their numbers beneath the sands of the desert. A small attack was ordered upon Southwind Village while the front lines of Staghelm\'s army were kept occupied.', 10846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Valstann Staghelm served as the right hand of Fandral. A proud and noble warrior, his dedication and adoration for his father unyielding... and the Twin Emperors sensed this as weakness. A weakness that could be exploited.\n', 10845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vek\'nilash and Vek\'lor, known as the Twin Emperors of Ahn\'Qiraj, watched the war from the sanctuary of their temple. The clever brothers devised a plan to demoralize and divide Staghelm\'s forces. ', 10844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unfortunately, the night elf defense was untenable and Rajaxx knew that they could not hold out much longer. Their tenacity, however, was causing great frustration to Rajaxx and causing even more frustration to his king. Wait, kings? Incredible...\n', 10843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Staghelm and his armies were clearly overwhelmed as the endless flow of Rajaxx\'s troops poured into Silithus. It would seem as if Staghelm, however, was more than just a nuisance to the Qiraji. Under Staghelm, the whole of the night elf armies had come together to defend Kalimdor, greatly slowing the Qiraji forces.\n', 10842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A mighty Qiraji known as General Rajaxx would command the initial incursion into Silithus. Only one would stand in his way: A night elf known as Staghelm. They refer to him as Khar\'sis or \'hand of the earth\' in the native Qiraji tongue.\n', 10841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Titans had long since vacated this world. Only the night elves that once inhabited this area were here to defend. Oh my! The next passage is fascinating!\n', 10840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The moment that C\'Thun had so patiently waited for had finally arrived. His children had spent thousands of years building an army capable of exacting revenge upon the whole of Kalimdor and now the prize was within their grasp.\n', 10839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is more.', 10838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s regains her composure.', 10837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This can\'t be right. An Old God could never be allowed to enter this world. The results would be... Oh dear!', 10836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The evil in these stones is strong, but it has been dispelled.', '', 10835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s examines the Scourgestone closely.', '', 10834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Old God would create avatars from the silithid in its own image. These avatars were to be known as Qiraji. Sentient and with purpose, the Qiraji would name their creator: C\'Thun was born... For many thousands of years the Qiraji worked feverishly to build a force capable of laying waste to the world that would betray their god. The great fortress city of Ahn\'Qiraj was created to house their growing armies and prepare for the coming of C\'Thun.\n', 10833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The land of eternal starlight, Kalimdor, was a nurturing mother to all of its creatures. The magic of the Well of Eternity permeated the land and empowered the multitude of flora and fauna that would make the world their home. From this magical ether were born the silithid. It was through the silithid that the brooding Old God would reach and attempt to sunder the world that it once held in its unmerciful grasp. \n', 10832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For millennia this being lay dormant beneath the world - biding its time. From its prison it waited for the exact moment at which to strike back at those that would see it harmed.\n', 10831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the time before time, when the world was still in its infancy, a battle between a Titan and a being of unimaginable evil and power raged on this very soil. The prophecy is unclear about whether or not the Titan was vanquished in this battle but it illustrates that a Titan fell. An Old God had also fallen - or so it was thought.\n', 10830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is history... A history of Silithus... of Ahn\'Qiraj... of Titans and Old Gods... I read from the prophecy of C\'Thun as written by the Qiraji Prophet Skeram. A prophecy that portends a cataclysm...\n', 10829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh...', '', 10828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to meet your doom!', '', 10827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begs Impsy for forgiveness.', '', 10826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic fool!  Now I will teach you the meaning of pain!', '', 10824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!  It can\'t be...', '', 10823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs maniacally.', '', 10822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to buy another stink bomb!', 'I want to buy another stink bomb!', 10821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sergeant Hartman!  I need to buy another stink bomb cleaner!', 'Sergeant Hartman!  I need to buy another stink bomb cleaner!', 10820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am despawning from $n.', 'I am despawning from $n.', 10819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What ISN\'T there to do, you mean!$B$BEach of the innkeepers throughout the world are handing out trick-or-treat goodies, and many of the towns are decorated for the season!  Also, Sergeant Hartman in Southshore needs help against the Forsaken and their Wickerman Festival.$B$BOne more thing - I\'ve heard that a sick little boy at the orphanage in Stormwind is looking for someone to help him gather treats for the holiday.', 10818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What ISN\'T there to do, you mean!$B$BEach of the innkeepers throughout the world are handing out trick-or-treat goodies, and many of the towns are decorated for the season!  Also, there is the Wickerman Festival just outside the Undercity during the evenings.', 10817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is there to do on Hallow\'s End?', 'What is there to do on Hallow\'s End?', 10816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What Hallow\'s End candy do you have for sale?', 'What Hallow\'s End candy do you have for sale?', 10815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the best, $n - thanks for going trick-or-treating for me!', '', 10814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re the best, $n - thanks for going trick-or-treating for me!', 10813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to miss out on trick-or-treating because I can\'t go out!', '', 10812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to miss out on a lot of the trick-or-treating!', 10811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Killing you and your cohorts, $c, will amuse me.  I shall make it quick.', '', 10810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Happy Hallow\'s End!  How do you like my mask?  Very scary!', 10809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Happy Hallow\'s End!  Do you like my mask?  Very scary!', 10808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?  Such a small, frail thing beckons me?  I shall add your bones to my throne, $r!!', '', 10807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare!  Outrageous!  I curse you, $c.  I curse you with... death!', '', 10806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your treachery only speeds your doom.  This world will fall to darkness!', '', 10805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imposter!  It is a dishonor without equal to be summoned by a whelp such as you!  DIE!', '', 10804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?  Such a small, frail thing beckons me?  This will not go unpunished!', '', 10803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This act of defiance will not go unpunished.  You, and your world, will die!', '', 10802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay the ultimate price for this insolence, little vermin.  Your soul is mine!', '', 10801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I may have ninety-nine problems, but dancin\' ain\'t one of them!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!', 10800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chugga-chugga, woo-woo!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!', '', 10799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bawk, bawk, bawk!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!', '', 10798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooo, so strong!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!', 10797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ancient forces stir - forces that have not been seen or felt for thousands of years. The world weeps, $r. Perhaps a new sundering comes. A sickness born from within...$B$BThe foulness has begun to seep into our lands. From the Dream come nightmares. Nightmares to befoul us in our waking hours...\n', 10796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what do you say?', 'And what do you say?', 10795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They say that I am blessed: A herald to harken in a new age.', 10794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do they say?', 'What do they say?', 10793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have been slain a hundred times. I always wake here, alive. Some say I am cursed and others...', 10792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you know?', 'How do you know?', 10791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, traveler. It was here, nearly 1,000 years past, that the Qiraji began their march of destruction across Kalimdor.$B$BThousands of lives were lost during the war, most in this cursed desert during the initial invasion.$B$BI am one of only a few that remain, chained to both the past and the present. I know not why I am to remain stationed here but I know that I must.', 10790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooo, so strong!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!', 10789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chugga-chugga, woo-woo!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!', 10788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I may have ninety-nine problems, but dancin\' ain\'t one of them!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!', 10787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bawk, bawk, bawk!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!', '', 10786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Lok\'delar.', 'Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Lok\'delar.', 10785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Rhok\'delar.', 'Greetings, ancient one. I have done all that has been asked of me. I now ask that you grant me Rhok\'delar.', 10784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n.', '', 10783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told. I know, I know... he\'s a gnoll.  But he\'s a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!$B$BAnd we are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!', 10782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have more than one enemy in Silithus, $n.$B$BWhile everyone\'s attention is focused on the silithid, my big brother and I have been keeping a close eye on the Twilight\'s Hammer crazies.\n\n', '', 10781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told. I know, I know... he\'s a gnoll.  But he\'s a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!$B$BAnd we are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!', 10780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attractions?', 'Attractions?', 10779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No one really knows who made the Darkmoon Cards or what their true purpose is, but I can tell you that they have been found all over Azeroth, usually in the hands of a villain attempting to unlock their mysteries.', 10778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkmoon Cards?', 'Darkmoon Cards?', 10777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad you asked. Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets are your currency to purchase some amazing prizes.$b$bPrize Tickets are rewarded for doing monthly quests and playing the games around the faire.$b$bCompleting the monthly quests will earn you the most Prize Tickets, but playing the games daily, is a great way to get ahead.$b$bOnce you have enough tickets, you can spend them at the different vendors on the faire grounds.', 'Glad you asked. Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets are your currency to purchase some amazing prizes.$b$bPrize Tickets are rewarded for doing monthly quests and playing the games around the faire.$b$bCompleting the monthly quests will earn you the most Prize Tickets, but playing the games daily, is a great way to get ahead.$b$bOnce you have enough tickets, you can spend them at the different vendors on the faire grounds.', 10776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets?', 'Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets?', 10775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food or drink, then visit Stamp or Sylannia\'s booths.\n\nIf you\'d rather purchase something more exotic, then Lhara may have just the thing for you. She specializes in rarities from all over the world.\n\nAnd then there is Flik running around here somewhere. If you can grab him he sells balls for throwing and frogs to keep as pets.', 'An excellent question! We have many things for sale here at the faire. If you are interested in food or drink, then visit Stamp or Sylannia\'s booths.\n\nIf you\'d rather purchase something more exotic, then Lhara may have just the thing for you. She specializes in rarities from all over the world.\n\nAnd then there is Flik running around here somewhere. If you can grab him he sells balls for throwing and frogs to keep as pets.', 10774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I purchase?', 'What can I purchase?', 10773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire. There is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That\'s why I\'m here to help. Do you have any questions?', 10772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve come back to my old home so my knowledge may be passed on.  Unlike the mindless undead around me, I\'ve chosen this unlife for my own reasons.$B$BThe silithid are formidable opponents, $n.  I\'ve learned to respect them as much as I despise them.$B$BMuch of their deadliness comes from the strength and lightness of their chitin, which I\'ve learned to work into armor.  As we seem to have a common enemy I shall teach you my trade. ', 10771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s simple! You give me a Darkmoon Game Token, and I toss you in and light the fuse.$B$BYou\'ll \"float\" for a little while after you\'re shot, but you can descend quickly by dropping the \"wings\" I\'ll give you.$B$BYou\'re aiming for a big floating target in the water right off the boardwalk.$B$BJust don\'t drop your wings while you\'re still over ground, or... well... I don\'t sell life insurance!', 10770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I use the cannon?', 'How do I use the cannon?', 10769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome! Step right up, don\'t be shy.$b$bThis here is my pride and joy... the Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon! Ain\'t she pretty?', 10768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re heading toward the city, then I have something important for you to do!', 10767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve caught me at a critical time in my research!  No worries, you\'re welcome to join me in quiet contemplation... emphasis on \"quiet\", if you don\'t mind though.', '', 10766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knowledge is power - TRUE power, my young friend.  You\'ll be wise to acquire as much of it as you can, and pay proper heed to those who have already done so.$B$BBefore the razing of the Sunwell, we fooled ourselves into thinking we had neared the apex of our civilization.  It took the Scourge to bring us to our knees... and in a way, back to reality.', '', 10765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your continued service to the Blood Elves is paramount to our survival!  We must all pitch in and pull ourselves out of the mire we all find ourselves in.$B$BIf you\'re ready to work, then let\'s get started.', '', 10764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sunspire held a beautiful vantage of the Sunwell... once.  Our lives have been turned upside down, $n, but we nonetheless carry on.  It is our way; we are survivors.$B$BIf you are to survive this upheaval... to carry on in your own right, then you MUST learn how to survive.  All blood elves must do this.  You must master your insatiable hungering for magic before it masters you.', '', 10763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will do my best to translate and describe what I see.', 10762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what I can learn.', 'Show me what I can learn.', 10761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ghostly figure looks at you with mistrust in her eyes and remains silent.', 10760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Cenarion Circle is wise, and has delved into many of earth\'s secrets.  Craftsmen would do well to heed the words of these druids.', 10759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n!  I hope you\'re ready to get to work, because there is much for you to do here on Sunstrider Isle.$B$BEver since the destruction of the Sunwell by Arthas and the Scourge, we have been a race adrift on a sea of uncertainty.  We teeter on the edge of oblivion.  This will change, $c, and you will learn and aid our recovery at the same time.$B$BThe Outland awaits us!', 10758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Murloc pet.', 'I would like to enter the secret code to receive my Murloc pet.', 10757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail $c. Didn\'t I see you recently at an exclusive gathering? You look familiar, but then again this city is a busy place.$B$BIf you attended that convention, then surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return.', 'Hail $c. Didn\'t I see you recently at an exclusive gathering? You look familiar, but then again this city is a busy place.$B$BIf you attended that convention, then surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return.', 10756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emits a strange noise.', '', 10755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits of Silithus call out to us, $n.  The land weeps, for it has a woeful story to tell...', '', 10754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where would you like to fly to?', 'Where would you like to fly to?', 10753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Use the transcription device to gather a rubbing.>', '<Use the transcription device to gather a rubbing.>', 10752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were always the troublemaker in the family, Noggle.  Always!', 10751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...$B$BWhat is this?  I sense a little cultist scurrying about!  Run along, vermin, or face the wrath of the lords of the Council!', 'A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...$B$BWhat is this?  I sense a little cultist scurrying about!  Run along, vermin, or face the wrath of the lords of the Council!', 10750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...$B$BI sense your Medallion of Station, cultist, but you have no Ring of Lordship?  Are you truly a commander of the Twilight\'s Hammer, or do you merely run errands for your betters?', 'A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...$B$BI sense your Medallion of Station, cultist, but you have no Ring of Lordship?  Are you truly a commander of the Twilight\'s Hammer, or do you merely run errands for your betters?', 10749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What bug comes before the lords of the Council?  A bug, no doubt, wishing to be squashed!', 'What bug comes before the lords of the Council?  A bug, no doubt, wishing to be squashed!', 10748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A clear voice rises from within the stone...$B$BYou come to us with title and so we will listen, but do not try our patience, $c.  The council has no time for idle gossip from one such as you.', 'You come to us with title and so we will listen, but do not try our patience, $c.  The council has no time for idle gossip from one such as you.', 10747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A clear voice rises from within the stone...$B$BWhere is your Medallion of Station, little one?  You may not speak with a Duke without proof of title...', 'A clear voice rises from within the stone...$B$BWhere is your Medallion of Station, little one?  You may not speak with a Duke without proof of title...', 10746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A faint whisper is heard from within the stone...$B$BGreetings, little one.  Do you have news for the Templar?', 'A whisper may be heart from within the stone...$B$BGreetings, little one.  Do you have news for the Templar?', 10745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal is covered in intricate glyphs and runes. You can\'t make sense of any of it.', '', 10744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'C\'Thun will retake this world!', 10743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will make a fitting sacrifice!', 10742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the information, Frankal.', 'Thanks for the information, Frankal.', 10741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep.', '', 10740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a story! So she went into Hive\'Regal and that was the last you saw of her?', 'What a story! So she went into Hive\'Regal and that was the last you saw of her?', 10739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tell you \'then what.\' She went runnin\' straight for the hive. And you know what\'s crazier? Not a single damned bug got in her way or tried to stop her. She ran through them all as if she\'d been best friends with \'em for centuries.', '', 10738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then what?', 'Then what?', 10737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s there to ask? He\'s a monkey you crazy fool. Anyhow, so yea, the monkey went into a frenzy after seein\' ol\' Brann flop into the sand face first. Nothin\' the night elf could do was stopping Glibb here from poundin\' on her noggin.', '', 10736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been meaning to ask you about that monkey.', 'I\'ve been meaning to ask you about that monkey.', 10735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen $g sonny:missy;, I\'ll have you know that whatever attacked us was no priestess of nothin\'! Her eyes were aglow with something evil and she was genuinely frothing at the mouth! She came in, did some kind of crazy scream that sent us all runnin\' in separate directions then started flayin\' our minds one by one. I\'d be hearin\' shadowy words in my head, watchin\' the other\'s periodically black out here and there. It was madness! We would have been done for if not for the damned monkey.', '', 10734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 275, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You couldn\'t handle a lone night elf priestess?', 'You couldn\'t handle a lone night elf priestess?', 10733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re telling me! It\'s even stranger considering between Brann, Rutgar, me and the monkey, we know 38 different languages including a touch of Titan - both Vanir and Aesir.$B$BSo anyway, whatever she was click clacking about, it definitely wasn\'t with anyone \"present.\" She then nodded and went on the offensive! Attacked us outright!', '', 10732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s odd.', 'That\'s odd.', 10731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right then! So the Mistress had come back for a second go at the hives but Brann was having none of that nonsense! Before the melee began, she started talking to something or someone. Crazier still, she started chanting in a language none of us had ever heard.', '', 10730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s what I like to hear.', 'That\'s what I like to hear.', 10729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh brother, not this again... Have a seat $g sonny:missy;.$B$BI\'m sure Rutgar has told you some of this story already so I\'ll spare you the boring details and get right down to the nitty gritty.', '', 10728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, Frankal. I\'ve heard that you might have some information as to the whereabouts of Mistress Natalia Mar\'alith.', 'Hello, Frankal. I\'ve heard that you might have some information as to the whereabouts of Mistress Natalia Mar\'alith.', 10727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be back once I straighten this mess out.', 'I\'ll be back once I straighten this mess out.', 10726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who knows? Anyhow, that was the last I saw of her. Maybe Frankal can give you better information.$B$BNot to steer off topic here as I\'m sure the work you\'re doing for the Commander is important, but we\'re onto something huge here. HUGE! Our requests to Ironforge for an army have so far fallen on deaf ears. Apparently we\'re stretched too thin in protecting the realm or some such nonsense. Once you take your report back to the Commander, come back down here with some friends. We need your help!', '', 10725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Possessed by what?', 'Possessed by what?', 10724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you mean what do I mean? She went nutso! The girl went straight crazy on us. Now ordinarily I don\'t hit girls but after I recovered from the blackout, I was pretty damned angry. Brann, Rutgar, me and the monkey went positively orc on her! It\'s a miracle we were able to fend her off. She seemed almost possessed!', '', 10723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lost it? What do you mean?', 'Lost it? What do you mean?', 10722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She demanded that we immediately head back to Hive\'Regal! Brann would have none of that sass. He told her that there\'s no way we would go back into those hives without an army backing us up. It had gotten far too dangerous. The number of those stinking insects seemed to have tripled from when we first ventured into \'em.$B$BThat\'s when Natalia lost it!', '', 10721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What demands?', 'What demands?', 10720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you daft? Who else would I be talking about? Yes, the girl - Mistress Mar\'alith. Anyhow, she was back and not in too good of a mood. That\'s when the demands started flowing.\n', '', 10719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Natalia?', 'Natalia?', 10718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We took her to the Commander with hopes that the druids of the Circle could fix her up. Sure enough, they were able to wake her up. We figured our business with the Circle was done and we could get back to work.$B$BA few weeks passed and everything was going fine. Brann was still around back then so we had a bit of order in our work structure. Then one day, out of the blue, she appeared back at our camp.\n', '', 10717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to her after that?', 'What happened to her after that?', 10716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It sure is! Those hives were abuzz with various silithid that were none too happy to see us.$B$BEverything was going fine until we came across a glyphed crystal in Hive\'Regal. She was drawn to it like a moth to a flame! She put her pretty little cheek up against the crystal and instantly entered a trance-like state. Naturally, this worried my crew. We picked her up and carried her out of there with a quickness!', '', 10715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sounds dangerous.', 'That sounds dangerous.', 10714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You best have a seat then, this is gonna be a long one.$B$BWhen we initially arrived in Silithus, Mistress Mar\'alith was the first of the night elves from Cenarion Hold to join the expedition. Our routine was nothing out of the ordinary: Form a party to venture into the various hives and search for lost artifacts. ', '', 10713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, Rutgar. The Commander has sent me here to gather some information about his missing wife.', 'Hello, Rutgar. The Commander has sent me here to gather some information about his missing wife.', 10712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skwol!  I hold your scepter!  I command you to enter this world!', 'Skwol!  I hold your scepter!  I command you to enter this world!', 10711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kazum!  I hold your scepter!  I command you to enter this world!', 'Kazum!  I hold your scepter!  I command you to enter this world!', 10710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whirlaxis!  I hold your scepter!  I command you to enter this world!', 'Whirlaxis!  I hold your scepter!  I command you to enter this world!', 10709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skaldrenox!  I hold your scepter, and charge you to enter this world!', 'Skaldrenox!  I hold your scepter, and charge you to enter this world!', 10708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The day of judgment has come, fiend!  I challenge you to battle!', 'The day of judgment has come, fiend!  I challenge you to battle!', 10707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...$B$BGreetings, commander.  What news of Silithus do you bring the Lords of the Council?', 'A thunderous voice bellows from the stone...$B$BGreetings, commander.  What news of Silithus do you bring the Lords of the Council?', 10706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?  Where am I?  I feel... so weak...', '', 10705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!  Thanks for saving my hide!  I think I\'ll be lying down for a while until I recover my strength.', '', 10704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re hunting Deathclasp, $n?  Color me impressed.  I lost two of my men to her this week alone.  Let\'s hope your luck is better than theirs.', '', 10703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duke of Fathoms! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!', 'Duke of Fathoms! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!', 10702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duke of Shards! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!', 'Duke of Shards! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!', 10701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duke of Zephyrs! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!', 'Duke of Zephyrs! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!', 10700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duke of Cynders! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!', 'Duke of Cynders! I hold your signet!  Heed my call!', 10699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will listen to this, vile duke!  I am not your Twilight\'s Hammer lapdog!  I am here to challenge you!  Come!  Come, and meet your death...', 'You will listen to this, vile duke!  I am not your Twilight\'s Hammer lapdog!  I am here to challenge you!  Come!  Come, and meet your death...', 10698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you commune with a Duke of the Council, worm!', 'How dare you commune with a Duke of the Council, worm!', 10697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life is a fitting sacrifice for my master, $c.', '', 10696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my duty and honor to die for the Abyssal Council!', '', 10695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord will be outraged to learn of this ambush.  Let us hope your death will appease him.', '', 10694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trick or Treat!', 'Trick or Treat!', 10693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azure Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!', 'Azure Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!', 10692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earthen Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!', 'Earthen Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!', 10691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hoary Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!', 'Hoary Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!', 10690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No luck with the Twilight\'s Hammer deserter?  Check the mountains to the southeast thoroughly.  There are numerous rumors of a mysterious hermit living there.', 10689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a pleasure to see you again, $n.  Your aid has provided us with a considerable boost in the security of our supply lines.  I hope you understand the importance of the logistics involved in large battle efforts such as this.', 10688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c.  Welcome to Cenarion Hold.  From here we will strike against the silithid where they\'re at their strongest.  I hope you\'ve come to lend a hand.', 10687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Abyssal Council does not tolerate deceit!  Feel our wrath, little $r!', '', 10686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crimson Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!', 'Crimson Templar!  I hold your crest of beckoning.  Heed my summons!', 10685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am no cultist, you monster!  Come to me and face your destruction!', 'I am no cultist, you monster!  Come to me and face your destruction!', 10684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gone, infidel!  May the power of the Abyss smite you down!', 'Be gone, infidel!  May the power of the Abyss smite you down!', 10683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 10682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to hear your tale, Baristolth.', 'I am ready to hear your tale, Baristolth.', 10681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is we who must make the first strike. We cannot be allowed to repeat the mistakes of the past...', '', 10680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 26, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baristolth, I have lost my badge and require a replacement.', 'Baristolth, I have lost my badge and require a replacement.', 10679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars, high atop Blackrock Spire...', '', 10678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s becomes enraged!', '%s becomes enraged!', 10677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for finding my reagents!  *yawn*  That poison\'s made me... a bit tired...', '', 10676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes!  I\'m cured!  I\'m cure... whoa, got up too fast!', '', 10675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... cold...', '', 10674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there!  You look able bodied... we need your aid in defending Southshore!$B$BThe blasted Forsaken are all riled up because it\'s Hallow\'s End.  Their \"celebration\" will no doubt be leading them right to our doorstep.  If you\'ve got the time, we really could use your help!', '', 10673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha... where am I?  So... weak..', '', 10672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!$B$BOn the observance of Hallow\'s End, the Forsaken burn a Wickerman in honor of this, the most revered of occasions.  It was on this day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge.  We have remained free ever since.  Those who would have seen us fall are repaid in full... with vengeance!$B$BWhen the Wickerman is burning, paint your face with the ashes scattered below if you want to celebrate in style!', 10671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go Forsaken!  Yay us!', '', 10670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You like candy?  I like candy.', '', 10669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Happy Hallow\'s End, $c!', '', 10668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WE ARE THE FORSAKEN!! ', 10667, 1, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 25197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are NOT monsters! We are NOT the mindless wretches of a ghoul army!', 10666, 1, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 25193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are the chill in a coward\'s spine...', 10665, 1, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 25195, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, in the face of such atrocities, we were denied even the release of death.', 10664, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 25189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In life, we suffered unspeakable tragedies.', 10663, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 25186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Children of the grave, heed my call!', 10662, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 25185, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ashes from the burning wickerman radiate magical power.  You have already applied the ashes to your face.', '', 10661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smear the ash on my face like war paint!', 'Smear the ash on my face like war paint!', 10660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ashes from the burning wickerman radiate magical power.', '', 10659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A terrible and costly mistake you have made. It is not my time, mortals.', '', 10658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bronzebeard\'s gone missing again! That dwarf sure didn\'t get any of his brother\'s good senses.', '', 10657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look up to the heavens, $c. The Dragonflights have not been seen in this area for a thousand years! Those Qiraji are up to something, I just know it!', '', 10656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can ye hear it, stranger? The humming is gettin\' louder with each passing day. These crystals must be what\'s driving these bugs crazy.', 10655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Commander has not been himself as of late. His mistress disappeared while on an archaeological dig in the southern desert - vanished without a trace! Very strange, indeed.$B$BI suppose you\'re looking for work? Do I need to bash you in the head with a clue?', '', 10654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why now, $r? I just do not understand it. So much work to be done...', '', 10653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to stable my pet.', 'I wish to stable my pet.', 10652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look behind you, $r. The hive stirs as the land that surrounds us shudders and shakes.$B$BThe time has come for me to fulfill a promise I made a thousand years past. The sands shift once more as the Qiraji plan for war.', '', 10651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh dear, I am running dangerously low on supplies! What is taking that blasted goblin so long?', 10650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A great evil stirs, $r. Can you feel it?$B$BBah! Of course you cannot. Hand me your armor and weapons and I shall renew their vigor.', '', 10649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I supply the Hold with various relics required for spellcasting as well as other alchemical reagents.', '', 10648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares, Calandrath.', 'I wish to browse your wares, Calandrath.', 10647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, traveler. As long as you remain within the walls of the Cenarion Hold, you will be safe from harm.$B$BBe wary when leaving the protection of the Hold as the silithid have been swarming as of late.', 10646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a frenzy!', '', 10645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something different!!!', '', 10644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Hi!  I\'m Luis!  What do you think of me so far...?', '', 10641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle for Alterac Valley has begun!', '', 10640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('30 seconds until the battle for Alterac Valley begins.', '', 10639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1 minute until the battle for Alterac Valley begins.', '', 10638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n claims the Snowfall graveyard!  If left unchallenged, the Horde will control it!', '', 10637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n claims the Snowfall graveyard!  If left unchallenged, the Alliance will control it!', '', 10636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fleeing will do you no good, mortals!', '', 10635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde wins!', '', 10634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance wins!', '', 10633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The attackers have fled!  Strength and honor to the Horde!', '', 10632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Game start timer disabled.', 'Game start timer disabled.', 10631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is no easy task to protect the Horde\'s lumber gathering efforts here in Ashenvale, but we have never shied from battle!  The night elves and their allies will fall!', '', 10630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The battle for Warsong Gulch is a battle that we cannot lose.  We fight for our honor and we fight for our land, and no orc or misguided ally will take them from us!', 10629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t make me angry! You wouldn\'t like me when I\'m angry!', '', 10628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, please do.', 'Yes, please do.', 10627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Samuel Hawke, the main supplier for the League of Arathor posted here at Arathi Basin.  As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services.', '', 10626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What goods have I earned the right to purchase from the League of Arathor?', 'What goods have I earned the right to purchase from the League of Arathor?', 10625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Rutherford Twing, the main supplier for the Defilers posted here at Arathi Basin.  As you improve your standing with us, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you might find useful.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services.', '', 10624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What goods have I earned the right to purchase from the Defilers?', 'What goods have I earned the right to purchase from the Defilers?', 10623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that\'s what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I\'ve discovered it to be untrue.$b$bNow then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?', 'You can\'t teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that\'s what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I\'ve discovered it to be untrue.$b$bNow then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?', 10622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to untrain my pet.', 'I wish to untrain my pet.', 10621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can get back to the Stronghold on my own, I think.  Now that you bought me some time, I should be able to stealth out of here.  Who ever you are... thank you.  May Elune bless you always!', '', 10620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not now.  Have you any tasks for me?', 'Not now.  Have you any tasks for me?', 10619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world.', '', 10618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We, the Zandalarian trolls, traveled here from distant islands, for we cannot ignore the threat that now faces our world.$B$BThe leader of our expedition, Molthor, brought us to the Yojamba Isle, along the northern coasts of Stranglethorn, and even now recruits brave heroes to venture into the ancient troll city... Zul\'Gurub.', '', 10616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Soulflayer is defeated!  Our leader, Molthor, now calls more of his servants...', 'The Soulflayer is defeated!  Our leader, Molthor, now calls more of his servants...', 10615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take heart!$B$BThe Soulflayer has been defeated and his wretched heart has been cast into the nether!', 'Take heart!$B$BThe Soulflayer has been defeated and his wretched heart has been cast into the nether!', 10614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalarian trolls have traveled far and suffered much to reach this place, but to do nothing... is to invite our doom...', 'The Zandalarian trolls have traveled far and suffered much to reach this place, but to do nothing... is to invite our doom...', 10613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blood God, the Soulflayer, has been defeated!  We are imperiled no longer!', '', 10612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behind me is the Altar of Zanza, a sacred place for us Zandalar.  We pray here to bolster our resolve in preparation for war against the Blood God, Hakkar.$B$BProve yourself to the tribe by using the altar to destroy any of the Hakkari Bijous you might find inside Zul\'Gurub.  Also, I will trade you Honor Tokens our tribe uses for sets of coins you may find in Zul\'Gurub.  Bring me the coins that I seek, and you will be rewarded!', '', 10611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a winner!  $n has won FIRST PLACE in the tournament!', '', 10610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And the Tastyfish have gone for the week!   I will remain for another hour to allow you to turn in your fish!', '', 10609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the Fishing Tournament BEGIN!', '', 10608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to speak to the spirits, Tiev.', 'I wish to speak to the spirits, Tiev.', 10607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, young $c.  You hear the call of water?', '', 10606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve angered me for the last time $n!', '', 10605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! I\'m watching you!', '', 10604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yay!', '', 10603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow!', '', 10602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Grats, mon!', '', 10601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We already have all our winners for today\'s contest, but Jang is willing to purchase any Tastyfish that you have fished up!\n\nThere\'s always next Sunday for you to show your angling skill!', '', 10600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has gathered over 1200 resources and is near victory!', '', 10599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has gathered over 1200 resources and is near victory!', '', 10598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paragons of Power are powerful mojo.  They are Gurubashi Empire mojo.  We Zandalar must get mojo.  The tribe will take mojo for our own.  The Blood God will not destroy us.$B$BThere are three kinds of Paragons in Zul\'Gurub.  Seek coins.  Seek bijous.  Seek primal items.  These are the Paragons.$B$BGo to Zul\'Gurub now.  Kill.  Take the Paragons of Power.  Bring them to the tribe.  Earn our respect.  Earn our battle gear.  Earn real power.', '', 10597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings!  I am here to promote a tournament to test your fishing skill in Stranglethorn.  To participate you need enough might to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to coax the fish from the water.$B$B Come back later when you are more qualified!\n\n', '', 10596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met master of Rod and Reel!   If you be willing to test your skills against the best fisher-folk in the lands then listen up!   On this very Sunday there be a contest in Stranglethorn where the master angler will be chosen!\n\n', '', 10595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare set foot upon Hakkari holy ground? Minions of Hakkar, destroy the infidels!\n', '', 10594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pledge your allegiance to Hakkar and the pain you suffer shall be minimal.', '', 10593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Primal Gods serve Hakkar. Turn back now, you stand no chance.', '', 10592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your gods can\'t save you now, $c.', '', 10591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world will suffer immeasurable cruelties under my reign.', '', 10590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surrender your soul, mortal.', '', 10589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will make a fitting sacrifice.', '', 10588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hakkar will rule the world!', '', 10587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will suffer eternally, $r.', '', 10586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Silverwing Sentinels shall be in your debt, $c.  You will find Elfarran, our battlemaster, inside Stormwind Keep, attending the boy-king\'s audience.  Goddess watch over you!', 'The Silverwing Sentinels shall be in your debt, $c.  You will find Elfarran, our battlemaster, inside Stormwind Keep, attending the boy-king\'s audience.  Goddess watch over you!', 10585, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold the strongest of mojo used by the old Empire.$B$BYa can expect to be findin\' three kinds of Paragons in Zul\'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you\'ll be rewarded with the some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted.$B$BCount on it, mon!\n\n', 10584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You show wisdom beyond your years, $c.  Thank you. You can find our battlemaster, Lylandris, standing at the war table in the Hall of Arms. She can assist you in traveling to Warsong Gulch.', 'You show wisdom beyond your years, $c. Thank you. You can find our battlemaster, Lylandris, standing at the war table in the Hall of Arms. She can assist you in traveling to Warsong Gulch.', 10583, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light of Elune shine upon thee, $n!  You will find Aethalas, our battlemaster, on the Warrior\'s Terrace.  She will aid you on your way to Warsong Gulch.', 'The Light of Elune shine upon thee, $n!  You will find Aethalas, our battlemaster, on the Warrior\'s Terrace.  She will aid you on your way to Warsong Gulch.', 10582, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, we are not ashamed to say that we are in need of all of the assistance that we can get in our fight at Warsong Gulch.  But there is greater honor to be had now than at any time in the past if you so choose to lend us your skills.  As well, the Silverwing Sentinels are sure to look more favorably upon your efforts on our behalf.  Will you join the battle?', '$C, we are not ashamed to say that we are in need of all of the assistance that we can get in our fight at Warsong Gulch.  But there is greater honor to be had now than at any time in the past if you so choose to lend us your skills.  As well, the Silverwing Sentinels are sure to look more favorably upon your efforts on our behalf.  Will you join the battle?', 10581, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The seasons turn for all in due time, but you are still in the springtime of your life.  Please return to us later, $c, when you have experienced more.', 'The seasons turn for all in due time, but you are still in the springtime of your life.  Please return to us later, $c, when you have experienced more.', 10580, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am released through you! Avenge me!', '', 10579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent!  You shall be doing the League of Arathor a great service in ridding Arathi Basin of The Defilers and their Horde thugs.  Seek out the Lady Hoteshem in the royal audience chamber of Stormwind Keep.  She has been expecting you, $n.', 'Excellent!  You shall be doing the League of Arathor a great service in ridding Arathi Basin of The Defilers and their Horde thugs.  Seek out the Lady Hoteshem in the royal audience chamber of Stormwind Keep.  She has been expecting you, $n.', 10578, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall be in your debt, $c.  Look for Donal Osgood in the Hall of Arms.  He will be more than happy to aid you in your journey to Arathi Basin.', 'We shall be in your debt, $c.  Look for Donal Osgood in the Hall of Arms.  He will be more than happy to aid you in your journey to Arathi Basin.', 10577, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n!  You will find Keras Wolfheart on the Warrior\'s Terrace near the trainers there.  He will guide your way to Arathi Basin.  Good luck and great honor upon thee.', 'Thank you, $n!  You will find Keras Wolfheart on the Warrior\'s Terrace near the trainers there.  He will guide your way to Arathi Basin.  Good luck and great honor upon thee.', 10576, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you help us in our time of great need at Arathi Basin, $c?  The chance for increased honor and standing is greater than ever, and your assistance is sure to help to turn the tide against The Defilers.  Can we count on you?', 'Will you help us in our time of great need at Arathi Basin, $c?  The chance for increased honor and standing is greater than ever, and your assistance is sure to help to turn the tide against The Defilers.  Can we count on you?', 10575, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the offer, $c.  Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin.', 'Thank you for the offer, $c.  Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin.', 10574, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good for you, $c!  Our battlemaster, Thelman Slatefist, can be found in the war room inside Stormwind Keep.  He will help you get to Alterac Valley.', 'Good for you, $c!  Our battlemaster, Thelman Slatefist, can be found in the war room inside Stormwind Keep.  He will help you get to Alterac Valley.', 10573, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve made the right decision, $c.  You\'ll find our battlemaster, Glordrum Steelbeard, in the Hall of Arms.  Good luck, $n!', 'You\'ve made the right decision, $c.  You\'ll find our battlemaster, Glordrum Steelbeard, in the Hall of Arms.  Good luck, $n!', 10572, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fishmaster Bassbait has had the waters here seeded with high quality Tastyfish so he can have his tournament.\n\nOnce he gets his winners, I will give you silver for each five Tastyfish you bring me!', 10571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent, $n!  You shall find Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior\'s Terrace.  He can help you to get to Alterac Valley.', 'Excellent, $n!  You shall find Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior\'s Terrace.  He can help you to get to Alterac Valley.', 10570, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, the Stormpike Guard is in need of your aid in the battle against the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac Valley, now more than ever.  The opportunities for honor and repute are greater than ever as well! Will you join the battle?', '$n, the Stormpike Guard is in need of your aid in the battle against the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac Valley, now more than ever.  The opportunities for honor and repute are greater than ever as well! Will you join the battle?', 10569, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid ye would not survive long in Alterac Valley, $c.  Come back and see us when you have a few more seasons under your belt.', 'I\'m afraid ye would not survive long in Alterac Valley, $c.  Come back and see us when you have a few more seasons under your belt.', 10568, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honor and praise will be yours for the taking, $c!  Look for Kurden Bloodclaw in this city\'s Royal Quarter.', 'Honor and praise will be yours for the taking, $c!  Look for Kurden Bloodclaw in this city\'s Royal Quarter.', 10567, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have chosen wisely, $n.  Seek out Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise.  He will assist you on your journey to Warsong Gulch.', 'You have chosen wisely, $n.  Seek out Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise.  He will assist you on your journey to Warsong Gulch.', 10566, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then it is with great pride that I tell you that Brakgul Deathbringer stands ready in the Hall of Arms to aid you on your way to Warsong Gulch. Seek him out in the Valley of Honor.', 'Then it is with great pride that I tell you that Brakgul Deathbringer stands ready in the Hall of Arms to aid you on your way to Warsong Gulch. Seek him out in the Valley of Honor.', 10565, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, we have a great need for your help in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels.  And there is even greater honor and reputation with the Warsong Outriders to be gained as well!  Do you have the courage to enter battle?', '$C, we have a great need for your help in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels.  And there is even greater honor and reputation with the Warsong Outriders to be gained as well!  Do you have the courage to enter battle?', 10564, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately you are not yet strong enough to survive in Warsong Gulch, $c.', 'Unfortunately you are not yet strong enough to survive in Warsong Gulch, $c.', 10563, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good, $n.  You will find Grizzle Halfmane in the Royal Quarter of the Undercity.  May you find great honor in Alterac Valley.', 'Very good, $n.  You will find Grizzle Halfmane in the Royal Quarter of the Undercity.  May you find great honor in Alterac Valley.', 10562, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your name will be remembered down through the ages, $n.  Seek out Taim Ragetotem on the Hunter Rise and he will assist you on your way to Alterac Valley.', 'Your name will be remembered down through the ages, $n.  Seek out Taim Ragetotem on the Hunter Rise and he will assist you on your way to Alterac Valley.', 10561, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 10560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honor to your house and ancestors, $c!  You will find Kartra Bloodsnarl inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor.', 'Honor to your house and ancestors, $c!  You will find Kartra Bloodsnarl inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor.', 10559, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, $c.  There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?', 'Hail, $c.  There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?', 10558, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to be a stronger $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley.', 'You need to be a stronger $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley.', 10557, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And a great deal of honor you shall have, I am sure.  Speak with Martin Lindsey at the Pools of Vision.  It is a cave located in the side of the Spirit Rise.', 'And a great deal of honor you shall have, I am sure.  Speak with Martin Lindsey at the Pools of Vision.  It is a cave located in the side of the Spirit Rise.', 10556, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, of course.  Please speak with Deze Snowbane at the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor of this city, $c.', 'Of course, of course.  Please speak with Deze Snowbane at the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor of this city, $c.', 10555, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am so glad that you asked.  You will find Sir Malory Wheeler at the Royal Quarter in the presence of our Dark Lady.', 'I am so glad that you asked.  You will find Sir Malory Wheeler at the Royal Quarter in the presence of our Dark Lady.', 10554, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to join the battle!', 'I wish to join the battle!', 10553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our need for assistance in Arathi Basin is greater than one might imagine, $n.  So too is the honor and reputation one might acquire there in this time of need, however.  I implore you to seek out the Arathi Basin battlemaster in this city.', 'Our need for assistance in Arathi Basin is greater than one might imagine, $n.  So too is the honor and reputation one might acquire there in this time of need, however.  I implore you to seek out the Arathi Basin battlemaster in this city.', 10552, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not yet powerful enough, $c.  Move along.', 'You are not yet powerful enough, $c.  Move along.', 10551, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your callous disregard for the sovereign might of the Gurubashi Empire has been noted. The inhabitants of Zul\'Gurub have been alerted to your presence.', '', 10550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s flees toward the safety of another tiger.', '', 10549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heya Heya Heya!   If you want to test your fishing skills then I have just the place for you!   This Sunday we have a fishing tournament in Stranglethorn!\n\n', '', 10548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Hey Hey!  I am here to promote a fabulous fishing tournament in Stranglethorn but you need to be tough enough to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to fish those waters.$B$BCome back later when you are more qualified!\n\n', '', 10547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions of Hakkar, hear your God. The sanctity of this temple has been compromised. Invaders encroach upon holy ground! The Altar of Blood must be protected. Kill them all!', '', 10546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a rage after seeing his raptor fall in battle!', '%s goes into a rage after seeing his raptor fall in battle!', 10545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wushoolay, the Storm Witch.$B$BHis power is the power of the sky, the rain, and the shattered earth.  May he once again reign father to the Gurubashi.$B$BWushoolay now rages near the edge of madness.', '', 10544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wushoolay, the Storm Witch.$B$BHis power is the power of the sky, the rain, and the shattered earth.  May he once again reign father to the Gurubashi.  $B$BWushoolay now dwells far from here.  One day, he may return...', '', 10543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Renataki, of the Thousand Blades.$B$BPain is his lifeblood.  Fear, his ally.  May he one day return and bring joyous bloodshed with him.$B$BRenataki now dwells near the edge of madness.', '', 10542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Renataki, of the Thousand Blades.$B$BPain is his lifeblood.  Fear, his ally.  May he one day return and bring joyous bloodshed with him.  $B$BRenataki now dwells far from here.  One day, he may return...', '', 10541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hazza\'rah, the Dreamweaver.$B$BHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep.$B$BHazza\'rah now dreams near the edge of madness.', '', 10540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hazza\'rah, the Dreamweaver.$B$BHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep.  $B$BHazza\'rah now dwells far from here.  One day, he may return...', '', 10539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gri\'lek, of the Iron Blood$B$BThe wanderer.  May his strength and lust for battle pierce the ages.$B$BGri\'lek now lingers near the edge of madness...', '', 10538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All Hail $n, slayer of Hakkar, and hero of Azeroth!', '', 10537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look around you $c.  You are in rare company to be certain, yet still I think you need to prove yourself.  Hmm, perhaps I shall allow you to aid us in our cause at Arathi Basin.  Would you like that?', '', 10536, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you have what it takes to destroy The League of Arathor, $c?  I hope so.  What is it that you want, or are you simply here to waste my time?', '', 10535, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been expecting you $n.  Are you ready to assist us in Arathi Basin?', 10534, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope that you\'re here to help us take back Arathi Basin from The Defilers.  What do you say $n?', '', 10533, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin was once our home, and will be again with your aid!  Will you help us $c?', '', 10532, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The humans and their so-called League of Arathor think to push us out of Arathi Basin.  I think not $c!  Are you ready to be sent there and demonstrate that it is they, and not The Defilers, that will be leaving soon?', 10531, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope that you are here to go to Alterac Valley $n.  We can use all o\' the help that we can get.', '', 10530, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces in Alterac Valley need wisdom to achieve victory $c.  You look like the one to lead them.', '', 10529, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lok\'tar $c!  We have need of your services in Alterac Valley.  Shall I add you to the lists?', 10528, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stormpike Guard must be destroyed!  Ready for Alterac Valley $c?', '', 10527, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, have ye any idea o\' what we\'re up against in Alterac Valley?  Are ye ready to fight the Frostwolf Clan?', '', 10526, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye $g lad : lass; are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o\' what they been asking for?', '', 10525, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$C, we need your assistance at Warsong Gulch.  Will you aid us in our fight against the Warsong Outriders?', 10524, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here to fight for us at Warsong Gulch?  Lok\'tar Ogar $c!', '', 10523, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, the Silverwing Sentinels must be crushed!  Are you ready for Warsong Gulch?', '', 10522, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail to thee $n.  Do you wish me to aid you in your journey to Warsong Gulch?', 10521, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm\'ka $c!  Are you ready to fight for the Horde at Warsong Gulch?', '', 10520, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If that is your wish $c, then you will need to speak to Keras Wolfheart on the Warrior\'s Terrace.  He is a representative of The League of Arathor and can help you to get to Arathi Basin.', 10519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The humans definitely need all of our help in Arathi Basin.  The one that you wish to speak to is named Keras Wolfheart.  He stands ready to assist you on the Warrior\'s Terrace.', 10518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin', 'Arathi Basin', 10517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s admirable what The League of Arathor is attempting to do in Arathi Basin.  Too bad those undead abominations and their Horde friends are standing in the way.  Head over to Stormwind Keep.  Lady Hoteshem awaits you in the King\'s audience chamber.  She can help you to get to Arathi Basin.', 'It\'s admirable what The League of Arathor is attempting to do in Arathi Basin.  Too bad those undead abominations and their Horde friends are standing in the way.  Head over to Stormwind Keep.  Lady Hoteshem awaits you in the King\'s audience chamber.  She can help you to get to Arathi Basin.', 10516, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the King\'s audience chamber you will find the Lady Hoteshem.  She can assist you in getting to Arathi Basin where The League of Arathor is in need of assistance against The Defilers.', 'In the King\'s audience chamber you will find the Lady Hoteshem.  She can assist you in getting to Arathi Basin where The League of Arathor is in need of assistance against The Defilers.', 10515, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin', 'Arathi Basin', 10514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The League of Arathor is trying to reclaim their ancestral holdings in Arathi Basin from the Forsaken.  If you would aid them $n speak to Donal Osgood in the Hall of Arms.', 'The League of Arathor is trying to reclaim their ancestral holdings in Arathi Basin from the Forsaken.  If you would aid them $n speak to Donal Osgood in the Hall of Arms.', 10513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The humans are in need of your assistance in their fight against The Forsaken at Arathi Basin.  Go to the Hall of Arms and speak with their representative, Donal Osgood.', 'The humans are in need of your assistance in their fight against The Forsaken at Arathi Basin.  Go to the Hall of Arms and speak with their representative, Donal Osgood.', 10512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin', 'Arathi Basin', 10511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to aid The Defilers in their fight against The League of Arathor in Arathi Basin?  Very well, you should ask Martin Lindsey for his assistance then.  Look for him in the Pools of Vision.', 'You wish to aid The Defilers in their fight against The League of Arathor in Arathi Basin?  Very well, you should ask Martin Lindsey for his assistance then.  Look for him in the Pools of Vision.', 10510, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may seek out Martin Lindsey inside the Pools of Vision, underneath the Spirit Rise.  He will assist you on your way to Arathi Basin.', 'You may seek out Martin Lindsey inside the Pools of Vision, underneath the Spirit Rise.  He will assist you on your way to Arathi Basin.', 10509, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin', 'Arathi Basin', 10508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your deaths feed my strength!', '', 10507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DING!', '', 10505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin place to take from soft humans.  Sir Malory Wheeler send you there.', 'Arathi Basin place to take from soft humans.  Sir Malory Wheeler send you there.', 10504, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go Royal Quarter.  See Sir Malory Wheeler.  Him scary.', 'You go Royal Quarter.  See Sir Malory Wheeler.  Him scary.', 10503, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mudskunks are a particularly smelly breed of fish that likes tropical waters.  The Zulian Mudskunk - the smelliest of them all, can only be found in the steamy waters of Zul\'Gurub.$B$BThe Zulian Mudskunks are what I believe attracted Gahz\'ranka to the place, though trolls will probably tell you he\'s one of their gods...$B$BBelieve what you like, but mark me - fill one of my lures with Zulian Mudskunks and that old boy will come, for sure!', '', 10502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin', 'Arathi Basin', 10501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I catch the mudskunks for your lure?', 'How do I catch the mudskunks for your lure?', 10500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to help the Forsaken with their fight against the humans in Arathi Basin?  Then go to the Hall of the Brave and speak with Deze Snowbane.', 'You wish to help the Forsaken with their fight against the humans in Arathi Basin?  Then go to the Hall of the Brave and speak with Deze Snowbane.', 10499, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to the Hall of the Brave.  You will find The Defiler, Deze Snowbane there to assist you in getting to Arathi Basin.', 'Go to the Hall of the Brave.  You will find The Defiler, Deze Snowbane there to assist you in getting to Arathi Basin.', 10498, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin', 'Arathi Basin', 10497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gri\'lek, of the Iron Blood$B$BThe wanderer.  May his strength and lust for battle pierce the ages.  $B$BGri\'lek now dwells far from here.  One day, he may return...', '', 10496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin.', 'I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin.', 10495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to cast a Great Heal!', 10494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Whirr* *CLANK*\n\nI have been instructed to accept high quality rare fish and return valuable Nat Pagle fishing accessories.   Fish Requested.\n\n*THUMP* *Buzz*\n', '', 10493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nat, I want to buy your mudskunk lures!', 'Nat, I want to buy your mudskunk lures!', 10492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To catch Gahz\'ranka, you\'ll need a special Mudskunk lure.  I make \'em myself!$B$BBut you need more than just the lure; you need some mudskunks too... you need to place them in the lure to give it a rank old smell!$B$BWhen you have the mudskunks, throw the lure off Pagle\'s Point in Zul\'Gurub... and then grab a drink and wait... but not too long, because Gahz\'ranka is sure to come a\'stomping!', '', 10491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to catch Gahz\'ranka!  Tell me how!', 'I want to catch Gahz\'ranka!  Tell me how!', 10490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks again for returning my lucky measuring tape, $n.  I swear it helps me catch bigger fish!', '', 10489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ask me, the best part about fishing is its slow pace.  It gives one time to think, to reflect on past events and to plan for future ones.$B$BOh, and it\'s also a great excuse to drink.  Heavily.', '', 10488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The markings of this tablet show ancient diagrams and hold dire words of power.$B$BYou believe it is an alchemical recipe, but it is beyond your skill...', '', 10487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn the recipe.', 'Learn the recipe.', 10486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The markings on this tablet show ancient diagrams and dire words of power, used to create  Gurubashi Mojo Madness...', '', 10485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The markings of this tablet show ancient diagrams and hold dire words of power, but their meaning is inscrutable to you.', '', 10484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold latent signatures of magic used by the old Empire.$B$BYou\'ll more than likely discover three kinds of Paragons in Zul\'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you\'ll be rewarded with some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted.\n', 'The Paragons of Power are remnants from the ancient Gurubashi Empire.  We Zandalar seek them - not only are they of tremendous collectible value to us, but we believe that they also hold latent signatures of magic used by the old Empire.$B$BYou\'ll more than likely discover three kinds of Paragons in Zul\'Gurub: coins, bijous, and primal items.  Bring them to us in the quantities that we seek, and you\'ll be rewarded with some of the finest items we Zandalar have ever crafted.', 10483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are the Paragons of Power?', 'What are the Paragons of Power?', 10482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley.', 'I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley.', 10481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be lured into the mortals\' trap.  Bathe in my power!  Be renewed and destroy the heretics!', '', 10480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle has begun!', 'The battle has begun!', 10479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle will begin in 30 seconds.', 'The battle will begin in 30 seconds.', 10478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle will begin in 1 minute.', 'The battle will begin in 1 minute.', 10477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.  I am Exzhal. I was once the Servitor of Rastakhan. Now I am the server of tasty treats.\n\nYou would be wise not to disrupt King Rastakhan\'s groove, even by accident. For de consequences can be truly dire.', '', 10476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Booty Bay fishing contest where each week we reward the finest fishermen in all of Azeroth.\n\nWhen the fishing tournament begins, you will be able to catch tastyfish from any fishing node in Stranglethorn.', '', 10475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the ritual, my servants.  We must banish the heart of Hakkar back into the void!', '', 10474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, only one step remains to rid us of the Soulflayer\'s threat...', '', 10473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feast on $n, my pretties!', 10472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch.', 'I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch.', 10471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first is a primal token that must be taken from the most powerful of the Hakkari lieutenants: Jin\'do and the Bloodlord.$B$BThe second is a punctured voodoo doll. These can be found in the piles of refuse that litter this foul place. Look inside the jinxed Hoodoo piles.$B$BBring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!', '', 10470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are the components?', 'What are the components?', 10469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zanza can create the ancient troll enchantments with the right components. This magic will help you in defeating Hakkar and his minions.$B$BI only ask that you bring me two items.', '', 10468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arcanum? That sounds very familiar.', 'Arcanum? That sounds very familiar.', 10467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you? Then you know how weak and pathetic the high elf version of troll magic was?$B$BThe high elves could not understand why a people with their magical affinity could not contend with the powers of troll voodoo. This was an inconceivable notion for the pale skins to understand. They were resigned to using the bastardized version of troll enchantments. I believe they called them \'Arcanum.\'\n', '', 10466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I have heard of this magic.', 'I think I have heard of this magic.', 10465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A friend of the Zandalrian! You have ventured deep into the lair of the Blood God, $c. You will do well to listen to what I have to say.$B$BMany thousands of years ago, while the indigenous trolls of the Zul\'Aman empire were battling the invading high elf heathens, great magic was stolen from Zanza. This magic was used by the high elves to enchant their weapons and armor to assist in conquering the trolls of the region.', '', 10464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Zanza, a Loa of Zandalar. I have come in this ethereal form from Zandalar to help my people. Hakkar has no dominion over my soul.$B$BI help those that have helped the Zandalarian people.', '', 10463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Betina, I\'d like a replacement Rune of the Dawn please!', 'Betina, I\'d like a replacement Rune of the Dawn please!', 10462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bethekk, your priestess calls upon your might!', 10461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ssserenity...at lassst!', '', 10460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bless you, mortals, for this release...Hakkar controls me no longer!', 10459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Betina, I\'d like a replacement Seal of the Dawn please!', 'Betina, I\'d like a replacement Seal of the Dawn please!', 10458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and souls for Hakkar!  HAHAHAH!', '', 10457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is true, $n.  The wheels of doom now turn, inevitably, toward the true return of Hakkar!', '', 10456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shirvallah, fill me with your RAGE!', '', 10455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is resurrected by a nearby ally!', '%s is resurrected by a nearby ally!', 10454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s dies.', '%s dies.', 10453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally...death!  Curse you, Hakkar!  Curse you!', 10452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hakkar binds me no more!  Peace at last!', '', 10451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At last, I am free of the Soulflayer!', 10450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the great show, friends.  Step right up to die!', '', 10449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aid me my brood!', 10448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PRIDE HERALDS THE END OF YOUR WORLD.  COME, MORTALS!  FACE THE WRATH OF THE SOULFLAYER!', '', 10447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make peace, worms.  I be deliverin\' you to Hakkar myself!', '', 10446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is fully grown!', '', 10445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The brood shall not fall!', 10444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadra, make of me your avatar!', 10443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rin\'wosho, I require repairs.', 'Rin\'wosho, I require repairs.', 10442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us barter, Rin\'wosho. Show me what goods are available!', 'Let us barter, Rin\'wosho. Show me what goods are available!', 10441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, adventurer. I am Rin\'wosho, trader of Zuldazar. I come from the South Seas and bring many exotic goods and items from my homeland.$B$BPerhaps if you prove your worth to my tribe, I shall barter.  If you have any of my tribe\'s Honor Tokens, then perhaps we shall barter even more.', '', 10440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have lost the talisman, Falthir. I require a replacement.', 'I have lost the talisman, Falthir. I require a replacement.', 10439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel da big bad voodoo!', 'Feel da big bad voodoo!', 10438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Troll mojo da strongest mojo!', 'Troll mojo da strongest mojo!', 10437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skull gonna decorate our ritual altars!', 'Your skull gonna decorate our ritual altars!', 10436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gonna make you into mojo!', 'I gonna make you into mojo!', 10435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be dead soon!', 'You be dead soon!', 10434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sightless I may be, but vision I have.$B$BMy primary dealings are with hunters and rogues, $r.', '', 10433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources.  Lumber, ore, food... all these are needed in order to wage a good war.$B$BDenying our enemies of their supplies is as good as killing them on the battlefield.', '', 10432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must not allow the Alliance to expand their power base in Arathi!  Even their miniscule Refuge Pointe may one day grow to threaten us.', 10431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.  It is the time of the Harvest Festival - a time of great bounties and a time of remembrance.  We partake of feasts to celebrate all we have to be thankful of, and we remember our ancestors and past heroes to give thanks to the legacy they gave us.$B$BPlease feel free to partake of the feast being offered here.  Also, I am offering some fireworks to help celebrate this joyous time of year.', '', 10430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me browse your selection of fireworks.', 'Let me browse your selection of fireworks.', 10429, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.  It is the time of the Harvest Festival - a time of great bounties and a time of remembrance.  We partake of feasts to celebrate all we have to be thankful of, and we remember our ancestors and past heroes to give thanks to the legacy they gave us.$B$BPlease feel free to partake of the feast being offered here.  Also, I am offering some fireworks to help celebrate this joyous time of year.', '', 10428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maywiki, I\'ve lost my talisman and require a replacement.', 'Maywiki, I\'ve lost my talisman and require a replacement.', 10427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What you be expectin\', mon?$B$BMaywiki only be dealin\' with the druids and shaman.', 10426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s fully engulfs in flame and a maddened look appears in his eyes!', '', 10425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlemaster', 'Battlemaster', 10424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warsong Gulch', 'Warsong Gulch', 10423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alterac Valley', 'Alterac Valley', 10422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which battleground are you interested in?', 'Which battleground are you interested in?', 10421, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Silverwing Sentinels can use all the help they can get in their fight against the Warsong Outriders. $n, go to Stormwind Keep and speak with Elfarran if you wish to assist them.', 'The Silverwing Sentinels can use all the help they can get in their fight against the Warsong Outriders. $n, go to Stormwind Keep and speak with Elfarran if you wish to assist them.', 10420, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed, Silverwing Hold is in need of your assistance. Speak with Elfarran in the audience chamber at Stormwind Keep.', 'Indeed, Silverwing Hold is in need of your assistance. Speak with Elfarran in the audience chamber at Stormwind Keep.', 10419, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I wish I could join you $n. Head over to Stormwind Keep. You\'ll find Thelman Slatefist in the King\'s audience chamber. He will aid you in getting to Alterac Valley.', 'And I wish I could join you $n. Head over to Stormwind Keep. You\'ll find Thelman Slatefist in the King\'s audience chamber. He will aid you in getting to Alterac Valley.', 10418, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then it is Thelman Slatefist that you wish to speak to. You can find him in the presence of the King at Stormwind Keep.', 'Then it is Thelman Slatefist that you wish to speak to. You can find him in the presence of the King at Stormwind Keep.', 10417, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warsong Gulch', 'Warsong Gulch', 10416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alterac Valley', 'Alterac Valley', 10415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, and which battleground be ye looking for?', 'Aye, and which battleground be ye looking for?', 10414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any chance to fight against the Horde, especially orcs, is a good time if you ask me. You\'ll find plenty of battle in Warsong Gulch, that you will. Head on over to the Hall of Arms and speak with Lylandris. She\'ll set you on your way.', 'Any chance to fight against the Horde, especially orcs, is a good time if you ask me. You\'ll find plenty of battle in Warsong Gulch, that you will. Head on over to the Hall of Arms and speak with Lylandris. She\'ll set you on your way.', 10413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warsong Gulch you say? Well then, you\'ll be wanting to speak with fair Lylandris over in the Hall of Arms.', 'Warsong Gulch you say? Well then, you\'ll be wanting to speak with fair Lylandris over in the Hall of Arms.', 10412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlemaster', 'Battlemaster', 10411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warsong Gulch', 'Warsong Gulch', 10410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alterac Valley', 'Alterac Valley', 10409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What battleground you want?', 'What battleground you want?', 10408, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elves in Warsong Gulch make crunchy sound. You crunch them good. Talk to Kurden Bloodclaw in Royal Quarter.', 'Elves in Warsong Gulch make crunchy sound. You crunch them good. Talk to Kurden Bloodclaw in Royal Quarter.', 10407, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think him in Royal Quarter. Kurden Bloodclaw is little orc.', 'Think him in Royal Quarter. Kurden Bloodclaw is little orc.', 10406, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Him name is Grizzle Halfmane. He in Royal Quarter with Banshee Queen and Dread Lord.', 'Him name is Grizzle Halfmane. He in Royal Quarter with Banshee Queen and Dread Lord.', 10405, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It cold there! You go in Royal Quarter, talk to Grizzle Halfmane.', 'It cold there! You go in Royal Quarter, talk to Grizzle Halfmane.', 10404, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlemaster', 'Battlemaster', 10403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warsong Gulch', 'Warsong Gulch', 10402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alterac Valley', 'Alterac Valley', 10401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And to which battleground do you wish to journey?', 'And to which battleground do you wish to journey?', 10400, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such needless strife, but if the elves of Silverwing Hold will not speak to us in peace, then what alternative do they leave us? Seek out the aid of Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise to get to Warsong Gulch.', 'Such needless strife, but if the elves of Silverwing Hold will not speak to us in peace, then what alternative do they leave us? Seek out the aid of Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise to get to Warsong Gulch.', 10399, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise stands ready to help you get to Warsong Gulch.', 'Kergul Bloodaxe on the Hunter Rise stands ready to help you get to Warsong Gulch.', 10398, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is one that I know of here in Thunder Bluff that can aid you in your journey to Alterac Valley. On the Hunter Rise look for Taim Ragetotem. May you find what you are looking for $n.', 'There is one that I know of here in Thunder Bluff that can aid you in your journey to Alterac Valley. On the Hunter Rise look for Taim Ragetotem. May you find what you are looking for $n.', 10396, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then it is to Taim Ragetotem that you must speak. Seek him out on the Hunter Rise.', 'Then it is to Taim Ragetotem that you must speak. Seek him out on the Hunter Rise.', 10395, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warsong Gulch', 'Warsong Gulch', 10394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alterac Valley', 'Alterac Valley', 10393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which battleground do you seek your glory in?', 'Which battleground do you seek your glory in?', 10392, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Silverwing Sentinels are hardly what I would call honorable opponents. But if you are intent upon their slaughter $c, then seek out Brakgul Deathbringer in the Hall of the Brave.', 'The Silverwing Sentinels are hardly what I would call honorable opponents. But if you are intent upon their slaughter $c, then seek out Brakgul Deathbringer in the Hall of the Brave.', 10391, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must eliminate the elves and their cowardly Alliance from Warsong Gulch. Go to the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor and speak with Brakgul Deathbringer if you have what it takes to aid the Horde.', 'We must eliminate the elves and their cowardly Alliance from Warsong Gulch. Go to the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor and speak with Brakgul Deathbringer if you have what it takes to aid the Horde.', 10390, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warsong Gulch', 'Warsong Gulch', 10389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Alterac Valley', 'Alterac Valley', 10388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are several battlegrounds from which to choose.  To which battlemaster shall I send you?', 10387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Stormpike Guard is in need of your assistance in the fight against the Frostwolf Clan, $n. Speak to Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior\'s Terrace and he will help you find your way to Alterac Valley. Elune be praised!', 10386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know just the one that you speak of $c. You must seek out Brogun Stoneshield on the Warrior\'s Terrace.', 10385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have lost the talisman and require a new one, Al\'tabim.', 'I have lost the talisman and require a new one, Al\'tabim.', 10384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To win this war, we can\'t sit idle and let the tides sweep us over.  We must strike, hard and fast, or Arathi will never again be ours.', 10383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The League of Arathor has sworn to retake Arathi for humans of Stromgarde and the Alliance.  It is a battle hard fought, but a battle worth fighting.', '', 10382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Al\'tabim the All-Seeing - an envoy of King Rastakhan.$B$BMy dealings are with priests, mages, and warlocks.', '', 10381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have lost my talisman and require a new one, Jin\'rokh.', 'I have lost my talisman and require a new one, Jin\'rokh.', 10380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Jin\'rokh the Breaker, envoy of Mugamba: Fist of Rastakhan!$B$BMy dealings are with warriors and heathens.', '', 10379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll never fall for that, fool! If you want a battle, it will be on my terms and in my lair.', '', 10378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek to draw the General of the Frostwolf legion out from his fortress? PREPOSTEROUS!', '', 10377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormpike weaklings, face me in my fortress - if you dare!', '', 10376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Filthy Frostwolf cowards! If you want a fight, you\'ll have to come to me!', 10375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t ya try again without yer cheap tactics, pansies! Or are you too chicken???', '', 10374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never get me out of me bunker, heathens!', '', 10373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('World of Warcraft and Coca-Cola (R) have teamed up to bring you the iCoke-World of Warcraft Summer Promotion.  Look for codes under the caps of specially marked bottles of Coca-Cola.  Then return here and enter the code to win a virtual item.', 'World of Warcraft and Coca-Cola (R) have teamed up to bring you the iCoke-World of Warcraft Summer Promotion.  Look for codes under the caps of specially marked bottles of Coca-Cola.  Then return here and enter the code to win a virtual item.', 10372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the iCoke promotion.', 'Tell me about the iCoke promotion.', 10371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s emits a deafening shriek!', 10370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I command you to rain fire down upon these invaders!', 10369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 10368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How I yearn to join you in glorious battle, but instead I am stuck here on duty. Go to the Hall of the Brave in Orgrimmar\'s Valley of Honor and speak to Kartra Bloodsnarl. She will help you get to Alterac Valley. Make us proud $n!', 'How I yearn to join you in glorious battle, but instead I am stuck here on duty. Go to the Hall of the Brave in Orgrimmar\'s Valley of Honor and speak to Kartra Bloodsnarl. She will help you get to Alterac Valley. Make us proud $n!', 10367, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are going to Alterac Valley then go speak to Kartra Bloodsnarl. You will find her inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor.', 'If you are going to Alterac Valley then go speak to Kartra Bloodsnarl. You will find her inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor.', 10366, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlemaster', 'Battlemaster', 10365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Alterac Valley, I have fine memories I tell ya.  <sigh>  Well, I cannot join ya, but do me proud just the same!  To get there you\'ll be wanting to speak with Glordrum Steelbeard at the Hall of Arms here in Ironforge.', 'Ah, Alterac Valley, I have fine memories I tell ya.  <sigh>  Well, I cannot join ya, but do me proud just the same!  To get there you\'ll be wanting to speak with Glordrum Steelbeard at the Hall of Arms here in Ironforge.', 10364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So $g lad : lass;, you think you have what it takes to defend the Alliance against the Horde in Alterac Valley?  Very well then, you will want to speak with our very own Glordrum Steelbeard here in Ironforge.  You\'ll find him strategizing over the war table in the Hall of Arms.', 'So $g lad : lass;, you think you have what it takes to defend the Alliance against the Horde in Alterac Valley?  Very well then, you will want to speak with our very own Glordrum Steelbeard here in Ironforge.  You\'ll find him strategizing over the war table in the Hall of Arms.', 10363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlemaster', 'Battlemaster', 10362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is no light endeavor upon which you embark $n.  To get to Warsong Gulch you will want to speak to Aethalas, the Battlemaster of the Silverwing Sentinels.  She will guide your way.  Blessings of the Goddess be with you!', 10361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune be praised!  You seek out our Warsong Gulch Battlemaster?  Her name is Aethalas, and she stands ready to greet you near the warrior trainers.', 10360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlemaster', 'Battlemaster', 10359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drek\'Thar, I\'m coming for you!', '', 10358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Senior Wing Commander Vipore, launching. Pray for a swift death, Frostwolf.', '', 10357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m coming Frostwolf, and this time you\'re gonna feel the flames!', '', 10356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to go to the battleground.', 'I would like to go to the battleground.', 10355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings $c.  Do you wish to aid the Silverwing Sentinels in their fight at Warsong Gulch?', 10354, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tactical suppression fire, Vipore. Lay it on thick.', 'Tactical suppression fire, Vipore. Lay it on thick.', 10353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make the call, Commander. I\'ll tear the bottom half of their base apart.', '', 10352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want a surgical strike, Slidore. Carpet the road with fire!', 'I want a surgical strike, Slidore. Carpet the road with fire!', 10351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll patrol the pass leading up to Frostwolf Keep. Just give me the word and I\'ll take flight, Commander.', '', 10350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the base. We\'ll be sieging it from the ground.', 'Take the base. We\'ll be sieging it from the ground.', 10349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to fly, Commander. Just give the word and I\'ll be on their base like trogg on rock.', '', 10348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming aerial support to Dun Baldar! Stormpike bow down!', '', 10347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you feel it, Mulv? The need? You have to want it before I can give you the command. Who am I kidding. Get out there!', 'Do you feel it, Mulv? The need? You have to want it before I can give you the command. Who am I kidding. Get out there!', 10346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, sir! Just give the word and I will rain down hellfire upon their base!', '', 10345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me at \'em, $n! Just give the word and I\'ll mount up and attack their bridge!', 10344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jeztor lives! Time to light up the Valley sky, Commander.', 'Jeztor lives! Time to light up the Valley sky, Commander.', 10343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jeztor\'s coming for you, Stormpike!', 10342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come, Guse. You fly again!', 'The time has come, Guse. You fly again!', 10341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Awaiting orders!', 10340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Guse is joining the battle! Time to take out the Stormpike filth!', 10339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the iCoke-WOW summer promotion.$B$BDear $n, the halo of fortune goddess is shining on you.  Obey to the order of god; you\'ll get a special and mystery present.  Now, the gate of Azeroth is open for you.  A great adventure will begin soon.  Are you ready?$B$BMay the honor be with you!', 'Welcome to the iCoke-WOW summer promotion.$B$BDear $n, the halo of fortune goddess is shining on you.  Obey to the order of god; you\'ll get a special and mystery present.  Now, the gate of Azeroth is open for you.  A great adventure will begin soon.  Are you ready?$B$BMay the honor be with you!', 10338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to enter my e-coupon code to win the virtual item.', 'I would like to enter my e-coupon code to win the virtual item.', 10337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits on the corpse of the fallen zealot.', '', 10336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s drops his shoulders and exposes his neck.', '', 10335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike me down. I shall be reborn... Even more powerful...', '', 10334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are your Gods now? WHERE, SERVITOR?', '', 10333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s uses his index finger to make a cutting motion across his neck.', '', 10332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it? Call out to them, Servitor.', '', 10331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Primal Gods? Impossible!', '', 10330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s smirks.', '', 10329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And... do you expect to defeat the Primal Gods?', '', 10328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It shall NEVER happen. We are legion. We are united. Where are your heroes? Vol\'jin sits in sanctuary at the side of the young Warchief, unaware. Zul\'jin missing, probably dead.', '', 10327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The young races? The infants? Humans? Orcs? Dwarves? You expect to defeat the Hakkari? To destroy a GOD?', '', 10326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Times have changed. The young races will join us. You will never succeed.', '', 10325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bloodscalp, Sandfury, Skullsplitter, Vilebranch and Witherbark. They all pledge their allegiance to Jin - their souls to Hakkar. You have lost.', '', 10324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, even those nations that you would have called allies have recoiled and joined forces with us... Yes, old one, do not look so surprised.', '', 10323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOOL! Do you purport to have even one-tenth of the power you held during the Uprising? The nations were united and still were nearly consumed by a shadow of Hakkar. You stand no chance.', '', 10322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs maniacally.', '', 10321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never allow it... We have banished him from our world before and we will banish him again.\n', '', 10320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yes, old one, Hakkar has returned. Soon the world shall crumble beneath his might. Consumed. Left in ruin...', 'Oh yes, old one, Hakkar has returned. Soon the world shall crumble beneath his might. Consumed. Left in ruin...', 10319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you really need to ask? Can you not feel him? Has the almighty King Rastakhan sent his Servitor and Hand here on a mission of diplomacy?', '', 10318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So Hakkar has returned?', '', 10317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How pathetic. I am infused with the power of the Soulflayer. I fear nothing but the wrath of the almighty Hakkar. I serve no one but my master, Jin.', '', 10316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 10315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could crush you with but a single motion. Do not anger me.', '', 10314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a fool, soon to forfeit his life. No?', '', 10313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know who I am, zealot?', '', 10312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I said KNEEL!', '', 10311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curious. A Servitor of Rastakhan that does not know the Hakkari do not converse in the old tongue?', '', 10310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel, heathen.', '', 10309, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move!', '', 10308, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away, Servitor.', '', 10307, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guard, Bring forth the prisoner. Place him in the Circle of Binding.', '', 10306, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What happened to our pigs?', 10305, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon child... very soon.', 10304, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When is pappa coming back from the fights in Warsong? It has been so long... ', '', 10303, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes right away momma! ', '', 10301, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mogg, get inside. It is not safe out there while your father is gone.', 10300, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaahhh... Another glorious victory for The Horde! ', '', 10299, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now go back home where you belong! ', '', 10298, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t get away from a warrior of The Horde! Take that! And that!', '', 10297, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take that you mangy Harpy! Hyaa!', '', 10296, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s one! For the Horde!', '', 10295, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now to find an unsuspecting Harpy!', '', 10294, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
