('Greetings young $c. It is here that your Warchief challenged Orgrim Doomhammer! Although it happened so many years ago, it is an image still fresh in my mind.', '', 10188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
