('More bread boy!', '', 10183, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have for sale?', 'What do you have for sale?', 10182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kiss me.', '', 10181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ribbit.', '', 10180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me the drinks!', 'Show me the drinks!', 10179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just in... another batch of Darkmoon Special Reserve.  Come get yours before they\'re all gone!', 10178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tips are always graciously accepted, friend.', 10177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t be shy, buy a round for everyone!', 10176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tasty drinks for sale!  Quench your thirst on some of the Darkmoon Faire\'s finest brews!', 10175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are dangerous times, $r.  An ancient evil is rising, and it cares not if you\'re Horde or Alliance.', '', 10174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must ensure the survival of this camp at all costs, $c!  Our enemies must not be given any quarter, for they would surely give us none were we to need it.', '', 10173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hears her owner\'s voice!', '', 10172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jubjub?  Where are you, Jubjub?  Oh no!  Where did you go this time!', 10171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi Jubjub.  I missed you!', 10170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so happy that Jubjub returned!  I only hope that I don\'t run out of Dark Iron ale soon, or I fear my pet frog might once again escape!', 10169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t find my pet frog, Jubjub.  She loves Dark Iron Ale, it\'s all she ever drinks, but can be so hard to get!  Now I\'m out... and Jubjub must have run away to find more!$B$BI wish she would come back...', 10168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s guzzles down the ale!', '', 10167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello again, $n!  It\'s good to see you!  Our Darkmoon Faire is quite a show, don\'t you think?$B$BThere is quite a lot to see!  So look!  Look, and perhaps, one day, even more will be revealed to you...', '', 10166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 2, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('$n, you return!  The spirits of my last meal said you would come see me and that we would discuss business.$B$BWere they correct?', '', 10165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('Hello!  And welcome!  I\'m afraid my booth is not open... many repairs are needed...$B$BBut I am still bound by blood oath to put a smile on your face.  So please, smile, or I must cut off my hand and consume no living flesh until it regenerates...', '', 10164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('Hello again, $n.  Did you think I would forget you?$B$BI knew you would not.  You are a clever $c who knows a person with perfect memory when $ghe:she; sees him.', '', 10163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.  I am Chronos - He Who Never Forgets.  My memory is without flaw, and exact to the most minor detail.$B$BTrust me.', '', 10162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, it\'s good to see you again!  Are you having fun at the Faire?$B$BWant to arm wrestle?  No, of course not... you want to keep your arm!', 10161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 70, 153, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('We\'re back and better than ever!  It\'s the Darkmoon Faire friend, and it\'s your lucky day!  Sparing no expense, we\'ve gathered wonders and treats from around the world for your delight.  Whether you\'re young or old, rich or poor, the Darkmoon Faire has it all!  Be sure to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate, and choose from several exotic and wondrous prizes!', '', 10160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas... I am sorry to say I cannot currently give you your fortune, as you have recently received a fortune reading from me.$B$BReturn to me several hours from when you first received your fortune.  The forces of Fate will have properly recalibrated themselves, and I will be able to see into your future.', '', 10159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come one, come all!  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!  Do you crave adventure?  Do you seek exotic and mysterious treasures?  Then look no further!  You, my friend, have come to the right place!  Dive right in and take part in all that the Faire has to offer!  We\'ll be at this location all week, so be sure to tell your friends and loved ones!', '', 10158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings friends, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!$B$BPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Ride the rides and see the sights!  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!', '', 10157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome one and all to the greatest show on all of Azeroth... the Darkmoon Faire!  Adventure and excitement await, don\'t be shy!  Mysteries and prizes for both the young and the old are here for the taking.  And be sure to speak with the professor about any Darkmoon Cards that you have come across during your travels!', '', 10156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the world!  We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end!  Don\'t forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate!  All it takes is five or more and you\'re on your way to the most wondrous prizes on all of Azeroth.  Everybody is a winner!', '', 10155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come one, come all.  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!  Don\'t be shy.  Step right up to Lhara and buy yourself an exotic artifact from far off lands.  If you\'re one of the lucky few who have found Darkmoon Cards, have a word with Professor Paleo.  Hungry?  Thirsty?  You\'re in luck!  Refreshments are available right here from Sylannia and Stamp.  I recommend the Darkmoon Special Reserve to wash down some Red Hot Wings.  And if the future is what you seek, then run, don\'t walk, to speak with Sayge.', '', 10154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone enjoying themselves so far?  That\'s great!  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest show on all of Azeroth!  Make sure that you speak with Yebb and his friends here while you\'re taking in Neblegear\'s Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre.', '', 10153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prizes!  Get your prizes right here!  Get over here and turn in your Darkmoon Prize Tickets for valuable prizes!', '', 10152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Five tickets or five hundred, it doesn\'t matter friend, everybody is a winner!', '', 10151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mysterious prizes await the adventurous.  Step right up, step right up!', '', 10150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tickets! Redeem your Darkmoon Prize Tickets here!  Wondrous and exotic prizes are waiting for you!', '', 10149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frogs and leather balls for sale!', '', 10148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back here!', '', 10147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s getting away!', '', 10146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, someone help me catch this thing!', '', 10145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you any idea what I go through to bring these incomparable valuables to sell?  Come see them all for yourself!', 10144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come and take a look at my wares while you still can.  We\'re here all week, and then we\'re off to some far off land.', 10143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Darkmoon Faire Cards?  See the Professor here for those.', 10142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every item that I have for sale I acquired myself.  You have my personal guarantee of authenticity.', 10141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you any Darkmoon Faire cards?  Come speak with me to learn more about them if you dare!', '', 10140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkmoon decks! Turn them in here!', '', 10139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come speak with me if you have any Darkmoon Faire Cards.', '', 10138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a completed Darkmoon deck? Turn it in here!', '', 10137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For a limited time only, crunchy frog available exclusively here at the Darkmoon Faire.', '', 10136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got money and we\'ve got food.  What are you waiting for?!', '', 10135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkmoon Dogs fresh off the grill.  Come and get \'em while they\'re hot!', '', 10134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up!  Get your red hot wings right here!', '', 10133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You there!  Yes you!  You look thirsty.  Get over here, I have just what you need!', 10132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just in... another batch of Darkmoon Special Reserve.  Come get yours before they\'re all gone!', 10131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huzzah for the tipper!  Step right up and get your delicious, cold drinks right here!', 10130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cheap beer!  Get your cheap beer right here!', 10129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The longer you wait, the less future you have for me to foretell.', '', 10128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Fear not!  All fortunes can be discerned for those who know the way.', '', 10127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come speak with me, and what once was cloudy shall become crystal clear.', '', 10126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me and see what the future holds for you!', '', 10125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi $n!  Thanks for all the help you\'ve given me!  Right now I don\'t need anything, but who knows what the future will bring?$B$BEnjoy yourself, and remember to tell your friends about the Darkmoon Faire!', 10124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c!$B$BMy name is Kerri Hicks and I\'d shake your hand but I\'m afraid I\'d break it, because I\'m the strongest woman alive!', 10123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s fixates on $n.', '%s fixates on $n.', 10122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event on all of Azeroth!', 'The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event on all of Azeroth!', 10121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget to buy refreshments and souvenirs!', 'Don\'t forget to buy refreshments and souvenirs!', 10120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Having a good time?', 'Having a good time?', 10119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure are a lot of litter bugs around here.', 'Sure are a lot of litter bugs around here.', 10118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello friend.', 'Hello friend.', 10117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('asdasd', '', 10116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Darkmoon Faire opens, it will be located in Mulgore.  We\'ll be pitching our tents just southwest of Thunder Bluff!', '', 10115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in the golden plains of Mulgore, just southwest of Thunder Bluff.  Don\'t miss it!', '', 10114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Darkmoon Faire is open, it will be located in Elwynn Forest.  We\'ll be pitching our tents just south of Goldshire!', '', 10113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in Elwynn Forest, just south of Goldshire.  Don\'t miss it!', '', 10112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next location of the Darkmoon Faire has not been finalized yet, but when it is you and I will be the first to know!', '', 10111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire has already arrived, you say?  Where is it located?', 'The Darkmoon Faire has already arrived, you say?  Where is it located?', 10110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Darkmoon Faire arrives, where will it be located?', 'When the Darkmoon Faire arrives, where will it be located?', 10109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boys and girls - children of all ages - the Darkmoon Faire has arrived!  Huzzah!', '', 10108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire will only be live for a short time before the curtains are drawn closed.  Be sure to visit it today!', '', 10107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire has come to town!  Be sure to experience the most thrilling show you\'ll ever see!', '', 10106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s here!  The Darkmoon Faire is now open for business!  Be sure to see the most exciting show on all of Azeroth!', '', 10105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boys and girls - children of all ages - the Darkmoon Faire has arrived!  Huzzah!', '', 10104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire will only be live for a short time before the curtains are drawn closed.  Be sure to visit it today!', '', 10103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire has come to town!  Be sure to experience the most thrilling show you\'ll ever see!', '', 10102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s here!  The Darkmoon Faire is now open for business!  Be sure to see the most exciting show on all of Azeroth!', '', 10101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be sure to catch all the amazing sights and wonders of the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town!', '', 10100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up and hear about the most amazing spectacle in all of Azeroth - the Darkmoon Faire!  Huzzah!', '', 10099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire is coming!  There is fun for children of ALL ages!  Come one, come all!', '', 10098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire is coming to town!  Don\'t miss it!', '', 10097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up and hear about the most amazing spectacle in all of Azeroth - the Darkmoon Faire!  Huzzah!', '', 10096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire is coming!  There is fun for children of ALL ages!  Come one, come all!', '', 10095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be sure to catch all the amazing sights and wonders of the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town!', '', 10094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire is coming to town!  Don\'t miss it!', '', 10093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here is your fortune, $n.  May it serve you well.', '', 10092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d love to get one of those written fortunes you mentioned!  I\'ve got the space in my inventory for it.', 'I\'d love to get one of those written fortunes you mentioned!  I\'ve got the space in my inventory for it.', 10091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fortune is cast, $c.  For the next few hours, you will find your spirit in tune with your true nature.  Be careful, as your fortune - and your fate - are never as clear as you might think them to be.$B$BIf you would like a small glimpse of something to ponder in your future, by all means let me know.  I\'d be happy to give you a written fortune, provided you have room in your inventory.  It is one drawn from the insight you have shown in answering my questions.', '', 10090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would remain silent about the kill and allow the knight to claim the reward to aid his family.', 'I would remain silent about the kill and allow the knight to claim the reward to aid his family.', 10089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would show my liege the beast\'s ear and claim the beast\'s death as my own - after all, I did slay it.  I would then offer some of the reward to the destitute knight to help his family.', 'I would show my liege the beast\'s ear and claim the beast\'s death as my own - after all, I did slay it.  I would then offer some of the reward to the destitute knight to help his family.', 10088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would show my liege the beast\'s ear and claim the beast\'s death as my own, taking the reward for my own use.  It is wrong to claim a deed as your own that someone else in fact did.', 'I would show my liege the beast\'s ear and claim the beast\'s death as my own, taking the reward for my own use.  It is wrong to claim a deed as your own that someone else in fact did.', 10087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your next choice awaits.$B$BYou alone have defeated a terrible beast that has been ravaging the countryside, taking its ear as a trophy.  You later learn that your liege had offered a reward for the beast\'s death, and that a kind but destitute knight who you know is trying to support a family by meager means claims the beast\'s kill as his own.  You have no real need for money yourself, but you know that the destitute knight is lying for his own personal gain.$B$BMake your choice.', '', 10086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would create some surreptitious means to keep my brother out of the order.  I can keep him out without him being any bit wiser, thereby saving our familial bonds.', 'I would create some surreptitious means to keep my brother out of the order.  I can keep him out without him being any bit wiser, thereby saving our familial bonds.', 10085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would speak for my brother joining the order, potentially risking the safety of the order.  I could help him with the order\'s regimens, and I\'d have faith in his ability to adapt and learn.', 'I would speak for my brother joining the order, potentially risking the safety of the order.  I could help him with the order\'s regimens, and I\'d have faith in his ability to adapt and learn.', 10084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would speak against my brother joining the order, rushing a permanent breach in our relationship.  He would be a danger to himself and those around him, and that is too great a risk hoping he would improve over time.', 'I would speak against my brother joining the order, rushing a permanent breach in our relationship.  He would be a danger to himself and those around him, and that is too great a risk hoping he would improve over time.', 10083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your next choice awaits.$B$BYour brother seeks to join the ranks of the prestigious military order you are already a part of.  While you are sure of his commitment and loyalty, his talent and ability to perform the arduous tasks of the order is what you question.  While you are not certain he will be able to rise to the challenge of the order - putting you and others in danger - you are certain that your word alone would allow him in or keep him out.$B$BMake your choice.', '', 10082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I quietly ignore the insult.  I will not tell my liege, as I am to secure peace at all costs.  It\'s only an insult - not a declaration of war.', 'I quietly ignore the insult.  I will not tell my liege, as I am to secure peace at all costs.  It\'s only an insult - not a declaration of war.', 10081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not-so-quietly ignore the insult, hoping to instill a fear in the ruler that he may have gaffed.  I then inform my liege of the insult when I return.', 'I not-so-quietly ignore the insult, hoping to instill a fear in the ruler that he may have gaffed.  I then inform my liege of the insult when I return.', 10080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I confront the ruler on his malicious behavior, upholding my liege\'s honor at the risk of any future diplomacy.', 'I confront the ruler on his malicious behavior, upholding my liege\'s honor at the risk of any future diplomacy.', 10079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your next choice awaits.$B$BYou are on a diplomatic mission for your liege to a cruel country that is currently at war with yours.  The war has been costly on both sides.  Your mission is to secure a peace that is honorable to both peoples.$B$BAt a diplomatic dinner, you overhear the ruler of the opposing land viciously insult your benevolent liege.  You are fairly certain the ruler meant to say it out of your earshot, but nonetheless he has besmirched your liege\'s honor.$B$BMake your choice.', '', 10078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I risk my own life and free him so that he may prove his innocence.  If I can, I\'ll help him in any way.', 'I risk my own life and free him so that he may prove his innocence.  If I can, I\'ll help him in any way.', 10077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I execute him as per my liege\'s instructions, but doing so in as painless of a way as possible.  Justice must be served, but I can show some compassion.', 'I execute him as per my liege\'s instructions, but doing so in as painless of a way as possible.  Justice must be served, but I can show some compassion.', 10076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I execute him as per my liege\'s instructions, and do it in such a manner that he suffers painfully before he dies as retribution for his crimes against my people.', 'I execute him as per my liege\'s instructions, and do it in such a manner that he suffers painfully before he dies as retribution for his crimes against my people.', 10075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you manage to complete a deck of warlords cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of heroism.   This card will occasionally heal you while you are engaged in melee combat.', '', 10074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Warlords Deck.', 'Tell me about the Warlords Deck.', 10073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you manage to complete a deck of elementals cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the maelstrom.   This card will occasionally impact an enemy you are fighting with for heavy damage.', '', 10072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Elementals Deck.', 'Tell me about the Elementals Deck.', 10071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you manage to complete a deck of portals cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the twisting nether.   This card will occasionally pull your spirit back into your body after death and restore you.', '', 10070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Portals Deck.', 'Tell me about the Portals Deck.', 10069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you manage to complete a deck of beasts cards you will be rewarded with a greater darkmoon card of the blue dragon.   This is very useful in restoring of magical energies.', '', 10068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Beasts Deck.', 'Tell me about the Beasts Deck.', 10067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you like something more to eat sir?', '', 10066, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have seeded darkmoon cards around the world to see if any worthy individuals could complete a set of any of the eight suits.  If you manage to collect all eight cards of one of the suits we will reward you with one of the greater darkmoon cards that functions as a powerful trinket as well as a link to the Darkmoon Faire.', '', 10065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about these Darkmoon Cards.', 'Tell me more about these Darkmoon Cards.', 10064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the faire young one!   We have collected wonders from all over the world for your perusal.   Oh and please let me know if you manage to collect a set of the lesser darkmoon cards, as the master... I mean I would be keenly interested in them.', '', 10062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Won\'t be long now until the Darkmoon Faire opens.  Come back later and check to see if we\'re done.', 'Won\'t be long now until the Darkmoon Faire opens.  Come back later and check to see if we\'re done.', 10061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right friend!  The Darkmoon Faire is going to be right here.  Just as soon as I unload those huge wagons, put up all the tents, erect the zoo and pour the drinks.  Make sure you come back!', 'That\'s right friend!  The Darkmoon Faire is going to be right here.  Just as soon as I unload those huge wagons, put up all the tents, erect the zoo and pour the drinks.  Make sure you come back!', 10060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faire\'s a coming!', 'Faire\'s a coming!', 10059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see I\'ve got work to do here?', 'Can\'t you see I\'ve got work to do here?', 10058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is the time to attack!  For the Horde!', '', 10057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take heart, Alliance!  Throw these villains from Alterac Valley!', 10056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!  Your kind has no place in Alterac Valley!', '', 10055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Begone, uncouth scum!  The Alliance shall prevail in Alterac Valley!', 10054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your next choice awaits.$B$BYou are the sworn executioner for your liege.  A man has been sent to you for execution as a traitor of the liege and your people.  You know this individual as a close, virtuous friend who mysteriously vanished one day.  You also know that the man\'s crimes for which he was convicted supposedly caused the deaths of many innocent civilians.  Upon seeing you he begs for his life, claiming he was framed by a higher authority.$B$BMake your choice.', '', 10053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I allow the man to take enough corn to feed his family for a couple of days, encouraging him to leave the land.', 'I allow the man to take enough corn to feed his family for a couple of days, encouraging him to leave the land.', 10052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I confiscate the corn he has stolen, warn him that stealing is a path towards doom and destruction, but I let him go to return to his family.', 'I confiscate the corn he has stolen, warn him that stealing is a path towards doom and destruction, but I let him go to return to his family.', 10051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I turn over the man to my liege for punishment, as he has broken the law of the land and it is my sworn duty to enforce it.', 'I turn over the man to my liege for punishment, as he has broken the law of the land and it is my sworn duty to enforce it.', 10050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I slay the man on the spot as my liege would expect me to do, as he is nothing more than a thief and a liar.', 'I slay the man on the spot as my liege would expect me to do, as he is nothing more than a thief and a liar.', 10049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well then...$B$BYou have been tasked by your liege to guard his fields of corn from poachers and thieves.  One night on patrol, you stumble across a haggard man in thread-bare clothing stealing corn from the field.  You quickly confront him, and he immediately begs for his life.  He claims he is stealing the corn to feed his family since the lord of the land - your liege - demands too much in taxes.  Your liege is indeed known for his harsh taxes throughout the land.$B$BMake your choice.', '', 10048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to discover where my fortune lies!', 'I am ready to discover where my fortune lies!', 10047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have long known you\'d seek me out, $n.$B$BEvery sentient being in this world is driven by the choices they make.  Choices beget further choices, and these in turn make someone who they are.  This is where your fortune is drawn from - who you are, and the choices you make.$B$BAre you ready to discover where your fortune lies?', '', 10046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unlike most ogres, I do know what an outhouse is for - giving you a swirlie.  Now beat it.', '', 10045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lived in Dire Maul for a little bit.  That was fun.  Really.', '', 10044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a second head like I need to lose my first one.', '', 10043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mess with Silas, you mess with me.  Have a nice day.', '', 10042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In case it wasn\'t obvious, I\'m not here for customer relations.', '', 10041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re trying to be friendly, save your breath.  Better yet, just stop breathing all together.', '', 10040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ain\'t a ride, clem.  Beat it.', '', 10039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along, rube.', '', 10038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ticket redemption here!  Get your tickets turned into prizes!  Step right up!', '', 10037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not always about money, clem!  While we receive generous donations - some extremely substantial - our traveling troupe of performers is fueled creatively by a need to brighten this war-torn world.  Don\'t worry about us, but instead let us worry about how to best entertain you.', '', 10036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silas, why is most everything at the faire free?  How do you make a profit?', 'Silas, why is most everything at the faire free?  How do you make a profit?', 10035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back to the greatest show on Azeroth, my friend!  It is truly a delight to see you once again.$B$BPlease, step right up and once more take in all we have to offer.  Be sure to check around, as we are always adding new and exciting things to the Darkmoon Faire!  Amaze at wonders old and new that we have uncovered!  We continue to spare no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!', '', 10034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings my friend, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!$B$BPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer.  Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world!  We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!', '', 10033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treat the wind rider well as it takes you to your destination.  May your ancestors watch over you $n.', '', 10032, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  Wherever you decide to travel, may she watch over you.', '', 10031, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though the Crossroads seems to be the center of activity in The Barrens, I prefer the quietude of Camp Taurajo.  Where shall I send you?', '', 10030, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I send you today $c?', '', 10029, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome!  Welcome to Yebb Neblegear\'s Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre - a Trove of Living Legends and Mythical Oddities!  Enjoy your visit, friend!$B$BBut be mindful of what you touch!  These exhibits hold artifacts and beasts both dire and divine!  They might burn the wayward hand of an over-curious onlooker...', '', 10028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Hir\'eek, grant me wings of vengeance!', 10027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the coils of hate unfurl!', '', 10026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snivvle is here!  Snivvle claims the Coldtooth mine!', '', 10025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here!  And the Irondeep Mine is... MINE!', '', 10024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
