('The Alliance Flag has returned to its base!', '', 10022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What goods have I earned the right to purchase for use in Warsong Gulch?', 'What goods have I earned the right to purchase for use in Warsong Gulch?', 10021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the blessings of the night be yours, friend!  I am Illiyana Moonblaze, and I am the main supplier for the Silverwing Sentinels here in Ashenvale.  As you improve your standing with the Sentinels, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services.', 10020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What goods have I earned the right to purchase for use in Warsong Gulch?', 'What goods have I earned the right to purchase for use in Warsong Gulch?', 10019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zug zug, my friend!  I am Kelm Hargunth, the main supplier for the Warsong Outriders.  As you improve your standing with the Outriders, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services.', '', 10018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jobs/Lost & Found/Wanted:', '', 10017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
