('Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make a Wild Leather Helmet again?', 'Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make a Wild Leather Helmet again?', 9834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make Wild Leather Leggings again?', 'Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make Wild Leather Leggings again?', 9833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make Wild Leather Shoulders again?', 'Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make Wild Leather Shoulders again?', 9832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make a Wild Leather Vest again?', 'Hey Pratt - can you teach me how to make a Wild Leather Vest again?', 9831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
