('', 'Thorium Brotherhood or not, if one of them Dark Iron gets near to me they\'ll taste my mattock up the side of their head!  Now, where can I send ya $G lad : lass;?', 9828, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beware!  The $r $n attacks us at Winterax Hold!', 9827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear... if Quint tries to plant one more fishing grub on me, I\'m going to hack down his tree with my not-so-rusty sword.', '', 9826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done all that I\'ve asked you to do, $n. There\'s really nothing more here for you. If you are interested in continuing your career as an agent of the Thorium Brotherhood, speak with Lokhtos Darkbargainer at the Grim Guzzler in Blackrock Depths.$B$BFarewell!', '', 9825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As acting Taskmaster of this here compound, it is my duty to make sure that there is a certain level of tedium involved with all forms of business, work, rest, and relaxation that may take place here.$B$BIf you find anything that you are asked to do to be too easy and hassle free, report to me immediately.', '', 9824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that the Frostwolf general is defeated, we can spare some troops to guard the entrance to Winterax Hold.$B$BBut stay vigilant!  We must always be on the lookout for Horde interlopers..', 9823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that the Stormpike general is defeated, we can spare a few troops to guard Winterax Hold.  But we must be ever vigilant, $c, for the Alliance will return.$B$BWhen you find them skulking about, teach them another lesson!', 'Now that the Stormpike general is defeated, we can spare a few troops to guard Winterax Hold.  But we must be ever vigilant, $c, for the Alliance will return.$B$BWhen you find them skulking about, teach them another lesson!', 9822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Lolo doesn\'t wanna spill any o\' his precious ale or get his lil\' dress dirty, I\'m called in. Yep. Ol\' Hansel is the dwarf they use to mete out a lil\' bit o\' justice an\' a whole lotta pain.', '', 9821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well hello again, $n!  I don\'t know how much longer I\'m going to keep on trying to set up a shop out in the middle of nowhere.  Still, since you\'ve helped me out in the past, I\'ll show you some stuff you may find interesting!', '', 9820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burninate\'s the name, smithin\'s my game... and, erm... I sell a little food and water on the side. Care for some meat?', '', 9819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares.', 'I wish to browse your wares.', 9818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got anything interesting for sale, Zorbin?', 'Got anything interesting for sale, Zorbin?', 9817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, you! Random traveler! C\'mere and make some coin!', '', 9816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only a fool would remain in this battle. Farewell, coward.', 'Only a fool would remain in this battle. Farewell, coward.', 9815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Generic Text', 'Generic Text!', 9814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flee while you can mortal!', '', 9813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run if you like fools!  Your fate is sealed anyways!', '', 9812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We chose to leave the protection and comfort of the Depths to exploit... er, I mean... hrm, yes that\'s right, EXPLORE the world.', 9811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thieves! Scallywags! Rapscallions! Come face me gigantic pillas!', 9810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde Flag was returned to its base by $n!', '', 9809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance Flag was returned to its base by $n!', '', 9808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde Flag was picked up by $n!', '', 9807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde Flag was dropped by $n!', '', 9806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance Flag was dropped by $n!', '', 9805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance Flag was picked up by $n!', '', 9804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flags are now placed at their bases.', '', 9803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n captured the Alliance Flag!', '', 9802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n captured the Horde Flag!', '', 9801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll not let this act of madness go unpunished!', 'We\'ll not let this act of madness go unpunished!', 9800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our pillas! Someone has stolen our pillas!', 'Our pillas! Someone has stolen our pillas!', 9799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yesh, it\'sh true, I\'m blind as a bat! An\' drunk as a ... err, drunk as shomething that getsh drunk.$B$BI\'ll tell you what, $r. It\'sh the drink that keeps me shenses sharp. It\'sh common knowledge that when you lose a shense, yer other shenses become more alert. My drunk shense is incredible these days.', '', 9798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 33, 5, 10, 50, 100, 39653),
('A slippery tile causes you to lose your footing.', '', 9797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t interrupt me.', '', 9796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arr!   There be nothin I like to see better than folks fightin to the death in the arena.   If you be here at the right time maybe you can be one of them!', '', 9795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah...the heroes. You are persistent, aren\'t you? Your ally here attempted to match his power against mine - and paid the price. Now he shall serve me...by slaughtering you. ', '', 9794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s flinches as its skin shimmers.', '', 9793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merideth, could I have some more manna-enriched horse feed please?', 'Merideth, could I have some more manna-enriched horse feed please?', 9792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n.  How goes your delvings into the demonic and arcane?  Have you uncovered any dark secrets of late?', '', 9791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorzeeki tells me that you have brought him all that he needs for the Bell of Dethmoora, the Wheel of the Black March and the Doomsday Candle.$B$BWell done, $n!  You are almost ready to perform your ritual and bind a dreadsteed!', '', 9790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your preparations are complete.  All that now stands before you and your dreadsteed is the ritual for the Circle of Greater Summoning, and the binding of the dreadsteed\'s spirit...', '', 9789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To summon a Dreadsteed, you must first create a Circle of Greater Summoning.  A portal to Xoroth may only be created from within such a circle.$B$BThe Circle of Greater Summoning requires three powerful implements: a Bell of Dethmoora, a Wheel of the Black March and a Doomsday Candle.', '', 9788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul is mine, weakling.', '', 9787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is stricken by a virulent poison.', '', 9786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is immobilized.', '', 9785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH - this ends now!  You fools will be added to my bone collection!', '', 9784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s notes your cowardly battle tactics and flees from battle.', '', 9783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare challenge me? Prepare for an eternity of dread.', '', 9782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emerges from the darkness, drawn out by the divination scryer!', '', 9781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve come looking for the finest craftsmanship on this or any other continent in the world, then you\'ve come to the right place!$B$BGrimand Elmore, at your service!', '', 9780, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that should do it.  Come now, back to the shop to finish our business!', '', 9779, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s smiths the arcanite into place on the barding.', '', 9778, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s assembles the runecloth, herbs, and holy water to the barding.', '', 9777, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, good Paladin.  I\'ll have your barding done faster than I could down a Dwarven stout.  Mmmm... stout.', '', 9776, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s recoils in pain as the Judgment of Righteousness washes over it!', '', 9775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s recoils in pain as the Judgment of Justice washes over it!', '', 9774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s recoils in pain as the Judgment of Light washes over it!', '', 9773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall enjoy this, $c.', '', 9772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now... the final step!', '', 9771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, right!  Over here now...', '', 9770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, here we are!  Well let\'s get to work, shall we...?', '', 9769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is pulled back to Xoroth!', '', 9768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I shall leave before one of these beasts takes a liking to me!', '', 9766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual is already underway!', '', 9765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a killing frenzy!', '', 9764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s breaks free of its spectral bonds with a tremendous crash of thunder!', '', 9763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s is silenced by the venomous sting.', 9762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do I look like a fool, mortal? Because only a fool would remain here and do battle with you and all of your allies. Perhaps another time... Should you ever find the courage to back up your banter.', 9761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you wish, $c.', 9760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s laughs at your foolish request.', 9759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well, moving up in the world are we? You\'re looking for the Champions\' Hall, and you\'ll find it on the southeast end of Old Town. Good luck!', 'Well, well, moving up in the world are we? You\'re looking for the Champions\' Hall, and you\'ll find it on the southeast end of Old Town. Good luck!', 9758, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of a sudden you\'re a \'Defender of the Alliance\' are you?! Well, I suppose you\'ll be wanting to head to the Champions\' Hall now. It\'s over in Old Town.', 'All of a sudden you\'re a \'Defender of the Alliance\' are you?! Well, I suppose you\'ll be wanting to head to the Champions\' Hall now. It\'s over in Old Town.', 9757, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Officers\' Lounge', 'Officers\' Lounge', 9756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not fooled by your disguise, temptress. Your time to die has come.', 'I am not fooled by your disguise, temptress. Your time to die has come.', 9755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you are Klinfran the Crazed? Sad, I was expecting an actual challenge. Do you dare face me in your true form?', 'So you are Klinfran the Crazed? Sad, I was expecting an actual challenge. Do you dare face me in your true form?', 9754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A gnome? How pathetic. Face me, demon!', 'A gnome? How pathetic. Face me, demon!', 9753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want the Hall of Legends. It\'s high above the Valley of Strength on the west side.', 'You want the Hall of Legends. It\'s high above the Valley of Strength on the west side.', 9752, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you as Artorius the Doombringer. Show yourself, demon! Face me!', 'I know you as Artorius the Doombringer. Show yourself, demon! Face me!', 9751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for it high up on the west side of the Valley of Strength.', 'Look for it high up on the west side of the Valley of Strength.', 9750, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Officer\'s Lounge', 'Officer\'s Lounge', 9749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How wonderful to see another person in this remote region of the world. Come, walk with me. Let our bodies keep each other warm.', '', 9748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I come to Silithus every year around this time. The weather is phenomenal for my bunions.$B$BYou should take a stroll with me, friend. Enjoy the sights and what not.', '', 9747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lava? Pay no mind to all of that, friend. Look around you. Take in the joys that nature has to offer.', '', 9746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*GRRRR* *RUFF* *RUFF*', '', 9745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a wonderful day to be alive! Look at the beauty that surrounds you, friend. Enjoy what life has to give!', 9744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are mine, dreadsteed!  Your spirit is now bound to me!', 'You are mine, dreadsteed!  Your spirit is now bound to me!', 9743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m finished.  The parchment is made.  Now, return to Gorzeeki...', '', 9742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s no lie, traitor.  Banehollow wants your heart, and I\'m going to get it for him.', 'It\'s no lie, traitor.  Banehollow wants your heart, and I\'m going to get it for him.', 9741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?  But how?  No!  This is not possible!  I have been so careful... he could not know!$B$BYou lie!  You lie, and now you\'ll die for your deceit!', '', 9740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Ulathek.  He knows your secret.  He knows you plot with Lord Hel\'nurath of Xoroth.', 'No, Ulathek.  He knows your secret.  He knows you plot with Lord Hel\'nurath of Xoroth.', 9739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... A message from Banehollow?  What message is that?  Does he have need of his great advisor and servant, Ulathek?  Does he require my presence?', '', 9738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dreadlords?  Perhaps you mean Lord Banehollow.  He sends his regards, and has a message for you...', 'Dreadlords?  Perhaps you mean Lord Banehollow.  He sends his regards, and has a message for you...', 9737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gone!  I hold counsel with Dreadlords, and the matters we discuss are not your concern!', '', 9736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dog!  Now I\'ll trap your soul into a shard and give you to my imp as a plaything!', '', 9735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to purchase from you.', 'I wish to purchase from you.', 9734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ways of Jaedenar are dark and treacherous.  Watch your moves in this place, $C, or you will find your soul entralled by your rivals...', '', 9733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s recoils in pain as the Judgment of Wisdom washes over it!', '', 9732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the Bloodletting Begin!', '', 9731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrr, Me Hearties!   I be havin\' some extra Treasure that I be givin\' away at the Gurubashi Arena!  All ye need do to collect it is open the chest I leave on the arena floor!', '', 9730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirit of the Dreadsteed pulses with rage.', '', 9729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are saved! The peasants have escaped the Scourge!', 9728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares steal my precious mount?  You will pay for your insolence, mortal!', '', 9727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare interfere with this being\'s test? The battle must be fought alone! You shall all suffer for this indiscretion.', '', 9726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must do what I could not: Save the peasants that were cut down while fleeing from Stratholme.$B$BThey will walk towards the light, you must ensure their survival. Should too many fall, our cursed existence shall continue - you will have failed.$B$BEvery ability, prayer, and spell that you have learned will be tested. May the Light protect you, $n.', 9725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what can I do to help?', 'So what can I do to help?', 9724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never stated that you were here to redeem yourself, $g priest:priestess;. You are here to redeem me and the innocents murdered while trying to escape Stratholme.$B$BMy spirit and the spirit of those lost are bound here, cursed to endlessly relive our own tragic deaths.', 9723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those days are over, Eris.', 'Those days are over, Eris.', 9722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know you will, $n.$B$BI myself am a priestess, though, unlike you I am long since gone from this world. My spirit, however, remains here, as do the spirits of the thousands who were brutally slain by the mad Prince, Arthas Menethil and his legion of undeath.', 9721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really did not know what to expect, Eris. I will use my powers to assist you if that is what is asked of me.', 'I really did not know what to expect, Eris. I will use my powers to assist you if that is what is asked of me.', 9720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were. The Eye is never wrong.$B$BYou are a $g priest:priestess;, after all. A powerful $g priest:priestess;, if the Eye showed you this horrible memory.$B$BYou have come for redemption, yet you yourself do not even realize this... Do you?', 9719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I was suited to see this?', 'And I was suited to see this?', 9718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Eris nods.>$B$BThe Eye has seen so many horrors and so many wonders.$B$BIt displays what it feels the one looking into it is most suited to see.', 9717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eye led me here, Eris.', 'The Eye led me here, Eris.', 9716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stratholme is no more! The city lies in ruins. The Prince consumed by hatred... madness...', 'Stratholme is no more! The city lies in ruins. The Prince consumed by hatred... madness...', 9715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek sanctuary in the Hearthglen! It is our only hope!', 'Seek sanctuary in the Hearthglen! It is our only hope!', 9714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please help us! The Prince has gone mad!', 'Please help us! The Prince has gone mad!', 9713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge are upon us! Run! Run for your lives!', 'The Scourge are upon us! Run! Run for your lives!', 9712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Too many have fallen, $g priest:priestess;. You must focus!', 9711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until then, I shall take my leave...', '', 9710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, summon me again when you need to perform the ritual again.', '', 9709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But wait...', '', 9708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Praise the Light, one has finally answered the calling.', 9707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, my duties are complete and I shall now take my leave.  Luck to you my $gfellow:lady;, and remember to keep the Bell, Wheel and Candle working!', '', 9706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, freedom!  Although brief, so sweet it is...', '', 9705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And finally the candle... to burn those who would thwart you!', '', 9704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next, I\'ll place the wheel... to protect you from harm.', '', 9703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well duties call, yes?  First, the bell... to give you vigor!', '', 9702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can train you in bandaging techniques.', 'I can train you in bandaging techniques.', 9701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your bandage techniques.', 'I\'ve heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your bandage techniques.', 9700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks.', 'The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks.', 9699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Balai Lok\'Wein of Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh sells a manual that you will need to study in order to improve your skills!', 'Balai Lok\'Wein of Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh sells a manual that you will need to study in order to improve your skills!', 9698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now.  He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall.', 'Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now.  He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall.', 9697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s my way or the Gold Road.  Is that understood?', 9696, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Clean this place up! We will not live in such squalor.', 9695, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop whining!', 9694, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are mine now, children.  You will grow up to be a strong part of the Horde!', 9693, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe you children are our future...', 9692, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All will be well children.  The Light shall see to that!', 9691, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now children stop that!  I mean it!', 9690, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s so sad for you poor children.', 9689, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can teach you how to cook!', 'I can teach you how to cook!', 9688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wulan in Shadowprey Village can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\".  You will need that if you are to better yourself.', 'Wulan in Shadowprey Village can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\".  You will need that if you are to better yourself.', 9687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts.  To better yourself you will need to seek him out.', 'Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts.  To better yourself you will need to seek him out.', 9686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cooking is a lifelong pursuit and I see we share the same passion!', 'Cooking is a lifelong pursuit and I see we share the same passion!', 9685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge.  She can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\".', 'Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge.  She can sell you the \"Expert Cookbook\".', 9684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death take me! I cannot go on! I have nothing left...', 'Death take me! I cannot go on! I have nothing left...', 9683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should I live through this, I shall make it my life\'s sole ambition to destroy Arthas...', 'Should I live through this, I shall make it my life\'s sole ambition to destroy Arthas...', 9682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain is unbearable!', 'The pain is unbearable!', 9681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t make it... go... go on without me...', 'I won\'t make it... go... go on without me...', 9680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s causes a gale to sweep across the land, the sound of his mindless fury coming from the northwest.', '', 9679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Become a mentor for one of our orphans during the Week of the Wardens!  For the Horde!', 9678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Become a mentor for one of our orphans during the Week of the Wardens!  Huzzah!\n', 9677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are the so-called heroes of this world?  Too frightened to come out and play?', '', 9676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well what do you know, this is Children\'s Week!  What can I do to help?', 'Well what do you know, this is Children\'s Week!  What can I do to help?', 9675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you mortals are all so craven, this will be easier than I thought!', '', 9674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be too scared!  Me find you!', '', 9673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children\'s Week is not yet over... may I have another Orphan Whistle?', 'Children\'s Week is not yet over... may I have another Orphan Whistle?', 9672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a young warrior to be no doubt!  I take it you are participating in Children\'s Week, yes?  It warms these weary bones to hear that you are setting the example by which others will be sure to follow.$B$BI\'d be delighted to oblige you and the young lad.  Hrmm... what advice should I give to him?  Listen to the spirits, yes... maybe something about eating all of his vegetables too...', '', 9671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chief Bloodhoof, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy.  You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your hoofprint.', 'Chief Bloodhoof, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy.  You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your hoofprint.', 9670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s and his invading forces appear amidst a tumultuous conflagration in the northwest of Silithus.', '', 9669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s dissipates into the ether, his howling winds still ringing in your ears.', '', 9668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings young one, and welcome to Thunder Bluff.  You\'ll find safe refuge from the burdens of the world here.  All denizens of the Horde are welcome here.$B$BThe spirits of the present and past come alive here in this sacred place, my friend.  Honor them, and in doing so honor yourself.', '', 9667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This frozen land shall suffice for a start.  Come to me, mortals - and I shall give you a quick and painful death.', '', 9666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why... that is very sweet of you.  I gather that you are volunteering time for Children\'s Week, yes $c?  Well, you are to be commended.  It is imperative that we remember those less fortunate - especially the children.$B$BI\'d be happy to sign an autograph.  Here you go.', 9665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 17, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all pay dearly when I return from the depths!', '', 9664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Jaina, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy.  You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your autograph.', 'Lady Jaina, this may sound like an odd request... but I have a young ward who is quite shy.  You are a hero to him, and he asked me to get your autograph.', 9663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear me, denizens of the Crater!  I come to burn this land of its impurity!', '', 9662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have not seen the last of me fools!  All shall be consumed in the end!', '', 9661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?!  You no can beat me!  Me will return!', '', 9660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.$B$BOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Alliance takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children\'s Week.\n', 9659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tiny mortals - me HERE! Doom you meet!', '', 9658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked.  Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth.  Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.$B$BOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Horde takes time to give something back to these innocents.  This time is called Children\'s Week.\n', 9656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be healed!', 9655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of the light is truly great and merciful.', 'The power of the light is truly great and merciful.', 9654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranger, find the fallen Prince Menethil and end his reign of terror.', 'Stranger, find the fallen Prince Menethil and end his reign of terror.', 9653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall be reunited once more, my love...', 'We shall be reunited once more, my love...', 9652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, kind stranger. May your heroism never be forgotten.', 'Thank you, kind stranger. May your heroism never be forgotten.', 9651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, it ends....', 'At last, it ends....', 9650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I now return to whence I came, only to find myself here once more to relive the same epic tragedy.', 9649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have failed once more...', 9648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU ARE THE LOSE!', 'YOU ARE THE LOSER. BOO.', 9647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU ARE THE WINNER!', 'YOU ARE THE WINNER!', 9646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PEASANT CROSSES LINE.', 'PEASANT CROSSES LINE.', 9645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the contract.', 'Give me the contract.', 9644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see, all you gotta do is forge the Sulfuron hammer and find yourself the Eye of Sulfuras. Combine the Eye of Sulfuras with the Sulfuron hammer and it will become Sulfuras! Now I\'m not going to bog you down with any technical information as to where or how or when you can get an Eye of Sulfuras. I\'m sure you\'ll figure that stuff out. Just sign this here contract so that our agreement is binding and our business will be done.', '', 9643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got my attention.', 'You\'ve got my attention.', 9642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In exchange for one Sulfuron Ingot, I am authorized to grant you one copy of the plans to forge a Sulfuron hammer.$B$BNow an adventurer like yourself is probably thinking to $g himself:herself;, \"What would I ever need a hammer like that for when what I already own is far superior?\"$B$BWell let me tell you something, $g mister:missy;, there ain\'t nothing more superior than what the Sulfuron hammer can become!', '', 9641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrm, I\'m listening. What is this offer?', 'Hrm, I\'m listening. What is this offer?', 9640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Sulfuron ingot?!??! Impossible! I must have it! I must! I must!$B$B$R, I am authorized to make you a grand deal for that ingot. Perhaps you would be interested to know the secrets of the Hand of Ragnaros? Sulfuras, idiot! The legendary hammer of the Firelord.', '', 9639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence, servant! Vengeance will be mine! Death to Stormwind! Death by chicken!', '', 9638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Niby, you\'re an idiot.', '', 9637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rolls on the floor laughing.', '', 9636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BOW DOWN TO THE ALMIGHTY! BOW DOWN BEFORE MY INFERNAL DESTRO... chicken?', '', 9635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back! Stand clear! The infernal will need to be given a wide berth!', '', 9634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kroshius live? Kroshius crush!', '', 9633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I am to teach you the secrets of summoning an infernal servant, you must destroy Kroshius and bring me the infernal core from his burning remains. This, however, is not as easy as it sounds. Kroshius has all but burned out completely. You must reignite his corpse and raise him from the rubble. To do this, however, you must gather some components from other demonic entities.$B$BMy imp, Impsy, shall set you on your way.', '', 9632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I do that?', 'How do I do that?', 9631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not interrupt Niby, fool! I shall rend the flesh from your bones and use your skeletal remains as a coat rack. Now where was I? Oh yes, so, Kroshius lasted nearly ten times longer than any ordinary infernal. I am not sure why but I am confident that with enough study, I could find out.$B$BI need you to recover Kroshius\' Infernal Core.', '', 9630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is all very interesting but what is it that you want?', 'This is all very interesting but what is it that you want?', 9629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a powerful infernal named Kroshius northeast of this camp. It is why Niby is here. Kroshius is a greater infernal - an infernal that has lasted longer than expected. You see, nub, an infernal crashes down into the earth with great intensity to serve its master but this intensity fades fast. Once the blazing flames have died down, the infernal crumbles.', '', 9628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What task?', 'What task?', 9627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you have come to Niby to learn the secrets of calling down an infernal servant from the Nether.$B$BSilence! Niby knows all!$B$BNiby is not so quick to part with such knowledge. First, you must assist Niby with a very important task.', '', 9626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in search of a great and powerful Warlock.', 'I am in search of a great and powerful Warlock.', 9625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow in my presence, insect! Surely you can feel the power I hold over you.', '', 9624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ack! Help! Crazed gnome trying to kill me!', '', 9623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you little!', '', 9622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Awe inspiring, master. Your ineptitude is awe inspiring.', '', 9621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my, what a surprise! Another failure!? But how, oh great one??', '', 9620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Niby, you are stupid.', '', 9619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shakes his fist in frustration.', '', 9618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kick me out, will they!? I\'ll show those uptight cone heads in Stormwind the true power of Niby! BEHOLD!', '', 9617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brace yourself for the glorious impact, Impsy!', '', 9616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it, Impsy. I can feel it! This is the big one!', '', 9615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have regained control! Everyone - back to your posts!', '', 9614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must first craft a prison to confine the beast, if you wish to progress further.', '', 9613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I conjure a demon?', 'How can I conjure a demon?', 9612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will be the choice of the demon you wish to conjure and enslave. We wield dark powers and we pay grossly for the use of said powers.', '', 9611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would I sacrifice?', 'What would I sacrifice?', 9610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you have found me. I suppose that you have come to learn of suppression and control.$B$BI will teach you much more than that... you will also learn of sacrifice.$B$B<Daio grins.>', '', 9609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have come to learn, Daio.', 'I have come to learn, Daio.', 9608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are certainly a long way from home, $r.', '', 9607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If your glove is too big, does it still fit like a glove?', '', 9606, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does \"zug zug\" mean?', '', 9605, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If a turtle doesn\'t have a shell, is he homeless or naked?', '', 9604, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a rock in my nose.', '', 9603, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would a fly without wings be called a walk?', '', 9602, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When lightning strikes the ocean why don\'t all the fish die?', '', 9601, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re a real hero of the Horde, then I wanna see you fight a dragon!  Yeah!', '', 9600, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you try to fail and succeed, what did you just do?', '', 9599, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do fish ever get thirsty?', '', 9598, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happens if your snot freezes in your nose?', '', 9597, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If overalls are held up by the snaps at the top, then why do they have belt loops?', '', 9596, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mushrooms always grow in damp places and so they look like umbrellas.', '', 9595, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been to Ironforge before.  It smells funny there.', '', 9594, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I grow up, I wanna be the king of Stormwind!', '', 9593, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s flee as the controlling power of the orb is drained.', '', 9592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I fall into the abyss, I\'ll take all of you mortals with me!', '', 9591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A sacrifice will be due if I am ever called upon, mortal...', '', 9590, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot permit you to enter the Temple!  I must destroy you for your own good!', '', 9589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your armor looks scary.  Are you scary too?', '', 9588, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you just come out of a dungeon?  Did you get me anything?', '', 9587, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorzeeki, I wish to make a purchase.', 'Gorzeeki, I wish to make a purchase.', 9586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any spiders or beetles, $c?  They scurry fast, but if you\'re faster then you\'ll find them quite a treat!', '', 9585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There comes a time when the life we know falls short.  We are trapped and look for answers, and we find hope burning in dark places.$B$BOnly then, $n, do we take our first steps to freedom.', '', 9584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fissure closed and Krixix was gone! Swallowed whole!$B$BBe warned, $r, what you wish for could very well become that which you do not want. You play with beings and arcana that are older than time itself!$B$BShould Krixix be alive and should he have the information which you seek, you can be certain that he will not give up said information. He has faced terrors far worse than you could ever dream to perpetrate.', '', 9583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what happened?', 'So what happened?', 9582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, he had done what was thought to be impossible. Out from the fissure sprung an agent of Therazane!$B$BFrom my vantage point, I could see the goblin holding conversation with the agent of the Old God. What happened after that was terrible...', '', 9581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fissure?', 'A fissure?', 9580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A former student of mine by the name of Krixix spent a lifetime attempting to make contact with the chained Gods of the underworld. He pursued that which would spring up from the ravaged earth... That which would form only as a result of the elements clashing in titanic conflict.$B$BElementium as it would be known to mortals.$B$BOne day, nearly a decade ago, Krixix\'s pursuit lead to a fissure forming in this very gorge.', '', 9579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know of it, Franzahl?', 'What do you know of it, Franzahl?', 9578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elementium? I have not heard that word uttered from the mouth of a mortal in decades.', '', 9577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you the Earthshaper capable of creating Elementium?', 'Are you the Earthshaper capable of creating Elementium?', 9576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I study the known and unknown elements of our world.', '', 9575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Summon forth your cowardly master, fool! Let him face me!', 'Summon forth your cowardly master, fool! Let him face me!', 9574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Demitrian laughs.>$B$BYour reward is a quick and painful death, fool!', '', 9573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power is discombobulatingly devastating! It is ludicrous that these mortals even attempt to enter my realm!\n', '', 9572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, and the fool who freed me shall be among the first to quell my immense hunger.', '', 9571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, servant. For so long I have been held captive within the prison of the Firelord. I am once more free to feast upon the out world! The land shall once more be ravaged by the force of the Wind Seeker!', '', 9570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Syndicate keeps many locked boxes of supplies in Durnholde Keep in Hillsbrad.   ', 'The Syndicate keeps many locked boxes of supplies in Durnholde Keep in Hillsbrad.   ', 9569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Venture Company based around Windshear Crag in Stonetalon keeps their supplies in locked boxes.', 'The Venture Company based around Windshear Crag in Stonetalon keeps their supplies in locked boxes.', 9568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many locked supply boxes were lost when the Naga overran the Zoram Strand in Ashenvale.', 'Many locked supply boxes were lost when the Naga overran the Zoram Strand in Ashenvale.', 9567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many locked boxes of supplies were sunk by the orcs in Lake Everstill in Redridge.', 'Many locked boxes of supplies were sunk by the orcs in Lake Everstill in Redridge.', 9566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scarlet Crusade of Tyr\'s Hand in the Eastern Plaguelands have many lockboxes that will challenge your skill.', 'The Scarlet Crusade of Tyr\'s Hand in the Eastern Plaguelands have many lockboxes that will challenge your skill.', 9565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Both Lost Rigger Cove in Tanaris and the Bay of Storms in Azshara have boxes that can be picked to improve your skill.', 'Both Lost Rigger Cove in Tanaris and the Bay of Storms in Azshara have boxes that can be picked to improve your skill.', 9564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Iron dwarves of the Slag Pit in Searing Gorge have a great number of locked boxes.', 'The Dark Iron dwarves of the Slag Pit in Searing Gorge have a great number of locked boxes.', 9563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Pool of Tears in the Swamp of Sorrows holds ancient locked boxes that were lost in another age.', 'The Pool of Tears in the Swamp of Sorrows holds ancient locked boxes that were lost in another age.', 9562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waters of northern Sar\'theris Strand in Desolace or the Angor Fortress in Badlands have locked boxes that can be picked open.', 'The waters of northern Sar\'theris Strand in Desolace or the Angor Fortress in Badlands have locked boxes that can be picked open.', 9561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bluegill Marsh north of Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands holds many locked boxes from the wrecks offshore that have washed ashore.', 'Bluegill Marsh north of Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands holds many locked boxes from the wrecks offshore that have washed ashore.', 9560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I go to improve my lockpicking?', 'Where can I go to improve my lockpicking?', 9559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your challenge has failed!', '', 9558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can teach you fishing skills.', 'I can teach you fishing skills.', 9557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.', 'You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.', 9556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.', 'You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.', 9555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the vessel, Highlord.', 'Give me the vessel, Highlord.', 9554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The corporeal form of Ragnaros must be destroyed. From the remnants, his essence shall emerge. In this weakened state, Ragnaros\' grip on the prison of Thunderaan is loosed. The essence itself acting as a key...', '', 9553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall scour the earth for this Earthshaper. What of the essence?', 'I shall scour the earth for this Earthshaper. What of the essence?', 9552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration.', 'Greetings and salutations, hero!  I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration.', 9551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vessel of rebirth must be fortified with elementium. I know of only one source of the mineral: the elemental planes, at the core of our world.$B$BThere is one, an Earthshaper, who may know more than I about the acquisition of such things. You must find this Earthshaper!', '', 9550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Firelord and all who dare stand in my way shall reel from my wrath.', 'The Firelord and all who dare stand in my way shall reel from my wrath.', 9549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hold the vessel of his rebirth. Should you be prepared to take on this task, you will be required to fortify the vessel and ultimately, break the hold of Ragnaros himself!', '', 9548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What must be done?', 'What must be done?', 9547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Demitrian falls to his knees.>$B$BYou have recovered my Master\'s eternal prison!$B$BOh long have I waited for this day and finally, it is realized.$B$BHe must be released!', '', 9546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 16, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with me, $n - if you are willing, the Cenarion Circle would eagerly accept your generous offer of aid.  The threat posed by the Felvine of Eldre\'Thalas is indeed dire.', '', 9545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would you have me do, Rabine?', 'What would you have me do, Rabine?', 9544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... cannot begin to imagine, $n.  All I know is that I am not going to allow it to happen.  It will be destroyed - if not for our continued safety from demonic taint, then for the memory of Millicent Serene... Milli...$B$BThis, my friend, this is where I hope you will come in.', '', 9543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would happen if the Fruit of Fertility - or the Felvine - was allowed to be fully corrupted?', 'What would happen if the Fruit of Fertility - or the Felvine - was allowed to be fully corrupted?', 9542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas, it always seems like it does.  I - as did the rest of the Cenarion Circle - had assumed that Milli\'s creation was destroyed during the War of the Ancients.  This, as I have come to learn, is far from correct.$B$BThe Fruit of Fertility survived... though now it is known as the Felvine.  It is being corrupted by the demonic lord of that section of Eldre\'Thalas, Alzzin the Wildshaper.', '', 9541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But something went wrong, didn\'t it?', 'But something went wrong, didn\'t it?', 9540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In ages past, Eldre\'Thalas was a nexus of magical power, and those who dwelt within its hallowed halls wielded immense power.  One such night elf was Millicent Serene - a naturalist who willed the power of nature itself into potent artifacts she forged.$B$BThe Fruit of Fertility was her crowning achievement... she used a specially prepared moonwell to grow an exotic and vibrant vine that was imbued with an aura of protection and growth.  All of Eldre\'Thalas flourished from its existence.', '', 9539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fruit of Fertility?', 'The Fruit of Fertility?', 9538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agents of the Cenarion Circle have uncovered disturbing information pertaining to the current situation in Eldre\'Thalas.  I am at an impasse as to what to do about it, and I will no doubt soon seek the aid of able bodied beings capable of handling themselves in a fight.$B$BTo properly take action in Eldre\'Thalas, however, is to understand the lore of an object known as the Fruit of Fertility.', '', 9537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you say that this is a coincidence, Rabine?', 'Why do you say that this is a coincidence, Rabine?', 9536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, but I know it by its true name - Eldre\'Thalas.  It was a bastion of magical power for the night elves many, many years ago.$B$BYou know of Eldre\'Thalas, young one?  One might say that is coincidental to my current plight... but I am one not to believe in coincidence.', '', 9535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever heard of a place called Dire Maul?', 'Have you ever heard of a place called Dire Maul?', 9534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Serge I have lost the cure to the Touch of Zanzil! HELP!', 'Serge I have lost the cure to the Touch of Zanzil! HELP!', 9533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost the cure, Doc! Tell me you got more!!!', 'I\'ve lost the cure, Doc! Tell me you got more!!!', 9532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I help you?', '', 9531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nathanos, I have lost the rotten apple. I require another.', 'Nathanos, I have lost the rotten apple. I require another.', 9530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lexlort, I lost the thorium shackles.', 'Lexlort, I lost the thorium shackles.', 9529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no time for interruptions.', '', 9528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe... What do I do now?', 'Maybe... What do I do now?', 9527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you heard of the brood mother of the Black Flight? I believe she is called Onyxia...', '', 9526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh?', 'Eh?', 9525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I offer to you now is one such blade, unfired, unheated, untreated - the most raw and basic form.$B$BNow you merely need to find a dragon that will willingly enchant the blade.$B$BIf you had an eternity to live, this might be a possibility; but since you are mortal and could very likely cease to exist at any moment, might I recommend trying to persuade one of the lesser dragons to do your bidding. ', '', 9524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Continue.)', '(Continue.)', 9523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rumors exist of a single, legendary blade of Quel\'Serrar crafted for an unknown entity by the combined might of the five Aspects. Before the abominations of Nefarian and Deathwing were thrust into our world, such meetings of the Aspect were represented by the term \'Prismatic.\' I could only assume that the Prismatic Blade of Quel\'Serrar was a most glorious creation.\n', '', 9522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Continue.)', '(Continue.)', 9521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over the course of 8,000 years, only a handful of these blades were created - each blade unique in both power and appearance. The blades of Quel\'Serrar would take on the characteristics of their creator.', '', 9520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Continue.)', '(Continue.)', 9519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blade itself had to be crafted in ceremony with the children of the Aspects. A rare occurrence indeed... For not only would a dragon have to willingly heat and mold the enchanted metal with their breath, they would also need to contain the fury of their own enchantment by using their blood as temper.\n', '', 9518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating, Lorekeeper. Continue please.', 'Fascinating, Lorekeeper. Continue please.', 9517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lydros reaches into his robe and presents you with a dull, flat elven blade.>$B$BIn ages past, well before even the War of the Ancients, there existed this blade.', '', 9516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not be lured from this place.', '', 9515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grumbles.', '', 9514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Imbecile! Have you not learned the Dewey Decimal System? It has been 3,000 years since you began working for us! Incompetent buffoon.', 9513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When will they learn?', 9512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s sighs.', 9511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kildrath tends to overdramatize the situation. For example, \"Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery,\" has been stolen over 400 times.$B$BThe mark of the Athenaeum protects the tomes, preventing any unauthorized viewings.', 9510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('10,000 years of recorded knowledge tends to draw the wrong element to the Athenaeum. Books are stolen, recovered and stolen again on a daily basis.', '', 9509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down goes Frazier!  Down goes Frazier! Down goes...huh?  That wasn\'t Frazier?', 'Down goes Frazier!  Down goes Frazier! Down goes...huh?  That Wasn\'t Frazier?', 9508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like Skarr has found his next challenger!  Wouldn\'t want to be in that poor fool\'s shoes!', 'Looks like Skarr has found his next challenger!  Wouldn\'t want to be in that poor fool\'s shoes!', 9507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time for the main event!  Skarr the Unbreakable is in the Maul!', 'It\'s time for the main event!  Skarr the Unbreakable is in the Maul!', 9506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Razza just made more fertilizer for Mushgog!', 'The Razza just made more fertilizer for Mushgog!', 9505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woohoo! They are into it now!', 'Woohoo! They are into it now!', 9504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can that be The Razza down there in the Maul?  This is going to be exciting!', 'Can that be The Razza down there in the Maul?  This is going to be exciting!', 9503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at that!  Someone is fighting Mushgog!', 'Look at that!  Someone is fighting Mushgog!', 9502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holy Cow!  That is Mushgog down there in The Maul.', 'Holy Cow!  That is Mushgog down there in The Maul.', 9501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will teach you to lay off the herb, $r.', '', 9500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You honor us with your presence, my $glord:lady;.', '', 9499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps one day, your contributions to the Alliance will be as great as the heroes you have seen this day. Honor them, $n.', '', 9498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live only to serve our King.', '', 9497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the might of the Alliance! The dread lady, Onyxia, hangs from the arches! Let the rallying cry of the dragon slayer lift your spirits!', '', 9496, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens and allies of Stormwind, on this day, history has been made. $n has laid waste to that which had attempted to usurp the rule of the kingdom. Gather round and join me in honoring our heroes.', '', 9495, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be horde, all of us. Tauren, orc, troll, an\' all da rest. Never forget dat we in dis together.', '', 9494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze upon the enemy, $r. See what the might of the Horde reduces even the most powerful of dragons to! All that oppose us shall meet a similar fate!', '', 9493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bear witness to da undeniable power of ya Warchief! Be lifted by da rallying cry of da dragon slayers!', '', 9492, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People of da Horde, citizens of Orgrimmar, come an\' gather round an\' celebrate a hero of da  Horde. On dis day, $n laid a mortal blow against da Black Dragonflight. Da brood mother, Onyxia, been slain!', '', 9491, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cho\'Rush die! NOW YOU DIE!', '', 9490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s senses your presence and opens a nether portal!', '', 9489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fabric of which our world is woven is most delicate. It merely takes some knowledge and the application of said knowledge to tear the fabric. It is thusly that rifts are born. ', '', 9488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You are well versed in the creation and function of this robot.>', '', 9487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The complicated schematics are too much for your meager engineering talents to discern.>', '', 9486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Copy the schematic into your engineering notebook.>', '<Copy the schematic into your engineering notebook.>', 9485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Drawn out on this parchment is the schematic for a field repair robot.>', '', 9484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You cannot comprehend any of the technical mumbo jumbo on this scroll.>', '', 9483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doh!', '', 9482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no challenge me, scrubs!  I\'m da king now, and I stay king FOREVER!!!', '', 9481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This sounds like a task worthy of the new king!', 'This sounds like a task worthy of the new king!', 9480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess so!', 'I guess so!', 9479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me crush these punys!', '', 9478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to retaliate all attacks against him!', '', 9477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve been stolen, $r! Three of our most prized volumes. Should you return the tomes, a reward will most certainly be yours.', '', 9476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is \"Garona: A Study in Stealth and Treachery!\" These texts must be returned! ', '', 9475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh the drama and fuss the young Master exerted. You would think the fate of the world rested squarely on his shoulders. Only mortals could have such a skewed perspective on our world.$B$BAlas, he left me with his meager magical secrets... Librams or some such nonsense. I have no use for these paultry magics but perhaps you might be interested in their enchantments.', '', 9474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you must understand is that being able to index 10,000 years of existence has given me a rather unique perspective on life. Your present day trials and tribulations are meaningless.', '', 9473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The king is dead - OH NOES!  Summon Mizzle da Crafty!  He knows what to do next!', '', 9472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... you took out the King eh?  I knew that these bozos would make you the new king, I just knew it!  That\'s all these bozos understand - power.$B$BIt would seem that the more henchmen you keep alive, the higher your tribute will be.  Not to shabby - makes for an interesting challenge I\'d say.  If you leave, I wouldn\'t expect to remain king.  One of these yokels will no doubt step up and take your place.$B$BOne more thing... you didn\'t happen to find my key, did you?', '', 9471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you not talk to Mizzle, you not become da king!  Talk to Mizzle da Crafty!', '', 9470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Master holds great interest in the lair of Nefarian. If only someone would defeat the dragon and his minions and retell the tale to the Prince. I bet that would loosen the Prince\'s lips. The Ashbringer could be found!', 'The Master holds great interest in the lair of Nefarian. If only someone would defeat the dragon and his minions and retell the tale to the Prince. I bet that would loosen the Prince\'s lips. The Ashbringer could be found!', 9469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suspect that the imps are stealing knowledge.', 'I suspect that the imps are stealing knowledge.', 9468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has the Prince recanted the tale of the Ashbringer? It is our most favorite of his stories. His favorite is the followup to the Ashbringer. Of course, nobody has ever been able to get that story out of him.', 'Has the Prince recanted the tale of the Ashbringer? It is our most favorite of his stories. His favorite is the followup to the Ashbringer. Of course, nobody has ever been able to get that story out of him.', 9467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Books have been disappearing as of late. The Lorekeeper and his assistants are in a frenzy. They suspect foul play within Eldre\'Thalas.', 'Books have been disappearing as of late. The Lorekeeper and his assistants are in a frenzy. They suspect foul play within Eldre\'Thalas.', 9466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"The Arcanist\'s Cookbook\" is also gone! This is a disaster!', '', 9465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sighs.', '', 9464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh dear, where is the \"Codex of Defense?\" Lydros will be most assuredly displeased.', '', 9463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cause you no trouble, boss.', '', 9462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old king got dead?  That\'s unpossible!', '', 9461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am so smart!  S-M-R-T!', '', 9460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So long as you stay here with us, you da king.  You take off, and some other ogre will take your place.  That\'s da way of da Gordok!', '', 9459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We a lot cleaner than da ogres in Tanaris.  All over da desert as far as da eye can see - ogre poo.  Not here, no $g sir : ma\'am;!', '', 9458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem other ogres was dumb to attack you, boss!  Dat\'s why I\'m still alive - I\'m smart and stuff!', '', 9457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I scowled at you before you became da new king... um... I was just joking.$B$BYeah!', '', 9456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail to da new king!', '', 9455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even if I did, fool, do you think I\'d just let you take it from me?  The only way you\'d ever get it - if I did possess it - is to pry it from my cold, dead fingers.$B$BThat, my little friend, will not be happening any time soon.', '', 9454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... you wouldn\'t happen to have a chest around here that has, let\'s say, a gauntlet that the Gordok ogres consider to be a priceless artifact?', 'So... you wouldn\'t happen to have a chest around here that has, let\'s say, a gauntlet that the Gordok ogres consider to be a priceless artifact?', 9453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you do better at getting back prized Gordok relic from creepy Highborne prince than da old boss did!', '', 9452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, now that I\'m the king... what have you got for me?!', 'So, now that I\'m the king... what have you got for me?!', 9451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces are poised for battle, and eager to spill the blood of the Alliance.  Soon our captain will enter Iceblood Garrison and the war will begin anew!', '', 9450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mourn the great loss.', 'Mourn the great loss.', 9449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We most definitely do not need anymore attention drawn to us, stranger. Return to those that sent you in search of the lost master and tell them that nothing could be found. When this is done - and I will know when it is so - return and I shall reveal the secrets of the deceased.', '', 9448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I personally didn\'t mind him. It was the Prince who took exception to a high elf in his domain. Alas, I am not one to question the Prince. In his defense, he did not incinerate Master Winthalus immediately.', '', 9447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I very much doubt that he will have anything to say, stranger...', '', 9446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A cursory examination of the skeletal remains indicates that the flesh was seared off. Quite a grisly sight.', '', 9445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... I sorry I attack you boss.  You no kill me, please OK!?  You da king now, and I help make your tribute better!', '', 9444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh the horror! The tragedy! We are on the verge of a breakthrough, yet all could be lost.', 9443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, you kill king, yeah?  That means you take his place.  That make you da new boss!  Hail to da king!', '', 9442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to be the king!  Now, let\'s get back to what you were talking about before...', 'It\'s good to be the king!  Now, let\'s get back to what you were talking about before...', 9441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
