('', 'The Frostwolf Quartermaster is southwest of this bunker.  Enter the bunker and then exit on the right, you\'ll see the quartermaster a short way down the path.', 9439, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stormpike Quatermaster keeps his supplies under an awning, just west of here.', '', 9438, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Stormpike Quartermaster?', 'Where is the Stormpike Quartermaster?', 9437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Frostwolf Quartermaster?', 'Where is the Frostwolf Quartermaster?', 9436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When our supplies are high, Warmaster Garrick is stationed in the Field of Strife at a catapult, north of Iceblood Garrison.', 9435, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
