('Where is Warmaster Garrick?', 'Where is Warmaster Garrick?', 9433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Field Marshal Teravaine?', 'Where is Field Marshal Teravaine?', 9432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tharnariun, I have lost the trap. Could you please give me another?', 'Tharnariun, I have lost the trap. Could you please give me another?', 9431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are the orders, $n.  Now, take them quickly to Field Marshal Teravaine!', '', 9429, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here are the orders, $n.  Take them quickly to Warmaster Garrick!', 9428, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
