('Um, I\'m taking some prisoners we found outside before the king for punishment.', 'Um, I\'m taking some prisoners we found outside before the king for punishment.', 9421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
