('How many more supplies are needed for the next upgrade?', 'How many more supplies are needed for the next upgrade?', 9151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rat-kabobs!  Get your tasty Rat-kabobs here!  Get them while they last!', '', 9150, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rats everywhere.  Everywhere I see rats.  Always looking at me with their beady little eyes.  I\'ll show them.  I\'ll show them all!', '', 9149, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, $c?', '', 9148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s yawns.', '', 9147, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you attempt to zerg me, wimp!', '', 9145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s puts his club away and begins swinging wildly!', '', 9144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is my test gossip.', 9143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is my test gossip.\n', 9142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sifts through the trash.', '', 9141, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which way should you go? Well, the only advice I can offer is for you to take any road you want!$B$BI can\'t remember anything!', '', 9140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is some specialized equipment! Don\'t be handling it carelessly, and of course don\'t try and operate the thing if you\'ve had too much of that volatile rum I hear you like so much...$B$BSpeaking of which... you don\'t happen to have any of that nasty stuff, do you?', '', 9139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Larion, I want to help you fight these pests!', 'Larion, I want to help you fight these pests!', 9138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... these pests keep me busy night and day! Haven\'t you seen them?$B$BI wish I could just jump down a pipe to get away from them...', '', 9137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
