('How many more supplies are needed for the next upgrade?', 'How many more supplies are needed for the next upgrade?', 9130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many more supplies are needed to rebuild our base?', 'How many more supplies are needed to rebuild our base?', 9129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many more supplies are needed to send ground assaults?', 'How many more supplies are needed to send ground assaults?', 9128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We barely have any excess supplies.  It\'ll take a lot more work before we\'re ready to send another ground assault into the Field of Strife.', '', 9127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have excess supplies, but not many.  We\'ll need a lot more before we can send a ground assault into the Field of Strife.', '', 9126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a lot of excess supplies, but we still need more before we can send an assualt into the Field of Strife.', '', 9125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, we have enough supplies to launch ground assaults.  If your standing with the Stormpike Guard is high enough, then speak with Corporal Noreg Stormpike.', '', 9124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dun Baldar is in very bad shape, and we\'re very low on supplies to rebuild it.  The Alliance needs your help gathering supplies!', '', 9123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t have many supplies for rebuilding.  It will take a lot more before Dun Baldar will be repaired.', '', 9122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have gathered a lot of supplies for rebuilding, but we still need a lot more in order to repair Dun Baldar.  Keep bringing me supplies!', '', 9121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have lots of supplies for rebuilding.  Just a little bit more and we\'ll have enough to repair Dun Baldar and reenter the battle!', '', 9120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, we have enough supplies to launch ground assaults into the Field of Strife.  If you want to send the orders, and your rank is high enough, then speak with Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl in Frostwolf Village.', '', 9119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We barely have any supplies to build Frostwolf Keep.  We\'ll need many, many more before we can repair our base and reenter the battle.', '', 9118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a very small store of supplies to rebuild Frostwolf Keep.  It\'s going to take a lot more before we can repair and reenter the battle.', '', 9117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a medium store of supplies for rebuilding, but we still need a lot more before Frostwolf Keep can be fully repaired.', '', 9116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We have a large store of supplies to rebuild Frostwolf Keep.  Just a little bit more and we\'ll have enough to repair and reenter the battle!', '', 9115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have barely any supplies.  If we want to send a ground assault into the Field of Strife, then we\'ll need a lot more!', '', 9114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have some supplies, but not many.  We\'ll need a lot more in order to send a ground assault into the Field of Strife.', '', 9113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a lot of supplies, but we still need a lot more in order to send a ground assault into the Field of Strife.', '', 9112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many more supplies are needed to rebuild our base?', 'How many more supplies are needed to rebuild our base?', 9111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many more supplies are needed to send a ground assault?', 'How many more supplies are needed to send a ground assault?', 9110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stonehearth Graveyard lies east of the Stonehearth Outpost in the Field of Strife.$B$BThe Horde currently controls it.', '', 9107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stonehearth Graveyard lies east of the Stonehearth Outpost in the Field of Strife.$B$BThe Alliance currently controls it.', '', 9106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who controls the Stonehearth Graveyard?', 'Who controls the Stonehearth Graveyard?', 9105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last... Freed from his cursed grasp!', '', 9104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Ironbark. We are ready for you to open the door.', 'Thank you, Ironbark. We are ready for you to open the door.', 9103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, mortal. There is but one service that I may offer to you before I return to the Dream.$B$BThe door to Zevrim\'s master, Alzzin, blocks your path. I shall act as your instrument of destruction. The door will be opened, I merely await your command.', '', 9102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helpless... powerless... restore... must restore... Zevrim controls... end this torment...', '', 9101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My strength wanes, mortal. I have done as promised, the way is clear. I now return to whence I came.', '', 9100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish...', '', 9099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forty-two... forty-two... forty-two what?  It could be anything!  Forty-two... hmmm...', '', 9098, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On second thought... I think I\'ll pass.', '', 9097, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmm... don\'t you look good enough to eat.', '', 9096, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s stares hungrily at a Deeprun Rat.', '', 9095, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Explorer reporting!....Excellent!', '', 9094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target lost....resuming search patterns Delta', '', 9093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unknown life forms detected....assessing...', '', 9092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scanning life forms....target not found', '', 9091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show your appreciation for the arts and drop some coins in my hat!', '', 9090, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had it all!  I had it all and then I lost it.  Lost... all gone... like... my mind.  My mind is like... cheese.  I like cheese.  ', '', 9089, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare some change?', '', 9088, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, you\'re a great audience!  I\'ll be here all week!', '', 9087, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clap your hands everybody, and everybody clap your hands!', '', 9086, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, $c, that is not all. The elite fighting forces of the opposition are commanded by the four Commanders of the base. Should you be able to strike a fatal and rapid blow to their Commanders, the elite line will falter. Their numbers dwindling to nothing!$B$BBut be warned, soldier; Commanders and Lieutenants are not to be trifled with or taken lightly. They earned those ranks...', '', 9085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that all? I thought you were going to challenge me.', 'Is that all? I thought you were going to challenge me.', 9084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Six Lieutenants control the front line\'s defenses. They must be destroyed first and fast! We cannot risk one of their priests returning the fallen Lieutenants to life.$B$BShould all of the Lieutenants be killed in quick succession, the morale of the front lines will falter! It will be shattered! Their troops will run in fear, leaving the remaining soldiers without backup.', '', 9083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who do I kill? Just point me in their direction, Commander.', 'Who do I kill? Just point me in their direction, Commander.', 9082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then listen well, $c.$B$BCan you feel the power radiating from me? Does your morale not swell? Aye, it is the same for the other side. To disrupt their defenses and thin out their troops will be no easy task, but it must be done! Victory will be ours!', '', 9081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes I have, Commander.', 'Yes I have, Commander.', 9080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware of entering Frostwolf territory, soldier. The whole damn place is booby trapped! Landmines galore! Speak with our explosives expert in the first tower on the front lines for more information. I am certain that he could teach you how to diffuse the situation.', '', 9079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Syndicate have been reported to be nosing around in a cave on the eastern plateau. Find out what they\'re up to, soldier! Beware of Frostwolf activity!', '', 9078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look alive, soldier! Stormpike Intelligence has reported that a master goblin engineer has been taken prisoner by the Winterax trolls. The Frostwolf dogs are actively trying to rescue him so that they may use his engineered gadgets to destroy us! Do not let that happen.', '', 9077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step, soldier. The Stormpike have littered the ground around their bases with landmines. Speak with our explosives expert in the watch tower to the east if you want information on how to diffuse their mine fields.', '', 9076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My scouts report that the Syndicate has taken up residence in a hidden cave on the eastern plateau. Be cautious when adventuring in that area.', '', 9075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, soldier. Intelligence has reported that the Winterax trolls to the west have taken a master goblin engineer prisoner. Perhaps you should investigate?', '', 9074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such is the price of curiosity.', '', 9073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is under my protection. The mysteries of the arcane shall remain inviolate.', '', 9072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, little ones. Face me!', '', 9071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have come to learn of battles won and lost on this field? There are no winners here...', '', 9070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have come to learn in the art of warfare, $r? You have come to the wrong place.', '', 9069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
