('Truffles!', '', 9048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, the time has come to charge the Frostwolf filth! Run them through!', 'Commander, the time has come to charge the Frostwolf filth! Run them through!', 9047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The orders have been given! Death to Stormpike! Charge the enemy!', 'The orders have been given! Death to Stormpike! Charge the enemy!', 9046, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awaiting orders, sir. On your command, I shall unleash hell upon them!', '', 9045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, the time has come for the wolf riders to charge the enemy lines. Send the order.', 'Commander, the time has come for the wolf riders to charge the enemy lines. Send the order.', 9044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Commander has fallen! The time for vengeance is now! Ram riders charge!!!!!!', 'Our Commander has fallen! The time for vengeance is now! Ram riders charge!!!!!!', 9042, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Commander has been slain! Charge their lines! Die with honor!', 'The Commander has been slain! Charge their lines! Die with honor!', 9041, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alterac Valley - Alliance Quatmaster Greeting Option Default', '', 9040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many more supplies do we need?', 'How many more supplies do we need?', 9039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Korrak has come, weaklings! Snowfall belongs to Winterax!', '', 9038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what\'s for sale.', 'Show me what\'s for sale.', 9037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need some supplies?', 9036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interlopers! Invaders! The All Seeing Eye has been stolen! The miserable dog, $n, has it in $g his:her; possession!', '', 9034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I am so glad you have returned, $n.$B$BMy brother\'s spirit has now be freed from the corruption, but I choose to remain here, in my mourning.$B$BThank you so much for your help, $n.', 9033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place... it\'s cursed.$B$BI barely managed to escape, and I cannot bear to go down through the tunnels again.$B$BMy brother, and sisters though... They were not as fortunate. Trapped inside, they are feverish with the corrupted haze that flows from the evil garden growing there.$B$BPlease, you must help.', 9032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run! They are coming!', 'Run! They are coming!', 9031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have learned all that I am able to teach you at this time, Doctor $n. Return to me when your practice has expanded and I shall train you in the ways of the more advanced medicinal arts.', '', 9030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there. No, Marvon sure isn\'t here, and he won\'t be back for quite some time. Actually, I am getting a little worried about him...$B$BI hope he gets back soon. A large chest arrived for him and it\'s too heavy for me to lug it inside here! I had to leave it out by the door...', 9029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hiya! This workshop isn\'t mine, no! But one day after I finish training I am going to be an inventor, just like my hero, Marvon Rivetseeker.$B$BYou\'ve never heard of him? Well it just so happens that he left quite some time ago to study some ancient troll ruins he kept talking about. He left in a zeppelin... not quite sure about where exactly he went...$B$BTanarasin? Tenkeris? Taneranisany?$B$B<Liv shakes her head.>$B$BNo, that\'s not it...', 9028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have completed Teronis\' mission, and I appreciate all you have done, $n.', 9027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, I expected that you would be back. I sent Korra out earlier and she came across Dartol\'s Rod, abandoned in the forest.$B$BWe worked so hard to recover it, $n. Please take care to see that you do not handle it so carelessly in the future.', 9026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raene, I lost Dartol\'s Rod of Transformation.', 'Raene, I lost Dartol\'s Rod of Transformation.', 9025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know these forests as if they were a part of me... but know that there is still much to be learned from them, and much danger still hidden.', 9024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalaran, please enchant the torch.', 'Kalaran, please enchant the torch.', 9023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you misplaced that chapter you worked so hard to put together, $n. Well, you left it right here!', '', 9022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter IV.', 'Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter IV.', 9021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter III.', 'Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter III.', 9020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter II.', 'Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter II.', 9019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter I.', 'Barnil, I seem to have misplaced Chapter I.', 9018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Nesingwary has a big hunt ahead of him.  I find helping him prepare for a day in the jungle is much more relaxing than helping him ready for combat.  Although I do miss some of those glorious moments on the battlefield.', '', 9017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haleh, I have lost the Drakefire Amulet. Could you fashion another?', 'Haleh, I have lost the Drakefire Amulet. Could you fashion another?', 9016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it you ask of the Blue Flight?', 9015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rokaro, I have lost the Drakefire Amulet. Could another be created?', 'Rokaro, I have lost the Drakefire Amulet. Could another be created?', 9014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, $c. I am Rokaro.', '', 9013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shenthul, I have lost my whistle and I have no more flares. Please help!', 'Shenthul, I have lost my whistle and I have no more flares. Please help!', 9012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not be lured away!', '', 9011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, you look the type to be a leader.  Here to organize a guild to fight for the Alliance?', '', 9010, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our ancestors teach us that while the individual must be strong, there is safety in numbers.  Do you wish to defend the honor of Thunder Bluff by organizing a guild?', '', 9009, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll rue the day you crossed me, $n.', '', 9008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming $n - look sharp, friends!', '', 9007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out for the $n!', '', 9006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh, I need help here!', '', 9005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have found both parts of your scepter.', 'I have found both parts of your scepter.', 9004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lieutenant, I have lost my insignia. Could you please supply me with a replacement?', 'Lieutenant, I have lost my insignia. Could you please supply me with a replacement?', 9003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.$B$BAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement.', '', 9002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 113, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warmaster, I have lost my insignia. Could you supply me with a replacement?', 'Warmaster, I have lost my insignia. Could you supply me with a replacement?', 9001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in charge of recruitment for the Frostwolf Clan. As a soldier of Frostwolf, it is your responsibility to check in with me as your rank among the clan rises.$B$BHonor and respect are earned on this frigid field.', '', 9000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have enough supplies to launch a ground assault.  If you want to deliver those orders, and you think you qualify, then speak with Corporal Noreg Stormpike.', '', 8999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have enough supplies to launch a ground assault.  If you want to send the order, and you think you qualify, then speak Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl.', '', 8998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Click here to repair your gear', 'Click here to repair your gear', 8997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi! Clear your res effects here!', '', 8996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Click here to remove res effects and repair all gear', 'Click here to remove res effects and repair all gear', 8995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just gave kill credit to $n.', '', 8994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the bravest warrior must be well supplied if he is to face his foes with strength!', 8993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You!  $n!  What are you doing wandering around the village like this?  There are Alliance foes in Alterac!  We must drive them out!$B$BOur supplies are too low to launch a large ground assault, so speak with our quatermaster.  He\'ll tell you how you can increase our supply base.', 8991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, $c!  Our supply level is high, and we are ready to launch a ground assault through the Field of Strife.  Perhaps if your renown was greater, I would trust you to deliver the assault orders.$B$BSo get out there and fight the Alliance!  Show me you\'re a trusted and capable member of the Horde!', 8990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s good to have veterans like you in Alterac Valley, $n.  Our supplies are too low to launch a ground assault through Alterac Valley... speak with our quartermaster - he\'ll tell you how to increase our supply base.', 8989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why are you here, $n?  Is there lead in your boots?$B$BYou have the assault orders - Warmaster Garrick needs them in the Field of Strife before he can make his assault!  Go!', 8988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, $n!  It is good you came to see me.  We are prepared to launch a ground assuault through the Field of Strife!  Once Warmaster Garrick gets his orders, he and his reavers will cut a swath through the Alliance!$B$BDo you want to deliver those orders, $n?  Garrick is waiting in the Field of Strife...', 8987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can now rebuild!  For the Horde!', '', 8986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep them coming!  We need more supplies in order to rebuild...', '', 8985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good.  Our supply cache grows...', '', 8984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the supplies, $n.', '', 8983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our cache of equipment grows!', '', 8982, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the armor scraps, $n!', '', 8981, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we\'re making progress!', '', 8980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have enough supplies!  Our captain has retaken position in the Field of Strife!', '', 8979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re making progress!  Bring more supplies to repair Dun Baldar!', '', 8978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks a lot, $n!', '', 8977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the supplies, $n!', '', 8976, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great!  Let\'s keep those supplies coming, people!', '', 8975, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, head trauma surgeon of Alliance Trauma.', '', 8974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach me how to create and apply a Heavy Runecloth Bandage, Doctor.\n', 'Teach me how to create and apply a Heavy Runecloth Bandage, Doctor.\n', 8973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach me how to create and apply a Runecloth Bandage, Doctor.\n', 'Teach me how to create and apply a Runecloth Bandage, Doctor.\n', 8972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach me how to create and apply a Heavy Mageweave Bandage, Doctor.', 'Teach me how to create and apply a Heavy Mageweave Bandage, Doctor.', 8971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you again, Doctor $n. I have been following your progress and I dare say that it is time you learned some of the more advanced bandaging techniques.$B$BReturn to me from time to time, as your skill advances, and I shall teach you all that I know.', '', 8970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. I am Doctor Gregory Victor, head trauma surgeon of Horde Trauma.', '', 8969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, good $c.', '', 8968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bows low before you.', '', 8967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will aid you. Give me the instructions.', 'I will aid you. Give me the instructions.', 8966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though exiled as a heretic, my beliefs still ring true--that alone drives me onward. But for my destiny to be complete, I need the aid of an outsider... one not of any centaur tribe.$B$BThe task requires someone to enter the holy halls of Maraudon--a temple my people protect, and only the most devout are ever allowed to enter.$B$BIf you agree to aid me, then you need only nod. I will pass you a parchment with my instructions on it. Read it over and consider my words.', '', 8965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, go on.', 'Please, go on.', 8964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have my spirit and remains been kept captive here within Maraudon, young $c. The time has given me nothing but ample opportunities to reflect on my mistakes and realize that my jealousy of Remulos was foolish. He attempted to warn and persuade me that my relations with Theradras would bear nothing pure--that only destruction would come from chaos. My brother was right.$B$BBut that does not mean since you have freed me, I am free of penance.', '', 8963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ask of the Sons of Cenarius, Remulos and Zaetar.$B$BMy father, Remulos, was strong and beautiful, and my uncle, Zaetar, very cunning and slight of build. While they were respected quite equally, Zaetar always felt as if he could never quite compare to the glory and attention he thought Remulos had.$B$BAfter my sisters and I were born, Zaetar, blinded by jealousy, set out to outdo his brother... He was the creator of his own end. The sadness it brings me has never lessened, even as time passes...', '', 8962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about the history of Remulos and Zaetar.', 'Tell me more about the history of Remulos and Zaetar.', 8961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without knowledge of the incantations required to unite the two parts, Lord Vyletongue was unable to use the scepter. However, now that I am free of the curse of Vyletongue\'s corruption, I will be able to assist you, if you\'d like to bring me the two parts -- both the head and the rod of the scepter.', '', 8960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why didn\'t Lord Vyletongue unite both parts of the scepter into one?', 'Why didn\'t Lord Vyletongue unite both parts of the scepter into one?', 8959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the toxins lurking within Maraudon seeped into my mind, I began to lose my grip on reality. Worried that it would be used for evil, my dryad sisters secretly took the scepter from me, breaking it into two parts and hiding it within the caverns.$B$BSoon they fell victim to the madness as well, and the two parts of the scepter, left unguarded, came to be in the possession of Vyletongue, himself. The satyr entrusted one part to Noxxion, an evil elemental, and the other he still has to this day.', '', 8958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I find the two parts of your scepter?', 'How can I find the two parts of your scepter?', 8957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Explorers\' League.  If you need information, and it is in book form, then I might be able to help you out.', '', 8956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My scepter will once again become whole!', '', 8955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please do as I instruct you, $n.', '', 8954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For so long I have drifted in my cursed form. You have freed me... Your hard work shall be repaid.', '', 8953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to learn of the stone? Follow me.', '', 8952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to channel his energy, focusing on the stone.', '', 8951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Read this tome I have placed before you, and speak the words aloud.', '', 8950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shal myrinan ishnu daldorah...', '', 8949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, the two parts shall become one, once again.', '', 8948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we can attempt this later. Please speak to me again if you wish to do so.', '', 8947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could I have a copy of \"The Feast of Winter Veil\" to read?', 'Could I have a copy of \"The Feast of Winter Veil\" to read?', 8946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vile goblins... anything for a gold coin.', '', 8945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot believe those greedy goblins are allowed to hawk their wares while spoiling the spirit of this season.', '', 8944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spending coin is NOT the reason for the Feast of Winter Veil!', '', 8943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those goblins should be ashamed of themselves.  Bah!', '', 8942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Zaetar... <Celebras looks away.>$B$BMy father, Remulos, tried to stop him...$B$BZaetar was headstrong, and when he fell for an earthen elemental princess, my father knew that their union was cursed, but Zaetar refused to listen.$B$BThe centaur are the result of his mistake. They were born misshapen and hateful; my uncle Zaetar was killed by his own kin...$B$BThe evil princess, Theradras, still guards his remains here in the crystal caverns.', '', 8941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please tell me more about Zaetar.', 'Please tell me more about Zaetar.', 8940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, my dryad sisters and I entered these caves to free the tortured spirit of my uncle, Zaetar. However, the corruption that had already spread through these caverns soon overcame us, and we too fell.$B$BWe were destined to wander these passages; the toxins poisoning our minds...$B$BAlthough my spirit may now be at rest, I know that I have failed in my mission. It is a great sadness I must bear...', '', 8939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please tell me more about Maraudon.', 'Please tell me more about Maraudon.', 8938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow weary...$B$BFrom here, you can see the waterfalls, $n...The scepter grants you the power to travel to this very place, should you ever desire to enter through the front gates of Maraudon again.$B$BNear the entrance to Maraudon, you will find a passage that goes down beneath the caverns. Use the scepter at the ancient ritual site to create a portal, and you will find yourself here once more.', '', 8937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, really, I still don\'t understand...', 'No, really, I still don\'t understand...', 8936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Between the orange and the purple passageways near the doors to Maraudon, you will find a third path.$B$BThe scepter you hold in your hands is the key.', '', 8935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t quite understand...', 'I don\'t quite understand...', 8934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Between the colors, a path.$B$BBlink across in light.$B$BFrom the water, you emerge.', '', 8933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please explain how the scepter works.', 'Please explain how the scepter works.', 8932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please show me the Stone of Maraudon.', 'Please show me the Stone of Maraudon.', 8931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My scepter... After so many years... You have recovered it! You shall truly be the savior of this place...$B$BPlease listen to me carefully, $n. The head and the rod of the scepter may only be reunited into one at the Stone of Maraudon.', '', 8930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I carry both parts of the scepter.', 'I carry both parts of the scepter.', 8929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Celebras, I lost my Scepter...', 'Celebras, I lost my Scepter...', 8928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How has this come to be, $n? Do you think that an item such as the Scepter of Celebras is trivial?$B$BI can help you this time, but do not be careless with this valuable item again...', '', 8927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for what you have done, $n.$B$BKeep the scepter safe; may it aid you in your toil against the evils that have invaded this place...', '', 8926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, I am free of the corruption that once bound me to this place...', '', 8925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need no home to know I still have a place in this world, $c. The tribes will see... all of them. They fight amongst one another, and for what? Scraps left over by vultures... lands infested by the Legion... bah!$B$BThe centaur should be proud of their heritage--it is just as noble as any Night elf\'s or orc\'s--it is time we started acting like it!', '', 8924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, please take a look at the sample of the Vylestem vine that I took from the caverns, so that you know what to look for...', '', 8923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free! Free from my bonds at last!', '', 8922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I greet you, $r.', '', 8921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, please take a look at the sample of the Vylestem vine that I took from the caverns, so that you know what to look for...', 8920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sisters and I have come down from the Stonetalon Mountains to put to rest a tragedy from ages past. Unfortunately, we are not powerful enough to accomplish our goals on our own and now seek mortals such as yourself to aid us.$B$BIf you are powerful enough, then we have much to discuss, $c. If you are not, then, for your safety, I will leave the details of my mission out of our conversation.', 8919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May Cenarius guide you, $c.$B$BI am here in this corrupt land with my sisters on a mission of great importance to the Cenarion Circle. But only those who are powerful enough I ask speak to me about such matters--to send a lesser being would be folly.', '', 8918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, $n. We must be brief because there is much to do.', '', 8917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s attacks!', '', 8916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emerges from the plant, allowing it to heal.', '', 8915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll perform these with pleasure, $n!', '', 8914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, Reavers!  The orders are here!  To battle!', '', 8913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to stable my pet.', 'I wish to stable my pet.', 8912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With pleasure. These things stink!', 'With pleasure. These things stink!', 8911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just a few more and our stables will be overflowing with mounts. Release it into my custody, soldier. I\'ll take it from here.', 8910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The indigenous rams of Alterac are vital to the functionality of our cavalry!', 8909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the King!', 'For the King!', 8908, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patrol the front line, soldiers!', '', 8907, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lads and ladies. Today can be your greatest day, for today, you fight for the glory of Stormpike! Ride unto the field and grant your enemies no mercy! Strike the savages down and let their Warchief sort em out!', '', 8906, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ram Riders, REGULATE!', '', 8905, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awaiting orders from my superiors!', '', 8904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YAW! Er, to the front lines with you!', 'YAW! Er, to the front lines with you!', 8903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We ride on your command!', '', 8902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to Frostwolf!', '', 8901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The stable is empty! We must provide our cavalry with suitable mounts. Stormpike Stables requests your assistance!', 8900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The stables are full again! Our cavalry is soon to ride!', 8899, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have gathered enough hides from the wolves. Soon, the cavalry will be ready to ride! Speak to me again when we have stabled enough rams.', '', 8898, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kolkar invaders are retreating!', '', 8897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patrol Frost Dagger Pass. Let none through! Die with honor...', '', 8896, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krathok, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the weaponsmith.', 'Krathok, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the weaponsmith.', 8895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krathok, I was once an armorsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the armorsmith.', 'Krathok, I was once an armorsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the armorsmith.', 8894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Myolor, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the weaponsmith!', 'Myolor, I was once a weaponsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the weaponsmith!', 8893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Myolor, I was once an armorsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the armorsmith.', 'Myolor, I was once an armorsmith and wish to retake the hammer once more! Teach me the way of the armorsmith.', 8892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Warchief!', 'For the Warchief!', 8891, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come, brothers. We must not let the enemy advance through Frost Dagger Pass. Some of us will surely perish, but would any of you shy away from this duty? This honor? Onward! For the Horde!', '', 8890, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when it is best to ride. You must be our eyes and ears on the battlefront.', '', 8889, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RARRRRRR!', '', 8888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wolf riders, to Frost Dagger Pass!', '', 8887, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, Horde! We have enough Frostwolves in our stables to provide mounts to all of our wolf riders!', 8886, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need more wolves! Come to the stables and help!', 8885, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aw, don\'t want to train with me? What other weapon catches your eye?', 8884, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well hi there!  Are you here to learn the proper technique of a new weapon?', 8883, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What weapon were ye lookin\' to learn?', '', 8882, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye want to be trained in the use of a weapon, do ye?  Well don\'t stand there slack-jawed, speak up $gladdie : lassie;!', '', 8881, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can direct you to other weapon masters if you prefer. What interests you?', 8880, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The grace with which I fight is not something I can teach you, but I can teach you the use of various weapons.', 8879, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What weapon in particular interests you?', '', 8878, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come seeking training in the ways of armed combat?', '', 8877, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, it\'s good to see veterans like you in the field!  I\'m sorry to report that our supplies are currently too low to launch any large ground assaults against the Horde.$B$BSpeak with our quartermaster; he has supply missions available.', '', 8876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to stable my pet, Stable Master.', 'I wish to stable my pet, Stable Master.', 8875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tell you where to go, provided you tell me what interests you.', '', 8874, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose you are here to be trained in the use of a new weapon?  Make it fast, I\'m very busy!', '', 8873, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awaiting orders from my superiors.', '', 8872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done an exceptional job, soldier! The cavalry is ready to ride on your command.', '', 8871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unleash the cavalry!', 'Unleash the cavalry!', 8870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to Stormpike!', '', 8869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you require more training, I would be happy to tell you who can aid you. What weapon has caught your eye?', '', 8868, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n!  Our supplies are dwindling and until we get more we can\'t launch large ground assaults into the Field of Strife!$B$BSpeak with the Stormpike Quartermaster.  He\'ll tell you what you can do to resupply our assault forces.', '', 8867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would be honored to train you in the use of the weapons that I have mastered should you have the ability to learn within you.', '', 8866, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n!  What are you doing talking to me?  You should be out fighting the Horde!$B$BI have assault orders for one of our field marshals in the Field of Strife, but I need someone I can count on.$B$BPerhaps if your standing with the Stormpike militia were higher, I could count on you...', '', 8865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you want to learn, mon?', '', 8864, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $n!  You\'re just the person I was hoping to see!  We have enough supplies to send a ground assault against the Horde!  Field Marshal Teravaine is waiting in the Field of Strife for orders...$B$BYou\'re a brave veteran who\'s proven himself time and again.  Do you want to deliver Teravaine the orders?', '', 8863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heya mon.  You come right place learn how ta wield a new weapon.', '', 8862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Stable Master. Please take the animal.', 'Thank you, Stable Master. Please take the animal.', 8861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Well done, soldier. A few more and our stables will be overflowing with mounts for the cavalry to ride into combat!', 8860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, soldier. Are you here to help the cause?', 8859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whimpers obediently.', '', 8858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frostwolf Keep is razed!  We must have supplies in order to repair and rebuild!', '', 8857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some say that strength and bravery are most needed for an army\'s success.  And it\'s true!  But an army also needs supplies to keep itself in good shape, and it\'s my job to make sure they have what they need.', '', 8855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say an army travels on its stomach, and that\'s the truth.  For any offensive to succeed, your troops have to be well-fed and well supplied.', '', 8854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dun Baldar took a real beating in the last Horde attack!  We need more supplies in order to rebuild and make repairs!', '', 8853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine! Mine! Mine!  Gizlock is the ruler of this domain!  You shall never reveal my presence!', '', 8852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Glowing Shard.', 'Tell me about the Glowing Shard.', 8851, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s wings thunder in the distance.', '', 8850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, you will meet your ancestors!', '', 8849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no match for the strength of the Horde!', '', 8848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you will not leave Alterac Valley on your own, then the Frostwolves will force you out!', '', 8847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your attacks are slowed by the cold, I think!', '', 8846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your spirits are weak, and your blows are weaker!', '', 8845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot defeat the Frostwolf clan!', '', 8844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We, the Alliance, will prevail!', '', 8843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not be swayed from our mission!', '', 8842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'ll take more than you rabble to bring me down!', '', 8841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the best you can do?', '', 8840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your attacks are weak!  Go practice on some rabbits and come back when you\'re stronger.', '', 8839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stormpike clan bows to no one, especially the horde!', '', 8838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, sure, go ahead and tell ol\' Greatfather Winter what you\'d like for this Winter Veil.$B$BHo ho hurry up.', '', 8837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... you can\'t sit on my lap.', '', 8836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a pretty good idea what ol\' Greatfather Winter\'s gonna be doing when this shift is over.  I got a bottle of Winter Veil cheer right here in my bag, and I intend to get to the bottom of it.', '', 8835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A wondrous Winter Veil to you... uh... little $G boy : girl;.  Good children get special, um, discounts at any local Smokywood Pastures vendor.  Yum.', '', 8834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Snowfall Graveyard is owned by the Horde.', '', 8833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Snowfall Graveyard is owned by the Alliance.', '', 8832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fostwolf Graveyard is owned by the Horde.', '', 8831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fostwolf Graveyard is owned by the Alliance.', '', 8830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Frostwolf Graveyard is along the side of the road, not far north of Frostwolf Village.$B$BThe Horde currently controls it.', '', 8826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Frostwolf Graveyard is along the side of the road, not far north of Frostwolf Village.$B$BThe Alliance currently controls it.', '', 8825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who controls the Frostwolf Graveyard?', 'Who controls the Frostwolf Graveyard?', 8824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Snowfall Graveyard lies high atop a hill in the Field of Strife, east of Winterax Hold.$B$BThe Horde currently controls it.', '', 8823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Snowfall Graveyard lies high atop a hill in the Field of Strife, east of Winterax Hold.$B$BThe Alliance currently controls it.', '', 8821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who controls the Snowfall Graveyard?', 'Who controls the Snowfall Graveyard?', 8820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stormpike Graveyard is cut into the mountains, across the bridge east of Dun Baldar.$B$BThe Horde currently controls it.', '', 8818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stormpike Graveyard is cut into the mountains, across the bridge east of Dun Baldar.$B$BThe Alliance currently controls it.', '', 8817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who controls the Stormpike Graveyard?', 'Who controls the Stormpike Graveyard?', 8814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what weapon you want to learn or go away.', '', 8813, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can other weapon masters teach?', 'What can other weapon masters teach?', 8812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like some weapon training', 'I\'d like some weapon training', 8811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here to learn how to wield a new weapon, or just to waste my time?', '', 8810, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot store any more supplies.  I have all I can handle!', '', 8809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our units are upgraded to Champions, but I can still collect more supplies.', '', 8808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have enough supplies to upgrade our troops to champions.', '', 8807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have enough supplies to upgrade our troops to veterans.', '', 8806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have enough supplies to upgrade  our troops to seasoned.', '', 8805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our units are upgraded to Veteran, but I don\'t have enough supplies to upgrade them to Champion.', '', 8804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our units are upgraded to Seasoned, but I don\'t have enough supplies to upgrade them to Veteran.', '', 8803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our units are not upgraded, and I don\'t have enough supplies to upgrade them.', '', 8802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me the wisdom of Winterax!', 'Grant me the wisdom of Winterax!', 8801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We now hold the wisdom of the Winterax, $n. This power can be yours for a short time should you so desire.', '', 8800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to rock, Vipore! Give me a beacon.', 'I am ready to rock, Vipore! Give me a beacon.', 8799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gryphons are ready to strike, $n! You must take this beacon and plant it in the western crater of the central battlegrounds.$B$BDo this and the battle is ours!', '', 8798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their spirits are restored! The gryphons are ready to strike! Come, soldiers! Come to my side!', '', 8797, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the beacon, Slidore! Also, you still stink!', 'Give me the beacon, Slidore! Also, you still stink!', 8796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Finally!$B$BYou must take this beacon and plant it in the eastern crater of the central battle grounds. My flight will attack when the beacon beams its coordinates!', '', 8795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My flight is ready! Soldiers come to my aid!', '', 8794, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m your man, Ich. Give me a beacon!', 'I\'m your man, Ich. Give me a beacon!', 8793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay attention, soldier! You need to take this beacon to the Snowfall graveyard and plant it! Protect it long enough so that my gryphon can lock on.$B$BIf my gryphon gets a solid strike location, Mulv and his crew will be humiliated!', '', 8792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of Stormpike, come to my aid! The beacon must be planted.', '', 8791, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is destroyed. Aerial assault unable to confirm strike point. Mission aborted.', '', 8790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s armed. Aerie Gryphon en route.', '', 8789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s arming. T-minus 60 seconds.', '', 8788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Double time!', '', 8787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me browse your seasonal fare.', 'Let me browse your seasonal fare.', 8786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season!  Nothing says \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family.', 'Don\'t forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season!  Nothing says \"Wondrous Winter Veil\" like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family.', 8785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I had some chestnuts, you\'d better believe I\'d have them roasting over an open fire.  Mmmm!', 'If I had some chestnuts, you\'d better believe I\'d have them roasting over an open fire.  Mmmm!', 8784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket!  Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!', 'Don\'t let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket!  Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!', 8783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you\'d like to get this Winter Veil!', 'Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you\'d like to get this Winter Veil!', 8782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil!  Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!', 'Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil!  Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!', 8781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Tis the season for great bargains!  Fah la la la la!', '\'Tis the season for great bargains!  Fah la la la la!', 8780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh from our farm to your plate - it\'s Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!', 'Fresh from our farm to your plate - it\'s Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!', 8779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Season\'s savings to you and yours!', 'Season\'s savings to you and yours!', 8778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This forest can be confusing! Be careful out there.', 8777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I will deliver the orders to Warmaster Garrick!', 'Yes, I will deliver the orders to Warmaster Garrick!', 8776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a cold, bloody battle we wage in Alterac Valley.  It\'s perfect.', 8775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have orders here for an attack on alliance forces in the middle fields.  I need someone to get them to the assault leader.', 8774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going down, Mulv!', '', 8773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is far enough! Meet me back at base!', '', 8772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just get me close enough to our base and I can channel a teleport!', '', 8771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got no time to waste. This is a really long run! Cover me!', '', 8770, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cover me, I\'m making a break for it!', '', 8769, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got your back, Slidore, but to be honest, you do stink. Take a shower, man.', 'I got your back, Slidore, but to be honest, you do stink. Take a shower, man.', 8768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard their mocking laughter as my gryphon crashed and burned, $c.$B$B\"Slidore, you stink!\" They shouted.$B$BNobody talks to Slidore that way! Help me get out of here so that I can show them who the real stinker is!', '', 8767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got you covered, Vipore. Move out!', 'I got you covered, Vipore. Move out!', 8766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe it... I was doing a routine recon mission over the central DMZ when all hell broke loose. I saw the Horde Wing Commander, Mulverick, take out both Ichman and Slidore! Anger took hold of me and I broke from my wing man and drove that show-off, Mulverick, down. Unfortunately, he clipped my gryphon before he crashed, forcing me down as well. I ended up captured by these savages.$B$BI have to get back to base! Help!', '', 8765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got your back, Ichman. GO GO GO!', 'I got your back, Ichman. GO GO GO!', 8764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was shot down by that reckless fool, Mulverick. I fear that if I do not make it back to base, all will be lost! Mulverick and his squad of War Riders must be stopped!', '', 8763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Forest Lord is aware of the destruction in this valley, $n. Soon we must make our way to the Circle of Calling. Prepare yourself!', 8762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forest shakes and shudders! The winds howl! Does the Forest Lord approach?', 'The forest shakes and shudders! The winds howl! Does the Forest Lord approach?', 8761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. $n. I have located the Forest Lord. We must redouble our efforts! More crystals are needed!', 8760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The air is abuzz with energy, Archdruid. What is the status of the Forest Lord?', 'The air is abuzz with energy, Archdruid. What is the status of the Forest Lord?', 8759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have been lost in the Dream. I sense his lifeforce but my powers have not yet grown strong enough to make contact.', 8758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you made contact with Ivus, Archdruid?', 'Have you made contact with Ivus, Archdruid?', 8757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
