('I come to raze your bases, Frost Wolf clan. Ivus punishes you for your treachery!', '', 8737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wicked, wicked, mortals! The forest weeps. The elements recoil at the destruction. Ivus must purge you from this world!', '', 8736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must focus our thoughts upon the Circle of Calling if the Forest Lord is to come! We must hurry! Concentrate your energies!', 8735, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
