('I was searching for materials to build my latest and greatest invention, the portable remote control shredder unit, when these trolls clubbed me and dragged me into the depths of their cave.$B$BReturn me to safety and I will lend my aid to your cause, $r.', '', 8726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am greatly indebted to you, $c. Perhaps I can help your cause.', '', 8725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lets get back to your base!', '', 8724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Upgrade to champion units!', 'Upgrade to champion units!', 8723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The All Seeing Eye must be recovered!', '', 8722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it! This thing is probably more trouble than its worth.', 'Take it! This thing is probably more trouble than its worth.', 8721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see that you have found the eye.$B$B<Master Ryson grins.>$B$BWell, give it to me!', '', 8720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
