('Upgrade to seasoned units!', 'Upgrade to seasoned units!', 8718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like the type I should watch my coin purse around. Something I can help you with?', 'You look like the type I should watch my coin purse around. Something I can help you with?', 8717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out.', 'I don\'t think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out.', 8716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you next go to the Molten Core, kill a Firelord for me, will you?', '', 8715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our lord Hydraxis speaks highly of you.  My water is your water, friend.', '', 8714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you will tell me of your deeds, $n.  I would be honored to know them.', '', 8713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have made our enemies your own.  I will gladly share waters with you.', '', 8712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tales of your exploits spread.  Your name is not unknown to us, $n.', '', 8711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, little one.  You have business with the Waterlords?', '', 8710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak not your vulgar language to me!  Only Hydraxis can stand it.', '', 8709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no business with me, little one.', '', 8708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Hydraxis.', '', 8707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a Scrying Scope to view the Globe of Scrying, Ryson.', 'I need a Scrying Scope to view the Globe of Scrying, Ryson.', 8706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c.  How may I assist you?', 'Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c.  How may I assist you?', 8705, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Undercity Guild Registry. What do you want?', '', 8704, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you are ready for the ultimate task.  The fiery runes etched on the floor of the molten core are conduits to the realm of fire, and their presence is both an affront to us and a source of power for the Firelords.  They must be extinguished!$B$BTo extinguish a rune, take a vial of aqual quintessence.  Pour it on the rune and its flame will go out, rendering it useless and weakening our enemy!', '', 8703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Absolutely. Give me a beacon, Ryson.', 'Absolutely. Give me a beacon, Ryson.', 8702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take this beacon and advance upon the enemy\'s base. Make your way to the outside of their main stronghold and place the beacon in the center of the courtyard. Defend the beacon from attackers until the Eye has locked on the beacon\'s coordinates.$B$BOnce this is done, all activity outside the enemy\'s base will be viewable from here.$B$BWill you take on this task?', '', 8701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this task?', 'What is this task?', 8700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have only just begun to see the Eye\'s power, $c. If you wish to facilitate the abilities of the Eye, then there is a task that you must complete.', '', 8699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of the Eye is unquestionable, Ryson, but what else can it do?', 'The power of the Eye is unquestionable, Ryson, but what else can it do?', 8698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of the Eye is unquestionable, Ryson, but what else can it do?', 'The power of the Eye is unquestionable, Ryson, but what else can it do?', 8697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The past lives in these wastes, $c.  We must be careful to not awaken it.', '', 8696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t listen to the hearts of the world - the answer lies within.  You know the truth.', '', 8695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking for information that the Cenarion Circle might have archived somewhere, then I\'m the one to talk to.  Then again, you need to know what information you\'re looking for first before I can really help you.$B$BSee how that works?  Brilliant!', '', 8694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it! Return to me should the Eye\'s power falter.', '', 8693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to see my enemies, Ryson. Show them to me.', 'I wish to see my enemies, Ryson. Show them to me.', 8692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n.  I\'ll mobilize my people right now!', 'Thank you, $n.  I\'ll mobilize my people right now!', 8691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The orders are given!  Move out, and show them what we\'re made of!', 'The orders are given!  Move out, and show them what we\'re made of!', 8689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eye sees all within its sphere of influence, $c. What is it that you wish to see?', '', 8688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the orders!  I will deliver them to Teravaine in the Field of Strife!', 'Give me the orders!  I will deliver them to Teravaine in the Field of Strife!', 8687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, what are you waiting for?  Find Field Marshal Teravaine in the Field of Strife and give him the assault orders.  Once he gets the orders, he and his troops will charge into the Horde and take no prisoners!', '$n, what are you waiting for?  Find Field Marshal in the Field of Strife and give him the assault orders.  Once he gets the orders, he and his troops will charge into the Horde and take no prisoners!', 8686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sending ground assaults takes huge amounts of supplies!', '', 8685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surrender an\' we\'ll let ye live, heathens! Jus\' put down yer arms an\' march!', '', 8684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FER THE KING! Push \'em back, soldiers!', '', 8683, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show our enemies your resolve, soldiers! Crush them underfoot! Under steel!', '', 8682, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rally around your Lieutenants and Commanders, soldiers! Keep the savages at bay!', '', 8681, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Withdraw your troops, brother, and I promise you a swift second death!', '', 8680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show these savages no mercy, soldiers! They\'ll give none to you!', '', 8679, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to learn my leatherworking focus.', 'I wish to learn my leatherworking focus.', 8678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earth Mother watch over us; under cover of the night as in the day. Let this fire illuminate both our bodies and spirits and remind us of our honored ancestors, who are ever present and guiding our way.\n', '', 8677, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s springs forth to defend its hive!', '', 8676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s springs forth to defend its hive!', '', 8675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jeztor\'s Riders are ready! Soldiers of the Horde, report for duty!', 8674, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'War Riders are now ready! Soldiers of the Horde, I need your assistance.', 8673, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeee hawww! Mulverick\'s fleet is ready to rock. All able bodied Horde soldiers need request a beacon and try their damndest to plant it so that my War Riders can home in for the aerial assault.', '', 8672, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to plant the beacon, Mulv. Give me a beacon.', 'I\'m ready to plant the beacon, Mulv. Give me a beacon.', 8671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come to prove your worth as a wing man, $n. Take this beacon and plant it dead center of the Snowfall graveyard. Defend it until my fleet arrives.$B$B<Mulverick salutes.>', '', 8670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 113, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consider it done, Jeztor. Give me a beacon.', 'Consider it done, Jeztor. Give me a beacon.', 8669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fleet is ready, $n. You must take this beacon and place it at the western crater of the central battlezone. Defend the beacon from attackers until the fleet is able to lock on to its coordinates!', 8668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get that beacon to the crater safely, Guse. You can count on me!', 'I\'ll get that beacon to the crater safely, Guse. You can count on me!', 8667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require a vial of aqual quintessence, Hydraxis, for I go to the Molten Core to extinguish a rune of the Firelords.', 'I require a vial of aqual quintessence, Hydraxis, for I go to the Molten Core to extinguish a rune of the Firelords.', 8666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, it is good to see you.  Our war with the other elemental lords yet rages, but your efforts help ensure our victory.', '', 8665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Hydraxis, Duke of the Waterlords.  You are not an elemental and so cannot understand our struggle, but perhaps we can strike a deal that will benefit us both...', '', 8664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets loose a shrill cry.', '', 8663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('** SERVOS DESTROYED. UNIT TARGETTING CORRUPT. SHUT DOWN IMMINENT. **', '', 8662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('** PLANTED. CONFIRMING WAR RIDER LOCK. STAND BY. T-MINUS 60 SECONDS. **', '', 8661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('** CONFIRMS TARGET LOCK. WAR RIDER UNIT INCOMING.  AERIAL ASSAULT IMMINENT. **', '', 8660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fleet is ready, $n. You must take this beacon and place it at the eastern crater of the central battlezone. Defend the beacon from attackers until the fleet is able to lock on to its coordinates!', 8659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You continue to thumb through the journal looking for any information that might help in your search for the stolen chest.$B$BTowards the final pages of the book, in red pencil, you see a notation from James along the side of the page. It says, \"Old home near Stone Cairn Lake... gnolls will work perfectly as bodyguards.\"$B$BThere is no reason to suggest this is where the chest is, but there doesn\'t seem to be any other clues.', '', 8658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon, Lokholar shall rise... Soon... Very, very soon...', 8657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shaman Commander is not to be trifled with, $r.', 8656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are under direct orders from Cairne, $r. Do not interfere with the Commander\'s task.', 8655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never look the Commander directly in the eyes.', 8654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pages of the journal seem to be filled with information about trades, buyers  and other miscellaneous business related events.', '', 8653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holds mistletoe over $g his : her; head', 'Holds mistletoe over $g his : her; head', 8652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kazzak is supreme!', '', 8651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Legion! For Kil\'Jaeden!', '', 8650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this sacred place or perish!', '', 8649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be your wingman!', 'I will be your wingman!', 8648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a few good wing men to get me out of here safely and back to base.', '', 8647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have made contact, $n. It is Lokholar the Ice Lord. He has deemed our cause worthy - our earth bound sacrifice sufficient. He comes soon... prepare yourself.', 8646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a great power among us, Commander. Is the spell ready?', 'I sense a great power among us, Commander. Is the spell ready?', 8645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, $n. The elements are stirring. Soon, we will unleash their might upon our enemies. They shall reel from the blows!', 8644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must be close, Commander. I can feel the elements stirring.', 'We must be close, Commander. I can feel the elements stirring.', 8643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is much work left to be done, $n! Continue to strike down our enemies!', 8642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much more blood is needed, Commander?', 'How much more blood is needed, Commander?', 8641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing must befoul the gardens! You must be destroyed!', 8640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do not belong in these gardens.  Your body shall nourish our lovely creations!', 8639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can count on me, Jeztor.', 'You can count on me, Jeztor.', 8638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'About damn time someone came. What took you so long? Ah, nevermind. Cover me, soldier. I gotta make it back to base!', 8637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got your back, Guse.', 'I got your back, Guse.', 8636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work, soldier. I need to get back to base camp! Will you cover me?', 8635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a ride out of here, Martin.', 'I need a ride out of here, Martin.', 8634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s just so horrible. Our three top guns were shot down over Alliance territory during an air assault Nobody knows if they\'re dead or alive!$B$BThis is a terrible blow to our air strike capabilities.', '', 8633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Channel your energies into the Altar!', 8632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is enraged!', '', 8631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not summon me again unless you have a real question to ask, ok?', '', 8630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that some kind of a joke?', '', 8629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not worth answering.', '', 8628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forget about it!', '', 8627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done! The Ice Lord has arrived! Bow to the might of the Horde, fools!', 8626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch as the blood seeps into the snow, children. The elemental will be bound to us!', 8625, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Answer cannot be seen through the twisting nether.', '', 8624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Ice Lord will consume the entire Stormpike army!', 8623, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s cackles.', 8622, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The blood of our enemies shall be spilt upon the battlefield. The great elementals shall answer our call and crush all that stand in our way.', 8621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s\'s death wail has stirred the nearby silithid hive!', 8620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s death wail has stirred the nearby silithid hive!', '', 8619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I drink in your suffering, mortal. Let your essence congeal with Lokholar!', '', 8618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood of a thousand Alliance soldiers I shall spill... None shall stand against the might of the Ice Lord!', '', 8617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHO DARES SUMMON LOKHOLAR?', '', 8616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This expedition is a terrible drain on military supplies.', '', 8615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve reached my supply needs for now.', '', 8614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soldiers of Frostwolf, come to my aid! The time has come to unleash the fury of the elements upon them!', 8613, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s let\'s loose a menacing hoot.', '', 8612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work, soldier. Now we light the fires and spite their ire!', '', 8611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I come for you, puny Alliance!', '', 8610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get back to my ride. Search and destroy imminent! Cover me! On my six! GO GO GO!', '', 8609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guse? Jeztor? Are they... flat spin?? Seas of Southshore??', '', 8608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get down to business!', 8607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no time to waste, trooper. I must get back to base immediately! Cover me!', 8606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WOOT! Made it!', 8605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cover me, soldier! I have to make it back to our base and get the fleet prepped for an aerial assault!', 8604, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hook me up!', 'Hook me up!', 8603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve reached my supply needs for now.', '', 8602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('In Alterac Valley, battles rage and equipment is in short supply.', '', 8601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The kobolds are retaking the Coldtooth Mine!', '', 8600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The troggs are retaking the Irondeep Mine!', '', 8599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken the Irondeep Mine!  Its supplies will now be used for reinforcements!', '', 8597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken the Coldtooth Mine!  Its supplies will now be used for reinforcements!', '', 8596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken the Irondeep Mine!  Its supplies will now be used for reinforcements!', '', 8595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken Coldtooth Mine!  Its supplies will now be used for reinforcements!', '', 8594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Irondeep Mine is owned by the Troggs.', '', 8593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Irondeep Mine is owned by the Horde.', '', 8592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Irondeep Mine is owned by the Alliance.', '', 8591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This monument is dedicated to all those who have fallen in the protection of Stormwind. Our people have weathered unbelievable hardships to retain their freedoms and to control their own destinies. It is here we remember every sacrifice our citizens have made during the first war that riddled our people.', '', 8590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Irondeep Mine is in Alliance territory, north of the Stormpike Graveyard.$B$BIt is controlled by the Troggs.', '', 8589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Irondeep Mine is in Alliance territory, north of the Stormpike Graveyard.$B$BIt is controlled by the Horde.', '', 8588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Irondeep Mine is in Alliance territory, north of the Stormpike Graveyard.$B$BIt is controlled by the Alliance.', '', 8587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who controls the Irondeep Mine?', 'Who controls the Irondeep Mine?', 8586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Coldtooth Mine lies in Horde territory, in the mountains north of the Frostwolf Graveyard.$B$BIt is controlled by the Kobolds.', '', 8585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Coldtooth Mine lies in Horde territory, in the mountains north of the Frostwolf Graveyard.$B$BIt is controlled by the Horde.', '', 8584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Coldtooth Mine lies in Horde territory, in the mountains north of the Frostwolf Graveyard.$B$BIt is controlled by the Alliance.', '', 8583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Coldtooth Mine is owned by the Horde.', '', 8582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Coldtooth Mine is owned by the Alliance.', '', 8581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Coldtooth Mine is owned by the Kobolds.', '', 8580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who controls the Coldtooth Mine?', 'Who controls the Coldtooth Mine?', 8579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Major Domo Enabled.', '', 8578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rally around your Lieutenants and Commanders! Protect our bases!', '', 8577, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Push them back to their base! Let not a single Alliance soldier remain living on this battlefield!', '', 8576, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RUN THEM THROUGH, SOLDIERS!', '', 8575, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush them!!!', '', 8574, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU CANNOT DEFEAT THE LIVING FLAME! COME YOU MINIONS OF FIRE! COME FORTH, YOU CREATURES OF HATE! YOUR MASTER CALLS!', '', 8573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('COME FORTH, MY SERVANTS! DEFEND YOUR MASTER!', '', 8572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, $c? Are you reporting in?', '', 8571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You seek to lure me from my clutch? You shall pay for your insolence!', 8570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have done it!', '', 8569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, just at the water\'s surface!', '', 8568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense that the great beast draws near...', '', 8567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure that you are ready? If we do not have a group of your allies to aid us, we will surely fail.', '', 8566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please return to Zoram\'gar and report our success to the Warsong Runner.', '', 8565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am going to patrol the area for a while longer and ensure that things are truly safe.', '', 8564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A book by a goblin on gnomish military victories... and all the pages are blank.  Figures.', '', 8563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should talk to Dewey about some sort of notation system to keep these books better organized.', '', 8562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many bookshelves, so little time...', '', 8561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quite the riveting tale.  Now I know why there was so much dust on that book.', '', 8560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now where did I put that companion document?', '', 8559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my deepest gratitude. I thank you.', '', 8558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, it\'s not here.  I wonder where I left it last...', '', 8557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the brazier, $n. Put it out. Vorsha is a beast, worthy of praise from no one!', '', 8556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be a tough fight, $n. Follow me closely!', '', 8555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show strength to your enemy, and we will prevail!', 'Show strength to your enemy, and we will prevail!', 8554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require aid.', 'I require aid.', 8553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take heart!  Pain goes away and $gladies love men with scars:men love women with scars;!', 'Take heart!  Pain goes away and $gladies love men with scars:men love women with scars;!', 8552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Messengers from Ravenholdt delivered this letter to me this morning. It is addressed to you, $n.', 'Messengers from Ravenholdt delivered this letter to me this morning. It is addressed to you, $n.', 8551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, this came for you this morning.', '', 8550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to SI:7 headquarters, $n.', '', 8549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I have it, please.', 'May I have it, please.', 8548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got something for you, $n. Looks important.', 'I got something for you, $n. Looks important.', 8547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Guards! It\'s going to step on me!', 'Help! Guards! It\'s going to step on me!', 8546, 13, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you\'ve won already? Perhaps you\'ll need another lesson in pain!', '', 8545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over in the Hall of Arms you can find our resident stable master, Ulbrek Firehand.  He\'ll make sure any pets ye have are well fed and rightly cared for.', 'Over in the Hall of Arms you can find our resident stable master, Ulbrek Firehand.  He\'ll make sure any pets ye have are well fed and rightly cared for.', 8544, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taking care of animals is something that Ulbrek Firehand takes quite seriously.  He usually hangs out with the hunters at the Hall of Arms if ye want him to look after a pet or two.', 'Taking care of animals is something that Ulbrek Firehand takes quite seriously.  He usually hangs out with the hunters at the Hall of Arms if ye want him to look after a pet or two.', 8543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stable Master', 'Stable Master', 8542, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shelby Stoneflint houses a good deal of pets for the local hunters.  She can be found over by the Thunderbrew Distillery if ye need her to look after a pet.', 'Shelby Stoneflint houses a good deal of pets for the local hunters.  She can be found over by the Thunderbrew Distillery if ye need her to look after a pet.', 8541, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well $glad : lass;, ye can find Shelby Stoneflint right outside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos.  She\'ll take good care of any pets ye might have.', 'Well $glad : lass;, ye can find Shelby Stoneflint right outside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos.  She\'ll take good care of any pets ye might have.', 8540, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stable Master', 'Stable Master', 8539, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need to house your pet while you\'re training another, then you should talk to Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District.', 'If you need to house your pet while you\'re training another, then you should talk to Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District.', 8538, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District is the one you\'re looking for.  She tends to hunters\' pets while they seek training from her father.', 'Jenova Stoneshield over in the Dwarven District is the one you\'re looking for.  She tends to hunters\' pets while they seek training from her father.', 8537, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stable Master', 'Stable Master', 8536, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did you kill me, $n?', '', 8535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stable Master', 'Stable Master', 8534, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erma does all the caring for animals around here.  She\'s right outside the Lion\'s Pride Inn if you need to speak with her.', 'Erma does all the caring for animals around here.  She\'s right outside the Lion\'s Pride Inn if you need to speak with her.', 8533, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good ol\' Erma, she\'s been taking care of the local animals for years now.  I\'m sure she\'d be happy to take care of any you\'d like to put up.  She can be found right outside of the Lion\'s Pride Inn.', 'Good ol\' Erma, she\'s been taking care of the local animals for years now.  I\'m sure she\'d be happy to take care of any you\'d like to put up.  She can be found right outside of the Lion\'s Pride Inn.', 8532, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek someone who cares for animals?  Then you should look for Seriadne outside the Inn in Dolanaar.  She is the one that you seek.', 'You seek someone who cares for animals?  Then you should look for Seriadne outside the Inn in Dolanaar.  She is the one that you seek.', 8531, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, gentle Seriadne.  All animals are safe while in her care.  You can find her just outside the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'Ah, gentle Seriadne.  All animals are safe while in her care.  You can find her just outside the Inn in Dolanaar.', 8530, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stable Master', 'Stable Master', 8529, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are all pieces of a much larger puzzle, $n. Just as you guide the piece of a puzzle to its destination, so too are we guided by another.$B$BAnd perhaps they who guide us are themselves guided by an even greater force.', '', 8528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For many hundreds of years Alassin has cared for the animals that our hunters befriend.  His care of animals is highly sought for by the hunters around here.  If you seek him as well, then look for him in the Cenarion Enclave.', 'For many hundreds of years Alassin has cared for the animals that our hunters befriend.  His care of animals is highly sought for by the hunters around here.  If you seek him as well, then look for him in the Cenarion Enclave.', 8527, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can trust any pets you have to be well taken care of by Alassin.  He resides in the Cenarion Enclave where the hunters gather.', 'You can trust any pets you have to be well taken care of by Alassin.  He resides in the Cenarion Enclave where the hunters gather.', 8526, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stable Master', 'Stable Master', 8525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
