('Pets to take care of?  Just make sure you clean up after it!  Look for Shoja\'my in front of the inn.', 'Pets to take care of?  Just make sure you clean up after it!  Look for Shoja\'my in front of the inn.', 8507, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoja\'my is over in front of the inn.  Now move along, I\'m busy.', 'Shoja\'my is over in front of the inn.  Now move along, I\'m busy.', 8506, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did you kill me, $n?', '', 8505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a test spirit healer.', '', 8504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May Elune walk with you, $c.  The Temple of the Moon has come to help the troubled citizens of Auberdine.', 8503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I was not bound by duty to Master Ravenholdt, I would follow you to the ends of the world, $G Master:Mistress; $n. You are grace and cunning personified.', 'If I was not bound by duty to Master Ravenholdt, I would follow you to the ends of the world, $G Master:Mistress; $n. You are grace and cunning personified.', 8502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 16, 0, 1, 2, 0, 39653),
('I wept like a babe when I heard of your heroics. Master Ravenholdt would do well to have an apprentice like you.', 'I wept like a babe when I heard of your heroics. Master Ravenholdt would do well to have an apprentice like you.', 8501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And to think, one day you might be the one that the stories of legend are about!', 'And to think, one day you might be the one that the stories of legend are about!', 8500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time has come, $n. Master Kang awaits...', 'Your time has come, $n. Master Kang awaits...', 8499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really envy you, $n. You do amazing work.', 'I really envy you, $n. You do amazing work.', 8498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marvelous. Simply marvelous. You are an inspiration to us all, $n.', 'Marvelous. Simply marvelous. You are an inspiration to us all, $n.', 8497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should talk to Winstone. I hear he\'s looking for thieves with your skill.', 'You should talk to Winstone. I hear he\'s looking for thieves with your skill.', 8496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re shaping up nicely, $n. I\'ve heard good things...', 'You\'re shaping up nicely, $n. I\'ve heard good things...', 8495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Making it out of here without a blade in your back or poison in your veins would be an accomplishment.', 'Making it out of here without a blade in your back or poison in your veins would be an accomplishment.', 8494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare set foot inside Ravenholdt Manor, worm?', 'You dare set foot inside Ravenholdt Manor, worm?', 8493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Manor has been abuzz with talk of your arrival, $G Master:Mistress; $n. We are all honored and graced by your presence.', '', 8492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 16, 0, 1, 2, 0, 39653),
('It is my dream to one day serve under your command, $G Master:Mistress; $n. That is, should you ever deem me worthy of such things...', '', 8491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 16, 0, 1, 2, 0, 39653),
('I am unworthy of this conversation, $G Master:Mistress;.', '', 8490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tales of your heroics are heard throughout Ravenholdt Manor, $G Master:Mistress; $n.', '', 8489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence steels our nerves, $G Master:Mistress; $n.', '', 8488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G Master:Mistress; $n! Master Kang has been asking about you! Perhaps it is your time!', '', 8487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 25, 0, 1, 2, 0, 39653),
('I believe Simone was looking for you earlier, $n. Have you spoken with her yet?', '', 8486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 1, 2, 0, 39653),
('An honor to see you again, $n.', '', 8485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have truly grown more cunning, $n.', '', 8484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Syndicate is made up of a bunch of hacks - disorganized, unskilled, and lazy... ', '', 8483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. Have you spoken with Fahrad yet?', '', 8482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you again, $n.', '', 8481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
