('You need to be exalted with the dwarves of Ironforge before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.', 'You need to be exalted with the dwarves of Ironforge before I will teach you a riding skill, $c.', 8431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erm... I really don\'t know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered exalted amongst the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as exalted to Gnomeregan, I\'d be happy to show you what I have to offer.', 'Erm... I really don\'t know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered exalted amongst the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as exalted to Gnomeregan, I\'d be happy to show you what I have to offer.', 8430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 24, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I\'ll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that\'s not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you\'ve been recognized as exalted to Ironforge, I\'ll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale.', 'Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I\'ll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that\'s not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you\'ve been recognized as exalted to Ironforge, I\'ll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale.', 8429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least exalted to the Kingdom of Stormwind.  These steeds are the finest you\'ll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn\'t want them in the hands of our enemies.$B$BNot saying you\'re an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business.', 'Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least exalted to the Kingdom of Stormwind.  These steeds are the finest you\'ll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn\'t want them in the hands of our enemies.$B$BNot saying you\'re an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business.', 8428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You looking for plucky?  Well, you didn\'t hear me say this, but... maybe if you ask Kronkrider up in the tower, he\'ll tell you...', 'You looking for plucky?  Well, you didn\'t hear me say this, but... maybe if you ask Kronkrider up in the tower, he\'ll tell you...', 8427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plucky?  I heard race master Kronkrider up on the the tower knows where he is.', 'Plucky?  I heard race master Kronkrider up on the the tower knows where he is.', 8426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay calm, people.  We don\'t want to give away our position.', '', 8425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be notching our axes after this.', '', 8424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say Duriel is a fierce night elf.  It\'ll be a good fight!', '', 8423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These woods make my tusks itch...', '', 8422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With luck, we\'ll gain some good scars today.', '', 8421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steady, people.  We\'ll raid soon enough.', '', 8420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders! Attack the intruders!', 'Intruders! Attack the intruders!', 8419, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back! Children should not be here! Be gone, child!', '', 8418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas $c, you are not considered to be exalted to Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal.', 'Alas $c, you are not considered to be exalted to Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal.', 8417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not known to my people.  A kodo is a mighty steed, and it is the product of love and care by my people; such is not given onto strangers.  Until the elders of Thunder Bluff consider you to be exalted, I cannot offer you the sale of a kodo.', 'You are not known to my people.  A kodo is a mighty steed, and it is the product of love and care by my people; such is not given onto strangers.  Until the elders of Thunder Bluff consider you to be exalted, I cannot offer you the sale of a kodo.', 8416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won\'t be sellin\' my raptors to someone who hasn\'t proven themselves to be exalted to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be no less than exalted to us, then I\'ll make my raptors available to ya.', 'I\'m sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won\'t be sellin\' my raptors to someone who hasn\'t proven themselves to be exalted to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be no less than exalted to us, then I\'ll make my raptors available to ya.', 8415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only make my mounts available to those who are considered exalted to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I\'ll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection.', 'I only make my mounts available to those who are considered exalted to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I\'ll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection.', 8414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we will get a moment to rest. But I will not give up until we have faced off against Vorsha!', '', 8413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be on your guard, $n!', '', 8412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Royal Apothecary Society has little patience for fools, as do I.  Perhaps the next time you and I speak of my steeds, you will be considered exalted by the Undercity.  Until then...', 'The Royal Apothecary Society has little patience for fools, as do I.  Perhaps the next time you and I speak of my steeds, you will be considered exalted by the Undercity.  Until then...', 8411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we must wait. It won\'t be long before the naga realize what we have done.', '', 8410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear lies in your heart. When you truly are ready to face Vorsha the Lasher, come speak with me.', '', 8409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Train me in the ways of the beast.', 'Train me in the ways of the beast.', 8408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.', 'Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets.', 8407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?', 'You\'ve come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?', 8406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 8405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your selection of grimoires.', 'Show me your selection of grimoires.', 8404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re no warlock and I\'ve no time for you.  Begone!', 'You\'re no warlock and I\'ve no time for you.  Begone!', 8403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want to make your demons more powerful?  It\'ll cost you, but you\'ve come to the right place.', 'Want to make your demons more powerful?  It\'ll cost you, but you\'ve come to the right place.', 8402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what I have access to, Lokhtos.', 'Show me what I have access to, Lokhtos.', 8401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thorium Brotherhood possesses the knowledge required to make the sacred arms and armaments of the Fire Lord, but we lack the manpower to obtain the materials required for the crafting.$B$BI, Lokhtos Darkbargainer, have been empowered by the Brotherhood to exchange the exalted recipes for materials gathered from the Molten Core.$B$BPresent your offer, $r.', '', 8400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, you know a few things! If you wanna\' learn more you\'re gonna\' have to talk to Georgio Bolero in Stormwind.', '', 8399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s attacks the banner!', '', 8398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warriors of the night... Assemble!', 8397, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Great Mother!', 8396, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In position!', 8395, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid not, $n. Now, feel the shame you have brought upon yourself.', '', 8394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is the wrong answer, $n. Be off with you.', '', 8393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, answer me this, $n:$BWhich creature became the Lich King before spreading the plague across Lordaeron?', '', 8392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s always nice when someone wishes to speak to me. How are things with you, $c?', '', 8391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My question to you is this, $c:$BWhich of the Aspects created by the titans became the nefarious creature known as Deathwing?', '', 8390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. Is there something I can help you with?', '', 8389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malygos, is it?', '', 8388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alexstrazsa, the Life-Binder. A magnificent creature.', '', 8387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neltharion, hmm? As good an answer as any, yes?', '', 8386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malygos is my answer.', 'Malygos is my answer.', 8385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alexstrasza is  my answer.', 'Alexstrasza is  my answer.', 8384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neltharion is  my answer.', 'Neltharion is  my answer.', 8383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Ysera the Dreamer.', '', 8382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ysera is my answer.', 'Ysera is my answer.', 8381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ner\'zhul is my answer.', 'Ner\'zhul is my answer.', 8380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kil\'jaeden is my answer.', 'Kil\'jaeden is my answer.', 8379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan is my answer.', 'Gul\'dan is my answer.', 8378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kel\'Thuzad is my answer.', 'Kel\'Thuzad is my answer.', 8377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Ner\'zhul. Not a name that should be uttered lightly, but I did ask you for an answer.$B$BAnd Ner\'zhul is the correct one.', '', 8376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An interesting response to my question... and the wrong one.', '', 8375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan. Not a name many have heard on Azeroth.$B$BUnfortunately, not the correct answer.', '', 8374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kel\'Thuzad? If you know that name at all, then perhaps you did read the book I sent you to get.$B$BUnfortunately, you\'re answer is incorrect.', '', 8373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While nothing can change the past, time can heal all wounds. Thank you for showing me that it is possible, $n. I wish you well.', 8372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people, they are as shattered as the relic you seek to repair.', 8371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why have you come here, $c?', 8370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require training, Nissa.', 'I require training, Nissa.', 8369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you a student of the medical sciences?', 8368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can feel the presence of evil leaving...', 8367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May this evil aura be banished from this artifact!', 8366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require training, Arnok.', 'I require training, Arnok.', 8365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am an orc of medicine, $r. If you have come here to learn, I shall do my best to teach.', '', 8364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I regret to inform you that you have failed your examination, doctor.', '', 8363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The good doctor saves the day! HOORAY!', '', 8362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweet, sweet embrace... take me... ', '', 8361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brain encaved... mortar... bas... hed... leaking... dyin... g...', '', 8360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HOORAY! I AM SAVED!', '', 8359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goodbye, cruel world... I\'m leavin\' you today... goodbye... goodbye... goodbye...', '', 8358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not gonna make it... death comes... ', '', 8357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My entrails are leaking out! HELP!', '', 8356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m saved! Thank you, doctor!', '', 8355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I think I see Blue...', '', 8354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dying... See the light... gloriouss...', '', 8353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heeellp meee... ri... ribss... bro... broken.', '', 8352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!  You cannot be stronger than the Foulweald!  No!!', '', 8351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a little gnat to the Foulweald!  Die!', '', 8350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require training, Daryl.', 'I require training, Daryl.', 8349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I keep \'em fed, kid. Yep, Daryl Riknussun, at yer service.', '', 8348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require training, Zamja.', 'I require training, Zamja.', 8347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Can Zamja help you, $r?', 8346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your goods, Dirge.', 'I wish to browse your goods, Dirge.', 8345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may have been suffering a drought but there\'s no shortage of meat! Care to browse my goods?', '', 8344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Crystal Restore is a difficult item to acquire.$B$BI believe that it comes from Un\'Goro Crater, so you\'d best head there.', 8343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enchanted thorium is a highly sought-after metal. You best chance of finding some of it is to speak with an artisan blacksmith or miner.', 8342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I find Crystal Restore?', 'Where can I find Crystal Restore?', 8341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I get Enchanted Thorium?', 'Where can I get Enchanted Thorium?', 8340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, leave this place, $n. You know nothing of what troubles us...', 8339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, I was able to reseal the relic, $n.', 8338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require training, Grimnur.', 'I require training, Grimnur.', 8337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yap, I can teach ye to fish.', '', 8336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require training, Lumak.', 'I require training, Lumak.', 8335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fish so delicious. You come learn fish? Eat fish? Mmmmm...', '', 8334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ishnu... Oshalan thara dormil... Anu\'dorin...', 8333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please wait while I attempt to bind the shards together so that they will be whole once again.', 8332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a rage after seeing Misha fall in battle!', '%s goes into a rage after seeing Misha fall in battle!', 8331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stonetalon Mountain has many perilous caves through out this region.  Exploring these caves can hold many adventures for those willing to risk life for glory.$B$B$C, perhaps you seek riches that only following your heart and soul can garnish.', '', 8330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for helping me. I know my way back from here.', 8329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out! We\'re under attack!', 8328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go before they find out I\'m free!', 8327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you\'re here for the Warsong axes. Well, it\'s about time, $n. That crate has been sitting out there for days, now.$B$BFeel free to haul it away whenever you are ready.', '', 8326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see some interesting characters come and go here at the port. Watch yourself, $n. It\'s never clear who to trust, what with all of the shady activity that goes on here...', '', 8325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Myranda, do you have enough eyeballs to make another amulet? I have lost the old one.', 'Myranda, do you have enough eyeballs to make another amulet? I have lost the old one.', 8324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this.', 8323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Malfurion lies in the Dreaming.  Never forget this.', 8322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s collapses upon seeing his master die!', '', 8321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, Warchief!', 'Of course, Warchief!', 8320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Thrall laughs.>$B$BNoted... Now pay attention, $n. The Black Dragonflight brood mother, Onyxia, has been flushed out from her position of power in Stormwind. She has escaped, fleeing to her lair in Dustwallow Marsh.$B$BShe cannot be allowed to live in such close proximity to our capital cities. We must strike before being struck!$B$BI want her destroyed, $n. ', '', 8319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live only to serve, Warchief! My life is empty and meaningless without your guidance.', 'I live only to serve, Warchief! My life is empty and meaningless without your guidance.', 8318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, $n, you did not. I do not fault you, however, as yours is a mind much like mine was as a youth: Impetuous, rebellious, and often without a single coherent thought! Traits I can no longer afford to express.$B$BEnough lamenting. $R, I have a task for you; one that you may not survive. ', '', 8317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I did not think of it that way, Warchief.', 'I... I did not think of it that way, Warchief.', 8316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Thrall laughs.>$B$BSo much to learn still, $r.$B$BYou are too young to remember the wars and bloodshed of ages past. Too young to remember the burden of the curse carried by our people.$B$BOur position with the Alliance right now is a tenuous one. Skirmishes and smaller battles do take place, but there is peace - something our people have not known for millennia. Would you give this up and plunge us into the maw of chaos again but against a new foe? One that will not rest until we are all destroyed?', '', 8315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With all due respect, Warchief - why not allow them to be destroyed? Does this not strengthen our position?\n', 'With all due respect, Warchief - why not allow them to be destroyed? Does this not strengthen our position?\n', 8314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight had used illusion and trickery to disguise herself as a member of the royal court. Worse yet, she had assumed control of the current Highlord of Stormwind, Bolvar Fordragon.$B$BIt is no wonder that such foolish military decisions had been made. The movement of the Alliance forces as of late had left us scratching our heads. We now understand that the Black Flight was attempting to divide the empire - destroy it from within.', '', 8313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Usurper?', 'Usurper?', 8312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would appear as if the influence of the Black Dragonflight had extended beyond the borders of the Burning Steppes and into the kingdom of Stormwind itself! The usurper has since been unmasked and ousted.', '', 8311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What discoveries?', 'What discoveries?', 8310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shattered Hand has been able to place spies throughout the upper citadel of Blackrock. Though the information gathering process has been slow, we have made discoveries that cannot be ignored.', '', 8309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please share your wisdom with me, Warchief.', 'Please share your wisdom with me, Warchief.', 8308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lysta, summon forth... the abomination!', '', 8307, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lysta, summon in undead captives.', '', 8306, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic. You two do not deserve the training you are getting here if that was the best you can do.', '', 8305, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emerges to protect the Fathom Stone!', '', 8304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not see the warrior\'s spirit within you, child.  I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself.', 'I do not see the warrior\'s spirit within you, child.  I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself.', 8303, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn\'t even last a day under my training regimen!  $B$BA $c who thinks $ghe\'s : she\'s; a warrior.  Ha!', 'Yer no warrior... Why ye wouldn\'t even last a day under my training regimen!  $B$BA $c who thinks $ghe\'s : she\'s; a warrior.  Ha!', 8302, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid your darkness quotient isn\'t sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further.  Move along please.', 'I\'m afraid your darkness quotient isn\'t sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further.  Move along please.', 8301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness does not embrace you, $c.  Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight!  Be gone!', 'The darkness does not embrace you, $c.  Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight!  Be gone!', 8300, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can tell just by the way you\'re standing that you\'re no warrior.  $B$BWhy don\'t you go do something safe, like read a book.', 'I can tell just by the way you\'re standing that you\'re no warrior.  $B$BWhy don\'t you go do something safe, like read a book.', 8299, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I submit myself for further training, my master.', 'I submit myself for further training, my master.', 8298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no time to waste on the likes of you $c.', 'I have no time to waste on the likes of you $c.', 8297, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is wise that you humble yourself before me, $n, in your desire for more warlock knowledge.', 'It is wise that you humble yourself before me, $n, in your desire for more warlock knowledge.', 8296, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek further druidic training to have a closer understanding of the Earth Mother\'s will.', 'I seek further druidic training to have a closer understanding of the Earth Mother\'s will.', 8295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  May your ancestors watch over you $c.', 'Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  May your ancestors watch over you $c.', 8294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?', '$n, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?', 8293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a greater knowledge of the ways of the warlock that I crave.', 'It is a greater knowledge of the ways of the warlock that I crave.', 8292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c.', 'Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c.', 8291, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems you\'ll need another lesson, mortals!', 8290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me $n.', 'You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me $n.', 8289, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This meaningless exertion bores me. I\'ll incinerate you all from above!', 8288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Learn your place, mortal!', 8287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How fortuitous. Usually, I must leave my lair in order to feed.', 8286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I mean you no harm. I am scouting the quilboar and taking notes of their activities. My people have noticed something odd--an emanation or darkness--coming from this area. I\'ve come to investigate, and what I\'ve found is very disturbing.$B$BThere seems to be an undead diplomat who is powerful in the ways of the arcane. I don\'t believe he\'s one of the Forsaken... I think it\'s worse.', 8285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone ready?', '', 8284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 8283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourselves.  Silverwing is just around the bend.', '', 8282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go report that the outpost is taken.  We will remain here.', '', 8281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silverwing is ours!', '', 8280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who dares attack the Silverwing Outpost?!?', 8279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, let\'s move out!', '', 8278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ragers, Fetch!', '', 8277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got nothin\' more to teach! Not for somebody who knows as much as you do, anyway! You Horde types need to talk to Nogg in Orgrimmar!', '', 8276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for ya?', 'What can I do for ya?', 8275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish to unlearn my talents.', 8274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn my talents.', '', 8273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. I do.', 'Yes. I do.', 8272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn my talents.', 'I wish to unlearn my talents.', 8271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.', 8270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.', 8269, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.', 8268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.', 'The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.', 8267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s medallion shatters.', '', 8266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for freeing me.  Speak with my sister in Splintertree.  I... I must find a place to rest...', '', 8265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the wisdom and knowledge of the beast, and you will see yourself. Observe as the owl does, learn cleverness from the sabercat, embody the mighty spirit of the wolf.', 'Look at the wisdom and knowledge of the beast, and you will see yourself. Observe as the owl does, learn cleverness from the sabercat, embody the mighty spirit of the wolf.', 8264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you desire, in addition to training, I have it within my power to erase the knowledge of your talents from your mind.  Be warned that every time you undergo this procedure the more difficult it is to perform, and therefore the more expensive it becomes.', 'If you desire, in addition to training, I have it within my power to erase the knowledge of your talents from your mind.  Be warned that every time you undergo this procedure the more difficult it is to perform, and therefore the more expensive it becomes.', 8263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. I do.', 'Yes. I do.', 8262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I reset my Talents?', 'How do I reset my Talents?', 8261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?', 'Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?', 8260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 8259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements speak to us, $c.  They share knowledge that we must learn, and they share secrets that must be kept.', '', 8258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to know about the comings and goings of caravans and merchants here in Splintertree Post, then I am fortunately the orc you are looking for.  Unfortunately for you though, I don\'t like people.$B$BIf you want something, make it quick.', '', 8257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, as are my forces. Let us end this masquerade!', 'I am ready, as are my forces. Let us end this masquerade!', 8256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dragon hides behind a royal facade. The tablets will reveal her for what she is... If what I have seen holds true, I will not survive this battle, friend. It is you that must finish what I have started. Are your forces ready? Are you ready? We will begin on your command.', '', 8255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 25, 1000, 2000, 3000, 39653),
('%s forces one of his Firesworn minions to erupt!', '', 8254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s performs one last service for Ragnaros...', '', 8253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s becomes exhausted!', '', 8252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s dies.', '', 8251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bol... Bolvar... the medallion... use...', '', 8250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reginald... I... I am sorry.', '', 8249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have failed him, mortalsss... Farewell!', 8248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DO NOT LET HER ESCAPE!', '', 8247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Was this fated, Windsor? If it was death that you came for, then the prophecy has been fulfilled. May your consciousness rot in the Twisting Nether. Finish the rest of these meddlesome insects, children. Bolvar, you have been a pleasurable puppet.', 8246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hisses.', '', 8245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n brought us booze!  Let\'s party!', '', 8244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings $c - welcome to the front lines in our conquest of Ashenvale!  If you are looking for something to do, then you\'ve come to the right place.  I\'m always looking for able-bodied individuals to help bring glory to the Horde!', '', 8243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at what $n brought us!  Let\'s drink up!', '', 8242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Drag race will start in 1 minute!', '', 8241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your seats, folks!  The race is starting in 2 minutes!', '', 8240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yesss... Guards, come to your lord\'s aid!', 8239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s laughs.', 8238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dragon filth! Guards! Guards! Seize this monster!', '', 8237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gasps.', '', 8236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Curious... Windsor, in this vision, did you survive? I only ask because one thing that I can and will assure is your death. Here and now.', 8235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mightiest of all the beasts that make up the Ashenvale Hunt, Sharptalon is let to wander freely by the self-proclaimed guardians of this land, the night elves.  Sharptalon patrols for prey to the south of here, taking delight in rending the unsuspecting and unaware traveler limb from limb.$B$BTo bring down such a beast would be the mightiest of hauls, $n.  I wish you luck in the hunt for this creature!', 8234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This nightsaber is rumored to be docile in the presence of night elves and their allies, which makes her an even more worthy opponent.  Shadumbra\'s hunting path takes her from the Raynewood Retreat to our west, ultimately to lands due west of there.  Her fur is the color of pitch, and her speed is not to be underestimated.', 8233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This bear wanders a path close to where the Talondeep Path lies, due west of Mystral Lake and the Alliance outpost of Silverwind Refuge.  While he is the easiest of the three creatures you will face on the Ashenvale Hunt, he should not be trifled with.  His presence is a constant threat to travelers who sojourn between Ashenvale and the Stonetalon Mountains.', 8232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about the hippogryph - Sharptalon?\n', 'What can you tell me about the hippogryph - Sharptalon?', 8231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about the nightsaber cat - Shadumbra?\n', 'What can you tell me about the nightsaber cat - Shadumbra?', 8230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about the bear - Ursangous?\n', 'What can you tell me about the bear - Ursangous?', 8229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reads from the tablets. Unknown, unheard sounds flow through your consciousness.', '', 8228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Irons thought these tablets to be encoded. This is not any form of coding, it is the tongue of ancient dragon.', '', 8227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reaches into his pack and pulls out the encoded tablets.', '', 8226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s obviously beaten, tries to run.', '', 8225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s, too injured, gives up the chase.', '', 8224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place Termite Barrel on the crate.', 'Place Termite Barrel on the crate.', 8223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sturdy crate sits in the middle of the lumber mill surrounded by debris and very zealous followers of the Scarlet Crusade.', '', 8222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to train.', 'I would like to train.', 8221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The best miner has a firm grip on $ghis:her; pick, a stout heart in $ghis:her; chest, and thick, black dust in $ghis:her; hair.', '', 8220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, dragon. Let the truth resonate throughout these halls.', '', 8219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not escape your fate, Onyxia. It has been prophesied - a vision resonating from the great halls of Karazhan. It ends now...', '', 8218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wildhammer dwarves might have fast steeds, but can those Aerie Peak gryphons stand the heat of The Great Forge?  I think not!', '', 8217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And as your limp body dangles from the rafters, I shall take pleasure in knowing that a mad man has been put to death. After all, what proof do you have? Did you expect to come in here and point your fingers at royalty and leave unscathed? ', 8216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will be incarcerated and tried for treason, Windsor. I shall watch with glee as they hand down a guilty verdict and sentence you to death by hanging...', 8215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s laughs.', 8214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ask me, there\'s no greater profession than a miner.  And if you ask me, there\'s no greater miner than a dwarf!', '', 8213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the safe hall, your majesty.', '', 8212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The masquerade is over, Lady Prestor. Or should I call you by your true name... Onyxia...', '', 8211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Majesty, run while you still can. She is not what you think her to be...', '', 8210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mark my words!  You won\'t find faster gryphons anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms than the ones right here in Thelsamar!', '', 8209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onward!', '', 8208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be brave, friends. The reptile will thrash wildly. It is an act of desperation. When you are ready, give me the word.', '', 8207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, friends. To Stormwind Keep!', '', 8206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, old friend. You have done the right thing.', '', 8205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do so enjoy sitting out here, listening to the sounds of the Great Sea.  Oh, what?  Yes, there is a ship that will take you to Menethil Harbor.  It docks here from time to time.', 8204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who sent you here? You\'re not ready for my instruction yet! You\'ll be told when you\'re ready.', '', 8203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re doing very well in the art of tailoring, I must admit. Now, let\'s see how good you REALLY are...', '', 8202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. You have now earned tailoring\'s highest honor. Go forth, and do terrible things with this knowledge!', '', 8201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The place is a bit drafty... but what do I care? I\'m dead.', '', 8200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not worthy, sir.', '', 8199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot help you until you have learned more of the essentials. Come back to me when you are ready.', '', 8198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have come a long way, traveler. There is one more task for you to perform...', '', 8197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have truly become one of the finest tailors in the business! Congratulations, I am proud to have been your instructor!', '', 8196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have outfitted kings. With the proper training, you can too.', '', 8195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! I can tell that my efforts will not be wasted!', '', 8194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will instruct you when the time is right... that time is not now. You have much more to learn first!', '', 8193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before your learning may begin, I must ask of you a favor...', '', 8192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You require the instruction of a true master! Go to Daryl Stack in Tarren Mill and embrace your destiny!', '', 8191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cloth is okay. Personally I prefer to work with human skin.', '', 8190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! I can tell that my efforts will not be wasted!', '', 8189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll need more training before I can share my knowledge with you, I\'m afraid. ', '', 8188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require all my students to prove their dedication. Now it\'s your turn...', '', 8187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s only one person I know of who is more learned in the art of tailoring than myself. Last I heard he could be found in Theramore Isle. He is the person you should seek.', '', 8186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I\'ve been running this shop for some time now. Business has been pretty good lately. A lot of new adventurers coming through...', '', 8185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A living legend... ', 'A living legend... ', 8184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...nerves of thorium.', '...nerves of thorium.', 8183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good, you\'ve got some grit! I like that. Well then, let\'s get going!', 8182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I share my secrets with a beginner? Try speaking with Victor Ward first.', 8181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A moment I shall remember for always.', 'A moment I shall remember for always.', 8180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay... so you wanna\' be a tailor. How about you prove it?', 8179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have worked your way up... time to see the boss. Go to Josef and tell him you are ready.', 8178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are but dirt beneath your feet, sir.', 'We are but dirt beneath your feet, sir.', 8177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tailoring can come in very handy. I once had to sew my arm back on.', 8176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make way!', 'Make way!', 8175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are truly a determined student. I will be happy to provide you with instruction!', 8174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are fundamental things you must learn before I can aid you. Speak to my apprentice, Vhan. He is kind and patient and will teach you what you need to know.', 8173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There walks a hero.', 'There walks a hero.', 8172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will require a demonstration of your determination before I share my gifts with you...', 8171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are an inspiration to us all, sir.', 'You are an inspiration to us all, sir.', 8170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My knowledge is limited, though I am still learning. It is time for you to move on, traveler. Find Josef Gregorian in Undercity and tell him you are ready.', 8169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aren\'t the patterns beautiful? Each one speaks with its own voice.', 8168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light be with you, sir.', 'Light be with you, sir.', 8167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Expertly accomplished! Now, let us continue your education...', 8166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You still have lessons to learn before I may begin your training. In the meantime, perhaps Vhan, in Thunder Bluff can help you.', 8165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is a task I would like you to perform before we go any further...', 8164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your knowledge is great, traveler. You must learn from one who is wiser than I. Many tales have been told of the wisdom of Josef Gregorian. You may find him in Undercity.', 8163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to our tent. May I assist you?', 8162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done well, traveler. I am proud to call you my student!', 8161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are basics that must be learned. Trianna is standing nearby, speak with her and return to me later.', 8160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are many obstacles one must overcome on the path to excellence. Your path is no exception...', 8159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your talents excel! You are truly inspired. To continue your pursuit of knowledge, speak with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. He is held in high regard, and will be able to further your instruction.', 8158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a fine day! It inspires me to create a new design.', 8157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well well, not too bad. Maybe I CAN show you a few things...', '', 8156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! You ain\'t got what it takes... yet! Come back to me after you\'ve learned a few things!', '', 8155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you got it, maybe you don\'t. I think I got a way to find out...', '', 8154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not bad... for an amateur! Still, you know about as much as I do. If you wanna\' learn more you\'re gonna\' have to talk to Josef Gregorian in Undercity.', '', 8153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say a stitch in time saves... what, eleven? Ah, I can\'t remember. Stupid saying anyway.', '', 8152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('About time you showed me some results! Now I\'ll show you results!', '', 8151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Why are you bothering me? Why, I bet you can\'t even create a high quality robe! Go talk to Snang and come back when you\'re worthy of my talents!', '', 8150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you just walk up to me and I start teaching you? Ha! You need to pay your dues like everyone else!', '', 8149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to learn from someone who knows more than I do. Go talk to Josef Gregorian in Undercity. Well, what are you still doing here?', '', 8148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I made a lot of the things you see in the store. What do you think? Answer carefully, your life may depend on it.', '', 8147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look around you, $r. Appreciate what you see today.$b$bMuch has changed since I first stepped foot into this forest. Wonderful and unexpected changes....', 8146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... you show a little promise, I\'ll give you that. Okay then, where were we?', '', 8145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time to babysit! Go talk to me assistant, Uthrar! ', '', 8144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t train just anyone! You\'ll need to perform a task first!', '', 8143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, aren\'t you the smarty-pants? Ye know more than I do, I can tell ye that! Don\'t go getting\' a big head, but if ye want to keep learnin\', have a chat with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. They say he knows his tailorin\'!', '', 8142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, this Darnassian fabric is the finest!', '', 8141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine display of worthiness. Your instruction may now continue.', '', 8140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Lawrence Shneider at Duncan\'s Textiles around the corner to the left. He is adept at dealing with beginners.', '', 8139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will teach you, but first you must prove your worth...', '', 8138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are beyond my level of expertise. Georgio Bolero, the master of Duncan\'s Textiles around the corner could help you advance your skills.', '', 8137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day to you.', '', 8136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit Aayndia Floralwind in the town of Astranaar in Ashenvale Forest. She has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents.', '', 8135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, it is time to bring her reign to an end, Marcus. Stand down, friend.', '', 8134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holding me here is not the right decision, Marcus.', '', 8133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shame our ancestors. We shame those lost to us... forgive me, Reginald.', '', 8132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find passage to Theramore from this dock.  Heed my words, those lands are rarely safe to travel for people of the Alliance.  Watch your step and your back.', '', 8131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, Reginald. May the light guide your hand.', '', 8130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reginald Windsor is not to be harmed! He shall pass through untouched!', '', 8129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move aside! Let them pass!', '', 8128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand down! Can you not see that heroes walk among us?', '', 8127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dear friend, you honor them with your vigilant watch. You are steadfast in your allegiance. I do not doubt for a moment that you would not give as great a sacrifice for your people as any of the heroes you stand under.', '', 8126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ashamed, old friend. I know not what I do anymore. It is not you that would dare bring shame to the heroes of legend - it is I. It is I and the rest of these corrupt politicians. They fill our lives with empty promises, unending lies.', '', 8125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s appears lost in contemplation.', '', 8124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must do what you think is right, Marcus. We served together under Turalyon. He made us both the men that we are today. Did he err with me? Do you truly believe my intent is to cause harm to our alliance? Would I shame our heroes?', '', 8123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You haven\'t lived until you\'ve looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider.', '', 8122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reginald, you know that I cannot let you pass.', '', 8121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a look at my meats, friend.  You won\'t want to go out into the Barrens without a good stock of provisions.', '', 8120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seize him! Seize the worthless criminal and his allies!', 8119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? You trying to ruin my reputation? I don\'t teach novices, $gbuddy:lady;. Go talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus.', '', 8118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I\'ve got. That\'d be Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead who works in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.', '', 8117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned.', '', 8116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for your help, $n. Because of you, another shipment arrived safely at the excavation.', '', 8115, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.  If you are here for leather goods, then you will find my wares well crafted.', '', 8114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delivering these barrels to the excavation site is hard work, but there are so many depending on us to get the blast powder there.$B$BWe must do what we can against the Dark Irons!', '', 8113, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude.', '', 8112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air.', '', 8111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here to help with the delivery? Miran\'s just about ready.', '', 8110, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As was fated a lifetime ago in Karazhan, monster - I come - and with me I bring justice.', '', 8109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This dock here?  Well you can catch the ship that goes to that Night Elf place.  What\'s it\'s name?  Uhh Auberdine I think.  I don\'t really know for sure, I just load and unload stuff.', '', 8108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On guard, friend. The lady dragon will not give in without a fight.', '', 8107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On the northern dock, you can board a ship that will carry you to Rut\'theran Village and Darnassus.  From the southern dock, you can find passage across the Great Sea to Stormwind Harbor.  The dock to the west, at the end of the pier, leads to Azuremyst Isle, near the Exodar. Safe journeys to you!', '', 8106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure! Let\'s go for a ride.', 'Sure! Let\'s go for a ride.', 8105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fastest gryphons this side of Aerie Peak. Want to take a ride?', '', 8104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry but I can not let you ride my gryphons. You should go talk to Gringer if you need a ride somewhere.', '', 8103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my honor to provide for adventurers, for they are heroes in the making.', '', 8102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Although the coast of Darkshore is more dangerous than that of Teldrassil, many fishers find profit here.', '', 8101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fish off the coast of Teldrassil are quite large and robust.  Rumors say it is the speedy growth of our new world tree that is the cause.', 8100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To maintain our link to the mainland, we have hippogryphs constantly flying between Rut\'theran Village and Darkshore.', '', 8099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Hippogryph is a noble beast, proud and swift.  They are an honor to train, and can quickly take their rider a great distance.', 8098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me browse your goods.', 'Let me browse your goods.', 8097, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Greetings, and welcome.  I am not very good at smiling, but trust me; I am happy to serve you.', '', 8096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I be of service?', '', 8095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.  Our bats are well trained and fed.  You\'ll not find faster.', '', 8094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nearly shatters!', '', 8093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s loses power and shuts off!', '', 8092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yawww!', '', 8091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew you would come, $n. It is good to see you again, friend.', '', 8090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am afraid that I am no longer gentle or humble. Age and countless battles have hardened my skin and soul. Perhaps that is why Cairne assigned me to Sun Rock Retreat... the gentle winds and warm sun does ease the pain.', '', 8089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s da attitude! Grab a needle and thread and let\'s get jammin\'!', '', 8088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At dis point you know as much as I do, mon. Maybe you go see Magar in Orgrimmar. He not be da happiest tailor around, but he help you anyway.', '', 8087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey mon, what can I be doin\' for you?', '', 8086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not be disappointed, traveler. Tailoring is a joyous endeavor.', 8085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My education is ongoing, and your knowledge surpasses mine. If you wish to learn more you must speak to Me\'lynn. She will guide you.', 8084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no greater way to clear the mind than to weave.', 8083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I think you have potential. Maybe I can show you a thing or two.', '', 8082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just a student myself, really. Rhiannon\'s the expert. She\'s standing by the crates over there. You can learn a lot from her.', '', 8081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t get many visitors out here. May I interest you in something?', '', 8080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... you want to be a tailor? Very well, we\'ll see if you have what it takes.', '', 8079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am knowledgable, but I am not an expert. You know who you should talk to? Rhiannon! She\'s not far. Ask around for her in Undercity', '', 8078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pleased to make you acquaintance. May I help you?', '', 8077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the Earth Mother\'s blessing, we shall begin.', '', 8076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek a higher knowledge. Tepa is blessed with such knowledge. She should be standing somewhere nearby...', '', 8075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No part of the animals we hunt is wasted. ', '', 8074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will teach you what I can.', '', 8073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know a few things, but I\'m no expert. Lucky for you, Magar is. He\'s standing near the back of the shop. See if he can help you, but be careful not to rile him. He can be irritable.', '', 8072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We use many animal pelts and skins in our creations. ', '', 8071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! I\'ve been hopin\' for a new student. Well, let\'s get started right away then!', '', 8070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on there, I\'m just an assistant. If ye want to start learnin\' the fancy stuff, talk to old Stonebrew over there.', '', 8069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to me shop. What can I do for ye\'?', '', 8068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would be happy to take you under my wing. Let us begin.', '', 8067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time for you to journey to Darnassus and speak to Me\'lynn. She will guide you from now on.', '', 8066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Needlework requires a steady hand. And patience... above all, patience.', '', 8065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, let your journey of tailoring begin.', '', 8064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... the things you need to learn are a little above my head. Have a talk with Sellandus over at Larson\'s Clothiers just up the path to the right. He taught me everything I know!', '', 8063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Life is like a carefully woven tapestry.', '', 8062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you would like to learn a few things? I would be happy to get you started!', '', 8061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a simple man who knows a few things about tailoring, but you need more assistance than I can provide. I have heard of a Night Elf who is quite an accomplished tailor. He resides in Stormwind, in the Magic District. ', '', 8060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can tell that your wardrobe is in dire need of care.', '', 8059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have wasted your time and mine by coming to me for training, $n. I have no time to teach basic skills. We\'re fighting a war here, and this is one of the front lines. Don\'t return to me until you are more prepared.', 8058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot afford to give an inch in this war. Day and night, I create new armor, and I patch whatever can be salvaged from the old. I have no time for other tasks. Would you take care of something for me?', 8057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I only wish I had more students like you. Not many will venture so far into enemy territory. I salute your courage.', 8056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All requests for my work must be made in person by the buyer. Orwin often asks me to reconsider, but my priorities lie here. Look around you: many of these fighters rely upon me for their armor.', 8055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not here to teach babes fresh out of the cradle. Ye\'ve nowhere near the amount of skill I require in my students. In fact, ye\'re a sad figure of a $glad:lass;, an\' I\'ll thank ye not to stand there jibber-jabberin\' at me.', '', 8054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love a good challenge; don\'t you? Aye, of course ye do. An\' that\'s why you\'re about to do exactly what I say.', '', 8053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och, \'twas a sad day when I realized my obsession. I woke up and found myself tannin\' before I had my first tankard of ale. Hardly even a respectable hangover! I knew then--aye, I knew!--how it was goin\' to be.', '', 8052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin\'s beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, $n, and bring me back some tall tales.', '', 8051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cairne has brought us to a land rich with possibilities for the future. We have been fortunate, and so in turn we pass on our good fortune to others. That is why I began teaching, $n.', 8050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been so long since I was a novice myself that I don\'t think I\'d be the best teacher for you. Try talking to Tarn or Mak, right over there. One of them should be able to answer your questions.', 8049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As members of the Horde, we must contribute to our community to ensure that it continues to thrive. Thus, I am certain you will gladly aid us by undertaking a small task I have for you.', 8048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even my talents have a limit, and you have reached it. Congratulations, $n. Your next stop should be Camp Mojache in Feralas. The tauren Hahrana Ironhide lives there; she is renowned for her skill.', 8047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The needle is small, but the thread is strong, and the stitches are fine. Our pact with Thrall and the others will hold. The Horde will not be driven from these lands.', 8046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not try to force your will upon the leather. Rather, let its natural tendencies dictate what form and function it will take. This is not a battle to be won. Work with the leather, not against it.', '', 8045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I regret to say that I cannot aid you, $gnoble sir:gentle lady;, until you learn more of working with leather. Speak with Faldron or Darianna here instead. They can teach you the skill you require.', '', 8044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have demonstrated skill in learning our craft. Do you also possess the resolve to complete a mission on my behalf?', '', 8043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have advanced beyond my skill to teach you. Journey now to Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands and speak with the dwarf Drakk Stonehand. His work is magnificent, far better than my own.', '', 8042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The grass is soft and lush. The air is fresh, full of light and song. Everything I\'ve seen suggests that Teldrassil is a dream come true. Why, then, is my heart full of foreboding?', '', 8041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the northeastern Barrens lies a pool of water sickened by pollution.  The locals call it the Sludge Fen; the Venture Company has turned the once crystal-blue waters into a mire of industrial byproducts and waste.  In the heart of this fen lies what you seek, $n.$B$BBe warned - the Venture Company does not tolerate trespassers, and they consider anyone who does not work for them as such.  You\'ll especially be a target as a protector of nature, something they vehemently oppose.', 8040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the northern part of Darkshore runs the Cliffspring River, flowing down from the lands now known as Felwood.  As the river flows out and empties out into the Mist\'s Edge, travel north to where the deepest parts of the ocean begin.  A stone formation that some call the Stone Claw due to its shape is where you may find what you seek.$B$BBe warned - threshers gather by the Stone Claw, and will attack those who trespass on their territory.', 8039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the Silverpine Forest along the edges of the North Tide\'s Run, a derelict boat rests on the shore.  Out to the west of this lies what you seek; swim too far and the ocean will crush you from fatigue.  It resides on the ocean floor in a lockbox, waiting for you to claim it.$B$BYou\'ll be hard pressed to survive a dive to such depths without aid, so take heart; a bubbly fissure offers renewed breath to divers seeking this half of the pendant.  Use it wisely.', '', 8038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waters of Westfall are where you must search, due west-northwest of where the Gold Coast Quarry meets with the shore.  An anchor shows where a boat has sunk beyond it, deep within the water.  The underwater pressure is fierce here; swimming too far will crush even the mightiest swimmer from fatigue.  $B$BLook for a natural formation to aid you, $n - a bubbly fissure is near here, offering deep-water swimmers a chance for renewed breath.\n', '', 8037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance?', 'Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance?', 8036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility?', 'Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility?', 8035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a ride, Dungar!  I have important supplies to deliver!', 'I need a ride, Dungar!  I have important supplies to deliver!', 8034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Always double-check your measurements before you begin to cut the leather. We cannot afford to waste materials.', 8033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I only teach students who have already mastered the basics. You must seek out the night elf Darianna in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus. Her skills will be a perfect complement to yours.', 8032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot leave my post here, $n, but there is a task that must be taken care of. Can I trust you to see it done?', 8031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Training you further is beyond my abilities. Speak to Telonis in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus. He is always glad to help talented students.', 8030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune has granted the night elves many gifts. In return, it is our responsibility to safeguard these forests from the demonic taint that the Horde always brings with it.', 8029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I first set up shop in the Magic Quarter, but it was pretty noisy there. This is a definite improvement, barring a few persistent students who still track me down, despite the fact that I\'ve relocated.', '', 8028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I taught novices, there\'d be a lot more students visiting me, and things would get noisy. Go talk to Dan Golthas over there. He\'s a little intense, but he means well, and he\'s a decent teacher.', '', 8027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes, I\'ll train you. There\'s no need to raise your voice.', '', 8026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m pleased to say that your talents have outpaced my own. Go away now. Err, try the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff\'s central plateau. She\'s very skilled, I assure you.', '', 8025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before my death, I was a librarian; I had nothing to do with wars and plagues. I never asked to become this. On the other hand, now that my mind is my own again, I\'m not about to surrender without a fight.', '', 8024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The twists and turns of Orgrimmar are designed to thwart invaders. Can you imagine how quickly one of those puny gnomes would get lost in here? Ha! If it was lucky, I\'d track it down and keep it as a pet.', '', 8023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t study my techniques until you\'ve learned the basics. Speak with Kamari if you are interested in training.', '', 8022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s decent work, I admit. But I\'d be more impressed if you\'d handle something for me.', '', 8021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t learn anything new from me; you know too much already. If you want more training, talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff\'s central plateau. Send her my regards, eh?', '', 8020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I busy? What\'s that supposed to mean? Do you think I just stand here all day, twiddling my thumbs? If you\'re here to buy something, talk to Handor.', '', 8019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re pretty far from anything I\'d call civilization here, at least until the Horde can send us more reinforcements. You must really like working with leather.', '', 8018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got more guts than brains, coming to me without the proper training. Go talk to somebody closer to your skill level, like the orc Kamari, who lives in the Drag of Orgrimmar.', '', 8017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s enough work here for an army of orcs, and most of it, only I can do. Still, there is a job I could use a hand with.', '', 8016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d train you if I could, but you\'re too much for me. Tell you what: go talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff\'s central plateau. She\'s got some real talent.', '', 8015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have only a small foothold on this continent for now, but the humans can\'t fight us off forever. Then they\'ll pay for enslaving us. We\'ll cut their lying tongues out for their treachery.', '', 8014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am pleased with your progress so far. Surely the Earth Mother has inspired your hands.', '', 8013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skills are insufficient to learn what I teach. Try talking to Mak over there instead. He can help you out until you\'re ready for more advanced lessons.', '', 8012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have come to me for instruction, and in return I have a favor to ask of you. See it done, and you will be rewarded.', '', 8011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot help you with further training: your skill at working with leather rivals my own. You should speak with Una, over there. I will vouch for your skill if need be.', '', 8010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My axe has seen many battles, and I like to keep it handy. Enemy forces have fought their way into our capital several times now, but have no fear: we have always driven them back.', '', 8009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come for further training? Shake the dust of the road from your garments, then, and let us get to work.', '', 8008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not offer apprentice training. Look for the tauren Waldor in the Wailing Caverns, here in the Barrens. He can assist you with whatever you need.', '', 8007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A task presses upon me, but I do not have the time to take care of it myself. Can I entrust you with it?', '', 8006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot aid you with further lessons: your skills have surpassed mine. Go and see the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff\'s central plateau. She offers more advanced training.', '', 8005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This blue leather does draw the eye, I know. You see, we have a great many eager recruits running around here, hunting and slaying with more enthusiasm than wisdom. One must take precautions.', '', 8004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skills are coming along nicely. Soon you\'ll be running a leather shop of your own. I\'ll be glad for the help, $n. My hands are only so fast, you know? There\'s so much work to do!', '', 8003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I declare! It\'s a new student! I\'ll gladly teach you everything I know once you have a little more skill. Go talk to Gretta Finespindle over there, would you? She\'ll have you up to speed in no time.', '', 8002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see that you\'ll be a quick learner. That\'s good for me, because I\'m always busy these days. In fact, that reminds me: could you run a quick errand for me?', '', 8001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope, can\'t help you, I\'m afraid. Your skills have mine beat! If you want to learn more, talk to the night elf Telonis in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus. He\'s amazing!', '', 8000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots to do! Haven\'t been this busy since my cousin accidentally vaporized all the cloth and leather in Gnomeregan. My, it was drafty for a while! Ah, $n, those were the days....', '', 7999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many animals lost their lives so that we could gain these materials. Do not take their sacrifice lightly, $n. Handle the leather with the respect it deserves.', '', 7998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In time you will be ready for what I have to teach, $n. Until then, please ask Darianna over there to help you with your training.', '', 7997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This war has been an enormous drain upon our people and resources. Even here on Teldrassil, we cannot escape its repercussions. Forgive me for asking it of you, but would you perform a task for me?', '', 7996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are here for further training, you have overestimated my abilities. Have a word with Telonis over there; he can help you.', '', 7995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darianna shows promise, but she is so full of energy that it is hard for her to stay still and listen. With her strength and agility, I fear it won\'t be long before she is called to fight. We must teach her quickly.', '', 7994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, I guess I can take on another student. Well, don\'t just stand there. Tell me what you\'re looking to learn.', '', 7993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back to me when you\'ve had more training. Randal Worth over there can help you with that.', '', 7992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, I\'ll teach you, but I want you to do something for me. This is important, so pay close attention.', '', 7991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but you\'ve reached the limit of what I can teach. If you want to learn more, go see Telonis in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus. He\'s pretty talented, so I hear.', '', 7990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Randal\'s a bit of a dandy, but he\'s dependable, which is more than I can say for a lot of the students I take on. Still, I guess I can\'t blame them for wanting a bit of adventure.', '', 7989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not bad... I suppose training you is not out of the question. Very well! Let\'s begin...', '', 7988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even I have my limitations! Go talk to Lavinia Crowe in Undercity if you wish to further your training.', '', 7987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Listen carefully, $n, for I have much knowledge to impart.', 7986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My teachings would be too advanced for you at this stage. If you wish to learn more of potions, speak with Tel\'Athir here instead.', 7985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were wise to seek me out. I would ask a small favor. In return, there is much I can teach you.', 7984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are beyond my limited abilities. Seek out the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus. She can teach you more. I only wish that I could go with you.', 7983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free!  That device shall never torment me again!', '', 7980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HELP! ASSASSINS HAVE COME TO KILL ME!', '', 7979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take every word I say and commit it to memory. Until our enemies have been eradicated, we must never shirk a chance to further our knowledge. Reinforce your armor, and never relax your guard.', '', 7978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help you; your work is beyond my own. Talk to Arthur Moore, over there by the coffins. He\'ll be able to train you further.', '', 7977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I clawed my way out of the grave, I thought my family would welcome me with open arms. Instead, they drove me from the village, screaming in a language I could no longer understand.', '', 7976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cleanse your hands before you begin any project. Staining the leather with blood or dirt would take away from its natural beauty.', '', 7975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your talent is beyond my own, friend. Speak with Tarn here; his knowledge of leather is much greater than mine. I\'m sure he would welcome another student.', '', 7974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cairne himself lives here, they say. Once I have finished crafting a fitting gift, I will seek him out. Perhaps he will have words of wisdom for me.', '', 7973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even here in the wilds, you seek out learning. Your drive for knowledge is an admirable trait.', '', 7972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit the tauren Krulmoo Fullmoon in Camp Taurajo of the Barrens. He has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents.', '', 7971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The caverns below us are a source of strange and wondrous hides, but you must take care if you venture into their depths, $n. Remember that your own skin is far more valuable.', '', 7970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We live and die, and the land remains, eternal, unmoved by our passage. Thus, land cannot belong to us, $n. Instead, we belong to it. Therefore we protect the land, for without it we cannot hope to survive.', '', 7969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have outgrown any teachings I could offer. Go with the blessing of the Earth Mother. Seek out the tauren Tarn in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff\'s central plateau. Be guided by his wisdom.', '', 7968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meat, skin, bones... a good hunter lets nothing go to waste. Every scrap of leather can be salvaged, perhaps to reinforce an ally\'s armor. Thus, each of us is strong alone, but together we become invincible.', '', 7967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Before the plague came, I knew nothing about leather. Now I know enough to teach others. Death\'s left me with a lot of time on my hands.', 7966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve got the hang of it. I can\'t teach you any more, but talk to Arthur Moore, a Forsaken who works in the Rogues\' Quarter of the Undercity. Tell him I sent you.', 7965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skin, glorious skin. It holds your insides... in. You might\'ve noticed my skin\'s not doing so well. To think I used to worry about my pores. Hardly any skin left to worry about these days. In a way, it\'s very freeing.', 7964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Too bad we can\'t skin the humans and their allies. All that skin is just going to waste. Still, who\'d want to wear the flimsy leather you could make out of it?', 7963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have nothing more to teach you. Talk to Karolek if you wish to further your leatherworking skills.', 7962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You like the rug? I killed and skinned the beast myself. May all the centaur fall as easily.', 7961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, goody, something else to do while I wait! You\'re a real life-saver, $n!', 7960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aww, what rotten luck! My skills aren\'t good enough to be of any use to you. Oh well. Talk to Fimble Finespindle over there by the loom. He\'s been working with leather for longer than I have.', 7959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This hide isn\'t ready to work with yet. I wish it didn\'t take so long to make leather. There has to be some way to cut down on all this waiting. It can\'t be good for my health, you know?', 7958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s so exciting to be here in Darnassus, surrounded by talented people! I just know I\'m going to make my family proud. Maybe if I\'m really lucky, the Sentinels will ask me to join their forces on the front!', 7957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I\'m sorry, but you know more about leather than I do at this point. Talk to Faldron over there if you wish to learn more.', 7956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re interested in sewing with leather, you\'ve certainly come to the right place. Faldron and Telonis are true artists, and I hope to learn much from them.', 7955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You need to make your stitches smaller, $n. Fewer items will slip out of your quivers and ammo pouches. Besides, no one likes a lumpy tunic.', 7954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My apologies, but you have already learned everything I know. The night elf Faldron could offer you further training, however. Look for him in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus.', 7953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to our home, $n. Radnaal and I have little to offer, but you are welcome to what hospitality we can provide.', 7952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This outfit really brings out the blue in my eyes, don\'t you think? It should be obvious I have plenty of skill to go around, so I can afford to share a few of my tricks of the trade. Listen up, okay?', '', 7951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nothing I can teach you, other than maybe a better eye for color and detail. Talk to Simon Tanner over there; he knows a lot of advanced techniques for working with leather.', '', 7950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I already know a lot about style. Now it\'s just a matter of mastering the techniques for working with leather. Good thing Simon\'s a real sport about helping me learn them.', '', 7949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How\'s it going? I love the smell of leather; don\'t you?', 7948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gosh, I\'m sorry. I don\'t have anything new to teach you. How about you go talk to Simon Tanner in the Old Town section of Stormwind? He\'s a human with big muscles and dreamy red hair.', 7947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Since my husband left for the front, Helene here has been my strength. Her kind heart and sharp sword have helped me through a lot of tough times. I don\'t know what I would\'ve done without her.', 7946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are still lessons you must learn from others before my knowledge may be shared with you. Be diligent, and do not give up hope.', 7945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your education is nearly complete. One final task is all that stands between you and the culmination of all your efforts...', 7944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am proud. You are truly a gifted student. Now, for your final lesson...', 7943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings traveler, you have my undying gratitude for dispensing with those dreadful creatures! I was beginning to think I might have to hide out forever!', 7942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have reached new heights in your path to mastery. Let us see if we can take you even further...', '', 7941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Train hard, train every day. And when you have perfected your skills, return to me.', '', 7940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('True mastery must be earned! It is up to you to earn it now...', '', 7939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is one even greater than I in this art. You are ready to receive her knowledge. She is Annora, and you may find her... in Uldaman.', '', 7938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to seek the knowledge of Hgarth?', '', 7937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skills are truly becoming extraordinary. Now, let us continue your training...', 7936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are eager, that is good. However, you are not yet ready to train with the likes of me. ', 7935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To come this far has not been easy, I know. But how boring life would be without challenges, don\'t you think? Good, because I have a challenge for you...', 7934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are growing ever closer to the pinnacle of your training. To become a greater enchanter, you have yet another instructor to seek out. Her name is Annora, and you may find her in Uldaman.', 7933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What brings you to the Tower?', 7932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! You have that spark in your eye... I know it well, it\'s the same spark I had when I was but a pup! Now, let\'s see if I can\'t teach you something.', '', 7931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are unfit to train with me, stranger. Spend some time with my assistant Jhag over there. ', '', 7930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have what it takes. Let\'s find out! ', '', 7929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skills are out of my league, stranger.Talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains. He will provide you with more knowledge than I can. ', '', 7928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some adventurers think enchanting doesn\'t work. I find that when I challenge them to battle they change their tune!', '', 7927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, traveler! Care to delve into the mysteries of the arcane? Hm?', '', 7922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, I\'ve seen better. But, you have potential, I won\'t deny it. Pay attention and you just might learn something!', 7921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, no, you\'ll need FAR more training before you\'re ready to learn from me! Go talk to that uptight dabbler Malcomb Wynn. He\'s the one buried in books over there.', 7920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm, you scratch my back, I\'ll scratch yours. If you do what I ask, and do it well, maybe we can discuss your training.', 7919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I wasn\'t stuck here day in and day out, I would have attained the mastery required to train the likes of you! Unfortunately that\'s not the case. Go talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains.', 7918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t get many visitors.  You\'re looking for something specific, yes?', 7917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, very good. I am satisfied that you are a worthy student. Now, your training with me may begin...', '', 7916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely Mot didn\'t send you to me? He knows better. You are not yet capable of understanding what I would teach you. See my son Mot, just outside there, and finish training with him. ', '', 7915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will teach you... soon. I require a demonstration of your loyalty, first.', '', 7914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is one whose knowledge exceeds my own. You are ready to seek her out. Go to Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains. Find Hgarth, and continue your training.', '', 7913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enchanting has run in our family for generations. I learned at an early age, just as my son is doing now.', '', 7912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have gone to great lengths, stranger, and you have my appreciation. I promised to further your training, and now I shall keep that promise.', 7911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would be happy to teach you when you are ready, but that time has not yet come! I\'m sure Lalina Summermoon will guide you until then. You may find her in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in Darnassus.', 7910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why don\'t we see just what you\'re capable of? If you complete the task I shall be happy to further your training! ', 7909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know many things, stranger, but your knowledge rivals my own. Enchanters who wish to hone their skills further are known to travel to the Tower of Azora, where an artisan named Kitta Firewind resides.', 7908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you are seeking a truly rewarding pursuit, then a life of enchanting is for you!', 7907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine work! You are truly deserving of the knowledge I shall bestow upon you!', '', 7906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have not yet learned the basics, wanderer. Have you spoken to my assistant, Lalina Summermoon? Perhaps you should.', '', 7905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe you are up to this task... will you accept the challenge?', '', 7904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are an exceptional enchanter. Beyond my talents as a teacher, I fear. Seek out Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. Only she can qualify as your instructor now.', '', 7903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is true I have skills to teach to those who are worthy. Would that be you?', '', 7902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, eh? Oy! Citizen $n, come \'ere. Highlord Bolvar Fordragon has requested that all able bodied heroes o\' the Alliance meet with him at Stormwind Keep. You just been recruited, mate! Get a move on!', '', 7901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That one, Malagan. I know $g him:her;. Dependable, brave, and trustworthy. $n is $g his:her; name.', 7900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you seek to hunt naga, then you will need all the help you can get. Deep in the water you can find bubbly fissures that produce enough air bubbles that will allow you to breath underwater. Swim up close so that you can use the bubbles.', '', 7899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your confidence is well-founded, traveler. Now your true education may begin!', '', 7898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not ready. Speak to Betty Quinn, she\'s standing by the stairs over there. Return to me when you have achieved a higher enlightenment.', '', 7897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem confident. Surely you wouldn\'t mind a test of your skills?', '', 7896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A true professional know his limitations, and I\'m not ashamed to admit that your skills exceed mine. I want you to pay a visit to Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. She is well-renowned, and with good reason.', '', 7895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have what it takes, I will be happy to show you the way.', '', 7894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, well... don\'t get cocky! Since you have demonstrated  your competence though, we may now begin!', '', 7893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re joking, right? I believe you\'re looking for the OTHER short fellow, Thonys Pillarstone. He\'s downstairs. Now skedaddle!', '', 7892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great, let\'s get started... ha! Fooled you! Surely you didn\'t think it would be that simple. You\'ll need to prove your mettle just like everyone else!', '', 7891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do I look like, the Grand Poobah of enchanters? Your skills require the guidance of an Artisan! Go find Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora.', '', 7890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you? What do you want from me?', '', 7889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To die in battle is glorious! But, with what I teach you, maybe you not die so quickly, hm?  ', '', 7888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You come to wrong place. Talk to the expert Godan over there. You learn more from him.', '', 7887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm-ka! What you looking for, stranger?', '', 7886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are many secrets that may be unlocked with patience and determination. Now, let us begin...', '', 7885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot teach you anything you don\'t already know. However, the knowledge of my father far surpasses my own. Go inside and speak to him. Good luck!', '', 7884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I wouldn\'t give to be out on the open plains on a day like this... but my duty binds me.', '', 7883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t look like much to me, but who knows, maybe there\'s an enchanter hidden in there somewhere!', '', 7882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh, well you\'ve made it this far... go see Lavinia Crowe by the other bookshelf there. If you don\'t mess things up with her, maybe you can learn some more.', '', 7881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not have time to waste, stranger. State your business or be off!', '', 7880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Open your mind, wanderer, and we shall begin.', 7879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have truly excelled in your knowledge of enchanting. There is much more to learn, if you are willing. Speak to Taladan, in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in Darnassus.', 7878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune\'s secrets are many, but they are not to be shared with just anyone. ', 7877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will teach you what I can. Each lesson is a gift from the Goddess herself. Use her gifts wisely, and you shall not falter.', 7876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skills are beyond my reach. It is time for you to face new challenges. Taladan will help you prepare. He is standing by the table there.', 7875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Goddess has granted me wisdom, stranger. If it is her will, I shall pass it on to you.', 7874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, ye\'re an inquisitive one, are ye\'? Excellent! Pay close attention, this just might save yer skin when the goin\' gets rough!', '', 7873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'re a fine enchanter indeed! Now it\'s time fer ye to move on. I want ye to talk to Gimble Thistlefuzz, upstairs. He\'s a bit of a character, but he\'ll steer ye in the right direction from here on out!', '', 7872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are ways to strengthen steel beyond the hammer and forge, young wanderer.', '', 7871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm... well you seem capable enough. If you truly desire to learn, then nothing will stand in your way! I will guide you through your first steps on what I hope will be a long and fulfilling path.', 7870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m afraid I have nothing to teach to someone with your experience. But you haven\'t reached the end of the road yet. Speak to Lucan Cordell, behind the counter there. He\'ll guide you through the next phase of your journey.', 7869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, traveler! What brings you to my doorstep?', 7868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reignites from the heat of another Core Hound!', '', 7867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s collapses and begins to smolder.', '', 7866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s refuses to die while its master is endangered!', '', 7865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would never turn away someone who\'s ready to train with me. Unfortunately, you\'re not! You\'ve still got a ways to go kid!', '', 7864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what you got! You won\'t be sorry, I promise!', '', 7863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well my friend, you\'ve reached heights some people only dream of. Congrats! And now, without further ceremony, it is time for your final lesson!', '', 7862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been working on a way to transport oil underground between major cities, but everyone tells me it\'s a pipe dream.', '', 7861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice going! I knew I was right about you, no matter what those other people said. Ha! I\'m kidding! Okay, on with your lessons...', '', 7860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice try, but you\'ll need some more experience before training with me! Back to the trenches! ', '', 7859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think you\'re more than qualified for this little assignment... let\'s see if I\'m right!', '', 7858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t teach what I don\'t know! If only there was someone else who knew more than I do... wait, there is! Go see Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!', '', 7857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes I surprise even myself!', '', 7856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent, you have proven yourself worthy! Now for the next phase of your instruction...', '', 7855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The things I would teach you would turn your brain to jelly! Come back when you\'ve learned sufficiently!', '', 7854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not that I doubt your abilites, but I would like you to perform a task for me. Call it a demonstration of good faith...', '', 7853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have certainly come a long way in your training. If you want to learn more, you have to travel to the desert. Find Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan! ', '', 7852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my calculations are correct, the wheel will soon be obsolete!', '', 7851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... you almost impressed me. I suppose I could spare the time for a few lessons...', '', 7850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a waste of time, mine and yours! Go see Graham Van Talen if you want to begin your instruction! He\'s standing to my left over there.', '', 7849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how competent you are, shall we? If you perform this task to my liking, I\'ll spend the time to teach you!', '', 7848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think I could teach you? Roxxik would do a much better job. You can find him in Orgrimmar. Now be off!', '', 7847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time for idle gossip, I\'m a professional!', '', 7846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have passed your test, well done! Your training may now continue.', '', 7845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have not yet earned the right to train with me. See Thund first, over by the table. Come back when he says you\'re ready!', '', 7844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every day is a test, and this day is no different. If you pass this test, I will share some of my knowledge...', '', 7843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have earned the privilege of training with a higher instructor. Go see my pal Roxxik there.', '', 7842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there were just a few more hours in a day...', '', 7841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Not bad, for a beginner! I guess it couldn\'t hurt for me to show you a few things...', 7840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Close, but no cigar! I\'m afraid you\'ll have to talk to my sis, Jemma first. After she\'s gone over the basics with you, come see me and I\'ll show you the juicy stuff!', 7839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll need to prove your worthiness before I go giving away my secrets! I\'ve got just the test for you...', 7838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t tell anyone else I said this, but even I don\'t know everything! If you want to keep learning, you should talk to the owner of the shop, Springspindle Fizzlegear.', 7837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The plans for my twenty-foot tall turkey baster are nearly complete! Now all I need is a twenty-foot tall turkey...', 7836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You certainly did not disappoint! Now that we\'ve gotten that out of the way, your instruction may begin!', '', 7835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can learn from me in time... but not yet! Why don\'t you start out by talking to Sprite Jumpsprocket to my right here. You can check in with me after you\'ve gotten your feet wet!', '', 7834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quid pro quo! I\'ll teach you what I know, but first I want you to perform a small task...', '', 7833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, you\'re just zooming right along! I can\'t teach you anything you don\'t already know, but Springspindle Fizzlegear sure can! You can find Springspindle in Ironforge. Good luck!', '', 7832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see... fourteen plus seven, carry the two... oh, yes?', '', 7831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fantastic! Aren\'t you the industrious one? Well, let\'s get started, shall we?', '', 7830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... well, I can\'t help you quite yet! You have to learn the basics first. Why don\'t you go see Sprite Jumpsprocket in Stormwind!', '', 7829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can show you a few tricks... if you don\'t mind doing a little something first, that is.', '', 7828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re working your way up... higher than me, at this point! You should talk to Springspindle Fizzlegear in Ironforge! (He\'ll? She\'ll?) show you more than I ever could!', '', 7827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m never too busy to speak to a stranger! Almost never, anyway...', '', 7826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Engineering will provide you with the skills and knowledge to dismantle your opponents! Let me show you how...', '', 7825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are ready for greater things! See Franklin Lloyd, to my right. He will guide you from now on.', '', 7824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Lady has said that knowledge will be our greatest weapon in this war.', '', 7823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you\'re smart enough? You think you got what it takes? Let\'s find out!', '', 7822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know who\'s really smart? Nogg! Smarter than me, even. You go tell Nogg Thund sent you! You can find him by the control panel over there.', '', 7821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who says orcs aren\'t smart? It takes a lot of brains to be an engineer!', '', 7820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know a few things. You want me to show you?', '', 7819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know who can really show you some things? Nogg! You go find him in Orgrimmar.', '', 7818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like to build stuff. Of course, I like to blow stuff up even more!', '', 7817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fellow enthusiast, huh? Well, you just wait, we\'ll make a gearhead out of you in no time!', '', 7816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid you\'re out of my league, friend! You should go see Nogg in Orgrimmar, he\'ll take you to the next level!', '', 7815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Sniff, sniff) You smell that? Don\'t you just LOVE the smell of grease?', '', 7814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, I\'ll show you a few things. We\'ll see how you do, maybe you\'ll surprise me!', '', 7813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t help ya\'! You\'re ready to see someone who\'s been at it longer than I have! Let\'s see... you\'re an Alliance type, so you need to talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in Stormwind.', '', 7812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? You want something?', '', 7811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This kind of work isn\'t for the faint of heart. I have an uncle who lost a hand! Poor old Stumpy... anyway, if you\'re still interested I might be able to show you a few things.', 7810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You need to start learning things that are beyond my expertise! Talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in front of the tent there. He\'ll set you on the right course!', 7809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, what a beautiful day to blow something up!', 7808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You want to train? With me? Fantastic! The only thing better than assembling bullets and explosive devices is to share that knowledge with someone else! Let\'s get started!', 7807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, you\'ve got oodles of things to learn still. I would teach you everything if I could, but I\'m still learning too! Why don\'t you talk to Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge, she\'ll help you further your education!', 7806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello there! My name\'s Jenna! And you? ', 7805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d love to teach you! Show my sister she\'s not the only one who knows a thing or two about engineering...', 7804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well... I hate to admit it, but my sister\'s the one you\'ll have to talk to if you want to continue training. I don\'t know as much as she does... yet! She\'s standing over by the rocket car.', 7803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard the new Henweigh 6000 will be rolling off the assembly line soon. I can barely contain my excitement!', 7802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would be delighted to aid you in the commencement of your pursuit! Let me grab my spinner and we\'ll get started...', '', 7801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your current aptitude exceeds my instructional capabilities. You should enquire further with my fellow Gnome Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge!', '', 7800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s my spinner? I just had it here somewhere...', '', 7799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s becomes enraged!', '', 7798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a killing frenzy!', '', 7797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lookin\' to be an engineer, eh? Well, by Muradin, ye\'ve come to the right place!', '', 7796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would train ye if I could, but ye need the services of someone a bit more... what\'s the word? Brainy! Look for Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge. Tell \'er Bronk sent ye!', '', 7795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a minor adjustment here... ah there we go!', '', 7794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell to you, and may shadow always protect you!', '', 7793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those gnolls with your power to back me!', '', 7792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh, the pain. Will it ever leave me?', '', 7791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $gpriest:priestess;, you came along just in time. I appreciate it.', '', 7790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell to you, and may the Light be with you always.', '', 7789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those wendigo with the Light on my side!', '', 7788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh, the pain. Will it ever leave me?', '', 7787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $gpriest:priestess;, you came along just in time. I appreciate it.', '', 7786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell to you, and may our ancestors be with you always!', 7785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those humans with your power to back me!', 7784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Argh, the pain. Will it ever leave me?', 7783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, $gpriest:priestess;, you came along just in time. I appreciate it.', 7782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell to you, and may Elune be with you always.', 7781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those corrupt timberlings with Elune\'s power behind me!', 7780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Argh, the pain. Will it ever leave me?', 7779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, $gpriest:priestess;, you came along just in time. I appreciate it.', 7778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you ask me for training, maggot? What were you hoping for, you slack-jawed yokel, a lecture on the proper uses of silverleaf? Out! You\'re lucky I don\'t thrash you senseless for wasting my time.', '', 7777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, well, I can see that you have a little skill at making potions. Whether you\'re worthy to be my student remains to be seen, however. I have a job for you. Impress me.', '', 7776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t stir the potion like that, you ham-handed farmer! No, don\'t stop stirring it, either! Forget it--just give me that ladle before you start a fire. I\'ll salvage what I can. Now, pay attention.', '', 7775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief Thrall himself asked me to come out here. I was honored to obey, and it\'s no hardship. I couldn\'t have asked for a better posting than Stonard. Just about any herb I might need grows in the muck here.', '', 7774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalaran, I have misplaced my torch. I require another.', 'Kalaran, I have misplaced my torch. I require another.', 7773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune has seen fit to gift me with skill and experience. Now I shall pass them on to you.', 7772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skill displays an enduring affection for our art, but I would see further evidence of your commitment. I shall charge you with a task. Fulfill it, and I will be content.', 7771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you come here for instruction in the art of making potions? You were mistaken if you thought that I would offer such a privilege to you, unearned. Go, and do not return to me until you have greater skill.', 7770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once I welcomed darkness, for it was the sister of night. Now it is dark all the time, even during the day, and the forests cry out for sustenance. Unless we act soon, this spreading blight will cover the world.', 7769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready for training? Then try to keep up, $n. We\'ve got a lot of ground to cover.', '', 7768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t yet have the skill to study with me. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben over there, or go up the ramp to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. They are Forsaken who can give you the training you need.', '', 7767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got real talent and a passion for making potions. There is one little matter I\'d like you to take care of, though.', '', 7766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incredible. Your potions display a knowledge that rivals my own. I cannot train you further, but talk to the orc Rogvar of Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows. He\'s known for his cutting-edge experiments.', '', 7765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My colleagues and I are gathering the deadliest substances we know and testing their effects on our enemies. Once I have everything I need, I shall brew such plagues as this world has never seen.', '', 7764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your education is progressing well. You should be proud of your accomplishments.', 7763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skill at brewing potions needs to be greater before you can become one of my students. In the meantime, perhaps Sylvanna Forestmoon or Milla Fairancora can help you, just over there.', 7762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is excellent work. Are you ready to undertake a mission on my behalf? I know of no one more qualified.', 7761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time you moved on to a more advanced teacher. In the Feathermoon Stronghold of Feralas dwells the night elf Kylanna Windwhisper. She has a brilliant mind; doubtless she can train you further.', 7760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This potion seems to heal less damage every time I brew it, though I use the same ingredients. There can be only one conclusion: the plants are changing. I cannot say why or into what.', 7759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here to learn? Very well. I suppose you can\'t cause our allies much harm if I teach you. Just as long as you actually do manage to harm our enemies.', '', 7758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not amused by your audacity in coming to me for training. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Martin Felben. He is a Forsaken who can teach you the basics.', '', 7757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you seek to become my student, you\'ll need to complete an assignment for me. Prove yourself worthy, and I might even consider rewarding you.', '', 7756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no more knowledge to bestow upon you. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Herbert Halsey. He is a Forsaken who can teach you more advanced techniques.', '', 7755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With Algernon to keep me supplied, I can do all my work here without hunting for a single herb. If I never have to see the wonders of nature again, it won\'t be too soon.', '', 7754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My powers have returned and you have squandered your chance, foolish mortals. Till we meet again.', '', 7753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another student. Wonderful. This is why Lydon gets to supervise and I\'m stuck being an instructor. If I win another teaching award, I\'ll never live it down!', '', 7752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t waste my time. I have research projects older than you. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He\'s a Forsaken who can probably manage to teach you the basics.', '', 7751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re going to be taking up my time, you\'d better prove you\'re worth it. I ought to get something out of this arrangement, after all.', '', 7750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me, train you? Come on--we both know I can\'t. It\'s this teaching, you see. My own skills suffer. You want training, go to Doctor Herbert Halsey, a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.', '', 7749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another interruption. How am I supposed to get any work done like this? Don\'t answer that; do I look as if I care what you have to say? If we are to ever get this place cleaned up and expand our empire I will need absolute silence!', '', 7748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your potion-making skills are beyond mine. Seek out the undead Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He has the skill to train you further, and you can witness firsthand his people\'s plight.', 7747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have some skill, it is true, but every moment I spend teaching you is one more moment the undead will spend in torment. Prove to me that you are worth my time.', 7746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot in good conscience spend time training novices while our allies, the undead, are suffering so terribly. Please speak with Kray over there instead; he can help you for now.', 7745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you not sense the anguish of the Earth Mother for her lost children, the undead? Speak quickly, $n. Every second costs me dearly. We must help them find their way back to her!', 7744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When I first saw the undead, I wept, for I could not imagine their horror and loneliness. The Earth Mother spoke to me then; she sang in my blood. And she told me, \"Save them.\"', 7743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I\'ve got. That\'d be Ainethil, a night elf lady who lives in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus.', '', 7742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbs are so pricey! I could always use a little something extra, if you know what I mean. Help a goblin out?', '', 7741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? You trying to ruin my reputation? I don\'t teach novices, $gbuddy:lady;. Try talking to the orc Whuut in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He\'s a lot closer to your level of skill. And brains.', '', 7740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got plenty of great recipes for you to take a look at, and at discounted prices, too!', '', 7739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glyx and I have an understanding: he keeps me supplied, and I keep him rich. Seriously! What that pirate charges me for a measly pouch of crumpled kingsblood... it\'s enough to make a grown goblin cry.', '', 7738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another student, eh? All right. I\'ll see what I can do to help you out.', '', 7737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re talking to the wrong orc. I don\'t train novices. Talk to young Whuut over there... and use small words.', '', 7736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been looking for a little help. Since you\'ve got the skill, I guess you\'ll do, provided you\'ve also got the guts.', '', 7735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m honored to meet you, $n, but your skill at potions is greater than my own. Go see Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He can help you from now on.', '', 7734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m busy, $n. Tell Whuut to handle whatever it is. That young pup has been stewing all day long. He spends much more time like that, and he\'s going to hurt something.', '', 7733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have learned much of potions over the long years, $n, and that knowledge is at your disposal. You have only to ask.', 7732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, to be young again, and to have discovered potions for the first time. Thank you for refreshing my memory, $n. Now go share that youthful enthusiasm with Milla Fairancora over there.', 7731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skill is not inconsiderable. Since you appear to have sufficient experience, there is a matter in which I require your aid.', 7730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My skill at creating potions is inferior to yours. You are ready to speak with Ainethil, just over there. She will understand that you are ready for further instruction.', 7729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even slight alterations to a potion\'s ingredients can change it fundamentally. Patience and precision, young one: they will serve you well in all walks of life.', 7728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Although I am flattered by your confidence in my abilities, teaching you is beyond my skill. You must go to the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in Darnassus, and speak with the night elf Ainethil. She can help you.', 7727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have learned the fundamentals of making potions, but further study requires greater commitment. Prove your dedication by carrying out a task for me.', 7726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My apologies, $n, but I do not offer instruction to novices. Instead, talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus. She can help you make up for lost time.', 7725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Teaching is not a one-sided trade, $n. As I teach you, I learn more myself, and my understanding grows.', 7724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ishnu-dal-dieb, $n. Have you come here in search of knowledge?', 7723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who are you and why are you bothering me? Oh, right--potions student. Right. What can I do for you?', 7722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s nice, $n. Go show whatever it is to Vosur over there. He\'ll answer any questions you have.', 7721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, that\'s actually not so bad. Alrighty, then. How\'d you like to run an errand for me?', 7720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Um, you already know everything I could teach you. Maybe it\'s time for you to talk to someone else. Try the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus. She\'s got some real talent!', 7719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t let the beady eyes and bushy beard fool you. Vosur\'s a talented apprentice and a good friend, even if I do get a crick in my neck when I talk to him.', 7718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want my help? You got it. What do you need?', '', 7717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve put in your time studying the basics. Now it\'s time to up the ante.', '', 7716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, $n, but I have no time to spend on novices. You want someone closer to your own skill level. Try the night elf Milla Fairancora, in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus.', '', 7715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nothing more I can teach you. I\'ve heard of a night elf who might be able to, though. Her name is Ainethil, and she lives in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus.', '', 7714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop giving me that look. I may not be an adventurer like you, but that doesn\'t mean I can\'t have a few muscles. All that stirring makes your arms strong.', '', 7713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your knowledge of potions has exceeded mine, but you still have much to learn. Go up the stairs to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. He will teach you true sufferi--ahem. He is a Forsaken who will train you further.', '', 7712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Cut another lump of flesh from one of these specimens. Let us test what you\'ve learned so far, and we can progress from there.', '', 7711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, $n, for I know human weaknesses intimately.', '', 7710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I appreciate the company, but let\'s face it: you have more experience with potions than I do. Talk to Doctor Marsh instead if you want training. He\'s a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.', 7709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here to learn about potions? I\'ve got plenty to teach you. I might be dead, but I haven\'t lost my brains. Yet.', 7708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice to see a friendly face. I don\'t get much chitchat from Apothecary Johaan unless he wants something. He\'s been out of the grave too long. Someday I\'ll be like that, I hear. Creepy. Maybe by then I won\'t care.', 7707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your capacity for learning has outstripped mine. You will need to talk to Bena Winterhoof over there for further instruction. Please don\'t take too much of her time, though. She needs her rest.', '', 7706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must have broken hundreds of vials when I first began brewing potions. The glass was so fragile in my clumsy hands. I hope you are more cautious than I was.', '', 7705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury.', '', 7704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t help you. You know more about potions than I do. Besides, I have pots to watch. Talk to Yelmak over there. He knows a lot about potions.', '', 7703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They called me stupid, but I\'ll show them. I\'m going to watch every pot I have and prove that they can all boil stuff anyway. Yeah, I\'m on a roll! Who\'s stupid now, huh? Huh!?', '', 7702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the bottles on this table are potions I brewed today. And they say a watched pot never boils. Ha!', '', 7701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got questions, but they be too big for me to answer, $n. You be needin\' to have words with the orc Yelmak in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He\'ll help you out.', '', 7700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready for another lesson? All right, then. First, relax. You gotta stay loose to stir a potion just right.', '', 7699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got the look of someone wantin\' adventure. Me, I had enough of that by the time we trolls came here. Now I take each day as it comes, an\' I train other folks to handle adventures for me.', '', 7698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och, there\'s nothing I can teach ye, $n. Have a word with Tally Berryfizz over there. She can hardly reach the tables, but when she starts brewing a potion, watch out!', '', 7697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your back into it, $glad:lass;. Hard work and determination--that\'s the way! Don\'t let anyone tell you book learnin\' is all ye need.', '', 7696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let those big, innocent eyes fool ye. Tally\'s an expert, all right: I learn something new every day. Why d\'you think I\'m here in Tinker Town? Do I look like an engineer to you? Aye, I didn\'t think so.', '', 7695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'re beyond my skill to teach, $n. Go pester Tally Berryfizz; she\'s a gnome living in Tinker Town of Ironforge. Oh, and since you\'re headed up anyway, give Kali my love.', '', 7694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t suppose you\'re here to talk about my lovely Kali. Fine, then. Potions it is. Anyone ever tell ye you\'ve got a one-track mind?', '', 7693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did my sweet lass Kali send you down to me? The apple of my eye, she is.', '', 7692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are kind to seek me out, but your skills are beyond my own. Have a word with Sylvanna Forestmoon, just over there. She\'s been looking for another student.', 7691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it not astonishing what one can create from the plants of the forest? Truly, Elune has blessed us with her bounty.', 7690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune-adore, my $gbrother:sister;. You are welcome here.', 7689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unfortunately, there is little I can teach someone with your experience, my friend. Seek out the night elf Sylvanna Forestmoon, who resides in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace of Darnassus.', 7688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done! Your understanding of potions is coming along nicely.', 7687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The druids say that it is only a matter of time until nature itself drives the Horde from Kalimdor. Yet corruption continues to spread throughout our lands, even here on Teldrassil.', 7686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOW FOR YOU, INSECTS! BOLDLY, YOU SOUGHT THE POWER OF RAGNAROS. NOW YOU SHALL SEE IT FIRSTHAND!\n', '', 7685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must choose a more experienced teacher, for you have surpassed my abilities. I advise you to speak with Lilyssia Nightbreeze here: she has much knowledge to offer.', '', 7684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am honored to share my knowledge with you, $n. See that you use it well.', '', 7683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ishnu-alah, $gbrother:sister;. Have you any tidings from abroad? My heart yearns for news of Teldrassil.', '', 7682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shut inside this little house, I dream of joining the battles that rage outside the city walls. Still, duty compels me to share my knowledge with others who fight in my stead... for now.', 7679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve already learned everything I can teach you, $n. Talk to the night elf Lilyssia Nightbreeze in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind if you want to continue your studies. I hear she\'s a good teacher.', '', 7678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve made a good start, but you still have a great deal to learn, $n.', '', 7677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day, $gsir:ma\'am;. I\'d shake your hand, but as you see, I\'m in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?', '', 7676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You challenged us and we have come. Where is this master you speak of?\n', 'You challenged us and we have come. Where is this master you speak of?\n', 7675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We, his sworn servants, do his bidding and enforce his iron-rule. Cut off from the energies of his fiery realm, Ragnaros is but a shadow of his true self. However, he has more than enough strength to be your end.      \n', '', 7674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What else do you have to say?', 'What else do you have to say?', 7673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mere three hundred years ago, a reckless dwarf named Thaurissan summoned the master from his fiery realm. His return to this paltry world devastated the surrounding lands and created this volcanic Core. Mighty Ragnaros has slept under this mountain ever since. \n', '', 7672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell to you, and may the Light be with you always.', '', 7671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those murlocs with the Light on my side!', '', 7670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh, the pain. Will it ever leave me?', '', 7669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $gpriest:priestess;, you came along just in time. I appreciate it.', '', 7668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a ride, fast!  I have an important message to deliver!', 'I need a ride, fast!  I have an important message to deliver!', 7667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I try to keep Sentinel Hill stocked, and that\'s not easy with all the action we see.', '', 7666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are you going?  Well if you\'re looking to get there quickly, then look no further!', '', 7665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May da spirits protect you mon.', 'May da spirits protect you mon.', 7664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da spirits be strong wit you, mon. What kin dis troll do for ya?', 'Da spirits be strong wit you, mon. What kin dis troll do for ya?', 7663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOOL! YOU ALLOWED THESE INSECTS TO RUN RAMPANT THROUGH THE HALLOWED CORE? AND NOW YOU LEAD THEM TO MY VERY LAIR? YOU HAVE FAILED ME, EXECUTUS! JUSTICE SHALL BE MET, INDEED!', '', 7662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mortal infidels, my lord! They have invaded your sanctum and seek to steal your secrets!', '', 7661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the spirits be with you.', 'May the spirits be with you.', 7660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?', 'The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?', 7659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach me the ways of the spirits.', 'Teach me the ways of the spirits.', 7658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold Ragnaros - the Firelord! He who was ancient when this world was young! Bow before him, mortals! Bow before your ending!', '', 7657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey mon, you be needin\' to head on over to da $c trainer.', 'Hey mon, you be needin\' to head on over to da $c trainer.', 7656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impudent whelps! You\'ve rushed headlong to your own deaths! See now, the master stirs!\n', '', 7655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can not train you.', 'I can not train you.', 7654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t waste my time.', 'Don\'t waste my time.', 7653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', 'What?', 7652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I kinnae help ye with trainin\'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.', 'I kinnae help ye with trainin\'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer.', 7651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wot kin I do fer ye?', 'Wot kin I do fer ye?', 7650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, $n.', '', 7649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not have the knowledge you seek.', 'I do not have the knowledge you seek.', 7648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you prefer guns or bows?', 'Do you prefer guns or bows?', 7647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more.', 'Tell me more.', 7646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Firelord and his brethren once held sway over this entire world, mortal. As a servant of the Old Gods, he fought against the Titans for domination of this planet. The victorious Titans banished my master and his brethren to the Elemental Plane - there to remain imprisoned until the end of time.', '', 7645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can not train you, young one.', 'I can not train you, young one.', 7644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training in the ways of the Hunter.', 'I seek training in the ways of the Hunter.', 7643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot train a $c such as yourself.', 'I cannot train a $c such as yourself.', 7642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for you my child?', 'What can I do for you my child?', 7641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. I have.', 'Yes. I have.', 7640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to train with the Theramore guard have you?', 'Come to train with the Theramore guard have you?', 7639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While Theramore is reknown for it\'s exceptional training of warriors, I am afraid that I can not help you.', 'While Theramore is reknown for it\'s exceptional training of warriors, I am afraid that I can not help you.', 7638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hegnar Rumbleshot, at your service!', '', 7637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TOO SOON! YOU HAVE AWAKENED ME TOO SOON, EXECUTUS! WHAT IS THE MEANING OF THIS INTRUSION???', '', 7636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! You meet the required parameters and specifications. What can I do for you?', 'Excellent! You meet the required parameters and specifications. What can I do for you?', 7635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Due to incompatibility on your class specification, I am unable to help you rectify any situation you have with lack of ability.', 'Due to incompatibility on your class specification, I am unable to help you rectify any situation you have with lack of ability.', 7634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kin I do for ya, mon?', 'What kin I do for ya, mon?', 7633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it easy, mon. I only train da warriors.', 'Take it easy, mon. I only train da warriors.', 7632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t train your kind, $c.  Find your own trainer before you anger me.', 'I don\'t train your kind, $c.  Find your own trainer before you anger me.', 7631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not waste my time, $c.', 'Do not waste my time, $c.', 7630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m Augustus!  You want it, I got it!  You wanna sell it, then I want it!', '', 7629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m Augustus, and my prices are INSANE!', '', 7628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t find better prices anywhere!', '', 7627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE, INSECT!', '', 7626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. Please be brief in how the Kirin Tor may be of service to you.', '', 7625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a dangerous place, $n. Be careful around here.', '', 7624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Augustus.  I would like to do business.', 'Yes, Augustus.  I would like to do business.', 7623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commerce!  I crave it!', '', 7622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi $n!  Are you here to buy something?  Or maybe sell something?$B$BYou won\'t find better prices anywhere, or my name isn\'t Augustus the Touched!', '', 7621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before the Scourge came, I had a great business.  I bought and sold everything.  Everything!$B$BAnd my prices were INSANE!$B$BJust ask anyone.  Anyone who\'s not dead.', '', 7620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May Cenarius watch over you, $g brother : sister;.$B$BI am Tajarri, and I am a sworn protector of this shrine.  It is my honor to serve Keeper Remulos as a warden of this sacred land.', 7619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shrine of Remulos is a sacred place for us in the Cenarion Circle here in Moonglade... so please conduct yourself in a manner befitting a visitor.$B$BA visitor who doesn\'t want my scimitar buried in them, that is.', 7618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After the makrura attack, we could see that the Gallant would not survive another.  So I and the few surviving sailors abandoned my ship.$B$BWe are now ashore and will soon strike out for the town of Nijel\'s Point, but much danger lies between us and sanctuary, and I fear Desolace will consume us.$B$BI write this now in hopes that someone will know our plight, and some day avenge us against the watery fiends who were our ruin.', '', 7617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My chest is one of ingenious design, and requires two keys to unlock, one gold and one silver.  The first key, the silver key, I gave to my first mate, and I kept the gold.$B$BBut we were doomed to lose them.  My key was lost during the next naga attack, and my first mate\'s was lost a day later when drysnap makrura assailed us and pulled him into the deep.$B$BI am sure the naga and makrura have the keys.  I am glad the two are enemies and will not share them.', '', 7616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue reading...', 'Continue reading...', 7615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Ulysses Rackmore, captain of the Gallant.  And this is the log of the last few days of my doomed ship.$B$BWe were sailing to Feathermoon Stronghold with a shipment of supplies when naga stormed the sides of the Gallant.  We drove them back but we knew they\'d return.  Fearing the loss of my most precious belongings, I steered the Gallant to an island off the coast of Desolace, one with old, night elf ruins.  And there I left my treasure chest.', '', 7614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can not train you, $c.', 'I can not train you, $c.', 7613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reckless mortals! None may challenge the Sons of the Living flame!', '', 7612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work, $n!  Complete your trial by speaking with me.  Time continues to slip away until you do so!', 7611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throm-Ka, $c. My mood is poor this day, so please, unless you can help me, I would prefer to be alone.', 7610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s take a look at your fishing supplies.', 'Let\'s take a look at your fishing supplies.', 7608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should find some hired help; I don\'t like sitting here all day selling fish supplies. I\'d much rather go fishing, and then sell supplies.', 7607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blue dragons themselves aren\'t here, but followers of Malygos are. I do not know why, but I can tell you this: wherever the blue dragons are, expect to find arcane magic. I wouldn\'t be surprised if the dragonspawn are here protecting something... perhaps something the Highborne left behind.', '', 7606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen terrible things happen to the furbolg over the last few years--they were victims on many fronts. But it\'s unclear to me what\'s become of this tribe. Are they corrupted by the same plague that\'s touched Felwood? Or perhaps they are simply angry at what\'s happened to their once peaceful people and now seek to defend themselves. Either way, most of them appear hostile to those who come into the area.', '', 7605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A powerful human mage is rumored to live to the north; he keeps watch over the land for some unknown reason. I have not traveled there myself, but it is said that visitors are welcome and can even earn favor with him if they are willing to do errands for him.', '', 7604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once a great city of the night elves, the Highborne once ruled there, practicing great and powerful arcane magics. They are cursed now, haunting the lands, and their ruined city has been victimized by the Spitelash naga. I understand that the naga search the ruins for powerful Highborne artifacts.', '', 7603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because you have aided me, I will tell you what I know of this land and of the things there are to see. My knowledge is not vast, but perhaps I can point out some things that might interest one such as yourself.', '', 7602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The presence of blue dragons.', 'The presence of blue dragons.', 7601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Timbermaw furbolgs.', 'The Timbermaw furbolgs.', 7600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I should fall, take my pouch. Make certain that it gets to the High General.', 7599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These orders must get to High General Abbendis!', 7598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My back is killing me.', 7597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense danger up ahead.', 7596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Assassins! Guards! Guards!', 7595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mage tower to the north.', 'The mage tower to the north.', 7594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ruins of Eldarath.', 'The Ruins of Eldarath.', 7593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My knowledge of night elf lore is limited, but it is said long ago--back when the night elves still held sacred the art of arcane spell casting--that Azshara was the greatest of their kind. A beautiful woman they named queen. Sadly, it was her addiction to the arcane that would one day be the catalyst for the most devastating events in this world\'s history.', '', 7592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The land of Azshara.', 'The land of Azshara.', 7591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, citizen!  You look like a stout one.  We guards are spread a little thin out here, and I could use your help...', '', 7590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once ye\'ve seen one trogg, ye\'ve seen \'em all.', '', 7589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the beauty of Shadowglen never ceases to delight my senses!', '', 7588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Be prepared. Today, we will teach the quilboar much regret, sorrow, and fear, in the name of our Greatmother.', '', 7587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No other race on Azeroth has suffered as much as our people, $c. To laugh in the face of death has become second nature for all of us.', '', 7586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is drawn to the ghost magnet...', '', 7585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c. The ground itself quakes and cries out in anguish. We must remain resolute or we ourselves will be engulfed by the turmoil.', '', 7584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is angered!', '', 7583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve interfered with our plans for the last time, foolish $c!', 7582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s disabled ghost region.', '', 7581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins countdown.', '', 7580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve interfered with our plans for the last time, foolish $c!', 'You\'ve interfered with our plans for the last time, foolish $c!', 7579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking for a flight back to Rut\'theran Village, then you should talk to my night elven counterpart, Silva Fil\'naveth.', '', 7578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you like a flight to Thunder Bluff, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?', '', 7577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not a druid!', '', 7576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re looking for a flight back to Thunder Bluff, then you should talk to my tauren counterpart, Bunthen Plainswind.', 7575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would you like a flight to Rut\'theran Village, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?', 7574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
