('I have much knowledge to impress upon you, $c. You must learn to hunt with honor.', 'I have much knowledge to impress upon you, $c. You must learn to hunt with honor.', 7518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
