('Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c.', 'Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c.', 7513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kodo beasts, my friend!  Trained from a young age and raised on the Golden Plains of Mulgore, these fine animals will make even finer steeds!  Please, browse my selection, and see for yourself why we taurens have come to rely on these magnificant creatures!', 'Kodo beasts, my friend!  Trained from a young age and raised on the Golden Plains of Mulgore, these fine animals will make even finer steeds!  Please, browse my selection, and see for yourself why we taurens have come to rely on these magnificant creatures!', 7512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before beginning a hunt, it is wise to ask someone what you are looking for before you begin looking for it.', 'Before beginning a hunt, it is wise to ask someone what you are looking for before you begin looking for it.', 7511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not known to my people.  A kodo is a mighty steed, and it is the product of love and care by my people; such is not given onto strangers.  Until the elders of Thunder Bluff consider you to be a friend, I cannot offer you the sale of a kodo.', 'You are not known to my people.  A kodo is a mighty steed, and it is the product of love and care by my people; such is not given onto strangers.  Until the elders of Thunder Bluff consider you to be a friend, I cannot offer you the sale of a kodo.', 7510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me browse your goods.', 'Let me browse your goods.', 7509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years of quality breeding techniques and plenty of care allow me the privilege of showing you these horses!  Please, take your time as you consider them for your mount.  A horse is a companion for the ages, friend.  Don\'t sell yourself short - get your steed here today!', 'Years of quality breeding techniques and plenty of care allow me the privilege of showing you these horses!  Please, take your time as you consider them for your mount.  A horse is a companion for the ages, friend.  Don\'t sell yourself short - get your steed here today!', 7508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least friendly to the Kingdom of Stormwind.  These steeds are the finest you\'ll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn\'t want them in the hands of our enemies.$B$BNot saying you\'re an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business.', 'Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least friendly to the Kingdom of Stormwind.  These steeds are the finest you\'ll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn\'t want them in the hands of our enemies.$B$BNot saying you\'re an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business.', 7507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for the Gizleton Caravan to head on out! We\'ll be back soon but if you cannot wait, head north to Kormek\'s Hut. We open shop in about an hour.', '', 7506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So sorry to leave a customer but we have places to go and people to swindle. We will be back sometime later today. Good-bye!', '', 7505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the latest incarnation of automated vendors... we will rule the world one day... don\'t tell my boss that I am skimming money off his merchandise...', '', 7504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve not had a steed until you\'ve taken the reigns of a finely bred Barak Tor\'ol mountain ram, my friend.  Please, feel free to inspect these fine companions to any adventurer.  They\'ll serve you well, believe me.', 'You\'ve not had a steed until you\'ve taken the reigns of a finely bred Barak Tor\'ol mountain ram, my friend.  Please, feel free to inspect these fine companions to any adventurer.  They\'ll serve you well, believe me.', 7503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am curious to see what a bucket of bolts has to offer.', 'I am curious to see what a bucket of bolts has to offer.', 7501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My programming will not allow me to lower the cost of any items.', '', 7500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I\'ll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that\'s not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you\'ve been recognized as friendly to Ironforge, I\'ll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale.', 'Not so fast, $g guy : lady;... I\'ll not be handing out the reigns of a mighty ram steed to someone that\'s not a proven ally of the dwarves of Ironforge.  Once you\'ve been recognized as friendly to Ironforge, I\'ll gladly show you what varieties of rams I have for sale.', 7499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, my friend.  May the Dawn keep you well in these troubled times.', '', 7498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune be with you, $c.', '', 7497, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I look like a $c to you? Now run along before I feel the need to oil my blade... in your blood.', 'Do I look like a $c to you? Now run along before I feel the need to oil my blade... in your blood.', 7496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I have. Teach me.', 'Yes, I have. Teach me.', 7495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to learn from the master eh?', 'Come to learn from the master eh?', 7494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out.', 'I don\'t think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out.', 7493, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like the type I should watch my coin purse around. Something I can help you with?', 'You look like the type I should watch my coin purse around. Something I can help you with?', 7492, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you train me how to use rogue skills?', 'Can you train me how to use rogue skills?', 7491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m lookin\' for rogue trainin\'.', 'I\'m lookin\' for rogue trainin\'.', 7490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kin I do for ye, $n?', 'What kin I do for ye, $n?', 7489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This just happens to be your lucky day; I just completed Super-Seller 680\'s maintenance. There are tons of items for sell at great low-low prices. Go ahead and see for yourself... my brother Cork thinks his Vendor-Tron 1000 will out sell my bot.', '', 7488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me take a look at what you have to offer.', 'Let me take a look at what you have to offer.', 7487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No doubt you are another inept simpleton sent from the Dark Lady to train under her champion.$B$B<Nathanos sighs.>$B$BI\'ve sent every one of you back to her in pieces, I don\'t see why it will be any different this time.$B$BMine, however, is not to question why, but instead to do as the Dark Lady bids.', '', 7486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... a customer! Talk to my greatest invention, the Vendor-Tron 1000. He has all your needs... some of the rarest items you will ever find on the market anywhere in Kalimdor... not to mention that his programming will not allow any bargaining, so the price you see is the price you pay.', '', 7484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but I only train rogues.', 'Sorry, but I only train rogues.', 7483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
