('This is Rigger Gizelton asking for assistance escorting my caravan past Mannoroc Coven. I\'m on the road east of Shadowprey village.', '', 7475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
