('', 'Thanks again, $n! I\'m very pleased with what we found.$B$BGood luck to you!', 7465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us.  Never forget this.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us.  Never forget this.', 7464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We work to preserve the balance as Cenarius teaches, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.', 'We work to preserve the balance as Cenarius teaches, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.', 7463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You merely prolong the inevitable. Succumb. She will free your misguided soul.', '', 7462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place.', 7461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace.  In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance.', 'Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace.  In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance.', 7460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you!', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you!', 7459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blessings of Cenarius be yours, $c.', 'The blessings of Cenarius be yours, $c.', 7458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our master Malfurion has returned from the Dreaming, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.', 'Our master Malfurion has returned from the Dreaming, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.', 7457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, with Malfurion watching over us.  Never forget this.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, with Malfurion watching over us.  Never forget this.', 7456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A darkness had fallen over my eyes, but you tore me from my unholy reverie.  You saved me, $n.$B$BAnd now I beg you... to forgive me.', '', 7455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle is over, and the people of Darrowshire are saved.$B$BThey are saved, $n, because of you.  You are truly a hero of Darrowshire.', '', 7454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle is over, and the people of Darrowshire are saved.', '', 7453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training as a druid.', 'I seek training as a druid.', 7452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to teach you.$B$BIt never hurts to reaffirm one\'s place within what I like to call the Great Balance.  As preservers of this balance, we must strive to continually keep our minds clear and our hearts strong.  Training helps us in this regard.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to teach you.$B$BIt never hurts to reaffirm one\'s place within what I like to call the Great Balance.  As preservers of this balance, we must strive to continually keep our minds clear and our hearts strong.  Training helps us in this regard.', 7451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strive to keep the balance in all things, $c.  This is where true harmony lies.', 'Strive to keep the balance in all things, $c.  This is where true harmony lies.', 7450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you require an illusion?$B$BShould your illusion falter in the midst of your quest, return to me and I shall reapply the guise.$B$BShould you fail in your endeavors, do not give up! Return to me. I shall assist you until you have completed your objectives.', 7449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.  You are welcome in Nighthaven, as well as all of Moonglade.  The Cenarion Circle welcomes all beings who respect the authority and command of nature.$B$BWhile you are here, please be sure to preserve the balance in all things.  Disturbances are not welcome here, and our wardens are trained to cease all hostilities without question.', '', 7448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It remains to be seen if you are ready, young one.  Even the wisest and oldest of druids are never truly ready when their ultimate time of testing comes.$B$BYou have heard my words, and now you must move on.  Heed what I have taught you.  There will be a time when you will have your strength tested.  You must face your foe as the bear would - with strength of body and with strength of heart.  Learn from the fight, young one.  Go... with my blessings.', '', 7447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have heard your words, Great Bear Spirit, and I understand.  I now seek your blessings to fully learn the way of the Claw.', 'I have heard your words, Great Bear Spirit, and I understand.  I now seek your blessings to fully learn the way of the Claw.', 7446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength of the heart is what gives you the resolve to take action... action that is rooted in intents that are pure and forthright.  To keep the balance is not to be complacent or banal.$B$BYou must show resolve for that which you believe in, and you must be willing to fight for it.  The mother bear shows endless conviction in protecting her young, as does an elder bear protecting his den.  It is this resolve, this strength of heart, which you must come to know if you are to master the way of the Claw.', '', 7445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek to understand the importance of strength of the heart.', 'I seek to understand the importance of strength of the heart.', 7444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength of the body is the power and swiftness of action.  You must keep yourself fit at all times, both physically and mentally.  The bear\'s girth highlights its strength, as it is a ferocious foe in combat.  The bear\'s girth, however, belies its lithe agility and sharp mind.  These are surprises you will use to your advantage.$B$BYou must rely on the strength of the bear\'s body in order to master the way of the Claw.', '', 7443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek to understand the importance of strength of the body.', 'I seek to understand the importance of strength of the body.', 7442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I represent the strength which bolsters you as a young druid.  You have come to me to learn this strength, young one, and I will teach this to you.  I will teach you all that is the spirit bear, provided you will listen and understand.$B$BIn order to know what it means to draw upon my spirit, you need to understand the importance of the strength of the body, as well as the strength of the heart.', '', 7441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I represent the strength which bolsters you as a young druid.  I am the strength of the body, and the strength of the heart.  You have already come to know this in your training, and you draw upon this when you take on the aspect of the bear.$B$BContinue to keep the balance in all things, young one, and keep your perspective clear and true.  When you need me... I will be there for you.', '', 7440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you represent, spirit?', 'What do you represent, spirit?', 7439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bear spirit looks upon you with a calm and peaceful gaze.  You hear a voice speak to you as though it was coming from the bear, but the creature makes no indication that it is speaking.$B$B\"Greetings, my young friend.  If you have come to me seeking guidance, then perhaps I can help you find what you seek.\"', '', 7438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bear looks at you calmy and patiently, but says nothing.', '', 7437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then come, hermit!', '', 7436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I want to stay here and reflect on what we have seen. Please see Erelas and tell him what we have learned.', 7435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your help, $n. I wish you well in your adventures. ', 7434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tragic. The elder Fordring lives on... You are too late, old man. Retreat back to your cave, hermit, unless you wish to join your son in the Twisting Nether.', '', 7433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell.\n', 7432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, remember what we have shown you...', 7431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 30, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This I promise... This I vow...', '', 7430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too long have I sat idle, gripped in this haze... this malaise, lamenting what could have been... what should have been.', '', 7429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Know that wherever you might find them in the world, they are protecting something of importance, as they were entrusted to do so long ago.', 7428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wildkin are inherently magical; this power was bestowed upon them by the goddess.', 7427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will not have been in vain, Taelan. A new Order is born on this day... an Order which will dedicate itself to extinguishing the evil that plagues this world. An evil that cannot hide behind politics and pleasantries.', '', 7426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s holds the limp body of Taelan Fordring and softly sobs.', '', 7425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without a purpose, they wander... But many find their way back to the sacred areas that they once were sworn to protect.\n', 7424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look what they did to my boy.', '', 7423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But now, many years later, the wildkin have grown more feral, and without the guidance of the goddess, they are confused...\n', 7422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s falls to one knee.', '', 7421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousand more like him exist. Ten thousand. Should one fall, another will rise to take the seat of power.', '', 7420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was on that day that the wildkin were given to us. Fierce guardians, the goddess assigned the wildkin to protect all of her sacred places.\n', 7419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon after, we began to have visions of a creature... A creature with the feathers of an owl, but the will and might of a bear...', 7418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Realizing that the gem needed to be protected, we turned to the goddess herself.', 7417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anu\'dorini Talah. Ru shallora enudoril.\n', 7416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through the gem, Elune channeled her infinite wisdom...', 7415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This gem once allowed direct communication with Elune, herself.', 7414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look above you; thara dormil dorah... ', 7413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The altar is glowing! We have done it!', 7412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must continue on now.', 7411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s find the next one.', 7410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another Relic Bundle!', 'I need another Relic Bundle!', 7409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have all been witness to terrible tragedies, but we must not let them drag us to despair.$B$BInstead, hold those memories close so that one day, we might find a reckoning.', '', 7408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge are defeated!  Darrowshire is saved!', 'The Scourge are defeated!  Darrowshire is saved!', 7407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirit looks intently into your eyes and grasps your hand.  You feel a warmth shoot through your body, almost knocking you to your knees.$B$BAs the warmth passes, you feel the slight presence of an ursine spirit within your being... bolstering your resolve.', '', 7406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have fought well, spirit.  I ask you to grant me the strength of your body and the strength of your heart.', 'You have fought well, spirit.  I ask you to grant me the strength of your body and the strength of your heart.', 7405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The slain spirit of Lunaclaw stares at you intently, as though wanting something from you.', '', 7404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I missed you too, honey.  And I\'m finally home...', '', 7403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I missed you so much, Daddy!', 7402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go play!  No, tell me a story, Daddy!  No... let\'s go pick flowers!  And play tea time!  I found my dollie, did I tell you?', 7401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Daddy!  You\'re back!', 7400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Daddy!', 7399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahah!', '', 7398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pamela?  Are you there, honey?', '', 7397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare is finally over!  Darrowshire, forgive me!', '', 7396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not make it to the forest\'s edge, Fordring.', '', 7395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will show you...\n', 7394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enu thora\'serador. This is a sacred place.\n', 7393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We only wish to know why the wildkin guard this area...', 7392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 30, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, priestesses, forgive us for our intrusion. We do not wish any harm here.', 7391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 400, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who has disturbed the altar of the goddess?', 7390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It has been many years...', 7389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is happening? Look!', 7388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It... it is working!', 7387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will read the words carved into the stone, and you must find a way to light it.', 7386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time for the final step; we must activate the altar.', 7385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s turns his attention towards you.', '', 7384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you really believe that you could defeat me? Your friends are soon to join you, Taelan.', '', 7383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 7382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough!', '', 7381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve found it!', 7380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the place. Let\'s light it.', 7379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, light this while I am channeling.', 7378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slip a little coin into the boss\'s hand and look what it gets ya. I love my job. Though, if I could find a way to get that little firecracker Snurk reassigned to this port....well, I can\'t imagine it any better. But I\'m betting that you aren\'t here about my business practices. You\'re looking for the Zeppelin to Undercity, am I right? Well that\'s great, because it docks right here behind me. Oh and hey, if you see Snurk, put a good word in for me, would ya?', 'Slip a little coin into the boss\'s hand and look what it gets ya. I love my job. Though, if I could find a way to get that little firecracker Snurk reassigned to this port....well, I can\'t imagine it any better. But I\'m betting that you aren\'t here about my business practices. You\'re looking for the Zeppelin to Undercity, am I right? Well that\'s great, because it docks right here behind me. Oh and hey, if you see Snurk, put a good word in for me, would ya?', 7377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$g Hey there cutie, you looking for a ride to Grom\'gol? I hear it gets mighty steamy down in those jungles, maybe I could join you for a short vacation, show you a real jungle cat. : Come, take a trip to the wonderful, gorgeous, tropical jungles of Stranglethorn. That\'s right, you too can be spending your time sunbathing by the crystal blue waters while I stand here in this unbearable heat with nothing to look at but my brother Frezza all day! Enjoy your trip!;', '$g Hey there cutie, you looking for a ride to Grom\'gol? I hear it gets mighty steamy down in those jungles, maybe I could join you for a short vacation, show you a real jungle cat. : Come, take a trip to the wonderful, gorgeous, tropical jungles of Stranglethorn. That\'s right, you too can be spending your time sunbathing by the crystal blue waters while I stand here in this unbearable heat with nothing to look at but my brother Frezza all day! Enjoy your trip!;', 7376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This blue light... It\'s strange. What do you think it means?', 7375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face me, coward. Face the faith and strength that you once embodied.', '', 7374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your soul burn in anguish, Isillien! Light give me strength to battle this fiend.', '', 7373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you done,  Isillien? You once fought with honor, for the good of our people... and now... you have murdered my boy... ', '', 7372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not your fight, stranger. Protect yourself from the attacks of the Crimson Elite. I shall battle the Grand Inquisitor.', '', 7371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isillien!', '', 7370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Redpath is slain!', 'Captain Redpath is slain!', 7369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horgus is slain!  Take heart, defenders of Darrowshire!', 'Horgus is slain!  Take heart, defenders of Darrowshire!', 7368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Davil Lightfire has succumbed to his wounds!', 'Davil Lightfire has succumbed to his wounds!', 7367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Davil Lightfire is defeated!  Darrowshire is lost!', 'Davil Lightfire is defeated!  Darrowshire is lost!', 7366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, I need your help to properly channel. I will ask you to aid me several times on our path, so please be ready.', 7365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok, let\'s get going!', 7364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Too much time has passed. We must try again later.', 7363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sit and listen to my story, $r.', '', 7362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end is now, Fordring.', '', 7361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls for his guardsmen.', '', 7360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grand Crusader has charged me with destroying you and your newfound friends, Taelan, but know this: I do this for pleasure, not of obligation or duty.', '', 7359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darrowshire, to arms!  The Scourge approach!', 'Darrowshire, to arms!  The Scourge approach!', 7358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darrowshire is defeated!  Soon, all of Lordaeron will fall!', '', 7357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darrowshire!  You are doomed!', '', 7356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defenders of Darrowshire!  Rally!  We must prevail!', '', 7355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go back to your Lich King, foul creatures!', 'Go back to your Lich King, foul creatures!', 7354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight to your last breath, brothers and sisters!', 'Fight to your last breath, brothers and sisters!', 7353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight, and we will win this day!', 'Fight, and we will win this day!', 7352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not give up!  Shed your blood for Darrowshire!', 'Do not give up!  Shed your blood for Darrowshire!', 7351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge will not prevail!', 'The Scourge will not prevail!', 7350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight!  Fight for your families!', 'Fight!  Fight for your families!', 7349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our captain will save us!', 'Our captain will save us!', 7348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Darrowshire!', 'For Darrowshire!', 7347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horgus, your nightmare ends!  Now!', '', 7346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is the time, Davil.  Now is the time of your death!', '', 7345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light burns bright in you, Davil.  I will enjoy snuffing it out!', '', 7344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not lose hope, Darrowshire!  We will not fall!', '', 7343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'ll have our heads if we\'re caught!', 'She\'ll have our heads if we\'re caught!', 7342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them catch you!', 'Don\'t let them catch you!', 7341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of here!', 'Get out of here!', 7340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TEST - restart battlefield.', 'TEST - restart battlefield.', 7339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is as they say: Like father, like son. You are as weak of will as Tirion... perhaps more so. I can only hope my assassins finally succeeded in ending his pitiful life.', '', 7338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You disappoint me, Taelan. I had plans for you... grand plans. Alas, it was only a matter of time before your filthy bloodline would catch up with you.', '', 7337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde wins!', '', 7336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance wins!', '', 7335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Blast those stupid centaurs! Sigh - well, it seems you kept your bargain. Up the road you shall find Smeed Scrabblescrew, he has your money.', '', 7334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow! We did it... not sure why we thought we needed the likes of you. Nevertheless, speak with Smeed Scrabblescrew; he will give you your earnings!\n', '', 7333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only if I were about five feet taller, then I would show these blasphemous demons a thing or two! Help!', '', 7332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I paying you for? The kodos are nearly dead!', '', 7331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eeck! Demons appear hungry for the kodos!', '', 7330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not much further. The main road is just up ahead.', '', 7329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please speak with Sentinel Onaeya at Maestra\'s Post in Ashenvale, she will see to it that you are properly rewarded for your bravery this day.', 7328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Alliance!', 7327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here I am, alliance!  Take me down... if you can!', '', 7326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s Proudmoore! Get out of here!', 'It\'s Proudmoore! Get out of here!', 7325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run!', 'Run!', 7324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highlord Fordring, are you alright?', 'Highlord Fordring, are you alright?', 7323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, what\'s going on over there? Sir, are you alright? Sir??', 'Hey, what\'s going on over there? Sir, are you alright? Sir??', 7322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the...', 'What the...', 7321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something is wrong with the Highlord. Do something!', 'Something is wrong with the Highlord. Do something!', 7320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir?', 'Sir?', 7319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOOOOOOOOO!', '', 7318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whinnies.', '', 7317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls for his mount.', '', 7316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt.', '', 7315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remove your disguise, lest you feel the bite of my blade when the fury has taken control.', '', 7314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will lead us through Hearthglen to the forest\'s edge. From there, you will take me to my father.', '', 7313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re fired! <Cough...Cork clears throat.> I mean, help!', '', 7312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mister body guard, are you going to earn your money or what?', '', 7311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, you call yourself a body guard? Get to work and protect us...', '', 7310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not forrrget what you have done...$B$BPleassse, leave meee...', 7309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such sssorrow... The passst cannot be undone...', 7308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello! What brings you to Winterspring? These cold and vast lands may seem dismal, but this is a place of many secrets...', 7307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready for the illusion, Myranda.', 'I am ready for the illusion, Myranda.', 7306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These are dangerous times, adventurer. Walk lightly.', 7305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do the goblins ever manage to secure packs to these beasts?  Kodos are ten times the size!', 'How do the goblins ever manage to secure packs to these beasts?  Kodos are ten times the size!', 7304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah...the wondrous sound of kodos.  I love the way they make the ground shake... inspect the beast for me.', '', 7303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That kodo sure is a beauty.  Wait a minute, where are my bifocals?  Perhaps you should inspect the beast for me.', '', 7302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, look out with that kodo! You had better inspect that beast before I give you credit!', '', 7301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stormpike General is dead!', '', 7297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Frostwolf General is dead!', '', 7296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vanndar is here.  Come on, hordelings!  Show me what you got!', '', 7295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here!  Come and get me you alliance pansies!', '', 7294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drek\'Thar is defeated!  The Alliance is victorious... for now.$B$BSpeak with our quartermaster and aid in our reconstruction.', '', 7293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neither generals is spawned.', '', 7291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The horde general is defeated!$B$BThe Alliance is the victor, and the Horde now scrambles to rebuild its weakened forces.', '', 7290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our general, Vanndar Stormpike, has fallen in battle!  The battle is lost!$B$BSpeak with our quartermaster and help rebuild our forces.', '', 7289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces are ready and eager.  Soon, Balinda Stonehearth will enter her outpost and the battle will begin anew!', '', 7288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s start a new battle, and beat the Alliance this time!', 'Let\'s start a new battle, and beat the Alliance this time!', 7287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the Alterac Valley battlefield.  Currently both sides are at odds.', '', 7286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s start a new battle, and beat the Horde this time!', 'Let\'s start a new battle, and beat the Horde this time!', 7285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the Alterac Valley battlefield.  Both sides are still fighting.', '', 7284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh troops flood to Iceblood Garrison!  Captain Galvangar will soon arrive, and a new battle will soon begin!', '', 7283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Ballinda Stonehearth will soon arrive at her garrison.  A new battle will soon be joined!', '', 7282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s done $n, and I think you\'ll be satisfied with the results.', '', 7281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The solution is ready in my cauldron.  It\'s just the matter of treating both the unfinished key and the scarab.', '', 7280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s done $n, and I think you\'ll be satisfied with the results.', '', 7279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The solution is ready in my cauldron.  It\'s just the matter of treating both the unfinished key and the scarab.', '', 7278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s searches for a soul to swallow!', '', 7277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Being part of the Explorers\' League, I\'ve been hunting for artifacts in the area. Winterspring is said to contain very magical items... Most are highly guarded.', '', 7276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Sarkhoff\'s... sometimes the Sarkhoff\'s visit. They are good people.', 7275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are they all... dead?', 7274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is someone there? Tirion my old friend, is that you? Have you come to save us?', 7273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So dark...', 7272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m saved.', '', 7271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am now corrupted.', '', 7270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there is anything you would have of me...', 'If there is anything you would have of me...', 7269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the Searing Blade is expendable?', 'So the Searing Blade is expendable?', 7268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see the Burning Blade is taking over where the Shadow Council once failed.', 'It is good to see the Burning Blade is taking over where the Shadow Council once failed.', 7267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may speak frankly...', 'You may speak frankly...', 7266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will make it known to you. You are obviously already proving yourself in our ranks to become a lieutenant so quickly. Perhaps you can return to me later and I will have tasks for you. The council adores those skilled in the arcane, but servants of all kinds are always welcome, no matter their profession.', '', 7265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! Save for their leaders--the satyr, Bazzalan, and the warlock Jergosh--yes, all of them. That is why I constantly send Vol\'jin\'s worshippers at them. It gives Vol\'jin the impression that I am weeding out the evil in the bowels of his great city. The victory is in reality two-fold: kill Thrall\'s faithful and test the strength of those in the Searing Blade to see if they are truly worthy of joining me.', '', 7264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naive fool. The Burning Blade IS the Shadow Council! There are many cults and organizations under the Council\'s rule, but all of them are just extensions of their will. I may lead the Burning Blade, but I am still just as much a pawn to the Council as you are to me!$B$BLook at the Searing Blade--most of them think they are becoming the next rising group of powerful warlocks that they will replace the Shadow Council.', '', 7263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, one of our own. It is good to see our numbers are growing so rapidly that I can no longer keep track of the faces of our members.$B$BThat fool Vol\'jin thinks I am working hard to cleanse the image of warlocks and prove we are his servants. Idiot! The Burning Legion will make ash of this entire world after it drains it completely.', '', 7262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well. Looks like we got ourselves some competition. Get \'em boys!', '', 7261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be wise to explain to you the depths at which our enemies will go to to hide themselves under our noses.$B$BKnow this first and foremost: our enemy is the Shadow Council. No matter what task I give you, or who I ask you to act against, know that one simple fact.$B$BMany cults exist within the Council, but only to hide its actions against the foolish.$B$BGroups like the Burning Blade, the Argus Wake, and the Searing Blade are all tools of the Council. Consider them one and the same.', '', 7260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapon Master', 'Weapon Master', 7259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little forsaken know all weapons.  Him Archibald.  You find on inner ring of War Quarter.', 'Little forsaken know all weapons.  Him Archibald.  You find on inner ring of War Quarter.', 7258, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archibald who you look for.  He outside weapon merchant shop on inner ring of War Quarter.', 'Archibald who you look for.  He outside weapon merchant shop on inner ring of War Quarter.', 7257, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapon Master', 'Weapon Master', 7256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None are as skilled in the use of weapons as Ansekhwa.  It is said that he is guided by the spirits of the finest warriors of our honored ancestors.  Seek him out on the lower rise and he will teach you what you want to know.', 'None are as skilled in the use of weapons as Ansekhwa.  It is said that he is guided by the spirits of the finest warriors of our honored ancestors.  Seek him out on the lower rise and he will teach you what you want to know.', 7255, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you seek the wisdom of Ansekhwa.  Look for him on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Weapons.', 'Ah, you seek the wisdom of Ansekhwa.  Look for him on the lower rise at Thunder Bluff Weapons.', 7254, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapon Master', 'Weapon Master', 7253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for Sayoc and Hanashi at the Valley of Honor inside Arms of Legend.  Watch your tongue around them or Sayoc may decide to give a piece of you as a snack to Grinning Dog.', 'Look for Sayoc and Hanashi at the Valley of Honor inside Arms of Legend.  Watch your tongue around them or Sayoc may decide to give a piece of you as a snack to Grinning Dog.', 7252, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking to learn how to use a new weapon?  Find Sayoc and Hanashi inside Arms of Legend in the Valley of Honor.', 'Looking to learn how to use a new weapon?  Find Sayoc and Hanashi inside Arms of Legend in the Valley of Honor.', 7251, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer looking to learn how to use a new weapon are ye?  Well, ye should be talking to Bixi or Buliwyf over at the Timberline Arms weapon shop then $glad : lass;.  They know their weapons from axes to... uh... zweihanders.', 'Yer looking to learn how to use a new weapon are ye?  Well, ye should be talking to Bixi or Buliwyf over at the Timberline Arms weapon shop then $glad : lass;.  They know their weapons from axes to... uh... zweihanders.', 7249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Between Bixi and Buliwyf, there ain\'t many weapons they haven\'t had the pleasure of slashing or smashing an orc with.  You can find them hanging out at the Timberline Arms weapon shop if ye need some training.', 'Between Bixi and Buliwyf, there ain\'t many weapons they haven\'t had the pleasure of slashing or smashing an orc with.  You can find them hanging out at the Timberline Arms weapon shop if ye need some training.', 7248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons Trainer', 'Weapons Trainer', 7247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I received the majority of my weapons training from Ilyenia Moonfire in the Warrior\'s Terrace.  You would do well to seek her out if you desire to learn the use of a new weapon.  ', 'I received the majority of my weapons training from Ilyenia Moonfire in the Warrior\'s Terrace.  You would do well to seek her out if you desire to learn the use of a new weapon.  ', 7246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through the millennia, Ilyenia Moonfire has mastered numerous weapons and now offers to train others in their use.  You can find her at the Warrior\'s Terrace if you desire training.', 'Through the millennia, Ilyenia Moonfire has mastered numerous weapons and now offers to train others in their use.  You can find her at the Warrior\'s Terrace if you desire training.', 7245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons Trainer', 'Weapons Trainer', 7244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Woo Ping has mastered nearly every weapon known to man.  He is especially deadly with his sword techniques.  He spends a good deal of time over in the Weller\'s Arsenal waiting on new shipments of weapons to arrive if you need some training.', 'Master Woo Ping has mastered nearly every weapon known to man.  He is especially deadly with his sword techniques.  He spends a good deal of time over in the Weller\'s Arsenal waiting on new shipments of weapons to arrive if you need some training.', 7243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woo Ping\'s stamina is simply astounding.  Watching him practice his weapon techniques for hours on end, I felt sorry for the practice dummy afterward.  I can\'t think of anyone better suited to train you in armed combat.', 'Woo Ping\'s stamina is simply astounding.  Watching him practice his weapon techniques for hours on end, I felt sorry for the practice dummy afterward.  I can\'t think of anyone better suited to train you in armed combat.', 7242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons Trainer', 'Weapons Trainer', 7241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am now corrupting you...', '', 7240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time, bring friends.', '', 7239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You weren\'t worth the energy expenditure. <Nathanos spits.>', '', 7238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the best you can do?', '', 7237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disappointing.', '', 7236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The reckoning is upon you, weakling!', '', 7235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 7234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you!', '', 7233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you run now, you may live.', '', 7232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can smell your fear, $r.', '', 7231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall wear your entrails as a necklace.', '', 7230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare for a severe beating.', '', 7229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen closely to what you are told and do not quickly trust, or distrust.  For even friends serve their own ends, $c.$B$BOur great Warchief knows this, and to prove that there are warlocks within the Horde who do not wish to destroy it from within or gain control over it, I have volunteered to aid our young leader in anyway I can.', '', 7228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah!  My wounds are too severe.  Defenders, fight on without me!', '', 7227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is it that small creatures such as goblins are always fascinated with larger creatures?', 'Why is it that small creatures such as goblins are always fascinated with larger creatures?', 7226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will, Tirion.', 'I will, Tirion.', 7225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. The Scarlet Crusade are an aberration of the Order of the Silver Hand.$B$BYou must believe me, $r; Taelan is a good man. He needs guidance. He needs to remember... remember what it is to be noble and honorable. I know that in his heart, he knows what he does is wrong. Will you help him? Will you help him remember?', '', 7224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is terrible.', 'That is terrible.', 7223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My son, Taelan, was only a child when I was found guilty of treason and banished from the Alliance to live a life in exile. I chose to remain here so that I could watch over him; to somehow insure that he would grow up an honorable man.$B$BAs I had hoped, he took my place as lord of Mardenholde; but in a cruel twist of fate, joined the ranks of the Scarlet Crusade. He is now their Highlord, $r.', '', 7222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Tirion. What of your identity?', 'Thank you, Tirion. What of your identity?', 7221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must apologize for not being entirely truthful with you in regards to my identity. I had to be certain that you could be trusted - few people would have selflessly lent assistance to an old and forgotten hermit.$B$BYou have proven yourself as one of those people: A person of integrity and honor.', '', 7220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to hear your tale, Tirion.', 'I am ready to hear your tale, Tirion.', 7219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All members of the Horde are equal in my eyes, $n. We have all suffered many burdens, and if it were not for wisdom and honor, then we would be no better than the Scourge or my people while our blood was tainted by the demon Mannoroth.$B$BIt is your duty to aid the Horde and to defend our way of life. But it is also your duty to know when quarter and compassion should be given to friend and foe alike.$B$BUnderstand this well. This is the new Horde, not some demon-spawned army who lack freewill.', '', 7218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not presume to speak to me as though you are my equal, $c. Sylvanas is my queen, and I will do as she bids.$B$BIf you do not show the proper respect, I assure you, we can find a more than suitable place for you in the Nether.$B$BBut there is no reason we cannot have words if you wish to aid the Dark Lady...', '', 7217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, feel free to speak to me anytime, $n. You have served Magatha well. I am sure she will call upon you in the future.', '', 7216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n.', '', 7215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, $c. You may speak to me unless you have direct business with my mistress Magatha.$B$BI deal with most of her tasks for her so she can concentrate on more important matters. Perhaps there are some things we could discuss before you seek audience with her?', '', 7214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s takes in a deep breath...', '%s takes in a deep breath...', 7213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Redpath!  How could you forsake us!', 'Captain Redpath!  How could you forsake us!', 7212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was devoured by Horgus!  I can still feel his teeth upon me!', 'I was devoured by Horgus!  I can still feel his teeth upon me!', 7211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware Marduk!  Beware, or your strength will wither.', 'Beware Marduk!  Beware, or your strength will wither.', 7210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light must prevail!', 'The Light must prevail!', 7209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not fail us!', 'Do not fail us!', 7208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, Darrowshire!  I would give a thousand lives for you!', 'Oh, Darrowshire!  I would give a thousand lives for you!', 7207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must save him!', 'You must save him!', 7206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('End our suffering!', 'End our suffering!', 7205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I just fired an arrow.', 7204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares to challenge me in my domain?!', '', 7203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My leg feels much better now, the remedy must be working. If you will excuse me, I must go report to my superiors about what has transpired here.\n', 7202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Praise Elune! I don\'t know if I could have survived the day without you, friend.', 7201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... did you hear that? Something approaches from the west!', 7200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve run out of arrows! I\'m afraid if any more come you will need to take them on by yourself my friend.', 7199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I have another Dawn\'s Gambit, Betina?  I want to test it again...', 'May I have another Dawn\'s Gambit, Betina?  I want to test it again...', 7198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Plaguelands are an excellent place to strike against the Scourge!', 7197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This kodo sure looks nothing like the beast I originally lured!  I wonder if the kombobulator can be used on me.', 'This kodo sure looks nothing like the beast I originally lured!  I wonder if the kombobulator can be used on me.', 7196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When preparing the dragon\'s meal, be sure to torture the prisoner in view of the dragon.  It responds well to pre-meal entertainment.', '', 7195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lich King\'s forces are building.  It is imperative that our timetable supports his plans.', '', 7194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tomorrow we will begin training of our promising dragons, so don\'t forget your chew toys.', '', 7193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From yesterday\'s field trip, Marduk showed us that the dragons will tolerate the meat of recently killed humanoids, but only if they died slowly and painfully.', '', 7192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our oldest clutch of dragons are still far from maturity, but with patience and study, we are confident the dragonflight will soon be ready.', '', 7191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We await a batch of black dragon eggs from the Burning Steppes.  We believe that, through their study, we will advance our knowledge dramatically.', '', 7190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take note of the delicacy of the plagued dragon\'s diet.  Only terrified flesh will suffice.', '', 7189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now if you turn to page 34 in your text, you see an illustration of a dwarf undergoing dissection...', '', 7188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t look like a student...', '', 7187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your future is clouded.  Concentrate, and ask again.', '', 7186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a disturbance, lurking around you...', '', 7185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mind is unfocused.  Are you hiding something from me?', '', 7183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come from the Burning Steppes?  Do you have my black dragon eggs?', '', 7182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be silent!  Do you think our plagued dragons will hatch and train themselves?', '', 7181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What, may I ask, are you doing here?  Put on your student\'s attire, and study!', '', 7180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you bring your text books?  Can I look on with you?', 'Did you bring your text books?  Can I look on with you?', 7179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step in here, $gboy:girl;.  The master sees all...', 'Watch your step in here, $gboy:girl;.  The master sees all...', 7178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you finish yesterday\'s assignment?  If so, then sit by me!', 'Did you finish yesterday\'s assignment?  If so, then sit by me!', 7177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you forget your student\'s attire?  Do you think fashion is more vital than the Scourge\'s domination?', 'Did you forget your student\'s attire?  Do you think fashion is more vital than the Scourge\'s domination?', 7176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be silent!  I cannot afford to miss even a moment of this lecture!', 'Be silent!  I cannot afford to miss even a moment of this lecture!', 7175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must focus if we are to spawn our dragonflight!', 'We must focus if we are to spawn our dragonflight!', 7174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spend less time rattling and more time listening.', 'Spend less time rattling and more time listening.', 7173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be quiet!  Can\'t you see the master is speaking?', 'Be quiet!  Can\'t you see the master is speaking?', 7172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be a messenger from the Eastern Kingdoms, $n. I be sent here to make sure da priests who travel here be given proper direction.', '', 7171, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be seeking someone, $c. Please, leave me be... it is important I find them.', '', 7170, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek more training in the priestly ways.', 'I seek more training in the priestly ways.', 7169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek more training in the priestly ways.', 'I seek more training in the priestly ways.', 7168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek more training in the priestly ways.', 'I seek more training in the priestly ways.', 7167, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $n?', 'My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $n?', 7166, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune be with you, $c.', 'Elune be with you, $c.', 7165, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can this insignificant servant do for you, $n? Training perhaps?', 'What can this insignificant servant do for you, $n? Training perhaps?', 7164, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, $c?', 'Yes, $c?', 7163, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.', 'I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.', 7162, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be watchin\' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours.', 'You be watchin\' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours.', 7161, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek more training in the priestly ways.', 'I seek more training in the priestly ways.', 7160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope the Light is with you, $n. Is there anything I can do for you today?', 'I hope the Light is with you, $n. Is there anything I can do for you today?', 7159, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light protect you, $c.', 'The Light protect you, $c.', 7158, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek more training in the priestly ways.', 'I seek more training in the priestly ways.', 7157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I trust the Light is with you, $n. Is there something that I can I help you with?', 'I trust the Light is with you, $n. Is there something that I can I help you with?', 7156, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day.', 'Do not turn your back on the Light, $c, it may be the one thing that saves you some day.', 7155, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spot of tea, gov\'na?', 'Spot of tea, gov\'na?', 7154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you?!', 'How dare you?!', 7153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to dust you into oblivion!', 'I\'m going to dust you into oblivion!', 7152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to take out the trash!', 'Time to take out the trash!', 7151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t get paid enough for this!', 'I don\'t get paid enough for this!', 7150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to train.', 'I\'d like to train.', 7149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $n! Are you interested in training in tailoring?', '', 7148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you prove that you are a true ally, I might consider training you...', '', 7147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no time for you, $r. Continue on your way.', '', 7146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('School is in session!', '', 7145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes. I see you.$B$BBe on your way. You may have earned the trust of a few, but it will take more than that to prove it to me!', '', 7144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I trust very few of your kind, $n. But I can tell that you are a friend.', '', 7143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to buy from you.', 'I would like to buy from you.', 7142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, do not bother me... Your kind is all the same...', '', 7141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Winterfall furbolg that reside here in Winterspring were once our allies... But one day, that all changed.$B$BDriven by the strange demands of their high chief, they began to attack all others that they came in contact with, including our tribe. They keep to themselves now...', '', 7140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What about the Winterfall furbolg?', 'What about the Winterfall furbolg?', 7139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Timbermaw can grant you safe passage through the hold, however, you must prove yourself worthy of our aid.', '', 7138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must find a way to show that you both are fighting for the same side. Although the Timbermaw may attack you now, if you are diligent, you will find a way.$B$BYou must remember that any attacks on the Timbermaw furbolg directly will greatly hinder your chances of gaining them as an ally.$B$BA good place to start would be the Deadwood furbolg found in many parts of Felwood. These furbolg are the enemy of the Timbermaw tribe, and slaying them would greatly improve your standing with the Timbermaw.', '', 7137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I prove myself to the Timbermaw furbolg?', 'How can I prove myself to the Timbermaw furbolg?', 7136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the last of the furbolg race... The Timbermaw tribe remains uncorrupted, yet we face the same hostility from outsiders; most believe that it is not possible... that there could actually be furbolg that escaped the corruption...$B$BAngry at those that strive to make enemies too quickly, my brethren now attack any that draw near; they trust no one.$B$BBut perhaps, if you strive to make your presence peaceful with them, they might look upon you as an ally.', '', 7135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land belongs to the Defias Brotherhood now!', 'This land belongs to the Defias Brotherhood now!', 7134, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see those fools at the Abbey sent some fresh meat for us.', 'I see those fools at the Abbey sent some fresh meat for us.', 7133, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.', '', 7132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.', '', 7131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.', '', 7130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind.$B$BWe lost a number of friends and family in those days, and it pains me to know that the Scarlet Crusade has taken the mill for their own ends.$B$BThat\'s why I\'ve returned.', '', 7129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My family worked  the Northridge Lumber Mill in what\'s now Western Plaguelands. They were dedicated to the Dumah family, and now the Scarlet Crusade have taken it over along with all of Hearthglen!$B$BI will not rest until those zealots are wiped from Azeroth.', 7128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He... hello, $n. Sorry, I\'m recovering from my wounds.$B$BThose Scarlet Crusaders are tougher than I had given them credit for. They almost did me in.$B$BYou should be careful too. I\'d hate to see them get the jump on you.', 7127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c. Don\'t have too much time to talk--I\'m just using Chillwind as a camp to get some rest before heading to Hearthglen. I\'ve heard word that before they went crazy, the Scarlet Crusade had a mage working for them who was trying to create powerful bows and guns for their soldiers. I\'m not sure if he succeeded or not... the Crusade killed him before any of his finished product made it out. Maybe they killed him to keep it a secret... or maybe they distrust the arcane that much.', 7126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c. I\'ve set up camp here at the Bulwark to make my preparations for my journey into the Plaguelands. I\'ve heard rumor that a great human wizard took up residency in Hearthglen not terribly long ago. He was commissioned by the Scarlet Crusade to fashion their warriors and hunters new bows and guns. It\'s said that he was working on a remarkable weapon before the Crusade killed him.$B$BI guess their mistrust of the arcane has grown.', '', 7125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!  Please, you must help me!', '', 7124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many of the supplies the tailors need come by way of Darnassus.  It is not surprising that they all moved there to work.  If you wish to be a tailor then you best head to Darnassus.', 'Many of the supplies the tailors need come by way of Darnassus.  It is not surprising that they all moved there to work.  If you wish to be a tailor then you best head to Darnassus.', 7123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am certain there is a Tailor that could provide you training in Darnassus.  When you arrive, ask one of the Sentinels in Darnassus about seeing a Tailor.', 'I am certain there is a Tailor that could provide you training in Darnassus.  When you arrive, ask one of the Sentinels in Darnassus about seeing a Tailor.', 7122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tailoring', 'Tailoring', 7121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find Radnaal practicing his craft outside his home on the road to Darnassus.  You should stop by and see what he can teach you.', 'You can find Radnaal practicing his craft outside his home on the road to Darnassus.  You should stop by and see what he can teach you.', 7120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Radnaal provides Nadyia with a good supply of leather from the animals he skins.  I recommend you speak with him if you wish to learn the profession.', 'Radnaal provides Nadyia with a good supply of leather from the animals he skins.  I recommend you speak with him if you wish to learn the profession.', 7119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skinning', 'Skinning', 7118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nadyia has made quite the leatherworker in her years of practice.  Travel west on the road to Darnassus to pay her a visit and maybe she can bestow some of her knowledge upon you.', 'Nadyia has made quite the leatherworker in her years of practice.  Travel west on the road to Darnassus to pay her a visit and maybe she can bestow some of her knowledge upon you.', 7117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Maneweavers practice their professions out of their home on the road to Darnassus.  Nadyia is an excellent teacher when it comes to Leatherworking.  You should see what she can teach you.', 'The Maneweavers practice their professions out of their home on the road to Darnassus.  Nadyia is an excellent teacher when it comes to Leatherworking.  You should see what she can teach you.', 7116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leatherworking', 'Leatherworking', 7115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbalism requires a gentle touch that few such as Malorne can teach.  Seek him out east of the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'Herbalism requires a gentle touch that few such as Malorne can teach.  Seek him out east of the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malorne somehow manages to pick the most delicate herbs without damaging them.  Certainly he is the one you should learn from.  He lives just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'Malorne somehow manages to pick the most delicate herbs without damaging them.  Certainly he is the one you should learn from.  He lives just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbalism', 'Herbalism', 7112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Timberlings have made it too difficult for the fishermen to catch anything around Dolanaar.  You best look for someone to train you in Darnassus.', 'The Timberlings have made it too difficult for the fishermen to catch anything around Dolanaar.  You best look for someone to train you in Darnassus.', 7111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the fisherman have moved to Darnassus with the recent attacks around Lake Al\'Ameth.  You should try looking for someone to train you there.', 'All the fisherman have moved to Darnassus with the recent attacks around Lake Al\'Ameth.  You should try looking for someone to train you there.', 7110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing', 'Fishing', 7109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Byancie\'s skill in First Aid has proven useful on numerous occasions.  You can find her just north of the Inn in Dolanaar if you wish to learn from her.', 'Byancie\'s skill in First Aid has proven useful on numerous occasions.  You can find her just north of the Inn in Dolanaar if you wish to learn from her.', 7108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Byancie has often lent her services to the sentinels who patrol the local wilds.  You should talk to her if you desire to learn First Aid.', 'Byancie has often lent her services to the sentinels who patrol the local wilds.  You should talk to her if you desire to learn First Aid.', 7107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First Aid', 'First Aid', 7106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alanna spends most of her day at the Oracle Glade where she practices her profession.  Should you wish to learn the Enchanter\'s profession you will need to go there to find her.', 'Alanna spends most of her day at the Oracle Glade where she practices her profession.  Should you wish to learn the Enchanter\'s profession you will need to go there to find her.', 7105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alanna Raveneye attributes part of her talent in enchanting to her communion with the spirits at the Oracle Glade.  You should be able to find her there now.', 'Alanna Raveneye attributes part of her talent in enchanting to her communion with the spirits at the Oracle Glade.  You should be able to find her there now.', 7104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enchanting', 'Enchanting', 7103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could certainly use another cook around Dolanaar, not that Zarrin\'s cooking is lacking mind you.  Why don\'t you go see what he can teach you?', 'We could certainly use another cook around Dolanaar, not that Zarrin\'s cooking is lacking mind you.  Why don\'t you go see what he can teach you?', 7102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zarrin seems to have a good knowledge of the cooking trade.  Why don\'t you go see if he will show you some recipes?  He is usually cooking over by the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'Zarrin seems to have a good knowledge of the cooking trade.  Why don\'t you go see if he will show you some recipes?  He is usually cooking over by the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cooking', 'Cooking', 7100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cyndra\'s knowledge in alchemy is somewhat limited, but I\'m sure it would be sufficient to get you started.  She practices her craft just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'Cyndra\'s knowledge in alchemy is somewhat limited, but I\'m sure it would be sufficient to get you started.  She practices her craft just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While Cyndra is not bubbly like her potions, her kind manner is suitable for teaching her trade.  You can find her just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'While Cyndra is not bubbly like her potions, her kind manner is suitable for teaching her trade.  You can find her just east of the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alchemy', 'Alchemy', 7097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The path of those who undertake a profession is long and rewarding.  Which path do you choose to walk?', 'The path of those who undertake a profession is long and rewarding.  Which path do you choose to walk?', 7096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Profession Trainer', 'Profession Trainer', 7095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had the pleasure of seeing Kyra Windblade in combat once.  Considering what I witnessed, I am confident she will train you well.  Look for her at the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'I had the pleasure of seeing Kyra Windblade in combat once.  Considering what I witnessed, I am confident she will train you well.  Look for her at the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kyra Windblade wields her blade with great skill.  She should be able to provide you with some training.  You\'ll find her at the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'Kyra Windblade wields her blade with great skill.  She should be able to provide you with some training.  You\'ll find her at the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior', 'Warrior', 7092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek a rogue?  I believe Jannok would fit that description.  Why don\'t you go talk to him over at the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'You seek a rogue?  I believe Jannok would fit that description.  Why don\'t you go talk to him over at the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A rogue?  I\'m not in the habit of referring people to those types, but I believe Jannok would be the one you\'re looking for.  You will find him at the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'A rogue?  I\'m not in the habit of referring people to those types, but I believe Jannok would be the one you\'re looking for.  You will find him at the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rogue', 'Rogue', 7089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Laurna Morninglight offers healing to those that live around Dolanaar.  Perhaps she would be able to teach you in the ways of a priest.', 'Laurna Morninglight offers healing to those that live around Dolanaar.  Perhaps she would be able to teach you in the ways of a priest.', 7088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A priestess by the name of Laurna Morninglight calls Dolanaar home.  I believe she can be found just north of the Inn.', 'A priestess by the name of Laurna Morninglight calls Dolanaar home.  I believe she can be found just north of the Inn.', 7087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Priest', 'Priest', 7086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dazalar is well known around Dolanaar for his hunting skill.  Why don\'t you talk to him and see what he can teach you?', 'Dazalar is well known around Dolanaar for his hunting skill.  Why don\'t you talk to him and see what he can teach you?', 7085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If a hunter is whom you seek, then it is Dazalar that you should visit.  He can usually be found just outside the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'If a hunter is whom you seek, then it is Dazalar that you should visit.  He can usually be found just outside the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hunter', 'Hunter', 7083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The druid, Kal, often spends his time at the moonwell in Dolanaar.  I am certain he would be able to provide you with the training you require.', 'The druid, Kal, often spends his time at the moonwell in Dolanaar.  I am certain he would be able to provide you with the training you require.', 7082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek the aid of a Druid?  Then you should go see Kal at the Moonwell just south of the Inn in Dolanaar.', 'You seek the aid of a Druid?  Then you should go see Kal at the Moonwell just south of the Inn in Dolanaar.', 7081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Druid', 'Druid', 7080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find numerous trainers around Dolanaar with ages of experience with which to tutor you.  Which would you have me point you to?', 'You will find numerous trainers around Dolanaar with ages of experience with which to tutor you.  Which would you have me point you to?', 7079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Class Trainer', 'Class Trainer', 7078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you require time to rest and regain your strength, you will find the best at the Inn in Dolanaar.  Innkeeper Keldamyr will see to it that you are taken care of.', 'If you require time to rest and regain your strength, you will find the best at the Inn in Dolanaar.  Innkeeper Keldamyr will see to it that you are taken care of.', 7077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A restful sleep is sure to be had in the beds which Innkeeper Keldamyr keeps at the Inn in Dolanaar.  ', 'A restful sleep is sure to be had in the beds which Innkeeper Keldamyr keeps at the Inn in Dolanaar.  ', 7076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Inn', 'The Inn', 7075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Documents such as guild creation papers can be acquired from the Guild Master in the city of Darnassus.  ', 'Documents such as guild creation papers can be acquired from the Guild Master in the city of Darnassus.  ', 7074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Matters of such an official nature are only handled in Darnassus.  You must travel there to begin the process of your guild\'s creation.', 'Matters of such an official nature are only handled in Darnassus.  You must travel there to begin the process of your guild\'s creation.', 7073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Guild Master & Vendor.', 'The Guild Master & Vendor.', 7072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gryphons leave for Lor\'danel from Rut\'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil.  The portal in Darnassus will allow you to reach Rut\'theran safely.', 'Gryphons leave for Lor\'danel from Rut\'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil.  The portal in Darnassus will allow you to reach Rut\'theran safely.', 7071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To reach the Rut\'theran Ferry, you will need to travel to Darnassus and take the portal to Rut\'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil.', 'To reach the Rut\'theran Ferry, you will need to travel to Darnassus and take the portal to Rut\'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil.', 7070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rut\'theran Ferry', 'Rut\'theran Ferry', 7069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If a bank is what you desire, then your travels take you to the heart of Darnassus.  There you will find storage for your treasures.', 'If a bank is what you desire, then your travels take you to the heart of Darnassus.  There you will find storage for your treasures.', 7068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bank is located in the serene city of Darnassus.  You must go there if you wish to store your possessions.', 'The bank is located in the serene city of Darnassus.  You must go there if you wish to store your possessions.', 7067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bank', 'The Bank', 7066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are many places that you might visit in Teldrassil.  Tell me what you seek.', 'There are many places that you might visit in Teldrassil.  Tell me what you seek.', 7065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need directions.', 'I need directions.', 7064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What direction can I point you in?', 'What direction can I point you in?', 7063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you require guidance to your destination?', 'Do you require guidance to your destination?', 7062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I aid you in your journey?', 'How may I aid you in your journey?', 7061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anu therador mali $c.  Where can I guide you to?', 'Anu therador mali $c.  Where can I guide you to?', 7060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, ye won\'t have much luck with finding a tailor out here.  Ironforge is home to a quite a few talented tailors though.  Why don\'t ye go ask a guard there.', 'Well, ye won\'t have much luck with finding a tailor out here.  Ironforge is home to a quite a few talented tailors though.  Why don\'t ye go ask a guard there.', 7059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Stonebrow doesn\'t leave Ironforge much these days so if ye\'re looking to learn the tailor\'s profession ye\'ll have to go to see him up in Ironforge.', 'Ah, Stonebrow doesn\'t leave Ironforge much these days so if ye\'re looking to learn the tailor\'s profession ye\'ll have to go to see him up in Ironforge.', 7058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skinners usually take all their hides into Ironforge to dry out.  Why don\'t you head there and see if you can find one to train ye?', 'The skinners usually take all their hides into Ironforge to dry out.  Why don\'t you head there and see if you can find one to train ye?', 7057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye won\'t find any skinners out in here Dun Morogh $glad : lass;, they\'re mostly to be found in Ironforge if ye\'re looking to be trained.', 'Ye won\'t find any skinners out in here Dun Morogh $glad : lass;, they\'re mostly to be found in Ironforge if ye\'re looking to be trained.', 7056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A miner?  Ye don\'t need to ask if $glad : lass;, only where!  Yarr is who yer looking for, and I think ye can find him hiding out over in Steelgrill\'s Depot.', 'A miner?  Ye don\'t need to ask if $glad : lass;, only where!  Yarr is who yer looking for, and I think ye can find him hiding out over in Steelgrill\'s Depot.', 7055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely ye didn\'t think ye would find a town without a resident miner about, did ye?  Yarr can usually be found over at Steelgrill\'s Depot just outside of Kharanos.', 'Surely ye didn\'t think ye would find a town without a resident miner about, did ye?  Yarr can usually be found over at Steelgrill\'s Depot just outside of Kharanos.', 7054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ironforge is going to be your best bet for leatherworkers.  If memory serves, there\'s a shop by The Great Forge that should meet yer needs.', 'Ironforge is going to be your best bet for leatherworkers.  If memory serves, there\'s a shop by The Great Forge that should meet yer needs.', 7053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ye\'re looking to learn the profession of leatherworking, ye\'re gonna need to travel to Ironforge.  I hear there\'s a nice shop near the Great Forge where ye can learn the profession.', 'If ye\'re looking to learn the profession of leatherworking, ye\'re gonna need to travel to Ironforge.  I hear there\'s a nice shop near the Great Forge where ye can learn the profession.', 7052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope, nobody who can teach ye herbalism out here.  I think ye\'ll have better luck in Ironforge though.', 'Nope, nobody who can teach ye herbalism out here.  I think ye\'ll have better luck in Ironforge though.', 7051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing to see little flowers persist in the cold of Dun Morogh...  but ye won\'t find any herbalists out here.  Ye\'ll have to go to Ironforge to get some training in that profession.', 'Amazing to see little flowers persist in the cold of Dun Morogh...  but ye won\'t find any herbalists out here.  Ye\'ll have to go to Ironforge to get some training in that profession.', 7050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only a few spots to get any fishing done around here.  Paxton knows them all and probably a few he won\'t tell ya about.  Why don\'t ye go over to Iceflow Lake and see what he will tell ya.', 'Only a few spots to get any fishing done around here.  Paxton knows them all and probably a few he won\'t tell ya about.  Why don\'t ye go over to Iceflow Lake and see what he will tell ya.', 7049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not much fishing to be had around here, but what little there is to be had is Paxton\'s ye can be sure.  Ye can find him fishing out on Iceflow Lake.', 'Not much fishing to be had around here, but what little there is to be had is Paxton\'s ye can be sure.  Ye can find him fishing out on Iceflow Lake.', 7048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good ol\' Thamner bandaged me up just the other day when I had a run in with a nasty trogg.  I\'m good as new I tell ye!  I\'m sure Thamner would be happy to show ye how to make a good bandage.', 'Good ol\' Thamner bandaged me up just the other day when I had a run in with a nasty trogg.  I\'m good as new I tell ye!  I\'m sure Thamner would be happy to show ye how to make a good bandage.', 7047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First Aid may not make up for a priest\'s healing, but it\'s handy in a pinch.  I recommend ye go talk to Thamner in the Thunderbrew Distillery and learn what ye can.', 'First Aid may not make up for a priest\'s healing, but it\'s handy in a pinch.  I recommend ye go talk to Thamner in the Thunderbrew Distillery and learn what ye can.', 7046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With all the screws that Bronk has been tightening, I think he\'s let a few of his own go if ye get me.  All the same he\'s still got a good head for engineering the darndest devices.  Ye should go pay him a visit over at Steelgrill\'s Depot.', 'With all the screws that Bronk has been tightening, I think he\'s let a few of his own go if ye get me.  All the same he\'s still got a good head for engineering the darndest devices.  Ye should go pay him a visit over at Steelgrill\'s Depot.', 7045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye should check over at Steelgrill\'s Depot for Bronk.  When he\'s not tinkering with some odd device, he\'s usually chatting up the pilots about their steam tanks.', 'Ye should check over at Steelgrill\'s Depot for Bronk.  When he\'s not tinkering with some odd device, he\'s usually chatting up the pilots about their steam tanks.', 7044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye should take a look in Ironforge if ye have yer mind set on enchanting.  I think I saw a shop over by the gryphon master last time I was up there.', 'Ye should take a look in Ironforge if ye have yer mind set on enchanting.  I think I saw a shop over by the gryphon master last time I was up there.', 7043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There aren\'t any enchanters out here in Dun Morogh that I know of.  Ye\'re going to have to visit Ironforge if ye want to learn the enchanter\'s profession.', 'There aren\'t any enchanters out here in Dun Morogh that I know of.  Ye\'re going to have to visit Ironforge if ye want to learn the enchanter\'s profession.', 7042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gremlock doesn\'t always have the best of luck with cooking, but he does have some tasty recipies worth learning.  Go chat him up in the Thunderbrew Distillery and see what he\'ll teach ye.', 'Gremlock doesn\'t always have the best of luck with cooking, but he does have some tasty recipies worth learning.  Go chat him up in the Thunderbrew Distillery and see what he\'ll teach ye.', 7041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Thunderbrew ale and a bit of Gremlock\'s cooking makes for a nice meal indeed.  Ye really should hit him up for some training if ye want to be a cook.', 'A Thunderbrew ale and a bit of Gremlock\'s cooking makes for a nice meal indeed.  Ye really should hit him up for some training if ye want to be a cook.', 7040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye can probably hear Tognus beating away on the anvil when yer in Kharanos.  Although, if ye haven\'t cleared the wax out of yer ears recently, then why don\'t ye just have a look in the smithy.', 'Ye can probably hear Tognus beating away on the anvil when yer in Kharanos.  Although, if ye haven\'t cleared the wax out of yer ears recently, then why don\'t ye just have a look in the smithy.', 7039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och!  Now that\'s a skill worth knowing.  Tognus beats the anvil with a fury ye don\'t see often.  Why don\'t ye go talk him up and see what he can teach ye?', 'Och!  Now that\'s a skill worth knowing.  Tognus beats the anvil with a fury ye don\'t see often.  Why don\'t ye go talk him up and see what he can teach ye?', 7038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear there\'s a shop up in Ironforge run by the gnomes that specializes in alchemy.  You should go have a look.', 'I hear there\'s a shop up in Ironforge run by the gnomes that specializes in alchemy.  You should go have a look.', 7037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope, no alchemists out here in Dun Morogh.  Ye best take a look in Ironforge for them... try the gnomes in Tinker Town.', 'Nope, no alchemists out here in Dun Morogh.  Ye best take a look in Ironforge for them... try the gnomes in Tinker Town.', 7036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tailoring', 'Tailoring', 7035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skinning', 'Skinning\n', 7034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mining', 'Mining', 7033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leatherworking', 'Leatherworking', 7032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbalism', 'Herbalism', 7031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing', 'Fishing', 7030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First Aid', 'First Aid', 7029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Engineering', 'Engineering', 7028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enchanting', 'Enchanting', 7027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cooking', 'Cooking', 7026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blacksmithing', 'Blacksmithing', 7025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alchemy', 'Alchemy', 7024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which profession trainer would ye be looking for?', 'Which profession trainer would ye be looking for?', 7023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
