('You best head up to Stormwind in the Dwarven District if you want to learn to mine.  Surely one of the dwarves there can teach you the profession.', 'You best head up to Stormwind in the Dwarven District if you want to learn to mine.  Surely one of the dwarves there can teach you the profession.', 6975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Adele Fielder has made a name for herself as a leatherworker around Elwynn.  You can find her working out of her home up by Crystal Lake.', 'Adele Fielder has made a name for herself as a leatherworker around Elwynn.  You can find her working out of her home up by Crystal Lake.', 6974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over by Crystal Lake there lives a lady named Adele Fielder.  She makes patches for the local guards with the extra leather she gets from the local skinner, Helene.  She would probably be the one to see if you\'re interested in learning the profession.', 'Over by Crystal Lake there lives a lady named Adele Fielder.  She makes patches for the local guards with the extra leather she gets from the local skinner, Helene.  She would probably be the one to see if you\'re interested in learning the profession.', 6973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s an herbalist that lives in the hills east of Stormwind with our alchemist. Quite the handy pairing don\'t you think?', 'There\'s an herbalist that lives in the hills east of Stormwind with our alchemist. Quite the handy pairing don\'t you think?', 6972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
