('Paladin', 'Paladin', 6932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know much about magic, but there\'s a mage named Zaldimar who is staying at the Lion\'s Pride Inn that could probably assist you.', 'I don\'t know much about magic, but there\'s a mage named Zaldimar who is staying at the Lion\'s Pride Inn that could probably assist you.', 6931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zaldimar could probably teach you some new spells.  He has recently taken a liking to staying at the Lion\'s Pride Inn, you might want to check one of the rooms and see if he\'s in.', 'Zaldimar could probably teach you some new spells.  He has recently taken a liking to staying at the Lion\'s Pride Inn, you might want to check one of the rooms and see if he\'s in.', 6930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mage', 'Mage', 6929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet Josetta would be more than happy to teach you some new spells.  She is probably up in her room at the Lion\'s Pride Inn.', 'I bet Josetta would be more than happy to teach you some new spells.  She is probably up in her room at the Lion\'s Pride Inn.', 6928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Josetta has been a blessing to this town with her aid of the local guards.  If you seek her for training in the ways of a priest, you can find her in the Lion\'s Pride Inn.', 'Josetta has been a blessing to this town with her aid of the local guards.  If you seek her for training in the ways of a priest, you can find her in the Lion\'s Pride Inn.', 6927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Priest', 'Priest', 6926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard that there\'s a dwarf in Stormwind who has achieved some fame for his hunting skill.  Maybe you should go see if he could help you.', 'I\'ve heard that there\'s a dwarf in Stormwind who has achieved some fame for his hunting skill.  Maybe you should go see if he could help you.', 6925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hunter', 'Hunter', 6924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Druids?  I haven\'t seen any druids around here.  Although there is a district in Stormwind that the night elves have made their own.', 'Druids?  I haven\'t seen any druids around here.  Although there is a district in Stormwind that the night elves have made their own.', 6923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Druid', 'Druid', 6922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are quite a few trainers available in Elwynn.  Which one are you looking for?', 'There are quite a few trainers available in Elwynn.  Which one are you looking for?', 6921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lion\'s Pride Inn in Goldshire is as good as any inn you will find around these parts.  Drop in and let Innkeeper Farley make you feel at home.', 'The Lion\'s Pride Inn in Goldshire is as good as any inn you will find around these parts.  Drop in and let Innkeeper Farley make you feel at home.', 6920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look no further than the Lion\'s Pride Inn in Goldshire.  With a wide selection of ales and soft down beds you, couldn\'t ask for a better place to rest.', 'Look no further than the Lion\'s Pride Inn in Goldshire.  With a wide selection of ales and soft down beds you, couldn\'t ask for a better place to rest.', 6919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All that official business is handled up in Stormwind these days.  You could stop by the Stormwind Visitor\'s Center if you want to start a guild.', 'All that official business is handled up in Stormwind these days.  You could stop by the Stormwind Visitor\'s Center if you want to start a guild.', 6918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe Aldwin Laughlin is still the resident Guild Master of Stormwind.  Look for his residence on your left as you pass the inner gate of Stormwind.', 'I believe Aldwin Laughlin is still the resident Guild Master of Stormwind.  Look for his residence on your left as you pass the inner gate of Stormwind.', 6917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gryphon master oversees the gryphon flights from within Stormwind.  If you\'re looking to take a ride, then that\'s where you should be headed.', 'The gryphon master oversees the gryphon flights from within Stormwind.  If you\'re looking to take a ride, then that\'s where you should be headed.', 6916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well there\'s a gryphon master up in Stormwind if you need to fly somewhere.  You should be able to see the gryphons landing on your right as you walk through the Valley of Heroes.', 'Well there\'s a gryphon master up in Stormwind if you need to fly somewhere.  You should be able to see the gryphons landing on your right as you walk through the Valley of Heroes.', 6915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you must mean the Stormwind Counting House.  It\'s not far from the gates after you enter Stormwind.', 'Oh, you must mean the Stormwind Counting House.  It\'s not far from the gates after you enter Stormwind.', 6914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A bank?  Well, the closest bank around here is The Stormwind Counting House.  It\'s just up the road in Stormwind not far from the gates.', 'A bank?  Well, the closest bank around here is The Stormwind Counting House.  It\'s just up the road in Stormwind not far from the gates.', 6913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Profession Trainer', 'Profession Trainer', 6912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Class Trainer', 'Class Trainer', 6911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inn', 'Inn', 6910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guild Master & Vendor', 'Guild Master & Vendor', 6909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gryphon Master', 'Gryphon Master', 6908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bank', 'Bank', 6907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you looking for?', 'What are you looking for?', 6906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need directions.', 'I need directions.', 6905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you new here?  Well, tell me what you\'re looking for then.', 'Are you new here?  Well, tell me what you\'re looking for then.', 6904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look a little lost.  Who are you looking for?', 'You look a little lost.  Who are you looking for?', 6903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there something I can help you find?', 'Is there something I can help you find?', 6902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail citizen.  Do you need directions?', 'Hail citizen.  Do you need directions?', 6901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say hello to my little friend.', '', 6898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fordring shall never see his son.', 'Fordring shall never see his son.', 6897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your blood spills for the betterment of humanity, infidel!', 6896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TEST - death after attack $n', '', 6895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TEST - death before attack $n', '', 6894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reaps the Gloom Weed violently from the ground.', '', 6893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to get this wagon filled by the end of the day.  So back to work with you.  Chop, chop!', 'We need to get this wagon filled by the end of the day.  So back to work with you.  Chop, chop!', 6892, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daylight is still upon us so let\'s see that axe of yours chopping some more wood.', 'Daylight is still upon us so let\'s see that axe of yours chopping some more wood.', 6891, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have yet to meet our quota for the wood demand.  Now back to work with you.', 'We have yet to meet our quota for the wood demand.  Now back to work with you.', 6890, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Race does not dictate honor, $r. While you remain on my farmstead, I ask that you remember and respect this credo.$B$BI have known orcs who have been as honorable as the most noble of knights and humans who have been as vile as the most ruthless of Scourge.$B$BBut I shall not bore you with tales of my youth! There is much work to be done - if that is what you desire. ', '', 6889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 254, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Steelgrill\'s Depot!', '', 6888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Vectus, I sense something strange within this container...', '', 6887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marduk, gather the box and place it before me!', '', 6886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, so my minions from the Burning Steppes have brought the dragons...', '', 6885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.$B$BThose Sentinels over there have allowed me to share their camp as long as I promise no trouble will follow--I am sure you can appreciate the need for diplomacy while here, yes?$B$BI am here investigating disturbances to the land, and since it aids their cause also, they have agreed that my presence here could only aid the tenuous alliance between all of Azeroth\'s races. If you wish to aid me, then I would appreciate it, but regardless, please try not to cause any trouble.', '', 6884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?!  How dare you!', '', 6883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c.  I am Miranda Breechlock - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you\'ll earn valor tokens from Duke Zverenhoff.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you\'ll discover that more items will be made available to you.', 6882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join the fight against evil!  Accept a commission within the Argent Crusade today!', '', 6881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onward, Crusaders! We must retake Corin\'s Crossing!', 'Onward, Crusaders! We must retake Corin\'s Crossing!', 6880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Argent Crusade salutes you, $c!  The name\'s Lightspark, and I\'m an authorized equipment and materiel quartermaster for the Crusade.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you\'ll earn valor tokens from Officer Pureheart.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Crusade, you\'ll discover that more items will be made available to you.', '', 6879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another Argent Dawn Commission.', 'I need another Argent Dawn Commission.', 6878, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Join the fight against evil!  Accept a commission within the Argent Dawn today!', 6877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Argent Dawn salutes you, $c.  I am Hasana - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you\'ll earn valor tokens from Officer Garush.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you\'ll discover that more items will be made available to you.', 6876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up!', 'Wake up!', 6875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is lured out into the open!', '', 6874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh?  What do you want?', '', 6873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ZZzzzz....', '', 6872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bursts forth from the ground!', '', 6871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met, friend.  I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Crusade.  Our cause is simple - fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Light, my $g brother : sister;!', 6870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, friend.  I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Crusade.  Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Crusade, my $g brother : sister;!', '', 6869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s quiet... Too quiet...', '', 6868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be on the alert! The Blackwood furbolgs are numerous in this area...', '', 6867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, my sweet Brandy, I miss her so!', '', 6866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you should speak into these sound enhancing devices attached to my FISTS OF FURY.', '', 6865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My job title is Waste Management Specialist.', '', 6864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Barov house sure does keep me busy. Always some sort of refuse coming out of there.', '', 6863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am sorry. I am unable to help you at this time.', 6862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must save us!', 'You must save us!', 6861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Cult of the Damned.', 'Tell me about the Cult of the Damned.', 6860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some were spared the anguish that memories provide.', '', 6859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes I am.', 'Yes I am.', 6858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. In order to carry out my plan, we must first create a lifestone. Are you prepared to act?', '', 6857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes I do.', 'Yes I do.', 6856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And find it he did. After quickly advancing through the ranks of the Cult, the Lich King himself granted Ras immortality. Thus was born Ras Frostwhisper, the lich.$B$BNow do you understand?', '', 6855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue, please.\n', 'Continue, please.\n', 6854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I suppose that I am getting ahead of myself. Ras Frostwhisper is the overseer of this school. The being responsible for training all of its Dark Masters. A lieutenant and favored pupil of Kel\'Thuzad. He was once a hedge mage of Stromgarde: A rogue wizard that never received his formal training from Dalaran.$B$BWhen Kel\'Thuzad opened the Cult, Ras was among the first to join his ranks. Ras knew that through dark magic, he would find immortality.', '', 6853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ras Frostwhat? Who is that?', 'Ras Frostwhat? Who is that?', 6852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s simple, really. Rob the lich, Ras Frostwhisper, of his powers. Return him to his mortal form and then slay him, once and for all.', '', 6851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this plan?', 'What is this plan?', 6850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slow down, $r. The one you need to kill is already dead. Killing him again will serve no purpose. There are very few ways in which a lich can actually be destroyed and none of those means are available to you or I. That is why I have a plan. A plan that will have a very noticeable and real impact upon the Cult.', '', 6849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who do I need to kill?', 'Who do I need to kill?', 6848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop - no. Slow down - maybe.$B$BThe Scholomance is their primary source of training and education. It is from there that the Cult members fan out and ultimately, make their way into our societies.$B$BThat is why we must strike at the source. The very heart of the Cult of the Damned!', '', 6847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is disheartening. Is there anything I can do to stop this?', 'This is disheartening. Is there anything I can do to stop this?', 6846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it? This has always been their method of operation. What is of greater value to Kel\'Thuzad and the ever growing Scourge army? A zealous, living, follower that can work their way into a society and then unleash a plague, destroying thousands; or a single undead trooper? Certainly you cannot be that dense$B$BYes, $r, they live, work, and plot among you.', '', 6845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible.', 'Impossible.', 6844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Cult of the Damned has grown large in scope. Nearly every city, from the capitals to the small hamlets and hovels of both the Horde and Alliance, have Cult members hidden amongst their citizenry.$B$BDo not look so surprised. The Cult only wears a uniform for ritual and ceremony. It is quite possible that you have interacted with one during your adventures and not even known.', '', 6843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stop these villains!', 'We must stop these villains!', 6842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we fall, then Darrowshire is doomed!', 'If we fall, then Darrowshire is doomed!', 6841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight for your families!  Don\'t give up!', 'Fight for your families!  Don\'t give up!', 6840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Silver Hand?  We need their help!', 'Where is the Silver Hand?  We need their help!', 6839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has abandoned us!', 'The Alliance has abandoned us!', 6838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our captain has fallen!', 'Our captain has fallen!', 6837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight!  Fight for Darrowshire!', 'Fight!  Fight for Darrowshire!', 6836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not give up!', 'We must not give up!', 6835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hope is lost!', '', 6834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scourge will prevail!', '', 6833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darrowshire will fall!', '', 6832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our master wants you!', '', 6831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no hope!', '', 6830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us, or fall forever!', '', 6829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul is doomed!', '', 6828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail the Lich King!', '', 6827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('There\'s no loitering, pan handling, cursing, fighting, or anything else you\'re thinking about doing, allowed in Caer Darrow.', 'There\'s no loitering, pan handling, cursing, fighting, or anything else you\'re thinking about doing, allowed in Caer Darrow.', 6826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why, you look like a common street urchin!', 'Why, you look like a common street urchin!', 6825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a lot of pent up anger and hostility. Just give me a reason, guttersnipe.', 'I have a lot of pent up anger and hostility. Just give me a reason, guttersnipe.', 6824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got my eye on you, $r.', 'I\'ve got my eye on you, $r.', 6823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step, stranger. We do not allow miscreants in our town.', 'Watch your step, stranger. We do not allow miscreants in our town.', 6822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another lovely day on our beautiful island.', 'Another lovely day on our beautiful island.', 6821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re not really rude people, stranger, it\'s just that everyone is in a rush, trying to make sure that everything is perfect for Uther\'s arrival. It\'s not often that the Lightbringer comes to town.', 'We\'re not really rude people, stranger, it\'s just that everyone is in a rush, trying to make sure that everything is perfect for Uther\'s arrival. It\'s not often that the Lightbringer comes to town.', 6820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Caer Darrow, stranger.', 'Welcome to Caer Darrow, stranger.', 6819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you tried our bread? Baker Masterson must be the most gifted chef to have ever lived!', 'Have you tried our bread? Baker Masterson must be the most gifted chef to have ever lived!', 6818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see we\'re trying to prepare for Uther\'s visit? Now get out of my way, I have much work to do!', 'Can\'t you see we\'re trying to prepare for Uther\'s visit? Now get out of my way, I have much work to do!', 6817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They don\'t realize that they\'re dead, $r. They are cursed to relive the last memory they had before the town was eaten alive from the inside out. Most of them, anyway. Some were less fortunate.$B$BYou thought the Scourge did this? The Scourge did not yet exist and if they had, we would have at least put up a damned fight.$B$BNo, this was the result of a plague that came out of Scholomance and ravaged the town. It was horrifying and devastating. None survived.$B$BNow leave me to my sorrows.', '', 6816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 6815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 6814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks like the perfect place for a nap...', '', 6813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('looks very sleepy...', '', 6812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks very sleepy...', '', 6811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cheated!', 6810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wanna race again? Best two out of three!', 6809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I win!!', 6808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'HEY! No fair!', 6807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ready. Set. GO!', 6806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you inspect the cage and the Night elf inside, you get an odd sense of deja vu. For some reason she does not make eye contact with you--it is almost as if you are not there to her.', 6805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve already done me a great service, $n. For that I thank you.$B$BThe least I can do now is tell you what brought me here: My long time friend Trey Lightforge and I came to Jaedenar to investigate the Shadow Council when they caught us unprepared. They took Trey deeper into Shadow Hold and put me in here after taking all of our equipment... I can still hear his screams from below, $n. They were... inhuman. I don\'t know what they\'ve done to him, but they will pay for it. ', 6804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will pay for what you\'ve done to Trey!', 6803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You kept me in that cell for too long, monster!', 6802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not stop me from escaping here, $r!', 6801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So cold... and hungry.$B$BMy poor friend, I hope you\'ve found peace. I can\'t stand to think about what they could have done to you.$B$BYou! You there! Please, you have to help me escape. One of them has a key, can you find it? I know they have it. If you get it, you can help me get out of here. Trey is probably already dead, but there\'s still time! Please, can you help me?', 6800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eva, I have lost the Spectral Essence. I need another.', 'Eva, I have lost the Spectral Essence. I need another.', 6799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
