('You\'ve been MALOWNED!', '', 6530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success is ours! The Ash\'ari Crystal has been restored!', 'Success is ours! The Ash\'ari Crystal has been restored!', 6529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our summoning is complete! The Ash\'ari crystal has been restored!', 'Our summoning is complete! The Ash\'ari crystal has been restored!', 6528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Ash\'ari Crystal has been toppled! Restore the ziggurat before the Slaughterhouse is vulnerable!', 'An Ash\'ari Crystal has been toppled! Restore the ziggurat before the Slaughterhouse is vulnerable!', 6527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Ash\'ari Crystal has fallen! Stay true to the Lich King, my brethren, and attempt to resummon it.', 'An Ash\'ari Crystal has fallen! Stay true to the Lich King, my brethren, and attempt to resummon it.', 6526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well now $n, let\'s get to work on those cauldrons!  If you\'re going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You\'ll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.$B$BYou\'ll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It\'s not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you\'ll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it.', '', 6525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This job is definitely not worth sixteen-five a year.', '', 6524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, four ectoplasmic resonators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the resonators from wraith and ghostly undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.', '', 6523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.', '', 6522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, five somatic intensifiers, and and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the intensifiers from zombie or ghoul undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.', '', 6521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Based on the sample of the toxin you provided for us, we think you will need the following: an arcane quickener, six osseous agitators, and four pieces of runecloth.  With the vitreous focuser in tow, acquire the agitators from skeletal undead here in the Plaguelands!$B$BOnce you have these items, you should be able to load the counter agent into that cauldron.', '', 6520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s needed for the cauldron at Gahrron\'s Withering?', 'What\'s needed for the cauldron at Gahrron\'s Withering?', 6519, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s needed for the cauldron at the Writhing Haunt?', 'What\'s needed for the cauldron at the Writhing Haunt?', 6518, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s needed for the cauldron at Dalson\'s Tears?', 'What\'s needed for the cauldron at Dalson\'s Tears?', 6517, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s needed for the cauldron at Felstone Field?', 'What\'s needed for the cauldron at Felstone Field?', 6516, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well now $n, let\'s get to work on those cauldrons!  If you\'re going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me.  You\'ll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.$B$BYou\'ll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons.  It\'s not cheap, nor is it stable.  Once you have it, you\'ll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it.', '', 6515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fierce wind is coming - I can tell by the ache in my exposed knee.  I just hope we don\'t get caught up in it.', '', 6514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to purchase arcane quickener from you.', 'I wish to purchase arcane quickener from you.', 6513, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
