('%s raises an undead servant back to life!', '', 6511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?', 'The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?', 6510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid.', 'Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid.', 6509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
