('Who dares to approach this cauldron?  Taste my dark blade!', '', 6495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$R flesh... must feed!', '', 6494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Ash\'ari Crystal has been restored!', 'An Ash\'ari Crystal has been restored!', 6493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the Ash\'ari Crystals has been destroyed!  Slay the intruders!', 'One of the Ash\'ari Crystals has been destroyed!  Slay the intruders!', 6492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okothos will train you, $n.', '', 6491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Borgosh! $n is ready to be trained.', '', 6490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Krathok, overseer of these craftsmen.', '', 6489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the work of a blacksmith reaches your level of expert craftsmanship, I present them with a choice.$B$BWhile you are not required to make a choice, it is recommended that you do - after all, do you want to be a neophyte forever? It is the artisan armorsmiths and weaponsmiths that supply our armies, win our wars and garner acclaim!$B$BBe warned, $n. Once a choice is made and the tasks required completed - there is no going back. One can only walk down one path.', '', 6488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grumnus be your man, $n. He\'ll school you in the art of the armorsmith.', '', 6487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Ironus, $n. He\'ll be the one training you in the way of the weaponsmith.', '', 6486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have come looking for the gift of fast and safe mobility, then you have arrived at your destination!  This year\'s model of the new Mechano-striders have recently arrived, and I am ready to show you all they have to offer!', 'If you have come looking for the gift of fast and safe mobility, then you have arrived at your destination!  This year\'s model of the new Mechano-striders have recently arrived, and I am ready to show you all they have to offer!', 6485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um... I think you\'re a little too big to ride a Mechano-strider there, $g mister : ma\'am;.  You\'d likely crush the finely tuned servo-balancers!', 'Um... I think you\'re a little too big to ride a Mechano-strider there, $g mister : ma\'am;.  You\'d likely crush the finely tuned servo-balancers!', 6484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erm... I really don\'t know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered a friend of the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as friendly to Gnomeregan, I\'d be happy to show you what I have to offer.', 'Erm... I really don\'t know you that well, sorry.  I mean, as an authorized Mechano-strider dealer, I really only can sell my mounts to those people who are considered a friend of the gnomes.  If you ever are recognized as friendly to Gnomeregan, I\'d be happy to show you what I have to offer.', 6483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the grace of Elune, I am pleased to offer you the finest steed found anywhere in Teldrassil, and perhaps the world - the nightsaber.  For years, the Sentinel Army has relied on the value of these companions.$B$BTake your time friend and examine each one to your satisfaction.  I am sure you will not be disappointed.', 'By the grace of Elune, I am pleased to offer you the finest steed found anywhere in Teldrassil, and perhaps the world - the nightsaber.  For years, the Sentinel Army has relied on the value of these companions.$B$BTake your time friend and examine each one to your satisfaction.  I am sure you will not be disappointed.', 6482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas $c, you are not considered to be a true friend of Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to be friendly to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal.', 'Alas $c, you are not considered to be a true friend of Darnassus and the night elves of Teldrassil.  Only when you prove yourself to be friendly to us through deeds - not just mere words - will I then make available my selection of mounts for your perusal.', 6481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!', 6480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!', 6479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skill in blacksmithing is exceptional, $n. The time has come to make a decision. There are two paths you may choose: The way of the weaponsmith or the art of the armorsmith.$B$BBe warned, when you have chosen to dedicate yourself to a path, there is no going back. The discipline each path requires leaves no room for hybrids.', '', 6478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to become a weaponsmith.', 'I wish to become a weaponsmith.', 6477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to become an armorsmith.', 'I wish to become an armorsmith.', 6476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. I am Myolor Sunderfury, keeper of the Great Forge.', '', 6475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes the postmaster!', 'Here comes the postmaster!', 6474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No chance!', '', 6473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Certainly!', '', 6472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try again!', '', 6471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No tampering with the mail!', 'No tampering with the mail!', 6470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can travel faster on my own from here, $n. Meet Jessir Moonbow near Ashenvale. She should be with the druids of the Emerald Circle. She\'ll tell you what to do next. Thank you so much for your help!', 6469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! My friend... what\'s happened? This is all my fault...', 6468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'NO! What have they done to you!?', 6467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BETRAYER!', '', 6466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to make a purchase.', 'I wish to make a purchase.', 6465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They hand the corpses to me, I toss them in the pit.', '', 6464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What was that?! Trey? TREY!?', 6463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah! Fresh air at last! I never thought I\'d see the day...', 6461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DIE, DEMON DOGS!', 6460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get out of here, $n. I\'m ready now!', 6459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All I need now is a golden lasso.', 6458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! Over there!', 6457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh my! Look at this... all these candles. I\'m sure they\'re used for some terrible ritual or dark summoning. We best make haste!', 6456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rivendare must be destroyed!', '', 6455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May Kel\'Thuzad one day feel our vengeance.', '', 6454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise be to Egan!', '', 6453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The curse ends!', '', 6452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FREE!!!', '', 6451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. My torment is now at an end.', '', 6450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Payment for those plans comes in bones - YOUR BONES!', '', 6449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thieves! I shall smelt your remains!', 'Thieves! I shall smelt your remains!', 6448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fools think you can defeat me so easily? Face the true might of the Nathrezim!', '', 6447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won\'t be sellin\' my raptors to someone who hasn\'t proven themselves to be a friendly to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be at least friendly to us, then I\'ll make my raptors available to ya.', 'I\'m sorry $g mon : sis;, but I won\'t be sellin\' my raptors to someone who hasn\'t proven themselves to be a friendly to the Darkspear tribe.  When ya make a stand and show yourself to be at least friendly to us, then I\'ll make my raptors available to ya.', 6446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And a good day to ya, brave $c.  I know ya be lookin\' for a fine steed.  There\'s no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you $g mon : sis;!  Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere.', 'And a good day to ya, brave $c.  I know ya be lookin\' for a fine steed.  There\'s no finer steed than a raptor under your reigns, lemme tell you $g mon : sis;!  Take a look at the ones I got to offer - bred from the fiercest stock anywhere.', 6445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only make my mounts available to those who are considered friendly to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I\'ll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection.', 'I only make my mounts available to those who are considered friendly to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I\'ll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection.', 6444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 6443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn you mortals! All my plans of revenge, all my hate...I will be avenged...', '', 6442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today you have unmade what took me years to create! For this you shall all die by my hand!', '', 6441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zug zug, brave $c!  I have the finest bred wolf mounts for you to peruse.  You\'ll not find another animal with the level of endurance and survival instincts that the wolf has anywhere!  Please, inspect them for yourself.', 'Zug zug, brave $c!  I have the finest bred wolf mounts for you to peruse.  You\'ll not find another animal with the level of endurance and survival instincts that the wolf has anywhere!  Please, inspect them for yourself.', 6440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge have broken through in all wings!  May the light defeat these foul creatures!  We shall fight to the last!', 'The Scourge have broken through in all wings!  May the light defeat these foul creatures!  We shall fight to the last!', 6439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our defenses are failing!  By the light we must prevail!', 'Our defenses are failing!  By the light we must prevail!', 6438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skeletons have advanced past the Hall of Lights!  Destroy them!', 'Skeletons have advanced past the Hall of Lights!  Destroy them!', 6437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge have broken into the Bastion!  Redouble your efforts!  We must not fail!', 'The Scourge have broken into the Bastion!  Redouble your efforts!  We must not fail!', 6436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $c. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood.$B$BIt seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race\'s suffering seeks to regain some of its power.$B$BMy two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening.$B$BI expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late.', 6435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve failed, $n!!', 6434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m ready, $n. Let\'s find my equipment and get out of here. I think I know where it is.', 6433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Emerald Circle strives to heal the wounded land of Felwood. Although the land is named for the very thing that has corrupted it, we hope that one day we will be able to eradicate the corruption from this land.', 6432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah!  Please, if you see a survivor of Darrowshire, tell them I am free!', 'Ah!  Please, if you see a survivor of Darrowshire, tell them I am free!', 6431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you!  The battle for Darrowshire doomed me, but you have set me free!', 'Thank you!  The battle for Darrowshire doomed me, but you have set me free!', 6430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, my soul is free!', 'At last, my soul is free!', 6429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, thank you!  I have been trapped in this nightmare for so long...', 'Oh, thank you!  I have been trapped in this nightmare for so long...', 6428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you!  You freed me!', 'Thank you!  You freed me!', 6427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to flavor country!', '', 6426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ramstein hunger for flesh!', '', 6425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the records before the bastion falls!', '', 6424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave nothing behind!', '', 6423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to wear your skin as a smoking jacket! The stogies? You\'ll have to pry them from my cold dead... er... RAWR!!!!', '', 6422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bastion is falling! Burn the evidence!', '', 6421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking for these???? You\'ll never have em!', '', 6420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There, it is done.  The book has been enhanced...', 6419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s find out the whole story.  That\'s going to take some magic...', 6418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll keep the bad people away, won\'t you?', 6417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurray!  My doll!', 6416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb our master?', '', 6415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('8536 degrees Kraklenheit is the reading... Tired of me yet?', '', 6414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re getting warmer... 7039 degrees Kraklenheit!', '', 6413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*sigh* ...113 degrees Kraklenheit. Can\'t you do any better?', '', 6412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temperature is... not hot enough!', '', 6411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave...$B$BI think he\'s the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I\'m around....', 6410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just sit right back and you\'ll hear a ta... *hic* a tai... *hic* a taiiii *hic* Damnit!', '', 6409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have taken the translucent pill.', '', 6408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The what-bringer? Oh, ASHbringer? Never heard of it... What? Stop bothering me!', '', 6407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I come from the land down under... where women plague and men sunder.', '', 6406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then the Tauren said, \'13 INCHES!\'', '', 6405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Do you like the sauce? The sauce is good, no?', '', 6404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t take these taxes! F.I.C.A. me? F.I.C.A. YOU!', '', 6403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t get paid enough for this bull excrement!', '', 6402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to take matters into my own hands. Come. Enter my domain and challenge the might of the Scourge!', '', 6401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi! I just got back from exploring the Ruins of Kel\'Theril, to the southwest. Now I\'m intent on investigating the Wildkin that lie just up the ridge here, in Owl Wing Thicket.$B$BHave you spoken to Erelas Ambersky in Rut\'theran Village? He requested that I come here, and perhaps he has a task for you as well.', 6400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to buy from you.', 'I would like to buy from you.', 6399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you see fit to toy with the Lich King\'s creations? Ramstein, be sure to give the intruders a proper greeting.', '', 6398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mailbox', 'Mailbox', 6397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inn', 'Inn', 6396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know how they do it...  those mailboxes must be magic portals or something.  Why I see people gathered around the mailbox next to the bank all day pulling swords and shields and various armor all from that small box!', 'I don\'t know how they do it...  those mailboxes must be magic portals or something.  Why I see people gathered around the mailbox next to the bank all day pulling swords and shields and various armor all from that small box!', 6395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a mailbox located conveniently right between the Stormwind Bank and The Gilded Rose Inn in the Trade District.', 'There is a mailbox located conveniently right between the Stormwind Bank and The Gilded Rose Inn in the Trade District.', 6394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, The Gilded Rose... with its soft down beds and warm baths... just thinking about that Inn makes me want to... ::yawn:: Lucky you if you\'re heading over there...  you will find it in the west side of the Trade District.   ...nice soft pillows, warm blankets.  ::yawn::', 'Ah, The Gilded Rose... with its soft down beds and warm baths... just thinking about that Inn makes me want to... ::yawn:: Lucky you if you\'re heading over there...  you will find it in the west side of the Trade District.   ...nice soft pillows, warm blankets.  ::yawn::', 6393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are many establishments where you can get a drink in Stormwind, but only one will let you spend the night. Head over to the Gilded Rose in the Trade District. I\'ve heard the cost of a room is reasonable and the sheets are clean. ', 'There are many establishments where you can get a drink in Stormwind, but only one will let you spend the night. Head over to the Gilded Rose in the Trade District. I\'ve heard the cost of a room is reasonable and the sheets are clean. ', 6392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Used by the Barov family of the Scholomance as a mirror into the souls that they no longer possess. A valuable keepsake.', '', 6391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The threads that holds together the abominations of Stratholme are highly sought after by artisan craftsmen: Extremely resilient - nearly unbreakable.', '', 6390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legend claims that in places of extreme conflict, across what is now known as the Plaguelands; clean and holy springs may erupt from the ground. The water from those springs has been named \'Blood of Heroes,\' by artisans and commonfolk alike - in honor of those that fell in the war against the Scourge.', '', 6389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commonly found on the lesser chromatic flight: Whelps, broodlings, lesser wyrmkin.', '', 6388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Presumed to exist. Only a greater chromatic dragonkin or dragon could possess such a carapace.', '', 6387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
