('Information on the Chromatic Carapace.', 'Information on the Chromatic Carapace.', 6382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, traveler. Not many find me out this way.$B$BMy name is Rivern, and I train the Winterspring Frostsabers to become mounts.$B$BThese cats are the most feral and difficult to subdue of all the sabers. Only the most trusted and exalted may attempt to ride one.$B$BI will not sell such a mount to just anyone; no, you must work for it and earn your acceptance not only with me, but with the sabers themselves.', '', 6381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will not be the end of the Scarlet Crusade!  You will not break our line!', 'This will not be the end of the Scarlet Crusade!  You will not break our line!\n', 6380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have broken into the Hall of Lights!  We must stop the intruders!', 'They have broken into the Hall of Lights!  We must stop the intruders!\n', 6379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move to the stairs and defend!', 'Move to the stairs and defend!', 6378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move back and hold the line!  We cannot fail or all will be lost!', 'Move back and hold the line!  We cannot fail or all will be lost!', 6377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemies have reached the door!  Move in!  We must hold!', 'Enemies have reached the door!  Move in!  We must hold!', 6376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
