('You have <snort> aided Mangletooth more than I would have dreamed, $r.$B$BThank you.$B$BAs long as I remain a captive here, you may bring me blood shards from the Bristleback quilboar and I will bless you with Agamaggan\'s power.', '', 6117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
