('Priest trainer?  You go to outer ring of War Quarter and look for them there.', 'Priest trainer?  You go to outer ring of War Quarter and look for them there.', 5852, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Us see balloon run by Hin Denburg north of ruins up above in right tower.  It take you to far off places, like jungle of Grom\'gol in Stranglethorn Vale.', 'Us see balloon run by Hin Denburg north of ruins up above in right tower.  It take you to far off places, like jungle of Grom\'gol in Stranglethorn Vale.', 5851, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little goblin Zapetta on top of right zep building north of Ruins of Lordaeron.  Leave Undercity and you go there, to go Orgrimmar.', 'Little goblin Zapetta on top of right zep building north of Ruins of Lordaeron.  Leave Undercity and you go there, to go Orgrimmar.', 5850, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Central ring.  You go!', 'Central ring.  You go!', 5849, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have auction house in central ring.', 'We have auction house in central ring.', 5848, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Us need check to see if our Brain... Brain... Brain Hacker sold at auction.  You find mailbox next to inn on upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 'Us need check to see if our Brain... Brain... Brain Hacker sold at auction.  You find mailbox next to inn on upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 5847, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mailbox in middle of city, Trade Quarter, upper ring... next to inn.', 'Mailbox in middle of city, Trade Quarter, upper ring... next to inn.', 5846, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No rest for wicked, but us guess you ok.  You find Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 'No rest for wicked, but us guess you ok.  You find Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter.', 5845, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter is one to talk to.', 'Innkeeper Norman on upper ring of Trade Quarter is one to talk to.', 5844, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We join guild?  No?  Ok, you find Guild Master on east platform in Trade Quarter.', 'We join guild?  No?  Ok, you find Guild Master on east platform in Trade Quarter.', 5843, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep, you looking for Christopher Drakul in Trade Quarter.  He on eastern platform.', 'Yep, you looking for Christopher Drakul in Trade Quarter.  He on eastern platform.', 5842, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bat man on upper level of Trade Quarter.', 'Bat man on upper level of Trade Quarter.', 5841, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Michael Garrett on upper ring in Trade Quarter.', 'Michael Garrett on upper ring in Trade Quarter.', 5840, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have one eye and see better than you!  Bank in center of Undercity!', 'We have one eye and see better than you!  Bank in center of Undercity!', 5839, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bank in Trade Quarter central tower.  You not miss it.', 'Bank in Trade Quarter central tower.  You not miss it.', 5838, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Us know where they are!  Skull building in Magic Quarter on outer ring of city.', 'Us know where they are!  Skull building in Magic Quarter on outer ring of city.', 5837, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'s in Magic Quarter.  Look for them in scary skull building.', 'They\'s in Magic Quarter.  Look for them in scary skull building.', 5836, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do it... Do it now.', 'Do it... Do it now.', 5835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With pleasure... just let me savor this moment for a minute longer.', '', 5834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Milk me, John.', 'Milk me, John.', 5833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have summoned me, fool!  Now DIE!', '', 5832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve become quite the hunter, $n! Not only have you proven your skills, you also bested Daryl, which gets you extra points in my book!$B$BYou\'re welcome here any time.', '', 5831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You\'ll have to earn it.$B$BYou look up to the challenge, $Glad:lass;!', '', 5830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though I hate to admit it, the bear did get the better of me. My oh my, that\'s one big ol\' bear!$b$bNonetheless, if you can take that bear down, it\'d be a feat to be proud of! It gave more than a few of our best hunters some trouble.$b$b<He claps you on the back.>$b$bBest the bear and we\'ll accept you as a regular member of the Farstrider Lodge.', '', 5829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! This is way more than what I bargained for, you\'re on your own, Slim!', '', 5828, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, it\'s on now! Bet you thought I\'d be alone too, huh?!', '', 5827, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gryfe do his job! Gryfe go now!!!', '', 5826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did Gryphe tell boss?? Gryphe wasn\'t lying! There she is, trying to steal battle plans!', '', 5825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your victory shall be short lived. The days of both the Alliance and Horde are coming to an end! The next time we meet shall be the last.', '', 5824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imagination is the limit my friend, if you can figure out how to smith it then you can make it, box it, and ship it to retailers all over the world. Of course, then you have to deal with marketing. Tell you what, let\'s just stick with the smithing part for now, ok?', '', 5823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You act like this is the best junk I\'ve ever seen. Sure it\'s ok, but I see stuff this \'OK\' every day. Tell you what, you find a way to wow me, and I\'ll teach you things that make dwarves smile in their sleep.', '', 5822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you kidding me? You must be kidding me! Either that or you think I\'m a clown here to amuse you. Is that what you think? That I\'m a clown? Huh, is it! You think I\'m a clown don\'t you!', '', 5821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah? Of course I\'m a smith. What, you think Dwarves are the only ones worth their weight in anvils? Fine, be that way. Go get a dwarf to help you!', '', 5820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you know more of the secret of steel than I do. That is good, for it is meant to be taken. Now you must travel to the jungle south of the human lands, to the goblin city of Booty Bay. There you will find a Goblin named Brikk Keencraft. I do not like Goblins but his knowledge of the secret of steel is unmatched by any I know of.', '', 5819, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still a bit weak, unbalanced, unsure. Not your work youngling, I am speaking of you! Now, are you ready to be shaped into a real smith or not?', '', 5818, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t a game you toy with youngling! Go, speak with Snarl outside. He may be a serpent in my lair but he does know his way around an anvil.', '', 5817, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t say enough about yer work, truly amazing things that ye can do with a hammer and an anvil. Now, don\'t be tellin anyone that I suggested ye go find a goblin to teach ye but that\'s exactly what I\'m gonna do. Brikk Keencraft is his name, and last I heard he was operating a shop down in Booty Bay.', '', 5816, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like ye may have the makings of a great smith. But before I teach ye anything I need to know that ye\'ve got what it takes. ', '', 5815, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry $g lad : lass; but ye just don\'t have the foundation to learn what I have to teach. But don\'t fret, go speak with my student Rotgath, he\'ll help ye out.', '', 5814, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very fine equipment you make, very fine indeed. Go to the Orc\'s home of Orgrimmar and seek out a smith named Saru Steelfury. One thing you must give the Orcs, they make beautiful instruments of death.', '', 5813, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you have what it takes, perhaps not. If you do then I will take you on and teach you what you wish to know. If you do not... well, I\'ll just leave it at that.', '', 5812, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You waste my time, go talk with my student Basil.', '', 5811, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have learned much, but I sense that there is more left for the spirits to teach you. I can place your foot on the path but cannot guide your steps. Go and find Saru Steelfury in Orgrimmar, the next stretch of your journey begins there.', '', 5810, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are now ready to follow the path that joins your life with my own, if only for a short time. However we must make sure that you understand the things of which the spirits speak.', '', 5809, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have great potential, but you must achieve understanding first, you must accept the spirits and listen to their calling. Only then will you be prepared for the path you must follow. Go speak with Thrag, I think perhaps you can learn a lot from one another.', '', 5808, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our paths through life intersect only briefly and now is the time for ours to part ways. I consider myself blessed to have spent this time teaching you and now send you along to join paths with your next mentor. Seek out Saru Steelfury of Orgrimmar, he will teach what you need to learn.', '', 5807, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join me, together we will weave the spirits of the forge and find the true shape that the metal seeks.', '', 5806, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, do your feel prepared to face the challenge I have laid out for you? The spirits tell me that you will pass, but do you have faith in them or in yourself?', '', 5805, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to heed the guidance of the spirits a little better young one. Your path lies with another, Thrag Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff. Perhaps you can learn something from one another.', '', 5803, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits have brought you to me, and so I feel blessed by them. ', '', 5801, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nothing more that I can teach - now get out! And don\'t even think of approaching Saru, for one as unworthy as you he will use your blood to temper his steel.', '', 5800, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm? Oh yes, I can teach you something if you desire. But stay away from Sumi and Tumi, they are not for the likes of you. Saru only let\'s those of great skill approach his daughters.', '', 5799, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you think you are good enough to learn from me? The great Snarl? You are no more than a lowly worm beneath my boot. However, taking on an underling might make me seem more appealing to Sumi and Tumi. Let\'s see what meager skills you possess.', '', 5798, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me again with such pathetic work and I will send you home in a small iron box that I tempered in goat urine. Now go see that idiot Ug\'thok, he is better suited to your needs.', '', 5797, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away from Sumi and Tumi. They are....spoken for.', '', 5796, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('If I prove myself to Saru he will have no choice but to let me fight for one of his daughters. Then we will see who is sneering.', '', 5795, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now I\'m the one who feels rough around the edges, I honestly don\'t think there\'s anything left I can teach you. But you know who can? Bengus Deepforge in Ironforge, now there\'s a dwarf that knows his steel. Go look him up in The Great Forge of Ironforge, see if he\'s up to having a new trainee under him.', 5794, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do fine work, but it\'s a bit rough around the edges. Don\'t worry about it, it will come with practice. Speaking of which, how about we see what you\'ve been working on?', 5793, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah, I\'ve heard through the grapevine that I might be seeing you sooner or later. But I don\'t just take on anyone, I need to make sure you have what it takes first. You willing to take my little test and find out?', 5792, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm, your work is allright but it\'s nowhere near the quality I look for in a student. Go talk with Smith Argus in Goldshire, I\'m sure he can teach you some basics. Then when you\'re done, come on back to me and I\'ll give you a little test to make sure you are ready.', 5791, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ever since the shadows claimed Duskwood I haven\'t been able to sleep. I am kept awake by the ghostly sounds of screaming on the breeze. It sounds almost like lambs screaming, and they won\'t stop.', 5790, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t come out of the shadows like that. Next time give a girl some warning. ', 5789, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets out a shrill cry.', '', 5788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fast learner is what ye are, and a good smith to boot. I would sign off on yer work any day of the week. But I sense ye still have some learnin in ye. Go talk to Bengus Deepforge, he\'s a hard taskmaster but he\'s also one of the best.', '', 5787, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, I would love ta teach ye a thing or two about smithing. Grab an apron and a hammer and let\'s see what we can accomplish shall we?', '', 5786, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer skill is not without merit, but I need to put one last test to ye before I take ye on.', '', 5785, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry $g lad : lass;, ye aren\'t quite up to the challenge of learning from me. Go see my son Groum, it would make his day to get a new apprentice.', '', 5784, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The life of a smith is not an easy one, but it puts steel in yer bones and fire in yer heart. My da\' was a smith, my grandfather before him in the forges beneath Grim Batol. And now my son follows in our footsteps, that boy makes me proud.', '', 5783, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I said ye had the blood of a blacksmith in ye, and I was right. Go to Ironforge, to The Great Forge, and find yerself a Dwarven smith by the name of Bengus Deepforge. My teacher, and one of the greatest smiths I\'ve ever known.', '', 5781, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye have some skill about ye with hammer and anvil, but not enough. Go speak to Dane Lindgren, he\'ll get ye ready to learn what I have to teach ye.', '', 5780, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, it appears as if ye have learned quite a bit, I\'m impressed. But do ye know how many I have that seek to be my apprentice? Tell ye what, do a small task fer me and I\'ll take ye on.', '', 5779, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You merely destroy an image, fool. I shall hunt you until the end of days.', '', 5778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But for now, your death will have to suffice...', '', 5777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vaelastrasz, when this world belongs to the black flight, your flight shall know its end.', '', 5776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I get all shaken up, hear me shout...', '', 5775, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow!  OK, I\'ll get back to work, $n!', '', 5774, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The living are here!', '', 5773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s collapses but the broken body rises again!', '', 5772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shrugs.', '', 5771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t even leave his boots behind...', '', 5770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OZZIE!!!! OH NO!', '', 5769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, Ozzie... that doesn\'t look very safe.', '', 5768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temperature is 12 degrees Kraklenheit. How exciting.', '', 5767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temperature is 122 degrees Kraklenheit.', '', 5766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temperature is 564 degrees Kraklenheit.', '', 5765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temperature is 9280 degrees Kraklenheit! That\'s HOT!', '', 5764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holy Krakle! The temperature is 428,000 degrees Kraklenheit! ', '', 5763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This should do it! At least it better do it!', '', 5762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will suffer in this defeat, Nefarian!', '', 5761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have come too far to fail. Stand back, mortals.', '', 5760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far...$B$BYah, you may have another charm, but Mau\'ari is very displeased wit your actions!$B$BGo, now. ', 5759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost the Cache of Mau\'ari. What can I do?', 'I lost the Cache of Mau\'ari. What can I do?', 5758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'E\'ko is da unfocused form of the supernatural power, and Juju is da concentrated essence. By using a stong incantation, I can transform da E\'ko into Juju.  Once it becomes Juju, you can den use the Cache of Mau\'ari ta reflect da powers onto yourself.', 5757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is Juju?', 'What is Juju?', 5756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must continue! Their resolve is weakening. Drink from my power and be renewed once again!', '', 5755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have learned much, more than I can teach. Go to James Van Brunt, he will teach you what I cannot.', '', 5754, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not trying to kill the anvil with your hammer, you are trying to create a weapon to kill your foes with. Let me show you what you are doing wrong.', '', 5753, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope to one day forge weapons and armor from the bones of my enemies.', '', 5752, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have learned well my child. Go to the Undercity, find a smith named James Van Brunt. He will be able to teach you much that I cannot. I understand he spends his time near the Warriors training hall, forging their weapons and armor.', 5751, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah yes, another who will stoke the fires and forge the weapons of war. Of course I will teach you how.', 5750, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your interruption is costing me valuable time, this had better be good.', 5749, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is not lost! Battle these beasts without fear. Your wounds I shall heal, bones I shall mend. Be renewed, heroes!', '', 5748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess the spirits like you better than me, I still have not heard their call but you seem to have gathered their lessons well. Go speak to Karn, he will be excited to see one who hears them as he does.', '', 5747, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Karn says we need to listen to the spirits of the forge and of the steel, that they will guide us. I hear nothing but a ringing in my ears. Here, take a hammer and let us try to hear the spirits together.', '', 5746, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I listen and I listen but I don\'t hear these spirits that Karn speaks of. ', '', 5745, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You learn quickly, that is not a bad thing. Just be sure to do the job right, as long as it takes to do so. Now, I fear I must send you to Snarl to learn more. Learn what he can teach, but do not listen to his angry words. He gets that way when Saru\'s daughters laugh at him.', '', 5744, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can show you what you wish to know, but you must be patient. Take your time to work the steel and feel the way it shapes beneath your hammer. When you become one with the steel, then you will understand.', '', 5743, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snarl calls me simple because I am too slow. I just want to do the job right, and that takes time.', '', 5742, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not bad. Go talk with Snarl, he just moved to Orgrimmar to study under Saru. Look for him in the Warrior district near Saru\'s smithy. Oh and he\'ll test you, so you better be as ready as you think you are.', '', 5741, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just swinging a hammer at an anvil doesn\'t make you a smith. Give me that and let me teach you something before you embarrass us all.', '', 5740, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear one comment about waterfowl, and you will be eating through a tube.', '', 5739, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A far better blacksmith than I am, that\'s for sure. Though I\'ll deny it if you tell anyone I said that. You should go speak with Therum Deepforge. If anyone can teach you more, it\'s him.', '', 5738, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not bad, but let me show you a few tricks you might find handy. ', '', 5737, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I look like I have the time to spend jawin?', '', 5736, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, I\'m a bit busy right now making horseshoes for Verner Osgood in Lakeshire. ', '', 5735, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t admit this lightly, but you are a far better smith than I am. If you want to learn more than my meager teachings then I suggest you seek out a Dwarf named Therum Deepforge in Stormwind. You will find him in the Dwarven District.', '', 5734, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course I can help you with training. I\'m just a journeyman myself, but I\'m sure there\'s something I can show you.', '', 5733, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The creatures in Winterspring are a good place ta start.$B$BHoweva\', der may also be other places you can look...', 5732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where should I look for E\'ko?', 'Where should I look for E\'ko?', 5731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well my friend, ye have more skill than I do. Why don\'t ye go find me old friend Rotgath Stonebeard. He stayed in Ironforge when I left to join Jaina\'s army. I\'m sure he\'ll be able ta teach ye somethin, or at least know someone who can. If he\'s still around, I\'m sure he\'ll be at The Great Forge.', '', 5730, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye know more than I do, that\'s a certainty. Tell ye what though, go talk with me da\'. He\'ll want ye ta prove yerself, but he is a fine teacher indeed. His name\'s Rotgath, and ye\'ll find him near the anvils workin steel for ol\' Bengus.', '', 5729, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ve got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let\'s see what I can teach ye, shall we?', '', 5728, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh? I don\'t have time ta chat, my da\' wants me ta finish this order fer him.', '', 5727, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste in my power!', '', 5726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye learn fast $g lad : lass;, much faster than I can keep up with. If ye want ta continue yer training, I suggest ye see my teacher. His name\'s Rotgath, Rotgath Stonebeard and ye\'ll find him in Ironforge at The Great Forge.', '', 5725, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here for training eh? Just began my training meself, but I would be glad ta teach ye what I can.', '', 5724, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day to ye $g lad : lass;. Can I be of service?', '', 5723, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With pleasure...', '', 5722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s paces back and forth in anticipation of the battle.', '', 5721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief shall make quick work of you, mortals. Prepare yourselves!', '', 5720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blackhand legion shall wear your skin as fashion accessories!', '', 5719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You actually believed that you stood a chance?', '', 5718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Served!', '', 5717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not consume the entire corpse just yet, children! Save room for dessert!', '', 5716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consider yourself lucky, mortal. At least your corpse is still somewhat presentable.', '', 5715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want those boots! Nobody touch that corpse!', '', 5714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will surely save me some work.', '', 5713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WOOT!', '', 5712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is knocked off his drake!', '', 5711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mortals have fallen! The new age of the Blackrock legion is at hand!', '', 5710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THIS CANNOT BE!!! Rend, deal with these insects.', '', 5709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This will work -- keep heading through this gap.  The path to Un\'Goro is due west of here once we round these infernal bugs.', 5708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was not what I would call \'escort friendly\'.  I will find a way to go around these things.  Let\'s move to the south, toward that rock.  Maybe we can wedge through it and still avoid the ogres.', 5707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What the... what are those things crawling at us?  We... we have incoming!', 5706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This doesn\'t look... right.  Look at how alien the desert is!  Going through here might be a terrible mistake.', 5705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s snorts deeply as she comes to a halt.', '', 5704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoa, whoa, hold up Dadanga girl.', 5703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Tanaris desert is littered with gigantic bones just like this one to my right.  I\'d hate to have ever ran across that thing.', 5702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As nice as Gadgetzan is compared to Un\'Goro, I have some good folks counting on us to bring them some supplies.  If you\'re ready to go, then so are Dadanga and I.  Let\'s mount up!', 5701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'E\'ko is da power dat each creatures possesses. Da charm I made for ya allows you ta capture it in a physical manifestation.$B$BI know an incantation dat can transform da e\'ko you find, and turn it into juju.$B$BYou can den take the Cache of Mau\'ari, an\' use it ta reflect da power of da juju onto yourself.$B$BC\'mon, give it a try. Bring da e\'ko ta Mau\'ari an\' we have some fun.', 5700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da Cache of Mau\'ari holds great secrets... The shards used ta make it are reflective, and you can use its shiny surface ta siphon power from other tings and den reflect it onto yourself.$B$BKeeping da charm in your inventory lets you collect e\'ko, da spiritual power from the beasts you fight. Once you find e\'ko, you bring it ta Mau\'ari.', 5699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is E\'ko?', 'What is E\'ko?', 5698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They took off for Gadgetzan a while ago to bring us back some supplies.  Frankly, I would have given at least four of my fingers to have had the chance to crawl inside one of Dadanga\'s packs in order to leave this forsaken place.', '', 5696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen Petra or Dadanga around?\n', 'Have you seen Petra or Dadanga around?', 5695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah yeah, I know Dadanga dislikes smoke.  From the smell of it though, seems like Dadanga also dislikes bathing.', '', 5694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m gonna need some help with this $n!', 5693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out, incoming!', 5692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was quite a haul, but now I can load up on supplies for the trip back into the Crater.  I should be able to unload some of this exotic cargo as well.', 5691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re finally here, thanks to you $n!  Without your help, we would have been some over-grown lizard\'s lunch!', 5690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There it is -- Gadgetzan!  We\'re in the home stretch now!', 5689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on Dadanga!  March girl, march!', 5688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blast... ogres.  I forgot about these buffoons.  There\'s no easy way around them, so expect plenty of fighting.  Look sharp!', 5687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More and more of Kalimdor is turning into the twisted landscape to our left, and the critters who dwell within are NOT friendly.  Watch your step.', 5686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emerges from the log hovel and catches you tampering with the grain stores!', '', 5685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spies you tampering with the camp\'s fruit stores and attacks you!', '', 5684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks a bunch... I can find my way back to Whitereach Post from here. Be sure to talk with Motega Firemane; perhaps you can keep him from sending me home.', '', 5683, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your moldering remains will serve ME as a testament to what happens when one is foolish enough to trespass in my domain!\n', '', 5682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you will not serve my Master with your sword and knowledge of his enemies...', '', 5681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vincent!  You and your pathetic ilk will find no more success in routing my sons and I than those beggardly remnants of the Kirin Tor.', '', 5680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can stand no more of this!', '', 5679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defilers!', '', 5678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tear off your limbs and use them to beat you into submission!', '', 5677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears as if I will have to step in and take care of you myself.', '', 5676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will learn of the sanctuary only death can offer...', '', 5675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flee while you still have a chance, mortals. You will pray for a swift death should I enter the arena.', '', 5674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible!', '', 5673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sire, let me join the fray! I shall tear their spines out with my bare hands!', '', 5672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Concentrate your attacks upon the healer!', '', 5671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you, mortal.', '', 5670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I promise you an eternity of dung clean up duty for that failure!', '', 5669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts will prove fruitless. None shall stand in our way!', '', 5668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not force my hand, children! I shall use your hides to line my boots.', '', 5667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inconceivable!', '', 5666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolsss... Kill the one in the dress!', '', 5665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the freezing breath, imbecile!', '', 5664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sssplendid... Then let us watch as my children tear these mortals to pieces.', '', 5663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I use the Cache of Mau\'ari?', 'How do I use the Cache of Mau\'ari?', 5662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mau\'ari know why you seek her out...$B$BBring me da E\'ko you find in the world, an\' I can transform it for you.', 5661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many times my blades have felled my target before they even drew near. The secret is in the flick of your wrist.', '', 5660, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, $r... I possess great knowledge a\' da world and how ta create charms a\' great power. ', 5659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skill of the bow is a great asset to anyone, not just the hunter. You can strike swiftly, silently, and before your prey can blink... they are dead.', '', 5658, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many think the staff an inferior weapon. I challenge any who think so to prove their strength against my staff. ', 5657, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not know this Eye of the Tiger some speak of, but I can show you how to use the claws of the tiger.', '', 5656, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want a weapon that acts as an extension of your very fist? Yes, I believe I can show you something.', '', 5655, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now this looks familiar. If we keep heading east, I think we can... Ahh! Wyvern on the attack!', '', 5654, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, you wish to learn more about our elven weaponry? Let your first lesson begin.', 5653, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The secret to the knife is to keep it hidden until the moment you strike.', '', 5652, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The slow blade penetrates the shield.', '', 5651, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A hidden blade up the sleeve can mean the difference between you laying dead in the alley, and your opponent laying face down in his own blood.', 5650, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zoom, zing, and BAM! He may have had a huge two handed cleaver made from a boat anchor but after a few well placed slices from my dinner knife, he was the one going crash!', 5649, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lets go, $n. I am ready to reach Whitereach Post.', '', 5648, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Modernization is the key. With a crank and a lever you can fire this baby with the power of an ogre pulling a normal bow.', '', 5647, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The chromatic flight shall deal with these intruders. Let us talk of more pressing matters.', '', 5646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och I love a good brawl, but sometimes yer foe has a skull thicker than a Thorium heat shield. Times like that ye need a wee bit o assistance. ', '', 5645, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See this? This is my boom stick! Dwarven top of the line. That\'s right, this sweet baby was made in Ironforge, Khaz Modan. Retails for about one hundred and nine gold, ninety five copper. It\'s got a walnut stock, thorium steel, and a hair trigger.', 5644, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hound on the horizon moving at thirty feet per second. The only question is, right or left eye. That\'s right $g lad : lass;, I\'m that good.', 5643, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll teach ye to chop down yer foes like saplings in the forest.', '', 5642, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A good hammer in yer hands makes the world feel safer. Like ye can face even the mightiest of foes with a large hunk of solid metal gripped in yer fists.', '', 5641, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let not even a drop of their blood remain upon the arena floor, my children. Feast on their souls!', '', 5640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s turns to face you.', '', 5639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you think I\'m good, you should see my husband fight.', 5638, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve seen farmers with staves hold off trained soldiers. Do not ever underestimate the power and skill it takes to wield one of these properly.', 5637, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure it takes longer to reload but this baby will punch a hole the size of my fist through any set of armor.', '', 5636, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent... it would appear as if the meddlesome insects have arrived just in time to feed my legion. Welcome, mortals!', '', 5635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure I can teach you the fine art of wielding a polearm, but it\'s gonna cost you.', 5634, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can teach you both the finesse of a short blade and the bone shattering cleaving power of a two handed behemoth. Or we can get crazy and I can teach you both, could come in handy for when the situation changes on ya.', 5633, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next clutch is due to hatch soon, sire. We will be ready to launch the attacks by week\'s end.', '', 5632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then we must not waste anymore time. Are the chromatic dragonflight ready?', '', 5631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have freed the human, Windsor, sire. It will not be long until Onyxia is uncovered.', '', 5630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What of the Alliance, Rend?', '', 5629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, one of my favorite customers. You look to be of a warlock of some power, $n. I am pleased to meet you. If there is anything I can do for you, please, just ask.$B$BMy brother and I feel that it will be your kind who lead us into the next great era. One with such power... such control... it\'s only a matter of time before the Legion itself bends to your will.$B$BI am but a little envious.', '', 5628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my shop, $c. What is it the Goodstitch brothers can do for you?', '', 5627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The long reload takes some getting used to, but nothing else is better for starting off a fight. ', '', 5626, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Swift and sure. Cut a tendon here, slit an artery there. I can show you how to turn any knife into a perfect killing machine.', 5625, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your foes at bay and carve them into cutlets at the same time. The only problem is that the long shaft keeps me from getting blood on my hands.', 5624, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only weapon I know of that has no use other than killing someone. Not something, but someone. These blades were invented to end the lives of men. Beautiful aren\'t they?', '', 5623, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re doomed!', 'We\'re doomed!', 5622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nuttin\' be \'fraid of. Come.', 'Nuttin\' be \'fraid of. Come.', 5621, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('VanCleef pay big for you heads!', '', 5619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to greedily devour the food.', '', 5618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is lured out by the sweet scent of the purified food.', '', 5617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the... nobody cleanses a furbolg in MY camp!  Face the wrath of Xabraxxis!', '', 5616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m flattered, but really I\'m not interested... What?  You want to know where to learn enchanting?  Oh, how embarrassing!  Well, you should...  I\'m sure you could... go see, um...  Taladan!  Yes, see Taladan over in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace!', 'I\'m flattered, but really I\'m not interested... What?  You want to know where to learn enchanting?  Oh, how embarrassing!  Well, you should...  I\'m sure you could... go see, um...  Taladan!  Yes, see Taladan over in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace!', 5615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s summons a Black Iron Veteran to his aid!', 5614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to summon in a Black Iron Veteran!', 5613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s summons a Black Iron Dreadweaver to his aid!', 5612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to summon in a Black Iron Dreadweaver!', 5611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a stick? Want me to show you what \'just a stick\' can do?', '', 5610, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It may look simple, a large stick with a huge weight on the end. But when swung with the might of a tauren behind it, this stick can break stone walls.', '', 5609, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'ve come to find out how rampant the effects of Fel Moss are throughout Darkshore. The remainaing corruption in Teldrassil and our surrounding lands really concerns the druids of the Cenarian Circle, and all Night elves.$B$BIt is my goal to find out why this is still happening and put it to an end.', '', 5608, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never had much use for a bow, but these rifles the goblins make are very handy when hunting. Still can\'t get used to the smell though.', '', 5607, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis ain\'t no game mon. Joo want to use da axe, joo got to say da line. Say it wif me... \"Say hello, to ma little friend.\"', '', 5606, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A bow is a great ting ma friend. Joo jus have to take care of it, and it will take care of joo.', '', 5605, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Joo may tink this ma walkin stick mon. Dat\'s jus wat I want joo to tink.', '', 5604, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fists of an Orc are already a powerful weapon, so why not add blades or studs of solid steel. Now the fists I use to tame the wolves of the plains I can also use to shatter the armor of my foes.', 5603, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come to learn have ya, mon?', 5602, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have used bows since before even my father\'s time. They are solid and sure and take down our foes swiftly. I see no reason to use the guns that the goblins and tauren seem so fond of.', 5601, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take tha blade like dis, den throw. Just flip joo wrist mon, one twirl and joo got jooself lunch.', '', 5600, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s small but it does it\'s job if you know what you are doing. Let me show you just the right places to hit.', '', 5599, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you mean you don\'t know how to use an axe? ', '', 5598, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to train.', 'I would like to train.', 5597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Playtime is over!', '', 5596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, I have caught up with you, Nefarian. Surely you did not think you would escape the might of the other Aspects?', '', 5595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s will falters.', '', 5594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $r, you have returned!', '', 5593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone, mortal. You are not worthy of my knowledge.', '', 5592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have discerned the path that you must take. Are you prepared?', '', 5591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is surrounded by a barrier of anti-magic.', '', 5590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, Vaelan.', 'As you wish, Vaelan.', 5589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not bring it any closer, mortal. I can sense the evil coursing through the seal from where I stand.$B$BGive me a moment to inspect the item - hold it firmly.', '', 5588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be done.', 'It will be done.', 5587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be warned, mortal, it is exceptionally rare that one of the lesser clans in this citadel would hold such an item. Your search could take decades. I recommend you destroy these beasts without impunity.', '', 5586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do my best, Vaelan.', 'I will do my best, Vaelan.', 5585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must find one amongst the wretch in the lower portion of this citadel that has attained an Unadorned Seal of Ascension. It is a great honor for one of the lesser beings to obtain this item, as it is the first step in gaining access to the upper citadel and becoming one of Nefarian\'s elite guardsmen - the Blackhand legion. Find such an item and return it to me so that I may examine its properties. I will know how to proceed once my inspection of the seal is complete.', '', 5584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am willing to try but I will require instruction.', 'I am willing to try but I will require instruction.', 5583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is possible for one, not of dragon kind, to obtain the Adorned Seal of Ascension and pass through the protected barrier. While possession of such an item would surely destroy me, perhaps you could utilize it and lower the barrier.\n', '', 5582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unless?', 'Unless?', 5581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not our way, nor would it be possible. Nefarian is guarded by ancient wards, as old as the Aspects themselves. It is what prevents me from entering the inner sanctum of this citadel. The dark magic prevents any of the other flight to enter without being ordained... unless.', '', 5580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why not destroy them with the combined might of the Aspects?', 'Why not destroy them with the combined might of the Aspects?', 5579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before his banishment, Deathwing was attempting to create impure offspring. Half breeds that would not only be immune to the innate natural powers and abilities of their Aspects but also under the complete control of Deathwing.$B$BIt seems that where his father failed, Nefarian may have succeeded - at least partially.$B$BIt was Ysera, Aspect of Dreams, who saw the abominations and forced us to act. If these \'Chromatic\' dragonkin exist, they must be destroyed.', '', 5578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where he left off?', 'Where he left off?', 5577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. The item was ultimately destroyed and Deathwing nearly slain by the combined and renewed power of the four remaining Aspects. Where Deathwing is now is unknown. What we do know, however, is that one of his progeny, Nefarian, rules this citadel and wishes to continue where his father left off.', '', 5576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon Soul?', 'Demon Soul?', 5575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathwing, or Neltharion as he was once known, was the Aspect that embodied the strength of the world - granted almost limitless power over this mortal realm by the Titan shaper known as Khaz\'goroth: Forger of the world.$B$BThrough treachery and deceit, the foul one convinced the four other Aspects to imbue an item, known as the Demon Soul, with their powers - greatly weakening them, forcing a division among the once great Aspects. \n', '', 5574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Vaelan, I do not.\n', 'No, Vaelan, I do not.\n', 5573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I should tell you why I am here.$B$BDo you know of the Aspect, Deathwing? Or of his progeny, Nefarian and Onyxia?', '', 5572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please.', 'Please.', 5571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. I stand before you in a form that you can comprehend, mortal. Surely, you could not bear to stand in the presence of the dragon known as Vaelastrasz.$B$B<Vaelan laughs.>$B$BShall I continue?', '', 5570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind?', 'Your kind?', 5569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In decades past - of now ancient wars and conflicts - our kind was driven to the brink of extinction. Much we have endured, $r.$B$BThe onslaught of the Burning Legion. The Demon Soul. The Aspects divided. The ascension of Deathwing. The enslavement of our Queen, Alexstrasza, by the Dragonmaw.$B$BThrough it all, we have been the unshakable will of the dragons - the undaunted force that has fought to represent our waning existence in this world.', '', 5568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s regains its power and breaks free of its bonds!', '', 5567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is nearly at full strength!', '', 5566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to regain its strength!', '', 5565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. You are showing promise to join the elite ranks. Now, more practice.', 'Good. You are showing promise to join the elite ranks. Now, more practice.', 5564, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gnomes can be hard to hit due to their size. However, they have a pinchant for dancing around and thrusting their hips. When they do this, strike at them like so...', 'Gnomes can be hard to hit due to their size. However, they have a pinchant for dancing around and thrusting their hips. When they do this, strike at them like so...', 5563, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarves will spin around leaving their backs open for attack at times. Take this opportunity to strike like this...', 'Dwarves will spin around leaving their backs open for attack at times. Take this opportunity to strike like this...', 5562, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night Elves like to stand off on one leg while casting. Strike at that leg like so...', 'Night Elves like to stand off on one leg while casting. Strike at that leg like so...', 5561, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, you try.', 'Now, you try.', 5560, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Humans are usually vunerable on their left side between the 4th and 5th rib. Let\'s practice striking at this area like so...', 'Humans are usually vunerable on their left side between the 4th and 5th rib. Let\'s practice striking at this area like so...', 5559, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, a fellow warlock who has proven $ghis:her; worth to some degree.$B$BI am pleased to meet your acquaintance. My name is Menara Voidrender... and not without just cause.$B$BYou seem powerful and well-learned enough that other tools... more powerful tools... would be welcome and not foolishly imparted. If this is true, then speak to me further. If not, well then, you know your way  back to the docks and off into the ocean.', 5558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kar Aman, $n. You look to be a strong $c--you would do well to mind yourself in this area. Touching things you know nothing about, or showing disrespect to your elders is just cause for punishment.$B$BYou may not respect me or my companions, but you will learn to respect our power if you prove foolish enough.$B$BNow, enough with the pleasantries, was there something I can do for you?', 5557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen carefully, for the lord of Blackrock will surely destroy you, should you not be prepared.', '', 5556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last - one among you is worthy of my knowledge. Worry not - I have probed your thoughts, no harm will come to you.', '', 5555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your skills in smelting dark iron serve you well, $n.  But do not let your knowledge corrupt you... as it corrupted us.', '', 5554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going back to the Rookery, Tinkee.  I need an Eggscilliscope!', 'I\'m going back to the Rookery, Tinkee.  I need an Eggscilliscope!', 5553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Burning Steppes is a dangerous place, but scholars like me will do almost anything to advance our knowledge.', 5552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi $n!$B$BI have to work on my devices, but eventually... I\'m going to need someone to get me dragon eggs!', 5551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t mind Skuerto, $n. He doesn\'t mean to be rude, he\'s just terribly busy. While we wait for him to finish scouting, why don\'t we work on something more productive?', '', 5550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n.', '', 5549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets loose a guttural growl as her body collapses. A horrifying howl can be heard echoing through the halls of Blackrock Spire. Something is very, very angry.', '', 5548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here!  Now, puny little worms, you will pay for your intrusion!', '', 5547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dragons controlling orcs!? SQUAWK!', '', 5546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kibler is being investigated by G.E.T.A.', '', 5545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They all go to the Spire but none ever come back... just like Bijou.', '', 5544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Opus wants some Cuergo\'s Gold... with worm.', '', 5543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Bijou knows where treasures are hidden.', '', 5542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bijou lost! SQUAWK! *cough*', '', 5541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask Kibler about the treasure! SQUAWK!', '', 5540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SQUAWK!! *cough* *cough* I need to quit smoking!', '', 5539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders are destroying our eggs!  Stop!!', 'Intruders are destroying our eggs!  Stop!!', 5538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The plans are in there!', 5537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The liquids and mixtures all bubble and spasm as you approach. Next to the equipment lies a large pair of tongs that look as though they would be adequate for dropping in samples of ooze.$B$BThere is safety gear present, but it appears to be dusty and well-ignored.$B$BYou don\'t think touching anything would be wise.', '', 5536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch my back, this could get real messy.', 5535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you need assistance?', 'Do you need assistance?', 5534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...pan fried, deep fried, and stir fried...', '', 5533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got some extras with me; if you pay me back what I paid for them, you can have one.  I got some bait too.', '', 5532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing is real easy.  Just take a pole with a line on it, maybe put some bait on it, and cast it out in the water.  Sure enough, them fish will start biting.', '', 5531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gubber, I don\'t have a fishing pole.', 'Gubber, I don\'t have a fishing pole.', 5530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gubber, I don\'t know how to fish.\n', 'Gubber, I don\'t know how to fish.', 5529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi there.  I\'m Gubber Blump.', '', 5528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen the befouled water elementals in our lake, $n? It is a sorry sight, but I do not know where they are coming from.$B$BYour name has been mentioned in conversations past, perhaps you could help me with this problem.$B$BThe first thing we must learn is who is in control of these elementals.', 5527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings $g lad : lass;, if you\'re looking for the best deals you\'ll find outside of Ironforge itself, then you\'ve come to the right place.', '', 5526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, the way I see it, $n, we have two options to consider for leaving this cave.$B$BWe can make our way stealthfully--I use the cloak you\'ve given me, and you\'d be left to your own devices, or, and this may be a harder option considering my wounds, we fight our way out back to back.$B$BI\'ll let you decide since you know your strengths better than I.', '', 5525, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Volcor doesn\'t look at you at all as you get close to him. He seems to be concentrating on keeping his bandages from falling off. After a moment, he looks up at you, a little startled.>$B$BOh, sorry, $c. Now\'s not a good time. I hope you understand.', '', 5524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hip hip... arrrrr...', '', 5523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three cheers for $n -- Admiral o\' the Bloodsail Bucaneer Navy!', '', 5522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s becomes enraged from seeing a cub die!', 5521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Sylvanas has ordered the investigation of some of the natural phenomena of Azeroth. She feels there is something great to be learned from its secretive past.$B$BI know not how she learned such things, but I trust her completely, so I will do my best.$B$BI am currently investigating slimes, oozes and such. The creatures all seem to be similar in make up, but greatly affected by their environment.$B$BI could use your help in gathering samples of the creatures..', '', 5520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brother and I have dedicated ourselves to Sylvanas. She is our beacon of light when times were darkest. We sacrifice ourselves day in and day out to ensure our kind overcome the destiny that\'s chosen us.$B$BWe will not remain weak. We will take that which is owed to us. We will return tenfold, the pain that was done to us. And we shall do so with smiles on our faces.', '', 5519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zeppelin Master', 'Zeppelin Master', 5518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for the eastern Zeppelin Landing Tower outside of the city to the southeast.', 'Look for the eastern Zeppelin Landing Tower outside of the city to the southeast.', 5517, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just outside the city\'s main gate is a signpost.  It will point you toward the western zeppelin tower.', 'Just outside the city\'s main gate is a signpost.  It will point you toward the western zeppelin tower.', 5516, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auction House', 'Auction House', 5515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mailbox', 'Mailbox', 5514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inn', 'Inn', 5513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think of Dadanga?\n', 'What do you think of Dadanga?', 5512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All right then... I know the way to and from Gadgetzan.  What I need for you to do is to keep the beasts off of us.  I\'ve trained Dadanga how to defend herself pretty well, but we can\'t handle the overgrown madness out there for long.  Let me know when you\'re ready to go, $n.', 5511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes $gbrother : sister;, how may I assist you?', 'Yes $gbrother : sister;, how may I assist you?', 5509, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re ready, then Dadanga and I are ready.  Let\'s go!', 5508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hendel is in our custody now, $n, thanks to you.$B$BAlthough the questioning goes slowly, I assure you, he will tell us everything he knows.$B$BFor now, please be patient. I will contact you immediately if we have need of your assistance.$B$BUntil then, please, enjoy Theramore and I invite you to stay for as long as you like within our city\'s walls as a friend of the Alliance.', 5506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I welcome you to Theramore, $n.$B$BI apologize for being abrupt and not having a lot of time to exchange pleasantries, but my city must come first. Too many things threaten our way of life and the sanctity of the Alliance. I must stay ever vigilant against forces outside of our control if I\'m to ensure my people remain safe and happy.$B$BPerhaps we\'ll have more time to speak later.', 5505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This may come as a shock to you, but business hasn\'t been all that good as of late...', '', 5504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The auction house can be found on the central spire of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bottom of the Windrider\'s Tower. May your ancestors watch over you.', 'The auction house can be found on the central spire of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bottom of the Windrider\'s Tower. May your ancestors watch over you.', 5503, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is found on the lowest section of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bank.  It is not far from there.', 'It is found on the lowest section of Thunder Bluff.  Search near the bank.  It is not far from there.', 5502, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe I noticed a new shipment of mail being delivered not too long ago.  You\'ll find the mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 'I believe I noticed a new shipment of mail being delivered not too long ago.  You\'ll find the mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 5501, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find a mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 'You can find a mailbox just outside the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 5500, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Innkeeper Pala will help you rest your body and spirit.  You can find her in the building just south of the bank on the lower rise.', 'Innkeeper Pala will help you rest your body and spirit.  You can find her in the building just south of the bank on the lower rise.', 5499, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for Innkeeper Pala in the building just south of the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 'Look for Innkeeper Pala in the building just south of the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 5498, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, to soar with the great birds of the sky.  Seek out Tal at the top of the Winder Rider Roost.  He will steer you toward where you\'re going.', 'Ah, to soar with the great birds of the sky.  Seek out Tal at the top of the Winder Rider Roost.  He will steer you toward where you\'re going.', 5497, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strong of body and spirit.  There can be no stronger combination!  Find your destiny with Sark Ragetotem in the Hunter\'s Hall.', 'Strong of body and spirit.  There can be no stronger combination!  Find your destiny with Sark Ragetotem in the Hunter\'s Hall.', 5496, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the true sign of the hunter!  To stalk one\'s prey in the never-ending game of life.  Look to Drayl on the Hunter Rise for your answers.', 'Ah, the true sign of the hunter!  To stalk one\'s prey in the never-ending game of life.  Look to Drayl on the Hunter Rise for your answers.', 5495, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clothing the tribe is as important a job as any other.  You should look for Tepa inside Thunder Bluff Armorers.  She has a natural way with the needle.', 'Clothing the tribe is as important a job as any other.  You should look for Tepa inside Thunder Bluff Armorers.  She has a natural way with the needle.', 5494, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, in harmony with nature, and only your skills to survive.  This is the way that the Earth Mother intended it to be.  You will want to find Bale on the Hunter Rise.', 'You, in harmony with nature, and only your skills to survive.  This is the way that the Earth Mother intended it to be.  You will want to find Bale on the Hunter Rise.', 5493, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every scrap used makes us less wasteful and brings us closer to the Earth Mother.  Mooranta can show you the way.  Seek her just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 'Every scrap used makes us less wasteful and brings us closer to the Earth Mother.  Mooranta can show you the way.  Seek her just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 5492, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earth Mother calls and you answer.  You will find the Hall of Spirits on the Spirit Rise.', 'The Earth Mother calls and you answer.  You will find the Hall of Spirits on the Spirit Rise.', 5491, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Despite their tragedy the Undead have come all this way to aid us.  I only hope that we can be as helpful to them.  Seek out Father Cobb near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.', 'Despite their tragedy the Undead have come all this way to aid us.  I only hope that we can be as helpful to them.  Seek out Father Cobb near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.', 5490, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them.  You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology.', 'The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them.  You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology.', 5489, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very sad to think what has befallen those poor undead souls.  You can find Archmage Shymm reflecting near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.', 'Very sad to think what has befallen those poor undead souls.  You can find Archmage Shymm reflecting near the Pools of Vision under the Spirit Rise.', 5488, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a symmetry in the idea of the hide of your enemy providing you with protection.  To further your leatherworking skills look for Una inside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 'There is a symmetry in the idea of the hide of your enemy providing you with protection.  To further your leatherworking skills look for Una inside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 5487, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any friend of the animals is a friend of mine.  The Hunter\'s Hall is what you seek.  It sits atop the Hunter Rise.', 'Any friend of the animals is a friend of mine.  The Hunter\'s Hall is what you seek.  It sits atop the Hunter Rise.', 5486, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature provides all that we need.  Speak to Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism on the middle rise.', 'Nature provides all that we need.  Speak to Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism on the middle rise.', 5485, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fellowship of kindred spirits can be a powerful force.  Krumn will help you to achieve this.  You will find him at the Thunder Bluff Civic Information center on the lower rise next to the lifts.', 'A fellowship of kindred spirits can be a powerful force.  Krumn will help you to achieve this.  You will find him at the Thunder Bluff Civic Information center on the lower rise next to the lifts.', 5484, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kah Mistrunner at Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise will show you the way to find inner peace and serenity while fishing for your next meal.', 'Kah Mistrunner at Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise will show you the way to find inner peace and serenity while fishing for your next meal.', 5483, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Life is a struggle, and the saying that which does not kill you makes you stronger is not always true.  Sometimes wounds act slowly, which is why we have bandages.  Pand Stonebinder of the Spirit Rise can teach you the art of First Aid.', 'Life is a struggle, and the saying that which does not kill you makes you stronger is not always true.  Sometimes wounds act slowly, which is why we have bandages.  Pand Stonebinder of the Spirit Rise can teach you the art of First Aid.', 5482, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The profession of Enchanting displays the cycle of destruction and creation that is at the heart of nature.  Teg at the Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise will show you how.', 'The profession of Enchanting displays the cycle of destruction and creation that is at the heart of nature.  Teg at the Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise will show you how.', 5481, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings honored one.  Turak Runetotem and the other druids have been expecting you at the Hall of Elders on Elder Rise.', 'Greetings honored one.  Turak Runetotem and the other druids have been expecting you at the Hall of Elders on Elder Rise.', 5480, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You honor the spirits of the animals you must slay by not letting them go to waste.  Aska Mistrunner will show you how.  She has a kitchen on the high rise.', 'You honor the spirits of the animals you must slay by not letting them go to waste.  Aska Mistrunner will show you how.  She has a kitchen on the high rise.', 5479, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Metal, as with all things, should be used in balance with nature.  Karn Stonehoof has a smithy setup near the pond on the lower rise.  Seek out his wisdom.', 'Metal, as with all things, should be used in balance with nature.  Karn Stonehoof has a smithy setup near the pond on the lower rise.  Seek out his wisdom.', 5478, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may shed yourself of your worldly possessions at the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 'You may shed yourself of your worldly possessions at the Thunder Bluff Bank on the lower rise.', 5477, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The herbs found in nature can be a powerful ally when combined with respect.  You will want to seek out Bena at her alchemy shop on the middle rise to further your training.', 'The herbs found in nature can be a powerful ally when combined with respect.  You will want to seek out Bena at her alchemy shop on the middle rise to further your training.', 5476, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This $n has been driven mad from the corruption! ', '', 5475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This creature suffers from the effects of the fel... We must end its misery.', '', 5474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense the taint of corruption upon this $n. Help me destroy it!', '', 5473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you would want to leave these sunny shores and crystal blue waters I have no idea. It\'s like paradise down here. But don\'t tell my brother Zapetta that, he\'s bitter enough already about getting stuck up there in Tirisfal all day long. This Zeppelin here drops off at Orgrimmar so you shouldn\'t have to worry about having to listen to him whine. But if you are in Tirisfal anytime soon, heed my warning and don\'t get him started.', 'Why you would want to leave these sunny shores and crystal blue waters I have no idea. It\'s like paradise down here. But don\'t tell my brother Zapetta that, he\'s bitter enough already about getting stuck up there in Tirisfal all day long. This Zeppelin here drops off at Orgrimmar so you shouldn\'t have to worry about having to listen to him whine. But if you are in Tirisfal anytime soon, heed my warning and don\'t get him started.', 5472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A budding herbalist are we?  Then you should visit with Firodren Mooncaller over in the Temple Gardens.  He may have some tricks of the trade to impart with you.', 'A budding herbalist are we?  Then you should visit with Firodren Mooncaller over in the Temple Gardens.  He may have some tricks of the trade to impart with you.', 5471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gathering and knowledge of herbs is a specialty of Firodren Mooncaller.  Seek him out in the Temple Gardens in the southwestern area of Darnassus.', 'The gathering and knowledge of herbs is a specialty of Firodren Mooncaller.  Seek him out in the Temple Gardens in the southwestern area of Darnassus.', 5470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch out for the $n!', 5469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That has to be the biggest $n I have ever seen... and it\'s coming right for us!', 5468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dadanga!  Attack!', 5467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away from my kodo, you freak of nature!', 5466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares awaken Aquementas?', '', 5465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me now in peace. I must rest.', '', 5464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you have disturbed me from my rest!', '', 5463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Step lively Dadanga!  Come on, girl!  The quicker we get through here, the happier we\'ll both be.', 5462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, we\'re not getting any closer just standing here.  Come on Dadanga!  Yah!', 5461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begs to be put out of his misery.', '%s begs to be put out of her misery.', 5460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s weeps pitifully.', '%s weeps pitifully.', 5459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s groans.', '%s groans.', 5458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you into little tiny pieces!', '', 5457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bid you welcome, $c. Rare do we have visitors down to these levels of the Apothecarium... unless of course there\'s something someone wants... or needs.$B$B<Chemist Coely laughs.>$B$BHow can I help you today, hmm?', '', 5456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'ll definitely not be anywhere in the Eastern Kingdoms, that\'s for sure.$B$BIt\'ll have to be somwhere on Kalimdor, but still far enough away from the Horde and other races. Someplace unaffected by the Sundering--that means no where near the Night elves\' civilization either.$B$BI would guess it\'d be someplace protected also... like a valley, or a crater. I don\'t know. I\'m just guessing now. I\'m sorry I couldn\'t help you more.', '', 5455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are there any areas you can think of that would be so untouched?', 'Are there any areas you can think of that would be so untouched?', 5454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pure sample would be one that\'s uncorrupted by unintentional influences. We need to find the creatures in the most basic, normal environment we can.$B$BThat means somewhere devoid of civilization or the effects of the dominant races of Azeroth. Someplace... untouched.', '', 5453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you mean by \"pure?\"', 'What do you mean by \"pure?\"', 5452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, not that I can tell. It seems to be mostly based on region. Some races have labled them slimes, some oozes. It seems to be preference mostly.$B$BEvery time I\'ve encountered ooze, sludge, or slime they have basically been the same creatures. The differences seem to be based on their environment, which is why we need a pure sample.', '', 5451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there a difference between ooze and slime?', 'Is there a difference between ooze and slime?', 5450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There must be someplace on Azeroth that we can find oozes uncorrupted by the Scourge or anything else. But where?!', '', 5449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at these samples! What does it mean? What does it mean? I\'m going to need time, time to look at all this information. And I\'ll need more information. Information I can\'t get... damn! Think, Laris, think!$B$BWhat are you going to do? What?!$B$BThere has to be a solution!', '', 5448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incredible! Amazing! I don\'t even know what this means!', '', 5447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good riddance!', '', 5446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But your real punishment lies ahead.', '', 5445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! I bet you thought you were done!', '', 5444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unleash the fury and let it be done!', '', 5443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sons of Thaurissan shall watch you perish in the Ring of the Law!', '', 5442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been sentenced to death for crimes against the Dark Iron nation!', '', 5441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here it is -- the Tanaris desert.  Funny how an inhospitable place like this looks better than a lush jungle once you\'ve been trapped in it forever.', 5440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s the path out of Un\'Goro!  We made it!  All we have to worry about is the Tanaris desert now.', 5439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s the eastern mountain wall!  I\'m cutting towards the south now; try and keep up.  We\'re not out of the thick of it yet!', 5437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is where things get interesting.  My plan is to follow the mountail wall, keeping it to our left.  That way, we won\'t get lost in the jungle and we\'ll cut down on the hostiles.  You ready?', 5436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello stranger, and welcome to the untamed majesty of Un\'Goro Crater!$B$BMy name is Williden Marshal.  My sister, our companions, and I make up Marshal Expeditions - scientists and explorers of Azeroth\'s wild and great unknown.', '', 5435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hello there!  I\'m Hol\'anyee, the chief scientist and biologist of Marshal Expeditions.  My brother and I, along with our companions, travel Azeroth exploring the wild and untamed majesty.  It is exciting... but, um... I think we got ourselves into a little too much excitement this time!', 5434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the love of all that is holy and dear, please tell me that you\'ve come to deliver us from this forsaken land.  Though I\'m with Marshal Expeditions, I would give you the gold teeth from my mouth to climb inside your backpack and leave this place.', '', 5433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello there, my name is Petra.  To my right is my kodo, Dadanga.  We\'re with Marshal Expeditions - been so for a few years now, ever since Dadanga was a babe.$B$BIf you have any lit torches or any open sources of flame, I\'d like to ask you to keep them stashed if you could.  Dadanga dislikes smoke.', 5432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail to the king, baby!', '', 5431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emperor Thaurissan does not wish to be disturbed! Turn back now or face your doom, weak mortals!', '', 5430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s is visibly shaken by the death of Emperor Thaurissan.', 5429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s transforms the items into a totem.', '', 5428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast a powerful spell.', '', 5427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Image dissipation in sixty seconds.', '', 5426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing, aren\'t they? All these artifacts and remains.$B$BI\'m not sure what I\'m more impressed by, their size, or the stories that go along with them. There\'s so much to study and learn. And the connections we can make...$B$BDid you know rumor has it that many races have the same heritage as Night elves?', '', 5425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma\'am;?', 'Welcome to the Bank of Darnassus. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma\'am;?', 5424, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auction House', 'Auction House', 5423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your voice is hoarse from yelling huh?  Find the Orgrimmar Auction House in the Valley of Strength.', 'Your voice is hoarse from yelling huh?  Find the Orgrimmar Auction House in the Valley of Strength.', 5422, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Orgrimmar Auction House is in the Valley of Strength.  Look for it on the east side next to Boomstick Imports.', 'The Orgrimmar Auction House is in the Valley of Strength.  Look for it on the east side next to Boomstick Imports.', 5421, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bursts into the hatchery once you apply the lure to the crystal!', '', 5420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I present to you the Libram of Voracity.', 'I present to you the Libram of Voracity.', 5419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I present to you the Libram of Resilience.', 'I present to you the Libram of Resilience.', 5418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I present to you the Libram of Tenacity.', 'I present to you the Libram of Tenacity.', 5417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I present to you the Libram of Constitution.', 'I present to you the Libram of Constitution.', 5416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me grab the popped corn kernels, sire.', 'Let me grab the popped corn kernels, sire.', 5415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aright *hic*... Say, you look familiar *hic*. Have I ever told you about the time me and Windsor fought off thir, er... a thous... a million orcs?$B$BOh settle down friend, this is a good one!', '', 5414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me a story, John.', 'Tell me a story, John.', 5413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll have to give me a moment, $c, the naga are attacking us right now. I\'ll speak to you as soon as the attack is done!', 5412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, no problem, $n! Sorry... thought you were done with it already.', '', 5411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um... sorry to bother you, but could I see Goodsteel\'s ledger again... if you\'re not using it.', 'Um... sorry to bother you, but could I see Goodsteel\'s ledger again... if you\'re not using it.', 5410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello? ', '', 5409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You take care of yourself! I\'m gettin\' out o\' here.', '', 5408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach! Thank you so much, $n! I\'m free! Finally!', '', 5407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ringo? Wake up! Don\'t worry, I\'ll take care of you.', 5406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ringo! You\'re okay!', 5405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh.', '', 5404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... I\'m feeling faint...', '', 5403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spraggle! I didn\'t think I\'d make it back!', '', 5402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How am I feeling? Quite soaked, thank you.', '', 5401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where... Where am I?', '', 5400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am feeling a little better now, thank you.', '', 5399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I must go on.', '', 5398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe... you could carry me?', '', 5397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The heat... I can\'t take it...', '', 5396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not feeling so well...', '', 5395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uuuuuuggggghhhhh....', '', 5394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s faints and falls onto the ground.', '', 5393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I look woozy, slap me.  If I pass out, use the canteen.  Now let\'s go!', '', 5392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I\'m not sure how far I\'ll make it in this state... I\'m feeling kind of faint...', '', 5391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We...are...investigating.', '', 5390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HALT!  There were...reports...of a...disturbance.', '', 5389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Regthar.  He is wise and can help you find what you seek.', '', 5388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was the site of a great battle.  Many great battles.', '', 5387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have observed four different kinds of plants that have been affected by the corruption: the songflower, the windblossom, the whipper root, and the night dragon plant.  The songflower and windblossom are common plants in Felwood, while the whipper root and night dragon are seen less frequently.  All are a vital part of Felwood\'s ecosystem.', 5386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have observed four different kinds of plants that have been affected by the corruption: the songflower, the windblossom, the whipper root, and the night dragon plant.  The songflower and windblossom are common plants in Felwood, while the whipper root and night dragon are seen less frequently.  All are a vital part of Felwood\'s ecosystem.', 5385, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What plants are in Felwood that might be corrupted?', 'What plants are in Felwood that might be corrupted?', 5384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a creature in the forest can elude Corand, such is his skill at tracking.  You would do well to listen to his teachings if you wish to be even half as successful.  \n\nI will relieve you of the burden of tracking him and mark his location on your map, there in the Cenarion Enclave.', 'Not a creature in the forest can elude Corand, such is his skill at tracking.  You would do well to listen to his teachings if you wish to be even half as successful.  \n\nI will relieve you of the burden of tracking him and mark his location on your map, there in the Cenarion Enclave.', 5383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tracking', 'Tracking', 5382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would certainly be looking for Me\'Lynn if you have any hope of learning to be a tailor.  She resides at the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in northeastern Darnassus.', 'You would certainly be looking for Me\'Lynn if you have any hope of learning to be a tailor.  She resides at the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in northeastern Darnassus.', 5381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tailoring', 'Tailoring', 5380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need help surviving in the woods, you had best not stray far from the city walls.  However if you do plan to stray, then you had better have a talk with Malygen in the Cenarion Enclave so that you might learn to set a proper campfire.', 'If you need help surviving in the woods, you had best not stray far from the city walls.  However if you do plan to stray, then you had better have a talk with Malygen in the Cenarion Enclave so that you might learn to set a proper campfire.', 5379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Survival', 'Survival', 5378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us.  If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner\'s profession may suit you.  Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more.', 'In death, the animals of the world bestow both life and protection unto us.  If you feel that you can offer the appropriate respect for their sacrifice, then the skinner\'s profession may suit you.  Speak with Eladriel in the Craftsman\'s Terrace in northern Darnassus to learn more.', 5377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skinning', 'Skinning', 5376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"A skill for those who wish to overcome obstacles.\"  I believe that is how Faelyssa describes her skill set.  \n\nIf you believe as she does then find your way to the Cenarion Enclave in the northern section of Darnassus where she conducts her class.', '\"A skill for those who wish to overcome obstacles.\"  I believe that is how Faelyssa describes her skill set. \n\nIf you believe as she does then find your way to the Cenarion Enclave in the northern section of Darnassus where she conducts her class.', 5375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lockpicking', 'Lockpicking', 5374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We plant the vegetables.  Our vegetables are eaten by the rabbit.  The rabbit is devoured by the wolf.  The wolf is slain by us.  We take the meat and hide from the wolf\'s corpse.  It\'s that Magic Circle of life, or whatever you call it.  \n\nNow go see Telonis in the Cenarion Enclave to get started and let me return to my duties.', 'We plant the vegetables.  Our vegetables are eaten by the rabbit.  The rabbit is devoured by the wolf.  The wolf is slain by us.  We take the meat and hide from the wolf\'s corpse.  It\'s that Magic Circle of life, or whatever you call it.  \n\nNow go see Telonis in the Cenarion Enclave to get started and let me return to my duties.', 5373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skill with which Telonis crafts armor is beyond compare.  You should be grateful that he does not charge more for the knowledge he passes to others.  Go now and seek him out in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in the northeast section of Darnassus.', 'The skill with which Telonis crafts armor is beyond compare.  You should be grateful that he does not charge more for the knowledge he passes to others.  Go now and seek him out in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in the northeast section of Darnassus.', 5372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leatherworking', 'Leatherworking', 5371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbalism', 'Herbalism', 5370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A time consuming, yet rewarding skill.  Speak with Astaia in the Tradesman\'s Terrace and maybe you\'ll learn something useful.', 'A time consuming, yet rewarding skill.  Speak with Astaia in the Tradesman\'s Terrace and maybe you\'ll learn something useful.', 5369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing', 'Fishing', 5368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you have not a healer to tend to your wounds, the knowledge of First Aid can be a lifesaver.  I would consult Dannelor over at the Craftsmen\'s Terrace for instruction on this skill.', 'When you have not a healer to tend to your wounds, the knowledge of First Aid can be a lifesaver.  I would consult Dannelor over at the Craftsmen\'s Terrace for instruction on this skill.', 5367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First Aid', 'First Aid', 5366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och!  Ye should be careful what ye get enchanted $glad : lass;.  I had me mug enchanted so it wouldn\'t spill a drop, but now I can\'t drink from it!  Such a tragedy.  \n\nYou be sure to heed me advice when ye see Gimble.  He\'ll be in his shop right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge.', 'Och!  Ye should be careful what ye get enchanted $glad : lass;.  I had me mug enchanted so it wouldn\'t spill a drop, but now I can\'t drink from it!  Such a tragedy.  \n\nYou be sure to heed me advice when ye see Gimble.  He\'ll be in his shop right by the Gryphon Master at The Great Forge.', 5365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because the blade can never be too sharp nor the armor too tough a talented enchanter will always be needed.  Such an enchanter is Taladan, who can show you how to properly weave enchantments to improve your weapons and armor.  Seek him out in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace.', 'Because the blade can never be too sharp nor the armor too tough a talented enchanter will always be needed.  Such an enchanter is Taladan, who can show you how to properly weave enchantments to improve your weapons and armor.  Seek him out in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace.', 5364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enchanting', 'Enchanting', 5363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alchemy', 'Alchemy', 5362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Class Trainer', 'Class Trainer', 5360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dishes that Alegorn whips up are to die for.  He\'s always busy preparing new delicacies over in the Craftsman\'s Terrace.  Be sure to try his Cenarion Green recipe if he has any left.  \n\nNow, if you don\'t mind, I must investigate this rash of missing deer. ', 'The dishes that Alegorn whips up are to die for.  He\'s always busy preparing new delicacies over in the Craftsman\'s Terrace.  Be sure to try his Cenarion Green recipe if he has any left.  \n\nNow, if you don\'t mind, I must investigate this rash of missing deer. ', 5358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alegorn is a masterful chef who has had centuries with which to perfect his cooking.  You should consider yourself blessed should he decide to teach you.  If you believe you are worthy, you can find him in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace.', 'Alegorn is a masterful chef who has had centuries with which to perfect his cooking.  You should consider yourself blessed should he decide to teach you.  If you believe you are worthy, you can find him in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace.', 5357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cooking', 'Cooking', 5356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you truly have the desire to learn this profession, then I would point you in the direction of Ainethil, a skilled alchemist at the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in northern Darnassus.', 'If you truly have the desire to learn this profession, then I would point you in the direction of Ainethil, a skilled alchemist at the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in northern Darnassus.', 5355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alchemy', 'Alchemy', 5354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here among the craftsmen of Darnassus, there is a millennium of knowledge for the benefit of your chosen craft.  Now tell me, which craft do you find the most intriguing?', 'Here among the craftsmen of Darnassus, there is a millennium of knowledge for the benefit of your chosen craft.  Now tell me, which craft do you find the most intriguing?', 5353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Profession Trainer', 'Profession Trainer', 5352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find Sildinair at the Warrior\'s Terrace among the guards, her keen eyes scanning the forest for enemies that might dare to enter our fair city.  ', 'You will find Sildinair at the Warrior\'s Terrace among the guards, her keen eyes scanning the forest for enemies that might dare to enter our fair city.  ', 5351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior', 'Warrior', 5350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are those that attempt to follow the path of the Rogue, but only the night elves are truly embraced by the night.  If you seek to walk the shaded path then find Syurna in the Cenarion Enclave.', 'There are those that attempt to follow the path of the Rogue, but only the night elves are truly embraced by the night.  If you seek to walk the shaded path then find Syurna in the Cenarion Enclave.', 5349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is Syurna that you seek if you are to follow the rogue\'s path.  She dwells in the Cenarion Enclave down the spiraling path within the western most tree.', 'It is Syurna that you seek if you are to follow the rogue\'s path.  She dwells in the Cenarion Enclave down the spiraling path within the western most tree.', 5348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rogue', 'Rogue', 5347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of Elune compels you!  The power of Elune compels you!  \n\nGo now!  Seek out Jandria in the central hall of the Temple of the Moon in the southern section of Darnassus!', 'The power of Elune compels you!  The power of Elune compels you!  \n\nGo now!  Seek out Jandria in the central hall of the Temple of the Moon in the southern section of Darnassus!', 5346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Temple of the Moon is home to the priests of Elune.  There you will find Jandria and Lariia, who will provide you with further guidance in the path of priesthood.', 'The Temple of the Moon is home to the priests of Elune.  There you will find Jandria and Lariia, who will provide you with further guidance in the path of priesthood.', 5345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Priest', 'Priest', 5344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In grizzly times a druid can be a dear friend to those around them.  Ask any of the druids in the Cenarion Enclave and they will tell you the same.', 'In grizzly times a druid can be a dear friend to those around them.  Ask any of the druids in the Cenarion Enclave and they will tell you the same.', 5343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Druid', 'Druid', 5342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are fortunate to have come to Darnassus where you can find such an accomplished Hunter as Jocaste among our trainers.  I encourage you to visit her over in the Cenarion Enclave and seek her tutelage.', 'You are fortunate to have come to Darnassus where you can find such an accomplished Hunter as Jocaste among our trainers.  I encourage you to visit her over in the Cenarion Enclave and seek her tutelage.', 5341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hunter', 'Hunter', 5340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here in Darnassus you will find skilled trainers who have perfected the skills of their chosen class through ages of training and dedication.  I will guide you to one who can become your mentor, you have but to name your chosen path.', 'Here in Darnassus you will find skilled trainers who have perfected the skills of their chosen class through ages of training and dedication.  I will guide you to one who can become your mentor, you have but to name your chosen path.', 5339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A class trainer', 'A class trainer', 5338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a mailbox outside of the Bank which you\'ll find in the center of Darnassus.', 'There is a mailbox outside of the Bank which you\'ll find in the center of Darnassus.', 5337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mailbox', 'Mailbox', 5336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though I find the cool grass which covers Teldrassil as good a bed as any, the beds which Saelienne keeps at the Inn in Craftsman\'s Terrace are quite suitable for those with a taste for luxury.', 'Though I find the cool grass which covers Teldrassil as good a bed as any, the beds which Saelienne keeps at the Inn in Craftsman\'s Terrace are quite suitable for those with a taste for luxury.', 5335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Inn', 'The Inn', 5334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you desire to form a fellowship then it is the guild master, Lysheana, that you must see.  You will find her in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in the northeastern section of Darnassus.', 'If you desire to form a fellowship then it is the guild master, Lysheana, that you must see.  You will find her in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace in the northeastern section of Darnassus.', 5333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guild Master & Vendor', 'Guild Master & Vendor', 5332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vesprystus\' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination.  Seek him out in Rut\'theran Village, through the portal which lies in the western section of Darnassus.', 'Vesprystus\' hippogryphs will bear you swiftly to your destination.  Seek him out in Rut\'theran Village, through the portal which lies in the western section of Darnassus.', 5331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hippogryph Master', 'Hippogryph Master', 5330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may find storage for your worldly goods at the bank of Darnassus, which lies in the center of our wondrous city.', 'You may find storage for your worldly goods at the bank of Darnassus, which lies in the center of our wondrous city.', 5329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 5328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bank', 'The Bank', 5326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of all the wondrous places within Darnassus, which would you have me direct you to?', 'Of all the wondrous places within Darnassus, which would you have me direct you to?', 5325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you help me with some directions?', 'Can you help me with some directions?', 5324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What direction can I point you in?', 'What direction can I point you in?', 5321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you require guidance to your destination?', 'Do you require guidance to your destination?', 5320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I aid you in your journey?', 'How may I aid you in your journey?', 5319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anu therador mali $c.  Where can I guide you to?', 'Anu therador mali $c.  Where can I guide you to?', 5318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Auction House?  Why it\'s right by the gates of Ironforge as you enter our fine city.  Ye\'ll find it just across from The Vault.', 'Where is the Auction House?  Why it\'s right by the gates of Ironforge as you enter our fine city.  Ye\'ll find it just across from The Vault.', 5317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auction House', 'Auction House', 5316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the best you can do?  Do you really expect that you could defeat someone as awe inspiring as me?', '', 5315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! You can\'t even begin to imagine the futility of your efforts.', '', 5314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were just getting in the way anyways.', '', 5313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts are utterly pointless, fools!  You will never be able to defeat me!', '', 5312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for clearing out those foolish senators.  Now prepare to meet your doom at the hands of Ragnaros\' most powerful servant.', '', 5311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try the boar!  It\'s my new recipe!', '', 5310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you tried the Dark Iron Ale?  It\'s the best!', '', 5309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy!  You won\'t find better ale anywhere!', '', 5308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink up!  There\'s more where that came from!', '', 5307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need help in defeating the shadowsilk poachers.', 'I need help in defeating the shadowsilk poachers.', 5306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $n. Should you require assistance in completing your mission, you have only to ask. My guardian, Raze, can assist you in defeating the shadowsilk poachers. Use this Staff of Command to command Raze in battle. He is trained to ONLY attack shadowsilk poachers.', 5305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What want from Raze??', '', 5304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO SERVICE!!', '', 5303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have outworn your welcome!', '', 5302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must leave the bar!', '', 5301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Violence!  Property damage!  None shall pass!!', '', 5300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to train further in the ways of the Light.', 'I would like to train further in the ways of the Light.', 5299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Light protect you this day.', 'May the Light protect you this day.', 5298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders in the Manufactory? My constructs will destroy you!', '', 5297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greed has led you back to me.$B$B<Mathredis laughs.>$B$BA wise Draenei once told me that it - greed - is the single quality that all of the races on this world share. I would have to agree.$B$BHave you collected the components listed within the libram?', '', 5296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A rare find, indeed.$B$B<Mathredis nods.>$B$B If you wish to continue, I will need the components.', '', 5295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the arcana and I shall craft the amalgamation, mortal.', '', 5294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Mathredis gazes intently at the libram.>$B$BYou come for an amalgamation? Have you done as the libram instructed?', '', 5293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, so... you have found it.$B$B<Mathredis points to the book in your possession.>$B$BHave you collected the necessary components?$B$BThe manifestations listed in the libram, imbecile!', '', 5292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I present to you the Libram of Rumination.', 'I present to you the Libram of Rumination.', 5291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are lost, $r. Librams written by the elven masters. Scattered across the world when the Scourge was unleashed upon Quel\'Thalas.$B$BNow we search for these librams. Search to find the secrets they hold - to restore power once had.$B$BI search for the ten written by Master Kariel Winthalus. Should you find a libram, allow me to absorb its magical properties and for you I shall craft an amalgamation of power... of course, all things come at some cost. You will find my cost to be high; but pay you shall.', '', 5290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, that\'s it! I have finally figured it out!', 5289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blue plus red... I predict...', 5288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, let\'s see... If I am correct, then... Hmmm...', 5287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cries out an alarm!', '', 5286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, no! We\'ve run out of time. ', 5285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I do not enjoy conversation.', '', 5284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to summon a lava spawn!', '', 5283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting out of here!', '', 5281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh oh!  I\'m out of here!', 5275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Tanaris, $n. How can I be of service to you today? You don\'t look like a blacksmith to me, but I know how looks can be deceiving.', '', 5274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t hide from us.  Prepare to burn!', '', 5271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The secrets hidden within the Pylons of Un\'Goro Crater are now yours. Visit the Pylons at any time to access their power and gain useful resources.', '', 5270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We showed that one!', 5269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Ha! Ha! Thank you for freeing me, fools. Now let me repay you by charring the flesh from your bones.', '', 5268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it!  No more beer until this mess is sorted out!', '', 5267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, my pockets were picked!', '', 5266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!', 'No!', 5265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, now I\'m pissed!', 'Oh, now I\'m pissed!', 5264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for that!', 'You\'ll pay for that!', 5263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!  What\'s gives?', 'Hey!  What\'s gives?', 5262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I regret that I must fight this $n.', '', 5261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have destroyed my Azsharite weaponry! I need your assistance in defeating the triad of power.', 'I have destroyed my Azsharite weaponry! I need your assistance in defeating the triad of power.', 5260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doesn\'t anybody KNOCK anymore???!', '', 5259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where I come from, you get shanked for opening another inmate\'s cell door!', '', 5258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The door is open, Kharan. You are a free man.', 'The door is open, Kharan. You are a free man.', 5257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue...', 'Continue...', 5256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another sparkling stone.', 'I need another sparkling stone.', 5255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The large shrine was built many years ago by the night elves that once inhabited this land.$B$BWhat secrets could it hold?', '', 5254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You locked up the wrong Marshal, $n. Prepare to be destroyed!', '', 5253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet you\'re sorry now, aren\'t you $n!?!', '', 5252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is gonna leave a mark!', '', 5251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better hold me back or $n is going to feel some prison house beatings.', '', 5250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Administering fists of fury on $n!', '', 5249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks as though he\'s been stymied. He takes a few moments to recover from his wounds.', '', 5248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I summon you, Sha\'ni Proudtusk! ', 'I summon you, Sha\'ni Proudtusk! ', 5247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The remains are covered in flies and maggots.', '', 5246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here is a beacon for you, $n.  You must keep it in your possession if you are to find the corrupted items we will need.', 5245, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here is a beacon for you, $n.  You must keep it in your possession if you are to find the corrupted items we will need.', 5244, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a Cenarion beacon.', 'I need a Cenarion beacon.', 5243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them.  I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me.$B$BYou will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss.', 5241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are plants in Felwood that may be saved from corruption when Cenarion plant salve is applied to them.  I know how to make the salve from several different kinds of items; based on your skill set, you may find that you have multiple options to assist me.$B$BYou will also need a Cenarion beacon for your work here; it is a device that allows you to see the taint and corruption of nature that the naked eye will miss.', 5240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Box stupid. Lumurk sleepy.', '', 5239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lumurk open this box easy!', '', 5238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grurk stupid? You try open box! Maybe you smart as gnome???', '', 5237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me try! You too stupid!', '', 5236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid box! Stupid, stupid box! OPEN! GRURK SAY YOU OPEN!', '', 5234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grurk open soon. Then we split treasure.', '', 5233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me at Maxwell\'s encampment. We\'ll go over the next stages of the plan there and figure out a way to decode my tablets without the decryption ring.', '', 5232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We made it!', '', 5231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get him out of there!', '', 5230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He has to be in the last cell. Unless... they killed him.', '', 5229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open it. We need to hurry up. I can smell those Dark Irons coming a mile away and I can tell you one thing, they\'re COMING!', '', 5228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s go.', '', 5227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits on the ground.', '', 5226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That intolerant dirtbag finally got what was coming to him. Good riddance!', '', 5225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open it and be careful this time!', '', 5224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never did like those two. Let\'s get moving.', '', 5223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open it.', '', 5222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work, $n. Let\'s find the exit. I think I know the way. Follow me!', '', 5221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of here, Tobias, you\'re free!', 'Get out of here, Tobias, you\'re free!', 5220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did Crest send you?', '', 5219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally!! I can leave this dump.', '', 5218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we just have to free Tobias and we can get out of here. This way!', '', 5217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you feel the power, $n??? It\'s time to ROCK!', '', 5216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, there it is!', '', 5215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it, $n. My stuff should be in that room. Cover me, I\'m going in!', '', 5214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work! We\'re almost there! This way.', '', 5213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re free, Dughal! Get out of here!', 'You\'re free, Dughal! Get out of here!', 5212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HELP!!!!', '', 5211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n! I\'m free!!!', '', 5210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Darnassae?\"$B$BThe night elf druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her.  Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles.  She points at you and smiles once more.  She finally motions several times down the path to the north.$B$BPerhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further up the road?', 5209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These once beautiful woods suffer under a terrible curse!  Corrupting forces twist the life here into shadows of their former selves.  If you are not an agent of this corruption, then perhaps you can aid me in reclaiming Felwood!', 5208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check that cell, $n. If someone is alive in there, we need to get them out.', '', 5207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Taurahe?\"$B$BThe tauren druid looks at you expectantly, but it is clear you cannot verbally communicate with her.  Undaunted, she points to herself and smiles.  She points at you and smiles once more.  She finally motions several times down the path to the south.$B$BPerhaps she is indicating that there is a druid you can speak to further down the road?\n', 5206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get a move on. My gear should be in the storage area up this way...', '', 5205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These once beautiful woods suffer under a terrible curse!  Corrupting forces twist the life here into shadows of their former selves.  If you are not an agent of this corruption, then perhaps you can aid me in reclaiming Felwood!', 5204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps Ograbisi will use your head as a tiny little hat when I\'m through with you.', '', 5203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that you, my dear Tobias???', '', 5202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, just in time for your cleansing, $r. I shall wax the impurities from your soul.', '', 5201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What manner of filth dares enter my chambers!?', '', 5200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ograbisi needs new hat!', '', 5199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You make perfect little hat, $r!', '', 5198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s attacks a new target!', '', 5197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see the faint outline of a humanoid figure inside the pod; you now know that this is indeed the location you need to be at.  While you think you will eventually be able to open the pod, it remains tighly shut even to your most forceful attempts to open it.', '', 5196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure thing, $n. Here\'s another for you.', 5195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Western Pylon accepts red, green, and blue crystals.$B$BThe Pylon focuses on the energy that can be created using red crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that increases your protection from damage, and one that weakens an enemy\'s defenses.$B$BCrystal Ward requires red and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase to armor.$B$BCrystal Yield requires blue and red crystals. This can lower the armor of a specific target.', 5194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Northern Pylon accepts yellow, red, and green crystals.$B$BThe focus is the energy that can be created using yellow crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one that will produce damage, and one that will negate damage. $B$BCrystal Charge requires red and yellow crystals. This will produce a large explosion, stunning your enemies.$B$BCrystal Restore requires yellow and green crystals. This will provide you with a healing aura.', 5193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Eastern Pylon accepts blue, yellow, and green crystals.$B$BIt focuses on the energy that can be created using blue crystals as the main source of power. There are two possible effects: one provides bonus to spirit, and one that creates a damaging shield.$B$BCrystal Force requires blue and green crystals. This will provide you with an increase in spirit.$B$BCrystal Spire requires blue and yellow crystals. This will create a shield that does damage to attackers.\n\n', 5192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my Crystal Pylon User\'s Manual and need another one.', 'I lost my Crystal Pylon User\'s Manual and need another one.', 5191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about the Western Crystal Pylon.', 'Tell me more about the Western Crystal Pylon.', 5190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ravasaur here in Un\'Goro seem to be related to the raptors of the barrens - highly intelligent, volatile, and with a sense or code of conduct. The greatest of these that I have encountered is  Lar\'korwi. He is one of the most dangerous beasts I\'ve ever seen. In taurahe, Lar\'korwi means \"sharp claw,\" but that does not do him justice.$B$BDo not underestimate Lar\'korwi if you ever plan on hunting him, but I will help you in any way I can if you do.', '', 5189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about the Northern Crystal Pylon.', 'Tell me more about the Northern Crystal Pylon.', 5188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is this Lar\'korwi you spoke of?', 'Who is this Lar\'korwi you spoke of?', 5187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about the Eastern Crystal Pylon.', 'Tell me more about the Eastern Crystal Pylon.', 5186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks to you, we can now unlock the secrets of the crystals and the mysterious pylons, $n. If you need more information at any time, please come back and visit me again!', 5185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Un\'Goro Crater?', 'Where is Un\'Goro Crater?', 5184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Un\'Goro Crater be far to the south of Kalimdor. Beyond the Thousand Needles in Tanaris. Look for the large floating stones... they mark the entrance to the Crater. But be careful... it is no easy path. The raptors are not far from the entrance.', '', 5183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give you warm greetin\'s, $c, as does the Shattered Hand.$B$BDo not look so surprised, $n. There be shadows even on the highest perches of Orgrimmar--somethin\' must hide there. The Shattered Hand take that role willingly. Thrall, even in his good heart, acknowledge that the Hand be necessary to ensure orc and troll safety.$B$BBut you not here to talk \'bout my business, you here for somethin\' else.', '', 5182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve started down an honorable path, $n. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks.$B$BYou know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit.', '', 5181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe.$B$BFor me, race and profession mean nothing - it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor.$B$BIf you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more.', '', 5179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The symbols on the tablet are carefully transcribed...', '', 5178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Transcribe the tablet.', 'Transcribe the tablet.', 5177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burning Steppes - Tablet of the Seven', '', 5176, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me if you want to live.', 'Come with me if you want to live.', 5175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweet Elune, thanks for getting me out of that... thing!', '', 5173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, hits the spot!', '', 5172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My name\'s J.D., and I really can\'t tell you much about how I got here, but what I can tell you is that this camp is my home now!$B$BI spend my time studying the strange crystals that can be found all over the crater.  You must have seen some on your way over here.  Say, did you happen to pick any up?', 5171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks at you expectantly.', '', 5170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ALE!', '', 5169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, empty again!', '', 5168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one\'s empty!!', '', 5167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want more ale!  Give me more ale!', '', 5166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n attacking! Help!', 5164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need help!', 5163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help!', 5162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get this, $n off of me!', 5161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-Me, home. A-Me go home! $n, no stop A-Me.', '', 5160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Danger. Danger! $n try hurt A-Me.', '', 5159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, no hurt A-Me. A-Me, good.', '', 5158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad, $n. $n, bad!', '', 5157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-Me home! A-Me, good! Good A-Me. Home. Home. Home.', '', 5156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.$b$bA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing red, blue, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.$B$BA large red circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of blue crystals and another of green crystals.$B$BYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found.', '', 5155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.$b$bA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing yellow, red, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.$B$BA large yellow circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of red crystals and another of green crystals.$B$BYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found.\n', '', 5154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pylon seems to be transmitting data somewhere.$b$bA closer inspection of the pylon leads you to find a small table containing yellow, red, and green crystals arranged in what seems like a specific formation.$B$BA large blue circle of crystals is flanked on either side by a smaller circle of yellow crystals and another of green crystals.$B$BYou carefully take note of what you see, knowing that someone may be very interested in hearing about what you have found.', '', 5153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examine the pylon.', 'Examine the pylon.', 5152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Crystal Pylons of Un\'Goro are a mystery to all. To the few inhabitants here, they are a source of legend, with much speculation as to their purpose.', '', 5151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have suffered, but now I can feel it slowly fading from me. I feel... free.', '', 5150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I\'ve seen enough I think... so very draining...', '', 5149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will need to focus my energies onto this knife.  By doing so, I should catch some of the stronger psychic impressions associated with it.', '', 5148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
