('Yer looking for an Alchemy trainer are ye?  Just came from there, I did.  Ye\'ll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather.  \n\n::sigh:: ...why o\' why didn\'t I take the blue potion.', 'Yer looking for an Alchemy trainer are ye?  Just came from there, I did.  Ye\'ll find Ms. Berryfizz over in Tinker Town where the gnomes gather.  \n\n::sigh:: ...why o\' why didn\'t I take the blue potion.', 5116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
