('Hey!  Stop that!', '', 5056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No stealing the goods!', '', 5055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing over there?', '', 5054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!  Get away from that!', '', 5053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This here is the finest, most state of the art mode of transportation money can build. What? Deeprun Tram? Gnomes? Listen pal, If you believe that garbage then I\'ve got a statue down in Stranglethorn to sell ya. Now, are you walking to Grom\'Gol or are you gonna ride in style in this fine flying machine? Your choice.', '', 5052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My master, Plugger Spazzring, is a good boss.  And he makes a lot of money.  His pockets are bursting!', 5051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be sure to try our Dark Iron Ale.  I hear the dwarves around here can\'t get enough of it.', 5050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any mithril casings?', 'Do you have any mithril casings?', 5049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm, I don\'t have any mithril casings. I\'m all out. Is that all you need to get to fix A-Me? Oh, that would be fantastic!$B$BMithril casings aren\'t too hard to find back in civilization. Just ask any skilled engineer to make one for you. I think it takes a few bars of mithril, but if you could help me out, I\'ll make sure you\'re well rewarded!', 5048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen all the wonderful things here in Ungoro Crater, $n? It\'s simply amazing. Not as amazing as some of the things I can make with my skill at engineering, but for it being all natural here... it\'s not too bad.$B$BMy uncle Remtravel loves old stuff like this place. I\'m following in his footsteps kinda--I want to discover new things from lost cultures too!', 5047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s snores loudly and cuddles up next to A-Me 01.', '', 5046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks tired. He then yawns and lies down next to A-Me 01', '', 5045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re going to venture into Blackrock Depths, come speak with me. I may have some work for you.', 5044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another Engineer! Hey, this is a great chance for me to show off some new gadgets I\'ve been building!', 'Another Engineer! Hey, this is a great chance for me to show off some new gadgets I\'ve been building!', 5043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks again, $n.  Rocknot and I are really hitting it off!', 5042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good idea!', 5041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t you and Rocknot go find somewhere private...', 'Why don\'t you and Rocknot go find somewhere private...', 5040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Grim Guzzler!', 5039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, Ragged John. Your story was very uplifting and informative. ', 'Thanks, Ragged John. Your story was very uplifting and informative. ', 5038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The corruption of Felwood has trapped my spirit here... I may never rest...', '', 5037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. Now my spirit will finally be at peace.', '', 5036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! Put some fingers in your ears, your brain mighta just grown five sizes and I\'m worried it might leak out.$B$BSo, the Dark Irons spared his life and took him prisoner. Their leader, some self-important, uppity fella named Thauris-something, took Ironfoe for himself. And that was the last I saw of ol\' Windsor... *hic* \'scuse me.\n', '', 5035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 33, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh... Ironfoe.\n', 'Ahhh... Ironfoe.\n', 5034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may leave me here -- I wish to be alone in my final moments.', '', 5033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your knowledge is lacking.  Return to me when your skills in smelting have grown!', '', 5032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G Mister:Missy;, if I didn\'t know better, I\'d think you were one of them \'special\' peoples. We call em Troggs.$B$BWindsor didn\'t have no beef with the Dark Irons, after all, his great, great, grand pappy\'s best friend was a Dark Iron. Which is also probably why that army of Dark Irons didn\'t kill him on sight.', '', 5031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('300? So the Dark Irons killed him and dragged him into the Depths?', '300? So the Dark Irons killed him and dragged him into the Depths?', 5030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, my form has now changed! The true strength of my spirit is returning to me now... The cursed grasp of the forest is leaving me.', '', 5029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slow down! I was getting to that!$B$BSo there he was, standing tall with all the blood and guts dripping off him when who shows up?$B$BThe Dark Irons! Didn\'t you hear a word I said??$B$BWell, the Dark Irons are a little craftier than those Blackrock orcs. They came prepared. By prepared I mean there were about 300 of em... *hic* \'scuse me.', '', 5028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHY is he in Blackrock Depths?', 'WHY is he in Blackrock Depths?', 5027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel... something strange...', '', 5026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarves don\'t get drunk, $g mister:missy;. I\'m just a little sloppy.$B$BAnyhow, Windsor? I figure he\'s somewhere in Blackrock Depths. That\'s the Dark Iron city for you unedumecated peoples.', '', 5025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, so where the hell is he? Wait a minute! Are you drunk?', 'Ok, so where the hell is he? Wait a minute! Are you drunk?', 5024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can sense it now, $n. Ashenvale lies down this path.', '', 5023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you keep saying he died? Who told you he died? I never said he died.$B$BHe went missing is all.$B$BYou see, apparently we had gotten into the middle of some big orc versus Dark Iron dwarf battle. The orcs, being the filthy, miserable curs that they are, were out early, setting up some traps and other diabolical things you probably wouldn\'t understand.', '', 5022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So how did he die?', 'So how did he die?', 5021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Died? Are you cracked, $n? Excuse me, $g Mister:Miss; $n! Windsor wouldn\'t have died from no fifty orcs. As sure as Thelsamar blood sausage is the tastiest food the world may ever know, there he stood: He was covered in orc chunks from head to toe, drenched in about eighteen layers of their blood, but he was definitely alive... and really, really angry.', '', 5020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So that\'s how Windsor died...', 'So that\'s how Windsor died...', 5019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('So where was I? Oh yea, so the orcs rushed Windsor and Windsor, well, he didn\'t move an inch. He stood tall as they charged him, ten at a time. All I could see was the glow from Ironfoe and a lot of blood. This went on for hours, maybe days. I don\'t remember. Anyhow, FINALLY, it stopped.', '', 5018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting... continue, John.', 'Interesting... continue, John.', 5017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep. You never heard of Ironfoe? The legendary orc slaying hammer? Yep, yep, that was ol\' Windsor\'s hammer. He told me that Franclorn Forgewright himself made that hammer for his great, great, grand pappy. THE Franclorn Forgewright: The Dark Iron responsible for stonewrought archimetenc... building stuff. He also said the hammer had a twin that Franclorn kept for himself. Think he called it Ironfel or something.', '', 5016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ironfoe?\n', 'Ironfoe?\n', 5015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, alright. Anyhow, so I sorta slipped into the shadows.$B$BThat didn\'t sit too well with Windsor, seeing as how he was already extra cranky. Well he started spinnin\' old Ironfoe around and screaming like a mad man at the orcs. ', '', 5014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Start making sense, dwarf. I don\'t want to have anything to do with your cracker, your pappy, or any sort of \'discreditin.\'\n', 'Start making sense, dwarf. I don\'t want to have anything to do with your cracker, your pappy, or any sort of \'discreditin.\'\n', 5013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me versus fifty orcs? I\'m no fool, $n. My pappy always told me, \'Discreditin is the better part of a cracker,\' or something, and I knew what that meant.', '', 5012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what did you do?', 'So what did you do?', 5010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Windsor was particularly ornery that day - and believe me, for Windsor, that\'s a monumental accomplishment. He kept telling me that \'something feels off.\' Well he wasn\'t kidding!$B$BWe were in the middle of Blackrock Mountain when the filthy animals attacked. I\'m talking about the orcs, of course. Pay attention, will ya? All you could hear were grunts and the clanging of steel as they rushed us. ', '', 5009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That I must fight against my own kind deeply saddens me.', '', 5008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Official business, John. I need some information about Marshal Windsor. Tell me about the last time you saw him.', 'Official business, John. I need some information about Marshal Windsor. Tell me about the last time you saw him.', 5007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you be wanting? *hic*', '', 5006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The corruption of the fel has not left any of the creatures of Felwood untouched, $n. Please, be on your guard.', '', 5005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, help me to get through this cursed forest, $r.', '', 5004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s kisses Mistress Nagmara', '', 5003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s kisses her lover.', 5002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go, honey.', 5001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, Rocknot!', 5000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s drunkenly miscasts a shadow bolt!', '%s drunkenly miscasts a shadow bolt!', 4999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gets really dizzy!', '%s gets really dizzy!', 4998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your time, Lady Prestor.', 'Thank you for your time, Lady Prestor.', 4997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course not, dear $g boy:girl;. You \'adventurer\' types are often victims of circumstance; subject to the political drama which tends to unfold between citizenry and royalty.$B$BMy advice to you, then, is to seek out something else, more specifically: A new career.$B$BThis world has enough heroes.', 4996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begging your pardon, Lady Prestor. That was not my intent.\n', 'Begging your pardon, Lady Prestor. That was not my intent.\n', 4995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You seek to lower our global defenses in order to appease a paranoid magistrate and an encampment of riff-raff that are most probably suffering from heat stroke.', 4994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies, Lady Prestor.\n', 'My apologies, Lady Prestor.\n', 4993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was standing right next to you, imbecile. I know what you seek.', 4992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pardon the intrusion, Lady Prestor, but Highlord Bolvar suggested that I seek your advice.', 'Pardon the intrusion, Lady Prestor, but Highlord Bolvar suggested that I seek your advice.', 4991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Lady Prestor glares at you.>', 4990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n. If you\'d like to learn a thing or two about cooking, please visit me at any time.', '', 4989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to train in cooking.', 'I\'d like to train in cooking.', 4988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Nag, how about you slice me off a piece of that...', 'Hey Nag, how about you slice me off a piece of that...', 4987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mistress, you tell Plugger that I want more of his ale.  I can\'t get enough!', 'Mistress, you tell Plugger that I want more of his ale.  I can\'t get enough!', 4986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nagmara!  Have any mutton left?', 'Nagmara!  Have any mutton left?', 4985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Nagmara!  How about a mug of Dark Iron Ale?', 'Hey Nagmara!  How about a mug of Dark Iron Ale?', 4984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes $gsir:madam;.', 4983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll bring it right over, baby...', 4981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Coming right up!', 4980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You got it!', 4979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a mage of great power, I have spent my days studying the mind and the memory as it pertains to learning and the retention of learned abilities. I would even now be perfecting my studies if not for the great voices that came to me in the night, informing me that my services were required. I will be here for only a short time offering my ability to wipe your talents for free. Soon I will leave again, and you will once more be stuck with whatever choices you make.', 'I am a mage of great power, I have spent my days studying the mind and the memory as it pertains to learning and the retention of learned abilities. I would even now be perfecting my studies if not for the great voices that came to me in the night, informing me that my services were required. I will be here for only a short time offering my ability to wipe your talents for free. Soon I will leave again, and you will once more be stuck with whatever choices you make.', 4978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me choose wisely.', 'Help me choose wisely.', 4977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Engineering', 'Engineering', 4976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find that goblin and his toy shop in the Valley of Honor.', 'You\'ll find that goblin and his toy shop in the Valley of Honor.', 4975, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for Nogg\'s Machine Shop in the Valley of Honor northeast of Red Canyon Mining.', 'Look for Nogg\'s Machine Shop in the Valley of Honor northeast of Red Canyon Mining.', 4974, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!  Get away from me!  Help!!', '', 4973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re good for nothing, Ribbly.  It\'s time to pay for your wickedness!', 'You\'re good for nothing, Ribbly.  It\'s time to pay for your wickedness!', 4972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your family says hello, Ribbly.  And they want your head!', 'Your family says hello, Ribbly.  And they want your head!', 4971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s GO TIME! Come get sum! <replace this>', '', 4970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs as he watches the pests run off.', '', 4969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at them go!', '', 4968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s adds the haze to the Bloodpetal sprouts.', '', 4967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope this works!', '', 4966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brother said we could make great money with this trade route, but he didn\'t tell me I would be the one living on this side. If you come back this way on the Zeppelin, could you bring me something to eat? They sell some of the finest meat in Orgrimmar, and I sure could use something that didn\'t die weeks before it stopped moving.', 'My brother said we could make great money with this trade route, but he didn\'t tell me I would be the one living on this side. If you come back this way on the Zeppelin, could you bring me something to eat? They sell some of the finest meat in Orgrimmar, and I sure could use something that didn\'t die weeks before it stopped moving.', 4965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello!  You\'re just the person I was looking for.  Take a seat and listen, because I have a plan that will make us both rich!', '', 4964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course there\'s no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin, and fire spells are banned from being cast during the trip.', 'Of course there\'s no danger in everything catching flames and exploding like a huge helium bomb. This baby will get you to Undercity faster and safer than any boat, and the view is truly breathtaking. Speaking of breath, smoking is not allowed while on board the zeppelin', 4963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing?  Intruders!!', '', 4962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders!!', '', 4961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must say, Booty Bay has the best Clam Chowder to be had anywhere in the South Seas. Oh, not interested in cuisine eh? Well then let me be the first to welcome you to the berth of the Maiden\'s Fancy, the finest passenger ship to travel between the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. She\'s due back for another trip to Ratchet soon, so make yourself comfortable till she arrives.', 'I must say, Booty Bay has the best Clam Chowder to be had anywhere in the South Seas. Oh, not interested in cuisine eh? Well then let me be the first to welcome you to the berth of the Maiden\'s Fancy, the finest passenger ship to travel between the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor. She\'s due back for another trip to Ratchet soon, so make yourself comfortable till she arrives.', 4960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like you might be needing passage across the Great Sea. Well you have come to the right place, this here is the berth of the Maiden\'s Fancy, finest passenger ship to travel these waters. When she arrives, just climb aboard and the next thing you know you will find yourself basking on the sandy beaches of Stranglethorn.', 'You look like you might be needing passage across the Great Sea. Well you have come to the right place, this here is the berth of the Maiden\'s Fancy, finest passenger ship to travel these waters. When she arrives, just climb aboard and the next thing you know you will find yourself basking on the sandy beaches of Stranglethorn.', 4959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings $c -- if you\'re looking for leather goods and leatherworking supplies, you\'ve come to the right semi-retired Paladin.', '', 4958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Stonemaul Hold, brave $c.  How may I assist you this day?', '', 4957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father told me there\'d be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I\'d have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;.', 'My father told me there\'d be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I\'d have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;.', 4956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, I think I can make it on my own from here.  I don\'t know who you are... but I owe you one.  Thank you!', '', 4955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all guns and flames until someone loses and dies.', 'It\'s all guns and flames until someone loses and dies.', 4954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Hydraxis recruits more in his war, then it might shift the balance of power...', 'If Hydraxis recruits more in his war, then it might shift the balance of power...', 4953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like the way you think!  Let\'s get outta here!', '', 4952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms.  What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?', 'The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms.  What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?', 4951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire.  Let\'s hope he loses!', 'I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire.  Let\'s hope he loses!', 4950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh man, I thought I was dead for sure.  Ugh... still dizzy...', '', 4949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they\'re at war with us.  One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause...', 'The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they\'re at war with us.  One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause...', 4948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it weren\'t for the Grim Guzzler, I\'d probably spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.', 'If it weren\'t for the Grim Guzzler, I\'d probably spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps.', 4947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
