('What, you can\'t port there? Speak with Feenix Arcshine at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor. He is the resident mage trainer there.', 'What, you can\'t port there? Speak with Feenix Arcshine at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor. He is the resident mage trainer there.', 4808, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Feenix Arcshine at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor. He is the resident mage trainer there.', 'Speak with Feenix Arcshine at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor. He is the resident mage trainer there.', 4807, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find training at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor.', 'You will find training at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor.', 4806, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to The Barracks in the Valley of Honor.  Talk to Tamanji there.', 'Go to The Barracks in the Valley of Honor.  Talk to Tamanji there.', 4805, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can pick up your love letters outside the bank in the middle of the Valley of Strength.', 'You can pick up your love letters outside the bank in the middle of the Valley of Strength.', 4804, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find one of those outside the Bank of Orgrimmar in the middle of the Valley of Strength.', 'You\'ll find one of those outside the Bank of Orgrimmar in the middle of the Valley of Strength.', 4803, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for Innkeeper Grishka in the Valley of Strength.  Her inn is on the east side, north of the main city gates.', 'Look for Innkeeper Grishka in the Valley of Strength.  Her inn is on the east side, north of the main city gates.', 4802, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the second building on the right in the Valley of Strength north of the main city entrance.  Speak to Innkeeper Gryshka.', 'That\'s the second building on the right in the Valley of Strength north of the main city entrance.  Speak to Innkeeper Gryshka.', 4801, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde Embassy is in the Valley of Strength on the west side.', 'The Horde Embassy is in the Valley of Strength on the west side.', 4800, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re looking for Urtrun Clanbringer in the Horde Embassy.  Find it on the west side of the Valley of Strength.', 'You\'re looking for Urtrun Clanbringer in the Horde Embassy.  Find it on the west side of the Valley of Strength.', 4799, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did you think the Wind Rider Master would be?  Head to the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength!', 'Where did you think the Wind Rider Master would be?  Head to the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength!', 4798, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find the Wind Rider Master at the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength.  Doras will make sure you find your way to the battle you seek.', 'Find the Wind Rider Master at the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength.  Doras will make sure you find your way to the battle you seek.', 4797, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to the Valley of Strength and look for the Bank of Orgrimmar to the south of the Sky Tower.', 'Go to the Valley of Strength and look for the Bank of Orgrimmar to the south of the Sky Tower.', 4796, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bank of Orgrimmar is in the Valley of Strength. Look for it north of the main entrance to the city.', 'The Bank of Orgrimmar is in the Valley of Strength. Look for it north of the main entrance to the city.', 4795, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I hear him coming!  Look to the west!', '', 4794, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Warlord Krom\'zar?', 'Where is Warlord Krom\'zar?', 4793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have our duties, $c.  Duties to the Horde.', '', 4792, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good thing someone here has tracking!  Look for Shim\'la in the Hunter\'s Hall in the Valley of Honor.', 'Good thing someone here has tracking!  Look for Shim\'la in the Hunter\'s Hall in the Valley of Honor.', 4791, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Track down Shim\'la at the south entrance to the Hunter\'s Hall in the Valley of Honor.', 'Track down Shim\'la at the south entrance to the Hunter\'s Hall in the Valley of Honor.', 4790, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clothing!?  That won\'t help you against good steel!  Bah, if you\'re sure you want to be a tailor go find Magar\'s Cloth Goods in The Drag.', 'Clothing!?  That won\'t help you against good steel!  Bah, if you\'re sure you want to be a tailor go find Magar\'s Cloth Goods in The Drag.', 4789, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magar\'s Cloth Goods is in The Drag.  Find him south of the huge tree next to the Kodohide Leatherworks.', 'Magar\'s Cloth Goods is in The Drag.  Find him south of the huge tree next to the Kodohide Leatherworks.', 4788, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Denni\'ka can show you how to keep warm.  Look for her at Survival of the Fittest, a hut on the shore of the lake next to the Spirit Lodge.  Head up above and west of the Valley of Strength.', 'Denni\'ka can show you how to keep warm.  Look for her at Survival of the Fittest, a hut on the shore of the lake next to the Spirit Lodge.  Head up above and west of the Valley of Strength.', 4787, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I prefer my food raw, but if you like yours cooked Denni\'ka can show you how to light a fire.  Find her at Survival of the Fittest, a hut on the shore of the lake next to the Spirit Lodge.  Look for it up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.', 'I prefer my food raw, but if you like yours cooked Denni\'ka can show you how to light a fire.  Find her at Survival of the Fittest, a hut on the shore of the lake next to the Spirit Lodge.  Look for it up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.', 4786, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good that you wish to honor your kills by putting their bodies to use.  Find Thuwd inside the Kodohide Leatherworks in the middle of The Drag.', 'It is good that you wish to honor your kills by putting their bodies to use.  Find Thuwd inside the Kodohide Leatherworks in the middle of The Drag.', 4785, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thuwd will show you how to skin your kills.  Look for him at Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag.', 'Thuwd will show you how to skin your kills.  Look for him at Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag.', 4784, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Makaru can be found day and night at Red Canyon Mining in the Valley of Honor, just off the lake.', 'Makaru can be found day and night at Red Canyon Mining in the Valley of Honor, just off the lake.', 4783, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find Red Canyon Mining northeast of the lake in the Valley of Honor.  Speak to Makaru there.', 'Find Red Canyon Mining northeast of the lake in the Valley of Honor.  Speak to Makaru there.', 4782, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a treasure chest?  Let me see!  Alright, find Zando\'zan in the Cleft of Shadow.  Look for the tunnel going down in The Drag to find it.', 'You have a treasure chest?  Let me see!  Alright, find Zando\'zan in the Cleft of Shadow.  Look for the tunnel going down in The Drag to find it.', 4781, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go find Zando\'zan in the Cleft of Shadow.  There are a couple of tunnels leading down into that cavern, one just south of the Valley of Wisdom and the other in The Drag.', 'Go find Zando\'zan in the Cleft of Shadow.  There are a couple of tunnels leading down into that cavern, one just south of the Valley of Wisdom and the other in The Drag.', 4780, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kodohide Leatherworkers is what you want.  Find it in the middle of The Drag.', 'Kodohide Leatherworkers is what you want.  Find it in the middle of The Drag.', 4779, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag. Ask for Karolek.', 'Go to Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag. Ask for Karolek.', 4778, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya man, you be wantin Jandi\'s Arboretum.  Did I just say that?  Glok\'tar I must be tired!  Follow the wooden steps behind Asoran\'s Market in the Valley of Wisdom up into The Drag and you\'ll find Jandi\'s there on the upper level.', 'Ya man, you be wantin Jandi\'s Arboretum.  Did I just say that?  Glok\'tar I must be tired!  Follow the wooden steps behind Asoran\'s Market in the Valley of Wisdom up into The Drag and you\'ll find Jandi\'s there on the upper level.', 4777, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbs... you need to speak to Jandi at her arboretum in The Drag.  There are some wooden steps behind Asoran\'s Market in the Valley of Wisdom.  Follow them to the upper level of The Drag and you\'ll find her.', 'Herbs... you need to speak to Jandi at her arboretum in The Drag.  There are some wooden steps behind Asoran\'s Market in the Valley of Wisdom.  Follow them to the upper level of The Drag and you\'ll find her.', 4776, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing is a sport for the old who have not died in battle!  Go find Lumak on the lake in the Valley of Honor.', 'Fishing is a sport for the old who have not died in battle!  Go find Lumak on the lake in the Valley of Honor.', 4775, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Lumak... always fishing instead of fighting.  You\'ll find him out on his dock on the lake in the Valley of Honor.  While you\'re there say hi to Shankys for me.', 'That Lumak... always fishing instead of fighting.  You\'ll find him out on his dock on the lake in the Valley of Honor.  While you\'re there say hi to Shankys for me.', 4774, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess someone needs to bandage us warriors up after the fighting.  Seek out Gormok Ogrefist at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor.', 'I guess someone needs to bandage us warriors up after the fighting.  Seek out Gormok Ogrefist at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor.', 4773, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arnok makes good bandages.  Find him at the Survival of the Fittest hut on the shore of the lake next to Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  It\'s above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.', 'Arnok makes good bandages.  Find him at the Survival of the Fittest hut on the shore of the lake next to Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  It\'s above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.', 4772, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gnaws at the bait ravenously.', '', 4771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you enchant my axe?  I\'ll want a permanent.  Maybe later then.  Find Godan\'s Runeworks on the west end of The Drag near the Valley of Wisdom.', 'Can you enchant my axe?  I\'ll want a permanent.  Maybe later then.  Find Godan\'s Runeworks on the west end of The Drag near the Valley of Wisdom.', 4770, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Godan\'s Runeworks is where you\'ll go.  Look for it on the west end of The Drag, right next to the Valley of Wisdom.', 'Godan\'s Runeworks is where you\'ll go.  Look for it on the west end of The Drag, right next to the Valley of Wisdom.', 4769, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sniffs the bait.', '', 4768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll want to learn from Zamja.  Head to Borstan\'s Firepit on the upper level of The Drag by taking the stairs on the left as you enter from the Valley of Strength.', 'You\'ll want to learn from Zamja.  Head to Borstan\'s Firepit on the upper level of The Drag by taking the stairs on the left as you enter from the Valley of Strength.', 4767, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Grumble...', '', 4766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want Zamja at Borstan\'s Firepit on the upper level of The Drag.  Go up the stairs on the left as you enter The Drag from the Valley of Strength.', 'You want Zamja at Borstan\'s Firepit on the upper level of The Drag.  Go up the stairs on the left as you enter The Drag from the Valley of Strength.', 4765, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe Saru Steelfury will teach you to make an axe as good as mine some day.  Find him at The Burning Anvil in the Valley of Honor down the path to the right past Red Canyon Mining.', 'Maybe Saru Steelfury will teach you to make an axe as good as mine some day.  Find him at The Burning Anvil in the Valley of Honor down the path to the right past Red Canyon Mining.', 4764, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talk to Saru Steelfury at The Burning Anvil.  Go to the Valley of Honor.  It\'s at the end of the path to the right of Red Canyon Mining.', 'Talk to Saru Steelfury at The Burning Anvil.  Go to the Valley of Honor.  It\'s at the end of the path to the right of Red Canyon Mining.', 4763, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Potions and oils, these are things that Yelmak will teach you of if you are worthy.  Look for his shop in the middle of The Drag.', 'Potions and oils, these are things that Yelmak will teach you of if you are worthy.  Look for his shop in the middle of The Drag.', 4762, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for Yelmak\'s Alchemy and Potions.  Find it in the middle of The Drag, west of the huge tree.', 'Look for Yelmak\'s Alchemy and Potions.  Find it in the middle of The Drag, west of the huge tree.', 4761, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grumble, grumble...', '', 4760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready!', 'I am ready!', 4759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be alert, you lazy mules!', '', 4758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A defender has fallen!', '', 4757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Cyrus\'s eyes glow brightly>$B$BDo I devour you whole or do I allow you to live?$B$BPerhaps you could still be of some use...$B$BChallenge my minion, $r. Survive and return proof of your victory to me.', '', 4756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not possess any proof, Cyrus.', 'I do not possess any proof, Cyrus.', 4755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I present you with proof of my deeds, Cyrus.', 'I present you with proof of my deeds, Cyrus.', 4754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only a fool would dare disturb me in my lair.', '', 4753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here!', '', 4752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s holds the Rune of Escape in front of her.', 4751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it\'s any consolation, I\'ll be leaving the cell door open. How you get out is your problem. Good bye, Kharan. \n', 'If it\'s any consolation, I\'ll be leaving the cell door open. How you get out is your problem. Good bye, Kharan. \n', 4750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She now resides at the side of Emperor Thaurissan. He has her under some sort of powerful thought altering spell... and here I sit, completely helpless.\n', '', 4749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed.', 'Indeed.', 4748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where was I? Oh yes, so we were captured. My elite guardsmen were executed on the spot. They spared me and took the princess away by way of ram. I was taken to the detention halls of the Slag Pit and then transferred to this prison.$B$BI can only assume I am still alive because they wish to extract a ransom for my pitiful life. Or maybe out of cruelty, as a way to let me forever play back the events that transpired in my mind. Regret is the cruelest jailor of all, $r.', '', 4747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue with your story please.', 'Continue with your story please.', 4746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How else could this have happened? Someone must have tipped the Dark Irons off.$B$B<Kharan shakes his fist at you.>$B$BSo help me, if I ever get out of here, I will spend the rest of my days finding the traitor.', '', 4745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 15, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you suspect that someone on the inside was involved? They were tipped off?', 'So you suspect that someone on the inside was involved? They were tipped off?', 4744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As we were making our way across the Burning Steppes, we were ambushed. It must have been a hundred of them... Dark Iron dwarves! They were shifting out of the walls, from the rocks in the Steppes; out of every crevice, nook, and cranny in sight. They swarmed us, overwhelming the guards and the few brave heroes that had agreed to assist us on this mission.$B$BOne thing was clear: This was a highly orchestrated ambush. It was as if they knew every move we would make before we made them...', '', 4743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what happened?', 'So what happened?', 4742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kharan clears his throat.>$B$BWe made our way through the Searing Gorge tunnel and into the ravaged wasteland comprising the gorge. In retrospect, things were eerily quiet. The only dangers we ran across were the wildlife of the region: Creatures that my men easily dispatched.$B$BWe reached Blackrock Mountain with relative ease and made our way through the stonewrought construction without so much as a hiccup.', '', 4741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which would explain why you\'re sitting in a jail cell at the bottom of a mountain, right, dwarf?', 'Which would explain why you\'re sitting in a jail cell at the bottom of a mountain, right, dwarf?', 4740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then listen well, $r.$B$BSeveral months ago, the Magistrate of Lakeshire sent envoys to Ironforge, pleading with the King for assistance with the Blackrock incursions coming from Redridge and the Burning Steppes.$B$BPrincess Moira volunteered to help, against my pleadings. I was assigned twenty elite guardsmen to protect the Princess through the perilous journey from the Loch to Lakeshire.', '', 4739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing. My orders were to speak with you and then speak with Thrall. All I know is that Thrall is interested in saving your princess.\n', 'Nothing. My orders were to speak with you and then speak with Thrall. All I know is that Thrall is interested in saving your princess.\n', 4738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kharan sighs.>$B$BI suppose... I suppose you are right.$B$BGor\'shak told me that your Warchief has big plans. Plans that may change the way the Alliance and Horde interact. What do you know about this?', '', 4737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because you are still alive and my hands aren\'t gripped firmly around your stubby little neck.', 'Because you are still alive and my hands aren\'t gripped firmly around your stubby little neck.', 4736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I look stupid to you, $r? I may as well sign her death warrant myself! Why should I trust you?\n', '', 4735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 26, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is not lost, Kharan!', 'All is not lost, Kharan!', 4734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is lost...', '', 4733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not here to harm you, Kharan. Gor\'shak sent me. He told me that you would speak to me about the Princess.', 'I am not here to harm you, Kharan. Gor\'shak sent me. He told me that you would speak to me about the Princess.', 4732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get it over with you filthy $r.$B$B<Kharan lowers his head, exposing his stubby neck.>', '', 4731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... oops.', 4730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok!  Let\'s get started!', 4729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, darn...', '', 4728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, let\'s take a look at this thing...', '', 4727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s groans.', '', 4726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEY! HEY YOU! $R! Get me out of here!', '', 4725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try and make yourself useful, $r. GET ME OUT OF HERE! The High Interrogator has the key.', '', 4724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Key... get the key... Gerstahn has... key.', '', 4723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure thing, $n. You look like you can be trusted... Trustworthy! I can spot that a mile away...$B$BAnyway, back to what I was sayin\'. Takes one Evoroot plant to make the Videre Elixir. The rest \'a the ingredients are trivial really, but the Evoroot, well, that can be a bit tricky to get.', '', 4722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell me how I can get a Videre Elixir?', 'Can you tell me how I can get a Videre Elixir?', 4721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buy somethin\', will ya?', 'Buy somethin\', will ya?', 4720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw it with me own two eyes!  The biggest Makura ye ever seen, bigger\'n a mountain giant\'s fist it was, clawed its way right up the side of one o\' them twin colossals.  I dunno how yeh plan on gettin\' up there, but the beast\'s sure to have a load of treasure if yeh do.', '', 4719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes never deceive me, $r. I see great power in you - enough power, perhaps, to further our cause. Find me at the top of the tower.', '', 4718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are indeed powerful, $n. Come to me if it is more work that you seek.', 4717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings!', '', 4716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Launch me!', 'Launch me!', 4715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks up at you quizzically. Maybe you should inspect it?', '', 4714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to see what you have to sell.', 'I\'d like to see what you have to sell.', 4713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run for hills! Wait! We already in hills!', '', 4712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n KILL! $G He:She; kill you now! RUN! RUN!', '', 4711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rough times, huh, $n? No matter where you turn someone needs help, and my wife and I are no exception.', '', 4710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHO KILL GOR\'TESH!?!? WHO DO THIS?!', '', 4709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RUN! RUN FOR HILLS!', '', 4708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GOR\'TESH DEAD?!?!', '', 4707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll have to be patient with me, $n. I\'ve got my Spybot inside working on a very delicate matter. I\'ll be with ya in a second.$B$BOh, and do me a favor, try not to let Lescovar see you... we\'re about to ambush him.', '', 4706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, if I only had a tree branch to hold up in front of me. The guards would never see me then.', '', 4705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from there!', 'Get away from there!', 4704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This evil cannot be allowed to enter this world!  Come my children!', '', 4703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reaches out towards Captain Beltis as he falls.', '%s reaches out towards Captain Beltis as she falls.', 4702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s runs for their life!', '', 4701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be hard up to be wandering these Badlands, $c.  Hard up like me.$B$BOr maybe you\'re here because you\'re crazy.  Crazy, like me.', '', 4700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your reign of terror ends now!  Face your doom mortals!', '', 4699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great dangers lie beyond those walls, $n. turn back until you are more seasoned in the ways of combat.\n', '', 4698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ll excuse me, I must take my leave. Good day, ladies.', '', 4697, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, look at the time! I must return to my post... up over there.', '', 4696, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 4695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ewwwww... not if you were the last orc on Kalimdor, Lunk.', 4694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s blushes.', 4693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, soldiers! At ease!', '', 4692, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard the Warlord, maggots! MARCH!', '', 4691, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SIR, YES SIR!', '', 4690, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well hello there ladies. Heard about the new plague?', '', 4689, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, Proudtusk, you may begin your march. Carry on!', '', 4688, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s claps excitedly.', 4687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, how positively delightful!', 4686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, from what I hear, the new plague has ALL of the old plague flavor but none of the old plague calories or carbohydrates!', 4685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cherry pie is my favoritist food in all of Azeroth.', 'Cherry pie is my favoritist food in all of Azeroth.', 4684, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, do tell! The suspense alone is enough to make a girl scream!', 4683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh cherry pie for sale, looks so good it will bring a tear to your eye.', 'Fresh cherry pie for sale, looks so good it will bring a tear to your eye.', 4682, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try some of this cherry pie, it will put a smile on your face, ten miles wide.', 'Try some of this cherry pie, it will put a smile on your face, ten miles wide.', 4681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cherry pie tastes so good, it could make a grown gnome cry.', 'This cherry pie tastes so good, it could make a grown gnome cry.', 4680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, it\'s just terribly, terribly, awful! You will just DIE when you see it, Vivian.', 4679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Having a bad day? Try some cherry pie.', 'Having a bad day? Try some cherry pie.', 4678, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This pie is so good, would you like some?', 'This pie is so good, would you like some?', 4677, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So what\'s this new plague all about?', 4676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nana always said there was no greater thing in the whole world than a warm, toasty slice of fresh, homemeade cherry pie.', 'Nana always said there was no greater thing in the whole world than a warm, toasty slice of fresh, homemeade cherry pie.', 4675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love pie.', 'I love pie.', 4674, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FALL IN, MAGGOTS!', '', 4673, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All present and accounted for, SIR!', '', 4672, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch where you\'re stepping, $c, because I have a polymorph spell with your name on it...', '', 4670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 4669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! Shhhh! Just shut up. Goretooth is coming!', '', 4668, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But...', '', 4667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Gargal. Just no.', '', 4666, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proudtusk!', '', 4665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s seems oblivious to the nearby commentary.', '', 4664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit being such a baby, Razal\'blade. It\'s time to start acting like you\'re part of one of the Warchief\'s elite forces. You don\'t want to end up like Gargal, do you?', '', 4663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrmmm...', '', 4662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amakkar, where do you think Warlord Goretooth is going to send us? I don\'t think I can handle another tour in the Steppes.', '', 4661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, noble $c.  This humble servant of the Cenarion Circle wishes blessings and bounties be given unto you and yours.', 4660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be advised, $g Jackson : Princess;, I am in no mood for any comment that you think is cute or funny. I am here to make sure that the Archdruid\'s research proceeds as planned, and my orders are to weed out all non-hackers who do not pack the gear to serve in my beloved Cenarion Circle.', '', 4659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand prepared! The naga won\'t wait long to press their advantage once they know we\'re alive.', 4658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not a journeyman herbalist -- am I able to still assist you in your work?', 'I\'m not a journeyman herbalist -- am I able to still assist you in your work?', 4657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, but you\'ll find it more rewarding if you have skill in herbalism!  You will be required to nurture and cultivate special seeds -- not to swing an axe blindly or gesticulate wildly at passing shadows.  While the Evergreen Pouch you\'ll receive allows even the simplest brute to grow something, those who show some aptitude will have more bountiful results.', '', 4656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find Fineous Darkvire beyond the Ring of Law, in the Hall of Crafting. Kill the miserable cur and recover Ironfel.$B$BTake Ironfel to the Shrine of Thaurissan and place the hammer in its rightful place: In the hands of the statue erected in my honor.$B$BWhen this is done, the compartment in which I stored the master key will open. More importantly, Ironfel will remain forever in my grasp. Should they make an attempt to remove the hammer; both the statue and hammer will shatter, lost forever.\n', '', 4655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just show me the way, Franclorn.', 'Just show me the way, Franclorn.', 4654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My great hammer, Ironfel, was handed down to the new chief architect, Fineous Darkvire: A man of despicable motive and little talent.$B$BThis is where you come in, $n. I want him stopped. He is too inept to harness the true power of Ironfel, but should one come after him with the aptitude to use Ironfel to its full potential, the destruction they could cause with their creations would be disastrous to this world.\n', '', 4653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating. Please, tell me more.', 'Fascinating. Please, tell me more.', 4652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I stood by and watched the corruption of Ragnaros seep through the hearts and minds of the Dark Iron nation. This once honorable race, driven to madness... to evil.$B$BWhen the construction of the Spire was complete, my will to live amongst my people gave way. I passed as a hero of the new nation of Dark Iron. This tomb was placed here - at the entrance to the city I planned and built - in honor of my efforts.', '', 4651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue please.', 'Continue please.', 4650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had no choice, or so I thought. I would endure the destruction of Thaurissan and stand by the side of my king and his people.$B$BUnder the control of Ragnaros, King Dagran Thaurissan tore out the heart of this mountain and erected Blackrock Spire. We worked tirelessly to build a dwarven city mightier than any city or fortress that came before... or would come after.', '', 4649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing! I\'ve never spoken to a ghost. I wish to learn!', 'Amazing! I\'ve never spoken to a ghost. I wish to learn!', 4648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 4647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r. I am Franclorn Forgewright. Are you here to learn of the Spire and of Dark Iron?', '', 4646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I doing?  Do you lack vision?  I am a dreamer, good $g sir : lady;, and I dream of a better future for us all.  Clearly, I am a visionary.$B$BThere are those, however, who seek to keep us mired in banality.  I told him that I was a dreamer, and Archdruid Staghelm replied, \"Well, the world needs ditch diggers too.\"$B$BUntil such time as the shackles of banality are ripped from us, I will help the Cenarion Circle by shuffling these piles of dirt around.', '', 4645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing out here?', 'What are you doing out here?', 4644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conspiracies abound, I say.  There are those who lack vision in understanding what I do, and would seek to keep me shackled to obscurity!$B$BDon\'t step in the dirt.', '', 4643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bellows a challenging roar!', '', 4642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahoy, $n! Not a pretty picture, is it?$B$BThe Horizon Scout at the bottom of the sea, my crew in shambles, and our cargo and passengers strewn about like so much debris that you\'d think this was one of Stormwind\'s canals after a festival.$B$BAnd that\'s not where the trouble ends...', 4641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Thelsamar, your home away from home in Loch Modan!$B$BThelsamar is a nice place, but it\'s not all beer and salted meat for those who answer the call to duty!  If you\'re willing to face danger in the name of the Alliance, then read the poster outside the Thelsamar branch of the Explorers\' League.', '', 4640, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n.  Welcome to Thelsamar, and while you\'re here don\'t forget to visit our local brewery!', '', 4639, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c.  I hope you\'ve come to bolster our ranks.  Beasts and thieves are spilling into our beloved Elwynn, and we barely have enough men to keep the roads safe!$B$BAnd if you haven\'t done so, read that notice about Hogger.  He\'s a beast in yonder woods that must be dealt with.', '', 4638, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe the officials in Stormwind, sending the bulk of our army abroad... when our home front is under so much pressure!$B$BWith thieves coming from Westfall and gnolls encroaching from the east and west, it\'s a wonder Stormwind itself isn\'t besieged.', '', 4637, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are here to waste my time, then you are wasting the time of the Cenarion Circle as a whole.  For your sake, let us hope that you are not foolish enough to be doing just that.', '', 4636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The earth keeps many secrets, $c; it is our duty to ensure that those that must remain a secret for the good of all stays as such.', '', 4635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my transponder and need another one, Scooty.', 'I lost my transponder and need another one, Scooty.', 4634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course I offer lessons to other Enchanters, provided you are ready.', 'Of course I offer lessons to other Enchanters, provided you are ready.', 4633, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n! I am master engineer, Scooty.', '', 4632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I offer training. But it\'s not cheap.', 'Yes, I offer training. But it\'s not cheap.', 4631, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in peace there is still war, and many clans still fight beneath the banner of the Warchief. Are you here to add your clan to those that fight for Orgrimmar?', 'Even in peace there is still war, and many clans still fight beneath the banner of the Warchief. Are you here to add your clan to those that fight for Orgrimmar?', 4630, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in peace there is still war, and many clans still fight beneath the banner of the Warchief. Are you here to add your clan to those that fight for Orgrimmar?', 'Even in peace there is still war, and many clans still fight beneath the banner of the Warchief. Are you here to add your clan to those that fight for Orgrimmar?', 4629, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know how to speak kitty, and Effsee said thank you.', 4628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meow!', '', 4627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what you want, and make it quick.', 'Tell me what you want, and make it quick.', 4626, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Present the trinkets, Maltrake.', 'Present the trinkets, Maltrake.', 4625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live only to serve the master.', '', 4624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what you want, and make it quick.', 'Tell me what you want, and make it quick.', 4623, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many years of battle and slavery, it feels good to have a home again. ', 'So many years of battle and slavery, it feels good to have a home again. ', 4622, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you rather trust your goods with a goblin?', 'Would you rather trust your goods with a goblin?', 4621, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again for helping Nida, $g mister : miss;!  When I grow up, I wanna be a hero just like you!', '', 4620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guarantee this bank\'s security with my own blood, is that good enough for you?', 'I guarantee this bank\'s security with my own blood, is that good enough for you?', 4619, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there $g mister : ma\'am;... do you have a little time that you could help us out?  Please?', '', 4618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Besides the Grunts outside, my brothers and I fought at the battle of Hyjal. Any who seek to steal from the bank must face us first.', 'Besides the Grunts outside, my brothers and I fought at the battle of Hyjal. Any who seek to steal from the bank must face us first.', 4617, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you $g mister : miss; for finding my necklace!  You\'re the best!', 4616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think my necklace fell in the lake.  My daddy got it for me, and he\'s gonna be mad now.', 4615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, hello!  If you are here about fee collection and/or a summons, then you must have me mistaken for someone else.  Terribly sorry!', '', 4614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it! That\'s what you were waiting for! KILL THEM!', 'That\'s it! That\'s what you were waiting for! KILL THEM!', 4613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did a great job, Spybot! Glad to have you back here with me!', 'You did a great job, Spybot! Glad to have you back here with me!', 4612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course I will help!', 'Of course I will help!', 4611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need adventurers to assist us, $n. Will you help?', 4610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unbelievable! How dare they??', 'Unbelievable! How dare they??', 4609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Recently, the Dark Irons have been seen on the surface world with greater regularity. Fortresses have been built in the Badlands. Massive exploratory forces have been sent into the depths of Uldaman in search of ancient lore. They have even invaded our own homeland, striking at our dam near the loch.', 4608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting, continue please.', 'Interesting, continue please.', 4607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not know.$B$BThe Dark Irons that did survive made their way into the mountain and began rebuilding their city.$B$BFrom the ashes of Thaurissan then rose Blackrock Spire and the new Dark Iron nation. Additional fortifications were made within the Searing Gorge, in the area known as the Cauldron.$B$BStories of an ancient evil that controlled the kingdom of Dark Irons began to circulate. ', 4606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is tragic. How did this happen?', 'That is tragic. How did this happen?', 4605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hundreds of years ago, the great city of Thaurissan stood proudly in a lush expanse of land that is now the dilapidated Burning Steppes.$B$BThaurissan was home to the nation of Dark Iron dwarves and at the time, in the midst of a civil war among the dwarven nation at large.$B$BYou see, that area of the world was at one point in time part of the Redridge Mountains - until the day that Thaurissan was consumed by a gigantic explosion. The city lay in ruin, the surrounding areas reduced to an ashy wasteland.\n', 4604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Historian Archesonus.', 'I am ready, Historian Archesonus.', 4603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Notify me when you are ready to listen to the story.', 4602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n. Have you come to learn of the history of Ironforge?', 4601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defiler... you will be punished for this incursion. <A symbol of flame radiates from the relic before it crumbles to the earth.>', '', 4600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your existence is acknowledged. <The relic turns to dust. Your head throbs with newfound wisdom. Something evil lurks in the heart of the mountain.>', '', 4599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He cannot be defeated. <The relic burns to nothing. The memories it held are now your own. This city was destroyed by a being not of this world.>', '', 4598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help us, outsider. <The relic crumbles to dust. A vision of eight Dark Iron dwarves performing some sort of ritual fills your head.>', '', 4597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not taint these ruins, mortal. <You are engulfed in a blinding flash of light. A creature composed entirely of flame is the only thing you can remember seeing.>', '', 4596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will perish here. <Your mind fills with visions of chaos and destruction.>', '', 4595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this place. <The relic emits a white hot arc of flame. A memory has been gained: A lone Dark Iron dwarf is surrounded by seven corpses, kneeling before a monolith of flame.>', '', 4594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By your command!', 'By your command!', 4593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to face the Defiler.', 'I wish to face the Defiler.', 4592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am bound eternally to this cursed world. What is it you desire, mortal?', '', 4591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', 'Thank you.', 4590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.', 'The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate.', 4584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards!', 'Guards!', 4583, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pleasure, $n. What can I do for you?', '', 4582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Even if you do not follow the path of the warlock, you would do well to remember that.', 'The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Even if you do not follow the path of the warlock, you would do well to remember that.', 4581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain, here they come! The naga are coming!', 'Captain, here they come! The naga are coming!', 4580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skills in alchemy aren\'t yet high enough to benefit from my teachings.  Perhaps if you speak with me later...', '', 4579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your talents in cooking are a little too low.  Maybe with some practice I can teach you what I know.', '', 4578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, little $r!', '', 4577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will need to open the Felhound Tracker Kit and read the instruction manual. Summon the beast when you are near the peninsula of cliff giants, south of here.', '', 4576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank again, $n.  Now I\'ll just wait here until it\'s safe to leave.', '', 4575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Druids are very sensitive to the plight of all creatures of the world. When it was found that these birds were in danger, we set up a system of rescuing them from the corruption of Feralas.$B$BA gnome named Curgle Cranklehop leads the affair; she collects the eggs and has them sent here, where I care for them.$B$BWe could always use more help for our cause, $n. Maybe you should head over to Gadgetzan and look for Curgle.', '', 4574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about these hippogryphs.', 'Tell me more about these hippogryphs.', 4573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n. I train and care for young hippogryphs here; feel free to have a look around.', '', 4572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s growls.', '', 4571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s searches for a source of arcane energy.', '', 4570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders! Attack the intruders!', 'Intruders! Attack the intruders!', 4569, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards!', 'Guards!', 4568, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes.  Give me the spell to summon the avatar.', 'Yes.  Give me the spell to summon the avatar.', 4567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! Help me!', 'Guards! Help me!', 4566, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.  Though time and drink have dulled my outer senses, my inner eyes remain strong.', '', 4565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sentinels, come to my defense!', 'Sentinels, come to my defense!', 4564, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through my studies, I see that defeating the god Hakkar\'s avatar has weakened him.  But the bulk of his strength remains, lurking at the far end of the Nether.$B$BYou have defeated his avatar once, $n.  Perhaps if you defeat it again you can further weaken the god so that, one day, we might face his true self.$B$BI have prepared a spell that you may use to again summon an avatar of Hakkar within the Sanctum of the Fallen God.  Do you want to confront it once again?', '', 4563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sentinels, come to my defense!', 'Sentinels, come to my defense!', 4562, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards!', 'Guards!', 4561, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not defile our sacred land!', 'You will not defile our sacred land!', 4560, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guardians! Defend Sen\'jin!', 'Guardians! Defend Sen\'jin!', 4559, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grunts! Attack!', 'Grunts! Attack!', 4558, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me break down a little math for you: \"goblin\" plus \"engineering\" equals KNOW HOW, baby.  Anyone who tells you otherwise simply doesn\'t know how to add.', '', 4557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Tinkmaster Overspark, and I am the chief architect for modern gnomish engineering principles in the world today.  It is my job to ensure that the power of invention continues to shine brightest from our arclight spanners than anywhere else!$B$BAlso, if you happen to know a good schematic for radiation elimination, we just so happen to be in the market for one right about now...', '', 4556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, if it isn\'t $n!  It\'s good to see you again; I cannot express my gratitude enough at the help that you\'ve given me and my invention work to date.$B$BWhat can I do for you today?', '', 4555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there $glad:lass;... the name\'s Oglethorpe and I may be responsible for one of the amazing gnomish devices you might possess!  If it blew up, then it wasn\'t me; if it made you rich though, we can discuss royalties!$B$BOh, and if you\'re from Gnomeregan, you can just take two ninety degree angles, smash them together, and start marching.  I have nothing to say to you.', '', 4554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Access secret gnome engineering schemata!', 'Access secret gnome engineering schemata!', 4553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings!  If you are here to access gnome engineering schemata, then you are welcome to do so.  Our scanners report you are a certified gnomish engineer!', '', 4552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Access secret goblin engineering schemata!', 'Access secret goblin engineering schemata!', 4551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings!  If you are here to access goblin engineering schemata, please know we only interface with certified goblin engineers.', '', 4550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares summon me?', '', 4549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to carefully mix this - oops! ...Well, I spilled a little, but it\'s ready!', '', 4548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins casting a counterspell...', 4547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE, MORTALS!', '', 4546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I AM HERE!', '', 4545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOO!!', '', 4544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I DRAW CLOSER TO THIS WORLD!', '', 4543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fel weapon is ready, $n.', '', 4542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s seems to no longer be able to cast spells. The Felcurse is working!', '', 4541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s is substantially more susceptible to your attacks. The Felcurse is working!', 4540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is noticeably weakened. The Felcurse is working!', '', 4539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well yes, I do know a rare alchemical recipe.  Let me teach you!', '', 4538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re an alchemist?  So am I.  Perhaps you can teach me what you know...', 'You\'re an alchemist?  So am I.  Perhaps you can teach me what you know...', 4537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm... yes, I do have a recipe you might find useful.  Let me teach you!', '', 4536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can cook?  So can I!  Is there a recipe you can teach me?', 'You can cook?  So can I!  Is there a recipe you can teach me?', 4535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me!$B$BI\'m a cook and an alchemist from Stormwind.  I was here looking for local herbs and recipes for my uncle Angus when these quilboar captured me.  If you hadn\'t come around, I\'m sure I\'d have ended up in their stew pot!', '', 4534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wha... what\'s happening?', 4533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop!  Infidels!', 4532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No!  You must not do this!', 4531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must not summon our god!', 4530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No!  We cannot allow you to summon Hakkar!', 4529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will someone please give my little kitten a good home?', '', 4528, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does allergic mean anyway? And what does it have to do with either of my kitties?', '', 4527, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kitten for sale, looking for a good home.', '', 4526, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe dad won\'t let me keep your sister.', '', 4525, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can anyone give my adorable, extra little kitty a home?', '', 4524, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, I\'ll find a good home for ya.', '', 4523, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! Job\'s done.', '', 4522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raze follow $n! Raze SMASH poachers! SMASH SMASH SMASH! Tell Raze to SMASH by playing with stick! SMASH! ', '', 4521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, now that you mention it, yeah, I did see something I thought was a little strange yesterday afternoon!$B$BI was running past some old troll ruins southeast of here; well, I wasn\'t really running, more like hopping... The sand\'s so hot!$B$BAnyway, so I was hopping past the ruins, when I noticed a camp set up there. Seems like a funny place to set up camp, if you ask me... I would have poked around a little more but one of those crazy big vultures chased me off.', '', 4520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you help me get down?', 'Can you help me get down?', 4519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To get down safely, I provide wings to those in need. ', '', 4518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The land of Feralas has been through much, $r. The earth, the trees, the creatures; they are all changing what Feralas is and will be.$B$BThe Twin Colossals above us remain as a constant, though, throughout all that has happened here...', 4517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is VERY HUNGRY!', '', 4516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is getting really hungry!', '', 4515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feralas - Screecher Spirit - On Quest Default Greeting', '', 4514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This spirit hovers over its fallen body.  Its ghostly eyes pierce through you as it gazes beyond...', '', 4512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, I know, I\'m out here in the middle of nowhere!$B$BMy home is actually in Ratchet, but after crashing my zeppelin here, I thought I might as well start the research I came here to do!', '', 4511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here for training.', 'I am here for training.', 4510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('What brings you to the Cenarion Circle, $n?', 'What brings you to the Cenarion Circle, $n?', 4509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lashes at your collection phial. The green glow encases you. You don\'t look so hot, pal.', '', 4508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it -- we made it!  The ritual is set in motion, and idol fires are about to go out for good!  You truly are the heroes I thought you would be!', '', 4507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One more minute!  Hold on now, the ritual is about to take hold!', '', 4506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just two minutes to go!  We\'re half way there, but don\'t let your guard down!', '', 4505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three minutes left -- I can feel the energy starting to build!  Keep up the solid defense!', '', 4504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DUMMY SPELL TEST MESSAGE', 'DUMMY SPELL TEST MESSAGE', 4503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares?! I will destroy you!', 'Who dares?! I will destroy you!', 4502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, here we go.  It\'s going to take about five minutes to shut this thing down through the ritual.  Once I start, keep the vermin off of me or it will be the end of us all!', '', 4501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done it, $n! <The strangely familiar voice seems to be coming from the phial!> Hurry back! The fallout will only remain stable for thirty minutes.', '', 4500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n. I see you\'ve come from Orgrimmar to aid us. I\'m glad. I want to be out of this forsaken forest as quickly as possible. I\'d much rather be spending my time in Orgrimmar with a good ale.$B$BAlthough I cannot wait to hear how Belgrom talked you into coming out here.', 4499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am not here because of honor, $n. I am here because of one orc\'s pride.$B$BIf I had not rejected Belgrom\'s offers, then I\'m sure I\'d still be in Orgrimmar taking care of real business.$B$BHis desire for women is not unknown to many of the female warriors in Durotar, but that doesn\'t stop him from being his charming self.$B$BHe\'s lucky he didn\'t pursue his desire for me much longer though--he\'d be short more than just the digits on his hands.', 4498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Belgrom sent us here from Orgrimmar to aid him in an unwise Alliance, but if his gamble pays off, then it will be to the great benefit of all the Horde.$B$BToo many orcs have already perished because of his desire to please women, but he still commands us, and our honor dictates we make the best of this situation.', '', 4497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The days we\'ve spent here in Azshara are not among our best and most glorious, but we are still young and blood still courses through our veins--we shall find victory here. It is only a matter of time.', '', 4496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dare! Now feel my wrath!', 4495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, stay close.  These fiends will jump right out of the shadows at you if you let your guard down.', '', 4493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Now your death is ensured!', 'Ha! Now your death is ensured!', 4492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mistress!! They seek to destroy your work!!', 'Mistress!! They seek to destroy your work!!', 4491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shield be down! Rise up Atal\'ai! Rise up!', '', 4490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s staggers.', '', 4489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting, interesting... I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns, $n. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found.$B$BNow, I must get back to work!', '', 4486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My banishment is ended! Let the blood flow!', '', 4485, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders! Attack the intruders!', 'Intruders! Attack the intruders!', 4484, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to summon wraiths out of the freezing cold air!', '', 4483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck. Sorry I can\'t take you with me!', '', 4482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have given you an oathstone of Ysera\'s Dragonflight, $n.  When you are ready and able to aid us, use it, and then we may begin.', '', 4481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will consider what you have told me.', 'I will consider what you have told me.', 4480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fact that you are here is a first step... a correct choice if you will, in aiding Ysera\'s Dragonflight.$B$BYou may be here for purely the lure of personal gain, or you may be here because you are morally compelled.  Neither reason is important on its own, but both are in fact critical to this end: The agony that Eranikus endures is what rousted me from my Dream, and it is now my charge to see his torment ended.  I now ask you to aid me in this quest.\n', '', 4479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I possess part of Eranikus\' essence.  What do you want with it... or with me?', 'I possess part of Eranikus\' essence.  What do you want with it... or with me?', 4478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The god that the Atal\'ai trolls had brought forth is to blame for this.  We destroyed the god\'s physical manifestation and sunk the temple, but the god was much stronger than even we had anticipated.  Its seed of corruption ran deep, twisting everything in its path.$B$BEranikus was charged to watch over the sunken temple to ensure that neither the simple Atal\'ai nor their god would rise again.  He was an unwitting victim of this corruption, and we in underestimating its potency.', '', 4477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to him in the first place?  When I... encountered him, he was rather malicious.', 'What happened to him in the first place?  When I... encountered him, he was rather malicious.', 4476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know I do, mortal; I am abandoning a fair number of pretenses here, and I recommend you do the same.$B$BYou have come here clearly because you know that what you possess, garnered from your actions within the Sunken Temple of the Atal\'al, has brought you to me for a purpose.  This purpose is to put my associate... my brother, to rest.  He is trapped within a nightmare within the Dream itself.  He cannot break free alone.', '', 4475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know someone... or something, rather, by the name of Eranikus?', 'Do you know someone... or something, rather, by the name of Eranikus?', 4474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 4473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are quite inquisitive, though such inquisitiveness belies a general lack of understanding.  I say this because were you to have a definite purpose in being here, the question you ask would seem pointless. $B$BWith that, I bid you good day.', '', 4472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s an elf like you doing inside a cave like this?', 'What\'s an elf like you doing inside a cave like this?', 4471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know who you are, $n.  Fate and forces beyond that have brought you to me for a reason, and it is one I take no pleasure in being a part of.  There are many decisions you will make in the coming times, and I hope you are wise enough to make the correct ones.$B$BBelieve me, $r, when I tell you this - there are correct choices.', '', 4470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $Gsir:miss;. I am Master Xylem\'s apprentice Nyrill. If you have any concerns, please feel free to bring them up with the master.$B$BI will be here to serve you when you\'re ready to return down to the base of the mountain.', '', 4469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away, master!', '', 4468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The statues all move back into their original positions.$B$BThe sequence must be started again now, from the beginning.\n', 'The statues all move back into their original positions.$B$BThe sequence must be started again now, from the beginning.\n', 4467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reset all of the statues in this room.', 'Reset all of the statues in this room.', 4466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legion of Blackrock comes, dwarflings! We shall scorch the earth and set fire to the heavens. None shall survive...', '', 4465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to flap his massive wings faster. He is preparing for flight.', '', 4464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yes, the molt - do not lose it. There are those of my kin in the Burning Steppes that would craft items that only the molt of the black Dragonflight could fortify.', '', 4463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I leave you now, mortals. Alive and with these trinkets. Maltrake! Present them with the trinkets!', '', 4462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will live, if only to see the fruits of their labor: the destruction and chaos that will surely ensue as the legion of Blackrock invade the gorge.', '', 4461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SILENCE FOOL!', '', 4460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will we do with them, master? They are of no use to us anymore.', '', 4459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets loose a reptilian laugh... at least you think it\'s a laugh.', '', 4458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would not have helped the legion of Blackrock had we just asked for your assistance, now would you?', '', 4457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glorious, indeed, Maltrake. It looks as if my plan worked perfectly. Wouldn\'t you say so, mortal?', '', 4456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 300, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give unto you cordial salutations, $r.  You\'ve come far off the beaten path merely to speak to someone dwelling inside a cave.  I trust there is a reason for your strange, yet not unforeseen visit here.  Yes?', '', 4455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s engulfs the sentry tower. The tower is ablaze!', '', 4454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is released and now bound to you, $n.', '', 4453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conjure the Torch of Retribution, Kalaran.', 'Conjure the Torch of Retribution, Kalaran.', 4452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, $n, wait a minute! There\'s one more thing! Come back!', '', 4451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done...', '', 4450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s falls to one knee. He looks exhausted.', '', 4449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be patient, $n. The torch is almost complete.', '', 4448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s chants in an unknown tongue.', '', 4447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Superb! Because of your help, my people stand a chance of re-taking our beloved city. Three cheers to you!', 4446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My charge to watch the temple has failed... my corrupted soul knows no peace...', '', 4445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will the nightmare ever end?!  I cannot force myself awake!', '', 4444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It hurts so much... Itharius, my old friend... please help me...', '', 4443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soul is not a trinket!  Mortal, you must release me from these chains!', '', 4442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are an agent of their wicked god, fool.  I will see you destroyed!', '', 4441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortal, I will rend your soul in two once I am released!', '', 4440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torture me no more!  Release me, mortal!  The Swamp of Sorrows... mortal... please...', '', 4439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes!  It burns... it burns...', '', 4438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon, the Scourge will rule the world!', '', 4437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will spread across this barren land!', '', 4436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will enslave the quilboar!', '', 4435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me confer with my colleagues.', 'Let me confer with my colleagues.', 4434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you can see, I am but one man with a lumbering oaf of a squire. The might of the Dark Iron dwarves and the beasts held in the grip of Ragnaros would surely overwhelm me alone, but I have the utmost confidence that such a brave and ambitious adventurer such as you would have no problem handling the denizens of the cauldron. Should you choose to assist me, I shall reward you with riches and wealth beyond your wildest dreams.', '', 4433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue please.', 'Continue please.', 4432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father was slain by the filth that inhabits the cauldron. My pleas for assistance to the Stormwind magistrate fell on deaf ears. Nay, they want not to admit that this part of the world even exists, let alone send their precious military in to administer justice.$B$BI seek vengeance, $r, plain and simple. Is there a more passionate cause in this world?', '', 4431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what drives this vengeance?', 'Tell me what drives this vengeance?', 4430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vengeance shall be mine.', '', 4429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a berserker rage!', '%s goes into a berserker rage!', 4428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The statues are all in place, and you may begin the puzzle.', 'The statues are all in place, and you may begin the puzzle.', 4427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One bright light appears accross the room, then disppears. Then you notice another beam... and then another.$B$BThey seem to be showing you a pattern.', 'One bright light appears accross the room, then disppears. Then you notice another beam... and then another.$B$BThey seem to be showing you a pattern.', 4426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab your things, $n! I\'ve just gotten word from Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge that the Undermarket has set up operations in the heart of the Cauldron. Find Nilith Lokrav in the Searing Gorge and get the low down!', '', 4425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares.', 'I wish to browse your wares.', 4424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If tailoring is your thing, Vizzklick will most definitely have your supplies. Take a look around, $n, and let me know if you wish to purchase something!', '', 4423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All they be doin\' is a little huntin\' and gatherin\'. Where\'s the harm in that??', '', 4422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'ll be a new trade risin\' up round your carcass, $n. We\'ll call it \'flesh-craftin.\'', '', 4421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Existing in this area are many creatures considered allies of the night elves. The elves have had access to the power within each of these creatures; it is time that the horde be allowed this same satisfaction. I have devised a way that this power can be captured and used for our benefit.$B$BDo not doubt what I tell you, $n. Help me, and you shall see that I speak truth.', '', 4420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about muisek.', 'Tell me more about muisek.', 4419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to begin the statue puzzle.', 'I want to begin the statue puzzle.', 4418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could the altar and the statues be related?', 'How could the altar and the statues be related?', 4417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ancient Altar of Hakkar stands silently near the entrance to the room.$B$BLooking to the balconies above it, you notice a large serpent-like statue rests on each. The statues look very much like the ones on the altar before you. They must be related in some way...', 'The ancient Altar of Hakkar stands silently near the entrance to the room.$B$BLooking to the balconies above it, you notice a large serpent-like statue rests on each. The statues look very much like the ones on the altar before you. They must be related in some way...', 4416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bye, bye, tiny little $r. Raze go now.', '', 4415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use this Staff of Command on Raze when you are near Shadowsilk Poachers and he will make them rue the day they decided to poach in these lands.', 4414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raze need go home now. Bye, bye, $r.', '', 4413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me think about it, Zamael.', 'Let me think about it, Zamael.', 4412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Etched into a tablet of pure gold was the embodiment of my remorse, shame, regret, and sorrow. Unfortunately, the Twilight\'s Hammer found the tablet and branded me a blasphemer. I was summarily executed, my prayer to Elune incomplete. I am now bound to this world as a spirit, unable to transcend to the Nether; held in this cage as a warning to all that would betray the faith of the Twilight\'s Hammer.\n', '', 4411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please continue, Zamael.', 'Please continue, Zamael.', 4410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a young night elf in Darkshore, I crossed paths with a group of unsavory individuals known as the Twilight\'s Hammer. A group of them befriended me and shamefully, I ended up eschewing my faith in Elune and embracing the vitriol of the Twilight\'s Hammer.$B$BIt was not until a vision came to me from Elune, that I woke up from the malaise that I had fallen into as a follower of the old gods.$B$BIn repentance, I began work on my prayer to Elune. ', '', 4409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to hear your tale.', 'I wish to hear your tale.', 4408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise Elune! It has been many years since I have had visitors.', '', 4407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Been waitin\' for ya, $n. Glad to see you\'ve come through. Do you have the shipment?', '', 4406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salutations, Astarii. I require training.', 'Salutations, Astarii. I require training.', 4405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n. May Elune\'s wisdom guide your hand and heart. How may I help you today?', 4404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! Help me!', 'Guards! Help me!', 4403, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns,$n. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found.', 4402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Touch the Suntara stone and call forth Lathoric the Black and his guardian, Obsidion.', 'Touch the Suntara stone and call forth Lathoric the Black and his guardian, Obsidion.', 4401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The altar seems to beckon to you as if it were alive.', '', 4400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s laughter trails off...', '', 4399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And ultimately, it was Ragnaros that named me when I was reborn as an acolyte of fire: Lathoric... Lathoric the Black.', '', 4398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was the will of Ragnaros that Obsidion be built. Obsidion will destroy the Blackrock orcs of Blackrock Spire, uniting us with our brethren in the fiery depths.', '', 4397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I stumbled upon the Suntara stones at the Grimesilt Digsite, the power of Ragnaros surged through my being. It was Ragnaros that gave me a purpose.', '', 4396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How easy it was to manipulate you into recovering the last Suntara stone from those imbeciles of the Twilight\'s Hammer.', '', 4395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools, I knew that if I played upon my brother\'s feeble emotions, he would send \'rescuers.\'', '', 4394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bravo! Bravo! Good show. What? You thought I was dead?', '', 4393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Obsidion rise and serve your master!', '', 4392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your task is complete. Prepare to meet your doom.', '', 4391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have returned to finish the job? <Lathoric laughs.> Obsidion rise and annihilate them!', '', 4390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve come further than many, $n. Respect the elements around you and you shall fare far greater than most.', 4385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Glowing Shard.', 'Tell me about the Glowing Shard.', 4384, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent, fresh blood has arrived.', 4383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will make a fitting sacrifice to Ragnaros.', 4382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dare interrupt our prayer? Execute them!', 4381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Infidels!', 4380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been here long enough, $n. I\'m sure we\'ll meet again. Good luck!', '', 4379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooooo hot hot hot!  If that won\'t put spring in your step, I don\'t know what will!', '', 4378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nothing like some scalding mornbrew on a chilly Dun Morogh day to get things started right!', '', 4377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sell the finest cloth and leather garb this side of the valley!', '', 4376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, it\'s a cold one today, but ne\'er too cold to offer you my fine wares!', '', 4375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the pipe, 5 by 5!', '', 4374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GOOOOOOOAAAAAAAALLLLLLLLLLL!', '', 4373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swish!  We are on fire today boys.', '', 4372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He puts the rock into the hole!', '', 4371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
