('The Matrix Punchograph Technologic Huerist-o-meter has detected your aptitude in engineering.  You may now choose from the following option(s):\n\n01000111 01101111 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100001 00100001', '', 4009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
