('Brzzzzt!$B$BWelcome to Matrix Punchograph 3005 stroke A, a security level alpha terminal.$B$BYou must possess a white punch card to access terminal functions.\n\n01000100 01101111 01110111 01101110 00100000 01110111 01101001 01110100 01101000 00100000 01110100 01101000 01100101 00100000 01101000 01101111 01110010 01100100 01100101 00100001', '', 3989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c!  Welcome to the Cathedral of Light!', '', 3988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t train smiths with no skill, come back when you have something decent to show me.', 3987, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see potential in you $n. Now grab a hammer and some of those scraps, you need a lot of practice.', 3986, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes? I have a breastplate to finish so this had better be good.', 3985, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How are your travels, $n? $g Sumi and Tumi missed you, you should say hi after your lesson : I have heard tales of your adventures, sounds like you have been busy;. Now let\'s see what you\'ve learned while you were away.', 3984, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it? Can\'t you see I\'m busy?', '', 3983, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it? Can\'t you see I\'m busy?', '', 3982, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to learn more, $n? Come over here and show me you are ready.', '', 3981, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good steel $n. Grab a hammer and come over here, let me show you the secret to forging a legendary weapon.', '', 3980, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back to the Great Forge, $n. Ye come to visit an old Dwarf or do ye think yer ready for the next step in yer training?', '', 3979, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! How have ye been $g lad : lass;? Show me what ye\'ve learned since I saw ye last, we\'ll see if there\'s anything new I can teach ye.', '', 3964, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are good blades you make, $n. Cut a stone and still sharp enough to slit a throat. I have seen better though, an orc named Kelgrum Bloodaxe makes them, go and learn all he can teach you.', '', 3963, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to the Orc city of Orgrimmar, find him in the Valley of Honor at a shop called the Arms of Legend.', '', 3962, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want to be a smith? Want to forge blades to gut your foe? Hammers to crush his skull? Aye I can help, and gladly too if there is blood to be shed from it.', '', 3961, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is the edge of your steel? Good enough to cut through the belly of your enemy? Let me show you some things to make it even sharper.', '', 3960, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Armor like the kind you make could stop even the sharpest axe. I\'m impressed $n, that doesn\'t happen often. Seek out an Orc named Shayis Steelfury, she makes the best armor outside of that cursed Dwarven stronghold.', '', 3959, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to Orgrimmar, you will find her and her brood in the Valley of Honor.', '', 3958, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is a fine weapon indeed $n. You guide the spirits like few I have ever known. Listen to them and they will guide you as you have guided them. Go, seek out the Orc known as Kelgruk Bloodaxe. He does not speak with the spirits but he does listen, and his weapons are the finest I have ever laid my eyes upon.', '', 3957, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make the journey to Orgrimmar and seek him out in the Valley of Honor. He works in a shop called the Arms of Legend.', '', 3956, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have the look of a $g man : woman; who seeks knowledge. Perhaps you seek the teachings of the forge, and the hammer. Perhaps I can guide you down that path. But only once you have accepted the spirits, and listened to their calling.', '', 3955, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything has a spirit, if you learn to listen to it you can get it to take any shape you want. Blacksmithing isn\'t about beating metal, forcing it to do your will. It\'s about listening to the spirit within the steel and guiding it to the shape you know it wants to take.', '', 3954, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh....', '', 3953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You guide the spirits in the steel to protect and defend with far more skill than I ever could. The student has surpassed the teacher and now I must send you to where your education may continue. $n, you must seek out Shayis Steelfury in Orgrimmar. She is the finest Armorsmith I have ever known, and she can teach you much.', '', 3952, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Travel to Orgrimmar, to the Valley of Honor. There she lives with her husband and two daughters. All of them are smiths of great skill, but the spirits tell me that she will best guide your learning.', '', 3951, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alarm-a-bomb unit 2600 has failed. Self-destruct override [ACTIVE]. Cooldown [ACTIVE].', '', 3950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anti-escape countermeasures activated. Self-destruct in t-minus 20 seconds....', '', 3949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see the exit! Hurry, hurry!', '', 3948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good blades, solid axes. I have nothing left to teach you in the making of weapons $n. Take your pride and courage before Kelgruk Bloodaxe, he will forge them into the skills you will need.', '', 3947, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is he? Go next door, to the Arms of Legend. He forges special weapons for great heroes there. Honor him and he may show you how to make the stuff of legends.', '', 3946, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it you seek at my forge? Is it training? Do you perhaps seek the secrets of steel? The mysteries of the forge? Speak up Grunt!', '', 3945, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my forge, Blacksmith. Let me share with you a little secret. No one, no one in the world can you trust. Not men, not women, not beasts ... this you can trust, Steel.', '', 3944, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your steel is strong, your skill stronger. Take your steel and your strength to my mate Shayis Steelfury, her skill with armor crafting is unmatched even by me.', '', 3943, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you blind youngling? Shayis is standing right outside.', '', 3942, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Borgus used to work at the Great Forge but I hear he moved down to Stormwind when they finished rebuilding. Rumor holds that he started a shop in the Dwarven District with a man named Kathrum Axehand.', '', 3941, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well now, I haven\'t seen blades this fine since I left Lordaron with Proudmore and her people. I can\'t teach ye much more it seems, but if ye were to find Borgus Steelhand I bet he could show ye some things. Finest weaponsmith I ever met.', '', 3940, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to the Great Forge at the very center of Ironforge. He works there, alongside the other Masters of our kind.', '', 3939, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s a piece of steel worth wearing. Form and function lad/lass, I am impressed. Only ever seen it\'s match once, a Master in the Great Forge named Grumnus Steelshaper. I bet he has learned a few things since then, could probably teach some to ye.', '', 3938, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just can\'t seem to get comfortable without a sturdy ceiling of granite over my head. All these stars up there, enough to give ye the shivers.', '', 3937, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Defias shall succeed! No meek adventurer will stop us!', '', 3936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t see many Blacksmiths this far from Ironforge. What can I do for ye?', '', 3935, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! How dare you!', '', 3934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We didn\'t hide this stuff just you could steal it!', 'We didn\'t hide this stuff just you could steal it!', 3933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s our treasure, you lubber!', 'That\'s our treasure, you lubber!', 3932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!  Get away from our treasure!', 'Hey!  Get away from our treasure!', 3931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s waves goodbye to everyone.', '', 3930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for rescuing me! Word of your deed will not go unnoticed.', '', 3929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cheers!', '', 3928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Self-destruct sequence activated.', '', 3927, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s activates!', '', 3926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get to work, you lubbers!', '', 3925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Gordunni are a large ogre tribe that has control over considerable portions of forests in Feralas. Their dark magic seeps into the elements around them, damaging both the environment and the creatures that inhabit it.$B$BIf you do decide to travel to Feralas, please be mindful of these ogres -- they are quite nasty and many are able to wield powerful dark magic. ', 3924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please tell me more about the Gordunni ogres.', 'Please tell me more about the Gordunni ogres.', 3923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so glad yer back, Shay. Please, don\'t ever run off like that again! What would I tell yer parents if I lost ya?', '', 3922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t forget to get my bell out of the chest here. And remember, if do happen to wander off, just ring it and I\'ll find you again.', 3921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings $c, I am the leatherworking trainer for Thunder Bluff.  What may I assist you with?', 3920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
