('CLUCK! Sensors detect spatial anomaly--danger imminent! CLUCK!', '', 3822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CLUCK! Sensors detect spatial anomaly--danger imminent! CLUCK!', '', 3821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flight systems online! CLUCK! Engaging rockets for transport to Booty Bay!', '', 3820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emergency power activated! Initializing ambulatory motor! CLUCK!', '', 3819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You find it, you keep it! Don\'t tell no one that Rin\'ji talked to you!', '', 3818, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rin\'ji will tell you secret now... $n should go to the Overlook Cliffs. Rin\'ji hid something on island there.', '', 3817, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flight systems online! CLUCK! Engaging rockets for transport to Booty Bay!', '', 3816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In a place called Feralas to the west of here, the hippogryphs, long-time companions of the night elves, are in danger.$B$BI need you to rescue an egg from the ruins of Isildien, to the south, there. The Super Egg-O-Matic can analyze any egg brought to it and judge if it is likely to hatch. I then send the eggs along to the druids, safe from the Gordunni ogres\' dark magics.$B$BPlease know, $n, some of the rescued eggs are bad eggs, and will never hatch.', 3815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please tell me more about the hippogryphs.', 'Please tell me more about the hippogryphs.', 3814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there! I have a proposition for an adventure-seeker such as you, if you are up to the challenge!$B$BAlong with my invention, the Super Egg-O-Matic, I am hard at work aiding the druids with their campaign to save the hippogryphs. The birds are being affected by the evil effects of the Gordunni ogres inhabiting the ruins of Feralas, and their numbers are dwindling.$B$BI collect many different types of eggs.  Will you help and find some for me?', 3813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one challenges the Wastewander nomads -- not even robotic chickens!  ATTACK!', 'No one challenges the Wastewander nomads -- not even robotic chickens!  ATTACK!', 3812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m out of here!', '', 3811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul\'Farrak - Sergeant Bly - Greeting default.', '', 3810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Bly!  Bilgewizzle wants his divino-matic rod back!', 'Hey Bly!  Bilgewizzle wants his divino-matic rod back!', 3809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks a lot, $n.  We couldn\'t have made it without you.  Oh, and if I had mentioned before something about repaying you for saving us, well... you can forget it!', '', 3808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t have time to talk!  We have to think about those trolls!', '', 3807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!  My band and I have been captured by trolls, and they\'re going to sacrifice us!$B$BGet us out of here and I\'ll give you anything you want.', '', 3806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you blow up that door now?', 'Will you blow up that door now?', 3805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, $n.  If you hadn\'t shown up I\'m sure we would have been dead meat!  Now the only thing between us and the chief troll is that door yonder...', '', 3804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to kill more trolls!  Kill enough and I\'ll blow the door to the troll chief!', '', 3803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul\'Farrak - Weegli Blastfuse - Greeting default.', '', 3802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!$B$BIf you get me out of here, I can blow up the door that leads to the chief of Zul\'Farrak!', '', 3801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t listen to that old fool, kid. He\'s like that with everyone. I\'ve been watching you, though; you got real talent. Come have a talk with me.', '', 3799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! Omosh time!', '', 3798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CLUCK! Sensors detect spatial anomaly--danger imminent! CLUCK!', '', 3797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Threat analyzed! Activating combat plan beta! CLUCK!', '', 3796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Physical threat detected! Evasive action! CLUCK!', '', 3795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emergency power activated! Initializing ambulatory motor! CLUCK!', '', 3794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! I want more of that fabulous Noggenfogger Elixir!', 'Yes! I want more of that fabulous Noggenfogger Elixir!', 3793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Living out here in the desert is rough! I get so thirsty standing outside in this heat.', '', 3792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall use the time wisely, milord. Thank you.', 'I shall use the time wisely, milord. Thank you.', 3791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rin\'ji can see the road now, $n. Rin\'ji knows the way home.', '', 3790, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On the wings of death, I ride.', '', 3789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Under the cover of darkness.', 'Under the cover of darkness.', 3788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rin\'ji is free!', '', 3787, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of my sight, mortal. Your presence alone is enough to drive me to violence.', '', 3786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, here I go!', '', 3785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, thank you kindly. I will leave you to the library while I tend to this small matter.', '', 3784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course. He awaits you in the library.', 'Of course. He awaits you in the library.', 3783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. The Light be with you both.', 'Thank you. The Light be with you both.', 3782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day to you both. I would speak to Lord Lescovar.', 'Good day to you both. I would speak to Lord Lescovar.', 3781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Per your request, Corporal Splithoof has come, $n.', '', 3764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero, I have urgent business with Corporal Splithoof.', 'Hero, I have urgent business with Corporal Splithoof.', 3763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Milord, your guest has arrived. He awaits your presence.', 'Milord, your guest has arrived. He awaits your presence.', 3762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait here, $n. Spybot will make Lescovar come out as soon as possible. Be ready! Attack only after you\'ve overheard their conversation.', 'Wait here, $n. Spybot will make Lescovar come out as soon as possible. Be ready! Attack only after you\'ve overheard their conversation.', 3761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s move forward!', '', 3745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no!  Here they come!', '', 3744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your discs are now ready!  Engage the Discs of Norgannon once again to retrieve them!', '', 3743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In need of some alchemy supplies, are we?  Or do you have other business with me?', '', 3742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s points to the west.', '', 3741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s waits for the guards to be out of sight.', '', 3721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s prepares to sting its victim as a last desperate move!', '', 3713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must hear my story before we may continue, $n. It will be of great use to you in the future.', '', 3712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish it were true, $n, but it will take more than you alone to overcome the forces of Razelikh and his subordinates.$B$BGather a suitable group of adventurers and would-be heroes and free my men of their eternal torture! Eighteen stones you must shatter.$B$BFight hard and die with honor, $n.', '', 3711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can count on me, Hero.', 'You can count on me, Hero.', 3710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are exactly what you need to destroy in order to free the regiment! As I had told you earlier, Kirith had a plan.$B$BEach of the servants does have a weakness. Punish their physical form in proximity of their stones until they are near the state of disintegration. It is at that point, and that point alone, that the stones of binding are vulnerable to attack. You must hurry to destroy the stones, however, as once the enslaved regain their composure, they will be invulnerable to harm once more.', '', 3709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are the stones of binding?', 'What are the stones of binding?', 3708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The archmage Allistarj of the Shadowsworn was granted three. Lady Sevine, warlock of the Shadowsworn was also granted three. The remaining three were given to Grol the Destroyer, lord of the Dreadmaul ogres of these blasted lands.$B$BYou see, $n, without a soul, the body cannot be killed. The remnants of my men are now indestructible fighting units. Thankfully, they are bound in how far they can travel by the stones of binding.', '', 3707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Subordinates?', 'Subordinates?', 3706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neither you nor I could possibly imagine the pain an individual suffers when their soul is ripped from their body. They are not dead and by no means are they alive. Instead, they walk the land, servants of those that bind them to this world.$B$BLord Razelikh, demonic overlord of these lands, enslaved them all. Nine he took for his own, placing stones of binding near the Dark Portal. The remaining nine were divided up between his subordinates.', '', 3705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What could be worse than death?', 'What could be worse than death?', 3704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My captors were cruel beyond measure, $n. They would alternate between Lieutenant Kirith and I, torturing one while the other watched. During a lull in the activity of an especially brutal day, Kirith told me what had happened to my men and a plan he had been formulating to free them from their masters.$B$BThey suffered a fate far worse than death, or even the pain Kirith and I  endured.', '', 3703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please continue, Hero...', 'Please continue, Hero...', 3702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you believe that in my darkest hour, at the apex of my being, I failed.$B$BAs I fled from the wanton destruction of the forces that overwhelmed us, the only sounds I could hear were the screams of my soldiers and the rapid beat of my own heart.$B$BA short while later, I returned to the Blasted Lands in hopes of rescuing my men and restoring my honor. Instead I was captured and beaten until dead.$B$BWhat I found out during my inquisition and subsequent torture was horrifying.', '', 3701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourselves for an eternity of anguish and torture - vengeance shall be mine...', '', 3693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face my champion, mortals!', '', 3692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ilifar, your master calls!', '', 3691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, sir!', 'Yes, sir!', 3690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the flames of chaos engulf you!', '', 3689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now me crush you myself!', '', 3688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Now pet eat you!', '', 3687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get them my prettys...and their little dogs too!', '', 3686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, released from his cursed grasp. Father, I come... ', '', 3685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was not his fault. Tell him that...', '', 3684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Defiler... must warn Thrall... ', '', 3683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give my regards to Commander Trebor.', '', 3682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, the agony ceases....', '', 3681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seen any strange things in the desert lately?', 'Seen any strange things in the desert lately?', 3662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just sit tight while I get this prepared for you!', 3661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shatters, releasing the soul which it held.', '', 3643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s physical form is weakened. You notice the Stone of Binding near the creature is glowing! Strike now!', '', 3642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FREEEEEEEEEEDDOOOOMM!', '', 3641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you enter my sanctum!', '', 3622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me, my children!', '', 3621, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Regret. It is all I have now. One bad decision resulting in several horrible outcomes. If only I had waited for those orders. Maybe they would have detailed the horrors that awaited us in those cursed lands! Maybe they were to redirect us to another detail? Ultimately, it was my fault. All of it was my fault.', '', 3602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue with your story.', 'Continue with your story.', 3601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall\'s Grasp they called us: Twenty of Thrall\'s most accomplished and honored soldiers.$B$BI had ordered the regiment to build an encampment here, on the border of the Blasted Lands, while we waited for our orders to arrive from Orgrimmar. Weeks passed without word from the warchief; the men grew restless.$B$BIt was a judgment call, $n. I was young and ambitious, afraid of nothing. The battalion would set forth into the Blasted Lands under my command.$B$BA decision I would later regret.', '', 3583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you here?', 'Why are you here?', 3582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s hard to imagine that so much death and despair could be confined to such a small area; yet beyond the swamp is a land plagued by chaos and destruction.$B$BWatch your step, adventurer. The Blasted Lands are the final resting place to far greater beings than you.', '', 3581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This doesn\'t look good!', '', 3568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just /lay down anywhere, $n. I promise, this won\'t hurt a bit!', '', 3567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s seems to be talking to the squirrel and the statue. He periodically points in your direction.', '', 3566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Very interesting!', '', 3565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s examines the blood in the bottle.', '', 3564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s prepares his syringe.', '', 3563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! I almost forgot! I slipped you a set of thieven\' tools. You\'ll need those where you\'re going.', '', 3562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While my brother, Drazial, focuses his analysis on the more physical nature of the beasts of the blasted lands, I tend to focus on the more cerebral and spiritual aspects of the wildlife.$B$BIt is true that the beasts exhibit extremely unusual strength, agility, and stamina, but some of them also possess great intelligence and regenerative abilities, untied to their physical being.$B$BPerhaps you would be interested in helping advance my research, $r?\n', 3561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is now armed!', '', 3543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s will be armed in 5 seconds!', '', 3542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s will be armed in 10 seconds!', '', 3541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beasts of these blasted lands exhibit preternatural attributes, heretofore unseen in nature.$B$BWe have theorized that the energy which was released upon the opening of the Dark Portal, infused into their physical being and forced the creatures to evolve into their current forms.$B$BFearsome beasts they are, no doubt, but we also believe that they could prove to be quite useful in our studies.$B$BPerhaps you would be interested in assisting us in the study of these beasts, $n?\n', '', 3521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The King\'s guards should be along shortly to pick up the Memorial. In the meantime, come join me upstairs and let\'s finish our little chat, $n.', '', 3503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you have it! The King should be quite pleased, if I do say so myself.', '', 3502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get to work right away, $n!', '', 3501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s is once again at peace.', 3494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bale can teach you the ways of survival.  Look for him on the Hunter Rise.', 'Bale can teach you the ways of survival.  Look for him on the Hunter Rise.', 3493, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mooranta can help you learn skinning.  She can be found just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 'Mooranta can help you learn skinning.  She can be found just outside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 3492, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is not a better tracker in these lands than Drayl.  He can be found on the Hunter Rise.', 'There is not a better tracker in these lands than Drayl.  He can be found on the Hunter Rise.', 3491, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tepa is renown for her clothwork.  She can be found at Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 'Tepa is renown for her clothwork.  She can be found at Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.', 3490, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brek Stonehoof can be found at Stonehoof Geology on the lower rise and can teach you the proper way to harvest precious ores and gems.', 'Brek Stonehoof can be found at Stonehoof Geology on the lower rise and can teach you the proper way to harvest precious ores and gems.', 3489, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go see Una at Thunder Bluff Armorers then.  It can be found on the middle rise.', 'Go see Una at Thunder Bluff Armorers then.  It can be found on the middle rise.', 3488, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism is the one you want to talk to then.  He can be found on the middle rise.', 'Komin Winterhoof at Holistic Herbalism is the one you want to talk to then.  He can be found on the middle rise.', 3487, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t blame you for taking up fishing.  Mulgore has some the best fishing spots in Southern Kalimdor and Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise has all of the gear you\'ll need to take advantage of it.\n\nTell Kah Mistrunner that I sent ya!', 'Don\'t blame you for taking up fishing.  Mulgore has some the best fishing spots in Southern Kalimdor and Mountaintop Bait & Tackle on the high rise has all of the gear you\'ll need to take advantage of it.\n\nTell Kah Mistrunner that I sent ya!', 3486, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First Aid is always a nice skill to have.  Many a time during battle has it saved my hide.  Visit Spiritual Healing on the Spirit Rise.  Pand Stonebinder can teach you all you need to know to save your hide as well.', 'First Aid is always a nice skill to have.  Many a time during battle has it saved my hide.  Visit Spiritual Healing on the Spirit Rise.  Pand Stonebinder can teach you all you need to know to save your hide as well.', 3485, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check out Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise then.  Teg will be more than happy to help you in whatever way he can.', 'Check out Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise then.  Teg will be more than happy to help you in whatever way he can.', 3484, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no finer cook in Thunder Bluff than Aska Mistrunner.  Mmmmm, I can smell what she is cooking from here.  Head over to her kitchen located on the high rise.\n\nDrat... now I am hungry.', 'There is no finer cook in Thunder Bluff than Aska Mistrunner.  Mmmmm, I can smell what she is cooking from here.  Head over to her kitchen located on the high rise.\n\nDrat... now I am hungry.', 3483, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking to learn how to work an anvil and hammer, eh?  Karn Stonehoof can teach you how.  He has a smithy set up on the lower rise by the pond.', 'Looking to learn how to work an anvil and hammer, eh?  Karn Stonehoof can teach you how.  He has a smithy set up on the lower rise by the pond.', 3482, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then head over to Bena\'s Alchemy on the middle rise and talk to Bena herself.  She will be able to help you master the art of potion brewing.', 'Then head over to Bena\'s Alchemy on the middle rise and talk to Bena herself.  She will be able to help you master the art of potion brewing.', 3481, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to fight!', 'I wish to fight!', 3479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('War is a bloody, messy ordeal full of pain, suffering and death. But those that survive come back with a new respect for life. Not to mention a collection of stories to tell around the bar, full of bravery and courage. So tell me $g lad : lass;, are you here to make some stories? or just to hear some of mine?', 'War is a bloody, messy ordeal full of pain, suffering and death. But those that survive come back with a new respect for life. Not to mention a collection of stories to tell around the bar, full of bravery and courage. So tell me $g lad : lass;, are you here to make some stories? or just to hear some of mine?', 3478, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now you know why I live in a crater.', '', 3477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry brothers! You must go now! I do not know how much longer the rift will remain open!', '', 3476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success, the rift is open!! My brethren, rise and return home! The Outland awaits!', '', 3475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you have returned to help Kum\'isha, $r? Do not worry, the pang that you feel in the pit of your stomach is merely your willpower collapsing.$B$BThankfully, you will not need willpower for this collection. I am certain that you will enjoy the trinkets I will have waiting for you upon your return with the item.\n', '', 3474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s fascinating... I have heard orcs proclaim the odor of humans to be sickening and I have heard humans proclaim the odor of orcs to be wretched; yet, to me, all of the races of these lands give off the same odor: The foul, dizzying scent of greed.$B$BDo you doubt the validity of my claim? Do you not see these things that run your life as merely runoff from the greed which dictates your every decision?$B$BSo be it. As it was greed that displaced me from my home, it shall be greed that takes me back.', '', 3473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
