('Sharp teeth, muscles like cables, and a mind like a steel trap. This fella is one of the finest pets I have ever seen. Now if ye are interested, I could show ye a few things to make even the weakest of Raptors into a force to be reckoned with.', 'Sharp teeth, muscles like cables, and a mind like a steel trap. This fella is one of the finest pets I have ever seen. Now if ye are interested, I could show ye a few things to make even the weakest of Raptors into a force to be reckoned with.', 3365, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is not a chicken, and no you may not pet him. Now be on your way before I give you a closer look at his beak.', 'He is not a chicken, and no you may not pet him. Now be on your way before I give you a closer look at his beak.', 3364, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many would tell you that the Tallstrider is a laughable pet. But it\'s intelligence and loyalty make it a hard creature to match in many situations. If you are interested in the breed, then perhaps I can introduce you and your pet to a few talents I have learned over the years.', 'Many would tell you that the Tallstrider is a laughable pet. But it\'s intelligence and loyalty make it a hard creature to match in many situations. If you are interested in the breed, then perhaps I can introduce you and your pet to a few talents I have learned over the years.', 3363, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah? Ye interrupted me, so ye better have a blasted good reason to do so.', 'Yeah? Ye interrupted me, so ye better have a blasted good reason to do so.', 3362, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I came from Ironforge to help out with the rebuilding effort here. If I can teach enough of ye my skills then maybe I can leave it to ye and take myself back home.', 'I came from Ironforge to help out with the rebuilding effort here. If I can teach enough of ye my skills then maybe I can leave it to ye and take myself back home.', 3361, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not like these human cities of stone and steel. I would prefer the forests of Ashenvale, tracking great beasts. But my dear brother, Kaerbrus, felt it would be beneficial to train the humans in our ways. So while I honor him and offer my services, I do not have to like it.', 'I do not like these human cities of stone and steel. I would prefer the forests of Ashenvale, tracking great beasts. But my dear brother, Kaerbrus, felt it would be beneficial to train the humans in our ways. So while I honor him and offer my services, I do not have to like it.', 3360, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another Tracker, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques.', 'Another Tracker, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques.', 3359, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another Survivalist, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques.', 'Another Survivalist, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques.', 3358, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes my $g son : daughter;? What can I assist you with?', 'Yes my $g son : daughter;? What can I assist you with?', 3357, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you a fellow physician? I would be glad to teach you anything that would aid your journeys.', 'Are you a fellow physician? I would be glad to teach you anything that would aid your journeys.', 3356, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warrior\'s role is one of protection.  Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken.', 'The warrior\'s role is one of protection.  Just as we protect our compatriots in battle, we must also protect the interests of the Forsaken.', 3355, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how much one learns, there is always more to know.', 'No matter how much one learns, there is always more to know.', 3354, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings. You seek instruction in the art of war?', 'Greetings. Do you seek instruction in the art of war?', 3353, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade.', 'Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade.', 3352, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!', 'The big wars might be over, for now, but we still have to keep our skills sharp!', 3351, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have need of my skills as an alchemist, yes?', '', 3350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am interested in alchemy training.', 'I am interested in alchemy training.', 3349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have need of my skills as an alchemist, yes?', 3347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what you need, and make it quick.', 'Tell me what you need, and make it quick.', 3346, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most people around these parts frown on lockpicking. As a little professional courtesy, let me show you a few tricks I\'ve learned.', 'Most people around these parts frown on lockpicking. As a little professional courtesy, let me show you a few tricks I\'ve learned.', 3345, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t get too many Skinners in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you\'re ready.', 'I don\'t get too many Skinners in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you\'re ready.', 3344, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t get too many Leatherworkers in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you\'re ready.', 'I don\'t get too many Leatherworkers in here looking for training, but I guess I could teach you something if you\'re ready.', 3343, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I look like I have the time or energy to coddle every tourist that wanders through my door? Tell me what you need, and make it quick.', 'Do I look like I have the time or energy to coddle every tourist that wanders through my door? Tell me what you need, and make it quick.', 3342, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
