('Welcome to Stormwind. Took a long time to rebuild her but it was well worth it. So are you visiting, or are you here on business?', 'Welcome to Stormwind. Took a long time to rebuild her but it was well worth it. So are you visiting, or are you here on business?', 3340, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a fellow Fisherman. Are you perhaps in need of a little training? Maybe I can show you a thing or two?', 'Ah, a fellow Fisherman. Are you perhaps in need of a little training? Maybe I can show you a thing or two?', 3339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my shop, it\'s good to see another Tailor here in Stormwind. Are you here for a lesson perhaps?', 'Welcome to my shop, it\'s good to see another Tailor here in Stormwind. Are you here for a lesson perhaps?', 3338, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another Herbalist, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques.', 'Another Herbalist, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques.', 3337, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope that your interruption is for a good cause, I was in the middle of some important work.', 'I hope that your interruption is for a good cause, I was in the middle of some important work.', 3336, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another Alchemist, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques.', 'Another Alchemist, hmm. I doubt your skill is as great as my own so perhaps I can train you in a few proper techniques.', 3335, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my shop, it\'s good to see another Enchanter here in Stormwind. Are you here for a lesson perhaps?', 'Welcome to my shop, it\'s good to see another Enchanter here in Stormwind. Are you here for a lesson perhaps?', 3334, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I help you with $g sir : ma\'am;?', 'What can I help you with $g sir : ma\'am;?', 3333, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I smell rogue.', '', 3332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear that?', '', 3331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that noise?', '', 3330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He he!  This will be a great hiding spot.', '', 3329, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoops!', '', 3326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to learn alchemy, Serge.', 'I wish to learn alchemy, Serge.', 3325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t stand all of the cackling and diabolical laughter. One more \'muhahaha\' from Lydon and I\'m blowing us all up.\n', '', 3324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who would be foolish enough to enter the tower of the Grand Foreman?', '', 3322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*cough* who goes there? *cough*', '', 3321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, mortals!  I have been activated by the Discs of Norgannon to assist you!', '', 3308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have jostled the cluster, and have been sickened by the spores!', 'You have jostled the cluster, and have been sickened by the spores!', 3307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t let you down!', 'I won\'t let you down!', 3306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tower\'s defenses are at their weakest right now. The patrollers, sentries, lookouts, and even Gallywix himself are all infected and highly vulnerable to your special abilities and attacks.$B$BI want to see you enter that tower and when you exit, I want to see you covered in the blood of your enemies, the head of Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix in your hands, and the last of that poison in your pack. Take what you recover to Shenthul. He\'ll know what to do... I hope.\n', '', 3305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be strong, Fizzule!', 'Be strong, Fizzule!', 3304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defias? This is not good. Not good at all. Please continue.', 'Defias? This is not good. Not good at all. Please continue.', 3303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fast forward to the present: The resultant formula works, allowing for the creation of a more controlled drone, however, the drawback is that the inactive compound is extremely volatile.$B$BGallywix, everyone in this tower and everyone outside are infected with the poison. It\'s affecting our minds and our bodies. Our internal organs have become soft and extremely fragile. This is your chance, $n. I don\'t have the strength to carry on and I sense that soon I will become one of \'them.\'', '', 3302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 16, 13, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix finally intervened, taking the surplus of poisons to his tower, here at the Sludge Fen, in order to study and research the unstable nature of the toxins. A decision was finally reached to share the secret of the poison with the Defias Brotherhood in exchange for a very large supply of a stable, usable poison.$B$BKlaven Mortwake of the Defias Brotherhood was tasked with the job of altering the chemical properties of Zanzil\'s mixture.', '', 3301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue please, this story is intriguing.', 'Continue please, this story is intriguing.', 3296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('About five months ago, the Venture Co.\'s Stranglethorn division got their hands on a special poison from a shady merchant in Booty Bay named Crank Fizzlebub. Fizzlebub had apparently stolen the poison from Zanzil!$B$BYes, Zanzil the Outcast - the troll that was exiled from his own tribe due to the nature of his \'experiments\' in necromancy.$B$BNaturally, once they had the poison, they proceeded to test it on each other. The results were disastrous.', '', 3294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more.', 'Tell me more.', 3293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something plagues this tower. I\'ve fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick. Just last week, two of our patrollers died, only to come back to life immediately as mindless drones! The lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information. \n', '', 3292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, was it? That is a mighty fine piece of work ye have there. I\'ll take ye on, train ye how to make armor fit fer King Magni himself.', '', 3291, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye bothered me for that? Ye\'d be better off strapping a dead rabbit to yer back and running through a Troll\'s den than wearing that piece of garbage.', '', 3290, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for ye?', '', 3289, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something plagues this tower. I\'ve fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick.$B$BJust last week, two of our patrollers died, only to instantly come back to life as mindless drones!$B$BThe lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... *Fizzule slaps himself in the face* Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information. ', '', 3288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done!', '', 3287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, off to see Myolor, eh? He\'s right o\'er there... behind ye! Er, maybe in front of ye! Near the Great Anvil!', '', 3286, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye have my approval $n, ye can forge blades better than any I\'ve trained in years. If ye want to make a real weapon though, ye need to talk with Myolor Sunderfury. That Dwarf will set ya on the right path.', '', 3285, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Course I can show ye where Myolor is. Right over there near the anvil of the Great Forge, that\'s where he does his work. Listen to his words well $g lad:lass;, Myolor is as skilled as they come.', '', 3284, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice form $n, I bet a full mug at Bruuk\'s Corner that the function is just as solid. Ye know, ye might want to talk to Myolor Sunderfury. He\'ll set ya straight.', '', 3283, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Great Forge $g lad : lass;. It may be cold outside but we keep it nice and hot down \'ere. Grab a hammer, strike that anvil and show me ye\'ve got what it takes to be a Blacksmith of the Great Forge!', '', 3282, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see what I did? If you are unsure of the technique used in presenting the /salute, practice on me. If you correctly execute the Shattered /Salute, I will give you the proper response.', '', 3281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s prepares the Shattered Salute! *PAY ATTENTION!*', '', 3280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After you get his attention - and you can be certain that if he sees you near the tower, you\'ll have his undue attention - face him and perform the Shattered /Salute. Let me demonstrate....', '', 3279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, pay very close attention to what I do and follow my instructions precisely. To not heed my words is to sign your own death warrant, as Taskmaster Fizzule is VERY well versed in the ways of the warrior and the assassin.', '', 3278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are ye daft? That\'s not a weapon, that\'s a dinner knife. I don\'t train amateurs.', '', 3277, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t ye see I\'m busy? This had better be good.', '', 3276, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shattered Hand\'s influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all.$B$BYou have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, $n. The time has come to send you into the field.$B$BAre you prepared to undertake your next mission?\n', '', 3275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye have some skill at weapon crafting $g lad : lass;,very impressive indeed. Now grab a hammer and let\'s see if ye can forge a real weapon.', '', 3274, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want to train with Borgus? Aye, I can tell ye where to find him. Head through the Square northwest of me forge, then take the western road. Ye\'ll find him in the second building on yer right.', '', 3273, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s some impressive skill ye have there $n. The blades and hammers ye make surpass even my own, hard as that is to admit. Only person I ever met with skill even greater is Borgus Steelhand, I bet he could teach ye a thing or three.', '', 3272, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about Forging Weapons.', 'Tell me more about Forging Weapons.', 3271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ye want to find Grumnus, the first thing ye should do is head to Ironforge. Go to the very center of the city and look for the Great Forge, ye should find him there.', '', 3270, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you give me directions?', 'Can you give me directions?', 3269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve not seen finer armor made in many years $n. Not since I trained under Grumnus Steelshaper in the Great Forge. I bet he could teach ye things about makin armor that would spark yer interest.', '', 3268, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about Forging Armor.', 'Tell me more about Forging Armor.', 3267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Train me.', 'Train me.', 3266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So ye want to be a Blacksmith eh? Grab an apron and a hammer $g lad : lass;, let\'s see what ye\'ve got.', '', 3265, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be sure to read over the notes in my journal, $n. You will find them to be invaluable in overcoming the tower\'s defenses.', 3264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s chips and splinters!', '%s chips and splinters!', 3263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How dare you defile this ancient place!', 3262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None may steal the secrets of the Makers!', 3261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi this is my text.', 'Hi this is my text.', 3241, 11, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SI:7 lockbox creaks open. A loud booming voice can be heard. You can make out the words: \'Go... search... shadows...\'', '', 3225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SI:7 lockbox crashes open. Grunts and voices can be heard in the distance.', '', 3224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SI:7 lockbox begins to vibrate and hum. A loud, rustling sound, can be heard coming from the north.', '', 3223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SI:7 lockbox opens, sounding an audible alarm.', '', 3222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will access the discs now.', 'I will access the discs now.', 3221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is empty.', '', 3207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is full of dead black rats. Hmmmm....', '', 3206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s opens. The contents assault your senses with a very foul odor. Inside you see what appear to be enormous bird droppings and a lot of blood.', '', 3205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s explodes, lighting the sky up in a brilliant fireworks display! It seems to be beckoning to you, rogue.', '', 3204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s points you to the Gizmotronic Apparatus.', '', 3203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a lot to think about.', 'This is a lot to think about.', 3202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are the Creators?', 'Who are the Creators?', 3201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These dwarves are the same ones today, yes?  Do dwarves maintain any other links to the Earthen?', 'These dwarves are the same ones today, yes?  Do dwarves maintain any other links to the Earthen?', 3200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarves!!!  Now you\'re telling me that dwarves originally came from the Earthen?!', 'Dwarves!!!  Now you\'re telling me that dwarves originally came from the Earthen?!', 3199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mentioned two results when the Earthen destabilize.  What is the second?', 'You mentioned two results when the Earthen destabilize.  What is the second?', 3198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Troggs?!  Are the troggs you mention the same as the ones in the world today?', 'Troggs?!  Are the troggs you mention the same as the ones in the world today?', 3197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happens when the Earthen destabilize?', 'What happens when the Earthen destabilize?', 3196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What high-stress environments would cause the Earthen to destabilize?', 'What high-stress environments would cause the Earthen to destabilize?', 3195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I understand the Creators\' design intent for the Earthen now.  What are the Earthen\'s anomalies that you spoke of earlier?', 'I think I understand the Creators\' design intent for the Earthen now.  What are the Earthen\'s anomalies that you spoke of earlier?', 3194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything else I should know about the Earthen?', 'Anything else I should know about the Earthen?', 3193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... the Earthen were made out of stone?', 'So... the Earthen were made out of stone?', 3192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is a \"resilient foundation of construction\"?', 'What is a \"resilient foundation of construction\"?', 3191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are the anomalies you speak of?', 'What are the anomalies you speak of?', 3190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is a \"subterranean being matrix\"?', 'What is a \"subterranean being matrix\"?', 3189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are the Earthen?', 'Who are the Earthen?', 3188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Creators are cognizant of the magnitude of the information housed in this repository.  Subsequently, a portable copy of the data stored here will be made available to you once you are attuned with the Discs of Norgannon.$B$BPlease consider your cursory requirements for the assimilation of this knowledge to be complete.  At your leisure, access the Discs of Norgannon to begin synthesis of your discs.', '', 3187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Creators are... the Creators.$B$BThey are the beings that seeded and shaped this world by their own design.  They are the reason for this world\'s existence, as well as many other worlds.  They are the wellspring from which Azeroth flows.', '', 3186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am unable to process your chronological reference in comparison to the recording of this data, my apologies.$B$BThough the dwarf maintains most of the Earthen\'s mental attunement to Azeroth\'s stone composition, the reversion back into living biomass remains the main degeneration of the matrix.  Dwarves eat and procreate through means typical to other standard biomasses.$B$BThe Creators view the dwarf as an acceptable variant, worthy of genesis in its own right.', '', 3185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The data stored in this repository does indeed correlate with your astute proclamation.$B$BThe dwarf maintains an affinity for the stone composition of Azeroth, but due to the high-stress environmental anomaly within the Earthen\'s synthesis matrix, the dwarf reverts to a default biomass composition as seen in the standard subterranean matrix.$B$BErgo, the dwarf variant does synthesize from the degeneration of the Earthen creation matrix, as you inferred with your query.', '', 3184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiating visual aid representation number two.$B$BThe second resultant variance of the Earthen matrix retains many desired elements when compared to the standard subterranean matrix.  The common nomenclature for this variant is \"Dwarf\".$B$BThis variant retains strength and stamina inherent to the Earthen.  In some cases, the dwarf even exceeds the cognitive powers of the Earthen\'s matrix.  The dwarf, however, retains none of the physical composition of Azeroth\'s various stone core compounds.', '', 3183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am unable to process your chronological reference in comparison to the recording of this data, my apologies.$B$BThe trogg retains some composition of Azeroth\'s various stone core compounds, but the loss of cognitive power makes this variant unacceptable to the Creators.$B$BThe trogg procreates as per a standard biomass.  By default it consumes stone and anything else it can acquire, including other troggs.  Cannibalism is considered unacceptable by the Creators.', '', 3182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are two potential results when the Earthen\'s synthesis matrix destabilizes.  Initiating visual aid representation number one.$B$BThe first variant matrix is a degenerative product of synthesis, hereby designated with the common nomenclature of \"Trogg\".  This variant maintains strength and stamina comparable to the Earthen, but its cognitive processing power has been almost completely compromised.  Force of will and a strong sense of cunning are the only driving factors in the psyche of the trogg.', '', 3181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[There is a noticeable pause after you ask this question.]$B$BThe information you request is not currently available in this repository\'s data cycling.  I sincerely apologize for this omission.$B$BPlease request this information after a data cycling update has been performed on this information repository.  You may also request this information from another information repository located on Azeroth.', '', 3180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earthen\'s only anomaly in synthesis is the tendency for matrix destabilization while being utilized in high-stress environments.$B$BAddendum: deep earth sculpting was naturally suited to the new matrix design and thus never met the qualifications of duplicating a high-stress environment.$B$BDestabilization was not discovered until well into the Earthen\'s primary service cycle for the Creators.  The Creators began work on post-synthesis modification, rather than recall and re-synthesis.', '', 3179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is integral to the assimilation of this data that it is understood that the Creators wanted to synthesize a race that would long be an integral part of this world\'s development cycle after they had departed.  This race would be instrumental in fulfilling the Creators\' long-term development objectives for Azeroth.  $B$BAs an ancillary note, the nomenclature \"Earthen\" was deemed apropos for the new race by the Creators, based on the Earthen\'s composition.', '', 3178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simply stated, this is correct.$B$BThe Earthen\'s physical features are that of a smaller stature humanoid, though their composition is that of Azeroth\'s various stone core compounds.  Their design maximizes strength and stamina without sacrificing cognitive processing power.  Their skin and musculature are nearly impervious to physical damage, and with very minor modifications the Earthen display a remarkable resiliency to unwanted magical forces.', '', 3177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is the baseline material used in race synthesis.  A cross-section of Azeroth\'s crust was used as the foundation for the Earthen\'s synthesis rather than the typical biomass construction foundation used by the Creators.$B$BResearch on the world\'s composition led the Creators to theorize that an enhanced being could be synthesized that would epitomize the resiliency of this world\'s essence.  This was accomplished by choosing to use a blend of Azeroth\'s various stone core compounds as the foundation.', '', 3176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Additional background information on the Earthen must be given to you before this question may be answered properly.$B$BProcessing.$B$BTo understand the anomalies of the Earthen, it is first important to understand what the Earthen represent in their design intent.  The Earthen represent the Creators\' attempt at improving the survivability paradigm of the standard subterranean being matrix.  This was done by incorporating a resilient foundation of construction inherent to the world into said matrix.', '', 3175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('It is one of the synthesis matrices the Creators use when seeding a world.  Each synthesis matrix is used to achieve the Creators\' goals.  For Azeroth, a subterranean being matrix was modified to create a being with increased durability with an affinity for deep region shaping; the Earthen are the product of this modification.$B$BAfter the Earthen had been put into service for the Creators, unforeseen anomalies were discovered that affected their synthesis matrix due to high-stress environments.', '', 3174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earthen are a synthesized race engineered by the Creators, functioning as one of the seed races in the initial population of the world designated as Azeroth.  The Earthen were created to aid the Creators\' efforts in shaping the deep regions of this world.$B$BThey are a modification of the standard subterranean being matrix used on other worlds that the Creators have seeded.  The construction of this prototype race created various anomalies that were observed after initial synthesis.', '', 3173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salutations.  My function is to offer access to and, when permissible, insight into information regarding the Creators\' synthesis of the Earthen on the world designated as Azeroth.  I am ready to share this information with you now at your leisure.', '', 3172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure to visit the Gizmotronic Apparatus to grab a lockpick and an E.C.A.C. You will definitely need both to complete your mission!', '', 3171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SQUAWK!!!', '', 3170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is empty, save for a few crumbs and a gigantic green feather.', '', 3169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is littered with broken bones and cracker crumbs.', '', 3168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MmmmmMmmmm... Enormous chemically altered cracker....', '', 3167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press the red button labeled \'E.C.A.C.\'', 'Press the red button labeled \'E.C.A.C.\'', 3166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the squawk??? Squawk squawk, squawk? SQUAWK!', '', 3165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SQUAWK! Polly wants to crack you!', '', 3164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This plant stands out among the normal flora of Teldrassil, and emits a strange, purplish glow.', '', 3163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is an exotic sample of flora, unseen in other parts of Teldrassil.', '', 3162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'ll bring you mead$bHe\'ll bring you beer$bA grinning face from ear to ear$bHe\'s served us all from year to year$bWe call him Smiling Jim.', '', 3161, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press the yellow button labeled \'Thieves\' Tools.\'', 'Press the yellow button labeled \'Thieves\' Tools.\'', 3149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The machine comes alive at your touch.', '', 3148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require warrior training.', 'I require warrior training.', 3147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here for training?  Or are you just here to waste a warrior\'s time?', 'Are you here for training?  Or are you just here to waste a warrior\'s time?', 3146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello Zando\'zan, I would like to learn lockpicking.', 'Hello Zando\'zan, I would like to learn lockpicking.', 3145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zando\'zan of the Shattered Hand. How can Zando\'zan help you? He can\'t! He won\'t!\n', '', 3144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require training, sir!', 'I require training, sir!', 3143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Order of the Shattered Hand existed before Thrall and shall exist after Thrall. ', '', 3142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s self destructs!', '%s self destructs!', 3141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avert your eyes, children. The bloodrage has taken over...', '', 3135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, young rogue. Well done, indeed....', '', 3134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? Orcs already approach?', '', 3133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lucius is an old and trusted friend of Ravenholdt Manor - he and I have much to discuss. Find me at the docks in Lakeshire should you require my assistance or council.', '', 3132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s blood sprays into the air!', '%s blood sprays into the air!', 3131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Sigh* You\'re probably right, Raven. I\'m going back on patrol....', '*Sigh* You\'re probably right, Raven. I\'m going back on patrol....', 3130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dunno, Jill. If Klaven comes down while we\'re slacking, we may end up as one of those things!', 'I dunno, Jill. If Klaven comes down while we\'re slacking, we may end up as one of those things!', 3129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we take a break? My feet are killing me and those ... those things down there are creeping me out.', 'Can we take a break? My feet are killing me and those ... those things down there are creeping me out.', 3128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yea?', 'Yea?', 3127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, Raven...', 'Hey, Raven...', 3126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success!  Huzzah!  The power source restored the necklace!', '', 3125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fantastic then!  Let\'s get this thing fixed for you.', '', 3124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right, it\'s over by the bed.  Heh, sorry about that!', '', 3123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, it isn\'t here.  Where did I have that blasted thing at last?', '', 3122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me grab a spell focus from inside my home here, and then we\'ll get started!', '', 3121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another question on the first chain ANSWERED!', '', 3104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2nd chain, first answer.  PWNED~', '', 3103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Question 2, Chain 1?', 'Question 2, Chain 1?', 3102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the answer to the first question of the first chain.', '', 3101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Question 1, Chain 2', 'Question 1, Chain 2', 3100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Question 1, Chain 1?', 'Question 1, Chain 1?', 3099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now where did I put the Venture Company formulations?', '', 3098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shuffles through the books.', '', 3097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the very first thing I say to the player.  Huzzah!', '', 3096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sweet irony -- Stormwind forces cut down in defense of their city, only to rise and fight alongside the Brotherhood as instruments of destruction.', '', 3095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s wildly flips through the pages of a large tome.', '', 3094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And should one die, two shall rise!', '', 3093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot hide from me, rogue. I can smell your fear.', '', 3092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just as I thought, the gems and the necklace don\'t matter.  It\'s all about the power source.', '', 3091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet me down by the orchard--I just need to put my gun away.', 3090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Babba booey....', '', 3089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right. Die like the dog you are.', '', 3088, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any one else ready to feel the wrath of the Defias Brotherhood?', '', 3087, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victory for the Defias Brotherhood!', '', 3086, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There we go, all finished.  The journal has been translated for you.', '', 3085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will do nicely.  Now to the task at hand!', '', 3084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now for a quick look at these gems.', '', 3083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to get some water for the inking reagent.', '', 3082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malton, you dummy!', '', 3081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boy, you couldn\'t fix a sandwich without someone tellin\' ya how to do it.', '', 3080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sandwich?  What?  You makin\' a sandwich for me, pop?', '', 3079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe I can fix it, pop.  Lemme take a look at it.', '', 3078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we just need to figure out how to get this thing working again.', '', 3077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill, KILL! Get back artifact! Bring to Kartak!', '', 3076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sacred artifact belong to Blackrock! We take back!', '', 3075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is angered and attacks!', '', 3074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m done, $g brotha:sista;. Finish up yerself. I\'ll be restin\' meself back on the rock.', '', 3073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat should do it good...', '', 3072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll put me items in the brazier now. You just speak to da spirits when they appear.', '', 3071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, $g brotha:sista;, now fer da sapta... stay close ta me.', '', 3070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come down to da shrine with Tiev. We\'ll put da sapta magics to work there.', '', 3069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take cover in the shadows. We have business to discuss once I finish showing these beasts why I am called the Hand of Chaos.', '', 3068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Signet of Chaos belongs to Ravenholdt, beast! You will never hold its power! (PLACEHOLDER - TO BE MOVED/CHANGED)', '', 3067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the blood spilled here today be a lesson to all who dare encroach upon the territory of the Blackrock Clan!', '', 3066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods.', '', 3065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You check the front!', '', 3064, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smell ugly near. Me smell you ugly.', '', 3063, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s scans the mill', '', 3062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*You are able to make out the words* Stay... watch... shadow...', '', 3061, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, okay... gimmie a minute to rest now. You gone and beat me up good.', '', 3043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another fool falls to the Defias Brotherhood.', '', 3042, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In this place, darkness and shadows are tools to be used and disposed of at will.', '', 3041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings Erion, I require training!', 'Greetings Erion, I require training!', 3022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible.', '', 3021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I have seen the shaman you seek. Last I saw her, she was to the west of here. She hides in the hills above the Razormane tribe. If you\'re clever, you\'ll be able to find a path to her hut in the hills. It is not too far north of here. That path should allow you to find her without fighting through the quilboar.', '', 3014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell me where Brine is?', 'Can you tell me where Brine is?', 3013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Threshwackonator First Mate unit prepared to follow*', '', 3012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I walk this road alone, seeking ways to defend my honor and rid this land of our enemies.$B$BWhat can I do for you, $n?', '', 3011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lucan Cordell has a small shop on the canal by the Stockade. I am sure he will be able to teach you the art of enchanting.', 'Lucan Cordell has a small shop on the canal by the Stockade. I am sure he will be able to teach you the art of enchanting.', 3010, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing like spending a day down at Crystal Lake fishing. Arnold Leland is the man that taught me. You can usually find him out on the dock in the Canal District just fishing the day away. \n\nOh, and don\'t believe any of the stories he tells you about monsters in the canals either.', 'Nothing like spending a day down at Crystal Lake fishing. Arnold Leland is the man that taught me. You can usually find him out on the dock in the Canal District just fishing the day away. \n\nOh, and don\'t believe any of the stories he tells you about monsters in the canals either.', 3009, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always a good skill to have that Survival is.\n\nKaerbrus is who you are looking for. He\'s usually around the moonwell in the Park.', 'Always a good skill to have that Survival is.\n\nKaerbrus is who you are looking for. He\'s usually around the moonwell in the Park.', 3008, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Survival', 'Survival', 3007, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enchanting', 'Enchanting', 3006, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing', 'Fishing', 3005, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those thieving elementals are up the path, this way.  Good luck, $n.', '', 3004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
