('', 'Hello $r, it is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.\n', 2843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master has fallen!  Avenge him, my brethren!', 'The master has fallen!  Avenge him, my brethren!', 2842, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inns are places where you can rest after your adventures.  If you do not stay at an inn such as this, then you will not be fully rested when you venture again into the wilderness.$B$BYou may also acquire a hearthstone at any inn, and later when you are ready to rest you can use this heartstone to bring you back to the inn from which you acquired it.', 'Inns are places where you can rest after your adventures.  If you do not stay at an inn such as this, then you will not be fully rested when you venture again into the wilderness.$B$BYou may also acquire a hearthstone at any inn, and later when you are ready to rest you can use this heartstone to bring you back to the inn from which you acquired it.', 2841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to bubble!', '%s begins to bubble!', 2829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come in, come in. Just don\'t sit too close to the stove. It hasn\'t exploded yet today, but just to be safe I think you should sit elsewhere.', 'Come in, come in. Just don\'t sit too close to the stove. It hasn\'t exploded yet today, but just to be safe I think you should sit elsewhere.', 2828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams.', 'Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams.', 2827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We\'ve stories to tell and kegs to empty.', 'Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We\'ve stories to tell and kegs to empty.', 2826, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here.', 'As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here.', 2825, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest your weary bones for a spell.', 'Rest your weary bones for a spell.', 2824, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me browse your goods.', 'Let me browse your goods.', 2823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make this inn your home.', 'Make this inn your home.', 2822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?', 'Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?', 2821, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once followed the ways of the Twilight\'s Hammer. Obsessed with reviving the Old Gods, I journeyed deep into this lair to try to draw power from the cursed beast, Aku\'mai!$b$bAfter witnessing the sacrifice of countless innocents, I came to my senses.$b$bI was trapped but now I am free! But so far from my homeland of Khaz Modan!$b$bBrave adventurer, I offer you passage to a very special land in return for slaying Aku\'mai. If you wish, I can port you to the city of Darnassus.', '', 2807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. Release the bear into my custody so that I may apply the curing cantrip.', '', 2806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release the Rabid Thistle Bear for Tharnariun.', 'Release the Rabid Thistle Bear for Tharnariun.', 2805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The curing cantrip has failed. Unfortunately, the introduction of the serum into this beast\'s blood stream will soon end its life.', '', 2804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last! Someone to free me from this cell!$b$bHigh Executor Hadrec sent us to gather information on the Keep so that a plan could be formulated to overthrow Arugal once and for all.$b$bBut the old wizard has many tricks up his sleeve and we were detected by a magical ward. I was thrown in this prison. Vincent was not so lucky.$b$bI must return to Hadrec to debrief him at once. But first I will pick the lock to the courtyard door for you. Perhaps you can try your luck against the foes that lurk beyond.', '', 2803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please unlock the courtyard door.', 'Please unlock the courtyard door.', 2802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last! I am finally free from this cell!$b$bThe Kirin Tor sent me from Dalaran to investigate Arugal\'s progress with the undead here in Silverpine Forest. Little did we know that the wizard had lost his grasp on sanity.$b$bI must report this mess at once! But before I leave, allow me to undo the magical lock on the courtyard door.$b$bYou defeated Rethilgore, perhaps you will survive what lies beyond....', '', 2801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bears??', 'Bears??', 2783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah!  Tirth\'s been looking for him for days, but he doesn\'t want to be found.  He\'s chicken!', 'Hah!  Tirth\'s been looking for him for days, but he doesn\'t want to be found.  He\'s chicken!', 2782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Johnson?  I think he\'s around here somewhere...', 'Johnson?  I think he\'s around here somewhere...', 2781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tirth\'s not himself these days, and neither is his assistant.', 'Tirth\'s not himself these days, and neither is his assistant.', 2780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Tirth\'s assistant?', 'Where is Tirth\'s assistant?', 2779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Gizmotic Almanacotron says that we should beat the goblins by twenty seconds more than we did last time!', 'My Gizmotic Almanacotron says that we should beat the goblins by twenty seconds more than we did last time!', 2778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My son could design a faster car than that clunky goblin junk heap! ', 'My son could design a faster car than that clunky goblin junk heap!', 2777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I installed a new device in our car\'s matrix regulometer.  That should increase its velocity quotient by a factor of no less than fifteen!', 'I installed a new device in our car\'s matrix regulometer.  That should increase its velocity quotient by a factor of no less than fifteen!', 2776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These races are a great opportunity to show our ingenuity!', 'These races are a great opportunity to show our ingenuity!', 2775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it weren\'t for the goblins\' inconceivable, dumb luck, they\'d crash their car during every race!', 'If it weren\'t for the goblins\' inconceivable, dumb luck, they\'d crash their car during every race!', 2774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you mean Johnson?  I heard he\'s in hiding.', 'Oh, you mean Johnson?  I heard he\'s in hiding.', 2773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Tirth\'s assistant?', 'Where is Tirth\'s assistant?', 2769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard they were going to try to blow up the gnome\'s car in the next race!  True or not, I\'d stand clear of their pit area.', 'I heard they were going to try to blow up the gnome\'s car in the next race!  True or not, I\'d stand clear of their pit area.', 2768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My money\'s on the goblins!  And if you have any sense then yours is too!', 'My money\'s on the goblins!  And if you have any sense then yours is too!', 2767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I were you, I\'d buy a goblin race voucher.  Rooting for the other team is a waste of time.', 'If I were you, I\'d buy a goblin race voucher.  Rooting for the other team is a waste of time.', 2766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it weren\'t for that cursed, gnomish luck, they\'d never win a race!', 'If it weren\'t for that cursed, gnomish luck, they\'d never win a race!', 2765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ask me, I think the goblins are a shoe in.  We have the tools, and we have the talent!', 'If you ask me, I think the goblins are a shoe in.  We have the tools, and we have the talent!', 2764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whispers into $n\'s ear.', '', 2763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There.  I am finished with your robe, $n.', '', 2762, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One moment while I stitch this together...', '', 2761, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The animal looks confused.', '', 2757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require training.', 'I require training.', 2756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings $R, I am Tharnariun Treetender.', '', 2755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been summoned by Lago Blackwrench, warlock master of Ironforge. You\'d do yourself well to report to him immediately. You\'ll find him in the Forlorn Cavern district of the city.', '', 2754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What message?', 'What message?', 2753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid snow... Hey, you\'re, $n, aren\'t you? I\'ve just received a message asking for you.', '', 2752, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish the snow would just all melt away. It\'s always getting my robe wet and messing up everything!', '', 2751, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bank is located in the Trade District just northwest of the city gates. Here, let me show you on your map.', 'The bank is located in the Trade District just northwest of the city gates. Here, let me show you on your map.', 2750, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bank of Stormwind', 'Bank of Stormwind', 2749, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day citizen.  How may I assist you?', 'Good day citizen.  How may I assist you?\n', 2748, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Marlgen... One of the jailors. He has the key to my bonds.', '', 2747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the key to this lock?', 'Where is the key to this lock?', 2746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from here, $c, or they\'ll put you in chains as well.', '', 2745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the humans has the key to this infernal contraption. Eston I think they said his name was.', '', 2744, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I free you?', 'How can I free you?', 2743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you mock me while I am unable to defend myself, bound to this ball of iron?', '', 2742, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gelkak\'s key slides into the vacant slot.', '', 2741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t tell Tirth I\'m still here.  If he finds out I haven\'t left the Shimmering Flats, I\'ll be running his errands and cleaning his dirty laundry forever!', '', 2722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, I\'ll tell you the phrase.  As long as I don\'t have to go anywhere near Tirth!', '', 2721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 2000, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It worked!  Amazing!  I guess I haven\'t lost my touch...', 2709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand back, and ... hold your breath.  I haven\'t done this in a while.', 2708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me the phrase to Tirth\'s lockbox.', 'Tell me the phrase to Tirth\'s lockbox.', 2707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!  Are you on an errand for Tirth?  If I were you I\'d get as far away from him as I could!  His mind\'s been pickled from too much drink but his magic\'s as strong as ever!', '', 2706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m \"Plucky\" Johnson, and this is my default greeting.', '', 2705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YARRR! Swabie, what have ye done?! He\'s gone mad! Baton down the hatches! Hoist the mast! ARRRR! Every man for hi\'self!', '', 2704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn the key to start the machine.', 'Turn the key to start the machine.', 2703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The machine adjusts to face you.$B$BOn the back of the machine is an empty, oddly misshapen slot with an engraving that reads: \"Propirtee o\' Cap\'n Gelkak Gyromast\"', '', 2702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sets down the refined wood planks.', '', 2701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take a chest of containment coffers and a cantation of manifestation, $n.  You will need them for your mission.', 2682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here, $n.  Take a chest of containment coffers and a cantation of manifestation.  You will need them for your mission.', 2681, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your robe is complete, $n.', '', 2666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall now begin the robe...', '', 2665, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All right.  It\'s made!', 2664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok, let\'s get this orb made...', 2663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the event begin!', 'Let the event begin!', 2662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fanglords are dead! All hope is not lost!$b$bThe awakening ritual is quite complex, however. It cannot be done alone.$b$bI will handle all of the necessary preparations but I will need you to protect me. The nightmares summoned from Naralex\'s journey through the Emerald Dream prove to be quite formidable. Without your help, this mission is doomed.$b$bWhen you are ready to defend me, say the word, and I shall lead the way to Naralex\'s chamber.', '', 2661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naralex sleeps again!$b$bLong ago, Naralex journeyed to this cavern with the honorable goal of entering the Emerald Dream and regrowing the Barrens into a lush forest. His focus waned and his thoughts became tainted by serpentine visions.$b$bNow, reptilian beasts seep from his dreams to the land. He must be awoken from the nightmare or he will be forever lost, and a great evil unleashed.$b$bOnly after his corrupted servants, the Fanglords, have been slain can I perform the awakening ritual.\n\n', '', 2660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll just keep this here until we need it...', 2659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for your patience, $n.', 2658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s it!  It worked!', 2657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I just have one thing to check...', 2656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release the hounds!', '', 2655, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you go. I need to get back to work before Rokar clouts me again for being lazy.', '', 2654, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away, Rokar.', '', 2653, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harroc, get a box of tools for, $n.', '', 2652, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now where did I put that silver spool...', 2651, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aha!  There it is.', 2650, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok, let\'s get to work!', 2649, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s it!  It\'s all finished, $n.', 2648, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These are fine pieces, $n.  Let me get started on your robe.', 2647, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am done.  Your armor is ready, $n.', '', 2646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have finished your leg guards, $n.', 2645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to craft...', 2644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another set of thieves\' tools.', 'I need another set of thieves\' tools.', 2643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Therzok\'s sent you, tell him no, I won\'t go back to work for him, no matter how many times he asks.', '', 2642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s a young $c like you out visiting an old farmer like me?', '', 2641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have completed your helm, $n.', '', 2635, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your armor is ready, $n.', '', 2634, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Gnoarn finds out about this, it\'ll be my hide!', '', 2633, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n.  You have tempered the cold rage in my heart.', '', 2632, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah!  Eternal undeath to the cursed Agamands!', '', 2631, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another set of tools.', 'I need another set of tools.', 2630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gird yourself, $n, for the demon in this orb is a fel beast.', 2629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!', 'The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!', 2628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!', 'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!', 2627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.', 'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.', 2626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.', 'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.', 2625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck out there, $n.', 2624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, here\'s one.', 2623, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me go get you a set of tools, $n.', 2622, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mennet said I should ask you for a set of thieves\' tools.', 'Mennet said I should ask you for a set of thieves\' tools.', 2621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like training.', 'I would like training.', 2603, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory.', 'The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory.', 2602, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh! What was that? It\'s not supposed to work like this!', '', 2601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare yourself, $n.  I go to open the rift...', 2592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got something I need, Astor. And I\'ll be taking it now.', 'You\'ve got something I need, Astor. And I\'ll be taking it now.', 2591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I am. What\'s it to you?', '', 2590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re Astor Hadren, right?', 'You\'re Astor Hadren, right?', 2589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want, $c? I\'m running late, and my employer doesn\'t look kindly on tardiness.', '', 2588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a troll tailor trainer, and this is my default greeting.', 'I am a troll tailor trainer, and this is my default greeting.', 2587, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am interested in tailor training.', 'I am interested in tailor training.', 2586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, and feel free to examine my goods.  Other than the moldy smell, they are in perfect condition.', 'Welcome, and feel free to examine my goods.  Other than the moldy smell, they are in perfect condition.', 2585, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am an undead cloth vendor, and this is my greeting text.', 'I am an undead cloth vendor, and this is my greeting text.', 2584, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
