('%s lets out a high pitched screech, calling for help!', '%s lets out a high pitched screech, calling for help!', 2481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have run through these plains for many, many seasons.  And I have hunted great beasts.  And I had never been bested... until I faced Ghost Howl.$B$BLong ago, the massive wolf was an ally to the tauren and fought bravely against the Burning Legion.  But he was wounded savagely by a demon, and the tear in his flesh never healed.  Eventually... it drove Ghost Howl mad.$B$BNow he roams the plains in agony, seeking an end to his pain.  To my shame, when we fought I lacked the strength to slay him...', '', 2471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You killed Ghost Howl.  You\'re a stud!', '', 2470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me a story, Skorn.', 'Tell me a story, Skorn.', 2469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come closer, young one.  In my time I could hear the flutter of a prey\'s beating heart, but now you must speak up if you want your words heard.', '', 2467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help?', 'How can I help?', 2466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I figured I would step up my research efforts by, uh, \'borrowing\' some technology from the Venture Company. See, their new shredder is best of breed, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips!$B$BMy business partner Wizzlecrank is west of here in the Sludge Fen doing some \'Field Research\' for me, but he hasn\'t gotten back yet. ', '', 2465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used to direct Steamwheedle\'s shredder development program, but last month I struck out on my own. Now all my suppliers have blacklisted me. Worse, my development efforts haven\'t even gotten off the ground yet. I could use your help, $n!', '', 2464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See, the Venture Company\'s new shredder is better than my latest, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips!$b$bMy boss has given me a pretty strict deadline, but my boys and I couldn\'t come up with anything. Nothing was working, so we decided to \"borrow\" one of their prototypes. I sent Wizzlecrank to the Sludge Fen to steal one, but he hasn\'t gotten back yet!', 'See, the Venture Company\'s new shredder is better than my latest, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips!$b$bMy boss has given me a pretty strict deadline, but my boys and I couldn\'t come up with anything. Nothing was working, so we decided to \"borrow\" one of their prototypes. I sent Wizzlecrank to the Sludge Fen to steal one, but he hasn\'t gotten back yet!', 2463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to be your own boss!$B$BHey could you spare a couple copper for a sandwich? I\'m starved.', '', 2461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
