('The Affray has begun.  $n, get ready to fight!', '', 2301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer a blessing fer sure, $n. Thank you.', '', 2286, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light be with ya, $n.', '', 2285, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to you, $n.', '', 2284, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ye, $G lad:lass;. Thank ye, greatly.', '', 2283, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hamhock in trouble! Hamhock need help!', '', 2282, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $G lad:lass;. Thank you, greatly.', '', 2281, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, $n!', '', 2261, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say that is a nice looking outfit you got there.', 'Say that is a nice looking outfit you got there.', 2245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aku\'mai is sure to summon the old gods for us.  If only we can provide enough innocents to satisfy his hunger.', 'Aku\'mai is sure to summon the old gods for us.  If only we can provide enough innocents to satisfy his hunger.', 2244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon we shall bring about the return of the old gods.', 'Soon we shall bring about the return of the old gods.', 2243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the blood of an innocent can quench Aku\'mai\'s hunger.', 'Only the blood of an innocent can quench Aku\'mai\'s hunger.', 2242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aku\'mai needs more innocents to be satisfied.', 'Aku\'mai needs more innocents to be satisfied.', 2241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will be easy prey, $C.', 2231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My talons will shred your puny body, $R.', 2230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A fine trophy your head will make, $R.', 2229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torta must be so worried.', '', 2228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you heard the one about the ogre, the goblin and the pit lord?', '', 2227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish you could just pick me up and carry me.', '', 2226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much further to go?', '', 2225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I keep getting sand stuck in my toes.', '', 2224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are we there yet?', '', 2223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m thirsty.', '', 2222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do we have much further to go?', '', 2221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You win, $n.  You win!', '', 2203, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better luck next time, $n.', '', 2202, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, enough!  I give up!', '', 2201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Peace and patience be with you, $n. Remain strong always.', 2184, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength and endurance; patience and wisdom--remember these things always, $n.', '', 2183, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your spirit is pure, $n.', 2182, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your spirit burn brightly, $n.', '', 2181, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh! My tools\' have run out. We\'re going to have to start over...', '', 2162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got some great samples, Hornizz. I\'m going to get to work on them. Can you take care of the rest?', '', 2161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And try not to get lost this time....', '', 2145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will hurry back to Vahlarriel. Finish off those that you can--I should be fine on my own from here.', 2144, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune be with us! Let\'s make haste from this evil fortress.', 2143, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am eternal fire. I am forever reborn and I will be the light that will guide you when it is most cold.', '', 2142, 12, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Torta. Whatever your heart desires...', '', 2141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough with the rambling. I am starving! Now, get your dusty shell into that ocean and bring momma some grub.', '', 2140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dearest Torta, I have been gone for so long. Finally we are reunited. At long last our love can blossom again.', '', 2139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have any idea how long I\'ve been waiting here? And where\'s dinner? All that time gone and nothing to show for it?', '', 2138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Torta, my love! I have returned at long last.', '', 2137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll follow you back to the camp. If you speak with my assistant, Hornizz, he\'ll have your payment.', '', 2136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been such an unbelievably big help! These bones are going to unlock so much new information and help me futher my research.', '', 2135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a little damaged, but I should still be able to get some good information from this.', '', 2134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would never have expected to find something in such perfect condition.', '', 2133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must be very careful with this one... Very delicate.', '', 2132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll just label it for reference then dig it up.', '', 2131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen one this size before! I can\'t wait to send it back for research...', '', 2130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh, this looks promising...', '', 2129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Either that\'s a prime kodo bone or it\'s time I got my goggles!', '', 2128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over there! Can it be?', '', 2127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must be careful not to damage the specimen...', '', 2126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a rage!', '', 2125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And they\'re off!', '', 2124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen something like this before! Look at the extension of the jawbone...', '', 2123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh, it\'s a nice one! Let me just dig it up...', '', 2122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, there\'s one!', '', 2121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('to arms laddies!', '', 2108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets out a tremendous roar, alerting nearby enemies!', '', 2107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay down, Wretch!', 'Stay down, Wretch!', 2106, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Backhands $n solidly across the face.', 'Backhands $n solidly across the face.', 2105, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Warchief!', 'For the Warchief!', 2104, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must go and gather with the other Disciples. There is much work to be done before I can make another attempt to restore the Barrens. Farewell, brave souls!', '', 2103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders have assaulted our lair.  Be on your guard!', '', 2102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last! Naralex can be awakened! Come aid me, brave adventurers!', '', 2101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An interesting turning of events.', '', 2094, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, come. My master and I shall be waiting.', '', 2093, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come! Come to your deaths--if you dare!', '', 2092, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insects!', '', 2091, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares to seek me out?!', '', 2090, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic Forsaken weakling. You wish to see my master? So be it.', '', 2089, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You scum aren\'t even worth my time.  Destroy them, my pack!', '', 2088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I call your true name, Azrethoc. Show your visage to me!', '', 2087, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe it! You\'ve destroyed my pack... Now face my wrath!', '', 2086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This should only take a moment, $n.', '', 2085, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the glory of Ironforge!', 'For the glory of Ironforge!', 2084, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never cross a Dwarf!', 'Never cross a Dwarf!', 2083, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to make a copy of itself!', '', 2082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets out a shriek, calling for help!', '%s lets out a shriek, calling for help!', 2081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s follows $n.', '', 2080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh!  That\'s terrible!', '', 2079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let\'s try it...', '', 2078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! THIS AREA IS OFF LIMITS!', '$n! THIS AREA IS OFF LIMITS!', 2077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whispers to $n the secret to opening his strongbox.', '', 2076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s forces the fluid down the weary man\'s throat.', '', 2075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keever is most pleased.', '', 2074, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s pokes the wooly sheep repeatedly.', '', 2073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? Did Keever ask for a sheep? Keever wanted a weapon of great power and all he got was this sheep. Keever is very disappointed.', '', 2072, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grabs the rabbit and pours the fluid down its throat, then sets it back inside the cage.', '', 2071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keever is unhappy with this. Perhaps if Keever were to try a larger dose, that may fix this dilemma.', '', 2070, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s pokes the skittish rabbit.', '', 2069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s feeds the squirrel some of the viscous fluid.', '', 2068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that is just not right. The creature is far too small. Let us see what Keever\'s third batch will do.', '', 2067, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s pokes the small fuzzy squirrel with obvious disappointment.', '', 2066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s feeds the toad some of the strange liquid.', '', 2065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s pokes the small toad.', '', 2064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not what Keever was hoping for. Keever may have added too much earthroot. Let\'s see if the second serum will do what Keever needs.', '', 2063, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, there we go. Now, Keever must try this vial and see if it works.', '', 2062, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, it would seem Keever needs a new subject. If that fool Abernathy keeps taking Keever\'s subjects, Keever may have to have a word with him.', '', 2061, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There you have it. Our lesson on summoning has come to an end. A new class will begin shortly, so if you wish to brush up, feel free to stay around.', 2060, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I doubt you have had much occasion to see such a creature. These demonic equines will make your travels much faster by acting as your mount as long as you control them. However, they are difficult to control, so be sure you are ready before attempting it.\n', 2059, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When facing a spellcaster of any kind, this feral beast will be your best friend. Now, let us take a look at something a bit different. This next creature will aid your travels and make your future journeys much easier. Let\'s take a look at a felsteed.', 2058, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What you see before you is a felhunter. This creature\'s natural talents include spell lock and other abilities which make it unequalled when facing a magically attuned opponent.', 2057, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Study hard and you might one day be able to summon one on your own, but for now it\'s time to move on to the felhunter.', 2056, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All right now. Aside from the obvious distractions a minion like this will provide against your more masculine foes, she is also capable of dealing out impressive amounts of damage. However, her fragile endurance makes her almost useless as a shield.', 2055, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'ve never seen one, it is a sight to behold. A very impressive creature both on and off the field of battle. Next, let us take a look at what I am sure all you male students have been waiting for. The succubus.', 2054, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This demonic entity is known as the Voidwalker. Its strength and endurance are significant, making it ideal for defense. Send it to attack your enemy, then use it as a shield while you use your spells and abilities to drain away your opponent\'s life.', 2053, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that you have had a chance to study the imp, let us move on to the next minion you will be able to summon, the voidwalker.', 2052, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This foul little beast is the imp. It is small and weak, making it almost useless as a meatshield, and its damage output is mediocre at best. This creature is best used for support of a larger group.', 2051, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The easiest creature for you to summon is the imp. You should already be able to bring forth this minion but for completeness\' sake I will start with him.', 2050, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re here, then it means you are prepared to begin the study of summoning demonic cohorts to do your bidding. We will start with the lowliest creatures you will be able to call and continue from there. Let us begin.', 2049, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold, $n!  I\'m guarding these barrels, so ... look, but don\'t touch!', '', 2048, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 2047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahah!  That was funny!  Funny wooden human!', '', 2046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah!  Let us see the wooden human wave!', '', 2045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Back to the drawing board.', 2044, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But this can\'t be right. Where did I put that other book?', 2043, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If this is correct then I have a lot more research to do.', 2042, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So I was right about the energies. Let\'s see what the other tome has to say on the subject.', 2041, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very interesting. But if that\'s the case then my theory is wrong. I must reread the other sections to see what I missed.', 2040, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s what I wanted to know. Now I just need to find where the flux variance is discussed.', 2039, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That wasn\'t very helpful. Let me check the other one.', 2038, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, yes. Hmm, it seems to cross reference another tome. Guess I have to find that one too.', 2037, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s the mystical tome I was looking for.', 2036, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Magic Maladies\", no. \"Magic Matricies\", no. Ahh here we go \"Magic Mysteries\".', 2035, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I could just find \"Magic and the Ways of Power\". Ahh here it is, what was it doing over here?', 2034, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh, \"Mystical Conjurings of the Archmages of Dalaran.\" Perfect.', 2033, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Khadgar\'s Mystical Journal, Volume 8.\" I think this is the one I wanted.', 2032, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I really need a better system for filing these books. Ahh that\'s the one I wanted.', 2031, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Magical Flows and How They Effect the World\", by Maginor Dumas. That\'s the one I was looking for.', 2030, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh there it is.', 2029, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh! What is that scoundrel doing sending his vermin to me? Get out of my sight before I take what is left of your life. And take this with you.', '', 2028, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you have to house train her, Gerard?', 2027, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pet is wonderful, Gerard, but she needs a collar with a bell I think.', 2026, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t agree with your turning to alchemy to fix some of the problems, but I do agree with the results. Very well done.', 2024, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An amazing discovery you have made. I would love an opportunity to look at all of the failed experiments.', 2023, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very nice, Gerard. Next you will be breeding them.', 2022, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impressive, very impressive. Does she do tricks?', 2020, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am truly impressed, Gerard. I thought you were all talk, but I see I have been proven wrong.', 2019, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bravo, Gerard, you have exceeded yourself, yet again.', 2018, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen anything like it. No concentration or loss of awareness while the subject is dominated. What did you do to her?', 2017, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She retains knowledge and speech, and even the self sufficiency to perform tasks for you. Precisely what did you do?', 2016, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Astounding. You managed to dominate her, yet she retains self awareness and function. How did you do it?', 2015, 33, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
