('I shall get started right away, $n.', '', 1247, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast a spell on Grimclaw.', '', 1246, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that noise? It sounded like a roar.', '', 1245, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m happy to see you too, Grim! It looks like not all strangers are to be feared after all, huh, Grim? Terenthis shall reward this adventurer well.', '', 1244, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We made it, my friend. Remember to find Terenthis and let him know we\'re safe. Thank you again.', '', 1243, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are dismissed, $n.', '', 1242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars in excitement as he rushes Volcor. When he reaches his master, Grimclaw licks his face.', '', 1241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again, $n.  This rare earth will be very helpful in my experiments.', '', 1240, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let us place this rare earth in my planter...', '', 1239, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars as his form shifts and he runs off.', '', 1238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, now or never I suppose. Remember, once we get to the road safely, return to Terenthis to let him know we escaped.', '', 1237, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Thank you again, $n. I\'ll make my way to the road now. When you can, find Terenthis and let him know we escaped.', '', 1236, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I figured Flagongut would send someone for that fossil eventually.', '', 1235, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s growls in your direction before taking time to sniff you.', '', 1234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars in acknowledgement at Terenthis.', '', 1233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand, my friend. I shall find someone to help your master. Go back to him now, or at least stay close.', '', 1232, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars at Terenthis more, but this time the druid seems to understand the bear.', '', 1231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There... that should help. Now, tell me what\'s happened, Grimclaw.', '', 1230, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, whoa there, my friend. One moment...', '', 1229, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to moan and roar at Terenthis while stomping his paws on the ground.', '', 1228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grimclaw?! Easy there, my friend... where is your master Volcor?', '', 1227, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars at Terenthis to get his attention.', '', 1226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s faces southeast and whimpers before looking back at you.', '', 1225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, my soul may rest... Oh, dearest Cerellean...', 1224, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Athrikus points at you as he bellows forth words that scrape apart the inside of your ears. They are the last thing you hear.', '', 1223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uthrok make gud shot', '', 1222, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
