('Best weapons in the Barrens here!', '', 1212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n.  And luck to you.', '', 1211, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cliffspring Falls lies along the mountains to the east and north.', '', 1210, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is hungry...', '', 1209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Best drinks in Stormwind!', 1208, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Back from a long journey? Rest and relax at the Pig and Whistle!', 1207, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tired of all those pansy spellcaster drinks? Try something stronger at the Pig and Whistle!', 1206, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Smoother than and elf, stronger than an orc! No better drinks in all of Stormwind!', 1205, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Talk to me for a free beer at the Pig and Whistle!', 1203, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get a free beer at the Pig and Whistle!', 1202, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
