('', 'Oh no... Mist... what has happened...?', 1169, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 1168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 1167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, take another long look before we make our way to the Holy District and the great Cathedral of Light.', 1166, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Breathtaking. Children, when we return to the school, you will each give an oral report on one of these legendary people.', 1165, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t it amazing, children? All who enter the city must walk beneath the watchful eyes of the greatest heroes of our lands.', 1163, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, well...let\'s head on to the monument dedicated to the heroes of the two Great Wars, the Valley of Heroes. Follow me.', 1162, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When the Horde was shattered, men returned here and began to rebuild the once great city as a testament to our own survival.', 1161, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope this frond takes root...', '', 1160, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hurries to his planter.', '', 1159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s plants the fruit seeds.', '', 1158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how these seeds grow in my prepared soil...', '', 1157, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s removes the seeds from the Glowing Fruit...', '', 1156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Children if you would please follow me, we will now be going to see the keep where King Anduin Wrynn himself sits on his throne.', 1155, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, that is true. Paladins and priests alike train their skills and research great truths behind the walls of the Cathedral.', 1154, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it true that the paladins train here?', 'Is it true that the paladins train here?', 1153, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s plants the Moss-twined Heart...', '', 1152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a rage after seeing a friend fall in battle!', '%s goes into a rage after seeing a friend fall in battle!', 1151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s attempts to run away in fear!', '%s attempts to run away in fear!', 1150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re under attack! Avast, ye swabs! Repel the invaders!', 'We\'re under attack! Avast, ye swabs! Repel the invaders!', 1149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 5777, 5777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! Check out that noise!', 'You there! Check out that noise!', 1148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 5775, 5775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyone want to take a break?  Well too bad!  Get to work you oafs!', '', 1147, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get those parts moving down to the ship!', '', 1146, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cannons must be finished soon.', '', 1145, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time I see one of you not working, I\'ll have Buzzer cut your head off!', '', 1144, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders!  Slay them!  Don\'t let them into the room!', '', 1143, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You rabble get to work.  The ship must be completed soon.', '', 1142, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'TEST', 1141, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we have Stormwind Keep. Built upon the ruins of Stormwind Castle, which was destroyed by the Horde in the first Great War.', 1140, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teacher, he keeps poking me!', 'Teacher, he keeps poking me!', 1139, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teacher are there night elves in Stormwind? I\'ve never seen a night elf before.', 'Teacher are there night elves in Stormwind? I\'ve never seen a night elf before.', 1138, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teacher, I have to pee!', 'Teacher, I have to pee!', 1136, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard there are still orcs buried underneath it.', 'I heard there are still orcs buried underneath it.', 1134, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teacher, when are we gonna see the sparkly Mage Tower?', 'Teacher, when are we gonna see the sparkly Mage Tower?', 1133, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wanna see the dragon skeleton in the great library.', 'I wanna see the dragon skeleton in the great library.', 1132, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s better than the drawings in the history tomes.', 'It\'s better than the drawings in the history tomes.', 1131, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do we have to learn this stuff anyway?', 'Why do we have to learn this stuff anyway?', 1130, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we have the Cathedral of Light, the center of spiritual enlightenment here in Stormwind.', 1129, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s try planting it in some of my special, prepared soil...', '', 1128, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, underneath the moss, this heart looks like a seed!', '', 1127, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s examines the Moss-twined Heart...', '', 1126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Balance has been restored!', 1125, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Earthmother, grant me the power to undo this bloodshed!', 1124, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you\'ve gone and done it. I thought you were better than the people at Southshore. They would have bought all my wares! Too bad they\'re all dead.', '', 1123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No point in wasting any more time here. Ghosts don\'t have money!', '', 1122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand, Earthmother.', 1121, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sergra falls into a trance for a moment, then looks to the sky.', 1120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok I am here.  Come buy my wares while the getting is good.  I mean I am giving you first crack at these.', '', 1119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What has happened, Earthmother? Why has the spell failed?', 1118, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ARRRRRGGGHHH!', 1117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the strength of the earth, the power of storms, and...', 1116, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a stone from the table, $n.  You will need it for your quest.', '', 1115, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s exchanges quiet words with $n, and hands $ghim:her; a small object.', '', 1114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh now you\'ve gone and angered me! Time to see the true force of the Stone of Tides!', '', 1113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deja vu.  For a moment, I thought I was back home... before the plague...', 1112, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Think I\'m starting to wear a rut in the paving stones.', 1111, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jack and Jill my wrinkled patoot! I do all the water luggin\' \'round here.', 1110, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of these days I\'m gonna drown him in that blue robe. And all his brooms too.', 1109, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'O\'course I\'m talkin to myself. Only way to get decent conversation in this city.', 1108, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seems like a hundred times a day I walk all the way to the well to get more water. No respect for their elders I tell ya.', 1107, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
