('SMOTTS!', '', 773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU WERE SUCH GOOD SPORT THE LAST TIME...COME OUT!', '', 772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dirty beasts! Here they come!', '', 771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More beasts on the way!', '', 770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening? What force draws me to the Altar of the Tides!', '', 769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have failed to protect me from the apes!', '', 768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here come the beasts!', '', 767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have completed the quest!', '', 766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you again for your aid. May the wind always be at your back during your travels.', 765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SMOTTS!  HEY, SMOTTS!!  COME OUT AND PLAY!', '', 764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AH, A FEAST!  WHO LEFT THIS HERE...?', '', 763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How interesting... the Stone possesses great magical potential, but in a purely raw form...', '', 761, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is reduced to rubble, but still continues to fight.', '', 759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s strength dwindles as chunks of rock break off.', '', 758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to crack and break apart.', '', 757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you touch me again it\'ll be the last thing you touch!', '', 754, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? You mean you can\'t kill this one by yourself?', '', 753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just release me already! I\'ve had enough!', '', 752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make yourself useful and help me out here!', '', 751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did I have to get stuck with this repulsive, feeble excuse for a warlock?', '', 750, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better back me up on this one!', '', 749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This better be the last one!', '', 747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright I\'m going! Stop yelling!', '', 746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aha!  It opened!  I expected that to be harder.  Thanks for your help, $n!', '', 745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s tries opening Maury\'s Clubbed Foot...', '', 744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have fashioned Yenniku\'s Soul Gem, $n...', '', 743, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s presents the Mind\'s Eye and the Singing Crystals before him...', '', 742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to summon in reinforcements!', '%s begins to summon in reinforcements!', 741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, $n.  You may now speak to the Bloodscalp chief and his witchdoctor.', '', 740, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orcs are smarter than those couriers! Where the blazes are they?', '', 739, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupidity! I\'m surrounded by stupidity!', '', 738, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where in the Outlands are those shipments? For days they keep me waiting!', '', 737, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins chanting...', '', 736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, good $n.  Now let us see what tale these heads tell...', '', 735, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am done inspecting the skulls, $n, and I am relieved.  Yenniku is not among them...', '', 734, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s continues searching, placing more skulls in his crate.', '', 733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s searches through the skulls...', '', 732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmh...I SMELL FOOD!', '', 731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off to Darkshire then, I suppose.', '', 730, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, all. I shall return again in about a week.', '', 729, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come for me to once again make my wares available to all who travel near Sentinel Hill! Come one, come all!', '', 728, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long-lasting, well-crafted items for sale near the Hill! Come one, come all! Time is short, so make haste.', '', 727, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Known throughout the lands, Antonio Perelli\'s goods now for sale near Sentinel Hill! I must move on soon, so make haste.', '', 726, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Home again, home again.', '', 725, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good bye, Goldshire. I\'ll be back soon enough-- perhaps a week\'s time.', '', 724, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good people of Goldshire, come take advantage of my incredible prices on rare goods. I shall not return for some time!', '', 723, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come one, come all! Antonio\'s wares are for sale. I may not return for a great deal of time, so come one, come all.', '', 722, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wares for sale! Wares for sale! Come browse Antonio\'s wares before I must take my leave, citizens of Goldshire.', '', 721, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I will, my friend. I will indeed. You, too, be safe.', '', 720, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be safe, Antonio.', 'Be safe, Antonio.', 719, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Hello again, Antonio. Thank you again for the hat for my wife. She adored it.', 'Hello again, Antonio. Thank you again for the hat for my wife. She adored it.', 718, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re very welcome! I must be on my way... be safe, all of you.', '', 717, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, my friends. It is good to see you again. Still keeping our borders free I see. Antonio appreciates your hard work.', '', 716, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take care of yourself, Antonio. I\'ll see you in another week.', 715, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again, Amy. Be safe, luv. I\'m off to Goldshire now.', '', 714, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Items powerful enough to help make the journey through Duskwood, Antonio Perelli\'s goods are now for sale here in Lakeshire.', '', 713, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve finally reached Lakeshire-- come one, come all, and take advantage of Antonio Perelli\'s wonderful deals.', '', 712, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oops!', '', 711, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baby wants her dolly!', '', 710, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crybaby! Crybaby!', '', 709, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want her back you\'re gonna have to beg!', '', 708, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happens when I do this?!', '', 707, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have your dolly! Nyah nyah!', '', 706, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if your dolly can swim!', '', 705, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear ye, hear ye! I\'ll pause to sell my wares for only a short time here in Lakeshire. Come to the town hall with haste!', '', 704, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, Antonio. It\'s good to see you safely made it here again. Let me know if you need anything.', 703, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, hello, Amy. It\'s good to be back in Lakeshire and to see you, milady.', '', 702, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop! You\'ll pull her head off!', 701, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re hurting her!', 700, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop pulling her hair out!', 699, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m telling Mommy!', 698, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WAAAHHH!!!', 697, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t hurt Betsy, you meanie!', 696, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Betsy! Give me Betsy back!', 695, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gimme my dolly!!', 694, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! I have Betsy!', '', 693, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, Redridge. A pleasant change from the dark, cold fog of Duskwood.', '', 692, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, citizens of Darkshire. Until next time...', '', 691, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave your battles or errands, and browse my incredible wares! Only in Darkshire for a short time... praise the Light for that.', '', 690, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, travelers of Duskwood! My incredible wares are on sale for a short time in Darkshire. Make haste!', '', 689, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Travelers and adventurers make haste to the town circle and take advantage of Antonio\'s wonderful prices! Come one, come all!', '', 688, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Adventurers from all over sell things to Antonio-- come look for yourselves what little treasures he has for you this week.', '', 687, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This week it could be eye of newt, or perhaps a treasure map. You\'ll never know unless you look. What could Antonio have?', '', 686, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Items of antiquity, weapons of war, armor or rarity. Who knows what Antonio will be carrying this week if you do not come look.', '', 685, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate this part of my job. Oh Duskwood, be gentle with poor Antonio.', '', 684, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets out a deep sigh.', '', 683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s spirit is freed...', '', 682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is struck dumb by the Soul Gem!', '', 681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night, night.', '', 680, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another day gone by...', '', 679, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm, good stuff. Back to work once again.', '', 678, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little food\'ll feel pretty good right about now.', '', 677, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My back is killing me today.', '', 676, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This bridge isn\'t ever going to be finished, is it?', '', 675, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, ah\'m late.', '', 674, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s runs up to the other bridge workers, panting.', '', 672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh?! Darn it, it\'s lunch time! I overslept!', '', 671, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night, all. I\'m gonna sit up for a bit. Maybe Darcy\'ll come by.', '', 670, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh well, I\'m sure she\'ll be around later.', '', 669, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks up and down the docks.', '', 667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You guys see her? I didn\'t see Darcy. I wonder where she is tonight.', '', 666, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, this bridge is kind of large for just the 6 of us to be building. You\'d think more people would\'ve been hired.', '', 665, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light, I\'m hungry today. Did you all see Darcy today? She looked great.', '', 664, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love mornings! It\'s a great day, isn\'t it? Smell that air?', '', 662, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh! Being on your feet all day is no way to make a living. I should have been a tailor.', '', 661, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! I can\'t wait to get some sleep tonight.', '', 660, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Bout time. I was hungry an hour ago.', '', 659, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, okay... I\'m up.', '', 658, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t we just sleep a while longer?', '', 657, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good night, my friends. Until tomorrow.', '', 656, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another good day indeed.', '', 655, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Dimitri wipes sweat from his forehead and lays down his tools*', '', 654, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tis a good day to live, neh? Hard work and good food-- there are worse things we could be doing on such a beautiful day.', '', 652, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh... food It\'s \'bout time.', '', 651, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Morning, my friends.', '', 650, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good night, gents. Sleep well.', '', 649, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Day\'s wasting. Let\'s get going.', '', 648, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call it a day, men!', '', 647, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, good. Keep it up and this bridge\'ll be done in no time.', '', 646, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, lunch time\'s over, guys. Let\'s get back to work. If the rest of the day goes this well, then maybe we\'ll cut out early.', '', 645, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bridge is looking great. We keep up this pace and it\'ll be done for the first expansion forces to head north.', '', 643, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a break, men! Half hour and then back to work.', '', 642, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi Ho, Hi Ho, and all that... let\'s get a move on.', '', 641, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya\'ll get a few minutes to wake up, but let\'s get started soon.', '', 640, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, you lazy bums, time to get up and get started. That bridge isn\'t getting built on its own.', '', 639, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wahehe! I\'m taking you down with me!', '', 638, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s eyes glow red as he lights his dynamite and begins to cackle madly!', '', 637, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s takes out a bottle filled with some kind of green liquid and takes a large gulp.', 636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have succeeded in stopping us this time, but we shall return-- this we assure you!', '', 635, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Magistrate is too well protected. Retreat!', '', 634, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The meddlers shall pay for their interference. Retreat to the shadows!', '', 633, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! Alterac and Hillsbrad shall come under our rightful rule once again now that the Magistrate has fallen. Retreat!', '', 632, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Magistrate has fallen! Make your escape, my brothers.', '', 631, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The deed is done! The Magistrate is dead-- to the shadows, my brethren.', '', 630, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More agents of the Syndicate I\'ll wager! You\'ll never take back Alterac... or Southshore!', '', 629, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The assassins are over here! Quickly, before they reach the Magistrate!', '', 628, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re here! They\'re over here! Help me!', '', 627, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assassins... save... th... Magistraaa...', '', 626, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Southshore Crier grabs the back of his neck and his eyes go wide.', '', 623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so tired *pant pant*', '', 622, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards to your posts! They must be after the Magistrate again. He must be protected! They could come from any direction!', '', 621, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear ye! Hear ye! *pant pant* Be warned citizens of Southshore: assassins are heading to our fair town!', '', 620, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me! Help! Assassins in the hills! To arms! To arms!', '', 619, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings Citizens!  Soon perhaps the tide will turn in our favor and the plague will end.', '', 618, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spent my whole life caring for these trees. Pruning and nurturing them... only fitting that they have joined me in death.', '', 616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This orchard is now as barren and lifeless as my rotting shell. Once these trees bloomed with fruit but now there is only rot.', '', 615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My trees.... they have withered up and died just like me.', '', 614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the Magistrate at all costs. They could come from any direction!', '', 613, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
