('Althea, there are reports of strange happenings at the graveyard.  Ello believes it portends an attack on Darkshire.', '', 272, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watcher, inform Althea that a dire threat is marshalling against our town.  We must prepare!', '', 271, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is grim news, and I fear it is linked to the dealings $n had with the Embalmer.', '', 270, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Lord Mayor.', '', 269, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wolves head this way, as if fleeing from...something.', '', 268, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hideous bellows and growls are heard coming from that old hermit\'s shack!', '', 267, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mayor Ello!  Our graveyard scouts return with ominous reports...', '', 266, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Mayor!  Our scouts report strange activity to the west.', '', 265, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad to see you\'re doing so well, Harlan.  And I hope to see you again soon...', '', 264, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I\'m off then.  Take care, Harlan.', '', 263, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, and promptly delivered.  As always, it\'s a pleasure doing business with you, Corbett.', '', 262, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, much appreciated, Corbett.  We\'ll get these on the racks immediately.', '', 261, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oomph!  Here\'s another load of supplies, Harlan.  It must be selling fast!', '', 260, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, Harlan.  Here\'s a load of knitted cloth for you.', '', 259, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have a few extra coins from this sale.  Maybe I\'ll buy myself some lunch...', '', 258, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm...after dropping this off, I think I\'ll head to that cheese shop for a snack.', '', 257, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Business must be good down at the bazaar.  I\'ll get him resupplied right away!', '', 256, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pleasure, sugar drop.  I\'ll be back soon...', '', 255, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Corbett, you there?  Harlan needs another load of knitted goods.  Can you take it to him?', 254, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Corbett, dear.  Harlan needs a load of knitted shirts and pants as soon as we can manage.', 253, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe, but if it did hit me upside the head I\'d know exactly which cannon to use to blow it into the smallest bits!', '', 252, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! You wouldn\'t know a great steam engine if it smacked you upside the head!', '', 251, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I\'d take the sound of a Crater Cannon XT blasting off a shell over that any day!', '', 250, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing beats the sound of a twin-carb, fork-ring steam engine burning pure firestone!', '', 249, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! Sturdy old Trollplow has just a few meager battle scars!', '', 248, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I\'m more afraid that those old holes and gashes would burst that thing and I would be showered by the shrapnel!', '', 247, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Har! You scared I\'ll hurt your little dainty racer?', '', 246, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing you can say will ever get me in the arena against that monstrosity of a machine you call a steam tank!', '', 245, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye sure, just as long as we get to hit the arena right after!', '', 244, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Stone, let\'s hit the circuit some time. We could run a few laps and see who wins?', '', 242, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! That\'s no fun!', '', 241, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would have just dropped some Evershine in my tank and been back home before they realized I\'d gone!', '', 240, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brahaha! Tha look on their faces as old Trollplow\'s gun came swiveling around to meet them! Their saws couldn\'t even touch me!', '', 239, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, let me see. Yes probably nearing a hundred times now I\'d wager!', '', 238, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Fizzer, I ever tell you the time I was riding through the canals and some goblins in shredder suits tried to ambush me?', '', 237, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh! You\'re hopeless!', '', 236, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! By the time you got in range of old Trollplow you would be in reduced to rubble!', '', 235, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you ever think about anything other than fighting? I could circle you down on the stretch course!', '', 234, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes. I\'ve heard all about those new flarged things. Armor was removed from the casing to decrease weight. Bargh! Nonsense!', '', 233, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Stone, did you hear about the new steam engine old Tonkrend has been runnin on?', '', 232, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, we\'re getting close to the excavation site, so we have to proceed carefully. Engage underwater breathing apparatus...', '', 231, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, we\'ve just gotten word that a caravan is leaving from Thelsamar. It\'s time to move! Go go go!', '', 230, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you, $n!  One day, vengeance will be mine!', '', 229, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Keldric. See you later.', 228, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s my list, Keldric. The usual stuff.', 227, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose you\'re right.', '', 226, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only if we didn\'t follow the proper initialization procedures.', 225, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At least we wouldn\'t be around to have to clean it up.', 224, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we use the Surian theory, then yes, but not if we go with the Y\'serian approach.', 223, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow, all of this for a love potion. Hope he\'s worth it.', 222, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we use the appropriate sequence we should be ok. Will just take some serious studying before we start.', 221, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Always so negative. The chances of that happening are between zero and none.', 220, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But if we stabilize it with an anchor thread at the appropriate energy crux then it should work.', 219, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What if we used three focuses in Tyrean pattern? That should solve it.', 218, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suppose that could work, if we had twenty people to cast it with.', 217, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That will unbalance the magical focus, though, and cause a reverse vibration in the ether.', 216, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think not, I don\'t need to be blown up again.', 215, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But isn\'t that what caused the initial problems with Adept Syleria\'s magical formulae?', 214, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The resultant energies could collapse though, and that could cause an energy flux that would give you a migraine for weeks.', 213, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But wouldn\'t that mean crossing the streams? Isn\'t that really bad?', 212, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wouldn\'t that cause the weave to unravel if not properly anchored before starting the casting?', 211, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But what if the resulting frequency shift were to send magical feedback up the flows?', 210, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Putting in twelve centers of focus might allow the magical energies to form more solidly, adding the necessary stability.', 209, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why can\'t we just shift the array to compensate for the variance in the flux?', 208, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The magical wards at that point should be supported enough by the energy flux to contain the entity.', 207, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maginor says that twisting alternating flows of positive energy actually creates a much more stable flow.', 206, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When the positively aligned energies collide with the negatively charged energies, they don\'t negate one another.', 205, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portal will shift slightly, at this point if you cast a binding cantrip you will solidify it in place.', 204, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So then the array of magics would cascade into a chain reaction of positively charged energies.', 203, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we reverse the Essence flows perhaps we can alter the polarity.', 201, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the cask of booze, $n.  I think I\'ll open up a bottle right now!', '', 200, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three cheers for $n!  This land shall be ours once again!', '', 199, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The People of Westfall salute $n, a brave and valiant defender of freedom.', '', 198, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hail, $n! Defender of The People!', '', 197, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure it\'s just incompetence or oversight by some of the workers.', '', 195, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark Iron activity. Even that some of the shipments have been hijacked--', '', 194, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, Huldar... But it seems I\'ve misled you.', '', 192, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard all the kobolds that were down there are dead.', '', 190, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guard duty, I hate guard duty.', '', 189, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear that? I think they\'re getting closer...', '', 188, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all their fault, stupid orcs. Had to burn my farm to the ground.', '', 187, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all their fault, stupid Alliance army. Just had to build their towers right behind my farm.', '', 186, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shine yer armor for a copper.', '', 185, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare some change for a poor blind man? ...What do you mean I\'m not blind? ...I\'M NOT BLIND! I CAN SEE!! It\'s a miracle!', '', 184, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help a poor bloke out?', '', 183, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will gladly pay you Tuesday for a hamburger today.', '', 182, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Alms for the poor?', '', 181, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could ye spare some coin?', '', 179, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worm goes on the hook, hook goes in the water. Fish is in the water, our fish.', 'Worm goes on the hook, hook goes in the water. Fish is in the water, our fish.', 178, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think there\'s any fish in these canals.', 'I don\'t think there\'s any fish in these canals.', 177, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope that was a fish!', 'I hope that was a fish!', 176, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something smells funny.', 'Something smells funny.', 175, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got worm guts on my shoes.', 'I got worm guts on my shoes.', 174, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eww... that\'s not a fish!', 'Eww... that\'s not a fish!', 173, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I see something.', 'I think I see something.', 172, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I heard something.', 'I thought I heard something.', 171, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sounds kinda like one of Billy\'s fish stories to me.', 'Sounds kinda like one of Billy\'s fish stories to me.', 170, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you imagine?', 'Can you imagine?', 169, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father says that\'s just a story.', 'My father says that\'s just a story.', 168, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s neat.', 'That\'s neat.', 167, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh c\'mon, that\'s not true.', 'Oh c\'mon, that\'s not true.', 166, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t make me get my pappy to catch you! He likes to catch bunnies using his rifle!', 165, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Carrots every day for a year if you stop!', 164, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fluffy! Fluffy, stop running!', 162, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'C\'mon, Fluffy! I just want to give you a bath!', 161, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do you run from me, Fluffy?!', 160, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come back, Fluffy!', 159, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yeah, I heard about that.', 'Oh yeah, I heard about that.', 158, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow.', 'Wow.', 157, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know there are crocolisks in the Canals. They were brought from the swamp as pets, but got thrown in the canals.', 'You know there are crocolisks in the Canals. They were brought from the swamp as pets, but got thrown in the canals.', 156, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then the rabbit just bit his head off... I swear.', 'And then the rabbit just bit his head off... I swear.', 155, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear, people have actually seen them. Pandaren really do exist!', 'I swear, people have actually seen them. Pandaren really do exist!', 154, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no spoon.', 'There is no spoon.', 153, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know why orc eyes glow red? It\'s because they drink blood!', 'You know why orc eyes glow red? It\'s because they drink blood!', 152, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say he can turn into a raven sometimes.', 'They say he can turn into a raven sometimes.', 151, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so the knights stood before the charging Horde and held their ground as a thousand berserk orcs came through the valley.', 'And so the knights stood before the charging Horde and held their ground as a thousand berserk orcs came through the valley.', 150, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And that\'s how Lothar killed thirty six orcs with his bare hands!', 'And that\'s how Lothar killed thirty six orcs with his bare hands!', 149, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really?', 'Really?', 147, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we should go to the bridge and fish.', 'Maybe we should go to the bridge and fish.', 146, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you could catch a fish big enough for your mouth we\'d never be hungry again.', 'If you could catch a fish big enough for your mouth we\'d never be hungry again.', 145, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re making that up.', 'You\'re making that up.', 144, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh! You\'re scaring the fish away.', 'Shhh! You\'re scaring the fish away.', 143, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you fished as well as you talked the ocean wouldn\'t have any fish left.', 'If you fished as well as you talked the ocean wouldn\'t have any fish left.', 142, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard a story about this golden fish, and if you caught it you would get three wishes!', 'I heard a story about this golden fish, and if you caught it you would get three wishes!', 141, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And one time, at camp, I caught a fish that was bigger than I am!!', 'And one time, at camp, I caught a fish that was bigger than I am!!', 140, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard that there are these huge fish that can walk on land to hunt, and eat people!', 'I heard that there are these huge fish that can walk on land to hunt, and eat people!', 139, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Liar!', 'Liar!', 138, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nuh uh.', 'Nuh uh.', 136, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! Look! I caught something! Aww....it\'s just a stinky ol\' boot.', 'Look! Look! I caught something! Aww....it\'s just a stinky ol\' boot.', 135, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My daddy can catch more fish than your daddy!', 'My daddy can catch more fish than your daddy!', 134, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My daddy says that in the ocean, there are fish so big they could swallow a whole ship.', 'My daddy says that in the ocean, there are fish so big they could swallow a whole ship.', 133, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I caught a big one last week, it had three eyes!', 'I caught a big one last week, it had three eyes!', 132, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think there are any fish in here?', 'Think there are any fish in here?', 131, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m now far enough away...so I can\'t see the barrel.  Poison away!.', '', 130, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m back where I started.', '', 129, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, back to business for me.  But it sure was nice taking that short break, and it\'s always nice drinking Thunder Ale!', '', 128, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, that sure does hit the spot!  I think I\'ll get myself a couple more...can you watch these barrels for me, $n?', '', 127, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How goes the barrel watching...?', '', 126, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, Belm!  Give me a mug of Thunder Ale, and one for my good friend $n.', '', 125, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take whatever ya got cookin\'! And throw in a bottle to wash it down!', '', 124, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hoha! I\'d welcome the challenge from old weakbelly!', '', 123, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Belm says pay your bill or he\'ll break your face.', '', 122, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, tell your friend there Tongus if he dont take care of his tab here, i\'ll be making an appearance with old Steelhead!', '', 121, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye there you go lad, your favorite brew.', '', 120, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bagh! Back to work for me! Thank you kindly Belm.', '', 118, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach! Toss me a cold frosty, Belm!', '', 117, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah I am too busy for a drink now lad.', '', 115, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Bout time fer me to make mah rounds.', '', 114, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I need more practice!', '', 113, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see if I can hit that bullseye this time.', '', 112, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait...you are not my husband.  But he must have sent you.  And you...look..delicious!', '', 111, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aber?  Is that you...?  Oh...I\'m so hungry, Aber!  SO HUNGRY!!', '', 110, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is going on here?  Leave that powder alone!', '', 109, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very good.  You are relieved, private.  Rest, but don\'t get too comfortable.  Kurzen won\'t leave us alone forever.', 108, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'ll take more than a rotting corpse to stop us!', 107, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Private Thorsen returning from patrol.  Nothing new to report - it\'s pretty quiet out there...', '', 106, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been gone a long time...I better get back.', '', 105, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who goes there??', '', 104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that the coast is clear...', '', 103, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for my patrol.  I\'ll be back shortly.', '', 102, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you die!', '', 101, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for saving me!', '', 100, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n!', '', 99, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve ruined your own lands, you\'ll not ruin mine.', 98, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s My Bacon?', '', 97, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right, we\'re stupid. Stupid like a Fox!', '', 96, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine! You\'ve outreasoned me, you masters of Engineering! Put the door wherever you want!', '', 95, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t know he was getting married! I didn\'t even know he was dating! That\'s terrible! He can\'t work nights anymore!', '', 94, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast is slain! All\'s well in Darkshire!', '', 93, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The abomination has come! Forward!', '', 92, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It isn\'t enough! Defenders, gather in the center of town. Together we will stand against the undead monster!', '', 91, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The abomination has overrun the Night Watch camp! Quickly, we must intercept it before it reaches town!', '', 90, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rouse and to arms, citizens of Darkshire! An abomination of the undead approaches along the road!', '', 89, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my!  Look at the state of these books!  Who put them back without alphabetizing them??', '', 88, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now where was that book on Night Elf customs I was looking for...', '', 87, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much to do, so much to do!  Where does the time go?', '', 86, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Lion\'s Pride Inn.  Make yourself at home!', '', 85, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If your glass is full may it be again!', '', 84, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Scarlet Raven.  It\'s best to stay indoors these days.', '', 83, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This dark taint is downright bad for business.', '', 82, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up and wet your whistle.', '', 81, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Psssst.  We just got some Moonshine in. . . .', '', 80, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is something greater than magic at work in the night sky.  One day they\'ll listen to me. . . .', '', 79, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stars will be in perfect form tonight!', '', 77, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits whisper in my ear.  They are restless and full of angst.', 76, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The future holds much death and uncertainty, not unlike the past.', 75, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The stars speak to me.  They whisper of the horrors waiting in the night.', 74, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense evil brewing. . . .', 73, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our cause falls on deaf ears beyond the thick, stone walls of Stormwind.', '', 72, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The news from Stormwind does not bode well. . . .', '', 71, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Constant bickering will get us nowhere.  We need to take action.', '', 70, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The people of Darkshire expect more from the Council.  We cannot let them suffer from this unholy wrath which plagues us.', '', 69, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Council of Duskwood must take action.  Evil lingers in the air.', '', 68, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need better representation from Stormwind.  Our homes are falling to the undead.', '', 67, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forest is crawling with worgen and ghouls.  Something must be done!', '', 66, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not give into the evil which has darkened our land.  The Night Watch must prevail!', '', 65, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Night Watch alone cannot protect us forever.  We need the backing of the Stormwind Army.', '', 64, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Undead are crawling all over the land.  Where is the Stormwind Army?', '', 63, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fear not.  The Night Watch will rid the land of this foul taint soon enough.', 62, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay on the roads.  The forest is overrun with undead.', 61, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They might have run all the other farmers off, but the Saldean\'s will never leave Westfall.', '', 60, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A bunch of thugs and thieves aren\'t going to get me to leave my land!', '', 59, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now how am I supposed to get those mechanical wretches out of my fields?', '', 58, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be out of here just as soon as I get this wagon fixed. . . .', '', 57, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t believe the forsaken wagon broke down.  Ain\'t no luck to be had in this land. . . .', '', 56, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never thought the day would come that I\'d leave my homeland of Westfall. . . .', 55, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry, Old Blanchy, we\'ll get you something to eat soon. . .', 54, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marshal Marris expects the reserve from Stormwind any time now. . . .', '', 53, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still no sign of the 2nd Battalion from Stormwind.  Reports are coming in of Shadowhide movement in the Northeast.', '', 52, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are those reinforcements from Stormwind?  Heavy Blackrock activity has been reported in the East.', '', 51, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on boys, we\'ve got to get this bridge rebuilt.', '', 50, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hopefully the reinforcements from Stormwind show up soon. . . .', 49, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bottles are dusty but the liquor goes down clean!', '', 48, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull up a stool and have a drink!', '', 47, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here fishy fishy. . . come to papa.', '', 46, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing biting. . . .', '', 45, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind\'s desertion shall not be forgiven by the people of Westfall.', '', 44, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All clear on Sentinel Hill, Lord Stoutmantle.  Heavy Defias movement reported in Moonbrook, however.', '', 43, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots of gnoll activity reported in the Gold Coast Quarry and the Jangolode Mine.', '', 42, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defias activity reported on the costal horizon.  All clear on Sentinel Hill.', 41, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The farms must be liberated.  Stormwind may have deserted these people, but I\'ll be damned if I will.', '', 40, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everywhere I look I see thieves.  We, The People\'s Miltia, must return this land to the farmers.', '', 39, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here for the gold.', '', 38, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The boss wants all hands on high alert.  The rusty anchor sinks tonight.', '', 37, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stonemasons. . .errr. . Defias be warned:  The rusty anchor sinks tonight.', '', 36, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come one! Come all! Perelli\'s elixirs will dazzle!', '', 35, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Antonio Perelli\'s miracle elixirs for sale!', '', 33, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brave adventurer, thank you for rescuing me! I am sure Marshal Marris will reward your kind deed.', '', 30, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marshal Marris, sir.  Corporal Keeshan of the 12th Sabre Regiment returned from battle and reporting for duty!', '', 29, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So close to blessed Lakeshire.  By the Light, let my legs carry me a bit further!', '', 28, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blackrock infestation is thick in these parts.  I will do my best to keep the pace.  Let\'s go!', '', 27, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, fresh air at last! I need a moment to rest.', '', 26, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wounds are grave.  Forgive my slow pace but my injuries won\'t allow me to walk any faster.', '', 25, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not joining anyone, Thorsen..', '', 24, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I\'m here.  And I\'m ready to rejoin...', '', 23, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another herd brought in successfully!', '', 22, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, follow me!', '', 19, 6, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, you guys! Time to get up', '', 17, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right people, look alive!', '', 16, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good for nothing Kobolds!', '', 15, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrrr! Idiots!', '', 14, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work scum!', '', 13, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can go tell Stoutmantle this is where the Defias Gang is holed up, $n.', '', 11, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The entrance is hidden here in Moonbrook.  Keep your eyes peeled for thieves.  They want me dead.', '', 10, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, $n. I\'ll take you to the Defias hideout. But you better protect me or I am as good as dead.', '', 9, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you very much!', 'Thank you very much!', 7, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, let us engage in fisticuffs, like civilized folk.', 'Come, let us engage in fisticuffs, like civilized folk.', 5, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forward.. MARCH!!', '', 4, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Company.. HALT!  ... Fall IN!', 'Company.. HALT!  ... Fall IN!', 3, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help help!  I\'m being repressed!', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
